(280,'1-Page WordPress Website',3,'The business is renting or leasing out small-office warehouse spaces in a business park.\r\n\r\nI\'ve registered the domain www.citybusinessparks.com already and we already have a logo (see attached files).\r\n\r\nI would like a new website to be developed that will have a structure the same as www.capitolhillstorage.com. I\'ve provided new information for the areas on this new website that will be different.\r\n\r\nThe color scheme should be taken from the logo colors.\r\n\r\nBackground images should be of small-office warehouse-type spaces. I\'ve attached an example image but similar ones could be found online.\r\n\r\nI have a hosting provider already - www.siteground.com.\r\n\r\nThe website needs to be a WordPress site.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know:\r\n- if you can do it\r\n- how long do you think it will take you to deliver\r\n- what is your fee is\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\nB. Regards,\r\nLance.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01c9cd282c44412dbb','NA',7,'United States',NULL,500.000,NULL,600.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 17:04:41',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(281,'Logo Design',2,'Hey,\r\n\r\nI need helping creating a logo for a venture capital company. The company is called SBO Capital (SBO) stand for the initials of the founder. Please let me know if you can help','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~0148dbc567d5382d63/apply/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,0.000,NULL,60.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 17:06:15',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(282,'Graphic designer needed to design and creative for presentations',2,'We are a company looking for a graphic designer to help us develop some sales presentations as well as some brochures for our product.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~017aa3df6d5f188d77/apply/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,35.000,NULL,35.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 17:13:17',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
