(285,'ERC Explainer Video',2,'We are offering employee retention credit tax credits help to the US public, and need a talented animator or video producer to deliver on a concept that will be used across Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, and even on television devices.\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a video that is no more than 60 seconds that quickly explains:\r\n1) Attention grabber in first 5 seconds (probably the potential payout, find out in less than 5 minutes, but we\'d be open to multiple options)\r\n2) Who qualifies\r\n3) Social proofing (we\'ve secured millions in credit refunds already)\r\n4) 3 Step process\r\n5) call to action','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~018e3cec0574f9353a','NA',7,'United States',NULL,2500.000,NULL,2500.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 18:01:52',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
