(295,'Videos and slides for LinkedIn + copywriting',2,'We are a B2B digital marketing agency looking for marketing support in the following areas:\r\n1. Testimonial videos for LinkedIn / blog posts\r\n2. Testimonial slides for LinkedIn/ blog posts\r\n3. Editor/writer for blog posts\r\nEssential skills we need are video production, graphic design and copywriting /editing. Experience working for B2B clients preferred.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585708417140719617?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,60.000,NULL,60.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Clinet may ask for call, if he shows up on chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 19:03:44',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(296,'Sports Performance and Injury Prevention Brochures',2,'This job is to create two separate brochures highlight our sport performance evaluations and our injury prevention offerings. Both these brochures can be created based off the information available on our website for both offerings. These are similar offerings that are tweaked slightly based on the audience we are looking to market to.\r\n\r\nInjury Prevention Brochure: https://www.hybridpw.com/injury-risk-screening\r\n\r\nThis brochure will be mainly placed for gyms and fitness facilities. The audience for this brochure should be the coaches/owners of the gym and their clients, which are typically middle aged adults. This brochure will also be included in our new patient welcome packet.\r\n\r\nSports Performance Evaluations: https://www.hybridpw.com/sports-performance\r\n\r\nThis brochure will be marketed to local high schools, sports medicine staff, strength coaches, and sport coaches. We want it to appeal to athletes, their parents, and their coaches. This brochure will also be included in our new patient welcome packet. We would like to be able to distribute these brochures directly to coaches and staff when we set up meetings with them to talk about how we can help with injury prevention and performance in their athletes.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01d5851fff33fe6d8d','NA',7,'United States',NULL,50.000,NULL,50.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Hourly Bid',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 19:05:32',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(297,'Packaging Expert',2,'Looking to hire a packaging design expert to design 3x packages for a premium beauty brand. We will require hi-resolution, unique and creative packaging mock-ups in 3-4 perspective views to show the entire package and you will need to prepare the print-ready files, the dielines will not be provided, you will be required to make the dielines yourself.\r\n\r\nIf you are a packaging expert, design expert, or creative and have experience with designing premium and luxury packaging for cosmetic, haircare, or beauty brands, please share an example of your best work.\r\n\r\nShow me your best mock-ups and show me an example of print-ready files (dielines) you\'ve created.\r\n\r\nSuccessful completion of this project, may lead to ongoing work.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~017e116559e072b9ac','NA',7,'United States',NULL,50.000,NULL,50.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 19:06:30',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
