(306,'Book Cover Designer for Cozy Mystery Series Needed',2,'Hello!\r\nWe are looking for an experienced book cover designer for a 20k word cozy mystery book,  both for ebook and paperback.  The story setting is an old So. Carolina beachside inn.\r\n\r\nIdeally, we\'d love to find a great cover designer to hire for the remaining 2 books of the series as well.\r\n\r\nWe will be providing blurb/tropes and examples from some favorite best sellers in the genre for reference (one is attached).  \r\n\r\nThank you for your consideration!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01994b35ce83adef39','NA',7,'United States',NULL,200.000,NULL,200.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 19:28:01',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(307,'Comic Book cover',2,'his is a variant HORIZONTAL cover for our comic book. We only need the drawing done as we have a colorist to do the paint style we’re looking for.\r\n\r\nThe cover will be the Last Supper with 16 characters replacing the original people from the painting. We have all character concepts done already. This is a religious picture we are using so if that is seen as offensive to you, please respectfully don’t accept the job.\r\n\r\nThis cover will be 13 of these characters first appearance so we will be very picky. We’ll also be very reasonable but this comic issue is extremely important to us so we will be making sure everything is how we want it.\r\n\r\nPlease send any artwork you have that can best help me pick who would be best for us. If you need a reference for what we are looking for just look up The Last Supper picture. Thank you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~019ba20549b541da8b','NA',7,'United States',NULL,300.000,NULL,300.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Hourly Bid',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 19:30:05',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(308,'Logo Design that Matches Product Family',2,'I need a new logo made. This is a new product line. We already have a logo for our other product line, so we need it to match that, but be distinct (like microsoft word and microsoft excel, for instance). The OTHER Product line is the WorkFit products. I will include those logos here. This will be the \"EmPulse\"\r\n\r\nWe could try building something based more around that orange in the R, or perhaps theres another complimentary color that you would like to try. I\'m open to expanding the pallet if you feel it would be best. Happy to entertain ideas. We just need something that is from this same family\r\n\r\nThis is for a Business to Business SaaS product, and the audience will be business managers and decision-makers.\r\n\r\nHere is it\'s sister website: https://workfitdx.com/business/\r\n\r\nThe Empulse website is currently under developement.\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01c2fd6de54f8f7484','NA',7,'United States',NULL,60.000,NULL,60.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 19:33:21',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(309,'Graphic Designer for Video Game',2,'We are ExoWorlds.io, a company making a Sci-Fi RPG video game with TPS Style. We are also creating a smaller Strategy game that is similar to Clash of Clans or such games.\r\n\r\nWe need a very good Graphic Designer, to help us create visuals for the ideas and gameplay aspects that we are creating. Currently we are making a whitepaper that details all the different functions of the game and we need to represent a lot of these feature and functions visually with great graphics in the form of pictures.\r\n\r\nWe are currently using AI art softwares such as MidJourney to generate some awesome things such as Futuristic cities, items, space systems etc. However the AI produces a lot of unwanted noise within the picture.\r\n\r\nSo aside from creating images from scratch we would need someone who can take these AI generated images and clean them up, take away the noise so that they are presentable.','Graphic Designer for Video Game','NA',7,'United States',NULL,10000.000,NULL,10000.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Clinet may ask for call, if he shows up on chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 19:42:26',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
