(320,'Landing page design',3,'I need help redesigning doctor profile pages on our website, which allows people to sign up for \"premium\" plans with doctors that let them call the doctor directly on their cell phone and get priority scheduling access.\r\n\r\nSee, for example:\r\nhttps://app.exacthealthcare.com/doctors/busher\r\n\r\nI would like a design that makes Exact Healthcare\'s value proposition clearer and will convert more users to sign up for plans. Please take a look at what is there currently and let me know if you can help.\r\n\r\nI only need a design and not code. This will be implemented by a development team.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0136da49fd7c71cf9b','NA',7,'United States',NULL,400.000,NULL,100.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 20:07:56',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(321,'Logo Redesign and font advice',2,'We need a logo redesign to match our new agency brand identity. We updated fonts in our brand and website to a more bold approach and our logo now looks too decent and weak in small letters.\r\nWe are looking for a remake of our old logo that still maintains a recognizability, as we use this logo since 7 years, but still matches to our new, bold brand identity approach.\r\n\r\nAlso we are looking for a standard text font for our website, that matches the bold menu and headline font, but is easily readable.\r\n\r\nNew font as well as the current, old logo can be seen on our website. http://retush.de','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~017ebddd2c7f308a8c/apply/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,250.000,NULL,250.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 20:08:50',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
