(324,'dventure Van Co. Logo Design & Branding',2,'We are starting an adventure van rental company and we are looking for someone to help us get a great logo for our new business. The company name is Zodiac Adventure Vans.\r\n\r\nWhile we will provide images and descriptions of what we are looking for, we need someone who is able to ask questions that help them gain creative direction.\r\n\r\nThis is our third business, and have worked with others for logo design in the past, which will allow us to offer clear direction on what we are looking for, and to be clear about what we like and what we don’t like.\r\n\r\nWe would like to have this design completed in 2-3 weeks.\r\n\r\nFinal deliverables should include .png, .jpg, .eps, .pdf & .ai files','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585727197145268225?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,750.000,NULL,750.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 20:17:54',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(325,'Trade Show Booth Designer',2,'Our company is sponsoring a trade show in early december. We have ideas for what the sign of a trade show pop up banner would look like, but are not exactly clear of what to display/how to display it. I have a template from the printer of the final print (8ft by 8ft).\r\n\r\nI am looking for someone that will offer advice and consult on the final design as we are not able to offer a clear direction of exactly what we are looking for! We are looking for a talented, creative designer that can bring our idea to life!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585728505895919617?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,85.000,NULL,68.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 20:23:38',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(326,'Looking for next-level display ad designer',2,'We are looking for display ad designers who are capable of designing next-level ads for our brand.\r\n\r\nPlease apply if you think you fit the criteria:\r\n\r\n- Can think for themselves and take initiative on design ideas\r\n- Well versed in click baity ads\r\n- Can easily create HTML5 ads w/ animations\r\n- Familiar with cannabis ads (not necessary to be accepted)\r\n- Can come up with their own ideas and present new ideas for testing\r\n- Slack experience\r\n- (HUGE +) has great copywriting skills','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585729567496859649?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,60.000,NULL,60.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 20:27:10',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(327,'Web design and development, minor brand work (no brand workshop please!)',3,'HI Web Developers and Designers: (Experience with leadership development brand or workshops a plus)\r\n\r\nThis project is for a new website (nav layout attached), logo, design guidelines, web design and development, also need 3 LinkedIn pages headers.    You will get from me:\r\n1. Approved Brand strategy - just need the design guidelines (font, treatments, image usage, etc)\r\n2. Approved Copy\r\n3. Approved layout - draft attached\r\n\r\nYour deliverables:\r\nTimeline:  about 10-12 weeks (of course we know we have to do our job to keep this on track)\r\nWebsite - probably in wordpress, but i\'m open to other simple solutions.  This is not an e-commerce site, some lead gen but it\'s not the priority for launch phase.\r\nWeb design - no templates, want something a little unique\r\nLogo -\r\nDesign guidelines that can be used on web/product dev/social, etc. (specifically fonts, image treatment, logo usage, color pallet)  - all of the brand strategy and research is done.  I\'ll partner with you on pallet, etc --\r\n\r\nThere is potential for a 2nd website that houses their foundation work -- but I haven\'t scoped it yet.  It would be a separate budget.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01861d6f2f574a64e5/apply/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,6000.000,NULL,6000.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 20:36:05',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
