(329,'Create a sleek logo',2,'Hello!\r\nI am looking for a designer to create an attractive, sleek, and modern logo.\r\n\r\nI am looking for 3 variations of the logo.  \r\n1.  graphic logo - This logo includes a mandala/chakra/ scared geometry and includes infinity sign.\r\n\r\n2. Horizontal logo with company name. This is mostly text with an infinity sign in the middle\r\n\r\n3. the letters cXc made into an infinity sign\r\n\r\nI am inspired by very royal and symbolic graphics such as sacred geometry, mandalas and chakras. I like the colors black, gold, purple (mandala) and turquoise.  The logo should look sleek, sexy, sophisticated, meaningful and powerful.\r\n\r\nI am looking for a partner that will provide suggestions to make the logo stand up to the description.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b0b42dff63fdb8ab','NA',7,'United States',NULL,150.000,NULL,150.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Fixed Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 20:47:16',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
