(331,'Looking for animator and voice-over artist to make a series of short, animated videos',2,'Looking for an experienced animator and voice-over artist to help create a series of ~12 short (between 30 seconds and 2 minutes), animated videos to post on our website explaining the benefits of our product to prospective clients in different industries.\r\n\r\nAttached is an example of an animated video we had created for us in the past to explain the style of video we are looking for.\r\n\r\nWe will provide a script to base the animation and voice-over around.\r\n\r\nLooking to have the project completed before the end of the year.\r\n\r\nIf interested, send over examples of previous work.\r\n\r\nThanks!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~018a0c1c5b71ac5ed7','NA',7,'United States',NULL,70.000,NULL,70.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Hourly Bid',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 20:52:12',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
