(334,'Shopify Template Customizer',3,'Seeking an experienced Shopify template/theme designer who is well-versed in creating feminine designs. We currently have a Shopify theme design but would like the look of it to be more colorful, vibrant, and better organized in terms of our product sections (i.e. a featured section, an exclusive section, etc.) The current design looks like this zoranealehurston.net.\r\n\r\nThe steps of this project will involve:\r\n1. You choose a new theme that we approve.\r\n2. You customize this theme using your own aesthetic sensibility with some guidance from us. For example, we will suggest color schemes and the type of aesthetics we’re going for but we’d like you to have a designers eye to begin with.\r\n3. Some revisions and organizing of product sections/wordings.\r\n\r\nWe’d like this project to take no longer than a month. The pay would be a flat rate of $500.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585737251847790593?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,500.000,NULL,400.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 20:57:45',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
