(344,'Website designer needed to fix design of our Shopify website',3,'We need someone to look at our existing Shopify website and make it more organized, aesthetically pleasing, professional, and attractive to the user. We have the main components of the backend of the website and all of the pages created, but we do not know how to design the website to make it look cleaner and better. We have example websites we like and would like ours to look more similar to.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585745887010029569?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,45.000,NULL,45.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 21:31:56',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(345,'Create a unique Web Design for an online casino',3,'We are looking for an experienced web designer to create an immersive web3 experience for an online casino project. We are not looking for somebody who can code to implement the website right away, but rather somebody who can provide us with full design guidelines including fonts, logo, spacing, colors, animations and of course the screens of different tabs of the website like the landing page or the contact form, so we know exactly what the website is going to look and feel like in case we decide to build it.\r\n\r\nRequired skills are:\r\n Expert in Adobe XD or similiar UI/UX Software\r\nExpert in UI/UX Design\r\nCreativity to create a unique site experience\r\n\r\nWe\'re not looking for a simple wordpress site. We\'re looking for serious expert level unique designs like the following.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.schoolofmotion.com/blog/10-websites-with-great-animation\r\n\r\nSince the website will be a web3 site that connects to a crypto wallet, experience with cryptocurrencies is a plus but not a most.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~013443736e5bcbdfec/apply/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,8000.000,NULL,7500.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Suitable Bid - We can definitely deliver if we win this project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 21:33:28',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(346,'Landing Page for an Environmental/Outdoor Friendly Fintech',3,'We\'re an environmentally/outdoor friendly fintech looking for a quick turn around on a landing page (and potentially a short about us and contact us page). The goal of this project is to create a professional and inviting landing page that generates a waitlist (\"Sign up here!\") and presents a modern, sustainable, and narrative driven vibe. A full website design is on the table for down the road as we would like to have some input from the web designer on this project and keep those themes throughout the larger site.\r\n\r\nIf you have examples of past work, please share!\r\n\r\nWe currently have two mock websites built which can be used as a jumping off point for what we are looking for. We have a professional style guide to guide your development. We prefer a Webflow website we can take control over when the project is done. We are looking for a tight turn around and can make ourselves available 24/7 for intro calls, mood boards, questions, and feedback.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585747831883034625?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,1000.000,NULL,850.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 21:39:51',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(347,'Create Dynamic, Modern Presentation Using Keynote',2,'I will create copy and provide some photos. I need to create a series of 7-15 dynamic, modern slides with compelling graphics and colors. This is a presentation promoting myself as a Chiropractic business coach, speaking about business concepts and highlighting the success of my current doctors. The audience are young professionals from 25-35 men and women. This presentation has to be complete by 11/3 so when selected, you would only have a few days to create slides and deliver any edits.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585747060035223553','NA',7,'United States',NULL,250.000,NULL,250.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 21:40:27',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
