(349,'Sales Presentation for Fashion Accessory Brand Entering Wholesale Marketplace',2,'New unique fashion/bag company that has had online success is entering the wholesale market. So, instead of only selling online we would like to begin wholesale relationships with big retailers like Home Depot, Kroger, Walmart, Target, etc. This presentation will be mostly used as an attachment to emails, but I would also like to be able to print it out as well. I have 10-15 photos I would like you to include in the presentation, as well as, obviously, logo and company branding. There are multiple ways to use the product, so most of the education will be in photos. I do not expect to use more than 1000-2000 words in the document. However, strong copy experience and presentation/pitch deck experience is necessary! Please let me know if you have any questions!\r\n\r\nI will specify the information that I want to include in the presentation, but I will need you to decide where it goes and how best to communicate it! You will need to be creative and able to make some decision on what looks best!\r\n\r\nLooking forward to working with you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~010b96dc63ecf003d4','NA',7,'United States',NULL,1200.000,NULL,1200.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Fixed Price',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 21:52:31',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
