(351,'Logo Design',2,'Carnage K9 needs a logo designed, something simple but recognizable, branded.\r\n\r\nCarnage K9 is a pet product company creating leashes, collars, harnesses that are tough and can withstand the elements. They are designed for functionality, sleekness, and durability with quality always in mind.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a logo to represent our brand. While we have a couple ideas we\'ve been discussing, we aren\'t set on a design or font. We would like to see what you come up with and go from there. If needed we can attach the few logo designs we\'ve been tinkering with. I can also send photos of products we make if that helps the creative process as well.\r\n\r\nCarnage K9 is located in Oregon which is in the Pacific Northwest of the United States, which is great for people doing things outside with their dogs like hiking, paddle boarding, hunting, personal protection sports, lure coursing, etc. We have lots of mountains as well.\r\n\r\nOur products are made of Biothane and are easily washable, come in a variety of colors, and are very durable. I\'ve attached some photos of the products.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585752082608939009?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,600.000,NULL,600.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 21:59:28',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
