(354,'Wordpress Website development & Ecommerce',3,'We are looking for an expert wordpress developer to take our existing website project to completion.\r\n\r\nWe have designed, and branding and have a site built for Wordpress, we need someone to take the existing branding and site elements and develop a new site. We have a design/layout we want and need someone to quickly deliver this for us.\r\n\r\nImportant- must be designed to be mobile-first, must have e-commerce capability as we will have products, and will also link to our patient management system and our customer portal ( using login).\r\n\r\nWe are using WordPress as we want to be able to have the flexibility to continue making changes, adding pages ourselves, etc.\r\n\r\nPlease use clean code, error, and bug-free - a must!\r\nWe are looking for a fast turnaround.\r\n\r\nWe will provide images, copy, etc, so relatively straightforward project.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~014bd67f3d2ec1dac5','NA',7,'United States','Andover',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2022-10-28',1,'2022-10-28',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-28 13:28:53',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
