(357,'Software Explainer Video',2,'ElevenPoint2 is a pre-seed startup looking to change the world of Sales training. We partner with global technical sales companies to accelerate skill uptake. Our approach comes from the method used at the space program, based on our founder’s experience as a former flight control engineer at NASA.\r\n\r\nWe are asking you to create a video elevator pitch for our software product.\r\n\r\nWe need a concise, focused video with a very specific purpose: to communicate the value of our product in the shortest amount of time. It must grab the customer\'s attention with a clear message, high production value, and a clear call-to-action.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585990496191455233?success','NA',7,'United States','Plymouth',500.000,'fixed',400.000,'2022-10-28',1,'2022-10-28',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-28 13:45:40',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(358,'Design a set of 4-6 logos for the launch of an \'own-brand\' product range',4,'Hi.\r\nI own https://www.silverbackdirect.com, and I have attached to this message the logos that I am currently using on the website, stationary, etc.\r\n\r\nI am about to launch my own brand of gym equipment - dumbbells, benches, weight lifting equipment, free weights, etc. I need some logos that can be printed/used on these items, which are usually black (or at least dark-coloured) so my current logos are no good.\r\n\r\nI need logos in light colours - white/yellow/orange, etc that can go on black/dark equipment.\r\n\r\nIdeally, the logos will be a close match to the ones I currently use (attached).\r\n\r\nI would like the following options as a minimum:\r\n1. Logo + \'Silverback\' text underneath\r\n2. Logo + \'Silverback\' text to the right-hand side\r\n3. Just the logo on its own\r\n4. Just the text on its own\r\n\r\nThe logo and text font can be slightly different. I am open to ideas and I\'m just looking for something clean, simple, and close to my current logo in the design. Exactly the same would be best.\r\n\r\nThank you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585990974813626369','NA',7,'United States','London',199.000,'fixed',199.000,'2022-10-28',1,'2022-10-28',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-28 13:45:45',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
