(383,'Motion designer to turn static logo into 3 second animated logo',2,'Hi designers\r\nI\'m looking for a motion designer to create a cool animated logo sting for a logo I designed for our company workation(See attached png). We are creating an after movie and the logo will be displayed at the end of the video. The final logo animation should be no longer than 3 seconds.\r\n\r\nImportant:\r\n- Only people with actual logo animation experience will be considered for the job\r\n- Please show at least 2-3 examples of animated logos that you yourself animated\r\n- Include a rough sketch or reference in your proposal of what you would do\r\n\r\nPS. If you don\'t hear back from from me then it means that I already found a proposal that matched what I was looking for. Sorry but I\'m sure you understand that I will get loads of proposals and I don\'t have the time to respond to everyone individually','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1586012822108962817?success','NA',7,'United States','Amsterdam',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2022-10-28',1,'2022-10-28',1,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-28 15:13:59',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
