(385,'Build WordPress site from my furnished photoshop layouts',4,'I am an independent ad agency creative director wanting to develop a new website for my one-person business. This is my old and dated current site:\r\n\r\nwww.youngcreativeworks.com\r\n\r\nI have all the designing done and in photoshop layered files, including an opening logo animation. I just need someone to make it all go!\r\n\r\nI\'m patterning my new website off of this website: https://admarkny.com/\r\n\r\nI will attach jpgs of my files, but know thatI HAVE ALL OF THESE FILES EXISTING IN PHOTOSHOP LAYERED FILES. On the homepage, I want to show 8 featured samples of my work. This is the template I found for that: https://webredox.net/demo/wp/tank/elementor/portfolio-grid-creative1/\r\n\r\nThere will be 20 total individual WORK (portfolio) pages. I\'m only attaching 1 page here to show you what they look like. All 20 pages are done and are photoshop layered files.\r\n\r\nPlease lat me know if you have any questions. Thank you.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016f039f95683c3f74','NA',7,'United States','Dousman',1300.000,'fixed',1300.000,'2022-10-28',1,'2022-10-28',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-28 15:31:10',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
