(400,'Brand Identity/Design - \"Real\" a Lifestyle Action Sports Company',2,'Focus: The goal of the REAL project is to create a brand identity including logo and branding variants for a Lifestyle Action-Sports Adventure company named \"Real\". The idea born out of a family name, takes parts of the So-Cal surf, skate, wake, and athletic vibe of the region. With the belief that being active is part of who we are.\r\n\r\nExamples of brands in the competing marketplace... Billabong, Rusty Surf, Quicksilver, Hurley, Vans, Volcom, Oneill, Reef\r\n\r\nNeeds: Main Identity Logo with availability for variant logos. Capabilities of the logo/brand identity include Apparel, Signage, Hand Tags, Hats, Print, Web, Packaging etc.\r\n\r\nTarget Market: baby boomers through millennials - Those whose apparel style break the mold of traditional and transcend into the lifestyle which inspire and facilitate the adventure-seeking enthusiasts.\r\n\r\nRequirements: Passionate and strategic thinker capable of conveying thoughts and actions through design.\r\n\r\n\r\n• Art Direction: Digital\r\n• Branding Strategy Skills: Branding\r\n• UX/UI Design Software: Adobe Illustrator, Adobe Photoshop','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01684572c9c00fc1c5','NA',7,'United States','Riverside',65.000,'perhour',65.000,'2022-10-28',1,'2022-10-28',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-28 16:45:36',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
