(488,'After Effects - Motion Graphics Commercials',2,'We are looking for a series of short motion graphics animations for holidays or other sales occasions. We are looking for the deliverable to be about 6 templates we can then use and edit on our own with different products and pricing depending on the need.\r\n\r\nWe want to own the AE files at the end of this project. These will not have audio, however, I have included an attached file with audio as an example.\r\n\r\nThese will be used on TV screens in our stores and on signage. The animations should be quick and easy to see and understand.\r\n\r\nKey components:\r\n- A place to add a product image\r\n- A place for a price\r\n- A place for a date\r\n- A place for a logo\r\n- A place for additional text\r\n\r\nAll of these should be able to be used on the same screen or they can be hidden as needed.\r\n\r\nWe will want the following theme\r\nSpring\r\nSummer\r\nFall\r\nWinter\r\nChristmas\r\nGeneric','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/After-Effects-Motion-Graphics-Commercials_~01ff1f189d3a08c85d/','NA',7,'United States','clearfield',100.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-11-01',1,'2022-11-01',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-01 16:07:41',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
