(496,'web animator - Lottie Files',2,'True Filter is a social-impact organisation working on solving online abuse and creating a happier internet.\r\n\r\nWe build simple tools to allow people to hide racism, msyogeny, sexism, identity hate, spam, internet trolls and more and we provide them all absolutely free.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a superstar animator to help us build web-animations (ideally in Lottie) for our new website.\r\n\r\nYou can check out our current website, including explainer video here:\r\n\r\nwww.truefilter.io\r\n\r\nYou will need to have:\r\n\r\n- demonstrable experience building highly performant, beautiful animations for websites, ideally with lottie files\r\n\r\n-too many ideas to count! We love enthusiastic and excited people passionate about our work\r\n\r\n-illustration experience, especially with new stable-diffusion models, is a huge plus\r\n\r\n-be passionate about helping us end online abuse, cyber bullying and spam\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you for taking the time to consider the application,\r\nBest,\r\nMatthew\r\nFounder','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/web-span-animator-span-Lottie-Files_~0189b31cb2f4175aa0/','NA',7,'United States','Camberly',43.000,'perhour',43.000,'2022-11-01',1,'2022-11-01',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-01 16:23:23',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
