(548,'Experienced Motion Graphic Designer for Social Media Content Creation',2,'Our team is looking for a video editing/motion graphic professional who can work create creative and eye-catching video clips to produce engaging social media content. Good examples of what we are looking for see below:\r\n\r\nhttps://twitter.com/saylor/status/1581729280941137920\r\nhttps://twitter.com/corndalorian/status/1587433729961574401\r\n\r\nQualification and Requirements\r\n- Experience in creating and editing videos based on the creative briefs\r\n- Timely response time and delivery\r\n- Interest & Knowledge in cryptocurrency, bitcoin, blockchain, economics is a plus and preferred\r\n- Fluent in English and comfortable with working in English\r\n- Detail-oriented and great communication skills\r\n\r\nIf interested and available, please share most relevant video portfolio via links (no files attachments please)\r\n\r\nOpportunity to collaborate long-term.\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1587546251235074049','NA',7,'United States','canmore',60.000,'Open this select menu',60.000,'2022-11-01',1,'2022-11-01',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-01 20:47:50',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(549,'Create a Professional Services Website and Basic Branding',3,'Hello!\r\n\r\nTo bid on this project, please include the word \"strawberry\" in the first line of your reply.\r\n\r\nI need a simple website built, hopefully in the next week or two. This is for a professional services consulting firm. We need:\r\n-- main page template including a hero image\r\n--subpage template\r\n--contact page and form\r\n\r\nHere\'s a law firm with a similar page function just as an example: https://www.gglawoffices.com/\r\n\r\nWe don\'t need a lot of bells and whistles so probably a simple provider like Wix or Squarespace will be fine. Let me know what you want to use. We already have the URL\r\n\r\nI\'d also like a very simple logo, which can just be the company name in a cool font and does not need to be a separate design\r\n\r\nPlease link me to a few similar pages you have built.\r\n\r\nWe are ready to begin this project within 48 hours.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01d564fd2c94d6f923','NA',7,'United States','Chicago',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2022-11-01',1,'2022-11-01',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-01 20:49:48',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(550,'WalletHack.com Redesign: Home Page redesign and design guidelines',4,'Hello!\r\nMy name is Ben Racicot and I am a software engineer building a crypto project on WalletHack.com. I\'ve pushed my design skills past their boundaries and am in need of a talented designer who can help redesign my homepage and also create reliable brand guidelines for use across the app.\r\n\r\nDesign/branding inspiration:\r\nMy goal was to apply a stereoscopic effect (TikTock logo) sometimes referred to as \"Anaglyph\" or \"3D\" to specific elements and typography (design system). The reason is that with trading platforms you typically see red denote \"down\" or \"asking price\" and green denote \"up\" or \"bid price\".\r\n\r\nCurrently pink: 238, 55, 105 / #ee3769 and green: 26, 188, 156 but not limiting the effects to that. (see font-style-and-color-gradient-example)\r\n\r\nPlease see ideas.psd\r\n\r\nAcceptance criteria Home page:\r\nDeliver a design document of the redesigned WalletHack.com home landing page\r\nwith the same impact as some of the work at found on Dribbble.com/search/landing-page\r\n\r\nThe final homepage design needs:\r\n1. The current homepage is our current base design\r\n2. Branded typography to immediately inform who/what we are. (see copy.txt)\r\n3. A newsletter field\r\n4. Dark mode is a must\r\n5. Far more convincing aesthetics than the current design\r\n6. Fresh ideas!\r\n\r\nAcceptance criteria design:\r\n1. A brand guideline document used in the landing page to carry forward\r\n2. typography\r\n3. colors\r\n\r\nI will be available over chat at most times and will share a Google drive folder for documents. Seeking highest quality possible and am flexible on this project\'s schedule.\r\n\r\nAfter the landing page and some defined design I\'ll also need help with Dashboard page(s) and the profile page if interested.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01b6c100e340d69164/apply/','NA',7,'United States','Providence',1100.000,'fixed',1100.000,'2022-11-01',1,'2022-11-01',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-01 20:50:57',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
