(556,'Social Media ads expert',2,'We are looking for someone to handle our client\'s social media advertising budget. We have a few clients that will need this service, but we will start with one client for now. Our first client is a Concierge Medicine Clinic that wants to advertise on Insta & Linkedin (our second client will need youtube and Facebook)\r\n\r\nIdeally, we would like a person to plan the whole strategy, not just do the technical part. We know it\'s not an exact science but we\'d like to have an expected conversion rate to show to our clients.\r\n\r\nLastly, we require past performance proof.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nMartin','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1587553440597139457','NA',7,'United States','Miami Gardens',100.000,'perhour',80.000,'2022-11-01',1,'2022-11-01',1,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-01 21:14:48',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
