(558,'Graphic Design - Healthcare Technology Marketing & Sales Collateral',2,'We are looking for an experience and creative graphic designer to refresh our digital and print marketing/sales collateral. We would like to start with one piece, but would consider for all future content needs if our team approves and a consistent look and feel can be maintained.\r\n\r\nWhat we are doing:\r\n\r\nWe are refreshing our marketing and sales collateral and in some cases, creating new pieces. These document will be shared via email, made available on our website for downloading, and shared in person during trade shows and meetings.\r\n\r\nMost of the document are 1-2 pages (8x11) in length, but some are longer. All copy will be provided. You are only responsible for designing.\r\n\r\nMust be able to provide design files for all completed projects.\r\n\r\nOur website: Prevounce.com\r\n\r\nExample of a document needing a refresh is attached\r\n\r\nPlease let us know if you have any questions.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01f163097e597d7ab2','NA',7,'United States','Indianapolis',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-11-01',1,'2022-11-01',1,'No comments',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-01 21:15:41',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(559,'New Logo & Then a few brand templates for property marketing. Logo first',2,'I\'m looking for someone to design a new logo which should easily tie into social media platforms & print material for marketing properties.\r\n\r\nFocus: River, Land, & Luxury\r\n\r\nI\'m located in the Mountain/Piedmont area of North Georgia. I\'m hoping for something a bit unique & really do not want a house in the design. I would prefer to tie in the focus. River & Land are my primary focus while Luxury homes is third on the list.\r\n\r\nTheres an agent in my office who has the last name Orr & she uses Oar\'s in her marketing. There are several who use their initials, roof lines, house outline & another uses squiggly lines to represent the mountains. All of these look great, i just want mine to look different from theirs.\r\n\r\nI\'m hoping to change most of my online & print material to look new & fresh. All of these changes will follow the logo change. The hope is to make a few templates & change the property picture & information. You can view my ad\'s on google, facebook, & some on instagram to have an idea of the ad\'s (i feel like most of them have a really dated look). @TashaCirincioneHomes\r\n\r\nI look forward to hearing back from you.\r\n\r\nTasha','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1587553566315454465?success','NA',7,'United States','Clarkesville',300.000,'fixed',240.000,'2022-11-01',1,'2022-11-01',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-01 21:16:14',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
