(597,'Update an Ionic 2 app so that it works',2,'Hi,\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is a hobby project ;o) \r\n\r\n\r\nI need an Ionic developer to update the necessary components of an \"Ionic 2 mobile app\". The app is open source and documentation is available. \r\n\r\n\r\n1) App\'s retired website = http://community.impossible.com/ \r\n\r\n2) Source code and documentation = https://github.com/iampossible/impossiblepeople \r\n\r\n\r\nThe only other thing I will ask for is this = \r\n\r\n\"I want to customize this app often. So, I\'d update the -interest list- and -corresponding images\". So, I will ask you to show me how to compile and deploy it as needed. \r\n\r\n\r\nThat\'s it! \r\n\r\n\r\nThanks.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1960365','NA',7,'United States','-',250.000,'fixed',300.000,'2022-11-02',1,'2022-11-02',1,'fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-02 14:49:34',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(598,'Lottie Guru, take Figma design to Lottie animation',2,'We have a design for a website in Figma. It includes some animated scenes, see attached. Looking for someone to convert those Figma animations to Lottie files for deployment on the website. Should be straightforward for the right person. There are plugins for Figma that help export animations directly to Lottie. We just aren\'t familiar with this and need help. Most likely after export the files need some manual adjustments as well.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01220d2397a482d9bf','NA',7,'United States','Lockhart',75.000,'perhour',75.000,'2022-11-02',1,'2022-11-02',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-02 14:51:38',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
