(613,'Website Dev and Design: Youth Market + Ed Market Focused',3,'Do not contact us off of the Upwork platform.\r\nViolators will be reported to Upwork.\r\n\r\n**DO NOT APPLY IF YOU ARE NOT PHYSICALLY BASED IN THE UNITED STATES**\r\n\r\nProject: temporary website\r\nDue Date: December 15\r\n\r\nAbout Us\r\nWe work within the educational space delivering energetic experiences both in-person and online to multicultural teens. We specialize in introducing teens to career pathways in STEM, creativity, and business.\r\n\r\nWebsite Capabilities\r\nWe are seeking a website that will allow the following:\r\n\r\nSearch and Results\r\n- Ability to Save Results\r\n- Results Page with save capabilities\r\n- Connect to other internal pages\r\n\r\nData\r\n- Leveraging Open Source Data\r\n- Storing information in a cloud platform\r\n\r\nBasic Profile Build\r\n- Name\r\n- Title/School\r\n\r\nSaved Results\r\n- Mobile Responsive\r\n- Seamless mobile capabilities\r\n- Designed to be app ready in the future\r\n\r\nDemo Capabilities\r\n- We want people to gain a better understanding of the product. So the opportunity to set up meetings or schedule demos\r\n\r\nEmail\r\n- Connect to an email platform\r\n- Ecommerce\r\n- Opportunity for clients to purchase and upload assets on the website\r\n\r\nPlatforms\r\n- Would like to avoid Wordpress; however, if a savvy developer can make this an easy build, we would be grateful. Other options: React.js, etc.\r\n\r\nGraphic Style\r\n- Multicultural in the design taking in the aspects of the lifestyle of curious, ambitious, and fun teens.\r\n\r\nTimeline:\r\nCompleted by December 15\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease submit website that you have created directly.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1587817839878594561?success','NA',7,'United States','Waukegan',7500.000,'fixed',6700.000,'2022-11-02',1,'2022-11-02',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-02 15:23:57',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(614,'Social Media Strategist and Graphic Designer',2,'We are a busy team looking for an individual who has experience writing copy for social media ads and designing eye-catching graphics to go along with those ads.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for 20ish hours of work, and applicants must have experience with graphic design and social media advertising. We\'d prefer it if you specifically have experience creating ads for social media. We utilize Canva as a team, so we would want you to work in Canva for graphic design.\r\n\r\nPlease only apply if you are an individual freelancer, not a firm.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1587827360969924609?success','NA',7,'United States','Sacramento',2000.000,'fixed',1750.000,'2022-11-02',1,'2022-11-02',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-02 15:27:45',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
