(657,'Update Brand Logo & Font',2,'I would like to update my Brand Font which is currently Sackers Gothic Standard to Sackers Gothic Heavy or perhaps even \'heavier\'.\r\n\r\nI would like to convert the \'A\'s from solid triangles to just outlines maintaining the same line thickness as the font.\r\n\r\nThe brand logo which is currently two solid triangles needs to be as per triangles in DRAFT attachment.\r\n\r\nThe Draft attachment is just that, a draft. It is just given as an example to provide some direction away from the existing logo attachment.\r\n\r\nI would like several vectors - one for each of the following (and possibly a few more to be decided upon completion of the update of brand text and logo):\r\n\r\nBrand \'Alexis Amor\' in new agreed Font - linear.\r\n\r\nAs above preceded by Logo.\r\n\r\nLogo (Triangles) on their own.\r\n\r\nBrand logo to match existing - see website, alexisamor.com\r\n\r\nBrand logo with interlocking triangles as per samples.\r\n\r\nI\'m not 100% certain of what\'s needed but will know as we progress.\r\n\r\nPlease feel free to ask questions, make suggestions.\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1960349','NA',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-11-02',1,'2022-11-02',1,'fixed',0,NULL,NULL,1,'2022-11-02 16:51:11','2022-11-02 16:59:12',6,3,NULL,111),
