(661,'Build a Bootstrap Website',3,'We are looking for someone to build a clean, modern and minimalist website that is lightweight and responsive and built with Bootstrap. There would be some HTML, CSS and some minor javascript/jquery, PHPMailer for form processing.\r\n\r\nImportant to note that the content of the website will be in Spanish however speaking Spanish is not a requirement as the content will be provided and explained where to put.\r\n\r\nThe website itself is fairly small with only a few various in pages. In total, there are 10 pages but fewer page types:\r\n\r\nA \'home\' page type that will the index page\r\nA \'Contact\' Page type with an AJAX contact form\r\nA \'T&C\' page type that is just text and reproducible for the privacy page\r\nAn \'about us\' page type that is primarily 2 column based with alternating image/text layout on each row.\r\nA \'service\' page type that is identical to the \'about us\' page type but with the addition of an AJAX contact form on the bottom.\r\nAn \'experience\' page type that is similar to service page with a contact form on the bottom but this form should have checkboxes (bootstrap checkbox buttons) to allow people to select the types (plural) of experiences they want to book.\r\n\r\nThe other 4 pages are just some form of one of the pages above.\r\n\r\nThe colour scheme should be black (an off-black for text such as HEX #22252A), white and yellow (HEX #FDE400).\r\n\r\nFooter menu has a few links, contact information (but no map) and a mailchimp form that adds to our list via AJAX or some other means that doesn\'t take them away from the current page or use a pop up.\r\n\r\nAll contact forms on the site should be processed using AJAX and PHPmailer.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions please reach out.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1960361','NA',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'fixed',1300.000,'2022-11-02',1,'2022-11-02',1,'fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-02 17:00:30',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(662,'Website & Presentation design',2,'Looking for a graphic / web designer to work on presentations and websites linked to our initiatives. We currently have 3 different companies\r\n1. Fides Family Office services (fides-mc.com) which we would like to revamp and adapt to new marketing strategies ( might change the branding to ORACLE )\r\n\r\n2. UBIQUITY a new company which is in the process of being setup specialised in Wallet / Electronic Payments\r\n\r\n3. UTOPIA a new company which creates marketplaces in the metaverse.\r\n\r\nOur priority is Fides / Oracle which needs to be updated this would be job 1 we need a Website and Graphics for a presentations.\r\n\r\nUBIQUITY and UTOPIA will only need a landing page for the time being with an explanation of what they do - we will also need a graphic presentation for these as we are working on the business plan and decks.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0145e1011fa3627997','NA',7,'United States','monte carlo',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2022-11-02',1,'2022-11-02',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-02 17:01:56',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
