(671,'Cosmetic packaging',2,'We are a Danish beauty brand with a wide range of products from cosmetics to skincare products. Now the time is in for us to make a rebranding and therefore we are searching for help to create a new design or maybe just adjust and refine our products and colors\r\nfor packaging so we get a common thread through our entire product range.\r\n\r\nWhat we need your help at:\r\n- Create design for 1 product to start with. Our Anti-Aging Face Cream (bottle + box)\r\n- Create a more simple and minimalistic design then we have today (se attached examples for inspiration)\r\n- Colors has to be \"muted earth tones\" so it fits for both women and men (not pink colors etc.)\r\n- The look should be Scandinavian and simple\r\n- Colors has to be matte and not shiny\r\n\r\nWhat we expect of you:\r\n- That you are skilled in product packaging for cosmetics\r\n- Can make design files ready for production\r\n- Know how of materials such as types of carton, plastic, aluminium etc. and how colors and effects react to the different materials\r\n\r\nI have a clear idea about what I like and do not like, so it will be easy to spare with me :)\r\n\r\nAlso we have size etc. of the products so you can get free hands to be creative and help us to the next level in our journey. You will see all of our products so you have an idea what we got today and where we want to move too.\r\n\r\nIf this project here goes well, we have more work to do. But let\'s start with one project and then move on.\r\n\r\nPLEASE NOTE: the attached product pictures is not what we want, but just examples to show ideas.\r\n\r\nI need to see some work you have done before, before I even consider to move forward. So please send me your portfolio','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1587877481550700545?success','NA',7,'United States','Kobenhavn S',500.000,'Open this select menu',400.000,'2022-11-02',1,'2022-11-02',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-02 18:43:52',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(672,'Redesign and develop interactive map wp website',3,'A map on our WP landing page (https://korke.com/staging/) helps visitors, interested in our tailor-made tours, pick the locations they\'d like to include in their custom tour. They can select the locations which are then included in the ensuing form.\r\n\r\nWe would like to make this map more appealing by giving it a more modern and immersive design. We want it to appear directly in our hero header. We are very inspired by the following Google maps website: https://www.google.com/maps/about/behind-the-scenes/streetview/treks/petra/#sv-16, which could serve as the basis for the new design.\r\n\r\n4 versions of the same Interactive header map will have to be developed (one for Chile, one for Argentina, one for Patagonie and one for all three - the last would be on our homepage, the other on very similar landing pages- The map will have to be responsive, with maybe a simple adaptation for mobile phones.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0132274245d690bad4','NA',7,'United States','Santiago',1800.000,'fixed',1800.000,'2022-11-02',1,'2022-11-02',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-02 18:46:21',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
