(707,'Graphic Designer needed for new ground marketing asset designs',2,'We are looking for a graphic designer to design 20 customer facing ground marketing assets that will be used to market our clinics. There is potential for additional poster and general graphic design work based on the outcome of this project.\r\n\r\n\r\nProject Details\r\n\r\nWe have a comprehensive ground marketing strategy that our clinics execute during their pre-opening, grand opening, and post-open process that includes a combination of direct mail postcards, coupon books, and flyers that are distributed to community partners and other surrounding businesses.\r\n\r\nOur intention is to have a library of ready-to-use templates that clinics can pull from without having to design and generate their own creative assets. These templates would have all the design components and be adjustable to fit different format constraints. For example, clinics would be able to adjust the format of the template to adjust for a different size of postcard or printable flyer, but the design elements would remain the same.\r\n\r\nWe need the following items:\r\n\r\n6 direct mail postcard templates – 3 front side and 3 back side that can be combined to create a direct mail postcard\r\n\r\n3 landscape-oriented coupon book ads (i.e. Clipper magazine and other similar publications)\r\n\r\n3 portrait-oriented coupon book ads (i.e. Clipper magazine and other similar publications)\r\n\r\n1 Coming Soon flyer template\r\n\r\n1 Grand Opening flyer template\r\n\r\n1 Now Open flyer template\r\n\r\n1 Friends and Family event flyer template\r\n\r\n1 Puppy and Kitten-oriented flyer template\r\n\r\n1 General Event flyer template (that could be used for an external event)\r\n\r\n2 brand flyer templates for general use\r\n\r\n2 generic coupon templates (these would be placed on the flyers, direct mailers, etc.)\r\n\r\nWe have included our Branding Guide below, as it details the required branded elements that must be included in design (i.e. brand promise, approved fonts, brand colors, logo usage and constraints, etc.). We have also included past approved designs that have been used for reference.\r\n\r\nWe ask that for all these assets, space is left for the placement of coupons. The flyers will need space for up to 1 coupon, while the direct mailer templates and coupon book templates will need space for up to 2 coupons.\r\n\r\n\r\nTo be the best fit for this project you need:\r\n\r\nAbility to communicate clearly\r\n\r\nAttention to detail\r\n\r\nMeet project deadlines in a timely manner\r\n\r\n\r\nFinal Deliverables:\r\n\r\n1) 22 ground marketing assets in PDF and .ai file formats (items detailed below):\r\n- 6 direct mail postcard templates – 3 front side and 3 back side that can be combined to create a direct mail postcard\r\n\r\n- 3 landscape-oriented coupon book ads (i.e. Clipper magazine and other similar publications)\r\n\r\n- 3 portrait-oriented coupon book ads (i.e. Clipper magazine and other similar publications)\r\n\r\n- 1 Coming Soon flyer template\r\n\r\n- 1 Grand Opening flyer template\r\n\r\n- 1 Now Open flyer template\r\n\r\n- 1 Friends and Family event flyer template\r\n\r\n- 1 Puppy and Kitten-oriented flyer template\r\n\r\n- 1 General Event flyer template (that could be used for an external event)\r\n\r\n- 2 brand flyer templates for general use\r\n\r\n- 2 generic coupon templates (these would be placed on the flyers, direct mailers, etc.)\r\n\r\n\r\n2) All native files used for printers to work with','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1587914513171226625?success','NA',7,'United States','Knoxville',1200.000,'fixed',1200.000,'2022-11-02',1,'2022-11-02',1,'Clinet may ask for call, if he shows up on chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-02 21:10:34',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
