(719,'Finalize features for a WordPress Plugin before public release - Agencies welcome',4,'We\'ve got a few features that were partially done which require:\r\n1. Analysis of what is not working (as per the expected behavior)\r\n2. Finalize the features\r\n\r\nAfter we are done with this release, we prefer to keep an open relationship where we work continuously on the new features that we have in our backlog.\r\n\r\nTo give you more context, we are running a WordPress Plugin that is published to wp.org repo and have a PRO version.\r\n\r\nIt is required for you to have a deep understanding and experience in integrating with:\r\n- WooCommerce\r\n- Elementor\r\n- Divi\r\n- Google\r\n- Zapier\r\n\r\nPlease bid if you are interested and after we have a one-on-one alignment on the needful, you will be able to update your quote based on the amount of work left to be done.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1588095320546549761','NA',7,'United States','Cascioarele',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2022-11-03',1,'2022-11-03',0,'Ahmed Nayeem',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-03 10:22:40',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
