(728,'Standout label design for preworkout supplement',2,'Preparing to launch my supplement company, Slam, and am looking for a packaging/label designer for our signature pre-workout product.\r\nHoping to have the design finished by November 14th.\r\nI already have a few ideas, and I would for the product to standout and catch the eye when sitting alongside other labels.\r\nI already have a logo for the brand, and will provide the template from the manufacturer which will include the supplement facts and other label requirements.\r\nPrior experience would be great, but not required.\r\nWhat I had in mind\r\n- Eye catching with bright colors but clean.\r\n- Brand name is slam fuel, so would love for the product name, Slam, to look like it is being “slammed” onto the label with cracks running throughout the rest of the label. Pre-workout in smaller text below that Slam.\r\n- Flavors will be mountain glacier, peach mango, and white gummy, so need the design to allow for the easy switching of colors based on the flavor. For example, for the mountain glacier an arctic blue ice inspired design/color with silver or white cracks running through it would fit, and then peach mango just switching that arctic blue color to an orange and the cracks to potentially another color as well. I attached an example as well.\r\nPictures explanation\r\n1. and 2. - eye catching colors where colors can easily be swapped\r\n3. Eye catching color, clean,\r\n4. Product name in big font, pre-workout much smaller below.\r\nIf we are satisfied with the design would love to collaborate for future product','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1588168201331269633?success','NA',7,'United States','Fort Worth',400.000,'Open this select menu',320.000,'2022-11-03',1,'2022-11-03',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-03 13:57:57',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
