(732,'Pitch Deck Structure and Design on Canva',2,'We have a pitch deck I designed in Canva, but I want someone with experience to not only make it dazzling with graphic designs, but look at it from an investor perspective and apply their own ideas to tell the story better if possible.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for someone to take some time to understand our business and then think from scratch: \"How can we grab investors\' attention and impress them with in a pitch deck?\" \"Can this pitch be re-worked so it nails it?\"\r\n\r\nWe have a pitch deck that I did, but I would like a pro to reword if necessary, simplify, change the order...whatever the deck needs.\r\n\r\nI have an infographic done of two slides already, that will be used in this presentation.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1588169192398594049?success','NA',7,'United States','Kirkland',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-11-03',1,'2022-11-03',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-03 14:06:27',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(733,'Logo design',2,'MUST BE A NATIVE EUROPEAN OR AMERICAN.\r\nNeed a modern simplistic icon for my logo.\r\nPayment would be 10% down, 90% when complete.\r\nI am rebranding my product and have everything complete except an icon for my logo.\r\nI am looking for modern, simple, easy to print on my product and unique. When I say unique, I mean not a bird\'s head (my product is an LED light for pet birds).\r\nMy new name is HappyBird Lighting Company\r\nAttached is the current version, the font I like because my customers are typically empty nester women so it shouldn\'t look too industrial, the icon I do NOT like. It lacks originality and looks like a high school girl did it.\r\nThe icon shouldn\'t be too cutsie because I want to convey an established, high-quality company.\r\nI am reluctant to give examples because when I have done that in the past all I get back is the same icon as the example in a different shape or color. I am hoping to rely on your ability to understand \"modern minimalistic\" and upon your creativity.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1588170575581237249?success','NA',7,'United States','Milwaukee',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-11-03',1,'2022-11-03',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-03 14:07:14',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
