(737,'Graphic designer for ads, email and web',2,'Hey! We\'re looking for an experienced graphic designer to help take existing creative like photos and videos and turn them into amazing pieces of content for ads, email (Klaviyo) and images for our site.\r\n\r\nWe\'re an eco friendly men\'s clothing brand looking to raise awareness around ocean clean up. Our tone is light hearted, fun and our assets need to reflect that. You need to be highly skilled with design. We need you to have skills that can assist our ecommerce creative goals. Please write, \"Save the turtles\" at the top of your cover letter so we know you read this entire job description.\r\n\r\nFrequent and proactive communication is needed -- especially for the volume of work and dependency with other internal stakeholders and their projects.\r\n\r\nMultiple rounds of revision may be needed to ensure project expectations. We will start with one project and test, then look for long-term work on multiple projects for ongoing work.\r\n\r\nLastly, things will start off a bit quick since we\'re gearing up for Black Friday Cyber Monday and would love amazing looking content to set the season off right :)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1588174449686601729?success','NA',7,'United States','Denver',100.000,'fixed',45.000,'2022-11-03',1,'2022-11-03',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-03 14:23:08',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
