(760,'Product logo design',2,'We need basic logo design for use with a new product brand in the discount & deal shopping club space, the telemedicine space, and the ID Theft Space We are looking for a designer to provide a logo that will help with our brand development. Potential opportunity for future jobs in website and landing page design, email templates, and other product launches.\r\n\r\nWe have 4 different products and will be white labeling them into 4 brands each. We will need a total of 16 logos. The logo design can be basic and tweaked for each additional white-label brand in that category.\r\nThe 4 product categories are:\r\n- Shopping discount and deal club\r\nWe offer coupons and codes, instant discounts on shopping, home, healthcare, pet, etc along with excellent savings on travel, entertainment, and dining.\r\n- Telemedicine service\r\n24/7 365 access to a network of doctors for diagnosis, treatment plan, and prescriptions over the phone or video chat\r\n- ID Theft and protection\r\nID monitoring and dark web searches, password protection, etc\r\n- Warranty protection\r\nExtended protection for electronics, cell phones, and laptops coupled with shopping savings and discounts.\r\n\r\nWe prefer a small icon along with a text treatment for logos, nothing too complicated or involved.\r\nColors - for shopping programs - warm, happy, savings\r\nFor Telemed - trustworthy, official, caring\r\nID Theft - Strong, trustworthy, authoritative\r\n\r\nWe have a short timeline and would need these completed by early next week.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01804dd6d77f4407e3','NA',7,'United States','Westport',750.000,'fixed',750.000,'2022-11-03',1,'2022-11-03',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-03 15:36:42',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
