(793,'Branding Strategy Consultation',2,'Annually, we host a nationwide livestock show. We have developed a branding strategy for the livestock show itself. (see attached)\r\n\r\nFor this project, I would like help developing a brand for our bar and members club we set up for the show.\r\n\r\nProject 1 - The Hacienda\r\nThe name of the bar we set up is \"The Hacienda\". A couple of years ago, I had a designer conceptualize what a neon sign would look like (see attached). Originally, it was both a bar and grill. Since then, The Hacienda has become just a bar, so I would like to revisit the logo/sign for the Hacienda itself.\r\n\r\nSome thoughts/questions for Project 1:\r\n- Does The Hacienda logo need to reference or have a \"brought to you by\" reference to our company logo?\r\n- Or is using the fonts from our brand guide enough of an association?\r\n- I want both a logo and neon design created\r\n\r\n\r\nProject 2 - The Hacienda-Black\r\nWe have a membership program associated with the livestock show. One perk I\'d like to offer is a members only area adjacent to the bar where members can go into to relax and associate with one another. I\'d like to develop some branding for this location but would like it tied to The Hacienda.\r\n\r\nSome thoughts/questions for Project 2:\r\n- I need some thoughts on what to call this area. I arbitrarily called it \"The Hacienda-Black\", but that\'s just a place holder. I\'m totally open to other thoughts. I\'m also wondering if we need \"members only\" on this logo.\r\n- We need to create a version of The Hacienda logo for the members only area.\r\n- This logo will be used on promotional flyers as well as a sign at the entrance to the lounge area.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1588218200892235777?success','NA',7,'United States','PHOENIX',112.000,'perhour',45.000,'2022-11-03',1,'2022-11-03',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-03 17:16:12',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
