(814,'Conceptual Infographic',2,'Looking to create a compartive infographic that shows the beneficial economic density of 6 cases of beef jerky at $30 per case, that fit into the same space that a case of beer takes up ($25 per case). Looking to visually explain to beer distributors and stores that the the revenue density on their shelfs, or on their trucks, is a 6-7X better utilization of their space.\r\n\r\nThe case of beef jerky will be an illustration of our branded box, and the example box of beer will be an generic illustration of a Budweiser case.\r\n\r\nThe punchline of the infographic is that given the same amount of space, the jerky is a 6-7X better economic decision than more beer - and the beer distributor/retailer should therefore dedicate some space and resources to selling the jerky.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01a20dae5505143a48','no',7,'United States','West Chester',55.000,'perhour',55.000,'2022-11-03',1,'2022-11-03',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-03 21:54:26',NULL,6,3,3,111),
