(852,'Graphic designer needed to create a book cover mockup',2,'Hi\r\n\r\nI want to create a mockup for a book cover -\r\n\r\n1. The book is supposed to be a spell-book/grimoire\r\n2. This cover mockup will be used as the first page of a presentation - no need to place it on a mockup - I need the design itself as a high res photo\r\n3. It’s old/antique and thick\r\n4. Size - A4 - share final files as AI/PSD AND high-res JPEG\r\n5. I want it look like an actual leather cover for a book, with pages showing from the side\r\n\r\nA. The overall look -\r\n\r\nPlease refer to the attachments titled - “Cover Reference A” and “Cover Reference B” -\r\n\r\n1. Navy blue leather texture, a bit aged/worn out - thick book, with loads of old pages inside it\r\n2. It has a brass lock on it\r\n3. It has different shape outlines engraved/debossed on it - you can play with the depth of engraving for the different elements - needs to look realistic\r\n\r\nB. The Symbols - those will be on the leather -\r\n\r\n1. In the middle, there’s a circle with markings inside it - feel free to either trace those markings or find similar ones online(send me the files to purchase) - to find similar markings, look for - Seals of Solomon, Kabbalah sigils, etc… — please refer to the attached “Seal Reference”\r\n\r\n2. Inside the circle - there’s the symbol - attached the eps - “Hand Symbol” - remove the snake border, but you can keep the words\r\n\r\n3. On the bottom left corner of the page - there’s text scratched in — use this font; https://www.fontspace.com/drawing-blood-font-f10666\r\n\r\nThe words are(follow the layout and size font per the attached “Layout Mockup”) -\r\nAVENGED BE, REVENGE BE MINE,\r\nMY FOE HATH SOUGHT THE\r\nPATH OF BLIND.\r\n(Underlined)\r\n\r\n- A.W.\r\n\r\n\r\n4. Lastly, I want to add a logo - somewhere on top - I’ll share more info with the selected candidate - some minor tweaking required\r\n\r\n5. Bonus - if we can add more symbol markings around the edges of the book - more Kabbalah/occult symbols - that would be great\r\n\r\nAlso, make the cover look more 3D - i.e. we can see the top of the book, the spine, and the bottom with a texture of the pages inside it, etc..','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01d98c8b9173e03f88','no',7,'United States','Dubai',150.000,'fixed',200.000,'2022-11-07',1,'2022-11-07',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-07 16:30:48',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
