(869,'Cosmetic Packaging Design: Label and Box',2,'We\'d like to have a system created for packaging design. We have several serums in dropper bottles we\'re ready to launch. We\'d like to launch the dropper bottles in boxes for multiple reasons. Unboxing creates a sense of treating oneself and also provides a physical mechanism that can be sealed for additional product safety. Mid-range luxury skincare line based on the best ingredients available (natural, organic, synthetic). Line is biome friendly (planet and skin).\r\n\r\nWould like to have a system designed where we can use the same box to package our dropper bottles, yet be able to customize each box per serum. Perhaps the overall box design could be standard to the brand and a label could be affixed for each type of serum to the box. The boxes could feature embossing or another design element to set them apart yet reflect a luxury feel.\r\n\r\nOur initial serum to launch will be our anti-hyperpigmentation serum and a waterproof, oil proof label needs to be designed as part of this job. We\'ll provide the information for the label, yet we expect the designer to have experience creating cosmetic labels compliant with FDA guidelines in the United. States. Hence the designer will be responsible for knowing what information is mandatory for the label along with the required font sizes and primary panel information.\r\n\r\nWill provide our brand bible to the person we hire. Colors and fonts will be the brand fonts that we already have. Using Packlane for the product boxes. The dropper bottle dimensions are H5.0, W1.25, and D1.25 (dimensions are snug so .25\" will need to be added). I foresee using a branded sticker as part of the visual appeal, but also to show the client the box has not been opened and that their product is free from tampering.\r\n\r\nDepending on how the relationship progresses with the selected designer, there could be other work as we launch additional products. Our target demographic and messaging will be provided to the selected designer upon contract initiation.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~014b102fe91f1c21a8','no',7,'United States','Evans',450.000,'fixed',450.000,'2022-11-08',1,'2022-11-08',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-08 15:07:06',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
