(871,'Logo and brand designer needed',2,'I need a logo created for my Etsy shop. We specialize in wall art, i.e., posters that capture motivational sayings, Christmas-themed imagery and the like. Our customer is a Gen-Z or millennial woman who wants to beautify her living space.\r\n\r\nThe deliverables:\r\nTwo logos - one standard, one letter mark (plus source files)\r\nTwo banners - one large, one small (plus source files)\r\nOrder receipt banner\r\nCustom order banner\r\nReserved listing\r\n\r\nSee examples here: https://shop.macaronsandmimosas.com/product/bali-etsy-shop-set/#view-2\r\n\r\nPlease send a quote that includes pricing for all of the above. This is the aesthetic that I am looking for: https://www.pinterest.com/hillarywright01/malcolm-and-park/','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590009312500031489','no',7,'United States','Tamarac',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2022-11-08',1,'2022-11-08',1,'fix project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-08 15:55:08',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(872,'Need Book Cover Design For Self-Publishing Venture',2,'My competition-winning 86K spec-horror novel is in the middle of a professional edit and I am in need of a cover design!! My goal is to self-publish via amazon/kindle to start, then move to other companies after obtaining some exposure...\r\n\r\nBelow is a link to the facebook page where my novel info resides. Also, there\'s a link to my website. Attached is what I\'ve been working with now. Please take a look and let me know what you think!\r\n\r\nMy goal is to book launch in March 2023 at the latest. January would be ideal, but I will need to get beta readers and everything else locked in place.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/streetbetweenthepines\r\nhttps://jjalo143.wixsite.com/actor/writing\r\n\r\nMy website may be changing in the coming days...','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590015673080725505?success','NA',7,'United States','N/A',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-11-08',1,'2022-11-08',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-08 16:19:54',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
