(896,'Looking for a talented designer to design labels and gift box for a get well soon gift package',2,'Hello!\r\n\r\nWe\'re an ecommerce company looking to launch a new product: a beautifully curated get well soon gift box. This box will be mainly for women and will include the following:\r\n\r\n- ceramic mug\r\n- candle\r\n- greeting card\r\n- socks\r\n- blanket\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for a talented designer with a keen eye to help design a well-branded gift box that looks luxurious, minimal, and aesthetically beautiful. It should look like a premium gift box. We will need the following assets:\r\n\r\n- box design for mug\r\n- candle design to be printed directly on the candle\r\n- box design for candle\r\n- greeting card\r\n- a label to go around the socks\r\n- a label to go around the blanket\r\n- gift box to hold everything in place\r\n\r\nWe prefer to have light pastel colors (see attached) and utilize an ascent color that can bring the entire box together.\r\n\r\nBecause this gift box is targeted towards women, it would make the most sense to have a women\'s perspective when designing the box, although everyone is welcomed to submit a proposal.\r\n\r\nAlso, instead of having you work on all the labels and designs right from the start, we would like for you to submit one label that we can review together to see if the design is something we\'re looking for before committing to the rest of the labels and designs.\r\n\r\nShould your resume and experience fit our criteria, we\'ll reach out and provide further instructions for the labels (name of the product, logo, etc)\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590082815750815745','no',7,'United States','La Mirada',200.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-11-08',1,'2022-11-08',1,'fix project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-08 20:46:57',NULL,7,3,NULL,115),
