(900,'Graphic designer needed to create “kitschy cute” graphic for shirt',2,'We are a bubble tea shop that is looking for a new graphic to print on hoodies and/or t shirts.\r\n\r\nWe like to go with a different aesthetic for each design we put on merchandise. The aesthetic we would like to go with for this design is described as “kitschy cute.” Think of traditional tattoo style meets vintage ceramic animal statues. I will provide references as to exactly what kind of aesthetic we are going for. The references are from tattoo artist @aida_bloom on instagram that nails the aesthetic we are looking for perfectly.\r\n\r\nFor the design, we would like it to be an animal or two in the style mentioned above, along with a bubble tea incorporated into the image. We would also like our company name on the graphic as this will be going on clothing.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~014192855d63a765db/apply/','na',7,'United States','Marquette',25.000,'perhour',30.000,'2022-11-08',1,'2022-11-08',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-08 21:02:06',NULL,6,3,NULL,117),
