(909,'Packaging Design for Natural, Premium Consumer Goods CPG Oral Care Brand',2,'We are seeking a professional, premium look and amazing packaging design for our premium, innovative and sustainable oral care products.\r\n\r\nWe are a made-in- USA certified women-owned premium, oral care business that has been the #1 toothbrush brand in the natural products space for 15 years. We were established in 1983 and our second generation family-owned business. Our children’s toothbrushes are the #1 children’s toothbrushes on Amazon USA. We manufacture in our own factory in Eastern PA and our portfolio includes oral care for Adults, Children, and Pets too. We are experienced in selling to Distributors, Retailers in Brick and Mortar Online / eCommerce platforms, and many other formats. We are a fluid and flexible privately-owned company that is able to build out new business strategies/opportunities as they arise to ensure success.\r\n\r\nWe are currently manufacturing on-site in our factory in Pennsylvania. We have a few new items/designs coming up - toothbrushes, toothpaste, floss, and other items.\r\n\r\nThis project includes but is not limited to:\r\n- Full design of packaging label\r\n- Full product wrap\r\n- Print Ready labels\r\n- Source files\r\n- Mock up / 3D renderings\r\n- Multiple revisions included (4-5 min)\r\n- Coordinating samples as needed\r\n- Supporting during ramp-up to production with packaging vendors if needed\r\n\r\nYou will work directly with the CEO\r\n\r\nThere is an opportunity for additional new product packaging if the partnership and working relationship is a success. We have a number of new products we would like to launch.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b8d712a39b4229d3','no',7,'United States','Kutztown',150.000,'fixed',200.000,'2022-11-08',1,'2022-11-08',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-08 21:46:35',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
