(912,'Amazon Graphic Designer',2,'We\'re a new company and we\'re looking for a talented, hard working, highly experienced graphic designer that will create the following brand assets:\r\n(1) Amazon listing with A+/EBC (we have brand registry, so we\'ll need the 9 main listing images plus additional graphic design work for A+).\r\n(2) Packaging design (cardboard box, 1 or 2 sides with company logo and company details).\r\n(3) 3D render for listing images (primarily of product packaging).\r\n(4) Double-sided product insert design.\r\n(5) Product label/wash label.\r\n\r\nWe would like to see options and have unlimited revisions.\r\n\r\nWe want a consistent look and feel through each of the 5 areas above.\r\nDeep experience of creating eye-catching, high converting Amazon listing images and graphics is essential - which we\'ll need to see examples of.\r\nStrong client communication skills important.\r\nAbility to work to tight deadlines required.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you soon.\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nJason','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590098840593043457','NA',7,'United States','Alvescot',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2022-11-08',1,'2022-11-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-08 21:52:51',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
