(966,'Rethink / rebrand a company logo - copyright transfer required',2,'Our company has a starting point for a brand logo, but we are looking for a designer who can elevate / rethink the design. Not something very complicated or overly conceptual - a simple, straightforward logo. We will require the logo in the following formats:\r\n\r\n1. Black and white version\r\n2. Full-coloured version\r\n3. Icon / Favicon version\r\n\r\nIdeally we are hoping for a quick turnaround (around 1 week). We also require that the designer transfer full copyright of the logo to us for perpetual use.\r\n\r\nPlease send any samples of logos you have worked on in the past, especially those to do with biotech, healthcare, and technology.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e9f17a846c2edeb6','NA',7,'United States','Oxford',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2022-11-09',1,'2022-11-09',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-09 16:11:31',NULL,6,3,NULL,126),
