(974,'Frame by Frame Animator, CEL Animator - Logo animation',2,'Hello,\r\n\r\nwe are an animation studio based in Slovakia.\r\nWe now have one small project of the logo animation which requires a CEL, FbF animation.\r\n\r\nThe animation should be ready by 22.11.!\r\n\r\nPlease apply only if you have these skills. We are not looking for some Explainer video producer!\r\n\r\nThe video will start with animation of a flying hawk which will then transform to a logo.\r\nHawk like in this animation: https://youtu.be/AOHt-ijxSq4 (this movement is not FbF, so we need a little higher level)\r\nThe illustrations style of the animation should be really close to the reference I sent.\r\n\r\nI think that the final animation will have less than 10 sec.\r\n\r\nPlease in your proposal send us you best CEL, FbF animations.\r\nAlso start with \"Hello Moodive\" so we will know that you read the full text.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01c0ec3689a4ba763e','NA',7,'United States','Bratislava',900.000,'fixed',900.000,'2022-11-09',1,'2022-11-09',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-09 16:36:34',NULL,6,3,NULL,126),
