(978,'Front-end developer for website needed',3,'We are seeking an expert HTML/CS/JS developer to assist in converting our new website design into a functional set of templates. In this project you will work with our designer and other team members to help us convert our mockups and create the actual pages. You do not need to be a graphic designer but if you\'re able to work with Photoshop/Illustrator that is a bonus. We are leaning towards using Bootstrap 5 but custom HTML/CSS is acceptable. No back-end development is required as a part of this project. We are expecting to start this project in 1-2 weeks and will need someone who can start work as soon as the mockups have had final approval. Please include links to current web projects in your proposal if they are not already available in your Upwork profile.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~016da2dcad7cc4d6ae/apply/','na',7,'United States','Terre Haute',150.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-11-09',1,'2022-11-09',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-09 16:42:56',NULL,6,3,NULL,117),
(979,'Modernize Logo for Podcast Studio',2,'Thank you for taking the time to read our post! We are looking for a creative graphic designer who can take our logo\'s foundation to the next level.\r\n\r\nThe name of our network is called SpeakEasy Studios. Our mission is to make podcasting accessible to everyone that has a message. Our logo is meant to play on the term \"speakeasy.\" Many of them had red doors to indicate that it was a speakeasy. We want to incorporate a microphone and the red door. The idea is that the cord from the microphone has a key to open the door.\r\n\r\nI\'ve attached the foundation of what we are looking to create. This task is to make the foundation of our logo more modern AND create a variation with our tagline \"SPEAK AND BE HEARD\".\r\n\r\nThanks again for your interest in helping us complete this task','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590384881742508033','NA',7,'United States','Byonton Beach',60.000,'Open this select menu',60.000,'2022-11-09',1,'2022-11-09',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-09 16:46:57',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
