(981,'Graphics & Illustrations for Technical Subject - Destroying Cancer Causing \"Forever Chemicals\"',2,'Looking for a creative and seasoned graphic designer to help create a series of graphics depicting a complex, technical process as well as graphics/illustrations/infographics that show our company\'s value props. Taking these complex topics and being able to visualize them in a simple manner is our goal.\r\n\r\nAbout Us:\r\nAclarity is a venture-backed water technology company based in Massachusetts that quickly and safely destroys dangerous contaminants in water at the industrial scale. Aclarity’s low energy, electrochemical process makes it easy to destroy unwanted contaminants such as PFAS in landfill leachate. The prevalence of per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances (PFAS) across the planet is a hazard to human health and has been linked to cancers, decreased fertility, reduced vaccine response, high cholesterol, and developmental delays in children. PFAS are often called \"forever chemicals\" as they do not naturally decompose and therefore build up in humans, animals and the environment.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590386323613589505?success','https://trello.com/b/eh32Y1Pm/task-list-arturo-digital/member/hasnain143?filter=tcc',7,'United States','Hadley',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-11-09',1,'2022-11-09',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-09 16:52:36',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
