(1013,'Brand Identity',2,'I operate an online houseplant studio that supports online orders and local houseplant delivery. My store is on DoorDash, offering houseplant delivery, like a florist, wrapped like gifts. I offer wholesale products to other retailers worldwide (Organic Plant Polish) and Polishing Gloves (and soon plant soil).\r\n\r\nwww.octoberviolet.com\r\n\r\nWhat I need is an overall brand identity and product packaging that compliments one another. I\'ve expanded my product lines and in order to move forward with bottling and packaging products, I need updated labels and packaging. It\'s a weird hodgepodge of various branding that no longer matches or compliments the brand.\r\n\r\nAttached is the previous branding however, I only used one logo and the polish labels were changed almost immediately. Unfortunately, I never embraced this branding.\r\n\r\nScope:\r\n1. Logo Revision / Re-Design\r\n\r\n2. Organic Plant Polish Labels\r\nBottle Sizes: 60 ML, 300 ML, 500 ML\r\nScents: Lavender, Lemon, Peppermint\r\n\r\n3. Organic Plant Soil Labels\r\nBag Sizes: Unknown/TBD\r\nBlends: Earth, Wind, Fire, Water\r\n\r\n4. Stickers: Logo Sticker, Peace, Love, Plants Sticker\r\n\r\n5. Marketing Insert Template for DoorDash / Online Orders\r\n\r\n6. Plant Care Instruction Template','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01eb13f44b49d935a0/apply/','Na',7,'United States','Meridian',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-11-09',1,'2022-11-09',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-09 19:26:04',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
