(1020,'Logo for UltiFunds.com',2,'Hi!\r\n\r\nI\'m starting a new company that helps ultimate frisbee teams participate in fundraisers to help cover their team\'s expenses.\r\n\r\nIt\'s called Ulti Funds! Can be spelled UltiFunds like in the URL as well. Ulti-Funds is fine also.\r\n\r\nMost players spend $300+ to participate on their team. We help each individual player cover some or all of their costs.\r\n\r\nWhat\'s unique about this fundraising company is that there are:\r\n\r\nNo selling candy\r\nNo selling candles\r\nNo selling coupons\r\nNo carwashes\r\nNo asking for donations\r\n\r\nInstead, we use sponsors who make a donation for every person that gets a free auto insurance quote. So, for every person that a player gets to get a free auto insurance quote, the insurance company gives that team $15! Ten people call, that player raised $150! No sales, signups, or donations. They get the donation even if the participant doesn\'t use the insurance sponsor!\r\n\r\nUltimate frisbee is a fun, competitive, and growing team sport played all over the world.\r\n\r\nThis will be for United States teams only, for now.\r\n\r\nAge groups include Middle school, High school, College, and up! That\'s age 15-70 for our clients.\r\n\r\nWe need a fun logo that makes getting money for your team/program look easier than ever!\r\n\r\nOur logo will go on frisbees to be given to teams as a form of advertisement. Therefore, we shouldn\'t have a frisbee in the logo itself, as it will be printed on a logo.\r\n\r\nI will upload some images of what the frisbees look like in case any designers are unfamiliar.\r\n\r\nYou don\'t have to center your design around ultimate frisbee.... This logo should work for any sport as nothing would change if a soccer team or football team participated.\r\n\r\nThis is the easiest way to raise money that all players can participate in. They literally just text/email their friends/family a link to a form that they can fill out in under 60 seconds. After that they get their quote and they have raised $15 for their team!\r\n\r\nI don\'t have any particular images or ideas in mind, but I know I don\'t want the letters \"UF\" to be the logo. Doing just letters/font tells people absolutely nothing about the company.\r\n\r\nCustomers should see the logo and know: this company does FUNdraisers!\r\n\r\nPlease please please ask me any questions!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590427821606944769','NA',7,'United States','Charlotte',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2022-11-09',1,'2022-11-09',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-09 19:39:02',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
