(1030,'Animator for short video',2,'Looking for an Animator to create a short film in which a passage form a book is typed out on the top portion of the screen. When the passage is completed, the words, line by line, spin and fall to the ground like the winged seeds of a tree. The film is to be projected in a gallery. Here is reference as to how the words would spin. https://youtu.be/qvmTQHtHlIM','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590438812499558401?success','Na',7,'United States','Thornhill',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2022-11-09',1,'2022-11-09',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-09 20:20:46',NULL,6,3,NULL,140),
