(1038,'Project-Based Video Editing',2,'Here is an example of the type of video work we would need, specific to one of our partner spotlights:\r\n\r\n-Create a video that follows the same format as the other videos in our partner spotlight series (Example: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2w00n0SkZCQ&list=PL9zg0Nm37iG4YOYdBYzrGo-UWn4nfy4cg&index=6)\r\n-You will be provided video footage, and will need to add into/outro - will need new intro/outro to align to our updated branding\r\n-Update the intro video to the new speakers names, titles, companies, and headshots (original, editable intro video files will be included)\r\n- The first time each speaker appears on the screen, add a pop-up with their names and titles\r\n- Please include the Acceleration Partners logo on every screen (see example for reference on how to add it and make sure it’s easily readable by blurring background directly behind the logo and switching between colored and white logo versions, if need be)\r\n- Edit video to make it higher quality: cut any long pauses, filler moments, or any other parts that would ensure a smoother transition for the video\r\n- Add smooth transitions between intro and outro videos (see example for reference)\r\n- Add quote pop-ups to video (Word doc with quotes and timestamps will be provided, see example for reference on how they should look and how long they should stay up)\r\n- Add outro video (this doesn’t need to be updated every time – the content is evergreen)\r\n- Pull two short videos that can be used for social media promotion – 16:9 and 1:1 sizing. Timestamps will be provided','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590445786060681217','NA',7,'United States','Needham',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-11-09',1,'2022-11-09',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-09 20:48:08',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
