(1060,'Amazon Firestick App for TV',6,'Requirements:\r\n\r\nAn App that is installable on Amazon fire TVs to stream live events. The links streamed are to be updated by a dashboard. Details of the project as listed below.\r\n\r\n\r\n    The Firestick App:\r\n\r\n        Screen 1: Home screen or Browse / choose categories.\r\n\r\nThis screen will display all categories in the main screen with thumbnails.\r\n\r\nFunctionalities:\r\n\r\n    Choose categories.\r\n\r\n    Navigate through videos.\r\n\r\n    Show categories (viz. Latest videos, Family, Top viewed, etc..)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    Screen 2: Browse category in detail and choose videos in each category.\r\n\r\nTo be able to choose category videos, display thumbnails and titles with views.\r\n\r\n    Screen 3: Excerpt of live channel.\r\n\r\nDetailed view screen of the live channel features a thumbnail, Title, star rating, description, play button and total views.\r\n\r\nUsers will be able to like or dislike the video (or star rating).\r\n\r\nUser views will be counted upon each play.\r\n\r\n    Screen 4: Play video with a short description & Title displayed\r\n\r\nThis screen shows the actual video with title, excerpt etc. Player controls include play and pause.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    The Admin Control Panel (Web): The Admin control panel allows administrators to add users and allow video uploads.\r\n\r\nUsers would have these permissions or features in admin panel:\r\n\r\n    Login: Users will be able to login securely to the panel.\r\n\r\n    User management: Add edit delete users from admin panel.\r\n\r\n    Upload videos : Users will be able to upload videos and specify :\r\n\r\n        Category of video. (Max 4 in one)\r\n\r\n        Title. (with a max character limit)\r\n\r\n        Description. (with a max character limit)\r\n\r\n        Thumbnail. - A functionality to restrict image size so that image loads easily in TV App.\r\n\r\n        Tags (Max 4)\r\n\r\n        Image background. - A functionality to restrict image size so that image loads easily in TV App.\r\n\r\n        Video Views - Initially this will be zero at the time of upload.\r\n\r\n        Star rating or likes. - Initially this will be zero.\r\n\r\n    User statistics:\r\n\r\n        Number of views per video (Top 10).\r\n\r\n        Number of likes per video (Top 10).\r\n\r\n        Top grossing videos (Top 10).\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    API endpoints to connect to & from App:\r\n\r\nAPI Endpoints are the connection from and to the app to our admin dashboard. A push request is used by the App to get data and a put request to add data.\r\n\r\n\r\nEndpoints will have these features:\r\n\r\n\r\n    Secure login via API to admin panel\r\n\r\n    Categories listing to fetch top videos, latest upload etc.\r\n\r\n    Views are counted and populated in the app using push.\r\n\r\n    A data request sends each video count to the server.\r\n\r\n    Likes and dislikes are counted using API requests too.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1963454','n/a',7,'United States','-',2500.000,'fixed',2500.000,'2022-11-09',1,'2022-11-09',1,'fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-09 21:04:17',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
