(1067,'Graphic Designer For Ecommerce Brand',2,'Are you looking for a job where you can unwind your creativity, work on interesting projects with A-Players, and develop your skillset? If yes, this is the position for you.\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a passionate, talented, creative, and enthusiastic graphic who has an understanding of social advertising, email layouts, and performance marketing.\r\n\r\nThis is a contract-to-hire opportunity\r\n\r\nGeneral Accountabilities:\r\n- Social Ads and creative design\r\n- Other forms of graphic design for the Brilliance.com\r\n- Email blasts, from graphic design to management of certain campaigns\r\n- Product images: Retouch, improve and optimize product images for the web\r\n- Graphical elements such as banners, modals, etc.\r\n\r\nDesired Skills/Experience:\r\n- At least 1 year of graphic/web design experience (e-commerce)\r\n- High proficiency in Adobe Creative Suite\r\n- Photo editing and retouching skills\r\n- Video creation and editing experience is a bonus\r\n- Self-motivated with the ability to “think outside the box”\r\n- Basic Google Docs, Google Sheets\r\n- Strong work ethic, great drive\r\n- Detail and due date oriented\r\n\r\n\r\nCompany Overview\r\n\r\nHeadquartered in Boynton Beach, Florida, Brilliance.com is an online retailer of diamonds, engagement rings, and fine jewelry. With thousands of 5-star reviews over the past ten years, we have built a reputation as the highest-rated online diamond retailer.\r\n\r\nThe Brilliance Team is made up of a group of dreamers, designers, and doers with the goal of disrupting the engagement ring industry and consistently pushing its limits. At Brilliance, you will find a one-of-a-kind culture that empowers some of the industry’s brightest individuals to do their best work, further develop their professional goals, and grow into the ultimate versions of themselves. We believe that the journey toward achieving a goal is more important than the goal itself.\r\n\r\nCompensation & Benefits:\r\n\r\nStarting it will be pay per hour/pay per project position, with a possibility to develop into a full-time position.\r\n\r\nPlease attach your portfolio INCLUDING social media ads and/or email blasts.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590453638607269889','NA',7,'United States','Byonton Beach',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-11-09',1,'2022-11-09',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-09 21:20:52',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
(1068,'PowerPoint Template',2,'We would like to create a new PowerPoint template that follows our brand guidelines and is easy for employees to use.\r\n-Template will include:\r\n-Defined master slide\r\n-Defined Font theme\r\n- Hierarchy levels for font sizes with/without bullets\r\n-Defined color theme\r\n-Slides with placeholders (multipurpose, text, image, graphs, table, etc.)\r\n-Theme effects influences fills, lines, shadows, bevels, transitions\r\n-PowerPoint “user handbook” where the template and its usage is presented with instructions. We will provide Brand guidelines and samples of how fonts/colors have been used in existing marketing materials.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~013ec298445bf02548/apply/','Na',7,'United States','Glenview',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2022-11-09',1,'2022-11-09',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-09 21:26:39',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
