(1094,'Graphic designer needed to bring creative spark to new marketing initiatives',2,'I\'m looking to go from 0 to 100 on our marketing, using multiple strategies and platforms. What I need is someone with the ability to take boring techy topics, and make them shine!\r\n\r\nI want to:\r\n* Create printable and digital brochures for our products and services\r\n* Create eye catching PPT\'s for the sales team\r\n* Cerate short animations to quickly explain current market trends\r\n* Create professional looking video content of product demonstrations\r\n* Create videos of customer testimonials\r\n* Make our social media posts noticeable\r\n* Help us to remove boring stock images from the website\r\n\r\nWe can\'t do this all at once, even if you can. So this project is expected to last around 6 months, with 20hrs p/w. Longer term projects possible if everyone is happy :)\r\n\r\nTo submit a proposal for this project, please send a cover letter with an overview of your design philosophy and why this particular project sounds interesting to you. Any examples or taking a boring topic and making it fun will help you stand out! I am located in Texas and am online from 8 am until 6 pm CST.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0142bb5ba55f9980b1','N/A',7,'United States','-',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2022-11-09',1,'2022-11-09',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-09 22:35:02',NULL,6,3,NULL,126),
