(1105,'Create label for retail product.',2,'Need to make some labels for new products in our line of water filters. They will need to have the same logo and allot of the same components of our existing labels. I believe it will be 5 family of labels which will go be duplicated onto about 24 or so models of water filters.\r\n\r\nOn these 5 new labels, it will be taking inspiration from the original OEM products that we make compatibles for, so it should have the same color pallet and other aspects of them, but have our logos and our design as well. It will have to be a mix between the original product OEM and our brand labels..\r\n\r\nonce the 5 themes are done , basically the text of the model numbers and some fonts and text will change ... modifying text , upc codes, etc. Very straightforward.\r\n\r\nNeed this done asap..\r\n\r\nONLY USA designers please as these product need to have a western packaging look and feel.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01db55bd3ef5c57ad0/apply/','Na',7,'United States','Glendale',150.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-11-09',1,'2022-11-09',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-09 22:59:04',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
(1106,'Design and build stunning WordPress site',4,'We are looking for a top level, highly experienced WordPress expert to create a stunning-looking website (UI and UX design). It must both visually look and function *brilliantly* on all devices.\r\n\r\nThe website will be for an upmarket family-run UK investment company that specialises in property investing.\r\n\r\nThe website can be along the lines of the sites below which we like:-\r\n\r\nhttps://www.focusinvest.uk\r\n\r\nhttps://www.funding11.com/\r\n\r\nhttps://propiteer.com/\r\n\r\nWe will provide all the text and images to use. The logo has also already been created by us.\r\n\r\nWebsite will not be large and only have about eight pages.\r\n\r\nThere will be no registration, membership, e-commerce or purchasing function for you to take a considerable amount of your time creating.\r\n\r\nYou must professionally integrate an email sign-up box to an email broadcast service such as MailChimp. This includes setting-up a basic template (header etc.) for the emails.\r\n\r\nYou will also integrate a user-friendly contact form to the Contact page.\r\n\r\nAlso you should set-up Google Analytics for the website.\r\n\r\nYou will need to set-up and fully configure many Wordpress plugins. These will include all the regular popular ones such as those for SEO, as well as multiple ones to back-up the website, keep it secure from hackers etc.\r\n\r\nYou must use the default WordPress Gutenberg block editor or another free page builder.\r\n\r\nThe website must be created in a way it is easy for anybody to edit, update and redesign.\r\n\r\nThe reason we are willing to pay much more than other buyers posting similar projects for small, static websites on this freelancer portal is because we are looking for somebody who will enthusiastically go the extra mile with everything they do in creating the website: please do not bid for this job if you are only interested in doing a painting-by-numbers half-hearted ‘rush job’ and are not interested in methodically creating and refining the website to look visually stunning, to the client’s satisfaction, and ensuring you fully incorporate and configure the best features and plugins etc. For example, if, by default, you don’t skilfully make the websites you create search engine friendly, incorporate favicons etc. etc. this project is *not* suitable for you.\r\n\r\nNative or fluent English speakers only please.\r\n\r\nImportant: you must be willing to closely work with us and be an excellent communicator. If you are somebody who doesn\'t want to eagerly communicate and collaborate with us and do so in detail, including on video calls etc. when necessary, then please *do not* bid for this project.\r\n\r\nImportant: must be willing to work with commitment on this project from the week beginning 21 November 2022. We will communicate on a regular basis, at least every other day, and receive your updates at least twice a week.\r\n\r\nThe website must be completed by 1 January 2023 at the very latest please.\r\n\r\nIf you can\'t have everything finished by 1 January 2023, please do not apply for this job.\r\n\r\nNext Step: please:\r\n\r\n- show a portfolio of websites you’ve fully built, with websites you have personally both designed and created from scratch. Include examples of at least three Wordpress sites you’ve created.\r\n\r\n- describe how you intend to approach this project\r\n\r\n- let us know if you are willing to have Zoom meetings to discuss the website\r\n\r\n- inform us of where you are based\r\n\r\nWe are an established web agency of over 25 years which has built over 600 websites. This is the first of multiple Wordpress website design assignments we have for 2023. If – and only if - you do a truly brilliant job with this website, we will hire you regularly and pay you handsomely to create and/or maintain websites. We have paid hundreds of thousands of dollars to freelancers on freelancer portals like this over the last 15 years.\r\n\r\nImportant: as most freelancers here are careless, please quote \'WordpressGuru\' exactly at the top of your bid so that we know you have read this description. If you don\'t, we will not be able to respond to you or hire you.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1963526','n/a',7,'United States','-',2500.000,'fixed',1800.000,'2022-11-09',1,'2022-11-09',1,'fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-09 23:02:07',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
(1107,'Design our Box - Packaging',2,'Design our Packaging!\r\n\r\nNew packaging needed needed for a box with approx. dimensions of 12L X 8W X 2T.\r\n\r\n-This will be a Mailer type box - Example attached.\r\n\r\n-This is packing for our Wraps and Robes that goes directly to consumer.\r\n\r\n-Images and text ready to go, I have a basic roadmap for layout - just need it to be designed at a high level!\r\n\r\n- Sleek, memorable and professional are the goals\r\n\r\n-Our previous Box design is attached for reference.\r\n\r\n-I\'ve also included a very rough design of new box for inspiration.\r\n\r\nThis job needs to be completed ASAP. Pease only apply if you\'re able to execute a quick turnaround.\r\n\r\nThank you! I look forward to working with you!\r\n-KL','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590480035635654657','NA',7,'United States','Napa',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-11-09',1,'2022-11-09',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-09 23:04:12',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(1108,'Logo for brewing company',2,'Wild Brewing Co. needs your help creating a logo! We are after three different designs.\r\n\r\nFirst: WBC incorporated into a symbol, or design combining those three letters\r\nSecond: Use our partner companies logo as inspiration to create the new logo - i.e. follow the same style/theme\r\nThird - wild card suggestions - whatever you think is awesome.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590701518761037825','NA',7,'United States','Bedford',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-11-10',1,'2022-11-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-10 13:44:08',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(1109,'Find a name & design logo',2,'Hi everyone, we are looking for our startup a name, logo, and free available website.\r\nThe name should be in english and easy to pronounce.\r\n\r\nWHAT WE ARE DOING: Our startup is in the real estate industry which is using blockchain technology to allow our customers to buy fractional shares of real estate.\r\n\r\nWe like names such as Revolut, N26, Robinhood, Airbnb, and more ...\r\n\r\nWe think about a slogan such as:\r\n1) German estates for everyone!\r\n2) Real estate for everyone.\r\n\r\nWhat we don\'t like; toooo artsy or toooo playful names.\r\n\r\nSo shoot for ideas.\r\nMessage us.\r\nThank you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590703427405987841?success','NA',7,'United States','Berlin',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2022-11-10',1,'2022-11-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-10 13:51:53',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(1110,'Mobile app UI UX design',6,'Hi!\r\nI need to do an app design for iOs/android.\r\nApp have a simple function of generating images from the text by ML.\r\nI need to design first 4 screens:\r\n2 onboarding screens\r\nRedesign a little bit subscription screen that we already use in another apps.\r\nScreen where user inputs text and gets an image generated on the server.\r\nLogo also will be good to do, but not necessary.\r\n\r\nWill be great if you can do custom image assets, so the work will complete.\r\nDesign needs to be done in Figma.\r\n\r\nStyle of design will be great to do creative and colourful. So it will correlate with images user get using app. If you see what Midjourney, dalle and other ML generators do you understand what I\'m try to explain.\r\n\r\nFirst 4 screens will be great to do in 2-3 days. further design work will be more placid)\r\n\r\nWill be great to see examples of you work.\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590705439271010305?success','NA',7,'United States','Yerevan',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-11-10',1,'2022-11-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-10 13:59:15',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
