(1267,'Branding & Website Design for Growing SaaS Startup',2,'My name is Paul, and I run Fresco - an online whiteboard startup that is hoping to disrupt the visual collaboration industry. We are in need of a full brand redesign, along with new brand expression across our web touchpoints.\r\n\r\nHere are some of the deliverables we would need:\r\n\r\n- New Mark/Logo\r\n- New Color Palette\r\n- New Typography (for Logo & Product/Website)\r\n- Website Updates\r\n\r\nHere is a rundown of our main two priorities: Brand Identity and Website Updates.\r\n\r\nBrand Identity -- We need something that is better aligned with our values and vision, and that needs to be expressed with a new mark, logo, (and especially) color palette. These are super important for us, and we need to not only create a fitting brand identity but we need to create elements that allow us to independently scale these changes across our website and product as we grow.\r\n\r\nWebsite Updates -- We are optimizing our web presence and hoping to redesign our website to improve conversion and user experience. Our website has multiple touchpoints that need updates - mainly the blog posts, template pages, contact page, and landing page (potentially). We have an alternate landing page, so a full overhaul for the landing page would only be necessary if the work is impressive. We mainly want to restructure our theme to make the content more engaging for readers while also updating the branding of our site.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested in getting involved with our project, drop us a message, and we can see what\'s possible!\r\n\r\nPS: Use this link to check out our site: (frescopad.com)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590805412664963073','NA',7,'United States','Los Altos',4000.000,'Open this select menu',4000.000,'2022-11-10',1,'2022-11-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-10 20:39:04',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
