(1276,'Playground Sketch Illustrator/Graphic Designer',2,'We design playgrounds. Our designers will supply sketches and we want you to apply your masterful use of colour to bring the sketches to life. Sketches are 2D. You must have an excellent graphic design sense. In the same way that a graphic novel has an artist pencil, another artist\'s ink and a 3rd artist\'s colouring - it\'s that 3rd artist that we are seeking!\r\n\r\nYou must use a narrow colour palette and be consistent across one project to add compelling colour to concepts as a whole. Samples are attached.\r\n\r\nWe use Adobe software for design but you may choose to use another program.\r\n\r\nSketches of playground structures with themes will be supplied.\r\nYour deliverable is a coloured version of those sketches with 300 DPI in jpg format\r\n\r\nThis is a trial project. If we find the right candidate, we would like to hire on an ongoing hourly basis as needed.\r\n\r\nAttached files: SkyShips in black & white; SkyShips rendered (sample of what we will supply and what we want returned to us)\r\nUPSTAIRS LARGE FILES are examples of what you will received; we want you to bring to life with colour; these would be for one project so the colours need to be consistent across these three images.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590809604328984577?success','-',7,'United States','Wallenstein',30.000,'perhour',24.000,'2022-11-10',1,'2022-11-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-10 20:53:39',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
