(1279,'Create PowerPoint Presentation & Presentation Folder',2,'Create PowerPoint Business Presentation about 10 pages instructions below and please see attached files.\r\n\r\n\r\nPowerPoint Page 1: Just a colorful page. Standardize All pages should be similar in text, colors and design as the page I have attached.\r\n\r\nPowerPoint Page 2. An attention-grabbing page. Like page 4 of the Attentive (AHW) prezo attached here. It should clearly state that the employer will save about 25% off their federal income tax\r\n\r\nPowerPoint Page 3. Now we identify the problem. This will be page 5 and page 6 of the Health Compass (HC) prezo If we can consolidate to 1 page but I think this is extremely important so lets keep it on 2 pages if needed. This really shows how the program exists.\r\n\r\nPowerPoint Page 4. Outline the opportunity. Here is where we jump right into the pay example. I think we go with one example whereas before I had 2. Lets work on this together because I’d like to integrate the paycheck example with the benefits the employee has access to.\r\n\r\nPowerPoint Page 5. Now we show them why they work with is, experts with 20 years of experience. Etc. etc. Maybe list some of the clients who already work with Cody (HC prezo). For now, whatever you think is best. We can always adjust it later.\r\n\r\nPowerPoint Page 6. Testimonials and facts. Things that reinforce why the program exists. There is a lot in the two prezo’s attached, we can steal the best from.\r\n\r\nPowerPoint Page 7. The guarantee…not sure how we do this yet, but we want to put a stamp on the program. Really lock down that this will work.\r\n\r\nPowerPoint Page 9. Urgency…again, this is open, but we want to get them to a point where they feel this can’t wait.\r\n\r\nPowerPoint PowerPoint Page 10. Call to action!! This is where we try and close the deal.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01bcc259361cc847f7','no',7,'United States','Gilroy',80.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-11-10',1,'2022-11-10',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-10 21:00:06',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
