(1287,'Product Designer',3,'We are a B2C based app specializing in storage and organization and are looking for an entry-mid level UX/UI designer to join the team on a contract to hire role.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities\r\n* Collaborate with a team of Software Engineers & Designers\r\n* Ensure final visual design concepts are on-brand and deliver on strategy goals\r\n* Continuously iterate your designs to stay current with mobile trends\r\n* Prototype to communicate the “look” and “feel” of a project\r\n* Push for and create inclusive, accessible design for all\r\n\r\nQualifications\r\n* You’ve been designing digital products for 1-2 years\r\n* A portfolio that exemplifies strong visual design and a focus on defining the user experience\r\n* A strong understanding of typography, layout, color, and advanced design principles\r\n* You’re a conceptual thinker who can translate customer needs, behaviors, and project requirements\r\n* Experience effectively presenting and communicating your design decisions to team members\r\n* You’re knowledgeable of what’s possible on modern digital platforms coupled with an understanding of platform design standards (e.g. HIG, Material Design)\r\n* CSS experience preferred\r\n\r\nPlease include a link to your portfolio.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590807860906065920?success','https://trello.com/b/eh32Y1Pm/task-list-arturo-digital/member/hasnain143',7,'United States','Austin',40.000,'Open this select menu',40.000,'2022-11-10',1,'2022-11-10',1,'Clinet may ask for call, if he shows up on chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-10 21:19:22',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
(1288,'Website Needed Similar Cameo.com',3,'Hi all!\r\n\r\nWe need a platform that will be developed similar to cameo.com. The website will allow clients to accept orders. The platform will handle everything from payments to\r\npackages and content hosting.\r\n\r\nPlatform Features\r\n• Responsive design (Optimized for Mobile & Tablets)\r\n• Speed optimized & SEO-optimized\r\n• CRM integration and customized emails\r\n• Integration with tools like MailerLite / MailChimp\r\n• Analytics tools configuration\r\n• Integration with tracking systems (Facebook Pixel, TikTok Pixel, Google Ads)\r\n• Payment integration (Stripe or provider of your choice)\r\n• Content hosting & optimization\r\n• Options to configure multiple categories\r\n• Coupons and discount system\r\n• Content Management System (CMS)\r\n• Users’ management tool\r\n• Rating management tool\r\n• Advanced filters & search\r\n\r\nClient Portal\r\n• Dashboard\r\n• Manage profile\r\n• Manage orders\r\n• Manage packages\r\n• Manage videos\r\n• Payments\r\n\r\nAdmin Portal\r\n• Manage Clients\r\n• Control website content, settings, & configurations\r\n• Control packages and categories\r\n• Manage reviews and ratings\r\n• Payments\r\n\r\nThis website will need to be able to interact with our mobile app, which will be used for client purposes only, and not for customers. We will need to also incorporate something like OneSignal for requests from customers to clients. Please take a look at cameo.com.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~013f192939685a636b','no',7,'United States','tampa',4500.000,'fixed',4500.000,'2022-11-10',1,'2022-11-10',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-10 21:21:07',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
(1289,'Sales & Marketing Deck Designer',2,'Hey there !\r\n\r\nI am looking for a designer who\'s passionate by crafting sales and marketing presentations.\r\n\r\nTo start, we have a nice deck on Figma that we would like to migrate to Google Slide. Then there\'s an opportunity to work with us on the long term to design other presentations (Pitch, Sales and Marketing decks).\r\n\r\nWe already have brands guideline but we want to have someone with creative skills capable of designing something from scratch, based on conversations.\r\n\r\nWe will be interacting with myself and our sales and marketing Directors.\r\n\r\nWe expect high responsiveness, you\'ll be embedded in our team. We don\'t want someone who\'s working on 10 jobs in parallel and who will be talking to us once in a while.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to working with you !\r\nStephane','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590817628858814465?success','-',7,'United States','Montreal',70.000,'perhour',56.000,'2022-11-10',1,'2022-11-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-10 21:25:21',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
