(1304,'Website Banners & Matching Graphics Needed',2,'** I have attached a Word Document outlining information about all 3 sales and text needed in each graphic, etc. Please review this before applying**\r\n\r\nWe need a total of nine (9) graphics about our upcoming Black Friday, Small Business Saturday, and Cyber Monday sales.\r\n\r\nFor each sale, we will need the following three graphics:\r\n\r\n#1: Main web banner size: 2160 px (width) x 350 px (height) - please complete this size before moving on to the other graphics. **For this graphic, please keep all elements except for the background in between the red lines indicated in the attached \"Web Banner Margins\" screenshot. Everything outside of red lines needs to be just background. This is so the graphic can fit on all devices. This comes out to between about 650 and 1500 on the ruler tool in Photoshop.**\r\n\r\n#2: Large email banner: 1280 (width) x 720 pixels (height)\r\n\r\n#3: Instagram post: 1080 (width) x 1080 (height)\r\n\r\nYou can use the same elements, colors, etc. Just resized and rearranged accordingly for each size. The email banner & Instagram post do not have to follow the same margins as the web banner re: staying within the red borders.\r\n\r\n- Font: Please use the font in the example banners I included or something similar. Our brand font is variations of Visby CF. If you need the font files for this, let me know and I can send them.\r\n\r\n- Our brand colors and fonts are in attached \"CFS_Logo_Catalog 1st page\" image.\r\n\r\n- Include the attached brand logo in all graphics EXCEPT for the main web banner. I\'ve attached a couple of different versions of our logo. Let me know if you need a larger version/different color/etc.\r\n\r\n- Let me know if you need stock images or a background image. I can purchase them and send them to you.\r\n\r\nI\'ve attached some example banner images so you can get a feeling for the style of our brand.\r\n\r\nPlease account for multiple revisions when submitting your offer.\r\n\r\nWe will need source files for all graphics.\r\n\r\nLet us know if you have any questions!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1590833024801947649?success','-',7,'United States','King of Prussia',350.000,'fixed',280.000,'2022-11-10',1,'2022-11-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-10 22:26:46',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
