(1490,'Graphic design work for in app visualization',2,'Project description:\r\nWe have a new customer that has signed up to issue the digital achievement medals through Naenu. They are new to the concept so we would like to do the design work of the achievement itself also. We want to pre-seed the 6 faces of the cube with appealing images. The user can change it later if they want, but by pre-seeding the 6 images, we can at least show people how it would look like. Here is what I am thinking about the 6 sides:\r\n\r\nHero side: need to take the logo of the turkey trot and create a \"20th annual Turkey Trot Race Finisher\" image. Here\'s their website: https://www.gigharborturkeytrot.com/\r\n\r\nSide 2: The route map also from the site\r\n\r\nSide 3: A nice template for the user\'s Distance, Pace, and Time. We will pull the data from the race issuer, or the user can use strava to programmatically pull those three data points\r\n\r\nSide 4: A nice picture of Gig Harbor pulled from Google. Source of the picture here.\r\n\r\nimage.png\r\n\r\nSides 5 (top side): the Naenu logo with a text under it that says upload your image/video here\r\n\r\nSide 6 (bottom side): the Naenu logo with text under stating \"Add a journal about your experience\".\r\n\r\nSo as you can see there are various images associated with the 6 sides of the cube. What we need is a beautiful design that pulls these together. Potentially a border, font, etc. Also as I mentioned the race director for the turkey trot said we can use his logo and create a design for the \"20th annual....\" for the hero image.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1592194058708004865','NA',7,'United States','Dunwoody',100.000,'perhour',100.000,'2022-11-14',1,'2022-11-14',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-14 16:34:29',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
