(1535,'Explainer video needed for healthcare tech startup',2,'We looking for a 30-second explainer video on their company and product based on a provided script. Vendor should provide up to 3 examples of illustration/animation styles for us to choose from and then unlimited revisions on final direction.\r\n\r\nIn addition to motion graphics, vendor is expected to provide script feedback, voiceover talent, sound design and raw files upon delivery.\r\n\r\nTimeline\r\nExpected turnaround time on producing this explainer video is 2-4 weeks from contract signing and not to surpass our December 16th deadline.\r\n\r\nStyle references\r\nWe’re seeking a more abstract video style with less usage of character illustrations and a less cartoonish look than some SaaS explainer videos out there.\r\n\r\nExplainer Video Production - Demo Duck - Great video visually and compelling from a storytelling perspective. Sound design is clean, friendly and upbeat\r\n\r\nhttps://vimeo.com/141210862 - Google Wallet, love the story they’re telling and how they empathize with their audience off the bat. Maybe too many character illustrations, not as abstract as we’d like\r\n\r\n\r\nAdditional information regarding company/product to be provided upon bid submission. Please provide a rough final project cost (we\'re flexible) in addition to your hourly rate.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1592225636065103873?success','https://trello.com/b/eh32Y1Pm/task-list-arturo-digital/member/hasnain143',7,'United States','Newton',60.000,'Open this select menu',60.000,'2022-11-14',1,'2022-11-14',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat, THE RATE IS PUT AS HOURLY',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-14 18:40:44',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
