(1538,'Fantasy Genre Video of a Rosary Turning into a Sword',2,'Need an video designer to create a video of a rosary turning into a sword. Looking for a medieval style sword if possible.\r\n\r\nI would have perpetual and total rights to the artwork, which I would own, to use wherever and however I choose. I require original artwork to avoid any photo licensing fees. I need someone who is capable of producing original artwork, and/or artwork that will not include *any* licensing fees whatsoever.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for an Video Designer with experience in fantasy genre artwork with experience in Photoshop, Illustrator, After-Effects. I would like a fairly high degree of realism if possible but am flexible on this.\r\n\r\nI need someone who can agree to a general schedule and who can provide weekly updates. I for my part will be as direct and decisive and specific as possible, to provide clear direction.\r\n\r\nThe video would be used for a website and possibly YouTube, so the file format would need to accommodate this. Your work will need to be appealing to a teen/20\'s audience.\r\n\r\nVideo Description:\r\n(1) You see the words: \"It doesn\'t look like a sword ...\"\r\n(2) You see just the rosary\r\n(3) The rosary arranges itself into a sword shape and then becomes an intimidating, gleaming sword.\r\n(4) You see the words: \"BUT IT IS!\"\r\n(5) The sword is grasped by a hand, with a fiery background, the light playing off the sword.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1592229589829419009?success','https://trello.com/b/eh32Y1Pm/task-list-arturo-digital/member/hasnain143',7,'United States','Falls Church',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2022-11-14',1,'2022-11-14',1,'Clinet may ask for call, if he shows up on chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-14 18:57:04',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
