(1541,'Experienced graphic designer needed - Digital assets in Canva',2,'Hi there!\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for an ongoing relationship with an experienced graphic designer who\'s willing to work in Canva.\r\n\r\nI need help creating graphics for different uses in our small business (thesilverpost.com, @thesilverpost on Instagram). We have some digital designs we like, but would appreciate more ideas from an experienced graphic designer, and mostly need help with project execution.\r\n\r\nDeliverable examples: (A) Redesign the attached graphic using our updated brand colors and fonts. (B) Create a FB page cover photo using our brand photography. (C) Create Instagram graphics for a given message.\r\n\r\nTimeframe: 12+ graphics over the next 2 months, with option to continue!\r\n\r\nThis would be a collaborative job with me, Carolyn, a co-founder at The Silver Post. You must be able to communicate about our work on Mondays! I would also love to meet with you via Zoom to discuss ideas and review bigger work projects (this time would be paid).\r\n\r\nTo Apply:\r\n\r\nPlease apply with work samples, and we can chat about your questions!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1592232644128964608','NA',7,'United States','Boston',65.000,'perhour',65.000,'2022-11-14',1,'2022-11-14',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-14 19:07:59',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(1542,'Help me finish up a simple WordPress web site',3,'I have a freshly-developed site on WordPress that is not public yet. It needs tons of clean up before I can take it live.\r\n\r\nI would like to hire someone on an hourly basis to work with me live (via GoogleMeet) through the editing / polishing of the site. I know what I want the site to be -- I just have a huge WordPress learning curve. I will also appreciate suggestions to improve the site as we go.\r\n\r\nI am not looking to do anything exotic in the site. It is purely informational plus people submitting standard contact info, etc. No business transactions, etc. But I am looking for someone with real fluency in WordPress site design so we can get this done quickly and effectively.\r\n\r\nI will also be seeking help with SEO for the site and also understanding how to work with site analytics. I need a coach to work with me live to get these things in place and help me along the related learning curves.\r\n\r\nI require that anyone I engage is US-based and fully English-speaking.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Business-span-Website-span-developer_~01147e882e5fbbab32/','NA',7,'United States','Chagrin',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2022-11-14',1,'2022-11-14',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-14 19:14:08',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
