(1546,'Bilingual One-page WordPress Website Design and Integration and Google Presentation Theme',3,'Hello,\r\n\r\nWe have an accounting firm specialized for medical professional.\r\n\r\nWe have a logo.\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking to build a website to present our services.\r\n\r\nThe website should be a one page website with 5 sections:\r\n- Home\r\n- Services for MD who are not in a corporation\r\n- Services for MD who are in a corporation\r\n- About us\r\n- Contact\r\n\r\nWe already have a BlueHost hosting with WordPress deployed.\r\n\r\nWe have completed our content (section and texts).\r\n\r\nWe need graphical design and web design.\r\n\r\nThis should include visual support, such has icons and other graphical assets to be designed.\r\n\r\nWe would like a very visual website with very little text but a lot of graphical support, including tables, icons and maybe a graph / chart.\r\n\r\nThe website should be compatible to be viewed on computer and mobile.\r\n\r\nWe have two tables in Excel that will need graphical design.\r\n\r\nWe also need various graphical elements to support the design.\r\n\r\nOur website should be minimalistic, one-page (scroll through the section) with a menu to allow for easier navigation (jump to specific sections).\r\n\r\nAlso, we would like a Google Presentation template, using the same graphical artifacts that will have been created for the website.\r\n\r\nThe technical skills required are not high, because it\'s a simple informational website, with a contact section.\r\n\r\nHowever, we have high expectations for the design.\r\n\r\nWe also need to keep WordPress functionality so we can ajuste the content using the WordPress CMS.\r\n\r\nWe need someone to complete the design and integrated into our wordpress (full stack).\r\n\r\nIn your proposal, please detail how you would work (ex: WordPress child theme, etc.)\r\n\r\nWe are open to buying a WordPress theme if needed.\r\n\r\nThe timeline is 2 weeks.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~012021211983d80cd5/apply/','Na',7,'United States','na',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-11-14',1,'2022-11-14',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-14 19:37:24',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
(1547,'Photo Editing for Model Photography',2,'We are looking for someone to help edit photos for our models.\r\n\r\nI\'ve attached an example of what we\'re looking for, although even the attached images could be better.\r\n\r\nPlease provide samples of similar style projects, ideally with a before and after so we can see what was done.\r\n\r\nStart your post with \"ice cream\" so we know you read the job description.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1592240105384992769?success','https://trello.com/b/eh32Y1Pm/task-list-arturo-digital/member/hasnain143',7,'United States','Hurricane',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2022-11-14',1,'2022-11-14',1,'Clinet may ask for call, if he shows up on chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-14 19:38:06',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
