(1551,'Need infographics for home & gardening websites',2,'Hi there! Im looking for someone to create 5-10 base template infographics to be used across our home and gardening resource websites.\r\n\r\nWe write on many gardening and landscaping topics such as “5 Best Trees For Your Yard” and “7 Best Ways To Keep Deer Away” (these are just hypothetical examples)\r\n\r\nYou’ll create different infographics for 5-10 different articles and deliver the assets with an illustrator final delivery - I’ll then go through and use / change these out as needed for future articles!\r\n\r\nThese are simple infographics that will sum up the main headers of the article. They will be size 1000px by 1500px and be optimized for Pinterest sharing. The look and feel will almost be that of a rusty/distressed poster using the brands colors where we can then interchange the clip art / vectors as needed to match the content while keeping text and shape positioning pretty much the same.\r\n\r\nIf it makes sense, there’s an opportunity for you to continue creating infographics based on the templates you’ve created on a consistent basis (we publish around 50 articles per month)\r\n\r\nPlease send some infographics you’ve worked on that you may think will fit!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~011e6b9414301a8338/apply/','Na',7,'United States','Fairport',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2022-11-14',1,'2022-11-14',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-14 20:02:49',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
