(1565,'Designer Manager',2,'I am looking for a designer that I can call on for as needed basis.\r\n\r\nDesigner Will Need To:\r\nDirect discovery interviews with clients\r\nPrepare briefs to be used by the entire team\r\nAssign tasks, outline requirements, and manage design-team task completion\r\nContinually improve the agency’s design process\r\nDevelop site architecture (site map)\r\nDevelop creative and content strategies to shape projects before design\r\nCreate high-fidelity interactive prototypes and low-fidelity mockups of website designs\r\nTranslate customer insights into creative briefs. Guide the development of design concepts for creative campaigns and gather user data to evaluate design impact\r\nCreate and update marketing and sales materials including logos, websites, landing pages, email templates, brochures, and tradeshow collateral\r\nAssist the Account Team with discovery conducted on prospects and proposal construction to help win accounts\r\nBuild, manage, and maintain relationships with client accounts\r\nWork with cross-functional teams, collaborating with designers, copywriters, and videographers, from ideation to execution\r\nCoordinate with outside vendors such as printers and promotional companies to produce branded materials for clients\r\nDirect and conduct both photoshoots and video shoots, using Adobe Creative Suite to edit the final products\r\nPresent designs to the client and relay action items to the design team\r\nPerform quality assurance checks on the design of all client deliverables\r\nQA check copy\r\nQA check development functionality\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n5-10+ years of experience\r\nAbility to manage a design team\r\nStrong working knowledge of design theory\r\nStrong working knowledge of Adobe Creative Suite\r\nXD\r\nPhotoshop\r\nIllustrator\r\nPremier Pro\r\nAfter Effects\r\nIndesign\r\nStrong understanding of UX/UI best practices','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1592256266731671553','NA',7,'United States','R