(1572,'Magazine Designer to design and layout pages of travel magazine',2,'Carolina Traveler - the Things To Do magazine - is looking for a talented and experienced magazine designer to take over the design reigns of our tourism magazine. Here are the particulars:\r\n\r\n• We publish every other month.\r\n• The typical issue is 24 pages, infrequently up to 32 pages (we\'ll pay more for more pages)\r\n• We have new design elements for the cover art.\r\n• You\'ll be able to add your flair to interior pages.\r\n• Most of our advertisers supply camera-ready art for about 5 ad pages.\r\n• About 30 days before we publish you\'ll receive a content deck with editorial and photo options and a page-by-page manifest.\r\n• You\'ll have about two weeks to take the design through draft/proofing rounds, to camera-ready art.\r\n• Total hours per issue is about 30 (our current designer spends less time than this).\r\n\r\nWhat happened to the previous designer? She\'s awesome, but has decided to eliminate \"side gigs\" to regain personal time. She\'ll be available for knowledge and file transfers.\r\n\r\nYou can check out a previous version of the magazine here: https://heyzine.com/flip-book/551c4173e5.html\r\n\r\nA few of the must haves:\r\n• You must be able to connect with us by phone on Eastern Time (we won\'t drag you into conference calls, but we may have to reach you urgently if there\'s an issue with the files at the printer).\r\n• You must have print magazine/publication design experience (you\'ll need to know how to prepare files for printing).\r\n• Share an infectious spirit of adventure that will positively impact the magazine.\r\n\r\nIs this a long term gig? It could be! Show us what you can do with our Winter issue and we\'ll talk.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1592259665262956545','NA',7,'United States','Huntersville',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2022-11-14',1,'2022-11-14',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-14 21:02:42',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
