(1762,'Updates to our Wordpress Site',3,'We have some updated we need for our website (www.cafekreyol.com).\r\n\r\nOn our roasted coffee page, there is a \"medallion\" over the bottom right of the coffee images, showing that it won an award or got a 92 point score, etc. We would like to have one of these medallions also on the left side so that some coffees with multiple awards can be displayed.\r\n\r\nThis one might be more challenging. Currently there is no way for our customers to change subscriptions on their own, forcing them to either cancel it, which is more likely, or reach out to us and we can change it on the back end though WordPress. I would love if they can change their order. Increase quantity, decrease quantity, add products, or skip a delivery. If there is any sort of plug in for a better subscription service, or solution to these problems we would love to have it upgraded.\r\n\r\nWe were featured in several prominent coffee related magazines such as Barista Magazine and in Roast Magazine. We also just won the Silver Medal in the Golden Bean tournament. I was just wondering if these can be added to the \"featured in\" section on the home page so people know.\r\n\r\nUnder discover - press, we have our blog as well as a new category called research. We would like to see if we can separate those in the drop down from Discover to have Press say Press/ Blog and then have another spot for research that we can potentially move some of our blog posts to. We just released a scientific study on the CO2 being emitted from coffee and want to have it featured there.\r\n\r\nLastly we were hoping to have Albertsons logo added to our website on the home page where it says \"Available in\" Or \"Near you\" so that people know that store sells our product as well.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1592607174317461505','NA',7,'United States','Manassas',75.000,'perhour',75.000,'2022-11-15',1,'2022-11-15',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-15 19:56:48',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
