(1785,'Experienced & Creative UI-UX Designer With Conversion Rate Optimization Focus',4,'iPromo is a leader in Promotional Products and Corporate Gifting. We recently launched our new Magento site and are looking for an experienced and creative UI/UX Designer with an expertise in conversion rate optimization to take it to the next level from a user experience and CRO perspective. We are breaking this project down into stages, with the first stage focusing on reviewing our product listing pages. We are looking for the UX/UI designer to provide a detailed audit review, wireframing, and final full figma designs of the 5 specific product page layouts along with their embedded form designs.\r\nThe goal of this project is to increase conversion rates in terms of on-page form submissions, chats initiated, and overall ecommerce checkout conversions.\r\n\r\nOnce initial project phase 1 is completed, there is potential for this becoming a larger scale project working on other parts of the site including the shopping cart and category listing pages among others.\r\n\r\nThe following will be expected for stage 1 of this project:\r\n\r\n- Optimize existing user interface designs and user experience across 5 product pages.\r\n- Plan and implement new designs based on current page structure along with any recommendations for improvement and why those changes will increase conversion rates.\r\n- Communicate with our team to understand our business goals and objectives\r\n- Combine creativity with an awareness of the design elements\r\n- Create prototypes for new page layout and experience ideas as needed\r\n\r\nProduct Pages Looking to Improve:\r\nStandard Item: https://www.ipromo.com/recyclable-non-woven-grocery-tote-13-x-15-x-10.html\r\n\r\nApparel: https://www.ipromo.com/under-armourr-performance-locker-2-0-t-shirt-men.html','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1592617159598964737?success','na',7,'United States','Morton Grove',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-11-15',1,'2022-11-15',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-15 20:40:00',NULL,6,3,NULL,131),
