(1795,'Build a landing page',4,'I\'m preparing a latin american concert tour. I want to make a web page, optimized for mobile... to gathering fans data. It would be a series of questions. It needs to have the feel of a game. Each click should be a cute sound. It should move quickly. I would like to model this after BABBEL language app.\r\n\r\nThe deliverable must be in Spanish, Portuguese. Probably English as well. We will decide together creatively how to accomplish that.\r\n\r\nRight now Spotify is running a promotion allowed Artists to share videos and a link. I want to share this.\r\n\r\nExample\r\nI am going on tour in summer 2023 of Latin America.\r\nWould you like to come? This is a survey to see how many people may come in each city.\r\n\r\nMy Country *\r\n\r\nMexico\r\nPeru\r\nChile\r\nColombia\r\nBrazil\r\nArgentina\r\nOther ______\r\n\r\nMy City *\r\n\r\nMexico City, Mexico\r\nGuadalajara, Mexico\r\nMonterrey, Mexico\r\nTijuana, Mexico\r\nSantiago, Chile\r\nLima, Peru\r\nBogota, Colombia\r\nBuenos Aires, Argentina\r\nGuatemala City, Guatemala\r\nSao Paulo, Brazil\r\nRio de Janeiro, Brazil\r\nOther: ___________\r\n\r\nMy Age *\r\n\r\nI am over 18 - I could come to an 18+ show\r\nI am under 18 - I could come to an all-ages show','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1592619675864158209?success','na',7,'United States','San Mateo',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2022-11-15',1,'2022-11-15',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-15 20:51:02',NULL,6,3,NULL,131),
