(1995,'Explainer video for amazon and other promotions',2,'We have two Vitamin supplements for Immune Defense. We are looking to create a over the top, High impact video that shows graphically:\r\n1. We live in a dangerous world constantly under attack by viruses, diseases and pathogens.(names, life the flu, covid 19, Sars flying into a unprotected person)\r\n2. Our Immune systems try to fight, but are compromised, by low sleep, nutrition, pollution and cant protect us.\r\n3. A family takes IMMUNE DEFENSE 1 AND IMMUNE DEFENSE 2 and it creates a barrier around them.\r\n4. Now the family walks with a shield or barrier around them where the FLU, the Cold, and SARs, bounce off of the barrier and they are happy and secure.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1592963355951124481?success','N/A',7,'United States','Phoenix',80.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-11-16',1,'2022-11-16',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-16 19:34:49',NULL,6,3,NULL,132),
