(1997,'We\'re hiring a WordPress developer',4,'WordPress LTD is a leading provider ofWordPress coding, design, and development services. They are headquartered in the United Kingdom with offices in Poland and the United States. WordPress LTD has been in business for over 10 years and serves clients in over 30 countries.\r\n\r\n\r\nJob Description: \r\n\r\n- The WordPress Developer will be responsible for coding, designing, and developing WordPress websites for our clients. \r\n\r\n- The WordPress Developer will also be responsible for creating custom WordPress themes and plugins. \r\n\r\n- The WordPress Developer will work closely with our team of designers and developers to create high quality websites for our clients. \r\n\r\n- The WordPress Developer will also be responsible for troubleshooting website issues and providing customer support. \r\n\r\n\r\nThe Successful Applicant: \r\n\r\n- The successful applicant must have experience coding, designing, and developing WordPress websites. \r\n\r\n- The successful applicant must also have experience creating custom WordPress themes and plugins. \r\n\r\n- The successful applicant must have excellent communication skills and be able to work well with a team of designers and developers. \r\n\r\n- The successful applicant must also have excellent customer service skills.\r\n\r\n\r\nOffer Details: \r\n\r\nThis is a remote position with a competitive salary based on experience.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1967085','-',7,'United States','-',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2022-11-16',1,'2022-11-16',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-16 19:35:49',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
(1998,'Need a Canva Virtual Assistant',2,'I need help in reformatting some Canva designs. This will be mostly Canva templates that are already completed, and what I would need you to do is be creative! It might involve changing the stock photos, fonts, color. You may work in one template but make 3 different \"looks\". (That is where your creativity would come in!) I also have some printables in Canva that I need you to spruce up. Then, I need mockups done of the printables and templates - approximately 4-6 mockup images per template or printable.\r\n\r\nAll of the designs belong to me and cannot be shared or used in your portfolio etc. :) I need someone I can trust! I have a bunch to do but haven\'t had time to get them done. My initial price is $350 - I don\'t know how much this job would cost, so when you bid, let me what you would charge and how you\'d charge. Also, let me know what your charge would be to reformat (colors, fonts, images) for a 10-page printable.\r\n\r\nIf you have samples of mockups and designs you can send, that would be great.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions, let me know. Thank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1592965265845858305','NA',7,'United States','Cleveland',350.000,'fixed',350.000,'2022-11-16',1,'2022-11-16',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-16 19:39:37',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
