(2021,'Cartoonist for Caricature Holiday Card',2,'Annual cartoon holiday card that we send to our Clients, both print and electronically.\r\nWe have a \"theme\" and a layout that we would like to use for this year\'s card. The theme we desire is to have a candy shop scene (see attached for a visual). As we realize we can\'t copy the design, we would like that \"Style\" used when the scene is drawn. We would like our faces drawn on different body types & sizes similar to what you would see in the example. (see attached for a visual).\r\n\r\nQuick description: It will be set inside a candy shop, with a dark wall background. A Christmas Tree will be towards the right of the scene, decorated with ornaments and a star. The conveyor belt in the middle will be pastries, cookies and the like. The machine running the conveyor belt MUST look very technical with a lot of screens, buttons and electronic displays - as we are an IT Company.\r\n\r\nWe will have ten (10) people drawn in caricature style for the scene as well (we will provide pictures to the artist chosen). Each person will be drawn individually, and added into the scene. We would like most everyone doing something behind the conveyor belt with a few others managing the process with clipboards or laptops. On the backwall of the candy shop, will be our logo prominently displayed. When we provide the photos of each person, we will also provide specifics on what the person will be \"doing\" in the scene.\r\n\r\nWe would like a rough drawn sketch provided within 3 days of the job being accepted, and ample time provided for reviews and edits to the final.\r\n\r\nWe need this completed no later then 12/2/2022.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1592984913280630785','NA',7,'United States','Franklin',400.000,'fixed',400.000,'2022-11-16',1,'2022-11-16',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-16 20:57:18',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(2022,'Graphic designer needed for annual report',2,'The Center for Health, Work & Environment is an academic research and training center at the Colorado School of Public Health. We are looking for a contract graphic designer to create our annual report.\r\n\r\nThis year’s report will be in the exact same format and length as the previous two years. We intend to keep much of the design similar, with updates to colors, font, and illustrations. We will supply all the written content and have started collecting relevant photos, but there will need to be some supplementing with stock images and illustrations.\r\n\r\nWe anticipate the entire project to take around 40 hours with the initial design and 2 rounds of edits and hope to have the final report in the first week of February. These reports are published on our website and printed booklet-style (which creates a design restraint due to page numbers).\r\n\r\nPlease submit bids for this project with rate/scope.\r\n\r\nPrevious annual reports by fiscal year:\r\n2020-2021: https://indd.adobe.com/view/860f3ecc-361d-4965-b9aa-20eb0be9a4cf\r\n2019-2020: https://indd.adobe.com/view/ed53785d-f8fb-46fa-ac57-84b4606be62e\r\n2018-2019: https://indd.adobe.com/view/2cd1d57e-9a0c-4e45-b68d-b7d78eabba4f','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~010978da3980507ce0','no',7,'United States','Aurora',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2022-11-16',1,'2022-11-16',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-16 21:01:11',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
(2023,'Create new logo - all directions already set. Colors, shapes, etc. Needs to finish',2,'When considering price, realize everything\'s already done. We\'re paying for the shape and font.\r\n\r\nHello!\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for a creative mind that can finish our logo!\r\n\r\nWe got colors, shapes and everything in between but we need someone that an add creative meaning to the logo.\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for someone that can produce a shape around the X of AXEES that will be unique, easily recognizable and kickass looking that can stand on it\'s own.\r\n\r\nThe company is a social network that brings new technologies that leave Facebook, Youtube, Twitter and all of those in the dust.\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for someone that can finish this quickly.\r\n\r\nThanks!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1592985730354196481','no link',7,'United States','buenos aires',200.000,'Open this select menu',200.000,'2022-11-16',1,'2022-11-16',1,'fix project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-16 21:04:43',NULL,7,3,NULL,115),
