(2025,'Transform Figma design into fully functioning website using Bubble.io',4,'Hey! I am rebuilding the current website on Bubble (I have a ready-to-go Figma design). Read the description below. I am open to offers regarding price. Make sure to watch Loom video.\r\n\r\n\r\nExisting website - https://knowledgehunt.co/\r\n\r\nDescription: Existing website is built on Softr.io and connected with Airtaible, which is used as the database. We are gathering the resources around the web and adding them to Airtaible, which is then displayed on our website. When a user wants to ‘access the resource’, they are transferred to the maker of the resource. The existing website functionality is pretty similar to the ones that we are creating now.\r\n\r\nPages to build: Home page (hero section and resources), Resource detail page, Login/Singup, Blog (called “food for thought” in our case), community page, profile (where user will see resources that they ‘liked’)\r\n\r\nFigma design: We have a new design ready (90%) in Figma. See the Loom video of me describing the new design and main functionalities - https://www.loom.com/share/ef95f13fa9a44c5d9f063c9604de5efb\r\n\r\nFinal results: Off-page SEO optimized, quick, mobile-friendly website that looks identical to our Figma design','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1592880065122553857?success','-',7,'United States','Tbilisi',1800.000,'Open this select menu',1570.000,'2022-11-16',1,'2022-11-16',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-16 21:18:00',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
(2026,'Designer needed for logo and icon branding',2,'We need a logo & icon created for our Running Money® trademark.\r\n\r\nCurrently, we utilize our trademark in three areas: we have a blog titled Running Money®, we also have a printed newsletter titled Running Money® and our live events are titled Running Money® Live.\r\n\r\nWe are also working on some online courses that may utilize the Running Money® trademark in some fashion.\r\n\r\nThe logo & icon will need to complement our business’s logo and icon. Enduring Wealth Advisors® is also a registered trademark. We will include the details of the Enduring Wealth Advisors® logo for your reference.\r\n\r\nThe expected date of deliverables is Dec 1, 2022.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1592991335427493889','NA',7,'United States','Temecula',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-11-16',1,'2022-11-16',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-16 21:25:02',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
