(2035,'Website designer required for new website',4,'I need someone to design a website for my commercial office space leasing business. I will provide the written content for the website. The content is ready.\r\n\r\nThe website will not be complex. A horizontal navigation bar shall have the following headings: Home, Our Services, Clients, Tenant Representation Method, Our Team, and Contact.\r\n\r\nThe website will contain no videos.\r\n\r\nI will attach very strong importance to the look of the website. I would like to have the option of selecting the graphic designer who will work with you on the website, and in order to do so, I would need to see graphic artists’ portfolios.\r\nSome of the written content on the Home page will need to be changed when the website is completed. Please indicate the number of revisions that you will allow in working with me.\r\n\r\nThe website will need to be mobile friendly.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1592999656880492545?success','na',7,'United States','Bronx',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2022-11-16',1,'2022-11-16',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-16 21:56:28',NULL,6,3,NULL,131),
(2036,'30-second App Promotional Video',2,'We are the makers of a DMV Test prepping app and would like to create a 30-second App Promotional Video.\r\n\r\nThe app can be found here: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.dmvwrittentest.android or here https://apps.apple.com/us/app/id1497421016?platform=iphone\r\n\r\nThe final video will mostly be used in the various app stores to promote the app and as a video ad that can be displayed on the web to encourage people to download the app.\r\n\r\nSo the idea is to create a video:\r\n1- that showcases the app in action. Someone opening the app for the first time and starting a test and getting associated results\r\n2- while the person is taking the test, a voice over with the various key benefits associated to the app\r\n3- the final product shall abide by Google and Apple video app requirement to be displayed on the respective listings.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested, please confirm:\r\n1/ You have experience with app promo video. Please send references\r\n2/ Discuss your process and how do you envision the promo video to be created\r\n3/ How soon can you start\r\n4/ How many hours do you anticipate it will take\r\n5/ How much do you charge per hour\r\n\r\nThank you very much in advance. I look forward to reading your detailed proposals','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e3521e9e32255d8e','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e3521e9e32255d8e',7,'United States','Austin',100.000,'perhour',100.000,'2022-11-16',1,'2022-11-16',1,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-16 22:03:16',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
(2037,'Writer Required for Cat Blog',5,'Hi, my name is Shaun and I run a specialist cat blog that is 6 years old and well established and growing steadily. We provide in-depth help and advice on this breed of cat as well as well researched product reviews and guides.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for an experienced cat owner/vet who is also a talented writer to publish high-quality blog posts on this growing website.\r\n\r\n• You must have a genuine interest in cats\r\n\r\n• Articles will need to be well researched and evidence-based\r\n\r\n• You MUST be to be a native English speaker\r\n\r\n• Typical blog posts can be 800- 2000 plus words\r\n\r\nInitially, I will require 3-4 blog posts per month but this may increase with time. This will be an ongoing, long term position for the right person.\r\n\r\n*Please don\'t apply if you are from India, Pakistan or Asia as you aren\'t native English speakers.*\r\n\r\nTo apply for this job you will need to fill in the form below once you\'ve applied on Guru.\r\n\r\nhttps://bit.ly/Catwriter\r\n\r\nThank you for your time.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1967125','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-11-16',1,'2022-11-16',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-16 22:03:47',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
(2038,'Website application for automated poster creation',3,'The website will take two photos (maximum) and allow users to enter variable text. Once users upload photos and text, the web app will create a \'poster\' that is based on a template (we will provide a wireframe) and produce a .pdf or .jpg for print. See attached for end result (example) - users would only input certain things like weight/height, eye color, hair color, and location they went missing.\r\n\r\nThe web server is already running on AWS, specs will be given but they are common open-source web/DB solutions and we will use that framework for the web app. Once a user submits a poster in the above-mentioned workflow, all data including photos and text would NOT BE SAVED on any web servers or DB\'s.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593002058709368833','NA',7,'United States','Windsor Locks',2000.000,'Open this select menu',2000.000,'2022-11-16',1,'2022-11-16',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-16 22:06:32',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
