(2040,'Video Editing (Intro Slide, Closed Captioning, Outro Slide)',2,'Hello,\r\n\r\nWe have 20 raw video files that we need to be edited for our client to include the following:\r\n\r\n- Add an intro slide with the logo, a photo of the provider (possibly dynamic/moving) and their name and title. These are \"Provider Spotlight\" videos for a pediatric clinic.\r\n- The video footage next with closed-captioning for accessibility\r\n- Add an outro slide with the logo, web address, and \"Share this Video\" (or something along those lines.\r\n- Use client branding/logo\r\n- These will be uploaded to our client\'s YouTube channel and then shared on socials and on the website.\r\n\r\nAll videos are in the range of 30 seconds long. We have 15 ready to be edited now. We would like to have 1 video created first for the client to review and provide their feedback; then, once that is approved, we would have you create all of them. We would also like a 2nd set formatted for Instagram.\r\n\r\nIf interested, please provide examples of similar work for review.\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\nJenn','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593003108795572225','NA',7,'United States','Seattle',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2022-11-16',1,'2022-11-16',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-16 22:09:38',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
