(2055,'Develop Inventory application',3,'Hi there... we are looking for a web developer that can work on an inventory solution that will do the following.\r\n\r\n\r\n1. Design and implement a database recording and processing inventory procurement, verification, and installation as well as post-installation signoff.  Contract number being the key field.  Data sets are as follows: \r\n\r\n    \"360\" Contract Sheet (Items to be ordered - contract number source)\r\n    \"Cutsheet\" (Order document with specifications and product choices)\r\n    Acknowledgement (document verifying Order - must match Cutsheet <1-many>)\r\n    Manifest (Bill of Lading - Receiving Document <1-many>)\r\n    Order details (manufacturer agnostic)\r\n    Customer information\r\n\r\n\r\n2. Pull in and parse standard CSV files from different sources for importing into the database:\r\n\r\nContract Document (from csv file)\r\n\r\nCutsheet\r\n\r\nAcknowledgement/Verification\r\n\r\nManifest\r\n\r\n\r\n3. Verify CSV contents against one another (order vs verification vs bill of lading)\r\n\r\n4. Handle scan input from a handheld scanner to verify receipt of items on the Manifest\r\n\r\n5. Verify Installation of items through punchlist interface\r\n\r\n6. Signoff of satisfactory installation on Job site.\r\n\r\n\r\nPayment will be on deliverables defined during negotiation.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1967217','-',7,'United States','-',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2022-11-17',1,'2022-11-17',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-17 14:46:41',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
