(2057,'16 Icon designs for family of products',2,'Hi,\r\n\r\nI have a set of products, all from the same brand, that need icons. Basically these icons need to look like they\'re all from the same brand, and be the identifying mark for each of these products.\r\n\r\nOur brand is fun, young, and modern. I don\'t have any specific icons to reference as inspiration, I would just love to see your work and what ideas you have for this specific set of icons.\r\n\r\nHere\'s our list of products that need icons...\r\n\r\nGrow Curriculum\r\n• A curriculum for kids and teenagers.\r\n\r\nGrow Games\r\n• An app with games in it, I want a trophy icon.\r\n\r\nGrow Books\r\n• A library of books.\r\n\r\nGrow Slides\r\n• A cloud based presentation software.\r\n\r\nGrow Creative Board\r\n• A drag and drop board you can place note cards on.\r\n\r\nGrow You\r\n• Online coaching groups.\r\n\r\nGrow People\r\n• A database management software like a CMS.\r\n\r\nGrow Lesson Builder\r\n• A drag and drop lesson builder.\r\n\r\nGrow Habits\r\n• A habit tracking app.\r\n\r\nGrow Groups\r\n• Book clubs.\r\n\r\nGrow Kids\r\n• Our curriculum for kids.\r\n\r\nGrow Students\r\n• Our curriculum for teenagers.\r\n\r\nGrow TV\r\n• Our library of videos.\r\n\r\nGrow Kids Music\r\n• Our library of music for kids.\r\n\r\nGrow Hubs\r\n• A communication software like Slack.\r\n\r\nGrow Shop\r\n• Our shop where you can buy apparel and other items.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593255407860846593?success','https://trello.com/b/eh32Y1Pm/task-list-arturo-digital/member/hasnain143',7,'United States','Alpharetta',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-11-17',1,'2022-11-17',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-17 14:53:06',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
