(2059,'Need Logo Design for a product',2,'I\'m looking for a designer to create a logo for our Roof Asset Protection Program. This is a quick project. I\'ve attached several images of elements that I envision somehow being incorporated in this logo. This logo is for a program that is only for commercial/industrial roofs (NOT RESIDENTIAL). I\'ve included links and a fact sheet on the program to give you an understanding. At some point, this will be a stand-alone product as such it does not have to look like it\'s a Kautz Construction product. The RAPP acronym needs to stand out. I would like to have logo designs to look at by Nov 30th if possible.\r\n\r\nThe images I shared show elements I like. The typography of RAPP logo idea or something similar, the buildings showing \"commercial\" in rapp logo idea 2 and some kind of \"swoosh\" showing a play on the word RAPP meaning \"wrapped\". These are just ideas and I\'m not the expert so I leave it to your expertise and creativity.\r\n\r\nBelow is a link with some information about the RAPP program. I also attached a flyer that goes into a little more detail. The RAPP program consists of a customized QR code for each roof under the program. Every person who accesses the roof is to use the QR code to \"sign in\". This creates an access log of each roof which allows us to pinpoint if a roof leak is due to the negligence of a vendor who was on the roof. The program also keeps track of precipitation over a quarter inch. This precipitation log helps us if a leak call is made through the QR portal and there hasn\'t been any rain then we know that more than likely the issue is not roof-related but HVAC related. This helps us to save our clients money by instructing them to first check the HVAC system and save the money on a visit from us. We guarantee our clients that by being part of this program, and performing the suggested service their roof will be extended and thus saving them money in prematurely replacing their roof.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593255897769230337?success','na',7,'United States','Lancaster',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2022-11-17',1,'2022-11-17',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-17 14:55:30',NULL,6,3,NULL,131),
(2060,'WordPress website work',3,'I have NINE WordPress websites. I need some work done on all nine of them... the same work done on each of them as each website is almost identical, other than content.\r\n\r\n\r\n1). Fistly, I want a child Theme setup in each website.\r\n\r\n\r\n2). In of the nine websites, in the menu there is a doble arrow, it should only be one arrow. I need this fixed in all 9 websites. (See attachment)\r\n\r\n\r\n3). On each of the nine websites, I would like red ribbons added to nine images. These images must display on all desktop and mobile displays. (See attachments for images now, and also how I want the images to display after adding the nine red ribbons.)','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1967490','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1967490',7,'United States','none',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2022-11-17',1,'2022-11-17',1,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-17 14:56:29',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
