(2107,'Sport Psychology (Re)Brand Image',2,'Hi there,\r\nI am Gonçalo Marques, a Clinical and Sport Psychologist, currently building up an existing Project as a Brand with a Podcast, with a team of Psychologists.\r\n\r\nto check it out go to https://flow.page/ews\r\n\r\nWe want to show up with a more premium look, and a Brand Image that transmits sharpness, professionalism, tenacity, and intelligence. Other attributes/adjectives that may help in your creative process are: curiosity, compassion, power, respect, liberation, joy, safety\r\n\r\nYou may want to listen to our trailer, one episode of our Podcast, and this 1-page doc, to get a precise sense of what we envision and deliver.\r\n\r\nThe only visual idea I have in mind for the logo is a sense of a fierce competitive front look (forehead + top of the eyes) - this to not coming up with the usual obsolete brain designs. But please don’t feel attached to this idea.\r\n\r\nWhat we want you to deliver within 2months:\r\n\r\n- Logo + 3 options\r\n- Podcast Series Covers (easy to edit for personalization to some episodes) - 6\r\n- Social Media Layouts (The more consistent/unison with the brand image, the better) :\r\n      -- 4 easy ones for Stories\r\n      -- 4 for Instagram  \r\n      -- 5 for Tiktok (3 of them are already the same as the IG ones, just calibrate)\r\nExtras appreciated: 20min video call for sharing some views; suggestion for website and Social Media posts fonts (pairings) ; Quick and simple motion graphics (at least providing suggestion for software to use to create)\r\n\r\nOther links and views provided over selection process','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0100a0e29349255cfb','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0100a0e29349255cfb',7,'United States','Lisboa',400.000,'fixed',400.000,'2022-11-17',1,'2022-11-17',1,'fixed price',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-17 16:40:37',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
