(2119,'Web/UX Designer Needed for Website Mockups',4,'We\'re a small agency specializing in the hospitality space. We have 4-5 website projects on the horizon, and we are looking for a designer to help us bring client dreams to life.\r\n\r\nWe work exclusively in Wordpress (Elementor and Avada themes, to be exact), so we want attractive designs we can build in those platforms.\r\n\r\nWe\'ll provide a current site (in most cases), and some existing assets like logos/photography, etc...along with example sites to use as models based off client requests.\r\n\r\nThe deliverable would be a pdf mockup of the home page + an interior page, and all the assets needed to bring that to life.\r\n\r\nIt\'s a chance to work with a fun team on fun projects - an could grow into more design opportunities.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593286705442508801','NA',7,'United States','Olathe',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-11-17',1,'2022-11-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-17 16:57:21',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
(2120,'Need Logo Design for a roofing product',2,'I\'m looking for a designer to create a logo for our Roof Asset Protection Program. This is a quick project. I\'ve attached several images of elements that I envision somehow being incorporated in this logo. This logo is for a program that is only for commercial/industrial roofs (NOT RESIDENTIAL). I\'ve included links and a fact sheet on the program to give you an understanding. At some point, this will be a stand-alone product as such it does not have to look like it\'s a Kautz Construction product. The RAPP acronym needs to stand out. I would like to have logo designs to look at by Nov 30th if possible.\r\n\r\nThe images I shared show elements I like. The typography of RAPP logo idea or something similar, the buildings showing \"commercial\" in rapp logo idea 2 and some kind of \"swoosh\" showing a play on the word RAPP meaning \"wrapped\".  These are just ideas and I\'m not the expert so I leave it to your expertise and creativity.\r\n\r\nBelow is a link with some information about the RAPP program. I also attached a flyer that goes into a little more detail. The RAPP program consists of a customized QR code for each roof under the program. Every person who accesses the roof is to use the QR code to \"sign in\". This creates an access log of each roof which allows us to pinpoint if a roof leak is due to the negligence of a vendor who was on the roof. The program also keeps track of precipitation over a quarter inch. This precipitation log helps us if a leak call is made through the QR portal and there hasn\'t been any rain then we know that more than likely the issue is not roof-related but HVAC related. This helps us to save our clients money by instructing them to first check the HVAC system and save the money on a visit from us. We guarantee our clients that by being part of this program, and performing the suggested service their roof will be extended and thus saving them money in prematurely replacing their roof.  \r\n\r\nhttps://kautzconstruction.com/roofing/roof-asset-protection-program-rapp/','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ebf5d0ed1118557d','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ebf5d0ed1118557d',7,'United States','Lancaster',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2022-11-17',1,'2022-11-17',1,'fixed price',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-17 17:02:28',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
(2121,'Brochure Template Creation',2,'We are looking for creation of a single page (8.5 x 11) brochure template to be used and owned by our company.\r\n\r\nAn annotated example of what we are looking for is attached. We like the existing look of the template as it aligns with our branding, but we are very open to suggested improvements.\r\n\r\nThe template should allow our team to easily drop in new text and images, lock, and then email or print.\r\n\r\nIdeally the template will be accessible to us in Word.\r\n\r\nThis project includes the design of the template, plus two revisions based on our feedback.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593288956613758977?success','na',7,'United States','Winnipeg',150.000,'fixed',150.000,'2022-11-17',1,'2022-11-17',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-17 17:05:53',NULL,6,3,NULL,131),
(2122,'Commercial vehicle wraps',2,'We are a beverage distribution looking to stand out with a clear and concise design.\r\nThis design will be used to wrap company trucks which will vary on size and dimensions\r\n\r\nIdeally the \'wrap\' will be like a \'wallpaper\'\' that can over all vehicles and each having it\'s own adjustment if need.\r\nThe project company is the \'The Drinks Company\' we are what we say we are.....\r\n\r\nWe\'ve been established for 8 years time to step it up........\r\nWe don\'t want to use images of brands as these come and go......\r\nOur colors are base around a rich bold orange, matte black and white\r\nwww.thedrinks.company\r\nis the corporate website where you\'ll see the simplicity of what we do......\r\nOur clients are more B2B -Hotels, restaurants','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01d624feba1784c0e2','no',7,'United States','Miami',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2022-11-17',1,'2022-11-17',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-17 17:07:51',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
