(2183,'Create a Stunning Brochure',2,'We would like to hire a very creative designer/graphic artist to design a tri-fold brochure of our wellness, mental health, and clinical services. We have content available and the scope of work is focused on the design using our existing logo.\r\nOur philosophy of care is:\r\n- We believe in a holistic approach to health that combines lifestyle, exercise, mindfulness, therapy when needed, and medications.\r\n- It is your body and we respect that. What you put into your body should be your decision.\r\n- We want you to be very involved in your care as only YOU can tell us how and what you are feeling.\r\n- We do not believe in telling people what to do. Instead, we would like to work with you and provide scientific evidence and logic for the proposed plan of care.\r\n- Every person is unique and the key is in personalizing the right medication and the right dose. We use gene-drug information to guide the correct medication choice for the individual.\r\nOur website is www.aayuclinics.com\r\nWe look forward to working with you!!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593342476192845825?success','https://trello.com/b/eh32Y1Pm/task-list-arturo-digital/member/hasnain143',7,'United States','Chicago',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-11-17',1,'2022-11-17',1,'Clinet may ask for call, if he shows up on chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-17 20:42:19',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
