(2185,'Looking for a talented icon designer',2,'We are looking for a talented icon designer to create a set of custom icon glyphs for a client of ours.\r\n\r\nOur client has a suite of internal tools (like G-Suite) and we\'d like to design something proprietary for their tools.\r\n\r\nIf this is something you can help with, please get in touch! :)\r\n\r\nPlease also include links to examples of custom icon glyphs you\'ve designed in the past.\r\n\r\nLastly, to make sure you read the entire job description, please reply with the answer to \"what is 3+3?\"\r\n\r\nThanks and we\'re looking forward to chatting with you about this!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593343625126891521','NA',7,'United States','Danville',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2022-11-17',1,'2022-11-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-17 20:44:15',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
(2186,'Graphic designer needed for golf logo project',2,'We are looking for a new logo/wordmark. Our company acronym is WSGA and we were founded in 1901. Ideally, I would like the WSGA featured in the logo/wordmark and 1901 to be subtly incorporated into the logo/wordmark. With the right \"font\" choice, I think an S can subtly look like 9 and a G can look like a 0. The sides of the W and A can look like 1s as well. I\'m open to other designs as well. The logo/wordmark can have golf incorporated (ie club, flag, ball), but not required.\r\n\r\nFamiliarity with golf and or a clear understanding of what we\'re looking for is required.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~013bcfbcb691079844/apply/','Na',7,'United States','West Allis',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2022-11-17',1,'2022-11-17',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-17 20:46:13',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
