(2190,'Video editor needed to edit video assets/add graphics/text',2,'Editing 5 short videos to add text bullets to the screen, intro/outro and several graphics that we will provide.\r\n\r\nWe are shooting these videos using Iphone with good lighting, a lavalier mic, etc so while we are shooting them in a scrappy way, we\'d like help elevating them with some text, graphics, etc.\r\n\r\nThese videos will be introducing a nursing clinical ladder program and we will have:\r\n\r\n1) Overview Video - What is the Clinical Ladder? – 3 minute video max\r\n\r\n2) Clinical Nurse 1 – Congrats on reaching Clinical Nurse 1 -  30 seconds – 1 minute\r\n\r\n3) Clinical Nurse 2 -  Congrats on reaching Clinical Nurse 1 - 30 seconds – 1 minute\r\n\r\n4) Clinical Nurse 3 -  Congrats on reaching Clinical Nurse 1  -30 seconds – 1 minute\r\n\r\n5) Clinical Nurse 4 -  Congrats on reaching Clinical Nurse 1 - 30 seconds – 1 minute\r\n\r\nTimeline: We are shooting on Nov. 30, will have footage to you Dec. 2 and would like the finished products (at least videos 1, 3 &4 by Dec. 16th.) We will have extra time to complete the other videos.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01bfc50752a04121cb','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01bfc50752a04121cb',7,'United States','Cincinnati',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-11-17',1,'2022-11-17',1,'hourly price',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-17 21:04:06',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
(2191,'UX/UI for website refresh',2,'A software company in the moving and storage industry needs to rebuild their website as a responsive site utilizing a design system (details about typography, use cases for UI patterns, and more) - preferably using material design elements. Final deliverables will be a style guide, design system and pattern library as well as a some finalized mocks for mobile and desktop of our main website pages utilizing all the above. We would like the design to be executed using Adobe XD. Files will be exported for our development team to implement.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01e0790a9c6363ff51/apply/','Na',7,'United States','san diego',3500.000,'fixed',3500.000,'2022-11-17',1,'2022-11-17',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-17 21:06:04',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
(2192,'Custom e-commerce website',2,'I’m need a custom e-commerce site created. Basically, Homeowners and business owners sign up, upload pictures and a brief description of the job they need done.\r\n\r\nAfter that, they are shown a list of service providers who can perform the job. They can chat, and hire the handyman, contractor, or business that can perform the job.\r\n\r\nFor this project I need UX/UI design. I have screens shots and drawings of how I want each page to look and details on a word document.\r\n\r\nWebsite colors; Blue, white background, black text\r\n\r\n\r\nIt’s like Angi, but with a different business model:\r\nhttps://www.angi.com\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES:\r\n• Home and Business owner pays the credit card processing fee in addition to the price the service provider charged when the job is complete at check out.\r\n• Run a web reputation check on SERVICE PROVIDERS where it scours google for negative reviews at sign up and lets the service provider know if they qualify or not. If they qualify, it moves on to the background check request\r\n• SERVICE PROVIDERS are offered the option to pay for the background check up front OR have it taken out of their first booked job.\r\n• Next it moves on to the plans. It has 3 tiers basic, intermediate, premium. They have the option to pay a percentage per job for 2 years or a FLAT FEE for each month, quarter or year.\r\n• A separate dashboard with a lot of KPI’s. I’ll provide what metrics I want tracked\r\n• Also the ability for customer to run add campaigns on the platform similar to how Facebook allows you create ads (This can come later)\r\nLet me know if your team can build this for me?','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593349674704838657?success','-',7,'United States','The Colony',1500.000,'fixed',1300.000,'2022-11-17',1,'2022-11-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-17 21:07:48',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
