(2273,'Custom Calendars',2,'Full Color Cover & Insides (Full Color Both Sides) Calendars\r\n\r\n\r\nNeed a designer to design and create \"Ready to Print\" Custom Calendars. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWe are looking to have several types of calendars done, for example:  \r\n\r\na) Wall calendars (Spiral or Wire-O -- Which do you suggest and Why?)\r\n\r\nb) Desktop calendars                                    \r\n\r\nc) Table calendars                                          \r\n\r\nd) Poster Calendars                                    \r\n\r\ne) Calendar Magnets \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWe realize that we will receive many bids for this job and that there are many designers capable of designing.  The key is to find someone who can bring ideas that will make our calendars different from what we would get if we hired a standard designer who can only create and design without bringing any ideas. \r\n\r\n\r\n1) What ideas that you can offer to have our calendars different from a standard designer?\r\n\r\n\r\nFor our Review: Attached calendars to show us the calendars that \"you\" designed. \r\n\r\n2) When you submit your quote \"you\" must show your work of calendars you designed and created. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDo NOT bid if you are looking to be paid by the hour.\r\n\r\n3) What is your cost per each listed calendar and what we want? \r\n\r\n\r\n4) What is your turnaround?','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1967967','-',7,'United States','-',250.000,'fixed',200.000,'2022-11-18',1,'2022-11-18',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-18 15:49:49',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
