(2276,'Creative Direction for Redesign of Existing Landing Page',2,'Hello! We currently have a landing page that is focused on recruitment. We are looking for someone to provide creative direction and graphic design to redesign the look of the page. We basically want someone to take what we have and give us the tools we need to make it fresh and modern, while geared towards converting. We do not need coding or development work, just creative direction and design.\r\n\r\nWhat we will bring to the table:\r\n- Existing landing page with copy\r\n- Asset library with 100s of branded photos and videos\r\n- Brand guidelines book\r\n\r\nWhat you will deliver back to us:\r\n- Creative direction in terms of style, layout and design\r\n- Ideally, you would also deliver mockups and actual designs as well.\r\n\r\nWe are very specifically looking for someone will need minimum creative direction from us. We will not be providing any sort of \"design references\" or \"outlines\" on what to build. We are looking to hire someone will use their own creativity to design this page for us.\r\n\r\nThanks!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593633563307298817','NA',7,'United States','Nashville',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2022-11-18',1,'2022-11-18',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-18 15:54:41',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
