(2278,'Migrate existing site to wordpress',3,'We will prefer a company rather than individual part time freelancers.\r\n\r\nWe have our current website built on Drupal 9. We need to migrate it to wordpress as Drupal is coming to end of life. The website is https://www.mydbsync.com and https://www.mydbsync.com/community (excluding blog site which already uses wordpress)\r\n\r\nWe would like the company to provide a BA to review and understand / document the website and any changes identified in the process.\r\n\r\n- We would like to use wordpress.com for our hosting\r\n- Must be responsive. We will start with a pre-built purchased theme (to be decided)\r\n\r\nWe had the following components\r\n\r\n- The component to display all connectors in a matrix form\r\n- Lead gen form (form integrated with Salesforce)\r\n- Content type for Product page (all others we use standard pages)\r\n- Carousel (using pre-built templates)\r\n- Gotowebinar integration - (some php code might be required)\r\n- Community Portal - https://www.mydbsync.com/community\r\n- We will need url alias so that it is backward compatible with existing site. We will like to keep the same link structure to avoid any SEO impact.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593636414090907649','NA',7,'United States','Pleasanton',6000.000,'fixed',6000.000,'2022-11-18',1,'2022-11-18',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-18 16:07:48',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
