(2296,'Brand Redesign + Packaging Design + Style Guide',2,'Hello! We are an agency working with a new client who needs a redesign of their brand (logo redesign is likely too), plus a design for their initial product. From that redesign, we would like to create a brand style guide.\r\n\r\nThis product is an existing product that is licensed exclusively for the US market, so part of the redesign effort is to create packaging that is attractive to the US consumer. We are not limiting ourselves only to US-based designers, but a knowledge of the US market is necessary. Existing designs in your portfolio from US companies are a big plus.\r\n\r\nThis is a food product, which will also mean certain FDA requirements and certifications are included in the packaging.\r\n\r\nWe are looking to hire and begin within the next 48 to 72 hours.\r\n\r\nI look forward to reading your proposals.\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0197ded3912a2151bf','no',7,'United States','St Petersburg',3500.000,'fixed',3500.000,'2022-11-18',1,'2022-11-18',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-18 16:42:55',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
