(2313,'Senior UX Designer - Wireframes',6,'We are a small digital product agency where we have around 4-6 project per year. We are looking for a Senior UX Designer who we can work with on long-term.\r\n\r\nYou will be designing online digital products which are mostly SaaS platforms, mostly from scratch. You will be given detailed product feature specifications and expected to deliver fully finished, detailed wireframes.\r\nUX design areas that you will be expected to work on are: overall interface layout structure, navigational design, information design, interaction design and process flow design.\r\n\r\nYou should be able to handle complex product specifications and translate them in to flawless wireframes. Our projects are not simple, nor small.\r\n\r\nYou will be responsible for :\r\n- Understanding project requirements and feature specifications.\r\n- Defining the projects UX needs and deciding on the right UX approach.\r\n- Designing and delivering full set of highly detailed wireframes.\r\n\r\nYou are expected to have:\r\n- 7+ years work experience in designing digital web and mobile applications.\r\n- Experience working with large scaled web projects with complex feature set and with 100+ screens.\r\n- Strong portfolio as a UX Designer.\r\n- Strong understanding of information architecture and interactive design principles.\r\n- Ability to work without receiving significant supervision.\r\n- Strong analytic skills, problem-solving ability and high attention to detail.\r\n- Ability to manage own task and time. Strictly meet predefined milestone & deadlines.\r\n\r\nAgencies, please do not post on this project. This project is only open for individual UX designers.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593659606114127873','NA',7,'United States','AMSTERDAM',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2022-11-18',1,'2022-11-18',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-18 17:38:36',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
