(2326,'Expert UX/UI Designer - Figma',6,'ExoticCarTrader.com is an online marketplace that allows sellers to list Cars for sale, and then allows buyers to purchase those Cars, through our platform, from the seller. We are currently upgrading our platform significantly and need a very talented UX/UI designer who is extremely talented with user interaction and psychology.\r\n\r\nWe have two full time enterprise level engineers/developers who are recreating our MVP platform which is currently in Webflow to a new platform built out in React with back-end in Springboot. There are the obvious front-end facing pages and interfaces that will need to be built out for customers/users. There are also internal backend dashboards and user flows for employees and managers that would need to be cleaned up. The existing site is in a sense a blueprint for overall layout and there is currently some structure in the new site, but we would like to take the appearance/flow of this site to the next level, and need someone who can deliver in a way to do so.\r\n\r\nWe have an extremely clean and modern look.\r\n\r\nDesigner would need the ability to work well with the developers who are building the entire backend and technical flow of the site.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease send or be prepared to share examples or projects you have done in the past.\r\n\r\nThank you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593674831881314305?success','NA',7,'United States','Fort Lauderdale',100.000,'perhour',100.000,'2022-11-18',1,'2022-11-18',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-18 19:20:19',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
