(2367,'Build a Wix Website and Store',3,'I have a Wix website with an online store under a premium account. I’m selling my patented product from this site. This site employs my related domain name and registered trademark. I would like to sell the “same” patented product via a separate site. I plan to use another domain name and trademark (TM at this point). The reason for having separate sites is that the messages mounted on the patented product conflict from a marketing and target markets standpoint. The current site can be viewed as a one-sided politically conservative target market, and the new one will be a politically neutral, all-other target market (mainly licensed sports and pets, family, etc.) to appeal to a larger overall market.\r\n\r\nThe new website will be one that includes (1) a custom order setup mostly for sports and schools and (2) ready-to-sell designs related to local business, pets, family, etc.\r\n\r\nI need expert help putting the new website together. I’d like to start with a short discussion to determine if you can help me by:\r\n• Assessing my account to determine what kind of new website can be deployed under my existing Wix account, or tell me if I need to have a separate premium or other account essentially doubling website costs.\r\n• Further build out the site and store, taking my core information and going from there.\r\n• I’d supply photos, some graphics and videos.\r\n• Develop a design upload process where 5.5” high x 11” wide images are ready to print. I have one drafted, but it’s not as user-friendly as I see on other sites.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593708395864674305?success','N/A',7,'United States','North Chesterfield',80.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-11-18',1,'2022-11-18',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-18 21:00:38',NULL,6,3,NULL,132),
