(2390,'Black Friday/week banners',2,'Creatives for Black Friday promotion on eb.dk \r\nTO BE COMPLETED BY NOVEMBER 21st\r\n\r\nLink to brief: https://jppol-my.sharepoint.com/:w:/g/personal/ricki_e_lyngsoe_polhus_rootdom_dk/EcUfoHRXs_xIlOSe0rosmKIBmQlsIqzkxs2jvFSXzd9dlw?e=n7v03L\r\n\r\n \r\nA true conversion campaign – where we present a great offer for a limited time only.\r\n \r\nEverything needs to fit the eb.dk look and feel.  \r\n \r\nFormats and weight:  \r\nROS placements: https://adops.dk/produkter/standard-display/ \r\nWallpaper placement: https://adops.dk/dd/ \r\nSoMe (Facebook + Instagram)\r\n \r\nHTML5 is preferred with animations. \r\n  \r\nFont: Work Sans \r\nColours: https://ekstrabladetudvikling.github.io/eb-colors/\r\n\r\nLayout should be kept in our colours – black, white and our signature red\r\n\r\nLayout inspiration:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\nWe need a way for the CTA to stand out.  \r\no Potential customers, with the copy: ‘Køb abonnement’\r\n\r\nThe copy on the creative should read:\r\n \r\nBLACK FRIDAY\r\n50% OFF på Ekstra Bladet+\r\nTilbuddet udløber fredag d. 27/11 kl. 23.59\r\n\r\n\r\nSome animation would be good:\r\n- FRIDAY and WEEK needs to swap every couple of seconds\r\n- Balloons that waver in the air\r\n- Text that pops out at times','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593726653078605825?success','-',7,'United States','Copenhagen',100.000,'Open this select menu',80.000,'2022-11-18',1,'2022-11-18',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-18 22:06:57',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
