(2392,'WordPress Website Dev - 2 Simple Projects',3,'Looking for a capable WordPress developer to build out 2 very simple websites, nothing complex on the backend. Details for each are below. Please reach out with an estimated timeline + cost.\r\n\r\n**For both projects, my internal team will be providing the designs + content. You just need to develop. Prefer to be on Elementor / Astra for both.\r\n\r\nProject 1: Pest Control Website\r\nPages:\r\n-Homepage\r\n-Residential Pest Control\r\n-Commercial Pest Control\r\n-About Us\r\n-6 Template based location pages\r\n\r\nTotal of 10 pages.\r\n\r\nPlugin needs:\r\n-Form (Gravity Forms, Ninja forms etc.)\r\n-Quote Pricing Calculator **This requirement may be dropped.\r\n\r\nProject 2: Dog Training Website\r\nPages:\r\n-Homepage\r\n-About Us\r\n-Training Services\r\n--Evaluation\r\n--Board & Train\r\n--Basic Obedience\r\n--Personal Protection\r\n--Private & Group Training\r\n-Our Facility\r\n-K9\'s For Sale\r\n-Schedule Training\r\n\r\nTotal Pages: 11 Pages\r\n\r\nPlugin Needs:\r\n-Form (Gravity Forms, Ninja Forms, etc..)\r\n-Social Media Photo Feed\r\n\r\nOther Requirements:\r\n-On the Schedule Training page, need to embed a Calendly Calendar. Simple and easy.\r\n\r\nFeel free to reach out with any additional questions. Depending on how these projects go, we can send over 5-10 projects a month.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~013082d540aeec4360','no',7,'United States','pheonix',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2022-11-18',1,'2022-11-18',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-18 22:10:47',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
