(2396,'Heavier Content, Beauty Industry-Focused Resource Site',4,'Hi there!\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a web designer to redesign a content-heavy resource site. Right now, this project will span Q1 - Q2 2023. This site is an industry-materials reference hub. This site lives in the beauty product industry and will need to be a stand-out industry experience. You will work alongside our project managers, content producers, developers (no code required from you!) and our design team.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a designer that has strong skills in the following area:\r\n- Typography\r\n- UX design\r\n- UI design\r\n- Icon & Illustration Development if needed\r\n- Heavy QA skills\r\n- Deadline driven\r\n- Critical thinker\r\n- Team Collaborator\r\n- Above all a kind Co-creator:)\r\n- Expectations are that you work in Figma and/or Sketch.\r\n\r\nYou will be responsible for producing the following:\r\n- Wireframes\r\n- Style Guide/Elements Collage\r\n- Static Mockups of key templates\r\n- Light prototyping if possible\r\n- Heavy, tiered QA of Beta Site','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~010946fd5d622383be/apply/','Na',7,'United States','Washington',6500.000,'fixed',6500.000,'2022-11-18',1,'2022-11-18',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-18 22:30:12',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
(2397,'Create Simple Product Labels',2,'I have some small, simple product labels that need to be made quickly. They will include my logo, barcodes, and some product data like title, model number, etc.\r\n\r\nI will provide a brief that includes the current versions of the labels, their dimensions, updated product data, barcodes, vector artwork for my logo and some good input to get you started.\r\n\r\nSince we made these graphics we\'ve developed a new visual identity that we want incorporated in these labels. The old versions will be scrapped entirely. I\'ll provide samples and input on this in the brief.\r\n\r\nThis is fairly simple and I need it turned around quick. Not in a rush, but swiftly. I will be available via chat while you work and can provide quick feedback. It may require a round of edits or two, but the labels are simple so I don\'t expect much of that.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593733259224989697','NA',7,'United States','Greenville',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2022-11-18',1,'2022-11-18',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-18 22:30:32',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(2398,'Copy Writer and web content $250.00 – 75',5,'Copy Writer and web content\r\n\r\n$250.00 – 750.00 USD\r\n\r\nBIDDING ENDS IN 6 DAYS, 22 HOURS\r\n\r\n I’m currently launching a new business and I need assistance with content for the new website..  I will provide a brief of the content but I need this to be improved and the balance of the content completed.  Once done I will hand this over to my internal web design team to complete the project.  The website won’t be that large, I’m estimating between 10 and 15 pages.  Please send links to examples of content you have created so I can review.  Thank you','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1968352','-',7,'United States','-',750.000,'Open this select menu',750.000,'2022-11-18',1,'2022-11-18',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-18 22:32:29',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
(2399,'Need ui/ux mocks for website',2,'I need 10 mocks (pages) created for my website. Pages include but are not limited to: the home, login, billing, settings, etc..\r\n\r\nWhat’s most important to me is consistency and user experience. I will provide you a description for each page and a picture example of what I’ve already built.\r\n\r\nTo be clear, the mocks should not be a replica of what I’ve already built and should be an optimized or improved experience.\r\n\r\nWill consider long term arrangement after successfully completion.\r\n\r\nSee the attached image for an example of what I might show you. This is one of the pages that you will redesign/optimize.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593623789958221825?success','-',7,'United States','Charleston',500.000,'fixed',400.000,'2022-11-18',1,'2022-11-18',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-18 22:32:32',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
