(2401,'UX/UI Designer',2,'We’d like to introduce ourselves so you get an idea of who we are and what we’re looking for.\r\nFirst of all, we are a start-up based in Mexico/US that performs Background Checks (BC). We currently operate with 25+ freelancers worldwide on a non-stop project basis, meaning work is active and abundant if that is what you are looking for.\r\nWe are planning to restructure our platform entirely in a 3 to 4 weeks intense project aiming to put the most successful Background Check’s (BC) App ten years ahead of our competitors. We are looking for an UX/UI designers that can create the user interface for our cutting edge app:\r\n\r\nWe need you to gather and evaluate user requirements and use your skills to illustrate design ideas using storyboards, process flows, sitemaps and design graphic user interface elements like menus tab widgets\r\nWe need to optimize our app to improve ease of use (usability), and create the best user experience by exploring many different approaches to solve end-users\' problems and also to create and implement a user interface that is intuitive but also has the right look and feel required in the product design\r\nThe work includes collaborating with our product managers and engineers.\r\n\r\nWhat we need from you is proof that you have the necessary knowledge and persistence to partake in these projects, while being able to execute them successfully in the defined time frame. We need constant communication and updates at least every 3 to 4 days to understand how you are progressing, and to know whether you will be able to deliver the project on time.\r\nProcess headlines:\r\nYou send us your best works from your portfolio together with your economic requirements\r\nAmong the top we will distribute the platform Tech Specs and an demo user for you to navigate and understand how it actually works.\r\nYou will send us 3 or 4 initial proposals and among them we will decide the final candidate.\r\nAll work performed during the selection process will be fully paid\r\nThe final chosen one will be working with the company’s team that includes engineers, directors, developers and the company owner and founder. We are a flat high intensity team.\r\nWe have clear lines drawn on the sand:\r\n1. Projects\' budget vary based on quality and complexity\r\n2. We work on a milestone basis - first milestone is 30%, second is 30%, third is 40% (the nature of the milestones will be explained if we see you are a fit).\r\n3. We pay only after samples have been delivered\r\n4. After 10 days if samples have not been delivered we will understand you are not capable of working on the project and proceed to eliminate you from the team — we are looking for excellence, resilience, persistence, and strong intensity of work\r\n5. Lastly, if you deliver successfully, we guarantee an extremely profitable long-term relation with constant projects for at least 12 months. We don’t stop hiring you can check our adds in Upwork.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1593735585548259329','NA',7,'United States','ciudad de mexico',600.000,'fixed',600.000,'2022-11-18',1,'2022-11-18',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-18 22:41:31',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
