(2408,'Website Designer',4,'Calling all right-brainers looking to make a lasting impact through unique content creation and user-friendly web design. Creativity is a must. Familiarity with UX/UI, Wordpress, WooCommerce and CRO is beneficial. \r\n\r\n\r\nWe are looking for someone who: \r\n\r\n- Has the ability to come up with creative designs without any template \r\n\r\n- Know the difference between aesthetics and creative problem solving\r\n\r\n- Respond well to constructive criticism \r\n\r\n- Takes pride in work and growth \r\n\r\n- Welcomes and sees challenges as a way to accelerate experience \r\n\r\n- Holds high standards and takes initiatives \r\n\r\n- Interested to work with a closely knitted global team \r\n\r\n- Exercise creative freedom over content creation \r\n\r\n\r\nWhat you will do: \r\n\r\n- Plan website wire frames \r\n\r\n- Work closely with project and design team to create website interface and layout \r\n\r\n- Think analytically: Generate a wide range of concepts, and versions for user testing \r\n\r\n- Ensure website’s visuals are aligned with our brand’s goals and objectives \r\n\r\n- Understand, articulate, and strategically apply the latest platform/industry/creative trends and digital best practices \r\n\r\n- Improve and implement UX/CRO practices on an on-going basis\r\n\r\n\r\nMust Haves: \r\n\r\n- Fluent in English writing and communication \r\n\r\n- Passion and eye for web design \r\n\r\n- Attention to detail with emphasis on accuracy and quality \r\n\r\n- Intelligent and great at figuring things out. Problems are just challenges to be solved \r\n\r\n- Communicate regularly on the progress of ongoing projects and adhere reasonably to the agreed timeline \r\n\r\n- Experience working under pressure and able to handle a wide range of tasks and projects \r\n\r\n- Honesty and integrity – not afraid to receive and give constructive feedback. It’s how we grow \r\n\r\n\r\nINTERESTED? \r\n\r\n\r\nSend us a message. Including at least answers to the following to be considered: \r\n\r\n1. Start the process by replying in your application with the words ‘Design is thinking made visual’ \r\n\r\n\r\n2. Tell me about yourself? The relevant experience you have and your previous work experience. \r\n\r\n\r\n3. Your portfolio. Bonus if you have worked on ecommerce platforms before. \r\n\r\n\r\n4. What is your availability? Please provide days of the week and time ranges of when you are available for work. IMPORTANT: Make sure to convert time into GMT+8 timezone. Use WorldTimeBuddy.com if you need\r\n\r\n\r\n5. How long do you think you will take to create a website wireframe from scratch and expected remuneration? \r\n\r\n\r\nStart the process now. Good luck and see you on the other side','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1969557','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1969557',7,'United States','none',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2022-11-21',1,'2022-11-21',1,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-21 11:59:41',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
