(2449,'Logo Redesign and Guidelines for new CPG, retail, and influencer management company',2,'Looking for a new logo, and simple brand guide for a new company called Trusted Influence. It\'s slightly unconventional because the company works with celebrities and traditional product development and manufacturing.\r\n\r\nThere is a current logo to jump from, but we feel that the logo is too \"techy\".\r\n\r\nConsiderations:\r\n- Easy to read in small print (packaging and business cards) and digital (no OOH ads, etc,)\r\n- Mix between the traditional consulting company, influencer/talent management agency, and a retail company that creates and sells products\r\n- Trusted Influence is the connection between many partners coming together, so connectivity and credibility are crucial\r\n\r\nDesign Details\r\n- Business Name: Trusted Influence\r\n- Business Description: Trusted Influence is a unique business structure that is designed to connect celebrity and social media influencers with traditional retailers to leverage their combined influence to commercialize products and increase brand value.\r\n- Brand Values: Expertise, Connection, Credibility, Quality, Support, Guidance, Humor\r\n- Brand Attributes: Charismatic, Dynamic, Fresh, Open, Practical, Supportive\r\n- Logo Type: Abstract Mark or Emblem, Contemporary\r\n\r\nFinal Deliverables\r\n- New Logo (project files and exports of all formats for web, print, etc)\r\n- Simple brand guide with fonts, colors, a few graphic elements, etc. (fonts should be easy to find and implement across an organization)\r\n\r\nThere may be more to do on this project once we establish the logo, colors, and direction.\r\n\r\nThere is a hard deadline of Nov 29 (the earlier the better!)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1594715604635664385','NA',7,'United States','Santa Monica',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-11-21',1,'2022-11-21',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-21 15:34:24',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
