(2458,'UX Design Template for new Mobile App',6,'Company and Product Background\r\n\r\nAvid Sports Medicine is a 2-year-old start-up in the growing sports medicine, training, therapy and wellness space. We are on a mission to empower people trapped by pain and poor habits to use movement as medicine.\r\n\r\nWe are creating the Avid Platform, a virtual, primarily self-service design that will take our model of Movement as Medicine directly to the millions of people who need it.\r\n\r\nObjectives of this Design Job\r\n\r\nWe are creating a health and wellness app to provide users with professional advice from doctors, physicians and athletic trainers. Content will be in text, picture, and video formats.\r\n\r\nDesired Deliverables\r\n\r\nIn general, the deliverables should be as follows:\r\n\r\n- A design template that includes fonts, colors, buttons, icons, form elements, etc., that are in alignment with our brand identity.\r\n- App logo, hero screens and follow-up screens utilizing this design system are scaled for mobile and tablet views. The number of total screens is TBD.\r\n\r\n\r\nHow We Work Together\r\n\r\nExpect hands-on, direct communication with founder Dr. Veronica Jow and weekly 30-60 min meetings to ensure everything is on track. Our team will provide the objectives of the app, but we would love to work with designers who can bring creative ideas to the table and design an app that is simple, beautiful and easy to use.\r\n\r\nWe will start with a 4-week commitment of a minimum of 10 hours/wk and reevaluate needs after every 4 weeks.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1594721718185922561','NA',7,'United States','San Francisco',75.000,'perhour',75.000,'2022-11-21',1,'2022-11-21',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-21 15:58:40',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
