(2465,'Mockup Designer for print design needed',2,'Hi, I am looking for a professional mockup designer for my print products.\r\n\r\nI need someone who is really experienced with amending or creating mockups and adapting the shadow in order to deliver realistically looking product images.\r\n\r\nAs you are used to this kind of job, you have professional accounts at adobe stock or freepik etc. so that you bring in the access to mockups.\r\n\r\nI would like to start our collaboration with the following job.\r\n\r\nCould you make the following mockups for me: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mjx9-TIlj7q4wIjh9jeB-jK-8H2KJ_5C6Dr9hSqdDsc/edit?usp=sharing\r\n\r\nYou do not have to take the mockups I shared there - you can take also other ones.\r\n\r\nBUT you would have to show the correct calender with it\'s correct white spiral binding and the correct number of rings within the spiral and the correct length of the horizontal \"stick\" going through the rings - the spiral binding must be on all mockups the same - according to the real product.\r\n\r\nStart your proposal with \"heythere\" in order to make sure that you have really read it completely - otherwise I will ignore your proposal.\r\n\r\nCan you make beautiful and realistic mockups of this calendar here https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1T1pcSQiRsUSphEwCK67rq9j1QCi0I9q_?usp=sharing ?\r\n\r\nIf so: How long do you need for that and how much do you charge for that?\r\n\r\nAnd please answer the question:\r\nDo you have a adobe stock account in order to provide relevant mockup material?\r\nOr which other professional mockups account do you use as your source?\r\n\r\nThank you','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1594702916324855809?success','-',7,'United States','Kriftel',100.000,'fixed',80.000,'2022-11-21',1,'2022-11-21',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-21 16:21:40',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
