(2468,'Looking for Graphic Designer expert in MS & Adobe',2,'Hi,\r\n\r\nI am looking for a Graphic Designer expert in branding to update list of applications (around 112) made in MS & Adobe softwares\r\n\r\nWill share all files and the new identity PDF guideline during the interview.\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1594713594690469889?success','-',7,'United States','Riyadh',300.000,'fixed',240.000,'2022-11-21',1,'2022-11-21',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-21 16:26:15',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
(2469,'YouTube video editor and animator',2,'Need someone who can edit YouTube videos and do animation for YouTube videos.  I also need thumbnails to be created for YouTube videos.  If you can make videos and thumbnails like the videos on Tech Zone (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6H07z6zAwbHRl4Lbl0GSsw/videos) and Bestie (https://www.youtube.com/@BestieMedia/videos) then reply to this post.  You also need to have access to paid stock footage like Storyblocks for example.  You also need to have access to paid background music like Epidemic Sound for example. You must choose background music similar to the background music in videos on Tech Zone and Bestie. You also need to create a 5 second trailer for the logo of my channel.  See how Tech Zone has a  5 second logo trailer as introduction to its videos.  The revisions on each video must be unlimited.  The video quality, meaning, picture resolution should be crisp as videos on Bestie.  The price per video must include the creation of three videos which are basically the same and the only difference between the videos is the voiceover and text on screen in a different language. The videos are done in English, German and Spanish.  The videos must have a watermark of my channel that looks like the watermark YouFact Tech uses in its videos (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0OspaXWWcvw). My watermark must be in the upper right hand corner starting from the first second to the last second of the video.  I look forward to your answer.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0118bee1d0adf26ec2','NA',7,'United States','na',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2022-11-21',1,'2022-11-21',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-21 16:26:21',NULL,6,3,NULL,125),
(2470,'Above-the-fold design challenge based on mockup + color scheme',2,'We are doing a roofing website makeover, and are looking for candidates who can take a one-page mockup with specific color constraints and fonts and make the design look vibrant and like a professional roofing company.\r\n\r\nWe value iteration and collaboration to get to a design that works, fast. First, we want to get to an appealing balance of colors and fonts, and then we can home in on some of the finer UI elements.\r\n\r\nIf we work well together, this job could lead to work on the full website, and work on future projects.\r\n\r\nPlease apply to this job with:\r\na. Any questions\r\nb. Approximate turnaround time + hours you\'d spend on a job like this (just an estimate)\r\n\r\n--\r\n\r\nOne-page mockup:\r\nhttps://share.cleanshot.com/CfDLNk\r\n\r\nColors:\r\nhttps://www.wcu.edu/discover/communications-and-marketing/wcu-brand/visual-identity/wcu-colors.aspx\r\n\r\nFonts:\r\nhttps://www.wcu.edu/discover/communications-and-marketing/wcu-brand/visual-identity/typography.aspx\r\n\r\nThis post contains a few designs that we like:\r\nhttps://hookagency.com/blog/best-roofing-websites-roofing/','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1594714797776240641?success','-',7,'United States','Tampa',100.000,'Open this select menu',80.000,'2022-11-21',1,'2022-11-21',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-21 16:27:52',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
