(2595,'Character creation anime style. Vectorized. Different poses',2,'Hello,\r\nI run a small printing company. We would like to expand by creating a mascot to make a media presence\r\n\r\nCreating a vectorized mascot in different poses for our company to use on social media, stickers, banners and vehicle wraps.\r\n\r\nDescription of the mascot:\r\nPlace holder name\r\nGiant Printing Robot\r\n\r\n- The main look is inspired from the Japanese 80\'s giant robot animes. ie (Voltron, Mighty Orbots, Goldrake)\r\n\r\n- The main body is mostly chrome.\r\n\r\n- GPR is powered by the 4 colors: Cyan, Magenta, Black, Yellow\r\n\r\n- The 4 color inks will flow through the body in hoses\r\n\r\n- The hoses replace the muscle. When GPR powers up, the hoses swell from the ink that flows in it\r\n\r\n-On its chest he will have a circle thats shoots out a beautiful rainbow laser.\r\n\r\n- You can see the 4 colors travel through the hoses and reach every extremity of the body\r\n\r\n- It can fly as well. By shooting ink of all 4 colors out the bottom of his feet as jets. He swirls and leaves a beautiful trail of colors behind\r\nhim\r\n\r\n- GPR will come to the rescue and save the day by shooting the rainbow laser that will produce the prints that out company makes.\r\n\r\n- It is not a violent robot','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1594780974418501633?success','-',7,'United States','montreal',400.000,'fixed',320.000,'2022-11-21',1,'2022-11-21',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-21 21:58:56',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
(2596,'Design a 2023 Calendar for Healthcare Brand',2,'2023 Calendar\r\nWe are doing a wire coil 2023 calendar like this: https://smartpress.com/offering/custom-wire-coil-calendars\r\n\r\nSize 8.5 x 11\r\n\r\nI need your help on creative for this. The theme of this calendar is about Philadelphia so I\'m thinking that we can potentially include some iconic Philly area photos or open to suggestions from the designer. I\'d also like to have a quote for each month that features something from a Philadelphian.\r\n\r\nJust to keep in mind for all of this, our target audience is 65+.\r\n\r\nIn addition to the standard calendar months that we need, I also need an additional page that has the following wellness reminders added in a nicely designed way:\r\n\r\n-Schedule your annual wellness visit.\r\n-Plan any preventative screenings (Ex: mammograms, colon cancer screenings, and lab work).\r\n-Add a reminder to schedule your flu shot in the Fall.\r\n-Schedule your COVID-19 booster if you already have the vaccine, and if not, schedule your -COVID-19 vaccine.\r\n-Schedule a routine eye, hearing, and dental exam.\r\n-Add a reminder when quarterly over-the-counter allowance benefits are due.\r\n-Remember that the 2024 Annual Enrollment Period starts 10/15/2023.\r\n\r\nIndependence Blue Cross offers products through its subsidiaries Independence Hospital Indemnity Plan, Keystone Health Plan East and QCC Insurance Company — independent licensees of the Blue Cross and Blue Shield Association. Y0041_HM_22_111374_C\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nBrand Guidelines & Logo attached for reference. Our clients logo will also be added to this calendar.\r\n\r\n****NOTE**** the focus of this calendar is not about the brands, it is intended to be a really nice gift calendar with high quality creative. The preference is to include subtle brand nods within the calendar or on the back of the calendar.\r\n\r\nPreference will be given to designers that have created calendars in the past and can show examples of their work.\r\n\r\nWe are on a tight timeline, so preference will also be given to designers that can start immediately','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1594772568831885313?success','-',7,'United States','Philadelphia',1000.000,'Open this select menu',850.000,'2022-11-21',1,'2022-11-21',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-21 22:00:34',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
