(2616,'Brand Designer',2,'Looking to build a short list of go-to brand and graphic design contractors for a series of projects at an ecommerce startup. There\'s no 1 specific project at the moment. Here are some examples of the types of work needed, feel free to apply if any (not necessarily all) are something you\'re interested in. I will review your portfolio and any additional information you provide to help match you with projects on a rolling basis.\r\n- New brand design (color palette, styling, font, logo)\r\n- Email marketing deliverables (HTML files, etc)\r\n- Mobile App UI/UX\r\n- Web UI/UX (creating or modifying existing webpages)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1594822393430548481','NA',7,'United States','San Fransisco',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-11-21',1,'2022-11-21',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-21 22:41:11',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
