(2618,'Ontraport Landing Page',4,'I\'ve created a simple landing page using Ontraport/Pages.\r\n\r\nOntraport is supposed create a page that is responsive, but it does not appear to be working automatically.\r\n\r\nI am looking for someone that get Ontraport to display my landing page correctly on mobile devices and tablets.\r\n\r\nIt looks OK on Desktop, not on my iPhone.\r\n\r\n- Bulleted lists do not line up properly on left margin.\r\n- Background photo is too big for mobile, but I cannot determine how to exclude it for mobile.\r\n- font size is not adjusting down to mobile device size.\r\n\r\nShould be a small job, easy job for someone familiar with Ontraport/Pages\r\n\r\nhttps://quantumresults.com.respond.ontraport.net/Peggy-5Day-V2','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1594820153290457089?success','na',7,'United States','Eden',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2022-11-21',1,'2022-11-21',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-21 22:52:32',NULL,6,3,NULL,131),
(2619,'Packaging designer for Golf accesory Brand',2,'I need a box and blister packaging to be designed for my Golf Brands new training aid product.\r\n\r\nOur brand is fun, energetic, vibrant and approachable while maintaining a sleek sport look.\r\n\r\nLooking for designer whos designed similar aesthetics.\r\n\r\nif you think you\'re a good fit, please reach out and I look forward to talking with you.\r\n\r\nPlease attach specific examples that are similar to what I described above.\r\nAttached below is our old packaging and some newer design styles that we align with.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1594824785215627265?success','na',7,'United States','London',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2022-11-21',1,'2022-11-21',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-21 22:54:44',NULL,6,3,NULL,131),
(2620,'2D Animation- Mechanical Energy',2,'We are looking to develop a motion graphic/2-D Animator to help us create graphics for a 10:45 minute science explainer video for high school students. We are looking for someone with expertise in Adobe After Effects and Adobe Illustrator. We will be supplying the initial assets for the graphics. Additionally, we require the ability to edit the files to fit the narration so editable files of the end deliverable graphics are a must. We will provide narrative descriptions of graphics, music and narration file to be used.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01d76847f0d3e7c163/apply/','Na',7,'United States','Lubbock',3960.000,'fixed',3960.000,'2022-11-21',1,'2022-11-21',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-21 22:55:06',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
(2621,'Rockstar Graphic Designer To Build Brand Media',2,'Help us create brand media!\r\n\r\nJob Summary:\r\n- Help to create a brand guide to unify the look and feel for all marketing campaigns (note, you\'ll have an existing logo, color palette, demographic profiles, and past marketing media to use as a reference)\r\n\r\n- Design brand re-useable templates for use on social media and email campaigns (your designs should draw on the brand guide to standardize posting format, typography, and unification of brand elements — THINK Instagram grid layout ⇨ 15 posts that align the brand and style)\r\n\r\n- Design images for campaigns (go beyond templates and create custom media for social, email, and print campaigns)\r\n\r\nExample Project:\r\nDesign client brand look and feel concept, create generic media templates using the brand concept (up to 10-15 templates for social media and email campaigns), and deliver 15-30 custom media designs to include social media posts, email images, and maybe a flyer/billboard.\r\n\r\nTiming:\r\n- 1-2 weeks for brand concepts\r\n- 1-3 weeks for media deliverables\r\n- Repeat work available for other projects\r\n\r\nPayment:\r\n- project-based and varies by project\r\n\r\n\r\nQualifications\r\n- must use Adobe Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, Indesign, etc.)\r\n- must be an expert at using Canva\r\n- must have a portfolio of work that we can review online\r\n- must be flexible and ready for more work past the introduction project\r\n\r\nSkills Required:\r\nAs a designer, you must have an eye and talent for matching and mirroring branding and imagery (color, use of shapes, images, typography, etc.)\r\n\r\n\r\nIMPORTANT: Candidate must be dependable, show attention to detail, and work quickly.\r\n\r\nNext steps:\r\nPlease reply to this post and share your portfolio if you\'re interested and meet the above requirements.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1594827276943671297?success','NA',7,'United States','Columbia',80.000,'perhour',100.000,'2022-11-21',1,'2022-11-21',1,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-21 22:59:40',NULL,6,3,NULL,143),
