(2638,'Animated Product Video for a SaaS Startup in the Logistics Industry',2,'This product video should highlights current issues in operational shipment handling for freight agents and is designed to show why AGX in particular is a perfect solution to positively impact their business in the long term. The video is short enough that any decision maker can quickly watch it and share it with their network. The goal is for viewers to book an appointment with the Sales Department to learn more about AGX.\r\n\r\nDuration: max 3min.\r\n\r\nAudience:\r\nOften 40-50+\r\nConservative\r\nSecurity oriented\r\nSaaS and technology not in core knowledge, understand it\'s needed but don\'t necessarily like that\r\n\r\nShort Description of the video content:\r\nAGX is a collaboration tool that provides its customers with maximized efficiency in shipment handling, as well as other features that can make SME-FF competitive against digital FF. Since people usually think in terms of relations, to show through a \"before and after comparison\" how much time savings and error reduction can be achieved with AGX.\r\n\r\nFirst we throw an emotional & temporal relations anchor, in which we let the viewer live through the process:\r\nWhat does the current process look like?\r\nWhat are the pain points that come up?\r\nWhat are the implications?\r\n\r\nTo subsequently be able to put the viewer in the emotional position that this \"stressful\" state they live through day after day doesn\'t have to stay that way. We awaken desires in him.\r\n\r\nNow we can go through the same process, showing that the Pain-Points are no longer present when using AGX. While resolving pain point by pain point, an explanation is given of how AGX resolves them. By comparing both processes (putting them in relation to each other), it should be clear at a glance that the process with AGX is much better!\r\n\r\nNow AGX offers further services, which not only increase efficiency, but also provide agents with further benefits. These gain creators should be clearly shown at the end as ADDITIONAL. We do not only take the pain of short term shipment handling, but offer you an important tool to compete in the more and more digitalizing competition. Here we have to trigger the strong need of survival. If you want to survive in the market next to digital FF, you have to adapt.\r\n\r\nThis state of affairs should now drive the viewer to take an action.\r\n\r\nWe\'re currently writing a script (Voice Over + Action on Screen). It would be ideal if you could us feedback, that our collaboration is going well.\r\n\r\nPlease let us know how long it takes you to make such a viedeo. I will be happy to answer any further questions in the chat! I\'m happy to provide you with our current script!\r\n\r\nBr\r\nDavid','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1595070016045838337?success','https://trello.com/b/eh32Y1Pm/task-list-arturo-digital/member/hasnain143',7,'United States','Hong Kong',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 15:03:47',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
