(2695,'UI UX Designer',4,'Position: UI/ UX Designer\r\n\r\n﻿\r\n\r\nGroove Jones is a creative technology company that produces next-generation experiences for world-class brands. We are best known for our award-winning work in AR (Augmented Reality), VR (Virtual Reality), ML (Machine Learning), and AI (Artificial Intelligence) Application development. We\'re currently accepting resumes and portfolios for a Graphic Designer with a focus on UI/UX design. Our Designers are responsible for both the visual look and implementation of UI for our experiences whether they are an app or website. Our designers have strong art fundamentals while understanding the UI/UX principles for beautiful application design.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nQualifications\r\n\r\nBA in art, graphic design, or related field\r\n3-5 years of Graphic Design or UI design at digital agency, or other firm preferred\r\nStrong mastery of Adobe softwares including Photoshop, Illustrator, XD\r\nExperience with Figma or other wireframing tool preferred\r\n\r\n\r\nResponsibilities and Duties\r\n\r\nCombine UX thinking with design execution, to produce usable and intuitive user interfaces for each project\r\nCommunicate design solutions to engineers and stakeholders, helping guide the project’s creative execution and keep the design cohesive from start to finish\r\nProduce high quality UX design solutions through wireframes, visual and graphic designs, flow diagrams, storyboards, site maps, and prototypes.\r\nDesign UI elements and tools such as navigation menus, search boxes, tabs, and widgets for our apps, websites, etc.\r\nPresent concepts, research, and references to the project team.\r\nInterpreting initial ideas and creating quick sketch drafts for review.\r\nCreating detailed concept designs in a variety of mediums specific to the brief such as 2D drawings or 3D renders.\r\nParticipating in feedback consultations and noting changes.\r\nManage project timelines and schedules and reporting any issues to the supervisor.\r\nKeeping up to date with the latest design trends and advancements in technology.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWe offer competitive wages, health insurance, dental insurance, vision insurance, 401K package, vacation and sick time, paid holidays, and other optional employee benefits.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAbout Groove Jones\r\n\r\nGroove Jones is an award-winning creative technology company that provides software solutions to advertising, entertainment, marketing, health, and training companies to engage with their audiences. It has a client list of numerous Fortune 500 companies like Amazon, AT&T, Comcast, HP, IBM, Intel, Mastercard, McDonald’s, Nestle, Samsung, and Under Armour.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWe are artists, musicians, thinkers, creators, tinkerers, technologists, gamers, strategists, innovators, rebels, developers and most of all, digital fanboys (and fangirls) with a common interest: consistently delivering amazing, effective work for amazing clients. We love what we do.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFor more information visit – www.groovejones.com','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~018f67f00f38637c02','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~018f67f00f38637c02',7,'United States','Dallas',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 16:53:02',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
