(2757,'Brand Designer w/ Emphasis in Packaging Design',2,'Hello! We are in search of a packaging designer to create a brand style guide, logo concept and packaging designs for a new snack food brand! We would provide the designer with a brief of the project (may discuss over zoom), then share the assets so that you can start working!\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\nBrand Stylescape:\r\n• Logo\r\n• Messaging\r\n- Should be included in design, but messaging will be provided to you\r\n• Graphical Standards\r\n- Imagery\r\n- Iconography\r\n- Social Media Design\r\n- Packaging Design (specs will be provided)\r\n• Color Palette\r\n• Fonts & Typography\r\n\r\nLogo Design:\r\n• Logo Design\r\n• Packaging Design\r\n\r\nAbout The Snack:\r\n• A healthy, fun, rice-based snack alternative\r\n- Enriched with vitamins\r\n- GMO, Gluten, Artificial & Cholesterol Free\r\n• Target Demographic – Kids & Adults\r\n• Target Location – USA\r\n• Mindful Foods – 3 generations of rice farming & milling\r\n\r\nLogo/Packaging Information:\r\n• Would like one (1) whimsical approach\r\n• Open to color choice\r\n• Logo can visually communicate the snack\r\n• Tagline can be incorporated into logo\r\n• We will provide an initial mock-up idea, provided by client\r\n\r\nBrands the Client Admires:\r\n• Hippeas\r\n• PopChips\r\n• Celestial Seasonings\r\n\r\nTentative Deadline: Friday, December 16th (For Internal Review)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1595147381027495937?success','NA',7,'United States','Morristown',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 20:10:27',NULL,6,3,NULL,143),
