(2787,'Website design for a content and commerce website',3,'We are seeking a website designer to create mockups for a new content and commerce website. We are looking for a designer that has:\r\n\r\n1. Experience with designing UX/UI for content and commerce websites\r\n2. Ability to complete all design elements within the supplied budget and on deadlines proposed\r\n3. A demonstration of innovative / forward thinking design. We don\'t want the same design everyone else has...we want our website design to look contemporary but also fun and fresh so that it sets future trends.\r\n4. Good experience with UX and UI best practices\r\n5. Fluent English communication skills (verbal & written)\r\n\r\nWebsites for look and feel Inspiration:\r\nGoop.com\r\nCosmopolitan.com\r\nInStyle.com\r\nLemmelive.com\r\nGrailed.com\r\n\r\nWhile we have some of the initial branding work complete, we will allow this designer to translate the branding and apply it in an innovative web design that will engage users. Our goal is to engage users with content on the site, keep them engaged in our community, and push the user to commerce pages to shop content.\r\n\r\nDesign mockups should be responsive and accommodate standard desktop/tablet viewports and be optimized for mobile web.\r\n\r\nThe project will require designs of the following page and function types:\r\n\r\n---General Pages/Elements---\r\no Homepage\r\no Navigation\r\no Footer\r\no Reusable Standard Page Template (For Terms of Service, FAQ, Privacy Page)\r\no Login/Registration\r\n\r\n---User Account Page---\r\no Checkout Process (Shipping, Billing, Confirmation, validation prompts)\r\n\r\n---Editorial Content Specific Page Types---\r\no Category Page\r\no Article Page\r\no Author Page\r\n· Custom Page Type:\r\no Astrology Page with zodiac sign breakdown in a grid\r\no Astrology Page with individual zodiac sign content\r\n\r\n---eCommerce Specific Pages and Elements---\r\no Products Landing Page\r\no Product Category Page\r\no Single Product Page\r\n\r\n---Forum Specific Page Types---\r\no Forum / Community Page---\r\no Forum / Threaded Conversations (integration with Discus or other similar tool)\r\no User Profile Page (can be included as an element in User Account Page Details)\r\n\r\n---Modular Widgets that can be embedded/added to pages---\r\no Shopping/Product module\r\no Pull quote module\r\no Image carousel\r\no Video unit\r\n\r\n---File Deliverables---\r\nWireframe/Prototype/Asset Files should be provided in a format agreed upon by developer (Sketch, PSD, etc) and delivered for review and final format in flat JPGs as well.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1595163494809464833?success','NA',7,'United States','Weehawken',7500.000,'fixed',7500.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'fixed price',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 21:14:45',NULL,6,3,NULL,143),
(2788,'Graphic Design for an existing brand that needs a re-boot',2,'We want to re-design our current packaging! We have a great logo and many products, but one of our lines is doing a re-launch so we want to freshen up our package design with a new look. If the contract is accepted, I would explain the job in more detail and then ask for 3-4 design submissions in return. If one is accepted, we would work on perfecting that design.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~0120890d5b82669478/apply/','Na',7,'United States','Bay Harbor Islands',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 21:18:36',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
