(2791,'Webflow Maintenance and Redesign',4,'Looking for a creative individual to help us redesign and fix our Webflow website.  The website was set up using a template bought from the Webflow store.  But we have grown past the provided template tools and need a pro to help.\r\n\r\nIf hired we\'ll be expecting your input to help guide the overall refinement of the website experience.  Our goals will be broad as we\'ll expect your expertise to help us fill in the gaps.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b90af1b70d8fb735','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b90af1b70d8fb735',7,'United States','none',55.000,'perhour',55.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'hourly price',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 21:23:36',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
(2792,'Graphic Designer for Digital Content Creation',2,'Looking for a designer to hire either by the hour or per asset delivered who is experienced with athletic apparel and sporting goods brands.   Ideally this is a long-term relationship.  We need someone who can design and deliver variety of creative assets, static and motion/video, to be deployed across our digital channels (social, website, youtube).  We don\'t want someone who just executes a brief, but understands the competitive landscape and brings their creativity and suggestions to the table','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011dc11b732c7f3a4a','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011dc11b732c7f3a4a',7,'United States','Simi Valley',55.000,'perhour',55.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 21:24:53',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
