(2799,'Design & Build a Website in Wordpress',3,'Hello,\r\n\r\nI need to re-design a website from the ground up for a complete rebuild.\r\n\r\ncurrent website: traversestaffing.com\r\n\r\nRequired Experience:\r\n- 3+ Years WordPress Development / Design\r\n- 3+ years knowledge and experience with PHP, CSS, HTML\r\n- Experience working with Databases\r\n- System Administration experience is a plus, you will have to work with system admin team to deploy the site.\r\n- Experience having made a recruitment / staffing industry website.\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for someone who can build out a sleek overall design for a business which is in staffing industry, and also add some functionality around a blog, SEO optimization, chatbot, and anything that can drive customers to book a meeting with our sales team.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for someone to come in and do a full project, then if you are interested I can keep you on for an hour or two each month to maintain the website.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know what information you need.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e6cf4760dc88075e','N/A',7,'United States','Milton',2500.000,'fixed',2500.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 21:38:41',NULL,6,3,NULL,129),
