(2802,'Create 2 animated lottie gifs',2,'We have a list of ~100 website links, we\'d like you to take the logo from each site (i do NOT have vector files, you will have to gather) and create the following 2 animated gifs in lottie format:\r\n\r\nGIF #1) all the logos start to fall from the top of the screen, into a container toward the bottom of the screen. the container fills up with the logos to the top\r\n\r\nGIF #2) the container now has a funnel at the bottom, all of the logos go through the tunnel and one single logo comes out the other side, our company logo\r\n\r\nI am happy to provide rough sketches','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1595123069278339073?success','-',7,'United States','Carpinteria',350.000,'fixed',240.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 21:40:05',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
