(2817,'Powerpoint presentation DE',2,'Hello! We need to design a PowerPoint presentation for a client that is due early next week.\r\nWe have brand guidelines and a previous presentation to base ourselves off for the content. We are looking for a corporate yet fun presentation with smooth animation added at the end.\r\n\r\nHere are the stages of the project:\r\n1 - Design the presentation based on last year\'s content (very very similar to this year\'s). This look needs to be adapted to the new brand.\r\n2 - The client will then take a few days to input the new content in the presentation. (this is not ready yet so we need to start without it)\r\n3 - The presentation is then returned to us to implement animations and transitions.\r\n\r\nThe presentation is on November 5th but it needs to be approved by end of next week.\r\n\r\nAttached you\'ll find last years presentation!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1595096531691376641?success','-',7,'United States','Dieppe',250.000,'fixed',200.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 22:25:39',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
