(2819,'Landing Page - Simple Remake - Fast Loading',2,'Hello,\r\n\r\nI would like a very simple landing page creating (HTML & CSS, one page).\r\n\r\nActually I need one \"re-creating\".\r\n\r\nBecause I already have an \"old version\" of the page done, but it is slow to load, with unused javascript, CSS, etc.\r\n\r\nI would therefore like the page to be remade, but much lighter.\r\n\r\nThis will involve remaking the page, so there is no unused code (and perhaps other optimizations).\r\n\r\nThe page itself is simple, with...\r\n- logo and navigation menu\r\n- headline\r\n- video\r\n- icons\r\n- text elements\r\n- a few images\r\n- a popup form (to collect emails)\r\n\r\nIt is a simple page, and it is already made - but not optimized.\r\n\r\nI will basically send it to you and you will just remake it as it is, but with a new CSS, then deliver the HTML and CSS to me.\r\n\r\nThe only new element to add is, I want an optin form popup to appear on clicking some buttons (I will provide HTML for the popup, it is a simple Aweber code).\r\n\r\nThe page will need to be mobile responsive and load quickly on mobile as well as desktop.\r\n\r\nPlease reply with examples of landing pages you have done previously, and how you will remake the page.\r\n\r\nThanks','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1595089844893769729?success','-',7,'United States','Manchester',200.000,'fixed',160.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 22:29:06',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
