(2824,'Above-the-fold design challenge based on mockup + color scheme',2,'We are doing a roofing website makeover, and are looking for candidates who can take a one-page mockup with specific color constraints and fonts and make the design look vibrant and like a professional roofing company.\r\n\r\nWe value iteration and collaboration to get to a design that works, fast. First, we want to get to an appealing balance of colors and fonts, and then we can home in on some of the finer UI elements.\r\n\r\nIf we work well together, this job could lead to work on the full website, and work on future projects.\r\n\r\nPlease apply to this job with:\r\na. Any questions\r\nb. Approximate turnaround time + hours you\'d spend on a job like this (just an estimate)\r\n\r\n--\r\n\r\nOne-page mockup:\r\nhttps://share.cleanshot.com/CfDLNk\r\n\r\nColors:\r\nhttps://www.wcu.edu/discover/communications-and-marketing/wcu-brand/visual-identity/wcu-colors.aspx\r\n\r\nFonts:\r\nhttps://www.wcu.edu/discover/communications-and-marketing/wcu-brand/visual-identity/typography.aspx\r\n\r\nThis post contains a few designs that we like:\r\nhttps://hookagency.com/blog/best-roofing-websites-roofing/','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1594714797776240641?success','-',7,'United States','Tampa',100.000,'fixed',80.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 22:35:35',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
(2825,'Designer needed for a Kids\' Book Cover Design',2,'Hi there!\r\n\r\nI need an experienced designer to create a kids’ book cover design for me. The book will be published on Amazon and possibly on other platforms too.\r\n\r\nI will provide the detailed requirements, size and template of the cover once I choose the designer.\r\nI will also provide some examples of covers I like (some attached to this job posting).\r\n\r\n\r\nRequired skills:\r\n- Extensive experience in the book cover design field\r\n- Good knowledge of Adobe Illustrator (I prefer designers that work in Illustrator, but will possibly accept Photoshop as well. I’m interested in receiving the source file of the cover in the native files of these programs)\r\n- Attention to detail is important to you\r\n- Meeting deadlines is critical\r\n- Frequent, easy and open communication\r\n- Open and willing to take constructive feedback\r\n\r\nImportant info:\r\n- I need all the images/vectors/fonts to be licensed, therefore, you either provide me the licenses (you own) for the files you use or we select together the files from Adobe Stock/Fonts and I buy them and provide them to you, for using them in this project.\r\n- I need the source files of the cover (meaning AI file) + PDF export\r\n- You can consult various resources on the internet, for inspiration purposes. HOWEVER, you need to make the design original.\r\n- I am interested in starting a long-term collaboration for various book cover designs, with similar topics or niches. For this, I want you to prove that you understand my needs, communicate openly, on time, and provide top-notch design.\r\n\r\nDelivery requirements:\r\n- I need the source files of the cover (meaning AI file) + PDF export\r\n- Delivery time: no more than 2 weeks.\r\n\r\nMy budget for this book cover is $100.\r\n\r\nApplication:\r\n- Please provide examples of your relevant work.\r\n- Please include SARA in your job application to be taken into consideration.\r\n\r\nI look forward to speaking with you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~0179cd4d7920911709/apply/','Na',7,'United States','SHERIDAN',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 22:38:37',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
