(2832,'Graphic designer with some web design experience',2,'We are looking for a graphic designer to help our client with design output for the Marketing team. Examples of some projects you might be working on:\r\n\r\n- Imagery for social media\r\n- Powerpoint presentations\r\n- Infographics\r\n- Customer facing posters\r\n- Web design and UI\r\n\r\nThe applicant needs to have experience taking design briefs and translating them accurately into assets ready for web and print.\r\n\r\nWorking primarily in:\r\n\r\n- Adobe Photoshop\r\n- Adobe Illustrator\r\n- Microsoft Powerpoint\r\n- Microsoft Word\r\n- Figma\r\n\r\nIn addition to the skill set above we are looking to work with somebody who:\r\n\r\n- HAS ATTENTION TO DETAIL: We need design briefs to be translated into web ready images and video that is pixel perfect\r\n- GETS THINGS DONE EFFICIENTLY: For the 5 weeks we need you to be responsive and get things done quickly and accurately\r\n- CAN COMMUNICATE FREELY: If you get stuck feel free to chat to us so we can answer questions\r\n- INDEPENDENT FREELANCER: Not part of an agency','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1595187229733019649','NA',7,'United States','Melbourne',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 22:49:03',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(2833,'Need Help Recreating My Original Company Logo',2,'I need help recreating my current Logo. I am very happy with my Logo but I need help figuring a few things out so we can keep the branding uniform across all social media posts and other content. The person who made this font for me has since passed away so I don\'t know who to ask. The information I need is listed below.\r\n\r\n1. I need a version of my logo that is just the \"B\". It needs a transparent background so we can overlay it on different marketing materials.\r\n\r\n2. I need a version of my full logo with the \"B\" on top that has a transparent background so we can overlay it on different marketing materials.\r\n\r\n3. I need a version of my full logo with the \"B\" on the left in front of the text (bailey boys services) that has a transparent background so we can overlay it on different marketing materials.\r\n\r\n4. I need to know the font that was used for the text \"bailey boys services\".\r\n\r\n\r\nMy daughter is helping me with our marketing and social media. She will be using Canva for creating online posts so the files need to be compatible with Canva.\r\n\r\nIf we find the right person we will have small ongoing projects for you in the future.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1595188566042468353?success','-',7,'United States','Orangevale',65.000,'perhour',52.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 22:53:54',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
(2834,'Graphic designer with some web design experience',2,'We are looking for a graphic designer to help our client with design output for the Marketing team. Examples of some projects you might be working on:\r\n\r\n- Imagery for social media\r\n- Powerpoint presentations\r\n- Infographics\r\n- Customer facing posters\r\n- Web design and UI\r\n\r\nThe applicant needs to have experience taking design briefs and translating them accurately into assets ready for web and print.\r\n\r\nWorking primarily in:\r\n\r\n- Adobe Photoshop\r\n- Adobe Illustrator\r\n- Microsoft Powerpoint\r\n- Microsoft Word\r\n- Figma\r\n\r\nIn addition to the skill set above we are looking to work with somebody who:\r\n\r\n- HAS ATTENTION TO DETAIL: We need design briefs to be translated into web ready images and video that is pixel perfect\r\n- GETS THINGS DONE EFFICIENTLY: For the 5 weeks we need you to be responsive and get things done quickly and accurately\r\n- CAN COMMUNICATE FREELY: If you get stuck feel free to chat to us so we can answer questions\r\n- INDEPENDENT FREELANCER: Not part of an agency','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1595188824884645889?success','na',7,'United States','Melbourne',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 22:55:08',NULL,6,3,NULL,131),
(2835,'UI/UX designer needed for building design system for industrial startup',4,'We are an early-stage startup working with other companies in high tech manufacturing, robotics, and drone autonomy, and are looking for a part-time UI/UX designer to partner with us as we take our company to the next level.\r\n\r\nThis project is an initial pilot project with a fairly tight deadline (demo next Thursday; we\'ll need to update our code to reflect the new designs), with the potential for more work after completion (I\'m envisioning consistent part-time work, and you\'ll partner with our frontend engineers).\r\n\r\nAs part of this job, you\'ll help us create a design system to guide our frontend engineers\' work, and help refresh the UI that we\'ve already built so that the design is cohesive and consistent.\r\n\r\nWe\'re trying to go for a professional UI design that caters to industrial founders and developers.\r\n\r\nFor example, Stripe caters well to developers, and Caterpillar caters well to industrial people. Functionality-wise, we\'re supporting workflows/data density similar to Flexport, so their design system is a good starting point. Some links:\r\n\r\nhttps://anvil.so/ (our site; some of the content is outdated but the branding is directionally what we want)\r\nhttps://www.caterpillar.com/ (similar branding colors)\r\nhttps://medium.com/flexport-ux/introducing-latitude-ab04c6e94c0c (similar UIs)\r\nhttps://andrewcoyle.com/flexport.html (more UI pages)\r\nhttps://stripe.com/ (developer focused marketing)\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JMsFfX6qTNI (superhuman UI -- superuser focused)\r\n\r\nWe want to have the best of both worlds:\r\n- data density and cater to superusers (keyboard shortcuts, quick actions)\r\n- enable people who are not so technically savvy to use the interface (buttons should generally be obvious to use, hard to fat finger on a touch screen, etc.)\r\n\r\nWe\'re optimizing primarily for desktop, but having a design system that could be mobile-friendly is a big plus.\r\n\r\nRight now, our core UI consists of:\r\n- a big data table, a drawer that slides out for details when you click a table, some forms, and navigation.\r\n- an operational dashboard with computer vision camera data and reports\r\n- a device management dashboard\r\n\r\nThere are a lot of UIs that do similar things, so we\'re mainly looking to tweak them to match our brand identity and our actual workflows\r\n\r\nThe initial project is to help us fix up our existing dashboard UIs for a demo next week, but once that is done we can discuss further projects.\r\n\r\nFor example, later we\'ll also want to make general branding components, like the logo in various formats (light, dark, with/without text), business cards, pamphlet templates, etc. and eventually will redo our marketing website.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1595187142952869889?success','-',7,'United States','San Francisco',400.000,'fixed',320.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 22:55:19',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
(2836,'2D animator for stories',2,'We are looking for a creative animator to develop excellent visual frames with 2D techniques. Your work will give life to storylines and characters in films.\r\n\r\nAnimators possess a creative eye and artistic aptitude. They can easily turn a script or a concept into an impressive computer-generated animation. To excel in this role, you must be highly skilled in Animate cc or Flash.\r\n\r\nAnimator responsibilities are:\r\n- Understanding storylines to create excellent animation\r\n- Creating drawings electronically and by hand\r\n- Incorporating images with special effects\r\n- communicate with the team in a daily basis','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0197aad1c2ea89b176','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0197aad1c2ea89b176',7,'United States','Larnaca',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2022-11-22',1,'2022-11-22',1,'fixed price',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-22 22:56:42',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
