(2846,'Mascot character creation',2,'Hello there,\r\n\r\nI need to create a cartoon-style mascot for a website. He will accompany visitors on a website\'s different pages, banners, etc.\r\n\r\nIt will be a dog mascot. Not a specific breed, but a generally a nice looking dog :)\r\n\r\nI have three ideas for the Role of that mascot:\r\n1) Employee - dog wearing a branded baseball hat with the logo and a shirt with the name tag on the chest (Similar to those guys who help you in the electronics shops)\r\n2) Adventurer / Indiana Jones - Basically Indiana Jones, but DOG.\r\n3) Superhero dog - with a logo on the chest, wearing a cape.\r\n\r\nI am not sure what idea will look better, so it would be good to start with raw sketches for each idea and decide what we will take in development.\r\n\r\nProbably I will need a couple of different poses for the final Character and maybe some additional elements/objects drawn in the same style.\r\n\r\nCharacter mood: Not very childish, but still cute looking. Serious but still funny. Definitely not an aggressive Bodybuilder dog like all those football mascots...So something in the middle. Website auditory is only 18+.\r\n\r\nPants: Not sure, but I think it must be without pants to still look like an animal, but have a human-shaped figure as well, but not 100% human shape.\r\n\r\nI attached some good examples of moods, that can fit...\r\n\r\nPlease provide your similar works and provide your estimations (price/time) for a raw sketch and for character development.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01c620c6b59c91a8c3/apply/','Na',7,'United States','Tallinn',30.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-11-23',1,'2022-11-23',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-23 14:55:50',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
