(2858,'Book cover design',2,'Creative and dynamic book cover designer required.\r\n\r\nI am seeking a creative and dynamic book cover designer who can create for me the artwork for an important book I have written. The requirements of the project are:\r\n\r\n- You will use the attached image for the book cover\r\n- The dimensions of the front cover will be 225mm x 150mm (spine width to be supplied later)\r\n- I will require a hi-resolution (300dpi) front cover .jpeg.\r\n- I will require a hi-resolution PDF full cover jacket file ready for print.\r\n- Once the initial front cover design is complete I will require you to add rear book text, spine text and also the insertion of a bar code and ISBN number which I will supply.\r\n- Once the job is complete I will require a transfer of copyright agreement form to be signed which transfers the rights to the cover and design to myself.\r\n- I will require 2 weeks full email support and alterations as required after the final files are delivered.\r\n- The time-frame for this project is a maximum of 7 days.\r\n- Full details of the style, branding and title will be sent once the successful candidate is selected.\r\n\r\nTitle :\r\n\r\nComment vendre rapidement et le plus cher possible votre maison ?\r\n\r\nSub title :\r\n\r\nToutes les méthodes détaillées\r\n\r\nAuthor :\r\n\r\nChristian Perron','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011f7e088fa3a2e5a3','no',7,'United States','paris',50.000,'fixed',250.000,'2022-11-23',1,'2022-11-23',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-23 15:36:10',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
