(2880,'Menu Re-Design using existing branding',2,'Hello, we are a Mediterranean restaurant that needs a menu re-design utilizing existing branding. See attached existing menu.\r\nWe are looking to utilize more imagery within the menu, as well as highlighting specific top-selling items on the menu.\r\nRe-structuring of the menu is needed as well since the inside of the Z-fold menu looks cluttered and too \"text heavy\" on the eyes.\r\nThe menu feels cluttered in the center but too spacious on the outside pages.\r\nOverall, a major re-design of the menu is required to make it more symmetrical between text, imagery, spaces and top-selling dish highlights.\r\nAdditional work thereafter includes:\r\n- re designing the catering menu.\r\n- creating a \"Lamb Shank Weekend Special\" Banner.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1595457372978679809?success','-',7,'United States','Walnut Creek',2000.000,'fixed',1750.000,'2022-11-23',1,'2022-11-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-23 16:42:56',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
