(2882,'Powerpoint Template - Retro Gaming Mario Bros',2,'Theme of event is \'Magic is Made\' and will be company convention. This presentation is specifically \'Raise your game\' and presenter is wanting a retro-gaming, mario bros, themed powerpoint template. Make sure the use of characters, symbols and fonts, is available. We don’t want just a simple background.\r\n\r\nOpportunity to build basic template and possibly continue work with the presenter to customize final presentation for additional bonus.\r\n\r\nNeed template developed by 12/2, so quick turnaround needed. Can\'t be too basic or cheesy, needs to be vibrant, action-oriented, and if possible, include some magic/ghost/harry-potter-esque elements to help tie into overall event theme.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1595460060983189505?success','-',7,'United States','Charlotte',500.000,'fixed',400.000,'2022-11-23',1,'2022-11-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-23 17:00:03',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
(2883,'Package Designer Needed',2,'We are in the process of launching three new products/services and are in need of a designer to develop creative. A project brief will be provided to the selected candidate with all relevant information.\r\n\r\nThis project is for a few go-to-market design assets and if the team likes it, we will prioritize you for a project to develop several additional go-to-market assets for upcoming lines of businesses we\'re launching in the next few weeks.\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\n-Packaging design options for (3) medical products/services\r\n-Instruction design options for (3) accordion instruction manuals\r\n-Insert options for (1) thank you/company information card\r\n\r\nSuccessful candidates will have the following:\r\n-Strong attention to detail\r\n-Effective and efficient work\r\n-Designers with previous experience creating product assets (packaging, inserts, instructions etc.) or transferable skills is preferred\r\n\r\nTo submit a proposal for this project, please send your design portfolio, resume and a brief summary why this particular project sounds interesting to you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~016aeb949eaa8261f9/apply/','Na',7,'United States','Toronto',80.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-11-23',1,'2022-11-23',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-23 17:04:04',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
