(2885,'Graphic Designer - UI/UX',4,'Graphic Designer – UI/UX\r\n\r\nFixtman LLC., is a Texas based firm providing technical services within USA. Services include furniture assembly, fitness equipment assembly, tv mounting, wall hanging, appliance installation, remodelling, home security and IT services.\r\n\r\nWe are currently looking to hire someone for the position of Graphic Designer – UI/UX.\r\nGraphic designer should be creative and passionate to work for our Company (FixTman LLC). We will provide an opportunity to explore creative space and gain more knowledge in design. Focus will be on providing a graphical front-end visual design for our company to allow for a better and well development user experience and content creation.\r\n\r\nDuties and Responsibilities:\r\n1. Creating Brand book containing Logo, color pallet, Patterns and all other related items.\r\n2. Work with the marketing team and create related material for their plans\r\n3. Create designs and assets for our multiple platforms\r\n4. Concept and layout development\r\n5. Content creation:\r\n- Some designs for posts, reels and stories(Instagram, Facebook, Pinterest, Twitter)\r\n- Developing strategy with marketing team\r\n6. Contribute ideas and design artwork\r\n7. Produce new ideas and concepts\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\n1. Should possess the following:\r\n- Qualification in Graphic design\r\n- Proficiency in UI/UX\r\n- Passion for graphic design\r\n- Experience in graphic design and web/mobile/App frontend design\r\n- Skills in creating special landing pages and pop ups for website\r\n- Skills in Adobe products\r\n- Corel draw (optional)\r\n2. Must have 3-5 years of related experience and/or training\r\n3. Bachelor’s Degree in Computer Programming, Information Technology or Computer Science\r\n4. Must understand both aesthetical and technical sides of related work\r\n5. Highly motivated to create new approaches\r\n6. Must be creative, strategic and possess great sense of team work and collaboration\r\n7. Strong organization and time management skills\r\n8. Ability to learn quickly or work independently or as a team','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1595462576582279169','NA',7,'United States','Plano',30.000,'fixed',30.000,'2022-11-23',1,'2022-11-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-23 17:05:20',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
