(2919,'Redraw and Reimagine Logo, Create logo intro video',2,'I have a logo that I need to make two options for:\r\n- I need the same logo redrawn in vector, it can be slightly different (maybe no embossing and drop shadow) but needs to have the same general feel. There is no high res version of the logo available, only the screenshot attached.\r\n\r\n- I want a more modern version of the logo, it should still have the same basic elements (circles, torch, Bible) cross, text) but you can make updates to make it cleaner and more up-to-date (I am going to try to sell the client on the up to date logo, but they may just want the redraw). We could make one version the same color scheme but it should also work well in black only.\r\n\r\nOnce the final logo is drawn and decided on, I need a small intro video (bumper video) that can be used.\r\n\r\nAttached are the old logo (very low resolution) and the old bumper video. Please let me know if you have any questions about the requirements. We will start with the redraw of the old logo, then move on to the \'reinvention\' of it, and finally the bumper video. Thanks!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1595502104817557505?success','-',7,'United States','Bluffton',150.000,'fixed',120.000,'2022-11-23',1,'2022-11-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-23 19:40:40',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
