(2926,'Illustrator for various T-Shirt Design elements',2,'Hello there, my name is Linus and I am looking for an Illustrator to help me out with some design ideas. Currently I use the vector platform vexels.com to download vectors that I then combine with text and other elements to create designs that then will be sold online.\r\n\r\nThe job is only for design/vector illustration and not for the creation of a complete t-shirt design with text.\r\n\r\nI have many vector/design ideas that are not available or already used thousands of times. Thats why I hope to find you, a passionate illustrator/designer that is skilled in various illustration types!\r\n\r\nI have included several images of vectors/designs that I have used in the past and if you think that you are able to produce a similar quality of work then feel free to send me a message.\r\n\r\nI hope to make this a long term relationship in which I deliver several design ideas to you every month.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested please take a look at my reference designs/vectors and then send me a short portfolio of the type of work that you have done in the past.\r\n\r\nThank you very much!\r\n\r\nBest Regards,\r\nLinus','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1595506955344535552?success','NA',7,'United States','Minden',50.000,'Open this select menu',50.000,'2022-11-23',1,'2022-11-23',1,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-23 19:59:01',NULL,6,3,NULL,143),
