(2928,'Package Designer Needed',2,'We are in the process of launching three new products/services and are in need of a designer to develop creative. A project brief will be provided to the selected candidate with all relevant information.\r\n\r\nThis project is for a few go-to-market design assets and if the team likes it, we will prioritize you for a project to develop several additional go-to-market assets for upcoming lines of businesses we\'re launching in the next few weeks.\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\n-Packaging design options for (3) medical products/services\r\n-Instruction design options for (3) accordion instruction manuals\r\n-Insert options for (1) thank you/company information card\r\n\r\nSuccessful candidates will have the following:\r\n-Strong attention to detail\r\n-Effective and efficient work\r\n-Designers with previous experience creating product assets (packaging, inserts, instructions etc.) or transferable skills is preferred\r\n\r\nTo submit a proposal for this project, please send your design portfolio, resume and a brief summary why this particular project sounds interesting to you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1595507219599319041?success','-',7,'United States','Toronto',80.000,'perhour',64.000,'2022-11-23',1,'2022-11-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-23 20:00:08',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
