(2934,'Taco Turtle',2,'Taco Turtle!\r\n\r\nTo start, we will need to create a logo that we will then insert into a larger seamless pattern.\r\nThe logo should contain:\r\nTwo Turtles to resemble the Ying Yang symbol. (picture attached- \'yinyang\')\r\nBoth Turtles have taco shells instead of their normal shell (with taco fixin\'s spilling out)\r\nEach Turtle is taking a bite out of the tail end of the other Turtles taco shell.\r\nWe will want to repeat this logo in one alternate color scheme.\r\n\r\nOnce the logo is created we will want to recreate the seamless pattern that resembles the attached picture titled seamless Sugarskull pattern\' and add the logo in.\r\n\r\nHere are the details for how we want the over all pattern to shape up:\r\n\r\nIn the attachments you will find some photos depicting smaller details that I would like to change to make this design uniquely ours.\r\n\r\nFor the picture titled \'sugar skull\', please replace the entire image with taco turtle color scheme 1.\r\n\r\nFor the picture titled \'dotted circle and snow flake\', please replace the entire image with taco turtle color scheme 2.\r\n\r\nFor the picture titled \'heart&circle\', please change the circle to a sun and the heart to a cactus.\r\n\r\nFor the picture titled \'heart&drops\', please change the heart to a sombrero and the drops to lime wedges.\r\n\r\nFor the picture titled \'flower&stem\', please change the flower icons to hops strands. I\'ve also included a picture of hops strands for reference.\r\n\r\nAll of the other smaller images and icons can be replicated. If minor changes are made to the icons themselves, that is fine, but keep the placement consistent with the layout in the original print as it adds a lot of volume to the over all design.\r\n\r\nThe photo titled \'Taco Turtle Color Palate\' provides a reference for the colors we would like represented in this design.\r\nTwo exceptions- please make one (or both if it looks good) turtles sea-foam green so it contrasts with the orange.\r\nPlease experiment with adding some purples into the color scheme as well.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01862e7028423fdbd8/apply/','Na',7,'United States','Denver',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2022-11-23',1,'2022-11-23',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-23 20:31:08',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
