(2954,'Social Media Video Editor',2,'FORMATION. Media, a digital marketing agency for artists and lifestyle entrepreneurs, is looking for a freelance video editor that specializes in short-form video for social media.\r\n\r\nWe have several clients that want to tell their stories through Instagram Reels, TikTok, and YouTube shorts. Generally, they send us the footage and we edit the video down to one-minute, adding captions, transitions, interesting cuts, etc. to make the videos engaging for social media.\r\n\r\nHow We Work\r\nWe currently have roughly 30 hours per week that can be filled, and we expect more by 2023. As new projects arise, we will present our freelancers with the scope and they can accept or decline based on availability.\r\n\r\nWe\'re fully remote. Our standard operating hours are 10am-6pm EST. We do have certain clients that have tighter turnaround times, but we don\'t require our freelancers to work any set hours, just meet deadlines. We do request that you set up one hour per day to be reachable for immediate questions.\r\n\r\nPreferred Skills\r\n- Adobe Creative Suite\r\n- Knowledge of social media video optimization\r\n- Graphic Design\r\n\r\nPlease provide examples of your work with your submission to be considered.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016f21d16fcd8bf694','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016f21d16fcd8bf694',7,'United States','Riverton',55.000,'perhour',55.000,'2022-11-23',1,'2022-11-23',1,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-23 21:17:37',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
