(3053,'Logo and Brand Design for Ice Cream Company',2,'We need help creating a logo and a pint container design for our company \"Hound Dog Creamery\"\r\n\r\nOur company makes ice cream with organic and fair-trade ingredients, and our current packaging features our mascots and two dogs Kingsley and Watson.\r\n\r\nFor our logo: We are hoping for a simple line illustration (color optional) featuring the two dogs and the company name. The goal is for this logo to be easily read and usable on everything from Pints, and business cards, to merchandise.\r\n\r\nFor the packaging: We\'re hoping to achieve something fun and colorful that mentions our use of quality ingredients. Our naming convention for our flavors should be included \"Ain\'t Nothing But_____________\" Both a full pint and lid design are needed. There should be room left for a standard Nutrition facts label as well.\r\n\r\nHoping to receive vector assets with the final deliverable as well.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1597313702584324097','NA',7,'United States','United States',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2022-11-28',1,'2022-11-28',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-28 19:38:14',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(3054,'Website Design - Landing Page & 3 Tabs',4,'I need a landing page created for an online consignment store/service.\r\n\r\nI run an online consignment business. We list household items for customers and then pay them a commission for the sales we generate from listing those items. Those items are typically listed on eBay, Mercari, Poshmark, Facebook Marketplace, and a few others.\r\n\r\nThis website is designed to be an attention getter to bring awareness to the brand. We\'d like for the landing page to explain who we are and what we do.\r\n\r\nOne tab will be an about section.\r\n\r\nThe other tab will be a consignment section explaining how it works and what the pay structure is like.\r\n\r\nThe third tab will be a contact us and scheduling section to coordinate visits.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1597314997322641409','NA',7,'United States','Lawrence',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-11-28',1,'2022-11-28',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-28 19:43:20',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
