(3056,'Web Design/Animator',4,'We are seeking a conceptual web designer/animator to help us find a voice and visual style for our agency’s new website. You will collaborate with our creative team to create web animations (mostly for the hero section and pursuing content blocks) that will blend in cohesively with the graphic style developed for the website.\r\n\r\nYour responsibilities on this project will be to conceptualize, design, and animate the hero section of the homepage in line with the graphic style that has been developed. We’re looking for highly skilled and experienced designers in that area specifically — please provide portfolio or examples of past work.\r\n\r\nAlthough we’re missing a precise visual direction, we have an idea of what we’re looking to achieve. Here are some examples of relevant inspiration:\r\nhttps://deveb.co/\r\nhttps://boomexagency.com\r\nhttps://kromad.com\r\nhttps://rno1.com\r\nhttps://www.hardworkclub.com\r\n\r\nWe’d love to see your more recent and most captivating work.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Wordpress\r\n- Figma\r\n- Elementor','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1597317908343132161?success','-',7,'United States','Miami',100.000,'perhour',80.000,'2022-11-28',1,'2022-11-28',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-28 19:55:04',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
(3057,'2D Animation Using Krita',2,'I need the following:\r\n\r\n1. (4) characters designed in Krita (boy, girl, whale, dolphin) ---I have 4 characters already completed.\r\n\r\n2. Create an image storyboard for me to give feedback on and then approve.\r\n\r\n3. Animate a 3-minute animated video with sfx. (I will provide voices and music)\r\n\r\n\r\n* You can use the files exported from Krita in Adobe After Effects.\r\n\r\n* All work must be 100% custom design. \r\n\r\n* No white-board animation, corporate videos, or clip-art.\r\n\r\n\r\n--- Please only submit examples of animated stories with characters speaking.\r\n\r\n--- Please share only beautiful, custom-designed characters & animation created from scratch. \r\n\r\n--- Please do not submit clip-art animation or corporate videos. \r\n\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1973258','-',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2022-11-28',1,'2022-11-28',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-28 20:04:28',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
(3058,'Shipping box packaging design',2,'Hello all,\r\n\r\nwe would like a shipping package design made for our products (dog chews inside milk cartons) that has our brand identity. attached you will find out branding guidelines, assets, visuals, cartons (that the product will be in). 3 skus, 3 designs. In the attached die cut you will find the shipping box die cut and the card insert die cut (that holds the product in place)\r\n\r\n\r\n- Each design should incorporate the main color of each sku. (See branding guidelines for color codes and visual references)\r\n- Cmyk color profile for all designs\r\n- Please follow branding guidelines closely\r\n- Include sku barcodes on packaging\r\n- IMG_5658.jpg is for visual reference only','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01f50b8ebfae9ebc35','no',7,'United States','Meridian',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2022-11-28',1,'2022-11-28',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-28 20:07:46',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
