(3076,'Looking for a digital artist who can make designs fast',2,'I\'m looking for a graphic designer who can pump out designs fast based on the elements I provide. You don\'t have be a great artist for this job. You just need to be able to take what I give you and turn them into good looking background paper or other designs fast, and do it digitaly. I\'m NOT looking for a traditional artist who does everything on paper or canvas.\r\n\r\nFor example, I will give you some vintage paper as well as coffee stains and old scripts PNG files, then it\'s your job to add some of these PNG files on the vintage paper and choose the right blending mode to make the new design look aesthetic. That\'s 1 design. And then you will adjust the colours (hues saturations etc..) to turn the 1 design into many different new designs.\r\n\r\nHere is an example that represents the final result I\'m looking for:\r\nhttps://www.etsy.com/ca/listing/598549102/blue-ephemera-digital-paper-instant?ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=digitalcurio&ref=sr_gallery-1-29&pro=1&sts=1&organic_search_click=1\r\n\r\nhttps://www.etsy.com/ca/listing/599001526/turquoise-ephemera-digital-paper-instant?click_key=1137acffab02c3d4acff183eb0b41897b1f66029%3A599001526&click_sum=0ab547ec&ga_search_query=Ephemera%2Bdigital%2Bpaper&ref=shop_items_search_17&pro=1&sts=1\r\n\r\nPlease apply with revenant portfolio. Thanks!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1597334623628685313','NA',7,'United States','Calgary',15.000,'Open this select menu',15.000,'2022-11-28',1,'2022-11-28',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-28 21:02:17',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
