(3081,'Looking for a Elementor/Wordpress EXPERT for constant development of sites',3,'Hello,\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a new web developer as the last one didn\'t have the skills able to create the custom site we want. Our designer has already created a mock-up of our site we just need someone to put it all together with all the functions we desire.\r\n\r\nThere are two tasks that are PRIORITY and need to be done first and foremost. If you take a look at the additional project files under Task List you will find the jobs.. If you think you are capable of getting this done and have the required skill then please apply.. If you are someone who wants to waste our time, do not bother. We need someone to start RIGHT AWAY. This task needs to be accomplished right away and we can discuss further work. We are a company building many sites looking for a solid member to help us with the web design.\r\n\r\nPlease take a good look at our current site at: buybulkshrooms.com\r\n\r\nBE HONEST. DON\'T TELL ME YOU CAN DO WORK YOU CANNOT. TIME WASTERS DO NOT APPLY.\r\n\r\nThank you for taking the time to read our proposal.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nJustin Stevens','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1597334266483699713','NA',7,'United States','Vancouver',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2022-11-28',1,'2022-11-28',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-28 21:11:10',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
