(3088,'Web developer Wordpress/ Laravel - SEO expert',3,'We are in the process and rebranding which includes brand name change and domain change. We are looking for someone to help us in the process for this to not alter Organic SEO progress we have made thus far. It is also the opportunity to review on page and technical SEO and have a new website properly optimized for mobile and SEO.\r\n\r\nThe key skill that we will need to vet for this position is technical SEO knowledge.\r\n\r\n1) Website (WordPress Developer) Responsibilities include:\r\n-Maintain AWS EC2 instance that provides hosting for the website.\r\n-Handle development of a custom WordPress theme that is used for the website, including but not limited to template updates, custom post types, custom fields, and custom theme functions.\r\n-Manage and maintain community plugins on the WordPress application that are critical to the operation of the website.\r\n-Handle deployment of changes from your local development environment to the production environment.\r\n\r\n2)Application (Laravel/PHP Developer)\r\n-Maintain AWS EC2 instance that provides hosting for the application.\r\n-Have full command over the PHP language and familiarity with the Laravel Framework and the MVC methodology.\r\n-Develop new features on the application, working with the client on the requirements and establishing a roadmap for the build of the feature.\r\n-Troubleshoot bugs that might occur on the application in existing and new features/functionality.\r\n-Handle deployment of changes from your local development environment to the production environment.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1597341302221422593','NA',7,'United States','Flushing Queens',50.000,'Open this select menu',50.000,'2022-11-28',1,'2022-11-28',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-28 21:27:57',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
