(3090,'Developer needed for web scraping and API integration for internal business tool',3,'We are a start-up short term rental (Airbnb co-hosting) management company. We are in need of a developer to help with 2 projects\r\n\r\nFIRST PROJECT: Lead generation - We want an small script preferably with a GUI that can be run multiple times and can be run on a schedule.\r\n\r\n1. Scrap Airbnb\r\n+ Address of property in a specified geographic location\r\n+ Name of host\r\n+ Put results in a table #1\r\n\r\n2. Run a script that will do the following:\r\nFrom table #1, pull only properties that are managed by individuals and not companies. Create another table #2 with the specific data.\r\n\r\n3. The purpose of the list is to contact the individual host and offer our management services. It would be nice to automate the Contact Host process.\r\na. Only on property profiles that are managed by individuals, click on \"Contact Host\" button.\r\nb. In the \"Still have questions? Message the Host\" field, put a pre-written message offering our services.\r\nc. Send message.\r\n\r\nSECOND PROJECT: Short Term Rental Market Data\r\nWe want to build an internal market data gathering app similar to Airdna.co. It will be used internally to gauge market viability for a property. However, we do want to make available some statistics to potential clients who are thinking of using their property as a short term rental.\r\nPull Airbnb market data like avg daily rates, occupancy rate, active rentals, property sizes, amounts of properties per size, etc.\r\n\r\nWe will be looking for a long term relationship with this developer. Our goal is to create an internal tool for our business that will be pulling data from multiple sources and will require API integration. We are open to low-code solutions.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1597340663770378241','NA',7,'United States','Phoenix',25.000,'Open this select menu',25.000,'2022-11-28',1,'2022-11-28',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-28 21:28:48',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
