(3092,'Redesign Logo and Brand Identity',2,'Looking for an expert to redesign our AVAN Mobility logo to be more modern and representative of our business.\r\n\r\nAVAN Mobility manufactures and sells wheelchair-accessible vans and mobile medical vans in the USA. Our sister company, MoveMobility, does the same in Canada.\r\n\r\nThe look and feel of the brand is to be professional, clean, and modern. The wheelchair icon is no longer relevant to the brand.\r\n\r\nWe are open to changes in the colour theme but would like to stick to black and blue as in the current logo, where possible.\r\n\r\nScope of the job:\r\n- Create new logo\r\n- Create brand guidelines and identity\r\n- Create style guide\r\n- Create social media post templates (Canva)\r\n- Create document templates/letterhead (Word)\r\n\r\nThe logo and brand identity created as a result of this project will be included on website and all other digital marketing media.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b09c5e5abad220ab','no',7,'United States','Winnipeg',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2022-11-28',1,'2022-11-28',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-28 21:37:24',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
