(3236,'High Quality Web Content',5,'need high-quality Web content for local business websites.\r\n\r\n\r\nYou must be a native English writer\r\n\r\nAll Articles are to be written in American English\r\n\r\nThe articles are to be written with perfect Grammer and spelling.\r\n\r\nAll articles must be unique and pass Copyscape as well as our international plagiarism checks\r\n\r\n\r\nThe pages are not just random blog posts, But must encourage the visitor to call the business. The page must talk about the service and the company. The pages are for Junk Removal and Garbage Removal company.\r\n\r\n\r\nAbout Us - This page will be about the company and service provider\r\n\r\nJunk Removal Brooklyn NYC\r\n\r\nGarbage Removal\r\n\r\nFurniture disposal \r\n\r\nConstruction debris removal\r\n\r\n\r\nThe page will need to be between 800 to 1000 words\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is the first of many projects I will need done. I am looking for a writer that I can use on a regular basis. We usually need 5 - 10 articles a month for a different project.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease send samples of your work.\r\n\r\n\r\nAlso in your response please add the word TipTop so that I know you read the entire Job post','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1975598?apply=true','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-11-30',1,'2022-11-30',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-30 20:29:56',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
