(3251,'Squash Sport - Logo Design',2,'I am a squash professional and coach. Squash has been part of my life since I was old enough to hold a racket. I have coached and trained with the world\'s top players, including Nour ElSherbini world #1. I run a business based in Maryland coaching top US junior players on the East coast, and around the country. I am passionate about cultivating a love for this sport. I have recently rebranded and started my own club. I have a company name and am looking for a talented designer who can build a stylish logo for my new brand. I have a few ideas to offer but in general I\'m looking for someone who can craft the spirit of my sport on paper. This contract may also lead into more work with brand identify/ website, etc.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1598064772733071361?success','https://trello.com/b/eh32Y1Pm/task-list-arturo-digital/member/hasnain143',7,'United States','Baltimore',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-11-30',1,'2022-11-30',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-30 21:23:27',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
