(3268,'Creative Graphic Designer Needed for Banners, Ads, info graphics + More For Apparel Company',2,'We need to find and interview for long term ongoing work project for a mens apparel and lifestyle brand. We pride ourselves on art based design for our prints and therefor any graphic design work needs to be top notch, creative, super clean and clear and concise but ultimately serve to function in our most pressing need which is to continuously increase sales and improve our brand identity. We are a clothing brand based on travel and fun experiences.\r\n\r\nAt the beginning you will be working with Jeff - CEO and Richie - Head Designer to apply our branding to a number of new product graphics, website banners, advertisements and emails. We will start with some simple banners for our website. We will then develop the rest of our banners to have the same feel and identity while maintaining uniquness between them. Color schemes - messaging, use of space, wording etc are all crucial for this. You can refer to Roark.com and howlerbros.com for examples of similar brands that are doing a great job in this space.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe need banners that are responsive to insert on our product pages collection pages and homepage. Most are very simple with text maybe a few graphics like the attached\r\n\r\nWe are growing quickly looking for an ongoing relationship to help with general graphic design going forward.\r\n\r\nIf you feel you are a right fit for us please provide examples of applicable existing work preferably showing the skills above and any other work you feel is relevant to our company and job types mentioned.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nRichie','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1598068586139742209','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1598068586139742209',7,'United States','none',55.000,'perhour',55.000,'2022-11-30',1,'2022-11-30',1,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-11-30 22:32:05',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
