(3335,'Build Website for Podcast',2,'Hi! My name is Sarah, co-host of the podcast, Screen Cares. My partner and I are looking for someone to help build a new website. The current site is hosted through Podbean and is clunky, and not as functional as we\'d like. https://www.screencares.com\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for a new website that has our current content migrated, but is cleaner and works better on mobile devices and super easy to navigate with tabs, etc.\r\n\r\nWe\'d also like to have a bio/about us page, a clear location where listeners could drop audio, submit feedback, and contact us, links to our social media, and to figure out a way to include episodes and related content.\r\n\r\nWe are thinking of a couple different ways for listeners to be able to search through our episodes-- either by theme, title, or Screen Shares Rating and would love for the new website to incorporate one or both of those methods.\r\n\r\nLastly, our second season will launch around March 7, so we\'d love for the new site to be up and running before then.\r\n\r\nWe\'d love to be able to update the website ourselves after this is built, but possibly with occasional support afterwards.\r\n\r\nThanks for considering!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1598359207452160001?success','NA',7,'United States','Palmetto Bay',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-12-01',1,'2022-12-01',1,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-01 16:52:53',NULL,6,3,NULL,143),
