(3374,'Design webinar slides in Canva',2,'We\'re looking to hire a webinar presentation designer to create my slides in Canva.\r\n\r\nI have the entire webinar script mapped out and am asking you only to put the BOLDED words on the slide and choose coordinated images that use coordinating colors, include women, coffee shops, or laptops. Working women, but not corporate. Women that look like they work for themselves, flexible, at home.\r\n\r\nThe design should follow this format:\r\n\r\nFor Fonts -\r\nHeadlines: Bebas Neue - uppercase\r\nSubheadlines: Glacial Indifference - bold\r\nBody Text: Glacial Indifference\r\n\r\nColors -\r\nBackground Options: #F0F8F5 or #FFFFFF\r\nAccent Colors: #D3EAE1 or #000000\r\nEmphasized Text: #1FA3AA\r\n\r\nThis is an example presentation for inspiration attached as a file.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for a professional and clean, looking presentation','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1598350625858514945?success','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1598350625858514945?success',7,'United States','Bellingham',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2022-12-01',1,'2022-12-01',1,'fixed price',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-01 19:35:42',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
(3375,'Illustrator Needed: Line drawings to simply convey complex business psychology concepts',2,'I own a consulting firm (www.theoutstandingcompany.com) and we are looking for someone to take complex business psychology ideas, definitions, etc. and turn them into easy to understand graphics. There are several Instagram accounts that represent what we\'re hoping to achieve:\r\n\r\n@valuethe.mind\r\n@mmindnote\r\n@neuronvisuals\r\n@ecom.paths\r\n@concisevisuals\r\n\r\nAn example of a more complex topics would be trait entitlement vs. state entitlement:\r\n\r\nTrait entitlement = I exist, therefore I deserve special treatment and priority\r\nState entitlement = I perceive that I gave something up in a specific context and therefore deserve special treatment or priority\r\n\r\nI also would like to know if that information is enough to create something from, or if you\'d need more, so that I can ensure efficient communication.\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1598359031925547009?success','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1598359031925547009?success',7,'United States','Santa Monica',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-12-01',1,'2022-12-01',1,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-01 19:37:51',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
