(3404,'Edit YouTube Thumbnail Templates',2,'In our Canva account, we\'ve created four templates for YouTube video thumbnails: Guitar, Piano, Bass, Drums. Each template needs a minor cosmetic updates:\r\n\r\n1) increase size/visibility of the section that says Note-For-Note (Instrument) Transcription\r\n2) increase size/visibility of the section with the artist/band name\r\n3) increase size/visibility of our logo\r\n\r\nOnce complete, you\'ll need to edit the templates to create 60 YouTube Thumbnails. Editing necessary:\r\n1) Edit Song Name\r\n2) Edit Artist or band name\r\n3) Edit artist or band photo (if band, photo must be of entire band) - photos can be pulled from artist or band\'s official social media, or google images\r\n4) Take a screen shot of the relevant sheet music for the video (in our google drive folder) and edit the sheet music image in the template\r\n5) Export all images and file correctly in our library.\r\n6) Upload Thumbnail to correct YouTube video in our YT account\r\n\r\nDetailed description of the process is attached. Will provide more details upon hiring.\r\n\r\nWe will have roughly 500 videos that need thumbnails over the next 3 months, so if work is completed efficiently and correctly, the contract will be extended.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016109d59d1c43ee1e','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016109d59d1c43ee1e',7,'United States','Huntington Beach',55.000,'perhour',55.000,'2022-12-01',1,'2022-12-01',1,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-01 21:12:26',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
