(3492,'WooCommerce Website Development',3,'We are a well established eCommerce company selling imported wine...but with a very outdated website. While we\'re looking to establish a relationship with an IT person for the long term, we are starting with our most immediate need of an intense project developing a new website on WooCommerce and migrating our current content to the new platform. There are apx 500 skus of wine and various products.\r\n\r\nWe want the front end to be as beautifully designed as the backend. Some key functionality will include (but is not limited to):\r\n\r\n•Fed Ex shipping quotes at checkout and printing of shipping labels - or option to pick up.\r\n•Credit Card processing, (PayPal, Apple Pay, Google and Amazon)\r\n•Comprehensive inventory management system for a complex business model. Because we sell wine months before it even arrives at the warehouse, then sometimes store it for customers. It\'s a bit more complex than other business models. This will involve an understanding of our business to create this type of inventory tracking. Products for sale should be displayed with information about whether it\'s in stock and ready to ship or on pre-order.\r\n•Customer accounts storing credit cards and showing purchase history and shipping preferences.\r\n•A well thought out Email sign up strategy\r\n•A sophisticated shopping cart (possibly slide-out) and forgotten cart considerations.\r\n•Gift wrap, card message upsells\r\n•Discount codes\r\n\r\nWe need some flexibility to work with someone as we try out functionality and build/change things that work or don\'t work.\r\n\r\nAs mentioned at the beginning of this post, ideally we\'d like to find someone who can continue to work with us, growing and improving functionality as well as being available for our IT needs. This isn\'t critical - our priority is getting a website functioning and smoothly launched.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1598780231477825536','NA',7,'United States','Ojai',90.000,'perhour',90.000,'2022-12-02',1,'2022-12-02',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-02 20:46:39',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
