(3496,'Build a responsive wordpress site',3,'Background information\r\nIm looking for a creative web designer who can build a website in wordpress\r\nInclude a logo design\r\nWho can review several of my themes and color choices I have and then come up with something similar but I am completely open to creativity of your own\r\nI need the site complete by end of December 2022\r\nIm taking one current website that has 5 different categories of services and splitting half of them off to another site\r\nI have all the content ready\r\nTherefore, it’s an option to clone the existing website that has existing blog, leadership, forms etc and just redesign it for different look and feel and or simply create the new site from scratch\r\nBudget for site plus logo variations ($400)\r\nHosting = godaddy and I can provide a user login for designer\r\nSpecification of use = Business B2B, Design preference = Modern / Tech / creative / professional\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements and desire for this website project\r\n\r\nWordpress - Create site with Wordpress\r\nResponsive - Needs to be responsive for all devices\r\nEcommerce is not necessary, but will want to add woocommerce later\r\nWill need 3 basic forms for contact us and getting started information\r\nContact us form\r\nPost a job form\r\nTell us about your project form\r\nDuplicate page plugin to allow me to clone a page and add additional easily myself in the future\r\nPassword protected area that is used to provide more sensitive “how we do it” information for prospects only.\r\nBlog/Insights posting area that can be segmented by 3 different categories of contributors\r\nTeam and leadership bio posting area\r\nPlugin for Job posting area for job seekers and job posters\r\nLogo creation with a few variations of color once designed so we can use in our various ppt decks\r\nBonus features\r\nWould like a Dark Mode / Light mode switch on website if possible…\r\nReally like Parallax\r\nClient folder area that can be used to store documents for clients with a pw login\r\nCompletion asks:\r\nBy end of December or sooner\r\nColor palette with #s for all colors used for logo and website\r\nSimple directions summary for basic editing (I have medium grade knowledge of editing in wordpress with 3 other websites currently but not a coder','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1598786394873475073','NA',7,'United States','Austin',500.000,'Open this select menu',500.000,'2022-12-02',1,'2022-12-02',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-02 21:10:25',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(3497,'Newsletter Image Design',2,'I am in need of a graphic for a newsletter that will be sent out to our clients weekly.\r\nWe are calling it empowerment. It is designed to keep our current clients informed of what offerings we have for them to choose from as well as spotlight other clients. This is really our way of trying to stay connected to the organizations that we are impacting on a daily basis but don\'t have the opportunity to talk to every single week. I don\'t really know what I am envisioning for the logo. I am looking for something sophisticated, not overly crowded that people will look at and be happy to keep reading this newsletter/clicking into the email to see what we have going on.\r\nI have attached our company logo to this so you have who we are but otherwise, I am open to a fresh look.\r\n \r\n\r\nless\r\nMore/Less about','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011e831b7f77317088','no',7,'United States','Grapevine',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2022-12-02',1,'2022-12-02',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-02 21:13:59',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
