(3517,'Designer I Brand Style Guides Colors',2,'-WHAT WE NEED -\r\n\r\nWe’ve hired a design agency to create our brand guideline. I\'m pretty satisfied with what they’ve done, except for how they picked the principal and secondary colors.  I don’t think that what we have now represents the brand mission.  I’m looking for another designer or agency that would show me other possibilities regarding this aspect.\r\n\r\nIt would be interesting to have the colors apply to a small example. Ex: website skeletons etc.  \r\n\r\nI’m not looking for a full NEW visual brand identity. I want to have new propositions for my brand\'s colors.  You\'ll need to tell us how will need to use those colors across our content (%Primary colors, %secondary colors, %accent colors, %colors in images etc)\r\n\r\nThe easiest way I could explain to you how the project work would be by having a call. I’ll show you the word they’ve done, explain to you our brand vision and how you could help us.\r\n\r\nThe best way of showing you that you\'re a good fit for this job would be to show us example of previous jobs that are not under NDA.\r\n\r\n- HERE IS WHAT THEY’VE DONE SO FAR-\r\n\r\nBrand Guideline\r\nLogos\r\nSafe area\r\nMinimum size\r\nPrincipal use\r\nOther usage\r\nImagotype\r\nIncorrect Use\r\n\r\nThe system\r\nColor\r\nTypography\r\nGrafic\r\nPhotography style\r\n\r\n-REVISION-\r\n\r\nAt least 2 round of revisions\r\n\r\n-NDA-\r\n\r\nNDA is required','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0177aa1120cc3db8ab','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0177aa1120cc3db8ab',7,'United States','Barcelona',55.000,'perhour',55.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 15:00:40',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
(3518,'UX/UI Designer Needed for Web Updates',3,'I am looking to hire a UX/UI designer to help update our existing website and create a few digital assets. If my team likes your work, we will consider you for our new website launch project in the new year.\r\n\r\nWhat we are doing:\r\n- We are expanding our service offering to offer a new type of service and need to update our website to reflect this new service\r\n- Please work off of our existing website and be consistent with our brand\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\n1. A \"\"New Service\"\" banner on our homepage to replace the existing New Service banner. This will go right below the hero banner.\r\n2. Update our hero banner. The content will not change but instead we want to update the hero banner image and possibly edit a CTA button on our hero banner.\r\n3. Update our services section on our home page with an additional icon to represent the new service we offer\r\n\r\nThis project is for a few design assets and if the team likes it, we will prioritize you for a big project to redesign our website.\r\n\r\nCandidate requirements:\r\n- Need candidate to start ASAP and work full-time this week until project completion, looking for this to be completed by end-of-week\r\n- Designers with previous agency experience or creating campaign assets (social, banners, etc.) is preferred\r\n\r\nTo submit a proposal for this project, please send your design portfolio, resume and a brief summary why this particular project sounds interesting to you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1599781751292006401','NA',7,'United States','Toronto',67.000,'perhour',65.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 15:06:11',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
