(3531,'YouTube Thumbnail Designer for Luxury niche needed urgently!!!',2,'I am looking for an experienced thumbnail designer who knows how to create high CTR thumbnails.\r\n\r\nExamples of the type of thumbnails I’m looking for come from 2 channels:\r\n1. https://youtube.com/@MrBeast\r\n2. https://youtube.com/@rebound\r\n\r\nI am currently in the luxury niche on YouTube so I also needed a candidate who can adhere to the following criteria:\r\n\r\n-$5 per thumbnail\r\n-2 thumbnails per week\r\n-example channel: https://youtube.com/@Luxurio\r\n\r\n-I’d also would like to see examples of your work before proceeding towards a long term position.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ea4baebb89c28590','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ea4baebb89c28590',7,'United States','Edmonton',4000.000,'fixed',4000.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'fixed price',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 16:00:03',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
(3532,'Graphic Designer for Finance Related Social Media Posts and Collateral',2,'Looking for a graphic designer capable of creating social media graphics (that occasionally include charts) and sales collateral to brand specifications.\r\n\r\nYou will be provided the copy for a social media post, and your job will be to create a captivating graphic that is on brand to the client\'s requirements.\r\n\r\nOccasionally, you may be asked for larger projects like designing a report, email marketing opt-in. Again, you will be provided with the copy, and your job would be to design the report around it.\r\n\r\nPreferred if you\'re using Adobe InDesign, but Canva is okay as long as you are familiar with image minification and can keep file sizes small, particularly for PDF pieces.\r\n\r\nHow to apply:\r\n\r\n- Please do not send a long cover letter\r\n\r\n- Do not send a resume\r\n\r\n- DO send examples, especially if you have relevant work experience in finance type graphics\r\n\r\n- Do tell me any relevant experience that you have and what software you prefer to use.\r\n\r\nThis is an opportunity for long-term, steady work for the right person.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to reading your application!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011bd3bbd3eefa80f0','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011bd3bbd3eefa80f0',7,'United States','Miami',55.000,'perhour',55.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'hourly price',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 16:01:47',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
