(3539,'Branding Expert Needed for Custom Gifting / Design Website',2,'We are looking for a Brand Identity Consultant to create a new brand identity for a custom gift website. The successful candidate will have experience in creating brand identities and will have an eye for detail, creativity and an understanding of the customer experience.\r\n\r\nThe Brand Identity Consultant will be responsible for designing a new brand identity for the website, including:\r\n\r\n• Developing the brand’s name, logo, slogan, and visual identity\r\n• Developing a website and social media style guide including a color palette\r\n• Working with the client to ensure that the brand’s message is effectively communicated across all communication channels\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will have experience in developing brand identities and will have an understanding of the customer experience. The candidate should also have strong communication skills and the ability to work independently.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this position, please apply with your resume and a portfolio of your work. We look forward to hearing from you. Thank you for your interest.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0173f06a0f187d9d36','no',7,'United States','leeds',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 16:09:59',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
(3540,'Enthusiastic graphic designer for Global Financial Information!',2,'Seeking enthusiastic designer who can create a large fold able\r\nWorld Map with links/lines to world tax havens.\r\nMust be able to think outside of the box.\r\n\r\nThere\'s a website that has done a lot of the research already\r\non what to provide and insert into world map.\r\n\r\nThis map must be able to have print shop print it\r\nand easily fold where there is a front page.\r\n\r\nThank you for your interest!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1599795865982836737','NA',7,'United States','Birmingham',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 16:10:53',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
