(3542,'Graphic Designer for Instagram Ads',2,'We\'re a young edtech startup looking for help creating visuals for our social media advertising program, focused on Instagram Ads.\r\n\r\nYou\'ll be working with our part-time CMO, who has many years of experience with digital ads. You\'ll start with a well-defined project, but there\'s potential for future work as well.\r\n\r\nTo apply, please send over *a few* work samples you think are most relevant to this job.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1599799750598266881?success','https://trello.com/b/eh32Y1Pm/task-list-arturo-digital/member/hasnain143',7,'United States','Princeton',50.000,'Open this select menu',50.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 16:17:19',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
(3543,'Sell Sheet Design Needed for Print Flyer',2,'We need a flyer design that\'s suitable for print. The final design will be printed on 8.5\" x 11\" flyers. We will need a full bleed version and a no-bleed version.\r\n\r\nThis is going to be a sell sheet for two new products that we are offering. We will supply the copy, which is 489 words total. We will also supply the product pictures and logo, as well as brand guidelines such as the fonts and colors that we normally use in our marketing materials.\r\n\r\nIf you need additional materials such as stock photos or backgrounds that need to be purchased, we can purchase them and send them to you.\r\n\r\nWe need you to put everything together in an attractive flyer layout that we can then print out for our customers.\r\n\r\nPlease submit examples of similar flyers you have done in the past along with your application.\r\n\r\nPlease account for multiple revisions when submitting your offer. We will need source files for the final products - full bleed and no bleed.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1599799872481378305?success','--',7,'United States','King of Prussia',150.000,'fixed',150.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'Fix',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 16:17:38',NULL,5,2,NULL,111),
