(3545,'Logo Designer',2,'We are looking for a graphic designer to come up with a logo for our new staffing website. The website will specialize in placing associate dentists with current established ones.\r\n\r\nThe name of the business is Locum Tenens Connections or LT Connections.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for someone who can provide around 3-5 mockups for feedback and a couple of rounds of editing to get what we want. We want to use \"LT Connections\" for the logo.\r\n\r\nWe like more minimalist style logos and something that is easy to recognize. As for colors mostly blue, white, red, and grey but we are open to other options for a talented candidate. Please send us some examples of other logos you have designed in your proposal!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1599800797937778689?success','-',7,'United States','Charlottesville',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 16:21:26',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
