(3553,'Logo for a Sleep Wellness Studio',2,'Somnus Sleep Wellness is a studio that provides psychological therapies and other solutions for clients with sleep complaints. We focus on services strongly backed by scientific data and equip individuals with strategies and skills that will be of lifelong help to their sleep quality.\r\n\r\nWe seek a designer to create an impactful company logo that reflects our branding and core values. We have the following notes as a starting point:\r\n\r\n• We are going for the look of a wellness company and not one that this too medical.\r\n\r\n• The logo should contain the word SOMNUS in a modern sans-serif font.\r\n\r\n• It should also contain an abstract icon that conveys the idea of good rest and sleep. We want to avoid literal depictions of people sleeping and cartoony images (e.g. the SERTA sheep).\r\n\r\n• The colour palette should use calming, cool colours (e.g. baby blue, lavender).\r\n\r\nWe have a mockup from another designer that we\'ll like to work on based on that attached design. Some modifications include changing the base curve into a crescent moon \"bed\" and working with the colour palette attached.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1599803447885508609?success','https://trello.com/b/eh32Y1Pm/task-list-arturo-digital/member/hasnain143',7,'United States','Singapore',30.000,'Open this select menu',30.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 16:31:45',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
