(3555,'Klaviyo Email Designer for eCommerce Fashion Brands',2,'If you’re a great email designer specifically for Klaviyo who is capable of designing attractive emails for flows (welcome series, abandoned checkout, post-purchase emails, etc.) and campaigns (flash sales, collection launches, blog post email campaigns, etc.), then this is for you.\r\n\r\nYou will be required to design highly creative emails in Klaviyo for eCommerce Fashion Brands. Copywriting will be provided.\r\n\r\nMust strictly have the following skills:\r\n- Ability to design highly creative emails in Klaviyo and use platforms like Canva, & Photoshop.\r\n- Convey the brand’s messaging to its audience through creative email designs.\r\n- Have past experience designing emails in Klaviyo for eCommerce Brands.\r\n- Be familiar with eCommerce Flows and Campaigns (Abandoned Cart, Welcome Series, etc.)\r\n- Should be able to deliver designs within 2 days after the copywriting is provided.\r\n\r\nThis will be an ongoing project - you will be copywriting approximately 5-12 campaigns and 3 automation sequences (3-4 emails) per month.\r\n\r\nTo apply,\r\n- Send your portfolio\r\n- Be prepared for a short interview\r\n\r\nSuccessful applicants will have demonstrated their skill with the quality of email designs and past experience working with brands.\r\n\r\nIf you cannot send a relevant portfolio (emails designs previously executed on Klaviyo), do not apply to this job.\r\n\r\nThanks and Good Luck!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~015fc43d93c5fbdfda','no',7,'United States','Toronto',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 16:36:00',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
(3556,'Website Development',3,'We are looking for a development team to build a cloud-based application. The application will be HighschoolBabysitters.com and will match high school students with parents who are looking for babysitters. We have designed the frontend and have a working figma design, clickable prototype, user stories, and high-level database schema definitions. The application consists of roughly 25 pages and serves 3 personas: parents looking for babysitters, babysitters and babysitters’ parents(legal guardians).\r\n\r\nWe would expect the application frontend to be developed in a modern javascript framework, such as React, Node.js, Vue or Angular. The backend should be fully cloud-deployed ideally in a serverless environment utilizing available services for things like relational database, authentication and messaging. Before beginning development, we would like to review proposed technical design and architecture.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a full development team that can complete the project within 60 days from project launch. We will require weekly sprints with online meetings to review and plan the sprints. We will consider fix priced and hourly contracts. Our budget is 12,000 to 15,000 for the full completion of the site. We will be looking at interested groups over the next few weeks and will have a video phone interview with promising candidates during that time. We will select a group to complete the project by in the next two to three weeks. Once you reply with your team qualifications, we will send you our PDF packages that outlines in detail the scope of the project.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1599805075198025729','NA',7,'United States','EVERGREEN',15000.000,'Open this select menu',15000.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 16:38:38',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
