(3567,'Produce Professional Book Covers for my educational book series and lesson plan book',2,'Greetings,\r\n\r\nI have a total of 6 books: A book series that consists of 3 books and a workbook, a childhood biography, and a lesson plan book. I\'m looking for you all to produce eye-catching covers that appeals to a 10-year-old, 23-year-old, and a 40 year old successful/ powerful female business mogul. These covers must have a modern, sophisticated look that\'s serious, cool, and timeless. These books are all about evolution.\r\n\r\nMy idea is for you to take the alien movie photo with that beautiful black background and colorful accenting and lighting, replace the egg with the DNA strand on one of the photos sent and the man and woman off of my old cover on the site and make it mine. Now, show me this and whatever unique ideas and covers you all can come up with. We can come up with colors from there.\r\n\r\nHere\'s the future business site: www.IntransigentMinds.com\r\n\r\nThis will give you a feel of who and what we are about. Along, with the potential printed and e-book covers we may use. What would be the cost and turnaround time for this project? To clarify: 5 Book covers for the series The Process of Becoming (Purpose, Mindset, Discipline, and Insite) and to finish the book cover that\'s attached for The Building Blocks book.\r\n\r\nI look forward to hearing back from you and gaining a greater understanding of your services provided!\r\n\r\nRespectfully,\r\nDe Angelo Moody\r\n\r\nThe Process of Becoming; Discipline\r\n5.5\" x 8.5\" (13.97 x 21.59 cm)\r\nBlack & White on Cream paper\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Process of Becoming; Mindset\r\n5.5\" x 8.5\" (13.97 x 21.59 cm)\r\nBlack & White on Cream paper\r\n77 pages\r\n11,578 words\r\nIntransigent Minds\r\nISBN-13: 978-0989112659\r\nISBN-10: 0989112659\r\n\r\nThe Process of Becoming; Purpose\r\n5.5\" x 8.5\" (13.97 x 21.59 cm)\r\nBlack & White on Cream paper\r\n69 pages\r\n9,366 words\r\nIntransigent Minds\r\nISBN-13: 978-0989112666\r\nISBN-10: 0989112667\r\n\r\nThe Process of Becoming; Insight (Workbook)\r\n5.5\" x 8.5\" (13.97 x 21.59 cm)\r\nBlack & White on Cream paper\r\n138 pages\r\n16,891 words\r\nIntransigent Minds\r\nISBN-13: 978-0989112642\r\nISBN-10: 0989112640\r\n\r\nUn-Broken; To Hell and Back (Child Biography)\r\n6\" x 9\" (15.24 x 22.86 cm)\r\nBlack & White on Cream paper\r\n250 pages\r\n72,040 words\r\nIntransigent Minds\r\nISBN-13: 978-0989112635\r\nISBN-10: 0989112632\r\n\r\nThe Building Blocks of Knowledge, Peace, Happiness & Success (Lesson)\r\n8.5\" x 11\" (21.59 x 27.94 cm)\r\nBlack & White on Cream paper\r\n149 pages\r\n15,881 words\r\nIntransigent Minds\r\nISBN-13:\r\nISBN-10:','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~013f590f63f91dc2f8','no',7,'United States','COLUMBIA',3000.000,'fixed',3000.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 16:48:03',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
