(3590,'Design a card deck of a toy for kids age 6-9',2,'We are developing a card game for children in the age of 6-9 years and are looking for a\r\n\r\n2D designer to create a compelling design of the playing cards\r\n\r\nYou should also have an understanding of UX processes within a game and design the cards accordingly.\r\n\r\nWe are accepting 5 proposals and work on a first milestone, which is the design sketch of one card and some variations (approx. 3-5 hours).\r\n\r\nWe will select 2 concepts that we want to continue with and will create the full card style with you (approx. 8-10 workdays).\r\n\r\nPlease submit work references of any designs that you had previously created.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to your proposals.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1599819007088332801?success','--',7,'United States','berlin',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 17:33:55',NULL,5,2,NULL,111),
(3591,'Logo for a Sleep Wellness Studio',2,'Somnus Sleep Wellness is a studio that provides psychological therapies and other solutions for clients with sleep complaints. We focus on services strongly backed by scientific data and equip individuals with strategies and skills that will be of lifelong help to their sleep quality.\r\n\r\nWe seek a designer to create an impactful company logo that reflects our branding and core values. We have the following notes as a starting point:\r\n\r\n• We are going for the look of a wellness company and not one that this too medical.\r\n\r\n• The logo should contain the word SOMNUS in a modern sans-serif font.\r\n\r\n• It should also contain an abstract icon that conveys the idea of good rest and sleep. We want to avoid literal depictions of people sleeping and cartoony images (e.g. the SERTA sheep).\r\n\r\n• The colour palette should use calming, cool colours (e.g. baby blue, lavender).\r\n\r\nWe have a mockup from another designer that we\'ll like to work on based on that attached design. Some modifications include changing the base curve into a crescent moon \"bed\" and working with the colour palette attached.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1599818294518857729?success','-',7,'United States','Singapore',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 17:34:02',NULL,6,3,NULL,122),
(3592,'Bakery Store Website',4,'need a simple bakery store website (must Android/IOS friendly) that must include a shopping cart with a checkout through PayPal or Google pay... Must give each customer option for delivery (delivery fee applies) or pick up at our store location.  It also needs to have a back-end to upload edit product images, price and descriptions.  It also needs to have the ability to create usernames and passwords customers but also be able to lock, unlock and delete user accounts. Must have the ability for Admin to leave email messages in each user\'s inbox with the ability to allow User to reply to Admin... Will also need a section on the web page app to advertise special promotions or discount products.\r\n\r\nIn addition, each user should have a profile picture and a history of each of their bakery food orders and the amount of the transaction. There should also be a click button for reordering the same previous menu order.  This app must be user friendly.  Once project is completed it must be uploaded on our webserver tested and fully functional before any funds are released.\r\n\r\n\r\n* Any outrageous prices will be met with no response!\r\n\r\n* Any bids that are falsely misrepresented or changed during the process will be reported to Guru.\r\n\r\n** No amateur developers need apply!\r\n\r\n* 90 Free Tech Support to fix any errors on the the App','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1976511','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'Open this select menu',500.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 17:37:01',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
