(3602,'WordPress website design and development for 3rd party bookkeeping agency',3,'We are a specialized bookkeeping service for insurance sales agents looking for a 3rd party solution to outsource all bookkeeping too.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a well-seasoned agency or professional that can accomplish the following:\r\n\r\nDesign\r\n-Create mood board for project\r\n-Design website concept\r\n-Build website wireframe and mock up\r\n-Present final website design\r\n\r\nDevelopment\r\n-Test initial website design\r\n-Run the website live\r\n-Track and maintain website performance\r\n\r\nIdeally, we would work with an agency or professional for both Design and Development.\r\n\r\nThe website will be used to sell services and a user portal to upload documents and check the status of their accounts.\r\n\r\nTarget Date of Completion\r\nWe would like the site to be live and functional by January 15th','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1599837227325165569','NA',7,'United States','Virginia Beach',75.000,'perhour',75.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 19:02:23',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(3603,'Maintain and update WordPress site using Divi',3,'Please update headshots for the entire Ransom Group team with photos specified by Rachel. There are new team members that must be added to our \"Our Team\" page. Two new team member bios and profiles need to be published and one needs to be created but not published at this time. This will include:\r\n- Photo\r\n- Full Name\r\n- Ransom Group title\r\n- Bio (provided by Rachel)\r\n- Phone number\r\n- Email address\r\n- LinkedIn profile\r\nThe pages should be modeled after the already-existing pages on our site. All email addresses, short bios, LinkedIn profiles, and phone numbers will be provided by Rachel.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, please provide recommendations for the map feature on the \'Our Team\' page in the section \'Where We Are.\' It is currently a PNG file that is edited on Adobe, but we are open to a more user-friendly feature being implemented as a replacement.\r\n\r\nPlease touch base with Rachel prior to beginning work, and feel free to reach out with any questions throughout the process.\r\n\r\nPlease only make the changes specified here.\r\n\r\nPrior to beginning work, the designer will be provided with the standard agreement we use for all third-party partners.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1599840604770136065','NA',7,'United States','Na',100.000,'perhour',100.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 19:03:26',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
