(3605,'Poly Mixer Flyer',2,'Design & Art\r\n\r\nGraphic & Layout Design\r\n\r\n    Flyer Design\r\n    JPEG\r\n\r\nGreetings, I\'m in need of a flyer for a mixer event.  The details are as follows in bold:\r\n\r\n\r\nTampa Bay Polygamy Lovers\r\n             presents\r\n\r\n\r\nPoly Dating Mixer Part 1\r\n\r\nLocation: The Deck Bar & Grille - 5901 Sun BLVD - Saint Petersburg, FL - 33715\r\nDate: Jan 14th 2023\r\nTime: 5:00pm to 9:00pm\r\n\r\n\r\nFREE Admission\r\n\r\nBuy your own food and drinks\r\n \r\n\r\nVisit TheDeckBarandGrille.com to see menu\r\n\r\nLet\'s Get This Poly Started!!\r\n\r\n\r\nMake the flyer red on the top half fading into white on the bottom half. I have some files uploaded to be included on the flyer.  You are welcome to be as creative as you\'d like.  Also, please add a male with two females as poly triad as a watermark, unless you have a better idea for the triad  I would like all vector files, JPEG, PNG, PDF, etc...\r\n\r\nNotice: I will only reply on guru.com site.  Please do not attempt to find my personal email address or social media pages to contact me.  \r\n\r\nThank you very much! :)\r\nAttachments','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1977234','-',7,'United States','-',250.000,'fixed',200.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 19:18:55',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
