(3626,'Hubspot Websites Redesign',3,'Here\'s the type of individual we are looking for:\r\n- Someone who has an eye for design and can give us suggestions and feedback\r\n- Someone who knows how to manage Hubspot with three different unique production sites and three different development sites\r\n- Someone who is OK with changes\r\n- Someone who can teach us best practices for Hubspot CMS\r\n- Someone who can create mockups of pages, themes, and navigation\r\n- Someone who knows how to edit and manage Hubspot website themes\r\n\r\nSome History:\r\n\r\nWe are relatively new to Hubspot after transitioning three unique websites from WordPress. Two of our three sites are fully launched, but we are looking to redesign one of those sites to sure our main site\'s theme, but with different navigation options. Our third site has most all content and navigation in place but needs some design work to make it look better.\r\n\r\nSpecifics:\r\n- Update or clone our current theme and make it useful for our redesigned website\r\n- Work on navigation and page structure for the redesigned site (10 -15 pages). We have most of the content created but need help with design and layout.\r\n- Work on making our relaunched site look nicer. All content is there, but it needs some formatting work to flow better (16 pages).\r\n- Possible ongoing engagement to provide support for our websites.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1599857298831511553','NA',7,'United States','Fort Myers',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 20:05:33',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
