(3629,'Social Media',2,'In order to grow several potential social media platforms, we need someone who can create engaging social media content, create user names and groups, put together packages, and develop different features of each package.  It is your responsibility to write the required information on the bio, about you (tell your story), tagline on a short description, and more for each social media platform.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nYou must have experience including define which products and services each platform should market on their platform. \r\n\r\n\r\nShow us your work, in one of two ways.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWe understand that you may not manage a social media platform, but you can do the job. As part of our hiring process, therefore, you\'ll need to demonstrate your social media platforms and how you gained and grew real followers.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nOR\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAre one or more of your clients social media platforms.  Considering one of the main purposes of the assignment they hired you is to gain them real followers by creating, writing, and posting on their social media platforms, by that being the case, please do not come back with that you signed an NDA with clients. In case you wish to submit theirs, we would like you to show the number of followers they had before you took over and the number of followers they gained upon taking over their social media platforms. \r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIn contrast to some social media, you will not be provided with the admin authority, but one of a page role instead. If you want to write the content and we post it, that is fine as well.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAs a starting point for us to determine which person is the right person to handle all the other social media platforms, you will be given one social media platform to see how well you can perform, so you will only be given that platform to get started. If you are looking to be paid an hourly rate, please do not apply.  \r\n\r\n\r\nWhat is your cost per each that we stated in the first (1st) paragraph?','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1978004','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 20:12:33',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
