(3682,'Book illustrations and cover',2,'Hello!\r\n\r\nWe are looking to hire a freelancer to create illustrations for a novel/book (fiction). As of now, we need the following developed (illustrated):\r\n\r\nCover Page for the book (color)\r\n3-5 illustrations - for different chapters (greyscale)\r\n\r\nWe would really appreciate you spending a couple of minutes on the three links below to get an idea of what we are looking for before applying for this job. Additionally, please type “Space Monkey Mafia” at the top of your proposal. We are looking for people who pay attention to detail.\r\n\r\nTake your time to go through these to send a proper proposal.\r\n\r\nYou will find the following links helpful:\r\n\r\nDescription of the world the novel is set in\r\n\r\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/14-7VXNCFjKoCu813EmRGLytWnRNwbTM2-_znobKgNZU/edit?usp=share_link\r\n\r\n\r\nA short random chapter from the book - Chapter 37 (3 page read)\r\n\r\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1PH-tBvPLd1xtfmDvpAjkoKdsfm_6P4kO2hwEO2QuEcs/edit?usp=share_link\r\n\r\n\r\nDescription to help visualize/illustrate the scene in chapter 37\r\n\r\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1b6tdaufnyQ2WAxvpBg5u6ctYCDdFvwtQyJLAzTUX47k/edit?usp=share_link\r\n\r\nIt would be awesome if you attach or direct us to any relevant illustrations you have done before.\r\n\r\nWe encourage new freelancers on Upwork to apply as well.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions regarding the job description, feel free to ask them in your proposal. In case you are not able to access the links above, please feel free to mention that in your proposal as well.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time,\r\nAnirudh','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01f1eb1a945176189e','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01f1eb1a945176189e',7,'United States','none',55.000,'perhour',55.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'hourly price',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 22:05:52',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
