(3687,'Board of Directors PowerPoint Deck',2,'I need help constructing a deck for a consulting engagement.\r\n\r\nMy company provides fractional CFO and advisory services and I have been engaged by a privately held company to review their: (a) finance team ; (b) review of accounting / finance process (including month end close, AP/AR process, cash forecasting, etc); (iii) evaluation of accounting systems; (c) review of financial reporting process/accuracy; (d) review of annual budgeting process; (e) assessment of accounting controls; (f) creation of future state roadmap.\r\n\r\nI will complete all of the work, analysis, etc. as it relates to the engagement but I am looking for someone with proficiency in PowerPoint and with a business background to help design and lay out the final product (a ppt deck). I will lay out the substance via a combination of a word document writeup and sketching out content in ppt and will expect this partner to lay out in an intuitive, visually appealing, and clear/concise manner.\r\n\r\nI need this work to be completed by 12/23. I will provide contents by 12/14.\r\n\r\nThanks!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01fb54f3b2f2cec895/apply/','Na',7,'United States','Chicago',100.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-12-05',1,'2022-12-05',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-05 22:31:39',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
