(3736,'Simple Logo Animation',2,'We need to animate our company logo. It should be easy and hopefully fun.\r\n\r\nThere are four versions of the logo, so they would all need to be animated. Although, it is only the colours that are different for different uses, so it could be one animation, and then you swap out the assets.\r\n\r\nEssentially the L needs to move out from under the black A. And then the little seedling needs to move up from the L (like it is growing), potentially starting smaller and then reaching this size as it grows out. And then as it reaches full size the two leaves need to bounce a little.\r\n\r\nFinished formats, would need it as a GIF where the above happens.\r\nAlso another looping GIF, where it happens in reverse\r\nAnd then as an MP4 so we can add SFX\r\n\r\n\r\nNote, the A should start off in the middle of the screen, perfectly centred and then move left as the L moves right','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~017dde5f07f125f677','no',7,'United States','London',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2022-12-06',1,'2022-12-06',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-06 17:08:41',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
