(3762,'Landing Page Design Rockstar Needed for Consistent Longterm Work',4,'We\'re a small agency from Florida that specializes in landing page optimization and we\'re at a point where we need more help specifically with landing page projects.\r\n\r\nI am looking for someone who checks ALL of these boxes:\r\n\r\n- You are already familiar with Figma, Adobe XD, or Photoshop (and can show examples of your work)\r\n- You know the basics of conversion optimization best practices\r\n- You have an eye for good design\r\n- You are available during US working hours with at least 5 hours per week of availability\r\n- You are able to turn projects around quickly and can jump into Slack to chat with us as needed\r\n- You are able to take a project and run with it using the kickoff document/brief that we provide\r\n- You can do some custom icon work and custom illustrations if needed\r\n- You can source stock photos from Adobe Stock\r\n- You can provide Adobe XD, Figma, or Photoshop high-fi mockups that we can then get turned into Unbounce pages\r\n- You are an independent contractor (not an agency)\r\n\r\nNOTE: You do not have to be a developer. We will be taking the designs you create and building them in Unbounce. For this job, I\'m mostly interested in a great designer who knows the basics of conversion optimization and can make great mockups. But if you have worked with Unbounce before, let us know as well. That is always a plus.\r\n\r\nIf you check all of these boxes and are excited about consistent work with a growing conversion optimization agency, please apply and let\'s chat! We\'re fun to work with and as you can see from my reviews on Upwork, I try to take very good care of all of our partners.\r\n\r\nThere is lots of opportunity here for the right person with the right skills!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1600213530669346817','NA',7,'United States','Boca Raton',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-12-06',1,'2022-12-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-06 19:43:13',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(3763,'Website Designer',4,'We\'re a music software company based in the USA.\r\n\r\nOur products consist of a Digital Audio Workstation and VST Drum Machine.\r\n\r\nWe\'re in the process of updating our website from Word Press to React.js and need a web designer that can help us build a beautiful theme for the entire website.\r\n\r\nWe need you to nail the graphics for displaying our software using screen captures. You will be required to edit/manipulate SVGs and PNGs of our product to display it as beautifully as possible on the product pages, marketplace, and homepage.\r\n\r\nOther than the product image, the website needs to be fully SVG/CSS and behave like a beautifully designed piece of software.\r\n\r\nBy the end of this, we need many content component ambiances that we can continue to recycle and reuse for the next ten years.\r\n\r\nWhen I mean “Components,” I mean modular blocks that lay out the content nicely and are easy to mix/match, change the order, and edit slightly.\r\n\r\nWe need the following in both Dark & Light themes.\r\n\r\nBreakdown:\r\n1) Global Nav & Footer Theme\r\n\r\n2) Homepage\r\n\r\n3) Blog Hompage.\r\n\r\n4) Individual Blog Article.\r\n\r\n5) My Account.\r\n\r\n6) Product Page themes for our 2 Music Production Software Products and 2 Music Production Courses (These themes should include multiple designed components that can be recycled and reused).\r\n\r\n7) Marketplace that lays out all of the courses nicely with the ability to check out their product pages.\r\n\r\n8) Marketplace for music software that lays out all of the software nicely with the ability to check out their product pages.\r\n\r\n9) Purchase Page\r\n\r\n10) Shopping Cart Widget','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0163964c66530b2819','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0163964c66530b2819',7,'United States','Allston',4000.000,'fixed',4000.000,'2022-12-06',1,'2022-12-06',1,'fixed price',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-06 19:46:27',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
