(3783,'Cover for Zombie Book',2,'I am looking for a book cover for my novella that I\'m working on. At this moment I\'m just looking for a front cover that I could use for digital promotion and kindle. In early 2023 I may inquire about getting a full cover done for a physical version.\r\n\r\nTitle: Decay\r\nAuthor: Andrew Kibe\r\nOne line sell: Squid Games but with zombies attacking as well\r\n\r\nDescription:\r\nGroups of people have signed up for an experiment with the promise that when they are done they will get something big that was promised to them. For some it\'s money, for others it\'s fame, or finding family that was separated.\r\nEach contestant wakes up in a cell. Where they find out that they are a part of a deadly game. They must work together to complete a series of challenges to get their prize. But they must complete these challenges while facing off against hordes of zombies.\r\n\r\nIdea:\r\nI have a male character that acts as a big brother to a younger character. To help feel safer and closer to each other they make a wolf with their fingers. It\'s symbolizes that they are a pack in this together and a wolf always comes back to the pack.\r\nSo I thought maybe a cool idea would be to see that hand symbol but the skin is pale and decaying some. So it\'s a zombie hand making the gesture.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~012797f078187bf397','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~012797f078187bf397',7,'United States','Ambler',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2022-12-06',1,'2022-12-06',1,'fixed price',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-06 20:50:06',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
