(3785,'Small Book Design as Holidays Gift',2,'Hello.  We need to make a book as a Holidays Gift for our clients.\r\n\r\nThe book will:\r\n* Had an small intro page with copy\r\n* Have 22 square graphics with titles (thinking one graphic per page)\r\n* Have a collage of the 22 graphics at the front and possible back inner cover spread\r\n* Each book will be numbered - so the edition will look slightly different per book\r\n* Hard cover book preferred.  I suppose double sided paper makes more sense, but there are so few pages perhaps you will recommend we do single sided.\r\n\r\nThe copy is ready.  The graphics are already made.  Each of the 22 is almost identical, just the graphic and title changes for the graphic.  I\'m assuming that you will make an indesign file that lays it out for print.  \r\n\r\nNow, we are going to get spammed by like 100 applicants, so to break through all that noise it would help if you could just briefly mention your favorite printer, not necessary, but that would be nice - one that you have had personal experience with that can do this so we can send to them for printing.  \r\n\r\nWe think this will fall in the realm of about a day of work. We do have on going graphic design needs: for print, decks, pitches, social media graphics, ads, etc.  So if you have these skills then that would be great to know so maybe can set up something for future as well.\r\n\r\nThanks!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01190f5b12c43e5ec3','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01190f5b12c43e5ec3',7,'United States','New York',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-12-06',1,'2022-12-06',1,'hourly price',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-06 20:58:19',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
