(3822,'Infographic Wizard',2,'We are a tech company in the telematics and fleet vehicle space. We analyse vast amounts of data to deliver insights into driving behaviour and risk.\r\nPart of this process is giving drivers a score, which is made up of multiple weighted components. We want to produce a set of infographics that helps the drivers to more easily understand how the scores are produced.\r\n\r\nWe would need to explain our concept and then see 2 or 3 lo-fi ideas before selecting our choice to become the final infofgraphic.\r\n\r\nWe would need an ides for how many hours would be expected to\r\n1. have the initial design brief,\r\n2. produce some lo-fi ideas for us to select from\r\n3. produce the final infographic\r\n\r\nGoing forward, if this is a success there could be repeat business.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1600517015941517313?success','Na',7,'United States','Southwick',35.000,'Open this select menu',35.000,'2022-12-07',1,'2022-12-07',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-07 15:48:24',NULL,6,3,NULL,140),
(3823,'Graphic Designer for preschool marketing. Expertise in Canva and other graphic design programs',2,'We are a preschool looking for a graphic designer to take on our graphic design needs. We need social media posts, advertisements, info graphics, etc that support our operations and marketing efforts.\r\n\r\nWe currently use Canva. If it is can be created in Canva, we would like it to be. That allows the operational staff, whom are not graphic designers to correct or make small changes vs reaching out each time.\r\n\r\nWe will need basic photo editing skills as well. to take photos we take on a mobile phone and make them look a lot better before posting to the website. Looking for stunning contrast rich, HDR, contact that will pop on a social media thread.\r\n\r\nHowever, that is not to say that having expertise in other graphic design will be important.\r\n\r\nTo that end, besides the basic skill set of understanding how to use the suite of graphic design programs, your creativity and skill will be looked at.\r\n\r\nMust haves to be considered:\r\n- Written and Verbal English skills need to be very good, better than fluent. to define that further, if you have a thick accent, unfortunately we cant work with you. You may be fluent, but if we can convey information and understand you well, it just won\'t work out. Also, if we constantly have to correct spelling and grammar, that is also not going to work out.\r\n-need to have a stable internet connection that can support voice, video conference and screen share.\r\n- need to be creative and innovative in how you think about advertising and marketing.\r\n- need to be fluent on all the programs mentioned above. you should be able to edit things on the fly while during a screen share using keyboard shortcuts to quicken your workflow.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1600519617502633985','NA',7,'United States','Nashua',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2022-12-07',1,'2022-12-07',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-07 15:57:27',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
