(3826,'Graphic designer to create program booklet',2,'We are looking for someone to design a summer camp booklet which provides information on our services and each program being offered at Camp Yowochas in 2023\r\n\r\nThis will include a cover page, table of contents, and pages with descriptions of each program by category. We will provide content, photos to choose from via dropbox, and design specifications.\r\n\r\nDeliverables include a version to put on our website, and a higher quality version for printing. Print guidelines are included as an attachment. I\'ve also attached a couple of previous versions that I am fond of. Hoping to have some fresh design with the incorporation of our colours and logos.\r\n\r\nNeed completed project by December 16.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~017562f9bde53acfa4','no',7,'United States','Fallis',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2022-12-07',1,'2022-12-07',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-07 16:15:27',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
