(3828,'Create / Redesign Web site.',4,'Create a new WordPress site for https://www.apgmsh.com/, We are interested in a design that does not look \"WordPress like\" but with the simplicity of edits of WP.\r\n\r\nLooking for a more modern and very professional look while still being approachable so creativity will be required.\r\n\r\nResponsive site is required and it must look good in both mobile and PC/Mac screen.\r\n\r\nAll required images must be demonstrably legal to use (we are willing to purchase all required photos and add-ons)\r\n\r\nWe will need multiple distinct creative mock-ups (3+)\r\n\r\nWhile this is a single site, we will also need your hourly rate if you are interested in working on other sites with us as well as relevant additional technical skills for ecommerce and other commonly needed add-ins.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1600527401747148801?success','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1600527401747148801?success',7,'United States','North Richland Hills',750.000,'fixed',750.000,'2022-12-07',1,'2022-12-07',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-07 16:38:56',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
(3829,'Shopify Website Design & Development',4,'We have a (drop shipping) store called Pets Quarter (https://petsquarter.com) and the audience is based in America. We still haven\'t officially launched and are planning to start selling by 1st week of January.\r\n\r\nWe want the following changes implemented:\r\n\r\n1. Redesign & modify store, either using the current theme (DAWN) or paid theme called Petka.\r\n\r\n2. Integrate sales boosting apps like cross selling/up selling and further consult on more apps for reviews and social proof etc.\r\n\r\n3. Source private suppliers with fast shipping times from places like CJ dropshipping and Aliexpress/Alibaba\r\n\r\n4. Set up & design email marketing system for abandoned carts and step by step order processing.\r\n\r\nMy team has the products and their descriptions set up on the website (you can audit these if you wish). We do wish to become more \'rare find\' product website in our niche.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1600529366234152961?success','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1600529366234152961?success',7,'United States','none',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-12-07',1,'2022-12-07',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-07 16:40:07',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
