(3834,'Expert Graphic Designer Needed ASAP',2,'Dear Graphic Design Candidate,\r\n\r\nWe are a marketing company based in USA.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for an experienced graphic designer that can help us with:\r\nLogo design, facebook and Instagram ad design, branding.\r\n\r\nNeed to have:\r\n1. all the tools you need to get your job done: canva, figma, photoshop... and any other tools you need.\r\n2. Need to have fluent English so we can communicate with the team.\r\n3. when applying share your previous work you did.\r\n4. Able to work with a team and report on previous tasks.\r\n5. If you worked with western customer before its a plus (like: USA, Canada, UK or Australia)\r\n6. We work on American time line meaning you will need to work at least half of your day on our time line (texas time).\r\n\r\nThanks a lot for applying\r\nDavid','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~017ea5cd2678158886','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~017ea5cd2678158886',7,'United States','Davie',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-12-07',1,'2022-12-07',1,'hourly price',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-07 17:07:39',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
