(3838,'Video EXPERT Editor required - ASAP!',2,'ou MUST be THE video Editor Wizard! Able to take any video apart and reconstruct it to make it appear ... look as if you had just video recorded with the BEST format and resolution.\r\n\r\n\r\nYou MUST be able to take an existing video, edit it, regardless of the format, and make a new video from it adding new photo captions, and enhancing the music score.\r\n\r\n\r\nYou MUST be able to incorporate animated photos into the video to give an interesting twist to the video clip. \r\n\r\n\r\nThis is a FIX PRICE project! Do NOT submit ANY bid outside of the \'FIX PROJECT\' price. In order to be considered, you MUST provide your price quote; we have extended you the scope of the Project so you MUST know what your service cost?\r\n\r\n\r\nThe BEST qualified and FAIR Fixed Price wins the engagement.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1980000','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-12-07',1,'2022-12-07',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-07 17:30:08',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
(3839,'Looking to create a android IPTV app',6,'am currently looking for a developer to create a personal apk IPTV android operating systems app for me. It will be built off my current IPTV app with some changes and have specific needs.  Please tell me more about your skills in the apps and IPTV space.\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you for your time','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1980041','-',7,'United States','-',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2022-12-07',1,'2022-12-07',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-07 17:30:52',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
(3840,'Interview Editing (video and audio)',2,'I run a new business called Back Story. I offer recorded life story interviews, edited together with the interviewee\'s music selections that form the soundtrack of their lives.\r\n\r\nThe edited interview is then presented to the interviewee on a USB memory stick.\r\n\r\nFull details are here: www.back-story.co.uk\r\n\r\nEach interview is about 1.5 - 2 hours long. All assets for the interview would be provided via we transfer. If you have a remote desktop that would be better as the files are pretty big and take a long time to upload/download from the cloud.\r\n\r\nHere is an example of an interview:\r\n\r\nOnline via Zoom\r\nhttps://www.back-story.co.uk/kip-bertram\r\nPassword: P@ssword\r\n\r\nEach interview follows exactly the same format with the same intro and outro. All interviews are editied in a linnear, chronoligical way making the process quicker and easier.\r\n\r\nI can send you the assets for a sample interview.\r\n\r\nThe assets include the following:\r\na.    The original video footage interview\r\nb.    The original audio from the interview\r\nb.    The songs (audio files + video files + images)\r\nc.    Intro and Outro assets\r\n\r\nINTERVIEW\r\n\r\n1)    I do not want to include anything that either of us says whilst we are listening to the music during the interview. Neithe rof us has headphones on during the interview, for various reasons. For each song, please find a suitable cut off after the song has been introduced and cut out everything said until I say, ‘that was XX with XX reminding you of XX’ and replace it with the full song.\r\n2)    I prefer to remove pretty much everything that I say except for the actual questions I ask. The interview is not about me or what I think! If any of what the interviewee says (around what i say) can be used then great.\r\n3)    I like to fade the song in and out over it being introduced at the beginning and me reminded listeners/viewers what the song was at the end.\r\n\r\nSONGS\r\n\r\nI pull these from YouTube and then purchase a special license via PRS. The challenge with video interviews is what to show on the screen whilst the song is playing. Very often the music doesn’t have an associated video, or one of high enough quality. Instead, I use a single still image that holds on screen whilst the track plays.\r\n\r\nINTRO & OUTRO\r\n\r\nIntro includes\r\n1)    Photo ‘Start Plate’ and the audio \'logo\' track\r\n2)    Then the \'name plate\'  with the relevant audio track introducing the interviewee and the date of the interview.\r\n3)    Then fade into the interview.\r\n\r\nOutro includes\r\n1)    ‘outro logo recording’ audio file over the audio \'logo\' track again with the ‘end plate’ and ‘Spotify plate’.\r\n\r\nDELIVERABLES for each interview\r\n1)    Video edit - HD, MP4 and under 150mb\r\n2)   Audio edit -  MP3 and under 5mb.\r\n\r\nTURNAROUND\r\nI need the finished edits within 10 working days of receipt of the assets. Deadlines to be agreed per job.\r\n\r\nDo let me know if you need anything at this stage.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1980058','-',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2022-12-07',1,'2022-12-07',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-07 17:31:49',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
