(3879,'Website Design and Development for Education Company',4,'General Overview:\r\nPotomac Debate Academy, a company that coaches students in competitive debate and public speaking, is looking for a re-design/development of our current website (https://www.potomacdebate.com/) along with design/development of a new website to specifically advertise our upcoming summer camp. In addition to the initial work, we would like someone open to contracting out future website changes/additions/maintenance.\r\n\r\nTimeline:\r\nWe would like to have the summer camp website completed by the end of December, but the timeline for the re-design of our current site is not as pressing.\r\n\r\nBudget:\r\nWe do not currently have much of an idea as to a budget, so this is open to discussion with the designer.\r\n\r\nSkills:\r\nWe are looking for an emphasis on design and client experience. Our currently website lacks a modern design that is easy to navigate for our clients. We are hoping to design the site in such a way as to provide an easy to understand overview of our offerings to new clients unfamiliar with the debate and public speaking space.\r\n\r\nPlatform:\r\nWe are currently using Wix but would like to move away from this platform. Ultimately we are open to the suggestions of the developer, but are currently leaning towards WordPress  or Squarespace. A platform that is quick-to-load for users and allows us to made small website edits ourselves is at the top of our priority list.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b3d711ddcac664e9','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b3d711ddcac664e9',7,'United States','Rockville',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-12-07',1,'2022-12-07',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-07 20:02:58',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
