(3899,'Industry Report Designer',2,'We recently wrapped up a survey to create a flagship State of the Industry Report. We’re currently working on the copy and visual elements, but need a professional designer to create the final report.\r\n\r\nThe survey consisted of approximately 60 questions and we\'re hoping to segment them into 10-15 sections.\r\n\r\nOur website link is included below and a sample report is attached for reference. Our report won’t be nearly as long as the one attached, but it’s a good example of our overall vision.\r\n\r\nAs I mentioned, we will provide the full copy and all graphics, we simply need someone who can design the template and bring our report to life!\r\n\r\nhttps://servicecore.com','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~014ed160054323ac0b','no',7,'United States','Lakewood',4000.000,'fixed',4000.000,'2022-12-07',1,'2022-12-07',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-07 21:18:38',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
(3900,'Family Poster',2,'We need someone to design a poster for our three sons\' room. Needs to be easily readable for 10 year olds. The text to include is below. Would like 2 initial options. Something a bit more creative and something more straight forward. Text is all that is required in the design but if you see an easy way to create a symbol/graphic that represents each quality listed, feel free (but not required). I\'ve attached a few things that caught my eye. Size of poster will be 24\" x 36\". Other notes: our sons are rough and tumble and are \"all boy\" so to speak in case that impacts your design. Additionally, this will probably be part one of a series of projects we have you complete. To come...a family crest, family motto design, other printed material.\r\n\r\nText for the Poster Below:\r\n\r\nMay You Grow to be Men of God\r\n1. Step Up\r\n2. Stand Strong\r\n3. Serve the King\r\n4. Stay Humble\r\n5. Respect Women\r\n6. Live Generously\r\n7. Live with Integrity','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01d2ac4e676e62acb8','no',7,'United States','TULSA',75.000,'fixed',75.000,'2022-12-07',1,'2022-12-07',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-07 21:23:18',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
