(3904,'Logo design',2,'Our company name is Tambo, referring to the Incan structure (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tambo_(Incan_structure)). We have built targeting technology for a new type of drug which is based on Nobel Prize winning click chemistry. More info on us here: https://tambo.bio/ and https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4e1lHRw6rAI\r\n\r\nWe\'d love a clean design with significance to our technology behind our name. Our founder is Peruvian, hence the link to his heritage with the Incan structure, which we\'d love to see incorporated behind it if possible. We stand for humble confidence, collaboration and simplicity in focus.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1600605763606659073','NA',7,'United States','San Fransisco',50.000,'fixed',50.000,'2022-12-07',1,'2022-12-07',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-07 21:42:19',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
