(3948,'Shopify Developer',3,'We\'re looking for someone that can help us with a few updates to our Shopify Theme.\r\n\r\nOur site has a few different issues: https://caliberfirepits.com/\r\n\r\nIssues\r\n(1) Product Page Template: https://caliberfirepits.com/products/copy-of-tabletop-fireplace-portable-ethanol-fireplace-clean-burning-personal-concrete-fireplace-and-indoor-outdoor-smores-maker-sandblasted-finish\r\n- Get rid of the page title banner\r\n- fix checkout buttons\r\n- Overall CRO\r\n\r\n(2) Product Page Template (above link)\r\n- Add to Card / Buy with PayPal / Buy with Prime - they are not aligned\r\n- Reviews shouldn\'t be above Buy with Prime\r\n- Get rid of \'add to wish list\'\r\n\r\n(3) The popup in the right corner keep showing the same sale over and over again.\r\n- A visitor should only see that sale once unless there are new sales\r\n\r\n(4) Homepage: https://caliberfirepits.com/\r\n- there should be at least 3 additional buy now buttons that lead to our product page (this is a one product website)\r\n\r\n(5) When you add an item to cart the side bar checkout has a mess of buttons at the bottom.\r\n\r\n(6) We have a speed score of 19% which isn\'t helping us convert or with SEO.\r\n- would like to see that above 80%\r\n\r\n(7) Once these updates are done I would like to have the mobile version reviewed to make sure everything looks good over there as well.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ca5d05888f2b822b','no',7,'United States','Canal Fulton',55.000,'perhour',55.000,'2022-12-08',1,'2022-12-08',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-08 16:10:31',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
