(3976,'Digital agency website design+developmet',3,'Hi there,\r\n\r\nAs a digital design agency, we want our website to appear high on search engine results. We do not have the time to design our website, although it may sound crazy.\r\nHowever, we would like a clean and simple website with two or three pages, perhaps? We do not know how many of those services we will need for SEO (not sure how many we need). We are designers, not SEO experts.\r\n\r\nThe goal is to have our websites appear in the search results for specific locations.\r\n\r\nYou can use Webflow/Webflow Template/Custom Code/Framer, etc., making it easy for you and us.\r\n\r\nWe have a domain; you can suggest us a good hosting.\r\n\r\nWhat do we need from you?\r\n- A clean website design (In Figma, Framer, or Customise a Webflow/Framer Template?)\r\n- Write the content very carefully\r\n- Front-end Development with a 100% High-end SEO focus\r\n- Publish it\r\n\r\nImportant notes:\r\nRemember, we are designers, so that we might give you feedback. So if you love input and changes, let\'s work together.\r\n\r\nWe can help with UI/UX design feedback, but we are Zero SEO skills :)\r\n\r\nWhat is the central vision of the website?\r\n- We want to be found online very, very, very quickly in specific locations.\r\n- We want to be on top of search engines (For some specific locations)\r\n\r\nWho are we?\r\n- We are a UI/UX Design agency\r\n\r\nSounds interesting ? Have we missed anything?\r\nPlease message us :)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1600921671633145857','NA',7,'United States','Sunamganj',1000.000,'Open this select menu',1000.000,'2022-12-08',1,'2022-12-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-08 18:35:06',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
