(3986,'2D AE Animator for Explainer Video',2,'We\'re assembling a small team to knock out a client explainer video that\'ll be roughly 90 seconds to 2 minutes in final runtime.\r\n\r\nTIMELINE\r\nAnimation would start at the beginning of January with a final deliverable at the end of the month. I try to build in about a week between rounds and we\'ll have three of them- a rough first pass, a polished second and a white glove third round (most likely retiming for our final VO) before turning it over for sound design.\r\n\r\nWHO - THE TEAM\r\nMe. Hi. I\'m the producer. Just doing the producing here. I\'m a pretty technically proficient producer, as rare or unlikely as that may be.\r\n\r\nAnd then there\'ll be client-side interaction (we\'ll insulate you from that as much or as little as you want to be involved).\r\n\r\nAnd finally a very seasoned, very smart art director we\'ve worked with for over ten years.\r\n\r\nThat\'s it. That\'s the team.\r\n\r\nWHAT ARE WE MAKING\r\nLike most LMS platforms, the product sounds boring until you look under the hood and realize what it does and how it could be used. We\'re here to paint it as a powerhouse. I mean, it IS a powerhouse. We\'re just going to help other people understand that.\r\n\r\nUsually when we make these kinds of things we win a Telly or whatever I submit it for, so that\'s the goal here. Let\'s make a video about an LMS that\'s so freaking good it scrapes out a bunch of statues affirming our skill. Heck yeah.\r\n\r\nHERE IS AN EXAMPLE OR TWO OF SIMILAR WORK WE\'LL BE EMULATING\r\nhttps://youtu.be/EGfDLUx5YYQ\r\nhttps://youtu.be/mCKiL_au0Go\r\n\r\nHOW CAN YOU PROVE I\'M NOT GOING TO GET SCOPE BURNED\r\nI can tell you exactly how many hours our animators spent on previous videos so we\'re pretty good at this at this point. We also fully understand what types of animations take more time to make and know to avoid those by coming up with slick alternatives. We aren\'t entirely as dumb as we sound from this post.\r\n\r\nBUDGET\r\nIt\'s not final but it\'s probably ballpark. Again, we\'re not going to be unfair and we\'re not going to allow scope creep. I\'ve personally been on all sides of those things and I\'m not a fan and wouldn\'t subject anyone else to it.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01fb2a0b0ab28d722e','no',7,'United States','Austin',3000.000,'fixed',3000.000,'2022-12-08',1,'2022-12-08',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-08 19:28:04',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
