(3992,'Seeking Motivated and Highly Skilled Web Developer for Custom WordPess Site',3,'We are seeking a highly skilled and motivated web developer experienced in making custom WordPress themes and sites. We currently have a website in production (https://staging-easycampsignup-easycamp.kinsta.cloud/alt-home/) that urgently needs to be revised, reworked, and redeveloped.\r\n\r\nExternal API integration with WordPress is a major plus. This is a single-page site dedicated to advertising and selling summer camps. In addition, we have a custom registration system developed that uses WooCommerce for cart/checkout.\r\n\r\nAll the updated designs for the page have already been completed in Figma. We need a developer to take those Figma designs and produce a perfect replica on the front end (responsive) with a user-friendly and easy-to-edit system in the backend. Please tell us your favorite food in the first sentence of your reply.\r\n\r\nWe are looking to build a long-term relationship with the right candidate, as we have many additional projects in the pipeline. We need someone who is self-motivated, a problem solver, and can work/communicate efficiently with a small team (project managers, designers, additional developers, etc.).\r\n\r\nPlease share your portfolio or a few links to custom WordPress sites you have built. Only respond if you can start on this project immediately after the interview and hire.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1600940722510041089','NA',7,'United States','Washington',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-12-08',1,'2022-12-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-08 19:54:27',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
