(3994,'Animated flyer for music event',2,'We have a major music event in Miami which we need to announce shortly with an animated flyer that makes people excited about the event. You can see the event below to get an idea of what we need to try to communicate. The start of the show is The Fluffy Cloud, a UFO-like touring art installation from Burning Man that creates a 360-degree music show.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/tv/CgP4ahcDllE/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\r\n\r\nWe have done this show in various cities already, and have a flyer motif which we are generally happy with, but we\'d like to try to make it a bit more intense/dark if possible. If you see the example flyers in the ZIP attached, we\'d like to see if we can try to incorporate that overall design primarily with some lightning/dark type elements as you can see in this old promo video of ours: https://vimeo.com/585568882\r\n\r\nCurrent motif updates:\r\n1) Maintain Fluffy Cloud silhouette as \"star\" of the design\r\n2) Cultural icon update: we need to update the background elements to be specific to Miami culture. We suggest 2 different silhouettes of the iconic Miami beach lifeguard towers plus 2 Miami-type palm trees.\r\n3) Change the background animated elements in some way, can either just be a change of shapes or something totally new, ideally we would like to maintain and upgrade the background smoke to make it more visible/stormy and perhaps add some flashes/lightning. This can be either replacing the current background shapes we used in our flyers, or adding to them with the dark stormy vibes linked in the above vimeo video example.\r\n5) Add logos for Teksupport and Stranger;Than to the corners of the design as was done in the DC flyer example (will be provided at hiring, getting files now)\r\n\r\nText updates:\r\n1) City = Miami\r\n2) Date = February 4th\r\n3) Venue = Toe Jam\r\n4) Maintain \"Fundraiser\" language\r\n\r\nDELIVERABLES\r\n1) 15 second long animated flyer in 9x16 story size (1080x1920)\r\n2) 15 second long animated flyer in 4x5 post size (1080x1350)\r\n3) Static version of animated flyer with all key information in FB cover size (1200x628)\r\n4) All original design files (PSD, illustrator, etc)\r\n\r\nThe vision here is to update our motif a bit in a way that is impactful, something that will make people curious on social media, and willing to share. Super important is to keep in mind that we are a TOUR, so this is just the FIRST of multiple city flyers we will need to make in 2023. Whatever we do here needs to be created thinking of easy ways to update it for new cities without being too much work, while also still being unique enough each time that we can continue to post it without boring our followers with content that is TOO similar each time we post it.\r\n\r\nPS - we also included the Austin flyer PSD file which is different from everything else just to provide some additional elements/inspiration if it\'s helpful, it is NOT a primary guiding document and you don\'t need to include parts of it, we just wanted to give everything. The main content is in the zip folder plus the vimeo promo video in this text.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1600944841071652865?success','https://trello.com/b/eh32Y1Pm/task-list-arturo-digital/member/hasnain143',7,'United States','Miami',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-12-08',1,'2022-12-08',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-08 20:08:27',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
