(3999,'HubSpot Theme Website Designer',3,'We’re searching for a talented freelance web designer to help us with our website design projects. We’re looking for someone to design our client’s websites using the HubSpot CMS on pre selected themes. The ideal candidate has a strong understanding of color contrast, spacing/layout, type-setting, and good taste of image selections that don’t feel “stocky”. Please see attachments of past websites that we have done in the past to get a sense of the projects.\r\n\r\nSkills needed:\r\n3-5 years of web design experience\r\nUnderstanding of UX/UI principles\r\nUnderstanding of responsive design\r\nExcellent layout, typography and graphic design skills\r\nExperience using Sketch or Figma\r\nExperience with Adobe CC software\r\nHubSpot knowledge a major plus\r\n\r\nAdditionally, please give a brief 1-2 paragraph summary of your design experience and why you feel like you’d be a great fit for this work. Also, please provide a link to your online portfolio that showcases relevant work. Please include the phrase “Dominate the Mofu” in your response.\r\n\r\nOur max budget for this project is approximately $60/hr.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1600951402856288257','NA',7,'United States','San Diego',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-12-08',1,'2022-12-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-08 20:33:16',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
