(4005,'WordPress Form',3,'I’m looking for a WordPress form to be created. This form is to send virtual faxes.\r\n\r\n- When going to the website URL, the user will be asked for a username and password\r\n- Once the user logins, they will be directed to a form that asks for the following information\r\no Fax number\r\no Upload a document (word, excel, pdf, jpg)\r\no Then a send button\r\n- The behavior of the form\r\no The send-from email address will be faxservice@stgohio.com\r\no We will use SMTP2GO API for sending email\r\no The user that is logged in will dictate some of the information\r\n The fax number will be the first half of the email address (i.e.\r\n5555555555@domainname.com)\r\n The email subject line will be a 9-digit number\r\n Do not save this information in WordPress or anywhere else\r\n- User accounts\r\no I need to be able to create users which will include the following information\r\n Firstname\r\n Lastname\r\n Company Name\r\n Email address (login username)\r\n Password (user will create)\r\n Access Code\r\n• This will be the access code that will be included in the subject line\r\nof the email\r\n To domain\r\n• This will be the domain name after the @ sign','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1600960890967625729','NA',7,'United States','Northfield',55.000,'perhour',55.000,'2022-12-08',1,'2022-12-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-08 21:11:14',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
