(4012,'Ad Landing Page development for Wordpress',4,'We have 3 ad landing pages that we are hoping to improve the customer experience on. We are a manufacturing company specializing in 3D printing, Vacuum forming and Machining. My primary focus at the moment is improving the 3DP landing page experience and go from there. That page has an instant quote tool where customers can upload models, get a price and place an order. The other two are RFQ forms. There is important process and product information that is not easily viewable from the form landing page - it requires clicking links or scrolling to access. A lot of customers miss out on this info and the whole page experience could be cleaner and prettier. We are looking for solutions to help customer interaction with these tools/forms since we spend a lot of money every month to get customers to land on these pages.\r\n\r\nPages:\r\nhttps://www.rapidmade.com/instant-quote/\r\nhttps://www.rapidmade.com/machining-quote/\r\nhttps://www.rapidmade.com/thermoforming-quote/','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1600969212085911553','NA',7,'United States','Portland',100.000,'Open this select menu',100.000,'2022-12-08',1,'2022-12-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-08 21:50:13',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(4013,'Simple Line Animated SVG or GIF Icons',2,'I\'m looking for someone to help me with some custom icons for a new website in the tourism space. Simple line style, but ideally I would want them as animated SVGs, so would be a plus if you\'re someone who has SVG experience. This is for a WordPress site, so will be using a plugin on top of Elementor to handle the animations as Lottie files, so if you can export that way that would be ideal.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re a great icon designer and animator and would prefer to do gifs, we can do that as well, I\'d just prefer SVG if possible.\r\n\r\nStylistically these will need a fair amount of detail, as they will be somewhat granular concepts embodied (\'hikes to a waterfall\' or \'seafood restaurants\' and things like that). I\'d like to start with a dozen icons, but ultimately will need around 100.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1600972486885228545','NA',7,'United States','Mendocino',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2022-12-08',1,'2022-12-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-08 21:58:36',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
