(4015,'Maxxis Tyres Australia - Website Home Page Redesign Concepts',2,'Hello,\r\n\r\nI am part of the Marketing team for Tyremax – a national importer and wholesaler of tyres in Australia. One of the brands we import is Maxxis. We look after wholesaling and distributing the brand in Australia through our dealer network, and also look after marketing it through various marketing channels.\r\n\r\nOne very important part of our marketing for the Maxxis brand is the Maxxis Tyres Australia consumer website: https://maxxistyres.com.au/\r\n\r\nWe are looking at doing a refreshed design of the website to take it to the ‘next level’. We have our own Wordpress developer who looks after the development of the site, however we need to be able to provide him with some design files that he can work from.\r\n\r\nFor this new design, we would like to keep in mind the following:\r\n\r\n- The wireframe and content on each page should remain the same as the existing site, as this work well for us – particularly on the home page\r\n- We would like the design to be clean and sophisticated (not overly complex), and make good use of imagery\r\n\r\nA full brief for the website redesign project can be viewed here: https://www.dropbox.com/s/vwkc5veq0ves6g2/TM221122_New%20Maxxis%20Website%20-%20Design%20Brief%20-%2022.11.2022.pdf?dl=0\r\n\r\nThe Maxxis international brand guidelines can be viewed here: https://www.dropbox.com/s/lmbql7t0dduwzzu/Maxxis%202020%20Brand%20Guidelines-Rubik-AUG2020.pdf?dl=0\r\n\r\nOther imagery can be provided for the design from our libraries too.\r\n\r\nPlease note that for the font used on the new website design, we want to use the same font as this site: https://www.maxxis.com/int/).\r\n\r\nBefore we commit to getting the whole redesign of the site done, we would like to get some design options for the home page.\r\n\r\nWould you be able to design two options for the new home page for us? Once we’re happy with that, we will then work with you to redesign the whole site as a separate project.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1600972520494190593','NA',7,'United States','Tahmoor',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-12-08',1,'2022-12-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-08 21:59:20',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
