(4026,'PowerPoint Expert/Designer needed',2,'Looking for a PowerPoint designer/presentation expert that can polish and clean up presentations for our all company meeting we’re having the week of January 9.\r\n\r\nThe assignment is mostly touching up and reformatting slides that are provided. Some light design work may be required to break up text heavy slides and death by bullet points.\r\n\r\nA template will be provided with the basic slide formats.\r\n\r\nIt is expected we’ll have 6-8 presentations, each with an average of 15-20 slides.\r\n\r\nThe bulk of this assignment will take place between January 3 and 6 with some expected stragglers submitting their presentations at the last minute. It’s likely this will require work over the weekend of January 7 and 8 to meet the deadline of Monday Jan 9 for our practice run.\r\n\r\nIf the project goes well it’s likely we’d want to continue the arrangement in the future for other presentations including webinars, events and sales presentations.\r\n\r\nPlease respond if interested and available to work in the timeframes mentioned above.\r\n\r\nThanks!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~011a2ed5991ae3d613/apply/','Na',7,'United States','Overland',100.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 14:21:14',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
