(4035,'Need A PowerPoint Presentation-Medical Topic',2,'I need an expert who is great at both the use of smart art and infographics in Microsoft PowerPoint. When I say infographics, I mean people infographics and data infographics, I\'m attaching an example to this post. I pull data and people infographics from slidesgo which is free.\r\n\r\nI wrote a report that outlines the history of the US pharmaceutical industry in the United States.\r\n\r\nIf you are an expert in PowerPoint design, the hardest part about this job will be to understand the report and then synthesizing it into slides. Which is why it would be ideal if the person has a background in breaking down technically complex or health/ medical topics.\r\n\r\nThe goal is to have as limited text as possible on each slide. There would need to be just enough where if a key person missed the meeting, they could review the slide deck and not be lost, but not so much text that they might as well be reading the report. This is where discernment and analytical skills are key.\r\n\r\nI have a set template I have to use so the person would need to design within the specifications of that template. For the person hired I would send them a blank template, several other presentations I have done in the past to get a sense of design aesthetic, and the report itself.\r\n\r\nDue date would be December 13th.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01bf7b5fd0a27c9cf5','no',7,'United States','Hermitage',100.000,'Open this select menu',100.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 15:20:28',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
