(4049,'YouTube Thumbnail Designer Needed',2,'I\'m looking for a long-term thumbnail designer for YouTube.\r\n\r\nYou will be given information about a video, such as it\'s title and story. Your job will be to first put together a concept and render based on my idea. Thereafter, you will create an original thumbnail concept and render for an idea that you come up, based on the video concept.\r\n\r\nThumbnail guidelines:\r\n\r\n-These thumbnails are based on realism. They must be crisp, simple and clean. They must not look cheap.\r\n\r\n-This is not a challenge channel like MrBeast. Our audience will not resonate with overly plastic colors or overly acted facial expressions. Much of what works for them will not work for this channel. This is an older, more mature audience.\r\n\r\n-Renders can be a rough representation of what the final thumbnail will consist of. It doesn\'t need to be digital, it can be hand drawn (see attachment).\r\n\r\n==\r\n\r\nI\'ve attached examples to this job post of the kind of thumbnails I\'m looking for, and not looking for.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate must have a deep understanding of YouTube, and thumbnail CTR (and the importance of it).\r\n\r\nYou must posses the ability to concept, sketch, create and revise thumbnails (see example attachment relating to hand drawn renders).\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for a long term hire! You must have a great attitude, be willing to learn.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1601235148436344833','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1601235148436344833',7,'United States','Flushing',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 15:54:49',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
