(4067,'Pitch Deck Redesign for Established Web3 Company Looking to Raise',2,'Hi there! I am the CEO Founder of two companies in the web3/defi space- RugDoc.io and Paladinsec.co I am raising for the first time and have a rough deck done but it doesnt look as professional as I would like. I want to be able to effectively communicate what the companies I have founded do, why it is important, and feature their current services while explaining what I plan to do with the raised amount to the current company RugDoc and what I want to build out in a larger ecosystem called Korri. While the previous companies have been in the retail investor space, Korri is aimed for institutional development such as large funds, advanced venture, and banks. Korri will help identify risky users, risky assets, and track/offer predictions of user behavior through AI networking on the blockchain. Think being able to categorize user risk like a credit score for a blockchain address, asset score like Moodys, and track these factors like cookies for Web3.\r\n\r\nI am particularly displeased with the current rugdoc company slides as they look amateur and dont communicate what the company does which is offer user risk reviews for decentralized assets, KYC services, marketing, education, content, community and more. I also have been having trouble finding good screenshots to feature our services which can be found at rugdoc.io wiki.rugdoc.io rugdoc.io/kyc rugdoc.io/media-kit rugdoc.io/education. Current deck has been done in Keynote which I have literally never used before this so I have no preference or love for Keynote vs any other modality','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01891aa3e7a6b613f5','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01891aa3e7a6b613f5',7,'United States','Belgrade',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 16:43:59',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
