(4071,'Need a brand identity designer',2,'We are a new startup looking for a talented brand identity designer to work with. In this role, you will be responsible for creating and defining the visual appearance of our brand. You will work closely with our marketing and product teams to develop a cohesive brand image that resonates with our target audience and sets us apart from our competitors.\r\n\r\nAs our brand identity designer, you will need to have a strong understanding of design principles and the ability to create original graphics and visual elements. You will also need to be able to clearly communicate your ideas and collaborate effectively with other team members.\r\n\r\nIn this role, you will be expected to:\r\n\r\nDevelop a comprehensive brand guide that outlines our brand\'s visual appearance, including colors, fonts, and imagery\r\nCreate original graphics and visual elements that align with our brand\'s aesthetic\r\nCollaborate with the marketing and product teams to ensure that our brand image is consistently applied across all channels and touchpoints\r\nStay up-to-date with the latest design trends and techniques and incorporate them into your work','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01aae2877447af287b/apply/','Na',7,'United States','Sandwich',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 16:52:14',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
