(4073,'Create an animated company logo',2,'Our company name is iReyes Films. So we would like to play off of those words.\r\n\r\nWe were thinking of having a camera that turns to the audience exposing it\'s lens. Then that lens (iris) opens with a mechanical sound and becomes an eye. And inside of that eye it has an iris flower. We like either purple or blue for the color of the iris flower.\r\n\r\nOur other option is a ticking clock that has a shutter sound which opens the eye in the middle of the clock with the iris flower within that.\r\n\r\nI am going to supply some photos that we pulled just to give an idea of the type of theme we are going for.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01c41bf1bdd63ddc2d','no',7,'United States','Clearwater',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 16:53:40',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
