(4079,'Graphic Design for a Trade Show Display',2,'I need the graphic design done for a tradeshow display. This job needs a quick turnaround because we have show coming up in less than a month. I would like an initial draft back with in 48 hours (sooner would be even better) and need to finalize the design by Monday.\r\n\r\nHere is the display we are planning to order. Please note, the project includes designing for ALL the pieces shown in the picture. Templates are available to download on the page. -- https://www.signwindisplay.com/trade-show-booths/10x20-booths/10x20ft-custom-trade-show-booth-r.html\r\n\r\nIn addition, we will be adding two of the following that need to be integrated into the design of the space. -- https://www.signwindisplay.com/stylish-tv-ipad-tablet-literature-banner-stand.html\r\n\r\nA few notes:\r\n- We are a luxury outdoor living space company. We do decks, patios, porches, swimming pools, etc.\r\n- Our website is www.keystonecustomdecks.com. The website should serve as inspiration for the design colors, etc.\r\n- The display needs to include the Trex and TimberTech logos in a visible but discreet way. You should be able to find those logos online, but if needed, I can supply files.\r\n- The words \"Bringing your outdoor living dreams to life\" should be featured, perhaps on one of the pedestals. \"Create your own backyard oasis\" should be featured in the main design. Another line that could be used, but not as high priority is \"Become a master host.\"\r\n- Our website address -- www.keystonecustomdecks.com -- should be featured prominently\r\n- If you could do a mockup of the space, using the picture from the website, that would be great. Not a must, but it would be very helpful.\r\n\r\nI have attached the following:\r\n- Our Logo\r\n- Numerous pictures to choose from. Not all need to be used in the design. In fact, my thought would be to use only one or a few pictures on the main arched part of the display.\r\n\r\nPlease note the delivery time and the job particulars. I am NOT looking for a trade show booth design. I am looking for the graphic design for the items in the templates listed.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01a46f00c2b715eb76','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01a46f00c2b715eb76',7,'United States','New Holland',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 17:08:15',NULL,6,3,NULL,138),
