(4093,'Create a Corporate PressKit',2,'We are seeking a highly creative and skilled designer to create a professional presskit for our company. The presskit will be used to provide journalists and media outlets with information about our company and its products, as well as high-quality images and other assets.\r\n\r\nThe successful candidate will have a strong portfolio of design work, with a focus on creating compelling visual materials. They will be responsible for working with our marketing team to understand our brand and product offerings, and translating that information into a visually appealing and effective presskit.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n\r\nCollaborate with the marketing team to understand the company\'s branding, products, and messaging\r\nCreate a professional and visually appealing presskit, including images, graphics, and other assets\r\nDevelop and implement a consistent design aesthetic that aligns with the company\'s brand guidelines\r\nEnsure that all materials in the presskit are accurate and up-to-date\r\nWork with the marketing team to make updates and revisions to the presskit as needed\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nA degree in graphic design, or equivalent experience\r\nA strong portfolio of design work, with a focus on creating visual materials for marketing and communication purposes\r\nExperience creating presskits or similar materials for companies or organizations\r\nProficiency in design software such as Adobe Creative Suite\r\nStrong attention to detail and ability to meet deadlines\r\nIf you are a creative and skilled designer with experience creating presskits, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity. Please submit your resume and portfolio for consideration.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01c572665eefdd1b54/apply/','Na',7,'United States','San Juan',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 19:02:55',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
