(4099,'Expert Wordpress Upsell Page Design',3,') The page needs to sell 12 ebooks, in a long-page format, showing upsells as the page progresses. This is not an easy task.\r\n\r\n\r\n2) The page needs to sell a training program\r\n\r\n\r\nYou must be an expert with English as your first language or doctorate level in English\r\n\r\nYou must be an expert in Marketing\r\n\r\nYou must be an expert in Website Design\r\n\r\nYou must be an expert in Upsell page design\r\n\r\nYou must be an expert in Illustrator and Photoshop\r\n\r\nYour final delivery must have perfectly labeled layers so I can manage them after the job\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease do not submit if you do not have these skills.\r\n\r\n\r\nTo apply, please share examples of unique sales pages and other examples that prove the above expertise. All other submissions will be rejected.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease DO NOT submit without a clear example of an awesome upsell page related to my job description. And please do not send a long list of websites that are not related to the description.\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you for reading.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1980838','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',400.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 19:05:52',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
