(4101,'Minimalist Logo & Brand Design Kit',2,'Looking for someone to design a logo and brand kit for a launch of a new candle supply store online.\r\n\r\nCurrently using the attached label with simple text over it for our packaging, we would like to have a more professional logo, minimalist but capturing what we sell (wicks, wick clips, candle making supplies) in a format that we could use on labels, Shopify, social media, etc..\r\n\r\nI would like a full color as well as a black and white logo.\r\n\r\nDeliverables to include all standard file formats as well as transparency and vector format.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e914475225cad6fd','no',7,'United States','Danbury',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 19:15:22',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
(4102,'Bakery Store Website',4,'I need a simple bakery store website (must Android/IOS friendly) that must include a shopping cart with a checkout through PayPal or Google pay... Must give each customer option for delivery (delivery fee applies) or pick up at our store location.  It also needs to have a back-end to upload edit product images, price and descriptions.  It also needs to have Front-End with the ability to create usernames and passwords customers but also be able to lock, unlock and delete user accounts. Must have the ability for Admin to leave email messages in each user\'s inbox with the ability to allow User to reply to Admin... Will also need a section on the web page app to advertise special promotions or discount products.\r\n\r\nIn addition, each user (Front-End) should have a profile picture and a history of each of their bakery food orders and the amount of the transaction. There should also be a click button for reordering the same previous menu order and also have a comment box for any additional changes to the customers orders.  This app must be user friendly.  Once project is completed it must be uploaded on our webserver tested and fully functional before any funds are released.\r\n\r\n\r\n** Please submit a Mock Design!\r\n\r\n\r\n* Any outrageous prices will be met with no response!\r\n\r\n* Any bids that are falsely misrepresented or changed during the process will be reported to Guru.\r\n\r\n** No amateur developers need apply!\r\n\r\n* 90 Free Tech Support to fix any errors on the the App','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1980616','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 19:17:06',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
