(4129,'Commercial Real Estate Robust WordPress Website',3,'We are a commercial real estate company that specializes in the sale and acquisitions of car washes, retail, land, and more based out of Texas with operations nation-wide.\r\n\r\nWe are wanting to completely overhaul our existing website through transition – move it to a full flag-ship WordPress website from a Weebly website. The theme will be need to be completely custom and original. No theme basis to go off of other than a color scheme; however, direction will be provided so availability and communication access is critical.\r\n\r\nWe’ll need the following functionalities:\r\n\r\nProperty Listings (real estate) that can be displayed on a fully immersive geographical map so that users may search for properties by navigating via touch/scroll on a map. Property listings are to be managed through API sources, integrations, custom integrations, or whatever is needed to achieve this. The ability to adjust parameters for displayed properties must exist - i.e. displaying land that is available through public listing platforms (i.e. Loopnet.com, BizBuysell, etc.). Property listings generated must also have their own landing page created from data pulled from the integration so that users may click on a property to display more information about the property. Please note, we are a commercial real estate company, we are not looking to display residential properties. Information that is displayed on any given property must also have the ability to be edited/modified/redacted or any other way artificially modified. For instance, (If the address pulled from the source is wrong, the ability to alter the address on the backend is possible), etc. The ability to remove/add fields is also sought. Please advise best approach to achieve this.\r\n\r\nCustom post types: Press Releases, Industry News, Career/job position openings/employment opportunities (and the ability to apply for the job posting internally without leaving the website, Team Member/Employee page with biographies/social media links, and more with the ability to create additional custom post types on our back-end.\r\n\r\nAlso - all WordPress default paths and URL structures are to be modified and customized. Any WordPress folder structures and paths that reference WordPress to be changed as directed for security and analytic purposes. wp-content, wp-json, wp-. , to be masked/hidden and/or changed.\r\n\r\nRequired Experience\r\n\r\nWrite \'I am human\' at the top of your proposal.\r\nExperience in WordPress development\r\nFull-stack developer\r\nAbility to create solutions/come up with solutions\r\nCommunication\r\nCustom plugin development, API integration, SQL and/or mySQL database experience\r\nUI, UX, interactivity design experience a huge plus\r\nGraphics design experience a plus but not required for this project\r\nExperience integrating real estate management plugins/software in WordPress\r\nKnowledgeable in CSS to optimize appearance and mobile-friendliness.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011b26e6a1252a49d2','no',7,'United States','McKinney',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 20:53:08',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
(4130,'Presentation Designer',2,'We are looking to hire presentation designer to create beautiful and ORIGINAL templates that our customers can use.\r\n\r\nWe are a well established technology company in the creative space, and have built a template designer that our customers can use. However, we need a variety of high quality templates created to help non-designer customers get started.\r\n\r\nYou must design these templates in our new tool, so there will be somewhat of a learning curve. You may not use existing templates. These must be original works created from scratch.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~0160aa5cb111631c9d/apply/','Na',7,'United States','Bowling Green',80.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 20:54:49',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
(4131,'Commercial Real Estate Robust WordPress Website',3,'We are a commercial real estate company that specializes in the sale and acquisitions of car washes, retail, land, and more based out of Texas with operations nation-wide.\r\n\r\nWe are wanting to completely overhaul our existing website through transition – move it to a full flag-ship WordPress website from a Weebly website. The theme will be need to be completely custom and original. No theme basis to go off of other than a color scheme; however, direction will be provided so availability and communication access is critical.\r\n\r\nWe’ll need the following functionalities:\r\n\r\nProperty Listings (real estate) that can be displayed on a fully immersive geographical map so that users may search for properties by navigating via touch/scroll on a map. Property listings are to be managed through API sources, integrations, custom integrations, or whatever is needed to achieve this. The ability to adjust parameters for displayed properties must exist - i.e. displaying land that is available through public listing platforms (i.e. Loopnet.com, BizBuysell, etc.). Property listings generated must also have their own landing page created from data pulled from the integration so that users may click on a property to display more information about the property. Please note, we are a commercial real estate company, we are not looking to display residential properties. Information that is displayed on any given property must also have the ability to be edited/modified/redacted or any other way artificially modified. For instance, (If the address pulled from the source is wrong, the ability to alter the address on the backend is possible), etc. The ability to remove/add fields is also sought. Please advise best approach to achieve this.\r\n\r\nCustom post types: Press Releases, Industry News, Career/job position openings/employment opportunities (and the ability to apply for the job posting internally without leaving the website, Team Member/Employee page with biographies/social media links, and more with the ability to create additional custom post types on our back-end.\r\n\r\nAlso - all WordPress default paths and URL structures are to be modified and customized. Any WordPress folder structures and paths that reference WordPress to be changed as directed for security and analytic purposes. wp-content, wp-json, wp-. , to be masked/hidden and/or changed.\r\n\r\nRequired Experience\r\n\r\nWrite \'I am human\' at the top of your proposal.\r\nExperience in WordPress development\r\nFull-stack developer\r\nAbility to create solutions/come up with solutions\r\nCommunication\r\nCustom plugin development, API integration, SQL and/or mySQL database experience\r\nUI, UX, interactivity design experience a huge plus\r\nGraphics design experience a plus but not required for this project\r\nExperience integrating real estate management plugins/software in Wordpress\r\nKnowledgeable in CSS to optimize appearance and mobile-friendliness.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1601318917214236673','NA',7,'United States','McKinney',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 20:59:38',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
