(4152,'LinkedIn Engagement Specialist',2,'Sales & Marketing\r\n\r\nCustomer Relations\r\n\r\n    LinkedIn\r\n    Salesforce\r\n    Business Development\r\n    Client Assessment\r\n    Client Contact\r\n    Client Development\r\n    Client Issue Resolution\r\n    Client Orientation\r\n    Customer Experience Management\r\n    Customer Retention\r\n    Customer Satisfaction\r\n    Customer Service Management\r\n    Customer Service Training\r\n    Marketing\r\n    Promotions\r\n    Relationship Marketing\r\n    Sales\r\n    Social CRM\r\n    CRM\r\n    Zoho\r\n    Company Profile\r\n    Business Services\r\n    Relationship Management\r\n\r\nWe required a  LinkedIn Guru especially a “LinkedIn engagement specialist” who can help us get more post engagement at LinkedIn. It must be very tailored. Not someone to generate leads but someone who specifically increases engagement for posts on LinkedIn. You must know the “Marketing and Engagement  Techniques” to perform this task. This job simply required the following:\r\n\r\n    Best results in a short time.\r\n    Increase amount of profile views for the CEO of the company\r\n    Increasing the amount of likes, shares, and comments on the CEOs LinkedIn posts.\r\n    Advise CEO on a weekly basis on what is working, not working, and ideas to further growth.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease type “LinkedIn engagement specialist” at the start of your quote. A generic quote will not be taken into the consideration.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRegards,','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1981778','-',7,'United States','-',700.000,'fixed',700.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 23:02:09',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
