(4154,'Professional look to marketing materials',2,'I am looking for someone to clean up my brochures and look to be more modern/professional. I don\'t have much budget which is why I have been going at it on my own. I just don\'t love them and know they need some professional edits or changes in style. \r\nAttachments','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1981680','-',7,'United States','-',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 23:03:45',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
(4155,'Favicon and T-shirt design',2,'I need a designer for my Favicon and my T-shirt. I would like to get a \"white\" image for the Favicon, generated in a blue background. The same white image will also be displayed on the T-shirt with additional designs. As for the T-shirt, I need the \"white\" design so that I can display it on virtual T-shirt representations. So there will be two designs: the Favicon and the T-shirt. This needs to be done in two weeks, with one additional week for revisions. Total budget for this project is $250.\r\n\r\n          Once hired, the designer will have to sign this contract below and send it back here on Guru. Do not hesitate to chat with me if you have any questions or concerns. As a reference, feel free to visit my website here. I really appreciate your support in advance and I\'m excited to here from you soon!\r\n\r\n\r\nSincerely\r\n\r\nJorstern','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1981614','-',7,'United States','-',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 23:04:35',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
(4156,'Complete redesign of our Company Websit',4,'We need a complete redesign of our website https://www.wyngatesolutions.com. We need the following areas done -\r\n\r\n1. Main landing area.\r\n\r\n2. Services - We need to include the logos for Power Platform, Power Apps, Power Automate, Power Virtual Agents, Power BI, .NET, SharePoint, Azure and SharePoint Syntex. We might add some more information in the future. So we will need some way to handle this at a later stage.\r\n\r\n3. Blogs - This will list the top blogs for the company and when they click on it it goes to our blog site for details. \r\n\r\n4. Videos - List of our youtube channel videos. We should be able to add new videos in the future as well.\r\n\r\n5. Case Study - List of the latest case studies. Once we click on the case study it displays the details for the case study.\r\n\r\n6. About - Company information\r\n\r\n7. Contact Us - Provide contact information and form that users fill out and it emails it to our sales team.\r\n\r\n\r\nHere are some samples we like -\r\n\r\nhttps://www.nvisionkc.com/\r\n\r\nhttps://www.convergeone.com/\r\n\r\nhttps://solliance.net/\r\n\r\n\r\nWe have subscription to istocks so if you need any images let us know and we will get it for you. We would like to launch this site in January.\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\n\r\nAP','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1981613','-',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 23:05:18',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
(4157,'Wordpress Enfold Theme',4,'Need someone who can help with WP Enfold theme\r\n\r\n1. Connect, set-up Enfold Theme with my WP business account.\r\n\r\n2. Create Enfold Pages with forms and use the images or photos I provide.\r\n\r\nSelect enfold layout that works best.\r\n\r\nHome - main page include a sign-up form or select enfold layout that has a sign-up form \r\n\r\nInclude a sign-up form for each page:\r\n\r\na. About\r\n\r\nb. How It Works\r\n\r\nc. Investor\r\n\r\nd. News Media\r\n\r\ne. Mortgage Lenders\r\n\r\nf. Real Estate Agents\r\n\r\ng. Escrow\r\n\r\n(default body text will do ex. lorem ipsum)\r\n\r\n\r\nI will provide login credentials\r\n\r\nThat\'s it!','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1981574','-',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 23:05:52',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
(4158,'Need Power Point presentation template',2,'We need PowerPoint Presentation Template for the company. Our consultants do presentations at conferences and also client presentation. We need some really good looking for PowerPoint presentation template with our logo and colors. You can go to https://www.wyngatesolutions.com/ to check the logo. We are Microsoft Partners hence we would like to use some of the color schemes from Microsoft site too. \r\n\r\n\r\nPlease give us some ideas and we will pick.\r\n\r\n\r\nNeed this done by Monday December 13th 2022.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1981604','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 23:06:27',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
(4159,'Logo design',2,'\'m looking for a logo that I can use for my new business as a celebrant of services and ceremonies (Including weddings) - the domain is \'thecannycelebrant\'.\r\n\r\n\r\nAs I\'m from the North East of England, the word \'canny\' has a special meaning of \'fair/pleasant/joyful\' as well the more traditional meaning of \'smart/savvy\'.\r\n\r\n\r\nSo I need something colourful and linked to a positive emotion - but please avoid wedding cliches.\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'ve bought logos from here before and I make fast decisions when I like what I see - I\'ll need a full range of formats provided so I can use the logos on all sorts of \'media\' from websites to Tshirts...(previous logos can be seen at www.hypnotherapyetc.com and www.qedod.com) and what would be good is a wide range of ideas from which to choose and then narrow down quickly.\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m in a hurry for this (before xmas if poss) so sensible pricing and not having to fill in a 75 page document or send you ideas or face a website audit would be appreicated....\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m happy for ideas to involve colours - a name, strapline and some sort of image too....\r\n\r\n\r\nAny more questions feel free to ask - but don\'t take too long as I\'m hoping to have commissioned someone before the end of the weekend if possible, so if you are fast and flexible, I would love to hear from you....I\'m also happy to \'take a chance\' on someone without too much epxerience as long as they fit the bill.....\r\n\r\n\r\nI would much prefer all contact to be on here please so I would appreciate all contact to avoid direct emails, WA and texts....\r\n\r\n\r\nI will give people the chance to bid - so I won\'t just accept the first bid that arrives on the site - I will properly review all bids - after all, you spent time sending a bid so I will review all properly - so not point chasing me....Thanks\r\n\r\n\r\nMany Thanks','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1981595','-',7,'United States','-',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2022-12-09',1,'2022-12-09',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-09 23:07:03',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
