(4164,'Bangladeshi folk art style logo',2,'Subhanbagh is the name of an ancestral home in Sylhet in Bangladesh. It acts as a charitable foundation, family graveyard, heritage centre and holiday home for the descendants of zamindar Abdus Subhan, who number over 300, are digitally connected and live all over the world. We are looking to develop a logo that could be used for recognition by local villagers, authorities and for branding of goods and memorabilia for the family.\r\n\r\nIt needs to be in a traditional Bangladeshi folk art style, reflect our agricultural roots, and should involve a betel nut tree. The reason for the betel nut tree is that in 1955, the official government land surveyor observed an ancient and therefore very tall betel nut tree at the site of our original ancestral home (lost to the Kushiara River through erosion). He noted it in the official land survey maps as a landmark for historical record.\r\n\r\nThe logo will be used to create a nameplate for the house, as a decal on one or more vehicles and branding for social media and websites. Stylistically, the logo of JatraBangladesh.com is appealing.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1602316745101209601','NA',7,'United States','London',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2022-12-12',1,'2022-12-12',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-12 15:01:11',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
(4165,'Logo and Brand Colors for Wedding Stationery Brand',2,'I’m looking for an experienced and talented designer to design a logo and brand colors for my wedding stationery brand.\r\n\r\nSpecifics:\r\n• 2 versions of the logo -- square + horizontal (rectangular) format\r\n• Vector Format\r\n• Transparent background\r\n• I will need the Illustrator source file\r\n\r\nTime Frame: 2-3 weeks (max)\r\n\r\nI will be hiring 3-5 designers for this project to get a few ideas from different designers.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will be able and willing to work on future projects together including, but not limited to, designing lead magnets + PDF downloads, ads, landing pages, website, shop banners, etc.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhen responding to this ad, please include the following:\r\n• A sample of your work\r\n• Will you be available to work on future projects together?\r\n• Turnaround Time\r\n• Fixed-price quote for the project\r\n\r\nThe design shall not have been previously used anywhere, nor can it be used in the future. I am requesting copyright/commercial rights.\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\nMiriam','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~012dcd5712641c7211/apply/','Na',7,'United States','Huntingdon Valley',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-12-12',1,'2022-12-12',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-12 15:04:14',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
