(4171,'Website Graphics Creation',2,'Website Graphics Help\r\n\r\nWe want to introduce a new aesthetic to our website with the use of new graphics.\r\n\r\nOur website is sitecare.com.\r\n\r\nWe do not want to make any changes to the fonts, layout, or color palette of the website. We want to replace the graphics only.\r\n\r\nHere are a couple of requirements of the project:\r\n• The “tiny head” graphic style shouldn’t be used. Example: https://eyeondesign.aiga.org/dont-worry-these-gangley-armed-cartoons-are-here-to-protect-you-from-big-tech/\r\n• No team member photos should be used in any graphics\r\n• We want the graphics to reflect a modern (2022-2023) styling\r\n• The images created must be original work and not subject to any licensing or copyright.\r\n\r\nThe iconography used in this portion of our homepage is something we like, and could potentially build off of, but we’re open to new ideas as well: https://share.cleanshot.com/L2Yx17\r\n\r\nThe image styling should convey confidence, professionalism, and trust.\r\n\r\nHere are examples of the graphics we’d like to replace: https://share.cleanshot.com/OvagFa\r\n\r\nThis initial project will consist of creating an initial concept, and then creating new graphics for our website’s homepage. Assuming we’re satisfied with the direction and the finished product, we’d like to work with the designer to complete graphics for the rest of the pages of the website.\r\n\r\nDeliverables will include the following:\r\n• 3 comps for possible look and feel of the new graphics style\r\n• 5 original graphics designed using a modern design tool\r\n• Source files for any graphics that are created\r\n\r\nIf you’d like to participate in this project, please provide a quote for cost as well as initial delivery date for the 3 comps. Anything that demonstrates past success with similar projects will be great as well.\r\n\r\nIf you need additional details or have more questions, please send them our way. Thanks.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1602323951270359041','NA',7,'United States','Spanish Fork',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-12-12',1,'2022-12-12',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-12 15:28:10',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
