(4239,'Branding (re-branding) of a Community College',2,'We are an advertising agency for Universities and Community Colleges and one of our schools has asked that we initiate a new Brand for them. True \"Branding\", from the beginning of the process to the end, is not in our wheelhouse and we would like someone to Lead and Execute this project with us.\r\n\r\nWho we are:\r\n\r\nWe are a people-first team passionate about using what we create to support the communities and people we interact with where imagination, innovation and effective design meet. Our clients are major universities, colleges and junior colleges, corporations and the U.S. Government. We seek to change the way institutions grow enrollment, improve student engagement and retention to build a better world one student at a time.\r\n\r\nWe work in a fun, collaborative environment that is creative, ethnically diverse, inclusive of LGBTQ persons and U.S. Veterans. We look for proactive, accountable people focused on continuous learning and growth to push themselves and our businesses forward.\r\n\r\nWe encourage people from all backgrounds, ages, abilities, and experiences to apply for our roles. We are an Equal Opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based on race, color, ancestry, religion, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital of family status, disability, gender, gender identity or expression, pregnancy or caregiver status, veteran status, or any other legally protected status.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1602421394042884097','NA',7,'United States','Norwalk',9000.000,'fixed',9000.000,'2022-12-12',1,'2022-12-12',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-12 21:54:43',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
