(4259,'Kiosk mode GPS Golf App',6,'Need a bid on 2 things: 1 Phase 1 app, and secondly, Combination of Phase 1 and Phase 2 apps. \r\n\r\n\r\nPhase 1: Tablet app: \r\n\r\nApp is primarily a GPS distance app for golf courses.  The GUI will display a background image with yardages showing the distance to the front center and back of the green as well as hazards on each hole (up to 3 per hole).  The background image for each hole as well as pop up advertisement images will be loaded from a folder. The app will automatically change between holes using a GPS location and radius measureement from the tee box.  The measurement will use the GPS data on the hardware and the app will measure the distance from the hardware location and data tables uploaded to the unit.  The app should be able to upload changes to the data tables and background images via a wifi connection in a certain location.  The app should be able to run without internet.  Additional data will be provided. \r\n\r\n\r\nThe intention of this app is to have an app tha pushes data back and forth between a CMS and Android or iOS app.  The intent of the app is for courses to utilize it as their own app.  The Admin CMS is setup as part of the course set-up and then the Course CMS is set-up and maintains the app from that point.  \r\n\r\n\r\nPhase 2: Phone Version of the same app: \r\n\r\nThe Phone version of the app can be used to purchase and reserve events, specials, food and tee times.  The app is used as a method to track food sales (bought on the app) and provide an advertising venue also.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThe intent is to be able to build a custom course app with course logo which is self contained after creation, but also to have a company app that holds access to all the courses.   \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBoth apps provided are both very similar.  I would actually prefer 1 app with ability to turn off the additional features as needed.  If it is easier and more cost effective to do both at the same time.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n1.0 Tablet App: This is a limited version of the phone app that will run on android and IOS tablets.\r\n\r\n- Platforms: IOS and Android\r\n\r\n- Auto adjust images to match multiple screen sizes\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTablet: Only running the following: Main Screen, GPS (NOT including Mark Distance), Advertising full screen, Scoring, and LOCKOUT password.  \r\n\r\n1.1 Tablet App General:  \r\n\r\n- Tablet App will work the same as the phone app but with the following differences:\r\n\r\n- Tablet App only has the following pages:\r\n\r\n1. GPS\r\n\r\n\r\n    Tablet app does not contain the following which the phone app does include: \r\n    1.  Mark Shot Button\r\n    2.  Tee Times button\r\n    3.  Food button\r\n    4.  Events button\r\n    5.  Social Media button\r\n    6.  Welcome User Name button\r\n    7.  Return to course selection button\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTable App: Add LOCKOUT password function:\r\n\r\n - Requires users to enter password set in CMS to use the exit or escape buttons or the menu        buttons.  \r\n\r\n-  The purpose of this feature is to keep users from exiting the app.\r\n\r\n-  If another method will work to accomplish this please provide.  Please see link below for             another possible solution.\r\n\r\n        -  http://android-developers.blogspot.com/2012/01/say-goodbye-to-menu-button.html\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n    Course Admin web page (Course management login admin):  Allows Course users to update course information and receive information related to the following:\r\n    Tablet app\r\n        Course Details\r\n        Holes\r\n        Par Values\r\n        Statistics\r\n        Social Media\r\n        Reports\r\n\r\n\r\n    Phone app\r\n         Course Details\r\n        Holes\r\n        Par Values\r\n        Food Menu\r\n        Membership\r\n        Tee Times\r\n        Events\r\n        Specials\r\n        Statistics\r\n        Social Media\r\n        Reports\r\n        Money\r\n\r\n\r\n1.1.1 Data Flow: \r\n\r\nCourse setup information is initially loaded into the Admin CMS upon course creation.  After this occurs, the Course CMS information is added.  Both the Admin and Course CMS shall be live updateable.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUpon installation of the app all data is initially loaded from Admin and Course CMS web page / server to the app.  Once loaded it should be stored in the device long term memory and should be reusable.  If data is updated within the Admin or Course CMS, this data will be updated when the app is opened.  Only data which is changed from the CMS will be overwritten.  A full overwrite of all data is not acceptable unless validated by completely new data within the CMS.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCurrently the images load from Server as they change.   Need them to load to the phone / tablet memory.  Tablets will only have connection at clubhouse, so all images need to load into memory when apk is installed and then reload if updates are available.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1983168','-',7,'United States','-',3000.000,'fixed',3000.000,'2022-12-12',1,'2022-12-12',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-12 22:23:08',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
