(4265,'Build responsive WordPress site optimising for speed',3,'Hi,\r\n\r\nI have provided the job details in the attached project brief with some example web designs.\r\n\r\nThe current budget is a placeholder amount so place your bid as you think appropriate.\r\n\r\nIt is important to have someone who can accurately take web designs and apply them to a website so if you can provide examples of web designs provided to use and then how you applied them to a website, then it would be great for us to see.\r\n\r\nWe can provide website architecture if we proceed further however expect a home page, about 7 or 8 product pages (where 4 of them will have the same design), a blog page and then beyond that some standard pages like contact us etc.\r\n\r\nWe are posting this now to find the right candidate who can do this in the new year for us once we finalise the web designs and architecture.\r\n\r\nWe would expect a pretty quick turnaround on this as it is a basic build.\r\n\r\nMake sure your response has \'bananas\' so I know you have read the brief.\r\n\r\nWe intend to do this on wordpress.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0115c431c9fe2276b5','no',7,'United States','Black Rock',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2022-12-12',1,'2022-12-12',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-12 22:42:50',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
