(4277,'Wordpress / Woocommerce Developer',3,'Wordpress / Woocommerce developer\r\n\r\nConnectUs is looking for an experienced and passionate WordPress Developer to join our IT team here at ConnectUs! This contract role will be responsible for both back-end and front-end development, including creating WordPress themes and plugins. Experience with the Woocommerce plugin and ecosystem is a requirement, as this project will have a lot of tight integrations with the Woocommerce ecosystem.\r\n\r\nYou will work with business stakeholders, our software architect as well as other developers who are working in concert to deliver the next iteration of our corporate site and catalog.\r\n\r\nPhase 1 Goal - (60 days) to provide a self service user portal where users can create a login, and manage billing and shipping information that is stored directly to our OrderTime order management platform. I would like for a customer to be able to login ongoing so that they can view their order information. This order information will include tracking information, a downloadable pdf invoice and other downloadable files associated to the each order. This portal will allow customers to see all order history associated to their account.\r\n\r\nPhase 2 Goal - (120 days) To allow customers to order our top 25 products directly on our website. The order process is more complex than a standard ecommerce shopping cart because there will be subsidies and bill credits associated to an order based on selections the user makes.\r\n\r\nPhase 3 Goal - (360 days) Provide a full blown search engine optimized (SEO) ecommerce platform that pulls in product catalogues from our distributors to display their products on our site. The 12 month goal is to showcase at least 10k devices on the site.\r\n\r\n- Proven work experience as a WordPress developer.\r\n- Proven Experience with Woocommerce.\r\n- Experience with OrderTime and the OrderTime WP plugin is a huge plus.\r\n- Experience developing Wordpress on WPEngine.\r\n- Knowledge of front-end technologies including CSS3, JavaScript, HTML5, and jQuery.\r\n- Knowledge of Git/Github required.\r\n- Experience working with debugging tools such as Chrome Inspector and Firebug.\r\n- Good understanding of website architecture and modern UX patterns.\r\n- Good communication skills.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1602679299044478977','NA',7,'United States','New Holland',75.000,'perhour',75.000,'2022-12-13',1,'2022-12-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-13 15:03:07',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(4278,'Wordpress Developer for New Developments Updates and Maintenance',3,'We are a design studio and we are focusing on web development. We currently have a few developers who we work with. We are looking for one or two others who could help with ongoing work.\r\n\r\n- Websites we are developing are primarily Wordpress sites.\r\n- Attention to detail is a must.\r\n- Smart development skills is a must.\r\n- Ability to design and appreciate design is a big plus.\r\n- Clear and ongoing communication will be required.\r\n\r\nIf you think you are a good fit for this work, please send me a proposal and more importantly links to some of the sites you have developed. Please be sure to specify if you designed and developed or simply developed','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1602682879328743425','NA',7,'United States','Lawrence',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2022-12-13',1,'2022-12-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-13 15:13:34',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
