(4302,'IOS and Android APp',6,'An App where Moto Riders will have the ability to Login and verify their identity and show up to our verified geolocation areas, check in, and ultimately earn $MOTO tokens for the duration of time in that area.\r\n\r\n-Riders can only ride a maximum of 8 hours per day and will utilize a camera section of the app to clock in and out of geolocation areas with a photo of the bike clean (upon clock in) and a photo of the bike dirty (upon clock out). [Each photo clock in/out will be split into a photo collage and automatically posted for users to see who rode where, for how long, and how much they earned.)\r\n\r\n-Earnings will be held in a local wallet assigned at login, although users will be able to send their tokens to any wallet/exchange which accepts our Token.\r\n\r\nEarnings can either be staked in order to earn weekly distributions or swapped for other Crypto and ultimately, to fiat.\r\n\r\nApp Buttons at bottom of app will be as follows and in order; Left to Right:Home:-  Instagram Style Photo Feed of all users and ability to go to others profiles to tip with crypto, comment, like, and follow each other.Wallet:-  Users can see their wallet address, earnings, as well as staking tiers with lockup percentages in our vaults.Camera:-  In app camera where users can clock in and out of geolocation areas and post to feed.R2E:-  Mad Skills Motocross type of game that allows you to earn and wager $MOTO tokens in order to enter in online races with users around the globe. (Partner with Mad Skills Motocross for API or build game in house) Settings:- Users can update their profile/personal homepage as well as account details - Help Button','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1983709','-',7,'United States','-',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2022-12-13',1,'2022-12-13',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-13 16:55:47',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
