(4320,'Simple Logo for BetRCareers',2,'About:\r\nWe are creating a recruiting website to find new insurance agents across a variety of industries.\r\n\r\nWe will be using the name betrcareers for our recruiting campaigns.\r\n\r\nWhat\'s Needed:\r\nWe are looking for a clean and modern logo with a bold san serif font.\r\n\r\nWe\'re open to a single-color logo (black/white/gray), but if an accent color is needed, use royal blue or navy blue.\r\n\r\nWe\'ll need 2 variations, one with the \".com\" and one without.\r\n\r\nWe\'d also need all-white and all-black versions (+colored-versions if the final design includes color).\r\n\r\nFile Format:\r\nPlease provide all images in SVG format with the editable raw files.\r\n\r\nWhat\'s Attached:\r\nI\'ve attached some very simple concepts I put together, feel free to use them as inspiration or disregard them entirely if you come up with something better.\r\n\r\nFuture Opportunities:\r\nWe are a growing company that is expanding our leads division and will have an ongoing need for graphic design jobs. The goal of this job is to get our requested logo, and also to hopefully identify you as a resource we can use on an ongoing basis.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1602719030896095233','NA',7,'United States','Roseville',100.000,'perhour',100.000,'2022-12-13',1,'2022-12-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-13 17:40:24',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
(4321,'Finalize coding needs on existing store',4,'Hello, \r\n\r\n\r\nI am searching for a coder to put the finishing touches on my online store hosted by Big Cartel. Here\'s what needs to be done: \r\n\r\n\r\n    On each of the products pages, the background of the roll-over-zoom feature needs to be turned to white #F on desktop\r\n\r\n\r\nWill provide login credentials when necessary.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1984310','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-12-13',1,'2022-12-13',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-13 17:42:40',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
(4322,'Design for two page flyer needed',2,'We are looking to create a advertising, two page flyer for our new start up. We need help creating:\r\n\r\n1. The color palette\r\n2. The logo\r\n3. The flyer itself, integrating the color design and logo\r\n\r\nWe currently have no brand design or guidelines to use for the flyer.\r\n\r\nAbout our technology:\r\n\r\nWe have created an algorithm that manages the profitability of energy strategies for high-density energy users. This algorithm acts as a \"conductor\" managing the electron flow to machines. It determines whether a machine should use an electron depending on how much money it will make in any given moment and turns it on or off to make that money automatically.\r\n\r\nWe would like to have a design that represents the edginess and trustworthiness of our techonolgy, that also demonstrates the fact that we are working with \"hardware\" like machines and engines.\r\n\r\nA successful candidate will have had experience creating designs and logos from scartch and has worked with cutting edge techonologies like AI, blockchain, energy, and cars.\r\n\r\nWe will also provide some inspiration for the design.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1602721562958327809?success','Na',7,'United States','Chicago',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-12-13',1,'2022-12-13',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-13 17:47:22',NULL,6,3,NULL,140),
