(4325,'Graphic Designer needed for Marketing Deliverables',2,'We\'re looking for a graphic designer than can help us put together some company marketing material. We have an idea in mind with a need for ultimately (4) 2 page deliverables. Our aim is to print these ourselves on a single sheet front and back.\r\n\r\nWe are a financial services company and would like a professionally designed deliverable. We use Century Gothic font, 4f81bd blue, and 898c90 gray. We implement an Art Deco sort of style in other deliverables so if you are able to implement some sort of feel / shapes / lines then great. Otherwise, don\'t worry.\r\n\r\nWe\'ll also need pdf versions of all deliverables as well as the jpeg version of an image we\'ll need you to create as well. (It\'s a graphic of calendar, should be a straight forward graphic)\r\n\r\nIdeally looking to take care of this in the next week or two tops. We\'re sending to print at EOY.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1602723141706936321','NA',7,'United States','Miami',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2022-12-13',1,'2022-12-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-13 17:54:26',NULL,6,3,NULL,124),
