(4328,'UX/UI designer with strong graphic design skills needed for high fidelity mockups',6,'We are creating a brand-new WordPress website. In-house, we have designed several of the top pages (about 15) but would like you to take what we have already done, elevate it, and produce high-fidelity mockups of them.\r\nThese will be presented to our stakeholders for final approval, and then they should be able to be passed off to our front-end team to apply the design to our new site. (Note: we are also looking for developers…so if you do both, bonus!)\r\nA preference would be for the design to be provided in Adobe XD for easy collaboration with our internal team.\r\n\r\nYou must be located in the United States, with a preference to the Eastern time zone.\r\n\r\nWe will provide:\r\n• Brand guidelines\r\n• All photos and logos\r\n• Our current landing page designs (for you to improve upon!)\r\n\r\nRequired Experience\r\n• Strong UI/UX skills\r\n• Strong graphic design skills\r\n• Strong skills in using Adobe XD\r\n• Experience designing for web-based platforms\r\n• Experience designing for responsive web sites\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this project, please let us know what other information you would need in order to be able to submit a proposal (we can also send an RFP), as well as provide samples of past work. We are estimating for this work to begin mid-January with a quick turn-around.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1602746290481754113','NA',7,'United States','Alexandria',2500.000,'fixed',2500.000,'2022-12-13',1,'2022-12-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-13 19:25:27',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(4329,'Video editing / Sound Design : Youtube',2,'We are a youtube based company consisting of 4 different youtube channels. We have a combined subscriber base of over 8 million subscribers. The largest channel being \"The Atlantic Craft\" which has over 6 Million solely. Our channels focus on Minecraft and Roblox Gameplay/Roleplay videos. However we do occasionally do Shortform content (tiktoks/Instagram Reels/Youtube Shorts), Vlogs, Funny moment compilations, Animations, parodys, Other gameplay, etc. This position requires a familiarization with the youtube gaming community, knowledge of minecraft is a bonus!\r\n\r\nThe main part of this position would be editing minecraft gameplay/roleplay videos, Which entails combining different audio tracks, pitching up voices of certain characters, matching up characters POV\'s, Balancing all audio tracks, Backround music, Sound effects to enhance video (battle sounds if we are having a fight, bear growl if we stumble upon one etc), Graphic overlays (funny, counters, etc), cutting out boring bits or mess ups. Videos usually range from 15-30 minutes long. Some of our channels try to upload daily. Videos are usually rendered in the day before they need to be released so quick turnaround required. Weekend videos are almost always rendered in by Friday. Ideally you would be able to edit 2-3 videos per day if needed. We would start you off with a few test videos to see quality and time efficiency. Programs that you must be skilled in include: Adobe Photoshop, Adobe After Effects, Adobe Premiere or Sony Vegas.\r\n\r\nHere is a link to the main active channels\r\n\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/TheAtlanticCraft\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@crazybloxers\r\n https://www.youtube.com/@CrazyCrafters\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@CartoonCrab','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1984307','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2022-12-13',1,'2022-12-13',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-13 19:25:47',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
