(4338,'Investor presentation design',2,'Hi All -\r\n\r\nWe need an experienced designer to do a design touch up on the following google slide presentation:\r\n\r\nhttps://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1bLdrh5o1oJ7syD5RMWFvwG_Wu1dY_5Ja7iiPq66LlOA/edit\r\n\r\nThe company makes software for US police officers in order to modernize their internal video review processes.\r\n\r\nWe would like to keep a color scheme that is simple and includes blue, but are open to suggestions.\r\n\r\nDesign should be simple, minimalist, futuristic.\r\n\r\nIt would be helpful to see examples of previous work you’ve done that you think might have a similar aesthetic\r\n\r\nWe would like to incorporate infographics where applicable, open to ideas\r\n\r\nUse of simple icons where applicable, open to ideas.\r\n\r\nIf possible we would like to include a branded set of icons for police, body-worn cameras, law enforcement, police departments, use of force, community policemen, automation, video analytics, police misconduct, and any others you think could be incorporated.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you have any questions.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nJeremy','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01846c14c2f8e1fb53','no',7,'United States','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01846c14c2f8e1fb53',100.000,'perhour',80.000,'2022-12-13',1,'2022-12-13',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-13 20:15:34',NULL,6,3,NULL,133),
