(4363,'Sales Presentation Required For Energy Solutions Company',2,'Hello! We are seeking a sales veteran with experience in creating sales presentations for services that follow procedures. It is one thing to take information and separate it by titles and slides but another to explain why certain things are done in specific ways while keeping the presentation as short and straightforward as possible and tying everything together.\r\nOur main clients are building owners and building management companies who have a basic understanding of the energy efficiency world. They have followed a process that most energy solutions, energy auditors, and contracting companies have proposed and set as a \"standard\" over the years.\r\nWe are putting a presentation together that explains a different process for getting more bang for their buck, higher annual $ savings, much higher incentives/rebates, and more! The trick is to put everything together into a presentation that is easy to understand.\r\nAdditionally, most building managers and owners are crazy busy and between 40 and 70 years old. We would like the presentations to be \"modern\" but also something that is simple and relatable enough for the ~older~ demographic to relate to.\r\nWe have many other presentations we are working on and would love to find someone with whom we can build a relationship and work on all these projects! If you feel you are the right person for the job, please apply today!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1602794177580331009?success','https://trello.com/b/eh32Y1Pm/task-list-arturo-digital/member/hasnain143',7,'United States','highlands ranch',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2022-12-13',1,'2022-12-13',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-13 22:36:15',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
