(4378,'Woocommerce / Wordpress Specific Dev',3,'We are looking for support to develop a specific section to share information regarding product information to clients after order processing. For each order processed through Woocommerce multiple products will be attributed a \"grade\" out of 10 once the products will be graded. This grade out of 10 should be shared through the system to clients.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlateform hosted by Wordpress. Orders hosted by Woocommerce.\r\n\r\n\r\nDevelopment Specs :\r\n\r\n\r\n    Development of a front end product grade section within the \"my account\" section. This section should be available on each user account and reflect past orders.\r\n        Develop the ability to manually add information for each order, product, client through the wordpress dashboard. This dashboard should be usable by employees and serve as a gateway between the client and the company.\r\n        Develop light animation revealing the grade when triggered by a click.\r\n        Trigger email to the client (using already existing template) when grades are available.\r\n\r\n\r\nAsk :\r\n\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a Wordpress / Woocommerce developer with graphic design and hard coding experience who could develop the requirements of the development specs. Strong attention to detail and a great design capabilities are expected.\r\n\r\n\r\nCompany purpose : \r\n\r\n\r\nThe company is an intermediary service entity helping card collectors to grade trading cards within reputable grading companies. The company prepares orders and sends the cards for grading and then receives the cards and sends them back to collectors.\r\n\r\n\r\nMany thanks for the interest. We would be glad to further discuss the need with you.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1984534','-',7,'United States','-',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2022-12-14',1,'2022-12-14',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-14 14:37:10',NULL,6,1,NULL,136),
