(4469,'PowerPoint Presentation Design/Revamp',2,'We are looking to have someone revamp our presentation. It is appx 10 pages and the content is completed. We have selected images for the majority of the slides and can advise of which image belongs to which slide on at least 50+ at this point.\r\n\r\n*** We are looking for a very quick turn around on this project! ***\r\n\r\nFor the designer that works on the project, we have created the following notes:\r\n• With exception of a few images (mainly ones that are already in the presentation and are staying), the image formatting needs to be consistent throughout the presentation. We want to try to stay as consistent as possible but if some will look better placed differently on the page, or with some design element added to them, that may be okay.\r\n• Within each slide you will find a text box (with yellow highlighted text) that provides the name of the photo to be used in that slide. Once you’ve inserted the image, that box can be deleted.\r\n• We discovered that the majority of photos found were horizontal, therefore, the majority of the photos we chose are horizontal. However, there are some that are not.\r\n\r\nOf most importance to us is consistency throughout the presentation. This includes:\r\no Font (type, size – as much as possible, color, spacing, etc.)\r\no Colors\r\no Bullet points (color, size, type, etc.)\r\no Shape borders (color, line style and width, transparency, etc.)\r\no Logo placement (as much as possible – understand if it needs to be moved to accommodate image placement)\r\n\r\nAll the old images have been removed, and content has been added - now we just need it to be designed and have the new images added.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1606407729189724161','NA',7,'United States','Richmond Hill',65.000,'perhour',65.000,'2022-12-23',1,'2022-12-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-23 21:58:04',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
