(4609,'Designing a book cover professionally',2,'Looking for a professional graphic designer who can bring a champion story to life!! this story has done extremely well in America but is due to be released in Feb 2023 in the UK. the cover that worked in the US will not work in the UK or other countries. The US Publicist designed the first cover for \"A Voice Out of Poverty\" from a chapter in the book \"My Coat of Many Colours - along by Dolly Parton\" The UK Publisher says that the cover means nothing and does not work. Please visit my website www.jilliannhaslam.com and read a few of the book reviews in order to get an idea of the story. The book is based on Resilience & Adversity. The current Publicist said that she likes the cover with half the face but I do not. The Published likes number 8a but I still do not believe that we have found the right image to match such a powerful story. Many thanks, Jillian','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01642a2e663f9615c0/apply/','-',7,'United States','London',400.000,'fixed',400.000,'2022-12-29',1,'2022-12-29',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-29 20:11:05',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
