(4615,'Branding Package',2,'The way I like to work is to create a full brand guide for your business that includes a logo, type-font, color scheme, logo proper and improper use for different mediums, background gradients and other graphics. This full brand kit is everything that you need for your web presence, marketing etc and others on your team can take the kit and use it for the entire foundation of developing your online and offline presence.\r\n\r\nTypically this process takes 2-3 weeks, faster or slower depending on how frequently we communicate and how quickly you are able to get back to me with feedback. This process takes about 15 hours and includes up to three revisions, rounds of feedback on the full brand guide. The early iterations of specific elements are also included in this process. If you need additional revisions, other graphic elements or specific marketing material created from the brand kit I’ll do my best to quote you on the number of additional hours outside the original scope that might be needed.\r\n\r\nThe total price of the brand kit is $400 at an hourly rate of $25/hr. I usually charge more but because you are friends with Austin I’ve included ~20% discount. If it’s ok with you I ask that clients pay half up font and the remaining when at the conclusion of the project.\r\n\r\nSee logo below please. I love concept of it, but it is too busy and not quite right.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1608572994207064065','-',7,'United States','Tempe',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2022-12-29',1,'2022-12-29',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-12-29 21:18:52',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
