(4698,'Sales Deck - Presentation Design',2,'I’m building a Solution Sales Deck for a healthcare staffing company. The sales deck should be in the the Minto Pyramid Principle concept.  The current information is 16 slides. I’m working on adding some slides for an early engagement conversation also, which will probably bring the deck to 20 slides.  The output of this exercise is a master deck. From the master desk, we’ll reduce the presentation to 8-12 slides as needed.  I’ve put together draft material, but I’d like someone to push back and offer suggestions, such as “ this has too many words”, and “lets change the prose of this”.\r\nThe graphics for the slides will need to be created from scratch.  I have a logo that I can provide and a color scheme for the brand.  \r\nFollowing are the sections of a complete consulting presentation.\r\n1.    Executive Summary\r\n2.    Table of Content\r\n3.    Action Title\r\n4.    Chapters\r\n5.    Body of slides / slides that conform to the narrative\r\n6.    Conclusion / recommendation\r\n7.    Appendix\r\n\r\n1.    Use a professional font like Arial (12/14 font size)\r\n2.    Minimum and consistent use of font colors\r\n3.    Highlight / underline the key point that you wish to make\r\n4.    Have margins all around the slides so that it can breathe\r\n5.    Alignment of the text and the elements in the slide\r\n6.    Each slide should also have a slide number','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1610321402310610945?success','-',7,'United States','Portland',52.000,'perhour',52.000,'2023-01-03',1,'2023-01-03',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-03 17:06:28',NULL,6,3,NULL,139),
