(4751,'WordPress Expert to Build Website for My Publishing Company',3,'Hello Web Designers,\r\n\r\nI’m looking for an expert in WordPress to design and build a website for my publishing company, which provides writing coaching, editing, and publishing consulting services as well as other resources. The ideal person will have experience with Elementor, have experience with transactional websites, be able to provide me with tutorials or hop on some video calls to show me how to do some basic upkeep for the site, and be willing to occasionally help me with some of the more complicated maintenance I may have trouble with.\r\n\r\nThe pages/features I’d like to start with are:\r\nEmail newsletter sign-up and integration\r\nHomepage\r\nAbout Us page\r\nServices page\r\nResource Library (maybe even a password-protected one)\r\nBlog\r\nBookstore\r\nContact Us page\r\n\r\nHowever, I’m thinking I may divide the creation of these pages into stages based on current business needs. For example, Stage 1 would be: home page, services pages, and integrated client onboarding pages/forms.\r\n\r\nWhat the website needs to be able to do:\r\nIntegrated invoicing and payments for services\r\nSell digital (pdfs and access to online courses) and physical products (books, journals)\r\nAffiliate marketing enabled, not through ads, just by recommended resources\r\n\r\nI am also open to any feature/page recommendations from the website builder.\r\n\r\nI plan to expand on this website in the future as business grows, so I’m looking for a website expert I can have a long-term relationship with.\r\n\r\nI’ve created a project brief with preferences, examples, copy, company info, and such that I can provide upon hiring. I’m also happy to provide any additional materials the web builder requires/recommends to get started. The brand kit has already been created and will be provided.\r\n\r\nThis will be the first website for the company, and I’d like the end-product to be a professional, eye-catching, easy to navigate, functional website that reflects the company and enables its growth.\r\n\r\nI’m also happy to work this as a fixed-price project if the web designer prefers. If you could provide an estimated cost range (whether hourly or fixed-price) in your proposal, especially within the parameters of Stage 1, that would be great.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to hearing from you!\r\n\r\nKristen','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1610385788602654721','-',7,'United States','Lenoir City',100.000,'perhour',100.000,'2023-01-03',1,'2023-01-03',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-03 21:22:03',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(4752,'Create an E-Mail Design template for eCommerce',20,'The job will be to turn a pre-made design into a functional E-Mail that will be sent out customers.\r\n\r\nIt is important to stay as close to the given design as possible.\r\n\r\nFast responses and fast turnaround will be prioritized heavily.\r\n\r\nPlease contact us with your available and possible turnaround time, the files are all ready.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01ca41fa679ae21bba/apply/','-',7,'United States','Riga',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-01-03',1,'2023-01-03',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-03 21:25:56',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
(4753,'UX / UI Designer For New Online Coaching Website',3,'Hi, I\'m looking for a UX / UI expert to help design the user journey and visual experience for an online coaching website I\'m working on. I need something professional and thorough that I can hand off to a developer to implement and bring to life. Design needs to be responsive on mobile, but this will all be website based (no app).\r\n\r\nI already have a good idea of the user journey, and have that wire-framed out, but would like feedback on that in case you have suggestions or if I\'m missing anything.\r\n\r\nFrom there, I\'m looking for a thoughtfully designed, visually appealing website. Stylistically prefer modern, clean, and uncluttered. Can be minimalist, but should have creative accents that show a level of attention to detail and appeal that are engaging to the user. We already have the brand name, color palette, and logo completed. Typography is open for discussion.\r\n\r\nHappy to answer any questions you may have. Thank you in advance- I look forward to working with you.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nSteve','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1610388434586980353','-',7,'United States','New York',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2023-01-03',1,'2023-01-03',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-03 21:32:50',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
