(4790,'Branding for Event Installation',2,'Style Guide will be provided but selected vendor must have experience with LARGE FORMAT design (i.e. trade shows, Time Square banners, etc.). Understanding of visibility and scale is critical.\r\n\r\nImages of areas in which each item will be located will be provided upon award of the project.\r\n\r\nItem #1 - Spandex Mural\r\n62’ wide x 10’ 5” high\r\nFull color mural - background will be 35,000 varied/randomized names of people that have visited our church - then our initiative theme will be boldly laid on top. Similar to the Goodyear image attached.\r\n\r\nItem #2 - Two Infographic Wall Images\r\nImage 1 - 16’ 10” wide x 9’ 11” high\r\nImage 2 - 11’ 6” wide x 9’ 11” high\r\nWe will provide key data points and specs but will need you to create a compelling infographic and story from them. These images will be side-by-side with a 3\' gap separating them.\r\n\r\nItem #3 - PROCLAIM banners\r\nIndividual banners for each letter of PROCLAIM\r\nEach banner is to be 10\' high and 3\' wide\r\nFull color - similar to Item #1, each banner will have various images behind a semi-transparent background but each letter (P R O C L A I M) is to be bold and clearly visible\r\n\r\nItem #4 - Overhead Banner #1\r\n8\' high x 46\' wide\r\nFull color - design concept by you\r\n\r\nItem #5 - Overhead Banner #2\r\n5\' High x 58\' wide\r\nFull color - design concept by you\r\n\r\nItem #6 - Hanging Signs\r\n4\' high x 20\" wide\r\nWe will need to produce 120 signs to hang from Rafters once people hand write on them. This need is to create the template of the signs.\r\n\r\nEverything will be located within proximity to each other so the final three items are to be created with that reality in mind.\r\n\r\nAll items are to be completed and ready for production by 1/19/23. This project will be awarded 1/5/23.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1610655347355312129','-',7,'United States','Celina',5000.000,'fixed',5000.000,'2023-01-04',1,'2023-01-04'