(4809,'2-page business brochure design for an Australian accounting business',13,'I\'m looking for an expert to help us design a business brochure that presents our story well and is visually looking good. We are a small startup in Australia so having experience with businesses in similar industries in Australia is a must.\r\n\r\nWe already have content for the business brochure. It is about 2 pages long with 6 sections. We will provide you with our logo and the content. We currently don\'t have any other marketing materials so you might need to use photos from Canva for your design (which we are happy to give you access to our subscription temporarily).\r\nWhat is very important to us is that:\r\n- The brochure tells our story well and clearly outlines\r\n- Has nice visuals\r\n- Easy for readers to read and navigate through\r\n- Consistent branding elements and format\r\n\r\nWe need an EXPERT, not just someone who just copies a template from Canva and replaces it with our text and photos etc.\r\n\r\nWe need two versions of the brochure: one is for printing and the other is a digital copy in pdf format. At the end of the project, we also need you to give us the editable version of the design so that if there are any simple minor changes later(such as contact details, service type..etc), we can quickly edit them ourselves.\r\n\r\nIdeally, we would like to start this project asap and get the design done before New Year.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this job, please submit your proposal with your price and some samples. Prefer a fixed price over an hourly rate. Thank you and I look forward to working with you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01cc8a8e61ee709a42/apply/','-',7,'United States','Morley',20.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-01-04',1,'2023-01-04',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-04 16:51:44',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
