(4826,'90 Product Commercial Video',8,'I\'m looking for someone to create a commercial-like video to help highlight our product\'s key features and benefits.\r\n\r\nLength: 60-90 seconds\r\nStyle: commercial/product video\r\nDue Date: January 25, 2023\r\n\r\nGoal:\r\n- explain who our product is for (DTC brands) and how it helps them quickly grow sales\r\n\r\nAssets we\'ll provide:\r\n- platform screen recordings to showcase product features\r\n- videos from brands using our platform\r\n- existing customer logos\r\n- Figma files to make animating certain features easier\r\n- voiceover\r\n- a loose storyboard to help guide the project\r\n- brand guidelines\r\n\r\nWhat we\'ll need:\r\n- royalty-free audio track\r\n- strong animation of text\r\n- clean cutouts of our screen recordings to isolate on key features\r\n- storyboarding support to help craft the best video possible\r\n- quick turnaround time\r\n\r\nExample of a similar video that we\'d like to achieve:\r\n- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4AgXd7W6lbA','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Product-Commercial-Video_~01ab672a013005be8d/','-',7,'United States','Toronto',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-01-04',1,'2023-01-04',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-04 19:04:57',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
(4827,'Figma Designer Needed (Website Mockups & Landing Pages)',3,'We\'re a growing web design & development agency and looking to partner with a talented Figma designer to help out with website design projects. No coding or development skills are required, we\'re just looking for someone to work on the design side of things.\r\n\r\nThe ideal person would be willing to be client facing and could go throughout the whole design process with our clients, with the final deliverable being the full website mocked up in Figma, ready for development.\r\n\r\nWe typically work with startups & brands in the tech space, so designs must be top notch to meet the expectations our clients have of us.\r\n\r\nMost of the sites we develop have complex animations, so we\'re looking for someone who can come up with fresh ideas within their designs.\r\n\r\nWe\'re also open to working with agencies, and working on a fixed price basis as well if that is what is preferred.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Expert in Figma\r\n- Proficient in English & Communication\r\n- UI/UX Background\r\n\r\nBonus Skills (Not required)\r\n- Graphic Design Experience\r\n- Photoshop/Illustrator\r\n- Logo Design & Branding Experience\r\n\r\nSo that we know you read this whole thing and understand what\'s expected, please respond with \"Figma Rocks\" in your response.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1610714800494399489','-',7,'United States','Orem',70.000,'Open this select menu',70.000,'2023-01-04',1,'2023-01-04',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-04 19:12:02',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
