(4864,'Book Cover Creation [+ Paperback Manuscript Adaptations]',2,'Looking for an experienced and professional book cover designer to create a book cover based on the model of an existing book. We need one cover, that in the end will be used in three formats (paperback, ebook & audiobook). The book will be published on Amazon, so the paperback will be a full-size paperback, including spine and the back cover as well. We already have the cover draft ready, and know what we want, so there will be no time needed for creating different cover drafts. We also have the manuscript both as a word file, as well as a finished PDF manuscript, that was used for a paperback version of this book published previously. You will have to do some adaptations to the paperback manuscript, such as increasing the margins to the sides, however apart from this, there won\'t be major modifications needed.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1610754226307178497','-',7,'United States','Vienna',150.000,'fixed',150.000,'2023-01-04',1,'2023-01-04',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-04 21:46:11',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(4865,'Graphic Designer for Instagram posts',2,'Hi,\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for a graphic designer who can create instagram posts on a regular basis for a growing fashion brand.\r\nWe are in the middle of discovering our brand visual identity - colors, fonts, graphics etc\r\nWe do have topics and messages we want to send out though.\r\n\r\n-Need about 3-5 original posts a week.\r\n-Create a database of templates (backgrounds + logo) in Canva for Instagram stories and text only posts.\r\n-using brand visual look in instagram planning tool planoly\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n-using canva for designs\r\n-good eye for visuals\r\n-using planoly planning for\r\n\r\nWe are a fast fashion brand in sustainable way and we are in the process of developing an app. We are launching many new styles in very different design and colors. our price point is slightly above zara but not expensive and we are trendy and fashionable.\r\nOur message is we love fashion and we love our planet. Thats why we created LeTribe!\r\nWe are redefining sustainable fashion and showing that it can look great and attractive. We rather want to be bold and fashionable instead of classic sustainable look. We want to change the perception of sustainable fashion totally. So please do keep that in mind when creating the visuals.\r\n\r\nOur style and tone is positive, attractive, witty, bold, modern.\r\n\r\nInstagram accounts that we like:\r\n\r\n@reformation\r\n@fleurdumalnyc\r\n@ganni\r\n\r\nMust have experience with instagram posts previously with accounts that have +50k followers. Any inquiries please include instagram handles to accounts that have your work.\r\n\r\nTo apply we ask to make a paid test assignment.\r\nPlease create us 3 different moodboards (combination on 9 posts) of the look and feel of @letribers with color schemes and graphic design.\r\n- modern, bold and pop look\r\n- softer and more sophisticated look (maybe also more mature colors)\r\n- modern tribal look\r\n\r\nPlease add any photos there as inspiration (photo editing style is also up to you to choose). As well as graphics for messages.\r\nNB: please keep in mind that our photos of clothes will not be in specific colour scheme. we can not keep that as we produce clothes in all colors. So please do also include that in the visual planning. If there are only one tone of clothes then this is not realistic. in terms of clothes please check zara as we also have a wide selection of styles.\r\n\r\nHere are photos of our clothes and please use them in the mood board. They could be designed or filtered how ever you like though:\r\nhttps://we.tl/t-OGu5MFp0mC\r\n\r\nBudget for that would be 100 Eur for a test assignment.\r\nBut that successful test assignment will lead to a contract of 3000 USD.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to working with you:)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1610756622180601857','-',7,'United States','Tallinn',3000.000,'fixed',3000.000,'2023-01-04',1,'2023-01-04',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-04 21:55:41',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(4866,'Book Cover Creation [+ Paperback Manuscript Adaptations]',2,'Looking for an experienced and professional book cover designer to create a book cover based on the model of an existing book. We need one cover, that in the end will be used in three formats (paperback, ebook & audiobook). The book will be published on Amazon, so the paperback will be a full-size paperback, including spine and the back cover as well. We already have the cover draft ready, and know what we want, so there will be no time needed for creating different cover drafts. We also have the manuscript both as a word file, as well as a finished PDF manuscript, that was used for a paperback version of this book published previously. You will have to do some adaptations to the paperback manuscript, such as increasing the margins to the sides, however apart from this, there won\'t be major modifications needed.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1610756945282027521?success','-',7,'United States','Vienna',150.000,'fixed',150.000,'2023-01-04',1,'2023-01-04',1,'Fixed Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-04 21:57:02',NULL,6,3,NULL,140),
