(4868,'New Tequila Logo & Package Design',2,'Bandita Tequila should be edgy and fun, a little dangerous, a little seductive sexy. The East Indes bottle in the attached images is a very excellent direction. I can see the attached Lima eyes image being surrounded by Mexican art colors. The Indes bottle is actually a printed sticker/label, not screen printed. I\'m not opposed to a screen-printed or labeled front and an image sticker/label on the back of the bottle. Labels are easier. We\'re looking for one person/company to design the logo and bottle graphics, it doesn\'t make sense to do these separately. Bottle 1 and 2 is the bottle we\'ve chosen. Sorry, I don\'t have exact dimensions today.\r\n\r\nPlease don\'t apply unless you have completed similar projects.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1610760916800004097?success','-',7,'United States','Austin',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-01-04',1,'2023-01-04',1,'Fixed Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-04 22:12:56',NULL,6,3,NULL,140),
