(4874,'2 Event Flyers',12,'We are looking to have 2 flyers created. They will require high level creativity while clearly communicating information.\r\nThe event information will be given - here is an example of one of the 2 events\' info: RENEW.org Southern California RelationShift Event: DiscipleShift Requires RelationShift\r\nDate: Tuesday, February 28, 2023\r\nHost Church: Calvary Community Church; 603 S. Valencia Avenue, Brea, CA 92823\r\nTime: 10:00 am to 1:00 pm PST\r\n\r\nBoth flyers should be similar but distinct from one another.\r\nBoth should highlight our main speaker \"Jim Putman\" - headshot and bio will be given to include.\r\n\r\nThe flyer should graphically represent that the featured book \"RelationShift\" is a sequel to the best selling book \"DiscipleShift\" by using elements from the 2 book covers (attached)\r\n\r\nPreference is that there is a transition represented in the artwork from DiscipleShift (use clearly recognizable title image) to the current book. The current book (RelationShift) should have the full cover featured somewhere on the flyer with the text \"All attendees will recieve a free copy of Jim\'s new book RelationShift.\"\r\n\r\nAll titles should be italicized...','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01527abc69cad6e039/apply/','-',7,'United States','Franklin',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-01-04',1,'2023-01-04',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-04 23:00:06',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
