(4877,'Web Designer for Creative Agency Website',3,'We are seeking a highly talented and experienced web designer to create an innovative and visually striking website for our agency. We are looking for someone who can bring fresh ideas to the table and can create unique designs rather than relying on templates.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n1. Conduct research on competitors to gather insights on industry trends and best practices\r\n2. Brainstorm and develop visual concepts for the agency website\r\n3. Create the designs\r\n4. Collaborate with the development team to ensure smooth delivery of the final designs\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\n1. Proficiency in design software such as Photoshop, Figma or other industry software.\r\n2. Strong portfolio showcasing original and creative web design work\r\n3. Ability to think critically and bring new ideas to the table\r\n4. Excellent communication skills and ability to work well in a team environment\r\n\r\nWe are excited to see what you can bring to the table and look forward to reviewing your application!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1611004255570583553','-',7,'United States','Beer sheva',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-01-05',1,'2023-01-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-05 14:20:30',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
(4878,'Designing a Wine Bottle Label',2,'To produce a label for an artisan Perry (i.e. pear cider) to go on champaign style bottles with an exposed cork and wire cage (i.e. no metal foil). The words on the label should contain (but not necessarily in this order):\r\n\r\n\"\r\nSaul Lodge\r\nArlingham\r\nSevern Vale\r\n\r\nPerry\r\n\r\nProduct of England\r\n\"\r\n\r\nI would like to go for a classic style with a pail background (this could be printed on a white or textured off-white paper but not be full label printed in colour).\r\n\r\nImage wise I would like to have a stylised drawing of the \"Yellow Hufcap Pear\" either singular or as a bunch which is very distinctive with it\'s Rugby Ball shape and speckles. See attached an images of the pear to show the style. The image on the label could be a small logo as an outline with speckles or as a larger water-print behind the text. This is open to discussion.\r\n\r\nThis is not a commercial venture, only 500 bottles are produced each year for friends and family, hence the small budget.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you would like any more information.\r\n\r\nMany thanks\r\n\r\nAdrian','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1611012671558234113','-',7,'United States','Cirencester',250.000,'Open this select menu',250.000,'2023-01-05',1,'2023-01-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-05 14:53:53',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
