(4881,'Create Pitch Deck from an existing website.',11,'Hi,\r\n\r\nWe would like to create a brochure for our business, Condor Partners. We have a detailed website and all we need to do is translate it into a PowerPoint deck, which can than be PDF\'d and circulated to potential clients.\r\n\r\nHere is the source website: https://condorpartners.net/\r\n\r\nFor this task, we just need somebody to pull the content from the website and reformat it into a PPT deck. Since websites and pitch decks are different formats, we need to creatively move around the content to make it more presentable in a PPT format.\r\n\r\nThe format should follow this layout:\r\n\r\n- Cover slide\r\n- Our Story slide\r\n- Our team, highlighting only the three Partners, with space next to their images to include Bios (which we will add)\r\n- Project Overview - Mural Park (https://www.condorpartners.net/projects/muralpark)\r\n- Project Overview - Trulee (https://www.condorpartners.net/projects/trulee)\r\n- Project Overview - Duke of Wells (Proposed) https://www.condorpartners.net/projects/wells\r\n- Past Projects - single slide summarizing a few examples of past projects\r\n- Recommendations - use the \"News\" tab to populate','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1611017715149443073','-',7,'United States','Chicago',45.000,'Open this select menu',45.000,'2023-01-05',1,'2023-01-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-05 15:14:24',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
