(4899,'Modern Web Developer Needed for Relaunch of Publication Website with e-Commerce Store',4,'We are seeking a web developer with a modern design eye for the relaunch of our entertainment-based website. The website will have articles, events, podcast episodes, digital advertising opportunities for businesses and an e-Commerce store.\r\n\r\nThe web developer will build the site infrastructure which will be based off a mockup that we will provide to you. The e-Commerce store will sell a wide variety of items that includes t-shirts, hats, and accessories.\r\n\r\nWeb Developer Qualifications:\r\n• Innovative web developer with experience developing multi-page sites that receive a high volume of web traffic\r\n• Experience building e-Commerce store workflows from product pages to the payment page\r\n• Experience building web banners for digital advertising and tracking\r\n• Must be able to design for both mobile and desktop with Google’s mobile-first indexing in mind  \r\n• Strong attention to detail\r\n• Understanding of best search engine optimization (SEO) practices for the main part of the site and e-Commerce store\r\n• Ability to troubleshoot and optimize web pages for security and responsiveness\r\n• Optimizing web pages for conversion and user engagement\r\n• Great written and verbal communication skills\r\n\r\nExperience:\r\n• Minimum of five years of experience as a web developer\r\n• HTML5 (Required)\r\n• WordPress and WooCommerce Experience (2 years)\r\n• 5 years of proficiency in programming languages (Javascript, CSS, HTML)\r\n\r\nLocation: Fully remote position.\r\n\r\nPay: Starting at $5,000+\r\n\r\nPlease send you resume with web page examples and portfolios to be considered. Scheduling interviews soon!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1611046868306714625?success','-',7,'United States','Houston',7500.000,'fixed',7500.000,'2023-01-05',1,'2023-01-05',1,'fix',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-05 17:09:20',NULL,6,3,NULL,139),
