(5027,'Looking to turn a children\'s book into a movie short (cartoon)',8,'I have published a children\'s book on anxiety, called \'This Thing Has A Name\', and I own the rights to all of the art, which was done by someone else. I would like to take the existing art, and turn it into a short film, think Pixar Shorts.\r\n\r\nThe book is being sold in the US, Canada, the UK, and France. It just won a national award, and it\'s starting to gain traction, and I think having a short film would be amazing.\r\n\r\nI would like to have control over the narration.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested and want to talk more...please reach out and send me your portfolio. Also, please keep in-mind, it\'s very important to me that we use the art that\'s already created, although I appreciate since it will literally be moving, that you would need to supplement in places, so please look at website the cover of the book really gives a sense of the art work.\r\n\r\nI have the artwork in ADOBE, I know nothing about how you take that and make it move.\r\n\r\nI can\'t imagine the total \"short\" would be longer than 15 minutes.\r\n\r\nThe book is This Thing Has A Name...my website is https://www.thisthinghasaname.com/ and the book is also on Amazon.\r\n\r\nI am open to creating a flat fee, or being billed by the hour. I would put together an NDA and contract for us to agree upon.\r\n\r\nTHANKS!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Looking-turn-children-book-into-movie-short-cartoon_~0147825c5895caa029/','-',7,'United States','newfields',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-01-06',1,'2023-01-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-06 19:51:54',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
