(5050,'PowerPoint Presentation Slide Design and Graphic Design',11,'Moxie Institute is growing!\r\n\r\nWe are seeking talented slide designers to join our team. Moxie\'s presentation designers create engaging, on-brand visual concepts via slide presentations to communicate ideas that inspire, inform, and captivate an audience or viewer.\r\n\r\nWe are seeking project-based graphic, slide, and PowerPoint designers with experience creating slide decks for business presentations, TED talks, sales pitches, and conference/event presentations.\r\n\r\nWe love slide decks that focus on high-impact emotional imagery that aligns with our client\'s message, captures the attention of large audiences, and moves them to action. However, we realize this style isn\'t perfect for every situation. The ability to create infographics and complex data visualization is a plus.\r\n\r\nRESPONSIBILITIES INCLUDE:\r\n• Meet with clients and stakeholders to determine the scope of a project\r\n• Advise clients and team on strategies to reach a particular audience\r\n• Ability to maintain our client\'s brand and style\r\n• Select colors, images, text style, and layout as it relates to the presentation\r\n• Strong communication skills\r\n• Strong ability to present the design to both clients and the internal team\r\n• Manage time effectively, multi-task, and meet deadlines\r\n• Detail-oriented individual who reviews work carefully\r\n• Self-starter with the ability to work independently\r\n\r\nIf you have a shared mission to be a positive force in people\'s lives and you have slide and visual design skills, we want to meet you!\r\n\r\nTo learn more, check out who we are, what we do, and why Moxie Institute dot com.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1611494231018135553','-',7,'United States','San Diego',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-01-06',1,'2023-01-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-06 22:49:56',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
