(5081,'Logo Designer + Branding',2,'I am looking for a person who can create the logo and help visualize it. I have the the perspective how it should look like - need the right hand to draw it properly. I put \"branding\" so a person would understand that the logo will the define the brand. The logo will consist og wording only (no image). Logo should be that bubly compact wording I imagine. I will try to draw a draft.\r\n\r\nThe customer target is modern woman age 20 - 50 (older Gen Z; millennials) . It will be the athletic brand with a voice to support women. Keywords: vintage \'60+modern feminity+pastel tones+luxury+sustainability.  It is a start up brand which will see expansion after 1st revenue only. Invest personal money - I am a big believer of my idea and concept. It is me - my character and soul.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if interested! Do not want to sound cheeky as I prefer females for this role as the brand plan  to support women or who identify themselves in such. Thanks for understanding! :0','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1612476441435136001','-',7,'United States','Marina Del Rey',85.000,'perhour',85.000,'2023-01-09',1,'2023-01-09',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-09 15:57:12',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
