(5084,'Graphic Designer to Create a Banner for Printing',2,'We are looking for a Graphic Designer who will help us design a banner that will be used for a booth. The design will be simple that will only contain the name of the company. The banner size will be 3ft width x 2ft height.\r\n\r\nApplicants may send a sample of a similar design.\r\n\r\nWho we are\r\n\r\nFriends of Hue Foundation (friendsofhue.org) was officially founded in May 2000 in San Jose to assist victims of the November 1999 flood that ravaged Central Vietnam, specifically those who resided in the Thua Thien Hue Province. The floods took 595 lives while subjecting 55,000 to homelessness, causing $290 million in damage to the region and $490 million in economic losses. It is estimated that 1.7 million people of the Central Provinces of Vietnam were affected by the floods.\r\n\r\nSince its inception, FHF has served Hue’s impoverished population by offering her residents access to health care, education, and economic self-sufficiency. Today, FHF continues to play a vital role in helping to reduce poverty by equipping our community with business and skills development while also implementing sustainable solutions to mend communities in Hue and throughout Vietnam.\r\n\r\nFHF was the first officially registered United States-based INGO with a physical presence to provide Thua Thien Hue Province services. As the organization grew, FHF fostered a meaningful and relationship with the Santa Clara County Vietnamese American community. FHF is dedicated to providing social and financial support to meet the needs of our underserved Asian populations.\r\n\r\nThank you for applying, and we look forward to hearing from you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1612480902692192257?success','-',7,'United States','San Jose',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-01-09',1,'2023-01-09',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-09 16:07:57',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
(5085,'Designer to Create Building Illustrations',2,'We are searching for a Graphic Designer with experience in creating realistic building renderings. The end use for these graphics is to be included in our pitch decks and marketing collateral.\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\nRenderings of 4 Building Types (High-Rise Multifamily, Garden Style Multi-family, Hosptial, Industrial)\r\nFor each building type, we need to create a series of graphics that show where our technology is inside the building. We have 4 systems: Cellular, Wifi, Public Safety Radio, and Smart Building Technology. We will provide exact direction on where the technology needs to be identified in each building rendering.\r\n\r\nAlthough this project is pretty straightforward, we have a quick turnaround time for the project. We are hoping to have the graphics by Monday, January 16th.\r\n\r\nAttached are examples of the type of rendering that we have found as good examples to reference but they can be improved upon.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1612481314207326209?success','-',7,'United States','Washington Dc',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-01-09',1,'2023-01-09',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-09 16:10:20',NULL,6,3,NULL,139),
