(5088,'Company Logo Design',10,'I\'m in the process of changing my company name, which means I require a new logo. I\'m looking for a designer that can take my requirements and create a professional, modern design that fits with the company brand.\r\n\r\nI will require the following formats:\r\n- PNG\r\n- JPG\r\n- EPS\r\n- TIF\r\n- Black and white\r\n\r\nThe logo will be simplistic. Therefore, I would like some innovation included e.g. using a different font for a letter. The company will be running for 10 years this year. As a result of this, I would like an additional inclusion around a reference to this for the website. This can be discussed further.\r\n\r\nI would expect a series of designs to be submitted (at least six), and the opportunity for revisions to be made (at least two).\r\n\r\nI\'ve attached a copy of the current logo to give an indication of the style previously used. Whilst the name is changing, the style will likely remain similar.\r\n\r\nDue to requirements of my clients, it\'s often a requirement to meet their brand guidelines, which can involve colour. Therefore, ideally I would like to ability to change the colour of the logo and/or text when required. Again, this can be discussed.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1612485275033653249','-',7,'United States','Southampton',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-01-09',1,'2023-01-09',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-09 16:24:50',NULL,6,3,NULL,116),
