(5217,'Graphic Designer and Branding Specialist for Ecommerce and Marketing Agency',2,'Job Description:\r\n\r\nWe are a growing ecommerce and marketing agency looking for an experienced graphic designer and branding specialist to help create visually stunning designs and develop strong brand identities for our clients. The ideal candidate will have a strong portfolio of work and experience working in the ecommerce and marketing industry.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nCreate visually compelling designs for websites, social media campaigns, email marketing, and other digital marketing materials\r\nWork with clients to understand their brand and create designs that align with their brand identity\r\nCollaborate with the marketing and development teams to ensure designs are functional and technically feasible\r\nCreate graphics, logos, and visual elements for clients\r\nReviewing final designs for errors and making needed changes\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nStrong experience with design software such as Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign)\r\nStrong portfolio of design work, demonstrating experience in web design, branding, and print design\r\nStrong understanding of design principles, typography, composition and layout\r\nExperience working with ecommerce and marketing related designs\r\nStrong communication and project management skills\r\nBonus: Knowledge of web development and front-end technologies such as HTML, CSS, and JavaScript\r\nAs a freelancer, you will have the opportunity to work with a wide variety of clients and industries, and the flexibility to set your own schedule. If you are passionate about design and branding, and are looking to work with a dynamic and fast-paced agency, we would love to hear from you!\r\n\r\nPay:\r\nTo be discussed on the call. This will depend on the scope of work.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1612831000517263361?success','-',7,'United States','london',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-01-10',1,'2023-01-10',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-10 15:19:14',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
