(5257,'Hand trace topo map into useable vector image',2,'See image attached.\r\n\r\nI am looking for someone to trace this image and turn it into a vector that I can use. The map should include all topo lines, elevation numbers, street and trail names, outlines of houses and greenspaces.\r\n\r\nThere should be no shading and no background. Please keep the colors and line widths/styles as close to the original as possible.\r\n\r\nDo not include the green words \"Grand Junction\" or \"Colorado National Monument\" which are tiled throughout.\r\n\r\nThe file should be delivered in adobe illustrator format so I can make changes as necessary. Text should be editable (no outlines).\r\n\r\nThere will be a small \"test assignment\" also attached before starting the full project. Thanks!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1612846682256556033?success','-',7,'United States','Loveland',152.000,'fixed',152.000,'2023-01-10',1,'2023-01-10',1,'fix',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-10 16:21:31',NULL,10,3,NULL,139),
