(5274,'Birdview illustration for childrens game',2,'Hi,\r\nwe are a young boardgame publisher based in Luxemburg.\r\n\r\nFor 2023 we are planning to launch a series of small games based in a \'children friendly playable world\'.\r\n\r\nIn 1 \'world/location\' we will have\r\n\r\n- 16 cards made from \'cardboard\' - printed both sides  - size maximum 58x58 mm\r\n(i.e. same \'location\' (i.e. city or farm etc) but one side day, the other night, or one side sunny, the other snowy etc)\r\n- 6 (maybe 8 ?) different wooden meeples with heat transfer image on both sides\r\n- 1 \'explanation\' sheet   (since it is not really a ruled game)\r\n- 1 tuckbox (size 65.5 mm x 115 mm x 34.5 mm)\r\n\r\n\r\nas of today we are planning on 9 \'locations\' to start with - scheduled over the next 3 years - so 3 locations +- per annum\r\n\r\nthe following will most likely be the starting locations/meeples  (in no particular order)\r\n\r\n- city / car, bycicle, policecar, schoolbus, ambulance, motorcycle (tramway, firetruck)\r\n- forest / owl, fox, roe deer, badger, marten, wild boar (bat, woodpecker)\r\n- airport / 3 different planes, taxi, helicopter, follow-me-car (bus, fuel-truck)\r\n- meadow / bee, butterfly, snail, ladybird, hedgehog, rabbit (lizard, mole)\r\n- farm / dog, cow, pig, sheep, rooster, hen (tractor, mouse)\r\n- horse farm / horse, mare, foal, cat, mouse, donkey (horse trailer, pony)\r\n- lake / 3 different trouts, heron, frog, paddleboat (tent, campfire)\r\n- mountains / goat, chamois, ibex, marmot, golden eagle, wolf (shepherd dog, bear)\r\n- trainstation / 2 different locomotives, 4 different wagons (2 more wagons)\r\n\r\nAlso imaginable are extra tuckboxes with just meeples in order to \'complete\' a location.\r\nSuch a tuckbox should have 8 (maybe 10?) meeples\r\n\r\n- i.e. farm-addon / 1 bull, 1 cow, 1 calf, 1 sheep, 1 buck ram, 1 lamb, 1 hen, 1 chick)\r\n- i.e. city-addon / different \'people\'\r\netc...\r\n\r\nIMPORTANT _ the worlds must be designed in a way, that they will later \'fit\' together (and must have some common objects - like road or railway - to connect them)\r\n\r\nYour job would be to produce all the graphics needed for the tiles, rules, box and some internet teasers on minimum 3 worlds. If they are successful, the other world-jobs will follow of course.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1612853283186892801?success','-',7,'United States','Luxembourg',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-01-10',1,'2023-01-10',1,'fix',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-10 16:47:26',NULL,10,3,NULL,139),
