(5279,'Logo design',10,'This job is a logo design for a new product/company. We will launch a new brand, specializing in sleep and comfort. The bread and butter of this industry is the mattress, thereby we will start selling mattresses under this new brand however will add other materials under the brand, such as pillow, linen sheet, blanket and sleep support and comfort products, since the brand is all about sleep and comfort.\r\n\r\nI\'m from Turkey, for this reason I gave a Turkish name, tweaked a little with 1 letter, meaning Sleep in Turkish - UYQU - the names resembles what I envision about the brand in Turkish meaning - I also want to emphasize the mattress part of it in the brand so as well as reflect it to the design. Here\'s what I have in mind:\r\n\r\nUYQU\r\nMattress & Beyond\r\n\r\nor alternatively, I have this in mind:\r\n\r\nUYQU\r\nSleep & Comfort\r\n\r\nI also want to include Blue, Silver and/orange, Gold, comforting colors for sleep, in the logo design. Check the attached file which I tried illustrating what I have in mind. I want the amblem and the whole wording next to each other and sometimes, I want to be able to use the wording without the amblem in The Whole Logo. In other words, I want the amblem and the all wordings to form the MAIN LOGO, however I want to be able to use the wordings in the main logo, and/or the amblem, to be able to use to represent the brand.\r\n \r\n\r\nless\r\nMore/Less about\r\nView job posting\r\nIntermediate,\r\nExperience Level\r\n$15.00 -$25.00\r\nHourly Range\r\nLess than 30 hrs/week','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1612857787323817985?success','-',7,'United States','Mount Prospect',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-01-10',1,'2023-01-10',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-10 17:05:26',NULL,9,3,NULL,140),
(5280,'Wordpress Designer / Developer to help build out an up and coming site',3,'I\'m looking for a designer / developer that can help build out a website that I\'m working on.\r\n\r\nI own Tattoos.com and I\'m looking to re-build the existing HTML site into a wordpress site, as well as add some things using Dall-E for AI generated tattoo ideas, with a new homepage.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking to create a directory element to the site that lists the top tattoo shops in major cities that I will then sell ads to local shops.\r\n\r\nThe site will need to have sign up for tattoo shops / artists to create a profile, advertise their shop, and post tattoos wanted in a mini job board\r\n\r\nAnd then a blog as well that works.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1612859240350859265','-',7,'United States','Burlington',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-01-10',1,'2023-01-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-10 17:11:36',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(5281,'Graphics Production Assistant - web graphics & social media graphics',2,'I\'m looking for someone to take a finished design for a campaign or project, and make graphics for it in typical social media and web graphic sizes (depending on the project -- banners, homepage widgets, email headers, etc.)\r\n\r\nThis role is not primarily design -- it\'s primarily production. However, a good graphic sensibility is required in order to make the content work in many different sizes.\r\n\r\nMy workflow is primarily InDesign, as campaigns require a mix of print and web materials, whose first iteration is in InDesign. A strong understanding of InDesign and export options is required.\r\n\r\nPlease provide an example set of images you have made for the same campaign, only in different sizes/versions. Please limit your examples to about 5, or place them in one PDF','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1612859873067622401?success','-',7,'United States','Aurora',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-01-10',1,'2023-01-10',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-10 17:13:33',NULL,10,3,NULL,139),
