(5288,'UX/UI Designer needed',6,'We are looking for a skilled UX/UI Designer for 3-6 months, part time or full-time.\r\n\r\nAs a product-led-growth company with a self-serve approach, our product is the core of our business. Our users should fall in love with our amazing design and usability.\r\n\r\nYou will be mainly responsible for the design of our desktop and mobile application. You will transform design challenges and tasks from our product manager into wireframes, mockups or high fidelity designs.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- You have at least 5+ years of experience as a UX/UI designer\r\n- You know how to design software and mobile apps very well\r\n- You are very familiar with Figma and Adobe XD\r\n- You are a great analytical thinker, creative, detail-oriented, excellent communicator and used to work autonomously\r\n\r\nYou will be part of an international working environment (15 nationalities of our 35 employees) characterized by flat hierarchies and a great company spirit.\r\n\r\nWe are looking forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1612870376349347841','-',7,'United States','Delhi',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-01-10',1,'2023-01-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-10 17:55:16',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
