(5292,'Pitch Deck design',11,'Designer Wanted\r\n\r\nWe are a new company in need of a talented designer to create a visually compelling pitch deck to help us secure funding and attract potential clients.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for someone who is able to take a creative approach and think outside the box to create a design that will make a strong impression.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Collaborate with the team to understand the company\'s vision and goals\r\n- Create a design that effectively communicates the company\'s value proposition and unique selling points\r\n- Utilize design software to create visually appealing slides that are easy to understand and engaging\r\n- Work with the team to incorporate any necessary changes and ensure the final design is polished and professional.\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n- Strong portfolio of design work, with a focus on pitch deck design or similar projects\r\n- Experience with design software such as Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, and InDesign\r\n- Excellent attention to detail and ability to work under tight deadlines\r\n- Strong communication and collaboration skills\r\n\r\nThis is a great opportunity for a creative and driven designer to play an instrumental role in the launch of a new company. If you\'re excited about the chance to make a real impact, please apply with your portfolio and resume.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1612873833674268673','-',7,'United States','Tel Aviv',75.000,'Open this select menu',75.000,'2023-01-10',1,'2023-01-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-10 18:09:19',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
