(5295,'Logo for non-profit',10,'I would like a logo for a non-profit. Description of the non- profit: a group dedicated to earth and climate issues that involves getting churches together as a group to help glorify and honor God’s creation by caring for the planet, plants, wildlife, water…\r\nI am also hoping that it can be a vehicle for both believers and non-believers to join together to care for the gift that is our world and through doing so, fine common ground.\r\nThe domain name is EarthMinistries.org and the by line is\r\n“Caring for God’s Creation Together, or something along those lines.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1612878431424176129?success','-',7,'United States','Woodside',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-01-10',1,'2023-01-10',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-10 18:27:51',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
