(5300,'Illustration and Animation',8,'We are looking for someone that can build us a full production young adult (Ages 12-18) cartoon/animated production. Please read the full description.\r\n\r\nThere is no budget set on this job. I am open to your proposal, as we are looking for the right candidate, but we are also looking for a good price, so keep that in mind. Here is what your bid should consider:\r\n\r\n1. We are looking to create 7 minute animated shorts. That include a few characters in a circumstance that find a solution to their circumstance. You will be provided a script that the characters and voices will follow.\r\n2. Animation style is undetermined, we are open to examples to choose from.\r\n3. Characters will be unique and created in whatever style we determine.\r\n4. Once each script is written, we will collect the voice overs and send the voice files to you. (We will pay for all voicing)\r\n5. The animation flow, the voicing, and production will then all be put together by you for a final deliverable which is approximately 8 minutes long with a short opening theme of about 20 seconds, and end credits of about 40 seconds.\r\n\r\nYour bid on this job is for a full video created in that manner. We are looking for someone to do 40+ of these videos over time.\r\n\r\nWhat we need to know from you:\r\n1. Price per video?\r\n2. Styles and examples that you prefer and have done?\r\n3. Do you want credit in the credits, or ghost animation?\r\n4. How long will it take to complete each video start to finish assuming you have the storyline and voices ready?','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1612882319642836993','-',7,'United States','Idaho Falls',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-01-10',1,'2023-01-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-10 18:42:52',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
