(5353,'Design an eye catching website for a Boutique Hotel',3,'Rundle Suites, a newly renovated boutique hotel, is seeking a talented and innovative web designer to join our team and elevate our online presence. As we launch a new marketing campaign for 2023, our goal is to create a visually captivating website that captures the essence of our hotel and drive online bookings.\r\n\r\nAs our web designer, you will be responsible for creating visually appealing and intuitive layouts that engage visitors and improve usability. Your expertise in graphic design and UI/UX will be instrumental in achieving this goal.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities include:\r\n-Create visually striking and user-friendly interfaces that align with our brand theme of modern, boutique, and clean, utilizing a copper color palette\r\n-Design elements such as headers, global interface color palette/theme, parallax effects, patterns/vector graphics, global font styles, and seamless navigation\r\n-Optimize the website for mobile and install Google Analytics for website tracking and optimization\r\n-Optimize the website for search engine\r\n\r\nSuggested features to include:\r\n-Clear header with white menu lettering\r\n-Dark interface with high contrast icons\r\n-Blur/blend effects\r\n-Use of images and photos featuring the hotel and special offers (provided by us)\r\n-Incorporation of transparent design elements\r\n\r\nIn addition to our inspiration, we will also provide you with some mockup designs created by artificial intelligence for creative inspiration.\r\n\r\nWe are searching for a designer with an eye for detail, passion for creating beautiful and functional websites, and the ability to merge technical know-how with artistic vision. If you meet these qualifications and are excited about the opportunity to work with a unique boutique hotel, we want to hear from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1612934236932186113','-',7,'United States','Glasgow',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-01-10',1,'2