(5389,'Need site reindexed (URGENT) Expert SEOS',5,'Have had our site online since 2012 with thousands of indexed articles. Last week we somehow got penalized by google and our site is no longer being indexed which is obviously very bad.  \r\n\r\n\r\nNot sure why we were penalized because there are no manual or security issues in the search console. Probably algorithm related.\r\n\r\n\r\nI need someone to walk me through the process of getting my site indexed again as fast as possible. Only experienced SEO\'s. If you don\'t know what you are doing, don\'t waste your bid.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/1999858','-',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'Open this select menu',1000.000,'2023-01-11',1,'2023-01-11',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-11 15:55:13',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
(5390,'Website/platform development plan',3,'Programming & Development\r\n\r\nConcepts / Ideas / Documentation\r\n\r\n    Concept Development\r\n    Concept Mapping\r\n    Design Documents\r\n    Functional Design\r\n\r\nI am planning to develop a health and fitness related service with a high scientific background. I would like to have a complete plan for the design of the website/social media and email marketing.  as broad as possible. \r\n\r\nAddressing \r\n\r\n- \r\n\r\n    The structure of the website, including the main sections and pages, and the navigation menu.\r\n\r\n    The design elements, such as colors, fonts, and graphics.\r\n\r\n    The functionality of the website, including forms, interactive elements, \r\n\r\n    The content of the website, including the text, images, and videos that will be used.\r\n\r\n    The marketing and promotional strategies for the website.\r\n\r\n    The goals and objectives of the website, including any specific metrics that will be used to measure success.\r\n\r\n    The development timeline and budget for the website.\r\n\r\n    The teams and resources required for the website development. \r\n\r\n\r\nThe platform aims to be the most authoritative and trusted voice in the Dutch (Netherlands) language area. \r\n\r\nThere will be a weekly newsletter by email discussing all scientific developments concerning our specialty. \r\n\r\nThere will be facebook/youtube/instagram/tiktok and LinkedIn accounts for the service, which will have the same name. We need a design and strategy for the use off these social media.\r\n\r\nWithin 12 month\'s of launching we want to start with podcasts which will be videoed as well for Youtube. \r\n\r\nFirst Aim of the website is to sign people up for the newsletter\r\n\r\nSecond aim is to get people to contact any one of the participating health clubs to take the Special test which will lead to the special training program to be followed at the health/fitness club. \r\n\r\n3rd aim is to convince health clubs to join the business and pay a subscription to be part of the system. \r\n\r\n\r\nHealth clubs that are participating will get access to a special page which will give them the possibility to do our special test. This page needs to have a separate programming so that it will be able to run several algorithms and develop training program\'s for many different people. \r\n\r\nThe staff of the health club will fill out the test page on the site. But alongside, there needs to be a questionnaire that the customer can fill out with 20-30 questions. This will influence the results of the test, and both the questionnaire and the test will develop the training program. Results need to be stored and accessible so they can be presented to show improvements over time in an attractive way. \r\n\r\n\r\nI expect you will need much more information from me along the way and I can answer any questions and give feedback on a daily or twice a day basis. \r\n\r\n\r\nWith the plan a website developer should be able to program the site in Wordpress, A logo can be designed, Texts for the website can be written and all social media accounts can be started. Email marketing automation done etc etc. \r\n\r\n\r\nMarketing for the platform, advertising, SEO, influencers etc need to be planned \r\n\r\nI would also like to have budgets etc for all different jobs that need to be done. \r\n\r\n\r\nI have little experience with this so I need capable help. \r\n\r\n\r\nFor now the exact nature of my specialty is not needed. But once the job is awarded will be revealed. \r\n\r\n\r\nIt needs to be much more than a website. It needs to be a platform with all things connected and information pushed to the subscribers and those interested regularly. \r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know what you think. Please do not send me','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2000325','-',7,'United States','-',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-01-11',1,'2023-01-11',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-11 15:56:23',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
