(5392,'graphic artist for ad creative',2,'e are seeking a graphic designer to generate still and animated graphic creative for a series of Instagram ad campaigns.\r\n\r\n\r\nIdea candidates will have experience with high-converting and high performing ad creative, especially with travel, clubs, lifestyle brands and services.\r\n\r\n\r\nShould be able to do images of iphones at angles displaying our website, animations of iphones with our website scrolling, headshots cutout/cutaway over background, etc.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2000383','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'Open this select menu',500.000,'2023-01-11',1,'2023-01-11',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-11 15:57:37',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
(5393,'Brand Guidelines/Identity Refresh',2,'We have a brand established and have been in business for several years. As we are updating our website and would like to test new typeface combinations that are cutting edge, fresh and new. See below brands that we like.\r\n\r\nOur brand is similar in product to:\r\nhttps://try.javycoffee.com/lp30/\r\nhttps://eatsurreal.co.uk/\r\nhttps://magicspoon.com/\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\n- New Typeface Combinations\r\n- Elements we can add to our brand to make it more fun.\r\n- Brand Guidelines Deck to solidify new brand guidelines\r\n\r\nWhat you won\'t need to do:\r\n- Create new brand colors,\r\n- Edit logo or change branding from the ground up (just a refresh)\r\n- Make any modifications to our website.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\nMust provide final designs in AI, PS or Figma.\r\n\r\nBudget is negotiable based on previous work/experience.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1613201399308578817','-',7,'United States','Simi Valley',55.000,'perhour',55.000,'2023-01-11',1,'2023-01-11',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-11 15:57:41',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
