(5427,'Social Media Content Creator for Children\'s Book Series',2,'**Personal experience with food allergies is preferred**\r\n\r\nBudget expectations for this project: This will be milestone based, where each milestone is priced based on a batch of 7 social media posts (Facebook and Instagram for now). Prefer that one post for Instagram also translates to Facebook. The initial $200 is assumed to be for the first month. If things go well, we will add additional milestones.  \r\n\r\nJob Overview:\r\nWe are a start-up children\'s book series focusing on food allergies and are in need of a creative and engaging social media content creator to help spread awareness about our brand. The ideal candidate will have experience creating content for Facebook and Instagram, as well as the ability to create longer form content for TikTok and YouTube in the future.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Develop and execute a social media content strategy that aligns with our brand and goals\r\n- Create engaging and informative posts for Facebook and Instagram\r\n- Collaborate with our team to create consistent messaging across all social media platforms\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience creating social media content, specifically for Facebook and Instagram\r\n- Experience creating longer form content, such as videos, a plus - for future reference\r\n- Strong graphic design, writing and editing skills\r\n- Knowledge of best practices for social media marketing\r\n- Personal experience with allergies is a BIG PLUS\r\n- Experience with the children\'s book industry is a plus\r\n- Strong attention to detail\r\n- Strong time management skills\r\n\r\nPlease note that this is a start-up company without a lot of capital. This business probably won\'t be super profitable ever, but it\'s a passion project that is deeply mission based create awareness about food allergies.\r\n\r\nIf you meet the qualifications and are excited about the opportunity to make a difference, please apply and include a portfolio of your past work.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1613221922004783105?success','-',7,'United States','--',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-01-11',1,'2023-01-11',1,'fix',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-11 17:12:02',NULL,10,3,NULL,139),
