(5440,'We are looking for a designer who specializes in animated ads',8,'We have ongoing ad campaigns that require several different ads in Photoshop to be animated.\r\n\r\nAds will already be designed and in artboards, and your job will be to add attractive (but fairly simple) animations to each. Consider \"typing out\" text effects, fading in and out buttons, etc. There shouldn\'t be anything too complicated, but it should look professional.\r\n\r\nIn addition, we have static images from our website that we would like to convert into motion graphics. For an example, please see the top banner image on https://www.kompyte.com/.\r\n\r\nI have attached an example of one of the static ad sets. There are a lot of ads per set, so an expert is preferred! Looking forward to hearing from you','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1613235340858347521','-',7,'United States','Los Angeles',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-01-11',1,'2023-01-11',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-11 18:05:57',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
(5441,'Brand identity, Wordpress, and custom app re-design',2,'We\'re looking for a designer or team who can re-design our brand identity, Wordpress site, and directory app.\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\n\r\n1. Brand Identity Design:\r\n\r\nLogo design: We will design a professional and memorable logo that represents your brand and appeals to your target audience.\r\n\r\nSocial avatar assets: We will create social media avatar assets that match your brand guidelines, including profile pictures and banners for various platforms.\r\n\r\nFavicon: We will design a favicon (favorite icon) for your website, which is a small logo that appears in the browser tab and bookmark icon.\r\n\r\nColor palette: We will develop a cohesive color palette that reflects your brand\r\npersonality and is appropriate for your target audience.\r\n\r\nKey visuals: We will design a set of key visuals that can be used in various marketing materials, such as website graphics, social media posts, and email campaigns.\r\n\r\nDefault share images: We will create default share images for various platforms,\r\nincluding Facebook, Twitter and LinkedIn.\r\n\r\nEmail newsletter design: We will design a single generic email newsletter template that can be used to build templates for future campaigns.\r\n\r\nPrint design: We will design a single generic print design, such as a brochure or flyer, that can be used for marketing materials.\r\n\r\nBusiness card design: We will design a single generic business card design that\r\nrepresents your brand and includes your contact information.\r\n\r\n2. Wordpress Site Design:\r\n\r\nHome page: We will design a visually appealing and functional home page that\r\nreflects your brand identity and showcases your product.\r\n\r\nCategory guide generic page: We will design a generic Category page template that can be used for multiple Category pages on your website.\r\nContact page: We will design a contact page that includes all necessary information for visitors to get in touch with you, such as your address, phone number, and email.\r\nGeneric blog listing: We will design a template for a generic blog listing page that displays your blog posts in an organized and visually appealing way.\r\nGeneric blog article: We will design a template for a generic blog article page that includes elements such as a header image, title, and body text.\r\n\r\n3. Directory App Design:\r\n\r\nNew theme: We will design a new theme for your Directory app that matches the new brand guidelines and provides a cohesive look and feel.\r\nHome screen: We will design a visually appealing and functional home screen that will serve as a starting point for anyone exploring the Directory.\r\nSearch results with filtering: We will design a search results page with filtering options that allows users to easily find the information they are looking for.\r\nCategory/tag listing page templates: We will design templates for category and tag\r\nlisting pages that display listings in an organized and visually appealing way.\r\nWorld map page: We will design a world map page that shows the locations of listings in your directory app.\r\n \r\n\r\nless\r\nMore/Less about\r\nView job posting\r\nExpert,\r\nExperience Level\r\nPropose your terms\r\nFixed Price\r\n3 to 6 months\r\nProject Length','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1613236164831686657?success','-',7,'United States','Lisboa',10000.000,'Open this select menu',10000.000,'2023-01-11',1,'2023-01-11',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-11 18:10:26',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
