(5477,'Design wrap ideas for a new turbine',2,'Hello! We have one of the largest fleets of mobile turbines which travel all around the US and Mexico providing temporary power to utilities or data centers or anyone in need of massive amounts of temporary power. We are expecting new turbine soon and would like to creatively wrap it so that it stands out when traveling down the road or is set up at a job site. I am attached an example of one we previously wrapped, however it simply looks like our logo. We want something more creative for this next wrap. This is where you come in... we are looking for some design ideas to creatively wrap the next turbine.\r\nThis one is slightly different, because, when parked at a job site, one tractor trailer will be backed up tightly against another tractor trailer. Therefore, the design could actually be split in half, where when the 2 trailers are parked, they make 1 large image.\r\nI have demonstrated that on one of the images attached where we have split the logo across the 2 trailers, so when parked, the logo is complete. www.dpsenergy.com','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011692e14c3865a663','Sandra Chambers | Design wrap ideas for a new turbine | TM',7,'United States','Pearland',68.000,'perhour',68.000,'2023-01-12',1,'2023-01-11',1,'In process',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-01-11 20:57:16','2023-01-23 22:29:03',9,3,NULL,126),
