(5718,'Wildlife Movement Paper',2,'Nonprofit conservation org seeking help to layout a 30-page report—with title page, inside cover page, table of contents (hyperlinked to corresponding sections), photos, table(s), charts, and citations.\r\n\r\nWe can provide most of the content but need your help in finding appropriate photos or graphics to improve the look / style of the report. We need attractive public-facing reports that will be posted in pdf format on our website.\r\n\r\nThis job does not require proofreading or copyediting but does require work converting the 42 citations from MLA, in-text, to numeric superscript, AMA format.\r\n\r\nNeed someone who can use Adobe Illustrator for graph/figure files, design and layout for what is currently a Microsoft Word draft of a report and combine them into a laid-out report that looks good, ready to post on the web, as a pdf.  It won\'t be printed on paper, but as you will see from our prior reports, we like a layout that is easily printed, with a cover page and inside front cover.\r\n\r\nWe need the final files as a .doc, InDesign or Illustrator format, and as a pdf.\r\n\r\nPrefer someone who can do high quality design work to create an attractive style to the images/figures and the overall report. There are 4 tables that need style/design work and several highlighted points within the body of the paper we’d like amplified using callout boxes. The report will be read by government office staff, tribes, states, environmental nonprofits, academics, and students. It should look professional and somewhat formal.\r\n\r\nSee these links for examples of a couple previous reports:\r\nhttps://www.policyinnovation.org/publications/conservation-of-defense\r\nhttps://www.policyinnovation.org/publications/tribal-compensatory-mitigation  \r\nhttps://www.policyinnovation.org/publications/how-to-help-conservation-data-tech-spread\r\nhttps://static1.squarespace.com/static/611cc20b78b5f677dad664ab/t/62d9c9e1e8f0bc1cafb6dd88/1658440164786/CWA+Priorities+for+Offset+Policies_2022.pdf\r\n\r\nOur proposed timeline and payment schedule:\r\n\r\n1. You submit a first draft, which will include all formatting of tables and citations work. We will review and pay $150 at that time.\r\n2. Then, we provide feedback and request changes (if needed) to improve upon that first draft. You submit a second draft to us for additional review. We can pay $75 at that time.\r\n3. Finally, we offer final feedback to help get to the final version, in which you incorporate last changes and then you share back the final version. We will pay the remaining $75 at that time.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1613952904121688065?success','-',7,'United States','Takoma Park',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-01-13',1,'2023-01-13',1,'fix',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-13 17:38:52',NULL,10,3,NULL,139),
