(5769,'Branding Packages for Sister Companies',2,'We are seeking a talented designer to create multiple branding packages and website designs for two related businesses. The websites will have the same layout but will require different content, logos, colors, and names.\r\nThe designer will be responsible for creating a cohesive and visually appealing brand identity for each business, including the development of logos, color schemes, and typography. The designer will also be responsible for designing the layout and user experience for the businesses\' websites, ensuring that they are visually appealing, easy to navigate, and optimized for conversions.\r\nThe ideal candidate will have experience in creating branding packages and website designs, as well as a strong understanding of design principles and the ability to create visually compelling designs. The candidate should be able to work independently and be able to deliver the project on time.\r\nIf you are interested in this project, please provide a portfolio of your previous work and a brief description of your design process.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1614010824775573505?success','-',7,'United States','Sherman Oaks',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-01-13',1,'2023-01-13',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-13 21:27:04',NULL,10,3,NULL,139),
