(5773,'Graphic Designer for Agency',2,'We\'re a marketing agency on the lookout for a skilled graphic designer to join our team and help create visually stunning graphics for our small business clients in health, agriculture, mining, e-commerce, and more.\r\n\r\nAs a graphic designer, you will be responsible for designing high-quality graphics that align with our clients\' brand and messaging. You will work on a variety of projects such as social media content, motion graphics, email graphics, web graphics, branding, and more.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Design visually stunning graphics that align with our clients\' brand and messaging.\r\n- Work with our team to create social media content, motion graphics, email graphics, web graphics, branding, and more.\r\n- Ensure all designs are delivered on-time and on-brand.\r\n- Stay up-to-date with the latest design trends and technology.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Ideal Candidate:\r\n\r\n- Has experience in graphic design, with a portfolio that showcases their skills and design aesthetic.\r\n- Has experience working with a variety of design tools such as Adobe Creative Suite, Figma, Sketch, and more.\r\n- Has experience creating social media content, motion graphics, email graphics, web graphics, branding, and more.\r\n- Has an eye for color, typography, and composition.\r\n- Bonus if you have skills as an illustrator, animator and copywriter.\r\n- We offer a fast-paced and challenging work environment with a chance to work with a variety of clients across different industries. Our team culture is built on collaboration and continuous learning, we are always looking for ways to grow and improve.\r\n\r\nWe would love to hear from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1614014589998080001','-',7,'United States','Brisbane',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-01-13',1,'2023-01-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-13 21:43:17',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
