(5822,'1 Minute SaaS 2D Explainer',8,'Hello!\r\n\r\nI\'m in need of a ~1-minute SaaS explainer video. I\'m wanting the explainer video to be artsy, fun, and powerful.\r\n\r\nHere\'s a very short overview of how we\'d want our story/explanation to go:\r\n\r\nScene 1: Start in a movie theater, filled with people- then an advertisement plays on screen, and groups of people start walking out, dissatisfied with the ad.\r\nScene 2: The camera zooms into the theatre screen, then the product being advertised transitions from the movie screen traditional ad to a Youtuber using the product organically. And it shows a teenage girl watching this Youtube video with her friends laughing.\r\nScene 3: From girls located- camera zooms out all the way to outer space where now we see all of the earth, and markers go all over the earth showing how there are creators all over the world making videos.\r\nScene 4: The camera zoom into a marker, then shows a factory/ warehouse of a product being made, then the camera enters an office of a business manager.\r\nScene 5: The manager is on a computer, using our website, and from there he chooses a creator he wants to work with\r\nScene 6: The manager grabs a \"package\" of his product and ships it out to the creator.\r\nScene 7: The camera would show a creator recording a video using this company\'s product, then they go on their own computer and send the video they just recorded to the manager\'s computer\r\nScene 8: The manager \"watches\" the video the creator made and presses accept\r\nScene 9: Now it shows a “Youtube” page, where the video is getting hundreds of thousands of views, likes, and comments.\r\nScene 9: The manager is now putting his credit card details into his computer- and it does a transition to the creator and the creator holding a lot of cash and smiling.\r\nScene 10: Our logo and slogan\r\n\r\nWe would need voice-overs throughout the entire video, and high-quality sound effect design along with cute character animations and really cool scenery.\r\n\r\nIf you could provide me a quote for how much this would cost and how long this would take that\'d be great!\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nCole','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1615022043922919425','-',7,'United States','Houston',3000.000,'fixed',3000.000,'2023-01-16',1,'2023-01-16',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-16 16:25:25',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
