(5882,'Pitch Deck Designer for Tech SaaS Startup',11,'We are a tech SaaS startup looking for a skilled and experienced pitch deck creator with strong custom graphic design skills to help us raise money for our seed round. The ideal candidate will have experience creating effective and visually appealing pitch decks for tech startups and a deep understanding of what investors are looking for. They must have successfully raised funding from a pitch deck they created and be able to present proof or evidence of it. They must also have a strong ability to create and design custom graphics and illustrations from scratch.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nCreate a compelling and visually appealing pitch deck that effectively communicates our company\'s value proposition and growth potential using custom graphics and illustrations created from scratch\r\n\r\nResearch and incorporate industry trends and best practices into the pitch deck\r\nWork closely with our team to gather information and understand our company\'s unique value proposition\r\n\r\nMake revisions and adjustments to the pitch deck as needed to ensure it meets the needs of potential investors\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nProven experience creating pitch decks for tech startups\r\n\r\nStrong understanding of the tech industry and SaaS business model\r\n\r\nSuccessfully raised funding from a pitch deck they created and able to present proof or evidence of it\r\n\r\nStrong ability to create and design custom graphics and illustrations from scratch\r\n\r\nExcellent design skills and attention to detail\r\nStrong written and verbal communication skills\r\n\r\nAbility to work independently and meet tight deadlines\r\n\r\nIf you are passionate about helping tech startups succeed and have a proven track record in creating effective pitch decks that have resulted in funding, as well as strong custom graphic design skills, we want to hear from you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~010e794aba2539c002','-',7,'United States'