(5893,'Book Cover Design',2,'I have a book that I\'ve written in manuscript form. I have a working title and I would like to go through a creative exercise to narrow down my options for a cover.\r\n\r\nThe book is a bit of a memoir so I would layout some themes, sports, and things I talk about in the book. I\'d like to use that to come up a number (12+) of rough draft copies that aren\'t fully detailed. From there, I would like to reduce it down to three of them and give revisions on those three to create three final copies.\r\n\r\nFrom there, I would like to have the files to work with my marketing team to edit, vote with my audience on what they like, and potentially change the title.\r\n\r\nI\'d like to pay an hourly fee that is milestones at each of these three checkpoints:\r\n\r\n1- The initial 12+ book cover design examples.\r\n2- Getting the first revisions and final detail on the three top covers.\r\n3- Final revisions on the final three and release of the files in a way that we can continue to edit them.\r\n\r\nContinuation of work after milestone 1 is contingent upon liking some of the initial samples.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01328937e5c6692c94/apply/','-',7,'United States','Alpharetta',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-01-16',1,'2023-01-16',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-16 20:21:46',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
