(5951,'Graphic designer to make cartoon-style logo for New Jersey based golf tournament',10,'We are hosting a New Jersey-based golf tournament called The Parkway Playoff and are in need of a tournament logo. We\'d like it to be modern, but also fun have an element of whimsy/cartoon-ish.\r\n\r\nThis logo will be embroidered on shirts, hats, and towels, used on the internet for marketing, and used in print for marketing and scorecards.\r\n\r\nA visual we have in mind to use is the iconic \"toll baskets\" once found on the Garden State Parkway. (image attached). Drivers would stop at these and toss change to pay the toll into these baskets. Perhaps something with golf balls can be used instead of change.\r\n\r\nFinal deliverables should include:\r\n-image files\r\n-source files\r\n\r\nWe have a deadline of February 2, 2023.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1615366033770684417','-',7,'United States','na',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-01-17',1,'2023-01-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-17 15:21:16',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
