(5982,'Animated GIF (STANDUP180)',8,'Hello\r\n\r\nHere is the job required.\r\n\r\nFrom raw type photos (see RAW Pictures folder in the Dropbox link), it would be necessary to create an animated .gif of a piece of furniture.\r\n\r\nI would like these to be inserted into a background that you have attached to the folder whose name is Background.jpg\r\n\r\nAlso attached to the file is a brief model (sample draft.jpg) concerning the positioning of the product on the bottom.\r\n\r\nThe playback sequence would be Pic_1...Pic_13...Pic_1.\r\n\r\nPlease make the necessary light and shade corrections in order to give as much realism as possible and to remove any defects and dirt that may remain on the photo.\r\n\r\nHere is the Dropbox link with the files.\r\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/sh/w3dusfuvs4ljdvb/AAA9Tp2BhJnPimUlSKjwQMeva?dl=0\r\n\r\nThank you in advance for your application.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1615388744957960193','-',7,'United States','TOURCOING',200.000,'Open this select menu',200.000,'2023-01-17',1,'2023-01-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-17 16:42:17',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
