(5985,'Motion Designer Synthesia',8,'Blue Carrot video production studio is looking for a motion designer with experience working in Synthesia o rwith the desire to learn to work there quickly\r\n\r\nBy task: a script and an original video will be provided to get you started. As a result, you need to create assets in Adobe After Effects, such as https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MfAbxjdXwPCN7ABLvVR9Ab6y_jUH0DjB/view?usp=sharing and create a video in https://www.synthesia.io/.\r\n\r\nFor example: https://share.synthesia.io/d391dded-ff77-4354-9885-930dca99e8cc\r\n\r\nDeadline:\r\nWe have to create 10 videos by January 30 and then 15 localize to some language, after that there will be 200 more videos.\r\n\r\nPlease write the hourly price.\r\n\r\nDemo workflow in Synthesia:\r\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1zXWw6E_71Y8HM_n875v5BkQxJFa6SG9R/view?usp=share_link','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1615390904262578177','-',7,'United States','Lviv',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-01-17',1,'2023-01-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-17 16:51:14',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
(5986,'Horror Gaming Youtube Video Editor',8,'Hello! I\'m looking for someone who has experience working with horror gaming videos for YouTube. The ideal candidate would take my raw footage that can vary between 1-2 hours into 10-20 min long yt videos.\r\n\r\nI\'m simply looking for someone who can take this work off my hands and maximize the editing to its true potential. My style of editing is simple yet specific. The best way to understand my style is by simplifying and watching my videos.\r\n\r\nI mostly focus on zooming in and out and I remove all fluff and silence from the video to give it a good pace. I like subtitles, memes (when appropriate) and sound effects to emphasize jokes and moments.\r\n\r\nMost importantly, I need someone who knows how to tell a STORY! so the cutting part is crucial to understand what is necessary to leave in the video and what can be removed.\r\n\r\nHere\'s my YouTube - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KwO-OQEd_Nw&t=390s\r\n\r\nPlease take a look at my gaming videos and let me know if this is something you can help me with. DO NOT CONTACT ME OUTSIDE OF UPWORK.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1615392318498000897','-',7,'United States','Medford',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-01-17',1,'2023-01-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-17 16:56:46',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
