(6156,'Tractor wiki as part of a wordpress site',15,'Hi. I have a wordpress site with focus on vintage vehicles, primarily tractors.\r\n\r\n\r\nPart of this is a tractor wiki. The former programmer was unable to understand the project, so I am looking for a replacement. The former developer dit upload tractor details, but the editing of the details did not work for all fields and as such it is useless. Of course it is important to be able to edit all fields online. However, the main part of the editing must be done offline using the plugins WP All import pro and WP all export pro.\r\n\r\n\r\nIt is important that you are familiar with the wordpress plugins WP All import and WP all export pro version. That is used for offline editing and reupload after editing.\r\n\r\n\r\nI need the implementation of this feature based on the excel spreadsheet with current details. I have attached two excel files. One explaining the heading groups such as engine, transmission etc. The other contains the content details of a number of tractors. The list is not complete yet, but that is another project. First part is to make the system work. \r\n\r\n\r\nI also want to enable users to upload their own gallery of a particular vehicle including text to describe what you see on the photo and a general description made by the user relating to the gallery. Very often users are collectors, who would like to explain about their tractors, restoration projects etc.\r\n\r\n\r\nRight now it is being developed from my website www.lynderup.dk and when it is completed, it must be transferred to www.lynderupvintage.com.\r\n\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\n\r\n\r\nJens Lynderup\r\n\r\n\r\nMaskinvurdering ApS\r\nAttachments','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2005074','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'Open this select menu',500.000,'2023-01-18',1,'2023-01-18',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-18 19:58:26',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
