(6223,'Senior Graphic Designer | Health & Wellness Brand',2,'We are seeking a highly skilled and experienced Senior Graphic Designer to join our team and lead the design efforts for our direct-to-consumer brand in the health and wellness industry.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will have a strong portfolio of work showcasing their ability to create visually stunning designs that are both on-brand and effective in driving sales.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Develop and implement visual design concepts for a variety of direct-to-consumer brands, including digital advertising, infographics, website design, email campaigns, social media graphics, packaging, and product design and bottle rendering.\r\n\r\n- Collaborate with cross-functional teams, including marketing, product development, and e-commerce, to understand and translate business objectives into visually compelling designs.\r\n\r\n- Lead the design process from concept to final production, including design presentations and revisions\r\n\r\n- Provide creative direction and stay current on industry trends and best practices, and apply them to the design process\r\n\r\n- Ability to provide copy or suggestions to set the feel for the designs\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nBachelor\'s degree in graphic design or a related field\r\n\r\nMinimum of 5 years of experience in graphic design, with a focus on direct-to-consumer brands\r\n\r\nStrong portfolio showcasing a variety of design projects, with a focus on e-commerce and direct-to-consumer branding\r\n\r\nProficient in Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign)\r\n\r\nStrong conceptual and problem-solving skills\r\n\r\nExcellent communication and presentation skills\r\n\r\nAbility to work in a fast-paced, deadline-driven environment\r\n\r\nThe Senior Graphic Designer will be a key member of our creative team, working to create visually stunning designs that drive sales and build our direct-to-consumer brands. If you are a passionate, highly skilled design