(6279,'Design a cover for kid\'s fiction book',2,'My daughter wrote a book and I need help in designing the book cover. Here\'s the book summary:\r\n\r\nAlice Redsong and Iris Dragonheart are first year students and best friends at Cosmic Moonlight Academy. After the first day\'s finalized powers ceremony, the duo realizes they can’t be friends due to their opposite powers. As one day, Alice is exploring her academy she stumbles upon a strange room, with books that have her name on it. In the mysterious story, it reveals a secret about the famous treasure of the Aqua Stone, a priceless jewel of goddess Anastasia, a princess who lived many centuries ago. Knowing the consequences, Alice sets off on her mission to protect the Aqua Stone, knowing thousands were after it. As she journeys off one night to the mystical planet of Tentin on her Puffable  (a small cloud said to be given rides) she hopes to find The Aqua Stone, she realizes it wouldn’t be as easy as she thought. From her Puffable, she falls from a long distance and finds many severe injuries on her body. She freezes on the chilly, cold planet with no sign of The Aqua Stone, praying for help from Goddess Anastasia. Thinking no help will come, she passes out. Goddess Anastasia’s ghost appears and arrives in Tentin. She knew Alice had come to save her stone, so the goddess took her stone, and healed Alice as well as blessing her with good health for her future life. As Alice woke up, she knew the jewel was in safe hands. She got onto her Puffable and rode back to CMA.\r\n      As she reached CMA, she was in trouble. The professors were lined up waiting for her. Although she got one month of detention from the teachers, her friend Matilda covered up for her by saying something to the professors making them proud of Alice, but not telling Alice how. Alice reunited with Iris and were an unstoppable duo again..\r\n\r\nLink to the book in Amazon:\r\nhttps://www.amazon.com.au/Quests-Starlight-Sparklers-Alice-Redsong-ebook/dp/B0B32RGZZ9','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e9961e0eae6406c2','-',7,'United States','Plano',50.000,'fixed',150.000,'2023-01-19',1,'2023-01-19',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-19 17:09:25',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
