(6309,'Virtual Admin Needed for Mental Health Scheduling + Intake',22,'We are excited to bring on a Client Experience Coordinator in our practice, as this position plays a critical role in our clients\' journey while assisting with the day-to-day operations of the practice. Lincoln Park Therapy Group is a fast-paced environment looking for a technologically proficient team member with previous experience in client or patient relations. Our ideal candidate will have experience specifically with intake and scheduling in a healthcare, wellness, or mental health setting, and will be a quick learner, dynamic, and able to work well autonomously.\r\n\r\nAs a Client Experience Coordinator, you are responsible for creating a warm and welcoming environment to help guide and enhance the clients\' journey through the intake and scheduling process. The Client Experience Coordinator will warmly guide new clients through our Intake process and match them with the perfect therapist from our clinical team, and will readily assist patients with resolving any complicated insurance issues they may have ahead of their visit. We’re obsessed with the overall client experience!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1616151600108281857','-',7,'United States','Chicago',25.000,'perhour',23.000,'2023-01-19',1,'2023-01-19',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-19 19:13:38',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
