(6325,'Video editor that can edit together high converting video sales letters',8,'Looking for a talented and creative video editor to help us craft high converting video sales letters.\r\n\r\nWe have creators that give us audio and video. Using those clips, access to stock video, and stock audio, it is your job to piece together effective video sales letters.\r\n\r\nThe majority of the work we do together will be 3-6 minute videos. Occasionally there will be a ~45 minute video.\r\n\r\nEventually as we ramp up our content production, there could be 15 videos per week to edit.\r\n\r\nSome great skills to have:\r\n- Be able to find authentic looking stock video that keeps a viewer\'s attention\r\n- Be able to find awesome scroll stoppers that stop a social media browser dead in their tracks\r\n- Be able to create captions for a video - Animated captions with certain words highlighted would be great\r\n- Be an expert on keeping a viewer\'s attention, being very strategic with all you do.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1616167748867969025','-',7,'United States','New York',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-01-19',1,'2023-01-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-19 20:18:02',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
