(6328,'Social Motion Video - 60s',8,'The Project/Need:\r\n• 1 60-minute real estate stats social video design\r\n• 4 templated versions of the video. Each will be the same design with different location data, example: Seattle, Eastside, King County, Snohomish. The cover/start frame of each of the 4 videos needs to be differentiated by color/design/title.\r\n• Stats: 7 data points, 3 of which are charts\r\n• Strategize: Brainstorm, storyboard 2-3 design/style directions\r\n• Design: something that is easily replicated each month, so illustration makes the most sense but open to ideas.\r\n• Launch: Ideally Feb 9th, if February is too soon then March 6th\r\n• The 4 videos will be released 1x per month with updated stats.\r\n\r\nExample of previous years videos and new stats:\r\nhttps://bit.ly/REUexamples\r\n\r\nYou:\r\n• Available to start as soon as possible\r\n• A top-notch motion designer/creator/builder in After Effects.\r\n• Clean, modern design aesthetic.\r\n• Can strategize ideas.\r\n• Can storyboard your ideas.\r\n• Can work from an established brand.\r\n• Responsive & communicates well.\r\n• Detail oriented and thinks ahead.\r\n• Available for zoom meetings.\r\n• Resides in US and can be available during PST.\r\n• Available for 40-120hrs asap over the next few weeks to design, storyboard & build the video.\r\n• Available 1x per month for up to 5hrs during a set 24hr timeframe (around the 6 and 7th of the month) to update stats and export.\r\n\r\nUs:\r\n• A creative agency solely supporting real estate agents.\r\n• Small team of 9 people.\r\n• Based in Seattle.\r\n\r\nInterview process:\r\n• Portfolio review, samples are required. If you have similar social video work in your portfolio, please share.\r\n• Zoom interviews with our Director, Creative Director, and Account Manager\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1616173811732979713','-',7,'United States','Kirkland',90.000,'Open this select menu',90.000,'2023-01-19',1,'2023-01-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-19 20:41:59',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
