(6331,'Camping T Shirt Design',2,'Looking for a T Shirt design for an upcoming camping rally we are hosting. This is the truck camper rally, we need an image and then the words \"Texas Truck Camper Rally\" and 2023, and Bandera, TX somewhere as well. Attached is a rough idea we had, of the truck camper being in the stars, but of course what we have is too \"thick\" of an image and will not work printed on a tshirt. We need something a little lighter and cleaner please. Thank you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~014f992300fae8466a','-',7,'United States','round rock',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-01-19',1,'2023-01-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-19 21:01:27',NULL,6,3,NULL,125),
(6332,'Company Logo',10,'We would like a minimalist and modern logo designed for a company that resells OE automotive takeoff parts. We primarily sell new take off wheel and tire sets however also sell other factory take off parts like running boards, hoods, bumpers, and truck beds. I do not want an image of a wheel or tire in the logo design however the shape and font can be influenced by the tire industry.\r\nWe will be using the logo on a new website, print material, social media, clothing, banners, signage, and will also need to use the logo as a watermark on product photos.\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n1. A simple professional and elegant logo. The logo has to be original and customized. No Clip Art is to be used.\r\n\r\n2. The logo needs to be eye-catching and make a statement. I will choose from a few different options that you provide.\r\n\r\n3. The logo must be created using layers (Adobe Photoshop preferred) and those layers be available in a final version of the logo for further manipulation.\r\n\r\n4. The deliverables must include a version of the logo in a scalable vector format. The logo must be provided in the following formats: Adobe Photoshop, Adobe Illustrator (AI), PSD, PNG, JPG, and GIF.\r\n\r\n5. The logo and name must be able to be reduced to simple 3-color print colors and still retain its crispness and clarity.\r\n\r\n6. The logo must be compatible with black and white printers.\r\n\r\n7. The logo must be able to scale in printed and on-screen format in sizes as small as a business card or in the web space available on its home page, and be scalable to as large as a banner or sign without losing clarity or quality.\r\n\r\n8. Any fonts used in the logo or company name must remain as fonts (and not images) in the final version (both scalable vector format and layered formats) and a copy of the fonts used provided.\r\n\r\n9. Finally we are to own all the copyrights to all the designs.\r\n\r\nInfluences:\r\nThe logo needs to convey the following characteristics: masculine, color scheme (black, red, dark gray), & inspiration can be drawn from the GMC automotive brand. I have attached our current logo and sister logo and some extremely rough ideas.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1616180833133228033','-',7,'United States','HARTFORD',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-01-19',1,'2023-01-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-19 21:09:57',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
