(6339,'Graphic Design Work to Style a Whitepaper into a flyer',12,'Scope of the work:\r\nI\'m looking for a skilled graphic designer with experience in magazine page design to creatively layout a 2000-word whitepaper.\r\n\r\nThe designer should have an eye for layout, text, and reference graphics and images, and should be able to create a visually pleasing, magazine-like spread that aligns with our company\'s website look and feel. Experience with magazine layouts is preferred.\r\n\r\nThe project may also include using stock photos, and re-designing reference graphs and charts as needed.\r\n\r\nThe final deliverable should be a multi-page InDesign and PDF format that we can use as a web lead generation tool and sent via email and printed to give to prospective customers as a sales tool.\r\n\r\nFinal Deliverables:\r\n(1) Full whitepaper designed into a final PDF ready for distribution, and (2) each main section of the whitepaper broken out into a standalone PDFs.\r\n\r\nHow fast you need it delivered:\r\nOver 2-3 weeks with layout draft approval. You\'ll work independently.\r\n\r\nRequired:\r\nMust use Adobe InDesign to layout page design.\r\n\r\nFonts: Open Sans (Paragraphs), United SemiCond Bold (Titles and Headings)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1616186046522368001','-',7,'United States','Mentor',65.000,'perhour',65.000,'2023-01-19',1,'2023-01-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-19 21:30:02',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
