(6344,'Short term podiatry coding and billing',30,'We need short term help with podiatry coding and billing. The notes supporting the claims are in both Dr. Chrono and TrakNet systems. Experience in either or both systems is desired but not necessary. We need an individual who can review the notes, apply CPT codes and submit the charges to payers. We will work with you to provide training on either EMR. Podiatry coding experience is ideal but not necessary. We will also provide some Q&A support on the coding, in case of questions.\r\nThe work can be entirely remote and independent. Ideally, we would like this person to start within 1-2 weeks. It will likely include coding and submitting claims on a 100-200 charts.\r\nWe have a team of in-house coders and billers that would be available for some support. We work in acquiring podiatry practices and have grown very quickly over the last year and haven\'t been able to scale up our billing team accordingly yet.\r\nWe would expect daily updates on progress.\r\nWe are a very collaborative, fast-paced start up with operations all over Ohio.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1616189083111092225','-',7,'United States','-',22.000,'perhour',22.000,'2023-01-19',1,'2023-01-19',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-19 21:42:44',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
