(6425,'Need a Brand Naming Specialist to create a Brand Name for a new Fitness Clothing & Apparel Brand',2,'Looking for an experienced branding expert, who specializes in Brand Naming specifically, with a portfolio of brand names they have developed to understand if their thought process aligns with what we are looking for.\r\n\r\nAs far as branding goes, we ALREADY HAVE a mission statement in place, 3 words that define the brand, a color palette, and overall brand image / vibe in place, target audience, and list of competitors. Do not bother submitting a proposal, if your service is not 100% focused on BRAND NAMING.\r\n\r\nThe actual Brand Name is our only missing piece of the puzzle.\r\n\r\nWHAT WE NEED:\r\nONLY a Brand Name. Nothing more. Simple.\r\n\r\nWHAT WE ARE LOOKING FOR IN A BRAND NAME:\r\n\r\n-Made up name: No acronyms, alphanumerics, descriptive names, etc. We have examples of competitors of which you can use as reference if hired.\r\n\r\n-Aesthetics: Short, easy to say name with a clean visual appearance. 3 syllables max, 8-10 letters max. NO hyphens or special character, etc.\r\n\r\n-Low Google MSV (monthly search volume): We want to avoid competing with high difficulty when the brand is searched on google. *Note* We are SEO experts, so if there is a KILLER brand name, with this being it\'s only caveat, still propose and we may be able to work around it.\r\n\r\n-Domain Availability: We must be able to purchase the .com extension of the exact brand name (reason a made up name may be of importance), or the .com extension of the name is available at a reasonable price (under $1,000).\r\n\r\n-Social Media Handles: We must be able to create the @username handle for the brand name, without the use of any special characters or numbers. In order of importance, first is instagram (this is make or break), second tik tok, third facebook, fourth youtube, fifth twitter.\r\n\r\n-Trademarks / Copyright: The brand name must not match or be similar to any existing trademarks nor existing brands (especially existing brands in the same industry).\r\n\r\nWe have no \"minimum\" amount of options we\'d like to have proposed, as we are simply looking for the best, most unique ideas that match our criteria. It is preferable to have at least 4-5, so that in case none work upon the first draft, we can point you in the direction of which most closely aligns with our ideal brand name.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0137301a08ee3bf079','-',7,'United States','Melville',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-01-20',1,'2023-01-20',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-20 16:50:23',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
