(6493,'Graphic Designer needed to create new Mobile First WordPress Template in Photoshop',4,'The new site design should be simple yet impactful, created as a multi-layer Photoshop document.\r\n\r\nAll page elements as images, text, colors should be on separate layers to facilitate easy sampling and image extraction from the photoshop design document for use in website development for Wordpress header, footer and body content areas.\r\n\r\nThe design is paramount, working out all of the visual details. The developer\'s task will be to create a pixel perfect rendition of your design, including details such as font-family used, font-size and line-height as appropriate.\r\n\r\nWhile the design should be desktop-centric, The new site build will follow the Mobile-first responsive strategy to create the best user experience by beginning the building process with **mobile devices in mind first**.\r\n\r\nCommon break points for device viewports and corresponding widths are as follows:\r\n\r\nMobile portrait (320x480)\r\nSmall tablet portrait (600x800)\r\nSmall tablet landscape (800x600)\r\nTablet landscape (1024x768)\r\nDesktop (1400)\r\n\r\nWe need 3 templates designed:\r\n\r\nTemplates\r\n1. Homepage: https://www.bankruptcy-canada.ca/\r\n2. Consumer Proposals - https://www.bankruptcy-canada.ca/what-is-a-consumer-proposal\r\n3. City Page - https://www.bankruptcy-canada.ca/insolvency-trustee-barrie\r\n\r\nPages should have a contact form on them with the following fields:\r\n1. First Name\r\n2. Last Name\r\n3. Phone\r\n4. Email (optional)\r\n5. Province - Drop Down\r\n6. City - Drop Down\r\n\r\nThank you','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1616537391130464257','-',7,'United States','Cambridge',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-01-20',1,'2023-01-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-20 20:46:16',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
