(6582,'Pitch and small business plan',11,'’m looking to hire someone in the US, United Kingdom, Canada, Australia, South Africa, Jamaica or Puerto Rico to write an English Business pitch with a short business plan with financial report for potential investors to obtain funds for a new Earth Mapping smart tools. \r\n\r\nThis project will be based on a cloud platform and it will focus on adding and sharing earth data both land and marine. \r\n\r\nIt will be like a Wikipedia but for earth data with graphics utilities. User will join to this platform will have opportunity to use a easy graphic rectangle to select a geographical area on the world map and see if there are data in that area (text, pictures, pdf, word and any report or information connect to that area). Then the user can easily add data categorizing the data by predefined category such as : archaeology, biodiversity, bathymetry, geology, weather, seismic, facilities, infrastructures, topography, biology, elevation and so on...\r\n\r\nThe main target is to have a global data platform user-friendly of shared knowledge updated by voluntary contributions. \r\n\r\nWe can have profit by :\r\n\r\n- donations for environmental causes\r\n\r\n- sponsorship by Oil&Gas or energy companies would like to show it owns logos/banners in an       environmental cause\r\n\r\n- Earth data sales \r\n\r\n- Weather Forecast reports\r\n\r\n- premium account\r\n\r\n- Investors close to environmental projects\r\n\r\n- Universities for educational \r\n\r\n- Government offices to share platform to decision makers\r\n\r\n- Suppliers of equipment likes to be founded to sell equipment to perform survey job\r\n\r\n- Company likes to be founded to perform survey job\r\n\r\n- Freelance data processing to elaborate geographic data\r\n\r\n\r\nThe platform could have different users:\r\n\r\n- Students\r\n\r\n- Researchers\r\n\r\n- GIS Specialist\r\n\r\n- Mapping companies\r\n\r\n-  Business\r\n\r\n- Earth passionate\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Platform could help to better understand the earth science.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe financial part will developed to ask to investors for a budget around 100K USD which will cover the first 3 years of activities - the Startup phase.\r\n\r\n1 year - 38500\r\n\r\n2 Year - 18000\r\n\r\n3 Year - 35000\r\n\r\nIn the first 3 years of activities you have to evidence the developing of new features and data entry and a good marketing startegy as participation to main market exhibition and events, client and suppliers network development. \r\n\r\nAny good point to magnify the business plan, mission and vision will be appreciated.\r\n\r\nIn the business plan /financial report you have to demonstrate we will have revenue and profit from the 3rd year:\r\n\r\n\r\n3 Year - 150K USD with 40% profit\r\n\r\n4 Year  - 250K USD with 40% profit\r\n\r\n5 Year - 350K USD with 40% profit\r\n\r\n\r\nI need this done asap and please state how quickly you can get it done.\r\n\r\n\r\nI’m looking for high professional content with market analysis, swot, stats, industry growing numbers,operational plan and VALUE PROPOSITION.\r\n\r\nI’m only looking for unique content, meaning nothing that you turn in should be plagiarized or stolen from other sources.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThe report needs to be of high quality content…no Fluff! No Filler!\r\n\r\n\r\nWhen bidding so that I know that you actually took the time to read this post and are not bindly bidding please mention the words “EOD OK”\r\n\r\n\r\nThe finished Report must be in power point or A4 word format and I have to edit it without any problems.\r\n\r\n\r\nAt very beginning the business plan must include 1-2 paragraph summary of what its about , as well as 12-15 bullet points of what is covered.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI will own all of the rights to the completed work once you are fully paid, including but not limited to resale rights, byline rights and copyright.\r\n\r\nI actually need several of these types of reports, so if the quality of your work is great and your prices and turn-around time are fair we will hire you for all or many more of our projects.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2007273','-',7,'United States','-',250.000,'fixed',600.000,'2023-01-23',1,'2023-01-23',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-23 15:25:18',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
