(6667,'Postcard',2,'My company is a home care company; we assign aides to provide services to our clients (seniors)so that continued living at home is safe and comfortable.\r\n\r\nOur problem is that as our community ages, the demand for these services is exceeding the supply of skilled caregivers.\r\n\r\nMy postcard mailing project is part of our attempt to increase the number of applicants to our company, so that we can better service the large number of seniors in our community.\r\n\r\nThe postcards will be targeting three distinct groups of potential employees: 1) professional caregiving employees already in the industry who may be interested in changing employers; 2) people who may have been out of the workforce that are looking to return, who might not have considered this industry; and 3) people who may be anxious to work, and who may well be very good at caregiving, but who might be reluctant due to language barriers.\r\n\r\nI think separate postcards targeting each group would be necessary.\r\n\r\nI would like bold and imaginative designs, that would be attention-grabbing ... also easy to connect to us (QR Codes linked to FAQ page and application?)\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you can help me. Thanks, Dave.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1617608295784632321?success','-',7,'United States','United States',50.000,'Open this select menu',50.000,'2023-01-23',1,'2023-01-23',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-23 19:42:21',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
