(6746,'Motion Designer',2,'We’re seeking a creative Motion Designer who has a passion for bringing graphics to life. A high-quality driven professional to evolve motion design for Railsware Product Academy YouTube channel, products, and services.\r\n\r\nAre you up for a new challenge? Enrich your expertise by creating animations for a diverse array of media together with a smart and talented team!\r\n\r\nYour skills and experience:\r\n- Prior experience with and a strong portfolio of motion designs for video production\r\n- Ability to bring your concepts to life using a wide range of tools such as After Effects, Animate, Illustrator, etc.\r\n- Great understanding of movement and an excellent eye for motion, pace, and composition (typography, color, form, and ideation)\r\n- Understanding the business context of the created content (pick appropriate animation, illustrations; know where and how to highlight the brand)\r\n- Great sense of dynamics and time in the video (pauses, speed-ups, speed downs)\r\nAwareness of the latest trends in Motion Design\r\n- Strong attention to detail\r\n- Creative mindset and customer focus\r\n- Great communication and teamwork skills\r\n- Good English for communication\r\n\r\nWould be a plus:\r\n- Video editing experience\r\n- Experience designing graphics/illustrations\r\n\r\nYour responsibilities:\r\n- Create highly engaging motion for videos, mainly to support our YouTube channels, products, and services\r\n- Collaborate with our team to conceptually explain your ideas and select appropriate animation styles\r\n- Create editable templates for our video series\r\n- Manage personal workload to ensure all deadlines are met effectively across your own projects','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1617905720235642881?success','-',7,'United States','Dubai',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-01-24',1,'2023-01-24',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-24 15:25:22',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
