(6808,'WP Multisite for university projects',15,'My colleague and I have a running international project with a WP based and highly customized website. We plan to start another projects with similar functions so we are looking for programmer(s) who would  set up a WP Multisite Network and integrate our already existing project website into the network as one of the websites (not the main parent site). We would like to use Domain Mapping so that the main URL is not visible to the users. Our users should be able to register for a website in the network and their data should be saved in the main user DB (as per default in WP Multisite). They can use their login credentials on another websites in the network, but first they must be approved by the site admins to get access to the other websites. The Site admins should be able to change only some settings in WP and plugins - this needs some customizations in the WP and plugin code.\r\n\r\n\r\nTasks for programmer (team)\r\n\r\n    Setup Multisite in our webspace (shared hosting) with all functions that our existing website already has.\r\n    Setup Domain Mapping with our registered domains.\r\n    Integrate our existing website into the network as one of the (child) websites.\r\n    Customize user management so that users register for the network with their first registration on a website but must be approved by each Site administrator if they want to use their login credentials for another website in the network.\r\n    Customize WP so that Site administrators can see/change only particular settings in their websites.\r\n    Customize Plugins so that Site administrators can see/change only particular settings in their websites.\r\n\r\n\r\nFor detailed information and more questions see the attached document.\r\nAttachments','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2008542','-',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-01-24',1,'2023-01-24',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-24 19:08:14',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
(6809,'Edit product photos for selling outlets.',2,'Looking for a photo editor to refine photos of products for selling outlets such as Etsy and Amazon. \r\n\r\n\r\nEditing will include removing particles of dust and fixing any blemishes. For photos on white background, I need the product area around the product to have the \"curve\" adjusted so that the white is adjusted to digital white, but shadows near the product are not entirely eliminated.  * See attached samples*\r\n\r\n\r\nPhotos on a white background will need to be cropped square with the product in the center (Amazon standard). Lifestyle photos will need two sizes, one cropped square and one with the 4:3 ratio used by Etsy (or as close as possible without cropping out the product).\r\n\r\n\r\nI would like an editor who can start immediately and finish editing around ~20 photos per week with a one or two-day turnaround for twenty or fewer photos. \r\n\r\n\r\nI will work to incorporate any feedback into the process of taking photos but the attached samples are representative of what photos I will be providing. I can provide either JPEG or RAW format. \r\n\r\n\r\nThe attached samples show two photos I have edited myself to show the minimum results I require. \r\nAttachments','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2008411','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-01-24',1,'2023-01-24',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-24 19:08:53',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
