(6848,'Build a responsive website',3,'Set up WordPress on our host to include SSL (Secure Sockets Layer) certificate,\r\ninstallation, and setup of base plugins, initial theme configuration, etc.\r\nCreate a site wireframe to determine navigation and site structure to include:\r\nWhat we do, Contracts, History, About, Incentives, Members, and Contact\r\nReview the mission and revamp existing content with our professional copywriter.\r\nBuild robust content for the website as a whole\r\nImplementation of selected mockup and wireframe. This includes making the site\r\nresponsive and mobile-friendly.\r\nCreation of email campaign framework and initial automated components or\r\nimplement existing provider (Mail chimp, etc)\r\nCreate sign up form (Incentive Alerts etc) for email list building\r\nMake sure the site follows WCAG (Web Content Accessibility Guidelines) and is\r\noptimized for the best performance\r\nLight SEO will be performed which will help people find your services\r\nSetup automated backups\r\nUser training/documentation on how to change text, create posts and add\r\nimages\r\nAdd social media icons and links (Twitter, Facebook, and LinkedIn)','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016c91de96e7542225','-',7,'United States','Charlottesville',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-01-24',1,'2023-01-24',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-24 21:18:29',NULL,5,3,NULL,133),
(6849,'HealthStacks - Health & Fitness Portal',19,'Want to build an information and advice portal for paying clients only (health and nutrition space).\r\nSo the website landing page would literally be one page and the only other tab I would need is a \"login\" tab.\r\n\r\nOnce a client logs in, that\'s what I want to be built.\r\nThe service we provide paying clients is actionable information, tools (excel, calculators etc), case studies and guides (infographics etc) to help them address any of their health and fitness challenges. E.gs below:\r\nNeed a new training program? They have dozens to choose from.\r\nWant to read a new study on the benefits of olive oil? We put in it an easy to read shareable document\r\nWant to understand the best practices when it comes to intermittent fasting. The clients can access all that information.\r\n\r\nOnce a client logs in it is essentially a digital content library (as attached mock up).\r\nPart of that service is we are constantly adding and updating the content to keep the users engaged and adding value.\r\n\r\nPlease see the attached FAQs\r\nAttachments','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2007916','-',7,'United States','-',2500.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-01-24',1,'2023-01-24',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-24 21:21:35',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
