(6866,'WordPress Website Redesign',4,'[SEE ATTACHED DESIGN BRIEF FOR EASIER TO READ SCOPE OF WORK]\r\n\r\nTerra Genesis Website Redesign Brief\r\n\r\nSummary\r\nTerra Genesis wants to complete the makeover of its company website, www.terra-genesis.com\r\nFocus is on getting something up and running asap (i.e. a new home page, 2-3 sub-pages with copy and images, and a blog landing page as a gateway to blog posts), while building out the rest of the website over time. We need the home page and other priority pages completed by February 20, 2023.\r\n\r\nCurrent website is not at all user friendly in the back-end (it’s a custom WordPress template that requires coding to even create simple content pages). The new website needs to be set up in a way that is user friendly in the back-end, i.e. it should be relatively easy for a staff member to create a new page, make edits to existing pages, create/add new blog posts and case studies, etc.\r\n\r\nWeb designer can choose from two different scenarios, whichever is more cost effective and practical\r\n1) Restructure/redesign current website to meet our needs\r\n2) Build anew on out-of-box premium theme (e.g. Divi, etc) to our provided site index\r\n\r\nNote: we would ideally want to know the cost, timeline, pros, and cons for both options\r\nIdeally the website would remain a WordPress website. Site speed, UX and SEO optimization are all important factors that should remain intact with whatever solution is chosen.\r\n\r\nNote: current website has very little content, so in case a completely new website would be built there are not too many concerns about disrupting existing link-infrastructures, etc\r\n\r\nPlease contact elizabeth@terra-genesis.com for additional info and/or to send your proposal\r\n\r\nREQUIRED WORK - PHASE 1 (ready before end of February 2023):\r\nLANDING / HOME page (scrollable) that provides overview of core service offering + appropriate CTAs\r\nSuggestions for Blocks on page:\r\n- Header Block with hook + outline core offering\r\n- Block with link to case studies / client project database + a few featured/highlighted projects\r\n- Block with introduction main client categories (Brands, Farmers, Developers)\r\n- Block with some impact indicators/”credibility numbers”\r\n- Block with featured blog posts\r\n- Featured In Media Block linking to media outlets (e.g. newspapers, website etc) that feature content about our work\r\n- Endorsement / Credibility block with quote/shout outs of people we have worked with\r\n- Block with logos of brands / partners we work with\r\n- Footer block with useful links\r\n\r\n“ABOUT US” page (scrollable) containing the following sub-sections/blocks:\r\n- Who We Are\r\n- How We Work\r\n- Where We Work\r\n- Our Partners\r\n\r\n“SERVICES” pages: one independent page for each of our main client categories (3 in total)\r\n- For Brands\r\n- For Farmers\r\n- For (Real Estate) Developers\r\n- ROV™ page\r\n- ARTICLES page (effectively our blog, should cater to the following 3 categories of content: “Project Related”, “TGI Reports & White Papers”, “Regeneration Knowledge Base”\r\n\r\nCONTACT page\r\n\r\n- In addition it would be great to have 2-3 easy and flexible build general page template(s) that can be used to create new (fixed) pages or modify existing ones.\r\n\r\nGeneral Site functionalities / capabilities should include:\r\n- Subscribe pop-up enabled\r\n- Yoast or Rank SEO plug-in (SEO optimized)\r\n- Update social icons + enable easy sharing on socials\r\n- Expanded footer menu with full site index','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1618004451089674241?success','-',7,'United States','Freeville',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-01-24',1,'2023-01-24',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-24 21:58:42',NULL,5,3,NULL,132),
(6867,'Build Shopify website and landing pages & build separate Squarespace website',3,'Hello! We are looking for someone to build a Shopify website for our company, along with landing pages for specific products.\r\n\r\nOur thinking is for these landing pages to have their own domain, but on the backend would be linked to the Shopify account. We are looking for expert insight on if that is the best route and how to bring the vision to life.\r\n\r\nRESPONSIBILITIES:\r\n- Manage the ongoing design and maintenance for the Thank Me Later Inc. ecosystem, primarily housed through thankmelatermoney.com\r\n- Build out Shopify site for thankmelatermoney.com, which will house the company\'s ecosystem and landing pages\r\n- Build out 4 landing pages for specific initiatives. Externally we will drive to these landing pages via their own domain, but on the backend we would ideally like these landing pages to link to the main website\r\n- Build a separate Squarespace website for our CEO\'s personal brand\r\n- Test website functionality and perform quality assurance to ensure all pages and functionalities work properly when rolling out website enhancements\r\n- Provide recommendations to update the websites quarterly to align with business objectives and seasonal priorities\r\n- Troubleshoot website issues within 24-48 hours\r\n- Share biweekly reports outlining site speed and performance of web pages through developer and Google site speed tools, as well as website traffic and engagement through Google Analytics\r\n- Outline insights for context on website traffic (i.e. promo to explain an increase in traffic)\r\n- Optimize websites for SEO\r\n\r\nSKILLS / TRAITS\r\n- Proficient in Squarespace and Shopify\r\n- Advanced knowledge of Google Analytics\r\n- Responsive and dependable\r\n- An eye for design and attention to detail\r\n- A knack for understanding the user experience\r\n- Equal parts creative and analytical\r\n- Not sensitive to feedback\r\n- Amazing technical support\r\n- Experience in RSS and HTML\r\n\r\n\r\nOTHER:\r\n- Role Type: Ongoing Support','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1618006390137671681?success','-',7,'United States','East Point',4000.000,'Open this select menu',4000.000,'2023-01-24',1,'2023-01-24',1,'Fix price project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-24 22:04:00',NULL,5,3,NULL,128),
