(6876,'Email template design in Figma',20,'I\'d like to get help building out some email template designs. We\'re trying to send different email notifications with tables, charts, and potentially other visualizations, but need somebody to design them for us.\r\n\r\nI\'ve attached some screenshots of an existing email that we send out, so you can use that for some style guidance.\r\n\r\nWhat I\'m looking for is loosely shown in the picture of a hand drawing. Specifically it should be:\r\n- Same overall format, with an introductory message on top and then a section with multiple charts, then a closing section\r\n- A button at the bottom that says \"Analyze Performance\" (replacing the one that says \"Manage Exceptions\" but only place it at the bottom, not the top)\r\n- 2 line charts (you can make them look exactly the same) which shows 6 data points, which are months, with the y axis going from 0% to 100%\r\n\r\nOnce we have that worked out I might ask for more help with some bar charts and other notifications.\r\n\r\nOne tactical point: I am hoping you can use Figma and share figma work product directly.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b37e94b5d0b2095f','-',7,'United States','Hoboken',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-01-24',1,'2023-01-24',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-24 22:31:05',NULL,5,3,NULL,133),
