(6880,'Update Website w/ product purchasing capabilites',2,'Hey there,\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a talented web and graphic designer to update our business website. We want to be able to house our coaching programs as products for sale, better advertise who we are and what we do, and make the rest of the pages look more professional (probably heavily editing or deleting some pages).\r\n\r\nLooking for someone who will listen well to feedback and make edits based off that feedback but someone who is also comfortable making decisions. We want someone who is open-minded and will collaborate with us to improve the site.\r\n\r\nStarting at $500 to get it cleaned up and functional, with the possibility of future work on building out the site further and managing content creation.\r\n\r\nTake a look at the site and let us know how you would start improving it:\r\nhttps://www.wallacemcgeeacademy.com/','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1610766141272576001','Eric-Update Website-Crystal',7,'United States','Carmel',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-01-19',1,'2023-01-24',1,'Fixed',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-01-24 22:39:14','2023-01-24 22:49:29',5,3,NULL,132),
(6881,'Create single page website design in Figma /top notch/',4,'Hi freelancers,\r\nI\'m a web developer and currently working on my personal website. It\'s a single page - landing page, where I will explain a little bit more about me + show my process and my portfolio.\r\n\r\nI already have a few concepts (wireframe) for the different sections of this landing page.\r\nWhat I need is someone who is creative enough to take my ideas and build a landing page in Figma that really stands out from the sea of sameness.\r\nFor some of the sections I’ll need illustrations\r\n- The project is only for designing a single page in Figma (around 7 sections)\r\n- I don\'t need any development\r\n- The final delivery will be just a Figma file in 3 screens (mobile, tablet and desktop)\r\n\r\nI\'m searching for a designer that :\r\n- has creative thinking\r\n- understands web and responsive design\r\n- has good skills in Figma\r\n\r\nHave in mind that I\'m a pretty good designer myself, so I DON\'T need someone who is a newbie, starter or uses templates and generic stuff.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking to start with this project right away.\r\n\r\nGood luck\r\nP.s. Start your proposal with the phrase : \'my designs are not a template\'','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1618015592926191617?success','-',7,'United States','Sofia',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-01-24',1,'2023-01-24',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-24 22:40:59',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
