(6893,'Use canva to create book interior',2,'THIS IS NOT AN ADULT COLORING BOOK!\r\n\r\n\r\nSorry for shouting but tired of looking at proposals for what amazing coloring books people can make when the job clearly is not for that.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe design here is not a low content book although some pages are similar to that. An example of the type of book you would be creating would be a book on using crystals. So the interior would be a page or two of text followed by a few lined pages where the user could write down some notes on their experiences using the crystals. I would provide you with a word doc with the text to include and the requirements for how many lined pages in between including any headings or other directions. I would also give you the page size to use. You would create a print ready pdf using canva (you are free to use something different canva just seems easiest). You would only be responsible for the interior of the book. I will handle the cover.\r\n\r\n\r\nIn your quote include your hourly rate as well as an estimate of how long it would take you to create a simple book with 25 spells and 75 lined pages with a Notes header with the following format Spell, 3 Notes pages, Spell 3 Notes pages and so on for a total of 100 pages.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhen I say how long it would take I am asking for an estiamte of time as well as your normal turnaround time. \r\n\r\n\r\nAlso, once you prove yourself by completing a task I am happy to start using safepay but I have a long payment history you can see with 100 percent positive feedback and it is getting old having to ask for refunds from people who ghost me.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2007840','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',750.000,'2023-01-24',1,'2023-01-24',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-24 23:09:20',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
(6894,'Designer needed for new coffee brand logo',10,'I am looking to create a new coffee brand and need a logo. I have two styles in mind.\r\n\r\nBrand: Full Moon Coffee\r\n\r\nStyle 1 (not cartoonish):\r\n\r\nAcross a black background you have the phases of the moon starting with the crescent turning into a full moon (attached illustration as an example, no need to use the new moons). Above it i want a very trendy and chic with a thin font with silver letters spaced out saying full moon coffee in all caps.\r\n\r\nStyle 2 (cartoonish):\r\n\r\nBlack background. Picture of a full moon large and center. A monkey is sitting on it on an angle and sitting away from the camera. He is looking back holding his pants as he moons you with an evil smile. It should look fun and playful.\r\n\r\nBoth versions should come with a clear background.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0141116234991f37e8','-',7,'United States','New York',70.000,'fixed',70.000,'2023-01-25',1,'2023-01-25',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-25 13:57:34',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
