(6915,'Improve and renew an investor presentation',11,'Can you make this presentation into a 10 slide pitchdeck?\r\n\r\nModdern presentation, with a lot of joy and freedom. Plus fancy app images. Maybe more colors in a way that matches the presentation but a modern and fancy look so the presentation can be more memorable for others to watch.\r\n\r\nThe concept is one app that includes all the information nessesairy, insurance, healthcaresystem, economy, valuables, important photos, testament, taxes, important documents, electrical use ect. All these apps needs separeted ID login, but now you can have access to all the apps with just one login.\r\n\r\nIf someone dies or get sick the family can easily get access to important documents, healthsystem, valuables ect..\r\n\r\nOne login for all the important aspects of users life.\r\n\r\nSuitable photos (I will buy the ones you need):\r\n\r\nhttps://www.shutterstock.com/image-photo/cheerful-family-on-beautiful-summer-meadow-285009053\r\n\r\nhttps://www.shutterstock.com/image-photo/happy-family-spending-good-time-beach-1154866195\r\n\r\nhttps://www.shutterstock.com/image-photo/happy-family-mother-father-children-son-1448244677\r\n\r\nhttps://www.shutterstock.com/image-photo/woman-using-her-mobile-phone-street-160559990\r\n\r\nhttps://www.shutterstock.com/image-photo/hand-holding-smartphone-glowing-multimedia-icons-262485218\r\n\r\nhttps://www.shutterstock.com/image-photo/hand-holding-smartphone-media-icons-concept-1051758239\r\n\r\nhttps://www.shutterstock.com/image-photo/hands-old-man-young-on-white-371056514\r\n\r\nhttps://www.shutterstock.com/image-photo/beautiful-happy-senior-couple-love-sitting-1824240998\r\n\r\nshutterstock.com/image-photo/businessman-finger-touch-digital-device-hud-2093493742','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01a0ffbd95d10fd8c1','-',7,'United States','Oslo',600.000,'fixed',600.000,'2023-01-25',1,'2023-01-25',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-25 15:16:49',NULL,5,3,NULL,133),
