(6928,'ONLY FOR FREELANCER: Custom Made 2D Animator for Several Explainer Videos Needed',8,'Hi,\r\n\r\nwe are an explainer video agency in Germany. We are looking for a long-term collaboration with an animator (FREELANCER) who can create videos in our style and with our quality. NO AGENCIES NEEDED!\r\n\r\nWe pay $9/Videosecond, based on how long the final video is. Example: 70 Seconds = $630\r\n\r\nScript and VO will be provided for every project. Sound effects have to be done by you.\r\n\r\n\r\nONLY APPLY IF:\r\n- you can take over at least 3-4 project per month\r\n- you are creating custom-made videos, no templates!\r\n- you can deliver the above quality\r\n- If you have at least 3 years of experience\r\n\r\nDon\'t apply if:\r\n- you are only creating 3D animations. We are only looking for 2D animators\r\n- If you don\'t like the above payment\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you are interested please send me EXACTLY 3 (not more!) videos from your portfolio. One can be a showreel if you have one.\r\n\r\nThank you very much.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1618274847416954881','-',7,'United States','Munich',900.000,'fixed',900.000,'2023-01-25',1,'2023-01-25',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-25 15:53:01',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
(6929,'Wordpress Designer/Dev To Help Post, Refine and Design 3-5 Articles A Month',4,'We are looking for a Wordpress designer with an basic understanding of HTML/CSS to help us post 3-5 pre-written articles per month. Articles can be posted using the block editor or Oxygen Builder (recommended). All images and layout are already completed and you will just need to post the content on our blog.\r\n\r\nAn eye for detail is important, as this is the final step. This is not just a a cut an paste job. You will need to check for technical SEO, responsiveness, image clarity and final appearance different viewports.\r\n\r\nSome graphic design may be required for the header and within the article. We prefer a Figma workflow utilizing tools like Noun Project to make it easier.\r\n\r\nWe have a backlog of 6 articles awaiting publication.\r\n\r\nCurrent Blog\r\nhttps://www.powproductphotography.com/blog/\r\n\r\nSkills/Knowledge Set\r\n-Wordpress (frontend)\r\n-Some CSS/html knowledge\r\n-Eye for design\r\n-Wordpress SEO knowledge (ie rankmath)\r\n-Social: Organic posts + PPC\r\n-Extreme Attention To Detail\r\n-Photography knowledge is preferred\r\n\r\nProjects Include\r\n-Layout articles and images into a blog post.\r\n-Review for errors and Issues\r\n-Check SEO\r\n-Check or Create CTAs\r\n-Schedule Social Media Posting\r\n-Help build new website pages\r\n-Design marketing emails in Mailchimp\r\n-Check Responsiveness\r\n\r\nOur stack\r\n-Wordpress block editor\r\n-Oxygen Builder\r\n-Rankmath\r\n-Optinmonster','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01cb19d16a82e8871d','-',7,'United States','Chichago',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-01-25',1,'2023-01-25',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-25 15:53:03',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
