(6936,'Animation / exploration of an existing logo design',2,'Using an existing logo design currently going through a rebrand - We require exploration into how the logo mark can translate into motion. This animation / interaction style will also translate into other aspects of the brand such as imagery, type etc.\r\n\r\nThe animation will be used for social posts, website animations and applications.\r\n\r\nThe end result would initially be ideas / directions this could go, and then deciding on a final style that can be rolled out across various visuals on an ongoing basis.\r\n\r\nYou can see a image of the logo here: https://i.ibb.co/vdjbBLs/av-rebrand.png\r\n\r\nExamples of work we like: https://design.studio/work/eurostar-group\r\n(like the use of 3D space with a 2D visual)\r\n\r\nhttps://www.dixonbaxi.com/work/hulu\r\n(Like the use of the shape with text and imagery)\r\n\r\nhttps://www.itsnicethat.com/news/koto-bolt-graphic-design-230123\r\n(Like the use of angles and shapes blowing out the screen but again being used for type and imagery.\r\n\r\nLooking for designers / animators with a motion background specifically in branding, with strong examples. happy to pay more if the work is great!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1618280437928939521?success','-',7,'United States','Essex',60.000,'fixed',60.000,'2023-01-25',1,'2023-01-25',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-25 16:14:21',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
