(6940,'Animation / Product Review',8,'We are looking to create an animation for Senstone use cases. Senstone is a physical device you wear you talk to and it comes out in text. On the animation we would like to visualize how different heroes create voice notes in different life situations: from personal to business. Overall an expected length of the video - 1 minute. Style - minimalistic.\r\n\r\nPlease see more details on explainer video use cases.\r\n\r\n1. Using Senstone to capture keywords, dates, names and technical details hard to remember (talking into the device in the office, with a desk with computer, phone, whiteboard around animated hero)\r\n2. Todo items, lists, tasks or things to buy (at home when opening the fridge or similar)\r\n3. Work notes and significant bits of information. Patient and progress notes, meeting notes for sales, construction and refurbishment planning (After the meeting with the other person in a conference room, in the hospital)\r\n4. Ideas, thoughts, vision and goals, road diaries and travelogues. Noting activity and events (in the car, on the street, at the conference/exhibition event)\r\n5. Personal writing and memories, reflections of the accomplishments, ideas and questions. Food and health diaries. Cash or sales journals (in the park or similar, beach etc.)\r\n\r\nWebsite link: https://www.senstone.io/\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\n1. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pPbmd5mbs5Q\r\n2. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KypSsXtkW7s\r\n\r\nPlease make sure to include any prior works for the evaluation if these are not available in Upwork profile.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1618282074886418433','-',7,'United States','Walnut',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-01-25',1,'2023-01-25',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-25 16:19:29',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
