(6943,'Voiceovers for animated videos',8,'I am looking for a voice actor to recite poetry for use over several animated videos being created. \r\n\r\n\r\nI am seeking a quote for the first voice over initially. The recital runs to approximately 8 minutes at a clear, medium pace. There are 52 Stanzas. One for example is:-\r\n\r\n\r\nI thought of a word that nobody knows\r\n\r\nas I walked through the bells of the Molovere groves\r\n\r\nIt occurred when I turned and stubbed my toes \r\n\r\non a Shabberlocks limb as it chewed on a rose. \r\n\r\n\r\nI look forward to receiving tenders from those interest. I do not have a particular voice style in mind at present.  If you think you voice works for nonsensical poetry, I look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease upload samples (or links to them) with your quote.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2009264','-',7,'United States','abc',0.000,'fixed',600.000,'2023-01-24',1,'2023-01-25',1,'abc',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-25 16:28:02',NULL,4,1,NULL,152),
