(6957,'Looking for an outstanding illustrator/artist/motion graph person',8,'I am looking for an outstanding illustrator/artist.motion graph person to create a series of ongoing projects throughout 2023. Can you please let me know what roles you are interested in and able to successfully complete\r\n\r\nI have an idea for a 15 - 30 second video. I have a completed story and would like to know if you are able to do something of this quality? I would embed it on my website as well as use it on social media. Can you give me a rough price quote and time needed to complete something like this:\r\n1. https://www.akidcalledbeast.com\r\n2. https://www.instagram.com/p/CQgjG0qHb2O\r\n\r\nCreate a NFT character\r\nCreate 40 - 60 traits for a collection with random traits (rarity).\r\n\r\nAnd finally, please share some samples when you apply.\r\n\r\nWhen you apply, please do not forget to let us know:\r\n1- How many hours would you be able to spend on this project for us (for the next 20 days)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLooking forward to your application','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1618291135463542785','-',7,'United States','Atlanta',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-01-25',1,'2023-01-25',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-25 16:55:17',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
