(7025,'Voiceovers for animated videos',8,'I am looking for a voice actor to recite poetry for use over several animated videos being created. \r\n\r\n\r\nI am seeking a quote for the first voice over initially. The recital runs to approximately 8 minutes at a clear, medium pace. There are 52 Stanzas. One for example is:-\r\n\r\n\r\nI thought of a word that nobody knows\r\n\r\nas I walked through the bells of the Molovere groves\r\n\r\nIt occurred when I turned and stubbed my toes \r\n\r\non a Shabberlocks limb as it chewed on a rose. \r\n\r\n\r\nI look forward to receiving tenders from those interest. I do not have a particular voice style in mind at present.  If you think you voice works for nonsensical poetry, I look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease upload samples (or links to them) with your quote.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2009264','-',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'fixed',900.000,'2023-01-25',1,'2023-01-25',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-25 22:44:58',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
(7026,'Online Food Delivery Platform',19,'We are looking for a developer who has experience with various food ordering script available on the market. The kind of script we need is a just-eat type clone. If you can supply or recommend similar scripts to the links I have provided then we will be interested in hearing from you. Please note, we don\'t want you write a script from scratch but rather use an existing script available on the market which you can customise further to fulfil our requirements. The script must be reliable that has been tested over time.\r\n\r\nThe script must have the following additional features or you need to customise these for us:\r\n\r\n1. The main website is a portal. But new restaurants can signup and register their business. The new restaurant will populate the portal once the signup process is complete.  \r\n\r\n2. During website registration we need a direct Stripe connect payment sign-up. This will automatically link customers stripe account to our stripe connected account. From the portal super admin account we need an option to set stripe payment share percentage for each customer. This is the fee percentage that we are charging customers to use use on our platform. Check this link (link removed)\r\n\r\n3. The website must be support PWA Progressive Web Apps so when accessed via mobile phone it will appear as an app with an option to added icon for IOS and Android. This PWA app must support customer ordering, Restaurant Order Accepting app, Delivery driver app along with driver tracking features.\r\n\r\n4. Need to support various POS printers, GSM printers etc.\r\n\r\n5. SMS gateway integration.\r\n\r\n6. Optional - We need customer ordering apps for Android and IOS. Restaurant Order Accepting app along with driver tracking features for Android and IOS.\r\n\r\nBasically this platform should allow customers to signup and have a fully functional website with their food menu without involving anyone else. Once they sign up, they will access the backend to type their food menu, use their logo, add various pages using CMS features, setup printer, sms gateway, payment API key for stripe etc.\r\n\r\nYou must supply all source code and documentation.\r\n\r\nPlease provide a fixed cost for the project. No hourly rate.\r\n\r\nPlease have a look at the links below. We are expecting similar features:\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://www.just-eat.co.uk\r\nhttps://deliveroo.co.uk\r\nhttps://www.ubereats.com/gb\r\nhttps://www.foodpanda.com\r\nhttps://www.gloriafood.com\r\nhttps://cloudify.store','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2009305','-',7,'United States','-',2500.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-01-25',1,'2023-01-25',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-25 22:45:48',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
