(7061,'Brand Creation',2,'We are seeking a talented and experienced designer to create a comprehensive brand identity for our company, \"Program for Purpose.\" Our mission is to empower individuals to discover and achieve their purpose in life through mentorship, guidance, and support.\r\n\r\nThe successful candidate will be responsible for creating a visually stunning and cohesive brand aesthetic that aligns with our mission and core values: ambition, empowerment, purpose, growth, and support. This includes creating a logo, color palette, typography, and imagery that effectively communicates our brand message and resonates with our target audience.\r\n\r\nThe deliverables for this project include:\r\n\r\nA logo that is simple and modern, featuring the brand name in a bold font with an icon or symbol that represents the concept of purpose or direction.\r\n\r\nA color palette that includes any of the following, blue, navy blue, green, purple, black and/or orange\r\n\r\nA typography system that includes a bold and clean serif font for headlines, and a sleek sans-serif font for body copy\r\n\r\nA set of brand guidelines that outlines the usage, placement, and variations of the logo, typography, and color palette for consistency across all marketing materials.\r\n\r\nProfessional imagery that aligns with brand personality, message and visual identity.\r\n\r\nThe successful candidate will have a strong portfolio demonstrating their ability to create visually stunning and cohesive brand identities. They should also be able to work in a timely manner and be open to revisions and feedback. If you believe you have the skills and experience to bring our brand to life, we would love to hear from you.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01f03933ef8ae69300','-',7,'United States','Watertown',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-01-26',1,'2023-01-26',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-26 15:23:20',NULL,5,3,NULL,133),
