(7080,'Need Video Animator For Short Social Media Clips',8,'I am looking for someone to help me created short, animated clips with voiceovers for social media.\r\n\r\nHere are some examples of the type of content I\'d like to emulate:\r\n\r\n1. https://www.linkedin.com/posts/benmeer_how-to-be-more-productive-without-burning-activity-7024366824456642560-ISVD/\r\n\r\n2. https://www.instagram.com/reel/CnwpXbGKkZU/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\r\n\r\n3. https://www.instagram.com/reel/CneoehHqB0n/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\r\n\r\nThe person I\'m looking to hire should be good at:\r\n\r\n1. Storyboarding - taking the original content from me and turning it into a compelling idea for a video\r\n\r\n2. Motion Graphics - this content is based on animated motion graphics so experience in that is key\r\n\r\n3. Video Editing - in addition to the animations, we\'ll need to layer in the voice over and edit the clip for different platforms\r\n\r\n4. Communication - Being able to communicate ideas clearly and concisely is going to be key for this project\r\n\r\n5. Creativity - I can come up with the original content but I need a partner who is willing to get creative and bring great ideas to the table for the animations\r\n\r\nThis project will start as a test with a few videos. If the process goes well and the content is performing well, the goal is for it to turn into a longer term, ongoing relationship!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1618640916023734273','-',7,'United States','New York',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-01-26',1,'2023-01-26',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-26 16:05:26',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
