(7096,'Logo / Brand Identity Company',2,'Hello,\r\n\r\nHope you are well.\r\n\r\nMy name is Shayann Shams, I am reaching out to you from Switzerland. We own a company, Golestan SA, that aims at offering the best products from Iran for the Swiss and European market.\r\n\r\nAs part of this project, we are trying to modernize our current brand identity, and develop a logo that could communicate effectively our purpose: representing our Iranian culture and values through amazing products from our country.\r\n\r\nI wanted to have a look at some of your previous work and see if you were interested by this. Ideally I would need cultural proximity with the subject (Iran, our culture, strong symbolic representations there, khatam, famous architectures...), because I need the designer to deeply understand what we are trying to achieve as a company. With the current situation in the country, this missions is even more important now.\r\n\r\nLet me know also an overall price for this project. We want a fix budget price so we can both work freely on this. Our budget should be around 200$. Keep in mind that I am looking for someone for packaging design aligned with this brand identity afterwards, so this project could lead to another together.\r\n\r\nExcited to be working with you!\r\n\r\nمراقب خودت باش\r\n\r\nShayann Shams','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~012cd06319e6a590c4','-',7,'United States','Denens',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-01-26',1,'2023-01-26',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-26 16:29:11',NULL,5,3,NULL,133),
