(7107,'Data Architecture Animation/Explainer',8,'animation for tech startup explaining technical architecture of distributed computing process, and how company software interacts with client.\r\n\r\nCompany website:\r\nhttps://coiled.io\r\n\r\nCurrent animation:\r\nhttps://coiled.wistia.com/medias/9y6gsb9rcj\r\n\r\nLooking for something simple and clean, along the lines of the graphics in this video:\r\nhttps://youtu.be/Pm7ol3e0qdA?t=448\r\n\r\n\r\nBasic outline:\r\nYou can set up and manage a parallel computing environment on your own\r\nBut its messy and error prone\r\nCoiled can help\r\nCoiled manages your cloud for you\r\nuser requests cluster from Coiled\r\nCoiled talks to your cloud provider to start up cluster\r\nuser connects to cluster\r\nuser does lots of great work on the cluster with their data, etc.\r\nSimultaneously with 2, 3, and 4: Coiled talks to cloud provider to stay up-to-date with how the cluster is doing\r\nuser talks to Coiled control plane to shut down cluster (or cluster shuts itself down when idle)\r\nCoiled can do this with lots of teams, across lots of companies.\r\n\r\nRough script and visual assets, with inspiration attached.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1618653211525246976','-',7,'United States','wellesley',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-01-26',1,'2023-01-26',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-26 16:53:56',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
