(7225,'Updated Sales Deck - Events & Offerings',11,'We are a non-profit based in New Jersey looking for a designer who can create a new version of our sales presentation that displays our offerings. We\'d expect this designer to work with our sales team to show the story of our brand as well as all of our offerings for clients.\r\n\r\nOur current version is used to show off the organization as a whole, and we\'d like this new presentation to be capable of showing all our unique offerings that can be purchased along with a broad overview of who we are and what our vision is. The updated materials should be a strong presentation of our story and rely heavily on visuals. We would be able to supply you with example presentations, a list of all our offerings, and pieces of content & data to use.\r\n\r\nThe goal is to have a template presentation with all relevant offerings that we can cut down to specific proposals for each of our clients to read through. I am attaching our current presentation below.\r\n\r\nSuccess will look like: A fully branded presentation with updated content, data and offerings that has an easy-to-understand flow of content explaining us as a whole as well as all the ways the client can get involved in partnership. We’d also ideally prefer someone with great communication skills to provide updates throughout the project.\r\n\r\nOur website: TechUnited.co','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~018370a9a30e81cc29','-',7,'United States','Hoboken',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-01-27',1,'2023-01-27',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-27 16:13:48',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
(7226,'Short Animated Video with Voiceover - Producer',8,'We are working to build awareness and demand of our products in the industrial space and are looking for an experienced animated video producer to create a quick 45-second, engaging, animated & educational video promoting the advantages of our industrial products.\r\n\r\nOverview of the video content -\r\nSpectroline fluorescent leak detection works effectively in any closed-loop system where fluids are used for lubrication, hydraulic, and water/glycol. The dye remains indefinitely within the system and works 24/7 to identify future leaks quickly. https://spectroline.com/industrial-leak-detection-works/\r\n\r\nProject details:\r\n- Animated explainer video approximately 45 seconds in length.\r\n- The topic of the video is to convey the advantages in a quick way with engaging animations, non-robotic voiceover\r\n- We need this video completed by early March 2023.\r\n\r\nAbout us: Our product works to detect leaks in HVACR, Industrial and Automotive systems using UV fluorescent leak detection dye.\r\n\r\nThis video will be used in:\r\n\r\n*Trade shows\r\n*Globally\r\n*Video advertising\r\n*Social media\r\n*Our website\r\n*Distributor websites\r\n\r\nWe have a video script for you to work off of that will be sent when hired.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1618980607841411073?success','-',7,'United States','Melville',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-01-27',1,'2023-01-27',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-27 16:14:51',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
