(7275,'Animated banners for a website',8,'We are currently in the process of developing a website on the Shopify platform and are in need of a skilled designer to assist us with several elements of the project. Specifically, we require the following:\r\n\r\nA main animated banner featuring two characters located under the sea. The characters in question will be provided by our team.\r\nAn additional image featuring the same two characters, with slight animation applied.\r\nA banner for the checkout page, which does not require animation.\r\nAll necessary assets will be provided to the successful candidate.\r\n\r\nIt is important to note that we require a portfolio of similar work to be submitted along with any proposal. Please include the code \"AA12\" in the proposal title to ensure that your application is properly considered.\r\n\r\nAs an example of the type of animation we are looking for, please see the website animation on https://littleairballoon.com\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and we look forward to hearing from you.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016921ca4ded5b0585','-',7,'United States','Dubai',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-01-27',1,'2023-01-27',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-27 19:21:36',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
