(7278,'Design for WordPress Website for client',15,'We are looking for web designers to make pages on wordpress, the projects would be as follow:\r\n\r\n\r\n- We install the wordpress, and all the necesary plugins.\r\n\r\n- You will have editor user so you can work on the pages.\r\n\r\n- The websites will be made using using Elementor Pro and Hello Elementor Theme\r\n\r\n- The pages on each website would be (Home, About us, Services, Contact)\r\n\r\n- You will receive a figma link so you can see the design for each page.\r\n\r\n\r\nThere may be cases when:\r\n\r\n\r\n- The client needs one or more additional pages, or doesn\'t need some of the above pages.\r\n\r\n- The client will not have any images to use in the website, in wich case we will provide you with images to choose from in the media section of the site.\r\n\r\n- The client will not have text, in wich case you will need to insert Lorem Ipsum text to match the figma section.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe timing for each project would be around 2 to 4 weeks.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2010376','-',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'fixed',1700.000,'2023-01-27',1,'2023-01-27',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-27 19:23:04',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
(7279,'Short Animated Video with Voiceover - Producer',8,'We are working to build awareness and demand of our products in the industrial space and are looking for an experienced animated video producer to create a quick 45-second, engaging, animated & educational video promoting the advantages of our industrial products.\r\n\r\nOverview of the video content -\r\nSpectroline fluorescent leak detection works effectively in any closed-loop system where fluids are used for lubrication, hydraulic, and water/glycol. The dye remains indefinitely within the system and works 24/7 to identify future leaks quickly. https://spectroline.com/industrial-leak-detection-works/\r\n\r\nProject details:\r\n- Animated explainer video approximately 45 seconds in length.\r\n- The topic of the video is to convey the advantages in a quick way with engaging animations, non-robotic voiceover\r\n- We need this video completed by early March 2023.\r\n\r\nAbout us: Our product works to detect leaks in HVACR, Industrial and Automotive systems using UV fluorescent leak detection dye.\r\n\r\nThis video will be used in:\r\n\r\n*Trade shows\r\n*Globally\r\n*Video advertising\r\n*Social media\r\n*Our website\r\n*Distributor websites\r\n\r\nWe have a video script for you to work off of that will be sent when hired.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~012d890ee527e3f68d','-',7,'United States','Melville',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-01-27',1,'2023-01-27',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-27 19:23:19',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
(7280,'WordPress Site',15,'\'m looking for a WordPress developer who has experience using the following:\r\n\r\n    Kadence Blocks Pro (https://www.kadencewp.com/kadence-blocks/pro/)\r\n    Restrict Content (https://restrictcontentpro.com/)\r\n    Events Calendar (https://theeventscalendar.com/)\r\n\r\n\r\nThis will be a non-profit association website with membership tiers and ticket sales for events to members and non-members. There will also be resource pages, mostly a collection of curated external links.\r\n\r\n\r\nThere will be the following pages:\r\n\r\n    Home Page\r\n    Objectives\r\n    Team\r\n    Upcoming Events (Calendar)\r\n    Past Events (Collection grid of event categories)\r\n    Event Detail\r\n    Resources (Like  Blog Homepage)\r\n    Resource Detail (Blog Page)\r\n    Sponsor \r\n    Volunteering \r\n    Membership (basic profile ,signup, sign in)\r\n    Contact\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAdditional requirements:\r\n\r\n    Similar visual theme to (https://www.kadencewp.com/kadence-theme/starters/church/)\r\n    Hosted on a free host for staging purposes and to generate a Kadence Child Theme (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5qsPHrOd1qY)\r\n    Some content will be provided, otherwise, placeholders should be used.\r\n\r\nAttachments','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2010480','-',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-01-27',1,'2023-01-27',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-27 19:24:11',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
