(7309,'Youtube video animation / editor for quiz/educational/explainer type videos',8,'I am looking for someone to help me take a video draft to the next level and make it more professional.\r\n\r\nThe format is an entertaining quiz/gameshow that uses statistics and comparisons to entertain and educate at the same time\r\n\r\nI\'ve struggled to know who to use because plenty of people will edit youtube videos, but they really want you to provide elements and they edit it all together. Then on the other side, there are full animators, but that\'s probably a step too far\r\n\r\nWhat this consists of is a set of scenes with some animated graphics, text and embedded videos, along with a voiceover. I\'ve made something myself and it looks \"ok\" but I can\'t help wonder if someone more experienced might be able to add a wow factor to it and make it feel more professional. I am not an experienced creator, so I am sure someone else could do a much better job.\r\n\r\nSo I guess what I am looking for is someone who is versatile in video editing, production and creative at the same time. I don\'t want someone who just expects me to provide all the content and they whip it together and make it look nice. I want someone who will have ideas on a better way to execute and present what I\'ve done\r\n\r\nI also don\'t want someone who wants to create every video on my behalf and charge me for it. So I am looking for someone who\'s happy to help me take it to the next level and charge me for that but then allow me to take it back over from there','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1619079611020197889','-',7,'United States','-',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-01-27',1,'2023-01-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-27 21:10:53',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
(7310,'UI/UX needed for SaaS Website',4,'I need UI/UX built for my SaaS website, NILvaluation.com. I will need designs for 5 pages total. The website tracks the monetary value of a college athlete, and helps brands figure out how much money to spend on endorsement deals.\r\n\r\nI have a rough mock-up built for each page, but I would love a UI expert to make it their own.\r\n\r\nPage 1 (homepage) is a simple web app.\r\nPage 2 shows an index of player valuations.\r\nPage 3 is the player profile page.\r\nPage 4 shows all endorsement deals.\r\nPage 5 shows a competitor analysis.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01314f96100299ab48','-',7,'United States','Plain City',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-01-27',1,'2023-01-27',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-27 21:13:25',NULL,5,3,NULL,133),
