(7315,'Stop Motion Animator for Short',8,'Looking for stop motion animators to help grab a storyboard and deliver the final project for production start-up.\r\n\r\nOur company produces educational materials that\'s entertaining, thought-provoking, and visually appealing for children. You must willing to work as part of a team.\r\n\r\nClay, clay mation, 3d printing, props, mayor production experience a huge plus.\r\n\r\nSample:\r\nhttps://www.google.com/search?q=just+dance+mr.sunshine&oq=just+dance+mr.sunshine&aqs=chrome..69i57.9865j0j4&client=ms-android-verizon-us-rvc3&sourceid=chrome-mobile&ie=UTF-8#','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1619085892895940609','-',7,'United States','Orange',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-01-27',1,'2023-01-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-27 21:33:59',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
(7316,'WordPress developer needed to revamp large site that has been in place for 10 years.',3,'Very large WordPress site in need of TLC. Some of the clear things I want done are:\r\n1. Page load speed is very slow, especially on mobile. Identified root causes relate to unused JS, render-blocking, resources, and image size/format. Need to identify the specific causes and fix them.\r\n2. Identify the plug-ins that are necessary and useful so we can minimize the number of plug-ins used, while using the necessary ones to their best potential.\r\n3. Help to configure the current Pixwell theme to optimize performance, or choose a better theme and migrate to it.\r\n4. Determine if moving away from Pressable hosting will help performance. This could be either because Pressable\'s server speeds are too slow or because we need a more robust CDN.\r\n5. Create new landing pages and integrate with MailChimp. Then develop automation to allow newly submitted emails to be routed properly and give automated responses.\r\n6. Properly configure ads and affiliate links.\r\n7. Get RSS feed configured properly to allow linkage to the Smart News app.\r\n8. Develop subscriber newsletter automation linked to the new giveaway & contest page, as well as being linked to the top articles.\r\n9. Work with me along the way to teach me the best practices for ongoing work so the gains we make are not lost over time through bad practices.\r\n\r\nUltimate goal is to increase the site revenue. To do that, we need to increase the DA from the current 45 to 60, if possible, plus increase traffic to the site. This should lead to increased revenue.\r\n\r\nI have another freelancer working on technical SEO actions, but I need someone to focus on developing and improving the website as well.\r\n\r\nI prefer to use hourly work, assigning hours as needed each week, based on the tasks being worked on. The amount of hours assigned will vary based on both the work being done and the revenue coming in.\r\n\r\nFinally, and very importantly, I need someone who will work with me to give me basic training on what is being done so I can maintain everything over the long term.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1619086232132243457','-',7,'United States','YORKVILLE',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2023-01-27',1,'2023-01-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-27 21:34:48',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
