(7318,'Need Logo Designed for Outdoor Lighting Company',10,'Company name: Southeast Lightscapes\r\nPossible \"Custom Outdoor Lighting\" underneath.\r\nIndustry: Outdoor Landscape Lighting\r\n\r\nThis company is in the beginning stages and needs a very professional classic, bold, and strong logo that will showcase my outdoor lighting business. I\'m looking for great branding and will be using the logo across all social media and online areas, along with shirts/hats, etc.\r\n\r\nI\'m completely open to any design ideas here.  I believe I would like the colors to be black/white/gold/yellow/white/silver/grey/beige... somewhere along that color scheme, but certainly open to any ideas.  \r\n\r\nI prefer classic bold, sans serif fonts, and also mild script fonts as well.  I prefer deep outlines and depth to the text, which appears great on both black/white and colored backgrounds. Possible icon incorporated into it as well.  Different star styles, or illumination icons, etc.\r\n\r\nAs I\'m not exactly sure how I\'d like the logo to look structurally yet, I\'m open to various designs.\r\n\r\nTarget market is higher end residential clients.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1619055007699693569','-',7,'United States','Cordova',45.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-01-27',1,'2023-01-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-27 21:35:59',NULL,15,3,NULL,155),
