(7321,'Need cool logo/design drawn',10,'I am looking to create a cool design that I can print out and place on my wall in the office. The style is similar to that of \'90s skateboard stickers, just something cool and retro with bright colors.\r\n\r\nIdeally I would use this for wall art but also for branding online.\r\n\r\nThe name of my business is LIL BEE CREATIVE and im a photographer, i would like to include a bee into the design and then work from there.\r\n\r\nPlease do not apply if this is not your style. Please do not apply if you are gonna go on Envato and use a basic logo design, that is not what im looking for.\r\n\r\nSend me a few examples of your work as well as an estimated cost. Thank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1619069781362122753','-',7,'United States','Ogden',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-01-27',1,'2023-01-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-27 21:39:45',NULL,15,3,NULL,155),
(7322,'Software Explainer Video | Motion Graphics Artist',8,'Hello! I\'m producing an explainer video for an online software and need to hire an experienced motion graphics / 2D animation artist with experience creating these types of videos (software explainers).\r\n\r\nDuration: ~3:00\r\nAspect Ratio: 1920x1080\r\nScript: will be provided\r\nVoiceover: will be provided\r\nMusic: will be provided\r\n\r\nHere are 2 style references, the project will have a similar structure and vibe. However, due to timeline, we will stick strictly to on-screen elements (no additional animation beyond the software its self).\r\n1. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=467BnfY3AIw\r\n2. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1Jc4ywxopmY\r\n\r\nThe project is on a quick turnaround:\r\n– **Start Date:** Monday, January 30\r\n– **First Cut Due:** Thursday, February 2nd 5:00PM CST\r\n– **Final Cut Due**: Tuesday, February 7th 1:20PM CST\r\n\r\nIf your availability aligns with this schedule please be sure to let me know in your cover letter. Looking forward to working together – I anticipate having more projects of this nature going forward and hope that we can begin a relationship with this job.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1619087528091066369?success','-',7,'United States','Grapevine',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-01-27',1,'2023-01-27',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-27 21:40:09',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
(7323,'Business Book Diagramming for Models, Frameworks, Concepts - Graphic Designer',2,'I am looking for a highly skilled information designer to create 30 custom graphics for a business book I have just finished writing.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe illustrations will include redesigns of existing concepts as well as new designs based on concepts, frameworks and models I have introduced in the book.\r\n\r\nThe illustrator will be responsible for ensuring design consistency throughout all 30 illustrations.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Create 30 custom illustrations for a book\r\n- Redesign existing concepts and designs\r\n- Create new designs based on provided concepts and models\r\n- Ensure design consistency throughout all illustrations\r\n\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\n- Strong illustration skills and experience\r\n- Ability to create both new designs and redesign existing concepts\r\n- Strong attention to detail and ability to maintain design consistency\r\n- Proficient in Adobe suite of tools and other design software\r\n- Strong communication skills and ability to work with a team\r\n- Please provide a portfolio of previous work along with your application.\r\n\r\nNote: You may want to add any specific details that you think it is important for your project and also you might want to specify the type of illustrations you are looking for(vector, digital, hand-drawn illustrations','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1619091956959064065?success','-',7,'United States','Oxford',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-01-27',1,'2023-01-27',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-27 21:57:44',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
