(7391,'Full-Time Fully Remote Email Designer',20,'Do you love designing really good-looking emails? Then we\'re looking for you!\r\n\r\nWe’re a fast-growing boutique email marketing agency serving a range of e-commerce clients. We\'re looking for a hands-on email designer to join our fully remote team on a long-term basis.\r\n\r\nWHAT YOU’LL DO:\r\n\r\nexactly what you do best: design beautiful, highly converting, and mobile-optimized emails for top US & EU e-commerce brands\r\nwork in a small highly-driven team creating irresistible emails (copy, brand guidelines, strategy & references will be provided)\r\n\r\nWHAT WE EXPECT FROM YOU\r\n\r\ntop-notch email design skills\r\nresearch skills and creativity to craft ever better email design for our clients\r\ninterest in emails and email marketing\r\nproficiency with Figma\r\nstrong work ethic, proactivity, and adherence to deadlines\r\navailability during EU working hours (approx. 9 AM to 5 PM GMT+3)\r\n\r\nBONUS POINTS\r\n experience designing emails from e-commerce brands, incl. email templates, graphic elements, and GIFs\r\n prior work experience with or within agencies or professional organizations\r\n prior hands-on experience with email marketing platforms like Omnisend, Klaviyo\r\n\r\nWHAT WE PROMISE\r\n\r\n flexibility to organize your work and your time respecting the deadlines\r\n competitive compensation and on-time payments (no chasing invoices)\r\n opportunities to develop your design and email marketing skills!\r\n professional, friendly, and respectful team.\r\n\r\nThank you! We can’t wait to hear from you :)','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0174981171fc6c86a0','-',7,'United States','Vilnius',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-01-30',1,'2023-01-30',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-30 15:59:39',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
