(7485,'Content Writer',37,'We are looking for a high-quality non-fiction ghostwriter who can write the copy for the interior of a low-content relationship-building journal [3,000 words].\r\n\r\nWe will pay a fixed rate for 3,000 words, and we will offer up a comprehensive outline with a guide to specific terminology. We will require a writing sample (we will pay for it) of the first 250-500 words.\r\n\r\nRequirements context:\r\n*Any resources used must be cited in MLA or APA.\r\n*Must have excellent English grammar, mechanics, and sentence structure/style.\r\n*Tone/Voice is fun & saucy.\r\n*Must be comfortable with finding and using peer-reviewed research.\r\n*Must have familiarity with writing about relationships/dating\r\n*Must feel comfortable using inclusive concepts and terminology\r\n*Job also has the possibility of becoming long-term work.\r\n\r\nIn your proposal, please explain your personal experience (including experience with self-help and productivity genres), and please provide a relevant sample/excerpt of previous nonfiction work to showcase your expertise and expertise in this field.\r\n\r\nLastly, please put \"crime brûlée\" as the first two words in your application so that we know that you\'ve read and understood everything.\r\n\r\nThank you for consideration, and we look forward to talking more with you','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2012227','-',7,'United States','abc',1000.000,'fixed',1200.000,'2023-01-30',1,'2023-01-30',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-30 20:33:48',NULL,4,1,NULL,152),
