(7547,'Revamp Existing Wordpress Sites',15,'will share the url after I get a price range. \r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m supporting a non-profit organization, which has the following and following needs. \r\n\r\n\r\nOne of the organization\'s Website has been redone.  There are some aspects that need some edits.  \r\n\r\n\r\nBased on that design, I need four more sites that have the overall same theme, look and feel, but with difference in colors. \r\n\r\n\r\nOne of the sites is the organization\'s main page. We have the layout developed, including all content.  This site will be no more than 4 pages. \r\n\r\n\r\nThe three other sites, are different programs, and will differentiate by color and some layout changes. \r\n\r\n\r\nThe idea is that these different sites will be part of the overall site, so build has to flow. \r\n\r\n\r\nWe have all content for the sites.  \r\n\r\n\r\nCan be a partial project for the right bidder, with opportunity of addendums. \r\n\r\n\r\nAdditional needs:\r\n\r\n\r\nChat feature\r\n\r\nRotating video clips\r\n\r\n\r\nPossible video library. \r\n\r\n\r\nPlease feel free to ask any questions, public or private. \r\n\r\n\r\nThank you','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2010937','-',7,'United States','-',3500.000,'fixed',3500.000,'2023-01-30',1,'2023-01-30',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-30 23:05:56',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
(7548,'Movie Graphics Designer/Concept Artist',2,'Please READ carefully before submitting your candidacy to make sure you can meet the below requirements. MOVIE AND/OR TV MARKETING EXPERIENCE A MUST. We are not trying to build a brand but concept/key art for a movie and TV project. \r\n\r\n\r\nTentative Title, LLC. (https://tentativetitle.org/) is currently developing a TV/Streaming Series called Merry Outlaws, which is based on a true story that took place in the 1980s and part of the 1990s.  The series is meant to be a real-life action series as well as a hybrid narrative-graphic novel.\r\n\r\n\r\nTentative Title is seeking an additional graphics designer/concept artist to join our development team for the project.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe candidate will be a seasoned artist in graphics design focusing on media projects, creating key art, concept art for storyboards, and VFX. More specifically, the candidate must be able to create artistic montages, compositions, and/or collages using multiple assets (e.g., photos, news articles, illustrations, etc.) in a unique style matching the look and feel of the project.\r\n\r\n\r\nPLEASE, READ THE ATTACHED DOC FOR MORE DETAIL\r\nAttachments','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2011114','-',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-01-30',1,'2023-01-30',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-30 23:06:32',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
(7549,'Design for Printed Newsletter',2,'need a design done in Photoshop where I get the original file so that I can make changes if needed. I need a sample within 6 hours of placing the order- I will work with you to create quickly and easily. It is for an ad in a newsprint art magazine for a small town in East Texas. We plan to print quarterly.  I do not have a large budget for these ads .I am talking like $25 max for this. \r\n\r\n\r\nI have attached the art - this is a new project and I have a very small budget- but whoever I choose will be able to do 3 pieces of work about other companies.\r\n\r\nI have done these before and I am able to do certain things but I am so busy proofing that I do not have the time to also be creative. \r\n\r\n\r\nyou will have to cut out the photos, then do a layout that is pleasing to people who listen to classical music- This is a group of conservative people for the most part- probably older adults.\r\nPlease tell me right now what you intend to do. I have to finish today. \r\n\r\n\r\nMount Vernon Music \r\n\r\n4.74”width x 10.5” height CMYK with 100% K on the text please!! 500DPI \r\n\r\nArt includes images of different performers and composers and I have included screen shots to show which is which. \r\n\r\nAnd, there is a logo and a header for the performance. There is an example of the natural connection logo and the musical note. You do not need the background of stars this time- it is spring so maybe you could help lighten the situation? The look? To be more spring like. \r\n\r\nThanks! \r\n\r\n\r\nHere are some pictures for Feb 19 (Emilie Mayer, Sibelius and Brahms), April 1 (Weiner, Marquez and Rimsky-Korsakov), and Family Concert April 29 (Overtones and Town Musicians)\r\n\r\n\r\nWords: \r\n\r\n A Spring of Natural Connections (logo) \r\n\r\n(Include tagline of) “Because Music Belongs to All of Us!” \r\n\r\nFebruary 19, 2:30 pm — Trailblazer Emilie Mayer and Music from a Revolutionary Age \r\n\r\nApril 1, 7:30 pm — Folk Tunes and Captivity Transcended \r\n\r\nApril 29, 11:00 am — Family Concert with The Overtones and The Town Musicians\r\n\r\n\r\n402 Leftwich St.,\r\nMt. Vernon, TX 75457','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2011099','-',7,'United States','-',250.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-01-30',1,'2023-01-30',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-30 23:07:22',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
