(7551,'design logo and cards and brand guide for SuperSenses',10,'Hi,\r\n\r\nI need to develop a\r\n1) logo\r\n2) 5 cards that explain Super-Smeller et\r\n3) brand guide\r\n\r\nThe five cards can be found here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1y0dEI5f3nLVhraDcV-sAMWUVt0nmsuuKgvlbVfXkJZc/edit\r\n\r\nIntroduction:\r\nSuperSenses is a company that specializes in the development and production of at-home testing kits that measure and score human sensitivity to each of the five senses of sight, hearing, touch, smell, and taste. Our mission is to empower individuals with the knowledge of their sensory profile, and to provide them with the tools they need to optimize their success in life.\r\n\r\nBrand Mission:\r\nTo empower individuals with the knowledge of their sensory profile and to provide a card on what it means to be a super-xyz\r\n\r\nBrand Personality:\r\nInnovative: We are constantly seeking new and innovative ways to improve our testing kits and to provide our customers with the best possible experience.\r\nEmpowering: We empower individuals with the knowledge of their sensory profile, so they can make more informed decisions about their careers and activities.\r\nTrustworthy: We strive to build trust with our customers by providing accurate and reliable test results, and by maintaining the highest standards of customer service.\r\nEducated: We believe in educating our customers about their sensory sensitivities, and providing them with the information they need to improve their overall well-being and quality of life.\r\n\r\nBrand Voice:\r\nProfessional: We are a professional company that takes the accuracy and reliability of our test results seriously.\r\nInformative: We provide our customers with the information they need to better understand their sensory sensitivities.\r\nEmpowering: We empower individuals with the knowledge of their sensory profile, so they can make more informed decisions about their careers and activities.\r\nFriendly: We pride ourselves on providing excellent customer service, and we strive to make the testing process as easy and stress-free as possible for our customers.\r\nBrand Visuals:\r\n\r\nColor Palette:\r\nOur color palette is composed of blue, white, and gray, which convey reliability, innovation, and professionalism.\r\nTypography: Our typography is clean and modern, to reflect the innovation and accuracy of our testing kits.\r\nImagery: Our imagery is people-centered, showing individuals of different ages and backgrounds using our testing kits and looking satisfied, curious and confident.\r\nIconography: We use simple and clean icons that represent the 5 senses and the concept of self-discovery.\r\nBrand Identity:\r\n\r\nLogo:\r\nOur logo is composed of an icon that represents the 5 senses, and the company name \"SensoryTypes\" in a modern and clean typography.\r\nTagline: \"Unlock Your Senses\"\r\nConclusion:\r\nAt SensoryTypes, we are dedicated to providing individuals with the tools they need to gain a better understanding of their sensory sensitivities, and to optimize their success in life. Through our innovative testing kits and our commitment to customer service, we strive to empower individuals with the knowledge of their sensory profile, and to provide them with the\r\n\r\n\r\n5 - logo Ideas\r\nA stylized human head with the five senses (sight, hearing, touch, smell, and taste) represented by different symbols (eye, ear, hand, nose, and tongue) arranged around it. The head is in the center of a circle.\r\n\r\nThe letter \"S\" in the form of a stylized human head, with the five senses represented by different symbols (eye, ear, hand, nose, and tongue) arranged around it.\r\n\r\nThe letter \"S\" in the form of a stylized human head, with the five senses represented by different symbols (eye, ear, hand, nose, and tongue) arranged around it. The letter \"S\" is in the center of a circle.\r\n\r\nThe letter \"S\" in the form of a stylized human head, with the five senses represented by different symbols (eye, ear, hand, nose, and tongue) arranged around it. The letter \"S\" is in the center of an upward-pointing arrow, representing the idea of self-discovery, self-improvement and progress.\r\n\r\nThe letter \"S\" in the form of a stylized human head, with the five senses represented by different symbols (eye, ear, hand, nose, and tongue) arranged around it. The letter \"S\" is in the center of a lightbulb that represents the idea of enlightenment and understanding.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~010b0074025498682c','-',7,'United States','Venice',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-01-31',1,'2023-01-31',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-31 07:30:25',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
