(7555,'Logo design for a land and water search engine project',10,'Land and water data can be inaccessible, expensive, hard to find, or not publicly available. Here a new digital gateway will be developed to give all New Zealanders transparent access to trusted data sources. Our research aims to create a digital MVP (minimum viable product) gateway to data and tools that is user-friendly, open-access, inclusive, collaborative, and trustworthy. Called Kuaha Matihiko, the digital gateway aims to consolidate access to disparate systems and data layers behind a single ‘shop-front’ that enables people to both access and contribute data. Our project will be highly participatory, with the gateway co-designed through wānanga and engagement with Māori, local and central government, and other stakeholders, to ensure that Kuaha Matihiko is relevant and attractive to various groups to meet their needs.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~018da89aa0375edbd5','-',7,'United States','Tauranga',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-01-31',1,'2023-01-31',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-31 09:23:58',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
(7556,'Parody Logo Edits - Modify existing logos for a fun company gift',10,'My company, Yard Stick, needs two \"parody\" logos:\r\n1. The \"Taco Bell: Live Más\" logo edited to instead be \"Yard Stick: Scan Más\".\r\n2. The \"Wendy\'s: Always Fresh, Never Frozen\" logo/tagline edited to instead be \"Yard Stick: Always Fresh, Never Frozen\".\r\n\r\nI need two logos, and then ideally I\'d like those logos placed on a t-shirt design, which may be as simple as ensuring nice colors for the logos.\r\n\r\nNote the US Supreme Court has explicitly upheld parody as protected free speech over and over! So while you will be working with existing corporate logo assets as a starting point, this project has no IP sensitivity concerns.\r\n\r\nThis should be a few hours of work for somebody who knows what they\'re doing.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~012bcae6951e0982a5','-',7,'United States','Cambridge',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-01-31',1,'2023-01-31',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-31 09:35:22',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
