(7561,'Write 3 page white paper on benefits of recruitment marketing',37,'Will start as such …\r\n\r\nRecruitment marketing is a key component of any successful recruitment strategy. It involves using multiple channels to reach and engage potential candidates, including job postings, social media, email campaigns, and more. Omnichannel marketing is an approach to recruitment marketing that leverages multiple channels to reach and engage potential candidates. This approach is becoming increasingly popular as it allows recruiters to reach a wider audience and better target their messages. In this white paper, we will discuss why recruitment marketing using omnichannel marketing is better than job postings for reaching passive candidates.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~011334a7dc89d584f0/apply/','-',7,'United States','Boca Raton',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-01-31',1,'2023-01-31',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-31 12:05:47',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
