(7564,'Graphic designer needed to create a logo and a packaging design',10,'Brand Name: Fruit Fiesta\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Part:\r\n\r\nCreative Brief: Logo for a new fruit-flavored hard candy brand\r\n\r\nTarget Audience: Adults, health-conscious consumers and those with a sweet tooth\r\n\r\nBrand Personality: Fresh, natural, wholesome and indulgent\r\n\r\nKey Message: A delicious and healthy treat that combines the goodness of fruit with the satisfaction of hard candy\r\n\r\nCompetitive Landscape: Competitors in the fruit-flavored hard candy space include Cavendish & Harvey, Simpkins and Kalfany\r\n\r\nDesign Requirements:\r\n\r\nSimple and memorable\r\nMust include the brand name\r\nColors should reflect the elegance of the brand (suggested: Metallic colors)\r\nUse a font that is stylish and easily readable\r\nShould be easily recognizable at small scale (e.g. on packaging)\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\n\r\nLogo in vector format\r\nColor palette\r\nTypography guidelines\r\n\r\nNote:\r\n• Please present 2-3 concepts for review and feedback.\r\n• Final deliverable should be in vector format for ease of scaling and reproduction across various mediums.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSecond Part:\r\n\r\n\r\nCreative Brief: Fruit Hard Candy Tin Box Packaging Design\r\n\r\nObjective: To create an elegant and appealing packaging design for fruit hard candy in a tin box.\r\n\r\nTarget audience: Adults who enjoy a sweet treat, including busy professionals and gift-givers.\r\n\r\nKey message: Our fruit hard candy is a premium, sophisticated treat made with natural ingredients.\r\n\r\nTone: Refined, upscale, and modern.\r\n\r\nDesign elements:\r\n\r\nSleek, metallic colors\r\nSimple, clean lines\r\nFruit illustrations or graphics\r\nClear, stylish font for labeling\r\nHigh-quality materials, such as a tin box with a lid\r\n\r\nPackaging format: Rounded Tin box with a lid.\r\n\r\nKey information to include:\r\n\r\nProduct name\r\nFlavor\r\nIngredients\r\nBrand logo\r\n“Natural ingredients” or similar messaging\r\n\r\n\r\nNotes:\r\n\r\n• The design will be printed on sticker and will be used on the face of the circle shaped lid.\r\n• Different variations for different flavors are needed after approval of the design\r\n• The packaging should reflect the premium quality of the product inside.\r\n• The design should be visually appealing and create a strong first impression.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e5e8bb25f51a447b','-',7,'United States','Ajman',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-01-31',1,'2023-01-31',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-31 12:31:20',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
