(7567,'Product Box Design made Remade ready for print',2,'Hello\r\n\r\nAttached is the box design - Box.jpg\r\n\r\nWe have created this design with the help of AI art and our own photoshop skills making the design look good enough that we are happy for printing it as is for our product.\r\n\r\nWe need a professional to take our finished design and remake it, in a printable illustrator file ready to send to our factory for printing.  PDF export required too.\r\n\r\nBox dimensions:\r\nTop - 160*100*60MM |\r\nBottom - 155*95*55mm\r\n\r\n## Files supplied by us:\r\n1. Box.jpg - Final design to copy for printing.\r\n2. Original EliteDrive logos in .AI format complete\r\n3. Full text for bottom of the box and icons used\r\n4. NEWSMARTTHROTTLEBOX.jpg - Shows how bottom of the box should look\r\n\r\nPDF from factory will be sent with dimensions same as listed above.\r\nRender JPG of device supplied to go on front of box\r\n\r\nWe require a professional who has designed for print before and can recreate our exact design looking smart for printing.  We want a sharp sleek design with vivid colours same as our concept render.  \r\n\r\nPlease specify when you\'ll be available to start on the project as we wish to move forward asap.\r\n\r\nThank you\r\n\r\nMatthew\r\nEliteDrive','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01a3990130d4175944','-',7,'United States','Clear Island Waters',300.000,'Open this select menu',300.000,'2023-01-31',1,'2023-01-31',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-31 14:14:26',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
