(7635,'Help with Theme and Materials for Professional Conference (Graphic Design)',2,'We are looking for a creative-minded person to help us develop materials for an upcoming professional conference. If we like your work, there be future opportunities available, too.\r\n\r\nHere\'s what we need assistance with:\r\n1. Developing a cohesive theme, slogan & graphics for materials for the conference. Slogan would ideally be centered around success/growth of our company. Graphics would ideally be centered around Old West/Wild West (Conference will be in San Antonio, Texas).\r\n2. Graphic materials would include a minimum of:\r\n-Graphics/logo to include in our social media posts\r\n-Professional booklet for printing/publishing (see attached example - we would provide the content for this booklet) We are looking for the booklet to be in Publisher format, PowerPoint is also acceptable.\r\n-PowerPoint template that can be edited\r\n\r\n\r\nWe would break this project up in milestones based on our internal deadlines for each deliverable. The first step, though, would be the theme and logo. Due by Monday, February 6th.\r\n\r\nWe expect we\'d wrap up this project no later than April 14, 2023.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1620475528599408641?success','-',7,'United States','Houston',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-01-31',1,'2023-01-31',0,'Fix price project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-31 17:35:31',NULL,5,3,NULL,128),
