(7638,'WordPress Website Developer for 3 websites',3,'We are seeking an experienced WordPress Developer to build three custom websites from scratch using the latest coding techniques and standards. The successful candidate will have a strong understanding of WordPress and be able to build websites without using templates or themes.\r\n\r\nDeliverables (Terms*)\r\n*Migrate/ Develop Figma designs into fully functioning WordPress websites (without using an already built template)\r\n*Write clean, efficient, and well-documented code (unique and not duplicate from any other websites (as per reference - we will go through code manually to verify that website pass this)  \r\n*Collaborate with the design team to ensure the websites match the Figma designs and specifications - both in terms of of UX/UI as well as Functionally (if there are errors made we need it to be revised accordingly)\r\n*Ensure cross-browser compatibility and responsive design (both on Mobile and Desktop)\r\n*Perform regular maintenance and updates to keep the websites running smoothly (subject to charge by Developer - you will help us with support and maintenance for the first 3 months free of charge)  \r\n*Ensure the websites are optimized for speed and security\r\n*Ensure that the websites are optimized for SEO (including Web Vitals)\r\n*Ensure that the developer do not use and page builder like Elementor or any other free or PRO versions\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n*Proven experience building custom WordPress websites from scratch\r\n*Strong understanding of HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and PHP\r\n*Familiarity with Figma design software\r\n*Ability to write clean and efficient code\r\n*Excellent problem-solving and troubleshooting skills\r\n*Good communication and collaboration skills\r\n\r\nImportant details\r\nWe expects the project to be executed in accordance with the Figma designs and functions outlined in the agreement. Revisions may be requested until the project meets the standards outlined in the agreement. If the project is not executed according to the agreement, the Client has the right to request a refund.\r\n\r\nIf you have a passion for building custom WordPress websites and are looking for a challenging and rewarding opportunity, we would love to hear from you!\r\n\r\nBy applying to this job you AGREE to the Deliverables above. If any of the Deliverables (*) does not comply with the outcome or scope of this project we will ask for a refund in full - or partial refund. This will be subject for discussion and the development team need to estimate per detail in terms of hours spent per each deliverable.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1620480502177792001','-',7,'United States','Stockholm',3240.000,'fixed',3240.000,'2023-01-31',1,'2023-01-31',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-01-31 17:55:50',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
