(7739,'Throwback Animation Videos (in the style of School House Rock)',8,'We have a fun project. We are looking to create throwback animation style videos, approximately 60-90 seconds max, to educate our audience on basic topics of our industry. Our plan is to create several of these depending on how the first two or three turn out.\r\n\r\nThe inspiration for these videos would be the old School House Rock cheaply drawn cartoon animations of the 70\'s.\r\n\r\nExample: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YkAX7Vk3JEw\r\n\r\nExample: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tyeJ55o3El0\r\n\r\nWe will script and do the basics of the key educational breakout images. We can also do voice-over and music separately as needed.\r\n\r\nThe budget is very loosely based. You can provide a proposal based on one, two, or three similarly styled videos if there is some economy of scale to doing multiple at one time. Cost per unit will definitely play a role in our selection, but please don\'t submit a proposal for a cost you can not achieve this animation content goal.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested, PLEASE share your experience and WORK SAMPLES related to 2D animations or illustrations, the types of tools you use for these projects. This may be stylistically quite different from your past work so if relevant, show us your most intentionally simplistic or cruder drawn animations in the manner of this School House Rock style.\r\n\r\nWe will only be contacting people with complete proposals and samples and reasonable response. Thanks!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0170f0b5a1c06992af','-',7,'United States','Dorado',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-02-01',1,'2023-02-01',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-01 07:46:58',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
(7740,'Redesign Website on Shopify',4,'Hello,\r\n\r\nOur current website is (www.fishfuse.com) which is clean, but lacks depth and a defined story. We are looking to have our website completely redesigned with an outdoor sports (Fresh water fishing) feel, that’s modern, aesthetically clean, tells an appealing story that connects from page to page. We already have a logo that we’ll provide.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n_Please share expected timeframe to complete the work (Understand that the TAT is predicated on when we assign work — We are looking to kickoff project within the next week)\r\n_Must be built on Shopify platform (Not opposed to a premium template thats customized to our wants/needs)\r\n_Please provide some example websites you’ve built\r\n_Pages: Home, Shop (Subcategories: Baits, Apparel), About (Subcategories: Our Story, Team, Ambassadors), FAQ (May change)\r\n_We have product photos\r\n_Key Focus Points: Made in USA, Unique Industry Designs, Custom Crafted, Vision\r\n\r\nSome graphic design is an expected component of this project.\r\n\r\nThank you in advance and we look forward to your best offer.\r\n\r\nCheers!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~014613a3f1b7c3740c','-',7,'United States','Woodbury',2500.000,'fixed',2500.000,'2023-02-01',1,'2023-02-01',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-01 08:34:47',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
