(7749,'Logo Animation',8,'I need my clients logo animated. Animation should run for just under 5seconds.\r\n\r\n1. The scroll \'Fraternitas Ludorum\" at the bottom rolls out like a scarf would. From the center to the edges.\r\n2. The Golden Leaves come from the center, bottom, and grow to the finished state.\r\n3. Center shield starts at the bottom and grows up. The lines going at different paces/speeds until the logo is complete.\r\nTotal animation should take around 3-4 seconds.\r\n4 The only white should be in the shield and bottom scroll \'Fraternitas Ludorum\"\r\n\r\nPlease ask any questions needed. Completion time by 15th Feb.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0139474241258348bc','-',7,'United States','Durban',80.000,'fixed',80.000,'2023-02-01',1,'2023-02-01',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-01 13:05:36',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
(7750,'Experienced Packaging Designer Needed',2,'Are you an experienced packaging designer that loves minimalism and can currently work on beautiful branding and packing?\r\n\r\nFor one of our big clients with a worldwide base of millions of followers, we are looking for a designer to create modern, sleek, premium, and minimalist branding for a liquid dietary supplement that will be packed in pouches. The pouches will be packed in a bigger paper box (10 or 30 pouches).\r\n\r\nThe great news is that this part of the project will involve mockup creation ONLY (branding + mockup). Therefore there´s no need for long communication with printers and re-creating designs 20 times to follow their instructions.\r\n\r\nWhat exactly we´d like you to help us create:\r\n- a modern, sleek, premium, and minimalist branding for the liquid dietary supplement\r\n- a design of the pouch and use it on the mockup within the next 10 business days\r\n- a design of the box in which the pouches will be delivered\r\n\r\nNext steps?\r\n\r\nIf you are currently available and looking for an interesting project this might be for you :)\r\n\r\nPlease send us your portfolio - ideally just the works that were related to packaging.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to speaking soon!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01a0132cb1da57b37c','-',7,'United States','Wien',1400.000,'fixed',1400.000,'2023-02-01',1,'2023-02-01',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-01 13:36:34',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
