(7753,'Ad creatives - Facebook Ads',9,'Hello there!\r\n\r\nWe are looking for an experienced Facebook ads designer.\r\n\r\nWe are a small advertising agency managing $10k to $30k monthly on Facebook ads.\r\n\r\nCourse Incubator is an agency that scales online course creators through paid advertising - https://courseincubator.com/\r\n\r\nHere is the information about the job:\r\n- 50$ per set of creatives (10) - (If high-quality creatives, the price will increase)\r\n- Able to communicate through slack regarding the creative content\r\n- Other possibilities (Creating a mockup for a website - Or simple schema for a blog post)\r\n\r\nThe agency is growing - Great growth opportunities \r\nThe agency is working with clients all other the world. (New markets in China, USA, Japan, and Arabic-speaking countries coming soon...)\r\n\r\nTake your seat and grow with the agency!\r\nNathan','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~010990703e2a2c1fbf','-',7,'United States','Tallinn',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-02-01',1,'2023-02-01',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-01 14:07:03',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
