(7756,'Logo / Brand Designer Needed',10,'Hello!\r\n\r\nI have a small starter company needing a designer to provide a quick logo design and give us the impetus to kickstart our larger branding project.\r\n\r\nIs that a bit back to front? Probably!\r\n\r\nRegardless, we have a placeholder logo designed for our brand HIKE MERCH (www.hikemerch.com) that will sell merchandise to hikers / walkers / runners and lovers of the great outdoors. It\'s about celebrating being outside in the hills, mountains, forests and parks kicking around in leaves, mud, streams and waterfalls and promoting healthy, happy, wild and wonderful liiving outside in the fresh air.\r\n\r\nIt\'s VERY important we differentiate the look and feel from NIKE for obvious reasons.\r\n\r\nWhat we need at Phase 1 is a logo + a favicon so we can begin talking to people about what we\'re doing online and on social media and kick start the process of growing our global outdoors community.\r\n\r\nFor Phase 2 we would like to run a full branding exercise to include digital and printed media (scope to be confirmed) as well as animated graphics and logo to draw our target market toward us.\r\n\r\nIf you are capable of straddling the line between energetic & fun and clean & high end graphics and don\'t mind having a shot at predicting our visual future to help us get off the ground, please get in touch!\r\n\r\nThanks, Sam','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01849852159f68406e','-',7,'United States','Hope',50.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-01',1,'2023-02-01',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-01 14:24:50',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
