(7771,'raphic Designer for Social Media, Ads, Website',2,'Qualifications:\r\n•Strong knowledge of graphic design programs within Adobe Creative Suite, especially including InDesign, Illustrator and Photoshop; and Acrobat\r\n\r\n•Ability to meet deadlines is a must\r\n•Strong analytical skills\r\n•Excellent eye for detail\r\n•Applicants must provide a compelling digital portfolio of work over a wide range of creative projects\r\nResponsibilities\r\n\r\nThe graphic designer is responsible for creating and developing high-quality design projects\r\n\r\n•Create creative and thoughtful designs for newsletters, digital advertising, social media and website graphics, infographics and presentations\r\n\r\n•This position ensures corporate image is consistently reflected and creatively used throughout our internal and external communication channels\r\n\r\n•This person must be able to design for a wide range of media\r\n\r\n•Create design ideas and advise on layout, typefaces, colors and styles for presentations, logos, email templates, posters, websites, advertisements, publications and more\r\n\r\n•Create web-based design and graphic elements for company websites\r\n\r\n•Create social media and infographics for internal and external audiences\r\n\r\n•Design digital marketing collateral including newsletters and email templates\r\n\r\n•Perform retouching and manipulation of images\r\n\r\n•Create, format and/or edit presentations (PowerPoint, executive communications, etc.)\r\n\r\n•Ensure projects are completed with high quality and on schedule\r\n\r\n•Prioritize and manage multiple projects within design specifications\r\n\r\n•File and store digital assets and working files effectively\r\n\r\nMonthly fixed budget $300\r\nTasks range from 10 - 20 hours per week.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ad73ce8b177e41f0','-',7,'United States','Philadelphia',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-02-01',1,'2023-02-01',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-01 14:58:19',NULL,5,3,NULL,