(7775,'Corporate Logo Refresh',10,'We have restated a small division of our company and need a logo modernization. We don’t want the logo changed just updated to look fresh and new. We would like three concepts. Each concept must have a vertical and horizontal version. We will choose the pair that we like. Once we chose. We want an entire pallet that consists of abobe illustrator and Adobe photoshop version in both vertical and horizontal. We would like some prepared versions. One-Color Back, On-Color White, Grayscale, Transparent background, and a few different sizes.  .jpg, tif, png, e\r\n\r\nLastly, we need a few designs in a specific sizes. These are to be used on our new YouTube Channel. We need the following:\r\n\r\nProfile  \r\nMinimum dimension for upload: 2560 x 1440 px with an aspect ratio of 16:9.\r\nAt the minimum dimension, the safe area for text and logos: 1235 x 338 px.  For this we would like three different versions to pick from all incorporating the new logo refresh, a professional headshot that we will supply, and then using three words as bullets:  Cooking, Nutrition, Fun\r\n\r\nProfile Thumbnail Picture. JPG, GIF, BMP, or PNG file (no animated GIFs)\r\n800 X 800 px image (recommended)\r\nSquare or round image that renders at 98 X 98 px  this should be a small version of the new logo that is designed for this size.  We would like three versions to pick from.\r\n\r\nVideo watermark guidelines\r\nYour video watermark must meet the following criteria:\r\n\r\nSquare image less than 1 MB in size. An image that’s 150 x 150 pixels is recommended. Use a PNG, GIF (no animations), BMP, or JPEG file that’s 1MB or less.  This can be a slightly larger version of the profile thumnail.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e14ba12b25f71b49','-',7,'United States','Chantilly',85.000,'perhour',80.000,'2023-02-01',1,'2023-02-01',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-01 15:00:47',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
