(7797,'Video editing for tik-tok style explainer video',8,'I am creating a series of short explainer videos. They are kind of \"Tik-Tok\" fashion in that I want them to jump around without any breaks in the action. Ideally very crisp, fast.\r\n\r\nI created my own explainer video here to test out what I was looking for. Speeding up clips when needed to make them fit my narration. And zooming in to show details of action areas:\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iZeiKes_K7U&t=5s\r\n\r\nI\'d like you to work on my second video (and eventually re-do my first. I\'ll re-record that later).\r\n\r\nWith this project, I\'ll grant access to:\r\n1. An audio narration. There is errors, ums, and deadspace that should all be trimmed.\r\n2. An iphone recorded video for the first couple sentences\r\n3. A screen recording for the demo.\r\n4. My logo in png and vector format.\r\n\r\nYou should overlay the audio narration onto the iphone recorded and screen recording to make a video that fits the narration and zooms around to show details of the action areas.\r\nAnother requirement is to cut off my computer\'s top bar and the top of the browser up through the URL bar. Viewers don\'t need to see what URL\'s I\'m at.\r\n\r\nI would also like a reusable intro and outro. I\'m not sure what effects you can do here but I\'d like be an impressive appearance with a sound effect. These videos will be a first look for a lot of potential customers. Because these video are so short, I\'m thinking around a 2-second intro. Maybe a longer outro.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1620813852690190337','-',7,'United States','Hoboken',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-02-01',1,'2023-02-01',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-01 16:03:26',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
