(7829,'Packaging and Label designer needed for confectionery products',2,'We\'re an importer, distributor and DTC seller of confectionery food products. We\'re launching some new products in spring, and we need a skilled designer to create:\r\n\r\n- Beautiful, enticing product labels which may include:\r\nimages/mockups of the item inside the packaging, logo placement, UPC/ingredients/allergens/claims, nutritionals, barcode placements.\r\n- Multiple product shots once completed + additional marketing content we can use for product listings, sell sheets, and ad content.\r\n- (Optional) Renderings of the packaging itself in multiple angles. If not able to design, we can obtain renderings ourselves with smart objects to place labels.\r\n\r\nWe have logos, UPC codes and some die lines to begin the work. I\'m open to logo re-designs, color changes, and shifting the brand identity to match the target demographic.\r\n\r\nThe items we\'re looking to have designed are:\r\n\r\n1.) Cake & Pastry Fillings (Packaging: Cans). We already have the renderings for these, just need label designs for 6 SKUs.\r\n2.) Fondant/Icing (Packaging: Tubs). We do not yet have the renderings for these. We will have the die lines soon for the labels.\r\n3.) Vanilla Extract/Paste (Packaging: Glass Jars/Plastic Bottles). We do not yet have the renderings for these. We will have the die lines soon for the labels.\r\n\r\nOur brand identity is clean, simplistic & modern with vibrant colors. We value simplicity in our packaging design while getting the selling points across. I can provide reference images of other brands that I like.\r\n\r\nIf the job is done well, we would look at hiring on the designer as our consistent, go-to individual for packaging & label design, as well as future projects in branding & marketing.\r\n\r\nThank you','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1620849302441373697?success','-',7,'United States','Surrey',45.000,'Open this select menu',45.000,'2023-02-01',1,'2023-02-01',1,'Cl