(7854,'Motion Graphic Designer for Animation Project',8,'We are looking for a talented and enthusiastic person to develop animations for our Swiss watch brand that will be primarily used for social media. Format will be short form reels, shorts, tiktoks.\r\n\r\nWe are bouncing between developing reels that will tell stories and insights that mirror our brand values as a fun and passionate brand that happens to sell watches.\r\n\r\nHoping the person that we work with is able to produce multiple animation monthly. The success of the project will be determined by a few factors:\r\n1. How many animated reels we produce monthly (min. 4)\r\n2. How much organic reach we create per reel.\r\n3. How on brand and high quality it consistently looks.\r\n\r\nThe ideal person enjoys the ideation process of creating these reels. Enjoys delivering consistent high value results.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to hearing from you and happy to answer any questions.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1620865212120117249','-',7,'United States','Los Angeles',52.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-01',1,'2023-02-01',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-01 19:23:52',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
