(7860,'Full Board Game art',2,'he job: Artwork in all aspects of the board game I have made. I\'m looking for someone with serious creative juice to bring my brainchild to life. \r\n\r\n\r\nThe potential: If you\'ve ever wished you could have been there when Catan, Ticket to Ride, or Seven Wonders was made, well, here you are. This is not bluster or hyperbole. The game I\'ve made checks all the boxes to be the next great family/game night game. \r\n\r\n\r\nCan be learned in under 10 minutes.\r\n\r\nHas high replay-ability and fun factor.\r\n\r\nEndgame scenario is tense and exciting. As in, there are several paths to victory. \r\n\r\nThe game is tested and Kickstarter ready.\r\n\r\n\r\nDetails of the job:\r\n\r\nBoard game is map of America (900mmx600mm) with roads interconnecting cities all through out. Scaling will need to be done. See attached image of prototype. \r\n\r\nDeck 1: 108 cards, same back, play side is unique text only.\r\n\r\nDeck 2: 15 cards, same back, play side is unique text only.\r\n\r\n12- individual player marker cards. 3x5 has been the size in the prototype, but that is flexible. Each player has 2 of these and they are color matched to their game marker. \r\n\r\nLastly, box design, and instruction booklet. \r\n\r\n\r\nI realise this is a pretty broad stroke, but I\'m not willing to part with too many specifics. It is more to give you an idea of what I\'m looking for. The artist that receives the contract will receive all pertinent game files. \r\n\r\n\r\nWhat I\'m expecting:\r\n\r\nA firm 2-3 month time line, professional behaviour and attitude. Awareness of deadlines.\r\n\r\nRegular updates, open communications, email, phone, FaceTime. If you have questions, suggestions, or artistic input, I am all ears. In short, I want to work with you to flesh out artistic themes to go with the game to create a cohesive experience for the player.\r\n\r\n\r\nI am looking for a long term artist partnership. I am already developing expansion packs, and other games in the series. This game is simply the starting point. \r\n\r\n\r\nCompensation:\r\n\r\n$5,500\r\n\r\n2% commission from the Kickstarter campaign once it has closed and money has been received. \r\n\r\n5% commission on profits after operating expenses, to be paid at the close of each quarter.  \r\n\r\nPlease send portfolio samples, and 3 business references with your submission. \r\n\r\nThank you, have great day and good luck!\r\n\r\nif you have standing questions I can be reached directly at chad@cargokings.co\r\n\r\n \r\nAttachments','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2013405','-',7,'United States','-',5500.000,'fixed',5000.000,'2023-02-01',1,'2023-02-01',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-01 19:31:38',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
