(7864,'Video Animation and Video Editor Specialist (Special Effects)',8,'**Job Description:**\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a highly creative and talented Video Animation and Video Editor Specialist to join our team.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will have a passion for visual storytelling and experience working with special effects in After Effects. In this role, you will be responsible for creating and editing captivating video content for a wide range of projects, including those incorporating sacred geometry shapes, toroidal fields, star constellations, and ethereal transitions.\r\n\r\n**Responsibilities:**\r\n\r\nDesign and create high-quality video animations and special effects using After Effects\r\n\r\nEdit and refine video footage to meet project specifications and timelines\r\n\r\nIncorporate sacred geometry shapes, toroidal fields, star constellations, and ethereal transitions into video content\r\n\r\nCollaborate with other team members and stakeholders to ensure video content aligns with project goals and objectives\r\n\r\nStay up-to-date with industry trends and technology advancements in video animation and editing\r\n\r\n\r\n**Requirements:**\r\n\r\nProven experience as a video editor and animator, with a strong portfolio showcasing relevant work\r\n\r\nAdvanced knowledge and proficiency in After Effects and related software and tools\r\n\r\nUnderstanding of sacred geometry, toroidal fields, star constellations, and ethereal transitions and their use in video content\r\n\r\nExcellent creative and problem-solving skills\r\n\r\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team\r\n\r\nStrong communication and organizational skills\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you are a skilled and passionate Video Animation and Video Editor Specialist with a focus on special effects, we would love to hear from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1620873737932963841','-',7,'United States','Noarlunga Centre',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-02-01',1,'2023-02-01',1,'NA',0,'Open this select m