(7924,'Logo for mental health counseling clinic',10,'I am opening a mental health clinic called Brighter Day Counseling.  \r\n\r\nMy clients will be adults, many of whom are older adults.  I am creating my website and need a logo to build my brand around.\r\n\r\nMy mental health counseling clinic will be 100% online.\r\n\r\nI have some ideas for a slogan, such as \"Today will be a brighter day\" or \"Tomorrow will be a brighter day.\"\r\n\r\nI\'d like to know what my logo/brand color scheme will be before designing my website.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1620902348305088513','-',7,'United States','Whitter',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-02-01',1,'2023-02-01',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-01 23:01:24',NULL,15,3,NULL,155),
(7925,'Create a motion graphics/logo animation for this Health care clinic video outro',8,'We are seeking a talented and creative Motion Graphics Designer to create a logo animation for the end of a health care clinic video. The ideal candidate will have experience creating simple and effective logo animations that match the branding and tone of the company.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDevelop a motion graphics/logo animation for the end of a health care clinic video\r\nEnsure the animation matches the branding and tone of the company\r\nKeep the animation simple and in line with the casual feel of the video\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience as a Motion Graphics Designer\r\nStrong portfolio showcasing logo animations and motion graphics work\r\nAbility to create animations that are simple, effective, and match the branding and tone of the company\r\nUnderstanding of design principles and color theory\r\nProficient in Adobe After Effects and other motion graphics software\r\nWe are looking for a designer who is passionate about their craft and can bring their creativity and expertise to this project. If you\'re a Motion Graphics Designer who is interested in working on a fun and impactful project, please apply with your portfolio and relevant work samples.\r\n\r\nI Have attached the video for you to get an idea of what it looks like. We are also open to different suggestions and ideas on the opening and closing of the video of you have any.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sAkG6Vbj86E\r\nCompanies website: https://www.vitalcarewa.com/','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~014c845f2733e97794','-',7,'United States','Kalispel',175.000,'perhour',175.000,'2023-02-02',1,'2023-02-02',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-02 07:47:43',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
