(7933,'Design of illustrations',2,'Hi\r\n\r\nI have some illustrations (enclosed) that is symbols of a few of our IT-systems. Each \"person\" represents a huge IT-system (the name of the system is on the chest of the person).\r\nThe first pictures show the system when we bought them - represented as a fit and happy person.\r\nOver time we develop our systems with so much overlapping functionality that they add weight and become fat & lacy (picture nr 2)\r\n\r\nWe uses such cartoons to tell stories about systemdevelopment and technical debt.\r\n\r\nSo, what do I need?\r\n\r\nI want more \"persons\" in the same style - but this time as children. The \"story\" I want to tell is that these persons (IT-system) get a lot of children. Some of the children are small, some are thin, some are lazy, some are active, etc . So a kind of family around each \"main person - seen in the pictures enclosed\".\r\n\r\nI guess 2-4 children to each \"main person\".\r\n\r\nUnfortunally I don´t have the source files for the pictures enclosed - so you might need to reedo them as well','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01d40f8cbb7fddebec','-',7,'United States','Stavanger',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-02-02',1,'2023-02-02',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-02 11:00:55',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
