(7936,'Convertion of Microsoft PPT template from 4:3 to 16:9 and Refresh',11,'Hi, I have a Powerpoint template that I want to convert from 4:3 scale to 16:9 and do a little refresh of the design. Only three slide types are typically used as per the three images attached.\r\n\r\nThe title slide has a background image that rotates every few seconds where up to three images are shown and rotate constantly until the mouse is clicked. I would like to keep this feature. The images will be provided in raw format to the chosen freelancer.\r\n\r\nLooking for someone to bring a new idea to this presentation and suggestions for alternatives. Examples can be provided for review as part of the bidding stage. Three primary colours are to be considered in the general style that match the logo colours, but the general design is open to suggestions.\r\n\r\nThe original 4:3 editable Powerpoint will be provided with company logo and images that can be used. Only freelances with experience in Powerpoint template generation and related portfolio content will be considered.\r\n\r\nTime frame for this work is ideally 5 days, but negotiable. Please state in your bids an estimated number of hours (or total cost) and time to deliver.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~019cd3be43ea8673f2','-',7,'United States','Santiago',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-02-02',1,'2023-02-02',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-02 11:31:36',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
(7937,'Animated Logo',8,'\'m developing a storyboard for an animated logo for a Swiss company and I\'m looking for a skilled animator to create the animation.\r\n\r\nWebsite of the company:\r\nhttps://mybox.ch/\r\n\r\nWhat the company does:\r\nOffers storage spaces for private and businesses.\r\n\r\nCurrent logo (not animated):\r\nA red box and the brand \"MYBOX\" written on it.\r\n\r\nRough storyboard for the animated logo:\r\n1. Beginning with a small red box.\r\n2. Items such as furniture, old TV, chairs etc. are falling into the red box.\r\n3. The box is growing and reaching it\'s appropriate size.\r\n4. The text \"MYBOX\" appears and the letter \"X\" is shaking joyfully.\r\n5. End position: current logo.\r\n\r\nThe character of the animation should be cheerful and have a cartoonish touch.\r\n\r\nThe animation can be created with After Effects or Fusion.\r\n\r\nDelivery time: around 3-4 weeks.\r\n\r\nPlease supply examples of your work that resemble the style of this job.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016c5b70ac6e22180a','-',7,'United States','4053',65.000,'perhour',65.000,'2023-02-02',1,'2023-02-02',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-02 11:40:57',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
(7938,'Branding assistance, slogan, logo, signage',2,'I would like help\r\n* Creating a slogan\r\n* What the brand logo should be (the actual drawing can be outsourced but needs a concept)\r\n* Creating eye catching signage that drives user adoption (one sign design, rectangular approx 8\"x12\" that people will be passing a few feet away from. Actual graphical creation can be outsourced.)\r\n\r\nResulting work will be used on website and physical signage. The intent is to as simply as possible distill the product down for potential users to understand and drive adoption\r\n\r\nMy expectation is for this to be several hours of work but not much more than that. Actual graphical design will be outsourced unless that\'s something you want to do, otherwise this is consulting only.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for candidates with a strong history of experience in the creative marketing/branding space.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~014f66e62a8d0bdb88','-',7,'United States','Madison',75.000,'perhour',75.000,'2023-02-02',1,'2023-02-02',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-02 13:00:11',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
(7939,'Logo and company style for an art gallery, business cards, stamp,',10,'A new opening art gallery/shop needs a logo and company style.\r\nLogo will be used on a website, outdoor advertising, business cards, stamp on the paper bags.\r\nWe need to develop different options to choose from, after one is chosen to proceed with developing chosen option in details.\r\n\r\nGallery name: Gallery 16\r\nShort description/slogan(English): Handmade arts and crafts\r\nDescription of the activity: we sell handmade artworks, crafts, jewelry in the old town of Vilnius in a small shop/gallery\r\nDetailed description about the brand: Modern art gallery and a shop that manufacture and sell modern jewelry, accessories and paintings. We value manual work, we are for piece work, not for mass production. In each product, quality and price must match. We create and sell products that are not cheap, but available. Each Item in our gallery is meaningful, has a complete creation, it is not made of plastic, it is made with love and with an idea. We consider gallery space as a place for events, workshops and training. People and their relationship with nature is considered as one of the main motives of the works exhibited in the gallery. The concept of our products should be obvious and easily understood by our audience.\r\nWe are located in the historical center of Vilnius, on one of the streets famous for its galleries and shops. We do everything qualitatively, politely and with great attention to details. We are neat, stylish and punctual. We are in line with the environment, we are not rebels and rule breakers, but thoughtful collectors and connoisseurs.\r\nWe are not magical, not office, not industrial, not mass production, we are natural and modern.\r\nAttaching the examples of real works which would be sold and artists with whom we are cooperating. Also a photo of first project of inside interior.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01961a35963b3d0e2d','-',7,'United States','Vilnius',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-02-02',1,'2023-02-02',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-02 13:12:17',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
