(7973,'Media Kit',2,'We are looking for an experienced and talented freelancer to create a media kit for New York Style Guide. This media kit will serve as a key tool for promoting our brand to potential partners and advertisers, so we expect high-quality, visually appealing design and attention to detail.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will have a strong understanding of the fashion industry, as well as a passion for design and a keen eye for typography, color, and layout. You should be able to turn complex information into easy-to-understand visuals, and create a media kit that accurately reflects the New York Style Guide brand and its mission.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDevelop a comprehensive and visually appealing media kit for New York Style Guide\r\nWork with the team to understand the content and messaging needs of the media kit\r\nDesign pages and graphics that are in line with New York Style Guide\'s brand guidelines\r\nEnsure that the media kit is well-organized and easy to navigate\r\nProvide multiple design options and iterate based on feedback from the team\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience in creating media kits and other promotional materials\r\nA strong portfolio demonstrating your design skills and attention to detail\r\nExcellent understanding of graphic design principles, including typography, color, and layout\r\nExperience with Adobe Creative Suite (InDesign, Photoshop, Illustrator)\r\nExcellent communication skills and the ability to work efficiently and independently\r\nA passion for fashion and an understanding of the fashion industry is a plus\r\nIf you believe you have the skills and experience required for this project, we would love to hear from you. Please provide your portfolio and a brief summary of your relevant experience.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~014fe01ed5b36f256b/apply/','-',7,'United States','Boca Raton',75.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-02-02',1,'2023-02-02',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-02 15:46:03',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
