(8001,'Web Design Needed for Website Refresh/Redesign',4,'We are a strategic consulting firm that focuses on enabling intelligent and profitable growth for our global clients.\r\nI am in need of a refreshed web design that will be flexible enough to grow with us, show case the work that we do, provide a good user experience and in some cases drive lead gen,\r\n\r\nI have been in digital space myself for the last 17 years and do not have the bandwidth to redesign my firms website as I have client commitments so I am outsourcing it to someone who I can communicate my vision to and they can help elevate and execute quickly.\r\n\r\nWe are needing/wanting version 1 of this new site stood up within the next month (no later than end of February). I have several bandaides in place that are working for now but it is not long term sustainable.\r\n\r\nOur current website: https://www.nourgroup.com\r\nLanding page layout that we\'ve moved to and prefer better can be seen on our landing pages: https://www.nourgroup.com/resummit\r\nhttps://www.nourgroup.com/learning-expeditions\r\n\r\nOther websites that we like the overall look & feel of are clean, lots of white space, engaging:\r\nhttps://www.tellius.com/\r\nhttps://interbrand.com/\r\nhttps://www.outreach.io/\r\nhttps://about.gitlab.com/\r\n\r\nThis website needs to support a blog and be able to seamlessly connect to a store and community forum.\r\n\r\nWe are also going through a brand renaming which will be announced later this year, so the website will need to accommodate a new logo/name change but nothing else about our brand will be changing.\r\nI have a brand style guide to share as well. Please let me know if there are any questions.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1621189077557723137?success','-',7,'United States','na',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-02',1,'2023-02-02',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-02 16:51:12',NULL,5,3,NULL,132),
