(8006,'2D Animator needed to create a product advertisement for an upcoming marketing campaign.',8,'ID123 is a digital identity solution company that is quickly expanding its business operations. We provide a cloud-hosted identity platform to both large and small institutions around the world enabling them to offer digital ID cards to their members. We need a 2D animator to create a product advertisement for an upcoming marketing campaign.\r\n\r\nAn ideal candidate will have experience in 2D animation, post-production, and advertising with an eye for detail and creativity. This job will require you to gain a moderate understanding of the ID123 product so you can create an effective product advertisement. A script and storyboard of approximately 574 words have already been created. We need a talented 2D animator to bring our vision to life in addition to creating a voiceover narrative of the provided script. You may take some creative liberties when creating the product advertisement under the supervision of the ID123 team. Supplementary information needed to complete the project will be provided as needed.\r\n\r\nThis position is entirely remote. You can set your own schedule but must meet the set deadline. Giving weekly progress updates is a requirement of the position.\r\n\r\nPlease submit a resume and relevant work samples when submitting a proposal for this job.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1621191667174887425?success','-',7,'United States','Waltham',55.000,'Open this select menu',55.000,'2023-02-02',1,'2023-02-02',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-02 17:02:11',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
