(8014,'DME Billing',21,'I am looking for a contractor that has a lot of experience with Medical Billing for Durable Medical Equipment. We currently sell only one product which are safety beds for children and adults with special needs.\r\nWe currently have a billing company 24/7 medical billing and they will submit the claim to insurance. We are looking for help with the task below.\r\n\r\n1. Checking Benefits\r\n2. Calling customer and explaining benefits\r\n3. Billing customers for co-pays or OOP cost\r\n4. Getting the prescription, Letter of Necessity and delivery confirmation. Passing this on to the billing company.\r\n5. Sending paperwork to customers through docusign and making sure everything is complete.\r\n6. Communicate to customers via phone and email.\r\n\r\nWe are a safety bed factory and registered by the FDA. We sell directly to customers, bill insurance, Medicaid as a DME in Ohio. Currently we are approved through Medicare and working on Medicaid in Ohio. We will be applying to other states for Medicaid soon.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1621211255250411521','-',7,'United States','Conesville',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-02-02',1,'2023-02-02',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-02 18:18:46',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
