(8098,'Creating a visual/brand identity for a Cybersecurity project',2,'We are looking for a designer who will work with us to design a visual identity / brand identity for a project in the field of Cybersecurity. We gathered information from the different project partners that shall serve as the basis for the design work. We will make a meeting with you to talk you through the input from the project partners. See attached a PDF summarising the insights gathered from the partners.\r\n\r\nWhat we are looking for in the first place is a concept for the visual identity and then we are looking for 3 logo / key visuals alternatives that represent the concept. The logo and key visuals should be placed on mock-ups so that we can imagine how the logo/visuals will turn out in reality. Attached to the job offer you can find a proposal that we received from our former designer and we expect something similar from the designer who takes this project.\r\n\r\nWe expect the designer to work with us on some iterations until we have finalised the logo/key visuals.\r\n\r\nThe final deliverables need to be vector-based files (Adobe Illustrator). The visual identity shall come with a clear definition of primary and secondary colors, fonts used etc (style guide).\r\n\r\nPlease show us similar work (incl. concepts and logo variations) that you have done. Do not simply send us logo examples you created.\r\n\r\nAfter this initial project, we will be in need for a designer who can design marketing material based on the visual identity (e.g. roll-up banner; brochure, flyer, etc.). The designer who designed the logo and key visuals will be our first contact point for this so that follow up work could be expected.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1621231805712621569','-',7,'United States','Muenster',390.000,'fixed',390.000,'2023-02-02',1,'2023-02-02',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-02 22:24:04',NULL,7,3,NULL,155),
