(8233,'Craft a sales letter for ebook',2,'Do you love talking or writing about saving time for both mom and entrepreneur? Can you create content in the first person, conversational style that’s popular with bloggers?\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you answered “yes” to both questions, then here is a project that’s perfect for you:\r\n\r\n1) I need a good English copywriter who has experience with writing sales letter or sales copy.\r\n\r\n\r\n2) The project is to craft  a sales letter about an ebook entitled SAVING TIME MADE EASY FOR BUSY MOMPRENEUR (mom and entrepreneur). (I’ll  explain more when I narrow down the bids.)\r\n\r\n\r\n3) I already have the e-book that targets the market (e.g. Mommy entrepreneur or mompreneur).\r\n\r\n\r\n4) No plagiarism will be tolerated. You can use other websites to do research, but the final work\r\n\r\nwill be 100% unique content. I use Copyscape to double check the final work.\r\n\r\nWhen bidding, please provide samples of sales letter that directly relate to “saving time” or any related topic. If I like your bid, I’ll reply back with more details about what’s required.\r\n\r\n\r\n5) Expected duration of time to complete the job: 3 weeks-1 month.\r\n\r\n\r\n6) Also, include the words “kalabaw”. That way I know you’ve read this entire description and\r\n\r\nunderstand what I need for this job. Feel free to use the private message board if you have any\r\n\r\nquestions or need further clarification.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2014662','-',7,'United States','abc',500.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-02-03',1,'2023-02-03',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-03 19:10:34',NULL,4,1,NULL,152),
