(8249,'Video Editing: Typography & After Effects for Acoustic Music Videos!',8,'Create the typography and graphic/animation effects for acoustic music videos on our channel to make them more entertaining so people can follow along and read the lyrics on screen while watching the video and being entertained by any added effects or graphics appropriate to the song and lyrics. Very fun project!\r\n\r\nHere is an example on our channel: https://youtube.com/shorts/X2798P-wQkw?feature=share\r\n\r\nWe would like to find new creative ways to improve upon this to make the video better and more engaging. You would start with the blank video and add the lyrics/text plus transitions/animation/effects.\r\n\r\nSkills with typography and understanding fonts and which ones fit the mood of a song are important. Being creative and finding fun and entertaining ways to captivate viewers is the goal.\r\n\r\nSkills with typography, after effects, animation etc... will be necessary.\r\n\r\nWill be an ongoing part-time project for the right person and potential for very consistent work.\r\n\r\nThank you for your interest!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1621594223664574465','-',7,'United States','Ashland City',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-02-03',1,'2023-02-03',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-03 19:40:28',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
(8250,'Logo and brand identity package',2,'Our client is an online startup travel guide that will curate thousands of destinations around the world. We are currently looking for a creative partner to design the online guide\'s logo and visual brand identity. It is a rare opportunity for a designer to shape what will feel like a luxurious online experience. The main application for the identity will be through our client\'s future website. For now, it is important to note that the website’s rich content will be displayed on a map showing all recommendations.\r\n\r\nWe would like to see at least three distinct brand identity and logo directions, followed by a couple of rounds of interactions, until we arrive at a logo and a concept that is polished, then finalized.\r\n\r\nWe envision the following deliverables:\r\n\r\n● Logo or wordmark\r\n● Logo lockups (black and white, horizontal and vertical applications, etc.)\r\n● A set of icons representing the various groups of recommendations: restaurant,\r\nhotel, museum, shop, café, etc.\r\n● Color palette\r\n● Typography\r\n● Standard typographic treatments (headlines, pull-out text, etc.)\r\n● Image styles (establishing a consistent look and feel for photography, line art,\r\nillustrations or charts/graphs)\r\n● Graphic elements (background texture, a line style treatment, etc.)\r\n● A few dimensionalizations of the identity and logos; mocked up examples of\r\nusage.\r\n\r\nPlease submit proposed budget / hourly rate, proposed timeline, and example of your work we should review as we consider your proposal. We are available to provide clarifying answers, and we\'ll share a lot more detail with the chosen creative partner. Many thanks for your time and attention.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1621594518323302401?success','-',7,'United States','Seattle',50.000,'Open this select menu',50.000,'2023-02-03',1,'2023-02-03',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-03 19:43:04',NULL,5,3,NULL,132),
