(8299,'Minimalistic Social Media Website For Image sharing',3,'Hi,\r\n\r\nLooking to create a very simple/minimalistic social media website focused on-image sharing (image attached but description below). WP themes/templates ok, ultimately whatever is the easiest and affordable to get started with the ability to scale.\r\n\r\nI have done a lot of web development, but this requires a few steps outside of my wheelhouse. I\'m looking for the skeleton of the website mostly and I can adjust aesthetically. If it grows as I market it, I\'d happily love to offer more work.\r\n\r\n- Website will mostly be a grid of tiles like Pinterest or Netflix (with a few sections)\r\n\r\n- Users can share a post that\'s an image as the tile with tags & description OR a Text post where the Text is the tile\r\n\r\n- The website Will have two main sections with a toggle (image based, or text based) Image based\r\n\r\n\r\n- User profile: pic, description, option for external link + links to their portfolio and shares\r\n\r\n- User can login through website or Gmail\r\n\r\n- Users can comment or \"like\" posts\r\n\r\n- There should be three rows \"popular\", \"trending\", \"newest\"\r\n\r\n- A search bar\r\n- Content has to be approved before accepted\r\n\r\nSimplicity, functionality, and implementation are more important than aesthetics.\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1621632922129412097','-',7,'United States','San Jose',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-03',1,'2023-02-03',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-03 22:14:37',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
