(8307,'Animated whiteboard explanation of product trial',8,'We are a telemedicine company. We offer a trial whereby clients receive:\r\n\r\nA prescription\r\n3 tablets of sildenafil at 25 mg\r\n3 tablets of Tadalafil at 5 mg\r\n\r\nThey then try one tablet of sildenafil and later two tablets. Then do the same with Tadalafil. Thereby having tried both drugs and both doses and they know which drug and dose to use moving forward.\r\n\r\nI envision all of this being explained in a 60 second (more or less) whiteboard video.\r\n\r\nI’m flexible on budget. I would like a draft by Wednesday and final product by Saturday afternoon.\r\n\r\nUSA only, and please do not outsource. Mention the timeline so I know you’ve read this, and show me some\r\nWhiteboard examples you’ve done. Thank you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ffda073ec95231e1','-',7,'United States','St. Charles',400.000,'fixed',400.000,'2023-02-06',1,'2023-02-06',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-06 07:50:23',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
