(8311,'Logo / Icon designer wanted',10,'**PLEASE READ THIS DESCRIPTION CAREFULLY BEFORE APPLYING FOR THIS ROLE***\r\n\r\nHello designer friends!\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for a logo designer who is passionate about creating beautiful iconography.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate has:\r\n• A passion for creating exceptionally beautiful, balanced graphic icons for branding\r\n• Loves creating perfect geometric shapes with their chosen design tool (Figma / Illustrator / whatever)\r\n• Has incredible attention to detail\r\n• Loves working with grids and the pen tool\r\n• Can work very quickly and create SVGs at speed\r\n• Is happy to spend 8 hrs a day working on iconography / branding exclusively\r\n• Is looking to build a long-term relationship with an overseas client\r\n• ** MOST IMPORTANT: HAS A LARGE DESIGN FOLIO FULL OF EXCEPTIONALLY GOOD DESIGNS - VERY SIMILAR IN STYLE TO THE DESIGNS ATTACHED TO THIS BRIEF. DO NOT APPLY IF YOU DO NOT HAVE THIS.**\r\n\r\nThe logos attached here are from various designers who are very talented people. The are perfectly formed, made exceptionally well and are perfectly drawn.\r\n\r\n*IMPORTANT - Please note*.\r\nYou will NOT be asked to design for a SPECIFIC company. This is a design brief to create the icons for brands only, and it will be up to you to think each day about how to create new iconography. This will involve sourcing material from the net - ie: Behance - and using this material as inspiration. You will not be copying, but using certain material you find, making minor adjustments and therefore creating something new. (For example, you may find a repetitive, geometric you think is nice. You can make a similar shape, with perhaps one less repetition. A change of colour of the original design is not enough of a significant change to validate your design.)\r\n\r\nAll logos will be supplied by you, in SVG form, with black icons on a white background, to a very specific size. I\'ll supply the Figma file. (Note that you can create the icon in any platform, but must be supplied via Figma, which is preferred.)\r\n\r\nIf you can design icons to the level of quality attached, please apply with authentic, verifiable examples. This is a long-term opportunity for very talented designers. No time wasters please. Thanks.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~013db630fbfdb67981','-',7,'United States','Australia',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-02-06',1,'2023-02-06',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-06 11:22:07',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
