(8317,'Brand Design Strategy',2,'We\'re looking for an experienced Brand Identity Designer and Strategist to create recommendations, a new style guide, and create examples of new icons, illustrations, image styles, font choice, swatches etc.\r\n\r\nPlease note: we do *not* need a new logo - we understand the difference between identity design/strategy, and logo design.\r\n\r\nOver the next couple of months, we need new designs for the website, sales decks, brochures, whitepapers etc. But that\'s not what this job is about.\r\n\r\nAll of these need to be designed with a coherent look and feel. To ensure this happens, we need an experience brand identity designer/strategist to create an over-arching style for everything.\r\n\r\nThe person we engage for this is specifically a brand person who can also tell us what styles we should use for things like icons, illustrations, images etc. Below is the list of items we need to be part of the brand strategy:\r\n\r\nBrand elements\r\nDesign concepts\r\nStyle guide\r\nIllustration styles\r\nImage styles\r\nSocial media assets styles\r\nContent assets styles\r\nSales deck and presentation styles\r\n\r\nIf you also happen to be a graphic designer, then we\'d certainly give you more work over time, including design the above assets. But we really need someone right now who can create the brand identity and guidelines for all of the above assets.\r\n\r\nWe need to get working immediately on this.\r\n\r\nPlease mention your approach to brand identity strategy in your cover letter, and include some example of previous work. Also please write the word RBcyber in your letter.\r\n\r\nMany thanks,\r\nBrad','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1622601149447176193','-',7,'United States','Darlinghurst',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-06',1,'2023-02-06',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-06 14:21:55',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
