(8365,'Medical Animations',8,'We are a personal injury law firm seeking a talented Medical Animator to join our team. The ideal candidate will have experience creating visually appealing and informative medical animations that help explain complex medical concepts to lay audiences.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Design and create medical animations and illustrations that accurately depict injury mechanisms, medical procedures, and medical conditions\r\n- Work with attorneys and medical experts to understand the case details and accurately depict them in animation form\r\n- Ensure that animations meet the highest standards of accuracy and are in compliance with medical standards and regulations\r\n- Stay up-to-date with the latest medical and technological advancements in animation production\r\n- Collaborate with other team members to ensure that animations support the overall case strategy\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Experience in animation, biomedical visualization, or a related field\r\n- Strong portfolio showcasing previous medical animation work\r\n- Proficiency in industry-standard animation software such as Autodesk Maya, Adobe After Effects, or similar\r\n- Knowledge of anatomy, physiology, and medical terminology\r\n- Excellent visual storytelling skills and attention to detail\r\n- Ability to work well under tight deadlines and in a fast-paced environment\r\n\r\nIf you are passionate about medical animation and have a strong desire to help people understand complex medical concepts, we want to hear from you..\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit your resume, portfolio, and cover letter highlighting your experience and qualifications.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1622624327220432897','-',7,'United States','Columbia',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-06',1,'2023-02-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-06 15:53:54',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
