(8424,'Designer needed to create new design concepts for upcoming research',10,'We are creating some new product concepts for upcoming research testing. These concepts are for the Imodium brand in the Anti Diarrhoeal category.\r\n\r\nWe will be creating 3x concepts in English (EN) and then in German (DE) so 6 concepts in Total to be created. The 3x concepts are based around the same idea so once a master concept version is created it will be relatively easy to create the 2nd & 3rd concept from.\r\n\r\nStep 1: create 3x new product concepts in EN\r\n\r\nApprove\r\n\r\nStep 2: recreate 3x new concepts in DE (translations to be provided)\r\n\r\nWe are looking for this concept creation and finalisation to take place across a time period no longer than 10 working days but ideally within 5 working days.\r\n\r\nMore specific details to be shared on a project kick off call to be scheduled.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1622666003392643074','-',7,'United States','Santa Clara',800.000,'fixed',800.000,'2023-02-06',1,'2023-02-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-06 18:39:41',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(8425,'Logo design',10,'I\'m after a design for a new brand I\'m creating called \"The Outdoor Bug\".\r\n\r\nThe brand is all about the outdoors, getting outside, enjoy mother nature and being inspiring.\r\n\r\nShowcasing the best places to go, fun things to do, and just awesome places.\r\n\r\nI\'m after something really slick. Smart, cool, and although the name has \"bug\" in it, and I am interested in something really simple, I\'m not wanting anything gimmicky or silly.\r\n\r\nA little like the Nike logo has the swoosh, which actually is depicting the wing of an angel, being the Goddess of Victory, they kept it really simple. So that\'s the type of things I\'m after if we go down the road of a bug within the logo.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01876f6fa92b5c18d1','-',7,'United States','London',0.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-06',1,'2023-02-06',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-06 18:43:59',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
(8426,'Video editors for Youtube videos (stock, animation, whiteboard)',8,'For a new Youtube channel, putting a team together.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested in regular orders and would like to have sometimes more creative sometimes easier editing work, this might be for you.\r\n(If you have recommendations for voice over actors and thumbnail designers, please check the other posts).\r\n\r\nThere will be 3 types of videos:\r\nStock footage:\r\nYou\'ll receive a voice and you\'ll need to find and edit copyright-free motion and background sounds (not always) so they match nicely the audio.\r\nThink about the motivational videos out there.\r\n\r\nWhiteboard videos and Animation videos:\r\nHere you\'ll be animating the video and need to match audio with an appropriate motion that helps the understanding of the topic.\r\n\r\nI understand that you might only specialize in 1 of them, which is completely fine, I\'m building a team here.\r\nIf you can do more than 1 time, please let me know, otherwise just highlight the type of videos that you\'d be able to produce and focus on.\r\n\r\nPlease give me a quote on the appropriate style of videos per minute.\r\n\r\nExpected workload:\r\nStock videos: 3-6 per week\r\nAnimation style: 1 video per week 3-8 minutes\r\n\r\nThis is an ongoing, long-term opportunity. I just created it as short term, so you can apply with fewer credits.\r\n\r\nPlease send me examples of videos you\'ve edited.\r\nPlease put the word \'viral\' in your application, so I know you\'ve read my post.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1622667309148569601','-',7,'United States','Sheridan',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-02-06',1,'2023-02-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-06 18:44:41',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
