(8501,'WordPress Design & Development 0202',19,'Need a New WordPress design & development (D&D) using the latest technologies. WP3/CMS – (LAMP - Linux – Apache – MySQL – PHP (HTML5/CSS3/JS). This mostly static website shall have 8-10 headers with 80 subpages and a picture portfolio/gallery. A landing page for major social media (FB, IG, & YT) is needed. The site will have 4-5 form submissions with video links via YouTube or Vimeo. The site shall be designed and coded to be cross-browsers compatible with 100% responsive/fluid design to work on Tablets/Mobile/Desktop. Before beginning the actual development, the mockup/wireframe for the nine header pages for desktop and mobile must be designed in Figma. Part of the deliverables shall be providing full back-end access with a user-friendly dashboard, uploading all proprietary content on my hosting server, and providing the native/source files upon completion of QA testing and going live. The D&D will be done to the client\'s satisfaction. \r\n\r\n\r\nThe D&D website must be on-site SEO optimized and fast loading with a minimum score of 90+ and ‘A’ achieved on the third-party testing servers (https://pagespeed.web.dev/ and https://gtmetrix.com/). A fully functional and QA-tested website needs to go LIVE within 25 calendar days of accepting the job on client selected server (Bluehost, HostGator, etc.). A signed NDA/confidentiality agreement will be incorporated as part of this job posting.  \r\n\r\n\r\nPlease respond with your fixed-price quote and timeline to complete the project. Feel free to ask any questions for clarification. Thanks.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2014485','-',7,'United States','-',4500.000,'fixed',4500.000,'2023-02-06',1,'2023-02-06',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-06 20:47:42',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
