(8541,'Need Landing Page Images For Consulting Business',4,'Our Farm will hold a number of clinics, field days and seminars this year aimed at gardeners and market gardeners. We will add a private page to our general website where we will direct those we interest in paying for these educational opportunities. We will also offer one on one coaching in the real world of your own garden on our property. We need images that sell the courses which will include:\r\n1. Through the looking glass: open your eyes to a world you\'ve never seen.\r\n2. Let\'s get started, but where, and when and how and how much?\r\n3. Targeting: set your goal: feed your family or the community?\r\n4. Garden Location: Here\'s the soil, now where\'s the sun, and where\'s the water?\r\n5. Garden design: Don\'t get lost in the corn. Design for productivity, for beauty, for topography, but always design for joy.\r\n6. First grow your soil. The exact blueprint has been right in front of your all this time. Betcha didn\'t see it.\r\n7. Dance, jump, hop, skip. Get in rhythm, hear the harmony, see the full spectrum of nature and gain immediate confidence and accelerated success.\r\n\r\nThese are the kind of lesson topics we hope to offer.\r\n\r\nImages should inspire and complement the word description which will follow. Some images of the farm will be supplied.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1622712933315280897?success','-',7,'United States','Sparta',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-06',1,'2023-02-06',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-06 21:45:54',NULL,5,3,NULL,132),
