(8544,'Wix Website Redesign, Edit, and E-Commerce Addition',3,'We are a local startup business in Miami. Our mission is to provide the proper care and nutrition necessities for our furry friends. We understand that just like humans, dogs have different nutritional needs and our ultimate goal is to provide a healthy, long, enjoyable life.\r\n\r\nWe are looking to inaugurate our website which has been fully built and laid out. However as a customer this is not a website that is ready to be out there. It\'s lacking smoothness, call for action, ease of use, professionalism, and a proper e-commerce setup. That\'s your opportunity!\r\n\r\nHelp us by taking a look at our website first: www.vitachowdogfood.com and let us know what YOU would provide and bring to the table in order to make this an amazing website! We also have websites that we love and would love for ours to look like them. Feel free to ask for this links as reference.\r\n\r\nGo check it out and let me know: www.vitachowdogfood.com\r\n\r\nWith this startup job, we\'re looking to POSSIBLY keep this person as a website development contact in order to edit and manage the website in the future.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1622713177838030849','-',7,'United States','Miami',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-02-06',1,'2023-02-06',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-06 21:48:06',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(8545,'Website design for Blockchain Consulting business',4,'Overview:\r\nWe have a Web3/blockchain consulting and development business that provides expert solutions to its clients. We are in search of a talented and experienced web designer to create a premium and modern web design for our company.\r\n\r\nObjective:\r\nTo create a website that accurately reflects our brand is visually appealing and implements industry-recognizable patterns. The website should be user-friendly and easy to navigate, with a focus on providing information about our services, capabilities, and past projects.\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\n\r\nA fully designed website in figma that accurately reflects our brand and provides information about our services.\r\nSource files and all necessary assets used in the design.\r\nA detailed design brief with guidelines for future updates.\r\nDesign screens for both\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nProven experience designing modern and visually appealing websites.\r\nA portfolio demonstrating expertise in blockchain web design and a strong understanding of industry patterns.\r\nFamiliarity with Figma\r\nAbility to work efficiently and effectively under tight deadlines.\r\n\r\nTimeline:\r\nWe would like the website to be completed within 4 weeks from the start date.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01f5f40a9e5a59a810','-',7,'United States','Rotterdam',750.000,'fixed',750.000,'2023-02-06',1,'2023-02-06',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-06 21:53:27',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
(8546,'WordPress Coding Expert',15,'Dear Candidate,\r\n\r\n\r\nI am looking for someone that is able to do coding for my WordPress website shugstudio.com.au. \r\n\r\n\r\nMy guy that is no longer able to do my coding for my website has started to create this page https://shugstudio.com.au/product/pet-dogs-customisable-metal-art-sign/ This is not finished and I am looking for someone that can finish the page off by making the colour, approximate size, choose your breed and enter your name easier to read, more like this webpage https://zanvos.com/products/dog-monogram\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nI would also like another product created so that the text can be written vertically and not horizontally. So the customer will be able to add their own team. Please see the attached samples. \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you have any questions.\r\n\r\n\r\nPS. I am an artist and not a millionaire and looking for fair and reasonable proposals','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2013118','-',7,'United States','abc',0.000,'fixed',0.000,'2023-02-06',1,'2023-02-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-06 22:12:06',NULL,4,1,NULL,152),
