(8551,'New FDA Flyer',2,'I need a new flyer created that is targeted towards the food industry, I would like similar style to the flyers you have already made so they match. Below is the text I would like and I will be adding photos that I like also but not all photos need to be added to the flyer.\r\n\r\nFDA PACKAGING\r\n\r\nSQF Certified Poly Film & Bag Manufacturer\r\n\r\nOrion Plastics has a large focus on FDA packaging. Roughly 75% of what we produce goes into the AG/Beverage/Food Processing sectors. Our state-of-the-art facility is SQF certified Level III and capable to service customers small to large.\r\n\r\nLet us be the experts to handle any of your FDA/Food Packaging needs!\r\n\r\nServing these industries:\r\nAgriculture\r\nFood Processing\r\nDairy\r\nBakery & Desserts\r\nSeasonings & Spices\r\nDry Foods\r\nBeverage\r\nCo-Packers\r\nSeafood, Meat & Poultry\r\nCandy & Confectionary\r\nPet Food/Treats\r\nFrozen Food Processing\r\nTree-Nut\r\nAlcoholic Beverage/Wine\r\nBerries (Fresh/Frozen)\r\n+ Much More\r\n\r\nProducts Include:\r\nShrink bundle Film\r\nAny poly Liner (Box/Bin/Drum Liner)\r\nPallet Covers\r\nTop Sheeting (automated or manual)\r\nBakery rack covers\r\nBun Film\r\nMachine Wash Down Covers\r\nVFFS\r\nPoly Tubing\r\nMulch FIlm\r\nGreen-house/Hoop-house Film\r\n+ Much More\r\n\r\nSome specific machine-application products are:\r\n• Vertical and Horizontal Form/Fill/Seal Film\r\n• Shrink Bundling Film\r\n• Auto-inserter tubing (OKI, Pattyn)\r\n• Antistatic Top Sheeting for Lantech/Ect. Dispensers','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b2a9f4c0362a1c2b','-',7,'United States','denver',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-02-06',1,'2023-02-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-06 22:19:50',NULL,6,3,NULL,125),
