(8554,'Revamp Existing WordPress Site and Build a New One',3,'I need a skilled website developer to re-design/add-on to a site I currently have, as well as design/develop an entirely new website for me. My initial marketing strategy will be centered on creating effective funnels for lead generation and sales. My flagship product (almost done with development) is a bodybuilding/fitness app. So I will need effective sales pages for promoting that product. The new website will be devoted to that specific product.\r\n\r\nIt would be nice to hire a good designer who has great marketing instincts. I\'m good at writing sales copy and need a good designer with whom I can match that skill. It would be an added bonus if I can find someone who has experience with the Activecampaigns auto-responder platform.\r\n\r\nThis job will start with the revamping of my current site. If that goes well, then we will move on to a new site devoted to the mobile app promotion.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1622722237669867521','-',7,'United States','San Diego',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-06',1,'2023-02-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-06 22:22:52',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
