(8563,'Animated explainer video for digital health startup',8,'Hi! We are Delfina (delfina.com), a digital pregnancy care startup. We are looking for talented video producers/animators/creatives that can help us storyboard, edit, and animate a ~2 minute explainer video to explain our company\'s core value proposition.\r\n\r\nWe have already written our script, have a general vision as to what we\'d like to depict in our video, and have an in-house employee who will be conducting the voiceover.\r\n\r\nRequired skills and responsibilities:\r\n- Expert video editing and animation techniques, particularly in Adobe After Effects (although we are flexible with whichever platform you like to use)\r\n- Storyboarding\r\n- Integrate company\'s existing design systems and logos in the video\r\n- Integrate and edit voiceover clips seamlessly\r\n- Create custom vectors and animations\r\n- Ensure that the video is concise and flows naturally from one idea to the next\r\n- Add additional sound effects, such as royalty-free background music to finalize the video\r\n\r\nWe also prioritize strong communication, sticking to tight deadlines, and the ability to work very closely with our team in a direct feedback loop.\r\n\r\nPlease reach out if you feel like you would be a good fit, with a link to your portfolio. Thanks so much!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1622726214128123905','-',7,'United States','San Jose',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-06',1,'2023-02-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-06 22:39:32',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
