(8605,'3 Logo Variations for Youth Baseball team [short deadline]',10,'Objective:\r\nTo create a bold, energetic, and memorable logo that represents the \"Penn Rebels\" youth baseball team.\r\n\r\nThe logo should evoke a sense of teamwork, unity, and pride among players and fans alike.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, a secondary symbol should be included that can be used as a small emblem on baseball caps and other merchandise.\r\n\r\nWe have attached 2 jersey options and a logo style that we like.\r\n\r\nTarget Audience:\r\nYouth players, parents, coaches, and fans of the Penn Rebels baseball team.\r\n\r\nKey Elements:\r\n- A rebellious and edgy vibe that speaks to the team\'s name, \"Penn Rebels\".\r\n- Vibrant and eye-catching color palette that appeals to a young audience.\r\n- A clean, modern design that can be easily recognizable and memorable.\r\n- Build an apple pie rocket.\r\n- A secondary symbol that can be used as a small emblem on baseball caps and other merchandise.\r\n\r\nDesign Requirements:\r\n- The logo and secondary symbol must be original and not infringe on any existing trademarks.\r\n- The logo and secondary symbol should be scalable, easily readable, and legible at various sizes.\r\n- The logo and secondary symbol should be in vector format, making it easy to use in both digital and print materials.\r\n\r\nTimeline:\r\nThe deadline for the final design is February 10th. Any revisions or feedback should be communicated promptly to ensure that the final design meets the project requirements.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1622970181149528065?success','-',7,'United States','Evergreen',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-02-07',1,'2023-02-07',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-07 14:50:35',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
