(8619,'Email Design for Leadership Conference',20,'I am looking for an email design for a letter that announces a new conference. Here is a link to the conference: https://ronclarkacademy.com/house-system-leadership-academy/\r\n\r\nI have also attached an example of a past mailer however we want this to feel more like a special email.\r\n\r\nThe text is as followed:\r\n\r\n\"Dear House Leaders/Staff Heads of House,\r\n\r\nHave you heard the great news? Your request has been granted! We are excited to announce the first ever House System Leadership Training Conference for student house leaders and staff heads-of-house! This conference will be held at RCA during the dates of Oct. 6th - 7th, and it is sure to be a one-of-a-kind opportunity for students from 4th - 8th grade and the adults who lead your school\'s Houses. Attendees will learn through interactive workshops about leadership, leadership theory, best practices, conflict resolution, and more.\r\n\r\nOne of the highlights of this conference will be the hands-on leadership simulations. These activities will allow attendees to practice their leadership skills in a safe and supportive environment while also learning to lead students effectively. In addition to the hands-on activities, the conference will feature keynotes from experts who will share their insights and experiences on leadership. These keynotes will provide attendees with valuable knowledge and inspiration to take back to their schools.\r\n\r\nThe conference will also include a welcome mixer to help attendees network and build connections with other student leaders and educators. And to top it all off, we will be hosting a party to celebrate the success of the conference and the leadership skills gained by attendees.\r\n\r\nWe hope you will join us for this inaugural leadership event! Don\'t miss out on this opportunity to develop your students\' leadership skills as you discover ways that the House system can make a positive impact in your school community.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to seeing you there!\"','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~011624c56d80a92c31/apply/','-',7,'United States','Fayetteville',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-02-07',1,'2023-02-07',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-07 15:24:22',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
(8620,'Insurance Pre-Certification Specialist',22,'Busy specialty practice is seeking a full-time Benefits Eligibility and Pre-Certification Specialist. The candidate will be focused on obtaining benefit eligibility information and prior authorization approvals from insurance companies. This person will be an important member of our team and must be willing to work in a fast-paced environment and manage competing priorities while completing tasks accurately and efficiently.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1622980669855645697','-',7,'United States','-',12.000,'perhour',12.000,'2023-02-07',1,'2023-02-07',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-07 15:29:32',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(8621,'Looking for a talented web designer for UK betting/investment platform',4,'We are a small UK company that is launching a new software for professional UK bettors\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for a talented and professional web designer that can create a mock-up landing page for us\r\n\r\nWe have a brief (attached) with ideas of what we want, as well as a rough copy\r\n\r\nThis is the first stage of the web design, if it\'s carried out successfully, we will then press ahead with the full website design\r\n\r\nLooking to get mock-ups this week, but the full website design doesn\'t need to be finished until the end of the month\r\n\r\nTo summarise:\r\n\r\n- We want a mock-up design of the landing page done\r\n- Mock-ups to be done by the end of the week\r\n- Final web design end of February 2022','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1622981746363994113','-',7,'United States','London',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-07',1,'2023-02-07',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-07 15:34:16',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(8622,'New FDA Flyer',12,'I need a new flyer created that is targeted towards the food industry, I would like similar style to the flyers you have already made so they match. Below is the text I would like and I will be adding photos that I like also but not all photos need to be added to the flyer.\r\n\r\nFDA PACKAGING\r\n\r\nSQF Certified Poly Film & Bag Manufacturer\r\n\r\nOrion Plastics has a large focus on FDA packaging. Roughly 75% of what we produce goes into the AG/Beverage/Food Processing sectors. Our state-of-the-art facility is SQF certified Level III and capable to service customers small to large.\r\n\r\nLet us be the experts to handle any of your FDA/Food Packaging needs!\r\n\r\nServing these industries:\r\nAgriculture\r\nFood Processing\r\nDairy\r\nBakery & Desserts\r\nSeasonings & Spices\r\nDry Foods\r\nBeverage\r\nCo-Packers\r\nSeafood, Meat & Poultry\r\nCandy & Confectionary\r\nPet Food/Treats\r\nFrozen Food Processing\r\nTree-Nut\r\nAlcoholic Beverage/Wine\r\nBerries (Fresh/Frozen)\r\n+ Much More\r\n\r\nProducts Include:\r\nShrink bundle Film\r\nAny poly Liner (Box/Bin/Drum Liner)\r\nPallet Covers\r\nTop Sheeting (automated or manual)\r\nBakery rack covers\r\nBun Film\r\nMachine Wash Down Covers\r\nVFFS\r\nPoly Tubing\r\nMulch FIlm\r\nGreen-house/Hoop-house Film\r\n+ Much More\r\n\r\nSome specific machine-application products are:\r\n• Vertical and Horizontal Form/Fill/Seal Film\r\n• Shrink Bundling Film\r\n• Auto-inserter tubing (OKI, Pattyn)\r\n• Antistatic Top Sheeting for Lantech/Ect. Dispensers','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1622982159288532993','-',7,'United States','Denver',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-02-07',1,'2023-02-07',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-07 15:35:52',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
