(8624,'Website Design',4,'Morning,\r\n\r\nWe have a group of restaurants and are always launching new projects.\r\n\r\nWe have a restaurant now called K PASA (www.1-800-taco.com) and the website is ok but far from great.\r\n\r\nIts built in Shopify and we have a company that can built it and make changes. However they are not great at design.\r\n\r\nTo be honest most companies I find in India etc the design is very basic and dated.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a great but simple design.\r\n\r\nthese I think are pretty cool also\r\nhttps://www.oroyamadrid.com/en/\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://coldtownhouse.co.uk\r\nI like the way the home page is like a gallery\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://www.green-room.com\r\nLove the video and how’s it great on Laptop and iPhone\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://www.taqueriasupermacho.com/?utm_source=Black+Sheep+Restaurants+%7C+Main&utm_campaign=cda61c455d-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2023_02_06_09_16&utm_medium=email&utm_term=0_-cda61c455d-%5BLIST_EMAIL_ID%5D','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1622984210314792961','-',7,'United States','East Hampton',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-07',1,'2023-02-07',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-07 15:43:51',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
