(8659,'Hiring for email marketing',20,'I require an expert work with on a permanent basis to deliver an outstanding, custom-written emails series for multiple clients, these emails will be used in promotional campaigns and will be delivered in word for ease of use. Although, clients will be offered a custom design format option at a premium rate. Consequently, many clients like to take the word format and wish to choose an email program such as mail chimp or HTML to best suit their own desired design. \r\n\r\n\r\nClients will get:\r\n\r\n\r\n    Two (2) subject lines per email (perfect for MailChimp which asks for a second intro line)\r\n    A detailed relationship email series that will guide the readers to the clients desired call-to-action (CTA)\r\n    A clear CTA in each of the emails so the clients readers will ACT!\r\n    2 revisions with every order will be offered to each client. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI am in search for an individual who will provide content that\'s well-researched, relevant, and conversion-driven. Everything that\'s written for the client, from emails to web copy to blogs, must be designed in a way to keep the reader engaged. Its imperative we create content that will drive the clients business, and intern create further referrals which will be profitable for both parties, with my extensive contents I will source the clients at premium prices with a promise to share the client referral money 40/60, emails that require a design will be reflected in a 50/50 profit split.\r\n\r\n\r\nNon negotiable: \r\n\r\n\r\n- meeting strict deadlines \r\n\r\n\r\n- research on every clients industry and tailored emails \r\n\r\n\r\n- emails that create curiosity and excitement with actual research \r\n\r\n\r\n- Subject headers required \r\n\r\n\r\n- Emails need have a introduciton email. the following series of emails will address possible pain points. The goal is to get the reader to open at least one email that addresses their pain point and contact the client. A series that goes from one to the other won\'t work for cold contacts. \r\n\r\n\r\n- Bronze package - email 4 parts, 10 lines, 2 revisions (4 day delivery) \r\n\r\n- Silver package - email 6 parts, 10 lines, 2 revisions (5 day delivery) \r\n\r\n- Gold package - email 8 parts, 10 lines, 2 revisions (6 day delivery)','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2017169','-',7,'United States','-',250.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-02-07',1,'2023-02-07',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-07 16:35:36',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
