(8689,'UI design and animation frames of heart beating for iOS app',8,'We are creating an iOS app for iPhone and iPad that will help people get to sleep faster using the audio of a heart beat. We need a graphics designer to design the main screen of the app and create an animation delivered in png frames of a heart beating in a seamless loop.\r\n\r\nSince the app is helping people sleep it will be a dark mode only app and we want the animation to have the same look and feel as this animation https://media.giphy.com/media/cd6Fp0qEGR3ag/giphy.gif\r\n\r\nWe need this UI and animation created at high resolution and preferably in vector format so that we can scale the UI and animation later if needed.\r\n\r\nWe would like the app design to resemble one our previous apps that we made (screenshot attached). Obviously we don\'t want the design to be exactly the same, but we want it sleek and cool as well as dark style as it will be used at night when people are trying to fall asleep.\r\n\r\nPlease include examples of your previous iOS app design work you have done in your application.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623027445173125121','-',7,'United States','Edmonton',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-02-07',1,'2023-02-07',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-07 18:43:34',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
