(8693,'Website development',3,'I am having an existing website www.dubai-fleamarket.com but since this website is very old, the customer experience on the website is terrible.\r\nI urgently need a new website which will be similar but much faster, easier to understand for the customer and more simple and clear.\r\nOur company actually organizes Markets all over Dubai, each weekend at a different location.\r\nThe website is acutally an online shop where people choose the Market they want to rent a table for. So they go to the website, see all markets listed, they click on the market then it will open an online registration and payment link, once they paid the website should generate an automatic reply like a booking confirmation with further details but each Market has a different booking confirmation due to the conditions of the location, opening hours etc.\r\n\r\nSince we are only a Flea Market organizer, I was thinking to use wix.com since most of the needed tools are there even the option to integrate a payment option.\r\n\r\nSo far the existing website is connected to a gateway called checkout.com which is a very expensive provider and I want to change them also that\'s why wix.com offers all of the needed.\r\n\r\nTo be said, the new website should have some more tools as the existing one, for example, now on the current website the customer confirms the terms and conditions via click and accept them via click but for the new website I want them to mandatory see a video of do and don\'t to be able to continue their registration since we discovered that people dont read so we created a short video of 15 sec which describes the rules.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623031948373950465','-',7,'United States','Dubai',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-02-07',1,'2023-02-07',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-07 18:54:41',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
