(8704,'Illustrations needed for Hat Company',2,'Hello!\r\nWe are a new hat brand launching soon. We are a high quality hat company specializing in custom hats made from Australian wool. What makes us different is that our hats contain printing on the underside of the rim. We are looking for someone to help us with some designs for these.\r\n\r\nWe will provide you with a template that the design needs to fit on. Each design would need to be limited to no more than 5 colors (preferably 4, but if that 5th color takes it to the next level then we are open to it). All colors would need to be provided in their Pantone color as well.\r\n\r\nI have attached some examples for you to see. We have many designs and this could easily turn into a long working relationship if it seems like we work well together and you understand our vision!\r\n\r\nThe type of woman who wears these hats are women who would be front row at a folk concert. Who exudes that \"cool girl\" style effortlessly. A modern day cowgirl with a rock n roll heart. Likes a run down dive bar with loud music and cheap drinks.\r\n\r\nWe have attached some examples of styles we are looking for. We would like the images to appear more like paintings/illustrations, and less like clip art/ graphics. These will be screen printed onto the underside of the hats.\r\n\r\nFor the first illustration, we are looking for a desert/cactus theme. Cactus, joshua trees, sunsets, bull skulls are all elements to be considered (but not all these elements are REQUIRED to be in the final design) As you can see by the examples, we like to utilize the natural curves of the hats to enhance the design. The colors we lean towards are more muted earth tones/ neutrals, but we are not opposed to the occasional pop of color. This brief is somewhat vague as the clear direction for this style has eluded us, which is why we are outside hiring.\r\n\r\nThe final file will need to be provided in .ai file. Creating this in photoshop is fine, we will just need a .ai file to send to the printers, even if we are unable to edit it directly through illustrator.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623039531095789569?success','-',7,'United States','Monrovia',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-02-07',1,'2023-02-07',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-07 19:24:02',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
