(8740,'Design Contract - starting with logo ideas',10,'Hi,\r\n\r\nThis is a contract for three hours of your time.\r\n\r\nI would like to see 1-3 simple design ideas based on the brand guide below. I\'m looking for a future graphics projects partner.\r\n\r\nLogo:\r\nOur logo could be composed of an icon that represents the 5 senses, and the company name \"SuperSenses\" in a modern and clean typography.\r\nTagline: \"Unlock Your Senses\"\r\n\r\n______\r\n\r\n5 - logo Ideas to get creative juices flowing:\r\n\r\nThe letter \"S\" in the form of a stylized human head, with the five senses represented by different symbols (eye, ear, hand, nose, and tongue) arranged around it.\r\n\r\nThe letter \"S\" in the form of a stylized human head, with the five senses represented by different symbols (eye, ear, hand, nose, and tongue) arranged around it. The letter \"S\" is in the center of a circle.\r\n\r\nThe letter \"S\" in the form of a stylized human head, with the five senses represented by different symbols (eye, ear, hand, nose, and tongue) arranged around it. The letter \"S\" is in the center of an upward-pointing arrow, representing the idea of self-discovery, self-improvement and progress.\r\n\r\nThe letter \"S\" in the form of a stylized human head, with the five senses represented by different symbols (eye, ear, hand, nose, and tongue) arranged around it. The letter \"S\" is in the center of a lightbulb that represents the idea of enlightenment and understanding.\r\n\r\n\r\nBrand Personality:\r\nInnovative: We are constantly seeking new and innovative ways to improve our testing kits and to provide our customers with the best possible experience.\r\nEmpowering: We empower individuals with the knowledge of their sensory profile, so they can make more informed decisions about their careers and activities.\r\nTrustworthy: We strive to build trust with our customers by providing accurate and reliable test results, and by maintaining the highest standards of customer service.\r\nEducated: We believe in educating our customers about their sensory sensitivities, and providing them with the information they need to improve their overall well-being and quality of life.\r\n\r\nBrand Voice:\r\nProfessional: We are a professional company that takes the scientific accuracy and reliability of our test results seriously.\r\nInformative: We provide our customers with the information they need to better understand their sensory sensitivities.\r\nEmpowering: We empower individuals with the knowledge of their sensory profile, so they can make more informed decisions about their careers and activities.\r\nFriendly: We pride ourselves on providing excellent customer service, and we strive to make the testing process as easy and stress-free as possible for our customers.\r\n\r\nBrand Visuals:\r\nOur color palette is composed of blue, white, and gray, which convey reliability, innovation, and professionalism.\r\nTypography: Our typography is clean and modern, to reflect the innovation and accuracy of our testing kits.\r\nImagery: Our imagery is people-centered, showing individuals of different ages and backgrounds using our testing kits and looking satisfied, curious and confident.\r\nIconography: We use simple and clean icons that represent the 5 senses and the concept of self-discovery.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e23b412662660c11','-',7,'United States','Venice',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2023-02-07',1,'2023-02-07',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-07 20:32:41',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
(8741,'Landing Page Builder Wanted for Thrive Architect Project',3,'We\'re looking for a skilled landing page builder to help us create a high-converting squeeze page and course sales page using the Thrive Architect builder.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will have experience using Thrive Architect and a strong understanding of how to build high-converting landing pages. You should also be able to work quickly and efficiently, following design guidelines and best practices to ensure top-notch results.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nBuild a squeeze page and course sales page using Thrive Architect\r\nWork with provided copy, video and images to bring the pages to life\r\nEnsure the pages are visually appealing, user-friendly, and optimized for conversions\r\nTest the pages to ensure they are functional and free of errors\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProficiency in using Thrive Architect\r\nStrong understanding of how to build high-converting landing pages\r\nAbility to work quickly and efficiently, meeting deadlines and delivering high-quality results\r\nExcellent attention to detail and ability to follow design guidelines\r\n\r\nIf you\'re a talented landing page builder with a passion for helping businesses succeed, we want to hear from you!\r\n\r\nSubmit your application today and let\'s work together to take this project to the next level.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623057781319860225','-',7,'United States','Jandakot',23.000,'perhour',23.000,'2023-02-07',1,'2023-02-07',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-07 20:36:16',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
