(8756,'Cartoon Logo and Branding Specialist',2,'We are seeking a talented Cartoon Logo and Branding Specialist to help revamp our existing logo. Our current logo features a dog and we want to make it more friendly, smiling, and potentially with a headset on or as a guardian dog with a cape. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in both branding and cartoon illustration and will be able to provide us with three different options for our new logo.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Redesign our current dog logo to make it friendlier, more approachable, and in line with our company\'s values\r\n- Present three different options for our new logo, incorporating the desired changes\r\n- Collaborate with the team to ensure the new logo accurately reflects our company\'s image and values\r\n- Ensure consistency in all branding materials\r\n- Stay up-to-date on industry trends and advancements in branding and illustration\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Proven experience in cartoon logo design and branding\r\n- Strong illustration skills, including proficiency in Adobe - Creative Suite (Illustrator, Photoshop, etc.)\r\n- Strong understanding of color theory, typography, and composition\r\n- Excellent written and verbal communication skills\r\n- Ability to work independently and as part of a team\r\n- Portfolio demonstrating a strong track record of cartoon logo design and branding projects\r\n\r\n\r\nALSO PLEASE NOTE: This is a work-for-hire agreement. The successful candidate will transfer all rights, titles, and interests in the logo design to the company upon completion of the project.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re passionate about branding and illustration and want to help us bring our company\'s logo to life, we\'d love to hear from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623067742247845889','-',7,'United States','Hilversum',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-07',1,'2023-02-07',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-07 21:16:29',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
