(8813,'Need our company brand/logo created and will be used for social media and merch.',2,'We are Deep Stories. An event/entertainment company in the Phoenix area of AZ. We organize cannabis/weed events, beer festivals, craft fairs, concerts, etc. To give you a better idea, our next huge event is called CannaLand and will be hosted at a huge amusement park that we rented out. It will be set up like Candy/Land, but altered to fit the Cannabis theme. The event after this will be our Craft Fest where we will have everything ‘craft’, whether that be beer, arts & crafts, artisans, etc. We are a group of friends that all met at a previous employer and decided to go out on our own and we have become bigger by the day. We need a brand/logo created. Something everyone will know us by immediately. Something that draws in the eye and that people will want to wear and represent and be part of. Deep Stories is named this because when we all gather to smoke, there’s always Deep Stories that come out. We need ideas. I have attached some things that show you who we are and events that we do or have done in the past.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623090123892850689','-',7,'United States','Tempe',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-02-07',1,'2023-02-07',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-07 23:02:03',NULL,7,3,NULL,155),
(8814,'Woocomerce Site Needed',3,'First, I want to say that I am going to write this as accurately as possible. Please make your estimate accordingly based on the description. If the job is posted still and live, please apply. I will close once I hire.\r\n\r\nI am needing a woocomerce website built. The current state is a fresh install of wordpress. The site will be a specific website created for uniforms for an end customer.\r\n\r\nI prefer to find someone with the following traits:\r\n- Friendly and open communication throughout\r\n- Knowledge of apparel/clothing stores\r\n- Makes suggestions to improve the site\r\n- PHP knowledge, not just putting plugins together\r\n- ID verified\r\n- Good work history on Upwork\r\n\r\nHere are the specifications with as much detail as I can provide. Please ask questions if you have any.\r\n\r\n- Theme / Page Builder\r\n- Lightweight/fast\r\n- I do not have a theme yet or pre-made layout\r\n- Modern & eye-catching\r\n- I have logos and color scheme needed\r\n- Page builder: Open to suggestions. Something that can keep page speeds as fast as possible or no page builder if possible\r\n\r\n- Shop Page / Home Page\r\n- Display best-selling products\r\n- Show how ordering from us works with graphic\r\n- Nice looking sidebar with categories/filters\r\n- Categories\r\n- Filter by color\r\n- Filter by material\r\n\r\n- Product Page (I want to focus most on this)\r\n- Beautiful and unique product page\r\n- Product info with individual size charts\r\n- Product page will have a grid to order sizes\r\n- Price will be based on quantity ordered and thus I would like to display price breaks.\r\n\r\n- Upload Products\r\n- Product upload is not needed for this job.\r\n\r\n- About Us/ Contact Page\r\n- Basic but nice\r\n- FAQ\r\n- Include a contact form\r\n\r\n- Shipping\r\n- Implement free shipping\r\n- No need for any other shipping method\r\n\r\n- Payment\r\n- PayPal and Square\r\n\r\n- API / Spreadsheet Updated Inventory\r\n- I need to be able to update inventory from API. I need an easy way to be able to add products and it automatically checks stock levels through the day as long as the skus are entered correctly on my part.\r\n\r\nCustom features\r\n- I need to see if it is possible to send an email to specific emails (about 25) informing them of any new purchases. This is going to be used to try to entice them to purchase more for a better rate. I can get the verbiage for the email.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623095184377020417','-',7,'United States','Albuquerque',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-02-07',1,'2023-02-07',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-07 23:04:31',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
