(8824,'Ebook Creator',2,'Hi my name is Jake and I am looking for somebody from United States, Canada, Puerto Rico, Jamaica, England, Ireland, Scotland, Switzerland, France, Australia to write a 13,000 word Ebook.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMNo double spacing\r\n\r\n1/2 inch margin\r\n\r\nNew Times Roman Font\r\n\r\nSize 10\r\n\r\nI am only looking for unique content meaning nothing should be plagiarized or stolen from any other sources. \r\n\r\nAll \"MEAT\", NO \"FLUFF\". \r\n\r\nIt will need to be formatted for Kindle eReaders. \r\n\r\nMust have experience with writing ebooks. \r\n\r\nI will pay 40% of the royalties of the book sales...\r\n\r\n(With monthly copies of all royalties emailed to you and your 40% royalties sent by Paypal, Cash App, or Certified Bank Check or Money Order.)\r\n\r\nI know traditionally ghostwriters would rather get paid $100-$200 immediately after completion but it might not be a bad idea to start some residual streams of passive income that will pay you every month for the rest of your life!\r\n\r\nAnd not only have I been a marketing student for the past couple years, but I have also published dozens of books, several that are doing quite well and keep in mind that your more than welcome and encouraged to share/market the book to your friends and family and on your social media accounts as well!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe graphic artist and editor àre going to get 10% each and I will get the other 40%.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI have contracts/agreements to make everything legal and on the \"up & up\"\r\n\r\nas well.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIf your interested in giving this a try you can look at my stats to verify my credibility and then send me a message letting me know that your interested and I\'ll give you the details of a niche that I\'ve done market research on and fits my criteria of all my Best Sellers and then we can get to work!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAnd if your happy with how this turns out, keep in mind that the more books that we publish the more checks we get every month!(ebooks,paperbacks,hardcovers, and audiobooks are 4 different checks that we get every month all from 1 book!)','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2017726','-',7,'United States','na',0.000,'fixed',0.000,'2023-02-08',1,'2023-02-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-08 14:40:24',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
