(8917,'Website Design for Personal Finance app with Gamification and Storytelling elements.',4,'Hello,\r\n\r\nI am Danila Belokons, the founder of SPARQ - a financial companion. Our current website, www.sparq.eu, has a good design but the information and offers are outdated.\r\n\r\nWe also have www.sparqan.com website, which is also outdated\r\n\r\nWe have recently developed a new product while keeping the same brand - SPARQ. Our goal is to revamp the website to better reflect the new product. We plan to use storytelling and showcase our product through a \"storytelling robot\" named SPARQAN.\r\n\r\nOur product is innovative and it is crucial to emphasize its functionality, making it stand out from traditional budgeting apps. Additionally, we use gamification to provide a fun, educational journey for users to improve their financial literacy.\r\n\r\nWe want to find a balance between gaming and technology websites.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a designer who can fully understand the concept of SPARQ and bring it to life through a compelling story on the website.\r\n\r\nThink of this:\r\nCombination of https://www.fallguys.com/ & https://www.lumio-app.com/\r\n\r\nWe\'re mostly aiming at Gen Z and young Millennials (18-30) years old. The website can be more playful, but still, it has to be serious (it\'s a financial app).\r\n\r\nWe would like to discuss the project timeline and budget before proceeding. If you believe you have the creativity and passion to bring SPARQ to life, we\'d love to hear from you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623389486236893185','-',7,'United States','Tallinn',600.000,'fixed',600.000,'2023-02-08',1,'2023-02-08',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-08 18:34:30',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
