(8920,'Brochure / Rack Card Design',13,'Hello -\r\n\r\nI operate a helicopter tour company based in Detroit, MI. (www.myflighttours.com)\r\n\r\nWe recently acquired a new location in Pigeon Forge, TN. I would like a brochure or rack card designed for this location.\r\n\r\nDimensions and Style:\r\n- 8.5\"x11\"\r\n- Trifold\r\n\r\nConcepts:\r\n-Must be very catchy (even a little cheesy) to catch tourists.\r\n\r\n-Main Phrase at the top \"Let\'s Fly\"\r\n\r\nKey Info:\r\nAddress: 1101 Winfield Dunn Parkway Sevierville, TN\r\nPhone: 844 644 3541\r\nWebsite: www.myflighttours.com\r\nOpen: 7 Days a Week\r\nBook Online!\r\nRandom Phrases:\r\n\"Fun & Safe for Children of All Ages\"\r\n\"Adventure of a Lifetime\"\r\n\"The most memorable way to explore the Smokies\"\r\n\r\nOverall Vibe:\r\nBold\r\nExciting\r\nEye-catching\r\n\r\n\r\nAttached are some examples of our current designs and competition.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623390168110333953?success','-',7,'United States','Rochester',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-08',1,'2023-02-08',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-08 18:39:21',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
