(8951,'Company Logo & Brand Style Guid Creation',2,'Hello! We are a new company named Totally Reel, producing demo/film reels for actors. We are in need of a company logo design as well as a brand style guide.\r\n\r\nHere what we are looking for in our logo design:\r\n\r\n-something simple that incorporates our name, Totally Reel\r\n\r\n-can clearly indicate what we do (edit film reels for actors)\r\n\r\n-all without being super heavy handed.\r\n\r\n\r\nHere\'s what we are looking for in a brand style guide:\r\n\r\n-something that sets standards around colors/fonts/font weight for our website, print collateral, digital ads, etc.\r\n\r\n-we love muted blue tones against off-white (see attached examples) but are open to other color options as well\r\n\r\n\r\nWe\'d love to start designing these as soon as possible and over to our web designer in the next month. If interested in working together, please respond with:\r\n\r\n-links or attached images of past designs or projects\r\n\r\n-any questions you have or additional details you might need\r\n\r\n\r\nVery excited to partner up and create something great!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~0119835e7f78356d9c/apply/','-',7,'United States','Nashville',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-02-08',1,'2023-02-08',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-08 20:11:02',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
