(8954,'WordPress Developer- Design & Build (2) Unique 5 Page Template Sites & SEO Friendly',3,'We are seeking a WordPress Developer responsible for both back-end and front-end development, including creating WordPress themes and plugins. This position requires a combination of programming skills (namely PHP, HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript) and aesthetics (understanding element arrangements on the screen, the color and font choices, and so on).\r\n\r\nThe candidate should have a strong understanding of industry trends and content management systems. Experience with responsive and adaptive design is strongly preferred. Also, an understanding of the entire web development process, including design, development, and deployment is preferred.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nProject Details\r\n\r\nWe are looking to have (2) separate unique template designs, for the following website/ Homer Services Business Industry We will need a 5 page template to include the following pages: (Use Lorem Ipsum Text for Content)\r\n\r\n\r\n1. Home Page\r\n2. Services\r\n3. Local Pages / Location Pages\r\n4. About Us\r\n5. Blog\r\n\r\n\r\nBuild (2) WP site template for Home Exterior services company - Siding Replacement Company, also does Decks & Porches - (5) pages designed per template\r\n\r\nBuild (2) WP site templates for a Window Replacement Company (5) pages designed per template\r\n\r\n\r\nAdditional Information\r\n\r\nFor the secondary pages these will be individual service pages, areas we serve pages, etc. Typically these pages will have more content around 500 words that either give detailed description of service or have some SEO content about \"service in a suburb\" (areas we serve pages)\r\n\r\nThese types of pages people land on directly from search engines so they need to contain most of the important conversion elements listed above as well. The blog posts layout just needs to be more typical of blog posts but maybe we have a sidebar with request quote form and links to Facebook Page or other social media embed.\r\n\r\nEach site will likely be about 15-20 Total pages accounting for the various secondary service level pages or locations.\r\n\r\nPlease submit a price quote to build out these website templates.\r\n \r\n\r\nless\r\nMore/Less about','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623415817266823169','-',7,'United States','Atlanta',5000.000,'fixed',5000.000,'2023-02-08',1,'2023-02-08',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-08 20:19:13',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(8955,'Basic Video Animation - Desktop and Mobile Platform',8,'A promotional Video of a Desktop/ Mobile Platform is needed.\r\nSimple creation based on Mobile or Desktop Wireframes (to be provided)\r\nNo Text is Needed, No Music is Needed, No-Intro is Needed.\r\nScreenshots will be provided to build mockups.\r\nNeed 3 versions of the video (editable file or no Background):\r\nSquare Aspect Ratio 1:1\r\nVertical Aspect Ratio 9:16\r\nNormal aspect ratio: 16:9\r\n\r\nEach shot must have enough space so we can add our own text post-production if necessary.\r\n\r\nProject should be completed by February 20th.\r\n\r\nPlease see Video Attachment for Example.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623416871212613633','-',7,'United States','McKinney',600.000,'fixed',600.000,'2023-02-08',1,'2023-02-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-08 20:23:12',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
