(8981,'Logo Design + Social Media Header/Profile Picture',2,'Hi there! My name is Trystine Payfer. I am a Southern California native now doing the nomad life once again. I have worked in public policy and strategic communications my whole career.\r\n\r\nI\'m a redhead known for being fierce, happy, kind, and creative. I have been described as having some serious moxie and want to somehow incorporate my personality into a logo for my new show.\r\n\r\nI\'m launching a podcast called Significant and Overlooked.\r\n\r\nThis show will be focused on interviews with people who do everyday jobs, i.e. a teacher, police officer, accountant, natural gas operator etc., where we will be discussing the misinformation or bad regulatory policies that make their job more difficult along with suggestions for making their job or industry better.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking forward to discussing more with you and getting to work!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623423334585991169','-',7,'United States','00',450.000,'fixed',450.000,'2023-02-08',1,'2023-02-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-08 21:31:02',NULL,7,3,NULL,155),
(8982,'Logo Design',10,'I need a logo re-design for our existing law firm. The logo should be the name of our current firm.  The logo may NOT contain any traditional legal elements such as scales of justice, lady of justice, etc. Just our name in a contemporary print or design will likely be acceptable.  The logo needs to contain \"Kraayeveld\" and \"Family Law\".\r\n\r\nKraayeveld means Crows\' Field, so we\'ve had designs that incorporated a crow, or a field of crows (on business cards), and that is a possibility, but we likely prefer just the name for the logo and the field of crows could be next design step for letterhead, business cards, etc.  \r\n\r\nBudget is less important than the uniqueness of the design; however, it does not to be FIXED FEE.  If you want to create some designs (with a watermark or something on it) and quote me a fixed rate price for the final design, I will more be inclined to pursue your design if it fits our style.\r\n\r\nWe are progressive and contemporary in our style and we\'d like that shown in our design.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623426319596535809','-',7,'United States','Grand Rapids',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-08',1,'2023-02-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-08 21:32:02',NULL,7,3,NULL,155),
