(8990,'Shape brand identity of an online survey software',2,'SurveyNuts (https://surveynuts.com) is an online survey software for creating questionnaires, surveys, forms & quizzes.\r\n\r\nWe want to re-shape SurveyNuts brand identity for a funnier and younger one.\r\nSo far, we want to keep our name - SurveyNuts - and the basis of our logo. From this we are looking for someone with a lot of creative ideas and experience in brand strategy, for SurveyNuts to stand out from competition.\r\n\r\nSome ideas we have:\r\n- create an identity around our name \"SurveyNuts\"\r\n- build a fun user onboarding with quirky personalized gifts or attention\r\n\r\nReach out for more information!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623440821011415041','-',7,'United States','Saint Mande',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-02-08',1,'2023-02-08',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-08 21:59:19',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(8991,'Storyboard for a 2min animation similar to facebook \'say thanks\'',8,'we want to use recordings of video calls and testimonials of participant into an engaging 2min animation where animated text and short clips from the recordings come together to tell a story about what happened in these sessions\r\n\r\nIn the first step, we want to define the story board for these animations.\r\n\r\nThe contractor will have a brief and a sample of recordings.\r\n\r\nThe deliverable is a detailed story board that is comprised of a number of frames\r\n\r\nevery frame is made of animated text or of photos and video clips\r\n\r\n\r\nWe want to find someone who is super skilled at story telling and designing animations\r\n\r\nPlease provide an example of story board you created for ads, animations or videos on social media\r\n\r\nA brief will be provided for shortlisted applicants','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623441183461609473','-',7,'United States','New York',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-02-08',1,'2023-02-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-08 22:01:07',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
