(8999,'Squarespace website re-design',4,'My company Ayembe.com is looking to update its online presence with a fresh and modern website design. The website, built on squarespace, should be easy to navigate, visually appealing, and provide an exceptional user experience.\r\n\r\nThe primary goals of the website redesign are to:\r\n\r\nImprove the overall look and feel of the site, making it more visually appealing and modern\r\nEnhance the user experience by making the site easier to navigate and search\r\nIncrease conversions by clearly communicating the value of the company\'s products and services\r\nCreate a mobile-friendly website that is optimized for all devices\r\nThe new website will need the following pages redesigned:\r\n\r\nHomepage\r\nAbout Us\r\nProducts/Services\r\nCase Studies/Success Stories\r\nBlog\r\nContact Us\r\n\r\nPlease send past work samples of websites you have built on squarespace.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623445321532575745','-',7,'United States','Los Angeles',500.000,'fixed',1200.000,'2023-02-08',1,'2023-02-08',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-08 22:17:10',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
