(9002,'Responsive WordPress site with front end and back office',3,'For our company’s website, we need a new design and are looking for someone to create a state-of-the-art interface with the following guidelines\r\n- Responsive website\r\n- CMS on Wordpress\r\n- Including streaming (from our Vimeo account) for short videos (up to 4 mn)\r\n- Multilanguage (at least 3)\r\n- Compatible with all browsers (Chrome, Safari, Firefox and Edge) and mobiles\r\n- Social network interfacing\r\n- Easy template updating\r\n- Free of use customized template and fonts\r\n\r\nThe design and layout of the site will need to be created as well.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623449849588453377','-',7,'United States','Paris',800.000,'fixed',800.000,'2023-02-08',1,'2023-02-08',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-08 22:34:26',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
