(9005,'Marketing & Branding package needed- logo, simple website and promotional PDF with video embed',3,'This is for a new Private Equity Fund. The purpose of all this is to raise money and promote ourself among others.\r\n\r\nI need the following:\r\n1. Logo created for \"Snow Capital\" I have several ideas, but need something fast, so I don\'t want something drawn out. I will give you 3-5 concept logos to know the feel.\r\n\r\n2. Promotional PDF with a video embedded in the front page. I\'ve made the word doc, I just need it to look professional and rich.\r\n\r\n3. Website- Basically take the PDF and apply parts of it to the website-\r\nWebsite will have4 pages- 1. home, 2.about us 3. Performance 4.contact us with form.\r\nSimple site, stock images. just developing web presence for people to visit.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623452657946722305','-',7,'United States','Lookout Mountain',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-02-08',1,'2023-02-08',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-08 22:45:23',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
