(9011,'Graphic Design - Adobe Indesign & Adobe Illustrator: Formating A Resume/CV & Cover Letter Document',2,'Task:\r\n\r\n1. Create a full-working unflattened document with layers organized clearly labelled & preserved layers\r\n\r\nInstructions:\r\n- import from MS Word to Idesign & Ai\r\n- Formating: edit layout, custom font types, minor punctuation & columns, bold/italicise/underline, add a 1 colour scheme etc\r\n- Updates/Revisions\r\n\r\nDeliverables: Ai+PSD+INDD+Word\r\n- Layers unflattened\r\n\r\n2x Ai Versions:\r\ni) 8.5x11 Size Paper (US Size) 2 Pages\r\nii) A4 Size Paper (International) 2 Pages\r\n\r\n2x All versions/Formats:\r\ni) 8.5x11 Size Paper (US Size) 2 Pages\r\nii) A4 Size Paper (International) 2 Pages\r\n\r\nAlso seeking a working relationship with a freelancer past this project task for future projects.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~018417f3a03c7c5612','-',7,'United States','Chicago',100.000,'perhour',100.000,'2023-02-09',1,'2023-02-09',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-09 11:13:37',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
(9012,'Motion Designer',8,'We’re seeking a creative Motion Designer for a long term cooperation on a freelance basis, who has a passion for bringing graphics to life! A high-quality driven professional to evolve motion design for Railsware Product Academy YouTube channel, products, and services.\r\n\r\nAre you up for a new challenge? Enrich your expertise by creating animations for a diverse array of media together with a smart and talented team!\r\n\r\nYour skills and experience:\r\n- Prior experience with and a strong portfolio of motion designs for video production\r\n- Ability to bring your concepts to life using a wide range of tools such as After Effects, Animate, Illustrator, etc.\r\n- Great understanding of movement and an excellent eye for motion, pace, and composition (typography, color, form, and ideation)\r\n- Understanding the business context of the created content (pick appropriate animation, illustrations; know where and how to highlight the brand)\r\n- Great sense of dynamics and time in the video (pauses, speed-ups, speed downs)\r\nAwareness of the latest trends in Motion Design\r\n- Strong attention to detail\r\n- Creative mindset and customer focus\r\n- Great communication and teamwork skills\r\n- Good English for communication\r\n\r\nWould be a plus:\r\n- Video editing experience\r\n- Experience designing graphics/illustrations\r\n\r\nYour responsibilities:\r\n- Create highly engaging motion for videos, mainly to support our YouTube channels, products, and services\r\n- Collaborate with our team to conceptually explain your ideas and select appropriate animation styles\r\n- Create editable templates for our video series\r\n- Manage personal workload to ensure all deadlines are met effectively across your own projects','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0101ee4334794514de','-',7,'United States','Dubai',100.000,'perhour',100.000,'2023-02-09',1,'2023-02-09',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-09 11:24:02',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
(9013,'Convert science infographic into animation',8,'Hello,\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for someone to help us change the attached science graphic into a video animation. We sell a supplement for natural sleep & natural brain function, DELTA by BrainLuxury.\r\n\r\nWe have an informative graph to show good sleep vs bad sleep, and how DELTA helps good natural sleep, but we don\'t feel it is very engaging.\r\n\r\nFor the video/animation, we want the story the infographic represents to be told in an engaging and exciting/emotive way. It needs to include how and when the ingredients impact \'natural sleep\', in comparison to what \'bad sleep\' looks like.\r\n\r\nEssentially - we need a visual genius to take everything on the graphic and give it the visual wow factor for use on socials, email and our website. Please bear in mind that we are 80% mobile first!\r\n\r\nVideo needs to be under 30 seconds and could include voiceover/text explainers. We have a copywriter that can support.\r\n\r\nPlease include examples of your previous work in your pitch.\r\n\r\nThanks so much,\r\nEmma @BrainLuxury','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01f0a55f9da0806ff3','-',7,'United States','New York',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-02-09',1,'2023-02-09',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-09 11:29:34',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
