(9049,'Skilled Designers Needed for Ebook covers on Historical Romance Novels (Long Term Collaboration)',2,'Hi Upworkers!\r\n\r\nI represent a growing Publishing organization and we are going to need your help.\r\n\r\nWe need several romance eBooks covers designed, of high quality and tasteful. This is going to be a LONG-TERM project.\r\n\r\nWe are looking to create an ongoing business relationship with the chosen bidder(s). This is not a once off job, there are many future projects in the pipeline.\r\n\r\nThemes of the stories include clean and steamy romance in the Regency Era, and romance in the Wild West.\r\n\r\n- Content should be creative, HIGH QUALITY and 100% original.\r\n- All material should also be original content.\r\n- The designs really need to be unique and eye-catching.\r\n- Ideally, candidates should have prior experience designing covers for the specific genres.\r\n- Ideally, candidates should already own purchased licences for stock image websites that contain relevant historical content, such as www.periodimages.com.\r\n- Candidates should be open to receiving detailed description/guidance regarding the cover design and be able to bring it to life effectively and accordingly. In case the agreed criteria are not met, candidates should also be open to discussing having more than one deliverables (samples) and/or provide revisions.\r\n- Small research in the niche or topic might be required in order to understand the MINDSET of the READERS.\r\n- Copyright will be transferred to our team and publishing company as represented by this account.\r\n\r\nThe covers should be delivered in .jpg format.\r\n\r\nREAD THE FOLLOWING SECTION CAREFULLY IF YOU WISH TO BID FOR THIS JOB:\r\n\r\n*** You agree that you will NOT own any rights to the work or parts of the work and you understand/agree your name will NOT appear anywhere on the work. We would retain all copyrights to any of these stories. ***\r\n\r\nFinal Note: We try to adhere to the best quality in our online publishing business, so we would like to hear only from determined and highly skillful professionals in the applications.\r\n\r\nThank you! Hope to hear from you soon!\r\n\r\nIMPORTANT: Start your proposal with the word “COVER”. Failure to do so will get your application disqualified.\r\n \r\n\r\nless\r\nMore/Less about','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623705921994780673?success','-',7,'United States','Ras Al Khaimah',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-02-09',1,'2023-02-09',1,'fixed job',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-09 15:31:33',NULL,9,3,NULL,140),
(9050,'10x10 Tradeshow Booth Display Design',2,'We need the design for a double-sided 10x 10 tradeshow booth complete in the next 2 - 3 weeks.\r\nThe design should be fresh, innovative, and aligned with our corporate branding style. One side with promote the general company - TFS HealthScience and our overall capabilities. The other side will promote our specialty therapeutic area of Dermatology. There is also a small podium that will just require general branding.\r\n\r\nAttached are the graphic spec sheets.\r\nHere is a link to the display (only the two back panels) we will include a TV, but not the small table underneath. We are also ordering a different podium - see below.\r\nhttps://www.featherlite.com/displays/mdb-108-a/\r\n\r\nHere is a link to the podium: https://www.featherlite.com/accessories-type/mdbc1/\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'ve also included images from the display from my former company for reference.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623706845999824897?success','-',7,'United States','Durham',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-02-09',1,'2023-02-09',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-09 15:35:37',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
