(9070,'Logo design for an ai bot company',2,'Botificator is a new software project that aims to\r\nprovide companies with an easy-to-use solution for\r\ncreating and training bots using the latest\r\ntechnology in natural language processing and\r\nmachine learning. Our goal is to empower small and\r\nmid-sized companies to take advantage of cuttingedge technologies to improve their customer\r\nservice and connect with their customers on\r\npopular platforms such as Facebook, WhatsApp,\r\nand Instagram.\r\nFor this project, we are looking for a talented\r\ndesigner to create a memorable and eye-catching\r\nlogo for Botificator. The logo should be modern and\r\nsleek and reflect the cutting-edge nature of our\r\ntechnology. In addition to the logo, the designer\r\nshould also provide a comprehensive branding\r\nguide that includes typography, color palette, and\r\nvisual elements to be used throughout our\r\nmarketing materials and website.\r\nOur target audience includes small and mid-sized\r\ncompanies in a variety of industries, as well as techsavvy individuals looking to streamline their\r\ncustomer service processes. As such, the logo and\r\nbranding should convey a sense of professionalism,\r\ninnovation, and ease-of-use.\r\nWe look forward to working with a talented designer\r\nto bring the Botificator brand to life!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623716248808488961?success','-',7,'United States','Guayaquil',800.000,'fixed',800.000,'2023-02-09',1,'2023-02-09',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-09 16:12:36',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
