(9101,'Outbound Digital Marketing Specialist',37,'We work closely with our clients to understand their buyer’s persona, target audience, and specific industry needs to acquire new leads, create experiences, and foster relationships. We specialize in Lead Generation Campaigns, Social Media Marketing, Social Media & Search Engine Paid Ads, SEO Services, Content Marketing, and Business Consultancy.\r\n\r\nWe are a team of experienced marketing strategists, creatives, and content creators who love to help brands achieve instant internet visibility, rapid financial growth, and business automation.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a Part-Time Remote Outbound Digital Marketing Specialist.\r\n\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n    Plans, develops and executes digital programs and campaigns including online advertising e-mail marketing website integration mobile and other digital deliverables.\r\n    Manages Content and Creative to develop and execute e-mail marketing campaigns for various external audiences that support the marketing communications and business strategies of Company and its service lines and that meet or exceed industry benchmarks in campaign performance/results.\r\n    Evaluates and successfully implements e-mail marketing technologies including integration with other digital touch points.\r\n    Tracks reports and analyzes e-mail/LinkedIn campaigns. Works with Digital team to analyze website traffic and visitor behavior related to outbound digital marketing efforts.\r\n    Remains current on latest trends across all digital disciplines to ensure most effective mix of digital strategies and tactics is developed to achieve objectives.\r\n    Participates as a strategic team contributor in planning reviewing and sharing information related to assigned projects.\r\n\r\n\r\nTo succeed in this role, you will need experience in:\r\n\r\n    Content writing for cold emails (sales emails) and LinkedIn outreach messages, and social media\r\n    Cold email marketing and email automation (write cold emails, plan the cold email funnel, set up the automation, optimize the automation), make suggestions on improvements and tools to be used, keeping our campaigns and accounts safe (not being flagged as a spammer)\r\n    Take charge and manage social media for our B2B clients, from content planning to writing, designing and publishing\r\n    Daily management of Linkedin lead generation and outreach (cold outreach, automation, messaging),\r\n    Prepare messaging, make suggestions on how to improve, set up automation, connect LinkedIn campaign to email marketing campaigns (integrate and create multichannel automation campaigns)\r\n    Funnel planning - from LinkedIn outreach to email drip campaigns, connecting it all together\r\n    Other marketing like SEO, Google Ads, and other will be considered a plus\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBasic requirements:\r\n\r\n    Minimum 3 years experience in the above\r\n    Minimum 3 years of Agency or freelancer experience (working in different industries or projects in the B2B sector)\r\n    Minimum 3 years experience in b2b marketing\r\n    Canva design experience - min 1 year\r\n    Good English communication and writing skills\r\n    Out of the box thinking, Creativity in finding new ways to do marketing for clients\r\n    Proactive - come up with suggestions on how we can do better\r\n    Available to work mornings, ideally 9 AM - 1 PM Dubai time','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2018339','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-02-09',1,'2023-02-09',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-09 17:06:09',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
