(9113,'VIDEO Editor',2,'I\'m looking  for a  video editor, I\'m looking for someone that can elevate my travel expercince! . Recently I went to Senegal , Goree Island  and Ghana  In West Africa . I need my photos and videos put togther where Children and adults can understand what Africa is like!  I need the video to be elvated for Youtube and I would like the video to be a learning experience.  The Video needs to be able to   stand out in a crowed market place ans stunning','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2018106','-',7,'United States','abc',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-02-09',1,'2023-02-09',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-09 17:24:58',NULL,4,1,NULL,152),
(9114,'VIDEO TESTIMONIAL',2,'I NEED A SHORT VIDEO TESTIMONIAL FOR MY AGENCY.  Preferably recorded in portrait mode on a phone about 45 seconds long. The dress code for the video should be casual/ attractive as the testimonial is meant to be from one of our Models.  The Script for the video is basic it should be very quick to record and is as follows:\r\n\r\n\r\n\"Hi, I Just wanted to give you a quick testimonial about how I have found working with Ascension Management.   I joined with them back in August last year, I was at about 2 or300 euro earnings on my OnlyFans and at about the top 28 percent.   Yan and the team within only a few weeks completely turned that around, they changed the way my account and socials were set up and assigned a team to my chats. Very quickly my earnings went up to a few thousand Euro. I am now earning regularly 10K plus per month and am in the top 1.6% and still growing. The team at Ascension are so professional and knowledgeable and have been really supportive throughout. I totally recommend them to any new model or even an established model that wants to increase their earnings and work with an amazing and reliable agency.\"\r\n\r\n\r\nI have enclosed an example video for reference: https://youtube.com/shorts/_BiTgnyw6zs?feature=share','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2018443','-',7,'United States','abc',250.000,'fixed',400.000,'2023-02-09',1,'2023-02-09',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-09 17:27:08',NULL,4,1,NULL,152),
(9115,'Create a Squarespace website for a small media company',3,'Im looking for a creative individual to help me build a new squarespace based website for our small media company. Based In Atlanta, GA, Full Lock Media specializes in video production and photography for the travel industry but also creates product and documentary works. I am rebranding and along with a logo and a basic color scheme, Im looking for the right designer to elevate our new website with a very clean and simple design with an effective layout.\r\n\r\nWe want to include Team member pages, Photos galleries with sorting tools, Video pages with a strong layout and some details about each video (vimeo hosting linked videos) that are easy to copy for additional work. We want something that can be designed and easily updated / edited as new work is created by our team. We are open to look and layout, would love to see some examples of work.\r\n\r\nWe would like this site to work well with both web and mobile.\r\nIf you have experience in SEO backend, we would be willing to keep you on longer to work that into our site as well.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623735770610401281','-',7,'United States','Atlanta',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-02-09',1,'2023-02-09',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-09 17:30:50',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
