(9168,'WordPress Web Developer',3,'Qualifications\r\n\r\nWebsite WordPress Design: 5+ years\r\nGraphic Design: 5+ years\r\nAdobe CC: 5+ years\r\nWP Bakery | Emulator | Guttenberg Block\r\nSEO Optimization | Social Media | BLOG Skills\r\n\r\nAbout Us\r\n\r\nWe are a dynamic group of highly skilled professionals building a SaaS business platform geared to disrupt the auto industry. We are driven to change the future of the way people buy and sell vehicles online. We are currently in production of 4 platforms with the first platform target launch in December 2022. We are looking for professional, technologically savvy, individuals who are interested in working hard. The right person should possess an entrepreneurial spirit and a desire to be part of an emerging technology business poised to lead the industry. We seek to be known as the authority in ALL things auto, cars, vehicles anything within the industry bought and sold online. Our platforms are web-based apps, mobile apps in partnership with leading data suppliers and technology leaders.\r\n\r\nDo you fit the bill?\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a Website WordPress Designer/Developer to join our team!\r\n\r\nAs a WordPress Designer, you will be responsible for designing and maintaining corporate WordPress application delivering the best online user experience, which makes your role extremely important for our success and ensuring user conversion into the sales funnel. We are specifically looking for WordPress design skills using WP Bakery | Emulator | Guttenberg Block Designer. SEO skills a plus. BLOG and Social Media integration a plus.\r\n\r\nYou will be designing content pages using various methods (Graphic Design, SEO Keywords, Video) using the latest technology. You will be designing content pages, landing pages and forms for conversion support PPC campaigns. You will be converting existing website designs to a functional WordPress website and control structures based on Bootstrap architecture. You will be an active member of the team participating in and sharing creative ideas and production strategies.\r\n\r\nA design portfolio is required. Experience in the automotive industry is a plus.\r\n\r\nJob Responsibilities:\r\n\r\nPlan and implement desktop designs that translate into a Marketing Website using WordPress\r\nOptimize and follow existing user interface brand, designs and styles\r\nWork in a creative team contributing ideas to optimize conversion\r\nCommunicate with creative director to understand business goals and objectives\r\nCombine creativity with an awareness of the design elements\r\nCreate marketing landing pages and form interfaces\r\nCollaborate with development team and discuss new ideas before implementing\r\nMaintain all plugins, WordPress versions and backup of website\r\n\r\nJob Requirements and Qualifications:\r\n\r\nExperience as a WordPress Designer\r\nExcellent interpersonal and communication skills\r\nAbility to discuss and explain design options\r\nDetail oriented\r\nCritical thinker\r\nProblem solver and customer-centered\r\nProficient with Adobe CC range of products\r\nExperience with Adobe XD is required\r\nWeb development HTML | CSS | JavaScript experience a must\r\nWordPress design and implementation required\r\n\r\nEducation\r\n\r\n4 years of college degree in commercial art/communication design or related major.\r\n\r\nPlease provide a resume and samples of work via online portfolio or online links to working examples of active projects. This is a contract position leading to full-time. Compensation based on experience. Base pay range is $55 - $75/hr. This is a remote/full-time position; time zone is required to be Florida USA EST. Must be fluent in English.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1623778749572071425','-',7,'United States','Indialantic',75.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-09',1,'2023-02-09',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-09 20:20:56',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
