(9281,'UX/UI Web design',4,'Seeking web designer strong in both UX/UI to design 3 web pages\r\n\r\nScope\r\n\r\nRedesign\r\n1. Home page\r\nhttps://rangerdesign.com/\r\n\r\nAs the main entry point to Ranger Design would like the home page to reflect the quality and world-class customer experience of doing business with Ranger Design. It needs to have a \'wow’ affect.\r\nSeeking to improve:\r\n• Make it more visually appealing through UX/UI, showcasing our products and users\r\n• Add Promotional Space where we can highlight NEW products, Tradeshow participation\r\n• Better expose our Fleet offering (https://rangerdesign.com/fleet/)\r\n• Visibility for Careers (HP and/or Navigation)\r\n• Allocate space in design for New Tagline (TBD)\r\n\r\n2. Van Shelving Landing page\r\nhttps://rangerdesign.com/shelving-commercial-vehicles/\r\nUsed for paid campaigns. Needs to better reflect the offering of Van Shelving and generate leads. Lacks substance.\r\n• Performance will be measured on leads generated by form\r\n• Assumption is that traffic to this page is less familiar to the brand\r\n• More mobile sessions than website average\r\n\r\n3. How to Buy New\r\n\r\nCreate dedicated page to outline and simplify buying journey for customers. The process is different depending on ‘type’ of customer.\r\n\r\n• End User/Tradesman direct to Request a Quote. secondary self serve options to Local or Online Upfitter\r\n• Large Fleet direct to our Fleet offering (microsite)\r\n• Other clients: OEM (vehicle manufacturer) direct to form, New distributors direct to form\r\n• Provide solution to incorporate in navigation vs existing How to Buy sub navigation\r\n\r\n4. Review Top Navigation\r\nProvide UX/UI Recommendations to improve experience.\r\n\r\n\r\nAdditional Notes\r\n• Responsive design for all pages\r\n• Integration not required','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1624070083002396673','-',7,'United States','Baie D\'urfe',4000.000,'fixed',4000.000,'2023-02-10',1,'2023-02-10',1,'na',0,'