(9294,'Senior UIUX designer',4,'Senior UIUX designer\r\nYou should want to:\r\ncreate user-centered design solutions that feature ease of use, employ best-in-class interaction design, and optimize the user experience. Functions as the UX lead/strategist for an aligned area to set the vision for the product(s) and make UX staffing and strategy recommendations.\r\nYou should know how to:\r\nBe creative and enjoy solving complex challenges to help people who may be in challenging situations. We are looking for someone who looks beyond the pretty interactions and really digs into the interface. What is the experience - and how can it be better.\r\nYou should be able to:\r\nLead the discovery process with support from product and engineering leadership, including user stories, development, and interpreting goals. Execute a variety of user research activities. Synthesizes and communicates results of concept testing, usability testing and quantitative analysis to make complex design recommendations. Proactively identifies the need for and initiates new, complex multi-step user flows using various design tools (e.g. experience and service design maps, journey maps, concepts, storyboards, wireframes and prototypes). Serves as subject matter expert in the defined UX and brand standards and the execution of visual, interaction and motion design. Analyzes impact of proposed changes and contributes to the pattern library with markup. Acts as an advocate for the end user. Works collaboratively by sharing designs early and often, seeking constructive feedback and integrating feedback. Offers guidance and provides constructive feedback to other team members.\r\n\r\nMinimum 8 years of experience in a related field: Experience using methodologies such as Figma/design(primary tool), Agile, Design Thinking, Lean UX, atomic design(primary), and Lean Startup\r\nFamiliarity with the following core disciplines, with demonstrated expertise in at least two and proficiency in two others: visual design, UX design, prototyping, front-end development, user research and/or experiment design\r\n\r\nComfortable interacting with all levels of the company\r\nCan present projects and status reports\r\nStrong organization and analytic thinking skills\r\nSolve complex content into user scenarios\r\nCreate flows and diagrams\r\nProven track record of collaborating effectively with cross-functional teams\r\n\r\nThis is a quick exercise to find the right person - roughly 2 weeks to evaluate your initiative and problem solving skills.\r\nBig growth potential to stay with the team as we scale, if your work quality and craftsmanship align with expectations.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1624074379648008193','-',7,'United States','Seattle',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-10',1,'2023-02-10',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-10 15:55:44',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(9295,'Illustrator/Animator Needed for Short Visual',8,'We are an EFT Tapping company looking for a visual to be designed and animated.\r\n\r\nSpecs (3 deliverables): 1920x1080, 1080x1080, and 1080x1920\r\n\r\n*We would like this animation to be exported with an alpha channel underneath, so that we can switch out the matte backgrounds later on if needed.\r\n\r\nThe visual we’d like created:\r\n\r\n1. A body shape like this, with the person Tapping on their temple: https://tenor.com/view/meditate-energy-chakra-light-flow-gif-14411945\r\n\r\n(See Tapping example on temple here: https://drive.google.com/file/d/12R4dCbHMqZWtRMUjrOwa1GoUohC7b3ah/view?usp=sharing)\r\n\r\n\r\n2. With the energy moving outward like the below example, in the ‘chakra’ colors: https://gfycat.com/dimwittedtightagama-consciousness-holographic-meditation\r\n\r\n(See Chakra colors and placement here: https://kenaibackcountryadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/chakra-colours-.jpg)\r\n\r\nIf interested, please share any relevant examples of your work when responding. Thanks so much!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1624075440720330753','-',7,'United States','Brookfield',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-10',1,'2023-02-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-10 16:00:05',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
(9296,'Whiteboard Animator needed!',8,'Please, DO NOT APPLY IF YOU WORK IN VIDEOSCRIBE, DOODLY, or VYOND!!\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a highly creative and talented Whiteboard Animator.\r\n\r\nIn this role, you will be responsible for producing a whiteboard animation video to help explain our construction services, processes, and products in a simple, clear, and engaging way.\r\n\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\nDevelop and create an engaging whiteboard animation video to explain complex construction concepts and services\r\n\r\nWork with our marketing team to conceptualize, write and produce whiteboard animations that meet our company\'s branding and messaging standards\r\n\r\nEnsure that all animations are aligned with the overall brand strategy and messaging\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n2+ years of experience in whiteboard animation and/or video production\r\n\r\nStrong portfolio demonstrating experience creating whiteboard animation videos\r\n\r\nExcellent storytelling, illustration, and animation skills\r\nAbility to work independently and manage multiple projects simultaneously\r\n\r\nProficiency in Adobe Creative Suite (After Effects, Illustrator, Photoshop) and other video production tools\r\n\r\nwrite \"plkj\" on the top of your proposal if you have read my post thoroughly, otherwise your proposal will be ignored\r\n\r\nWe only want professional animators who create everything from scratch! and animate it in After effects or Adobe Animate.\r\n\r\nThanks','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1624077125459116033','-',7,'United States','London Borough of Islington',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-02-10',1,'2023-02-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-10 16:06:59',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
