(9319,'Landing Page Funnel Builder Specialist for Guitar Company',3,'Zager Guitar is a leading brand in the musical instruments industry, providing high-quality guitars to musicians all around the world. Our mission is to bring the joy of music to every individual, and we believe in delivering the best customer experience possible.\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a highly skilled freelancer to help us drive traffic from PPC ads to a funnel page and collect emails and SMS numbers for our marketing efforts. The ideal candidate will be an expert in funnel design, conversion optimization, and copywriting, and will be able to show examples of their recent work.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDesign and build effective landing pages and funnels to increase conversions\r\nOptimize the landing page and funnel for maximum conversion rates\r\nWrite compelling copy that engages visitors and drives them to take action\r\nTest and analyze the performance of the landing page and funnel, and make necessary improvements\r\nCollaborate with the marketing team to ensure the landing page and funnel align with overall marketing goals\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience as a Landing Page Funnel Builder Specialist\r\nExpert knowledge of funnel design, conversion optimization, and copywriting\r\nStrong portfolio of recent work demonstrating your skills and experience\r\nAbility to analyze data and make data-driven decisions\r\nExcellent written and verbal communication skills\r\nFamiliarity with PPC advertising and email marketing\r\nExperience with landing page builders such as Leadpages, Unbounce, or ClickFunnels\r\n\r\nWhat we offer:\r\n\r\nWe are offering a project-based opportunity for a talented freelancer to work with a leading brand in the musical instruments industry. If you have a passion for funnel design and conversion optimization, and you are looking for a challenging and rewarding project, we would love to hear from you!\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit your resume, a cover letter, and links to your portfolio, and examples of your recent work.\r\n\r\nWe will review all submissions and reach out to the most qualified candidates.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1624088141011910657','-',7,'United States','Lincoln',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-10',1,'2023-02-10',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-10 16:50:55',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
