(9321,'Non-Profit Content Creation For web and media',2,'Hope you are well. \r\n\r\nCan you please design a 1 pager (simple flyer) for us at Sawyer\'s Wish.\r\n\r\nObjective: Create a 1 pager that prompts Child LIfe Specialists at our partner hospitals to encourage families to take pictures of their patients in their donated sheets via the Sheets From Sawyer Program and send the patient photos to Kayla at Kscalf@sawyerswish.org \r\n\r\nI have included the google links with the photos and instructions. \r\n\r\nThe plan is to place the flyer in boxes we ship to our child life team across the country (with the sheets inside them) so they can help collect patient photos in an effort for us to spread our mission and provide more sheets to more patients. \r\n\r\nIf you can get a mockup to us by Friday, Feb. 17th that would be ideal.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you have any questions,','https://www.upwork.com/nx/wm/workroom/32742813/overview','John Cash2- Become a STAR - Flyer Request- Crystal',34,'United States','Doylestown',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-02-10',1,'2023-02-10',1,'Fixed',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-02-10 16:59:44','2023-02-28 21:03:15',5,3,NULL,132),
