(9360,'Need a short, animated video of a short story',8,'We are in need of a short, animated video to tell the story behind an award we give out: The Dragon Award.\r\n\r\nThis award is the highest honor in our company and is reserved for people who have gone above and beyond, have battle scars, have made it through the fire and flames and come out on top.\r\n\r\nWe already have a short story that was written to go with this award and now we want a really cool animated video to portray this story. Looking for it to be 1-2 minutes long. Want the vibe to be dark, badass, fire & ash, and coming out on top. Our colors are purple, blue, pinkish but with the dark undertones of black, gray, silver.\r\n\r\nHere is the story that will serve as the groundwork for the animation (for context, Smoothstack is our company name):\r\n\r\nThe Kingdom of Smoothstack is a land of fire and struggle, bravery and triumph, battles and heroes, defined by community, opportunity, proactivity and perseverance.\r\n\r\nIts citizens engage in daily battles to attain their personal goals, be it for freedom, honor, or to become the greatest warrior in their guild.\r\n\r\nEach year, during the winter equinox, the greatest warriors receive their reward against the clear night sky. Out of the bottomless chasm at the heart of the great Mount Smooth, infant dragons ascend to bond with their warrior for life.\r\n\r\nTo possess a Smoothstack Dragon as a companion is the highest sign of honor and ultimate symbol of prestige.\r\n\r\nOnly a select few Smoothstackers receive the gift of a Dragon each year. If you have been gifted a companion, be proud: you have rare courage, unimpeachable values, and you are a true ambassador for the Kingdom of Smoothstack.\r\n\r\nWould love to chat and see how we can work together on this!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1624123719885668353','-',7,'United States','McLean',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-02-10',1,'2023-02-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-10 19:13:44',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
