(9384,'Design a 6.25”x 9” Postcard',2,'An enterprise client is seeking an experienced Ad Designer to assist with designing a 6.25”x 9” postcard for advertising the client’s cleaning services. The client has a copy however would like the designer to create a more visually appealing and simplistic design to go on the postcard. There are two vertical and two horizontal images that will be provided. The Client only needs to display two images total and the logos.\r\n\r\nFor this project, the client will provide guidance on the style and direction along with location-specific info for the postcard. Upon receiving the assets and instructions, the selected designer will work directly with the hiring manager to implement any feedback.\r\n\r\nDeliverables Due February 17, 2023:\r\n-6.25”X9” Post Card to be printed on 10pt cardstock (0.010”) that contains:\r\n1. Heading: Life’s too short to clean your own toilet\r\n2. Three bullets:\r\n• Safe\r\n• Insured\r\n• Satisfaction Guaranteed\r\n3. The call to Action: $50 Off Your Initial Cleaning (Some restrictions may apply. Please call for details)\r\n-Please mention our “Pure Cleaning” without adding too many words to the postcard.\r\n-print-ready file and the native file\r\n\r\nIdeal candidates will have:\r\n- Strong graphic design and layout expertise\r\n- Experience creating and editing print-ready designs\r\n- Use of the Adobe Creative Suite of design tools\r\n\r\nPlease submit your proposal, along with highlights from your experience and examples that demonstrate your abilities, for consideration.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01c620f3102a3ae8a6/apply/','-',7,'United States','Atlanta',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-02-10',1,'2023-02-10',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-10 20:57:32',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
