(9443,'Minimalistic Wordmark Logo Design',10,'We are looking for a designer with a passion for creating simple yet impactful logos. Do you have a talent for using typography to create a memorable brand identity? If so, we have an exciting opportunity for you!\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a talented designer to create a minimalist wordmark logo that accurately represents our brand values and appeals to our target audience. We believe that simplicity is the key to creating a timeless and memorable brand image, and we are looking for a designer who shares our vision.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate for this role will have a strong portfolio of minimalist design work, showcasing their ability to create logos that are clean, strong, and impactful. You should have a good understanding of typography, color theory, and the principles of design, and be able to create logos that are effective in both digital and print contexts. You should also have an eye for detail and be able to create logos that are both visually appealing and brand-centric.\r\n\r\nSo if you are ready, apply now! Can\'t wait to see your designs and work with you to create a minimalist wordmark logo that will help us stand out from the crowd.\r\n\r\n--------------------\r\n\r\nSomething about us so that you can better imagine the direction in which we want to develop the logo for our brand.\r\n\r\nBusiness: Coffee & Tea Drinkware\r\nStyle: Dark / Nordic / Old Norse / Elder Futhark\r\nColor: Black / White\r\nTypography-ish: Gotham, Helvetica, Avantgarde...\r\nWe listen: Hard Rock / Heavy Metal\r\n\r\n--------------------\r\n\r\nCheers!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1624802071607476225','-',7,'United States','Ljutomer',400.000,'fixed',400.000,'2023-02-12',1,'2023-02-12',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-12 16:08:46',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
