(9463,'Logo Animation (morphing sequence showin',8,'We need to show a 3 logo elements morphing into the next through rebrands.\r\n\r\nHere is an example of how it can be achieved in After Effects. we don\'t need to use this program, but it best illustrates what we\'re looking to create: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wkuRGW-jcuw\r\n\r\nHere\'s another videos example of the logo morphing technique being used:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yZwSC1r6b58\r\n\r\nA breakdown is:\r\n\"Logo-1.png\" needs to morph into \"Logo 2.png\". Then logo \"Logo 2.png\" into \"Logo 3.jpg\". Then \"Logo 3.jpg\" should morph to the animated version of the logo, file name: \"VD ANIMATION - LOGO - WHITE.mov\".\r\n\r\nAttached are the 3 logo files and animation\r\n\r\nFuture uses/ Sizes/ Formats: Needs to be used on our website and in the future will be used on Social Media, in Ads and YouTube videos - so whatever specs best facilitate this.\r\n\r\nDue date: ASAP - Latest 21/02 (final deadline, consider revision time and please include two rounds of revisions at least)\r\n\r\nPlease can you share any examples of your work.\r\nand fixed price estimate.\r\n\r\nThanks','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2020492','-',7,'United States','na',0.000,'fixed',0.000,'2023-02-13',1,'2023-02-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-13 15:00:33',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(9464,'Graphic designer(s) needed to create \"bezels/stationery\" to be used with Word',2,'Seeking a designer to create \"stationery\" that can be used with Word and can be converted to PDF.\r\n\r\nWe need a range of styles that would appeal mainly to women - contemporary, florals, geometrics (circle or bubble themes), clean/crisp, stick figure people, \"rainbow\" colored themes. Designs can be in black and white or full color.\r\n\r\nEach design needs to come in four parts:\r\n* \"bezel\" - a margin design that leaves the middle of the page white\r\n* watermark/wash - that would not interfere with text on top of it\r\n* bezel with wash - dark on the edges and able to have text in the middle of the page\r\n* right edge/left edge - a design that would go up the center of a book\r\n\r\nWe need to be able to write over or next to the design. There is a possibility of this becoming a long-term collaboration.\r\n\r\nNeed inspiration? Look at products from companies like Great Papers.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1624785163167977472?success','-',7,'United States','United States',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-02-13',1,'2023-02-13',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-13 15:00:52',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
