(9476,'Looking for Expert Mobile Developers',6,'Dear All,\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWe are a startup and we are looking for expert mobile developers having extensive experience with React Native or Flutter framework.\r\n\r\n- You should have a proven track record of working in one of the above frameworks. We have a preference of flutter. We will need proof of work from you, any 2 sample apps on IoS or Andriod\'s playstore.\r\n\r\n- This will be a delivery application, therefore you should have solid experience with Google Maps / GeoLocation. We will need to track time, cost, shortest path from restaurant to customer\'s address. Therefore, you should have experience with \"LIVE tracking\"\r\n\r\n- Outstanding UI/UX skills, we are looking to create an out of the box experience / user journey for our clientele\r\n\r\n- For the backend, for REST APIs, we may use nodejs\'s express framework. The database can be MYSQL or even any other from google cloud like firebase. We need a performant application with minimal latency and maximum compatibility with different versions of IoS/Andriod\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWe start with building with UI/UX and then the APIs and backend. This will be a long term project as we may need changes and improved versions of the app. We plan to work with a good and cooperative team. Our budget is going to be low initially but then we can add more value to you as we grow. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBest Regards,','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2020514','-',7,'United States','na',0.000,'fixed',0.000,'2023-02-13',1,'2023-02-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-13 15:37:11',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(9477,'Graphic Designer For Restaurant Menu Designs + Layouts',2,'We are a leading restaurant marketing agency, and we are in need of a talented freelance graphic designer to join our team on a project basis. As the restaurant menu designer, you will be responsible for creating beautiful and functional menus for our restaurant clients. You will be tasked with taking a series of menu items, content, and copy, and turning it into a cohesive menu/product offering that accurately represents our clients\' brand and appeals to their customers.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Work with our client service team to understand the vision and goals for each menu design project\r\n- Collaborate with our clients\' culinary team to gather menu items, descriptions, and pricing information\r\n- Create eye-catching and easy-to-read menu designs that highlight our clients\' offerings and increase sales\r\n- Ensure that the designs are consistent with our clients\' brand guidelines and messaging\r\n- Ensure that the designs are optimized for print and digital use\r\n- Stay up-to-date on current design trends and make recommendations for updates to our clients\' menu designs as needed\r\n- Manage multiple projects simultaneously and deliver high-quality work on tight deadlines\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience as a graphic designer, with a strong portfolio showcasing menu design work\r\n- Strong skills in Adobe Creative Suite, including Illustrator and Photoshop\r\n- Excellent design skills, with an eye for typography, layout, and color\r\n- Strong attention to detail and ability to work within brand guidelines\r\n- Excellent communication and collaboration skills\r\n- Ability to work independently and manage multiple projects simultaneously\r\n\r\nIf you are a freelance graphic designer with a keen sense of design and a passion for creating beautiful and functional restaurant menus, we would love to hear from you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0199a120f06ce73418','-',7,'United States','Victoria',35.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-02-13',1,'2023-02-13',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-13 15:38:33',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
