(9480,'Website Redesign for Tech Company',4,'Web Designer – Rebuild/Update 3 existing sites\r\n\r\n\r\nWe want to rebuild up to 3 sites with a new look and feel\r\n\r\nThe first one needs to transition from our current site here https://bit.ly/3JWRLT2\r\n\r\nThe work will certainly need to include the following\r\n\r\n• We’d like to add Shopify or some credit card systems\r\n• We’d like to be able to maintain via some tool editor like WordPress\r\n• The site needs to responsive, SEO friendly and great to navigate\r\n• If you can copyright and help steer the content and SEO this would be great too.\r\n• A few samples we like are here\r\no https://demo2.wpopal.com/smartic/home-40/\r\no https://demo2.wpopal.com/smartic/home-41/\r\n\r\nCandidates must reply with the following.\r\n\r\n• A URL link to a live site that shows your work.\r\n• This site must focused on a B2C sale of a cool tech product, not a restaurant or real estate site\r\n• We will want to ask for permission to contact the site owner for a recommendation\r\n\r\nWe have TWO other sites we’d like to rebuild as well. These are larger for our global sales and have more work associated with them. If you’d really like to impress us I’m sure you can find them navigating from our first site. We’d love to learn what you think about them too!\r\n\r\nPlease start any correspondence with my name so I know you’re not a robot and really read this posting. b.t.w. We’re a great team to work with and would like to have your skills be a part of our company growth and innovation.\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nSam','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625158850497445889','-',7,'United States','Westport',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-13',1,'2023-02-13',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-13 15:45:04',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
