(9516,'Create an E-commerce website',3,'Programming & Development\r\n\r\nWeb Development & Design\r\n\r\n    WordPress\r\n    User Experience Design\r\n    Web Design\r\n    Web Development\r\n    Web Servers\r\n    E Commerce\r\n    Marketplace Web Design\r\n    User Profiling\r\n\r\nHey, I\'m Matt, Co-founder of Page Express project.\r\n\r\nPage Express is a student-to-student marketplace for college textbooks.The idea is to make it easier and more affordable for college students to get their hands on the books they need for their classes.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for someone to help build a clean and user-friendly website that will make it simple for students to list their books, browse through available titles, and make transactions with each other. \r\n\r\nI\'m thinking a modern and minimalistic design would be a good fit, and a few key features I\'d like to include are:\r\n\r\n    User profiles where students can view their own listings and track their transactions\r\n    A search bar and filters to help students find the books they need quickly and easily\r\n    An easy-to-use listing form that makes it simple for students to list their books for sale\r\n    Secure payment processing through a trusted third-party provider\r\n\r\nSo what do you think? I’d love to hear some ideas for making it a reality. \r\n\r\nThanks for your time','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2020046','-',7,'United States','abc',1000.000,'fixed',0.000,'2023-02-12',1,'2023-02-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-13 16:43:35',NULL,4,1,NULL,152),
