(9519,'Mental Health Provider Credentialing Specialist',24,'We are a healthcare organization dedicated to improving the mental health and well-being of communities. We are looking for an experienced and motivated Mental Health Provider Insurance Network Credentialing Specialist to join our team and help us expand our network of provider partners.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Coordinate and manage the entire insurance network credentialing process for mental health providers\r\n- Ensure timely and accurate submission of provider credentials to insurance companies and networks\r\n- Maintain and update provider information in databases and systems\r\n- Keep up-to-date with insurance company and network requirements and changes\r\n- Respond to inquiries from providers and insurance companies related to credentialing\r\n- Collaborate with internal teams to resolve credentialing issues and disputes\r\n- Provide support and guidance to providers throughout the credentialing process\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Bachelor\'s degree in Healthcare, Business, or a related field\r\n- 3+ years of experience in insurance network credentialing for mental health providers\r\n- Knowledge of insurance company and network requirements and processes\r\n- Strong attention to detail and organizational skills\r\n- Excellent verbal and written communication skills\r\n- Ability to work independently and manage multiple tasks in a fast-paced environment\r\n\r\nIf you\'re a motivated and experienced Mental Health Provider Insurance Network Credentialing Specialist, we\'d love to hear from you! Please submit your resume and a brief cover letter to apply.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625175899195457537','-',7,'United States','-',60.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-02-13',1,'2023-02-13',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-13 16:54:30',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
