(9524,'Pitch deck development for a dermatology marketplace for skin of color',2,'Hello, I would like to bring 2 projects to your attention.\r\nFirstly I have a developer who I am contracting to develop a teledermatology app and  platform for me, however I am looking for a skilled designer who can assist to optimize the appearance/layout and overall functionality from a design perspective. This project will begin around March 1st, 2023.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe app and platform are the basis of a larger project. Ultimately the app and platform will be the basis for an online dermatology marketplace for skin of color. In summary patients would come to the market place to get their medical diseases diagnosed and receive professional medical advice for skin care from a dermatologist using the telemedicine app and portal. Additionally cosmeceutical products and educational content would be available for purchase on the site. I have a business plan: I need a skilled and savvy presentation to create the pitch deck to attract funding for this larger endeavor. This project will not begin before May 1st.\r\n\r\nI look forward to your feedback.\r\n\r\nBest regards\r\n\r\nDr Kuda','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01f4d0bbf6a8836629','-',7,'United States','Houston',0.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-13',1,'2023-02-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-13 17:06:49',NULL,6,3,NULL,125),
(9525,'We are looking for a Web developer with Wordpress and Elementor, with experience in graphic design.',3,'We are looking for a talented web developer with experience in Wordpress and a strong background in graphic design to join our specialized fitness sector marketing agency.\r\n\r\nIn this role, you will have the opportunity to work on challenging projects and collaborate with a creative team of marketing and technology experts. As a web developer, you will be responsible for creating and maintaining attractive and efficient websites for our fitness sector clients. You will also have the opportunity to develop your graphic design skills and contribute to the design of advertisements, brochures, and other marketing materials.\r\n\r\nIf you are motivated, passionate, and ready to join a growing and evolving agency, send us your application! We are eager to have you on our team.\r\n\r\nIn addition to offering a professional growth opportunity, we also value honesty, humility, camaraderie, commitment, and integrity in our company. We believe that these values are essential for forming a strong and collaborative team.\r\n\r\nWe offer a part-time schedule so you can balance your work and personal life, but if you are interested in dedicating more time, we are willing to consider the possibilities. Ultimately, we want you to feel comfortable and satisfied with your work.\r\n\r\nIf you share our values and are looking for an opportunity to work in a dedicated and committed agency, send us your application! We are eager to have you on our team.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625179506762465281','-',7,'United States','Montilla',9.000,'perhour',9.000,'2023-02-13',1,'2023-02-13',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-13 17:07:06',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
