(9549,'Product Training Videos',8,'We are looking to create training videos for our clients that walk them through how to use our platform.\r\n\r\nThe videos should be around 60-75 seconds long and feature a number of important product screenshots with voiceover instructions which we will provide.\r\n\r\nThe video should include illustrations to showcase our service and clients at the beginning and be in our brand colours and language.\r\n\r\nOur previous marketing video was this:\r\n\r\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/16rAKjjcu35IiawdlF6R8sHx5zrSjc9Ok/view?usp=sharing\r\n\r\nFor this project, we\'re wanting to take a training approach with clear step-by-step guidance and instruction that contains some illustrations alongside our products.\r\n\r\nWe will also ask for additional versions to be made which will include client-specific changes to the content.\r\n\r\nThe best versions of what we\'re looking for are from UBER and APPLE Support\r\n\r\nApple -\r\n\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rVZGryGESMA\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QWEsHV93XVw\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f_pTguuSA4o\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7sHaXuFb6uk&list=PLIl2EzNYri0cLtSlZowttih25VnSvWITu&index=17\r\n\r\nUber -\r\n\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PMMUj3bsPEc\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KlbRJDQhiZA\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RHwdtDgzOkI\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZWHZ3u7v6ig\r\n\r\n**To be considered for this project, we would like to see your previous work and a price and time estimation**','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~0193ab198ec535b85d/apply/','-',7,'United States','New York',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-02-13',1,'2023-02-13',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-13 18:45:48',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
