(9563,'Branding expert needed for e-commerce brand',2,'Looking for an experienced branding expert to help us build our e-commerce breath mint brand. We do have a good idea what we’re shooting for. The brand should look clean, upscale and creative. Our business model is a membership model with monthly/tri-monthy recharge of mints. Our audience is professionals, adults, healthy lifestyle, green-conscious and busy people. The first step of this project would be to build the brand guide and logo.\r\n\r\nNext step, we will need to design packaging: box, standup pouch and paper tube. The packaging is gonna be recyclable/compostable and we would like these values to show in the brand as well. We would like to include turquoise colour in the brand or some kind of variation. The logo should be simple, minimalist and trying to avoid all the common graphic elements of mints brands ( the mint leaf, the bright green and white, etc. ). We will also provide example as inspiration for the brand. We’re fresh, cool, professional and chill people and this is what we want the brand to tell, with a fresh breath.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625215066632323073','-',7,'United States','Delson',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-02-13',1,'2023-02-13',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-13 19:28:20',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
