(9567,'Small branding project',2,'We already had designs made by a brand designer, but after advise of our Web Design Agency the logo and screen designs got refined and we used other colors, etc. that’s why we need our Brand Kit to get redesigned also according to our new style. These are the deliverables we need:\r\n\r\n1. Powerpoint Deck (10 different slides)\r\n\r\n2. Cover Letter, 2 versions for Invoices, etc.\r\n\r\n3. Social Media Kit (all visuals must be editable in canva)\r\na. LinkedIn Profile Banner (2 different versions)\r\nb. Linked In Post, 4 different Designs\r\nc. Linked In Carousel Post\r\nd. Linked In Profile Photo Design\r\ni. As a background, e.g. this: https://www.linkedin.com/in/stephanrathgeber/\r\nii. As a ring, e.g. this: https://www.linkedin.com/in/sebastian-friesen-0712ba91/\r\niii. As a badge, e.g.: https://www.linkedin.com/help/linkedin/answer/a517793/-hiring-on-linkedin-overview?lang=en\r\n4. Business Cards\r\n\r\n5. Logos\r\na. Only Icon, in 4 different Colors\r\nb. Full Logo, with company name next to the icon, stacked\r\nc. Full Logo, with company name next to the icon, in one line\r\nd. Full Logo, with company name under the icon\r\ne. Favicon with Incon\r\n\r\n6. Canvas\r\na. Setting up all deliverables in canva, so we can edit them by ourselves (e.g. Social Media Posts)\r\nb. Setting up our Brand Kit in canva as Branding Guide\r\nc. Goal: Being able to edit or build any visuals quickly and without further help, according to our Corporate Design\r\n\r\n7. Coverletter for Doks (must be editable in .docx)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBest,\r\n\r\nFN','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625222397044080641','-',7,'United States','na',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-02-13',1,'2023-02-13',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-13 19:57:39',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
