(9576,'Brand Identity, Logo and Powerpoint Template',2,'I am looking for someone to develop a brand identity and collateral including business logo, powerpoint template, email signature, website header and business cards for a start up hospitality training school called Raise the Bar.\r\n\r\nWHO WE ARE\r\nA collective of veteran hospitality heroes blending global knowledge, local understanding, and complimentary skills to raise the bar of service and customer experience in the hospitality sector of Sri Lanka.\r\n\r\nOur talents include customer service, operations, culinary, beverage training, concepting and event management. We offer a holistic solution to hospitality businesses looking to elevate their customer experience, grow a dedicated, talented team and boost business turnover.\r\n\r\nWHAT WE DO\r\n\"Raise the Bar is a bespoke, workplace training program focusing on the hospitality and tourism sector in Sri Lanka. Our passion is delivering an exceptional customer experience across all facets of engagement with your business.\r\n\r\nThrough hands on training on the fundamental elements of hospitality, we deliver an adaptable, polished, highly skilled and enduring workforce that will level-up your service offering.\r\n\r\nBRAND STYLE\r\nLooking for a unique, tropical style fitting of Sri Lanka, with a vintage feel that breaks the mould of regular corporate branding. A logo to stand out to those in the hospitality sector. Logo to allow for progression/adaptation within the pitch deck. Inspiration: https://dribbble.com/Wibbly2023/collections/6323149-Raise-the-bar','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625226389542629377','-',7,'United States','Atawhai',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-13',1,'2023-02-13',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-13 20:13:47',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
