(9588,'Personal Branding for Life Coach, Author, and Podcast Host',2,'Dear Creatives,\r\n\r\nOur client is a life coach, author, and podcast host and we’re looking for an experienced branding expert to help me elevate and grow their brand. I am seeking a full branding package that includes a logo, font, colour palette, social media style guide, and brand guidelines.\r\n\r\nI am looking for someone who can bring their creativity and expertise to the table and help me establish a strong and recognizable brand image. Their target audience is people who are looking to improve their lives, navigate change, and find their sense of purpose, so it\'s important that the brand appeals to them and reflects their values and expertise in this area.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n* Develop a unique and professional logo that represents their brand\r\n* Choose a font and colour palette that aligns with their brand image and appeals to their target audience\r\n* Create a social media style guide that defines how their brand will be represented on various social media platforms\r\n* Develop brand guidelines that outline the key elements of their brand, such as tone of voice, imagery, and messaging, and provide recommendations for how to use them consistently across all platforms\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n* Strong portfolio of previous branding projects that demonstrate your expertise and creativity\r\n* Excellent attention to detail and ability to understand their target audience and what they are looking for\r\n* Excellent communication skills and the ability to work effectively with me to ensure that my vision for their brand is realized\r\n* Ability to deliver all elements of the branding package in a timely and professional manner\r\n\r\nIf you believe you have the skills and experience to help me with this project, I would love to hear from you. Please include your portfolio and any relevant information about your experience when applying for this job.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\n