(9606,'Simple Website/Blog Design and Development',3,'Hi there!\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for a talented web designer/developer to help build a blog about autism. This is a $500 test project. If this goes well, we hope to develop many more websites together for different projects we\'re working on as well as expand this site!\r\n\r\nWe want to get up and running quickly and need help from design to development. While we wish for the initial website to be simple (feel free to use templates etc), we want to make sure we pick the right platform to use that will allow us to grow while being super easy to adjust ourselves and add content.\r\n\r\nFor the design aesthetic, it\'s not much but, I\'ve attached a screenshot of a font and color combination we would like to copy. The text shown should fit seamlessly into the website design.\r\n\r\nThe features of the site:\r\n1. a simple, colorful blog where we can share Autism tips\r\nexample: sporked.com, colormecourtney.com\r\n2. The ability to sign up for a newsletter and integration with an email provider\r\n\r\nFuture features (Could be through apps or plugins)\r\n2. The ability to sell merch\r\n3. Adsense\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for someone who...\r\n- knows both design and development and can help us bring this site (and hopefully many others) to life\r\n- Is passionate about helping others and is excited to grow with us\r\n- Is able to take elements from the design elements we already have and translate them into the entire site.\r\n- Does not mind taking design risks and can make the site look fresh, new, and different\r\n\r\nIf you think you\'re a good fit for this project, please...\r\n- let us know why!\r\n- share any websites you have made or designed that you think would fit what we\'re looking for.\r\n- any questions you have about the project\r\n- your rate for this project and future hourly rate\r\n\r\nHope you have a wonderful day!\r\n\r\nPS: Other jobs we are hiring for right now are TikTok/Youtube Editing, Social Media Management, Advertising, and Copywriting. If you happen to also be good at any of these as well please let me know.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625245900015288321','-',7,'United States','Shelby',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-02-13',1,'2023-02-13',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-13 21:30:53',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
