(9754,'Water Bottle Packaging Designer',2,'Are you a creative and innovative designer looking for a new challenge?\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a talented and experienced Freelance Designer to help us create a unique and eye-catching water bottle packaging design. The ideal candidate should have experience in designing packaging for food and beverage products, be able to work independently, and have an eye for detail.\r\n\r\nIn this role, you will be responsible for creating a unique design that meets our company\'s standards, while also taking into account the demands of our target market. You will be expected to create a design that stands out from similar products on the market. You will be in charge of creating the artwork, ensuring that all the necessary information, such as barcodes, nutritional information, and company logos, is accurately included.\r\n\r\nThe successful candidate should have a degree in Graphic Design or a related field and experience in designing packaging for food and beverage products. In addition, you should possess excellent time management and communication skills.\r\n\r\nIf you think you have what it takes to create an eye-catching design for our water bottle packaging, then we would love to hear from you. Please send your portfolio and CV to our email address. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625581373237342209?success','-',7,'United States','Boston',150.000,'fixed',150.000,'2023-02-14',1,'2023-02-14',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-14 19:45:24',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
