(9756,'Klaviyo Template Creator',20,'We are a DTC eCommerce brand in the & health & fitness niche looking for a Klaviyo Email Designer to create email templates.\r\n\r\nPlease note:\r\n- Email templates need to be created with the email editor (no HTML)\r\n- We can produce assets for the emails\r\n- We are NOT looking for someone who runs email campaigns, JUST someone to create these templates\r\n- No agency','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625589168724619265?success','-',7,'United States','San Francisco',65.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-14',1,'2023-02-14',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-14 20:14:41',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
(9757,'Developer required for new website',15,'A new company needs to establish a website and integrated social media presence.  The company runs a small orchard selling fresh farm products. Also, the company will sell tour packages to the farm, including fully catered long-term vacation stays.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe day-to-day operations will be run on an ERP hosted on AWS. Current operating modules include employee management, projects management, sales, purchases, CRM, invoicing, etc.) \r\n\r\n\r\nThe idea is to link these modules (as needed), to share information with the front-end UI (Website).\r\n\r\n\r\nSCOPE OF WORK:\r\n\r\n\r\nGiven remote access to a hosted server, you will:\r\n\r\n    Install an existing CMS website template to serve as the front end (we are open to your template suggestions).\r\n    Add primary content as provided.\r\n    Establish site and content level permissions for users.\r\n    Install standard SEO tools on the website to report on factors such as Domain, page site, title tags, keywords, backlink user interactions, brand signals, web spam, etc.\r\n    Using RESTful APIs, configure the shopping cart (see #1 above) to work with Axelor open suite: https://github.com/axelor/axelor-open-suite. For this role, you will work closely with our engineer for the Axelor instance in production at AWS.\r\n    Provide a site for room reservations with real-time room availability and seamless guest confirmations.\r\n    Implement landing pages for social media accounts (Facebook, Facebook Messenger, Instagram, Pinterest, Twitter, LinkedIn, YouTube, google business profile)\r\n    Recommend any other features you believe could enhance overall user experience, and boost site traffic, sales, and loyalty.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2021425','-',7,'United States','-',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-02-14',1,'2023-02-14',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-14 20:15:50',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
(9758,'Branding and Logo Design for New Body Care Line',2,'Need help in developing a logo and branding package for new all natural body care line of products.\r\n\r\nI have a general sense of what I want elements I would like to include and overall image of brand.  Just need a designer to develop the concept.  \r\n\r\nThere will be ongoing requests for packaging designs as products are developed and launched.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0154dde5710d491af8','-',7,'United States','Tacoma',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2023-02-14',1,'2023-02-14',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-14 20:21:59',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
(9759,'Packaging Design for Children\'s Toys',2,'Please see the attached design brief for all project details and timeline requirements.\r\n\r\nProject Overview: This project is for the packaging design for a new product that has three individual pack variations. Because each of the three (RSC) boxes contain a variation of the same product, 95% of the graphic design elements and copy of each box will be the same. Each box variation will contain a directions sheet (single page, double-side printed), in which the (client provided) step-by-step instructions will need to be laid out. Each box variation will also contain a die-cut cardstock page (single page, double-side printed) which will need to be stylized and laid out. The boxes will be craft color with black printing, and the directions and die-cut cardstock pages will be grayscale printing on white paper. This is a new brand (separate from the company’s existing brands), so a text based logo and general design language will need to be developed.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625593820400693249?success','-',7,'United States','Seattle',3600.000,'fixed',3600.000,'2023-02-14',1,'2023-02-14',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-14 20:33:21',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
