(9762,'Looking for an artist to do a Horror Book Cover',2,'I am looking for an artist to make the cover for my first book, which is a collection of short stories. I would like to find someone experienced with making custom fonts. I would like this cover to look as realistic as possible, no cartoon artwork please. The stories are in the science fiction/horror/dark fantasy genre. The title story is called A Bite to Eat and is about a couple who go eat at a fancy restaurant that serves lab grown human meat.\r\n\r\nThe idea that I have for the cover is the following: Dark Visions I: is written in an elegant cursive over the top third of the cover. The I should be a boning knife instead of a cursive I. The bottom two thirds will be taken up by a plate with a hunk of very fatty raw meat on a dinner plate. There is a large bite mark (human) taken out of the meat. Burned into the top of the meat is the subtitle: A Bite to Eat & Other Rancid Morsels. It should look like a cattle brand burned the subtitle into the flesh. There should be the clear, fatty, red blood on the plate underneath the hunk of meat. I have attached a couple photos to give a better idea of what I’m looking for. I am looking for someone to take this drawing and make it better. Additionally, I will need a puddle of thin, clear, liquid yellow vomit for the back cover. This is the basic premise of the cover, I am open to any suggestions that would make it better.\r\n\r\nThanks for taking the time to read this.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625595398172426241?success','-',7,'United States','Cincinnati',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-02-14',1,'2023-02-14',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-14 20:40:54',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
(9763,'6-8 Page Word Press Site',3,'We want to build a 6-8 Page Wordpress site to take the place of www.andmir.com.\r\n\r\nThe site will be set up for continual improvement.\r\n\r\nCurrent examples of what we want the site to look like:\r\n\r\nhttps://salamandersolutions.com/\r\n\r\nhttps://variperm.com/\r\n\r\nhttps://pangeascreen.com/#/\r\n\r\nExisting sitemap:\r\nHome | Solutions | Project | Contact','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625595973717766145?success','-',7,'United States','Calgary',3500.000,'fixed',3500.000,'2023-02-14',1,'2023-02-14',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-14 20:41:43',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
