(9767,'WordPress developer needed to refresh existing WP travel site',3,'The travel site EuroCheapo.com is looking for a freelance WP developer to refresh design elements and navigation of our blog (eurocheapo.com/blog) and homepage (eurocheapo.com).\r\n\r\nWe’re currently refreshing all content on the site, and the blog needs an overhaul. The ideal candidate will bring ideas and solutions for better design, navigation, site speed and SEO enhancements. A love of travel is a big plus!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625597823822315521','-',7,'United States','Maplewood',90.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-14',1,'2023-02-14',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-14 20:49:05',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(9768,'Logo Designs',2,'We would like some new designs for our company, Motivation & Success. As well as new logo ideas for our brand \"Media Mavericks\".\r\n\r\nFor Motivation & Success: our color codes are: #25aae2 #000000 #8ccb3e #1a73b7\r\nWe would like 3 different designs with just the name \"Motivation & Success\" with and without a globe, while making the name stand out.\r\nWe would also like 3 different designs for a square logo similar to our publishing logo, but modernized while making our name stand out.\r\n\r\nFor our brand \"Media Mavericks\", we want the logo to look fierce with the implementation of a horse/horse head in the logo. The colors we were thinking for the logo are blue and silver, we aren\'t picky on specific color codes as it is now so whatever you choose!\r\n\r\nWe would love for your work on these logos as we know how good of work you do! We look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nThanks!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625597839367913473?success','-',7,'United States','Defiance',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-02-14',1,'2023-02-14',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-14 20:52:05',NULL,5,3,NULL,132),
(9769,'Law Firm Website Design',4,'The client does not have and existing site. This will be a brand-new website.\r\n\r\nFor their new site, they want it to look very high-end and clean. All the assets we have (photos, logo, etc.) are attached. Anything that is missing can be replaced with placeholders until we have actual assets. Photos are old and will be replaced.\r\n\r\nI have attached a logo they have started using that would be great if we could incorporate it in the new design.\r\nThe focus for the site will be professionalism and a clean but not sterile look and feel.\r\nDo not be afraid to jump outside of conventional boring Law Firm website design tropes. We selected you for this job based on the creativity and quality of your work, so take some creative liberty with it!\r\nIntended Audience: The firm is looking to attract injured clients with the types of injuries mentioned above. These are typically very in-depth and high-value cases. We want to communicate the value and experience the firm brings. The potential clients have just gone through a very traumatic/painful experience in their life. They are most likely very hesitant to contact a lawyer. We want the site to present the firm as approachable and caring.\r\nThe homepage design needs to have the following sections/features:\r\nA big bold hero section\r\n*Clear calls to action for Phone Calls & Free Consultations*\r\nA nicely designed, yet clean “About Us” section\r\nA “Case Process” section\r\nCase Results section featuring settlement amounts and case types\r\nA Google Reviews Section featuring star ratings\r\nA Testimonials Section featuring video testimonials of their past clients (use a stock photo here, as these videos are not yet produced)\r\nA Contact Us Section\r\nCall to action sections\r\nA section that shows what areas of practice they are involved in. (Uber Accident, Personal Injury, Maritime Injury, Mass Tort/ Dangerous Drugs, Commercial Trucking Accident, Wrongful Death, Oilfield Injury)\r\nA clear and well-designed “Headlines” section that features each attorney and headlines for some big cases they have been involved in.\r\nWe are looking for 3-page designs (All three designs should be included in first Draft:\r\nHomepage\r\nAbout Us page\r\nInterior Page (a section that can fit a large amount of text content + a sidebar with a form + menu, followed by a call-to-action, a reviews section, a results section, and the footer).\r\nTagline: There will be a tagline in the header of the homepage, but we have not narrowed that down yet.\r\n\r\nReference sites:\r\nsargentlawfirm.com\r\nlacentury.com\r\nhttps://www.abrahamwatkins.com/houston-personal-injury-lawyer/ Pa page on this site without all the H1 text\r\n\r\nColor Scheme: Attatched\r\nWe want this to be used in the call to actions https://codepen.io/bingwa/pen/vYERWpv\r\n\r\nSome Notes:\r\nOn all of our phone call call-to-actions, we’d like it to say “Free Consultation” above and “Available 24/7” below; See the example here: http://bit.ly/3FyDAAZ - This is to ensure that the visitor has all necessary information about the firm’s cost & availability before calling or submitting a webform.\r\nThe header should always feature prominent calls to action for phone calls and form submissions like this example: http://bit.ly/3FyDAAZ - it can be styled differently, but the feature should always be there to provide an easy way for visitors to convert.\r\nOn our forms, we’d like it to say “100% Secure and Confidential” below the submit button. This is to reassure the visitor that their information will only be shared with the law firm: See the example here: http://bit.ly/3FyDAAZ\r\nWe’d like the client reviews, results, and testimonials to be featured more prominently on the homepage like in these 2 examples: https://bit.ly/3BkVVin , https://bit.ly/3uy8sLw - This is done because reviews and results help the visitor understand what the firm can do for them, and convert more easily.\r\nHero Sections on pages should feature 2 calls to action buttons below the title one for calls, the other for a free consultation (webform), Example here: https://bit.ly/3BkVVin\r\nTypography:\r\nPróxima nova all weights\r\nPróxima Nova Bold, Medium, and Light\r\n\r\nNote from the Client:\r\nWant us to present as very personable and approachable. Don’t want to be overly stuffy and want to highlight our TX roots without being overly country. Not sure if that makes sense but I can explain. We don’t need to wear cowboy hats for people to relate and understand that we are real deal TX trial lawyers who have a proven record of success.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625599346685272065?success','-',7,'United States','Greenville',1800.000,'fixed',1800.000,'2023-02-14',1,'2023-02-14',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-14 20:55:33',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
