(9782,'Gif Animator for Brand Channel on Giphy',8,'We are looking for a skilled Gif Animator who can create animated GIFs from 2D drawings for our brand channel on Giphy.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will have experience creating custom GIFs and will be able to produce a large volume of high-quality GIFs that align with the style and look of our brand.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Create animated gifs from 2d drawings based on our brand\r\n- Understand and incorporate popular memes and online slang into the gifs\r\n- Organize the gifs into categories within the Giphy platform, including positive affirmations, national holidays, birthdays, and more\r\n- Work closely with our team to ensure the gifs align with our brand\'s overall messaging and aesthetics\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Strong experience in gif animation, with a portfolio of past work to showcase\r\n- Expertise in creating gifs from 2d drawings\r\n- Knowledge of popular memes and online slang\r\n- Ability to produce a large volume of gifs quickly and efficiently\r\n- Strong communication skills and ability to work collaboratively with a team\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you are a talented Gif Animator with experience creating high-quality gifs and a passion for staying up-to-date with the latest trends in online culture, we would love to hear from you.\r\n\r\nAttached to this job post, you\'ll find an example of the exact style of animated gifs we\'re looking for. We encourage you to review it before submitting your application with your portfolio!\r\n\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\nhttps://giphy.com/pudgypenguins\r\n\r\nhttps://giphy.com/SappySeals/','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625613330731941889?success','-',7,'United States','Miami',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-02-14',1,'2023-02-14',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-14 21:53:14',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
