(9824,'Mattress Brand Banner',2,'We will require some banners made, which will be 41 inches wide by 84 inches in height.\r\n\r\nThe banners showcase our brand and the mattress brands we carry.\r\n\r\nThe mattress brand banners should have a large logo on top, with some images on the brand\'s theme filling out the rest of the banner.  I will attach samples and ideas of what we currently have and the banners that fit the style on our website.\r\n\r\n1. National Mattress “Our Commitment To You” Banner\r\na. Same information as the current one (attached) just with a modern look.\r\n\r\n2. Sealy Posturepedic Banner\r\na. Brand website: https://sealy.ca/en/\r\nb. Our website: https://www.nationalmattress.ca/all-mattresses/sealy\r\n\r\n3. Serta PerfectSleeper Banner\r\na. Brand website: https://serta.ca/\r\nb. Our website: https://www.nationalmattress.ca/all-mattresses/serta\r\n\r\n4. Beautyrest Banner\r\na. Brand website: https://beautyrest.ca/\r\nb. Our website: https://www.nationalmattress.ca/all-mattresses/beautyrest\r\n\r\n5. Simmons Banner\r\na. Brand website: https://simmonscanada.com/\r\nb. Our website: https://www.nationalmattress.ca/all-mattresses/simmons\r\n\r\n6. Tempurpedic Banner\r\na. Brand website: https://tempurpedic.ca/en/\r\nb. Our website: https://www.nationalmattress.ca/all-mattresses/tempur-pedic\r\n\r\n7. iComfort Banner\r\na. Brand website: https://www.serta.com/collections/icomfort-assortment\r\nb. Our website: https://www.nationalmattress.ca/all-mattresses/icomfort\r\n\r\n8. Chirofoam Banner\r\na. Brand website: https://www.chirofoam.com/\r\nb. Our website: https://www.nationalmattress.ca/all-mattresses/chirofoam\r\n\r\n9. Springwall Banner\r\na. Brand website: https://springwall.com/\r\nb. Our website: https://www.nationalmattress.ca/all-mattresses/springwall\r\n\r\n10. Galaxy Bedding Banner\r\na. Brand website: NA\r\nb. Our website: https://www.nationalmattress.ca/all-mattresses/galaxy\r\n\r\n11. Healthguard Banner\r\na. Brand website: https://www.healthguard.com/\r\nb. Our website: https://www.nationalmattress.ca/accessories/healthguard\r\n\r\n12. NM Generic Banner Banner\r\na. Brand website: https://www.nationalmattress.ca\r\nb. Our website: https://www.nationalmattress.ca/all-mattresses/nm\r\n\r\n13. Evergreen Sleep Banner\r\na. Brand website: NA\r\nb. Our website: https://www.nationalmattress.ca/all-mattresses/evergreen\r\n\r\nIf you could also include our \"NM Circle Logo\" on the bottom right-hand corner of every banner, that would be great.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you require further information and how much you can quote me for this work.\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~018433f7527523ff18','-',7,'United States','Etobicoke',0.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 14:59:56',NULL,6,3,NULL,125),
