(9829,'Graphic Designer For Branding/Creative Agency',2,'FREELANCERS ONLY - NO AGENCY, NO TEAMs.\r\n\r\n--\r\n\r\nHello!\r\n\r\nWe are a small, strategic branding & creative agency searching for a talented graphic designer to help bring incredible branding, creative and design work to life for the agency and our clients.\r\n\r\nYour role includes working with our team on graphic design work for various clients. You\'ll help, manage and be responsible for the following:\r\n\r\n• Social media graphic design for Linkedin & Instagram\r\n\r\n•  PowerPoints, Google Slides, flyers, banners, brochures, case study designs, etc.\r\n\r\n• Expert knowledge of the full Adobe suite & Microsoft PowerPoint/Google Slide is critical\r\n\r\n• Support in designing the front-end of website pages & landing pages (From a graphic/design standpoint)\r\n\r\n• Communicate and be available, as-needed, weekly on Slack/email/Asana/Zoom\r\n\r\n\r\n• Contracts can be hourly, per project, or monthly retainer fees.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you!\r\n\r\nThank you.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011748a7c2dd156ddd','-',7,'United States','Windermere',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 15:06:30',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
(9830,'Informational blogging website',3,'Home Page: Create a clean and intuitive home page that provides an overview of the website\'s purpose and offers easy navigation to other sections of the website. Ensure the page loads quickly and is mobile-friendly.\r\nBlog Post: Integrate a CMS to allow you to create, edit, and publish blog posts easily. Provide an intuitive text editor with similar features as Medium.com, such as formatting options, image embedding, and easy publishing. Ensure the blog post section is optimized for search engines and is mobile-friendly. Select an AI voice readout solution: Choose a reliable AI voice readout solution that can read out the content of each blog post section in a natural-sounding voice.Integrate the AI voice readout: Work with the AI voice readout provider to integrate the technology into your website. Ensure that the readout is available for each blog post section.\r\nPodcast Section: Integrate a podcast section on the website, where you can upload and share audio content related to the website\'s purpose. Ensure the podcast section is optimized for search engines and is mobile-friendly.\r\nVideo Section: Integrate a video section on the website, where you can embed videos from YouTube or any other platform. Ensure the video section is optimized for search engines and is mobile-friendly.\r\nSale Store: Integrate an e-commerce store on the website that allows you to sell products related to the website\'s purpose. Ensure the store is secure, mobile-friendly, and easy to use for customers.\r\nExample Website: Provide the website designer with an example of a website that you like (in this case, GoodRx) to give them an idea of the design and functionality you\'re looking for.\r\nSpeed Optimization: Optimize the website for fast loading times by minimizing HTTP requests, compressing code, and optimizing images. Ensure that the website performs well on both desktop and mobile devices.\r\nResponsive Design: Ensure the website is mobile-friendly and responsive to different screen sizes and devices. Use responsive design techniques to ensure that the website looks great on all devices.\r\nSEO Optimization: Ensure the website is optimized for search engines by implementing metadata, creating an XML sitemap, and ensuring the website is crawlable. Use best practices for on-page optimization, such as using keywords in title tags and headers.\r\nSecurity: Implement security measures such as HTTPS encryption, secure login, and data backups to ensure the website and user data is protected.\r\nDeadline: Establish a clear deadline for the website\'s completion and launch. Be realistic about the timeline, and make sure your designer understands the importance of meeting deadlines.\r\nCost: Discuss the cost of the project with your designer and make sure you have a clear understanding of what is included in the price.\r\nCommunication: Establish a clear communication channel with your designer to ensure that you are always in the loop on progress, and to promptly address any issues or concerns. Use a project management tool to track progress and communicate effectively.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625874192235413505','-',7,'United States','na',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 15:07:28',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(9831,'UI/UX Designer',6,'We are looking for a skilled UI Designer with extensive knowledge of the eCommerce landscape.\r\n\r\nAs an established pet fashion store, we require your expertise to enhance the user experience of our product customization processes and overall customer journey.\r\n\r\nYou\'ll be utilizing Figma to analyze our current designs and propose improvements that will streamline the shopping experience for our customers and increase conversion rates.\r\n\r\nYour role is to create designs that eliminate any obstacles that may impede the customer\'s experience.\r\n\r\nWe\'re seeking a long-term partnership with someone who will get to know our brand, become our go-to UI designer for future projects, and grow with us. We\'re not interested in one-time projects.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested, please submit your portfolio *at the top of your application* along with your application.\r\n\r\nWe would also love to see a video introduction of yourself so that we can get to know you as a person.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to being your client for the long term!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625874323497594881','-',7,'United States','london',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 15:08:03',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
