(9835,'Design and build Divi landing page',4,'We have a sales landing page that we need to have designed (with a mockup), then developed in WordPress using Divi Themes.\r\n\r\nSo we need someone who has both skills.\r\n\r\nWe would expect to see a mockup, provide feedback on the mockup, then develop the mockup in Divi.\r\n\r\nBelow is a link to the copy and general design layout for the page.\r\n\r\nPLEASE READ! I will not consider any applications without a bid for time/cost, and acknowledgement that you have read the job scope rather than just responding with your portfolio. Thank you, it helps save me time.\r\n\r\nhttps://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1Fj3K_ouDRCTVoKs1ym_I9X6OO0BXdNZDkFCuh_zs3_k/edit?usp=sharing','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625878248240627713?success','-',7,'United States','rohnert park',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 15:23:28',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
(9836,'URGENT Branding Needed for Blog',2,'****PLEASE NOTE, THIS IS AN URGENT REQUEST.\r\n\r\nTHIS PROJECT NEEDS TO BE COMPLETED NO LATER THAN SATURDAY, FEBRUARY 18TH, 2023. IF YOU\'RE UNABLE TO MEET THIS AGGRESSIVE DEADLINE, PLEASE DISREGARD THIS JOB *****\r\n\r\n*I will be extremely responsive and engaged to streamline and expedite the process.*\r\n\r\nWe are developing new branding guidelines for an up-and-coming blog.\r\n\r\nIt\'s geared toward professionally ambitious upscale, chic, modern millennial women. It\'s a new website that offers relevant career and lifestyle content with a lens towards a sophisticated and luxe experience for our readers.\r\n\r\nIn preparation for the upcoming launch in late Feb, we are looking to define our visual aesthetic that speaks to the brand, I am looking for a thought partner who can execute the vision, but is also able to advise on the end-to-end branding including the following:\r\n* Main Logo\r\n* Submark (monogram)\r\n* Color palette (primary + extended)\r\n* Typography (hierarchy + system)\r\n* Brand Pattern or illustration\r\n* Brand Guidelines\r\n* Image Curation (for blog posts)\r\n* Email signature\r\n* Social Media Styling (using Canva)\r\n* Business Cards\r\n\r\nGood news is that you wouldn\'t be starting from scratch!\r\n\r\nWe already have a mood board, some preliminary designs created, and ideas on sub mark logos, we just need someone to put the vision together in a cohesive way. Happy to share this with interested parties.\r\n\r\nIf interested, please reach out and I will provide the addition website information.\r\n\r\nThanks so much!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~013edf27ebb393f23e','-',7,'United States','Milton',3000.000,'fixed',3000.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 15:24:03',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
(9837,'UX / UI Designer needed to help shape the visual identity & website for a marketing agency',4,'Hello,\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking to contract an expert UX / UI designer with strong experience in creating websites & helping shape visual identity.\r\n\r\nThe job scope is to help us update our visual identity & website to attract clients with larger budgets.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate has a very strong design background, has an eye for details, knows how to add a bit of cool to the brand and translate our core values into a visual identity.\r\n\r\nType \"banana\" at the beginning of your proposal so we know you actually read this.\r\n\r\nWe\'d like to get started right away. We have typography defined, and a general direction of colors and patterns, but we need an expert who can make it all work together.\r\n\r\nPlease attach your previous works to the proposal and tell us why you\'re the person for this job.\r\n\r\nOpen to a long-term relationship if short-term is ok.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01a1a212c92b8d6ebb','-',7,'United States','Osijek',75.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 15:24:05',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
