(9843,'Company Logo Short Animation',8,'Hello,\r\n\r\nI am looking to have a short animation made for my company\'s logo to be used as a piece of company branding as an introduction to company videos and social media posts.\r\n\r\nThe animation only needs to be 2 to 4 seconds long max.\r\n\r\nMy company brand assets are attached as well as a company brand asset guide that has colour schemes etc. Once the animation has been made I need a version in each colour within the colour scheme.\r\n\r\nSpecifically, I am looking for our tree logo to be animated so that the tree looks likes it\'s growing into the logo. Maybe the logo itself grows then afterwards the company name fades in, or something like that.\r\n\r\nAll the best,\r\n\r\nChris','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625881088539410433?success','-',7,'United States','London',100.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 15:34:52',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
