(9846,'Mental Health Insurance Claims Biller',21,'We are a private practice group looking for assistance in insurance billing on a regular basis. Hours needed vary based on week-to-week need. Ideally, it would be great to \"work yourself out of the project\" but getting us set up to run more independently. Tasks would include: recuperating denied or unpaid claims, credentialing on insurance panels, preauthorizations, and the like. We use Therapy Notes for a system and will give you access. We are located in Wisconsin. Knowledge of Wisconsin or Midwest Insurance companies is a plus.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625881739440865281','-',7,'United States','-',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 15:37:21',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(9847,'Web Design for Copper Sink Business with Minimalistic Design',4,'We are looking for a talented and experienced web designer to create a high-design, minimalistic website for our kitchen and bath copper sink business. The website will be programmed in WordPress with a WooCommerce shopping cart, but the designer does not need programming skills as we have a programmer who will take your design and convert to wordpress. Certain knowledge of wordpress is desired for efficiency purposes in the design. The ideal candidate will have artistic skills and creative ideas, which is the most important skill needed. We do not have a preference for any specific design software. We want a creative individual who will be able to create a custom design that showcases our products in the best possible way.\r\n\r\nThe project will involve designing the website from scratch, including creating custom graphics. This is a general structure of the website:\r\n- Home Page - Best design and creative needed\r\n- Additional Content Pages with more content than design - 9 pages (e.g. History of copper, copper benefits, maintenance, etc)\r\n- Pure content pages with minimal design (FAQ, Terms, etc) - 3\r\n- Category Pages - Good design needed (e.g. Drop in Sinks, Farmhouse sinks, etc) - 8\r\n- Product pages. We just need the design of one product page. There are 35 products. The programmer will replicate for each additional product in Woocommerce.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a designer who can work quickly and efficiently, and who has a strong portfolio of previous work.\r\n\r\nWe prefer a fixed-price contract. Please include examples of previous web design work in your application, along with your fixed-price quote. We look forward to working with you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625882499156426753','-',7,'United States','The Woodlands',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 15:41:06',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
