(9871,'Graphic designer for logo and branding',2,'The Job Overview\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a dedicated graphic designer to join our growing company. we are initially looking to create a logo and branding for our company to create effective and eye-catching logo that to attract our target audience. As a graphic designer, we hope you can put your passion for design to create beautiful and compelling logo. Your duties will include.\r\n\r\nLogo branding for luxury clothing line\r\nStarting up a clothing line targeting adults from 18-35, street wears and sophisticated luxury designs with unique materials. Our mission is to provide quality, authentic clothing unique to traditional casual wears, incorporated with Afrocentric patterns and sophisticated fabric. Our vision is to create a community within our customers through the value they get from out fashion lines, a bonding through sophisticated fashion design, royal outlook of our unique pieces and interpersonal inclusiveness towards the growth of O.G.A family and its community. IDEA: I want a logo with an elegant letter-mark of the brand stating \"Of Greater Authority\". or a font that symbolize power, might, strength, authority, leadership etc. with a symbol at the top that also represent the same quality of the font style / the brand or a combination of the brand abbreviation \"O.G.A\". examples. Versace, Burberry, Chanel, Lacoste, Louis Vuitton etc. I have my ideas attached on a file, you can come up with something more creative and unique.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities\r\n\r\nBelow are some of the responsibilities a graphic designer is expected to assume in their position:  \r\n\r\nCreate and design various materials for digital and print\r\nSelect colors, fonts, images, and layouts\r\nEnsure projects are completed in a timely manner with a quality product\r\nAdvise best practices and optimizations throughout design projects.\r\nCollaborate with fellow designers to develop new approaches for creating more-expressive graphics for the company\r\nWork with a wide range of media and graphic design software\r\nEstablish creative direction for the company within brand guidelines\r\nManage multiple projects within design specifications and budget restrictions\r\nDetermine voice and messaging for graphic design pieces\r\nQA design for errors\r\nImplement feedback and changes whenever possible\r\nCreate visualizations that convey accurate messaging for the project.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625893015053164545','-',7,'United States','calgary',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 16:22:36',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
