(9873,'SEO Specialist needed',5,'We\'re looking for a Search Engine Marketing Specialist. The primary purpose of this job is to help us with the search engine-marketing channel. The Search Engine Marketing Specialist will help us setting up and how to manage all paid search campaigns on Google, Yahoo and Bing, as well as other search and display marketing engines. \r\n\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n    Search Engine Optimization (SEO) skills and best practices and apply them to business tasks.\r\n    Keyword research tactics and use them to improve organic rankings for a variety of page types.\r\n    Monitor and report on website performance using a number of SEO tools.\r\n    Master and utilize SEO tools such as Google Analytics, Search Console, Keyword Planner, Semrush, and Ahrefs.\r\n    Research, plan, and execute SEO strategies to improve organic rankings.\r\n    Analyze data to measure the success of SEO strategies, develop new theories, and implement and test them.\r\n    Research the latest tools and techniques in web marketing.\r\n    Communicate with other departments to ensure joint marketing objectives are in line with SEO best practices.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2021774','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 16:24:11',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
