(9875,'Writer on SEO / Niche Website Topics',5,'ooking to hire a writer that is familiar with the Niche Websites and SEO topics. \r\n\r\n\r\nYou\'ll be creating content (writing articles) that help grow our website. \r\n\r\nThen, after writing an article, create social media posts based on that content.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe goal is to bring in organic traffic, from search engines and social media platforms to our new website. We will also be \"boosting\" posts on social media (Facebook) to bring in more traffic and to build our audiences / followers. \r\n\r\n\r\nWe are building a SAAS product and are launching in a couple of weeks, so it\'s important we start working on creating this content now. Become the voice of our content! \r\n\r\n\r\nPlease rate yourself on a scale from 1-10 (10=best) on each subject/topic and briefly explain why you gave yourself that score: \r\n\r\n1. SEO\r\n\r\n2. Niche Websites \r\n\r\n3. Online Marketing\r\n\r\n4. Canva\r\n\r\n5. Facebook\r\n\r\n6. Instagram \r\n\r\n7. Twitter\r\n\r\n8. YouTube\r\n\r\n9. Social Media Marketing (advertising on Social Media)\r\n\r\n10. Email marketing \r\n\r\n11. Grammarly \r\n\r\n12. English\r\n\r\n13. Typing - please take this typing test and include a screenshot of your results with your past writing examples. https://10fastfingers.com/typing-test/english\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease continue by answering these following questions:\r\nDo you have any blogs you\'ve created or written for that I could see (please share in your response)? \r\n\r\nHow would you be able to best contribute to this project?\r\nWhat does success mean to you? \r\n\r\nHow many hours per week would you be able to put in? \r\n\r\nWhat does your typical week / weekend look like? \r\n\r\n\r\nThis job is $2/hr (for now) and will increase in the future.  \r\n\r\n\r\nLooking to hire right away. \r\n\r\n\r\nFinally, place \"SEO success\" in the first line of your response so I know you\'ve read this. Apply now so we can get started!','https://www.guru.co