(9985,'Create a video animation of a story from a podcast',8,'I\'d like to create an animated video from a story in a popular podcast, Smartless. It is from the episode with Julia Louis-Dreyfus where she describes her meeting Barbara Streisand.\r\n\r\nI plan to hire multiple providers so that I can gauge style and skills. I expect to create more videos down the road.\r\n\r\nHere is the link to the podcast:\r\nhttps://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/julia-louis-dreyfus/id1521578868?i=1000505642321\r\n\r\nHere is high-level direction for what I want included in the animation:\r\nStart at 10:48 (with the words, \"there was a period in my life...\")\r\n10:48 - 11:09 - young Julia going to the movie theater many times\r\n11:09 - 11:23 - young Julio and Barbara Streisand having lunch, getting a pedicure, and going for a walk on the beach\r\n11:23 - 11:37 - fancy party at the white house, pan to Barbara Streisand sitting at a table\r\n11:37 - 12:03 - julia introducing herself to Barbara, and Barbara delivering the line \"I already told them what I wanted\"\r\n\r\nPlease overlay the audio from the podcast over your animation.\r\n\r\nThanks and let me know if you need any more details. I look forward to working together.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625969718684856321?success','-',7,'United States','San Francisco',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 21:27:23',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
(9986,'Website Build for Roofing Company',3,'WordPress website design needed for a roofing company that has multiple services. 8 pages to start, and possible pages to add later.\r\n\r\nNeeds to be completed by 27 February.\r\n\r\nAll content is written, and photos and logo are in a Google Drive and DropBox.\r\n\r\nIdeally you also have experience with on-page SEO for alt tags, etc.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625969797311279105','-',7,'United States','Virginia Beach',15.000,'Open this select menu',15.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 21:27:38',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(9987,'Experienced Graphic Designer for Law Firm',9,'Law firm marketing team seeking an experienced graphic designer to help create a range of visual assets including website elements, social posts, visuals for video production, print assets and more.\r\n\r\nVideo editing and production is not required but we could use help there as well.\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for someone who can spend in the range of 5-10 hours per week work with us on an on-going basis.\r\n\r\nMust be able to work within brand guidelines, be dependable (meet deadlines) and communicate well. Likely, we would schedule a weekly meeting with you so you have a chance to ask questions about assignments.\r\n\r\nKnowledge of Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, Page Design is a must and some knowledge of Premiere is a \"nice to have.\"','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01bc5c5b5f948636bd','-',7,'United States','Austin',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 21:28:53',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
