(9991,'E-Book Creation',2,'I have a number of posts from social media that I would like to put together into an e-book.\r\n\r\nWhat I am NOT looking for:\r\n\r\nMarketing or branding expert. This is not a brand building project.\r\n\r\nWhat I AM looking for:\r\n\r\nI need someone who is an expert at putting content together into a simple e-book. This is not intended to be a full-fledged book through Amazon KDP or other full-blown publishing system.\r\n\r\nThe focus of the posts is on legal technology, so some experience with putting together white papers and downloadable e-books in the technical and/or legal spaces could be beneficial. I have attached a potential outline for the ebook.\r\n\r\nOnce I have hired you, I\'ll share a categorization of my posts so you can see each post and then help determine the best way to put some of them together into an e-book of a short to medium length.\r\n\r\nI try to be as responsive as I can, but for the sake of transparency, there may be times when a day or more may go by before I can respond to a note you send me.\r\n\r\nI am eager to get going on this project, but it is important for me to find someone who not only can do the work but wants to work with me and vice versa.\r\n\r\nI have proposed a budget estimate, but do have some flexibility based on the project and your expertise and intended plan for this project.\r\n\r\nI look forward to hearing from you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1625971611700584449?success','-',7,'United States','Weston',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 21:35:15',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
