(9998,'Presentation Designer needed for immediate project and upcoming projects',11,'Hello hello! I\'m Mike and I\'m excited to be working with you.\r\n\r\nFor this project, we want to redo a deck and make it WAY more visually interesting.\r\n\r\nHere\'s a quick overview from my Partner of the project: https://d.pr/v/PiMPfM\r\n\r\nWhat we have:\r\n- We have an hour long audio file and need to redo a very visually engaging presentation to go along with it. We will keep the audio, but redo the presentation with more bullets, more stock images, etc.\r\n- We\'ll get you an iStock or whatever account you\'d like for photos\r\n- We have the existing presentation if you\'d like to start with that and add\r\n\r\nWe will expect you to pull lots of photos from the Internet of Josh Axe the presenter, videos from his Facebook page or content from his Instagram.\r\n\r\nIn the future we\'d like to work with you on all our presentations!\r\n\r\nIf all of this sounds great to you, please reply to this post with \"Yes, I read the whole post!\" just to let us know you read the whole thing and then include a link to your portfolio or a single presentation you\'ve done and the estimated cost for the project.\r\n\r\nBONUS: not necessary, but if you would record a short (less than 3 minute Loom) we will review those applications first because it guarantees that you have good English and serious about the project!\r\n\r\nWe\'re pumped to work with you, have an absolutely amazing day.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~015a8540e350cedb31','-',7,'United States','Paynesville',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 22:11:10',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
(9999,'Build a responsive website with capabilities to securely accept payment for food/drinks',3,'Searching for a website developer capable of creating a modern, aesthetically pleasing, website capable of accepting orders for drinks/food items. The website must be mobile friendly, secure, capable of processing and accepting payment, as well as online pick-up orders. The website will need to be integrated and streamlined with a POS system like \"Toast\" or \"Square\" for ease of online ordering.\r\nAll product photos, logos/graphics, and website copy will be provided.\r\nI own the domain(s) and have hosting/website building already on \"elementor\". Experience is required. Please submit a portfolio of sorts including previous projects or works.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01fa670f4b9444f8c4','-',7,'United States','los angeles',1400.000,'fixed',1400.000,'2023-02-15',1,'2023-02-15',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-15 22:15:33',NULL,6,3,NULL,125),
