(10025,'UI animation website (webflow)',4,'Dear UX Designers,\r\n\r\nIt is my pleasure to reach out to you with an exciting opportunity. Our company is in search of a talented UX Designer who can create an exceptional investor pitch deck interactive website for both mobile and web, incorporating the latest trends in web design and user experience.\r\n\r\nThe pitch deck is an essential component of our upcoming fundraising efforts, and we want to ensure that it effectively conveys our brand message and value proposition to potential investors. We are looking for a designer who can help us create a visually stunning and informative deck that will capture the attention of our audience.\r\n\r\nIn addition to the pitch deck, we would like to see examples of user experiences such as the ones found in https://www.wearegoat.com/\r\nand https://the-goonies.webflow.io/.\r\n\r\nWe are eager to learn about your process and methodology and would appreciate a breakdown of your budget to create both the pitch deck and website. Please be detailed in your proposal and feel free to include any additional information that you feel would be relevant to the project.\r\n\r\nWe are excited to hear from you and look forward to the possibility of working together to create an exceptional user experience that will set us apart from the rest.\r\n\r\nour pitch deck is attached to this message.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0125ee846ae007818a','-',7,'United States','Natanya',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-02-16',1,'2023-02-16',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-16 12:43:40',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
