(10032,'Pitch Deck for tech startup',11,'We are a software company that is offering a niche service to the hospitality industry. We have been in business for a number of months and already have a soft launched product with a few clients.\r\n\r\nWe are looking to build a pitch deck which we can use to promote and seek investors to take the company to the next level. I already have a presentation which we present when discussing the business, benefits, features with the clients, so a lot of the content is documented. We also have some $ projections a couple of years out. We did some competitive analysis and market research but can use some help with that. Company logo design/concept is a plus\r\n\r\nThis is a very short term project which can lead to other opportunity. I will be looking for someone who has done this previously and can provide examples of completed (tech) startup pitch decks. It would also be appreciated if in the cover letter you step through the process with me.\r\n\r\nThank you','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1626231060482101249','-',7,'United States','Woodmere',1100.000,'perhour',1100.000,'2023-02-16',1,'2023-02-16',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-16 14:58:20',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
