(10039,'WordPress Site Migration, Design, and Development',3,'We seek a skilled WordPress developer to migrate and redesign a news site to a new WordPress platform. The ideal candidate will have experience in site migration, design, and development, and can work independently to ensure the successful completion of the project.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nMigrate existing site content, including articles and media, to the new WordPress platform\r\nDevelop custom post types and taxonomies to organize site content\r\nDesign and develop a new WordPress theme to give the site a fresh, modern look\r\nImplement custom fields and metadata to enable advanced search and filtering functionality\r\nDevelop custom plugins as needed to extend WordPress functionality\r\nEnsure the site is optimized for speed and performance\r\nIntegrate the site with social media and email marketing platforms\r\nWork closely with the project manager to ensure the project stays on schedule and meets project goals\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nStrong experience in WordPress site migration, design, and development\r\nExpertise in custom post types and taxonomies, custom fields, and metadata\r\nExperience in designing and developing custom WordPress themes\r\nProficiency in PHP, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript\r\nExperience with popular WordPress plugins and tools\r\nAbility to optimize site speed and performance\r\nExcellent communication and problem-solving skills\r\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team\r\nKnowledge of SEO best practices a plus\r\nThis is a remote, freelance position with the potential for ongoing work. We are looking for a developer available to start immediately and commit to the project for the duration of the migration and development process. If you have the skills and experience we are looking for, please submit your application with your resume and portfolio of relevant work.\r\n\r\nthe current site:\r\nhttp://www.dvarhamefarsem.co.il/home.asp\r\n\r\nNew site: example :\r\nhttps://www.ice.co.il/\r\nhttps://demo.tagdiv.com/newspaper_pro/\r\n\r\nThe current site has 2 types of posts: news and job\r\nthe jobs are different by the fields, like youtube links or audio files, etc: a form for each type.\r\nthe posts go to the approval of the admin.\r\nThe structure should be kept. menu to be simple,\r\nlong page and article no navigation content is loaded upon click.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1626240574564003841','-',7,'United States','Israel',3500.000,'fixed',3500.000,'2023-02-16',1,'2023-02-16',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-16 15:23:12',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
