(10063,'Webflow Development and Design',3,'Looking for a developer to design and implement a new main page for our website jumla.io through webflow.\r\n\r\nThe project skeleton, mood board and content will be provided by us, we are only looking for design and development for it.\r\n\r\nAbout JUMLA:\r\nJumla is a specialized online procurement solution that enables foodservice operators such as hotels, restaurants, and cafes to manage all their procurement activities. Through one online platform, we provide restaurant operators with a complete sourcing solution from the moment they design their menu items to the moment they receive their supplies and pay for them. By seamlessly integrating logistics and technology, Jumla reinvents the way foodservice operators get their supplies. They can order their needs, control their spending and receive their shipments, all from one place. We commit ourselves to drive efficiencies throughout the food and beverage industry. Jumla. Sourcing. Simplified.​','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1626251699678965761','-',7,'United States','GRANDVILLE',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-02-16',1,'2023-02-16',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-16 16:07:44',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(10064,'2D animation video x 3 (car buying company)',8,'Need fast turnaround 1 week per video (3 vids).\r\n\r\nWe would like 3x 2D animation videos demonstrating our service at cardaddys.co.uk (a car buying company).\r\n\r\nThe scripts are currently being prepared and will be no longer than 30 sec\'s each.\r\n\r\nWe will have voiceover and music in each clip.\r\n\r\nThey will all show how simple it is to sell your car through cardaddys. Customer will be at home on their laptop/mobile device then somebody from cardaddys will arrive at their home and purchase the car.\r\n\r\nStoryboard and copy will be provided by ourselves.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1626252411789283329','-',7,'United States','london',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-02-16',1,'2023-02-16',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-16 16:10:11',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
