(10066,'Looking for ADA/WCAG compliant 3 page WordPress website for Disability Business',3,'Hi,\r\n\r\nI run a marketing agency in Australia and am looking for a team/person to create whitelabelled and confidential websites for my clients in the disability sector.\r\n\r\nMust have knowledge of ADA and WCAG and be able to create websites which follows those guidelines and more such as WCAG 2.1 Level AA etc.\r\n\r\nCurrent project is a 3 page website with home, about and description pages for a disability business. Nothing too complicated but website should be fully compliant so that its accessible for everyone. Also need to be well designed (with accessibility in mind ofcourse) and responsive on all devices.\r\n\r\nBasic onpage SEO can be performed too. Must be good to run through this - https://wave.webaim.org/ and https://validator.w3.org/. Please get in touch if your interested in this project and we can consider a long-term relationship.\r\n\r\nWebsite design is still important but aslong as its in line with the guidelines thats all that matters.\r\n\r\nThanks!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1626253804210130945','-',7,'United States','Maddington',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-16',1,'2023-02-16',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-16 16:15:59',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(10067,'PowerPoint sales decks',11,'I am looking for someone to design and build two PowerPoint templates - one for each of my businesses.  I envision using these templates primarily for sales presentations to homeowners and commercial clients, but would adapt them to other purposes where it makes sense.\r\n\r\nI will provide a brand kit, product images, and other assets.\r\n\r\nHere\'s a rough general outline:\r\n- Cover\r\n- About [The Tailored Closet / Premier Garage]\r\n- Project design goals\r\n- Design slide(s): 3D design views, features, considerations, price\r\n- Our Promise: quality, service\r\n- Next steps\r\n- Last slide (Thank you, general product images)\r\n\r\nI\'m envisioning that the text-based pages would contain inspiring, beautiful stock images from our catalog.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01668b4402650f99bb','-',7,'United States','Cleveland',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-16',1,'2023-02-16',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-16 16:18:16',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
(10068,'UI design for eCommerce websites using our prebuilt template',4,'We\'re a software company. We develop eCommerce software solutions for our clients. Specifically, we developed a template that all new customers use.\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for a designer to help create amazing eCommerce designs for our clients. This project encompasses UI design mockups (we will implement the CSS/HTML).\r\n\r\nBasically, we will provide the standard demo design on Adobe XD format and you need to create a new fresh design for our customer using the SAME structure. Once the design is approved you have to send us the static data (images, font, etc.), CSS (which is an override of the existing css) and custom HTML.\r\n\r\nIn your proposal, please provide a one- or two-paragraph summary of your design experience and why you\'d be a great fit for this work. Also include two relevant samples that show your best design work and creativity.\r\n\r\nYour job will be:\r\n1. Do eCommerce site design following the restrictions and directions of the basic structure\r\n2. Apply necessary changes to designs\r\n3. Provide any icons and images related to the designs produced\r\n4. Provide any custom css and HTML for the website\r\n\r\nRequirements\r\n- Having a tax ID number (no individuals)\r\n- Be on time with deadlines\r\n- Ability to follow procedures and to be perfectly organized\r\n- Solid verbal and written English communication skills\r\n- Creativity\r\n- Adobe XD (you can use any software you want to be honest but with XD you will get the blueprint)\r\n- CSS and HTML\r\n\r\nThe candidate has to sign an NDA and a contractor agreement. Thanks!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1626255417666605057','-',7,'United States','Albettone',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-02-16',1,'2023-02-16',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-16 16:22:25',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(10069,'E-commerce - Outdoor furniture (30 products)',16,'Hi,\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a freelancer in EUROPE to design and develop an e-commerce that sells outdoor furniture (tables, sofas, cushions, etc...).\r\n\r\n- The site will be in one language (French)\r\n- The site will have 30 products.\r\n\r\nWe will have to do everything from A to Z:\r\n\r\n- design\r\n- development\r\n- adding the 30 products\r\n- adding the payment methods (Stripe+ Twint because in Switzerland)\r\n- testing the e-commerce\r\n\r\nIt can be done with Woocommerce (Elementor) or Shopify.\r\n\r\nFor information, we are a web agency in Switzerland and we already work with 3 developers and we have a big demand in 2023, that\'s why we are looking for someone like you.\r\n\r\nVery important : We are looking for someone in Europe!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ffe101fb4a9103f7','-',7,'United States','Champlan',2100.000,'fixed',2100.000,'2023-02-16',1,'2023-02-16',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-16 16:25:34',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
