(10072,'Website for boat trips similar to Airbnb Experiences',3,'I want a website for local boat trips from different companies that will have the ecommerce and foreign language option also. Similiar to Airbnb Experinces.\r\n\r\nIt is going to be a website where individuals can book boat trips in the\r\nsame region but these trips are operated by different companies.\r\nSo like a listing of the different daily trips that can be booked on this website and then an email or sms is automatically forwarded to any of these companies when a booking is made.\r\n\r\nOn first page there is a listing of different boat trips\r\n\r\nAnd you click on one and it gives details about that boat/trip.\r\nAnd then you can proceed to booking a trip by choosing the date and number of people.\r\nAnd then is payment by card.\r\nIts not going to have all the features of Airbnb Experiences but listing, photos, details about trip, booking by date, etc need to be there, so client can make a choice.\r\n\r\nBelow is possible content for the website.\r\n\r\nContent\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\nHome page\r\n\r\nIntroduction to the website and its purpose, brief overview of available\r\nboat trips\r\n\r\nBoat trips listing\r\n\r\nList of available boat trips, including the name of the trip, the duration,\r\nthe departure and return times, the price, and a brief description of the\r\ntrip\r\n\r\nTrip details page\r\n\r\nDetailed information about a specific boat trip, including photos, a more\r\ndetailed description, any inclusions or exclusions, and any special\r\ninstructions or requirements\r\n\r\nBooking form\r\n\r\nA form that allows customers to select their desired boat trip, the date\r\nthey want to go, and the number of people in their party, as well as enter\r\ntheir personal and payment information\r\n\r\nConfirmation page\r\n\r\nA page that confirms the details of the customer\'s booking and provides\r\nthem with a booking reference number\r\n\r\nAccount page\r\n\r\nA page that allows customers to view their past and current bookings, as\r\nwell as manage their personal and payment information\r\n\r\nFAQ page\r\n\r\nA page that answers common questions about the website and the boat trips,\r\nsuch as what to bring, what to expect on the trip, and cancellation policies\r\n\r\nContact page\r\n\r\nA page that provides contact information for the website and the boat trip\r\ncompanies, including email, phone number, and physical address\r\n\r\nPlease let me know your proposals.\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1626257954138394625','-',7,'United States','Capital City',300.000,'Open this select menu',300.000,'2023-02-16',1,'2023-02-16',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-16 16:32:28',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
