(10114,'Startup Pitch Deck Design',11,'Looking to partner with a skilled designer who has extensive experience in pitch deck design, graphic design, graph creation, and animation/transition effects.\r\n\r\nI\'ve been selected to pitch my startup on 2/25 at a local competition. You\'ll be presented with a basic powerpoint that contains all needed info as well as a basic brand guide with our logo & color scheme. The presentation is 5 mins long, but has 10 mins of Q&A. Estimated 10 slides for the presentation and 10 additional slides for supporting appendices.\r\n\r\nYour scope is relatively straightforward - make the pitch deck look top notch! Looking for cohesive, professional, elegant and delightful design. Some original icons may need to be created but open to using previously created icons or licensable icons/images if it makes sense. There will be 2-3 graphs/timeline style charts in the presentation that need to be improved/recreated to match the overall presentation look/feel that we agree upon. Please have experience with content/slide animations as I like to have each bullet point/image appear on click.\r\n\r\nThis is the 3rd company I\'ve started so you\'ll be working with a responsive, experienced founder that will make the process easy.\r\n\r\nHARDEST PART: Timeline! The slides are due to the governing body by 2pm on Thursday, 2/23. However I likely won\'t have the final slide content to you until 5pm on Monday, 2/20.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to working with you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1626292442854461441?success','-',7,'United States','Portland',80.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-16',1,'2023-02-16',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-16 18:49:42',NULL,9,3,NULL,140),
(10115,'Explainer Video & B2B SaaS Product Video Needed',8,'I have two videos I am looking to have created.\r\n\r\nThe first of which is an already existing video using animated characters but the content is a few years old and requires a refresh. I\'d be happy to share a link to the video privately. This will be presented on our Member sign-up page and is intended for the Member to understand what information is and is not passed between them to us when using our product.\r\n\r\nWith this video, I do not intend to make major updates to the script so that is also largely completed as well.\r\n\r\nFor the second video, I am interested in a SaaS product video that leverages some of our product screens (examples: https://youtu.be/mZlzS9i9i2Y or https://youtu.be/q19RtuCHt1Q -- we\'re not affiliated with either of these vendors). I intend for this to appear on our home page but have not yet completed a script (but do suspect it would run about 90-120 seconds or so if that helps with scope). We have an existing homemade video we\'re looking to make more professional that I would be happy to share privately.\r\n\r\nBoth of these videos would be hosted on website pages.\r\n\r\nAs for budget, I do have an idea of what video creation would run and I do have a budget set aside for this project, but I have not set a project rate as I am not sure if both video styles can be completed by the same vendor. I am hoping to receive a quote for each video separately.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1626293249133907969?success','-',7,'United States','Beaverton',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-02-16',1,'2023-02-16',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-16 18:52:50',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
