(10136,'Graphic Designer for KDP Book Cover and Interior pages for Puzzle Book series',2,'Hey there!\r\n\r\nWe\'re a growing publishing company that specializes in fun puzzle books, and we\'re on the lookout for an awesome graphic designer to help us create visually exciting book covers and interior pages for our upcoming series of books.\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for a designer who can help us develop a strong brand look and create designs that will make our puzzle books stand out from the rest. The designs will mostly be for entertaining puzzle books, and we need a designer who can create fun intro and instruction pages.\r\n\r\nHere\'s what we need from you:\r\n\r\n-A portfolio of work that showcases your experience in book cover and interior design.\r\n-A willingness to work with us until we\'re completely happy with the final product.\r\n-Experience with Kindle Direct Publishing (KDP) platform.\r\n-Great communication skills.\r\n\r\nWe have a couple of projects that we need to complete quickly, and we\'re hoping to find a designer who is interested in working with us on an ongoing basis. We\'ve attached a couple of book drafts, current company logo (that we are still refining) and some designs for similar books that we\'d like to improve upon. So if you\'re interested, please send over some examples of your work that show your design style and quality. Also, please let us know your best offer for this project so we can compare it with others.\r\n\r\nThe first job includes work for the following two books:\r\n\r\n**Frabble - Volume 1**\r\nExterior Cover (Front & Back)\r\nInterior Cover (1pg - Redo of Exterior Cover for Interior of Book)\r\nCopyright Page (1pg)\r\nHow To Play (2pgs)\r\nExample Gameplay (5pgs)\r\nTips & Tricks (2pgs)\r\nStatistics (1 pg)\r\nGame (1pg - as an example)\r\nSolutions (1pg)\r\nThank You (1pg)\r\nAdd\'l Offerings (1pg)\r\n================\r\n1 Book Cover (Front/Back) and 16 Interior Pages (See attached book mockup)\r\n\r\n**Lexagons - Volume 1**\r\nExterior Cover (Front & Back)\r\nInterior Cover (1pg - Redo of Exterior Cover for Interior of Book)\r\nCopyright Page (1pg)\r\nHow To Play (2pgs)\r\nTips & Tricks (1pg)\r\nGame (1pg as an example)\r\nHints (1pg as an example)\r\nSolutions (1pg as an example)\r\nThank You (1pg)\r\nAdd\'l Offerings (1pg)\r\n================\r\n1 Book Cover (Front/Back) and 10 Interior Pages (See attached book mockup)\r\n\r\nThere is some room for negotiation, but please do not contact if your quote is much higher than the fee proposed.\r\n\r\nThanks for taking the time to read this, and we can\'t wait to hear from you!\r\n\r\nBest,\r\nFribbler Games','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1626311320013254657?success','Rob Langston - Graphic Designer for KDP Book Cover and Interior pages for Puzzle Book series - Alex',28,'United States','no city mentioned',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-02-16',1,'2023-02-16',1,'Fixed',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-02-16 20:04:15','2023-02-28 20:18:18',7,3,NULL,133),
