(10140,'Graphic designer for various packaging/design jobs for website with shoes and clothes for kids',2,'We would like to find a graphic designer who can do all our graphic design jobs from now on.\r\n\r\nWe don\'t have a huge work load but there will probably be smaller or bigger projects each year.\r\n\r\nRight now (within a few weeks) we need the following designed:\r\n\r\n- Thank you card for customers\r\n\r\n- Candy bag design\r\n\r\n- Packaging design for shipping bags\r\n\r\n- Update of website colors etc\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in the job we would really love to see you design a small example of the direction you see our brand identity go.\r\n\r\nInfo about our company: We are an online store located in Denmark and we sell a wide variety of shoes, clothes and decor for kids aged 0-8 years old. We like Scandinavian design but are very open to suggestions of the direction that our new brand identity can go.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1626311799421964289','-',7,'United States','Kvistgaard',1500.000,'Open this select menu',1500.000,'2023-02-16',1,'2023-02-16',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-16 20:08:37',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
