(10289,'Branding for a Luxury Handbag Brand',2,'i!\r\n\r\nWe are Clayword, a new luxury handbag business based in the UK. We are in our infancy and are looking for a Graphic Design and UX expert to help our shape our brand.\r\n\r\nPlease read the requirements section for guidelines on what we would like.\r\n\r\nWe have a website but it is locked at the minute as we want to relaunch with our new branding. Use the below link to login and use the password \"sneakpeek2023\" to view our website. It is pretty barebones at the minute, hence being locked at the minute.\r\n\r\nWebsite https://clayword.com/password\r\nPassword: sneakpeek2023\r\n\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/clayword_official/\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe are looking for:\r\n\r\n- Logos. One for desktop and one for mobile. The desktop logo can just be our business name \"Clayword\", and the mobile version can be \"CW\".\r\n- Colour Palettes. Totally open to suggestions on this.\r\n- Repeating patterns. We have attached a sample one that we have, but we would like to see a better implementation of this and more versions of it. These should have transparent backgrounds so as they can be used on our digital handbag designer software. These are important as we will be using them on our handbags.\r\n- Example landing page for our website\r\n- Example product listing page for our website (list of products) - https://clayword.com/collections/handbags\r\n- Example product page for our website (single product view) - https://clayword.com/products/vibrant-little-hearts-handbag\r\n- Examples of social media posts with our branding on it\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nWe want to place ourselves firmly within the realm of luxury handbag businesses, so there needs to be a theme of luxury and elegance to the chosen typography and brand colours.\r\n\r\nPlease take inspiration from other luxury fashion brands, such as Louis Vuitton, Burberry, Hermes, Chanel etc.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1626675063476023297','-',7,'United States','na',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-02-17',1,'2023-02-17',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-17 20:10:18',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
