(10296,'Motion Graphics Designer (After Effect) for website animations (RiveApp or After Effects)',8,'Job Description:\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a talented Motion Graphics and Animator who can design creative and engaging animations using Riveapp or Adobe After Effects. The ideal candidate will have a passion for creating high-quality motion graphics and animations for a variety of digital media including social media, websites, videos, and other online platforms.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Design and create visually appealing motion graphics and animations for various digital media platforms.\r\n- Collaborate with the creative team to conceptualize and execute creative solutions for a range of projects.\r\n- Create storyboards and design concepts to effectively communicate ideas and concepts to clients.\r\n- Develop and maintain a thorough understanding of - industry trends and techniques to ensure the use of cutting-edge technology and design concepts.\r\n- Manage projects from concept to completion, meeting tight deadlines and ensuring high-quality deliverables.\r\n- Ensure consistency of design across multiple platforms and channels.\r\n- Please say \"Adobe Magician\" in the first line of your cover page, to prove you read the entire job post\r\n\r\nRequirements\r\n- Proficiency in Riveapp or Adobe After Effects and other animation software.\r\n- A strong portfolio demonstrating proficiency in motion graphics and animation.\r\n- Excellent communication and collaboration skills.\r\n- Experience working in a fast-paced environment and managing multiple projects simultaneously.\r\n- A strong attention to detail and ability to follow brand guidelines.\r\n- Ability to work independently or as part of a team.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1626680432077234177?success','-',7,'United States','Santa Monica',7500.000,'fixed',7500.000,'2023-02-17',1,'2023-02-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-17 20:31:45',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
