(10299,'Graphic Designer (Mushroom Coffee Brand)',2,'We are a mushroom coffee brand looking for a talented and creative Graphic Designer to join our team. As a Graphic Designer, you will be responsible for creating visually appealing and effective packaging designs, complete branding for our brand, and content creation for our website.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Develop packaging designs that are visually appealing, on-brand, and effective at communicating product features and benefits.\r\n- Create and implement a cohesive brand identity that aligns with our company values and mission.\r\n- Collaborate with the marketing team to ensure brand consistency across all platforms and mediums.\r\n- Create engaging and visually appealing content for our website, including blog posts, social media graphics, and email marketing campaigns.\r\n- Manage and organize all graphic design files and assets.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- 2+ years of professional graphic design experience.\r\n- A strong portfolio showcasing your experience with packaging design, branding, and website design.\r\n- Expertise in Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign).\r\n- Experience with UX design and web design.\r\n- Strong attention to detail and an ability to work in a fast-paced environment.\r\n\r\nPreferred Qualifications:\r\n\r\n- Experience with food and beverage packaging design.\r\n- Knowledge of HTML and CSS.\r\n- Experience with Shopify or other e-commerce platforms.\r\n\r\nIf you are a creative and detail-oriented Graphic Designer with a passion for branding and web design, we would love to hear from you. Please include your portfolio and resume when applying.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1626681689735094273','-',7,'United States','Groningen',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-02-17',1,'2023-02-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-17 20:36:58',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
