(10321,'Animator for Safety/HR/Softskills Training Productions',8,'We\'re a fast growing company that is taking the lead in creating and selling our own productions while cutting back on using other vendors products. We are looking for someone who is hungry to bring their A game to the table and knock our socks off with their creativity and ideas to take the boring safety training videos you watch during every job orientation and then every 6 months after that and make them something that people look forward to watching.\r\n\r\nWhen stock footage isn\'t available, animations will need to be put in to paint the picture of what the script is portraying. When specific scenarios need to be played out that we can\'t get a person on the scene to act, animation steps in again bringing all of that to life to portray to the person watching the training.\r\n\r\nInterested in coming on board with us for awhile? Shoot us an example of your work - let\'s chat!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1626696987999449089?success','-',7,'United States','Newark',60.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-17',1,'2023-02-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-17 21:36:58',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
