(10354,'Creative Designer for Bored in Paradise Lifestyle Bag Company',2,'Bored in Paradise is looking for a rock star creative designer who can develop artistic designs for a new brand of lifestyle bags. As a designer for Bored in Paradise, you will have the opportunity to showcase your creativity and design skills by creating unique and captivating designs for the brand\'s products.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDevelop creative and innovative designs for Bored in Paradise lifestyle bags.\r\nUse specific arts, embroidery and patterns to create designs that stand out in the market.\r\nCollaborate with the Bored in Paradise team to conceptualize and execute design projects.\r\nStay up to date with current design trends and techniques.\r\nEnsure all designs are consistent with the Bored in Paradise brand identity.\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience as a creative designer in the lifestyle or fashion industry.\r\nA strong portfolio showcasing your design skills and creativity.\r\nProficient in Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign, etc.).\r\nStrong communication and collaboration skills.\r\nAbility to work in a fast-paced environment and manage multiple projects simultaneously.\r\nStrong attention to detail.\r\nIf you are a creative and passionate designer with a strong eye for detail and a desire to work in a dynamic and innovative environment, we encourage you to apply for this position.\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit your portfolio on Upwork.  You can find more on our website www.boredinparadise.com','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1627581418724913153','-',7,'United States','Houston',60.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-20',1,'2023-02-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-20 12:00:18',NULL,7,3,NULL,155),
