(10430,'Creative Web Designer for Personal Brand',4,'Hi my website is outdated and needs a refresh and new, updated information added.\r\n\r\nThe website is for my personal brand. I offer a few products and services, but the website is mostly for authority/credibility.\r\nhttp://chris-finlay.com/\r\n\r\nYou could build the new one from scratch, or improve the existing site.\r\n\r\nI want the quality to be high spec and I want the imagery to be invoking and exciting.\r\n\r\nI released a new product recently, perhaps you could use it to align branding:\r\ntake a look here:\r\nhttps://thejournal.one\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe budget for this is somewhat limited,\r\nDesigners that can work quickly and get a lot done by using software/templates will get preferance.\r\nThat said I am looking for something creative and high quality.\r\n\r\nSend me examples of your work, send me your offer and ideas.\r\nIf you have experience and a clear creative eye AND your bid is competitive - perfect!\r\n\r\nThanks for taking the time to read','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1627746502854074369','-',7,'United States','Astoria',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-02-20',1,'2023-02-20',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-20 19:07:38',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
