(10435,'GIF Creator',8,'We are seeking a highly creative and talented GIF creator to join our team. The ideal candidate will have a passion for creating engaging and visually appealing GIFs that can be used across various platforms. As a GIF creator, you will be responsible for designing GIFs that are 500x500 and under 600mb.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n-Design and create high-quality GIFs that align with our brand\r\n-Collaborate with the marketing team to understand project goals and requirements\r\n-Ensure all GIFs are optimized for web and social media\r\n-Manage and organize multiple projects simultaneously\r\n-Work with tools such as Asana, Slack, Canva, and Figma\r\n-Make edits to GIFs quickly and efficiently\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n-Proven experience in creating and designing GIFs for web and social media\r\n-Proficiency in Asana, Slack, Canva, and Figma\r\n-Knowledge of file optimization and image compression\r\n-Strong attention to detail and ability to meet tight deadlines\r\n-Excellent communication and collaboration skills\r\n-Ability to take feedback constructively and make necessary revisions in a timely matter\r\n\r\nIf you are a creative, detail-oriented, and passionate individual with experience in creating engaging GIFs, we encourage you to apply.\r\n\r\nPlease submit your resume, portfolio, and any relevant links to your work.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1627750490221182977?success','-',7,'United States','Dallas',75.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-02-20',1,'2023-02-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-20 19:23:44',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
(10436,'Build WIX website',3,'Our company is developing website catering to those seeking flexible office space (example – business travelers). We wish to launch a very professional website which will attract corporate partners.\r\n\r\nOur content right now contains:\r\n\r\n1. Homepage (one paragraph)\r\n2. About (one paragraph)\r\n3. Our Marketplace (one page with hyperlinks)\r\n4. Partners (one page)\r\n5. Our Values (3 paragraphs)\r\n6. Contact Us\r\n\r\nWe have a strong preference for WIX.\r\nIf you are interested, please send rough estimate.\r\nBest regards,\r\nMeir','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1627750611600777217','-',7,'United States','na',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-20',1,'2023-02-20',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-20 19:23:51',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(10437,'Logo for NGO',10,'Hi All\r\n\r\nI am looking for a logo design for a new NGO. The NGO its name will be Zaedno (In English Together).\r\n\r\nThe focus of the NGO is environmental for clean air, keeping forests and parks and positive animal care. The NGO is focused on the country North-Macedonia. The logo should be simple, memorable, and convey the organisation\'s message clearly.\r\n\r\n- The logo needs to show unity\r\n- We like the idea of a brand word ZAEDNO\r\n- The brand word logo could have a heart for the A and the O as the Macedonian sun\r\n- It needs to be Social Media proof\r\n- It needs to be used on a businesscard\r\n\r\nI like these colours : https://nl.pinterest.com/pin/5770305761611326/','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~012d1fa8d2c51b54e3','-',7,'United States','Utrecht',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2023-02-20',1,'2023-02-20',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-20 19:24:50',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
