(10443,'Creation of logo animation',8,'2D Animation Posted Feb 20, 2023\r\nWe need a motion designer to create an animated version of the logo, that can later be used for branded videos.\r\n\r\nHere are the requirements for animated logo:\r\n1) Intro lengths - max. 5 sec.\r\n2) Use a tornado as an animation piece.\r\n3) Positive message/animation.\r\n4) No tagline as part of the logo.\r\n5) No sound.\r\n6) White background.\r\n7) 2D.\r\n\r\nHow we need it to be delivered: We want to receive 3 versions of logo animations so that we can choose from them. Our project price included 1 round of revision (each additional revision will be paid separately). Once the offer is sent by us and accepted on your side, we will send you our logo, corporate brand, and formats of logo animations needed.\r\n\r\nSome logo animations for inspiration: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1tj7Y3PR16s (#5, 9, 10, 13, 18, 20, 36)\r\n\r\nPLEASE NOTE: THIS IS AN INDEPENDENT CONTRACTOR PROJECT. ACCEPTANCE OF THIS PROJECT IN NO WAY CONSISTUTES OR IMPLIES ANY TYPE OF EMPLOYMENT RELATIONSHIP BETWEEN YOU (CONTRACTOR) AND TEMPESTA MEDIA (THE COMPANY).','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1627756534506401793?success','-',7,'United States','Michigan City',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-02-20',1,'2023-02-20',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-20 19:48:54',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
