(10454,'Infographic Designer For Skincare Brand',2,'We are looking for a talented graphic designer/illustrator to create infographics for skincare articles, blogs and guides.\r\n\r\nWe will provide all the necessary text, statistics and direction for each infographic. But you must be able to come up with professional, artistic and minimalistic ideas that match our existing brand guidelines.\r\n\r\nThis task will be for one article so we can get a feel for your personal style and estimated rate per article.\r\n\r\nThere is opportunity for this project to turn into long-term work. We estimate creating 40-60 educational articles over the next year with roughly 2-5 graphics per article.\r\n\r\nWe are seeking an art style that is intelligent, scientific and professional, but still engaging, friendly and interesting to look at. We are a premium skincare brand that sells scientifically advanced skincare treatments. Our infographics need to provide a feeling of trust and authority without being overly scientific or detailed.\r\n\r\nPlease view the infographics attached below for more context of what we are looking for.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1627770346912825345?success','-',7,'United States','Philadelphia',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-02-20',1,'2023-02-20',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-20 20:42:10',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
