(10495,'Wix Website Redesign',4,'Our rental company is looking to have our Wix Website redesigned. We initially put together the website over the course of a few days to begin advertising with the intent of having a professional give it a front end design for appeal and usability.\r\n\r\nCurrently, I have not opted in to use Wix’s booking forms because I did not find them to be very effective at managing rentals. If you disagree with this, I am open to using this feature however I am fine using a contact form with automated emails for our rentals.\r\n\r\nThe most important features are a visually professional home page that directs customers to an input form. You’ll notice that we currently have a contact us form in addition to a page that clarifies the different types of rentals we offer. These are controlled via Wix’s content manager, again I think this is the easiest way to control the website via a database but if you recommend an alternative I would be open to seeing your previous projects.\r\n\r\nThe other important page is the product spec page clarifying prices and terms of the rentals.\r\n\r\nCurrently the site functions for desktop but it has not been optimized for mobile. This will need to be included in the redesign. Other ongoing concerns are that google ranks the site as being slow to load. Please include if this is something you can address within the scope of this redesign.\r\n\r\nThe current website can be found here:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.reliablebooths.com/\r\n\r\nThe graphic assets were obtained through Canva, this is acceptable to continue.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1627792556533104641','-',7,'United States','Beaverton',450.000,'fixed',450.000,'2023-02-20',1,'2023-02-20',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-20 22:10:25',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
