(10547,'PowerPoint Design and Development',11,'roject Overview: Ongoing project work to be completed within 3-6 months. Develop professional standardized training materials to be used nationally in developing supervisory personnel for our client. Our customer expects to have correct technical content in a professionally produced PPT format.\r\n\r\n\r\nScope: We are seeking forty-two PowerPoint training presentations totaling approximately 3,200 slides. Twenty-one presentations will be branded under one logo/company, and the other twenty-one (similar presentations and content) under another logo/company. Each training presentation will cover one topic area.\r\n\r\n\r\nOur Job: Create PowerPoint presentations utilizing the design templates and Word files with the bullet points and related graphics we provide. The developer can establish the PPT messages with pleasing aesthetics and visual flow as needed. (Sample files are attached)\r\n\r\n\r\nYour Job: Add the bullet points and images we supply in a Word document to our PowerPoint design presentation templates. We encourage you to enhance our design templates and image ideas to create a more robust training message.\r\n\r\n\r\nFormat: The overall design needs to remain consistent throughout the entire presentation. The headers, bullet points, and graphics should be in the same place on every page and should transition smoothly to the next slide. Only use one font throughout the presentation; if too much information is on one slide, an additional slide should be added to break up the data. Left align bullet points.\r\n\r\n\r\nBudget: We have an $11-15-an-hour budget for this project, not to exceed 120 hours (approximately .41 to .56 cents a slide). We will pay per PowerPoint presentation as completed.\r\nAttachments','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2025311','-',7,'United States','-',2500.000,'fixed',3000.000,'2023-02-21',1,'2023-02-21',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-21 14:38:23',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
