(10595,'High-end Branding & Logo Design Needed',2,'I own Niche\' websites in various verticals, I create content sites & monetize through Ads & Affiliate offers. I recently purchased a domain from a defunct publication in the recreational boating niche. The publisher sold me the domain but they own a trademark to a portion of the actual domain name, luckily not the whole domain.\r\n\r\nThis magazine has a 100 Yr history & was sold in book stores like Barnes & Noble. I need a creative logo that can be used on the site that is recognizeable but different than the original.\r\n\r\nThis company is already a known brand in the boating industry so I want to take advantage of that without crossing the line of the old Trademark.\r\n\r\nI want this site to be a brand as I will be getting into merch such as clothing, gear, etc. Once the initial (Main Logo) is created for the website & all SM accounts, I want to have variations of the Logo for various Merch, let\'s use www.saltlife.com as an example of doing the same logo 100 different ways.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for someone that can bring creativity & an eye for what\'s Hot & New, thanks for your time!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01502f9526e11d2648','-',7,'United States','Eden Prairie',150.000,'perhour',55.000,'2023-02-21',1,'2023-02-21',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-21 16:47:28',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
(10596,'Build Single Product Shopify Website',3,'I\'m launching an Olive Oil E-Commerce brand based in New York on April 1st. Website is due the week before for Pre-Sale.\r\n\r\nWebsite Due Date: March 24th\r\n\r\nI need you to build:\r\n1. Shopify Website: 1 Product Store (2 Bottle Sizes)\r\n2. Customized Mobile Landing Page\r\n\r\nI will provide you clear deliverables and expect on-time delivery & quick response-time.\r\n\r\nI can understand HTML / CSS and make edits in Shopify, but have limited experience building.\r\n\r\nI am the direct point of communication for you and here whenever you have questions.\r\n\r\nThe website will be developed in stages and will require additional features after April 1st. There is always opportunity for additional work.\r\n\r\nLooking for simple and luxurious, yet informative if the customer wants to learn.\r\n\r\nHere is a comparable website: https://www.gucci.com/us/en/\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628074395000782849?success','-',7,'United States','Syosset',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-21',1,'2023-02-21',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-21 16:50:19',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
