(10599,'Senior Brand Designer & UX/UI - long-term employment',2,'Are you creative? Are you passionate about what you do? Would you like to work with others who share your passion?\r\n\r\nWe are currently looking for a FULL-TIME Senior Brand Designer & UX/UI to join our team remotely and help us grow.\r\n\r\nBut before you jump aboard for an adventure, we would warn you that we sail in some pretty big oceans. So our able-bodied designers should:\r\n\r\n• Have a great portfolio that shows you know the ropes\r\n• Be filled with energy and enthusiasm\r\n• Be ready to work on their own initiative, and be capable of managing projects effectively\r\n• Understand that it’s not about thinking outside the box – because there is no box\r\n• Be ready to play as a team – a ship only sails as well as its crew allows\r\n        \r\nWe are budgeting a monthly salary of $1,500 - $1,800 for the right candidate based on three main pillars:\r\n\r\n1. Character and attitude\r\n2. Skillset and Quality\r\n3. Experience\r\n\r\nInterested? Great! Let’s get to the technical stuff.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~014e660d3a9818537c','-',7,'United States','San Gwann',1800.000,'fixed',1800.000,'2023-02-21',1,'2023-02-21',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-21 17:09:04',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
(10600,'Claims Processing and Member Support - Healthcare Startup',21,'We’re looking for a Claims Support Associate to help process healthcare claims submitted by Garner members. In this role, you’ll become an expert on Garner’s claims system and work with members (via chat, email, and phone) to ensure their claims are processed quickly and accurately. \r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will be detail-oriented, comfortable working with numbers, a strong written communicator (via chat and email), and passionate about providing quality customer service and helping people solve their problems.\r\n\r\nThis position is 40 hours/week and Claims Support Associates are expected to be online during regular working hours. This is a fully remote position.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities will include:\r\n\r\n-Managing the end-to-end processing of healthcare claims submitted by Garner members\r\n-Reviewing documentation, determining reimbursement eligibility, and processing payments\r\n-Following up with members for additional details needed to process their claims and offering member support via chat, email, and phone\r\n-Supporting the Garner frontline customer service team to answer incoming member questions related to claims processing\r\n-Responding to inquiries in a timely and professional manner\r\n-Providing feedback on claims operations and technology to Garner’s internal teams \r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate has:\r\n-A bachelor’s degree\r\n-A high level of attention to detail, process orientation, focus, organization, and resourcefulness\r\n-An affinity for working with numbers\r\n-Excellent written and verbal communication skills\r\n-A passion for working with people to solve their problems, with an ability to think creatively and empathetically and stay calm under pressure\r\n-A desire to work in a dynamic, fast-paced environment, and a willingness to “roll up your sleeves” to get things done\r\n-A desire to be a part of our mission to improve the US healthcare system\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nless\r\nMore/Less about\r\nView job posting\r\nEntry,\r\nExperience Level\r\n$20.00 -$24.00','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628080418390425601','-',7,'United States','-',22.000,'perhour',17.000,'2023-02-21',1,'2023-02-21',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-21 17:14:23',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(10601,'PAID Audiobook audition. FEMALE VOICE',2,'Hello,\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nI am Mike Way, author of the recently published clean Christian Romance novel, A Simple Act of Kindness. I am looking to eventually produce an ACX audiobook version by a passionate reader who instinctively knows how to interpret emotion as needed in reading. The novel is 100K words at 400 pages. I seek a strong yet feminine female voice that delivers multiple characters’ emotions and various intonation speech styles.\r\n\r\n\r\nBecause the main protagonist is a woman in her early to mid 20\'s ONLY FEMALE VOICES will be considered.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTHIS GIG IS FOR A PAID AUDITION:  Please provide a quote to perform a sample chapter of 1500 words as an audition.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nLook at one of the review links below, and if the book suits your interest and taste, something you\'d enjoy, please reach out.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2025340','-',7,'United States','abc',0.000,'fixed',0.000,'2023-02-21',1,'2023-02-21',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-21 17:14:52',NULL,4,1,NULL,152),
