(10681,'Squarespace SEO Expertise',18,'This request is for someone expert in how Squarespace websites are organized and practical approaches to bring it to the top of Google searches.  We are leaders in residential outdoor landscape design and build services, with over twenty awards during the past fifteen years.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWe have three websites that interact with each other.  The project will be done for a fixed fee with a maximum estimate before and after SEO performance ratings, and we would like to ask you to provide positive evidence from your work.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThis initial task will be for one of the websites. If we work well together, we can extend work to the other sites and consider your help with periodic reviews and adjustments. You’ll be able to understand the context of our websites and identify approaches to increase traffic.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBased on their SEO strength, we expect a ranked order of terms or words to use in original website text content. You will also offer a periodic performance scorecard to track our relative monthly strength increases/decreases for ongoing adjustments.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWe require vertical market experience, so please be prepared to show that you\'ve used your practical experience in climate change, nature conservation, outdoor living, landscape design, pollinator gardens, subject matter, and word-of-mouth programs.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCould you show us how your work has generated organic growth for other brands? Could you provide a list of questions we need to be answered to deliver the cost estimate?\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThank you for considering our needs as we bring the beauty of the outdoors to homeowners.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2025400','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-02-21',1,'2023-02-21',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-21 21:56:07',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
