(10683,'Logo Design, color and font --MARINE ROOM---',10,'Create a logo for a new Mediterranean restaurant -- MARINE ROOM --\r\nAdd colors and other font for website that are complementary. The dark green is one of our colors. We just need a complimentary font that will work with Wordpress.\r\n\r\nI will provide some examples of previous logo that we liked but we have to use different name (attached). Think south of Italy, Greece, marine, ocean, nautical but also a fun party and celebration of life.\r\n\r\nMARINE ROOM\r\nThe dining philosophy of this Mediterranean, ocean-inspired fine dining restaurant is centered on the idea of celebrating life and dining as an experience. It seeks to create a unique and memorable atmosphere through architecture, food, service, music, lighting, and ambiance. The focus is to bring people together at the same table through the celebration of culinary art. Dishes are crafted to stimulate the senses with delicate aromas, bold flavors, vibrant colors and textural contrasts. The ultimate goal is to provide guests with a gastronomic journey that is both indulgent and memorable.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628152182687412225?success','-',7,'United States','Providenciales',400.000,'fixed',400.000,'2023-02-21',1,'2023-02-21',1,'Fixed Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-21 21:59:19',NULL,9,3,NULL,140),
(10684,'Web design for nutritional supplement brand',3,'Hi! We are a new brand, specialized in Nutrition, looking to develop our first website. We currently have only two products in our portfolio, but we are building on it, so the structure needs to allow us to add new products while mantaining the same structure.\r\nWe are looking for a modern, clean, informative website that transmits professionalism and quality.\r\nSome references from similar brands (with many more products than us):\r\n- https://www.medtrition.com/\r\n- https://www.idipharma.com/\r\n- https://brudylab.net/publica/\r\n- https://nutrition-care.de/en/\r\n\r\nFrom a structure perspective we have in mind a simple \"About Us\" section, but the focus of the web is on the Products, nutritional information, facts, scientific literature, claims, etc etc etc\r\n\r\nRegarding deliverables, after we agreed on a budget, we\'ll need a mockup to give feedback and then you can proceed with the web development. Ideally, the site should be built on Wix platform (or similar).\r\n\r\nPls let me know if you have any questions\r\nThanks!\r\nG','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628152296564334593?success','-',7,'United States','Panama',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-21',1,'2023-02-21',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-21 22:00:03',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
