(10688,'Shopify Design for a cake e-commerce',16,'I\'m looking for an expert, creative Shopify designer with an excellent eye for design to set up and design the Online Store for a Miami-based online cake shop. You will work directly with me on this. I need a first draft for Monday, February 27th. So far, the store only has a login.\r\n\r\nScope of Work:\r\n* Set up the Shopify theme (I will provide the selection)\r\n* Create initial product listings (10-15 cakes)\r\n* Create the following menu items/pages:\r\nHOMEPAGE (hide this from the navigation bar)\r\nSHOP (create a dropdown for ALL, BEST SELLERS, and OUR FAVORITES)\r\nABOUT\r\nLOCATION\r\nCONTACT (add contact form)\r\nFAQ (hide this from the navigation bar)\r\n\r\nThe homepage must definitely have: 4 starred products \"best sellers\", what makes them special, location, customer reviews (I will provide these), and an Instagram feed. I\'m open to suggestions!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628061232745021441','Victoria-Shopify Design for a cake e-commerce-Crystal',36,'United States','Miami',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-21',1,'2023-02-21',NULL,'Hourly project',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-02-21 22:05:07','2023-02-28 21:10:44',5,3,NULL,128),
