(10707,'PitchDeck for Fintech Startup',11,'The job is to build 2 versions of Pitch deck for us. We will provide a long detailed presentation of the company, product, business plan to the contractor. The presentation will include some competitors and how they have built their UI. We will also provide the contractor with some use case scenarios for him to build. The selected contractor will use this presentation along with his own research in the domain to come up with a clear, succinct and poignant pitch deck of about 20 to 22 pages (long version).\r\n\r\nOnce the long version is completed, we will work with the contractor to reduce it to the short version of 8 to 10 pages max. This short version is intended to make the audience want more. So it will lack critical details.\r\n\r\nIn addition, there will be one presentation with user use case scenarios. These will include custom design graphic and animations or video illustrations.\r\n\r\nAt the end of the project, we expect 4 deliverables: Long version pitch deck, short version pitch deck, user use case deck and all the files including raw files.\r\nPayments will be progressive and based on milestones with $100.00 up front payment at signing of the contract.\r\nWe expect the project to be completed with 4 weeks time frame.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628168420623659009?success','-',7,'United States','Santa Clara',1000.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-02-21',1,'2023-02-21',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-21 23:04:16',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
(10708,'Professional User-Friendly E-Commerce Web Design',3,'We are looking to make more than just a basic website. We are looking for high-quality e-commerce platform with clear user friendly interface with intuitive haptics. Here are some examples of our competitors we are looking to emulate in terms of design and haptics: leanorb.com, justwater.com .\r\n\r\nWe currently have 1 wordpress domain greentekplanet.com and 1 shopify domain theearthstraw.com which we need to combine/link for shopping capabilities.\r\n\r\nBuiliding Attractive wireframes are a first step, then improved User Interface. We will provide as much content as possible to make this work, along with branding guidelines and themes.\r\n\r\nWe will also want an intuitive landing page to help funnel customer engagement.\r\n\r\nSEO and Keywords are a future considerations as well. Fullstack/wordpress is a plus,\r\n\r\nPlease also see our Site map and layout draft attached','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628169836815187969?success','-',7,'United States','Long Beach',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-02-21',1,'2023-02-21',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-21 23:09:22',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
