(10710,'Brand Package Designer',2,'Job Summary:\r\nI am looking for a highly creative and skilled Brand Package Designer to help me create a main brand icon/character for my expanding restaurant business. As the owner of a Jamaican food restaurant, I am planning to open different styles of restaurants, including a wings restaurant and a smoothie place, and I need a main brand persona that will be the face of all my restaurants. A great example of what I’m talking about is Papa Louie’s video game series - I am looking for someone to design this Papa Louie type of character for me and the branding around it. The ideal candidate should have experience in creating brand characters and designing a complete brand package around them.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n* Develop a main brand icon/character that reflects our brand\'s personality and values.\r\n* Create a brand package that includes logo design, color scheme, typography, and other visual elements that will be used across all our restaurants and merchandise.\r\n* Design marketing materials such as advertisements, brochures, menus, and signage that promote our brand\'s persona and values.\r\n\r\nPlease provide:\r\n* A strong portfolio that showcases your design skills and previous work on brand characters and brand packages.\r\n\r\nBonus points:\r\n* Experience in designing packaging for food and beverage products.\r\n* Experience in designing merchandise and toys.\r\n\r\nIf you are a creative and skilled designer with a passion for creating brand personas and packages, I would love to hear from you. Please include your portfolio of previous work.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628301901174931457','-',7,'United States','Irvine',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 08:01:30',NULL,7,3,NULL,155),
(10711,'PowerPoint Masterslide Designing',11,'Hello PowerPoint Experts!\r\nWe, Mispa Technologies, an IT service provider, looking PowerPoint experts with good branding spirit in their blood. You have to deliver master slides for our PowerPoint templates that match our branding (color, logo, and fonts) contain different slides including introduction and section slides with animation and some illustrations.\r\n\r\nAs an IT service provider, these slides will be used for presenting the service portfolio and for sales presentations. This means the slides should have a good, authentic business look and feel.\r\nYour expertise will be used to refresh our branding in other areas later.\r\n\r\nI look forward to seeing your proposals along with your previous masterslide samples to make a final decision.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nJiju M','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628308557282123777','-',7,'United States','Langenfeld',60.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 08:33:12',NULL,7,3,NULL,155),
