(10714,'Videogame concept artist needed for scenario',2,'Looking for concept artist to define overall scenario of old Indian city for a videogame under development, plus some details of the streets.\r\nArtist must respect historic and architectural guidelines provided.\r\nShort briefing about the videogame/scene will be provided.\r\n\r\nJob is divided into two:\r\n\r\n1. Design overall look of the whole city based on historical map and document. This will set the color tones and look for our 3D artists to implement. Includes church, houses, commerce building, fort, city walls and bridge. (3-4 illustrations)\r\n\r\n2. Design (3-4 illustrations) of city-level detail of the streets, including house/shack with patio, streets, bridge, streets with city wall. All in nightscene.\r\n\r\nAttached is the architectural document. Videogame scene idea will be provided after job sign.\r\n\r\nFeel free to bid. Budget is merely indicative.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628339844275044353','-',7,'United States','Funchal',350.000,'fixed',350.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 10:37:55',NULL,7,3,NULL,155),
