(10716,'Logo Creation',10,'We are a small family owned Dumpster Rental company looking to update our logo. I know what I want it to be like and how I want it to look, Just need someone to bring my vision to life!\r\n\r\nThe company name is Done Rite Hauling\r\nCompany Colors: Blue & Yellow\r\n\r\nI want the logo to be big letter saying DRH and underneath It saying Done Rite Hauling then under that our slogan that says \"Need it hauled? Have it done rite!\"\r\n\r\nDRH\r\nDone Rite Hauling\r\nNeed it Hauled? Have it Done Rite!\r\n\r\nThe slogan I want smaller to fit under the company name.\r\n\r\nI was also thinking of adding our cartoon small next to the DRH on the left and right side of it, we have a couple cartoons I can provide','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~013b22092503c37da7','-',7,'United States','Seminole',48.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 11:07:48',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
(10717,'Logo Design for New Dermatology Practice',10,'I need a few unique logo designs (ideally 2-3 versions) for a new dermatology company. There\'s s few examples that we like that I can share for inspiration as well as an overall direction for the color palette we\'re thinking.\r\n\r\nLooking for a modern/timeless design and someone who thinks outside the box. The name of the company will be Solstice Dermatology, so we\'d like to tie in the theme of the sun or a modern representation of a sun into the logo. The dermatologist really likes the conceptual idea of the sun and changing of seasons in a person\'s life, which I think can give more meaning to the overall branding.\r\n\r\nWe really like the idea of using a cobalt blue with a gold for the color palette with gray tones and white as secondary colors.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ed166ffbe7bd5379','-',7,'United States','Ridgeland',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 11:16:09',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
