(10729,'Home health Intake coordinator/Insurance verification, eligibility, authorization',22,'The Intake coordinator/Insurance Verification and Eligibility Specialist is an administrative support position that is considered the front line of the revenue cycle process when a patient is in need of care and they need to start the insurance verification process.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities\r\n\r\n● Obtains authorization from payer for services ordered/requested for prospects/referrals in a timely manner.\r\n● Documents specific details related to authorization including effective and end dates using the appropriate systems.\r\n● Contacts practices to complete enrollment and/or obtain the correct insurance information.\r\n● Contacts patients to obtain information necessary to complete enrollment or verity insurance.\r\n● Contacts various insurance companies to obtain insurance benefit details.\r\n● Contacts primary or secondary insurance companies to verify eligibility and/or coverage.\r\n● Completes chart audits.\r\n● Adheres to confidentiality and HIPAA compliance standards.\r\n● Complies with all company policies and procedures.\r\n● Demonstrates high level of time management and efficiency.\r\n● Assists with performing billing functions and collections as needed.\r\n● Performs other duties as assigned. Experience\r\n● 1-3 years of relevant experience in an office setting, preferably in a doctor’s office or hospital.\r\n● Prior authorization experience required.\r\n● Proficient computer skills and ability to operate general office equipment.\r\n● Familiar with insurances and billing policies and procedures.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628404782095990785','-',7,'United States','-',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 14:43:07',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
