(10750,'Experienced Premium Press theme mods.',15,'Feb 22, 2023, 01:35 GMT+8\r\n\r\nI have a list of modifications needed to my dating site.  I want to do these mods one at a time to eliminate confusion. I have aprox. 10 mods needed in total.\r\n\r\n1st mod:  The idea behind this mod is to only display the profiles that match the gender seeking gender that was selected at sign up. If the user selected they are a \"female seeking male\" then, only \"males seeking females\" profiles will be displayed anytime profiles are listed. Search results, featured profiles etc.... If the user isn\'t signed in and those variables \"female seeking male\" are nul, a simple ajax opens allowing them to select what gender they are and what gender they are seeking, to assign the variable.\r\n\r\nTo outline, we don\'t want the user to be able to change in search what gender they are seeking and see profiles that don\'t match their signup gender seeking gender. We want the MySQL search string to auto assign the gender seeking gender from the selection that the user made at signup. The only options could be: man seeking woman, man seeking man, woman seeking man, woman seeking woman.\r\n\r\nIf you need further clarification please ask. \r\n\r\nRegards,Jim','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2025536','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 15:33:22',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
