(10766,'Assistant with experience in both business and personal organization',22,'Hi! My name is Kai and I am a solo practitioner psychologist with ADHD and chronic pain. I\'m struggling with managing my small private practice and requests I get as an independent contractor. I also struggle with keeping up with bills when sent to me through different means (paper vs email) and aren\'t on automatic payment. I am looking for someone who can hopefully manage a mix of business and personal tasks. I know I\'m kind of asking for a unicorn but I can dream right? I want someone who is personable, trustworthy, organized, responsible, and good with making organization systems, has experience handling sensitive records and has knowledge of HIPPA laws.\r\nWould like someone who is interested in long-term part-time work; ideally, the person would stay with me for a long time.\r\n\r\nMost of the work would be:\r\nAnswering any texts and calls, managing messages that come through EHR system and business email/mail/text/voicemails\r\nCall/text/email any clients or others when necessary.\r\nSending and checking that client paperwork is received\r\nManaging calendar integration\r\nManaging appointment requests\r\nCreation/Editing of business forms\r\nCreation of payment plans on Square when necessary\r\nAt some point manage some marketing things.\r\n\r\nPersonal:\r\nMaking medical appointments when needed\r\nHelp organizing medical bills\r\nPaying medical bills\r\nSubmitting information to health plan when necessary\r\nFiling (if necessary and person is available for in-person hours once a month, extra pay)\r\n\r\nPreferred Qualities/Experience:\r\nMental Health field experience\r\nExcellent writing and speaking skills in English and Spanish\r\nKnowledge of Excel/Word/Goggle work space\r\nMarketing/SEO and social media management (within next 3-6 months).\r\n\r\nIn terms of payment, it would depend on experience and the amount of tasks that can be handled. You would be an independent contractor. No benefits available. Flexible schedule and may need to work from 5-10 hrs a week with the potential to work more.\r\n\r\nHoping to make a great working connection! Thanks for reading.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628423592599777281','-',7,'United States','-',20.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 15:59:13',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
