(10799,'ADHD & Mental Health Writers Needed - $400/Article',37,'ABOUT US:\r\nFrida is focused on improving mental health and happiness through education, diagnosis and treatment. Frida is changing the lives of Canadian patients with easier access to adult ADHD diagnosis, and fast and affordable treatment.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about us and better understand our brand, please visit our website at talkwithfrida.com\r\n\r\n \r\nOUR NEEDS\r\nWe are looking for 1-3 creators to write informative, original content about ADHD.\r\n\r\n You will produce content that helps people with adult ADHD and other mental health issues (a) better understand their illness, (b) begin to understand treatment options, and (c) understand why our new offering might be the solution for them.\r\n\r\nThe goal is to build the highest quality library of mental health content in Canada that meaningfully helps our users improve their lives while also enabling SEO-driven acquisition.\r\n\r\n  This content will primarily target women (22-50 age range) and will be written in a conversational tone.\r\n\r\n\r\nRESPONSIBILITIES\r\n- Write original copy for 1-4 articles per month.\r\n- Work in a timely and collaborative manner with Frida staff, communicating responsibly.\r\n- Spell-checking, grammar-checking, and fact-checking articles before submitting them for review.\r\n- Fixing articles that have edit requests after review.\r\n\r\n\r\nSKILLS REQUIRED:\r\n- Proficiency in writing in English.\r\n- In-depth knowledge of ADHD and related conditions, including diagnosis and treatment. Medical backgrounds preferred.\r\n- Established experience in writing/communications\r\n- Ability to research unfamiliar topics and write from an empowering perspective.\r\n\r\n\r\nPAYMENT: $400 per accepted article (1500-2000 words)\r\n\r\n\r\nNEXT STEPS:\r\nIf you’re interested in this project and feel you meet the requirements, please submit your resume and writing samples.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to reading over your application! :)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628441452852256769','-',7,'United States','Kingston',4000.000,'fixed',4000.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 17:09:38',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
