(10806,'I need a creative web designer and dev.',3,'Hi Web developers,\r\n\r\nI need a professional and creative web developer or a team of developers to work for my personal portfolio website. You have to develop the website using custom coding . You can basically use any technology or language but not any website builder like wordpress. So basically the site will have 5-6 pages. Don\'t consider it as an usual portfolio website. We will need tons of animations and a very modern site. So you have to be creative and skillful .  \r\n\r\nI will provide you the color scheme and other details later on. If you can show me the design in figma first then develop, it would be better. Our main focus is on animation and creativity so the site can stand out from the crowd. I am leaving some of the inspiring websites I like.You have to make something similar like them. PLease drop the works you have done so far. And its a static website... so our main concern is only the frontend and the animations. So put your best animations website in your proposal. Start the proposal writing \" Creative\" so i can know that you have  gone throiugh the description. Cheers !\r\n\r\nDeadline: 29th February\r\n\r\nExample sites :\r\n\r\nhttps://kuon.space/#reile\r\n\r\nhttps://prashantsani.com/\r\nhttps://strakzat.com/\r\n\r\nhttps://www.halo-lab.com/\r\n\r\nhttps://tamalsen.dev/','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2025899','-',7,'United States','na',0.000,'fixed',0.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 17:40:15',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(10807,'Wix Website Designer for Female Fitness Trainer',4,'We are looking for an experienced Wix web designer to create a simple, yet astonishing website for a female fitness trainer: @natalieheso.\r\n\r\nThe website will need to be composed of the following pages:\r\n\r\n- Home page (General Info + quick links to other pages)\r\n- App (Info + Signup + Download)\r\n- Blog Post (Two main categories)\r\n- Consultation ( Info + Booking system)\r\n- Shop (Amazon storefront integration)\r\n- About (Personal information + Contact for collabs)\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a clean and minimalist design. Examples will be provided but we require creativity and initiative from the designer.\r\n\r\nGood communication is mandatory. We will have regular video meetings where we can clearly communicate our needs and provide feedback.\r\n\r\nPlease have a look at the example websites to know if this is your design style:\r\n\r\nhttps://joinform.co/\r\nhttps://www.getfitwithsav.com/\r\n\r\nWe are looking forward to your application!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628451291212759041','-',7,'United States','EDINBURGH',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 17:48:18',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
