(10814,'Create an Animation for Our Company Logo',8,'I work at Samaya AI and our company logo has an icon. It is a blue circle with a \"s\" and dot inside it (image attached). We would like to turn our icon into an animation. The details are as follow:\r\n\r\n--- start to animation is our icon (blue circle, \"s\" with dot underneath)\r\n--- during animation blue circle and dot stay still\r\n--- the \"s\" rotates around a vertical axis. Imagine a vertical line down the center of the \"s\" from top to bottom and it turns around that axis\r\n--- when it has turned 90 degrees, it\'s just visible as a straight line and the other 90 degrees of rotation turn it into a question mark\r\n--- this should be able to repeat on a loop\r\n\r\nThere is a drawing attached to this job description to help describe our thoughts.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628461765892673537?success','-',7,'United States','Mountain View',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 18:30:04',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
(10815,'Humm - Poster',2,'11\" x 17\" poster to be located at the Humm Kombucha Taproom.\r\n\r\nPlease use the final Strictly Organic \"Partner Poster\" PAGE 2 as the basis. Then, a few changes:\r\n\r\n* Replace \"Strictly Organic\" with \"Humm\"\r\n* Replace \" Save Money\" \"& Cut Carbon\" with these 3 lines: \"Shrink Your Bill\", \"Rethink Your Impact\", \"Drink More Kombucha!\"\r\n* incorporate Humm logo and QR Code (attached)\r\n* revise to say \"You no longer have to install solar panels or own a home to enjoy the benefits of solar energy - just sign up and save. As a thank you, receive a $40 Humm Taproom gift card!\r\n* remove: \"- that\'s over $300/year for the average LMI subscriber!\"\r\n* revise to read: \"Signing up is fast and easy:\"\r\n* URL is: www.oregonshines.com/humm. Please make font a little larger\r\n* replace coffee cup with attached \"Humm Image\"\r\n\r\nThanks so much, Azusa - I look forward to reviewing your draft!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628461988211757057','-',7,'United States','Greensboro',75.000,'Open this select menu',48.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 18:30:17',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
