(10820,'I need an excellent book cover designer to adjust a PDF cover template',2,'I have a book cover that was designed for Lightning source cover template for a 6.14 x 9.21 hardcover.\r\n\r\nThe original designer is not reachable so I do NOT have the original adobe files. I do have the production PDF. I need to adjust the existing cover to fit a 6 x 9 trade paperback print template.\r\n\r\nI will be submitting this to KDP and (potentially) Lulupress.\r\n\r\nThe job: use the existing PDF design adjusted for the correct 6 x 9 trade paper back. I will need it set up for print with both printing companies and provide any adjustments to the file of they are rejected by KDP or Lulu.\r\n\r\nI will supply the correct cover templates once you are selected.\r\n\r\nAnd learning my previous lesson I will require the completed print ready PDF AND the adobe or Affinity files used to create it.\r\n\r\nWhat will you charge to adjust this cover in the new paperback cover templates and what is your turn around time for completion?','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628465581702680577?success','-',7,'United States','Commerce City',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 18:45:13',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
