(10824,'Logo Design - Creative and Fast',10,'We are a group that creates multiple businesses to meet consumer needs - As such, we need a logo for our newest website. While we want it to be professional we do not want to spend weeks designing it. Therefore we need a highly skilled designer who is also innovative and creative. We need you to take the lead in creating the ideas rather than us feeding you examples to copy. This is an overview of the company: Overview\r\n=========\r\nCOMPANY NAME: BrainChain AI\r\n\r\nBrainChain AI is a leading developer of cutting-edge artificial intelligence systems specializing in analyzing global supply chains. Our mission is to identify disruptions and mitigate the worst effects of supply-demand mismatches. At BrainChain AI, we are constantly striving to innovate and push the boundaries of what is possible in the field of AI and machine learning.\r\n\r\nOur team of AI and machine learning researchers comprises some of the brightest minds in the industry. They work closely with our execution platform, which comprises experienced supply chain and sourcing professionals, to dramatically reduce the time it takes from gap discovery to mitigation. By combining the expertise of our researchers with the real-world experience of our supply chain professionals, we can deliver solutions that are both innovative and practical.\r\n\r\nAt BrainChain AI, we are committed to staying on the cutting edge of emerging technologies. We scan the world\'s public data on a near-real-time basis, leveraging natural language processing, language modeling, and time series forecasting to power our AI systems. Our data sources include news, blogs, government regulations, financial markets, and commodity reports. This enables us to stay ahead of the curve and identify and capture weak supply chain signals.\r\n\r\nBrainChain AI has the expertise and technology to succeed. Join us and join our team in shaping the future of supply chain management with our innovative AI solutions.\r\n\r\nIndustry\r\nTechnology, Information, and Internet\r\n\r\nATTACHED is an image to inspire','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628468580541960193','-',7,'United States','Queens, NY',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 18:56:46',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
