(10843,'Unlayer Email Design Work',20,'We have designed customer templates in Unlayer for previous project work and now need someone to replicate those designs to create the remaining emails for two large projects. In total, we need roughly 35 emails created.\r\n\r\nYour job will be to user our existing HTML designs in Unlayer and create new emails for specific topics and targeted products. You will follow the general design the customer uses (along with their branding and links. We will provide the text so you can update each email with the words, color updates to compliment the content, new images (you find from the brand website, Canva, or generate from AI), videos/GIF\'s (from the brand website, Canva, or generate from AI). This will require that you do some external; research on brand websites (such as Virgin Voyages, Kensington Tours, etc.) to find relevant content to support the provided text.\r\n\r\nWe would like this work done as soon as possible. Native English speakers only please.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628479641181655041?success','-',7,'United States','Highlands Ranch',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 19:40:24',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
