(10848,'Website Designer Needed',4,'Thank you for looking at this project. I have tried, at length, to detail the proposed project scope, so that there is no misunderstanding or miscommunication and we both can start out on the same page:\r\n\r\n- Redesign of entire website dolphinacademicprep.com\r\n- Ensure that daptutor.com, daptutor.net, daptutor.org (parked domains) are all optimized and all point to the site (no additional content will be on these sites).\r\n- Migration of all content- perhaps needing of additional \"free market\" images\r\n- ONsite SEO optimization (goal is get better traction)\r\n- Ensure site is optimized for mobile and tablet devices of all sizes (not a truncated version of the site), as well as on a computer - (Desktop, Mobile & Tablet Compatible)\r\n- Social media integration (Facebook, Twitter, YouTube, Instagram, LinkedIn with the possibility of adding others). Is there a way to automate social media campaigns with content already created? For example: I have a list of words and quotes to share, one a day, and would like there to be a scheduled posting, if possible. I know that if I do it on one, it can be \"mirrored\" on Facebook, Twitter, LinkedIn, and Instagram.\r\n- Ensure that logo appears in searches and google task bar (FAV ICON)\r\n- We like our logo- it just probably needs to be cleaned up some\r\n- Addition of \"Holiday looks\" (banner and/or logo, depending on the look of the site) for (academic calendar) National Holidays (think of Google\'s landing page, but not as frequent of changes, obviously): Election Day, Veteran\'s Day, Thanksgiving, Winter Holidays, Valentine\'s Day, St. Patrick\'s Day, Easter, Memorial Day, President\'s Day, Independence Day, Labor Day, Diwali, New Years, High Holidays (we would obviously assist in the details of what we\'re thinking). Not sure how the \"change\" would occur, each time.\r\n- Creation of \"location based landing pages\" (trying to spread our reach to other\r\ncities/locales in the area). I\'m not sure how this gets accomplished, but I presently have been cloning pages (perhaps not the most efficient way), and then changing the \"city\", including meta-tags, etc.\r\n- Creation of a \"child\" theme, as well for the site, so that when WordPress updates, it doesn\'t knock out the entire site, including our footer (and removing any mention of \"powered by Wordpress\" from the site).\r\n- Inclusion of an engaging and lead capturing \"contact us\" section\r\n- Chat integration\r\n- Integration of \"news\" banner (already on the current website- just needs to be dynamic and updated)\r\n- Utilization of Google Analytics and Sitemap, a backup program for the site (currently Undraft Plus), and some sort of security/antivirus (currently Wordfence)\r\n- Assist with helping me learn how to make changes/additions as new content arises (there will always be something new to add/subtract, update, etc)\r\n- Web Portal with Sign in (access only granted to those that are approved), with username/email password entry (Account Log in Area), and around 6 forms that can be filled out/signed online. We\'d want it to be secure as there will be sensitive information transmitted. We\'d either want the ability for it to be emailed to us (when completed) or stored on the site, for us to download/print- not sure how this can work. This would obviously entail a \"sign in\" section on the website requiring a username and password which we\'ll call a \"portal\". We\'d like to be able to approve anyone who tries to sign up, prior to them being able to access the \"portal\". It would be great if we could upload documents to the \"portal\" which in turn emails the specific user, letting them know that something is there for them in the \"portal\". Similarly, if the client uploads something to the \"portal\", WE would get a similar email (the email can simply be a form email).\r\n- Dolphin Academic Prep LLC retains all rights and ownership to the website and all its contents\r\n\r\nWhereas I have ideas of what I\'d like, I am open to your suggestions of what can/should be done to the site. If you see any other opportunities for improvement, and can offer any additional insight, I am certainly open to hearing them. The goal would be to create something dynamic and eye catching, and as unique as possible. I\'d like the site to look different from others in our market, our location, and our industry. I look forward to hearing from you and your thoughts for improving the site.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628482788162695169','-',7,'United States','NYC',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 19:53:21',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
