(10854,'Web designer and wordpress development whizz to improve our current website in short-term project',4,'We\'re looking for someone to elevate our website to make it look more cohesive and professional. We\'re half of the way there, so we need someone to really bring it to life!\r\nIdeally, you\'d be a web designer who could also implement the changes on wordpress (PHP), but if your real strength is one or the other and you feel you\'d be a good fit, please get in touch (as we\'re considering splitting the work into two).\r\n\r\nWe would love to have someone start in the next two weeks, if possible. You\'d be working independently but in collaboration with the Head of Marketing, who will provide brand guidelines (in terms of positioning and ToV) as well as our colour palette - although there is some room for manouver here. We already have a logo so the project would not include this.\r\n\r\nThere is certainly also potential for more work going forward should you wish, but we are open to having a fixed project too dependent on the candidate.\r\n\r\nWe\'d like to hear from people who have a strong portfolio. Here is our website for reference: www.guider-ai.com\r\n\r\nLook forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628486533034229761','-',7,'United States','Kensington',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 20:08:16',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
