(10867,'Wix Website Designer',4,'Hi!\r\n\r\nI am a WiX developer who engineers custom code solutions for WiX websites. I am looking for a Wix Website Designer (focus on the design) to join my team.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- WiX experience 2 years.\r\n- Familiar both classic and Editor X.\r\n- experience with figma.\r\n- sense of design, understanding of UX/UI\r\n\r\nWorkload:\r\nNow 1-2 hours a week. May increase.\r\n\r\nThere will be a short assessment task before hire:\r\nPlease create the component in the dribbble design below in Editor X:\r\nhttps://dribbble.com/shots/13907242-Sign-Up-Form-CreateWithAdobeXD\r\n\r\nThe component does not need to be functional but should be responsive. Partial submissions will also be accepted, please just let me know how long it took you to achieve it.\r\n\r\nPlease start your proposal with \"WIX\" so that I know you read this.\r\n\r\nThanks!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628493021496975361','-',7,'United States','NYC',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 20:33:50',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
