(10906,'I need a creative web designer and dev.',19,'Hi Web developers,\r\n\r\nI need a professional and creative web developer or a team of developers to work for my personal portfolio website. You have to develop the website using custom coding . You can basically use any technology or language but not any website builder like wordpress. So basically the site will have 5-6 pages. Don\'t consider it as an usual portfolio website. We will need tons of animations and a very modern site. So you have to be creative and skillful .  \r\n\r\nI will provide you the color scheme and other details later on. If you can show me the design in figma first then develop, it would be better. Our main focus is on animation and creativity so the site can stand out from the crowd. I am leaving some of the inspiring websites I like.You have to make something similar like them. PLease drop the works you have done so far. And its a static website... so our main concern is only the frontend and the animations. So put your best animations website in your proposal. Start the proposal writing \" Creative\" so i can know that you have  gone throiugh the description. Cheers !\r\n\r\nDeadline: 29th February\r\n\r\nExample sites :\r\n\r\nhttps://kuon.space/#reile\r\n\r\nhttps://prashantsani.com/\r\nhttps://strakzat.com/\r\n\r\nhttps://www.halo-lab.com/\r\n\r\nhttps://tamalsen.dev/','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2025899','-',7,'United States','-',2500.000,'fixed',2500.000,'2023-02-22',1,'2023-02-22',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-22 23:05:58',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
(10907,'Graphic designer needed to create business logo, banner and business cards',2,'I am looking for someone to create 3 logos for my new small business (a rock shop), along with a banner for my website and business card design.\r\n\r\nThe timeline for completing this work is flexible, but ideally within the next month.\r\n\r\nI have a general style that I am looking to achieve, but have zero design skills. I anticipate after an initial discussion, you could work independently with periodic check-ins/revisions (I do not anticipate many needed - I am looking for something simple and understated).\r\n\r\nFor reference, this is a website of a competitor that is close to the look I am going for: https://truthminerals.com/\r\n\r\nThanks for taking the time to look at my job.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628657996480155649','-',7,'United States','00',550.000,'fixed',550.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 07:32:38',NULL,7,3,NULL,155),
(10908,'New Website',4,'Hello,\r\n\r\nWe are a food import and distribution company and we have been using wordpress along with an e-commerce site. We no longer have a need for the e-commerce portion and just want a clean look professional website to say who we are and what we do.\r\n\r\nWe would like to highlight the brands we carry as well. We would also like our catalog to be linked onto the site as well. We are wholesale focused and no longer sell directly to end users. We are fine with using wordpress again or other programs.\r\n\r\nWe also need a person with good English skills and can help with copy writing.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately I cannot put my website here as people are contacting me direct - please note I will only look at those who contact me through this website.\r\n\r\nHere are some examples of what our competition is doing, to give you an idea of what we are looking for:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.svlacosta.com/OurProducts\r\nhttps://dovre.ca/\r\nhttps://www.continentalimporters.ca/\r\n\r\nWe would like to have similar information in 5 tabs:\r\n\r\nHome\r\nAbout\r\nBrands\r\nProducts\r\nPrivate Label Program\r\nContact Us\r\n\r\nPreference will be given to someone who has already worked in the food industry.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628662627735502849','-',7,'United States','Port Coquitlam',2200.000,'fixed',2200.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 07:48:33',NULL,7,3,NULL,155),
(10909,'Company Branding Expert/Agency for IT and Consulting Start-up',2,'Job Description:\r\n\r\nWe are a start-up IT and consulting company seeking a branding expert or agency to help us establish our brand identity. The ideal candidate should have extensive branding experience for startups and a proven track record.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nConduct research to develop a brand strategy that aligns with our business goals and target audience.\r\nCreate a unique brand identity that differentiates us from competitors.\r\nDevelop branding guidelines for consistency across all communication channels.\r\nDesign marketing materials such as business cards, brochures, presentations, and social media posts.\r\nLaunch the brand with a detailed timeline and task list.\r\nProvide ongoing support for brand implementation.\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\n\r\nComprehensive brand strategy document.\r\nUnique brand identity, including logo, tagline, colors, and typography.\r\nBranding guidelines for consistency.\r\nMarketing materials that align with brand identity.\r\nDetailed brand launch plan.\r\nOngoing support for brand implementation.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628667941331468289','-',7,'United States','Riyadh',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 08:09:15',NULL,7,3,NULL,155),
