(10915,'Modify existing logo for website',10,'I have an existing logo which I would like to modify the colours  and make more appropriate for my website.\r\n\r\nAttached is the logo and the new brand colours.\r\n\r\nBelow is a sample page from the website and you will see where it is to be positioned.  I also want a grey scale version for the footer of the website\r\n\r\nhttps://www.builditandprosper.com/1-course-demo-feedback/\r\n\r\nI am looking to have the logo followed by the title of the site \"Build It and Prosper\" or vice versa\r\n\r\nYou will see that it is already styled on the site, but it just doesn\'t look right.\r\n\r\nI have attached a couple of examples of what looks well.  I am not suggesting that you copy these, but I am looking for your creativity, so please inspire me.  \r\n\r\nIf this works out well, there will be ongoing graphic design work.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628708372343898113','Jim J Davidson - Modify the existing logo for the website - Alex',29,'United States','cupar',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'NA',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-02-23 10:50:48','2023-02-28 20:26:26',7,3,NULL,155),
(10916,'Brand / Logo design - cannabis',2,'Need Brand ID/Logo for:  The Phoenix Cannabis Co.\r\n\r\nWe are a high quality / premium cannabis brand (and possibly later a dispensary brand) in Phoenix, AZ. This will be a new brand for us.\r\n\r\nTarget is middle income Male 21-45,  is a heavy cannabis user, appreciates quality, and sees right through BS branding.\r\n\r\nLOGO USAGE:\r\n\r\n- Cannabis Product  (e.g. flower, vapes, edibles, etc). We will have 3 grades of product (good, better, best)… will need the logo to work with packaging to brand each uniquely (eg different color versions of same logo).\r\n\r\n- Our first usage will be for labeling (stickers) applied to Mylar bags containing flower. Later I n the future, the Mylar will be direct printed with brand/packaging graphics.\r\n\r\n- Dispensary Brand (not yet... but this logo/brand ID should translate as dispensary brand in the future)\r\n\r\nThe Phoenix Cannabis Co. is:\r\n- High quality\r\n- Premium\r\n- Potent\r\n- Authentic / real\r\n- Enjoyable and approachable\r\n- \"Cool!”\r\n- local\r\n- merchandisable (brand logo should look good on merch such as tshirts, rolling trays, grinders, etc).\r\n\r\nWhile the Phoenix Cannabis Co. stands for premium, and high quality, it is NOT pretentious or so luxurious that it’s out of reach for our middle income customer. The brand must be approachable to all,, but align with positioning of the finest, strongest, premium, high quality cannabis.\r\n\r\nMandatories:\r\n- DO NOT USE a Phoenix (bird) icon\r\n\r\nTiming:\r\nASAP!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628721686182428673','-',7,'United States','Mount kisco',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 11:44:25',NULL,7,3,NULL,155),
