(10925,'Virtual Medical Assistant fast pace/Health care professional',22,'we want a multi-skilled professional maintaining a friendly attitude with patients and ability to manage the work for one doctor. Professional and healthcare experience as follows; scheduling patients, assisting on follow ups, reviewing faxes, answering HIGH VOLUME phone calls, taking detailed messages and forwarding to appropriate staff members, inputting data into the EMR system (Electronic Medical Record), requesting missing lab results, imaging results and consult notes for upcoming appointments and etc...\r\n\r\nMust answer all questions to apply for the job:\r\n\r\n1. At the top of your message write 2-3 sentences on why you would like this position, and why you qualify for it.\r\n2. Workstation MUST be well equipped with desktop, two monitors and backup internet.\r\n3. Neurologist specialty experience a plus.\r\n\r\na. Number of years experienced in the VIRTUAL medical field?\r\nb. Number of years experienced as VIRTUAL medical assistant?\r\nc. Are you able to answer HIGH VOLUME calls and take detailed messages?\r\nd. Are you familiar with the EMR system (Electronic Medical Record)? if yes, LIST THEM.\r\ne. Familiar with the medical terminology and medications?\r\nf. Are you able to work Pacific Time? Los Angeles time zone, 8:45am-5:45pm - Monday to Friday\r\n\r\nMake sure to follow all the steps above. This is a great job opportunity, I will only look at applicants that really want the job AND THAT REPLY TO QUESTIONS. There will be a video interview required.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628767624682864641','-',7,'United States','-',9.000,'perhour',9.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 14:45:08',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
