(10940,'Shopify Landing Page & Graphic Designer - Gempages',4,'Hello\r\nI am looking for a Shopify landing page designer. You will be using Gempages page builder for most of the tasks.\r\n\r\nYou will be revamping / redesigning the current landing pages that have been existing since 2019 with fresh and new ideas. You should have some knowledge on marketing consumer behavior and how certain things ie Color , Images and also flow of a landing page influence a customers buying decision. Include the word, Indigo, for me to know you read this description. I have some ideas that we can brainstorm together and see if they work. Also i can share some articles that teach you more on this and also you can share your ideas.\r\n\r\nThis task can last up to a month however if you prove your skills and knowledge we will hire you full time with a monthly salary to run occasional A/B testing and also for additional products design.\r\n\r\nRegards\r\nMark','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628782446671941633?success','-',7,'United States','Germantown',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 15:44:25',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
