(10951,'Create a 2D animation promotional video',8,'Seeking an animator to create a ~30 second promotional teaser video for an NFT project.\r\n\r\nThe project deals with a gang of adolescent ghosts who are rebelling against their stodgy school teachers, who want them to grow up to do traditional ghost things by the books. But they just want to be rambunctious kids and have fun.\r\n\r\nIn the video, we should see the ghost kids act out at school, spray paint graffiti on lockers, give each other wedgies, and take over the school. We should also see the teachers react with horror and outrage. Then the video should end with the project logo and a mint date.\r\n\r\nI\'ve attached some reference art so you can see the NFTs and the illustration style we\'re going for.\r\n\r\nPlease show samples of your work when you apply.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628787806866665473?success','-',7,'United States','Austin',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 16:05:20',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
(10952,'Webflow Website Designer',4,'We are seeking an experienced Webflow Web Designer to redesign our existing website. As our ideal candidate, you have a keen eye for design and a solid understanding of user experience principles. You are proficient in Webflow, have experience working with responsive web design, and possess strong design skills.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Redesign our existing website using Webflow\r\n- Create visually appealing designs that align with our brand identity\r\n- Ensure the website is user-friendly and easy to navigate\r\n- Optimize website speed and performance\r\n- Ensure website is responsive and looks great on all devices\r\n- Work collaboratively with our team to ensure the website meets our business goals\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience as a Webflow Web Designer\r\n- Excellent design skills and attention to detail\r\n- Familiarity with responsive web design\r\n- Excellent communication and teamwork skills\r\n- Ability to work on a deadline and manage multiple projects simultaneously\r\n\r\nIf you meet the above requirements and are interested in this opportunity, please submit your resume and portfolio for consideration. We look forward to hearing from you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628787923170521089','-',7,'United States','London',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 16:05:27',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
