(10955,'Build awesome landing page',3,'We are a boutique sales data-processing company (www.wherwe.com) seeking a website designer to upgrade our landing page. Our main objective is to create an awesome design that showcases our company as tech-savvy and design-conscious.\r\n\r\nWe already have content available in first draft format, so you will not need to worry about making endless changes to the text. The landing page will consist of 4 or 5 sections, and we invite you to incorporate web technologies such as Parallax scrolling and Three.js to make it bold and engaging.\r\n\r\nTo give you an idea of the design direction we would like to take, we have listed a few references and websites that we think are neat. However, we are also open to your creative input and are excited to see what you can come up with.\r\n\r\nOverall, we are looking for a website designer who can create an exceptional landing page design that aligns with our brand’s image and objectives. Once you have created an acceptable first version, we will take over the design and implementation process.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering this opportunity, and we look forward to working with you to create an outstanding landing page.\r\n\r\nThis is current draft with the new content to go into new landing page.\r\nhttps://wherwe.com/content-draft-landing-page.html\r\n\r\nList of references, or just sites we think are neat:\r\nhttps://greensock.com/scrolltrigger/\r\nhttps://unseen.co/\r\nhttps://uplinq.non-linear.studio/\r\nhttps://crosswire.io/\r\nhttps://www.apple.com/macbook-pro-14-and-16/\r\nhttps://codepen.io/hexagoncircle/pen/LYpaPQp\r\nhttps://codepen.io/GreenSock/pen/oNjgEjm\r\nhttps://codepen.io/GreenSock/pen/oNjgEjm','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628789133814829057','-',7,'United States','na',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 16:10:50',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
