(10958,'Logo Design',4,'We are needing a logo for a Native American/American Indian project.\r\n\r\nThe logo is for a mental health hotline and services for NA/AI individuals.\r\n\r\nIt is for Comanche Nation 988 Tribal Response\r\n\r\nWe are wanting it to be a sweetgrass circle (traditional sweetgrass braids have 7 strands) that has a big 988 in the middle and is the primary focus. Beneath it, have Comanche Nation Tribal Response, rounding the bottom of the circle. And at the top, have call or text.\r\nColor preferences: red, turquoise, cream, and olive green, on a black background.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628790308636524545?success','-',7,'United States','St. Louis',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 16:14:59',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
