(10962,'WordPress Developer Needed to Create a Shop for Fashion Brand \"Bartliebe\"',3,'Bartliebe is a fashion brand looking for an experienced WordPress developer to create an online store for our brand. The successful candidate will be responsible for designing and building the website using WordPress and implementing the WooCommerce plugin for e-commerce functionality.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Developing a fully functional online store using WordPress and WooCommerce for Bartliebe.\r\n- Customize website theme to match brand aesthetics and user requirements.\r\n- Implement payment gateway integration for secure and seamless transactions.\r\n- Implementing protection software integration to protect against potential threats.\r\n- Optimizing website performance for fast page load times and user experience.\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience in WordPress website development, including knowledge of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\r\n- Experience in WooCommerce development and customization.\r\n- Strong understanding of e-commerce best practices, including payment gateway integration, shipping, and taxes.\r\n- Knowledge of website security and protection from potential threats.\r\n- Excellent communication skills and ability to work with a team.\r\n- Experience with SEO and digital marketing strategies is a plus.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this position, please send us examples of your previous work and a detailed proposal outlining how you would approach this project, including estimated timeline and cost. We look forward to hearing from you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628791548823367681','-',7,'United States','Berlin',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 16:21:08',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
