(10964,'Wix Website Design for Dessert Shop',4,'Hi, I have 2 dessert shops.\r\n\r\nI am looking for 1 Wix website that contains 1 domain but splits into 2 websites on the main domain and can allow each shop to operate independently of the other.\r\n\r\nFor example:\r\nThe customer comes onto the main website and can choose which site they want, either site A or B.\r\n\r\nOnce the customer clicks on their preferred site, they can order from the menu and we can prepare the items and have the order sent to their house.\r\n\r\nIf you think you can produce a website that can operate like this, please get in touch!\r\n\r\nThanks in advance!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628793819842252801','-',7,'United States','Sheffield',15.000,'perhour',15.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 16:29:03',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(10965,'Bold Designer For Hat Apparel Brand',2,'WHO WE ARE\r\n\r\nWe\'re a new apparel brand that\'s coming out with a line of hats targeting entrepreneurs, high-achievers and people who are proud to chase down dreams.\r\n\r\nWHAT WE NEED\r\n\r\nA designer that can help us come up with 3 initial concepts for the first Hats. Will need to follow the guidelines for the production team.\r\n\r\nSTYLE\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for bold, eye-catching design that is also clean and minimalist. See initial style options for the hat(s).\r\n\r\nNEXT STEPS\r\n\r\nShoot over any examples that are relevant and a quote for what 3 initial design concepts would take, with revisions.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0166a1ccfcc5328606','-',7,'United States','Scottsdale',65.000,'perhour',65.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 16:32:41',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
(10966,'Medical Billing Specialist for Optometrist-required',21,'Job Description:\r\nPlease do not apply if you don’t have optometry experience and have worked with Crystal and Revolution EHR!\r\nWe are seeking a qualified and dedicated individual to join our Medical Billing Team. In this position, you will be responsible for a variety of tasks, As our medical biller, your daily duties will include maintaining billing software, appealing denied claims, and recording insurance payments.\r\n\r\nTo succeed in this role, you must possess in-depth knowledge of billing software, such as Crystal, Revolution, Office ally, as well as medical insurance policies and terminologies. The ideal candidate must also be able to demonstrate excellent written and verbal skills, as communicating with the team, clients, and various insurance agents will form a large part of the job. The candidate must also understand HIPAA regulations and patient privacy.\r\n\r\nMedical Biller Responsibilities:\r\nPrepare and submit billing data and medical claims to insurance companies\r\nEnsure the patient\'s medical information is accurate and up to date\r\nPrepare bills and invoices, and document amounts due to medical procedures and services\r\nCollect and review referrals and pre-authorizations\r\nMonitor and record late payments (if applicable)\r\nFollow-up on missed payments and resolve financial discrepancies\r\nExamine patient bills for accuracy and request any missing information from insurance companies\r\nInvestigate and appeal denied claims\r\nMaintain current collection reports\r\n\r\nMedical Biller requirements:\r\nKnowledge in healthcare administration, account, or relevant field (preferred)\r\nA minimum of 2 years experience as a medical biller or similar role (preferred)\r\nSolid understanding of billing software: Revolutions, Crystal (preferred) and office ally.\r\nSolid understanding in electronic medical records (preferred)\r\nMust have the ability to multitask and manage time effectively (required)\r\nExcellent written and verbal communication skills (required)\r\nOutstanding problem-solving and organizational abilities (required)\r\nKnowledge and a solid understanding of HIPAA (required)\r\nSecure VPN','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628794787673706497','-',7,'United States','Elk Groove',18.000,'perhour',17.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 16:36:29',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
