(11027,'Web Designer',4,'As a BrandRep Web Designer, you will combine the technicality of SEO with the art of design, using some of the top website development tools as paintbrushes to create masterpieces. You are the Bob Ross of website development platforms like Shopify, Wix, WordPress, and other websites platforms. You excel working with teams and enjoy taking an active role to ensure the group fully understands all available options and capabilities.\r\n\r\nRESPONSIBILITIES AND SKILLS\r\n\r\nWork with the copywriter, graphic designer, and client to develop SEO-rich e-commerce websites for small to medium-sized businesses.\r\n\r\nExperience managing and servicing Shopify, WordPress, Wix, and other 3rd party website platforms.\r\n\r\nCreate the visual design of responsive brand websites and optimize them for mobile, tablet, and desktop.\r\n\r\nImplement industry-standard white-hat SEO and digital design best practices.\r\n\r\nResearch and recommend trending digital design, layouts, and interface to enhance user experience.\r\n\r\nStrong knowledge and proficiency of Photoshop and Illustrator.\r\n\r\nWorking knowledge of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript is a plus.\r\n\r\nQUALIFICATIONS AND EXPERIENCE\r\n\r\n2-4 years of extensive experience in developing eCommerce websites using templates.\r\n\r\nStrong portfolio showcasing skills incorporating brand design into websites.\r\n\r\nAbility to customize themes on Shopify, WordPress, and Wix eCommerce platforms.\r\n\r\nComfortable working from concept through completion.\r\n\r\nBold and clean web design aesthetic with a keen sense of design, typography, branding, and attention to detail.\r\n\r\nAbility to migrate websites from different web hosting platforms.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628855317939212289','-',7,'United States','Simi Valley',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 20:34:16',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
