(11038,'New Forum and Classified community website',3,'I am looking for a skilled web developer to help us create a professional and seamless website.\r\n\r\nThe website is a private community for mental health professionals.\r\n\r\nSome of the requirements for this site are:\r\n\r\nAssit with visuals to help make the website look clean, professional and inviting. I really don\'t want an average website.\r\n\r\nThe front part of the website will be classified ads for mental heath professionals. which will need the following:\r\n\r\n1. Users can post Ads for different categories\r\n2. Paid ads and free ads\r\n3. Featured Ads\r\n4. Connect to payment processor and paypal/amazon etc.\r\n5. Different payment tiers for the Ads\r\n6. How to page which explains the process\r\n7. we like this template obviously with customization https://demo.joinwebs.com/classiera/opal/\r\n\r\nNext we need the site to have a private forum only for professionals where they do not receive immediate access to the forum until approved by an administrator to verify credentials. I want to use XenForo for the website and need someone experienced with this platform.\r\n\r\nLastly, we need it to be available to have Ads on the site for extra revenue. It also needs to work on different medias- phones, ipads and computers.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628862704058265601?success','-',7,'United States','Roseville',2500.000,'fixed',2500.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 21:02:31',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
