(11042,'Wordpress website build using Divi from Adobe XD Mockup',3,'We have an approved Adobe XD design for the front page.\r\nDeliverables are as follows:\r\nBuild out front page to exactly match the XD Design\r\nOptimize for mobile using best practices\r\nBuild out internal pages to match the sitemap/content strategy document using your discretion for design to fit the front page concept\r\nOptimize internal pages for mobile\r\nYou may use ipsum lorem for internal pages content\r\nAfter the internal page designs are completed we will provide written content for each page to be loaded in by you.\r\n\r\nConsiderations\r\nWordpress development site will be hosted by me and admin login will be provided\r\nI will have Divi installed and activated\r\nWe will have 2 rounds of design revisions if needed.\r\nFront page includes hero video at top that will be provided\r\n\r\n\r\nXD Mockup link: https://xd.adobe.com/view/9e69fbb9-2d71-4fbb-a578-a730f0e573eb-cb3a/','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628864327190958081?success','-',7,'United States','Midland',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 21:09:14',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
