(11057,'Build a responsive Shopify website for a digital marketing agency',3,'I need an experienced web developer to create a simple website for a digital marketing agency that focuses on providing marketing services to accounting firms. The website needs a main home page, a services page with individual pages for each service, and a contact page.\r\n\r\nThere is an opportunity for long-term work as many of our clients need to update their websites or need entirely new websites.\r\n\r\nI need to be able to change the verbiage of the site and have some flexibility toward the look and design of the site. I already have a logo and would like the site design to follow a similar color scheme as the logo. I would like the site to be easy to use and \"software service style\" because we are offering digital products so it is important that our website is techy and impressive.\r\n\r\nThe website needs to be responsive to various screen sizes.\r\n\r\nThe project timeline is flexible, but the sooner I can launch it, the better.\r\n\r\nHere are some links to example websites from other marketing agencies I like:\r\nhttps://badrhinoinc.com/\r\nhttps://modernb2b.co/\r\nhttps://www.mabbly.com/','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1628887032835145729','-',7,'United States','na',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-02-23',1,'2023-02-23',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-23 22:39:23',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
