(11075,'PowerPoint Designer',11,'Job Overview:\r\nWe are looking for a skilled PowerPoint Designer who can help us create a professional presentation for a conference. The ideal candidate should have experience in creating visually appealing and engaging presentations for corporate clients. They should have strong design skills and be able to work independently to complete the project within the given timeframe.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nWork with the project team to understand the presentation requirements and objectives\r\nCreate visually appealing PowerPoint slides that convey the information effectively\r\nDesign graphics, charts, and diagrams to enhance the visual appeal of the presentation\r\nEdit and refine the presentation to ensure a polished and professional end product\r\nIncorporate client feedback and make revisions as needed\r\nEnsure the presentation is delivered on time and within budget\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience as a PowerPoint Designer, with a portfolio of past work to showcase your skills\r\nExpertise in PowerPoint design, including the ability to create custom graphics, charts, and diagrams\r\nStrong design skills, with the ability to create visually appealing presentations that convey information effectively\r\nExcellent communication skills and the ability to work collaboratively with the project team\r\nAbility to work independently and manage your time effectively to meet project deadlines\r\nAttention to detail and a commitment to producing high-quality work\r\nIf you are a talented PowerPoint Designer who meets the above requirements and is passionate about creating professional presentations, we encourage you to apply. Please provide your portfolio of past work with your application.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1629085685514620929','-',7,'United States','columbia',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-02-24',1,'2023-02-24',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-24 11:48:57',NULL,7,3,NULL,155),
