(11088,'White board explainer video',8,'We would like a whiteboard cartoon explainer video. We are an AI company focusing on the retail industry. Here is a description of what we provide - \"Xineoh\'s user-friendly platform empowers businesses to easily pinpoint the root causes of underperformance with AI and behavioral segmentation, driving increased profitability.\".\r\n\r\nWe would like the video to be based on this script and we have also attached a storyboard:\r\n\r\n\r\n1. Opening music and animation of a retail store, with customers browsing and shopping: Draw a retail store with customers walking around and shopping.\r\n\r\nNarrator: Retail can be a challenging industry. With so many factors that can impact your business performance, it\'s important to make data-driven decisions that can help you identify the root causes of underperformance. This is where Xineoh comes in.\r\n\r\n\r\n2. Cut to an animation showing how data is collected and analyzed in real-time: Draw a whiteboard animation showing data being collected from various sources such as sales transactions, customer feedback, etc. and then being analyzed by Xineoh\'s AI-powered platform.\r\n\r\nNarrator: Our AI-powered platform performs behavioral segmentation on your transaction data, providing you with valuable insights into your customers\' behavior and preferences. This enables you to quickly identify trends and patterns in your data and make informed decisions that can have a big impact on your bottom line.\r\n\r\n\r\n3. Cut to a shot of a graph displaying different customer segments: Draw a graph on a whiteboard with different customer segments, each represented by a different color or pattern.\r\n\r\nNarrator: With Xineoh, you can easily identify underperforming customer segments and the factors that are contributing to their lack of engagement. You can then use this information to formulate a strategy that drives growth and improves your bottom line.\r\n\r\n4. Cut to a shot of a business owner using data insights to make changes in their operations: Draw a whiteboard animation showing a business owner analyzing data on a computer screen and making changes to their business operations based on the insights gained from Xineoh\'s platform.\r\n\r\nNarrator: Our solution enables you to optimize your product offerings to meet customer demand, identify new opportunities to drive revenue and growth, and gain a deeper understanding of your customers\' needs and preferences.\r\n\r\n5. Cut to a shot of a happy retailer using the Xineoh platform: Draw a whiteboard animation showing a retailer smiling and looking satisfied while using Xineoh\'s platform on their computer.\r\n\r\nNarrator: Whether you\'re a small business or a large enterprise, Xineoh can help you take your retail operations to the next level. Our platform is user-friendly and provides you with valuable insights that you can use to make data-driven decisions.\r\n\r\n6. Cut to a shot of a computer screen displaying the Xineoh logo: Draw Xineoh\'s logo on a whiteboard and make it look like it\'s on a computer screen.\r\n\r\nNarrator: Don\'t let underperformance hold your business back. Try Xineoh today and start making data-driven decisions that drive growth and success.\r\n\r\n7. Closing slide with a call to action and contact information: Draw a whiteboard slide with the contact information for Xineoh and a call to action for viewers to contact them for more information.\r\n\r\nNarrator: Contact us now to learn more about how Xineoh can help you transform underperformance with AI-driven data insights.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1629122710800732161?success','-',7,'United States','Johannesburg',60.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-24',1,'2023-02-24',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-24 14:19:04',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
