(11133,'UX/UI designer needed for a vehicle report (data visualization)',4,'At CarEdge we help consumers save time and money when they buy new and used cars. We do this by providing them with insights, information, and professional support. We are passionate about financial literacy and wellness. We have developed a proprietary \"cost to own\" data-set, and are looking for a talented designer to help us visualize and layout this information.\r\n\r\nImagine the CarEdge report as a similar (but different!) report to a CarFax report (vehicle history). We focus on cost of ownership and value, CarFax focuses on vehicle history, but the concept is the same.\r\n\r\nThe design should be simple and clean. We are trying to clearly communicate important information to the user.\r\n\r\nHere is an example CarFax report: https://www.carfax.com/VehicleHistory/p/Report.cfx?partner=TVO_0&vin=KNMAT2MT0KP515103&source=BUP\r\n\r\nHere is an example Bumper report (CarFax competitor): https://www.bumper.com/lp/2cb4ad/1/landing?display_sample_report=true\r\n\r\nHere is the data that we have: https://coda.io/d/_d_hCFguezed/CarEdge-Report_sudtT','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~017804febd6957eb60','-',7,'United States','Kensington',70.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-24',1,'2023-02-24',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-24 16:05:44',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
