(11143,'Graphic Designer For Eco Friendly marketplace',2,'We are looking for a talented Graphic Designer to join our team and help us design the next phase of our marketplace. The ideal candidate should be able to bring creative and innovative ideas to the table and have a passion for designing user-centered digital experiences.\r\n\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nWork with our team to create the next phase of our marketplace using the Figma blueprint provided.\r\nCreate visually appealing graphics, icons, and illustrations to enhance the user experience of our digital products.\r\nDevelop wireframes, prototypes, and mockups to effectively communicate design ideas.\r\nConduct research on user behavior, industry trends, and design best practises to inform design decisions.\r\nIterate and refine designs based on feedback from the team.\r\nDesign 5-6 pages, including a shop home page, search page, single product page, about page, and header, based on the skeleton already created by our team.\r\nEnsure that all designs align with our marketplace\'s style and branding guidelines.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience as a graphic designer with a strong portfolio of design projects\r\nProficiency in design software such as Adobe Creative Suite, Sketch, Figma, or similar tools\r\nFamiliarity with design best practises and web design standards\r\nStrong communication and collaboration skills\r\nAbility to work independently and manage multiple projects simultaneously\r\nExperience with video conferencing software for remote meetings and conversations\r\nAvailability to attend a video call meeting before starting work','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01aeb67418c1c87d89','-',7,'United States','Wirral',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-02-24',1,'2023-02-24',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-24 16:38:11',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
