(11153,'Event Party Flyer Nightclub',12,'Dear freelancers\r\n\r\nWe need another flyer design for our nightclub. \r\n\r\nPlease do not apply with preset/standard texts as they won\'t be read. Your apply should be as unique as the design we are expecting.\r\n\r\n\r\npurpose: Flyer design for a new party format\r\n\r\ntitle: \"Pretty Cool\"\r\n\r\nsubtitle: \"Die Party für alle, die gerne früher kommen.\"\r\n\r\nLocation: \"Firehouse Weinfelden\"\r\n\r\ndate: \"Sa, 25. März 2023\"\r\n\r\ntime: \"18.59 - 00.59 Uhr\"\r\n\r\ninformal text: \"Früher starten. Früher ins Bett. Bei Pretty Cool hast du 100% Clubbing Erlebnis, einfach am Abend. So bist du am nächsten Tag fit und bereit für weitere Abenteuer.\"\r\n\r\n\r\nmain target: people between the age of 18 and 35 who like to go out and have a great time. It\'s for a party in a nightclub. Music format will be charts, hits, pop, rock = best songs of all time.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe would appreciate if the title is 3d animated / has depth.\r\n\r\nThe subtitle should go along with the main title and be seen as part of it.\r\n\r\nNo template design.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe overall design should look modern, catchy, not childish, not cheap. \r\n\r\nWe are open for suggestions.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease apply only if you can start right away and deliver the first mockups within a few days.\r\n\r\n\r\nOf course you can increase your chance of getting hired by sending a raw initial draft. (optionally)\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks,','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2026955','-',7,'United States','-',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-02-24',1,'2023-02-24',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-24 17:34:33',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
