(11155,'Excel to Web G',19,'We have several Excel Workbooks with VBA Macros that we offer to our customers to help them manage their investment accounts.  The workbooks allow importing of current balance information and transaction history from CSV files and then the VBA macros create needed exchange transactions.\r\n\r\n\r\nPresently, customers must have a valid copy of Excel running on a Windows or Mac PC to use our services.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe are interested in exploring the possibility of converting the full functionality of our existing Excel spreadsheets (approximately 50) to a web-based interface so that customers without Excel can also use our services.  \r\n\r\n\r\nWe want to continue to maintain the functionality and content of each of the 50 worksheets locally in Excel. Our chosen provider will need to be readily available to propoxate any changes made to an Excel workbook to the browser based version.  Typically each worksheet is updated 1-2 times per year only.\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'ve attached a sample worksheet and the CSV input file that can be used when testing the import functionality.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2026979','-',7,'United States','-',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-02-24',1,'2023-02-24',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-24 17:42:59',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
