(11181,'Enroll Patients by Phone for Health Care Clients of Ours',22,'We are a rapidly growing telehealth company in need of help with enrolling patients our clients (health care providers) serve. Our clients give us a list of patients they want us to recruit into a government funded remote patient monitoring program (RPM) that helps patients control hypertension (high blood pressure) and other chronic conditions.\r\n\r\nThe work we need you to perform is easy. We simply need to call patients on the list from clients and tell them we are calling on behalf of (insert name of client) about a great new government funded program that will help you remain healthy...\r\n\r\nWe are looking for 3 people who sound great on the phone, well organized, can work Monday through Saturday up to 6 hours a day.\r\n\r\nNote: A background check by a 3rd party will be required due to the nature of the patient information we have access to.\r\n\r\nThanks for your interest! - David','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1629195613908303873','-',7,'United States','Rockville',20.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-02-24',1,'2023-02-24',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-24 19:11:20',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
