(11193,'Brand Designer with Food Industry Experience',2,'We are looking for a talented brand designer with experience in the food industry to help us take Kakadoodle to the next level. We are a local food delivery company focused on providing sustainably produced food from local farms to health-conscious customers.\r\n\r\nAs our brand continues to grow, we need a designer to help us develop a consistent and memorable visual identity across all assets, include egg cartons, website, truck, billboard, and postcards.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will have experience designing for food and beverage brands, and will be able to create designs that communicate our values of sustainability, health, and local community.\r\n\r\nKey responsibilities include:\r\n\r\n- Designing a new look for our egg cartons that communicates our brand values and stands out on store shelves\r\n- Designing a visually appealing and user-friendly website that showcases our products and values\r\n- Creating designs for our delivery truck that will help us get noticed on the road and communicate our brand message\r\n- Designing a billboard campaign that will generate buzz and drive traffic to our website\r\n- Developing a set of postcards that we can use to promote our brand and products\r\n\r\nThe successful candidate will have:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience in brand design for food and beverage companies\r\n- A strong portfolio of previous work that demonstrates their ability to create visually appealing designs that communicate brand values\r\n- Expertise in Adobe Creative Suite and other design tools\r\n- Excellent communication skills and ability to work collaboratively with our team\r\n\r\nIf you are passionate about creating designs that promote healthy, sustainable food systems and have the skills and experience to help us take Kakadoodle\'s brand to the next level, we would love to hear from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1629208589938495489','-',7,'United States','Frankfort',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-24',1,'2023-02-24',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-24 19:57:32',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(11194,'Logo and Branding Designer with Website Development Expertise',2,'Hello,\r\n\r\nI am starting company in the baby clothes domain and I am seeking a talented and creative Logo, Branding, and Website Designer with Content Creation skills to help us establish our brand identity and online presence. The ideal candidate will have a strong portfolio of successful branding and website design projects, as well as experience in content creation and copywriting.\r\n\r\nYou will be responsible for developing and designing the visual identity of our brand, including logos, color schemes, typography, and brand guidelines. Additionally, you will be responsible for designing and developing our website(landing page with up to 5 pages, explaining our services together with 3-5 blog posts), including all content creation and copywriting.\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\n• A unique and impactful visual identity for our brand, including logos, color schemes, typography, and brand guidelines\r\n• A professionally designed and developed website(landing page) that aligns with our brand identity and mission, includes engaging content and copywriting, and is optimized for search engines and user experience. Please, note that I don\'t need online store.\r\n• A brand book that documents our brand identity and guidelines for consistent use across all marketing and communication channels\r\n\r\nBudget is flexible.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1629210020917137409','-',7,'United States','Freienbach',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-02-24',1,'2023-02-24',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-24 20:04:10',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
