(11216,'Kajabi Website for Female Empowerment Project',3,'Urgent work!\r\n\r\nHigh potential project launching in the USA, looking for long-term team members of high-energy, enthusiastic women. ❤️\r\n\r\n10-year goal: Helping 1 million women across the globe remember who they are.\r\n\r\nThe Bright Academy is an existing business in Hungary, teaching people in-demand professions for over 3 years now.\r\n\r\nI would like to expand my business to the USA focusing on topics that can help women and that are not taught in school.\r\n\r\nI need a BOMB looking website to\r\n1. show the potential tutors, and business collaborations what the project is about\r\n2. have 1-2 courses uploaded so we can generate revenue within in a few weeks\r\n3. create the system to collaborate with a coaching/mentoring company\r\n\r\nThere are three layers of the business we need to build:\r\n0. home page that sells- asap\r\n1. Classic online courses (optimized landing page asap, with a \"sign up to be notified when we launch email collecting tab+ course uploaded later)\r\n2. VIP service with 1on1 coaching- this system built asap\r\n3. Membership, recurring payment, consists of:\r\n- 1 monthly automated virtual meetup\r\n- 1 group coaching (either by the tutor of a certain course or a coach)\r\n\r\nFeel free to get creative and add your thoughts to the project and website. The more amazing minds work on this the better!\r\n\r\nThe LLC is being established at the moment so we should build the payment systems and wait a few weeks to have the bank account attached.\r\n\r\nThank you in advance for investing your time in a project that will help so many! Let\'s do this!\r\n\r\nLilla','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1629236658046042113','-',7,'United States','Kaposvar',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-02-24',1,'2023-02-24',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-24 21:55:42',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
