(11241,'T shirt designer',2,'Who we are:\r\nwww.zawn.com.au\r\n\r\nAt Zawn, we currently manufacture sustainable phone cases but are also building a boutique retail brand that produces sustainably made garments free of nasties, with a focus of driving profits back into wildlife conservation. Our clothing design is to be inspired by this\r\n\r\nAbout the job:\r\nLooking for an experienced designer from the fashion industry to utilise our branding for t-shirt design\r\n\r\nAbout you:\r\n- Experienced fashion designer\r\n- Understands the complexities of printing onto cotton garments\r\n- Understands the power of branding\r\n- You care about the company\'s mission\r\n- Proficiency in design software such as Adobe Illustrator and Photoshop\r\n- Strong knowledge of sustainable materials and manufacturing processes.\r\n- Creative and innovative thinker with a passion for sustainability.\r\n- Strong communication and collaboration skills.\r\n- Ability to work in a fast-paced environment and meet deadlines.\r\n\r\nBenefits:\r\n- Opportunities for professional development and ideally ongoing collaborations\r\n- Collaborative and supportive team culture.\r\n- Working for a company that is making a positive impact on the environment and promoting sustainability in the fashion industry.\r\n\r\nWe are an equal opportunity employer and welcome applications from all qualified candidates.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630109238202269697','-',7,'United States','Melbourne',65.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-27',1,'2023-02-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-27 08:20:50',NULL,7,3,NULL,155),
