(11246,'Professional business logos',10,'Let me start of by saying thank you for talking the time to read this. I have multiple company’s that I would like a professional business logo for. I’ve worked with what I could do through apps etc. but I’m no designer. It’s time to start pushing my companies more into the marketplace and I need the right images before I do that more.\r\n\r\nI have the following company’s and a quick description.\r\n\r\nThe Pallet Kings, LLC\r\nThis is a liquidation company that buys pallets and truckloads of merchandise from big box stores to resale to the public market.\r\n\r\nDeals N\' Steals Bin Store, LLC\r\nThis is an Amazon bin store where I feel the bins with merchandise and it’s a set price point per day, we’re open 5 days a week with a sliding price scale. Then we close and reset.\r\n\r\nI also have Deals N\' Steals Bin Store of Douglas, LLC\r\nThis is just like my original one.\r\n\r\nDiversified Auction Company, LLC\r\nThis ones pretty explanatory it’s an auction house.\r\n\r\nAnd lastly Robinson Liquidation Center, LLC\r\nThis is best described as a salvage home improvement store. We have everything you could find at Lowe’s or Home Depot Box Damage, Return, Overstock, Shelf pulls you name it.\r\n\r\nI’m looking for professional logos, Facebook banners and potential add campaign.\r\n\r\nI need something that will look professional on business cards and able to be received in multiple formats.\r\n\r\nWould love a quote on this job and possibly building a relationship with someone who could handle all my companies graphic designs for ads etc.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~019d3c940feebf05a2','-',7,'United States','Jesup',48.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-02-27',1,'2023-02-27',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-27 08:42:18',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
