(11288,'Decks for company',11,'We\'re looking for a talented freelancer to create two presentation decks for our company that are visually appealing and aligned with our brand guidelines. The main deck will be approximately 15 pages and will be used to present to potential investors, while the second deck will be a condensed, 5-page version that provides a quick overview of our brand and insights.  We\'ll provide you with all the information you need to create the decks, and we\'re looking for someone who can use their design skills and creativity to make the presentations stand out. The main deck should be impressive and engaging, while the smaller deck should be easy to read and visually interesting.  If this project sounds like something you\'d be interested in, we\'d love to see your portfolio and hear more about your approach to the project. We\'d also like to know your estimated timeline and cost for completing the work.  Once awarded for the job, we will provide you with all information and content necessary to build these PPTs.  Thanks for considering our project. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~019ab09f79cd4238e8','-',7,'United States','Abu Dhabi',80.000,'Open this select menu',80.000,'2023-02-27',1,'2023-02-27',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-27 15:50:35',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
