(11293,'WIX New Site Development',3,'We are seeking an experienced website developer to rebuild our existing website. As a small tutoring company based in Australia, we are looking for someone who can help us create an effective online presence that showcases our services and appeals to our target audience.\r\n\r\nThe successful candidate will have a proven track record of developing websites on the WIX platform and be able to create visually appealing and user-friendly designs. In addition, you should have a strong understanding of SEO best practices and be able to implement strategies that improve our website\'s search engine rankings. It is also essential that you have experience building mobile-friendly websites to ensure that our site is accessible to all users.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities will include building the entire website from scratch, including creating a wireframe, sourcing images, writing copy, and integrating the website into our old WIX account. The website design should be straightforward, but we will be looking for someone who can bring creative ideas and suggestions to the project.\r\n\r\nKey requirements for this role include:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience building websites on WIX\r\n- Strong design skills and ability to create visually appealing websites\r\n- Knowledge of SEO best practices and ability to optimize content accordingly\r\n- Ability to create wireframes, source images, and write compelling copy\r\n- Experience integrating websites into WIX accounts\r\n- Experience building mobile-friendly websites\r\n\r\nWe are committed to supporting you throughout the project and will be happy to provide any assistance or resources you need. If you are passionate about web development and interested in working with a dynamic and growing tutoring company, we encourage you to apply.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630237907926126593','-',7,'United States','Sydney',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-02-27',1,'2023-02-27',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu