(11296,'Logo for upcoming course',10,'I need this urgently (24-48 hours max). I have an online course, and I’m releasing it very soon. I need the logo done.\r\n\r\nVery important: everything in the logo must be original. No content off the internet (icons, images, etc.). If the logo is not original, it will not be accepted.\r\n\r\nThe logo is challenging because the name is pretty long: “Mindset: Programma Operativo”.\r\n\r\nThe style is very modern, like Cyberpunk. Glitchy, aggressive and generally bold.\r\n\r\nI will need some patterns to use around the course (see attached PDF).\r\n\r\nI need you to include a quick moodboard (with the colors and the fonts).\r\n\r\nIf you need any more details, I’m happy to provide more.\r\n\r\nI haven’t set a budget, so let me know your prices.\r\n\r\nPrevious experience is a must.\r\n\r\nThanks!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01a277ad0e4fe66671','-',7,'United States','Pescia',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2023-02-27',1,'2023-02-27',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-27 16:17:54',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
