(11319,'Create an animation to demo a spherical projection system',8,'CONTEXT\r\nAtmosphere is selling a very innovative projection device called ORA. This system can display any type of animation on a spheric screen. We are going to present our new technology for the first time in a trade show in Paris aimed at museums during the last week of March.\r\n\r\nDESCRIPTION OF THE JOB\r\nAs a demo, we would like to display a story of the world on our globe. We are going to use an existing film which we need to adapt to our globe. This requires to recreate all the images with an animation tool like After Effect with the right format characteristics and add a text layer on top of it. We have provided you with simple directions to create images/videos that can be adapted to our globe.\r\n\r\nWHAT WE NEED NOW AND LATER\r\nYou don\'t need to recreate the entire animation which is very long at the moment : 20 minutes at a super fast pace. You can choose one or several chapters in the whole story that you find easier to adapt to a spheric format. We have also provided you with a story line to make it easier to pick the part you prefer. The list of chapters can be found in an excel file.\r\n\r\nEventually, we would like to adapt the whole animation to our sphere. We would be happy to compte the whole task after the trade show if the demo animation your created works well.\r\n\r\nTEXTS AND LANGUAGES\r\nThere will be an English and a French version. So the text needs to be added as a separate layer.\r\nWe will take care of the sound and voices which will be added later.\r\n\r\nWHAT WE EXPECT FROM YOU\r\nWe would like you tell us which chapters you picked and present a budget for adapting the chapters you selected.\r\n\r\nRESSOURCES\r\nYou can find all the ressources on the following link\r\nhttps://indd.adobe.com/view/2070d009-e4a3-4463-96a0-92eece1e8c9b','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630249826866548737?success','-',7,'United States','PARIS',3000.000,'fixed',3000.000,'2023-02-27',1,'2023-02-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-27 16:54:55',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
