(11373,'Squarespace website designer and consultant',4,'Job Title: Squarespace Website Designer and Consultant\r\nJob Description:\r\nWe are looking for an experienced Squarespace website designer and consultant to help us improve and optimize our website. The ideal candidate will have a deep understanding of Squarespace design best practices, and a proven track record of creating beautiful, effective websites.\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n* Review our existing website and provide feedback and recommendations for improvement\r\n* Consult with us to understand our goals and objectives for the website\r\n* Develop a customized design plan that incorporates our branding, messaging, and content\r\n* Build out new pages and sections of the website as needed\r\n* Provide ongoing consultation and support to help us optimize the website and improve its performance\r\n* Ensure the website is fully optimized for speed, mobile responsiveness, and search engine visibility\r\nRequirements:\r\n* Proven experience with Squarespace website design and optimization, with a strong portfolio of past work\r\n* In-depth understanding of Squarespace design best practices, as well as broader design principles and trends\r\n* Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work closely with us to understand our needs and goals\r\n* Strong project management skills, with the ability to manage timelines and deliverables effectively\r\n* Experience with SEO and optimizing websites for search engine visibility\r\n* Familiarity with web analytics tools like Google Analytics\r\nIf you have the skills and experience we\'re looking for, we\'d love to hear from you. Please provide examples of past work and results, and let us know why you\'re the right fit for this position.\r\nNote: This is a remote contract position, with an initial trial period of one month. There may be potential for ongoing work and further projects in the future, depending on the success of this initial engagement.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630292598832001025','-',7,'United States','na',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-27',1,'2023-02-27',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-27 19:48:12',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
