(11399,'Branding guide and graphics design',2,'**We understand that this is not a great budget but we are a small startup and it is in the range of what we can budget to this at the moment. Please feel free to give us your pricing.\r\n\r\nWe need to consult with someone that has the ability to utilize their team to make some adjustments to our branding. We can not make drastic changes to our logos but are open to making some small adjustments that may make the overall group seem more cohesive.\r\n\r\nWe have an LLC that is sort of the \"parent\" company and it is called \"the SALT Smokehouse\". We also use the parent company branding for our full-service catering. We have been listing the SALT logo with the domain thesaltcaters.com underneath of it.\r\n\r\nWe have a small restaurant with about 10 tables but we do a lot of takeout currently. The restaurant is a quick service / fast casual concept with three counters serving food, One counter is \"Station House BBQ\" which serves BBQ food. The second counter is \"the Smokin Cuban\" which serves cuban BBQ fusion food. The third counter is \"Baby Brisket\'s Breakfast & Brunch\" which serves a unique twist on breakfast and brunch.\r\n\r\nI am going to attach the logos to the concepts to the project, We would like to hear how you think that we can make the logos more cohesive with some slight adjustments? We also need some help with acquiring the appropriate fonts for the concepts and creating graphics using the unique fonts.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630310109371437057','-',7,'United States','Safety Harbor',400.000,'fixed',400.000,'2023-02-27',1,'2023-02-27',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-27 20:54:23',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(11400,'Web UX/UI Designer',6,'Who We Are:\r\nVoyu is a hospitality web solution that is designed to help hotels, hostels and BnBs work more efficiently to better serve guests. We are currently finalizing feature set for MVP that will likely communicate with a lodging\'s PMS.\r\n\r\nWho You Are:\r\nWe are looking for an experienced and creative web user interface designer to join our team! The user interface designer will be responsible for creating and designing website elements that optimize user interaction and experience. The user interface designer will work with our team / leverage our brand book and assets to create the website design and conceptual models for testing and building.\r\n\r\n- Knowledge of user-centered design principles: You should be familiar with user-centered design principles and have experience creating user personas, user journeys, and user flows. Your design should focus on solving the user\'s problems and providing them with a seamless experience.\r\n\r\n- Proficiency in design tools: You should have experience using design tools like Sketch, Adobe XD, Figma, or similar. These tools are essential for creating wireframes, prototypes, and final designs.\r\n\r\n- Understanding of front-end development: You should have a basic understanding of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, as this will help you create designs that are feasible to implement.\r\n\r\n- Familiarity with responsive design: Your design should be responsive and work on different screen sizes and devices. You should be familiar with responsive design principles and have experience creating designs that are optimized for mobile devices.\r\n\r\n- Collaboration skills: You will be working with a team of developers, product managers, and other designers. You should be comfortable collaborating with others and be able to communicate your design decisions effectively.\r\n\r\n- Portfolio: You should have a portfolio that showcases your design skills, including wireframes, mockups, and prototypes.\r\n\r\nOverall, as a web UI/UX designer for an MVP, you should be able to create a design that is simple, intuitive, and user-friendly. Your design should focus on solving the user\'s problems and providing them with a seamless experience.\r\n\r\nResults of project:\r\n- User-friendly interface: The UI/UX designer will create an interface that is intuitive, easy to use, and provides a seamless experience to the users. This can lead to higher user engagement, retention, and satisfaction.\r\n\r\n- Improved user experience: The designer will work to understand the user\'s needs and create a design that addresses those needs. This can result in an improved user experience, making it more likely that users will continue to use the product or service.\r\n\r\n- Faster time to market: MVPs are designed to be developed quickly, and the UI/UX designer\'s input can help to streamline the process. By creating a design that is easy to implement, the product team can get the MVP to market faster.\r\n\r\n- Increased conversions: A well-designed MVP can lead to increased conversions, whether that\'s signing up for a trial, making a purchase, or taking some other action. A UI/UX designer can help to optimize the design to increase the chances of conversion.\r\n\r\n- Clear product vision: The UI/UX designer will work closely with the product team to ensure that the MVP has a clear vision and purpose. This can help to align the team and ensure that everyone is working toward the same goals.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630311549439864833','-',7,'United States','Rye',3000.000,'fixed',3000.000,'2023-02-27',1,'2023-02-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-27 21:01:06',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(11401,'WordPress | Woocommerce Developer',3,'We are seeking an independent developer with extensive experience in WordPress and customizing Woocommerce environments. Our plan is to use a Woocommerce site as our internal order tracking system. This job has been broken down into three phases. This portion is Phase One.\r\n\r\nScope of Work\r\nInstall and configure a secure WordPress and Woocommerce environment on an existing AWS EC2 server.\r\nCreate a custom permissions set that allows our salespeople to place manual orders without full admin access to the entire Woocommerce.\r\nWe also need our salespeople to have the ability to build orders for clients or non-registered customers on the backend.\r\nWe desire a single sign on from our platform out to the store.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities\r\nBe in constant contact to show progress and map out next steps\r\nMust use Upwork to track time\r\n\r\nQualifications\r\nExtensive experience developing custom WordPress and Woocommerce sites\r\nFamiliarity with the available plugins and apps that could suit our needs\r\nExperience with both Shipstation and Woocommerce API highly preferred','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630313667763793921','-',7,'United States','Indianapolis',50.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-02-27',1,'2023-02-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-27 21:08:40',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(11402,'UX Designer',4,'We are a startup in the industrial automation sector seeking a highly skilled UX/UI Designer to help us create onboarding user flows for a highly complex application that involves 10+ steps.  The ideal candidate should have experience designing customer-facing products with a focus on product-led growth. Will be responsible for thinking through our project end to end and creating a simplified, user-friendly experience for our customers.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n-Develop and design end-to-end user flows, wireframes, and prototypes that showcase the optimal user experience for our customers.\r\n-Conduct usability testing to validate and refine design solutions.\r\n-Develop and maintain design standards, guidelines, and design patterns to ensure consistency across the application.\r\n-Collaborate with front-end developers to ensure design integrity and successful implementation.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n-5+ years of experience in UX/UI design for customer-facing products with a focus on product-led growth.\r\n-Proven experience in end-to-end design process, including user research, user flows, wireframing, prototyping, and usability testing.\r\n-Strong portfolio showcasing your UX/UI design skills.\r\n\r\nThis is a one-time project that has iterations of our MVP deliverables due in 30, 60, and 90 days.  However, optionally we will be looking to fill a full-time position.\r\n\r\nIf you are an experienced UX/UI Designer who is passionate about creating exceptional user experiences, we encourage you to apply.\r\n\r\nPlease include your portfolio and links to any relevant design work in your application.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~019cdd7dc44c52b396','-',7,'United States','Solana Beach',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2023-02-27',1,'2023-02-27',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-27 21:09:04',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
