(11489,'10 Illustrations for a Children\'s Story',2,'I am looking for a talented illustrator to create 10 illustrations for a children\'s story about two characters named \"The Shark and The Bird\". The story is aimed at children aged 3-5. I have attached an ai-generated mockup on how the character should look like (It needs ofcourse a polish). Start your message to me answering what you think about it..\r\n\r\n\r\nThe illustrations should be simple, colorful and easy to understand. Avoid too much detail and complexity. The characters are cute and likable with expressive facial expressions and body language that make them easy to relate to.\r\n\r\n\r\nColor scheme and environment: Use a color scheme that fits the story and the characters. Strong can work well. The story is played out in the ocean so a \"Spongebob-environment\" would be great!\r\n\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n    Work closely with me in fast and short sessions to  understand the story and its characters\r\n    Create sketches and drafts to present to me for feedback and approval\r\n    Refine the approved sketches into full-color illustrations that bring the story to life\r\n    Deliver the final illustrations in digital format that can be easily incorporated into the book layout\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n    Proven experience as an illustrator, preferably in children\'s books\r\n    Proficiency in digital illustration tools such as Adobe Illustrator or Photoshop\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you are a creative and reliable illustrator who enjoys working on children\'s books I would love to hear from you. Please submit your explaination on why you are a good fit for this small project. If you can present drafts of your version of \"The shark and The Bird\" in the message section you will be ahead of the ones who doesnt. You may also have the story if you want and the points for the illustrations ahead for your evaluation.\r\nAttachments','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2028052','-',7,'United States','-',5