(11495,'Looking for a Brand Identity Designer for a Health and Wellness Agency',2,'We\'re looking for a talented and creative brand identity designer to create a strong visual identity for a Health and Wellness brand.\r\n\r\nAs the brand identity designer, you will be responsible for creating a logo, color palette, typography, and other visual elements that effectively communicate our client\'s brand message of health, fitness, and wellness.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Develop a logo and visual identity system that communicates our client\'s brand message and resonates with their target audience\r\n- Create a cohesive brand color palette and typography that is consistent across all marketing materials\r\n- Design brand collateral such as business cards, letterheads, and social media assets that effectively promote our client\'s brand\r\n- Provide guidance on the use of brand assets and maintain consistency across all touchpoints\r\n- Deliver a comprehensive brand guidelines document that outlines the visual identity and provides instructions on its application.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience in creating successful brand identities for fitness, health, or wellness clients\r\n- Excellent design skills and a keen eye for typography, color, and layout\r\n- Strong understanding of branding principles and the ability to translate client requirements into a visual identity\r\n- Proficiency in Adobe Creative Suite or similar design tools\r\n- Excellent communication skills and ability to collaborate effectively with team members\r\n- A passion for fitness and health is a plus.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re a talented and passionate brand identity designer who is excited about the opportunity to work with a fitness coach client, we\'d love to hear from you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630596285681053697','-',7,'United States','Paris',49.000,'Open this select menu',48.000,'2023-02-28',1,'2023-02-28',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-28 15: