(11533,'Part-time Luxury Fashion Brand Web Designer',4,'About the Company:\r\nWe are an independent fashion and textile design company that creates unique, handcrafted pieces with a focus on sustainable materials and ethical production. Our team is passionate about creating beautiful, functional designs that make a positive impact on the world. We are currently seeking a part-time web designer to help us elevate our online presence and bring our luxury fashion brand to life.\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\nAs our part-time web designer, you will be responsible for using our existing Squarespace platform to upload all product details, product images, sizing, and inventory. You will work closely with our team to ensure the website meets our brand standards and delivers an exceptional user experience. The ideal candidate will have experience designing luxury fashion brand websites and a strong understanding of Squarespace.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nUse our Squarespace platform to upload product details, product images, sizing, and inventory\r\nCollaborate with our team to ensure the website meets our brand standards and delivers an exceptional user experience\r\nUse our new campaign images to create a visually appealing website design that reflects our luxury fashion brand\r\nEnsure the website is optimized for mobile and desktop devices\r\nStay up-to-date with the latest trends and technologies in web design\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nPrevious experience designing luxury fashion brand websites\r\nStrong understanding of Squarespace\r\nProficiency in design software such as Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, or Sketch\r\nStrong attention to detail\r\nExcellent communication skills\r\nThis is a part-time contract position with the potential for future opportunities. If you are passionate about design and interested in working with a growing luxury fashion brand, we encourage you to apply.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630616993390776321','-',7,'United States','na',30.