(11535,'Create an Attention Grabbing Pitch Deck',11,'Looking for a skilled and experienced pitch deck designer to help us create an engaging and visually stunning pitch deck for our start up media company. The pitch deck will be used to send to prospective advertising partners and should be designed in a way that showcases the unique features of our brand and grabs the attention of potential clients.\r\n\r\nI have the copy ready to go and the brand guide, it just needs someone who can pull it all together as stated above. Hoping to get this done quickly.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Design a visually stunning deck that reflects the brand image of Inside Fighting\r\n- Create a professional and clean layout for the deck\r\n- Use graphics and visuals to make the presentation engaging and informative\r\n- Ensure that the deck is consistent with our branding guidelines\r\n- Revise and iterate on the deck until it meets our expectations\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience in designing visually appealing pitch decks\r\n- Excellent design skills with an eye for detail\r\n- Experience working with branding guidelines and adhering to them\r\n- Samples of previous pitch decks designed\r\n\r\nTo apply, please provide some examples, a brief explanation of your experience creating pitch decks.\r\n\r\nPlease also include a time estimate an your best project price.\r\n\r\nTIA :)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630617647984357377?success','-',7,'United States','Kelowna',50.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-02-28',1,'2023-02-28',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-28 17:16:31',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
