(11547,'Party flyer for an event in a nightclub',2,'Dear freelancers\r\n\r\nThis is a repost. We had about 50 applicants for the original post, but sadly none of them meet our requirements.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe need a flyer design for a party in our nightclub.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease only apply if\r\n\r\n\r\n    you have sample work in the same field (event flyer for a nightclub party = not for houses, no flat design, no brochures, no food ads, BUT: an event flyer for a nightclub party)\r\n    you DO NOT copy+paste your text of appliance. Your apply can be short though. Your sample work needs to convince.\r\n    you are a graphic designer and DO NOT use template designs. \r\n    are familiar with 3d text illustrations\r\n    have a feeling for the industry and know what it takes\r\n\r\n\r\npurpose: Flyer design for a party in our nightclub.\r\n\r\ntitle: \"Pretty Cool\"\r\n\r\nsubtitle: \"Die Party für alle, die gerne früher kommen.\"\r\n\r\nLocation: \"Firehouse Weinfelden\"\r\n\r\ndate: \"Sa, 25. März 2023\"\r\n\r\ntime: \"18.59 - 00.59 Uhr\"\r\n\r\ninformal text: \"Früher starten. Früher ins Bett. Bei Pretty Cool hast du 100% Clubbing Erlebnis, einfach am Abend. So bist du am nächsten Tag fit und bereit für weitere Abenteuer.\"\r\n\r\nformats: various, A3,A4,A6, square format (insta), fb event, HD screen, etc...\r\n\r\nincl. editable and well-layered source file (.ai or psd)\r\n\r\n\r\nmain target: people between the age of 18 and 35 who like to go out and have a great time. It\'s for a party in a nightclub. Music format will be charts, hits, pop, rock = best songs of all time.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe would appreciate if the title is 3d animated / has depth. sample work is attached.\r\n\r\nThe subtitle should go along with the main title and be seen as part of it.\r\n\r\nNo template design.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe overall design should look modern, catchy, not childish, not cheap, not flat. with depth.\r\n\r\nWe are open for suggestions and looking for creative people. If you convince there are more jobs to follow.\r\n\r\n\r\nAgain: PLEASE only apply with suitable sample work and safe us and you time by sending auto-messages and non-related sample work.\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you a lot! \r\n\r\nKind regards.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2029245','-',7,'United States','abc',500.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-02-28',1,'2023-02-28',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-28 18:19:05',NULL,4,1,NULL,152),
