(11564,'Freelance Website Developer for a SEO Friendly Website for a Tattoo Shop',3,'Buzz Ink Tattoo Shop is looking for a talented freelance website developer to create a modern and SEO-friendly website for our business. The website will serve as a hub for showcasing our tattoo work, sharing information about our shop, and keeping our customers up to date on the latest news and events.\r\n\r\nWe need a website that is visually appealing, easy to navigate, and optimized for search engines. The website should include the following pages: homepage, about us, gallery, and blog.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nWork with our team to create a website that reflects the personality and style of our business.\r\nDevelop a visually appealing and user-friendly website that is optimized for search engines.\r\nBuild a responsive website that works on all devices, including desktops, laptops, tablets, and smartphones.\r\nIntegrate social media platforms into the website to drive engagement and traffic.\r\nProvide ongoing website maintenance and support as needed.\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\n-Proven experience as a website developer, with a portfolio of successful projects.\r\n-Proficiency in WordPress or other content management systems.\r\n-Ability to create custom themes and templates using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\r\n-Excellent communication and collaboration skills.\r\n-Strong attention to detail and ability to meet deadlines.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re passionate about creating beautiful and effective websites, we\'d love to hear from you. Please apply with your portfolio and a brief explanation of why you\'re a good fit for this project.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to working with you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630646805376479233','-',7,'United States','Beograd',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-02-28',1,'2023-02-28',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-28 19:12:12',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
