(11629,'Experience Web Designer Needed',4,'Hello my name is Donovan I\'m looking for a professional web designer to design my web page with about us, how we work, contact, and a catalog of our products. I want to have props included of vending machines and prop workers with our logo. My goal for the designer is to create a professional web page. The website is already purchased and I\'m ready to hire. I can provide the literature for the page just need everything to be done professionally\r\n\r\nAbout us :\r\n\r\nTasty Tech Vending is a vending service founded in 2019. Tasty Tech wants to give our customers a tasty, convenient , and ultimate break room experience . Our staff is dedicated to allowing our client a chance to select your variety of vending machines . We work with our clients to provide Tasty selections of your choice and refreshing beverages . Our focus is customer service , satisfaction , and time sensitivity .\r\n\r\nHow we work :\r\n\r\nOur team Allows our clients to select the desired machines we have available. We then present the terms of our contract and what is required of us partnering with your business . Tasty Tech will work with our clients delivery of vending machines , scheduling of refills , cleanings , and selection of inventory. All vending machines that are placed inside of your establishment are insured . Our staff is professionals and we want to create a London standing partnership with our clients','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630683629658337281','-',7,'United States','West Bloomfield',350.000,'fixed',350.000,'2023-02-28',1,'2023-02-28',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-28 21:38:27',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
