(11644,'WIX Web Developer needed to build a company website',3,'I need a web developer with WIX experience to build a complete minimalistic website for a SAAS (Software as a sales) company. Below are samples of what I am looking for. I need this project to start immediately and be completed in 30 days.\r\n\r\nI will send full details of the project upon hire of the contractor.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.alteryx.com/\r\nhttps://www.semarchy.com/platform/\r\nhttps://indatalabs.com/services/big-data-development\r\nhttps://themoderndatacompany.com/','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630690999704776705','-',7,'United States','Seattle',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-02-28',1,'2023-02-28',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-28 22:07:44',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(11645,'2D Animation Background Artist',8,'If you had magic at your fingertips, what would you do? Fight the forces of darkness? Forge an empire? Fulfill an ancient prophecy? Destroy the world and remake it in your image?\r\n\r\nBoring.\r\n\r\nHeroes want to save the world, villains want to end it, but this coven of witches would so much rather conjure a pizza, light up a joint, and turn some ex boyfriends into pigs.\r\n\r\nLooking for an artist to help a writer and I create pitch-able materials for an animated comedic TikTok series. The series is about a coven of queer witches. Currently, we have our initial backgrounds, character designs and a few assets created. We are looking for an artist who wants to redesign our existing backgrounds to make them more cohesive with our updated character design and visually appealing.\r\n\r\nPay will be a pretty open discussion between us and the artist and we plan on paying after each deliverable. Would love to find a queer artist to collaborate with!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630691274930524161?success','-',7,'United States','Culver City',8000.000,'fixed',8000.000,'2023-02-28',1,'2023-02-28',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-28 22:09:43',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
