(11647,'Quickly design a popup booth for a conference',2,'As we\'ve updated the logo for our company, we need to update the back of the popup booth that we designed 18mo ago. To do this I need a graphic designed to produce a new design with the appropriate format to be printed by the booth manufacturer.\r\n\r\nYou\'ll get (attached below):\r\n- high res logo file\r\n- file with our last booth design / info on dimensions / resolution\r\n- my \"crayola\" version of what I think it could look like\r\n- Some real imagery here: https://photos.app.goo.gl/oWiCjo4khzLZgdHE8\r\n\r\nWhat I need:\r\n- you to create a concept or 2 that focuses on medical device aspect of what we do (Ok to pick some istock photos for this - I can buy)\r\n- realistically we will probably iterate a few times\r\n- if you have a better approach, then FANTASTIC\r\n\r\n...I\'m hoping to get all of this completed no later than Thu Mar 2nd.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630693024030117889?success','-',7,'United States','Sheridan',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-02-28',1,'2023-02-28',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-28 22:16:01',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
