(11651,'Logo Development',10,'Hello! I\'m looking for a creative designer to develop a logo for my travel agency called \'Anasa Retreats\'.\r\n\r\nThe word \'Anasa\' has various meanings in different languages. Some of them are:\r\n\r\nAnasa in Greek means: Breath\r\nAnasa in Kiswahili means: Luxury, Joy\r\nAnasa in Arabic: Peace of mind\r\n\r\nWith that said, \'Anasa Retreats\' offers experiences that can be linked to \'serenity\', \'tranquility\' etc.\r\n\r\nOur Moto/Slogan is: Breath of Joy\r\n\r\nIdeally, I am looking for a logo that contains:\r\nthe Name (Anasa)\r\nthe Slogan (Breath of Joy)\r\nand also has a symbol that can be easily applied on Social Media to stand out\r\n\r\nHope the brief is clear. If you have any additional questions please let me know.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630695697559220225','-',7,'United States','Dubai',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-02-28',1,'2023-02-28',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-28 22:26:53',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(11652,'Brand Logo',10,'Design a brand logo for a food product line we want to develop soon. We are very clear on what we are looking for and need someone with great skills to execute it.\r\n\r\nSee pictures attached to understand concept:\r\n\r\nHealth/Dietetic food brand offering high end healthy food products in pharmacies and dietetic stores. Food products from Iran, we want to call the brand \"Avicenna\" founding father of modern medicine. We want the Cyprès tree like in the pictures of stone sculpture to be represented (symbol of life and health). It can be placed like the tree on the brand \"L\'amour Naturel\" in a sober style. Finally, you can surround all of it with a square like the brand \"L\'amour Naturel\". We want one test in black color, one in a premium green color, and one in gold.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630696461123833857','-',7,'United States','Denens',40.000,'fixed',40.000,'2023-02-28',1,'2023-02-28',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-28 22:29:22',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
