(11660,'Experienced Webdesigner For Lead Generation Website',4,'We are looking for an experienced web designer to create a lead generation website for our financial services company. The website will include a funnel for each type of financial service product we want to get leads for. The successful candidate will have amazing design experience, ideally understand UI/UX, and be able to create conversion-focused outcomes on websites.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Design and develop a lead generation website with multiple funnels for different types of financial service products\r\n- Collaborate with the marketing team to ensure the website is optimized for conversion and meets business objectives\r\n- Ensure the website is user-friendly, accessible, and responsive on all devices\r\n- Stay up-to-date with industry trends and best practices in web design and development\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience as a web designer, with a portfolio of previous work\r\n- Excellent design skills, with an eye for detail and a focus on user experience\r\n- Strong knowledge of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript\r\n- Experience with website optimization and conversion rate optimization (CRO)\r\n- Knowledge of UX design principles and ability to apply them to website design\r\n- Familiarity with WordPress or other content management systems\r\n- Strong communication skills and ability to collaborate with cross-functional teams\r\n\r\nIf you are a talented web designer who is passionate about creating conversion-focused websites, we encourage you to apply for this role. Please submit your resume, portfolio, and a brief cover letter highlighting your relevant experience and skills.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630699574182440961','-',7,'United States','Concord',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-02-28',1,'2023-02-28',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-02-28 22:41:55',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
