(11679,'Logo Design & Different Sizes for my new marketing website launching next month.',2,'Hi.  I am looking for an awesome design specialist who can create a logo for a new small marketing firm that works with Google Ads clients.  High-quality images.  \r\n\r\nThe website is being built in a Wordpress Elementor Pro \"staging area\" and the colors and theme have not been set yet.\r\n\r\nLOGO - for the design of the logo, I am looking for a few proofs / examples from a talented artistic person.  \r\n\r\nLOGO - BANNERS - SIZES (Some sizes are Google Ads approved - so I will need some of these as well.) Logo (Rectangle), 250 x 100 px, 2:3 ; Logo (Square), 100 x 100 px .\r\n\r\nFAVICON - I will need this also.\r\n16x16 pixels\r\nImage result for logo and favicon sizes for wordpress\r\nFavicon images are small in size, only 16 pixels in height by 16 pixels in width, so there is not much space for complex designs. Still, a good favicon that is clean, simple and easily identifiable can provide a good visual indicator for visitors navigating to your site through their tabs or bookmarks.\r\n\r\nWhen we decide on the proof that is the best, then we can move on to the next step of sizes and file sizes, types of banners such as: Up to 5 logos with at least: 1 x 1200×1200 (recommended) (128×128 min size) square logo (1:1) 1 x 1200×300 (recommended) (512×128 min size) landscape logo (4:1)\r\n\r\nIt is not not a rush, but I can make sure we are on a weekly/hourly on Upwork so you get paid for any time each week after we start.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested, please let me know or send me some examples of your creative/logos, etc.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630877757688320001','-',7,'United States','Oakdale',65.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-03-01',1,'2023-03-01',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-01 11:17:59',NULL,7,3,NULL,155),
