(11712,'Designer for Theme based Templates for Customizable Stubbie Coolers',2,'We are seeking a talented designer to join our team and create templates for customizable stubbie coolers (koozies). As a designer, you will be responsible for developing creative and eye-catching designs that our customers can use to personalize their stubbie coolers. You will work closely with our marketing team to understand our customers\' needs and preferences, and to create designs that meet those needs.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDevelop thematic templates for customizable stubbie coolers (example weddings, golf trips, fishing trips, stag do\'s, hen do\'s etc etc).\r\nCollaborate with marketing team to understand customer needs and preferences\r\nCreate designs that are eye-catching, on-brand, and that appeal to our target audience\r\nStay up-to-date with design trends and incorporate them into your work\r\nWork within project timelines and budget constraints\r\nPresent design concepts to team members and incorporate feedback into final designs\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nStrong portfolio of design work\r\nProficiency in Adobe Creative Suite, including Photoshop, Illustrator, and InDesign\r\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills\r\nKnowledge of print production processes\r\nExperience in designing for merchandise is a plus\r\n\r\nIf you are a creative and motivated designer who is passionate about creating designs that make a difference, we want to hear from you.\r\n\r\nPlease submit your resume, portfolio, and cover letter for consideration.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ea1edda6b22d5fb9','-',7,'United States','Sydney',10.000,'perhour',10.000,'2023-03-01',1,'2023-03-01',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-01 15:54:51',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
