(11716,'Brand Book for Beachwear Brand',2,'We are seeking a creative and experienced graphic designer to create a brand book for Sanwin Beachwear. Our brand is all about the beach and adventure lifestyle, and we want our marketing materials to reflect that. We use a fun and playful tone in our communication, while still maintaining a sense of sophistication and quality.\r\n\r\nAs the designer for this project, you will be responsible for creating a comprehensive brand book that includes our brand\'s colors, fonts, and styles. We want our brand to be instantly recognizable and cohesive across all our marketing channels, from social media to our website.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should have a strong portfolio of work that showcases their experience in brand identity and design. They should be able to take direction and incorporate feedback from our team, while also bringing their own creative ideas to the table.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re excited about creating a brand identity for a company that embodies the beach and adventure lifestyle, then we would love to hear from you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630962238150479873?success','-',7,'United States','Groningen',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-03-01',1,'2023-03-01',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-01 16:05:27',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
(11717,'Create a Custom Google Slide Template from an existing Style Guide',11,'I need a custom Google Slides presentation THEMED TEMPLATE design to be adapted from existing PDF presentation. (Please reference photo \"Slides-Master.png\" attached)\r\n\r\nThe final themed template needs to match the existing style guide, and be easy to follow and edit. (Please Reference \"DomainGuard-StyleGuide.PDF\" attached.)\r\n\r\nThe final themed template must include a \"mini version of the style guide\" for ease of reference. This must include PNGs of the logos, color block examples and any other PNGs that I provide for ease of reference. (Please see example reference \"Mini-Style-Guide.png\" attached).\r\n\r\nI will provide the basic template that needs to be customized and share it with the contracted designer.\r\n\r\nAn example page of the presentation that needs to be adapted as well as an example of the brand style guide are attached for reference. (Please reference \"DG-Presentation-Example-1.png\" and \"DG-Presentation-Example-2.png\" attached).\r\n\r\nI will provide high resolution PNGs of all the necessary logos to the contractor once they are assigned.\r\n\r\nThere are 12 pages in total that need to be designed. 11 pages from the presentation + the \"mini style guide\" page.\r\n\r\nCREATIVE DIRECTION NOTES:\r\nThe PDF presentation is too BLUE and needs to be adapted to include more white space, and overall needs to more closely match the design of the brand style guide.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you have any questions.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630962516039774209?success','-',7,'United States','Cherry Hill',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-03-01',1,'2023-03-01',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-01 16:07:03',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
