(11755,'Logo Design / Brand Identity',2,'Hi everyone,\r\nWe are a small company in the process of rebranding an existing handmade ceramic product to be marketed and sold online via social media channels.\r\n\r\nWe hope to find a graphic designer that has creative flair and has the ability to create branding that fits our handmade product ; not only representing the handmade craft but also the utility and aesthetic value of the product. The branding has to fit into a 21st century kitchen and should be received well intergenerationally, however the branding needs to especially speak to Gen Z and Millennials.\r\n\r\nAttached is a brief outlining more about ourselves,','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1630975370835058689?success','Reid Wakefield - Mascot Logo Design - Alex',64,'United States','.',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-02-01',1,'2023-03-01',1,'NA',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-03-01 16:57:47','2023-03-13 19:01:20',7,3,NULL,135),
