(11761,'Developer required for Wordpress Plugin',15,'We are a very small agency that is currently seeking a skilled and experienced WordPress plugin developer to assist our front-end developer in updating and integrating a WordPress plugin - enhancing the functionality and design of the plugin.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe plugin is an old plugin from the WordPress repository (JustImmo) that calls on an API to pull data from this service. Our developer has updated the plugin to work, however still needs some code cleaning and styling to be done. Overall, this should not be a complicated task, however we need to outsource a bit of this work due to constraints.\r\n\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n    Update the existing WordPress plugin to ensure compatibility with the latest WordPress versions and security updates.\r\n    Clean code - update repositories and remove any deprecated code.\r\n    Integrate the plugin with Bricksbuilder\r\n    Integrate the plugin with WP Grid Builder\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements\r\n\r\n    Experience with WordPress plugin development\r\n    Good/strong proficiency in PHP, Javascript, and HTML/CSS\r\n    Good to have: Experience with WordPress plugin development frameworks such as WP-CLI, WP REST API, or WP-GraphQL.\r\n    Knowledge of WordPress security best practices.\r\n    Strong problem-solving and analytical skills.\r\n    Excellent communication and collaboration skills.\r\n    Ability to work independently and meet project deadlines.\r\n\r\n\r\nTimeline\r\n\r\nOnce the project is released, we expect a maximum two week period for deliverables.\r\n\r\n\r\nPricing\r\n\r\nBudget set to $250. As a good portion of the work is already done. Depending on overall experience we may consider up to $500 budget.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is a one time project, however, we are seeking the option for multiple project collaborations moving forward on freelancing basis. If the work is delivered on time, and signed off by our developer, then after a few additional projects, hiring may be considered.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2029641','-',7,'United States','-',250.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-01',1,'2023-03-01',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-01 17:04:11',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
