(11800,'Designing and building a website for business advisory services',3,'This website aims to showcase the consultant\'s expertise and services to potential clients. The website should provide relevant and helpful information to potential clients about how the consultant can help them achieve their goals.\r\n\r\nHere are some specific purposes that the website will serve:\r\n\r\nIntroduce the consultant and their services: The website should introduce the consultant, their expertise, and their services. This could include information about the consultant\'s background, qualifications, experience, and case studies or testimonials demonstrating their effectiveness.\r\n\r\nEducate potential clients: The website should provide information about the benefits of management consulting, the types of problems that a consultant can help solve, and the methods and techniques that the consultant uses. This will help potential clients understand how the consultant can help them improve their business.\r\n\r\nGenerate leads: The website should include calls to action, such as contact forms or email addresses, that allow potential clients to contact the consultant. It may also have downloadable resources, such as white papers or e-books, that provide additional value to visitors and encourage them to provide their contact information.\r\n\r\nEstablish credibility: The website should establish the consultant\'s credibility and expertise through thought leadership content, such as blog posts, articles, or videos that provide insights and commentary on industry trends and best practices.\r\n\r\nHere\'s an overview of the process:\r\n\r\nPlan the website architecture and navigation: Create a site map that outlines the website\'s structure, and plan the navigation to ensure that users can easily find the information they need.\r\n\r\nDevelop a content strategy: Determine what content will be included on the website and how it will be organized and presented.\r\n\r\nDesign the website\'s visual style: Develop the visual style of the website, including the color scheme, typography, and imagery.\r\n\r\nBuild the website: Use a web development tool or hire a web developer to create the website. Ensure that the website is mobile-friendly and meets web accessibility standards.\r\n\r\nTest and launch the website: Test it thoroughly to ensure it is functional and user-friendly, and project it once all the testing is complete.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631030345680269313','Pierre Adolphe Muhire| Website Des & Dev. | Shoaib Mehdi',92,'United States','Rwanda',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-03-01',1,'2023-03-01',1,'na',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-03-01 20:36:39','2023-03-09 21:48:05',8,3,NULL,156),
