(11821,'Build responsive Square Space website for AIYD',18,'AIYD is the pre-eminent track-two leaders’ dialogue between Australia and India. We bring leaders under 40 years of age from both countries together for an annual leadership conference and foster an active network of more than 150 alumni.\r\n\r\nAIYD\'s current website (aiyd.org) is tired and cluttered. It offers a poor user experience and too much content. We want to get rid of the video on the home page!\r\n\r\nWe need a new website that provides clear and concise information for prospective delegates, alumni, representatives from funder and partner organisations, stakeholders from government (e.g. foreign affairs policymakers) and business.\r\n\r\nOur first thoughts are for the following sections but we would work with you to confirm scope of work:\r\n\r\n1. About Us\r\n2. 2023 Dialogue\r\n3. Past Dialogue\r\n3. Alumni (see note below about extra work)\r\n4. Publications\r\n5. News\r\n6. Get Involved\r\n\r\nWe need a designer to take what we have and some thoughts on making it more streamlined, and building something with SquareSpace that is easy for volunteers to keep updated. We hope to complete this work within 1 month. You will need to work independently but we can give you 1 contact person (a volunteer) to help answer questions and provide collateral.\r\n\r\nThere is the potential for additional work, including updates to pages and helping us build a simple alumni portal, where partners and alumni could upload their bios, contact details and contact each other.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631042267102371841','-',7,'United States','na',1285.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-03-01',1,'2023-03-01',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-01 21:23:40',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
