(11858,'WANTED: Rockstar Graphic/Web Designer for Go High Level Pages',4,'Work for a Great Company! Weekly Pay + Bonuses + Sick Days + Vacation + Holidays\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nAre you looking for an awesome job that\'s not only\r\nfun, challenging, and enjoyable, but also pays you\r\nmore money the harder you work?\r\n\r\nNot only do we work on fun and challenging projects,\r\nbut as the company grows, so does your SALARY! :)\r\n\r\nThis job isn’t for everyone!\r\n\r\nThis job is for a person who really gets \"tech stuff\" and has Very Good English Writing Skills!\r\n\r\nThis freelance work will eventually lead to joining a team on a long-term basis, but first, we\'ll be building a website using Unbounce.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis Should Be A Challenging But FUN Job For Someone That Knows What They\'re Doing.\r\n\r\nI WANT SOMEONE WHO IS A PROFESSIONAL AND KNOWS HOW TO GET ME THE RESULTS OF BUILDING ENTIRE WEBSITES.\r\n\r\nWe want someone that pays high attention to detail.\r\n\r\nPlease note that this job is for one person only, and we do NOT deal with agencies. This includes two people who might want to job share. It’s very important that we hire one person!\r\n\r\nThe successful applicant will be provided software that can only be licensed on one machine, so if you are an agency, you will waste both our time and your own by applying. And for the same reason, don’t apply if you’re planning to job share with someone else.\r\n\r\n\r\nAfter reviewing your previous work history, I will give you full details in a private message.\r\n\r\nIn general, your first tasks will entail developing and building a website using Go High Level\r\n\r\nWe use communication, so you must have a working knowledge of these tools.\r\n\r\nPlease give me the following:\r\n\r\n1) Please provide links to your previous Go High Level graphic design work.\r\n\r\n2) An ETA when you would be able to start.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for someone who is available to discuss the project details first.\r\n\r\n3) Let me know you have read the entire job post, have a good eye for details, and can follow instructions by putting your first name spelled backward at the top of your cover letter.\r\n\r\nPlease reply with the words \"High Level\" in the first line, as the first characters in the description, so I know you took the time to read this complete job posting!\r\n\r\nIf we move you to a second interview, we’ll do a voice chat.\r\n\r\nSo that I know you read until the end, please put the name of the CEO of Home Depot at the top of your reply to this job posting.\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631058019964252161','-',7,'United States','New Jersey',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-01',1,'2023-03-01',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-01 22:26:18',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
