(11917,'Experienced package designer for a healthy sports drink brand',2,'NOOMA (www.drinknooma.com) is a line of organic sports drinks offered in thousands of retail outlets and gyms throughout the US and online, primarily via our website and Amazon. \r\n\r\nOur products set the standard for clean ingredients in our space and have thousands of 5-star reviews from customers that love what we offer. However, we feel our current package design falls short in impactfully delivering on this positioning.   \r\n\r\nWe\'re in search of a designer with significant industry experience, specifically in package design for food and beverage brands that understands the proper hierarchy of a package design and what\'s needed to stand out on a shelf. We need someone that can develop a design that brings together the worlds of clean eating and fitness. You need to have the ability to understand our target audience, what moves them, and how our products fit into their lives and utilize that information to develop a package they are proud to carry around.\r\n\r\nFor this project, we have an idea of where we want to go and have a set of initial package designs. We aren\'t starting from scratch - we need help impactfully and strategically bringing our ideas and concepts together. We\'ll be looking for you to help us incorporate ingredient imagery and/or illustration.\r\n\r\nIn total, we have 4 product lines (energy drink, sports drink, hydration mix, and recovery soda), each with its own flavors. We\'ll start with one product line and one flavor to get the design concept nailed down and then apply that to all other flavors and product lines.\r\n\r\nYou will report directly to the brand\'s co-founder, Jarred.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631317325007872001?success','-',7,'United States','na',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-03-02',1,'2023-03-02',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-02 15:36:41',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
