(11924,'Zero nicotine e cigarette packaging design',2,'RXNicotine® powered by NCTT® nicotine cold turkey therapy - is a revolutionary solution that eliminates nicotine from your body completely. Unlike NRT or \"reduced risk\" products that leave nicotine in your system, RXNicotine® is designed to satisfy the three primary psychological aspects of addiction that smokers experience. These aspects include the hand-to-mouth motion, the vapor, and the flavor. With RXNicotine®, you can experience the satisfaction of smoking without the harmful effects of nicotine addiction. Say goodbye to nicotine for good with RXNicotine® powered by NCTT®.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631320578319659009?success','Mike Silverstein | Packaging Design | JG.',77,'United States','pompano beach',200.000,'Open this select menu',200.000,'2023-03-02',1,'2023-03-02',1,'NA',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-03-02 15:49:56','2023-03-09 20:13:03',10,3,NULL,119),
