(11929,'Packaging Graphic Designer',2,'We\'re looking for a talented Packaging Graphic Designer to work with our creative team on an as-needed basis. As our Designer, you\'ll be responsible for creating visually stunning and marketable graphic designs for our product lines\' packaging boxes. You\'ll collaborate with cross-functional teams to ensure packaging designs align with our product strategy and branding. Additionally, you\'ll need to prepare artwork files for print, ensuring our designs are of the highest quality.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n- Develop visually stunning packaging graphic designs for our products.\r\n- Collaborate with cross-functional teams to ensure designs align with our product strategy and branding.\r\n- Create designs that effectively communicate product features, benefits, and value propositions.\r\n- Manage multiple design projects simultaneously, ensuring timely delivery of completed designs.\r\n- Prepare artwork files for print, ensuring our designs are of the highest quality.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Bachelor\'s degree in Graphic Design or a related field.\r\n- At least 3 years of experience in packaging design.\r\n- Proficient in design software such as Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, and InDesign.\r\n- Strong portfolio of previous packaging or graphic designs for products.\r\n- Excellent communication and collaboration skills.\r\n- Detail-oriented with exceptional organizational and time management abilities.\r\n- Experience preparing artwork files for print, ensuring our designs are of the highest quality.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631324363846791169?success','-',7,'United States','Singapore',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-03-02',1,'2023-03-02',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-02 16:04:23',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
