(11981,'Packaging Designer for Puzzle Adhesive Foils',2,'We are looking for a skilled packaging designer to create a visually appealing and informative design for puzzle adhesive foils. The adhesive foils are designed to hang wooden puzzles on the wall without the need for liquid glue. The package contains 8 adhesive foils, each measuring 25x17,5cm. Attached an example of a product packaging (old fashioned and not very appealing)\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Develop and execute a creative and informative packaging design concept for the puzzle adhesive foils.\r\n- Ensure the packaging design reflects the brand identity and product messaging.\r\n- Highlight the key features of the adhesive foils, such as their ability to hang puzzles without the need for liquid glue and the bendable nature of the foil for easy removal from the backing paper.\r\n- Collaborate with the client to incorporate any necessary information and requirements into the design.\r\n- Ensure the design meets the technical specifications for printing.\r\n- Provide the final design in a print-ready format.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience in designing packaging for consumer products.\r\n- Excellent skills in graphic design software such as Adobe Illustrator, InDesign, and Photoshop.\r\n- Strong portfolio of previous packaging design work.\r\nUnderstanding of the technical aspects of designing for print.\r\n- Ability to work efficiently and meet deadlines.\r\n- Strong communication skills to collaborate with clients.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you are a creative and skilled packaging designer with experience in designing for consumer products, we would love to hear from you.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01cf4ce3bb85848f7f','-',7,'United States','Esslingen Am Neckar',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-02',1,'2023-03-02',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-02 17:56:39',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
