(12028,'Developer for B2B Prospecting and Personal Identity Mapping Tool',4,'We need a talented developer with experience building B2B prospecting tools and databases to build a system for finding personal - not business - emails of prospects.\r\n\r\nMany tools currently available will allow us to refine by firmographic/technographic datapoints and then further refine by job titles, etc. They would then provide us with a business email address. In this case, we need to develop a tool for our internal use that will find the personal email address of a professional contact.\r\n\r\nClearbit, Metadata.io, and other high end platforms are able to do this as a small feature of a much broader tech platform. Our use case is straightforward and well defined as just the prospecting to personal identifier aspect of this.\r\n\r\nAlternately, for an MVP, it may be acceptable to skip the prospecting process and simply take a CSV with business contacts pulled from existing databases and match them to personal emails.\r\n\r\nYou must have development experience with these types of sales intelligence/prospecting softwares to be considered for this role.\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631372911888097281?success','-',7,'United States','Culver City',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-03-02',1,'2023-03-02',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-02 19:19:11',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
