(12059,'Branding & Logo Design / Brand Identity for DTC e-commerce Brand',2,'We are a german based DTC e-commerce brand specializing in selling shoes. With a focus on sourcing and selling high-quality, in-demand products, our company is offering customers a convenient and seamless online shopping experience.\r\n\r\nNow we want to refine our brand strategy and corporate identity. For this purpose we are looking for a person who has experience to develop the complete brand strategy for e-commerce brand and to provide an excellent brand experience.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe would need your skills for the following:\r\n- Develop brand strategy (goals, values, vision, mission of the brand)\r\n- Create a look & feel mood board\r\n- Create new logo variations\r\n- Create a corporate design guide (typography, logos, color palette, etc.)\r\n\r\nYour Benefits:\r\n- Professional collaboration\r\n- You can be creative to the fullest. We are a brand with proof of concept, which is open for new ideas.\r\n- We are well connected in the DTC e-commerce scene and would recommend your service in our network.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity for a one-time branding job. If you are a highly experienced and detail-oriented individual with a passion for branding and design, we encourage you to apply. Please send us a short letter of motivation and your portfolio. *Please attach in your motivation letter the word “BLUE” so we know that you’ve read the job description.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nless\r\nMore/Less about\r\nView job posting\r\nExpert,\r\nExperience Level\r\nLess than 30 hrs/week','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631385798847213569','-',7,'United States','Hamburg',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-02',1,'2023-03-02',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-02 20:08:44',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
