(12090,'Three Animation Videos',8,'I need an animation video for my new company which will have five (5) outlets or physical locations around the United States. The content created will be used on the company indoor/outdoor LCD monitors, websites and any kind of our ads.\r\n\r\n1. Company Name: McCurdy Naturals.\r\n2. My website is under construction which will be registered soon.\r\n3. Full text content, logo, background music and pictures for this design contents will be submitted to you by my project consultant. You just have to handle the layout and the design\r\n4. I want you to add our core values, mission and vision (This information will be provided on hire)\r\n6. I want this delivered in 5-6 weeks to the latest.\r\n7. All videos should be animated.\r\n\r\nYou will produce 3 videos, each featuring a different template as selected by me (see YouTube link below), with an approximate segment time of 120 seconds each. You will deliver 6 videos (1080p); 3 original/finished videos and 3 raw videos, one for each original video. This means you will deliver an unedited and edited version of all 3 videos. Delivering should also be in mov or mp4 format. The raw video will be used for future editing.\r\n\r\nBelow are the inspirational video templates below:\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8s-m2KB2_xM\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hXZOMEsCgZY\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l9M4t5vu3cI\r\n\r\nBrief information about the video templates:\r\nThe first template (1) will be a form of promotional animation to showcase our restaurant. The second template (2) will showcase our food menu and price. The third template (3) will be a special dish illustration . All videos should have background music and company logos which will also be delivered to you by the project consultant.\r\n\r\nMcCurdy Naturals is a dream come true for me. My whole life and family is into this project. To my customers, McCurdy Naturals should be able to provide a health conscious delicious menu under strict FDA\'s guidelines.\r\nOur uniqueness will be a privilege of a healthy menu and unique location around the United States. Our experienced and highly trained chefs/waiters will also stand us out.\r\n\r\nOther project essentials:\r\nI want you to know that this is the first time I will be doing an animation so I can only give you the above details but you can work based on the sample templates given above. The videos provided are our inspiration and how the preferred animation videos should look like.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631400898396139521?success','-',7,'United States','Eden',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-03-02',1,'2023-03-02',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-02 21:16:58',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
