(12095,'Create Designs For Us (+$7k/year) | Flexible Schedule',2,'If you\'re interested in consistent graphic design work each month, this could be a great fit!\r\n\r\nWe need self-motivated designers who can work through a list of projects & consistently produce professional looking designs.\r\n\r\nHere is our process...\r\n1. You pick a project to work on (example: Real Estate - Grand Opening Flyer)\r\n2. You get access to the template, logo & other assets.\r\n3. You come up with your own design (You can pull inspiration from the web)\r\n4. Submit for review and we pay you.\r\n\r\nIf this sounds interesting to you, please contact us and include the word \"AWESOME\" in your cover letter to show you read this.\r\n\r\nYou\'ll be designing in our online editor which is simple to learn and loaded with assets to make designing fast to ensure you\'re not wasting your time.\r\n\r\nPlease include relevant work if possible.\r\n\r\nThanks!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011f29b891838e609f','-',7,'United States','Fargo',20.000,'perhour',80.000,'2023-03-02',1,'2023-03-02',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-02 21:22:46',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
