(12121,'Book cover design for fiction book (front cover only)',2,'We need a book cover designed for a Christian fiction book that is Exodus-themed (front cover only).\r\n\r\nWe will need the cover to be designed in Adobe InDesign, and we will need all original artwork with layers unmerged so we can make any necessary modifications on our end and complete the back cover and spine design on our end.\r\n\r\nWe asked the author what she would like to see on this cover. This is just to give the designer a sense of what the author likes. She is not a graphic designer, so we are relying on your creative skill to produce a high-quality book cover.\r\n\r\nHere is the feedback provided by the author:\r\nI like the placing of the title, author\'s name and picture for this cover, not so much the color and font.\r\nhttps://www.amazon.com/Unscripted-Battle-Empire-Redstone-Family-ebook/dp/B0B1BR6JS4/ref=zg_bs_154821011_sccl_7/144-9334457-4487516?psc=1\r\nAgain, I like the set and placing of this cover, and the color is not so bad either.\r\nhttps://www.amazon.com/All-Beauty-World-Metropolitan-Museum-ebook/dp/B09JPKNG9X/ref=zg_bs_154821011_sccl_45/144-9334457-4487516?psc=1\r\nI like the placing, and I would like on my cover a more cartoonish picture. Not so much a real photo.\r\nhttps://www.amazon.com/Cure-Young-Adult-Dystopian-Chronicles-ebook/dp/B08Z46Y2HF/ref=sr_1_4?crid=29WO5O3KD2YX6&keywords=best+selling+young+adult+books&qid=1677378518&s=digital-text&sprefix=best+selling+young+adult+books%2Cdigital-text%2C90&sr=1-4\r\nI like the placing, and the art for this one\r\nhttps://www.amazon.com/Elephant-Garden-Inspired-True-Story-ebook/dp/B00606F5XU/ref=sr_1_6?crid=29WO5O3KD2YX6&keywords=best+selling+young+adult+books&qid=1677378721&s=digital-text&sprefix=best+selling+young+adult+books%2Cdigital-text%2C90&sr=1-6\r\n\r\nWe will provide the book title, subtitle, and author\'s name for the front cover ... as well as the book\'s description to give you a clearer understanding of what the book is about.\r\n\r\nIn your application for this job, please provide samples of book covers you have personally designed. We will pay $65 for the front cover design in Adobe Indesign file with layers unmerged.\r\n\r\nWe publish about 27 books per year and have other graphic design needs. We are looking for a talented, skilled, and easy-to-work-with designer we can rely on for future projects as well as this one.\r\n\r\nThanks in advance!\r\n\r\nHigh Bridge Books','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631419271970385921?success','-',7,'United States','WAYNESVILLE',65.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-03-02',1,'2023-03-02',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-02 22:21:41',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
