(12126,'5-7 page Divi website',15,'Need a WordPress website using Divi from Elegant Themes.  \r\n\r\nI have an account with Elegant Themes.\r\n\r\nThis is a manufacturing-type company.  \r\n\r\nThere is no current website. This is a brand-new website. \r\n\r\nI will supply all content and images.\r\n\r\n\r\nA child theme must be created.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThe following plugins will also need to be used:\r\n\r\n(1) Yoast SEO \r\n\r\n(2) Google Analytics\r\n\r\n(3) Formidable Pro - I have the license\r\n\r\n(4) Wordfence\r\n\r\n\r\nThe website must be Responsive Mobile Friendly \r\n\r\nI will need the design and implementation. I make most of the edits myself which should save you tons of time. I do 99% of the edits myself. Sometimes, I\'ll need help with CSS.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nI will set up WP on my server and install the theme and plugins. It will be set up on my domain /new-site/ Then transferred to the client\'s server upon completion.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nPlease send me the following ONLY\r\n\r\n(1) Three links of Divi WordPress websites. (Divi only please)\r\n\r\n(2) Answer this question:  What is your favorite home-cooked meal?\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nI\'m looking to add a team member to my company.  Therefore, I\'m looking for a long-term relationship. \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIf you are outside the US, please do not apply.  Your bid will be deleted. \r\n\r\nI prefer to work with someone on the East Coast due to time zones. But will entertain other US time zones.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAlso, I\'ve seen lately where people place a bid holder and ask for details.  I can\'t give you more details than what is included here.  So I\'d like an actual bid please.  If you have questions, feel free to ask them. But if you place a bid holder, you will be deleted.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIf you have any questions, you may contact me directly. \r\n\r\nYou will be deleted if you cut and paste 20 links into the bid. \r\n\r\nI\'m looking for someone who can follow directions. Email will be our primary method of communication.  It\'s important that someone can follow directions and ask questions.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2030445','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',750.000,'2023-03-02',1,'2023-03-02',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-02 22:28:12',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
