(12146,'Medical Relationship Manager',22,'The Medical Relationship Manager calls upon Doctors\' offices to fetch private medical information for our patients managing Diabetes. He or she would also be responsible for communicating with patients the documents compliance progress and establishing a trust-cooperation relationship with them to help expedite completion.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities\r\nSupport compliance efforts with medical documents for patients\r\nOutbound calls for paperwork follow-through, patient orientation and follow-up\r\nReview medical-related documents aligned with patient care as well as compliance.\r\nFax documents to physicians’ offices and follow through on their progress.\r\nRun patient reports and assess who’s scheduled and whom can we schedule for their annual healthcare benefit.\r\nBuild compassionate relationships with patients and their physicians\r\nTo perform all duties necessary in order to keep our patients safe.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for someone who has:\r\nRegistered Nurse is a MUST.\r\nVirtual Assistant experience is a PLUS.\r\nQuick-thinker; solutions-oriented and resourceful – is not afraid to think out of the box to accomplish tasks\r\nDetail oriented\r\nArticulate and able to clearly communicate in English\r\nWith excellent time-management and organizational skills;\r\nDetermined, results-oriented with good interpersonal and communications skills\r\nAbility to adapt, work independently and manage multiple tasks at a time - Requires minimal supervision\r\nA good team player as well and is willing to learn\r\nExperience with effectively supporting many roles & departments within an organization a plus.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631426630839119873','-',7,'United States','Brighton',5.000,'perhour',5.000,'2023-03-02',1,'2023-03-02',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-02 22:53:04',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
