(12154,'UI/UX Designer for Call Center Web App',6,'We are seeking a talented UI/UX designer to develop a couple of new pages for our call center web application. We have an existing app and we need to add some new functionality to it. Our previous UI/UX designer is no longer available, so we are looking for someone to take over the design work.\r\n\r\nThe successful candidate will be responsible for creating designs that are consistent with our current look and feel, and that seamlessly integrate the new elements we need to add. We have web developers on hand to handle the technical implementation, so we only need PSD files.\r\n\r\nWhile this is a small project, we have more features in the pipeline that will require additional UI/UX work for the web application, website, and marketing materials. Therefore, we are looking for someone who is interested in a long-term collaboration.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nDemonstrable experience in UI/UX design\r\nStrong portfolio demonstrating expertise in designing web applications\r\nExcellent knowledge of design software, such as Photoshop, Sketch, or Figma\r\nAbility to work independently and meet tight deadlines\r\nExcellent communication skills and attention to detail\r\nAbility to match the current look and feel of the app\r\nFamiliarity with call center applications is a plus\r\n\r\nTo apply, please prepare a mockup that demonstrates your ability to integrate the elements of the example we provide in Attachment2, in a design that matches our current look and feel as shown in the screenshots of Attachment1 of our current app. We will need the results within 24 hours of selecting a candidate. We plan to wrap up the selection process by Sunday or Latest Monday.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this opportunity, please submit your application along with your portfolio and mockup. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631430695656566785','-',7,'United States','London',50.000,'Open this select menu',40.000,'2023-03-02',1,'2023-03-02',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-02 23:07:32',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
