(12158,'Graphic designer to chalkboard-style designs for signage',2,'Seeking a graphic designer to create chalkboard-style designs for a project. This project is for one of my clients. I value confidentiality and am looking for someone who understands and respects the importance of maintaining my clients\' privacy. I would like to find a reliable and skilled designer who can take on this project specifically and then potentially additional design projects for future needs to alleviate my workload.\r\n\r\nExamples of past designs, current elements used in their materials, and photos can be provided to get a visual overview of the brand itself. Primarily their branding colors are black, white, & red with chalkboard-style feel. The focus for this artwork is handcrafted burgers, beer & cocktails, shakes & smoothies, and wings with chalkboard-style lettering & elements. Motorcycles and American Flag elements have been incorporated into the designs of their previous materials as well.\r\n\r\nThe design will be used on a wall mural or signage. Ideally, I\'d like both a vertical and a horizontal variation of the graphics. The final artwork needs to be an editable vector file so we are able to resize it to spec for printing & update content in the future if needed.\r\n\r\nAn ideal turn-around would be within 1-2 weeks, but I am open to adjusting that accordingly. Please let me know what additional details you might need to decide if this project is a good fit for you.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~014922458ce7a1677d','-',7,'United States','Destin',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-03-03',1,'2023-03-03',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-03 09:43:21',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
