(12176,'Logo Design and Brand Guidelines for Cryptocurrency Franchise Brand',2,'We are looking for a talented and creative designer to help us develop a logo and brand guidelines for our cryptocurrency franchise brand, BitBulls. The brand operates across multiple sites, and we want to ensure that we have a consistent concept while also maintaining a unique feel for each site.\r\n\r\nThe primary focus of this project is to design a logo that embodies the BitBulls brand and its values. The logo should be memorable, recognizable, and easily adaptable across different platforms and media. In addition, we would like the designer to develop a set of brand guidelines that will help us maintain a consistent brand image across all our sites.\r\n\r\nThe brand guidelines should include recommendations for typography, color palette, imagery, and other design elements that should be used to create a cohesive and effective brand identity. The guidelines should also provide specifications for how the logo and other visual elements should be used across different media types, such as websites, social media profiles, and promotional materials.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631669869718605825?success','-',7,'United States','Albany',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-03',1,'2023-03-03',1,'Fixed Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-03 14:57:11',NULL,9,3,NULL,140),
