(12235,'Animation for Website Banner',8,'Hi,\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for someone to design a website banner with mild animation for a windows and doors company. I\'m inspired by the website www.lemonade.com.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for something similar. I\'m not an artist but I\'ve attached a concept.\r\n\r\nEssentially I think we can do something where the family is looking from across the street at their windows getting installed... maybe have a Clera (this is for www.clearwindows.com) work truck parked up the street. And maybe have the installer on a ladder installing the window.\r\n\r\nAny maybe create a version where there is some seasonality for Winter, Spring, Summer, Fall.\r\n\r\nThis is for a website in Canada so perhaps we put a tree that has snow on it in the winter and the family has winter clothes. But in the Spring the tree is budding and there\'s a birds nest... and in the summer, its full of leaves... and the kid is now wearing shorts and he has a skateboard.... you know... just subtle things that would change with the season. Pumpkin and Fallen Leaves in the fall.\r\n\r\nHere\'s what I didn\'t like: https://www.figma.com/proto/8guwW9mKJqNE7sNCw6Zz8B/Clera-Homepage-Banner?node-id=11%3A18678&scaling=scale-down-width&page-id=0%3A1','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631733996520419329?success','-',7,'United States','Toronto',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-03',1,'2023-03-03',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-03 19:12:52',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
