(12249,'Landing Page Designer',4,'This job is primarily about conceptualizing, designing, and implementing creative digital design projects for AppSumo. Starting role will be up to 20 hours/week.\r\n\r\nThis role is for you if you’re highly creative, detail-oriented, and hyper-organized. It’s designed for someone excited by a fast-paced startup environment with continuous opportunities for innovation.\r\n\r\nYou’ll be working alongside our marketing and product teams. On the day-to-day, you’ll be using Figma primarily.\r\n\r\nSuccess means creating mock-ups and design/visual assets, delivering project deliverables on time, and establishing best practices for user experience.\r\n\r\nThis unique role requires creativity, tech-savvy, time management, and strong communication.\r\n\r\nWhy You’ll Love it\r\n\r\nIf you’re a team player who can work with various of different stakeholders, and a self-starter who loves to translate ideas into creative graphics, you’re going to crush this.\r\n\r\nWhy You May Not Like It\r\n\r\nYou’ll be creating landing pages in Figma. So if you’re uncomfortable with creating landing pages, this role may not be for you. You’ll be responsible for maintaining visual and branding consistency across all design elements produced, organization, self-discipline, and multi-tasking is a must.\r\n\r\nReady? Reply with \"Taco + Your Name\" as the first sentence of your reply!\r\n\r\nLet’s do this :)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631742021840908289?success','-',7,'United States','AUSTIN',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-03-03',1,'2023-03-03',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-03 19:44:32',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
