(12275,'Website Design for longevity-StartUp',4,'Hi together!\r\n\r\nWe need a draft for a webpage. Another party will do the development. The difficult thing is, that the webpage, in the beginning, is mainly sharing information without selling a product or having functions (no UI/UX needed in the beginning). But of course, the site should have the ability to be widened easily afterwards.\r\n\r\nSo there is one \"homepage\" and one section called \"Research\", basically a blog. That\'s it.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for a creative designer who understands the importance of simplicity, as well as speciality. I have already a mood board, but we don\'t have to stick to colours or ideas.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631757694961537025','-',7,'United States','na',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-03',1,'2023-03-03',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-03 20:54:29',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
