(12300,'Illustrator/Graphic Designer/Artist for Cookbook',2,'Hello,\r\n\r\nI am looking for a highly creative Illustrator/Graphic Designer/Artist to create the illustration images for a Cookbook.\r\n\r\nOriginally I was going to hire a photographer, but for the sake of consistency and originality, I would like to have the whole book illustrated.\r\n\r\nThe book is 25 x 25cm and it will contain about 40 recipes. In addition to illustrations of the food itself (recipes such as scones, paella, bread etc.) I will need a range of illustrations for the following pages:\r\n- Cover Page\r\n- Back Page\r\n- Introduction\r\n- Contents Page\r\n- Section Introduction Pages (there are 6 sections of recipes)\r\n- Filler Pages (pages with quotes about food)\r\n\r\nPictures of the real food can be supplied to use as a basis for the illustrations, but as you can see - this is a large project with a lot of illustrations required.\r\n\r\nI need someone with high levels of creativity who can create beautiful images and help me create something really unique.\r\n\r\nI have attached some images of some examples of style of art I may like - but I\'m open to suggestions. Please look at these suggestions and only apply if you can do something similar.\r\n\r\nI am collecting the recipes right now, and putting together all the content. I will need all images to be completed by latest September - so I can compile the whole book.\r\n\r\nI am happy to negotiate price for the right person.\r\n\r\nThank you :)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631774106710421505?success','-',7,'United States','Dubai',600.000,'fixed',600.000,'2023-03-03',1,'2023-03-03',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-03 21:51:32',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
