(12306,'Brand Guideline Creation for a Startup',2,'Looking for someone to create a Brand Guideline that includes the following:\r\n\r\n1. Overview (Text)\r\n2. Logo (Text + concept explanation of the logo)\r\n3. Logomark (logo applications on square and rounded icon)\r\n4. Logo usage on backgrounds (representation of the logo on solid and light background)\r\n5. Logo misuse (do not crop, don\'t swap colors, don\'t change opacity, don\'t rotate, don\'t adjust mark size, don\'t compress, don\'t add shadows, don\'t use other typeface, don\'t outline cases)\r\n6. One color use for Logo (solid black and white logo versions)\r\n7. Colors (representation of the primary and secondary colors of the logo and their hex codes)\r\n8. Gradients (Primary and secondary gradients representation)\r\n9. Typography (Representation of the font / typeface, weights, headings, paragraph and columns, numbers\r\n10. Our mission (Text only)\r\n11. Brand personality (Text only)\r\n12. Business cards (design)\r\n13. Letterheads (design)\r\n14. Posters (a5 design)\r\n15. Presentations / Slides (design)\r\n16. Social media (Posts and timeline design) format\r\n17. Merchandise (t-shirt, sweatshirt, hoodie and tote bag applications)\r\n18. Email signature (application)\r\n19. Our values (text only)\r\n20. Our vision (text only)\r\nAll text content is provided and no content writing is required.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631780131943538689','-',7,'United States','London',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-03-03',1,'2023-03-03',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-03 22:15:44',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
