(12313,'Looking for creative graphic designer for three book covers!',2,'Hello graphic artists!\r\n\r\nI am looking for a creative graphic designer who can create three book covers for me for my book series. Book series will start out as an ebook, followed by an audible. I have an idea for book covers but am open to other ideas. I am writing a fiction romance series based on my own story about battling mental illness and my now husband entering my life during the worst of it. He is an incredibly gifted artist and created a butterfly drawing for me symbolizing my freedom from anxiety, so I’d like his butterfly to be in a different stage on each cover. By the way, actual butterfly is not in mock-up attached to this. All three books are going to be released within a week of each other starting end of March. The only thing I am struggling with is the book title, so feel free to use “Book Title” as the title for each book for now.\r\n\r\nHere is my vision for all three books:\r\n\r\nBook one:\r\n\r\nBook one is about my battle with anxiety and I’d like it to have a person on the front of the cover in a huddled position who looks sad and is wearing a chain necklace with a cocoon on it. Since book one takes place at a hospital, I was thinking maybe a hospital building in the background with a mountain landscape, since this all takes place in Colorado.\r\n\r\nBook two:\r\n\r\nBook two will be where my husband comes into my life and starts walking through the battle with me. I am thinking of the women on the cover now standing with her arms crossed wearing a chain necklace that is starting to come apart with a butterfly coming out of its cocoon. In the background is a man. My hubby and I met at a coffee shop so maybe there could be a coffee shop in the background.\r\n\r\nBook three:\r\n\r\nBook three will be about our relationship moving to the next level and me completely healing from my illness. I’d now like the couple to be together on the cover with the butterfly flying above them, symbolizing freedom. The background will be a beautiful nature scene with mountains.\r\n\r\nAgain, I’m happy to consider other options for book covers. I just don’t want it to be too busy and it will need to flow well. Please take a look at my design effort attached. It\'s awful but you\'ll get the idea. Thanks in advance for your interest!\r\n\r\nOh, and please provide at least three samples of your work:)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631786440411635713?success','-',7,'United States','Colorado Springs',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-03-03',1,'2023-03-03',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-03 22:41:54',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
