(12381,'Powerpoint/Keynote/Canva presentation for conference',11,'My company, Omeda, is a marketing technology platform that helps media companies & publishers grow, engage, and monteize their audiences all in one consolidated platform.\r\n\r\nWe are throwing a conference May 10-12 and need an engaging presentation template for our speakers and sessions. This is going to be a refresh of last year\'s presentation. I would like the template to be delivered end of March, and have you receive the plain unformatted slides to  apply to the template throughout the month of April. Final delivery of the presentation in early May. We will need you to be \'on call\' May 8-11 to help with edits and changes.\r\n\r\nThe file may be in Keynote, Powerpoint, or Canva. The file must be protected (eg, fonts and graphics unmovable/unchangeable if opened on Mac or PC) and playable on Mac or PC.\r\n\r\nThe conference link is here - omeda.com/ox6.\r\n\r\nThe presentation template needs the following slides.\r\n- Title slide with OX6 logo w/ light continuous animation of attached connected star art\r\n- Agenda slide\r\n- Welcome slide with single speaker name and title\r\n- Things to know slide for conference information (wifi, lunch, etc)\r\n- Session slide with title and subtitle\r\n- Panel slide for 2-5 speakers,  including panel name, subtitle, and speaker names and job titles\r\n- Break slide w/ light continuous star animation\r\n- Success story slides - client name, goal, strategy, approach, results. Add in frames for screenshots and video/gifs\r\n- Year(s) in review, with timeline/roadmap/journey map\r\n- Industry Data with bar chart, line chart, pie chart, 3 things, 4 things, 5 things, stat with callout\r\n- Awards slide\r\n- Product Review - details to come\r\n- Product Roadmap - details to come\r\n- Bootcamp slides - details to come\r\n\r\nPrevious year\'s deck is attached. You may use the styling found on omeda.com which includes fonts [Avenir], gradients and colors. I will provide a more detailed presentation outline once project starts.\r\n\r\nPlease show examples of your previous work with slide animations.\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~012473f2f11afc88b9','-',7,'United States','East Hampton',75.000,'perhour',75.000,'2023-03-06',1,'2023-03-06',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-06 15:32:54',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
