(12497,'20-page Divi website with directory',15,'am a small web agency in Florida and need a WordPress website using Divi from Elegant Themes. I have an account with Elegant Themes.\r\n\r\nThis is a non-profit organization that has information pages with a small directory. But I need help finding the right directory.   \r\n\r\nThere is no current website. This is a brand-new website. \r\n\r\nI will supply all content and images.\r\n\r\n\r\nA child theme must be created.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThe following plugins will also need to be used:\r\n\r\n(1) Yoast SEO \r\n\r\n(2) Google Analytics\r\n\r\n(3) Formidable Pro - I have the license\r\n\r\n(4) Wordfence\r\n\r\n\r\nThe website must be Responsive Mobile Friendly \r\n\r\nI will need the design and implementation. I make most of the edits myself, saving you tons of time. I do 99% of the revisions myself. Sometimes, I\'ll need help with CSS.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nI will set up WP on my server and install the theme and plugins. It will be set up on my domain /new-site/ Then transferred to the client\'s server upon completion.\r\n\r\n\r\nThey do want to implement a directory with 3 tiers.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n    Free listing - Company name, category, phone number, website. (no logo) and no page (it would be weird to have a page with only this information.  So it probably works best just on the sidebar.\r\n    Upgraded Listing (fee-based) All free listing info plus company description, one photo, map link, logo, and placement above basic (is placement like this possible?) Probably their own page with only this information.\r\n    Featured Listing – (upgraded fee-based) All of the above, plus video, multiple pictures, contact information, top placement. Again, on their page. But also, is it possible to put a “featured” listing at the top of Funeral Arrangements? (kind of like a banner)\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDirectory plugin must be able to handle moving up the tiers. Such as if someone starts off with a basic listing, they can upgrade next tier.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAll billing (fees) will go to a third-party website.  (Think of a link to PayPal or something. So basically, it’s just a link to sign up)  This organization already uses this website to buy sponsorships and collect donations. No sense in reinventing the wheel. But if they decide to change, the directory must have payment capabilities.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nI found a few directories, but have never worked with them.\r\n\r\nhttps://codecanyon.net/item/listinghub-wordpress-business-directory-listing-plugin/43223865\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nhttps://directorist.com/ - this one says you can claim a listing, but can you create a listing? It also has a “featured” listing (putting it on top of the page)\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nI’m not sure they will use a map feature. Most of these businesses are within 2o to 30 miles of each other.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJust wondering if you’ve worked with any that you liked.\r\n\r\nIt seems to me that many features are standard, but I’m not sure about the tier listings. Is that standard? I think free and paid are standard. But what about 3 tiers?\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nPlease provide a price for a 20 page website and then also set up a directory (and help me find the right directory)\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nPlease send me the following ONLY\r\n\r\n(1) Three links of Divi WordPress websites. (Divi only please)\r\n\r\n(2) Answer this question:  What is your favorite car?\r\n\r\n\r\nI do not need hosting or a website maintenance package. I provide those services. \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nI\'m looking to add a team member to my company.  Therefore, I\'m looking for a long-term relationship. \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIf you are outside the US, please do not apply.  Your bid will be deleted. \r\n\r\nI prefer to work with someone on the East Coast due to time zones. But will entertain other US time zones.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAlso, I\'ve seen lately where people place a bid holder and ask for details.  I can\'t give you more details than what is included here.  So I\'d like an actual bid please.  If you have questions, feel free to ask them. But if you place a bid holder, you will be deleted.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIf you have any questions, you may contact me directly. You will be deleted if you cut and paste 20 links into the bid. I\'m looking for someone who can follow directions. Email will be our primary method of communication.  It\'s important that someone can follow directions and ask questions.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2032705','-',7,'United States','-',2500.000,'fixed',2600.000,'2023-03-06',1,'2023-03-06',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-06 19:35:28',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
(12498,'Business card, door hanger, and flyer designer',2,'Budget will be negotiated.\r\n\r\nI am looking for a professional print materials designer that can help create business cards, flyers, and doorhangers as marketing material for my business,\r\n\r\nwww.dewdrophomeservices.com\r\n\r\nWe can discuss further the design given the brand I have already created for this business.\r\n\r\nPlease show me your portfolio','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1632827044069986305?success','-',7,'United States','Oakville',48.000,'Open this select menu',48.000,'2023-03-06',1,'2023-03-06',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-06 19:35:35',NULL,9,3,NULL,140),
