ase.  If you have questions, feel free to ask them. But if you place a bid holder, you will be deleted.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIf you have any questions, you may contact me directly. You will be deleted if you cut and paste 20 links into the bid. I\'m looking for someone who can follow directions. Email will be our primary method of communication.  It\'s important that someone can follow directions and ask questions.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2032705','-',7,'United States','-',2500.000,'fixed',2600.000,'2023-03-06',1,'2023-03-06',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-06 19:36:29',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
(12501,'SEO ONSITE Optimization - Digital Agency',5,'I need to optimize my on-site SEO for two projects, but give me a fixed quote for the first one for now:    https://thehemp.zone/. It is a listing directory, of course we do NOT have to optimize each listing.\r\n\r\n\r\nI am looking for general on-site optimization for the WordPress-based website that includes Yoast, SEO installation and optimization, optimization of the primary Conent pages, and optimization of the first 10 BLOG POSTS (only) to make sure everything is configured and set up correctly. This includes also the set up of Google webmaster tools, and Google analytics, integration of Google analytics or search consult plug-in >>> I need a visual representation with in wordpress, so we can easily see performance in admin area.\r\n\r\nSo give me your best QUOTE for this initial TASK and more tasks and projects are waiting.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2032657','-',7,'United States','-',250.000,'fixed',800.000,'2023-03-06',1,'2023-03-06',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-06 19:37:12',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
