(12510,'Logo Design',2,'A new Pizza, Craft Beer, & BBQ concept is coming to the Wrigleyville/Lakeview area and we\'re naming our new restaurant! Spread over 10,000 sq ft, the venue features its own brewery, a wide expansive space, free arcade & pinball games, craft cocktails, brunches, live bands, and more!\r\n\r\nWe would like a logo created for the brand','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1632830616511242241?success','-',7,'United States','Des Plaines',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-03-06',1,'2023-03-06',1,'Fixed Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-06 19:50:31',NULL,9,3,NULL,140),
(12511,'Virtual Assistant',22,'Job Title: Virtual Assistant for Holistic Medical Practice Patient Care\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\nWe seek a Virtual Assistant to provide administrative and patient follow-up support for our holistic medical practice. As a Virtual Assistant, you will answer patient inquiries, schedule appointments, maintain electronic medical records, and coordinate patient care with our physicians.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n*Respond to patient inquiries via phone, email, or chat in a timely and professional manner\r\n*Schedule appointments and maintain appointment calendars\r\n*Input patient data and medical information into electronic medical records (EMR)\r\n*Coordinate patient care with healthcare providers, including referrals, prescriptions, and online orders.\r\n*Assist with insurance verification\r\n*Manage patient files, ensuring confidentiality and accuracy\r\n*Follow up with patients to ensure their care plans are being followed and to answer any questions or concerns they may have after their appointments\r\n*Coordinate with our team of holistic practitioners to ensure a coordinated approach to patient care\r\n*Perform other administrative tasks as needed\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\n*Experience in a medical office or healthcare setting is preferred, with a focus on holistic health practices\r\n*Strong communication and customer service skills\r\n*Ability to work independently and multitask in a fast-paced environment\r\n*Familiarity with electronic medical records and medical terminology\r\n*Proficiency in Microsoft Office and G Suite\r\n*Reliable internet connection and equipment for remote work\r\n\r\nThis is a full-time, remote position with flexible hours. Compensation will be commensurate with experience.\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit your resume and a cover letter outlining your qualifications and experience in patient care and medical office administration, specifically in holistic healthcare practices.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1632831858226442241','-',7,'United States','-',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-03-06',1,'2023-03-06',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-06 19:55:15',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
