(12524,'Landing Page Design for Telemedicine Platform',4,'Summary of what we\'re looking for:\r\n1. Deep experience creating unique, engaging, beautiful landing pages.\r\n2. Expertise in graphic design. Must be able to source and manipulate beautiful photos to convey our message.\r\n3. Conversion rate optimization experience preferred.\r\n4. HTML/CSS experience preferred but not required.\r\n5. Large portfolio of great landing pages. Please provide examples.\r\n6. History of graphic design experience on/off Upwork\r\n\r\nDetails:\r\n\r\nTreatable.org is looking for a landing page design expert to help build landing pages and to help inform its landing page editing software. Treatable.org partners with private practice healthcare providers to market their services and drive consults.\r\n\r\nIf you are great at building beautiful landing pages that drive conversions we want to talk to you! We need your landing page design expertise and amazing Photoshop skills to help bring our copy to life for search marketing campaigns.\r\n\r\nWe have a full stack dev team but if you have HTML/CSS knowledge it will only make our workflow easier. If you can\'t do HTML/CSS but are an amazing landing page designer then let\'s talk through workflow.\r\n\r\nIf you have experience optimizing for conversion rates with your landing page designs we want to hear about it! We obsess over performance data so any conversion rate data you can provide on your landing pages is very helpful.\r\n\r\nThanks for your interest. We look forward to chatting with you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1632841057643847681','-',7,'United States','Philadelphia',78.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-03-06',1,'2023-03-06',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-06 20:31:30',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
