(12586,'PowerPoint Pitch Deck - We Need a WOW Presentation',11,'We have a slide deck in PowerPoint that needs some tweaking! We need to take slides with a lot of text and make them more visually appealing (pretty boring subject matter) without losing the messaging. We need slides with graphics, flow charts, possibly adding animation and/or video. We need some design expertise in telling our story in a meaningful and memorable way, professional and purposeful.\r\n\r\nWe provide managed services for Government Pricing, Contracting and Rebate Processing to small to mid-size pharmaceutical manufacturers who want to sell their products into the government sectors for Medicaid, Medicare, Federal Supply Schedule, etc. We utilize an integrated data platform for performing government calculations and the SaaS platform is available to all of our clients to use as well.\r\n\r\nWe also provide consulting services to the commercial side of the business in areas to support product launches such as Gross to Net Modeling, Pricing Compendia, Forecasting and accrual support, Duplicate discount risk assessments, Specialty Pharmacy or Retail data aggregation and reporting, Market Access strategy and support.\r\nPricing sensitivity and analysis, Commercial contracting effectiveness and forecasting, Evaluation of commercial contract impacts on Govt Pricing calculations, Pricing and contracting dashboard development, Product acquisition and divestiture support, including onboarding of historic data for acquired drugs, and off-boarding of divested products.\r\n\r\nOur targeted audience is usually C-suite in Managed Markets, Market Access, Finance and Commercial Operations in small-to-mid pharma.\r\n\r\nWe would like this project to be completed no later than March 24, 2023.\r\n\r\nWe will provide all the guidance, information you need. We have sell sheets we created internally and can provide those as samples. We can also provide our current deck and highlight the areas that need improvement.\r\n\r\nThere is a potential for more business and other than a few emails/calls to help provide direction and answer any questions, this is an independent job request.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for someone who has experience in building PowerPoint presentation pitch decks and sales presentations.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1632860507910758401','-',7,'United States','San Francisco',60.000,'Open this select menu',40.000,'2023-03-06',1,'2023-03-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-06 22:07:37',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
