(12608,'Designer for Fast Growing Streaming Company',2,'P*roject Description:*\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a talented designer to join our team at our fast-growing streaming company. Your main responsibility will be to create visually appealing designs for our presentations using written content copy and imagery that we provide. We would like the designs to be laid out in Canva, so experience with this platform is required.\r\n\r\nAs our ideal candidate, you should have a creative flair and a strong eye for detail. You should be able to take examples of layouts and prepare the slides that are 4x6 ratio. We are looking for someone who has experience with magazine layout and can create edgy designs that stand out from the crowd.\r\n\r\n*Responsibilities*:\r\n\r\nCreate visually appealing designs for presentations using written content copy and imagery\r\nPrepare slides in Canva with a 4x6 ratio\r\nUse examples of layouts to create designs that are easy to read and have an edgy look\r\nCollaborate with the team to ensure designs meet company standards and brand guidelines\r\nEnsure all designs are delivered on time and to a high standard\r\n\r\n*Requirements:*\r\n\r\n◉ Proven experience as a designer\r\n◉ Experience with Canva is a must\r\n◉ Experience with magazine layout is preferred\r\n◉ Strong portfolio showcasing your design skills and creativity\r\n◉ Excellent communication skills and ability to work collaboratively\r\n◉ Attention to detail and ability to work under pressure\r\n◉Ability to meet tight deadlines\r\n\r\nIf you are a creative designer who has a passion for creating edgy designs and has experience with Canva and magazine layout, then we would love to hear from you. In your response, please start with \"I can handle\" to let us know that you have read the entire job description. We are looking for someone who can create mobile magazine layouts where the text is easy to read, so please provide examples of similar work in your portfolio.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1632874734883524609?success','-',7,'United States','Angwin',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-03-06',1,'2023-03-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-06 22:45:27',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
(12609,'Web design and Development (Shopify)',3,'We are looking for a talented team to design and update our shopify website with a new theme.\r\n\r\nThis is a long-term opportunities with ongoing projects. We will provide examples and work with you on the mockup to begin designing.\r\n\r\nMust have high end, elegant, stand out portfolio.\r\nDesign and update Shopify platform, themes, liquid programming language and corresponding apps\r\nDesign UX based on the industry and competitor research\r\nImplement system integrations that are crucial to our success\r\nContribute in the development of open source software, HTML5/CSS/JavaScript, and common web technologies integral to building seamless multi-channel experiences\r\nKnowledgeable in security / personal data protection principals and GPDR\r\nDeveloping testing plans and troubleshooting issues related to eCommerce issues\r\nConducting root cause analysis and determining/developing corresponding action items\r\nImplement advanced debugging techniques and usage of browser developer tools\r\nQualifications\r\n\r\nGeneral experience building, launching and maintaining stores, as well as general knowledge of the admin system\r\nDemonstrable expertise with HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript, with an in-depth understanding of DOM\r\nExperience with working with a made theme and/or Storefront API\r\nExperience with Shopify\'s theming system and Liquid templating\r\nExperience with implementing/debugging 3rd party Shopify apps as well as creating custom solutions if necessary\r\nThorough understanding and experience with vanilla JavaScript, jQuery, ES2015/ES6, and modern JavaScript frameworks\r\nExperience with Shopify\'s object/properties, AJAX API, and Meta fields\r\nThorough testing and debugging skills with browser console and external tools\r\nExperience developing for responsive layouts for a desktop, tablet, and mobile\r\nExperience working with 3rd party services and APIs, specifically plugins for Shopify\r\nAbility to communicate well, giving proactive feedback.\r\n\r\nWe need high-end skilled design and development team for long-term projects. Apply with your portfolio link.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1632878126477598721','-',7,'United States','Los Angeles',65.000,'Open this select menu',40.000,'2023-03-06',1,'2023-03-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-06 22:58:14',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(12610,'Logo & Label Design',10,'We are in the process of developing a new range of products with an environmental focus, we are partway through the process but need designer to assist us with the design aspect.\r\n\r\nHow quickly are your able pick up this project and assist with the following:\r\n\r\nPhase 1\r\n• New Sub Brand logo for “Enviro” range that sits within the Eclipse range of cleaning chemicals. So, it will be known as “Eclipse Enviro”. Or suggest an improved name/concept while keeping it tied in with the Eclipse brand,\r\n• Design 7 x Outer Packaging Labels (Front & Back)\r\n• Design 7 x Trigger Labels (Front Only)\r\n\r\nPhase 2\r\n• Design Wall Charts\r\n• Design 4 Page Flyer\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease see the supplier’s designs attached below, this has the relevant content required for all labels etc., but we don’t want it to resemble their product and would like it to have much more eco/ natural look & feel.\r\n\r\nAs a company we do have an ongoing reequipment for a freelance designer for flyers, email banners etc., so if you impress us with this project, we will likely want you use you going forward!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~014b46fcc0699a63fa','-',7,'United States','Watton',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-07',1,'2023-03-07',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-07 07:56:09',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
