(12612,'Shopify 2 Landing Pages - Building Landing page Expert',16,'Hi everyone,\r\n\r\nWe are currently looking for someone highly experienced with Shopify and landing pages for dropshipping stores. Someone that has created funnel style landing pages effectively.\r\n\r\nBesides this creation there are other areas that we are looking to hire as well, we can discuss on the call. But as of this job specifically, is for designing 2 landing page for similar niche products.\r\n\r\nWe will provide you:\r\n1. Examples of competition landing page\r\n2. Link to the product\'s supplier which has pictures, videos etc.\r\n3. Brief description of the overall feel of the store that we are looking for.\r\n\r\nPerformance bonuses will be paid out in our plans and we are looking for someone long-term for multiple projects.\r\n\r\nPlease only apply if you have a good understanding and background in this field.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from all of you.\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0128d8be85153680e5','-',7,'United States','Houston',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-03-07',1,'2023-03-07',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-07 08:38:06',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
