(12614,'Wordpress and Designer',15,'We have about 120 pages that need to be created with content that we will gladly take from other agency websites for now, as a placeholder, while you design the sections. We have specific pages that we like on other sites that we would like to bring over to ours, design-wise.\r\n\r\nWe use Wordpress and Elementor. We need a web designer who understands design principles and can design very clean interfaces and experiences.\r\n\r\nYou will work with one of our chief team members on this project, going page by page, creating these sections. This is urgent and we\'re looking for multiple freelancers to work full-time over the next few days to knock this out.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01535589cff058707d','-',7,'United States','Dallas',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-03-07',1,'2023-03-07',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-07 09:19:11',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
(12615,'Graphic design work for website images',2,'I am building a new website and would like some new images to suit.\r\n\r\nImages should all be vector based on layers to allow us to make colour and style changes.\r\nIdeally in Affinity designer, or SVG.\r\n\r\nAll images need to follow a consistent look, feel and style.\r\n\r\nWe want a modern and fresh look - so we are open to ideas.\r\n\r\nAttached is an example of an image, which we would like re-drawn. The style is similar to what we want, but we need an illustration which we can use.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0170f8d8b6193c7674','Advance Consulting | John Paul | TM',82,'United States','Adelaide',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-03-07',1,'2023-03-07',1,'In process',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-03-07 10:58:10','2023-03-09 20:46:29',9,3,NULL,126),
