(12618,'Feather logo for envelope seal embossed sticker',10,'We need a feather logo. This logo is going to be used in our gold envelope seal stickers. The logo needs to look good once embossed in the stickers so we need to be aware of this when designing the logo.\r\n\r\nWe\'re using as our main reference a brand called Papyrus. They use a hummingbird logo for their envelope seal stickers. Please see pictures attached. We would like something very similar to this but using a feather logo.\r\n\r\nWe will attach some feather logos for reference but we would like something better looking as this will be our signature logo for our envelope seal stickers.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011d536829d48c38bb','-',7,'United States','London',400.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-03-07',1,'2023-03-07',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-07 11:15:22',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
