(12621,'Illustrator/Designer Required For Book Cover',2,'I’m looking for an illustrator/graphic designer to create a design for the front cover of a book.\r\n\r\nThe freelancer needs to do the illustration work themselves, so that we can refine the design to spec over a few rounds if necessary.\r\nThe book cover should contain a guy like our website brand mascot (I will provide this once hired or during the interview) but more realistic, like a graphic novel.\r\n\r\nThe goal for this project is to use our brand mascot as inspiration and create a design/illustration that’s more realistic and dramatic, like a graphic novel, according to our specifications.\r\n\r\nHe should be holding the same items as in the mascot provided, but around his arms, should be broken shackles, to represent the breaking away from slavery.\r\n\r\nIf somehow we could represent government, bureaucracy, rulership, etc in the background as the thing that the mascot broke away from, that would be great.\r\n\r\nWhile this job doesn’t require full book cover design, this is ultimately what it will be used for, so taking that into consideration is key. And if you also do book cover design, we can expand the project to include that too.\r\n\r\nI’ve set a budget which we can use as a baseline, but welcome lesser and higher offers based on experience/skill.\r\n\r\nPlease only apply if you have existing portfolio work that I can look at beforehand.\r\n\r\nThanks!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0134d1bb25976d9fb9','-',7,'United States','Exeter',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-07',1,'2023-03-07',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-07 11:39:16',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
