(12640,'E-commerce UX/UI designer',3,'We are looking for an experienced UX/UI designer with expertise in e-commerce stores to join our team. The ideal candidate should have a solid understanding of user experience and design principles, as well as a proven track record of designing successful e-commerce stores.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n* Designing and developing user interfaces for e-commerce websites, including layouts, graphics, and navigation menus.\r\n* Collaborating with developers to ensure the successful implementation of design solutions.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n* Expertise in design tools such as Sketch, Figma, and Adobe Creative Suite.\r\n* Strong portfolio showcasing previous e-commerce store design work.\r\n* Excellent communication and collaboration skills.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this position, please send us your resume, portfolio, and a list of your top 3 e-commerce stores that you have designed. We are looking for a long-term cooperation and are willing to pay above average compensation for the right candidate.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01da5f9311f50ca916','-',7,'United States','Amsterdam',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-03-07',1,'2023-03-07',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-07 14:48:34',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
