(12644,'Identity design for department',2,'Need an identity for a department in a Christian non-profit that provides care to the members and their families.\r\n\r\npart of agwm.org\r\n\r\ndepartment name: Member Care\r\nmission: We minister to the whole family and our mission is to serve, equip and empower missionaries to greater health.\r\nwith 3 parts: International Society Mission Kids, Global Security, and Missionary Wellness\r\n\r\n\r\nNeed logo, they really like the attached blue bird that has 3 segments for the three parts of their department. Something like the blue bird with the blue should be a relatively short path.\r\nNeed help with font\r\nNeed basic identity guidelines\r\nNeed some textures\r\n\r\nRequest lockout with Member Care logo and font stacked with AGWM logo\r\nIdentity will be frequently used without AGWM identity but should be compatible when used together.\r\n\r\nLogo will be used online, in print, and app button\r\n\r\nOur office is made up of three ministries. We minister to the whole family and our mission is to serve, equip and empower missionaries to greater health. We exist so you can fulfill the call of God on your life. We are believing that God will use you to establish the Church among all people everywhere.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0197c1a12027516338','-',7,'United States','Springfield',75.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-07',1,'2023-03-07',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-07 14:54:50',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
