(12664,'Writer needed for mental health blog',37,'Do you consider yourself an expert in mental health? Do you spend more time researching and learning about mental health than you do with your family? Do your friends constantly come to you as their first port of call for all things related to mental wellness? And do you love writing and blogging?\r\n\r\nDo you consider yourself an expert in mental health? Are you someone that others seek out for advice on navigating mental health challenges? And do you have a passion for writing and sharing your knowledge with others?\r\nDo you have any professional credentials in the mental health space, such as a degree in psychology or a related field? (this is a plus)\r\n\r\nIf you answered yes to these questions, then read on.\r\n\r\nWe’re a mental health platform and are looking for an expert mental health writer who can help us create articles (guest posts and articles for our blog).\r\n\r\nWhether you’re a mental health professional or have personal experience and a passion for the topic, we want you to write for us. You’ll be covering a wide range of topics, including anxiety, depression, stress, mindfulness, therapy, and much more. Sometimes your articles will be published in our website and sometimes in partne websites.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633126923614724097','-',7,'United States','-',720.000,'fixed',720.000,'2023-03-07',1,'2023-03-07',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-07 15:43:15',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
