(12836,'Logo Design',10,'We are looking for someone to help create our logo.\r\n\r\nWe are a new digital marketing company. Our company name is \'Them Apples\'.\r\n\r\nLogo:\r\n\r\nWe are looking to give off the feeling of \'fresh\' , \'new\' and \'modern\'.\r\n\r\nFor text, we\'d like \'Them Apples\' to be clearly displayed. Maybe we can also experiment with putting \'Marketing\' in smaller letters under.\r\n\r\nIcon or graphic:\r\nThere needs to be either one apple or several apples incorporated into the logo\r\n\r\n2 Ideas:\r\n\r\n1. We\'d like to see one variation of the logo that is creative. Maybe having the T in \'Them\' taller then the rest of the letters and have apples coming off of it as if the T was a tree. But feel free to try out any creative ideas you have.\r\n\r\n2. A modern, fresh style. Maybe a sleek bold font with apple icon.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for creative individuals who can give this logo personality. We don\'t want generic logos that can be instantly generated via AI or logo generators.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633216007865163777','-',7,'United States','Charlotte',200.000,'Open this select menu',200.000,'2023-03-07',1,'2023-03-07',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-07 21:21:17',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(12837,'Looking for powerful website to transform the heat transfer industry, Screen Printed Transfer Offer',3,'We\'re in search of skilled developers and designers to assist us in revamping our outdated website. As a leading company specializing in heat transfer products, we cater to a diverse range of customers including screen printers, promotional product distributors, Etsy sellers, and anyone seeking to personalize their merchandise with their logo. Our product line includes various items such as t-shirts, jackets, shorts, tote bags, umbrellas, vinyl products, polyester products, hats, backpacks, and more.\r\n\r\nOur current website is outdated www.thermaprint.com\r\n\r\nOur primary objective is to enhance our brand image by modernizing our website and providing our customers with more comprehensive information than what is currently available. To achieve this, we aim to include pricing details for each product and provide detailed specifications, similar to our competitors. For instance, we\'d like to display the optimal temperature and pressure settings for each product.\r\n\r\nWe also aspire to create a straightforward order form that allows customers to input their information and upload their artwork with ease. Our focus is on simplicity, modernity, and elegance. While our product range isn\'t extensive, the industry is vast, necessitating that we step up our game in the design department. Hence, we\'re searching for the ideal individuals to assist us in achieving our objectives. Thank you for considering this opportunity.\r\n\r\nCompetitors site we like are the following:\r\nhttps://www.613originals.com/\r\nhttps://www.howardct.com/\r\nhttps://supacolor.com/\r\nhttps://www.fmexpressions.com/\r\n\r\nIf you possess the necessary skills and availability to assist us in achieving our objectives, kindly submit your bid. Our website doesn\'t need to cost between 10 to $50,000. We\'re seeking someone who can showcase our products to customers by displaying our pricing, print options, and allowing customers to upload their artwork through a form. We want to be able to compete with other similar websites from a marketing perspective. If you have expertise in graphics, design, and development, we\'d be delighted to collaborate with you. Please share your portfolio of your best work to demonstrate your level of proficiency. We appreciate all the quotes in advance, as we\'re eager to begin the project right away.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633215997508050945','-',7,'United States','San Clement',4500.000,'fixed',4500.000,'2023-03-07',1,'2023-03-07',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-07 21:21:24',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(12838,'Medical Assistant for Telehealth Practice',22,'We are seeking a highly motivated and organized freelancer to provide administrative support to our telehealth neurology practice. The successful candidate will assist with appointment scheduling, insurance and billing tasks, coordinate medical records, and communicate with patients and other facilities.\r\n\r\nExpectations:\r\n\r\nAdministrative support for telehealth neurology practice\r\nAppointment scheduling\r\nFollow up with insurance companies regarding billing and claims\r\nFollow up with imaging facilities regarding insurance authorizations\r\nConduct pre-authorizations\r\nCoordinate with other facilities and patients regarding medical record retrieval\r\nInsurance verification\r\nMedication prior authorizatio','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633218642683617281','-',7,'United States','Beverly Hills',10.000,'perhour',10.000,'2023-03-07',1,'2023-03-07',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-07 21:31:42',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
