(12840,'Virtual Assistant for Private Psychotherapy Practice',22,'We are seeking a highly organized and professional Virtual Assistant to join our private psychotherapy practice. As a Virtual Assistant, you will be responsible for providing administrative support to the therapist, managing their schedule, communicating with clients, and ensuring the smooth running of the practice.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n• Manage therapist\'s schedule, book appointments, and ensure clients receive timely and accurate reminders.\r\n• Communicate with clients via email, phone to schedule appointments, answer inquiries, and provide information about the practice.\r\n• Maintain electronic records of client data, ensuring that all confidential information is handled with discretion and confidentiality is maintained.\r\n• Provide administrative support for billing and insurance claims.\r\n• Manage therapist\'s email inbox and respond to inquiries and requests in a timely manner.\r\n• Perform other administrative tasks as assigned by the therapist to ensure the smooth running of the practice.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633219642374467585','-',7,'United States','-',7.000,'perhour',7.000,'2023-03-07',1,'2023-03-07',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-07 21:35:26',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(12841,'Medical Secretary',22,'This is an amazing opportunity to work with a leading ophthalmic surgeon, in a great team environment and where the practice is growing.\r\n\r\nAs a member of the team you will:\r\n• Be the first point of contact for patients, phone calls and emails\r\n• Arrange patient appointments, liaising between surgeon and various hospitals\r\n• Manage ophthalmic surgeon’s diary of appointments\r\n• Produce letters, reports, spreadsheets and invoices\r\n• Update records on IT systems\r\n• Photocopy, print and file documents\r\n• Handle confidential information\r\n\r\nDesired skills:\r\n• 5+ years of experience working as a medical secretary\r\n• Understanding of ophthalmology services a plus\r\n• Excellent written and communication skills\r\n• Ability to multi-task and quickly prioritize tasks.\r\n• A positive and flexible attitude\r\n• Administration skills\r\n• Attention to detail\r\n• Able to use a computer and the main software packages competently','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633220966392324097','-',7,'United States','-',12.000,'perhour',12.000,'2023-03-07',1,'2023-03-07',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-07 21:40:59',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
