(12846,'2D Artist/Animator Needed for Fitness Product Animation',8,'We are seeking a 3D Artist/Animator to assist us in creating an animation of a client’s product in use. The product is in the wearable fitness/wellness industry.\r\n\r\nThe product itself will need to be modeled and animated to show the proper way to prepare and equip it. The product will need to be put onto some kind of mannequin or character, but this can be a general stock character and does not need to be created from scratch/animated.\r\n\r\nThe final product will be imported into Unreal Engine and used in a real time application. The workflow/software used to create the animation is up to the artist, as long as the end product can be brought into Unreal. Additionally, we would like the animation to be done 6 times total. We will want a small, medium and large build mannequin of both a male and female. This will require small differences in the animation so that the product sits correctly on the mannequin, but the actual steps for each version will be identical.\r\n\r\nWe will be replicating the process shown in an existing product video, which is roughly 7 minutes long. Our animation can be much shorter than this, but that gives a rough idea of the amount of content. This video, as well as detailed product images will be provided once a proposal is selected.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633225145563275265?success','-',7,'United States','Winchester',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-03-07',1,'2023-03-07',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-07 21:57:43',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
