(12867,'Setting Appointments',35,'Job Summary:\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a highly motivated and results-oriented appointment setter to call businesses and schedule appointments for our team.\r\n\r\nThe appointment setter will be responsible for generating interest and identifying decision-makers for our team to speak with and provide our services.\r\n\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nConduct outbound calls to potential clients to generate interest in our services and schedule appointments for our team.\r\nIdentify key decision-makers within organizations and maintain a database of contacts.\r\nKeep accurate records of calls, appointments, and follow-up activities in our CRM system.\r\nProvide regular updates to the team regarding the status of appointments and leads.\r\nMeet or exceed weekly and monthly appointment setting targets.\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n1-2 years of experience in outbound calling and appointment setting.\r\nExcellent communication and interpersonal skills.\r\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team.\r\nStrong organizational and time management skills.\r\nProficient in using CRM systems and other software tools.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat We Offer:\r\n\r\nA supportive and collaborative team environment.\r\nThe opportunity to make a difference in the lives of military veterans by connecting them with employment opportunities.\r\n\r\n\r\nAbout Us:\r\nOur company is dedicated to helping military veterans with technical expertise find fulfilling employment opportunities. We pride ourselves on our commitment to our veterans and the relationships we build with our clients. We are looking for a team member who shares our passion for helping others and is driven to succeed.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1631328500344893441','-',7,'United States','Washigton',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-03-07',1,'2023-03-07',1,'Normal Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-07 22:24:34',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
