(12921,'Landing Page Designer Needed For New Web Apps',4,'We have a created a new Web-App that allows people to get immediate real time feedback from over 15,000 people in minutes!\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for a web/graphic designer with some style who can knock out a nice landing page (marketing site) design for the outside of the site.\r\n\r\nIt will be about a 3-4 page site, that really shows off what our web-app does.   Ideally looking for someone who can take screen shots of the app and bring them to life on the marketing site to really show it off.\r\n\r\nBonus points if you could help with the copy on the site a bit, but no big deal if not.  We can knock out alot of the copywriting as well.\r\n\r\nWe\'ll need a few more of these sites done, so we\'re looking for someone we can work with on a longer term time frame if possible.\r\n\r\nPlease include a few examples of sites you\'ve recently designed that you feel are similar to what we\'re looking for.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01924348b23bb9ca6e','-',7,'United States','Ruskin',150.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 15:00:50',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
(12922,'UI Designer for 10 to 15 Screen App',2,'We are looking for a talented UI designer to design a 10 to 15 screen app for our business. The app will be used by our customers to access our services and will need to be visually appealing, intuitive, and easy to use.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n-Work with our team to understand the business requirements and user needs\r\n-Create wireframes and mockups for the app screens\r\n-Design high-fidelity UI designs for the app screens\r\n-Ensure the designs are consistent with our brand guidelines and design principles\r\nCollaborate with our development team to ensure the designs are feasible and implementable\r\n-Iterate on the designs based on feedback from our team and users\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n-Proven experience as a UI designer, with a portfolio of app design work.\r\n-Expertise in design tools such as Sketch, Figma, or Adobe XD.\r\n-Strong understanding of mobile design principles and user experience.\r\n-Ability to work collaboratively with a team\r\nExcellent communication skills.\r\n-Attention to detail and ability to produce high-quality work on a tight deadline.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this opportunity, please send us your portfolio and a brief introduction to your experience and skills. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633483044963999745?success','-',7,'United States','Amman',36.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 15:02:41',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
