(12931,'Gorgeous Twitter Banner Needed',2,'Hello, I need a Twitter banner designed for Eric Spofford.\r\n\r\nWant it designed similarly to the LinkedIn banner here on Russell Brunson\'s page:\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/russellbrunson\r\n\r\nNeeds to include:\r\n- A cropped out picture of Eric\r\n- A bar listing all his press mentions\r\n- A center text listing his credentials\r\n- A list of all his social tags (Instagram, Youtube, TikTok, LinkedIn)\r\n\r\nMust be gorgeous, and worthy of a $100M brand.\r\n\r\nTo get access to all required source materials, check out his instagram @ericspofford and his website spoffordenterprises.com.\r\n\r\nIn your application please list out the following:\r\n- Links to any relevant/similar designs YOU made\r\n- A one to three sentence brief as to how you\'d design this banner\r\n- An expected turn around time for this final design','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633491603436580865?success','-',7,'United States','Colorado Springs',65.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 15:36:15',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
(12932,'Logo for High-End Therapy Group',10,'We\'re a high end, cash-pay therapy company that is looking for a logo. Our clients lean slightly female, top 5-10% of national household income, and can be children, adolescents, adults or couples/families.\r\n\r\nName: Oak Bluffs Therapy Group\r\nThe name comes from the oak tree and bluffs, which are a type of broad, rounded cliff. Most bluffs border a river, beach, or other coastal area.\r\n\r\nWe are still designing a website so don\'t have a color scheme to go off of.\r\n\r\nWe want this to look high-end and professional, but also welcoming (as we\'re a therapy company). And while bluffs are technically cliffs, we may not want to include cliff imagery as we cater to clients who are potentially suicidal. Please see attached for a few example logos from area practices as well as more concierge/high end therapy companies nationwide.\r\n\r\nCan you let me know an estimated price for this?\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n— Luke','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633492317321506817?success','-',7,'United States','Niantic',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 15:39:48',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
