(12935,'Website/landing page design',4,'Hi there!\r\n\r\nWe are a growing company that provides exclusive leads and appointments to roofing companies. We are looking for a talented Website Designer to come in and create a visually appealing and user-friendly 1-page website that effectively communicates our message.\r\n\r\nJob Overview:\r\n\r\nAs a Website Designer, you will be responsible for designing a visually stunning and user-friendly 1-page website for our company. You will work closely with me to ensure the website design effectively communicates our message and showcases our brand identity. I will provide examples of what I would like the landing page to look like and supply the copywriting elements. The ideal candidate will have experience in graphic design, layout composition, and creating mobile and desktop-optimized designs.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n-Proven experience as a Website Designer, with a strong portfolio showcasing your design expertise\r\n\r\n-Excellent knowledge of graphic design, layout composition, and design software.\r\n\r\n-Experience in creating mobile and desktop-optimized designs.\r\n\r\nStrong communication and collaboration skills\r\n\r\nFamiliarity with GoHighLevel.\r\n\r\nIf you are serious please send a quick 2 min video/audio message introducing yourself and why you are suitable for this work.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~012c7d9ce1dc0a7c90','-',7,'United States','Swansea',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 15:48:17',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
