(12939,'Designer Needed for Tiki Theme Party',2,'We need some fun ideas! We belong to a local boating club and we are hosting a tiki/Polynesian themed beach party this year. We need somebody that can help create a couple of different projects with a common mid-century / Tiki theme.\r\nProjects: 1. the two files attached are of our flag. We have never touched this. The outline needs to stay the same, but we can mess with the colors and a maybe a light print. We order our boat flags from Prestigeflag.com. So, project one is a Polynesian flag, using the current outline & shape.\r\nProject 2. We will need some help with artwork for flyers and dates. We are working on a party name, but we need to flyer to be also along the theme.\r\nProject 3. This is TBD, but we will need a few more tiki inspired designs that follow the same look and feel\r\n\r\nWill pay for more if needed.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633496142998646785?success','-',7,'United States','Bayport',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 15:54:28',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
