(12942,'Website Developer for Wordpress Site',3,'Need a skilled web developer to create a word press site. Site is for a commercial real estate investment company. We will be showing information on current investments and for capturing potential new investors information via a sign up form. will also need google and social media ppk connectivity. estimate the site could have 15-20 pages.\r\n\r\nPrefer someone who can deliver the themes, plugin set, website security hardening and background creatives as a package.\r\n\r\ncurrent website is www.realtycapitalfl.com\r\n\r\nwe will provide the new template to be used for the site.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633496736262774785','-',7,'United States','Winter Park',600.000,'fixed',6000.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 15:57:44',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(12943,'Landing page for medical device distributor',4,'We\'re a medical device distribution company in Israel.\r\nWe focus on representing companies that have advanced and cutting edge technology that is used by medical staff, primarily in the operating room.\r\nOut goal is make treatment smarter and safer by increasing the surgeon\'s knowledge and control during the procedure.\r\nFor example, we market the most advanced nerve monitoring systems and an infrared camera that can visualize organs during the surgery.\r\nOur staff come from advanced clinical and academic backgrounds so we know what the team need and why we\'re better.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for a sharp, confident and convincing landing page that communicates sophistication, confidence and experience.\r\nThe page needs to be in a format that we can be easily edited layer on, when our staff and portfolio grows (Wix?)','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b578dfcdaa0434e5','-',83,'United States','Jerusalem',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'In process',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-03-08 15:59:28','2023-03-09 20:52:17',9,3,NULL,126),
