(12945,'Revamp Landing Page/ Sales Funnel for google ads',4,'I am business owner looking to revamp my marketing/ sales strategy. I am currently paying for google advertising to send people to a landing page to gain attraction/ leads for my high ticket priced \"start your own body contouring center\" that costs $59,805 to start. Is this something you can help with? I have a baseline landing page, submission page, Calendly link, follow up email campaign but I want to make it more professional looking and get outside expertise on what may work or may not work on attracting and getting more leads from my google ads. Can you help us with fine tuning/ revamping our process of getting leads from our google advertising efforts through our landing page? the current page is www.adgbiz.com\r\n\r\nWe want to see your latest projects and you have experience with high ticket sales funnels/ landing pages.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01d443eca73a32440e','-',7,'United States','San Diego',400.000,'fixed',400.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 16:03:11',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
(12946,'Printing a journal',2,'Specifications for printing:\r\n26-pages front/back full color 110# white card stock\r\n1 page 12 mil grain-texture paper (purple, back page)\r\nApproximately 5.5”h x 7”w\r\n5/16” plastic comb – round black (cut to size after binding)\r\n\r\nI have adjusted the format fit to allow room for error in the printing process and human error in cutting so there are a few items that I would need to discuss with someone if we were to move forward','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633499350870253569?success','-',7,'United States','Tampa',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 16:07:26',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
(12947,'Landing page builder CMS',3,'We would like to build a web app that allows our clients to launch a landing page from a series of pre-designed landing pages.    \r\n\r\nUser experience:  Once the user signs up,  he will be asked to create password.  Then he can log in, and create a landing page.  He can edit the existing pages (switch photos, add text, headlines, add links to a Youtube video etc.  Will also need to integrate with the client\'s social channels to display social feeds on the landing pages as well.   Must have customizable forms etc.   Client should be able to see traffic reports etc.\r\n\r\nAdmin:    must be able to manually set-up clients as well as automatically setup clients after payments are made via STRIPE or PAYPAL payments.   We will be able to see analytics, users, stats that we choose to monitor etc.\r\n\r\nSimilar websites:   https:// https://carrd.co, https://about.me,  https://medali.st\r\n\r\nWe will require this project to be built in stages.  Phase 1 is UX design. Phase 2 is dev.  Phase 3 is testing/beta.\r\n\r\nOur target audience are parents.  So special attention will be given to simplicity and privacy.\r\n\r\n*if you have experience building a web app like this, please show us the link and description of your role.\r\n*preference will be given to the dev that can implement existing code or repositories that work.    We do not want to start to scratch.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b8a24d1efb9a9040','-',7,'United States','Calgary',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 16:11:11',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
(12948,'Develop an Elementor Website of 10 Pages',3,'Hello,\r\n\r\nI have a designed website that is roughly 10 pages large. The designs have been adapted from an existing Elementor template we have purchased.\r\n\r\nThe website is a brochure website with no 3rd party integrations.\r\n\r\nPlease send me over your Elementor experience, previous Elementor websites you have built and a rough outline of your costs. I will then send the website designs for a quote to the shortlist I make.\r\n\r\nAlso please let me know when you are available and roughly how long you think it will take to complete the build.\r\n\r\nThanks.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633500443549016065?success','-',7,'United States','Birmingham',3000.000,'fixed',3000.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 16:11:22',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
