(12973,'Packaging designer for label of 4 skincare products',2,'We are looking for a talented label/packaging designer to create stunning designs for our skincare line. We have four products that need label designing - two bottles, a jar, and a plastic pouch - that need to be designed. The text for each product is already prepared, so you will just need to focus on the label design.\r\n\r\nOur new bottles are dark, but you can view the existing bottles at elixirofskin.com to get an idea of the overall look and feel of our brand. We want the new designs to be minimal yet pretty, with a focus on clean lines and modern aesthetics. The design should appeal to both men and women, and reflect the high-quality, natural ingredients of our products.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a designer with experience in label/packaging design, specifically in the skincare industry. We would like to see a portfolio of previous work that showcases your ability to create beautiful, eye-catching designs that stand out on the shelf.\r\n\r\nFor inspiration, we love the packaging designs at https://primallypure.com/ and would like to achieve a similar level of elegance and sophistication for our products. We\'re looking for something that sparks just a bit more joy.\r\n\r\nIf you are a skilled packaging designer who can create a beautiful design for our skincare line, please apply with your portfolio and any relevant experience. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633512609739943937?success','-',7,'United States','Stittsville',160.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 17:00:00',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
