(12985,'Pitch Deck Expert',11,'We are seeking a skilled and experienced pitch deck expert to help us create an engaging and compelling presentation for our real estate startup, Propertybot.ai.\r\nWe are revolutionizing the industry with cutting-edge AI technology and superior customer service.\r\nThe ideal candidate will have a proven track record of creating successful pitch decks for startups and be able to effectively communicate our value proposition, competitive advantage, and growth potential to potential investors.\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n* Understand our business model, vision, and goals\r\n* Create a visually appealing and persuasive pitch deck that effectively communicates our key messages to potential investors\r\n* Help us refine and hone our pitch to ensure maximum impact and engagement\r\n\r\n* Deliver a final pitch deck that effectively showcases our unique value proposition, competitive advantage, and growth potential\r\nRequirements:\r\n* Proven experience creating successful pitch decks for startups\r\n* Excellent communication and collaboration skills\r\n* Strong understanding of the real estate industry and its challenges\r\n* Experience with AI technology and its applications in real estate is a plus\r\n* Ability to work under tight deadlines and deliver high-quality work\r\nIf you are passionate about real estate, cutting-edge technology, and want to be a part of a revolutionary startup, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633524715495874561?success','-',7,'United States','Winthrop',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 17:47:58',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
