(13015,'30- 60 second promotional video for new eLearning launch: Quick turnaround',8,'We need a 30 - 60 second promotional video for a new eLearning brand and products which is in early market launch. We need someone who can create that attention grabbing video that entices potential learners to opt-in and view our free course and feel compelled to purchase our paid course.\r\n\r\nWe have existing footage that will need to be cut into the right flow to tell the story. Our brand is developed. We have graphic standards and some graphics already developed, but we may need to create some more (with you or for you) to tell the story. Our websites are already built. Just need to drop that right video in the right place. We will need your skills to help us refine the way to tell the story in video form - using your marketing chops to decide what order to present the content and what to leave on the cutting room floor.\r\n\r\nWe\'d like someone available to meet by the end of this week to frame out the approach and then to produce it the week of March 13th.\r\n\r\nYou will be primarily working with one person who will interact with others to get feedback.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633552627183366145?success','-',7,'United States','SAN ANSELMO',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 19:40:12',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
(13016,'Pitch Deck Expert',11,'We are seeking a skilled and experienced pitch deck expert to help us create an engaging and compelling presentation for our real estate startup, Propertybot.ai.\r\nWe are revolutionizing the industry with cutting-edge AI technology and superior customer service.\r\nThe ideal candidate will have a proven track record of creating successful pitch decks for startups and be able to effectively communicate our value proposition, competitive advantage, and growth potential to potential investors.\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n* Understand our business model, vision, and goals\r\n* Create a visually appealing and persuasive pitch deck that effectively communicates our key messages to potential investors\r\n* Help us refine and hone our pitch to ensure maximum impact and engagement\r\n\r\n* Deliver a final pitch deck that effectively showcases our unique value proposition, competitive advantage, and growth potential\r\nRequirements:\r\n* Proven experience creating successful pitch decks for startups\r\n* Excellent communication and collaboration skills\r\n* Strong understanding of the real estate industry and its challenges\r\n* Experience with AI technology and its applications in real estate is a plus\r\n* Ability to work under tight deadlines and deliver high-quality work\r\nIf you are passionate about real estate, cutting-edge technology, and want to be a part of a revolutionary startup, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633553469274316801','-',7,'United States','Winthrop',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 19:41:58',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
