(13024,'Refresh Brand Guide + Marketing Templates for Activewear Brand',2,'Overview:\r\nWe are looking for a talented and experienced freelance designer to refresh our brand guidelines and design marketing templates. The successful candidate will be responsible for creating a comprehensive set of guidelines that outline our brand\'s visual identity. The guidelines will be used to ensure consistent branding across all of our marketing materials, both online and offline.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Video conference with our marketing team to understand our brand\'s unique selling proposition.\r\n- Refresh our existing brand guidelines that includes our brand\'s visual identity.\r\n- Ensure that the guidelines are easy to understand and implement by our internal team and external partners.\r\n- Work closely with our marketing team to ensure that the guidelines are consistent with our brand strategy and goals.\r\n- Provide ongoing support and guidance for future design projects.\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\n- Refresh existing brand guidelines\r\n- Targeted subdomain landing page template\r\n- Webpage refresh: Home, About, Services\r\n- Catalog: vertical (print) + horizontal (digital)\r\n- Proposal template\r\n- Slide deck\r\n- Social media\r\n- Email signature\r\n- Email newsletter\r\n- Business cards\r\n\r\nVisit tokalonclothing.com to see our existing brand experience.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Proven experience as a brand guidelines designer, with a portfolio that demonstrates your ability to create cohesive and effective branding.\r\n- Strong knowledge of branding best practices and current design trends.\r\n- Excellent communication skills, with the ability to clearly articulate your ideas and collaborate with internal teams and external partners.\r\n- Proficiency in design software such as Adobe Creative Suite, Sketch, or Figma.\r\n- Ability to work independently and manage your own time effectively.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a designer who can start immediately and is available for ongoing work as needed. Preferred delivery of brand guide and initial marketing templates is two weeks.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633556946668281857','-',7,'United States','Urbandale',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 20:00:04',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
