(13030,'Kajabi website designer, online course and landing pages',4,'Hi! My name is Lorena Martinez I\'m an actor and writer living in Los Angeles and I just launched a coaching business: Bien Creative, I already have the logo design and brand identity (attached). As you can see, Bien Creative is BRIGHT and it\'s an ode to my inner child. My mission is to help people find joy in their careers and return to their inner spark and ignite their creativity while giving them the tools they need to succeed. If Bien Creative had a taste... it would be Lucky Charms.\r\n\r\nI launched my first offer using google docs and that\'s how I\'ve been working so far: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1_tXwcmYYtuZtcZ9Zu7nthV5WJvKNQm0BLGEmwewX-c0/edit?usp=share_link\r\n\r\nBut I\'m needing to develop my website so my business can run smoothly. I would like to use Kajabi to host my website, to host online courses, gather data, create an email list, offer free workshops, be able to have a landing page for different offers etc. Looking for someone tech savy and creative to help me design a website that makes people feel safe, excited, clear, happy and inspired. But also a website that covers all the technical basics to run my business smoothly, and I would also like for clients to be able to make payments on it.\r\n\r\nI would like to have the ability to update the website on my own when I need (like updating pictures and videos) and hopefully you can help me understand how to do that! The ideal person would be someone that I could work with and hire again to help me elevate it as I go.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to meeting you, thank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633560542543589377','-',7,'United States','na',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 20:10:12',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
