(13056,'Content Management, Posting, Web Design',3,'We are looking for someone who is skilled at posting to Wordpress and similar CMS and websites, with basic design, layout and copy skills.\r\n\r\nAre you skilled at learning new CMS, and managing and posting content efficiently? Do you have a good skillset for design and layout, including basic graphic design?\r\n\r\nThis role could be for you.\r\n\r\nWe have a project and ongoing work to upload, post, edit, design and manage a content management system full of content for business use.\r\n\r\nMust have the above skills, as well as essential HTML and CSS skills and knowledge for design.\r\n\r\nUnderstanding of DNS and web configuration a plus, as the CMS interacts on a domain, for web use.\r\n\r\nThis is a constant opportunity for direct collaboration with a team, with lots of tools and support.\r\n\r\nMost content is already created, so it\'s a matter of layout, configuration, and content management.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633580442962046977','-',7,'United States','Dallas',45.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 21:29:23',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(13057,'Virtual Accounting & Bookkeeping Assistant',23,'Pennington Law Firm, LLC seeks a virtual assistant to assist with basic accounting and bookkeeping. The Firm has downsized from a large firm using PC Law software to a solo practitioner using Clio for timekeeping and billing and QuickBooks Online for accounting and financial reports. The firm primarily does commercial real estate and telecom-related business transactions. I am looking for the following skillsets:\r\n\r\n• Experience with Clio Manage.\r\n• Experience with Clio Grow (not mandatory).\r\n• Experience with QuickBooks Online and basic accounting and bookkeeping skills.\r\n• Experience with Collaborati (not mandatory).\r\n• Experience with SurePayroll.\r\n• Experience with Synovus Gateway online banking (not mandatory).\r\n\r\nThe tasks I need assistance with are as follows:\r\n\r\n• Creating new matters in Clio Manage.\r\n• Generating draft invoices in Clio each month. Once approved, email approved invoices to clients via Clio.\r\n• Creating invoices in Collaborati for one client and sending them for my approval. Once approved by me, send the invoices to the client.\r\n• Creating routine monthly reports such as P&L, balance statement, and outstanding A/R.\r\n• Paying bills/invoices in QuickBooks Online monthly. My preference is to pay all invoices via ACH via QuickBooks Online. If a check must be sent, the virtual assistant will create the check, and when notified, I will print, sign, and mail it.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633580531368321025','-',7,'United States','Beaufort',50.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 21:29:54',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
