(13059,'Healthcare Content Writing',37,'We are looking for content writer to write about healthcare procedures. This involves writing content for our landing page, blog posts, newsletters or educational content all around medical procedures.\r\n\r\nIn the short term, we are looking for a blurb about dental implants, what the procedure is about, steps in the procedure, recovery time etc. We also want content for our landing page and about blog posts for new regulations.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633583066501591041','-',7,'United States','-',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 21:40:16',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(13060,'Ongoing blog graphic design using AI and Canva',2,'Looking for a graphic designer who can assist with ongoing graphic design work for our blog.\r\n\r\nThe design work will primarily be for header graphics on blog posts. 1-2 designs per work.\r\n\r\nWe use Canva and would like to continue using Canva in some capacity for this work. Our previous designer had success using Dream Studio / Stable Diffusion to create custom artwork that we would enrich in Canva using style elements of our own product and brand identity.\r\n\r\nI\'ve attached examples of previous artwork, more of which you can see on our blogs https://blog.gilded.finance and https://cryptoadvisors.academy/.\r\n\r\nIdeal workflow would be as follows:\r\n\r\n1. Communicate weekly over Slack about upcoming blog posts and ideas for the graphics\r\n2. Share any screenshots or other materials needed for the graphics\r\n3. Use Canva to create and share graphics once completed\r\n\r\nPlease reply with examples of similar work, and also describe your experience and methodolgy for using AI tools such as Dream Studio / Stable Diffusion.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633583294252834817?success','-',7,'United States','New Orleans',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 21:43:00',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
