(13063,'Medical Billing Specialist',21,'Job Description:\r\nBilling Specialist is responsible for accurate and timely billing of electronic and hardcopy Behavioral Health claims. Responsible for creating reports from our system to identify billed, denied, paid services and work it to completion. Ensures claims are billed within 1 week. Resolves issues with unpaid claims to ensure claims are in a paid status. This position reports to the Clinical Director.\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\nMinimum 1-2 years of experience (including EHR and electronic claim submissions)\r\nExperience with a variety of contractual reimbursement arrangements\r\n\r\nResponsibilities include:\r\n- Accurate and timely billing of electronic and hardcopy Behavioral Health claims\r\n- Create reports to track billed, denied, paid services and update weekly for review\r\n- Resolve issues with unpaid claims to ensure that claims are resolved in a timely manner\r\n- Process new claims, resubmits, and adjustments\r\n- Identify, research and resolve unbilled claims and escalate to the appropriate authority for resolution\r\n- Responsible for accurate record keeping of claims billing\r\n- Keep management informed of production of claims and any problems submitting\r\n- Responsible for thorough understanding of payer billing requirements\r\n- Responsible for maintaining the claim billing process and procedure manual','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633586201754132481','-',7,'United States','-',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 21:52:13',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
