(13065,'Build Construction Company Logo and Identity.',10,'Hello, I am looking for a skilled designer to create a logo for a new commercial general contracting construction company. It must be unique, professional, and have different variations of the same concept. The different variations as mentioned below would be used on different things. One variation may go on hard hats, the other might serve for polos, the other may serve for safety vest, website, and so on.\r\n\r\nEx.\r\n\r\nCompany name: Bobs Construction Group, LLC\r\nVariations :\r\n\r\n“BCG”\r\n“Bobs Construction”\r\n“Bobs Construction group”\r\n“B (with a unique design that is specific to the company)”\r\n\r\nNote: The example is not the companies name. Just for reference.\r\n\r\nThis is a startup company and we are not looking to exhaust a lot of funds on a logo design. If you feel that you possess the skills to create a brand identity for this company while being cost friendly please connect for more details.\r\n\r\nProject needs to be completed within 1-2 weeks or less.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633587781635092481','-',7,'United States','Chicago',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 21:59:01',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(13066,'Branding expert to develop an organization\'s branding, and merchandise',2,'Job Summary:\r\nWe are seeking a talented branding expert to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for developing and implementing branding strategies to create a strong brand identity for our organization. The candidate will also be responsible for creating and designing various branding and marketing materials such as T-shirts, hoodies, wristbands, posters, stickers, letterheads, roll-up banners, and backdrop banners.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDevelop branding guidelines and standards for the organization\r\nDevelop and implement branding strategies that align with the organization\'s goals and objectives\r\nDevelop and design various marketing and promotional materials, including T-shirts, hoodies, wristbands, posters, stickers, letterheads, roll-up banners, and backdrop banners\r\nCollaborate with other members of the marketing team to create cohesive and effective branding campaigns\r\nManage and maintain the organization\'s brand identity across all marketing channels\r\nEnsure all branding materials are consistent and adhere to the established guidelines and standards\r\nKeep up-to-date with industry trends and innovations in branding and marketing\r\nContinuously evaluate and refine the organization\'s branding strategies and materials to ensure maximum effectiveness\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nBachelor\'s degree in Marketing, Advertising, Graphic Design, or a related field\r\nMinimum of 3 years of experience in branding and marketing, preferably in a related industry\r\nStrong understanding of branding principles, including brand positioning, messaging, and visual identity\r\nExperience with designing marketing and promotional materials, such as T-shirts, hoodies, wristbands, posters, stickers, letterheads, roll-up banners, and backdrop banners\r\nProficiency in Adobe Creative Suite or other design software\r\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively with cross-functional teams\r\nStrong project management skills with the ability to prioritize and manage multiple projects simultaneously\r\nAttention to detail and ability to ensure consistency in branding and messaging across all marketing channels\r\nIf you are a creative and experienced branding expert with a passion for developing strong brand identities, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633588651714207745','-',7,'United States','NAIROBI',400.000,'fixed',600.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 22:02:01',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(13067,'Logo Creation and Branding',2,'Hello,\r\n\r\nWe have started a new company and need a logo created. We have a couple sketches drawn up- nothing we particularly love- but it\'s a starting point. When the logo is being created, we need to keep in mind font and colors as we are also creating a branding package for future marketing. We would prefer a logo with a more custom font (not one easily found in Microsoft or Canva) and we require unlimited revisions.\r\n\r\nWe are really looking for someone with good communication. I have worked with people on Upwork before who do not respond in a timely manner and seem somewhat uninterested. We are easy going, but also require both ends of the agreement to be committed and follow through.\r\n\r\nIf you feel this might be a good fit, please reach out!\r\n\r\nThe company name is: GoDu our tag line is Simply Rugged although we don\'t think we want that in the logo. We sell high-quality, rugged, durable products. Our current product is an all aluminum boat, similar to a rigid inflatable boat (dinghy). We also have an aluminum garden cart and a few other aluminum boat related products.\r\n\r\nI have attached a few of the sketches we drew up, but as I mentioned, we aren\'t particularly into one specific design. There are elements of them we like and would like to incorporate, but are hoping for a logo artist to create their own design.\r\n\r\nWe also require that someone really understands logo creation and which file types. We need access to all file types: vector, true PNG, etc. This is not a beginner position.\r\n\r\nThanks for your time!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633589295093362689','-',7,'United States','Seminole',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-03-08',1,'2023-03-08',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-08 22:04:24',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
