(13117,'Landing Page Designer Needed',4,'We are a marketing agency that specializes in creating high converting landing pages for our clients. We are currently seeking a talented and experienced freelancer to join our team and help us create landing pages that drive results.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Design and develop landing pages for our clients using Figma and Webflow.\r\n- Implement landing page designs using Shopify\'s landing page building apps like Gempages, Pagefly, or Replo.\r\n- Collaborate with our team to create landing pages that align with our clients\' goals and objectives.\r\n- Optimize landing pages for maximum conversion rates using best practices in design and user experience.\r\n- Keep up to date with the latest trends and best practices in landing page design and optimization.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience in designing and developing high converting landing pages for a variety of clients and industries.\r\n- Expertise in Figma and Webflow.\r\n- Familiarity with Shopify\'s landing page building apps like Gempages, Pagefly, or Replo.\r\n- Strong understanding of user experience design principles and how to apply them to landing pages.\r\n- Ability to work independently and collaboratively in a fast-paced environment.\r\n- Strong communication and time management skills.\r\n- Ability to meet deadlines and deliver high-quality work.\r\n\r\nThe compensation is adjustable for the right candidate.\r\n\r\nIf you are a talented and experienced landing page designer who is passionate about creating high converting landing pages, we would love to hear from you. To apply start your cover letter with the word \"Prada\" or your application will be discarded immediately. Please submit your resume and portfolio showcasing your landing page design work.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01707375016d19a0f1','-',7,'United States','Canterbury',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-03-09',1,'2023-03-09',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-