(13130,'Shopify Website Redesign for Female-led Cookie Company',16,'Background:\r\nFeed Your Soul is a female-founded cookie brand that is focused on delivering high-quality, individually wrapped cookies to customers across the United States. With a mission to provide a meal to someone in need for every cookie purchased, the brand is committed to making a positive impact on the world.\r\nObjective:\r\nTo redesign the Feed Your Soul Shopify website in a way that optimizes corporate client revenue and enhances the overall user experience. The new design should be visually appealing, easy to navigate, and aligned with the brand\'s tone, personality, and values.\r\nTarget Audience:\r\nCorporate clients and B2B customers who are looking for unique and thoughtful gifts for their employees, partners, and customers.\r\nKey Themes:\r\n• Individually Wrapped Cookies\r\n• Giving Back\r\n• Gourmet Treats\r\n• Unique Flavors\r\n• Personalized Gifting\r\nDesign Direction:\r\nThe design should be based on the Narrative Shopify theme, which is versatile and designed to tell a story. The website should have a bold and eye-catching design that is customized to match the brand\'s personality and style. The new design should feature a clear and concise navigation that highlights the brand\'s products and services. The design should also be optimized for mobile devices and should load quickly.\r\nKey Features:\r\n• Customized Product Pages\r\n• Personalized Gifting Options\r\n• Corporate Client Accounts\r\n• Easy Checkout Process\r\n• Social Proof Elements\r\nDeliverables:\r\n• Custom Shopify website design that is aligned with the brand guidelines and optimized for corporate clients.\r\n• Design mockups and wireframes that showcase the new design and user experience.\r\n• Implementation of the new design on the Shopify platform, including customization and configuration of the Narrative theme.\r\n• Ongoing maintenance and support to ensure the website remains up-to-date and optimized for','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0138a7c90321aa543b','-',7,'United States','Chicago',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-09',1,'2023-03-09',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-09 15:07:00',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
