(13151,'Customer Support for Medical Practice',22,'We are seeking a highly motivated and organized individual to join our team as a Customer Support Representative. In this role, you will be the primary point of contact for our customers and will be responsible for answering emails, answering phone calls, submitting prior authorizations, and answering patients\' questions.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nRespond to customer inquiries via email and phone in a prompt, professional, and empathetic manner\r\nSubmit prior authorizations to insurance companies and follow up on the status of the request\r\nAccurately and thoroughly answer patients\' questions regarding their treatment and coverage\r\nMaintain a high level of knowledge of the company\'s products, services, and policies\r\nDocument all interactions with customers in our CRM system\r\nCollaborate with other departments to resolve customer issues and ensure customer satisfaction','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633859774931398657','-',7,'United States','Closter',10.000,'perhour',10.000,'2023-03-09',1,'2023-03-09',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-09 15:59:12',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
