(13156,'Create a design for a landing page',4,'Hi,\r\n\r\nthis job would require you to create a design for a simple landing page. Note that you will be required to create some custom icons for several of the sections included in the mockup.\r\n\r\nPlease use the following references when drafting the design.\r\n\r\n- The attached mockup. The final design should include all elements and content from the mockup. Please check the attachments for the `.bmpr` file containing the mockup and all text content. Note that, on hover, the background color of the \'Book a Webinar\' button should change to #149353\r\n- The https://spotware.com website. You can find an example similar to the mockup at this page: https://www.spotware.com/ctrader/trading/ctrader-copy. It includes several related elements such as section titles, green \'tick\' marks, etc.\r\n- The company brandbook - attached to this description. Please use Montserrat for text content.\r\n\r\nThe mockup includes the following sections.\r\n\r\n- The page title at the top of the page. Use `title_image.jpg` as the background image and make sure that the text and the green button look nice on it.\r\n- The \'Why Choose Us\' section. Please draw a custom illustration representing a line going up (representing business growth, profits increasing, etc.).\r\n- The \'Chief Presenter\' section. Please use `chief_presenter.jpg` and frame it in a circular frame - same as the mockup. Please crop the image as you see fit.\r\n- The \'Key Aims and Example Content\' section. Please draw four custom icons representing the concepts from the icons in the mockups - depositing money, partnering with someone / having a community, growing revenues / earning money, and a document / bill / paper in an envelope. Place the four quotes in a nicely-styled block - please consult the references for an example of how this block may look like.\r\n- The \'Webinars and Pricing Structure\' block. Please draw custom icons of the price tags. Style the tables so that they do not look out of place compared to the rest of the page.\r\n- The footer - it\'s can be a copy/paste of the same footer from https://www.spotware.com/ctrader/trading/ctrader-copy.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you have any questions regarding this job.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e376844dd8f2a2bb','-',7,'United States','Limassol',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-03-09',1,'2023-03-09',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-09 16:06:11',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
(13157,'Healthcare/ Medical Virtual Assistant with Clinical Experience',22,'We are a housecall primary care company primarily serving geriatric patients across the state of Michigan and Florida. We have about 2000 patients and we provide the following services:\r\n\r\n- Primary care & Palliative care\r\n- Podiatry\r\n- Wound Care\r\n- Social work/counseling and ​BHI\r\n- Chronic Care Management\r\n- Dietitian services\r\n\r\nWe are currently in need of nurse virtual assistants, preferrably with clinical experience, who can help us with different tasks like data entry, prescription refills, sending lab/radiology/home care orders, and sending/receiving faxes. Other significant tasks include inbound/outbound phone calls and email correspondence and EMR data entry.\r\n\r\nWe only need 3 but will initially hire 5 and give 1 week paid training then will evaluate at the end of the week to see who we can keep. If you understood the process and would like to send a proposal, please start your cover letter with \"I have clinical experience!\".','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633861718283268097','-',7,'United States','Fenton',8.000,'perhour',8.000,'2023-03-09',1,'2023-03-09',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-09 16:07:12',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
