(13160,'Medical Virtual Assistant',22,'We are seeking a dedicated and reliable Medical Virtual Assistant to join our team. As a Medical Virtual Assistant, your primary responsibility will be to interview and obtain the medical history and physical information of patients who are scheduled for surgery.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\nConduct virtual interviews with patients who are scheduled for surgery to obtain their medical history and physical information\r\n\r\nReview medical records and documentation to ensure accuracy and completeness\r\n\r\nCommunicate with medical professionals to relay pertinent patient information\r\n\r\nmaintain patient confidentiality\r\n\r\nFollow-up with patients to ensure they have completed all necessary pre-surgical preparations','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633862626614325249','-',7,'United States','Allen',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-03-09',1,'2023-03-09',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-09 16:10:38',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(13161,'Need a designer for a week',2,'Hello.  Our in-house designer is on vacation next week and we need to fill her role for a week. We are looking for someone that can be available to work for us and get on calls with us between 9 and 5 central time starting Monday thru Friday.\r\n\r\nYou must have email design experience, Illustrator experience, and we really could use someone with HubSpot CMS experience. Other designs are likely to be part of the project, too. The more experience you have, the better.\r\n\r\nThe project fee is for the full week of work.  We expect to keep you busy between 9 and 5, but even if we don\'t, the project fee is still yours.  :)\r\n\r\nWe need someone that works quickly.  Not rushed, but not someone that dilly-dallies either. (No idea if I spelled dilly-dallies correctly.)\r\n\r\nPlease write \"week of work\" somewhere in your cover letter so I know that you\'ve read this and are clear on the requirements.\r\n\r\nThere might be some work today or tomorrow, too, but that would be a separate fee. We\'ll let you know about that.\r\n\r\nWe think the compensation is fair, but we will consider higher proposals for the right person.\r\n\r\nMight be other overflow work in the future if we find someone we love to work with.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ec2bfaa7b7757890','-',7,'United States','Northbrook',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-03-09',1,'2023-03-09',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-09 16:11:45',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
