(13183,'WordPress Custom Development | ACF | Gutenberg Block |',15,'We are looking for a WordPress developer to set up Poll functionality on our site using advanced custom fields (ACF Pro) and a custom Gutenberg block.\r\n\r\nThe purpose of the polls is to engage our audience on various topics. The polls are entirely for fun, not serious so don\'t need to worry about double voting.\r\n\r\nRequired skills and experience:\r\n- Experience with WordPress, ACF Pro, and Gutenberg\r\n- Proficient in JavaScript, HTML, and CSS\r\n- Experience with AJAX and integrating it with ACF\r\n\r\nTimeline and budget:\r\nWe are looking to complete this project within 2-3 weeks and have a max budget of $2,000.\r\n\r\nThe Polls will be set up and edited inside of a standard wordpress post via the following:\r\n\r\n- ACF fields for the poll type, poll question, poll answers (text and image) and poll vote count. (I have already set this up in repeater fields).\r\n\r\n- Use the standard WP Post to create the poll via ACFs metaboxes (not via a custom post type because the entire site is polls and I need standard post for gutenberg functionality).\r\n\r\n- Create a custom Gutenberg block that will display the poll from that WP Post on the front-end of the post. There will be 3 different template parts to display the poll on the front end. This is based on 3 different poll types (VS, binary, multichoice). You can see further below examples of what I want it to look like and function like exactly.\r\n\r\n- Use AJAX to capture the user\'s vote and update the poll vote count data in ACF.\r\n\r\n- Use ACF to return and display the updated poll % results to the user immediately after they vote without refreshing the screen. (javascript?)\r\n\r\n- Style the poll to display nicely on the front-end of the post depending on the poll-type (like the examples I have given below)…\r\n\r\n\r\nPoll Type 1 - VS\r\nFront end style & functionality like this: https://bimber.bringthepixel.com/main/snax_poll/versus-poll/\r\n\r\nPoll Type 2 - Binary\r\nFront end style & functionality like this:\r\nhttps://bimber.bringthepixel.com/main/snax_poll/binary-poll/\r\n\r\nPoll Type 3 - multichoice\r\nFront end style & functionality like this:\r\nhttps://bimber.bringthepixel.com/main/snax_poll/classic-poll/\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this project, please contact us with your relevant work samples.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0150e890b0af35a3ea','-',7,'United States','upper hutt',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-03-09',1,'2023-03-09',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-09 16:55:04',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
