(13225,'Patient Intake Coordinator',22,'As our intake team, they are the first point of contact for prospective clients and play a defining role in drawing first impressions, building rapport and trust, and ensuring that all new clients are matched with the right therapist. In addition to supporting our clients, they are also the primary point of contact for the immediate needs of our therapists as it relates to communicating with clients, session scheduling, client billings, internal and external referrals, and more.\r\n\r\nDaily Responsibilities:\r\n\r\n• Monitoring and managing email inboxes, answering phone calls, live chats, and all incoming communications from clients, referral sources, and therapists;\r\n• Completing client intake assessments over the phone or video, creating rapport and trust with potential clients, and supporting them through meeting multiple therapists until they find the right therapist for them internally;\r\n• Supporting the clinic through active and inactive outreach to ensure that all potential clients receive the top level of quality care;\r\n• Managing the clinic’s schedule, the therapist’s schedules, and monitoring the waitlist;\r\n• Ensuring sessions and consults booked on the schedule are happening;\r\n• Adjusting, managing, and troubleshooting video therapy rooms;\r\n• Ensuring daily payment reconciliations are completed;\r\n• Demonstrating empathy, strong clinical knowledge, and ability to respond to difficult situations effectively;\r\n• Supporting therapists in administrative tasks;\r\n• Connecting with medical clinics and other external healthcare referral partners to accept and make referrals;','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633907784100790273','-',7,'United States','-',10.000,'perhour',10.000,'2023-03-09',1,'2023-03-09',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-09 19:10:04',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(13226,'Web solution for mapping',15,'I\'m looking for a web solution for a unique mapping solution.\r\n\r\nWhat we want to be able to do is allow users to select an area (lets say a zip code, city or address) and input a radius (5, 10, 20 miles) and have a bunch of addresses pop up.  Then filter some of the addresses out. and then once filtered provide an optimized route between all of them.  So if 10 addresses the output would be a route to visit each address in the shortest time.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe are open to customizing word press and open to using open source mappping products.\r\n\r\nWe can discuss more in chat, but this the rough concept.\r\n\r\n\r\nNeeds:\r\n\r\n1 Type of user needs to be able to input address and some additional information.\r\n\r\n2  Another type of user needs to be able to input an address, city or zip code and pull other addresses that are around them.\r\n\r\n3.  Filter for requirements and then get an optimized list\r\n\r\n4.  Submit and then get an optimized route for the items in 3.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks,','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2034587','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-09',1,'2023-03-09',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-09 19:10:11',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
