(13238,'Shopify Theme Edits for CRO',16,'We are seeking an experienced Shopify developer to join our team and help us improve our website\'s conversion rate. As a Shopify developer, you will be responsible for implementing changes to our website to improve user experience and increase conversions, as well as decreasing website load time.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Customize Shopify themes and templates to create visually appealing and user-friendly product pages, checkout pages, and other areas of the website\r\nImplement new features and functionality to improve the user experience and encourage conversions\r\n- Optimize our website for mobile devices\r\n- Decrease website load time through various techniques, such as compressing images, minifying code, and optimizing caching\r\n- Ensure website code is clean and optimized for performance\r\n- Collaborate with our design team to ensure website changes are visually appealing and on-brand\r\n- Continuously monitor website performance and make adjustments to improve user experience and conversion rate\r\nRequirements:\r\n- 3+ years of experience in Shopify development\r\n- Strong knowledge of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript\r\n- Familiarity with Liquid, Shopify\'s templating language\r\n- Experience with Shopify\'s APIs and app integrations\r\n- Experience with A/B testing and website optimization tools\r\n- Excellent attention to detail and problem-solving skills\r\n- Strong communication and collaboration skills\r\nIf you are a skilled Shopify developer with a passion for e-commerce and a drive to improve website performance, we encourage you to apply. Please see the list of changes attached.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~017a38926b5510beb8','-',7,'United States','New Hyde Park',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-03-09',1,'2023-03-09',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-09 19:30:49',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
