(13242,'Graphic Designer - Illustrator',2,'Job Summary:\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a creative and skilled designer/illustrator to create custom vehicle decals for our clients.\r\nThe candidate will take moodboard concepts and use their illustrative skills to create car vinyl designs that align with the client\'s style and needs. They will work with pre-existing templates and general style guidelines to produce unique designs that stand out from the competition. Attention to detail and the ability to communicate effectively with the current design team is key to this role.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nCreate custom vehicle decals that meet client specifications and needs.\r\nUse moodboards and existing templates to create unique designs.\r\nWork with clients to understand their requirements and provide design solutions.\r\nWork with 3D artists to ensure accurate representation of design on the final product.\r\nEnsure all designs are visually appealing, consistent and follow brand guidelines.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nAll candidates must have extensive experience using Adobe Illustrator and be able to provide a rich portfolio showcasing various different design styles.\r\n\r\nThanks,','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633914797593485313?success','-',7,'United States','London',48.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-03-09',1,'2023-03-09',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-09 19:39:16',NULL,9,3,NULL,140),
(13243,'Design an Ad for a billboard campaign',2,'For our upcoming Billboard ad campaign, we are looking for a great print ad.\r\n\r\nWe\'re a digital marketing agency and are new in town, so we need to get known by the locals.\r\nThe billboard will be around 4 meters wide X 3 meters high\r\n\r\nThe message should be clear and punchy.\r\nWe want something that catches the attention of the viewers, even without reading the text.\r\n\r\nThe message is mainly communicating about our website and app creation service, while also mentioning our digital marketing services.\r\nThe visual should really be aimed at selling the website development service.\r\n\r\nWe\'re in a country where many local businesses don\'t have a website, so the idea is to have a strong visual message to emphasize the need for a website.\r\n\r\nRecap:\r\nThe ad needs:\r\n- our logo\r\n- a strong image\r\n- main message and bullet points\r\n- phone contact/website\r\n\r\nAttached is our logo to get you started','https://www.upwork.com/nx/wm/workroom/32919788/details','Pierre Seylan || Design an Ad for a billboard campaign || Crystal.',74,'United States','Zurich',150.000,'fixed',150.000,'2023-03-01',1,'2023-03-09',1,'Fixed',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-03-09 19:41:20','2023-03-09 19:53:18',5,3,NULL,132),
(13244,'Website Redesign',4,'Before you read any further please do NOT email us. ONLY MESSAGE ME HERE.\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking to have our website redesigned to be more aesthetically pleasing, modern, and functional. We are going to drive traffic there for a blog and it will need to be optimized for mobile.\r\n\r\nOur website is fastfamvan.com and our socials are @fastfamvan so take a look, but again do not look us up, and do not email us or our agency. You will be immediately eliminated.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for someone that can build a beautiful and modern website that we feel excited to send people to and that people will be excited to explore!\r\n\r\nI think we will start with the top menu featuring each social media channel on the top left along with the rest of the menu featuring sections: About Us, Resources, Our Gear, Merch, Contact\r\n\r\nAbout us will link to a one page that will of course talk about us.\r\n\r\nResources will have a drop-down menu that features about 5 \"how-to\" guides that I\'m working on\r\n\r\nOur Gear will take it to a page that shows all of our gear with affiliate links to it\r\n\r\nMerch will take the user to an e-commerce store that likely needs to be revamped\r\n\r\nContact will of course allow the user to contact us.\r\n\r\nHere are some templates that I like and what I like about them. We will look to draw from these designs.\r\n\r\nhttps://meriden-fluid-demo.squarespace.com/ - very clean and simple, I like the newsletter and submenu at the bottom\r\n\r\nhttps://zion-fluid-demo.squarespace.com/ - I like the full page photo (I would prefer video) on the homepage, the about section is short, sweet, and simple\r\n\r\nhttps://clarkson-fluid-demo.squarespace.com/ - really like the design\r\n\r\nhttps://arcade-fluid-demo.squarespace.com/ - homepage is nice, I like how it features the merch shop and blog (I would put the blog in like this and keep it hidden until there\'s enough content on it)\r\n\r\nhttps://mycelium-fluid-demo.squarespace.com/ - visually appealing, wondering if we can embed a video like this with left to right arrows to showcase youtube videos\r\n\r\nhttps://www.thebucketlistfamily.com/ - I like their video on the homepage and their follow us on instagram section\r\n\r\nIf you are interested I will need these things from you:\r\n\r\n1. At least 3 websites you\'ve built in the past 12 months\r\n2. Your project scope including what you believe needs to be done, how long it will take, and any ideas you have for the design\r\n3. Your estimate for total project cost\r\n\r\nI am looking to hire for this immediately! Thank you for your interest!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633917305533911041','-',7,'United States','na',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-09',1,'2023-03-09',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-09 19:48:00',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
