(13258,'Personal Brand Logo Design + Visual Branding',10,'In need of a logo for my personal consulting business, as well as someone to help me enhance the overall visual branding on my website + promotional marketing materials.\r\n\r\nI\'m a communications consultant who works mostly in the sustainability/environmental sphere, but also for clients across a wide range of mission-driven fields.\r\n\r\nWhat I\'m looking for design-wise:\r\n-A logo that looks hand-illustrated but chic\r\n-Visual branding elements that are attractive for both clients in the environmental realm, as well as enterprise clients\r\n-Design that matches the vibe & feel of my current website\r\n\r\nYou should have:\r\n-A portfolio of past logo designs for clients\r\n-Experience with creating cohesive visual branding for consultants OR small-medium business clients\r\n-Some flexibility for a 30-minute weekly video call during standard 9-5 work hours PST\r\n-Superb and consistent communication skills\r\n\r\n***Please attach logo or visual branding work samples to your proposal.***\r\n\r\nThe pricing on this project is flexible and dependent on deliverables. We\'ll work together to set milestones that make sense and the project is broken up in increments (so you get paid sooner).\r\n\r\nLooking forward to working together! :)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633925406951600129?success','-',7,'United States','Seattle',1200.000,'fixed',1200.000,'2023-03-09',1,'2023-03-09',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-09 20:22:27',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
