(13261,'Five Website Logos Good Match',10,'Hello Everyone,\r\n\r\n\r\nI have Five (5) Websites and I need ONE logo for each website. Below is how I would like each of the logos to be developed. This bid is for FIVE (5) finalized logos. Each individual logo will have 3 to 5 mockups.\r\n\r\n\r\nFor each logo, I would like 3-5 mockups.Then I will choose the mockup I like best for each website, make some minor changes or possibly leave it as it is (maybe change some colors or make the font different). Then you will deliver the final logo file in 3 formats: Vector (illustrator), high resolution JPG and web-friendly PNG (with transparent background). \r\n\r\n\r\nThen we will move on to the next website and the same thing: 3-5 logo mockups, I choose the best mockup for the website and so on and so forth. \r\n\r\n\r\nFor each of the logos, I have a general idea of what I want. For example, I might say something like, \"okay here is the first website called MediaTempest.com, I would like the logo color in purple or blue or combination, a small tornado or a hurricane shape next to the words MediaTempest. Here is a logo I found that I like the color scheme on.\" \r\n\r\n\r\nSo for each of the logos, you will at least have a general idea of what I want. However, I would say this - if inspiration hits you and you have a good idea that is different than what I am asking, I love to see artists have some leeway - so in other words, there is room for creativity on this project if inspiration suddenly hits you and you think, \"hey you said you wanted a tornado, but instead, I made the font look like it is being blown by the wind.\" That\'s awesome to me if you get a sudden idea and want to incorporate it.\r\n\r\n\r\nNote that my company will own the intellectual rights (trademark) to each of the logos after delivery. I can also pay as we go. For example: Five Milestone Payments, as each logo is created and completed, you receive a milestone payment, then move on to the next logo.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2034710','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-09',1,'2023-03-09',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-09 20:27:55',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
