(13263,'Housing Landing Page Design UX in adobe xd',2,'The site HousingNonprofit.com is seeking UX design experts from the South Florida community to design our landing page and LP content.\r\n\r\nWe are a nonprofit platform matching renters with housing grants to purchase their first home.\r\n\r\nOur LP conversion point is when users fill out our form at https://housingnonprofit.com/apply/\r\n\r\nBecause many of our users are modest to middle income we want them to have relatable, easy to read content about affordable housing. Even if users are not ready to buy a home we want to stay in touch with them via our newsletter on affordable housing.\r\n\r\nWe want users to reach our landing page and feel like we are neighbors in their local community. We want a neighborhood feel with images of homes, nature and green spaces with a strong / clear call to action.\r\n\r\n*Designs must be submitted in Adobe XD\r\n\r\n**Our design tastes are Dwell.com, National Geographic, NPR, Monocle Magazine.\r\n\r\n***Comparable function websites are homebuyer.com and downpaymentresource.com.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1633928001962926081?success','-',7,'United States','Boca Raton',100.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-03-09',1,'2023-03-09',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-09 20:32:31',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
