(13331,'Credentialing Specialist for DMEPOS Vendors',24,'We are looking for a highly experienced Credentialing Specialist who can assist our DMEPOS vendors with the credentialing process for commercial payers such as Blue Cross, Aetna, Humana, Cigna, Kaiser and Tricare. As a Credentialing Specialist, you will be responsible for ensuring that our vendors meet all the necessary requirements and standards set by each payer in a timely manner.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nAssist DMEPOS vendors with the credentialing process for commercial payers\r\nEnsure that all documentation is complete, accurate, and up-to-date\r\nCommunicate with payers to ensure that all requirements are met\r\nMonitor the status of each credentialing application and provide regular updates\r\nWork closely with our team to ensure that all vendors are properly credentialed in a timely manner\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nAt least 2 years of experience in credentialing for DMEPOS vendors\r\nExpertise in the credentialing process for commercial payers such as Blue Cross, Aetna, Humana, Tricare, Cigna, and Tricare\r\nStrong attention to detail and excellent organizational skills\r\nAbility to work independently and manage multiple tasks simultaneously\r\nExcellent communication and interpersonal skills\r\nIf you meet the above requirements and are passionate about helping DMEPOS vendors navigate the complex credentialing process for commercial payers, we would love to hear from you. This is a remote position with a contract rate tbd. Please submit your resume and a brief cover letter explaining why you would be the ideal candidate for this position.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1634191495028289537','-',7,'United States','Kings County',18.000,'Open this select menu',18.000,'2023-03-10',1,'2023-03-10',1,'Normal Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-10 14:08:21',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
