(13341,'Whiteboard illustrator & animator for a video series',8,'Project Overview:\r\n\r\nOur client is developing the Anti-Racist Curriculum (ARC), the first of its kind for the Further Education Sector in Wales.\r\n\r\nThey plan to present their work in May, showcasing the \'World Centric History Timeline\' in four whiteboard animation videos, each one four minutes long, covering four regions and eras: Ancient, medieval, early modern and modern.\r\n\r\nThe videos will be written and voiced by a world-leading academic and housed in the curriculum\'s virtual reality platform, with the goal of educating and promoting anti-racism across all colleges in Wales.\r\n\r\nOur approach\r\nWe hope for a creative approach that incorporates stunning colours, thin pencil lines, and animation.\r\nThis will make the video engaging, bright, and memorable, while avoiding a cartoony look.\r\n\r\nDrawing inspiration from this video: https://vimeo.com/182580315\r\n\r\nThe videos will feature characters wearing traditional dresses and have memorable iconography for each location.\r\n\r\nTo ensure the message is effectively conveyed, important notes will be displayed on-screen in text form.\r\n\r\nThe result will be a visually appealing and informative video that captures the sincerity and significance of the subject matter.\r\n\r\nSo to sum up:\r\n*This is a series of 4 whiteboard videos, style as described above\r\n*Each video will be 4 minutes long\r\n*We have a budget of $375 per video, but please let us know what would be your rate\r\n*The video production will need to be done in 5 weeks, starting on March 20th and delivered (all of them) by April 24th\r\n\r\nPlease send over a relevant reference of your previous work.\r\nThanks for applying!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b7c49d815875985f','-',7,'United States','London',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-03-10',1,'2023-03-10',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-10 14:26:59',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
