(13345,'Local-SEO Expert GMB Maps Long Term',5,'We\'re looking for a Local-SEO Ninja with vast experience and passion in what he/she does - we have tons of projects & campaigns for different states, cities & niches we need help with!\r\n\r\n\r\nSpecifically we need a Local-SEO & GMB-Maps Optimization Expert - someone who will do audits, monthly GMB-Profile optimization activities and someone who knows the Ins & Outs of the latest GMB optimization tactics & long-lasting strategies.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe SEO (OnPage & OffPage) Strategies & Tactics employed must be legit, not spammy and fully transparent.\r\n\r\n\r\nFYI - We\'re looking for serious, experienced providers ONLY for a long-term partnership that can expand to more than 30+ clients...\r\n\r\n\r\nWhen submitting your bids please provide the following:\r\n\r\n1. Your past experience with similar Local-GMB campaigns.\r\n\r\n2. A Sample report of past packages you did which we can expect to receive on job completion.\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks in advance for your bids!','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2035250','-',7,'United States','-',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-03-10',1,'2023-03-10',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-10 15:46:36',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
