(13400,'Brand Identity Package Designer',2,'Company Overview:\r\nWe are a creative agency that specializes in storytelling. Our team is dedicated to helping our clients tell their unique stories through branding, design, and content creation. We are looking for a talented Brand Identity Package Designer to join our team and help us continue to create compelling stories for our clients.\r\n\r\nJob Summary:\r\nThe Brand Identity Package Designer will be responsible for developing and creating visual elements that represent our clients\' brand identities. This includes creating logos, color palettes, typography, and other design elements that will be used across various mediums. The successful candidate will have a strong understanding of branding principles and be able to create designs that effectively communicate the client\'s message and story.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n\r\nCollaborate with clients and internal team members to understand their brand identities and design needs\r\nDevelop creative concepts and design solutions that align with the client\'s brand identity and storytelling goals\r\nCreate logos, color palettes, typography, and other visual elements that can be used across various mediums, including print, digital, and social media\r\nWork closely with the creative team to ensure design consistency across all materials and channels\r\nPresent design concepts and ideas to clients and make revisions as needed\r\nStay up-to-date on design trends and technologies to ensure our designs are fresh and innovative\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nBachelor\'s degree in graphic design or related field\r\n3+ years of experience in branding and package design\r\nStrong portfolio showcasing brand identity design work\r\nExcellent skills in Adobe Creative Suite, including Photoshop, Illustrator, and InDesign\r\nStrong understanding of design principles and branding concepts\r\nAbility to work collaboratively with clients and internal team members\r\nStrong attention to detail and ability to work under tight deadlines\r\nIf you are a creative, detail-oriented designer with a passion for storytelling and branding, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1634290504787177473?success','-',7,'United States','Beacon',35.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-03-10',1,'2023-03-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-10 20:31:29',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
