(13402,'A price prediction game web+ios+android',6,'A price prediction game app.\r\n\r\nVery well designed, fun, captivating, functional bug free app.\r\n\r\nTwo people battle head-to-head making a prediction of what the price of an item will be on a given day. Whoever comes closest to the actual price wins tokens.\r\n\r\nRealtime active leader board to keep track of the best players.\r\n\r\nOpen real-time chat box with translator feature.\r\n\r\n\r\nStrong statistical skills.\r\n\r\nNFT or smart contract experience will be needed.\r\n\r\nPeople that own my NFT\'s will receive extra tokens & in game perks.\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m looking at fixed price offers only.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know the amount you can do the job for.\r\n\r\nTwo payments/milestones. One after approval of design & framework. Second payment upon completion of the 100% functional, published pug free app. Funds will be placed in safe pay before work begins.\r\n\r\nI\'m shopping by offer, price, experience & ability.\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you in advance for your time & consideration.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2035297','-',7,'United States','-',5000.000,'fixed',5000.000,'2023-03-10',1,'2023-03-10',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-10 20:43:27',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
(13403,'Looking for Letterhead and Cover Page Design for Real Estate Appraisal Company',2,'Hello,\r\n\r\nI have a lot of design needs on a constant basis for my clients. I need someone who is good at designing letterheads, cover pages, making logos, flyers, etc.\r\n\r\nI am looking for someone to do a small test task (paid obviously) and if that goes well I will consider more full time hours.\r\n\r\nThe task I currently need done is recreating a professional looking letterhead and cover page for a Real Estate Appraisal report.\r\n\r\nAttached you will see the current two letterheads they are using. I want to recreate these to look more professional and eye catching.\r\n\r\nYou will also see a cover page attached. I would like to keep the basic information on the cover letter (picture of property, date, client name, property address, etc) but I would like it to be designed to be much more professional and eye catching. Also the information on the cover letter has to be easily editable (preferably in word) so that we can change out the addresses, pictures, dates etc for each new property.\r\n\r\nThis company is a Real Estate Appraisal company, which is basically a company that inspects properties for banks and gives them a report that tells them the accurate value of that property.\r\n\r\nThe letterhead and cover letter we create will be used on these reports. The Ram head you see in the letterhead is our current logo. We would like to still incorporate that but the overall design and placement of everything needs to be improved.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1634294112949645313?success','-',7,'United States','Carlsbad',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-03-10',1,'2023-03-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-10 20:45:28',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
