(13425,'Dust Jacket',2,'I know you\'ve designed plenty of covers and was wondering what your experience is with the dust jacket?\r\n\r\nI\'m setting up distribution through IngramSpark and I\'m considering releasing a hardcover version, but I would need a dust jacket. page 26 of their guide has the dimensions.\r\n\r\nThe dust jacket is for the same novel.\r\n\r\n\"I. Love. This. Book. And if you\'re looking for a great psychological thriller for 2023, this is it. The Street Between the Pines is a delightful psychological thriller that has been written in the most gratifying way.\" - C.L. Roberts-Huth, Author\r\n\r\n\"This is written so well with so much detail. At no point does this story feel like it’s dragging, and the tension build-up kept me tearing through the pages. I mean, some of these chapters had me so anxious it was like watching a scary movie between your fingers because you’re THAT afraid to completely look.\" - Brittany White, Horror Haus Books\r\n\r\nThe inner back cover flap, I would like to add the attached photo, qr code and a brief info. so, photo/info/qr code. I attached a pic of what it should look like.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\ntext:\r\n\r\nSubscribe to my horror newsletter and stay informed!\r\n\r\nSubscribers will receive the award-winning screenplay, The Street Between the Pines for free!\r\n\r\nwww.jjalo.com\r\n\r\nSo here, the reviews would be on the right side (front cover) and the pic/qr would go on the left side (back cover)\r\n(Attaching image references)\r\n\r\nThanks so much\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://www.ingramspark.com/hubfs/downloads/file-creation-guide.pdf','n/a direct client','-',7,'United States','150',150.000,'fixed',150.000,'2023-03-10',1,'2023-03-10',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-10 22:59:03',NULL,5,3,NULL,132),
