(13432,'Website custom graphic design',4,'I have recently had a website built for a new beef jerky brand. the website consists mainly of photos with very few graphics. For example we have photos of cows in fields grazing.\r\n\r\nI want to make the website more graphical and require a graphic designer to go through some of the sections of the site where we have used photos and recreate these in a graphical design. So where we have an photo of a bunch of cows grazing, you will need to create a graphical scene of the same thing. we want to keep the graphics in a similar colour pallet to the existing design.\r\n\r\ni have attached an image of a style of graphic i have seen on another website but i am open to suggestions on other styles.\r\n\r\nWe will start on the home page of the site and work from section to section. so on the home page we will likely have 3 sections, the hero image, then an image half way down the page then the footer.\r\n\r\nI have my entire design in figma which i can share with the chosen person so you can easily work through and design side by side with my existing layout.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01bd14aeb947569411','-',7,'United States','Stockport',100.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 11:52:45',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
