(13450,'2D Animated Explainer 15 Second Video Commercial',8,'Hello! My site SaveOnCannabis.com had done an explainer video years ago as can be seen here: https://youtu.be/AqF_bCOXppA our brand has refreshed the whole look of our assets and also removed features like the forum.\r\n\r\nPlease start your bid with the term: EXPLAIN so I know you read this post.\r\n\r\nI am looking to create a new explainer video, but honestly not even sure it needs to be a full 30 seconds since am looking to use on the site possibly in a pop up and in our YouTube videos. We would want to incorporate the new logo style and also if any people and other assets are in the animation they should look similar to the style in our blog graphics: https://saveoncannabis.com/blog/\r\n\r\nSince it’s a pretty straightforward site want to make it as concise as possible but still exciting and interesting, so hope is as short as possible.\r\n\r\nHere is the script:\r\n“ Looking for a guaranteed way to save money on cannabis products? Look no further than SaveOnCannabis.com! Our directory features verified discounts on your favorite stores and products. Click a coupon and save instantly while shopping. Browse categories, products, and reviews to discover new stores. Explore today at Save On Cannabis and start saving now.”\r\n\r\nWe want to have expert voice over within the video, but if you don\'t have someone we can look to get one off Fiverr to integrate into the video.\r\n\r\nThanks!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~019bc968e31dc4f501','-',7,'United States','Thornbury',400.000,'fixed',400.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 13:50:47',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
