(13459,'Feature Film Human Reconstruction Artist Required',8,'NOTE: This job posting is part of a broad early development process currently in order to determine skills for the project in question.\r\n\r\nI am looking for a 3D animator, specialised in the creation of realistic human characters and sets, to collaborate in creating a motion picture reconstruction for a 1927 film. I\'m a historian-writer and I have been wishing to recreate a film that no longer exists using all of the surviving script and photo sources to create a live action simulated presentation with characters in motion in real time against photographed sets, and for it be as realistic as possible. I\'m searching for a small team or an all-in-one artist to come on board and eventually begin production under my guidance in recreating one of cinema\'s most mysterious lost titles to which I have recently authored the award-nominated leading book on. The project budget is yet to be determined based on the rates/negotiation of the chosen candidate and the budget will be decided more concretely once decisions, arrangements, and predicted length of production have been decided. In the meantime, this posting is my early research in finding the candidate(s) who can display the skills I\'m looking for. If you can provide relevant examples in advance that would be appreciated also. Thank you, and I hope to hear from you soon.\r\n\r\nPlease see attached the links for the examples I\'m searching for:\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jAM2HjHvbTk&t=43s\r\n\r\nhttps://www.reallusion.com/iclone/live-link/unreal-engine/metahuman/default.html?gclid=Cj0KCQiAx6ugBhCcARIsAGNmMbgrTTcqp_nSY0pajzE_P0tb-g575zGDKTM4qjMpbVTfbYSUx7fs5tMaAo5iEALw_wcB\r\n\r\nhttps://www.reallusion.com/character-creator/','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e3e99f90710e1811','-',7,'United States','Sedgley, Dudley',5000.000,'fixed',5000.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 14:02:15',NULL,6,3,NULL,125),
