(13462,'Full-Time Virtual Medical Assistant Needed for customer service and pharmacy calls',21,'Hi!\r\n\r\nWe are a fast-growing US-based telehealth startup treating urgent care complaints and opioid addiction patients (TeleMAT).\r\n\r\nWe have a wonderful team of 16 administrative assistants using Slack and Zendesk that is looking for several full-time administrative assistants--working under a local office manager. Our hours are 3:00 AM -8:00 PM Pacific Standard Time (PST) daily. Exact hours to be discussed with the office manager.\r\n\r\nTasks include the following:\r\n- calling pharmacies to resolve prescription issues\r\n- communicating pharmacy issues with our doctors to have the resend prescriptions\r\n- answering Zendesk tickets (emails) in a timely manner and returning phone calls of patients\r\n- issuing refunds and canceling/rescheduling patients\r\n- helping patients solve simple tech issues (resetting password etc)\r\n- coordinating care and appointments, rebooking missed appointments etc\r\n-handling inbound pharmacy calls.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYour skills should include excellent English skills and customer service skills. Your pharmacy calls need to be with self-confidence and organized.\r\nCustomer satisfaction is our number one priority, even if the customer may be impatient at times.\r\nYou should also have impeccable organizational skills.\r\n\r\nPlease only apply if you have at least 2 years of VA experience and if you fulfill all the above requirements and if you either have great Upwork credentials/reviews or third-party references that can be contacted.\r\n\r\nStarting salary is $6.00/hour for the first 3 months, after that, you will qualify for an increase to $7.00 with further increases as deemed fit.\r\n\r\nYou may be assigned anytime within the business hours for 8 hrs a day.\r\n\r\nWe prefer nurses but if you have a medical background or worked as a medical assistant, you are welcome to apply.\r\n\r\nThanks for your interest.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635273719055147009','-',7,'United States','Hokessin',16.000,'Open this select menu',18.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'Normal Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 14:04:44',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
