(13465,'Mental health writer for weekly blog post about major depressive disorder',37,'Profile:\r\nWe are looking for a content creator with experience of diving deep into topics related to mental health and illness, in particular major depressive disorder. You are comfortable finding, reading and presenting results from clinical research studies. Your tone is empathic and informative. A license as a mental health professional (such as psychologist, psychotherapist, psychiatrist, physician or nurse) is an advantage. As is a PhD in the field of mental health.\r\n\r\nWorking arrangement:\r\nResearching and creating a weekly opinion piece of roughly 1000 words for the Flow Neuroscience blog. Topics will be related to depression. You will receive a rough overview of what to include in each blog post.\r\n\r\nThe purpose is to:\r\n* Inform sufferers of depression and their loved ones about how depression works and what they can do by themselves to relieve symptoms.\r\n*Empower readers to find the depression treatment which best fits their needs.\r\n*Spread knowledge about our at-home tDCS treatment and encourage readers to try it.\r\n*Build trust in the Flow Neuroscience brand.\r\n\r\nThe arrangement includes 4 initial opinion pieces with the possibility of extension.\r\n\r\nYou will be paid per blog post.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635281219968430081','-',7,'United States','-',12000.000,'fixed',10000.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 14:07:45',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
