(13473,'https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635274872238256129',21,'I will not respond to copy and pasted generic messages of your own. I need a reply to my specific questions. You can answer \"in-line\" to make it easy if you want to copy and paste my questions.\r\n\r\nI am seeking a person who understands medical billing.\r\n\r\nI will ask for proof of what you tell me if I decide to hire you, so please don\'t waste either of our time by being dishonest.\r\n\r\nI am doing the research to start my practice. I am looking to practice in either Idaho, Montana, Tennessee, or North Carolina. Do you have experience with any of these states?\r\n\r\nI will bill out for orthopedic, mental health, pain management, and holistic medical services (not covered by insurance companies, that I\'m aware of, but some do pay on acupuncture). Do you have experience with any of these disciplines?\r\n\r\nDo you have experience with telemedicine?\r\n\r\nDo you have experience billing the Veterans Hospital Administration?\r\n\r\nHave you ever worked with Kareo?\r\n\r\nThank you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635274872238256129','-',7,'United States','Durango',15.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'Normal Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 14:15:24',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
