(13485,'Shopify Web Design',4,'Hi there,\r\nWe are looking for a web/Shopify designer who has extensive experience in modifying existing themes, particularly the \"Symmetry\" theme, to help us redevelop our supplement website. Our goal is to redesign certain pages on the site in line with our new branding, with the aim of driving more sales and subscriptions.\r\n\r\nTo give you some background, we are a doctor-developed subscription-based supplement brand with a specific focus on health and nutrition.\r\n\r\nWe are currently undergoing an exciting rebranding phase, and we need a skilled designer to help us create a website that reflects our brand\'s new image.\r\nAs a Shopify designer, your main task will be to modify the \"Symmetry\" theme to create an aesthetically pleasing, premium, and vibrant website design that is easy to navigate. Specifically, we need you to:\r\n\r\n1. Work with our team to understand our new branding guidelines and develop a design that aligns with our brand image.\r\n\r\n2. Redesign specific pages on the website, such as the homepage, product pages, and subscription pages, to improve user experience and encourage more sales and subscriptions.\r\n\r\n3. Ensure that the website is easy to navigate and that users can find what they are looking for quickly and easily.\r\n\r\n4. Create a visually stunning website that captures the attention of visitors and encourages them to learn more about our brand and products.\r\n\r\nTo be considered for this project, you should have:\r\n- Experience in modifying existing Shopify themes, particularly the \"Symmetry\" theme.\r\n\r\n- A keen eye for design and an ability to create aesthetically pleasing, premium, and vibrant designs.\r\n\r\n- A strong understanding of user experience and the ability to create designs that are easy to navigate and user-friendly.\r\n\r\n- Good communication skills and the ability to work collaboratively with our team to understand our brand guidelines and design requirements.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this project, please include the keyword \"duck\" in your response, along with examples of your previous work and an estimated timeline for completing the project.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635290171090952193?success','-',7,'United States','London',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 14:44:25',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
