(13487,'Create 4 editable Event Flyers',12,'I would like 4 alternate designs created for an event flyer in the real estate education space.  I will provide a few pictures, price, logo, QR code, bullets etc and i would like 1 design very quickly, with 3 alternates I can use for market testing.  I have attached flyers of design and appeal similar to what i want produced.  If you are interested please respond with a delivery timeline and fixed price for the first flyer, and the timeline and fixed price for the 3 alternates. Note: The attached example flyers about Mobile Homes are for a different speaker, topic date and event that the subject job posting.  The info for this job posting is containee the flyer titled \"The Automated Landlord\" live event flyer.  Deliverables will be created in Canva and Pages, and shared to me so i can edit for future events.  High prefrence for the ability to deliver the first flyer in under 24 hours and the remaining three within 48 hours.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01c9fbdfc6c62e2f84','-',7,'United States','Warner Robins',35.000,'perhour',80.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 14:52:22',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
