(13493,'Media Buyer for Facebook and Google Ads',37,'About us\r\n\r\nI am Sebastian Turner, and I strongly believe that mastery requires focus. If you\'re an advertiser, you shouldn\'t know everything about marketing. But you certainly need to be aware of the full-funnel approach. The ads are just the first step, but the revenue comes in for our clients when you piece each part together. If you\'re passionate about finding what makes someone buy vs what keeps them scrolling past, and if you know your tools inside and out, I want to hear from you. I’m looking for a passionate Media Buyer who shares these values and can bring their expertise to the table.\r\n\r\nWe are Impendo, a lead generation-focused marketing agency specializing in Facebook and Google Ads campaigns for roofing contracting businesses. My ideal candidate has a minimum of $100,000 in ad spend experience and is skilled in copywriting, Facebook Ads, and Google Ads, and has an obsessive focus on their passion.\r\n\r\nRequirements\r\n\r\n- Create and optimize campaigns that drive the highest-quality leads to my clients\r\n\r\n- Speak perfect English and have a professional on-camera presence.\r\n\r\n- Available for weekly client meetings and can work alongside me to ensure campaign success\r\n\r\n- Preferably be available from 8:00 AM-5:00 PM PST, Mon-Fri, although there will not be any set hours, as you will not be paid hourly.\r\n\r\nPay\r\n\r\nYou will be paid $500 per client, with performance-based bonuses.\r\n\r\nI’m not just looking for someone who can get a 2-3x ROAS, but someone who is dedicated to Impendo\'s growth and success.\r\n\r\nIf you feel aligned with these values and want to join me in my mission, I invite you to click the link and complete your application. I will be leaving the applications open until April 10, 2023.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2036349','-',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'fixed',850.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 15:04:35',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
