(13525,'Create the design for a digital planner',2,'Hi, I need a digital planner for the years 2023 and 2024, that is structured in months, week and days, with a medical theme. \r\n\r\nAlso It must include other chapters (like notes, agenda, phone book etc).\r\n\r\n\r\nIt will be used on apps like GoodNote\r\n\r\n\r\nThe structure of a daily page must include:\r\n\r\n- notes\r\n\r\n- medication (a box that shows he medication name, and 4 other spaces - morning, lunch, evening, night)\r\n\r\n- a box that include medical information (like blood pressures, temperature, how much water did you drink etc.)\r\n\r\n- a box for meetings\r\n\r\n\r\nMore details can be provided on request.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe structure of the week planner must be for notes and appointments.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe other chapters must be for:\r\n\r\n- phone book - emergency contacts\r\n\r\n- financial notes\r\n\r\n- general notes\r\n\r\n\r\nAll the pages must be linked and accessible from any part of the PDF. \r\n\r\n\r\nThe final product must be provided in PDF format and .PST format.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2037317','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'Open this select menu',500.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 15:44:31',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
(13526,'Book Cover Redesign',2,'Looking to redo my book cover for FREE OF MALICE.\r\nApplicants must have experience designing book covers.\r\nApplicants must be able to use existing InDesign files.\r\n\r\nWhat I don\'t like about the original cover (see attachment):\r\n- Looks amateur\r\n- Bulls eye is too prominent; for anyone anti-gun, it\'s a turn-off\r\n- Profile of guy looks like clip art\r\n- Font is old-fashioned\r\n- My name is too small\r\n\r\nWhat I\'m noticing in the thriller genre (have reference book covers):\r\n- Bold clean font, typically white\r\n- Font of TITLE and AUTHOR are all caps and prominent on the cover\r\n- Images aren\'t too busy\r\n- Font interplays with the image at times\r\n\r\nFor Free of Malice, theme is:\r\n- Scary, attack of protagonist, vigilante justice\r\n- See video: https://www.lizlazarus.com/free-of-malice/trailer\r\n- See website: www.lizlazarus.com','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635306076747358209?success','-',7,'United States','Atlanta',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 15:46:12',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
