(13536,'Create a website for my plumbing company',3,'Peter, Hey!\r\n\r\nI am on the roll to create a stellar website for your plumbing business!\r\n\r\nIn order to help your brand skyrocket digitally and create designs that results in a solid brand reputation, a great user experience and designs that are able to convert – I intend to start right off with working out concepts that are based on best branding and design practices. Ensuring that I am able to execute the designs while keeping visual hierarchy in mind and utilize the best color schemes, imagery, contrast, typography to establish brand authenticity will be my top priority!\r\n\r\nEnsuring that I am able to find a comprehensive balance between the visuals, create responsive designs, and gel in functionalities in a way that create a solid experience for the user is what I intend to do in order to make this project a success!\r\n\r\nPortfolio\r\nMake Me Pulse: http://bit.ly/3YN3BmT\r\nChungiYoo: http://bit.ly/3KfUcjw\r\nBallistic Moon: http://bit.ly/3Iq0zjg\r\nHumboldt: http://bit.ly/3k14KZh\r\nMoooi/Beauty Blooms: http://bit.ly/3YUgc81\r\nUnited Sodas: http://bit.ly/3YKBJ2A\r\nHi Skin: http://bit.ly/3Il4ug3\r\nQueen Garnet: http://bit.ly/3S0SCnu\r\nRino & Pelle: http://bit.ly/3KfUPJU\r\nKombu: http://bit.ly/3YCloO8\r\nAlmanac: http://bit.ly/3YS9Shk\r\nIFC: http://bit.ly/40W0zyp\r\nKaizen Ventures: http://bit.ly/3xkZGBZ\r\nCare Watch: http://bit.ly/3K70AcU\r\nBlack Carbon: http://bit.ly/3E8UGnY\r\nKink BMX: http://bit.ly/3IoCclN\r\nELKSQUAD: http://bit.ly/40W27IP\r\n\r\nAbout Me: https://www.upwork.com/freelancers/mshoaibmehdi\r\n\r\nPeter, I would love to collaborate further on this and make it a huge success!\r\n\r\nShoot me up with a message and let\'s connect!\r\n\r\nShoaib Mehdi','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635309186371956737','-',7,'United States','Sydney',350.000,'fixed',350.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 15:58:45',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
