(13557,'Brochure edit for medical device company',13,'Hello, we need someone with graphic and print design skills to edit and perfect a 2-page brochure for a medical device. You will be taking directions from both me and the chief scientist of the company. This is a small project but could lead to a longer-term relationship with our companys growing marketing needs. The brochure is attached and below are some of the instructions:\r\n\r\nThe main agenda here is to have continuity in the aesthetic of the primary Prescient Imaging Logo. I would make all of the significant texts dark blue and subtexts slightly lighter blue.\r\n\r\nOther items:\r\nremove all the gray background from the text boxes\r\nremove the image of the person\'s head in the old scanner head on the front page\r\nlight blue text at top of the first page should say \"In-office PET for Neurobiologists\"\r\nDelete the last graphic titled \"optimize workflow: scanner moves from one patient to another\"\r\nmake the adjusted chair for the patient in another graphic uniform to the images above it.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635321896560111617?success','-',7,'United States','Santa Monica',35.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 16:49:17',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
