(13564,'Simple website to capture email addresses',3,'We are opening a coworking space and looking for a quick initial website that will capture email addresses. Once we get going, we\'ll want a more substantial website, but for now before our marketing starts, we need something fast.\r\n\r\nExample: https://www.creativedensity.com/stjoe/\r\n\r\nNotes: we only just need 1 page. We don\'t need --\r\n1. all the categories at the top (Locations / memberships / meeting rooms / podcasting / about us, or \"schedule a tour\").\r\n2. the snazzy stats graphics that move. Love the stats, but it doesn\'t have to be moving.\r\n3. anything after the \"let\'s chat coworking\" section email capture form\r\n4. chatbot\r\n5. \"Generally what to expect\" pricing section\r\n\r\nIt would need to work on a phone.\r\n\r\nOnce we agreed on the work, how fast could it be completed?\r\n\r\nIt should be built in a way that allows us to:\r\n1. add functionality as we grow\r\n2. change the text\r\n\r\nThank you','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635323796503523329','-',7,'United States','Wheaton',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 16:56:48',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
