(13570,'Wix realestate services website',17,'I am writing to express my interest in hiring for RelocateDR.\r\n\r\nWe are a growing real estate and services business based in the Dominican Republic, and we are looking for a talented designer to help us create and implement a design for our Wix website.\r\n\r\nAs a designer with experience in web design and implementation, we believe that your skills would be invaluable in helping us achieve our business goals. We are looking for someone who can create a design that not only looks great, but also functions well and helps us to reach more customers.\r\n\r\nSome of the key responsibilities of this role would include working closely with our team to understand our business needs and goals, creating and refining a design concept that aligns with our brand, and implementing that design on our Wix website.\r\n\r\nTo be successful in this role, you should have a keen eye for design, a strong understanding of web design principles, and experience working with Wix or similar platforms. You should also be able to work collaboratively with our team, take feedback well, and be committed to delivering high-quality work on time.\r\n\r\nWe are excited to work together to create an exceptional website that helps us to grow our business.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635325844538150913','-',7,'United States','toronto',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 17:05:01',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
