(13572,'Landing page expert needed for rapid experimentation work - (NO CODE PLATFORMS)',4,'I have a hair loss company that will be running rapid experiments for the sake of customer acquisition.\r\nI need somebody who is comfortable with no code platforms such as leadpages, unbounce or click funnels.\r\n\r\nYou will need to work with the team to translate ideas and experiments into landing pages quickly so that growth hacks can be tested.\r\n\r\nYou must have an excellent eye for design both visually and functionally.\r\nYou must also be data driven and ready to investigate what is and what is not working work on different pages.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635327402460721153','-',7,'United States','PITSEA',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 17:11:20',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(13573,'Landing Page for Lead Collection',4,'Need to set up a landing page for financesmadesimple.net.  I need to use this to collect leads with a captcha to avoid junk as well as an option to connect to my calendly to schedule an appointment to learn more.   I use pipedrive for CRM and automation that connects the landing page to my CRM would be great.  That means we\'ll need to use a suitable form to make those connections, most likely with Zapier.  \r\n\r\nThe landing page will need to have copy written that flows with the content of the main site, but also be very marketing driven to stress the pain points early in the page and drive the story of why our solution is best towards the end.  The page itself will need to look and feel like it\'s all part of the Finances Made Simple brand.  This landing page needs to primarily focus on the ERC Tax Credit while still making clear we offer additional services such as R&D and Tax Strategies\r\n\r\nHere is some text that MUST be written for marketing purposes.  Copy and paste below is not an acceptable use of this data.  The person doing the page needs to be able to regenerate for maximum marketing performance.\r\n\r\nA study by the Government Accountability Office found that up to 60% of small businesses overpay their taxes, largely due to a lack of understanding of the tax code.\r\n\r\nSmall businesses also bear a disproportionate share of the costs associated with tax compliance. According to a report by the Small Business Administration, small businesses pay an average of $1,584 per employee to comply with federal tax requirements, compared to just $457 per employee for larger firms.\r\n\r\nAccording to the National Society of Accountants, 33% of small business owners overpaid their taxes by an average of $5,000 per year.\r\n\r\nWhile both Certified Public Accountants (CPAs) and Tax Strategists provide tax-related services, there are some key differences between the two.\r\n\r\nCPAs are licensed professionals who provide a range of accounting and financial services, including tax preparation and planning. They are required to complete a certain number of hours of continuing education each year to stay up-to-date on changes in tax laws and regulations. CPAs are generally well-equipped to provide tax advice and services to individuals and businesses of all sizes.\r\n\r\nTax Strategists, on the other hand, are specialists who focus specifically on tax planning and strategy. They often work with high net worth individuals and business owners to help them minimize their tax liabilities and optimize their financial positions. Tax Strategists typically have advanced training and experience in tax law and planning, and may hold additional certifications, such as the Certified Tax Coach designation.\r\n\r\nOne key difference between CPAs and Tax Strategists is their focus on tax planning versus tax compliance. While CPAs are well-versed in tax laws and regulations, their primary role is to ensure that clients are in compliance with those laws and to prepare accurate tax returns. Tax Strategists, on the other hand, take a more proactive approach to tax planning, seeking out opportunities to minimize tax liabilities and maximize tax savings.\r\n\r\nOverall, both CPAs and Tax Strategists can provide valuable tax-related services to individuals and businesses, depending on their specific needs and circumstances. It may be helpful to consult with both types of professionals to ensure that you are receiving comprehensive tax advice and planning services.\r\n\r\nFinances Made Simple is a tax strategist.  We specialize in ERC Tax Credits, Research and Development Tax Credits as well as Tax Strategy.  Additional information can be found on the website.  \r\n\r\nOnce the landing page design is complete and approved, we\'ll need to work with the website administrator for transfer and upload.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011eb0c40b8312d638','-',7,'United States','Shrewsbury',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 17:11:31',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
