(13585,'New Tea Product Packaging Design and Mockup',2,'We are creating a new tea product, and are looking for designers to help visualize, and create the following\r\n\r\nMilestone 1\r\nA. Mockup of a 2-3 packaging styles,\r\nWe\'re unsure of which packaging to go with, we have two options:\r\n\r\n1 cylinder tin with label\r\n1 rectangular cardboard box\r\n\r\nif you are able to provide multiple styles and ideas, that would be ideal.\r\n\r\nPlease help create a mock-up of each using the same design elements and styles,\r\nThis will include color, fonts, and graphics, no final text or descriptions in this stage, just product name, title, and basic front display details that we provide.\r\n\r\nMilestone 2\r\nB. After the mockup and we\'ve decided which looks best, we want to continue to finalize the design with the complete text, heading, information panel final design deliverables.\r\n\r\nDesign styles: we\'re looking for a modern, aesthetic style, to complement our current brand logo and colors (to be provided during interview/discussion) that can compete on the shelf with something like Firebelly, Blume Tea, Seventh Duchess\r\nhttps://ucarecdn.com/934ca436-5d65-4ed9-955f-cf5bed090119/-/preview/09xEk7jX\r\n\r\nPlease submit the previous examples of your work, and your proposal.\r\nThank you','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635335400707874817','-',7,'United States','MARKHAM',600.000,'fixed',600.000,'2023-03-13',1,'2023-03-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-13 17:43:16',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
