(13758,'Logo Design and Branding for \"Ascanium\"',10,'BACKGROUND\r\n\r\nAscanium is an intergenerational family-owned investment company. The name is derived from Ascanius, the character in Virgil\'s Aenid. It is intended to convey the idea that it is the material from which legacy is made. Ascanium\'s focus is direct investments into property and businesses, and its emphasis on sustainable growth and environmental considerations. Some colour options which were thought that could work well for Ascanium\'s branding are:\r\n\r\nNavy Blue: This color represents professionalism, trustworthiness, and stability, which are essential traits for a financially-oriented company.\r\n\r\nDark Green: This color represents growth, prosperity, and environmentalism, which could align with Ascanium\'s values of sustainability.\r\n\r\nGold: This color represents wealth, luxury, and success, which could align with Ascanium\'s investment focus.\r\n\r\nLight Grey: This color represents balance, neutrality, and sophistication, which could be suitable for a family office with a diverse portfolio.\r\n\r\n\r\nTASKS AND DELIVERABLES\r\n\r\nBrand Design tasks/deliverables to be completed:\r\n\r\n1 - Company Logo: one full-size formal logo and one simplified logo for use in small format or in working documents (headers, footers, etc.).\r\n\r\n2 - Branding Guide (including typography, colour palette, logo with colours/different use cases, basic cards).\r\n\r\n3 - Document/White Paper samples: Word and PowerPoint in the latest versions of the software. These should be provided \"ready to use\". Native formats used to produce these shall also be supplied if additional software file types were necessary to generate the final word processing document.\r\n\r\n4 - Presentation Slides/Deck: these shall be \"ready to use\" in PowerPoint and shall be fully compliant with the Branding Guide. Pages types to provide as a minimum: Cover pages for front and back, contents page, chapter/section divider pages, \"blank\" work page.\r\n\r\n5 - Email signature, should include logo and be compliant with the branding guide. The signature must be usable in MS Outlook and in Apple\'s mail client across iPhone, iPad and Mac, without requiring additional editing/modifications, other than information/details specific to each person/email ID.\r\n\r\n\r\nAll deliverables to be received in native formats (.ai, .svg, .eps, .psd, etc.), as well as working documents.\r\n\r\nWorking documents shall be at least in the following formats: jpeg/png, Word/Excel, PowerPoint, PDF.\r\n\r\nAll images, logos, drawings produced shall be submitted in at least three different sizes (small, medium, large) and in the various colour schemes/types which are generated for the branding.\r\n\r\nThe proposed font type files shall be provided and in all cases shall be easily accessible, and readily available in browsers, word processing documents, spreadsheets (i.e. Word, Excel, Numbers, etc.)\r\n\r\nIt is expected that there shall be a full briefing prior to commencing work so that the philosophy and desired outcome can be well-understood.\r\n\r\n\r\nSCHEDULE\r\n\r\nMaximum lead times after contract start are expected to be as follows:\r\nLogo and colours - First issue (rev 0): 3 days\r\n\r\nLogo and colours - First revision (rev 1): 2 days after review of rev 0. There may be further revisions.\r\n\r\nBranding guide - First issue (rev 0): 3 days after final approval of logo and colours.\r\n\r\nDocument/White paper samples, presentation documents and email signature (Rev 0): 4 days after final approval of Branding Guide','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01242e88e65fd97e4e','-',7,'United States','Paris',48.000,'fixed',48.000,'2023-03-14',1,'2023-03-14',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-14 14:28:12',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
(13759,'Create B2B Shopify Store',16,'Im looking for Shopify expert that can create a B2B shop for us.\r\n\r\nHere is the initial mockup of the website (the final design will be provided in couple of days to the final candidate for final evaluation):\r\n\r\nhttps://www.figma.com/file/FbBjgim4CeP4BNVTnYbcgG/CIGAR-DROPSHIPPING?node-id=0%3A1&t=JuJTe31XSeLaNOms-1\r\n\r\nWe plan to create a website focused on cigar wholesale and dropshipping.\r\n\r\nThe Main HOME page will be one single web page should be one big page divided into several parts:\r\n\r\n- Home (main image)\r\n- Benefits\r\n- Dropshipping\r\n- Wholesale\r\n- Cigar Catalog\r\n- Cigar Delivery\r\n- Contact Us\r\n\r\nThe content for the home page should be ready in couple of days from now.\r\n\r\nThen we would have LOGIN for registered customers and Registration form as separate pages.\r\n\r\nAnd then we would have a closed catalog for cigar wholesalers, a product page, Checkout pages (custom design but with one page checkout), order history and add balance page. The internal pages like catalog and product page would not have product descriptions because its focused only on wholesellers and they already know about the cigars, so just photo.\r\n\r\nWe need to make this project VERY VERY urgently (maximum in 10 days since the project assignment). We will use the Shopify Plus platform for this.\r\n\r\nThe website will have initially 10 products and 5 categories (2 products per category). Developer will need to create the products in catalog also.\r\n\r\nWe plan to use functionality with prepaid balance: B2B customer need to deposit funds to his account in order to use system. In this case it should be like available credits for the ordering process. If balance will be not enough to process order, it should show the alert on the customer account. I have seen very similar functionality in \"points\" system when admin manually add balance to each account in order for this customer to order. This should be completely configured by the developer.\r\n\r\nAlso we will use 2 tier of pricing (dropshipping and wholesale) and several rules for each type of account. This must be configured also.\r\n\r\nWe also need to configure custom shipping tarifs.\r\n\r\nPlease apply if:\r\n\r\n1. You have vast experience in Shopify Platform.\r\n2. You have experience in Shopify Plus platform.\r\n3. B2B shop experience is a plus.\r\n4. Development of additional functionalities in Shopify is a big plus.\r\n5. You are able to finish this project in 10 days.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635649795560865793?success','-',7,'United States','Las Palmas',3000.000,'fixed',3000.000,'2023-03-14',1,'2023-03-14',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-14 14:32:04',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
