(13828,'Build Wordpress educational website',15,'I need a website built with Wordpress. My host is Bluehost.  The following is the most important information and should answer most of your questions. I have uploaded an example of the site that will help you develop the final site. I don\'t care if you use a template like Eduma, but only if it allows the site to function as follows:\r\n\r\n\r\n1) This site is for continuing education for Texas licensed professional counselors.\r\n\r\n\r\n2) The student comes to the website and can view the course text and quiz before paying for the course, but must register before taking the quiz and must complete a course evaluation before paying and being issued a certificate. It is important that students be able to see the text and quiz before paying for it:  See course text>>See quiz>>Register>>take quiz and see results>>Complete Course Evaluation>>Make Payment using PayPal>>Print Certificate.\r\n\r\n\r\n3) After the student submits the quiz with a passing score (70%), the student must complete a course evaluation. Then, the student can pay for the course if they choose to print their certificate (or want to do so at a later time). Each student should have a record of quizzes taken, dates, when paid, etc., that can be seen upon log-in.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease do not adjust your bid after you have been awarded the project. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAttachments','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2038097','-',7,'United States','-',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-03-14',1,'2023-03-14',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-14 17:20:58',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
(13829,'Illustrator Needed for a Haunted Hotel Exterior',2,'Hello! I am a horror novelist, and my next book takes place inside of a large Victorian-style haunted hotel built in the early 1900\'s. I\'m looking for an artist to produce a color illustration of the house as described in the book as promotional material.\r\n\r\nThere are a number of sections throughout the book in which the house is described, however this is one early description that I think lays the groundwork:\r\n\r\nAt the end of the dirt path sits the main attraction, which stands out entirely from the decrepit ghost town. Whereas most of the buildings are made up of old, rotting wood, this building looks like it’s been plucked from time. It’s a massive Victorian-style hotel painted a crisp olive green, with rich red accents lining the windows, doors, and steepled wood-shingle roof. It stands at nearly triple the height of the rest of the buildings and stretches out wide enough that most mansions in Beverly Hills would be jealous of the square footage. On each of the building’s corners stand tall, rounded spires adorned in large stained glass windows. They’re all identical, except for the frontmost left one, which rises an extra level from its counterparts.\r\n\r\nWhile the bones of the buildings facade are somewhat defined, theres also quite a bit of room for artistic interpretation.\r\n\r\nHeres the one catch-- my timeline is fairly tight, and would be looking for delivery within the next two weeks at most. If you are interested, please send me a message!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01f8e197d4cfe83591','-',7,'United States','La Jolla',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-14',1,'2023-03-14',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-14 17:21:55',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
