(13840,'Re-architect my wellness website',15,'My natural health website has been on the net for 20 years now. Since 2019, I\'ve shifted to emphasizing awareness of EMF and the radiation of wireless technologies. I plan to make EMF the central point of the website, with additional sections on Nutrition, Detoxification, Immunity, Fitness, and Spirit.\r\n\r\nI want the site, www.WomensMedicineBowl.com to target Millennials, particularly parents, who suspect they have symptoms of EM radiation but who haven\'t taken any steps yet for remediation. On my new site I want them to find the information they need to protect themselves in our irradiated world. Info blocks will be on: Science. Advocacy, Courts Say, Articles, News for your Health, Views (blog), Media (interviews with me, my articles), Products, On-line courses--EMF FAST FIX, and Healthy Eating (on another platform).\r\n\r\nWe\'re constructing this on UNITE.live so there will no censorship--please look at the features of that platform.\r\n\r\nThough this site has been on the net for 20 years, it\'s been an information/education site, not monetized. \r\n\r\nI want the site to be lively, easy to navigate, and because the topic is stressful and the target audience is already stressed out--if not suffering from Electromagentic Hypersensitivity--the colors should be calming--earth tones and greens.\r\n\r\nTime--by early summer? When I start promoting media interviews. Will need url addresses to send listeners to.\r\n\r\nCost--budget production now. All writing is done or I will do. This is design and development.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2038048','-',7,'United States','-',2500.000,'fixed',2500.000,'2023-03-14',1,'2023-03-14',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-14 17:42:53',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
