(13854,'Logo and Brand Kits Design',2,'Job Overview:\r\nComplyEase, a rapidly growing cloud document management and compliance platform, is seeking an experienced and creative Logo Creator / Graphic Designer to develop a unique and memorable logo that effectively represents our brand identity. The ideal candidate will have a strong understanding of branding, visual storytelling, and the ability to create a logo that embodies our company\'s values and services.\r\n\r\nWhat we need:\r\n\r\n1. Present logo concepts to the team and gather feedback, iterating on designs as needed.\r\n2. 1. Produce high-quality, final logo files in various formats and sizes for use across all marketing channels (print, digital, social media, etc.).\r\n3. Branding Kits\r\n1. Logo\r\n2. Favicon\r\n3. Our tagline is: Streamline, Organize, Comply with Ease\r\n4. Color Palette\r\n5. Typography\r\n6. Iconography\r\n7. Brand Guidelines Document:','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635709951227047937','-',7,'United States','Silver Spring',95.000,'Open this select menu',40.000,'2023-03-14',1,'2023-03-14',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-14 18:31:02',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
