(13861,'Simple landing page design',4,'Looking for help to design a simple landing page for a pdf download. I have a sketch of what I want. It will be for a website that has a pretty good style already. It will just needed to be a picture of the download, a small picture of me, our company logo, and an opt in. Our website is CoachingInstitute.com. It is designed in elementor, so if this page can be elementor compatible that would be great. The opt in form will be with campaign refinery. Please let me know your experience, please share some links to landing pages you have developed and let me know your availability. How long would you expect a simple design to take? I will be ready to start this project today (Tuesday PST)\r\n\r\nNote: please do NOT write to me privately at my email address about this - it will disqualify you from the project. Please respond through upwork.\r\n\r\nThanks','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635714386500288513?success','-',7,'United States','Santa Barbara',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-03-14',1,'2023-03-14',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-14 18:49:39',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
(13862,'Graphic Designer Expert in Photoshop',2,'We are seeking a highly skilled Graphic Designer with expertise in Photoshop and Illustrator to join our team. The ideal candidate will have a strong portfolio showcasing their ability to create visually appealing designs for various media such as digital and print.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDesign and create various marketing materials such as flyers, brochures, social media posts, and email campaigns using Photoshop and Illustrator.\r\nCollaborate with the marketing team to develop concepts, layouts, and designs that effectively communicate our brand message.\r\nWork closely with the web development team to ensure consistency in design across all digital platforms.\r\nStay up to date with industry trends and best practices in graphic design.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0174a01f6cfbccd4ff','-',7,'United States','karachi',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-03-14',1,'2023-03-14',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-14 18:53:53',NULL,6,3,NULL,125),
