(13866,'Logotype and brand identity for a luxury Victorian clothing brand',2,'I am about to launch a very high-end business, supplying regalia for UK Freemasons, together with appropriate formal clothing.\r\n\r\nI already own a heritage brand which I am keen to use for this purpose: Lloyd Attree & Smith. This brand was established in the City of London in 1857 as a manufacturing tailors, and made the very finest men\'s formal clothing.\r\n\r\nWhere the brand wants to look vintage/Victorian, this should always be authentic and never contrived, fake or whimsical.\r\n\r\nI am looking for help in creating a brand around this.\r\n\r\n1. MAIN LOGOTYPE\r\n\r\nSomething that is easy to read but encapsulates heritage, ideally specifically Victorian heritage, in its typeface and look.\r\n\r\nFull Hierarchy:\r\nBrand name: LLOYD ATTREE & SMITH\r\nTagline: FINE REGALIA AND FORMALWEAR\r\nSupport: ESTABLISHED IN LONDON IN 1857\r\n\r\nAlternative Hierarchy #1:\r\nBrand name: LLOYD ATTREE & SMITH\r\nTagline: FINE REGALIA AND FORMALWEAR\r\n\r\nAlternative Hierarchy #2:\r\nBrand name: LLOYD ATTREE & SMITH\r\nSupport: ESTABLISHED IN LONDON IN 1857\r\n\r\n2. PRODUCT NAMES\r\n\r\nI am also looking for a graphic identity / logotype for a few key products.\r\n\r\nThese should look like a family of sub-brands, and should also look premium, aspirational, vintage/Victorian.\r\n\r\nSo far, we have:\r\n\r\n1. The \'Lifetime\' Apron\r\n2. The \'Lifetime\' Jewel\r\n3. The \'Coronation\' Jewel\r\n\r\nEach of these should be rendered in a style so that the three are obviously \'of a family\' with one another.\r\n\r\nHappy in due course to review some of the kinds of Victorian presentation I like - and what I know I don\'t like!!\r\n\r\nI look forward to reading your thoughts and proposals!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635717277148553217','-',7,'United States','Borough Green',350.000,'fixed',350.000,'2023-03-14',1,'2023-03-14',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-14 19:00:54',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(13867,'Virtual assistant',22,'We are looking for a highly organized and detail-oriented virtual assistant to join our team. As a virtual assistant, you will be responsible for providing administrative support to our executives and other team members. You will work remotely, managing various tasks and projects to ensure that the team\'s daily operations run smoothly.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n• Managing and organizing email inbox, scheduling appointments, and managing calendars\r\n• Handling phone calls, responding to inquiries and redirecting calls to the appropriate person\r\n• Drafting and editing documents, reports, and presentations\r\n• Conducting research on various topics and presenting findings\r\n• Arranging travel, accommodations, and transportation for executives and team members\r\n• Managing expenses, processing invoices, and coordinating with finance department\r\n• Assisting in organizing and coordinating company events, meetings, and conferences\r\n• Managing social media accounts and assisting with digital marketing activities\r\n• Providing general administrative support as needed\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n• High school diploma or equivalent, associate or bachelor\'s degree preferred\r\n• Prior experience as a virtual assistant or administrative assistant is preferred\r\n• Excellent communication and interpersonal skills\r\n• Proficient in Microsoft Office and Google Suite\r\n• Ability to prioritize and manage multiple tasks simultaneously\r\n• Highly organized and detail-oriented\r\n• Proactive and self-motivated with a strong work ethic\r\n• Comfortable working in a remote environment with limited supervision\r\n\r\nWe offer a competitive salary, flexible working hours, and a supportive and inclusive work environment. If you are an organized and efficient individual with a passion for providing administrative support, we encourage you to apply for this position.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635718022148161537','-',7,'United States','-'