(13885,'Editor for Blog Articles - Medical Billing',37,'I am looking for a skilled blog editor, specializing in the healthcare sector and medical billing, to help us develop our young but rapidly growing SaaS product, Approved Admissions.\r\n\r\nWhat is our product?\r\n\r\nApproved Admissions is a patient insurance eligibility verification software that automatically tracks any changes which happen in patients\' Medicare/Medicaid/HMO insurance coverage and proactively notifies the user, helping to decrease claim denials and improve the revenue cycle.\r\nOur software is mostly used by billing companies, skilled nursing facilities, and durable medical equipment providers.\r\nWe plan to increase the number of marketing activities for the product and develop the Blog section on the revamped website, to give more valuable insights to the visitors, attract new potential clients, and improve the SEO performance of the website.\r\nWe plan to write around 8 posts per month on US medical billing, revenue cycle management in billing/ SNF/ DME companies, healthcare automation, and insurance coverage. The articles will be written by our specialists internally, however, we would like to work with a professional editor who will re-check and adjust the articles (wording, grammar etc.).\r\n\r\nWhom are we looking for:\r\n\r\n- Excellent English (advanced level), native speaker\r\n- Familiar with the US healthcare system, preferably with an understanding and/or experience of RCM, medical billing, and insurance.\r\n\r\nFinal deliverables:\r\n\r\n-8 edited articles per month (expected)\r\nWe guarantee prompt and consistent payments.\r\nPlease contact me directly to learn more details.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635737591633969153','-',7,'United States','-',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-03-14',1,'2023-03-14',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-14 20:20:56',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
