(13889,'Need an existing logo from png as vector grafic',10,'Hi,\r\n\r\nI need the logo attached as SVG or EPS vector file. The green hexagon must be a vector graphic, and also the white heart line on the green hexagon. The white line should ne filled white, not transparent. The complete Logo must be on transparent background. I don\'t know the real font, please try to take a similar font.\r\n\r\nYours,','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635739559261667329?success','-',7,'United States','München',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-03-14',1,'2023-03-14',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-14 20:29:52',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
(13890,'Presentation Deck',11,'My name is Michele. I run a high-end brand advisory business working with mid-to-large clients. My background is senior leadership positions at TBWA, Ogilvy, Ketchum, and Edelman, so lots of big agency marketing and PR work.\r\n\r\nI have a client who needs a quick-turn but uncomplicated deck by Friday. We have a template that will cut down a lot of time, but I do value beautiful design. It\'s for a CEO who is giving an inspirational talk to some of his leaders. It would be great to hop on a quick call today to see if it\'ll work for you. I\'m looking for a designer I can work with across all my clients and build a creative language with.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1635741182727663617?success','-',7,'United States','Deerfield',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-03-14',1,'2023-03-14',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-14 20:36:05',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
