(13892,'Experienced Cosmetic Packaging Designer',2,'We are looking for an experienced Cosmetic product packaging designer to design packaging for us.\r\n\r\n** Must have years of cosmetic packaging experienced. Season cosmetic packaging designers only please. **\r\n\r\nWe have an in-house designer who will be working along side you for this project.\r\n\r\nWe will want you to create three distinct packaging variations.\r\n\r\nWe will provide you with resources and design elements. We will tell you our brands competitors and also show you all of our current packaging.\r\n\r\nWe we want everything custom created. No stock templates or online stock design resources should be used. Textures/fonts are of course okay if they are allowed for commercial use but everything else should be 100% custom designed. We will need you to sign and NDA and ownership agreement.\r\n\r\nPlease send examples of any relevant cosmetic work. Also, please start your proposal with the phrase Experienced Cosmetic Packaging Designer so we can confirm that you read our entire post.\r\n\r\nPlease feel free to contact us with any questions.\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~013706ff2e4a361b30','-',7,'United States','New York City',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-03-14',1,'2023-03-14',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-14 20:40:03',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
