(14006,'Rebranding Crypto DAO - Brand Identity Kit',2,'We are a cryptocurrency investment collective seeking to rebrand to match our new market positioning.\r\n\r\nSince we are a DAO (decentralized autonomous organization) we will need to vote on any changes as a community.\r\n\r\nWe are seeking bids from 3 branding experts that we can put to vote.\r\n\r\nThe bid should include the following as two separate bids:\r\n\r\nBid 1:\r\n1. Process for approaching rebrand and choosing a new DAO name\r\n2. Mood board and pitch kit for community to vote you in as branding vendor (should include proposal of how you’ll pitch project, brand ideas, approach, Early logo concepts, etc)\r\n\r\nBid 2 (if elected, deliverables you’ll create):\r\n\r\n1. Timelines for all assets\r\n2. New brand logo and digital assets\r\n3. Brand guidelines for brand asset usage\r\n4. Color schemes and font usage\r\n5. Potential website, social media concepts\r\n6. Messaging & positioning document\r\n\r\nPlease respond in your cover letter with I KNOW DAO BRANDING at the top so we know you’re someone who pays attention to detail.\r\n\r\nLet us know why you’re qualified for this role and why our community should use you for our rebrand.\r\n\r\nWe’d like to hear your process, past history of success, portfolio of work, and any questions you have for us.\r\n\r\nBudget is contingent on a community vote so open to pitches of any size but will need to have accompanying data and assets to support the bid, as community will consider timeline, quality of work and process, plus total fee in their final vote.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to working with you.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~013ea6113ef8d8b445','-',7,'United States','austin',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-03-15',1,'2023-03-15',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-15 16:51:52',NULL,6,3,NULL,125),
