(14075,'Chief of small medical office/business administrator',22,'I am a physician who works in various clinics and also has my own company. Because I\'m pulled in all different directions I do not have time to advertise or spend much time on my own business such as creating website creating a business card and whatnot. The patient I\'ve been getting for my own private clinic has been through word of mouth and from various clinic that used to work for that just followed me. I also have a mentor who sold me a huge list of his patient whom I have not even had a chance to contact because I don\'t have the manpower to do so. It\'d be great if I can find an assistant who is multi-talented in all areas of healthcare related business administration. I would love to find somebody who can assist me or independently take with the responsibilities and do the things that needed and necessary for this business to sustain and grow. I have done the most basics of the basic but still things like creating business card creating websites need to be done. I don\'t mind if my assistant can find some other ways to outsource these kind of responsibilities to freelancers on these kind of apps so that they can focus on figuring out what more needs to be done for the business. I have a lot of ideas just that I don\'t have time. I\'ll also need somebody that will be able to take all the phone calls and arrange with my patients regarding setting up appointments with me. And I will also love to have that assistant figure out with a marketing person on these kind of apps to do marketing campaigns to the patients that I inherited from my mentor sometime ago. The marketing has to be targeted, planned and executed differently based on the population within that patient list. I also have my own list of patience to whom I have not had a chance to reach out to because my lack of time. The person I\'m seeking should be motivated, self-starter, eager to learn and eager to to the job as best as they pos