(14091,'Creative Web template design',4,'Looking for someone to help me launch a landing page for an advertisement, preferably something that looks like this (refer to the attached file below). When you send me an application then I will get in contact with you and send you the information I want on it, with the end goal having the prospects fill out the needed information and then booking a zoom call for further consultation, so your going to need to know how to put that link on the web page. This could be done on any platform you feel most comfortable doing, and i would love it if we can hop on a zoom call so you could take me through the process of what your doing so I can better understand the software your using and make revisions myself because I would love to learn a thing or two about the skillset you possess. This project will essentially be a rough draft for a landing page that will have a link to send to as many people as i can. Let me know if this job sounds like something you\'re capable of and I will get in touch with you soon. Thanks, Ben\r\n\r\nP.S. i don\'t really have an idea on pricing yet, my main goal is to get this task done once i find that i trust to do it we can come to pricing as i will be negotiable, and it will be pay per project','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1636114098646048769','-',7,'United States','na',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-15',1,'2023-03-15',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-15 21:17:16',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
