(14111,'Expert Pitch Deck Creator for Sports Non-Profit',11,'We are seeking an experienced and skilled pitch deck creator who can help us create a compelling investor presentation for our sports non-profit organization. Our non-profit is a 501(c)(3) that aims to make a positive impact on generations of people through sports. At its peak, our organization has the potential to gross $10-20 million annually, and we are looking for someone who can help us achieve this goal.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will have a documented track record of raising substantial capital for non-profits or venture-funded startups. They must also have extensive experience in business writing, presentations, pitch decks, and fundraising.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Collaborate with our team to develop a pitch deck concept that resonates with potential investors and accurately represents our non-profit\'s mission, vision, and potential.\r\n- Develop and create a compelling investor presentation with clear and concise messaging that highlights the key value propositions of our organization.\r\n- Craft a fundraising strategy that is tailored to our specific needs and target audience.\r\n- Help us refine our overall approach to fundraising and make strategic recommendations to help us achieve our goals.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience in creating successful pitch decks and investor presentations.\r\n- Demonstrated experience in fundraising for non-profits or venture-funded startups.\r\n- Exceptional communication skills and the ability to work collaboratively with teams.\r\n- Strong analytical skills and attention to detail.\r\n- Familiarity with sports and the sports industry is a plus.\r\n\r\nIf you meet these requirements and are excited about the opportunity to help a sports non-profit organization achieve its goals, please submit your resume and portfolio of work. We are looking for someone who can deliver real results and has the expertise and experience to help us make a lasting impact.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01873b1baa6b0d6a6e','-',7,'United States','Derky Beach',800.000,'fixed',800.000,'2023-03-16',1,'2023-03-16',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-16 11:13:47',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
