(14119,'Graphic Designer',2,'We seek an experienced and highly motivated person to help us with our graphic design tasks.\r\n\r\nTasks & responsibilities:\r\nStrong knowledge of Adobe InDesign, Photoshop, and illustrator.\r\nStrong understanding of typography and layout for brochures, magazines, and catalogues.\r\nCreation of print-ready artwork and documents, including marketing material, packaging, and outdoor signage.\r\nKnowledge of Prepress processes, including digital and offset printing.\r\nDesigning asset for our Performance media channels eg Google & Facebook Ads.\r\nDevelopment of all brand stationery, including business cards, email signatures, letterheads and more.\r\nAdaptable and flexible with high attention to detail.\r\nWork well in a fast paced, multi business environment\r\n\r\nExtra bonus points if you have….\r\nExperience designing for eCommerce stores Experience.\r\nPhotography and video creation/editing.\r\nUnderstanding of UX design.\r\nAn understanding of CX customer experience journeys.\r\nA growth mindset.\r\nSEO.\r\n\r\nThis is work for approximately three months with the potential of ongoing work.\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for someone passionate about graphic designing  and who knows Photoshop and Illustrator inside and out. Good communication is key, and an eye for detail is essential - daily communication is required.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01590be05371650791','-',7,'United States','Keilor Park',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-03-16',1,'2023-03-16',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-16 13:48:29',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
