(14133,'Virtual Assistant for Plastic Surgery Office in USA',22,'Job Summary:\r\nWe are looking for a Virtual Assistant to join our plastic surgery office team. The Virtual Assistant will be responsible for scheduling patient appointments, responding to inquiries, and managing our electronic health records system. The ideal candidate will have excellent communication skills, be fluent in English, and be available for 20-25 hours per week.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n-Manage the electronic health records scheduling system and keep it up-to-date\r\n-Respond to inquiries from patients, potential patients, and other medical professionals in a timely and professional manner\r\n-Schedule patient appointments and confirm their attendance\r\n-Communicate with patients via email, texts, and phone calls to ensure a smooth and efficient scheduling process\r\n-Maintain the office\'s calendar and schedule to ensure smooth operations\r\n-Maintain strict patient confidentiality and privacy\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n-Fluent in English with excellent verbal and written communication skills\r\n-High level of professionalism and attention to detail\r\n-Ability to work independently and efficiently\r\n-Experience with electronic health records systems\r\n-Must have access to a reliable computer and high-speed internet\r\n-Available for 20-25 hours per week\r\n\r\nPreferred Qualifications:\r\n\r\n-Experience working in a medical office or plastic surgery office\r\n-Knowledge of medical terminology\r\n-Familiarity with HIPAA regulations\r\n\r\nIf you meet the requirements above and are interested in working in a fast-paced, dynamic environment, please apply with your resume and cover letter. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1636372609631391745','-',7,'United States','Dallas',9.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-03-16',1,'2023-03-16',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-16 14:27:42',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
