(14203,'Need a website built for an insulation company using Divi theme in WordPress',3,'We need to have a website designed for a local insulation company. There will be five pages in total.\r\n\r\n1. Home\r\n2. Blow-In Insulation\r\n3. Foam Insulation\r\n4. Mechanical Insulation\r\n5. Contact Page\r\n\r\nWe have a logo design, photos, and a rough outline of content for the pages. We have also set up a server with WordPress and Divi theme installed. We need someone to design a professional website using the DIVI theme builder. We do not want HTML blocks inserted into the Divi builder; we are looking for someone who has experience working with Divi and can use the content blocks included in the Divi Visual Builder.\r\n\r\nTasks include:\r\n- Create a custom global header and footer using Divi theme builder\r\n- Designing a professional 5-page website using Divi visual builder\r\n- Create copy for the homepage and services page regarding the different insulation services\r\n- Making adjustments and changes to the final design as requested by the client\r\n\r\nHere are some examples of the style of the website we are expecting.\r\nhttps://edstromconstructionco.com/\r\nhttps://glaciergarage.com/\r\n\r\nI\'ve attached a copy of the logo and a rough outline of services and talking points that can be used for copy.\r\n\r\nWe don\'t have a branding standard. We want the colors and fonts to work well with the logo provided.\r\n\r\nOn each of the three services pages, we would like a short description written out about the services provided. We also have 3-6 photos of each service that we would like to use as well.\r\n\r\nWe will provide all plugins, themes, imagery, and hosting.\r\n\r\nFeel free to message us if you have any questions regarding the scope. The project estimate is flexible, and we are also willing to work at an hourly rate. Please, provide an estimate of the cost and expected completion date. We want to have a completed first-draft of the design as soon as possible.\r\n\r\nThanks!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1636431979953459201?success','-',7,'United States','FAIRBANKS',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-03-16',1,'2023-03-16',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-16 18:20:14',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
