(14240,'Landing Page Design',4,'Hello!\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a designer for landing pages (no implementation needed) for several of our clients.\r\n\r\nWe are a digital marketing agency running paid advertising for e-commerce clients. Our clients are typically $10M - $20M / year businesses, and have decent ad budgets around $100K/month.\r\n\r\nWe are offering them the service of testing landing pages on a performance basis (they only pay if we drive results.) So we need to create a repeatable testing process for fast design and implementation.\r\n\r\nThe process will include us determining several example landing pages to essentially copy the elements, rebrand for our client, (colors, fonts, brand voice / vibe), and send to our dev to be implemented. Because we are doing a lot of the research and will have clear examples for the elements of the design, I do not expect this to be a hard project. The hard part will be getting in a nice groove where we can move fast.\r\n\r\nThe last note is we want to build out a playbook of templates. When we find a design that works really well, we will want help organizing these into templates that can be re-used to make everyone\'s time more efficient.\r\n\r\nThe great thing for the right person is, we will have real data on these designs. You will have hard numbers to add into your portfolio which is a great way to sell yourself!\r\n\r\nPlease respond with your portfolio, your available hours per week, and your rate :)\r\n\r\nThanks!\r\n\r\nBridgette','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1636459352779669505?success','-',7,'United States','Knoxville',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-03-16',1,'2023-03-16',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-16 20:08:57',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
(14241,'New brand logo',10,'Looking for two designs for a new CBD bakery. One will say \"Dapper Delights\" with a top hat, monocle, and bow tie arranged similar to the draft we uploaded, though the placement isn\'t set in stone. The monocle should be Vegas gold (C5B358), the top hat and bow tie should be black with accents of Vegas gold. The second will be a pet line titled \"Dapper Dog\" with the head of an Old English Sheep dog wearing the monocle, top hat, and tie. Similar to the one in the photos. For both finished files there should be a separate layer for each color used so we can easily screen print. If you have any questions feel free to ask, thank you in advance.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1636459372210659329?success','-',7,'United States','Howell Township',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-03-16',1,'2023-03-16',1,'Fixed Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-16 20:09:28',NULL,9,3,NULL,140),
