(14245,'Professional Ballroom Competition Logo',10,'We are looking to refresh and revamp, and have multiple color high quality versions of our logo (current version attached). Our professional competition has its first year after 30 years of running in its permanent new home in a gorgeous historic ballroom. We would like to include some sort of design aspect that bids an ode to the chandeliers (sputnik style) in the ballroom (Khorassan Ballroom at the Chase Park Plaza in St. Louis, photo attached) in order to tie the logo and branding to the location. We would however still use the monogrammed design of GDC from our current logo. However we would like a few versions that make the word \"Championships\" larger and perhaps play with the positioning of the text to give both square and rectangular versions. We would like this new version to be striking, dimensional, and straightforward. Our timeline on this is quite small, as we would like to have promotional material out in the next month for our new venue.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1636461338064166913','-',7,'United States','Boulder',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-16',1,'2023-03-16',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-16 20:16:55',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
