(14249,'Looking for a Skilled Web Developer to Create a TikTok/Instagram Reels Style Landing Page',3,'I\'m seeking an experienced web developer to create a custom landing page that closely resembles the look and feel of a TikTok/Instagram Reels feed for my social media content creation agency. Our agency works with a wide variety of clients, and I\'d like to showcase video content in a scroll-and-play format on both mobile and desktop devices.\r\n\r\nKey requirements:\r\n\r\nDesign a visually appealing UI that replicates the experience of scrolling through TikTok/Instagram Reels feeds. The design should be responsive and optimized for both mobile and desktop experiences.\r\nImplement smooth scrolling and auto-playing of videos as users navigate through the feed. The feed should offer an infinite scroll experience with efficient rendering to ensure optimal performance.\r\nIntegrate with third-party APIs (e.g., TikTok API, Instagram Graph API, or other video hosting services) to fetch and display video content from various sources.\r\nEnsure high-quality performance by implementing caching strategies, optimizing code, images, and videos, and addressing any potential bottlenecks.\r\nTest and debug the website on different devices, browsers, and screen sizes, ensuring a seamless user experience.\r\nPlease provide a portfolio or examples of similar projects you have completed in the past, along with an estimated timeline and cost for this project.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or need further clarification, don\'t hesitate to reach out. I look forward to discussing this opportunity with you and potentially working together to create an engaging and user-friendly landing page for my agency.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my project!\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nCharlie Couvillion','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1636462735733309441','-',7,'United States','na',60.000,'Open this select menu',60.000,'2023-03-16',1,'2023-03-16',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-16 20:22:21',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
