(14276,'https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1636483012479434753?success',11,'I need to create a new brand and a new Shopify store for a single pet product, which will have different designs and variations, but basically it will be a one product store.\r\n\r\nI mainly need to create the homepage, product page, about us page and collection page. The design must be applied on Shopify platform.\r\n\r\nI want my store to be minimal, clean and with cool animations.\r\n\r\nPlease take a look at this article on ecommerce design trends for 2023: https://99designs.com/blog/trends/ecommerce-design-trends/\r\n\r\nI definitely like the following:\r\n-Animated product reveals\r\n-Immersive branding experience for key products\r\n-Personalized, animated online shopping\r\n-Animated navigation\r\n-Curved frames\r\n\r\nAnimated icons would look cool as well:\r\n\r\nhttps://drawer.design/products/essential-e-commerce-icons/?ref=d-post-ecommerce-icons-3\r\n\r\nhttps://www.pinterest.it/pin/894175700986172363/sent/?invite_code=14036f2bacaf4678ab0c47ea48ccaa44&sender=799459508761054943&sfo=1\r\n\r\nBelow some examples I’ve found of the bullet points above:\r\n\r\nhttps://dribbble.com/shots/19924457-Product-Growth-Platform-Landing-Page-Animated\r\n\r\nhttps://dribbble.com/shots/19249487-Moon-Light-Vol-2-E-Commerce\r\n\r\nhttps://dribbble.com/shots/20585200-KMBCH-Landing-page-3D-motion-for-a-beverage-brand\r\n\r\nhttps://dribbble.com/shots/12129856-Hygge-eCommerce-I\r\n\r\nhttps://www.pinterest.it/pin/211174971670220/sent/?invite_code=b73ab3a54a01461e947847e2487547e1&sender=799459508761054943&sfo=1\r\n\r\nOf course I don’t expect all these features and animations to be implemented all together, it’s just an idea of what I like. I’m not even sure what level of customization Shopify supports.\r\n\r\nI will also need to create a logo and an email marketing funnel to complete the project.\r\n\r\nThe store must look very professional with a high level of branding. It must not look like a random