(14293,'Building an Elementor Website with Webstore for our Body Camera products.',3,'We are looking to build a website with webstore in Elementor for our body camera brand. We are looking for a clean, modern looking website with smooth transitions as you scroll down.\r\n\r\nWe are open to suggestions with regards to design. We will require mockups of the design and agree on the direction before it is implemented.\r\n\r\nPlease include your bid for the project in your application.\r\n\r\nThe content has already been written and SEO optimized. The content has been written in accordance to a rough idea of what the site would look like but are open to amending it in accordance with the new design.\r\nWe would like to have a short FAQ at the bottom of the page for SEO purposes. The content for this has already been written.\r\n\r\nWe have a fair number of photos of the products ready but can do more if needed. We also have a few 3D renders and are in the process of producing a product video.\r\n\r\nWe would like this to be built in elementor as it is one of the faster themes and want to stick with one theme for all our future websites.\r\nThe static pages would be:\r\n\r\nHome\r\nProduct 1\r\nProduct 2\r\nProduct 3\r\nPrivacy Policy\r\nTerms and Conditions\r\nCookies\r\nSectors 1 – 12 (They will all follow the same design, just different content.)\r\n\r\nDynamic Pages\r\nWebstore\r\nArticles\r\n\r\nThe webstore will function like a normal webstore. We can add products on the backend. Webstore should an account feature if possible.\r\n\r\nArticles will function like a blog.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1636726759644860417?success','-',7,'United States','High Wycombe',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-03-17',1,'2023-03-17',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-17 13:52:49',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
