(14395,'Webflow Expert / Front-end Developer',3,'Company you\'re working for: Linkme\r\n\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/linkme/\r\n\r\nAbout Linkme:\r\nLinkme is a globally used mobile application that connects people and businesses through seamless and innovative digital experiences. Our mission is to empower users by simplifying their digital interactions and enhancing their online presence.\r\n\r\nWe are currently seeking a highly skilled and motivated Webflow Expert / Front-end Developer to join our team. The successful candidate will be responsible for translating our website designs from Figma into fully functioning, pixel-perfect Webflow sites.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Collaborate with our design team to transform Figma designs into 1 to 1 copies on Webflow, ensuring accuracy and consistency across all devices and platforms.\r\n- Utilize your expertise in front-end development to optimize site performance, responsiveness, and accessibility.\r\n- Regularly update and maintain the website, implementing changes and improvements as needed.\r\n- Troubleshoot and resolve any technical issues related to the website\'s functionality and performance.\r\n- Ensure all web development projects adhere to best practices, industry standards, and company guidelines.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience as a Webflow expert, with a strong portfolio showcasing your work.\r\n- Proficient in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, with a deep understanding of front-end development principles.\r\n- Expertise in responsive web design and cross-browser compatibility.\r\n- Strong attention to detail and a commitment to delivering high-quality work.\r\n- Excellent communication and collaboration skills.\r\n- Ability to work independently and manage multiple projects simultaneously.\r\n- Familiarity with Figma and other design tools is a plus.\r\n\r\nIf you believe you have the skills and passion to excel in this role, we would love to hear from you. Please submit your resume, portfolio, and a brief cover letter explaining why you would be the perfect fit for our team. We look forward to reviewing your application!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1636827808531062785','-',7,'United States','Miami',36.000,'perhour',36.000,'2023-03-17',1,'2023-03-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-17 20:33:14',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
