(14435,'Design the first page of a website in Figma.',3,'In the spirit of efficiency and professionalism, Please read the entire description before submitting a proposal to avoid disappointment on both sides.\r\n\r\n\r\nI am only looking to work with independent freelancers and not agencies.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis project can become a long-term business relationship and regular work for the right designer.\r\n\r\n\r\nI am a UX designer myself and a conversion rate optimization specialist. Hence I am very familiar with design processes and concepts., so if you are an experienced designer and you know the craft, it will be a fun, pleasant experience working together.\r\n\r\nI am looking for a web designer with solid graphic design experience to design webpages in Figma. This will be a professional, clean and organized project in the sense that I have a design process and I have put together all the info the designer might need to get started and do the work easily and efficiently.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe information you will be provided with:\r\n• The low-fidelity wireframe\r\n• The info structure and content\r\n• The mood board and initial prototypes\r\n• The clear instructions\r\n• You will be given accessibility guidelines.\r\n• You will be given the demographic and use profile info\r\n\r\n\r\nThe expectations:\r\n• You will follow the instructions carefully.\r\n• You will do the entire page plus the mobile version\r\n• You will do the entire project in Figma\r\n• You know how to finish the design In a way it will be easy and clear for the developers to use.\r\n• The design will be accessible for people with disabilities and impaired vision.\r\n\r\n\r\nProjects and milestones:\r\n1. The hero section & top menu\r\n2. The design of the rest of the page, except for the “Contact Us” section\r\n3. “Contact Us” section\r\n4. Review and decide the final Typefaces we go with\r\n5. Final retouching, enhancement, and presentation\r\n6. Mobile design\r\n\r\n\r\nTimeframe:\r\nOnce the project is started, it must finish within two weeks.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1637733848844472321','-',7,'United States','London',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 08:34:17',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
