(14438,'Create a Logo and Website Wireframe',4,'We are a growing company looking for a talented graphic designer and UX/UI expert to create a unique and eye-catching logo, as well as a user-friendly website wireframe. Our company focuses on providing high-quality products and services, and we want our visual identity to reflect that. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in both logo design and website wireframing, and will be able to effectively communicate our brand values through their work.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDesign a creative and memorable logo that represents our brand identity and values\r\nDevelop a responsive website wireframe that ensures a seamless user experience across various devices and screen sizes\r\nCollaborate with our team to ensure that the website wireframe aligns with our business goals and objectives\r\nProvide design files in the appropriate formats (e.g., SVG, PNG, PDF, etc.)\r\nRevise designs based on feedback from our team\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nAt least 3 years of experience in graphic design, with a focus on logo design and website wireframing\r\nProficiency in design tools such as Adobe Creative Suite (Illustrator, Photoshop, XD) or similar software\r\nStrong understanding of UX/UI principles and best practices\r\nExcellent communication skills and the ability to work well in a collaborative environment\r\nA portfolio showcasing your previous logo design and website wireframe projects\r\nAttention to detail and a commitment to delivering high-quality work','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1637762228884508673','-',7,'United States','Rijeka',1200.000,'fixed',1200.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 10:27:41',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(14439,'Build a WordPress site for video and blog uploads',3,'Are you a sports lover with web building capabilities… then we have the opportunity for you. We are currently a podcast platform that is looking to expand our scope over 2023. Moving forward, we plan on providing resources for coaches and athletes. From Soccer through to tennis, we plan to be able to cater to sport lovers every need. So, what do we need, we would like an interactive and aesthetically pleasing website that is able to host a variety of material of which can be filtered down at the user’s desire. Below is an outline of the headings.\r\n\r\nHeadings – Available for selection at the top of the page\r\nHome practice\r\nAnalysis\r\nPodcasts\r\nResources\r\nShop\r\nMeet the contributors\r\nContact us\r\n\r\nFor the following sections I need a filter system (similar to that on a clothing site) for individuals to be able to narrow their search\r\n\r\nHome Practice – Short videos 2-3 minutes max\r\nSoccer/Tennis/Rugby/Basketball/Netball\r\nAnalysis – Blog/thread type articles\r\nSoccer/Tennis/Rugby/Basketball\r\nResources – pdf/powerpoints etc\r\nAcademic research/Coach Resource/Player Development plans\r\n\r\nBelow I have also provided some examples of websites I like which you may be able to use for inspiration:\r\n\r\n(link removed)/\r\n(link removed)/\r\n(link removed)/\r\n\r\nThe format needs to be via Wordpress so that I can export the template/plugins etc directly into my domain and make it functional. Colour schemes need to match that of the podcast which can be via Instagram and twitter at The Sports Initiative. These are generically black/grey/white and turquoise The website nail in the top left should be the same logo as the banner on our twitter page.\r\n\r\nThank you for reading my proposal and I look forward to hearing from you,','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1637766227206905857','-',7,'United States','Bratton',25.000,'Open this select menu',25.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 10:42:24',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(14440,'Look for a PowerPoint Expert for ppt creating and editing',11,'VV Translation is a translation agency based in Shanghai, China. For past 10 years, we have been working closely with global brands to expand in China and around the world.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a PowerPoint designer to create ppt. The major usage of the ppt is to do pitch for PR or digital campaigns..\r\n\r\n\r\nQualifications\r\n• A PowerPoint designer capable of creating ppt in English\r\n• Good at working with PR, advertising or digital agencies to do ppt for pitches.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you are interested, please kindly apply and submit your quote and former works.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01fcef66c3c27be242','-',7,'United States','Shanghai',48.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 10:51:16',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
(14441,'Single Page Responsive Landing Page Website',3,'We are looking for a talented individual who can start working today.\r\n\r\nIMPORTANT:\r\nWe are looking for someone who can take our ideas, samples, competitor websites and build something for us without too much guidance. If you haven\'t done that before, then this is not the project for you.\r\n\r\n\r\nPrerequisites:\r\n\r\nYou must have experience building landing pages for B2B websites. This is a must, please provide samples.\r\nYou must know how to build a responsive website in Wordpress.\r\nYou must be available to start working on this today and deliver in next 2-3 days.\r\n\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\nWe will provide you few websites as a reference point.\r\nYou have to build the website around those landing pages.\r\nYou can discuss the content on Skype. However, most of the content can be copied.\r\nA fully functional website that we approve.\r\n\r\nPlease provide a placeholder bid to get started.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1637769101843210241','-',7,'United States','Long Beach',35.000,'Open this select menu',35.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 10:53:32',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(14442,'Recreate a WordPress website',3,'We are a consulting company. We have a website and we want to completely redesign it\r\n\r\nOur website is currently online, and I can provide you with the link via messages.\r\n\r\nWe want a complete redesign of the site. The closest example of what we currently want is the following site:\r\n\r\nhttps://pathwaytoaus.com/\r\n\r\nRequired pages:\r\n\r\nHomepage\r\n\r\nabout us\r\n\r\ncall us\r\n\r\nblog page\r\n\r\nlanding page\r\n\r\nServices page\r\n\r\n\r\nWe need some 5 to 7 articles to fill the articles page\r\n\r\nThe new website is most like a branded website, and the example I have provided is typical what we want to look like,\r\n\r\nPlease send me your portfolio, based on the offer and portfolio will contact freelancer here,\r\n\r\nPlease provide as much information as in the offer to get contacted,\r\n\r\nWe look for professional work only,\r\n\r\n\r\nAny questions needed I can answer , but please be specific ,','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1637770100301303809','-',7,'United States','Wesley Chapel',700.000,'Open this select menu',700.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 10:57:30',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
