(14444,'Build Custom WordPress websites from Figma design',3,'We are looking to collaborate with freelancers with whom we can turn Figma designs into professional WordPress websites.\r\n\r\nThe website structures, UX & UI will be provided by us. We create wireframes & high fidelity prototypes, user stories if needed, in order to have a smooth workflow.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for freelancers whom we can consult with alongside the projects and find the best solutions together.\r\n\r\nWhat do we need:\r\n- a good Frontend developer who can easily implement our design requests\r\n- advanced knowledge in optimisation, website speed, on-page SEO, mobile/tablet optimisations (AMP)\r\n- being familiar with popular plugins (forms, translations, web scraping, woocommerce, etc.)\r\n- advanced Crockoblock and Elementor Pro user\r\n- database, domain & hosting handling, moving websites from old to new servers without loosing data\r\n- ability to co-work with us alongside projects\r\n\r\nWhat do we offer:\r\n- complete website structure and project overview\r\n- wireframes & high-fidelity Figma prototypes\r\n- design & UI guide\r\n- WordPress setup (depending on project)\r\n- collaborative support\r\n\r\nThe main goal of our projects is to create user-friendly interfaces and keep them updated and functional for the upcoming years.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1637773005402083329','-',7,'United States','Brasov',3500.000,'Open this select menu',3500.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 11:08:58',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(14445,'Wordpress - Zoho CRM - Calendar - access Wordpress per User',3,'Hello,\r\nI\'m searching for someone who can build a calendar in WordPress, where each logged in user has there own appointments. Some general and some specific. The appointments should come from Zoho CRM of the list of meetings for that user. Also in Wordpress the contributer group should have on a separat page the possibility to add the general appointments for all Users and to add just to specific user there appointments.\r\nThe User it self where he can see his appointments, is a month view where appove the appointments are should of the current day + 2 days ahead or if he change the date then on that day the appointments + 2 days ahead.\r\nin the appointment is following information needed: Subject, type of appointment and notes','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1637774216709410817','-',7,'United States','Vienna',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 11:13:55',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(14446,'UI/UX Web designer',4,'We are looking for experienced UI/UX designers with strong communication skill.\r\n\r\nWe have a number of design projects and need an experienced designer.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- 5+ years of experience in UI/UX design, Web design.\r\n- Clear communication with fluent English (verbal and written), prefer native English speaker.\r\n- Work on EST time zone to communicate with team.\r\n- Available for 30 hours per week.\r\n\r\nWe will share more details through interview with the right candidates.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01146b43cb22e010f7','-',7,'United States','Sharjah',9.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 11:29:39',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
(14447,'Graphic design/logo for a kids foamball',2,'Hi!\r\nI need a logo design for a foamball. The ball is called \"Kobraball\", and the design has to include the name of the ball, and \"by\" + our companys logo.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe ball is produced in Taiwan, and it will be sold mostly to elementary schools in Norway. The size of the ball varies from 9 to 21 cm in diameter in various colors. It is therefore important that there are not too many tiny details in the design, so that it still can look sharp on the smallest sized ball. The font can be a bit playful and fun, and the name of the ball must stand out, so that its easily recognized. Kobra is the norwegian word for Cobra, as in the type of snake called cobra.\r\n\r\nIt will be printed in black, on different coloured foamballs.\r\n\r\nThe design must be delivered in .CDR and .ai format.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~014c76f602de2f0776','-',7,'United States','Maura',48.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 11:35:44',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
(14448,'Produce a quick (90 Sec max) 3D/2D animated video for an internal event.',8,'IDEA: To produce a quick (90 Sec max) well polished animated video for an internal 3-day event. The primary purpose is to fire up the crowd and communicate a few inspirational messages. It’s typically used at the start of each day and maybe as the teams re-enter the rooms. Key messages we want to communicate:\r\nRaising the bar\r\nDigital comes first in the minds of our customers - Processes are transforming\r\nWe are awesome and are up for the challenge if we work together\r\nREQUIREMENTS: In the attached folder, you will find the script, Adobe Illustrator files, and other graphics for your reference.\r\nThe music should be powerful, inspiring, and uplifting. The voice-over should match the energy.\r\nWe need specific words to flash across the screen to emphasize key messages. Would it be possible to transition from a typography-style animation to a nature-inspired animation? Would it be possible to merge the aforementioned keywords into the pictorial-style animation? Please let me know if this sounds confusing and needs more clarity.\r\nWe want the animation to have a 3D look and feel with strong movements and a sense of pace. Should be dynamic. For reference, the first 00:10 of this video - https://youtu.be/P7Cz2IPe5J8\r\nPlease only use the primary and secondary colors as mentioned in the Brand guidelines.\r\nTIMELINE EXPECTATIONS: Ideally we would like the animation, from concept to completion, including revisions, to be completed within 3 weeks. Around 7th April would be perfect. If the timeline doesn\'t seems tight, please let us know so we can work out a schedule.\r\nDELIVERY REQUIREMENTS:\r\n1 Version with Voiceover & Music\r\n1 version without Voiceover\r\nBoth Web ready & HQ versions','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~013bedde4899bc4552','-',7,'United States','Rochester',1200.000,'fixed',1200.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 11:48:51',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
