(14473,'Graphic Designer needed for series of (8) tri-fold brochures',13,'I need eight tri-fold brochures created based off of one completed brochure.\r\n\r\nThe brochures are 11\" x 8.5\" folding down to 3.67\" x 8.5\" and are for a higher education client. Each one promotes a different program for the college.\r\n\r\nCopy will be provided and all brochures will follow the same basic layout.\r\n\r\nSome brochures will have less content than others as some programs have fewer offerings, and the graphic designer will need to adjust the type, spacing, and layout accordingly to maintain the overall appearance of each brochure.\r\n\r\nThe brochures feature multiple photos of students working within that programs field. We will provide access to student/college images that may be used. The photo sizes and placement may vary to work best with each layout.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~014c1bd93bbcd2eb43','-',7,'United States','Norwalk',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 14:37:53',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
