(14477,'Health care',22,'A healthcare job typically involves providing medical care or support services to individuals or groups of people. Healthcare professionals can work in a variety of settings such as hospitals, clinics, nursing homes, hospice care, private practice, or home healthcare.\r\n\r\nSome common healthcare job roles include:\r\n\r\nRegistered Nurse (RN): RNs provide patient care, administer medications, and work closely with physicians and other healthcare professionals to coordinate patient care.\r\n\r\nPhysician: Physicians diagnose and treat illnesses and injuries, prescribe medications, and provide preventive care to patients.\r\n\r\nMedical Assistant: Medical assistants work in various healthcare settings, performing administrative and clinical tasks such as taking medical histories, recording vital signs, and preparing patients for examinations.\r\n\r\nPhysical Therapist: Physical therapists help patients recover from injuries and illnesses by developing treatment plans and using exercises and other techniques to improve mobility and reduce pain.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1637828419608420353','-',7,'United States','-',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 14:49:00',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(14478,'Healthcare Developer for WordPress',15,'I\'m building a WordPress website and we\'re needing to pull in healthcare quotes for Term Life Insurance. I plan to create a Jotform with 3 simple questions and based on those questions provide an average quote for Term Life Insurance.\r\n\r\nI need to know how much it would be for development as well as what the monthly cost would be for the API to pull in these rates every time a call is made.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01a0ee009e572cf69a','-',7,'United States','Port Saint Lucie',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 14:53:42',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
(14479,'Fix Google PageSpeed Insights Issues',5,'Seeking an experienced WordPress developer proficient in Elementor to optimize our website\'s PageSpeed Insights score, focusing on mobile speed, and enhance SEO performance.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nAnalyze and improve PageSpeed Insights score, prioritizing mobile optimization\r\nAddress Accessibility and SEO scores\r\nImplement performance-enhancing changes to the Elementor-built WordPress site\r\nDiagnose and resolve technical SEO issues\r\n\r\nFind the page speed insights here: https://pagespeed.web.dev/analysis/https-tritonsensors-com/rz465cwrzu?form_factor=mobile\r\n\r\nDo not apply until you have had a chance to review.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~012de7932f51de3dab/apply/','-',7,'United States','Harrisburg',85.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 14:55:50',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
(14480,'Design a box for Flat Iron (Hair Straightener)',2,'Job Title: Flat Iron Box Designer\r\n\r\nCompany\r\n\r\nQiQi, a hair care brand that specializes in creating salon-grade products for professional and home users. Treatments, shampoos, conditioners, etc.\r\n\r\nJob Description\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a designer to create a box design for our new flat iron device that is in line with our brand guidelines. Our flagship product is an innovative in-salon lotion treatment that requires a professional flat iron when used. Therefore, we are creating our own high-quality flat iron for hairstylists to use in their salons to ensure the best results for our treatment.\r\n**We are NOT an electrical hair devices company, this specific product is an additional device mostly for brand awareness.\r\n\r\nTask\r\n\r\nYour task will be designing a box that is visually appealing and in line with our avant-garde brand personality. You will work with our exclusive colors, fonts, and imagery to create a unique and high-performance product that stands out in the market. We believe it’s a challenging and exciting opportunity to be part of our rebranding process and help us fulfill our vision.\r\n\r\nDesign Requirements\r\n\r\nMaster copy attached.\r\nBox color:\r\nGUNMETAL PMS TBD CMYK TBD RGB 70 / 75 / 79 HEX #464B4F\r\nText color:\r\nWHITE (#FFFFFF)\r\n\r\nWe would like to request a box design that highlights our brand name and leaves the subtitles hidden at the bottom. The box should be a dark gray with a textured finish, and the font should be white with a textured finish. Inside the box, we would like to include a photo as the first thing that customers see when they open it.\r\nAdditional requirements:\r\nSince we like minimalism, we really don’t want to overload the box with too much text, the goal is making a minimalistic & professional design visibly containing only mandatory information (Product name and other important features). However unnecessary text should be at the bottom of the box, just for regulatory purposes.\r\n\r\nNOTES\r\n\r\nWe are looking for top-rated designers who can establish a long-term relationship with us and work on numerous projects we have in the pipeline. Once selected, we will share our brand guidelines with you, and all information and materials provided will remain the sole intellectual property of QiQi.\r\n\r\nBrand Guideline (all brand\'s personality information) wil be shared with the hired designer.\r\n\r\nThank you, we look forward to your proposal.\r\n\r\nAaron Lisani\r\nQiQi','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1637829810779365377?success','-',7,'United States','Benei',45.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 14:57:38',NULL,5,3,NULL,132),
