(14483,'We are seeking an experienced WordPress website designer/developer for a one-time project.',15,'The project will involve designing and developing a custom WordPress website for our business. Your responsibilities will include:\r\n\r\nCreating a custom WordPress theme based on our design requirements\r\nImplementing and customizing WordPress plugins to meet the website\'s functionality needs\r\nEnsuring website optimization for fast loading speeds and mobile responsiveness\r\nTroubleshooting any technical issues that arise during the development process\r\nCollaborating with our team to ensure the project is completed on time and within budget\r\nThe ideal candidate will have:\r\n\r\nAt least 3 years of experience designing and developing custom WordPress websites\r\nStrong knowledge of WordPress themes and plugins\r\nProficiency in HTML, CSS, PHP, and JavaScript\r\nExperience with website optimization and SEO best practices\r\nExcellent communication skills and ability to work collaboratively with others\r\nIf you are a skilled WordPress website designer/developer who is available for a one-time project, we would love to hear from you! Please provide examples of your previous work and your availability to start the project.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~014b076934de5cf012','-',7,'United States','Kings county',400.000,'fixed',400.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 15:05:37',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
