(14495,'Front end developer needed for website build',3,'I’m currently working with a client that needs a straight-forward, 8-10 page website built for their insurance company. I build websites primarily using wordpress but they want very plain html/css/js files to implement into to their own system.\r\n\r\nSince wordpress adds a ton of extra/unnecessary css/html, I need someone to take the website I built in wordpress, and rewrite the code from scratch so that the code is easier to read.\r\n\r\nI’m going to do all the graphic design (via wordpress/elementor), and you’ll need to replicate my design from scratch via html/css/javascript. It’ll be a simple, informative website with very little functionality. About 8-10 pages but probably less.\r\n\r\nThe website is not built yet, but it’ll be comparable to something such as:\r\n\r\nhttps://krjmanagemedev.wpengine.com/','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01a290c69bf9197d18','-',7,'United States','Tallahassee',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 15:35:20',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
