(14512,'Seeking Experienced Web Designer for Micro Agricultural Technology R&D Wix Website',4,'We are a growing Micro Agricultural Technology Research and Development company looking for an experienced and creative web designer to help us create a visually appealing, user-friendly, and informative Wix website. Our goal is to showcase our innovative solutions, share our research findings, and build a strong online presence that engages our target audience and potential partners.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\nDesign and develop a visually appealing, easy-to-navigate, and responsive Wix website that effectively communicates our company\'s mission, research projects, and solutions\r\nCollaborate with our team to gather requirements, content, and visuals for the website\r\nCreate custom graphics and visuals to enhance the overall aesthetic and user experience\r\nOptimize the website for SEO and ensure compatibility across various devices and browsers\r\nIntegrate social media, blog, and newsletter subscription features to encourage audience engagement\r\nSet up and manage the website\'s back-end, including domain registration, hosting, and maintenance\r\nProvide post-launch support for updates, bug fixes, and improvements\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\nProven experience in designing and developing Wix websites (please provide a portfolio of previous work)\r\nStrong understanding of web design principles, UX/UI design, and responsive design\r\nProficiency in graphic design software, such as Adobe Creative Suite\r\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills\r\nAbility to work independently and meet deadlines\r\nFamiliarity with micro agricultural technology or a background in agriculture is a plus\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit the following:\r\nYour updated resume, including relevant experience and skillset\r\nA portfolio showcasing your Wix website designs\r\nA brief description of your approach to designing a website for a Micro Agricultural Technology Research and Development company\r\n\r\nWe look forward to reviewing your application and discussing the project further with qualified candidates.\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1637846321527013377','-',7,'United States','Leander',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 16:01:28',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
