(14610,'Turn a Word doc into a well-designed Pitch Deck',11,'We\'re looking for an experienced pitch deck designer to turn a word doc into a beautiful pitch deck.\r\n\r\nNOTE: we do not know the correct pricing for this project so I have put a placeholder, please propose a price\r\n\r\nYou should:\r\n- Have extensive experience in similar projects\r\n- Have strong examples of pitch decks you’ve designed\r\n- Be able to extrapolate a strong visual identity from a company’s branding files (logo, font, etc.)\r\n- Have experience creating charts, graphs, and visuals within business presentations\r\n- Be proactive and opinionated in suggesting good designs\r\n- Have availability to complete this project in ~1 week\r\n- Be comfortable leading a project with minimal direction\r\n- Be an excellent, clear communicator with good command of English that can effectively work within timelines\r\n\r\nYou will be provided:\r\n- A word doc with 10-15 slides of text. All copy will be written for you.\r\n- A document outlining what supplementary items (charts, graphs, etc.) need to be created and where\r\n- The company’s logo, fonts, and general color direction\r\n- A previous pitch deck that you can use for inspiration\r\n\r\nThe final deliverable should be a Figma file that can be exported to PDF.\r\n\r\nTo apply:\r\n- Please send the best 1-2 pitch decks that you have designed\r\n- Send a short cover letter explaining your approach to this project and how long you think it will take to complete\r\n\r\nWe have many more of these projects so we are looking for someone talented to take on longer term work, if possible.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~018e7df9d37ac43e10','-',7,'United States','San Francisco',500.000,'perhour',500.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 20:52:25',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
