(14615,'Flyer for bike event in Pittsburgh',2,'Bike Pittsburgh, a bicycle and pedestrian advocacy nonprofit in Pittsburgh PA, is seeking a designer for an event flyer. Please design a flyer according to the specifications below and reformat it to share across multiple social media platforms.\r\n\r\nEVENT DETAILS:\r\nBike to Work Day\r\nFriday, May 19, 2023\r\n\"Enjoy Pittsburgh by bike, morning or night\"\r\n- We’ll be setting up Commuter Cafes in 4 neighborhoods for Pittsburghers to enjoy! Everyone on a bike is invited to stop by for freebies and fun.\r\n Stop by for free breakfast in the morning.\r\n Swing by for a free beer at happy hour in the evening.\r\n\r\nFLYER:\r\n- Concept: Top is the sunrise over Pittsburgh with the event details about the morning Commuter Cafes. The bottom is Pittsburgh in the evening for happy hour with the information about the evening Commuter Cafes. These two scenes should meld together in an artful way, playing off of the \"morning/night\" theme.\r\n- Include images of bicycles and the Pittsburgh cityscape / bike lanes or bike infrastructure\r\n- Flyer can be a combination of elements artfully combined together-- photography, graphic design, illustration, etc.--\r\n- We have photos available to upon request, such as bike infrastructure photos and Pittsburgh skyline photos.\r\n- Flyer should include the BikePGH logo\r\n- Please provide .png and editable .ai file\r\n- design as scalable image - standard poster size: 18in x 24in\r\n\r\nSOCIAL MEDIA:\r\n- resize (1080 x 1080px) to share on Instagram\r\n- resize to share on Facebook and Twitter (1200 x 630px)\r\n- resize as header images: (1200 x 400 px), (1500 x 500px)\r\n- provide .png image and editable .ai file.\r\n\r\n---\r\nBudget = $550 total\r\nDeadline = by April 17th\r\n---\r\n\r\nPlease reach out with any questions, we look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01212be1c1328b77d0/apply/','-',7,'United States','Pittsburgh',550.000,'fixed',550.000,'2023-03-20',1,'2023-03-20',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-20 21:13:44',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
