(14634,'WordPress and Elementor Expert Needed',3,'I am looking to hire a WordPress + Elementor expert to help me with a simple 5 page website project.\r\n\r\nThe candidate should have:\r\n- 5+ years of experience working with WordPress\r\n- 2+ years of experience working with Elementor page builder\r\n- Expert with PHP, JS and CSS\r\n- Experience with CPTs and writing custom plugins\r\n- Ability to optimize the website performance to achieve 90+ scores in PSI with minimal caching\r\n- Attention to detail and and eye for good design\r\n- Experience with WooCommerce and WPML is a plus (though not needed for this particular project)\r\n- Minimal use of plugins and custom code\r\n\r\nIf you are interested, please reach out with:\r\n\r\n1. Links to your best 3 websites built using Elementor\r\n2. An estimated cost of building a basic 5 page business website where the designs will be provided through figma\r\n3. Estimated turnaround time\r\n4. Confirmation that you fulfill the requirements mentioned.\r\n\r\nNote: If the above is not shared, your proposal will be disqualified automatically.\r\n\r\nThank you','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638107783969415169','-',7,'United States','Doha',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-03-21',1,'2023-03-21',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-21 09:19:41',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(14635,'Require Branding & Custom Website for Pest Control Business',2,'We are a pest control solutions company based out in Sydney, Australia. We are looking to create an identity of our company both in the print and digital space and would like a branding development and website to be built.\r\n\r\nOur initial goal is to build a strong branding structure and then move forward with the website. We would like to use our competitors sites as a benchmark for ours while also adding our own identity and ideas.\r\n\r\nThe goal of our project is to create an image of our company to our customers that will best represent who we are, while also providing a strong foundation for generating organic & ppc leads.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638118430516813825','-',7,'United States','na',4000.000,'fixed',4000.000,'2023-03-21',1,'2023-03-21',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-21 10:02:28',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(14636,'Create new PPT and Google Slide templates for a B2B SaaS startup',11,'We are looking for a talented and experienced designer to create new PowerPoint and Google Slide templates for our B2B SaaS sustainability education and engagement platform.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should have a strong design portfolio and experience in creating engaging and professional presentation templates.\r\n\r\nAs part of this project, you will be provided with our brand guidelines and asset library to ensure consistency with our new branding. You will also have access to our current packs that contain the content required for the new brand templates, including sales packs, partner packs, and pitch decks (detailed plus simpler presentation versions).\r\n\r\nYou will be responsible for creating new templates that are visually appealing, on-brand, and suitable for use in a variety of contexts.\r\n\r\nKey deliverables:\r\n\r\n4 x new templates (1 sales pack detailed, one sales pack presentation version, pitch deck detailed, pitch deck presentation version) in both PowerPoint and Google Slides. These templates should be easy to use, customizable, and versatile.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n-Strong portfolio of design work, including PowerPoint and Google Slide templates\r\n- Proficiency in PowerPoint and Google Slides\r\n- Excellent communication skills and ability to collaborate with our team to ensure that the templates meet our needs\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this project, please provide samples of your previous work, a brief overview of your design process, and an estimated timeline and budget. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ffa812cd406dfa28','-',7,'United States','Dublin',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-21',1,'2023-03-21',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-21 10:38:46',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
