(14647,'Logo Animation',8,'We welcome proposals and budgets to animate the attached logo for Big Hitch Products.\r\n\r\nThe attached PDF explains in detail what we need - but here\'s a breakdown:\r\n\r\n\"BIG HITCH PRODUCTS\" will be cut from a large sheet of metal with a GREEN laser (very important that it\'s green). The metal background falls away, and the words remain.\r\n\r\nThe BHP in the logo starts as a rectangle and is then \"bent\" into the corresponding shape.\r\n\r\nFinally, the parts merge, and colors appear as the logo slowly pushes forward.\r\n\r\nWE WELCOME YOUR IDEAS-SUGGESTIONS!\r\n\r\nQUESTIONS? - Let us know if you have questions regarding what objects look like - we can submit examples of the green laser or bending.\r\n\r\nDelivery is a .mp4 or .mov file with transparency.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638167076965965825?success','-',7,'United States','Carbondale',3000.000,'fixed',3000.000,'2023-03-21',1,'2023-03-21',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-21 13:15:37',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
