(14680,'Data verification/entry project for healthcare IT company',22,'Repisodic is a digital health company that works with hospital case managers to help them identify the best post-hospital care options for each patient based on the patient\'s unique insurance and medical needs.\r\n\r\nFor this project, you will build out Repisodic\'s insurance verification database to ensure that patients are being presented accurate options. To complete this insurance verification, you will compare providers marked as \"in network\" on insurance sites to those listed on Repisodic\'s internal database. You will edit Repisodic\'s internal database until the \"in network\" providers match those listed on the insurance site.\r\n\r\nAccuracy and attention to detail is absolutely critical. Timing is flexible - this work does not need to be completed during business hours; however, we expect a minimum of 4-5 hours of work per day. This project is relatively short-term (3-4 weeks), but there is the opportunity for ongoing work.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638202843345403905','-',7,'United States','Philadelphia',15.000,'perhour',15.000,'2023-03-21',1,'2023-03-21',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-21 15:36:50',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
