(14691,'Brand RFP',2,'Build Plannet’s brand identity to be appealing to high earning millennials ($150K+ annual income). While we want to appeal to a broader market, we believe the brand should visually speak to the audience we will most likely attract: those with discretionary income who take 2-3 trips a year. Our goal is to make more trips happen and make planning a trip as easy as sending a text.\r\n\r\n\r\nCreate something that feels differentiated – that’s original, memorable, and aligned to Plannet’s values (Simplicity/Transparency/Connection). We don’t want to look like anyone else in this space (expedia/booking.com/hopper/skyscanner/Viator/Get your guide)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638214370025861121?success','-',7,'United States','North Brunswick Township',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-03-21',1,'2023-03-21',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-21 16:24:44',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
