(14695,'Medical Biller, Part Time Position',21,'We have a psychotherapy/counseling practice with three clinicians. We are looking to hire a person proficient in medical billing to catch up on outstanding unpaid or denied insurance claims through our electronic health record, SimplePractice.\r\n\r\nOur project is to catch up on any outstanding balances by:\r\n--Preparing and submitting billing data and medical claims to insurance companies, including filing CMS1500 forms for Single Case Agreements\r\n--Preparing bills and invoices and documents within the Client Portal in SimplePractice EHR\r\n\r\nThis project can turn into a permanent part time position if work is satisfactory.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n-Maintaining accounts receivable ledger and ensuring timely payment from insurance companies\r\n-Following up on unpaid claims to ensure payments are made and correcting and resubmitting denied claims to ensure payments have been made\r\n-Secure outstanding balance payments in SimplePractice\r\n\r\nRequirements and Skills:\r\n-Proven work experience as a Medical Biller or similar role\r\n-Solid understanding of billing software and electronic medical records\r\n-Must have the ability to multitask and manage time effectively\r\n-Excellent written and verbal communication skills\r\n-Outstanding problem-solving and organizational abilities','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638172744733032449','-',7,'United States','US',28.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-03-21',1,'2023-03-21',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-21 16:39:05',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
(14696,'Medical Billing - Denial management *Full time only*',21,'Looking for someone to help out with reviewing and Submitting claims, Post EOBs, correct/appeal denials, track unpaid claims.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYou will need to have good communication skills to communicate with insurance reps, team members, etc,\r\n\r\nWe have multiple different types of claims with a lot of variance, we use multiple different CPT codes, Modifiers, ICD codes, as services are provided by multiple different specialists.\r\n\r\nMinimum of 3 years experience required, please write in your message or resume clearly how many years of medical billing experience you have.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638171300479098881','-',7,'United States','brooklyn',5.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-03-21',1,'2023-03-21',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-21 16:47:52',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
