(14703,'Outdoor Living Illustration',2,'I\'m looking for someone to produce an infographic to be used as a full spread in our national magazine about sustainable living.\r\n\r\nNote that if this project goes well, we may be able to assign several projects to you over the coming year. We do not have a resident illustrator.\r\n\r\nThe image can be created using a combination of real photos and illustrations. The topic will be \"The Extreme Green Back Yard Experience.\" It will feature about 10 pullout photos (as details), and an illustration of a home\'s backyard with a seating area, electric barbecue, LED lights and other features tba. The style should be something like the cutaway image attached. Pay is $1200 flat fee.\r\n\r\nWe will provide the text, captions and small images and guidance, including photos for inspiration. Turnaround time is about 2 weeks.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0102da09a4f7aeae56','-',7,'United States','Eastsound',1200.000,'fixed',1200.000,'2023-03-21',1,'2023-03-21',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-21 17:05:29',NULL,6,3,NULL,125),
