(14717,'Appointment Setter/Call Center for Healthcare',22,'Job Overview: THIS JOB IS FOR THE MEDICAL/HEALTHCARE INDUSTRY\r\n\r\nYou will be calling prospects to book appointments for our medical clinics and providers.\r\n\r\nAs a virtual assistant appointment setter, you will be responsible for scheduling appointments for patients with our healthcare providers. You will be our medical call center team to ensure that patients receive timely and appropriate care. Your role will involve managing patient interactions, setting appointments, providing information to patients about our services and or clinic, and maintaining accurate records of all interactions.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Do instant outbound calling with patients\r\n- Schedule appointments for patients with our healthcare providers\r\n- Verify patient information and update patient records as needed\r\n- Follow up with patients to confirm appointments and provide reminders\r\n- Manage patient interactions in a professional and compassionate manner\r\n- Escalate complex issues or patient complaints to the appropriate team member\r\n- Collaborate with medical call center team members to ensure a high level of patient care\r\n- Maintain accurate and up-to-date records of all patient interactions\r\n- Adhere to all relevant healthcare regulations and privacy laws','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~010b4e2ad505c075c7/apply/','-',7,'United States','Medina,US',9.000,'Open this select menu',18.000,'2023-03-21',1,'2023-03-21',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-21 18:34:44',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
