(14719,'Need a New Shopify Theme Home Page (Image Designer + Programmer Needed)',4,'I can provide all copy... just looking for someone to edit my current shopify theme so it can look and FUNCTION like this example below:\r\n\r\nhttps://alltrendsusa.com/\r\n\r\nGraphic header + Headline + copy below linking to other products and also a tab with different pages.\r\n\r\nTimeline: 7 days or less.\r\n\r\nPlease only apply if you\'re able to do some designer work to make this all come together. I\'ll give you links to example of pictures to include but I\'ll need you to make them look good + high resolution + make sure they fit well on the page.\r\n\r\nFor context here\'s my current shopify theme to be edited:\r\n\r\nhttps://themes.shopify.com/themes/startup/styles/tech?catalog-size%5B%5D=1-to-9-products&price%5B%5D=paid&surface_inter_position=1&surface_intra_position=4&surface_type=all\r\n\r\nIf I like what you did on the homepage, I\'ll need other pages to be created and I will happily pay you for it.\r\n\r\nAll the best.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638249706701516801','-',7,'United States','Delray Beach',400.000,'fixed',400.000,'2023-03-21',1,'2023-03-21',1,'Fixed Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-21 18:43:41',NULL,9,3,NULL,140),
(14720,'Front end Developer(Wix)',4,'Seeking a skilled front-end developer proficient in Wix platform. The website is:\r\nhttps://editor.wix.com/html/editor/web/renderer/edit/aa565b40-ecc3-43fb-b028-4c8d11f115ff?metaSiteId=ce1ccac7-ec3f-454c-bab0-162545d0d9f6\r\n\r\nCollaborate with our team to make revisions to the website\'s layout and design for missing pieces which will include:\r\nOptimize the website\'s navigation for a better user experience\r\nMinor changes to heading/footer w/ minimal design changes to areas detailed in word doc outline\r\nEnsure website compatibility across different devices and browsers for clarity and use\r\nImplement best practices for website performance and loading speed\r\nRequires completion in 2-3 days\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nStrong proficiency in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript\r\nKnowledge and experience working with the Wix platform\r\nExperience in implementing responsive design and cross-browser compatibility\r\nFamiliarity with UX and UI principles\r\nAttention to detail and good visual eye and design sense\r\nInterested in reviewing details before starting project.\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638252707331764225','-',7,'United States','Haverford',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-21',1,'2023-03-21',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-21 18:56:31',NULL,9,3,NULL,140),
