(14722,'Reskin website\'s home page',4,'We need a facelift, a homepage reskin. Everything is in place, just looks like a website 1.0 right now, Looking for more style and flair and anything else that makes the navigation easier to use and to read. So, an evaluation on tweaks you would recommend as well as a facelift. The site is built with Elementor builder and currently has responsive design.\r\n\r\nWe want people to watch the film, make a donation or buy the book, summit, or all three. The backend is fully functional, just need a redesign of the home page.\r\n\r\nhttps://revelationscafefilm.com\r\n\r\nIt’s on wordpress, here is access info if you want to peek around.\r\n\r\nWe also have external google drive folders of all the film’s key art elements should you want them.\r\n\r\nBiggest note is to have the page immediately pop wide with the top sizzle video as big as possible with no sound, but with an easy to see sound icon to add the sound. And a bouncing ball below to show people to scroll down for more.\r\n\r\nCan you assist?\r\n\r\nNeed only experiences designers to apply and want a fast turn around, so would want a mock up as a first step.\r\n\r\nNeed to know what you would charge for this job?','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638259263820288001','-',7,'United States','Seminole',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-21',1,'2023-03-21',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-21 19:21:19',NULL,9,3,NULL,140),
