(14780,'Wordpress Expert',3,'We are seeking a highly skilled WordPress Expert to join our team and work on our blog. The ideal candidate will have a deep understanding of WordPress, and be able to work efficiently to edit existing pages, create and edit tables, add and change Amazon affiliate links, write code when needed, and completely redesign WordPress pages from scratch if necessary.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n•Edit existing pages to improve their design, layout, and functionality\r\n•Create and edit tables to present data in a clear and easy-to-understand manner\r\n•Add and change Amazon affiliate links to increase website revenue\r\n•Write custom code when needed to add new features or improve website performance\r\n•Redesign WordPress pages from scratch if necessary to improve user experience\r\n•Transfer pages to posts category to organize website content effectively\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n•Proficiency in WordPress CMS\r\n•Strong knowledge of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript\r\n•Experience with Amazon affiliate program and link management\r\n•Ability to design and implement effective page layouts and designs\r\n•Familiarity with SEO best practices\r\n•Excellent communication skills\r\n•Attention to detail and ability to work efficiently and meet deadlines\r\n\r\nIf you have a passion for WordPress and a proven track record of delivering high-quality work, we would love to work with you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638483136491544577','-',7,'United States','Hope',50.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-03-22',1,'2023-03-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-22 10:12:21',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(14781,'WordPress Website',3,'Sure, here\'s the job description in proper English:\r\n\r\nWe are looking for an experienced WordPress developer to create a website that will follow a pre-purchased template and use Elementor. We will provide you with graphic mockups created in Canva to demonstrate our desired layout for each page.\r\n\r\nHere are the key requirements for the project:\r\n\r\nMultilingual support for Italian, English, and German\r\nIntegration with Google Analytics\r\nApproximately 5 pages\r\nWe will provide the copy to be inserted on each page\r\nHTTPS must be enabled\r\nWe\'re looking for a developer who is detail-oriented, communicative, and experienced with WordPress, Elementor, and website security best practices.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested in working with us, please provide your portfolio and a quote for this project. We look forward to hearing from you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638491180282617857','-',7,'United States','Imola',30.000,'Open this select menu',30.000,'2023-03-22',1,'2023-03-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-22 10:42:46',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(14782,'Redesign landing page',3,'Hi\r\nI am looking for someone who can optimise a landing page so that it improves the conversion. I am running facebook ads to the landing page, with the aim of getting leads so prospects can book an appointment or call us to make an appointment.\r\nI need someone who can make sure that the landing page is optimized for conversions.\r\n\r\nI am looking for someone who is knowledgeable in this area, and can help us increase our conversion rate significantly.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638498504922918913','-',7,'United States','Tunbridge Wells',30.000,'Open this select menu',30.000,'2023-03-22',1,'2023-03-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-22 11:13:00',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(14783,'Professional Industrial WordPress Website',3,'We are a manufacturer of cable for very large projects in Australia, and our customers are large corporations and multinationals. We require a website with around 20 pages to replace our ecommerce site. The website must be professional in appearance, and must be mobile responsive. WordPress is the preferred platform, others will be considered.\r\nWe will supply text, photos, videos, drawings, logos, etc.\r\nInterested Upworkers are asked to provide recent examples of their work.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638502551973294081','-',7,'United States','Unanderra',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-03-22',1,'2023-03-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-22 11:29:41',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(14784,'Figma UI/UX Designer',3,'We are looking for a Figma expert to redesign our subscription portal that is based on Recharge Payments. It is a web based app which will need to have both a desktop (1440px) and mobile design view.\r\n\r\nWe would prefer to use existing a UI toolkit look Untitled to speed up the design process.\r\n\r\nWe are looking at making mostly aesthetic changes as the functionality will not be updated. We will be adding a single module to the design which is the loyalty points system.\r\n\r\nThere is a total of two main templates with some additional interactions that need to be considered - e.g. a modal window and some message boxes.\r\n\r\nYou must have experience designing web apps in Figma and be able to use best practice techniques for setting up the Figma frames and modules.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638505049606868993','-',7,'United States','Double Bay',50.000,'Open this select menu',48.000,'2023-03-22',1,'2023-03-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-22 11:38:24',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(14785,'Creative Designer for Sports Themed App',6,'We are looking for a talented and experienced creative designer to help us create 10 unique design styles for our app that celebrates the epic achievements of athletes. As a designer on our team, you will work closely with our decision maker team to create high fidelity mockups that can be handed off to the development team for implementation.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Collaborate with our development team to create 10 unique design styles that reflect our brand and celebrate the achievements of athletes.\r\n- Design and prototype high fidelity mockups, graphics, and user interfaces for our app using industry-standard design tools such as Figma, Sketch, or Adobe XD.\r\n- Collaborate with our team to refine design concepts and incorporate feedback from users and stakeholders.\r\n- Stay up-to-date with the latest design trends and technologies, and integrate them into our app to create a cutting-edge user experience.\r\n- Participate in user research and testing to validate design concepts and ensure that our app is intuitive, user-friendly, and engaging.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience as a creative designer, with a portfolio of work that demonstrates your skills in designing high fidelity mockups.\r\n- Experience working on mobile apps or web applications, with a deep understanding of user experience design principles and best practices.\r\n- Strong knowledge of industry-standard design tools such as Figma, Sketch, or Adobe XD.\r\n- Excellent communication skills, with the ability to collaborate with cross-functional teams and present design concepts to stakeholders.\r\n- Ability to work independently and manage multiple projects simultaneously.\r\n- Passion for sports and fitness is a plus.\r\n\r\nIMPORTANT!\r\nMust include examples of work, creative process, and estimated effort.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638507306856087553','-',7,'United States','Calgary',25.000,'Open this select menu',25.000,'2023-03-22',1,'2023-03-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-22 11:47:24',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(14786,'Finish website',3,'I have started a Wordpress site for a new business venture, however I do not have the time to finish the design/etc. I need someone to review the site with me, load pictures/align everything, then let me know where they need copy. I will write the copy and send it over. I will also only make 3 rounds of change suggestions as it\'s more important to get things moving and done.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638510307771547649','-',7,'United States','westerville',58.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-03-22',1,'2023-03-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-22 11:59:50',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(14787,'City Pass Website App',6,'We’re reaching out to you because we’re looking for a skilled freelancer to work on a project for City Pass. City Pass provides travelers with discounted admission to popular attraction sites in key cities around the world. We want to create a website and app that allows users to purchase City Passes, view their itinerary, and redeem their passes at the various attractions.\r\n\r\nWe’re looking for someone with relevant experience in website and app development, specifically with a background in creating a booking platform. If you’ve worked on similar project before, we’d love to hear from you. We believe that your expertise and successful background will help us create a seamless user experience for our customers.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Prior experience in website and app development\r\n- Strong portfolio of previous work\r\n- Familiarity with the latest coding technologies\r\n- Ability to create a user friendly and intuitive interface\r\n- Ability to work well under deadlines\r\n\r\nIf you’re interested in working on this project, please respond back with your portfolio and a brief summary of your experience. We’d love to discuss the project with you further.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638514075351375873','-',7,'United States','ANTALYA',2500.000,'fixed',2500.000,'2023-03-22',1,'2023-03-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-22 12:13:50',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(14788,'WooCommerce developer needed',3,'Hello,\r\n\r\nMy name is Thomas and i run a eCommerce store (WooCommerce) selling bamboo products in Holland.\r\n\r\nI\'m building a new productpage design on my staging website but some elements are not working according my deisng. You find the productpage design as attachment (productpagedesign.png).\r\n\r\nCouple things i can\'t achieve and would like to be fixed by you:\r\n\r\n1. The Woodmart Theme which i\'m using has the option to add a read more button. Somehow this functionality doesn\'t work when i\'m setting it up as the tutorial on their website (https://xtemos.com/docs-topic/read-more-button-for-text-or-section-row/). Can you see what the problem is why it\'s not working? When it\'s working i would like to use this functionality on the productpage description (see attachment 4.png). Out of the box this functionality doesn\'t work for productpage descriptions, so that\'s something i would like to have you fix as well.\r\n\r\n2. I have a sticky CTA on the productpage that pops-up on desktop too early (see attachment 3.png). I want te sticky CTA bar to pop-up when the original CTA (add to cart) is out of the viewport on desktop. For Mobile this is working good.\r\n\r\n3. The same sticky CTA as above in point 2 is used for variable aswell als simple products. For variable products, the CTA text is \'Select options\', but when clicking on it, it doesn\'t do anything and throws an error in the log (see attachment 1.png). When clicking on it it should scroll back to the top where the user can select different options.\r\n\r\nCan you give me an estimate of the cost per item? And let me know when you could start on this job?\r\n\r\nThanks in advance.\r\n\r\nThomas','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638523995215880193','-',7,'United States','Nijmegen',40.000,'Open this select menu',40.000,'2023-03-22',1,'2023-03-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-22 12:53:37',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(14789,'Website Design and Development- Wordpress',3,'We are looking for an experienced and responsive website designer and development team to help with our overflow work. Must have five-plus years of experience and be able to \"wow\" with design work and creativity.\r\n\r\nMust understand UX/UI design and design sites that will convert in contact.\r\n\r\nMust be able to develop fast, responsive mobile ready WordPress sites with error-free work. Elementor is our preferred builder, but we are open.\r\n\r\nSend 5+ samples of your work. I would like to see professional sites like legal, medical, accounting, etc, as samples. no stores or retail samples. No samples no consideration.\r\n\r\nWe offer 60+ hours a week and long-term work.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638526384956534785','-',7,'United States','St Augustine',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-03-22',1,'2023-03-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-22 13:03:06',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
