(14796,'Shopify drop ship expert needed to build & optimize high converting online store. Website dev. Exp',4,'Job Title: Shopify Dropship Expert for High Converting Online Store\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a Shopify dropship expert who can help us build and optimize a high converting online store. The ideal candidate will have extensive experience in website development and will be able to create an online store that not only looks great, but is also highly functional.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDevelop and design a highly optimized and visually appealing Shopify store\r\nConduct in-depth product research to identify profitable and high demand products like humidifiers and iPhone cases\r\nCreate and implement a winning dropshipping strategy that maximizes profit margins\r\nOptimize product pages to increase conversions and sales\r\nImplement effective SEO strategies to improve search engine rankings and drive organic traffic\r\nDevelop and execute a social media marketing plan to increase brand awareness and drive traffic to the store\r\nMonitor and analyze key performance metrics to identify areas for improvement and implement necessary changes\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience in building and optimizing high-converting Shopify stores\r\nIn-depth knowledge of Shopify platform and its features\r\nProficient in website development languages such as HTML, CSS, and JavaScript\r\nExperience in conducting product research and identifying profitable and high demand products\r\nStrong understanding of dropshipping and ecommerce business models\r\nExperience in optimizing product pages for maximum conversions and sales\r\nKnowledge of SEO best practices and strategies\r\nFamiliarity with social media marketing and advertising platforms\r\nExcellent communication and project management skills\r\nAbility to work independently and efficiently\r\nIf you are a highly skilled and experienced Shopify dropship expert who is passionate about building high-converting online stores and driving sales, we want to hear from you. Please include examples of previous successful projects and your estimated time frame for completing this project in your application.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638320132697579520?success','-',7,'United States','United States',100.000,'Open this select menu',1000.000,'2023-03-22',1,'2023-03-22',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-22 13:48:05',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
