(14868,'Marketing Expert and WordPress Website Developer',3,'As a Marketing Expert and WordPress Website Developer, you will be responsible for developing and executing marketing strategies and creating WordPress websites that drive our brand\'s engagement, traffic, and revenue. You will be responsible for creating visually compelling websites, managing content, and optimizing website performance to improve search engine rankings and user experience. Your ultimate goal is to increase our online visibility, generate leads, and convert prospects into customers through effective marketing and website development.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n\r\nDevelop and execute marketing strategies that align with our brand\'s messaging and goals\r\nDevelop and maintain our WordPress website, including designing, developing, and deploying website pages, themes, and plugins\r\nOptimize website performance for search engine rankings and user experience, using best practices in SEO, usability, and user interface design\r\nManage website content, ensuring that all content is relevant, up-to-date, and consistent with our brand\'s messaging and standards\r\nCollaborate with cross-functional teams, including creative, product, and customer service, to ensure that website development and marketing initiatives are aligned with overall business goals\r\nMonitor and analyze website metrics, using data to make data-driven decisions and optimize the future website and marketing strategies\r\nStay up-to-date on website development and marketing trends, and best practices, continually looking for opportunities to improve our online presence\r\nManage relationships with external vendors and partners, including web developers and designers, to ensure that all work is completed on time and to a high standard\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nBachelor\'s degree in marketing, communications, or a related field\r\n5+ years of experience in marketing, with a focus on digital marketing and website development\r\nExpert-level proficiency in WordPress website development, including designing, developing, and deploying website pages, themes, and plugins\r\nStrong visual design skills and ability to create visually compelling websites\r\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively with cross-functional teams and stakeholders\r\nStrong analytical skills and ability to use data to make decisions\r\nStrong project management skills, with the ability to manage multiple projects and priorities in a fast-paced environment\r\nKnowledge of marketing automation platforms, such as HubSpot or Marketo, a plus\r\nKnowledge of SEO best practices and website optimization strategies\r\nAbility to stay up-to-date on website development and marketing trends and best practices and incorporate them into campaigns\r\nSuppose you are a results-oriented, creative, and detail-oriented individual with a passion for marketing and website development and a track record of success. In that case, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638581747535446017','-',7,'United States','Plano',75.000,'Open this select menu',53.000,'2023-03-22',1,'2023-03-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-22 16:43:45',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
