(14874,'Get 10-20% more on your contracts with Feather',2,'As someone who has been in the industry for a while, I\'m sure you understand the importance of having a reliable and effortless contracting experience. At Feather, we see existing marketplaces like Upwork and believe that they don’t do enough to streamline your workflow. We believe the right contracting service should integrate into your design process instead of adding extra paperwork and logistics.\r\n\r\nWhat does this mean? Feather offers a simple chat interface that lets you negotiate every detail of your contract. No generic fixed rates or broad terms. Specify exactly what you need from the client to do your job.\r\n\r\nWhen you finish negotiating the contract, use Feather’s custom Figma widget to bring all the details directly into your Figjam or Figma files. No more chasing down emails or deliverable assignments from your client, all the necessary information is right next to your designs. As you finish deadlines, share specific components through the widget for your client to review on our site. No need to share the whole file with your client and have them looking over your shoulder the entire time. Seamlessly share just what they need and stay focused on your designs.\r\n\r\nAs part of our launch, we are doing a special deal where your first 5 contracts have 0% service fee. That means 10-20% more money in your pocket compared to platforms like Upwork. If you join us, you’ll get a contract service entirely built to serve you and a hungry team ready to build any features you need. You can explore our product further at feathercontracts.com\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested, please let me know and we can schedule a time to chat more about what we can offer you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638352894535348224?success','-',7,'United States','us',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-03-22',1,'2023-03-22',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-22 1