(14896,'Experienced Writer – Psychedelics and Medicine',37,'We\'re looking for a native English writer experienced in the psychedelic industry for a contract job (1-6 months) with the potential for ongoing work.\r\n\r\nYou will write well-researched 1000-1500 word articles (resource guides, drug-policy updates, psychedelic culture) and more content related to the psychedelic industry.\r\n\r\nYou will work alongside a team of writers, medical professionals, and other industry experts.\r\n\r\n**The ideal candidates will have the following:**\r\n\r\n- English as your first language with an excellent written grammar\r\n- Ability to work autonomously\r\n- Excellent attention to detail, accuracy, and creative problem-solving skills\r\n- Must be able to conduct research for article resources in the health industry\r\n- Knowledge of the psychedelic industry is a must\r\n- Experience in SEO copywriting is an asset\r\n- Ability to dig deep into a topic to create truthful, actionable advice for the reader\r\n\r\n**What will the work involve?**\r\n\r\n- You will be writing 1000+ word articles 1000-1500 word articles (resource guides, drug-policy updates, psychedelic culture) and more content related to the psychedelic industry.\r\n- Creating catchy titles and headlines\r\n- Conduct research to ensure the accuracy and credibility of all materials\r\n- You\'ll be required to contribute at least 1 high-quality post a week\r\n- Deliver work in a timely manner, as this is a fast-paced company\r\n- Must be able to self-edit before submitting work (use Grammarly)\r\n- Looking to take constructive feedback to grow writing skills\r\n- Provide feedback and suggestions for improvements','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638565417774510081','-',7,'United States','-',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-03-22',1,'2023-03-22',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-22 18:35:13',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
