(14906,'Build a simple Wix-based website with integrated Mobile Number capture to Text Magic',17,'Me and two dear friends are campaigning for the Board of Education in our town. It\'s our passion to serve our children and our community.\r\n\r\nWe need your help making our campaign page. We already have the Wix template and sub-page menu mostly set up. We just don\'t have a lot of time. We need your help to save time and make sure this works well on mobile.\r\n\r\nThere are 2 somewhat unique functions:\r\n-We need to build a Lead list of Mobile numbers to send text message updates to. Our plan was to integrate to Text Magic. So you need to be able to make this integrated and easy for someone to sign up on our site, then automatically be placed in our Text Magic list. We are open to suggestions if you can think of a better Texting platform. We also need 1 landing page to collect mobile numbers from people who visit via our post card that we\'ll be mailing.\r\n- We will have some events so we need a basic calendar-type page to see upcoming events and be able to RSVP. (No charge - they\'re free events).\r\n\r\nThere\'s\r\n-a main page\r\n- landing page (for use with our postcard)\r\n- and approximately 6 sub pages that we\'ll provide the context/copy and videos/images for. 1 sub-page will have many sections.\r\n\r\nSee attachment','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638613165313490945','-',7,'United States','Farmingdale',210.000,'fixed',210.000,'2023-03-22',1,'2023-03-22',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-22 18:49:23',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
