(14910,'PSD Mockup Request',2,'Hello!\r\n\r\nI\'m seeking a talented graphic designer with strong attention to detail and experience in UI/UX design for ongoing projects. The first project is described below.\r\n\r\nDesign a layered psd mockup of a carousel section in our job seeker portal. The purpose of this section is to display videos, blogs, surveys, and click through carousels. As you\'ll see I\'ve created a very basic mockup that needs to be refined to match the job seeker portal as a whole, clean up proportions, and generally optimize the look and feel. As part of the project I\'d like to build in a 20-30 minute kick-off meeting to ensure all questions can be answered and directions are clear. Below are the assets.\r\n\r\nMockup of current teammate portal - need to rebuild \"Tip\" section into carousel\r\n\r\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1dwp6x8kchhlyVSRWmZCFsXDaEoCcqS1Z/view?usp=sharing\r\n\r\nNon-professional mockups of carousel area. As you\'ll see we will have four different types of assets in the carousel - video, blog, carousel, and survey. Each will pop out when clicked (except the survey) and background will darken for easy viewing. Each state will need to be mocked up in the context of the larger page.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.canva.com/design/DAFZ76KpQW8/aKv48nxFPtz3UO7eq6uxPQ/view?utm_content=DAFZ76KpQW8&utm_campaign=designshare&utm_medium=link2&utm_source=sharebutton\r\n\r\nTeamed website to support in brand consistency\r\n\r\nhttps://teamedforlearning.com/\r\n\r\nTeamed Fonts and Colors\r\n\r\nTitles: \'Red Hat Display\'\r\nBody text: \'Inter\'\r\n\r\nGreen: #4CC3A5\r\nDark Gray: #444B56\r\nMed. Gray: #DDDFE3\r\nLight Gray: #F7F7F7','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638611128230035456?success','-',7,'United States','United States',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-03-22',1,'2023-03-22',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-22 18:54:25',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
