(14981,'Squarespace site design update / polish for niche healthcare consulting start up.',18,'We have drafted the anticipated content we believe is needed for launch in our (Squarespace) development site, with a basic thought on what our site map should look like.  This has admittedly been done by non-professionals, we are looking for a professional website designer to review, assess, recommend, and remediate the current website and prepare for our publish / launch date of April 10, 2023.\r\n\r\nScope of work:  We are looking for a website designer, with expertise in Squarespace, to review our current site and provide the following:\r\n• General assessment of current site and content, including recommendations for improvements to overall design, graphics, images, and basic sitemap created\r\n• Review recommendations with Leadership\r\n• Provide remediation on Squarespace dev site on agreed upon design work and improvements\r\n• Regarding timeline, the company is scheduled to \"launch\" website to public domain on or about April 10, 2023.  Ideally, we would like to target final edits and design work /content to be completed no later than April 7, 2023.\r\n• Scope to include mobile as well as standard view/format for website pages\r\n• We are hoping for a balance of graphics /images and text.  Current draft and content appear very “text heavy”, especially mobile view\r\n• Images used should reflect a theme of our business (a balance /mix of healthcare professionals and information technology)  \r\n• Recommendations should include:\r\n      o General messaging and “feel” that reflects our culture, vision for company and brand, and corporate values\r\n      o Best practice design concepts, alternative ideas, functionality of site based on past experiences, expertise from prior engagements\r\n\r\nWill provide further background on company background, including envisioned brand image and websites design of which we like in next step.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01a3e9