(15015,'Graphic Designer for Company Identity Card',2,'We are seeking a freelance graphic designer to create a professional and visually appealing design for our company identity cards. The identity card design should include a frame for an employee picture, a frame for a QR code, space for the employee\'s name, title, position, and our business logo.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n\r\nWork with our team to develop a design concept that meets our requirements for the identity card.\r\n\r\nDesign a visually appealing identity card that captures the professional nature of our business.\r\n\r\nIncorporate a frame for employee picture and a frame for QR code on the identity card.\r\n\r\nEnsure that there is enough space for the employee\'s name, title, position, and our business logo.\r\n\r\nEnsure that the design is consistent with our branding guidelines and specifications.\r\n\r\nProvide regular updates on progress and deliverables to the project lead.\r\n\r\nMake any necessary adjustments or revisions to the design as requested by the team.\r\n\r\nDeliver the final design in the required format and specifications.\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nStrong portfolio of graphic design work, with a focus on branding and promotional materials.\r\n\r\nExperience designing identity cards or similar promotional materials.\r\n\r\nExpertise in graphic design software such as Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, and InDesign.\r\n\r\nExcellent communication skills and ability to work collaboratively with a team.\r\n\r\nAttention to detail and ability to meet tight deadlines.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638919803378880513?success','-',7,'United States','Noerresundby',45.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-23',1,'2023-03-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-23 15:09:09',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
