(15023,'Simple Blog Website Built',3,'I\'m looking for a skilled freelancer to create a simple blog website for me.\r\n\r\nI\'m open to using WordPress, Squarespace, or Wix, and I\'m looking for a platform that is fast, easy to build on, and easy to manage. Here are some of the key requirements for the project:\r\n\r\n- Design and build a custom blog website with a clean and modern look\r\n- Create a simple and intuitive navigation menu that allows users to easily find content\r\n- Include social media sharing buttons to allow users to share content on their social media profiles\r\n- Make the website mobile responsive, so it looks great on all devices\r\n- Provide me with training on how to manage and maintain the website once it\'s complete\r\n\r\nPlease include the following information in your proposal:\r\n\r\n- Your experience building blog websites on WordPress, Squarespace, or Wix\r\n- Examples of previous work that demonstrate your design and development skills\r\n- Your estimated timeline for completing the project\r\n- Your hourly rate or fixed project rate\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for a freelancer who can deliver high-quality work within a reasonable budget and timeframe. If you have any questions or need more information, please don\'t hesitate to ask.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638924354092822529','-',7,'United States','Phoenix',45.000,'Open this select menu',45.000,'2023-03-23',1,'2023-03-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-23 15:27:01',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
