(15038,'Investor Pitch -- Need Content and Clean Up with Quick Turnaround',11,'What I need:\r\nI have an investor pitch for a Series A that is 80% complete. I need to get it to 100% quickly.\r\n\r\nPriority 1) sharpening content -- telling our story.\r\n\r\nPriority 2) design -- making sure the deck is visually consistent.\r\n\r\nI am not looking for a new design or a complete overhaul.\r\n\r\nJust some help on getting out story sharper and cleaner and filling in some missing holes (for example a competition slide, IP slide, customer slide, etc.).\r\n\r\nYour skills:\r\nPlease have experience with both design AND investor pitch content. I have found many good designers on Upwork, but I really need help making sure the message I\'m conveying is as sharp and compelling as possible.\r\nWould be ideal if you have an understanding of Use of Proceeds and how best to convey that along with our financials.\r\n\r\nNext step if we go forward:\r\nWe need to have a ZOOM call asap either same day or next day. I need to walk you through our deck and explain the areas where I need help. I want to have a conversation about the message we are trying to convey to investors.\r\n\r\nI have a short time frame with investor meetings on my schedule within 4-5 days.\r\n\r\nSee File:\r\nI have attached a handful of slides from my deck to give you an idea of look and feel. My complete deck is close to 20 slides but this is a snapshot.\r\n\r\nI need this work done in POWERPOINT. I will be saving it to PDF to share with investors, but the core work needs to be in Powerpoint.\r\n\r\nTHANK YOU FOR YOUR CONSIDERATION','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~019b7653e015706675/apply/','-',7,'United States','Austin',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-03-23',1,'2023-03-23',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-23 16:18:14',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
