(15066,'WordPress Developer for Health Website',3,'We are seeking a talented and experienced WordPress developer to join our team on a full-time basis to work on a health-related website. The successful candidate will be responsible for developing and maintaining the WordPress website, ensuring its performance, security, and user experience. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in WordPress development, as well as a thorough understanding of web design, UI/UX principles, and best practices for creating websites that cater to the healthcare industry.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDevelop custom WordPress themes and plugins for the healthcare website\r\nEnsure website is mobile responsive and optimized for fast loading times\r\nCollaborate with healthcare professionals to create website content that is accurate, relevant, and informative to users\r\nTroubleshoot and fix website issues and bugs\r\nEnsure website security and compliance with HIPAA regulations and guidelines\r\nOptimize website for search engine ranking and lead generation\r\nStay up-to-date with the latest WordPress and web development trends and technologies\r\nProvide regular updates and progress reports to project stakeholders\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience as a WordPress developer with a strong portfolio of WordPress projects\r\nStrong understanding of HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and PHP\r\nExperience with popular WordPress plugins and frameworks for the healthcare industry\r\nFamiliarity with web design principles and UI/UX best practices for creating websites in the healthcare industry\r\nAbility to troubleshoot and debug WordPress issues\r\nStrong attention to detail and problem-solving skills\r\nAbility to work collaboratively with healthcare professionals and stakeholders to achieve website goals','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638972002866851841','-',7,'United States','na',3000.000,'fixed',3000.000,'2023-03-23',1,'2023-03-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'