(15091,'Design and Develop Shopify Website',3,'Hello,\r\n\r\nIt is my pleasure to introduce Healn, a brand committed to the health and wellness of our customers. We are currently seeking a freelancer to assist us with the design of our 11-page Shopify website, including the Homepage, Shop Now Page, Product Page, Shopping Cart Page, About Us Page, FAQ\'s Page, Locate Us Page, Press Page, Blog Page, Blog/Press Entries Page, and Legal Page. We would like to build on a pre-existing design, but with some modifications.\r\n\r\nThe website will have two versions, in Spanish and English, with an identical design. Spanish is the default language, and the English texts are marked with the text \"English Version\" inside red rectangles. Once an agreement is reached, we will send a detailed briefing containing all the information, texts, and images, along with explanations about where each element goes, marked by numbered circles or black squares and tables.\r\n\r\nMost of the graphic resources will be provided by us. If you are interested in this project, please provide us with a budget and timeframe. It is essential for us to start the design process as soon as possible, so kindly let us know if you are interested at your earliest convenience.\r\n\r\nPlease read the forthcoming briefing carefully before asking any questions. We look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nWhat are we looking for?\r\n\r\nWe understand the importance of timely completion for this project and would like to emphasize that we require the final deliverables within a tight deadline of 7 to 10 days. This timeframe is crucial for our plans, and we expect the chosen designer and developer to prioritize this project accordingly, ensuring that the work is completed efficiently and to a high standard within the specified deadline. Please only consider taking on this project if you are confident in your ability to meet this deadline and deliver a quality product in the allotted time.\r\n\r\n1. Proven experience: A Designer and Developer with a strong portfolio showcasing their previous work, demonstrating their ability to create visually appealing, user-friendly, and responsive designs across various platforms.\r\n\r\n2. Technical expertise: Proficiency in design tools such as Figma, as well as a solid understanding of web development languages like HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to ensure seamless implementation of the desired design and functionality.\r\n\r\n3. Strong communication skills: Effective and timely communication to ensure smooth collaboration and understanding of project requirements, updates, and feedback.\r\n\r\n4. Attention to detail: A keen eye for design elements, ensuring that all visual components, typography, colors, and layouts are consistent and harmonious throughout the project.\r\n\r\n5. Bilingual capabilities: Fluency in both Spanish and English to accommodate the bilingual nature of the project, allowing for seamless integration of both language versions.\r\n\r\n6. Problem-solving skills: The ability to identify and address any technical or design issues that may arise during the development process, providing effective solutions to ensure a high-quality end product.\r\n\r\n7. Time management: The ability to work within deadlines, providing accurate time estimates for project completion and ensuring timely delivery of work.\r\n\r\n8. Knowledge of SEO best practices: Familiarity with on-page SEO optimization techniques to improve website visibility and ranking on search engines.\r\n\r\n9. Familiarity with UX/UI principles: Understanding of user experience and user interface design principles to create an intuitive and easy-to-navigate product.\r\n\r\n10. Adaptability: Willingness to make revisions and adjustments to the design based on client feedback and changing requirements, ensuring that the final product meets the desired expectations.\r\n\r\n11. Figma collaboration: The ability to design in Figma and share the project link with the client, allowing them to visualize the design and provide feedback frequently.\r\n\r\n12. Up-to-date with industry trends: Staying current with the latest design trends, tools, and technologies to ensure the final product remains modern, visually appealing, and competitive in the marketplace.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nAmparo','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1638991338516017153','-',7,'United States','Murcia',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-03-23',1,'2023-03-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-23 19:50:31',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
