(15137,'Experienced Designer Needed for Mobile App Celebrating Fitness and Travel',6,'Project Overview:\r\nWe are seeking a talented and experienced designer to help us create a visually stunning MVP for our fitness and adventure app. Our app celebrates epic adventures with amazing art, and we want the design to reflect this spirit of adventure and creativity. We have already defined the core features and screens for the MVP, but we need a designer to help us bring these ideas to life with beautiful and engaging visuals.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n- Collaborate with the project team to understand the app\'s concept, target audience, and brand personality.\r\n- Create visual designs for the MVP screens and features, including the home screen, Strava integration screen, adventure visualization screen, visualization screen, share screen, order screen, login/signup screen, and profile screen.\r\n- Design a variety of artistic filters and styles for users to choose from when creating their adventure visualizations.\r\n- Ensure that the designs are consistent with the app\'s brand guidelines and reflect the spirit of adventure and creativity.\r\n- Create high-fidelity wireframes, mockups, and prototypes to communicate the design concepts to the development team.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- At least 5 years of experience in designing mobile apps, with a focus on fitness, adventure, or travel apps.\r\n- Strong skills in visual design, user interface design, and graphic design, with a portfolio that showcases your creativity, attention to detail, and ability to create beautiful and engaging visuals.\r\n- Proficiency in design tools such as Sketch, Figma, or Adobe Creative Suite.\r\n- Experience with designing for iOS and Android platforms and knowledge of platform-specific design guidelines and best practices.\r\n- Understanding of user-centered design principles, design thinking, and agile development methodologies.\r\n- Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively in a team environment and present your ideas clearly and persuasively.\r\n- We are looking for a designer who is passionate about creating beautiful and engaging user experiences and who shares our vision of celebrating epic adventures with amazing art. If you are excited about this project and believe you have the skills and experience we are looking for, we would love to hear from you! Please provide a link to your portfolio.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1639204717818048513','-',7,'United States','Calgary',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-03-24',1,'2023-03-24',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-24 09:58:47',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
