(15141,'Book Cover Design (Fragmentos del Alma)',2,'The cover of \'Fragmentos del alma\' is a poetic and suggestive image that evokes the themes addressed in the work. It is designed with a dark background that highlights the title in white letters, in an elegant and curved font.\r\n\r\nIn the center of the cover, there is a delicate and suggestive image of a broken glass, which represents the fragments of the author\'s soul reflected in each poem. The pieces of glass are illuminated with an intense glow, symbolizing the light that shines in each poem, despite the shadows that may exist in the human soul.\r\n\r\nThe image is simple yet striking, and perfectly captures the emotional and profound tone of the work. The cover conveys a sense of mystery and depth, and evokes the idea that each poem is a window to the author\'s soul.\"','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0193223b50530d974f','-',7,'United States','Miami',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-03-24',1,'2023-03-24',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-24 11:29:14',NULL,8,3,NULL,146),
