(15157,'Brand Designer for Gen Z Designer Womenswear Fashion Brand Refresh',2,'Scope: We are seeking a highly creative and experienced Brand Designer to join our team and help us with the brand refresh for our designer womenswear fashion brand targeting Gen Z. The designer will be responsible for updating and modernizing the visual identity of the brand, while still staying true to its heritage and values. This may include updating the logo, typography, color palette, and overall design aesthetic to better align with current fashion trends and the preferences of the Gen Z target audience. In addition to visual elements, a brand refresh for our designer womenswear fashion brand may also involve redefining the brand messaging and tone of voice to better resonate with our target audience, as well as updating product offerings and packaging to reflect the updated brand identity.\r\n\r\nDelivery: Quick turnaround required.\r\n\r\nCollaboration: Work closely with our marketing team to ensure all designs align with our brand guidelines and enhance our overall brand strategy.\r\n\r\nPotential for More Work: Opportunity for ongoing projects.\r\n\r\nRequirements: Proven experience in brand design specifically for designer womenswear fashion brands targeting Gen Z. Strong understanding of the latest design trends in the fashion industry, ability to work under tight deadlines, and proficiency in Adobe Creative Suite.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a designer who can help us understand the nuances of fashion brand design specifically for Gen Z, suggest best practices to improve our brand identity, and provide creative solutions to enhance our brand messaging.\r\n\r\nHelpful Links: Desired style references will be provided.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re an experienced Brand Designer with a proven track record of creating visually compelling designs and developing brand guidelines specifically for designer womenswear fashion brands targeting Gen Z, proficient in Adobe Creative Suite, and can provide creative solutions to enhance our brand identity, we want to work with you. Please apply now to join our team.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1639256901266239489?success','-',7,'United States','London',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-24',1,'2023-03-24',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-24 13:29:19',NULL,5,3,NULL,132),
