(15181,'Website Design & Development',15,'I am in need of a website rebranding and redesign. I\'m looking for something somewhat unique but clean. I do not want a cartoon character website. They do not produce great results. I want something business owners can view and recognize its professionalism, because that is what we provide our customers. It must follow the stages of answering these three questions: who we are, what we do, and how can we help you? The next phase would be case studies, then sample work along with customer testimonials. \r\n\r\nThe menu structure will consist of a home page, services, gallery, case studies, about us, contact, blogs. \r\n\r\nThe services provided will consist of - SEO, Website Design, Copywriting/Content marketing, email marketing, social media marketing, local marketing. \r\n\r\nWe have a unique tagline that I will provide to the one chosen for the project. \r\n\r\nWe currently have a website called Reiner Leads and it is horrible. The new website will have a different name as our business is changing and growing. That also will be provided to the chosen company. \r\n\r\nThe website must be built in WordPress using either Elementor Pro or Divi. We will install RankMath when the website is completed for SEO. \r\n\r\nOur budget is not that big, and do not ask me what it is. You have the number of pages, provide an estimate, if you do not, you will not be considered. \r\n\r\nAs for images, you tell me what theme or image you prefer with color schemes along with the content and we will provide it. \r\n\r\nWe have statistical analysis and reports you can use on the website as long as you know how to make them appear professional. \r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know if you have any questions.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2043833','-',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'fixed',1100.000,'2023-03-24',1,'2023-03-24',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-24 15:07:59',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
