(15187,'BRAND & LOGO Design for Sports Company',10,'I need a wordmark logo for the word FIRE. I want it to be bold and dominant. Possibly using the Draper font or Colasta font. It\'s going to be the basis for a sports brand. I do NOT want a flame image stuck on a wordmark. I do NOT want a vertical logo. I do NOT want to see a flame ANYWHERE unless it is part of a CUSTOM letterform. I do NOT want vertical flames as an add-on. I do not want a flame as the \"i\" in FIRE.  I want ONLY a wordmark logo that is EXTREMELY well thought out and crafted. That is thoughtful and presents FIRE in a unique, simple, and effective way.  That\'s the first deliverable.\r\n\r\nThe second thing we need is that concept then to be used as the basis for the design of a wrestling singlet. The singlet must be EVOCATIVE and stand out. We want people to take notice. It must be bold, strong. modern design. It must stand out in a crowd and draw the eyes in immediately. It must be exciting and make people take notice.\r\n\r\nI hope this makes sense! Reach out if you have any questions.\r\n\r\n*Note: For the initial FIRE logo, keep cross sport branding and products in mind. NOT just for wrestling.\r\n** Note 2:  When I say wrestling I mean amateur athletic wrestling, kids wrestling, school wrestling...and not the entertainment kind of wrestling.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~012930d657f998c2c3','-',7,'United States','Wilmington',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2023-03-24',1,'2023-03-24',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-24 15:17:26',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
