(15190,'Marketing website creation',3,'We are seeking the services of a UX Designer to design a landing page for a SaaS Company.\r\n\r\nThe main objective of the landing page is to attract potential customers and encourage them to sign up for our service. To achieve this, we need a design that is visually appealing, easy to navigate, and highlights the benefits of our service.\r\n\r\nThe following are some key points to consider when designing the landing page:\r\n\r\n- Keep the design clean and simple, without too many distracting elements\r\n- Use high-quality images and graphics to create an engaging visual experience\r\n- Utilize legible fonts that are easy to read;\r\n- Consider the use of icons and illustrations to convey information quickly and effectively\r\n- Include clear calls to action, like \"Sign Up\" or \"Learn More\"\r\n\r\nWe expect the final outcome to be delivered in the form of a Figma file or Adobe XD.\r\n\r\nWe are open to creative ideas and suggestions that will make the landing page stand out and effectively communicate our service. Please feel free to ask questions or request further information as needed.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1639285981416058881','-',7,'United States','Ourém',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-03-24',1,'2023-03-24',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-24 15:21:29',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(15191,'Design presentation slides and synthesize content for consulting firm',11,'We are a family business consulting firm and need to have the contents of a guidebook synthesized and converted into our existing branded PowerPoint. These slides will serve as presentation materials for client workshops (these will not be handouts or client deliverables). We need someone who can think through the information in the guidebook and distill the content down to slides so that we can build a slide inventory to use in the future. We will provide the guidebook, our deck, and branding info (fonts, colors, etc.).\r\n\r\nWe are looking for this to be completed quickly - in about two weeks. I\'m attaching chapter 2 of the guidebook (there are 14 chapters) as an example of the source material that we want synthesized and converted to slides.\r\n\r\nSlides need to be on brand and the quality must be on par with McKinsey or Deloitte presentation decks. This is not a sales deck.\r\n\r\nWe will setup a kickoff meeting via Zoom to review the project, the guidebook, and our expectations. Please reach out with any questions','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01cf988cce83f4c5e6','-',7,'United States','Charlottesville',75.000,'perhour',75.000,'2023-03-24',1,'2023-03-24',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-24 15:26:48',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
