(15201,'Billing Support (REMOTE)',21,'- Must be fluent in English and able to speak AND write\r\n- This job is full-time with no end date determined. Looking for someone long term.\r\n- Knowledge of HIPAA preferred\r\n- Knowledge of Personal Injury preferred (we are not a law firm, we work directly with them)\r\n- Contacting law firms for updated case status on specific accounts we own via email and phone (60% email, 40% phone time)\r\n- Tasks will be provided for the day using Asana\r\n- 40 hours a week, can be flexible with discussion prior (work time MUST range from Monday - Friday 9am-5pm EST)\r\n\r\nA little bit about us:\r\nPremier Billing is a funding company that owns the billing for specific medical practices that are involved with personal injury cases/patients. We are a small team of less than 10 who all work remotely. You will get to know myself and the rest of the team virtually, and we primarily use Slack to communicate during the day. We work hard to try and get updated case status every 90 days on our ~5,000 accounts, so having a rockstar like yourself would be awesome. We are happy to train, so if you have the desire to make an impact and see results while learning a skill that could open doors, please reach out. If you have any questions in the meantime, let us know.\r\n\r\n** For consideration, message me with recent experience and briefly explain why you think you\'d be a good fit or want to work with us! Don\'t be shy. :)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1639288320620625921','-',7,'United States','Wilton Manors',7.000,'Open this select menu',18.000,'2023-03-24',1,'2023-03-24',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-24 15:47:08',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
