(15203,'Website Update',3,'To give you an idea, our entire product page would need to be revamped because some products may be removed, and we have several new ones. We would need a page dedicated to AAA (Automobile Association) providers (a client of ours), maybe a portal or landing page for them because they get special discounts others do not get. I would be looking for creative ideas for how best to present the products (click on photo and go to an expanded version with information, or....?) Things like that. Also, if you were interested, we would need a consultant to manage the technical side of the site if necessary (to make sure our site is optimized and visible to the extent possible), and to update the content as necessary. So, beyond the initial site revision, we would be looking for that as well. Let\'s  go for the upgrade and optimization','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1637912219259346945','Diana Holms | Website Update | JG.',111,'United States','El Cerrito',4000.000,'fixed',4000.000,'2023-03-24',1,'2023-03-24',1,'NA',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-03-24 15:51:34','2023-03-27 21:30:20',10,3,NULL,119),
