(15208,'Looking for a talented UI/UX Designer',3,'We are looking for a talented UI/UX Designer. As a UI/UX Designer, you will be responsible for designing and creating intuitive, user-friendly interface for our website. You will work closely with our development team to understand the user needs, create wireframes, prototypes, and produce high-quality visuals that align with our brand and style guidelines.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDesign and create mockups, design layout, and user interfaces for our website.\r\nDevelop intuitive, user-friendly interfaces that enhance the user experience.\r\nCollaborate with cross-functional teams to understand user needs and business requirements.\r\nConduct user research and usability testing to validate design decisions.\r\nEnsure consistency across all platforms and devices.\r\nStay up-to-date with the latest UI/UX trends and best practices.\r\nMaintain brand and style guidelines to ensure consistency across all designs.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience as a UI/UX Designer or similar role.\r\nStrong portfolio showcasing your design skills and problem-solving abilities.\r\nProficiency in design software such as Sketch, Adobe Creative Suite, Figma, and InVision.\r\nFamiliarity with HTML/CSS, Javascript, and responsive design principles.\r\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills.\r\nAbility to work in a fast-paced environment and manage multiple projects simultaneously.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1639299929913749505','-',7,'United States','na',40.000,'Open this select menu',40.000,'2023-03-24',1,'2023-03-24',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-24 16:16:37',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
