(15280,'Virtual Assistant Needed for Growing Wellness Provider',22,'Virtual Assistant\r\nG3M Therapy and Wellness is a start-up small wellness  business specializing in holistic care. As a growing company we serve members of the DC. MD, and VA area by targeting their self-care needs through wellness coaching, massage therapy services, and more. As a 5 star business our goal is to maintain the value of our clientele while focusing on their needs. We are hiring a talented Virtual Assistant professional to join our team. If you\'re excited to be part of a team that will help you to expand your skills and knowledge this is a great place to grow your career. You\'ll be glad you applied to G3M Therapy and Wellness.\r\nWe are looking for a responsible Virtual Administrative Assistant to perform a variety of administrative and clerical tasks. As a growing wellness company, we want to ensure our customers are valued before, during, and after their experience at G3M Therapy and Wellness. The virtual assistant will work as a support for the owner of G3M Therapy and Wellness and stakeholders. You will handle administrative projects and deliver high-quality work under minimum supervision.\r\nResponsibilities for Virtual Assistant Include:\r\nProvide customer service as first point of contact for internal and external clients\r\nMaintain and manage contact lists and organize managers’ calendars\r\nOrganize communication via emails and phone calls\r\nOrganize and schedule appointments through company website\r\nConduct market research and report on the results\r\nCreate presentations and documents\r\nWrite and distribute email and corresponding newsletters to clients for updates\r\nGather and organize data for statistical analysis\r\nUpdate and maintain office policies and procedures\r\nPlan, organize, and execute office activities and meetings\r\nManage virtual office logistics\r\nManage social media while working with Social Media Intern\r\nQualifications for Virtual Assistant\r\nHigh school diploma; additional qualification as an Administrator or Executive Assistant will be a bonus\r\nExperience of working as a Virtual Assistant for developing companies or other relevant position\r\nExcellent phone٫ email and instant messaging etiquette\r\nStrong organizational and time management skills\r\nAbility to manage a calendar and schedule appointments\r\nProficiency with Microsoft Office tools such as Word, Excel, and PowerPoint\r\nKnowledge of marketing, advertising, and public relations\r\nExcellent written and verbal communication skills\r\nFamiliarity with social media platforms\r\nProficiency with cloud-based platforms such as Google Drive, Zoom, and other remote team messaging apps\r\nStrong time management skills and the ability to multitask\r\nSkilled in data entry\r\nAbility to work in a growing environment\r\nHigh-speed internet connection','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Virtual-Assistant-Needed-for-Growing-Wellness-Provider_~014df81d29c9a7ea','-',7,'United States','US',15.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-03-24',1,'2023-03-24',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-24 20:45:19',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
