(15319,'Expert Website Developer (Webflow Specifically)',3,'At STADIUUM Group, we\'re looking for an Expert Website Developer, specifically skilled on Webflow, to create a website for our new brand and make slight changes to our existing corporate website to integrate the new brand.\r\n\r\nAll of the designs for the website have been prepared for the successful candidate, and it will be their job to integrate it into the Webflow software. The existing corporate website which will need changes to incorporate the new brand, is also live on Webflow.\r\n\r\nFor this task, we\'re hoping for a super quick turnaround, with a deadline by the end of this week, so the successful candidate must have the following:\r\n\r\n- A flexible schedule, so that they can attack this tasks full time & have the website live within the next fortnight.\r\n- Good communication with the STADIUUM Group team.\r\n- Experience working within Figma, which is where the UI/UX designs are housed.\r\n\r\nWe would not advise applying for this role if you can not adhere to the deadline of the next 7 days.\r\n\r\nIf you feel you\'re a perfect fit for this quick turnaround project and match the criteria above, we look forward to seeing your application.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640312593273876481','-',7,'United States','Glyn Ceiriog',550.000,'Open this select menu',550.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-27 11:21:40',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
