(15323,'Creation of Brand Identity',2,'Overview: The purpose of this project is to create a brand identity of a product for business professionals and aspirants that acts as an AI expert for strategic decisions. The AI product helps professionals to quickly understand the relevance and implications of complex information they have received and communicate effectively with their leaders, clients and other team members to make informed decisions for their organizations. The brand identity should convey the product\'s benefits and innovative approach to making business professionals and their teams more effective at supporting good decisions.\r\n\r\nTarget Audience: The target audience for FirstThing.AI is two groups of people:\r\n\r\nFormer consultants who work in leadership roles across various industries who want to raise the bar for synthesis and decision making across their business\r\n\r\nProfessionals at any stage of their career who aspire to excellence in communicating with diverse stakeholders, and generating first-class documents to progress their career\r\n\r\nBrand Personality: The brand archetype for FirstThing.AI is the Creator and should reflect the following characteristics:\r\nInnovative\r\nEffective\r\nInspirational\r\nExecutive\r\nStructured\r\nProfessional\r\nLeader\r\nExcellence\r\nSuperhuman\r\n\r\nReferences could be:\r\nFormula 1 teams / pit crews\r\nRally pilot & co-pilot\r\nOceans 11, Kaleidescope\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\n1. Logo design\r\n2. Color scheme\r\n3. Typography\r\n4. Visual element guide / template\r\n5. Brand guidelines\r\n\r\nBrand Identity Elements: It is imperative that the brand identity not be reminiscent of the brands of any major consulting firm, especially McKinsey, Bain, and Boston Consulting Group, as well as Accenture, EY, KPMG, PWC, or Delotte.\r\n\r\nLogo: The logo should be simple, modern, and memorable. It should convey the professional growth and excellence FirstThing.AI delivers to our users.\r\n\r\nColor Scheme: The color scheme should be modern, professional, and structured. It should reflect the brand personality and be easily recognisable. We have already developed the primary colours, so the scope of this deliverable is limited (see below).\r\n\r\nTypography: The typography should be modern and easy to read. It should be easily distinguishable and reflect the brand\'s professionalism.\r\n\r\nVisual Elements: The visual elements should be consistent with the brand personality and convey the benefits of FirstThing.AI’s product. This can include icons, graphics, and imagery that reflect the product\'s innovative approach. Photography guidelines can be excluded from scope.\r\n\r\nBrand Guidelines: A comprehensive set of brand guidelines should be developed to ensure consistency in the brand identity. The guidelines should include specifications for logo usage, color scheme, typography, and visual elements.\r\n\r\n\r\nColour Scheme: Regarding deliverable 2 – Colour Scheme, we are already working with a colour scheme, visible here https://colorhunt.co/palette/3038413a475000adb5eeeeee . Therefore, for this deliverable all you need do is provde recommendations regarding\r\n\r\n2.1 potential small changes to the primary colours,\r\n2.2. recommendations of secondary colours,\r\n2.3. Recommendations of colour usage.\r\n\r\nTimeline:\r\nThe project should be completed within two weeks of the start date. This includes time for revisions and feedback from the FirstThing.AI team. Please anticipate developing an initial scope to be agreed upon, an early direction setting session, and then up to two rounds of revisions.\r\n\r\nBudget:\r\nThe project is a capped budget project, at a maximum of $US1000. Please do not apply if you cannot deliver the required deliverables for less than that amount.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640335494977626113?success','-',7,'United States','Chatswood',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-27 12:52:43',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
