(15329,'Passionate UI/UX Designer Generalist',2,'We\'re a small agency in Europe looking for a part-time freelance designer to support our dedicated team.\r\n\r\nYou\'ll be working on client projects and a wide range of deliverables (mockups for websites, wireframes for mobile apps, interaction concepts, illustrations, …). Your weapon of choice: Figma.\r\n\r\nPlease only apply if you bring the following to the table:\r\n\r\n- Strong communication skills (English skills)\r\n- Experience with Figma\r\n- An eye for details and the will to go the extra mile\r\n- The passion and dedication to produce delightful digital design artefacts\r\n- A plus: You have skills in creating illustrations for web and mobile, or are a graphic design generalist with a broad range of skills\r\n\r\nWe have over 10 years of experience in working with freelancers. In our experience, it quickly shows which candidates are a good fit. We therefore expect candidates to participate in one or more rounds of interviews (including a Zoom interview which includes you walking us through a design you’re particularly proud of via screen share).\r\n\r\nOur timezone is GMT+2 (central Europe). If your work schedule roughly matches ours and we can meet at reasonable times, we can make it work.\r\n\r\nThis is a long-term opportunity. In the first 4-8 weeks, the workload will be limited. Later, expect this to increase. We\'re interested in finding a candidate who is ready and excited to grow together with us. Of course, this includes the medium- to long-term potential of you assuming a full-time position with a regular salary, if that’s of interest to you.\r\n\r\nThanks in advance for your application. Please feel free to send us your portfolio to give us a first impression of work you’re particularly proud of! We’re looking forward to meeting you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640340204476375041?success','-',7,'United States','Zurich',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'Client may 