(15361,'Graphic Designer for Music-Tech Startup',2,'NOT FOR AGENCIES. We are looking for a team member. \r\n\r\nWe’re a top learning app based in Berlin (job is remote) that is teaching people how to play the piano. Our app listens to your playing and gives you real time feedback while teaching you some of the most popular music for piano. We are looking for a graphic designer to join our team. Come and join an exciting and fast-paced music-tech startup!\r\n\r\nYOUR JOB\r\n\r\nDesign promotional assets to be used in different marketing channels such as Social Media, Newsletters or Paid Ads (Facebook, Google, Instagram, YouTube, etc)\r\nDesign screenshots to be used in our store in the App Store and Google Play to engage and increase our user base\r\nProactively come up with new ideas and designs to use in our different platforms\r\n\r\nYOUR PROFILE\r\n\r\nYou have several years of experience in designing Marketing assets for different channels such as Social Media, Email or Performance Marketing\r\nYou are a proficient with Figma, Photoshop and other design tools\r\nYou are able to design multiple assets in a fast-paced environment\r\nYou are able to come up with a design based on brand guidelines\r\nYou are a responsive person, used to give ETA for your tasks and give regular updates\r\nYou need to provide us with your portfolio\r\nBeing able to do video editing is a plus\r\n\r\nOTHER DETAILS\r\n\r\n• Fully remote but available during the Central European time zone.\r\n• 5 to 15 hours a week\r\n• We are looking for a long term collaboration','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01a09f75fdfc3ce56c','-',7,'United States','Berlin',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-27 15:05:22',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
