(15368,'Bilingual (English/Spanish) Admin Assistant for Regional Healthcare Corporation',22,'ABOUT US\r\nOur organization is one of the fastest growing and most respected healthcare providers in South Florida. We are a stable dynamically growing company. For a successful candidate, this is a long term project.\r\n\r\nJOB DESCRIPTION\r\nThe job seeker will work in: customer service, compliance, data entry, and other areas. We provide needed training.\r\n\r\nSKILLS\r\n• Must speak both English and Spanish\r\n• Have great communication & customer service skills\r\n• MS Office - Proficient in Excel, Word and Outlook\r\n• Great organization/attention to detail, and have ability to multitask\r\n• Friendly and timely communication\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640345610844393473','-',7,'United States','Boca Raton',12.000,'perhour',12.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-27 15:13:27',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
