(15370,'Virtual Medical Assistant',22,'Looking for a dependable and experienced virtual medical assistant for a thriving psychiatric outpatient practice. Ideal candidate will be an independent learner, reliable, and comfortable with change and navigating various platforms. Must be experienced in interacting with patients. Also, it is extremely important that the candidate is able to assist with completing many types of medical documentation. Would prefer a strong background and education in healthcare. Looking for a long-term team member who is focused on outcomes and the development of a great working relationship with providers and patients.\r\n\r\nPosition is full-time, 40 hours a week. The required hours are 9am-6pm central time USA, with a 1-hour break. Please ensure you can work these hours, and do not apply for comsideration if you have other obligations that would prevent you from working these hours consistently. Also, if interested in this position, please provide an audio and/or video recording of yourself for review.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640340309497147393','-',7,'United States','Richmond',12.000,'perhour',12.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-27 15:14:13',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(15371,'Bookkeeper / Financial Controller',32,'We are seeking an experienced Bookkeeper, ideally with a minimum of 10 years of experience, who is capable of managing the books for five different corporations owned by Dr. Ashok, a physician and business owner based in Los Angeles. Dr. Ashok operates in multiple hospitals, clinics, nursing homes, home health, and hospice environments. He also oversees operations for his four clinics and manages a team in India for offshore billing services. Additionally, he is currently expanding his real estate portfolio.\r\n\r\nThe Bookkeeper will be responsible for handling payroll and preparing financial records for a CPA working on Quickbooks Online. The Bookkeeper will have monthly meetings with Dr. Ashok to review profit and loss statements, as well as balance sheets for each of the corporations.\r\n\r\nThis position will initially be part-time, with a 20-hour per week commitment and the potential to expand to a full-time role. The Bookkeeper\'s responsibilities will include: maintaining accurate financial records, processing payroll, preparing financial reports for a CPA, and participating in monthly meetings with Dr. Ashok to discuss the financial performance of each corporation.\r\n\r\nThe successful candidate will be an organized, detail-oriented individual who can effectively communicate with business stakeholders, medical professionals, and staff across various industries. Familiarity with offshore billing services and international teams would be advantageous.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640371792754274305','-',7,'United States','South El Monte',40.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-27 15:19:37',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
(15372,'Wordpress Website development + Graphics Designer',15,'website from scratch. Logo design , font and color selection.\r\n\r\nDesigner will need to update our site with images\r\nDesigner will need to work on the layout and ensure the\r\n\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a talented website designer with experience in layout, graphics, and web development using WordPress to build out our website. The ideal candidate should be able to create visually appealing designs that are also user-friendly and responsive.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nCollaborate with our team to understand our website requirements and goals\r\nDevelop design concepts, wireframes, and mockups\r\nDesign and develop website layouts, graphics, and user interfaces using WordPress\r\nEnsure website is responsive and optimized for all devices\r\nTest website functionality and troubleshoot any issues that arise\r\nStay up-to-date with emerging web design trends and technologies\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience in website design and development using WordPress\r\nStrong portfolio showcasing previous work\r\nProficiency in web design software such as Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, and InDesign\r\nKnowledge of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript\r\nUnderstanding of SEO and web optimization best practices\r\nExcellent communication skills and ability to work collaboratively with team members\r\nAbility to manage multiple projects and deadlines\r\nIf you meet these requirements and are passionate about creating stunning websites that deliver great user experiences, we would love to hear from you. Please send your resume, portfolio, and any relevant links to [contact email].','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640373072128843777','-',7,'United States','na',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-27 15:20:59',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(15373,'Update PowerPoint Decks to New Template',11,'Goal:\r\nConvert 13 decks into our new template design\r\n\r\nBackground:\r\nWe recently updated branding and these decks have to get converted from the old style to the new style.\r\n\r\nDetails:\r\n**Note: I can\'t include all the decks in the initial upload because the file is too big. I\'ll add them to the job once it\'s posted.\r\n\r\nIn my project folder are the following folders:\r\n- Source Decks – 13 decks to convert to the new design.\r\n- Deck Summary.xlsx – This is an overview of the decks organized into 3 tiers. I need the decks in tier 1 first, then tier 2, then tier 3.\r\n- 2023 Powerpoint Template 021723.pptx – this is the template to use for all the new decks.\r\n- Sample Decks – this folder contains 2 samples for style.\r\n- JP Morgan January 2023 1.5.23 AM.pptx – I really like the look of this deck. It doesn’t use a lot of backgrounds, but it still has a nice use of color.\r\n- 2023 Sales Deck - 2.2.23.pptx – this deck is nice but it relies on the blue background for too many slides.\r\nI’d rather have the new decks look closer to the JP morgan deck than the Sales Deck.\r\nFonts – Poppins – used exclusively throughout. This is a Google font.\r\n\r\nNotes on design:\r\n- The source slides do not necessarily need new layouts, they just need update to the new branding\r\n- Feel free to update layouts to align with the new template, but I would expect that most slide layouts won’t change much.\r\n- The Smart Cycle Graphics (The blue circle things) should be replaced with the updated design found in the template deck\r\n- Update all fonts to Poppins\r\n- Note that our new base font color is now darker than it was in the old decks so that should be updated.\r\n- The color palette is new\r\n- The divider slides are new in the new template deck and should replace the old style\r\n- Use sample decks as a guide for what the new decks should look like','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011a63e9ded88cfad1','-',7,'United States','New York',48.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-27 15:21:03',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
