(15386,'Creating Stand-up pouch design for dog supplement brand',2,'You already have the template design for my previous collagen bags. This will be for Marine Collage. So there will need to be picture of a fish. I really like the blue color that you used before so let\'s do that.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'ll need;\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n3x 3D mockup images - 1 front, 1 back\r\nAI source file for printing\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n✅ ADVANCED SUPPORT FOR BONES, HIP & JOINTS, LIGAMENTS & GUT HEALTH: Contains 18 amino acids (8 essential) that aid in promoting muscle and ligament repair, flexibility, and recovery.\r\n✅ PREMIUM WILD-CAUGHT ALASKAN POLLACK: Sourced from the highest quality Wild Caught Alaskan Pollack from the Bering Sea. No Fillers or Preservatives. Non-GMO, Antibiotic-Free, Hormone-Free, & Sugar-Free Type 1 Collagen.\r\n✅ DOGS NEED COLLAGEN: Collagen is one of the most important proteins in your dog’s body! It’s the primary protein in their skin, coat, tendon, cartilage, bones, and joints.\r\n✅ PREVENTS AND PROTECTS - A great preventative measure against ailments such at arthritis, hip dysplasia, skin allergies and gastrointestinal problems. 3+ Month supply with over 114 servings per jar!','https://www.upwork.com/nx/wm/workroom/33162537/overview','Randall Ly 2 | Packaging Design | Munir',113,'United States','N/A',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'N/A',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-03-27 15:39:50','2023-03-28 15:38:17',5,3,NULL,129),
