(15391,'Internal Creative/Branding Posters',2,'Project consists of internal creative posters for our office locations.\r\n\r\nRefresh look and feel of our company\'s \"core values\" poster to start.\r\n\r\nWill likely need a couple different dimensions since office space varies. I\'m thinking a 22 x 28, 24 x 36, maybe a 33 x 55, or something along those lines.\r\n\r\nThere are a couple of different creative directions to go with this project. One poster with all 5 core values on it, and then a series (one poster for each core value with its corresponding definition). (Open to suggestions).\r\n\r\nWe have established brand guidelines for you to work with (attached).\r\n\r\nAttached is what the current core values look like (developed over 7 years ago) that needs a refresh.\r\n\r\nOther attachments include current marketing collateral that more so aligns with what we\'re looking for.\r\n\r\nSeeking a crisp, clean, look and feel. Like to mix bold with thin light text for contrast. Effective use of lines. I realize the Helvetica corporate look and feel is \"overused,\" but the Gotham font we use allows for some flexibility.\r\n\r\nB2B marketing experience within the industrial or manufacturing space is a plus.\r\n\r\nThis project has the potential to lead into other creative work we need done.\r\n\r\nVisit us at www.concentricusa.com.\r\n\r\nAny questions, or clarification needed, don\'t hesitate to reach out.\r\n\r\n- Eric Schlau','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640380541541416961?success','-',7,'United States','Greensboro',45.000,'Open this select menu',45.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-27 15:50:25',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
