(15413,'Provider Enrollment Support Representative',24,'We are seeking experienced candidates who are familiar with the provider enrollment/payer credentialing process to supplement our existing team. Our company is growing at a fast rate and we are looking for people with experience preparing, submitting, and following up on credentialing applications with insurance networks.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidates have 5+ years of experience preparing Medicare, Medicaid, and commercial insurance credentialing applications for physicians and other non-physician healthcare practitioners. A thorough understanding of the provider enrollment process including credentialing and contracting is necessary.\r\n\r\nThis position primarily consists of contacting insurance companies to find the status of credentialing applications, documenting application status in our system, taking necessary action to complete the application with the payor as quickly as possible. These positions work closely with our in-house experts to provide credentialing services to our clients nationwide.\r\n\r\nThis is an ongoing project to help supplement our permanent full time staff while we are in a recruiting phase to add more people to our team. We are looking for people who can work approximately 30-40 hours per week on a regular basis.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640387870681931777','-',7,'United States','Chattanooga',15.000,'perhour',15.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-27 16:29:00',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
