(15416,'Creative Logo Designer for Networking App',10,'We are seeking a talented and experienced logo designer to create a unique and eye-catching logo and app icon for our upcoming networking app. The ideal candidate will have a strong understanding of branding, the ability to translate our vision into a visual identity, and a proven track record of designing memorable logos that capture attention and resonate with users.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n-Collaborate with our team to understand the vision, mission, and target audience\r\n-Develop a creative logo concept that embodies the essence of the app and appeals to our target users\r\n-Design a complementary app icon that is recognizable and stands out in the app store\r\n-Present multiple logo and app icon design concepts for review and refinement\r\n-Incorporate feedback from our team and revise designs as needed to achieve the desired result\r\n-Deliver final logo and app icon files in various formats and sizes, ready for use in digital and print applications\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n-Proven experience in logo design, with a strong portfolio showcasing your work\r\n-Excellent understanding of branding, design principles, and color theory\r\n-Proficient in Adobe Creative Suite (Illustrator, Photoshop) or similar design software\r\n-Ability to work independently and manage multiple revisions based on feedback\r\n-Strong communication skills and the ability to collaborate effectively with our team\r\n-Experience designing logos for mobile apps or the tech industry is a plus\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit your portfolio, resume, and a brief description of your design process. Additionally, please include any examples of logos or app icons you have created for similar projects or industries.\r\n\r\nWe are excited to find the right designer to bring our vision to life and look forward to reviewing your application!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~018a35c1aa01f85cd9','-',7,'United States','Miami',95.000,'perhour