(15428,'Medical Writer for Articles - Focus: Clinical Research',37,'We are a fast-paced contract research organization (CRO) seeking an experienced writer with a background in medicine/healthcare, Pharma, clinical research, or drug development. Seeking a candidate for an ongoing working relationship.\r\n\r\n**Articles requirements**: Each article will have a 600-word minimum. We will provide the article topics. All research will be the writer’s responsibility (listing credible sources will be required). Must use H2s for section headings, list all sources/references, cite sources for statistics, etc., within the article. Do not use artificial intelligence writing tools.\r\n\r\n**Turnaround time**: Looking for an experienced writer who can deliver on a 2-day turnaround per topic (depending on the extent of the subject). Timelines can be discussed on a case by case basis.\r\n\r\n**Candidate requirements**:\r\n\r\n- 3+ years of professional writing\r\n- Experience in medical/health, Pharmaceuticals, clinical research, or drug development fields\r\n- Writing samples or online portfolio\r\n- Familiar with medical terminology\r\n- **Bonus**:\r\n- SEO experience\r\n- B2B marketing experience\r\n- Expertise in any of these therapeutic areas: cardiology, oncology, gastroenterology, neurology, dermatology, women’s health, or ophthalmology','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640402061277286401','-',7,'United States','Oakland',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-27 17:16:42',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
