(15432,'Wordpress Web Developer',3,'The Social Media Pros\r\n\r\nLocation: Remote\r\n\r\nAbout Us:\r\n\r\nThe Social Media Pros is a digital marketing agency specializing in the pressure washing industry. Our mission is to help our clients grow their businesses by providing them with high-quality, visually stunning, and highly functional websites. We take pride in our expertise in on-page SEO strategies and our well-defined SOP process for building websites that range from 5 to 25 pages. Our goal is to launch one or two websites per week, and we are now looking to expand our team with a talented and experienced WordPress and Elementor Web Developer.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nCollaborate with our design and content teams to build visually appealing and highly functional pressure washing websites using WordPress and Elementor.\r\n\r\nFollow our step-by-step SOP process for building websites to ensure a consistent and high-quality outcome.\r\n\r\nIntegrate on-page SEO strategies during the website build process to optimize the site\'s performance in search engines.\r\n\r\nTroubleshoot and resolve any technical issues that arise during the website development process.\r\n\r\nContinuously improve your skills and stay up-to-date with the latest trends and best practices in web development, WordPress, and Elementor.\r\n\r\nComplete website projects within the given timeline to meet our goal of launching one or two websites per week.\r\n\r\nProvide ongoing support and maintenance for completed websites as needed.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience as a WordPress and Elementor Web Developer.\r\n\r\nAbility to follow a detailed SOP process and adhere to deadlines.\r\n\r\nExcellent problem-solving and troubleshooting skills.\r\n\r\nStrong communication and collaboration skills, as well as the ability to work independently.\r\n\r\nA keen eye for design and attention to detail.\r\n\r\nAbility to manage multiple projects simultaneously and prioritize tasks effectively.\r\n\r\nCompensation:\r\nThe rate for this job will vary based on experience and website completion turnaround time.\r\n\r\nHow to Apply:\r\nPlease submit your resume, a portfolio of your previous work, and a brief cover letter explaining why you are the ideal candidate for this role. Be sure to highlight your experience with WordPress, Elementor, and on-page SEO strategies.\r\n\r\nWe are excited to welcome a new member to our growing team and look forward to reviewing your application.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640405207740047361','-',7,'United States','Springfield',1000.000,'Open this select menu',1000.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-27 17:28:56',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
