(15453,'Urgent Web Designer Needed for SquareSpace Website Revamp and Migration',18,'Description:\r\n\r\nWe are a Luxury Coworking Space in Los Angeles in need of a talented web designer who specializes in SquareSpace. We have an existing website hosted on Wordpress, but we are looking to switch to SquareSpace for its ease of use and flexibility. We also need a complete website revamp with a clean, modern design that is more lightweight and optimized for speed.\r\n\r\nIn addition, we need all our blog posts and backend meta data moved over from Wordpress to SquareSpace, so experience in website migration is a must.\r\n\r\nWe recently hired a web designer on Upwork, but unfortunately, the work was of poor quality and we were left in a bind. We have an advertising agency about to start promoting our business, so we need this project completed as soon as possible.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n• Expertise in SquareSpace web design and development\r\n• Experience in website revamping, optimization, and migration from Wordpress to SquareSpace\r\n• Strong portfolio showcasing clean, modern designs\r\n• Proven track record of meeting tight deadlines\r\n• Excellent communication and collaboration skills\r\n\r\nIf you\'re a talented web designer who can deliver high-quality work on time, we want to hear from you. This is an urgent project, and we are willing to pay a premium for top-notch talent. Please include your portfolio and relevant experience in your application.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640421227894960129','-',7,'United States','Santa Monica',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-27 18:32:27',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
