(15462,'Book Writing Help: The Power ofProximity',2,'eeking help on Christian based book on The Power of Proximity\r\n\r\n\r\nThe goal of the book is to teach that being around the right people (Proximity) can potentially make all of the difference between a life of squalor and one of success. I want the reader to understand that being in proximity with the right people and being humble enough to follow someone who has precisely the life  that they want and desire is the actual Power of Proximity.\r\n\r\nAre you seeking to loose weight? Get a degree? Advance your career? Save money? Have a better relationship? Grow spiritually?\r\n\r\nYou need PROXIMITY! Proverbs 13:20 Walk with the wise and become wise...\r\n\r\nLook around you and assess your current relationships. Perhaps your current relationships have become monolithic and are preventing you from tapping into ALL of your human potential.\r\n\r\nIf you are becoming stagnant it’s directly related to your relationships!\r\n\r\nFigure out how to place yourself in certain environments with people you admire. Strive to build relationships with those individuals whether they are near or far. Read everything they have written. Watch their videos. Ask them questions. Do what they do.\r\n\r\n\r\nOne Example: Carona Virus/6ft apart was all about proximity\r\n\r\n\r\n#ThePowerofProximity','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2044764','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-27 18:49:29',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
(15463,'Google Slide/ Powerpoint - designer to bring PODCAST Pitch Deck to life',11,'Color: Charcoal Gray + Crimson Red + White\r\nImage ideas: We\'ll provide / collaborate with artist on images.\r\n\r\nArtist needs to be creative and have the ability to take risk. The pitch deck needs to Pop creatively, it\'s not a corporate deck, the deck is to be made for Podcast entertainment.\r\n\r\nThe first draft #1 needs to be turned around within 48 (Tuesday evening, March 28th) hours upon accepting the job. The revisions will happen on day 3 (Wednesday March 29th) and the final needs to be completed by March 30th.\r\n\r\nWe’d like it built in Google Slides or Powerpoint.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01518e68209bdd98bc','-',7,'United States','Van Nuys',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-27 18:49:56',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
