(15484,'Quick Brand Identity Design + Packaging Mock Ups',2,'We are looking for a skilled professional to develop a cohesive brand identity, logo, and packaging mock-ups for a new snacking brand, Be Happy Snacking. The brand focuses on adaptogens and functional ingredients to promote energy, positivity, and overall well-being, with an initial product lineup of popcorn, trail mix, and a functional beverage. The goal is to create an adaptable brand identity that works across various snacking products, packaging, and future flavor drops in collaboration with social media creators.\r\n\r\nThis is unique - this may not be the final identity. We\'re looking to get this made with mock-ups quickly to show client concepts and get feedback. We will not be building a brand guideline and finalizing a full brand.\r\n\r\nObjective: Develop a cohesive identity, logo, and packaging mock-ups for Be Happy Snacking\'s popcorn (5oz large bag), trail mix (5oz stand-up bag), and a canned (12oz) functional beverage, showcasing the brand\'s energetic, positive, empowering, vibrant, and uplifting nature.\r\n\r\nTarget Audience: Health-conscious consumers aged 18-45, who value self-improvement, productivity, and positivity.\r\n\r\nBrand Descriptors:\r\n1. Energetic\r\n2. Positive\r\n3. Empowering\r\n4. Vibrant\r\n5. Uplifting\r\n\r\nBrand Story: Be Happy Snacking is dedicated to helping you live your best life by providing delicious and nutritious snacks powered by adaptogens and functional ingredients. We believe that every bite is an opportunity to stay energized, focused, and in control, so you can conquer your day with confidence and positivity.\r\n\r\nBrand Voice: Upbeat, empowering, and positive. The brand voice should inspire our audience to embrace a healthy lifestyle and focus on self-improvement through functional snacking.\r\n\r\nColor Palette: Vibrant, uplifting colors such as bright yellow, energizing orange, and lively green to evoke a sense of happiness and vitality.\r\n\r\nBranding Inspiration:\r\n1. Toodaloo\r\n2. Alani Nu\r\n3. Dear Beer\r\n4. Jerry Pop\r\n5. Feastables - Snack brand structure (chocolate bars, cookies, etc. under one brand) not for look & feel.\r\n\r\nDesign Requirements:\r\n1. Placeholder spot for an Umbrella company logo on the final design (think Nabsico in the top corner)\r\n2. Logo: Create an adaptable and recognizable logo representing the brand\'s energetic, positive, and uplifting nature.\r\n3. Packaging Mock-ups: Design packaging showcasing the vibrant color palette, brand voice, and adaptability for future product innovations.\r\n- popcorn (5oz large bag) - Popcorn is the focus for the first round. Product Name: Popcorn - 4 flavors that will be the big features of the branding. I will provide all flavors and ingredient details after contract.\r\n- trail mix (5oz stand-up bag) - 1 flavor\r\n- canned (12oz) functional beverage - 1 flavor\r\n\r\n4. Social Media Creator Collaboration: Ensure that the design allows for easy incorporation of special flavor drops or collaborations with large social media creators in the future.\r\n\r\nDesign Directions: Provide two distinct design directions that capture the brand identity and can be applied across various packaging formats.\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\n1. Two design directions for Be Happy Snacking\'s logo and packaging.\r\n2. Finalized logo and packaging mock-ups for popcorn (5oz large bag) 4 flavors, trail mix (5oz stand-up bag), and a can (12oz) functional beverage.\r\n\r\nTimeline:\r\n• Initial design concepts: 3/29/23\r\n• Feedback and revisions: 3/30/23\r\n• Final deliverables: 4/3/23','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640439717224456193','-',7,'United States','Santa Monica',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-27 19:46:10',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
