(15532,'WordPress Developer Needed for Refresh and Redesign of a Technology Recruiting Company Website',15,'We are a technology recruiting and staff augmentation company and are looking for an experienced and talented WordPress developer to refresh and redesign our website. Our goal is to create a professional, responsive, and user-friendly website that showcases our services and expertise while making it feel current and up-to-date. We will provide all the necessary photos and copy for the website.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n1. Proven experience in WordPress website development and design, including the ability to create custom themes and work with popular plugins.\r\n2. Strong understanding of responsive web design principles and best practices.\r\n3. Proficient in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and PHP.\r\n4. Experience with AWS hosting and the ability to set up and configure hosting environments.\r\n5. Strong understanding of SEO best practices and the ability to implement them within a WordPress website.\r\n6. Excellent communication skills and the ability to work closely with our team to ensure the project is completed on time and to our satisfaction.\r\n\r\nProject Scope:\r\n1. Refresh and redesign the existing website using WordPress, based on the provided photos and copy.\r\n2. Update the website\'s look and feel to be more modern, engaging, and in line with current design trends.\r\n3. Design and develop a responsive website with a clean and contemporary look.\r\n4. The website will consist of 10 main pages: Homepage, About Us, Recruitment Services, Staff Augmentation, Industries (with two subpages: Healthcare IT Staffing, Fintech Recruitment), Job Seekers, Testimonials, Blog, Contact Us, and Privacy Policy.\r\n5. Ensure that the website is hosted on AWS and configured properly for optimal performance and security.\r\n6. Implement SEO best practices, including proper URL structure, meta tags, header tags, and structured data markup.\r\n7. Provide a smooth handover and necessary training to our team for managing and updating the website.\r\nTo apply, please submit your portfolio showcasing your experience in WordPress website design and development, along with your estimated timeline for completing the project. We look forward to working with a talented developer who can bring our vision to life and make our website feel fresh and current','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640459265493716993','-',7,'United States','Maple',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-27',1,'2023-03-27',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-27 21:03:39',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
