(15560,'Simple client portal wire framing (Figma)',3,'To set up a customer portal with clear functionality, we require the following 5 views:\r\n\r\nFrontEnd\r\n1. Login with the option of \'lost password\'.\r\n\r\nBackend User\r\n2. A company-specific \'Create Request Form.\'\r\nFirst + Last Name (read only)\r\nCompany (read only)\r\nSource Language (dropdown)\r\nTarget Language (dropdown)\r\nDescription (text area)\r\nKostnadsställe/ref (input field)\r\nRequest a Quote /or/ Create Order (radio button)\r\nUpload source file(s)\r\nUpload reference file(s)\r\n\r\nA new form entry (form upload) results in a new pending request or order.\r\n\r\n3. Requests & Projects\r\nShow Requests OR Projects OR ALL\r\nShow list with request/project names, status (pending, in progress, completed, cancelled), view quote, download file(s) [only available when a project is completed]\r\n\r\nAdmin backend:\r\n4. Capability to add users in the backend, including their First Name, Last Name, Email, and Company.\r\n\r\n5. Edit a request/project\r\nA view where an admin can edit a request/project details, upload a quote to the project and also upload the completed file(s), change project status.\r\n\r\n// We want it to be very clean and simple (i.e. like Bootstrap). We think Figma is good to use. Your input and ideas on solutions are welcome. //\r\n\r\nThe project is very urgent - need fast project start','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640628872477691905','-',7,'United States','Lund',40.000,'Open this select menu',40.000,'2023-03-28',1,'2023-03-28',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-28 08:17:31',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
