(15627,'Inside Staffordshire Website Building Wordpress',3,'Project Title: Inside Staffordshire\r\n\r\nProject Description: The goal of this project is to create a bold and eye-catching website that provides a wealth of information about food, hotels, and local attractions in Staffordshire. The website will be a go-to resource for visitors and locals alike who are looking for information on the best places to eat, stay, and explore in the area.\r\n\r\nProject Deliverables:\r\n\r\nA website with a modern and attractive design that reflects the bold and eye-catching theme.\r\nAn easy-to-use navigation menu that allows visitors to quickly find the information they are looking for.\r\nHigh-quality content on food, hotels, and local attractions in Staffordshire.\r\nA space for advertising that is seamlessly integrated into the design of the website.\r\nA large logo prominently displayed on the website.\r\nSocial media integration to allow visitors to share information about the website with their friends and followers.\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nHomepage: The homepage should immediately grab the attention of visitors with bold, eye-catching images and a clear message about what the website offers. The homepage should also feature a prominent search bar that allows visitors to search for specific information.\r\nFood: The food section of the website should provide detailed information on the best restaurants, cafes, and bars in Staffordshire. The section should include reviews, menus, pricing, and contact information.\r\nHotels: The hotels section of the website should provide detailed information on the best places to stay in Staffordshire. The section should include reviews, pricing, and contact information.\r\nLocal Attractions: The local attractions section of the website should provide detailed information on the best places to explore in Staffordshire. The section should include descriptions, pricing, and contact information.\r\nAdvertising: The website should provide space for advertising that is seamlessly integrated into the design. Advertisements should be relevant to the content of the website and should not detract from the user experience.\r\nSocial Media Integration: The website should be integrated with popular social media platforms like Facebook, Twitter, and Instagram. This will allow visitors to easily share information about the website with their friends and followers.\r\nDesign Requirements:\r\n\r\nBold and eye-catching color scheme that reflects the theme of the website.\r\nHigh-quality images of food, hotels, and local attractions in Staffordshire.\r\nLarge logo prominently displayed on the website.\r\nEasy-to-use navigation menu that allows visitors to quickly find the information they are looking for.\r\nTimeline:\r\n\r\nDesign phase: 2 weeks\r\nContent creation: 4 weeks\r\nDevelopment: 6 weeks\r\nTesting and QA: 2 weeks\r\nLaunch: 1 week','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640736963827433473','-',7,'United States','Stoke-On-Trent',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-28',1,'2023-03-28',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-28 15:26:29',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(15628,'Shopify Web Designer and Migration Expert',4,'We are looking for a talented and experienced web designer to design a new site for us on Shopify and migrate our orders and customers from our current Squarespace site. The ideal candidate will have a proven track record of designing and building Shopify stores, as well as experience with Squarespace migrations.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Design and build a new Shopify site that meets our specific requirements\r\n- Migrate our orders and customers from our current Squarespace site to Shopify\r\n- Customize the Shopify theme to match our branding and design preferences\r\n- Ensure the site is responsive and mobile-friendly\r\n- Optimize the site for search engines and improve page load times\r\n- Provide ongoing support and maintenance as needed\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience with Shopify migrations from Squarespace\r\n- Strong knowledge of HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Liquid\r\n- Experience with Shopify themes and customizations\r\n- Knowledge of SEO best practices and page speed optimization\r\n- Excellent communication and project management skills\r\n- Strong attention to detail and ability to meet deadlines\r\n\r\nIf you meet the above requirements and are interested in this opportunity, please reach out!\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640738744188211201','-',7,'United States','na',700.000,'fixed',700.000,'2023-03-28',1,'2023-03-28',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-28 15:33:53',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
