(15694,'Quickbooks bookkeeping/accounting',18,'Med USA is a Utah-based medical billing/provider services company with a nationwide presence. We have been in business for over 40 years and Med USA provides practice management, payer credentialing and contracting, and full revenue-cycle management (RCM) services, including coding, billing, follow-up, and denial resolution.\r\n\r\nThe right candidate will have a helpful, positive attitude to assist our executive team with financial recording and respond to information requests. They must be organized and professional. The bookkeeper will be responsible for maintaining accurate financial records and ensuring timely and accurate reconciliations.\r\n\r\nDay to Day Responsibilities include:\r\n• Record and check accuracy of all accounting transactions\r\n• Prepare invoices\r\n• Reconcile bank and credit card statements\r\n• Reconcile and compose monthly financial reports\r\n• Assist the CFO with accounting matters\r\n• Enter data, maintain records, and create reports and financial statements\r\n• Comply with legal requirements\r\n• Work with all departments as necessary\r\n• Duties & responsibilities may be modified as directed by management\r\n\r\nMust Have:\r\n• Data entry skills along with a knack for numbers\r\n• Computer competency, including a working knowledge of Microsoft Excel, Outlook, and Word\r\n• Excellent communication skills, both written and verbal\r\n• Organizational, planning, accuracy, and time management skills\r\n• Ability to work quickly and efficiently with little oversight\r\n• Adherence to a high level of professional and ethical standards (including accordance with HIPAA standards)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640787552458190849','-',7,'United States','sandy',50.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-28',1,'2023-03-28',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-28 20:00:39',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
