(15716,'Shopify Dev For Full Time Celeb Marketing Agency',4,'Amazing opportunity to work with a leading marketing firm, 100+ employees and generating over 100 million $ for our clients.\r\n\r\nWe work with major A list celebs, movie stars and 1000s of small businesses that change lives + impact the world - you get to work on all these projects!\r\n\r\nOur own is @rudymawerlife and one of the worlds top marketers. Featured on the news, in Forbes and all the magazines + spoke on over 200+ stages about marketing.\r\n\r\nOur HQ is 50 employees in Tampa, Florida\r\n\r\nWe need 1-2 rockstar Shopify expert to join us on our question to hit 25 million $ this year.\r\n\r\nSounds good?\r\n\r\nWell, we’re looking for a full-time developer who can work most CRMS, Q/A Pages, Work in Sales force (we can train), and has EXTENSIVE experience in Wordpress and clickfunnels.\r\n\r\nAs mentioned, you will be working for some of our biggest 7-figure clients, celebrities, famous brands, medalists, elite achievers, etc. so the standards are high.\r\n\r\nYou will be working mostly on building new sites and managing big sites with 100s of sales. Sometimes, you will need to re build messy sites, sort 100s of products and do custom theme builds.\r\n\r\n***Please Note: This is NOT a job for interns or recent grads looking to build experience - minimum 3-5 years experience! ***\r\n\r\nYou must work daily, and provide a fast turnaround on urgent projects. If we want a small landing page, we want that a few hours later, not in 2 weeks.\r\n\r\nYou must attend regular daily meetings from 9am, and not have an agency or many other other clients distracting you.\r\n\r\nYou will be required to be online fully for 8hr a day at regular hours.\r\n\r\n***NO AGENCIES.\r\n\r\n***This is for you if you:\r\n\r\n– Want to be part of a growth-driven, high-energy team vs. picking up projects/assignments\r\n– Can provide high-quality work\r\n– Can work everyday\r\n– Have at least 3 years of experience\r\n– Can follow written guidelines and briefs\r\n– Are proactive and can juggle multiple priorities\r\n– Are confident in what you’re doing\r\n– Are comfortable using our messaging and video call software daily for communication\r\n\r\n***This is NOT for you if:\r\n\r\n– You need a supervisor/senior to work with you on every project\r\n– You can’t handle feedback or revisions\r\n– You would need more than 2 days to build one section or page\r\n– You don’t know the elements of a sales funnel, clickfunnels, Shopify, CRMs such as KEAP or Active Campaign, etc\r\n\r\nOur company is Mawer Capital\r\n\r\n***Pay:\r\nThis is long-term opportunity and you will be paid per hour.\r\n\r\n***WARNING: Do not apply if you don’t have an experience in the softwares listed above\r\n\r\nLooking forward to connecting and potentially bringing you on board!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/interview/uid/1640821329667059712','-',7,'United States','US',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-03-28',1,'2023-03-28',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-28 21:22:22',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
