(15719,'Website Design',4,'We are a nonprofit, education organization that provides character education curricula for teachers grades PreK through 6 and counselors. We have a template purchased via Themeforest. It\'s a Wordpress site but the template will need some modification. We provide more than 20 curricula for teachers and counselors, all downloadable. We need a fast system to take limited information and give the teacher access to the curriculum. We will be charging for \"out of state\" orders and will need a Stripe payment system. We have outlined 10 pages for the site. We had a website designer but he died suddenly. We have a sitemap. We have a graphic person who is selecting photos. Our current website is www.thefaceproject.org','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640991728935964672','-',7,'United States','North Garden',2000.000,'Open this select menu',2000.000,'2023-03-29',1,'2023-03-29',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-29 08:20:00',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(15720,'Custom WP theme development',3,'The main need is to develop re-designed custom content templates and navigation for the site. The content/backend is all there and ready to go, just needs a facelift. This could be accomplished by integrating an a custom template development. We do have a couple of themes that we were looking at for inspiration. We identified a starter color palette and mockups of a style template for main site pages and blog/podcast. We have template examples from a previous designer, There is also a new logo design that we were pretty happy with. All that being said, none of us is a professional designer. If your staff was to have another vision or what the site could be, most likely that will be better than what we came up with but I will be happy to show you what we have so far when the time is right.\r\n\r\nWe think we need to move from a classic to Gutenberg editor experience. There is existing custom business logic that may need to be updated for changes in templates. I’ve done most of the work there, but there may be little things, depending on what your implementation looks like.\r\n\r\nAll images are hosted in Google Cloud. There is only one copy of each image and we also integrated the imgix responsive image service to do resizing and optimization. All this is handled by the MediaCloud plugin.\r\n\r\n\r\nwe have a Backend Engineer, that can show you around the existing stack as well as the dev site that is currently hosted on Kinsta. Business logic is implemented as a mu-plugin that autoloads with PSR-4, the codebase is version controlled with Composer package manager and the dev site has CI/CD implemented with https://www.branchci.com/\r\n\r\n\r\nA stretch goal would be a Google maps component that has a map of Hawaii islands with interactive waypoints with information about the hotels that the agency books. The site is primarily a lead gen site and this project is looking to highlight that data and make it more available.\r\n\r\nexisting website is located here: https://hawaii-aloha.com','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1640992714382737409','-',7,'United States','Honolulu',6000.000,'Open this select menu',6000.000,'2023-03-29',1,'2023-03-29',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-29 08:23:00',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
