(15725,'Re-build a Photography/Photographers\' WordPress site based on ShowIt design',3,'I have been using a ShowIt template to build a new website. I want to use that design (roughly) to build out the site on Wordpress, which is where the original website is hosted. I believe Elementor or Kadence would be useful tools, but I need to have the capabilities for elements to overlay within the design. I would also like for the designer to have some creative input + UX & UI advice. I need to be able to maintain the site, so it is crucial for the designer/builder to train me in how to maintain and keep it up-to-date. I am somewhat familiar with WordPress (not coding), but have been successfully maintaining the original site for many years already.\r\n\r\nOverview:\r\n- Design Wordpress site based on ShowIt design\r\n- Tweak as needed and as advised based on UX/UI expertise\r\n- Use Elementor or Kadence (whichever can do overlayed elements, and if both can do overlays, then whichever is easiest to maintain)\r\n- Train me to continue maintenance on the site\r\n- Implement blog','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641009868404371457','-',7,'United States','na',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-03-29',1,'2023-03-29',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-29 09:31:40',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(15726,'UI Designer for a US Company',4,'We are a rapidly growing US-based company seeking an experienced and creative UI Designer to help us design the user interface for our new web-based application. We have a component library in Figma, and we need a talented individual who can utilize these components to create visually appealing and user-friendly individual pages for our application.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nCollaborate with our product and development teams to understand the project requirements and goals.\r\nUtilize our existing Figma component library to design cohesive and visually appealing individual pages.\r\nIncorporate user feedback and usability testing results to refine and iterate on designs.\r\nEnsure that designs align with our brand guidelines and overall vision.\r\nMeet project deadlines and deliver high-quality work.\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- At least 3 years of experience in UI design, with a strong portfolio showcasing web-based application projects.\r\n- Proficiency in using Figma, specifically with experience in working with component libraries.\r\n- Strong understanding of user-centered design principles and best practices.\r\n- Excellent visual design skills, including a keen eye for typography, color, and layout.\r\n- Ability to work collaboratively in a fast-paced environment and manage multiple projects simultaneously.\r\n- Excellent communication and presentation skills, with the ability to effectively communicate design concepts to team members.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641009770519953409','-',7,'United States','Brno',36.000,'perhour',36.000,'2023-03-29',1,'2023-03-29',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-29 09:33:07',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
