(15731,'Website update/refresh for a guitar lesson website.',3,'I have a website that started during the covid days as an \'information\' site about playing guitar.\r\n\r\nIt started as a fun project while I was hanging around playing guitar during covid, but lately, the site has been getting quite a few visitors every month. I am not even trying!\r\n\r\nI need to take the site to the next level both with design and marketing.\r\n\r\nI have tried to make it more of an affiliate site, but it does not look very good. Plus, I do not know what direction to take the site.\r\n\r\nI need someone who is an expert at building/refreshing WordPress sites (or anything that works), plus some expertise in building income-producing sites.\r\n\r\nHopefully, this sounds interesting and doable to someone. I will send the URL of the site after reviewing offers. (I don\'t want to just toss it out there)\r\n\r\nI published a budget for the project, but I am willing to spend more for someone good at this.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641023120792453121','-',7,'United States','Wesley Chapel',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-29',1,'2023-03-29',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-29 10:24:01',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
(15732,'Infographic and Design Creation',2,'Description:\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a creative agency to help us design a series of infographics and designs for an anti-racist research project. The purpose of these designs is to visually communicate the findings of our research and to provide positive and informative materials for our target audiences, including local authority leaders and librarians. We already have a project brief that outlines the scope, purpose, and target audiences of the designs. Start applications with a sentence containing Unreal\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDevelop a design strategy that connects acquisitions, collections, and front-line librarians\r\nCreate visually appealing and informative infographics and designs based on the project brief\r\nIncorporate key data points and quotes from the research into the designs\r\nDevelop designs that are suitable for different target audiences, from higher leadership to mid-management\r\nDevelop Welsh and English designs\r\nWork collaboratively with the project team to refine and finalize the designs\r\nDeliver designs in a variety of formats, suitable for web and print\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience in creating high-quality, visually appealing infographics and designs\r\nDemonstrated ability to effectively communicate complex information through visual design\r\nStrong proficiency in graphic design software such as Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, and InDesign\r\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills\r\nExperience working with clients in the research, education or non-profit sectors preferred\r\nAbility to deliver high-quality work on a tight deadline','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016000e7577c8220bb','-',7,'United States','Brough',65.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-03-29',1,'2023-03-29',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-29 10:27:17',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
