(15734,'To create an ecommerce website with five pages and a shop',3,'I am looking for someone to design a website to my specifications a word press website. I do not want any software used that is not compatible with ezoic such as elementor as I would like to place adverts in the future.\r\n\r\nThe main thing is the site ownership and control will reside with me, I do not want any software used where I am tied into the designer or where I can not buy the license for. I want all passwords to be transferred to me on completion.\r\n\r\nI am looking for five pages, a home page, a contact us page, an about us page, a terms, and conditions page, and a blog.\r\n\r\nI am also looking for this to be an e-commerce site so would need a fully functional shop- my needs are a shop where I have full editing control over and I want the stock shop images to have SEO, I want my shop stock to show up on google images search.\r\n\r\nI have a few websites that have elements that I like so want a designer who will look at all these elements and create a website to my taste to do what I want.\r\n\r\nI want the SEO for the website done however I also would like the designer to be available / willing to do maintenance on the site any time I have problems or want to introduce upgrades or changes. However i want full control to operate the site daily myself.\r\n\r\nPlease include some examples of your work.\r\n\r\nMy budget is £1500 to be paid in three installments,\r\n£500 when the site is created,\r\n£500 when the shop, blog, and SEO is complete\r\n£500 final payment when all bugs, tweaks have been made and the site is operational.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641026646564089857','-',7,'United States','Mountain Ash',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-03-29',1,'2023-03-29',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-29 10:37:56',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
