(15743,'Visually Stunning and SEO Optimized Website for my Roofing Company',4,'I need a new website for my Roofing Company from scratch. I would like it to be very graphically appealing and high end in appearance. I need it to drive action steps and function with widgets from my CRM. I will only entertain bids from designers that can show me sites they have built specifically for the service industry and preferably ones that can demonstrate some traffic and site score data etc. as well.\r\n\r\nSchedule will also dictate who I choose. I need to get a site up quickly so I would like to start with a wireframe to determine the specific flow and layout of the site and for the sake of speed, get a functional landing page up as quickly as possible that will set the tone for the style and layout of the site and then over the remaining weeks of the project, add pages and content as it is completed.\r\n\r\nLike any modern site, mobile and various browser compatibility is a must and I welcome ideas to add functionality and differentiate the site from my competition and add value as it relates to lead conversion and overall site ranking on search engines.\r\n\r\nIf you plan to send me the same copy and paste response with my name added to it that you send to all opportunities, you will likely not receive a response from me. I read responses thoroughly and will respond back to those that touch on my specific needs and provide insight into you plan to approach and successfully complete my project.\r\n\r\nThank you for taking the time to read this and I look forward to your response.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~015983d3b351c9f490','-',7,'United States','Fort Myers',5000.000,'fixed',5000.000,'2023-03-29',1,'2023-03-29',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-29 11:36:51',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
