(15749,'Logo/ brand design for a vacation rental business',10,'Hey! I am looking for 2 different logo designs. One is for the vacation management business and the other is for a specific house.\r\nOur theme is very outdoorsy, We want a strong message of self care and connection to nature.\r\nI will attach files of logos I like the style of.\r\nFirst logo is: Marrington Vacation Rentals\r\nThe attached logo that says future is something I think would be cool to mimick. If you could create an M that has trees or a house or mountain or something incorporated into the M. Then under it \"Marrington\" and under that \"vacation rentals\" I really like the font that is used in the \"future\" example logo.\r\nSecond logo: Basecamp @ Mt. hood. I can send you the airbnb link so you can get an idea of what this cabin is.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641055540138684416','-',7,'United States','Portland',300.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-03-29',1,'2023-03-29',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-29 12:32:52',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
