(15845,'Home Health Medical Coder, Oasis Specialist, POC, Notes Reviewer',30,'Home Health\r\n\r\nICD-10 CODER Responsibilities\r\n\r\n-Maintains a minimum of 95% overall coding quality score in diagnostic coding.\r\n-Maintains the productivity expectations as defined by the department standard for home care services.\r\n-Works closely with clinical team members for corrections/updates/clarifications to either the 485/POC, or the OASIS.\r\n\r\n\r\nOASIS REVIEWER Responsibilities\r\n\r\n-Oasis Review and suggested corrections\r\n-Abstracting information from the Medicare OASIS D form and other medical records.\r\n-Reviewing the 485 Plan of Care for compliance.\r\n-Reviewing Face to Face Documentation for regulatory compliance.\r\n-Maintains a minimum of 95% overall coding quality score in diagnostic coding.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNOTES REVIEWER Job Description:\r\n\r\n-Review clinical documentations (SN Visits, PT Visits, OT Visits, 60 day summaries, Plan of Care, Evaluations, and OASIS.) to ensure that it meets necessary requirements in compliance with federal and state laws.\r\n-Ensure that necessary orders, communication notes and supporting documents are attached to support the need for care.\r\n-Coordinate with department representatives involved via different communication tools\r\n-Analyze ongoing care and provide recommendations to supervisors\r\n-Provide insights to improve processes.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nQUALIFICATIONS\r\n\r\n-6 months coding experience preferred\r\n-6 months OASIS review experience preferred\r\n-6 months experience in home health and/or hospice QA review preferred\r\n-Certification in home health coding or Oasis Review (HCS-D or BCHH-C in ICD-10 and COS-C) a plus','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641061271929901057','-',7,'United States','Carolina',15.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-03-29',1,'2023-03-29',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-29 19:47:53',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
