(15859,'Email Graphic Designer',20,'Job Summary:\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a talented and experienced Email Graphic Designer to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for designing and creating visually appealing and effective emails that will engage and captivate our audience. The Email Graphic Designer will work closely with the marketing team to develop creative and innovative designs that align with our brand and marketing objectives.\r\n\r\nIm only interested in freelancers. NO AGENCIES\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities/ Requirements:\r\n\r\n- MUST HAVE A PROVEN TRACK RECORD (Gotta show emails designs as well as the reults).\r\n\r\n- MUST be familiar with Klaviyo\r\n\r\n- speak good english\r\n\r\n- Design visually engaging email campaigns that effectively communicate marketing messages and engage our audience\r\n\r\n- Create graphics, icons, and other design elements that enhance the overall look and feel of the emails\r\n\r\n- Collaborate with the marketing team to develop creative briefs and translate them into visual designs\r\n\r\n- Ensure that all designs are consistent with our brand guidelines and marketing objectives\r\n\r\n- Optimize email designs for mobile devices and different email clients\r\n\r\n- Test and troubleshoot email designs to ensure that they render correctly across different email clients and devices\r\n\r\n- Stay up-to-date with design trends, emerging technologies, and best practices for email design\r\n\r\nIf you are a creative, detail-oriented, and experienced Email Graphic Designer with a passion for designing visually appealing and effective email campaigns, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity.\r\n\r\nP.S.: The price is a placeholder. Not actual pay','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01135c3ae2c632b0bc/apply/','-',7,'United States','na',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-29',1,'2023-03-29',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-29 20:58:10',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
(15860,'Blogs writer about keto diet healthy life style and nutrition ( should use frase or surfer seo )',37,'Hello im looking for medical seo blog writers who are able to deliver an original content with exceptional depth to the topic must be expert in the keto diet and nutrition topic health in general and must be native english being a dietitian is an added value\r\n\r\nA writer know how to do deep topics and keyword research to understand the intent of the topics and ability to dig deeper to find quiestion and answer them .\r\n\r\nAll the writiers im working with deliver the content seo optemized with surfer seo or frase with all the recommended number of word count and photos internal links and external links recomended by those tools.\r\n\r\nKindly read the description very well and make sure that everything mentioned are applicable to you to not waste my time nor yours\r\n\r\nI pay (0.008) cent per word the project is for long term and open ill repeat the rate for 100 words that would be (0.8 ) cent\r\n\r\nTo make sure that you have read all the post when you apply add the word ( understood ) in the subject so i know you have read and understand and your qualified for this job other wise ill ignore any message dont have this secret word\r\n\r\n\r\nKindly if you dont agree to terms you have read here dont waste your time or mine and apply\r\n\r\nI prefer to work with someone who is an subject matter expert.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641183678598942721','-',7,'United States','Riyadh',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-03-29',1,'2023-03-29',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-29 21:02:00',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
