(15864,'Squarespace website designer needed for online nutrition coaching business',3,'We are a group of very experienced, licensed registered dietitian nutritionists in need of an updated website. Our new website will 1) explain what we offer and how we work in a VERY simple and easy-to-understand manner, 2) earn the trust of prospective clients through beautiful design and tasteful positioning of our credentials, press, and client reviews - which we have a lot of and 3) enable prospective clients to book a complimentary Zoom nutrition assessment session with one of our professionals.\r\n\r\nOur current site is here heatherbauer.com but we need something that sells the group and not just Heather! This is provided to give you a sense of our high bar and design standard.\r\n\r\nWe have been in business for a long time and know exactly what we want (i.e. the pages we need, site architecture, and copy. We also have all the backend tech in place to make this work.\r\n\r\nWe need someone that:\r\n*has extensive Squarespace web design experience\r\n*loves making good, clean, beautiful, photography-intensive websites that tell a story and earn the trust of prospective customers\r\n*understands SEO and analytics\r\n*understands sales funnels and dynamics\r\n*can make graphics that explain our service (i.e. showing a nutritionist and client on a video call or communicating via text message\r\n*is a perfectionist\r\n*is cool and fun to work with\r\n\r\nGood to have knowledge of (but not required)\r\n*Mindbody and their branded web plugin/application\r\n*Calendly or similar\r\n*Google analytics\r\n*PPC ad platforms and relationship to website and conversion funnels','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641187794745823233?success','-',7,'United States','Westport',5000.000,'fixed',5000.000,'2023-03-29',1,'2023-03-29',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-29 21:18:16',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
