(15879,'LeadPages designer and copywriter',3,'Job Description:\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a talented and creative LeadPages Landing Page Designer and Copywriter to help us design and write copy for a new landing page. The landing page will be used for experimentation purposes and should be quick to complete. The successful candidate will create a compelling and effective landing page that will drive leads and generate sales. This experiment is grant-funded via a non-profit wanting to upskill tech talent with our nano-courses.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Design a visually appealing and effective LeadPages landing page\r\n- Write clear, concise, and compelling copy for the landing page\r\n- Collaborate with the founder to ensure the landing page is aligned with our brand and marketing goals\r\n- Provide suggestions and recommendations to improve the landing page\'s effectiveness\r\n- Complete the project within the agreed-upon timeframe and budget\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\n- Demonstrable experience designing LeadPages landing pages\r\n- Strong copywriting skills with a proven track record of writing effective copy\r\n- Excellent attention to detail and ability to work independently\r\n- Strong communication skills and ability to work collaboratively with others\r\n- Proficient in LeadPages and other relevant design tools\r\n- Familiarity with SEO best practices\r\n- Quick and scrappy approach with the ability to work on tight deadlines\r\n\r\nIf you are a beginner with a quick and scrappy approach or an expert with years of experience, we encourage you to apply. https://biztechadcademy.org\r\n\r\nWe are looking for someone who is passionate about creating effective landing pages and is committed to delivering high-quality work.\r\n\r\nPlease review our website and provide a fixed price for the project. We are looking to hire immediately for ads to start running next week.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641365868506517505','-',7,'United States','Centerton',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 09:05:49',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
