(15890,'Create a modern Storybrand e-commerce website',3,'We currently have a successful e-commerce website that has been operating for 3-4 years. As our company has grown, our message has got a bit confusing. So we need a revamp of the website and message. We make B2B sales in the cannabis market. We are NOT a cannabis company but an ancillary business. We sell vape hardware to cannabis labs.\r\n\r\nWe hired a Storybrand brand specialist to outline everything; now, we need the website and content. It is a Shopify Plus website.\r\n\r\nWe need the website to be clean, cool, modern, tech-forward, and Storybrand. We need it to surpass the user experiences of our competition.\r\n\r\nWe\'ll also need ongoing maintenance on the website.\r\n\r\nPlease send me:\r\n-Estimated project cost\r\n-Estimated time needed\r\n-Examples of your work','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641383586068713473','-',7,'United States','Sacramento',12000.000,'Open this select menu',12000.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 10:22:02',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
