(15898,'Wordpress Website Designer and Developer',15,'We are looking for a skilled WordPress developer to help improve and enhance the user experience of our websites. Our websites are currently built on WordPress and we need someone who can take them to the next level in terms of design quality, website speed, and overall user experience. We open the every idea and advice for this process.\r\n\r\nPlease see the current website:\r\nhttps://www.app-consultoria.com/\r\n\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nAssess the current websites and identify areas for improvement in terms of design, website speed, and user experience.\r\nCollaborate with our team to come up with a plan to improve the websites and provide input on user experience standards.\r\nDevelop and implement changes to the websites that improve user experience, design quality, and website speed.\r\nEnsure the websites are fully functional and optimized for search engines and user engagement.\r\nProvide ongoing maintenance and support for the websites.\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nExtensive experience with WordPress development and customization.\r\nStrong understanding of user experience standards and how to apply them to website design.\r\nProficiency in HTML, CSS, PHP, and JavaScript.\r\nKnowledge of SEO best practices and website optimization techniques.\r\nExcellent communication skills and ability to collaborate effectively with team members.\r\nA portfolio of previous WordPress projects with examples of design quality and UX improvements.\r\n\r\n\r\nBudget: We are open to all applications and will consider all budgets for this project. Please include your proposed budget in your application\r\n\r\nWe will consider all budget proposals for this project, and while we appreciate competitive pricing, please note that the selection of the freelancer will not be solely based on the bid amount. We will also evaluate factors such as experience, skills, portfolio, and client feedback to ensure the best fit for our project.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this project and meet the requirements, please apply with your resume, portfolio, and proposed budget. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0132deaa2ae1769b4a','-',7,'United States','Ankara',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 11:23:25',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
