(15901,'Expert Pitch Deck Designer & Copywriter for Personal Care Brand in the Beauty Industry (US Market)',11,'We are launching a unique personal care brand in the beauty industry and are currently preparing for a small pre-launch, pre-seed funding round. We are seeking an expert pitch deck designer and fundraising specialist with a strong background in storytelling and copywriting to help us elevate our existing pitch deck.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will have a proven track record of creating successful pitch decks for startups in the beauty industry, and possess excellent design and copywriting skills. You will be responsible for taking our ready deck, creating variations, and making improvements to help us secure the necessary funding.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nReview and analyze our existing pitch deck to identify areas for improvement\r\nCreate multiple variations of the pitch deck, tailored to different investor audiences\r\nDevelop compelling and persuasive storytelling that showcases our unique personal care brand\r\nWrite strong and engaging copy that effectively communicates our value proposition and business model\r\nDesign visually appealing and professional slides that convey our brand identity\r\nCollaborate with our team to ensure the pitch deck is aligned with our overall strategy and objectives\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience as a pitch deck designer and copywriter, preferably in the beauty industry\r\nStrong portfolio showcasing successful pitch decks and fundraising campaigns\r\nExceptional storytelling, copywriting, and visual design skills\r\nAbility to create and edit content in a variety of formats (e.g., PowerPoint, Keynote, Google Slides)\r\nKnowledge of current design trends and best practices in the beauty industry\r\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills\r\nDetail-oriented and able to work under tight deadlines\r\nTo apply, please submit:\r\n\r\nA brief cover letter explaining your relevant experience and why you\'re the best fit for this project\r\nYour portfolio showcasing examples of pitch decks and fundraising campaigns you have worked on, particularly in the beauty industry\r\nAny testimonials or references from previous clients\r\nWe look forward to receiving your application and exploring the potential of working together on this exciting project.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01da4c7bd80bdc243a','-',7,'United States','Ajman',120.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 11:41:16',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
