(15925,'Web Designer - UI/UX Design Skills Required',3,'We are seeking a talented freelance web designer to help us redesign our website and design a new one with a new structure. The ideal candidate will have a strong portfolio showcasing their design skills, a solid understanding of user experience (UX) and user interface (UI) design principles, and a keen eye for detail. You will work closely with our development and marketing teams to create websites that meet their needs and exceed their expectations.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nRedesign the existing website and create visually appealing website layouts, graphics, and icons that align with the brand image, UX, and UI goals.\r\n\r\nDesign wireframes and prototypes to guide the development process and ensure design elements are implemented correctly\r\n\r\nCollaborate with developers to ensure designs are feasible, performant, and accessible.\r\n\r\nConduct user research and testing to inform design decisions and iterate on designs based on feedback.\r\n\r\nStay up-to-date with design trends, best practices, and emerging technologies to ensure our websites are innovative and competitive.\r\n\r\nCommunicate design concepts and ideas to teams and incorporate feedback into final designs.\r\n\r\nEnsure design deliverables are completed on time, within budget, and meet quality standards.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n3+ years of professional web design experience, with a strong portfolio showcasing your design skills and process\r\nProficiency in design tools such as Adobe Photoshop, Sketch, Figma, or similar\r\nExperience with responsive design and design systems\r\nSolid understanding of UX and UI principles and best practices\r\nStrong communication and collaboration skills, and ability to present design concepts and ideas to teams\r\nAvailability to work remotely and communicate via email, phone, and video conferencing\r\nExperience working as a freelancer or remote contractor preferred\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this freelance web designer opportunity, please submit your resume, cover letter, and portfolio for consideration. Please also include your hourly rate and availability for the project.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641451407679164417?success','-',7,'United States','San Mateo',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 14:45:32',NULL,7,3,NULL,133),
