(15929,'Building a responsive Webflow website',3,'We are looking for a skilled web developer to create a landing page for our IT outsourcing company. The landing page will be the primary point of contact for our clients, showcasing our services, expertise, and past projects. The landing page will also feature a blog section to provide valuable content and establish our brand as a thought leader in the industry.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nLanding Page Design: The landing page should be modern, professional, and visually appealing, reflecting our brand image. It should be optimized for lead generation and conversion, encouraging visitors to explore our services and get in touch with us.\r\n\r\nServices Section: The landing page should have a clear and concise section that highlights our services. This section should provide a brief overview of each service and include a call-to-action that encourages visitors to learn more about our offerings.\r\n\r\nProjects Section: The landing page should feature a section that showcases our past projects. This section should include a selection of our best work, with high-quality images and brief descriptions. Each project should link to a separate page with more detailed information.\r\n\r\nBlog Section: The landing page should have a dedicated blog section that features our latest blog posts. This section should be updated regularly with relevant and engaging content that establishes our brand as a thought leader in the industry.\r\n\r\nMobile Responsive: The landing page should be mobile-responsive and optimized for all screen sizes and devices.\r\n\r\nSEO-Friendly: The landing page should be optimized for search engines, including meta tags, alt tags, and keyword-rich content.\r\n\r\nCMS Integration: The landing page should be developed using a content management system (CMS) that allows us to easily update and manage the content.\r\n\r\nIf you are an experienced web developer with a strong portfolio of landing page design and development, we encourage you to submit a proposal for this project. Please include your estimated timeline and budget for completing the project, along with any relevant experience and samples of your work.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641452289058476033','-',7,'United States','texas',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 14:54:10',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
