(15982,'Design Kiss-Cut Sticker Sheets',2,'I need a graphic designer to make six different designs for a sheet of kiss-cut stickers. Attached are the assets. The following specifications must be adhered to:\r\n\r\n\r\n1. Sheet size: 8.5 x 4\"\r\n\r\n2. Full Color\r\n\r\n3. Each sheet of stickers needs to include the following:\r\n\r\n     a. Five sayings all from the same animal and include the following.\r\n\r\n          i. The saying, along with the name of the animal\r\n\r\n          ii. The image of the animal\r\n\r\n          iii. The Insight Works logo\r\n\r\n     b. A stand-alone image of the associated animal\r\n\r\n     c. A stand-alone image of the Insight Works logo\r\n\r\n4. The file type must be either PSD or AI and must include a layer showing the outline of each sticker to be used for the die-cut.\r\n\r\n     a. It is preferred that the kiss-cut outline follow the contour of the design rather than just a rectangle or standard shape.\r\n\r\n5. Be creative with the typography.\r\n\r\n6. Corporate colors are as follows:\r\n\r\n     a. #3399cc (primary)\r\n\r\n     b. #ff9933\r\n\r\n     c. #6eb644\r\n\r\n7. Refer to https://www.dmsiworks.com/ to get an idea of the look and feel of the company. Sticker designs should generally match.\r\n\r\n\r\nSheet 1: Barcoding Bear\r\n\r\n    \"The journey of a barcode is not just a physical one, but a journey of knowledge, understanding, and insight.\"\r\n    \"In the world of barcode scanning, accuracy is the foundation of trust.\"\r\n    \"I scan barcodes, therefore I ensure accuracy.\"\r\n    \"All that we know about our inventory is the result of what we scan with barcode scanners.\"\r\n    \"Barcode accuracy fosters trust.\"\r\n\r\n\r\nSheet 2: Barcoding Bear\r\n\r\n    \"The value of a barcode scan lies not in the scan itself, but in the data accuracy it provides.\"\r\n    \"Excellence in inventory management is a habit of accurate barcode scanning.\"\r\n    \"The only way to deal with inventory inaccuracies is to scan barcodes effectively.\"\r\n    \"Barcode scanning brings happiness to inventory accuracy.\"\r\n    \"Inventory excellence hinges on scanning.\"\r\n\r\n\r\nSheet 3: Production Puffin\r\n\r\n    \"Scheduling mirrors commitment to productivity.\"\r\n    \"Production scheduling speaks louder than production targets.\"\r\n    \"Efficiency in production management is a habit of effective scheduling.\"\r\n    \"The only way to deal with production inefficiencies is to schedule them effectively.\"\r\n    \"A well-crafted production schedule is a reflection of the care and attention to detail we have for our manufacturing process.\"\r\n\r\n\r\nSheet 4: Production Puffin\r\n\r\n    \"Production scheduling brings happiness to efficiency.\"\r\n    \"Know thy production schedule to know thy production capacity.\"\r\n    \"In the world of production scheduling, time is our most precious resource.\"\r\n    \"The only true wisdom in production management is in knowing you need to schedule production.\"\r\n    \"The act of scheduling production is not just a physical one, but a reflection of our commitment to efficiency and productivity.\"\r\n\r\n\r\nSheet 5: Packaging Platypus\r\n\r\n    \"Confident shipping brings peace of mind.\"\r\n    \"Sender\'s character shines through meticulous packaging.\"\r\n    \"Accuracy in shipping management is a habit of effective parcel handling.\"\r\n    \"A well-packed parcel is a reflection of the care and respect we have for its recipient.\"\r\n    \"The only true wisdom in shipping management is in knowing the importance of the parcels being shipped.\"\r\n\r\n\r\nSheet 6: Packaging Platypus\r\n\r\n    \"Shipping success thrives on will, desire, and care.\"\r\n    \"In the world of parcel shipping, accuracy is the foundation of trust.\"\r\n    \"The superior package is carefully packaged, labeled, and shipped with care.\"\r\n    \"A package well-prepared and shipped is a reflection of the sender\'s character and attention to detail.\"\r\n    \"Shipping breeds confidence. Confidence in shipping breeds peace of mind for both the sender and the recipient.\"\r\n\r\n\r\nAttachments','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2047798','-',7,'United States','-',250.000,'fixed',850.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 17:23:40',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
