(16007,'Design brand package for new ecommerce store',2,'I am looking for assistance with designing a brand package for our new e-commerce store. We have our title, brand recognition strategy, and concept nailed down. We need someone who is experienced in marketing across various platforms (digital and print) that can translate these ideas from paper to the visual world. Ideally, this would include a logo, as well as a graphic design package that would be fluid enough to be used on our website, social media, print publications, etc. We plan to launch by May 1, so designs would need to be ready far enough in advance to integrate by that date.\r\n\r\nPost launch, we will be no doubt need assistance updating our content (new graphics for updated content / labels for new products), so let us know if that is a service you offer on a contract basis and what your rate would be.\r\n\r\nBudget is negotiable, however be prepared to demonstrate your work and justify your rate. The ability to grasp our concept and translate it is the primary concern. However, time is of the essence as regards to our launch date, so please take into consideration before applying whether or not you can meet this deadline. We will require you to sign an NDA (Non - Disclosure Agreement).','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641513165639716865?success','-',7,'United States','Milton',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 18:51:04',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
