(16009,'Create GIF for Men\'s Jewelry Brand',2,'Podium is a men\'s jewelry brand based in Chicago that is launching a custom engraveable offering. Customers have the ability to get names, birthdays, coordinates, or sayings engraved on their bracelets. We want to create a single GIF for social media use that would show in real-time the ability to customize a piece of jewelry. The primary image we would want to be of a section of our bracelet. Below that image is a little text box. The gif plays through people typing in phrases and names (with ASMR sounds of typing happening) and the phrases and names rendering on the bracelet, as people are typing. This shows our new product brought to life, in real-time. Looking for intermediate to advanced graphic designers that can bring this to life!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641514648344145921?success','-',7,'United States','Miami Beach',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 18:57:15',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
(16010,'Sweatshirt design for a biker group',10,'We are looking for a design to go on the back of a sweatshirt.\r\n\r\nWe want a grim reaper tending to a bonfire that has 8 skulls in it.\r\nWe want the group name of JoyRiderz and the slogan FAAFO in the image. We want this gothic looking and think bikers art.\r\n\r\nIMPORTANT - we will not accept for any stolen images and will give proper reviews if we receive this','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641515192687726593?success','-',7,'United States','Ingleside',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 19:01:04',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
(16011,'Book Cover Design',2,'My name is Dr. Cedric Alford. I am in need a book design that will be used for a series of publications. My go-to-market name will be The Dr Ced, a play on \"the doctor said\". These books will cover everything from women in tech leadership, to healthy marriages and healthy relationships for teens. So, I want to create a book cover design that integrates my logo, a photo based on the topic, and some excellent typography. I am thinking more of the \"Chicken soup...\" and/or \"Dummy\'s\" type of series. I need some thoughts for how to leverage this common design for some disparate topics. The next step will be designing for each of the online book selling channels. I would like the book cover to show the front, back and spine.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641516263224643585','-',7,'United States','Sachse',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'Fixed Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 19:03:25',NULL,9,3,NULL,140),
