(16015,'Foster & Thrive | Animated gif for website needed',2,'I’m looking to complete Motion Graphics work. The work will require 1 freelancer. I anticipate the project will last a a few days.\r\n\r\nI am looking for a motion graphics artist to create an animated GIF using four different ampersand icons. We will provide the amersands to you as AI files, these need to build and morph from one to the other and loop. This will be used as the graphic when a web page is loading. We may also end up using in other instances as well (social media, motion graphics for video content, etc) - but the first usage will be for the website so the file size should be kept to a minimum. I am still awaiting web specs for this particular piece.\r\n\r\nThe build does not need to go in the order the icons are shown in the attached. If the lines connect better in a different order, we are open to that.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641520150728740865?success','-',7,'United States','Santa Clara',400.000,'perhour',400.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 19:19:13',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
