(16022,'Medical Billing',21,'Assist with Claim filing -related inquiries. Medical terminology knowledge is a must including ICD10, modifier requirements, and CPT coding.\r\n\r\nStrong follow-up skills are essential, as applicants will need to follow up on rejected and denied claims and underpayments, using the Practices electronic health record and/or payers Explanation of Benefits forms.\r\n\r\nPrepare and submit billing data and medical claims to insurance companies.\r\nEnsure the patient’s payment is accurate and up to date.\r\nPrepare bills and invoices, and document amounts due to medical procedures and services.\r\n\r\nInvestigate and appeal denied claims.\r\n\r\nCharge is based on percentage of successful payments from all claims submitted -long term partnership desired based on experience.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641423136879116289','-',7,'United States','Snellville',100.000,'fixed',18.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 19:47:31',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
(16023,'Social Media Marketing Manager',5,'Hello there!\r\nMy name is Anan and I am the founder of Berry Social. Berry Social is a marketing agency that specializes in helping dental clinics with their online presence, generating new customers and customer retention.\r\nWe have a social media manager and we are looking for a talented and experienced Marketing Manager to oversee the marketing strategies and campaigns for our clients. As the Marketing Manager, you will be responsible for developing and implementing effective marketing plans that will increase the visibility of our client\'s clinics, attract new patients, and maintain our reputation as a trusted provider of high-quality marketing services.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n-Develop and implement comprehensive marketing strategies to promote our dental clinics, services, and brand.\r\n-Identify and target new patient demographics through market research and analysis.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641528806357880833','-',7,'United States','-',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 19:54:21',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
