(16026,'Logo Update/Re-design',10,'Hello!\r\n\r\n*PLEASE READ THE ENTIRE POST FIRST BEFORE SUBMITTING ANY APPLICATION*\r\n\r\nWe are a small group of companies based in Western Australia. We design and import European women\'s fashion footwear into Australia and New Zealand.\r\n\r\nOur business name is Neo and we have a number of different labels/subsections of the Neo brands.\r\n\r\nNeo is the mainline, higher price point label.\r\nNu by Neo (or nuxneo) is our diffusion, more mainstream label.\r\n\r\nThe Neo logo was updated in the last few years and we are now looking to update the Nu by Neo logo.\r\n\r\nAttached to this post are:\r\n\r\n*The current Neo logo\r\n*The original Nu by Neo logo (no longer in use)\r\n*The most recent updated to the Nu by Neo logo that is currently in use','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641531731251580929?success','-',7,'United States','Fremantle',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 20:04:45',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
