(16030,'Semi-Rebrand needed for Real Estate company',2,'Hey guys,\r\n\r\nSearching for someone who can take a brand I have created for my real estate company and give it the touches it needs to be timeless, classic, elegant- as it already is but I want a talented designer who understands the art I have created with the brand.\r\n\r\nThe logo is attached, and you can see our website here -\r\nwww , maisongarde . com\r\n\r\nWhat i\'m looking for is someone who can create a similar style of typography and also create an emblem/logo as I have done with the M (I think it can be stronger).\r\n\r\nThe inspiration for the design of the brand was taken from a lot of luxury fashion brands- such as casablanca, gucci, audemars piguet, etc.\r\n\r\nWhat would be amazing, is if I could have an monogram design / logo similar to what I have attached.\r\n\r\nI\'m open for suggestions, but looking someone who understands and can design these \'sans serif\' type of logos and gets the emblem / monogram thing!\r\n\r\nThanks so much','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641536226274594817?success','-',7,'United States','London',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 20:25:10',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
