(16032,'Logo for Coaching Practice',10,'So I need a logo for my coaching practice - \"Jim McGee Coaching\".\r\n\r\nIt should have an image / SVG / icon / logo / whatever you call it and the name \"Jim McGee Coaching\".\r\n\r\nHere\'s my website: https://jimmcgeecoaching.com\r\n\r\nMy color palette is attached in SVG - the green is the main color; after that dark blue is secondary.\r\n\r\nCurrently:\r\n\r\n-The logo icon is too feminine for my taste.\r\n-Also, the main image at the top of the home page is too feminine -I like the dark, calm, peaceful vibe of the water and the lilypads or whatever they are, but the flower is a little too girly.\r\n\r\nI like the vibe of the attached \"Home Page Image 6\" - peaceful, serene, and not too girly.\r\n\r\nThe new logo needs to have the following vibes:\r\n\r\n-Primarily masculine, although it shouldn\'t turn off female clients\r\n-Healing\r\n-Putting broken things back together\r\n-Peaceful, serence\r\n-Building something for the future\r\n-Growth\r\n\r\nIt doesn\'t have to be white necessarily; I could make the header white and have the logo contrast on that.\r\n\r\nThe fonts I use are all Google Fonts.\r\n\r\nVollkorn\r\nVollkorn SC\r\nLato\r\n\r\nPerhaps the Logo should be Vollkorn SC I\'m thinking for \"Jim McGee Coaching\"','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641538293831569409?success','-',7,'United States','Tucson',100.000,'perhour',100.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 20:31:59',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
