(16034,'Poster',2,'ASK: Design a poster for a Mother-Daughter event that celebrates \"Living Your Best Life\" and promises a fun-filled day of laughter, learning, and love where participants will create a deeper bond and learn about the science and practices of happiness together. It will be held on April 30, 2023 at Ambassador Golf Course, 1025 Sprucewood Dr, Windsor, Ontario  from 9:00 - 4:30 starting with a light breakfast at 8:30. Prizes, swag, lunch and a take home resource-for-life will also be provided.  Tickets are 24.99 each.  Include a call-to-action that urges people to buy tickets as the number are capped at 40 participants.  There needs to be a way to register and take payment from people ahead of time - a QR code perhaps? Here is the link to the payment: https://buy.stripe.com/14kaFD5YF0r44iQfZ0\r\nAttachments','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2047857','-',7,'United States','-',250.000,'fixed',220.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 20:38:24',NULL,3,1,NULL,136),
(16035,'Infographic for Smart Glass in the Automotive Industry',2,'In the automotive industry, smart glass is a technology feature in high-end vehicle windows.\r\n\r\nAs high-tech glass in mobile phones redefined the role of this device in our lives, high-tech glazing solutions in vehicles will redefine the future of mobility.\r\n\r\nThe end-user must understand through the infographic that glass in vehicles will enable new possibilities, creating a third living space in our cars where safety and entertainment will become the norm while enhancing a sustainable tomorrow.\r\n\r\nWe will provide you a research and our brand\'s brand book and you may also use our previous infographic as a reference: https://www.linkedin.com/posts/agp-eglass_weareenablers-circulareconomy-activity-7042480453794037761-L3F_?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease send your portfolio in your proposal.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641540393256898561?success','-',7,'United States','Lima',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 20:39:16',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
(16036,'Designer to Create Graphics for LinkedIn Carousel',2,'Create a LinkedIn carousel post. This is an example of a carousel post:\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/posts/jasonvana_how-to-advertise-your-lead-magnet-shft-activity-6631512468877295616-FjUc/\r\n\r\nYou will need to create ten slides, all using the exact dimensions. Each slide should have a similar look and feel, match our brand colour, and include our logo icon (see our website for details, which will include a brand book for the winner). Each slide should also have the product\'s logo or a screenshot of the platform and the text provided to the winner.\r\n\r\nImage specs here:\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/help/linkedin/answer/a518909/upload-and-share-documents-on-linkedin?lang=en','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01e1a25207834e0252/apply/','-',7,'United States','Toronto',35.000,'fixed',700.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 20:40:01',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
(16037,'Building WordPress Website using Elementor',3,'We need an expert WordPress developer who can convert a Figma UI design into a functional website using the Elementor plugin. There are 6 pages in total, and no payment or user login features are required. We need this work to be completed within 2 weeks, so we are looking for someone who can commit their time until the project is finished.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641541896843563009','-',7,'United States','Kiyv',1200.000,'fixed',1200.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 20:45:17',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(16038,'\"Hugs are Love\"',2,'I’m searching for someone who can illustrate a new children’s book titled, “title”, targeted to ages 3-5. The story will contain 18-pages of illustration and must be engaging enough for readers in this age group but we don’t want them to look too “cartoony” or “digital” either —visible brushstrokes, pencil lines, textures, etc. are much appreciated for organic-looking illustrations.\r\n\r\nThe book will be displayed digitally on mobile devices (phones and tablets) in portrait orientation only with the illustration on top and the text on the. Square illustrations are required (1000x1000p, 300dpi minimum).\r\n\r\nNo need to include the text in the illustrations as they will be added separately.\r\n\r\nPAYMENT: We follow a three-milestone structure: rough storyboard ($150); Uncolored detail sketches OR detailed base color illustrations ($250); Final colored, shaded and textured, illustrations ($360). There is a 15% bonus for the successful competition of projects by meeting deadlines, communication when necessary, and overall conduct.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641541963961667585?success','-',7,'United States','Tucson',760.000,'perhour',760.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 20:45:42',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
