(16045,'Virtual Office Manager Needed',22,'Morph Health & Wellness is a completely virtual Telemedicine company focusing on new-age medical practices. We are looking to hire a part-time Virtual Office Manager to take on daily responsibilities with flexibility in scheduling. Must be organized, personable, willing to learn, flexible, self-motivated, confident. Experience in the healthcare industry preferred, but not required. This job is available to start as soon as possible with a minimum of 6 months commitment required, so part-time, long term would be the perfect fit. Serious inquiries only.\r\n\r\nTasks included in this job are as follows, but not limited to: managing excel spreadsheets for 10+ medical providers, being a liaison/manager between providers, billing, and shipping department, social media communication through comments and messages, inputting patients demographics into our EMR and communication platform, customer support and communication through answering phone calls, emails, and text messages regarding scheduling, shipping questions, online portal support, and general practice questions and more. The job requires around 4-5 hours of total daily work, but not all at the same sitting time frame.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641546359759179777','-',7,'United States','-',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 21:03:30',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
