(16048,'Elementor Wizard',2,'Job Summary:\r\nWe are looking for a talented and experienced Front End Developer who is an expert in Wordpress, Elementor, and Crocoblock to work on our software platform overhaul project. As a Front End Developer, you will be responsible for implementing user interfaces, collaborating with the back-end development team, and ensuring a seamless user experience across our platform. You must have strong graphic design skills and be able to translate design requirements into functional and responsive web pages.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n\r\nCollaborate with the back-end development team to design and implement user interfaces using Wordpress and Elementor.\r\nDevelop and implement custom Wordpress themes and templates.\r\nEnsure that all web pages are responsive and optimized for various devices and screen sizes.\r\nDesign and implement custom widgets and plugins using Crocoblock.\r\nWork closely with our graphic design team to translate design requirements into functional web pages.\r\nOptimize website performance and ensure fast load times.\r\nEnsure that our platform meets high standards for accessibility, usability, and security.\r\nTroubleshoot and debug any issues with the website.\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nStrong experience in Wordpress and Elementor development.\r\nExpertise in Crocoblock and other Wordpress plugins.\r\nStrong graphic design skills and ability to create visually appealing and user-friendly interfaces.\r\nExperience with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and jQuery.\r\nUnderstanding of SEO and web analytics.\r\nAbility to work in a fast-paced environment and handle multiple projects simultaneously.\r\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641548170750611457?success','-',7,'United States','Bowie',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-03-30',1,'2023-03-30',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-30 21:10:48',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
