(16062,'Squarespace Web Developer with Custom CSS Expertise',18,'We are seeking a talented and experienced Squarespace Web Designer/Developer with expertise in custom CSS to revamp our existing Squarespace website. The ideal candidate will have a strong understanding of the latest Squarespace platform features and capabilities, as well as a proven track record of creating visually appealing and user-friendly websites.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n1) Assess the current state of our Squarespace website and identify areas for improvement, including design, layout, and overall user experience.\r\n2) Update the website to the latest version of Squarespace, ensuring compatibility and seamless migration of content.\r\n3) Implement custom CSS to achieve desired design, functionality, and branding elements, while adhering to best practices and maintaining site performance.\r\n4) Collaborate with the project owner to ensure the updated website reflects their vision, preferences, and requirements.\r\n5) Test the updated website across various devices and browsers to ensure optimal performance, responsiveness, and user experience.\r\n6) Provide clear documentation and training on how to maintain and update the website, including guidance on managing custom CSS.\r\n7) Offer ongoing support and troubleshooting as needed after the project\'s completion.\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n1) Proven experience as a Squarespace Web Designer/Developer, with a portfolio showcasing completed projects.\r\n2) Strong knowledge of the latest Squarespace platform features and capabilities.\r\n3) Expertise in custom CSS, with the ability to create visually appealing, functional, and responsive designs.\r\n4) Familiarity with web design principles and best practices, including accessibility, usability, and search engine optimization.\r\n5) Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work closely with the project owner to achieve desired results.\r\n6) Strong problem-solving skills, with the ability to troubleshoot and resolve technical issues.\r\n7) Attention to detail and commitment to delivering high-quality work.\r\n\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit your resume, a link to your portfolio, and a brief description of your experience with Squarespace and custom CSS. We look forward to reviewing your application!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641739716649750529','-',7,'United States','New York',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 09:51:35',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
