(16067,'Senior Web Designer - Service/E-commerce Project',4,'We are looking for an experienced Senior Web Designer to join our team for a very specific large project. The successful candidate will possess the necessary skills and expertise to work with a senior head of design and a team of senior developers.\r\n\r\nWe are a digital marketing agency, and this project is aimed at selling sophisticated professionals - lawyers - specifically selling marketing services online. The project includes an e-commerce element, and the ideal candidate will have a thorough understanding of designing for e-commerce websites.\r\n\r\nThe successful candidate should have the ability to design pages that are content-heavy, read and interpret content and use design to clearly and articulately communicate the message to the user. It is important that the candidate understands the buyer\'s journey and creates designs that are user-friendly and visually appealing.\r\n\r\nThis project is not for junior or mid-level designers. We expect the project to last for a minimum of 3 months, and we require a Senior Web Designer who can work independently and meet tight deadlines.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will have a folio that demonstrates experience in e-commerce web design. While we are selling services and not products, we expect the candidate to have experience in designing for e-commerce websites.\r\n\r\nKey requirements:\r\n\r\nExperience in Sketch and Figma\r\nDesigning for Bootstrap\r\nWorking with custom Wordpress developers, including WooCommerce functionality\r\nExperience in e-commerce web design\r\nAbility to design pages that are content-heavy\r\nUnderstanding of the buyer\'s journey\r\nAbility to work independently and meet tight deadlines (you will report to a head of design, but they have many other projects they are managing - so there is a level of working independently required)\r\n\r\nIf you have the skills and experience we\'re looking for and want to work on an exciting project, please send your folio and CV. We look forward to hearing from you.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0153f8c9803aa81bc9','-',7,'United States','Yarraville',5000.000,'fixed',5000.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 10:03:27',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
