(16108,'Create website using WordPress',15,'We are looking for a talented and experienced website developer to create a website using WordPress.\r\n\r\nThe successful candidate will be responsible for creating a scalable database service. They should also be aware of the security challenges associated with hosting data for the US government and defense forces and have experience in creating a local hosting solution for data storage.\r\n\r\nThe primary objective of this project is to create an intuitive and easy-to-use website that allows users to upload content such as pictures and videos.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nStrong experience with website template customization and self-building website software.\r\nPrior experience with generating QR codes.\r\nExperience with creating scalable database services, preferably using AWS for data storage.\r\nFamiliarity with security challenges associated with hosting data for the US government and defense forces.\r\n\r\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills.\r\nAttention to detail and ability to deliver high-quality work on time.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01129b7b61e10a662a','-',7,'United States','New York',48.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 13:11:52',NULL,9,3,NULL,126),
