(16119,'Looking for a Web Designer for recurring landing page design (Figma)',4,'Job Overview:\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for a talented Web Designer to create home pages and landing pages in Figma for our clients. You will receive copy in a Google Doc, along with any required branding materials. Your main responsibility will be to interpret each brand\'s identity into a cohesive style across 1-4 pages per client/brand.\r\n\r\nRequired Skills and Expertise:\r\n\r\nProficiency in Figma, Adobe Photoshop, and Adobe Illustrator\r\n\r\nStrong grasp of design concepts, including layout, hierarchy, typography, and color\r\n\r\nFamiliarity with Figma autolayout is a bonus\r\n\r\nDetailed Job Responsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Receive project briefs, including a Google Doc containing assets, copy broken down by section, and sometimes guidance on section layout\r\n\r\n- Design 1-4 pages per client/brand within 5 days of receiving the project brief\r\n\r\n- Perform one round of edits based on client feedback\r\nProject Duration: If things go well, this will be ongoing and recurring work every week for the indefinite future.\r\n\r\nCommunication and Collaboration:\r\n\r\nPreferred communication channels: Upwork or Discord\r\n\r\nCommunication will be centered around project deadlines\r\n\r\nBudget and Payment Terms:\r\n\r\nPayment structure: Fixed price per page\r\nScalable work due to similarity across different projects\r\n\r\nPortfolio or Work Samples: Please provide a link to your Behance, Dribbble, personal portfolio, or any platform where we can see examples of your recent work.\r\n\r\nApplication Process: Apply through Upwork and include the requested portfolio link.\r\n\r\nInclude the word \"squirrel\" in your proposal so I know you read through this!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641793035950821377','-',7,'United States','Phoenix',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 13:23:18',NULL,8,3,NULL,156),
