(16126,'Graphic Designer for Logo and Banner Design',2,'We are a wholesale supplier of heirloom seeds, plants, and flowers based in Mexico. We believe in the importance of preserving and cultivating the biodiversity of our planet and promoting sustainable agriculture practices.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a talented freelance logo and brand identity designer who can help us create a modern and simple logo that reflects our mission and values. You can find a bit more information on our website (work in progress): fleuraissance.com\r\n\r\nThe logo should be accompanied by a visually simple banner design that could for example incorporates our slogan \"Cultivating the past, harvesting the future.\" The banner design could for example feature floral elements to convey the nature of our business. The banner should be suitable for use on our website and social media platforms.\r\n\r\nDesign ideeas could be referencing seeds, flowers, the renaissance, mexican culture and others.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641796465427316737?success','-',7,'United States','Augsburg',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 13:37:48',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
(16127,'Landing Page Builder Freelancer',4,'We are looking for an experienced landing page builder freelancer to join our team. As an affiliate marketer, we need someone who can help us create high converting landing pages using Convertri, as well as catchy thumbnails and YouTube banners. This is a long-term position, as we test many landing pages to optimize our conversion rates. I can send you winning landers to model\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n• Build high converting landing pages using Convertri\r\n• Create catchy thumbnails and YouTube banners\r\n• Test and optimize landing pages to improve conversion rates\r\n• Work collaboratively with our team, including editors and copywriters, to create effective landing pages\r\n• Stay up-to-date with the latest trends and best practices in landing page design\r\nRequirements:\r\n• Expertise in Convertri and other landing page builders\r\n• Strong graphic design skills and ability to create catchy thumbnails and YouTube banners\r\n• Knowledge of best practices in landing page design and optimization\r\n• Strong analytical skills and ability to test and report on landing page performance\r\n• Excellent communication skills and ability to work collaboratively with a team\r\n\r\nIf you meet the qualifications and are interested in joining our team, please send your portfolio. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641797463739142145?success','-',7,'United States','Melbourne',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 13:40:47',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
