(16135,'Medical Billing Specialist',21,'We are seeking a qualified and dedicated individual to join our Medical Billing Team. In this position, you will be responsible for a variety of tasks, As our medical biller, your daily duties will include maintaining billing software, appealing denied claims, and recording insurance payments.\r\n\r\nTo succeed in this role, you must possess in-depth knowledge of billing software, as medical insurance policies and terminologies. The ideal candidate must also be able to demonstrate excellent written and verbal skills, as communicating with the team, clients, and various insurance agents will form a large part of the job. The candidate must also understand HIPAA regulations and patient privacy.\r\n\r\nMedical Biller Responsibilities:\r\nPrepare and submit billing data and medical claims to insurance companies\r\nEnsure the patient\'s medical information is accurate and up to date\r\nPrepare bills and invoices, and document amounts due to medical procedures and services\r\nCollect and review referrals and pre-authorizations\r\nMonitor and record late payments (if applicable)\r\nFollow-up on missed payments and resolve financial discrepancies\r\nExamine patient bills for accuracy and request any missing information from insurance companies\r\nInvestigate and appeal denied claims\r\nMaintain current collection reports','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641790082520657921?','-',7,'United States','Elk Grove',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 14:32:43',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(16136,'Expert in presentation design - Immediate Hire',11,'Hello,\r\n\r\nI need a designer who can make amazing PowerPoint presentations to hire immediately, today if possible.\r\n\r\nI need to see your previous work samples and my Boss will speak to you directly.\r\n\r\nPLEASE:\r\n1) Attach previous work samples before you start writing\r\n2) IF YOU DO NOT HAVE SAMPLES OF PREVIOUS WORK, DON\'T APPLY.\r\n\r\nWe need a very good sleek clean style of work.\r\n\r\nThanks, Eunice.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b5454ceeb49d6ad0','-',7,'United States','Uyo',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 14:33:02',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
(16137,'Virtual Healthcare Practice Manager for Ongoing Projects',22,'You have a minimum of 5 years experience working in a small private practice (bonus points for orthopedic surgery, ENT, or plastic surgery) and are tech savvy. Ideally you\'re a practice manager who has worn many hats at some point in your career: front desk, billing, surgery scheduling, IT, EHR super user. Will consider an up and coming star who is ready to take the next step in their career. You are known to your peers as the fixer. You are THE problem solver. You\'re the calm voice that brings everyone together to solve the days issues. Some days you enjoy posting payments and other days you\'re creating a new call schedule for the doctors. You enjoy the variety of tasks and derive joy from completing tasks and checking items off of your to do list. Excel is your friend and you enjoy a good analysis. You thrive on new projects. You love being behind the scenes supporting the team and ensuring everyone has what they need to do their jobs. You\'re a master scheduler, incredibly organized, and have the natural curiosity to click on the help button when you see something new in the EHR. You\'re the resident go to on all things with the computer system. You\'ve made process changes and love training new people. You\'re cheerful, upbeat, and you can roll with the punches. You love healthcare, you love working with surgeons. Naturally you have thick skin and love a good challenge. You enjoy executing a plan and are not afraid of change.\r\n\r\nYou\'re at the point in your career where you need some flexibility, going to the office every day is no longer sustainable or perhaps enjoyable. Your doctors are retiring, or you have reached the maximum point of growth where you are. Project based work fits your lifestyle and work preferences.\r\n\r\nYou will be the right-hand to a fast paced, don\'t beat around the bush (but with southern hospitality and genuine empathy), values efficiency, and focused on precision co-owner who not only wants to get things done, wants them done right, and efficiently.\r\n\r\nSo what will you do in this position? You will work on a variety of projects and tasks depending on the client workload. Sample projects\r\nPersonnel file audit\r\nOnboard new staff','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641788443758366721','-',7,'United States','Commerce',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 14:33:36',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
