(16140,'Business name finding / Brand naming (+ Corporate design/Brand identity)',2,'Hello,\r\n\r\nwe need a company name for a new, internationally operating online marketing agency. We already have a few name suggestions, but so far there is none that really convinces us.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in the job, please read the -complete- description before contacting us.\r\n\r\n1)\r\nThis job is for experienced freelancers with excellent references. We do not want newcomers or people who are inexperienced in the field.\r\n\r\n2)\r\nThe name and associated brand should be in the premium sector. The name should be in English. The name should also be creative, easy to remember, easy to pronounce and unique. However, a free .com domain must be available for the name and it must not infringe any trademark or copy rights. The agency\'s target group are small and medium-sized enterprises and lawyers in Europe and North America.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641810912183078913?success','-',7,'United States','bremen',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 14:34:29',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
