(16147,'2D Explainer Video',8,'Looking for a CUSTOM designed 2D explainer video in a style exactly like the sample below –\r\n\r\nSample:\r\nhttps://vimeo.com/607167130\r\n\r\nI have an already prepared script, professionally recorded that you will use as the voice-over, so YOU WILL NOT NEED TO WRITE A SCRIPT! OR DO HAVE A VOICE-OVER DONE!\r\n\r\nThe script is 135 – 145secs long, with a professional female voice-over already recorded. I will send it to you along with the actual script, if you can accommodate my request.\r\n\r\nThe video needs to be an original design. No templates please. Need a storyboard prior to production.\r\n\r\n*** Note: The video I am looking for can very much resemble the sample in style, flow and narration, but needs to be custom designed around our concept and script.\r\n\r\nPlease provide a quote outlining the project: scope, process, stages, pricing and how long it will take.\r\n\r\nLook forward to your response.\r\n\r\nThx,','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01a92be41cfe75d4e2','-',7,'United States','Charlotte',0.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 14:53:28',NULL,6,3,NULL,125),
(16148,'Long term Video Editor for an International Sports Brand',2,'Yay you found us!\r\n\r\nWelcome aboard! Oh wait that’s for later, let’s get to know each other first.\r\n\r\n• Who are we?\r\n-Bright Sport (brightsport.com) is a fast-growing eCommerce sports brand in the market with customers in the AUS, UK, USA, Sweden, Norway, and all around Europe. We’re aiming for a worldwide expansion in 2023. That’s where you come in.\r\n\r\n• Who you are?\r\n-A positive-minded, ambitious, results-driven, and creative Video Editor that’ll bring ideas to life and create WINNING CONTENT for our Tiktok and Facebook ads.\r\n- A proven track record in paid advertisement videos\r\n\r\n• Who you’ll be to the company?\r\n- Video Editor that is responsible for editing and creating content regarding our product.\r\n\r\n\r\n• Your Responsibilities\r\n- Quickly assemble first cuts of raw footage\r\n- Quality-check deliverables of completed edits; generating missing (or additional) deliverables if needed\r\n- Ability to manage multiple projects of varying complexities and work well under pressure\r\n- Choose appropriate music and sound bytes\r\n- Ensure music copyright and licensing requirements are met for each project.\r\n- Help to manage and maintain video assets, video archives, and information security.\r\n- Edit winning ads/content for our social media platforms specifically Facebook and TikTok.\r\n- Produce scalable video ads\r\n\r\n• Our Requirements\r\n- 3+ years of experience in video production and editing\r\n- Strong eye for video composition\r\n- Strong communication skills & attention to detail\r\n- Capable of handling various projects simultaneously\r\n- Understanding of how to prioritize and respond accordingly\r\n- Strong collaboration and time management skills\r\n- MUST have experience producing paid ads for Facebook and Tiktok (other social media sites too)\r\n- MUST have experience finding and producing WINNING ADS.\r\n\r\n• Why should you choose us?\r\n- 100% remote. Doesn’t matter where you are as long as you’re the one we’re looking for.\r\n- Flexible working.\r\n- You\'re part of a worldwide small but enthusiastic team in a company that is growing insanely fast.\r\n-The career opportunities long term are enormous.\r\n\r\nThink you’re the one? Don’t hesitate, let’s have a talk.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641815766238957569?success','-',7,'United States','Dordrecht',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 14:53:33',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
