(16164,'Logo for SunCrew',10,'represent \"circular wealth\" where the money (drops) flows both up and down.\r\n\r\nsunCrew should be in the dark blue color. The letters for sun should match the letter for \"rew\"\r\n\r\nThe only challenging part is the middle section of the big C needs to fade from the dark blue to Sunglow yellow with the white in the middle behind the letters. (The bottom section below the \"n\" should be dark blue). I want you to use the drop symbol to make the fade. I don\'t want any color behind the letters for sun. I am thinking if you just make the drop pattern with rows of drops going up and rows going down with VERY small drops, it will look good. Let me know if you have any questions\r\n\r\nThe outside of the big C should be circle 13 in the golden ratio circle graph and \"e\" and the inside of the small C should be #5. Let\'s make something beautiful.\r\n\r\nThe tagline: Alone a Drop. Together the Tide. Just make it look right around the circle ;). Please provide a version with and without the tagline.\r\n\r\nThe \"rew\" font was made for another logo (attached). I tried to match the font with Avenir for sun, but it needs to match exactly. I am very particular about spacing and white space. The spacing between all the letters should be exactly the same and the spacing between the sections of the C and around the C should be exactly the same. Whenever possible, please use golden ratio.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641824388792651777?success','-',7,'United States','Ashland',50.000,'fixed',50.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 15:27:49',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
