(16170,'Banner & Flyer design for trade show',2,'Please read the job description carefully before applying - any generic replies that do not follow the instructions below will be declined and reported.\r\n-------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nWe have a trade show coming up, and need someone to design banners for our booth and a handout flyer.\r\n\r\nWe will purchase this package, which includes a banner for the back wall, a floor standing banner, a table top banner and a table runner: https://www.canadiandisplay.ca/Trade-Show-Booth-Package-Expo-p/tsp-exp03.htm (templates for the required artworks are provided on that site)\r\n\r\nWe also require a tri fold flyer, to be printed on letter size paper (with the inside being full letter, and the outside having front, back and flap panels).\r\n\r\nWe have mocked up some drafts for these, but do not have in house design skills, so are looking for someone to redesign them and make them look professional and draw traffic to our booth!\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\n\r\n8ft x 2ft back banner\r\n34\" x 33\" table top banner\r\n63\" x 24\" floor banner\r\n2ft x 6ft table runner\r\nletter size flyer, inside and outside\r\n\r\nAll files must be provided in print ready PDF, together with layered source files so any last minute edits can be made if needed. Please confirm your intended source file format before doing any work - I need to ensure that we can open/edit it this end.\r\n\r\nAll artwork must be cohesive, follow the same theme and work together to make our booth look amazing!\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this project, please mock up a draft for ONE of the pieces of artwork and provide it with your proposal. This only needs to be a high level draft so we can see how your design skills fit with out needs - we are not expecting the finished article at this stage!\r\n\r\nYou do not need to spend a lot of time on this, we just want to get an initial idea of your proposal and to weed out the generic responses!\r\n\r\nThe attached zip file contains screenshots and other assets. Our brand colors are #10AEC4 and #FFA710','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01fcac3dc397f79c24/apply/','-',7,'United States','Melton Mowbray',100.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 15:39:44',NULL,6,3,NULL,120),
