(16174,'Logo for Car Wash',2,'Need logo for \"Thunder Car Wash\".\r\n\r\nInfo: Emphasize “Car Wash”, and deemphasize “Thunder” , clean logo, professional, minimalistic, not cartoonish, no need for a car or other obtuse graphics in the logo.\r\n\r\nIdeas for image:\r\nOption 1: Stack Thunder on top of CAR WASH. Reduce size of THUNDER and to the right of THUNDER incorporate a lightning bolt or rain drops.\r\n\r\nOption 2: Incorporate a lightning bolt into the \"N\" with Thunder somehow.\r\n\r\nColors: Red and Black, maybe yellow with the lightning bolt, blue for water if incorporated.\r\n\r\nAttached are ideas from other logos I like.\r\n\r\nTiming: Need this done within by the end of next week 5/7.\r\n\r\nProposals will only be considered with the word \"Raindrop\" in the response as to filter out all the spam quotes from bots.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641830683172474881?success','-',7,'United States','Midlothian',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 15:53:18',NULL,7,3,NULL,159),
