(16185,'Get a Standout Brand Identity with Our Professional Logo Design Services',10,'We are a leading design agency looking for a talented logo designer to join our team. As a logo designer, you will be responsible for creating unique and eye-catching logos that accurately represent our clients\' brand identities. You will work closely with our clients to understand their vision, target audience, and competition, and translate that into a visually appealing and impactful logo.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should have a strong portfolio of logo design work, excellent communication and collaboration skills, and a keen eye for design aesthetics. You should be proficient in industry-standard design software and be able to work efficiently in a fast-paced environment.\r\n\r\nIf you are passionate about creating standout brand identities and want to work with a team of experienced designers, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0164173ec34ebb9ec4','-',7,'United States','N/A',85.000,'perhour',80.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 16:11:57',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
