(16208,'Law Firm Website Redesign',4,'General: The client liked the elrodpope.com for reference. They want to keep their current color scheme that they have on their originally website https://hortonmendez.com/\r\n\r\nThey want the design to have a sports undertone to it but they want that to be subtle. They also want potential clients when coming to the site to see them as a higher end brand but won’t be paying high end prices. White Glove concept.\r\n\r\nThe design should be well thought-out, with all styling being pretty consistent for the different sections. Remember to keep in mind high end. They want to make it clear that they are personal injury lawyers but use to work for the insurance companies. Hence the slogan “We know their playbook”.\r\n\r\nPlease review the project brief, as well as our attached guidelines and examples thoroughly, as we have done hundreds of hours of market research to maximize conversion on our websites.\r\n\r\nKeep in mind the guidelines are just guidelines to make sure certain areas are included and features that we need. WE NEED YOUR CREATIVITY ADDED TO THIS.\r\n\r\nThis Client has an existing site: https://hortonmendez.com/ \r\nFonts: Highend font. They want the look and feel to mimic a high end luxury brand.\r\nTagline: They like the slogan “We know their playbook”. “Former insurance Defense attorney. We know their playbook”. They also like to use the language “help begins here” for call to actions\r\nOn Their homepage they don’t like the hero section where it says “Experience Personal Injury Lawyers”.\r\n Ideal Audience: Personal Injury victim in North Carolina, seeking legal representation in a personal injury matter, who need reassurance that the attorney they are hiring is well qualified, respected, effective, professional, and fierce. We want the client to understand they will receive high end treatment. In the way a spa would treat their clients.\r\n\r\nPages Needed: We need Desktop AND Mobile designs for the following page types\r\n\r\nThe sections for each page type are listed in order below, please design all sections in accordance with our guidelines and using your best design judgement\r\n\r\nHomepage: Needs to have the following\r\n\r\nHero Section - designed in accordance with our guidelines.\r\nThey want a video in background of this section that plays but also has the play button to open a popup with the video\r\nThey want the tagline “We Know Their Playbook” in some sort of sports type font, but for it not to look cheap or cheesy.\r\nClient Reviews Section - designed in accordance with our guidelines\r\nCase Results section - designed in accordance with our guidelines\r\nPractice Area Section - designed in accordance with our guidelines\r\nCase Process Section - designed in accordance with our guidelines\r\nMention in this “white glove process\"\r\nMultiple call to action sections - designed in accordance with our guidelines\r\nClient Testimonials section (comprised of videos)\r\nThis section needs to be above the as seen on section. They want the testimonials displayed as a slider\r\nMeet the Attorneys Section\r\nA contact us section\r\n\r\nInterior Page:\r\n\r\nHeading Section - designed in accordance with our guidelines\r\nClient Reviews Section - designed in accordance with our guidelines\r\nCase Results section - designed in accordance with our guidelines\r\nPage Content Section - designed in accordance with our guidelines\r\nRelated Videos Section - This section should contain videos that correlate with that page on the bottom:\r\nFor example\r\nProminent Call-To-Action section (in accordance with our guidelines,)\r\nFooter\r\n\r\nAbout Us: Follow our guidelines which are attached for the below\r\n\r\nHero/Heading Section\r\nDevlin K. Horton and Nicholas B. Mendez\r\nOther staff\r\nReviews\r\nResults\r\nClient Testimonials section (comprised of videos)\r\nFooter\r\n\r\nNotes on Common Sections:\r\n\r\nFooter should contain the footer elements outlined in our guidelines\r\n\r\nMenu Bar:\r\n\r\nThe Menu Items should be same, however the header of the site should be redesigned according or our guidelines which are attached.\r\n\r\nReference Site(s):\r\n\r\nelrodpope.com\r\n\r\nAttach are out guidelines and the logo\r\nThis Client has an existing site: https://hortonmendez.com/','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641845041899450369?success','-',7,'United States','Greenville',60.000,'perhour',60.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 16:50:03',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
