(16229,'Modernize a Corporate Slide Deck Template to Make it both more sophisticated and original',2,'We have a corporate deck that was created some time ago. It is not terribly sophisticated in look and feel. We have tried some off the shelf templates, but none of them really are good at showing our unique brand.\r\n\r\nThe company is in the 55+ retirement community real estate business. You can think of us like the Expedia for 55+ retirement communities. We don\'t have any major direct competitors of scale (privatecommunities.com, newhomesource.com) are probably the closest. From a very distant way, we have some commonality with Houzz and Porch. Most of our competition come from builders like Del Webb, Trilogy or from very home spun brands like FloridaForBoomers.\r\n\r\nWe did run a fairly interesting campaign that had good appeal and there might be some design inspiration here: https://www.55places.com/blog/the-best-places-to-snowbird-in-2021\r\n\r\nThis project is meant to create a Google slides template that will be used going forward in business, board and analytical presentations.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641862993862463489?success','-',7,'United States','United States',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 18:01:08',NULL,6,3,NULL,123),
