(16235,'WordPress/Elementor website with blog',3,'I\'m just a poetry writer publishing my first book on Amazon KDP soon. I have a domain hosted on Hostinger loaded with WordPress and Elementor.\r\n\r\nI need the website to be somewhat simple with, aside from the common tabs, an interactive blog, a member log-in for inner content access, a comments section, a scrolling ribbon for reviews, a Portfolio page for previews and samples, and a few links. Pages would be Home, Portfolio, Storefront (no e-commerce) and Blog. Mostly, I need a creative touch to avoid my tendency towards mundane symmetry and bland color palettes.\r\nI cannot imagine such is too complex, but it manages to flummox my tired ADHD brain.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nJeffrey Greenmun','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641866317870206977','-',7,'United States','Peoria',50.000,'Open this select menu',48.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 18:14:21',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
(16236,'UX Design',6,'Hi, I\'m looking for UX help. We use Figma internally.\r\n\r\nThis is for a mobile-first web app. The style of the web-app is like that of a phone/tablet OS. There in, there is a selection of apps to choose from. When selected, the app opens.\r\n\r\nThis design task is for both the web-app, and for 4 contained apps.\r\n\r\nSo, rather than having a feel of a web-page with menus, we want the feel of an OS from which one can open additional apps.\r\n\r\nMilestones:\r\n1. wireframe for the web app\r\n2. high fidelity visual prototype\r\n3. interactive prototype\r\n4. wireframe for the 4 enclosed apps\r\n5. high fidelity visual prototypes\r\n6. interactive prototypes for the 4 enclosed apps\r\n\r\nPlease request from me any information you need to come up with an estimate.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641867001545560065','-',7,'United States','Newberry',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 18:17:16',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
