(16242,'Designs Needed for Multiple Festival Mobile App Home Pages',6,'We are looking for a designer that can help us design the home page of various event apps. These are typically apps for music festivals, county fairs, community festivals or holiday festivals. Most of the time we just need a design for the home page of the app plus a header image for some of the internal pages.\r\n\r\nDesigner will be provided with basic design elements like logos and color schemes, as well as a general style direction. Designer would be tasked with creating a single flat graphic (sometimes we would request multiple iterations) that we can send back to the client for approval and feedback. Once approved we may have the designer cut up the graphic into the necessary elements we need for our platform.\r\n\r\nInitial project would involve 4-5 different events.\r\n\r\nMany platforms can be used to design the app home page, including Photoshop, Illustrator, and more UI-specific design platforms. Ultimate goal is to deliver .jpg or .png slices to us for each home page.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641871257362857985','-',7,'United States','Lincoln',30.000,'Open this select menu',30.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 18:33:57',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
