(16249,'10 second motion video advert',8,'We are looking for a skilled Motion Graphic Designer to create a 10-second animation for our taxi advert targeting university students. The ideal candidate will have a strong understanding of motion graphics and animation, with experience in creating engaging and visually appealing content.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nCreate a 10-second animation for our taxi advert targeting university students.\r\nDevelop creative concepts and ideas for the animation that effectively communicate our brand message and appeal to our target audience.\r\nWork collaboratively with our marketing team to ensure the animation aligns with our branding and messaging.\r\nDesign and animate all graphics and elements for the animation, including typography, illustrations, and other visual effects.\r\nEnsure that the animation is optimized for various platforms and formats, including social media and digital signage.\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nA strong portfolio of motion graphics and animation work.\r\nProficiency in industry-standard motion graphics software, such as Adobe After Effects, Illustrator, and Photoshop.\r\nKnowledge of 3D modeling and animation software is a plus.\r\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills to work effectively with the marketing team.\r\nA keen eye for design and attention to detail.\r\nAbility to work under tight deadlines and manage multiple projects simultaneously.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641874975785226241?success','-',7,'United States','Stoke-on-Trent',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 18:49:16',NULL,10,3,NULL,119),
(16250,'Box/packaging design for a cremation company',2,'Hello,\r\n\r\nWe\'re a cremation service looking to have a box designed that will be used to mail cremated remains. We have some basic ideas for the design, but we\'re looking for someone creative to create a finished product with with a clean, soothing design that incorporates elements of our logo and brand colors.\r\n\r\nThe box measures 9\" x 6.75\" x 4.75\" when folded, and the design will be printed on the inside and outside of the box (all sides).\r\n\r\nThis can be designed using a template, or with the interactive design tool on the box manufacturer\'s website (samples attached).\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you for your interest in this project.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016e715f2567e6d48a','-',7,'United States','Wheat Ridge',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 18:50:16',NULL,5,3,NULL,129),
