(16255,'Fitness App - Dark Design',6,'The work entails re-designing our fitness app mockup (done in Figma) from a light design to dark design and make changes to work on the user flow. Then implement it in Figma using TailwindCSS.\r\n\r\nThis is our initial design so you can see the vision, but lots of work re-imagining the user interaction and flow is needed (and dark design).\r\nhttps://www.figma.com/file/Jf9547jl6NvCwt5hr8Frex/ExerFly_App?node-id=118-282&t=LEp2qC3y4UklmjOb-0\r\n\r\nWe\'re currently finishing up a subset of features to get something initially out to our customers.\r\n\r\nWe\'re using TailwindCSS, and would like candidates, as a test to show a mockup of their dark design in Figma of the attached app image (Workout settings.png) using the Tailwind CSS classes, padding etc. Happy to pay the top 2 candidates who do it correctly (Tailwind css) $50 for their time. Please leave the Figma mockup as editable so we can check.\r\n\r\nThe app also runs on desktop browser.\r\n\r\nSome of the dark designs we like are:\r\nhttps://dribbble.com/shots/16818556-MyFit-Mobile-App-Design-for-Fitness\r\nhttps://luminsports.com/products\r\n\r\nAbout us:\r\nWe\'re https://exerflysport.com we make and sell exercise equipment which uses a flywheel for resistance. We use the app to control and get statistics for the users.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641876792720064513','-',7,'United States','City Christchurch',36.000,'perhour',36.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 18:56:09',NULL,9,3,NULL,116),
