(16287,'Looking for Rockstar Presentation Designer',11,'We are looking for a talented and experienced freelance presentation designer to help us tell a compelling story with great visuals. In this role, you will partner with us to create an engaging and informative presentation that showcases our program and effectively communicates our message to our audience.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n* Collaborate with us to understand our program and our target audience\r\n* Help us hone our story and identify key messages that need to be conveyed\r\n* Create an eye-catching and visually appealing presentation using a variety of tools and techniques\r\n* Incorporate data and other relevant information into the presentation in a way that is easy to understand\r\n* Ensure that the presentation is engaging and interactive, with clear calls to action\r\n* Work with us to make revisions and refine the presentation as needed\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n* Proven experience as a presentation designer, with a strong portfolio of past work\r\n* Proficiency in presentation design tools such as PowerPoint, Keynote, or Google Slides\r\n* Excellent communication and collaboration skills\r\n* Strong attention to detail and the ability to work under tight deadlines\r\n* A passion for storytelling and a creative approach to design\r\n\r\nIf you think you have the skills and experience we\'re looking for, please submit a proposal and/or a link to your portfolio. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~0161450eb580367fd5/apply/','-',7,'United States','San Francisco',400.000,'fixed',400.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 20:34:46',NULL,19,3,NULL,120),
