(16295,'Medical Billing Virtual Assistant',21,'I am looking for a Virtual Assistant for a Medical Billing and Credentialing company.\r\n\r\nJob description\r\nWe are a family-owned and-operated Credentialing & Billing Firm looking to hire a qualified candidate for the following:\r\n\r\nOur goal is simple; Our team simplifies the process for our patients. Our customers come to us because of our outstanding reputation in the market and the amazing service that our team provides. We are looking for a Medical Billing Representative to communicate over the phone to answer billing phone calls from patients and insurance companies.\r\n\r\nDuties and Responsibilities:\r\n• Preparing claims to send to the insurance companies\r\n• Contacting/following up with patients to reconcile accounts\r\n• Following all work processes/procedures, while maintaining compliance to the rules and regulations\r\n• Reviewing patient files for accuracy and completeness, and obtaining any missing information\r\n• Answer billing phone calls from patients and insurance companies\r\n• Sorting/ Filing/ Depositing Medicare and insurance checks\r\n• Processing orders/ billing\r\n• Mailing product/ Sorting mail/ Document collection\r\nThe job requirements include but are not limited to\r\n- Preparing claims to send to the insurance companies\r\n- Establishing payment arrangements on current and delinquent patient accounts\r\n- Contacting/following up with patients to reconcile accounts\r\n- Posting EOB\'s daily\r\n- Report daily to the Vice President\r\n- Collecting and posting payments on outstanding accounts\r\n- Following all work processes/procedures, while maintaining compliance to the rules and regulations\r\n- Entering the correct, updated billing codes\r\n- Reviewing patient bills for accuracy and completeness, and obtaining any missing information\r\n- Answer billing phone calls from patients and insurance companies\r\n\r\nRequired qualities:\r\n- Very Detail Oriented\r\n- Someone who prefers consistency, rather than variety in their day\r\n- Excellent phone etiquette\r\n- Positive attitude\r\n- Team player\r\n- Excellent investigator/problem solver\r\n- Honest\r\n- Dependable\r\n- Professional at all times\r\n\r\n\r\nJob Type: 3 - 6 Months Project $3k -$6k Looking for 3 Qualified Candidate','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1641834143237541889','-',7,'United States','Miami',3000.000,'Open this select menu',2700.000,'2023-03-31',1,'2023-03-31',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-03-31 20:49:33',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
