(16335,'Help Rarebird (Your Personal AI Matchmaker) communicate its mission/personality/values to investors',11,'Rarebird is a new app turning online dating into AI matchmaking. We\'re looking for a copywriter to help us improve our pitch deck\'s storytelling and communication so that it better reflects Rarebird\'s personality and values, and clearly communicates our value proposition and differentiation compared to other apps. Fundamentally, we\'re a couple of very technically-minded engineers who are looking for help capturing and expressing the very human and personal motivations and mission of our project, along with the playful, quirky, and inclusive personality of Rarebird\'s brand.\r\n\r\nYou must have prior experience with online dating and be able to relate to our target audience. US-based applicants only please.\r\n\r\nI\'ve attached our initial rough draft of a deck here so you can see what we have so far. You may also want to review our marketing site at https://rarebird.app\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for someone to start immediately. I\'d like to work with you today (Monday April 3) to workshop our deck together, bounce ideas, and iterate on the content.\r\n\r\nAfter this editing is completed, we\'ll be working with a designer to improve the formatting and visuals of the deck.\r\n\r\nThings we\'d like to improve:\r\n- capture that Rarebird is all about enabling self-expression, individuality, and discovering/creating the truest fullest version of yourself\r\n- storytelling. right now the \"Ana\" example in our deck is cliche and trite, but we\'re really about something important to everyone: finding meaningful relationships, and there has to be a better way to convey that\r\n- overall: reduce wordiness and improve communication and clarity, add emotional connection and impact\r\n\r\nAbout Us:\r\nRarebird is an AI-driven matchmaking app that provides highly compatible matches, focusing on quality over quantity. Utilizing the Taste Engine and EMMA, it quickly learns user preferences and incentivizes better matches. Rarebird revolutionizes online dating by prioritizing personalization, eliminating the need for multiple apps, and fostering genuine connections.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ca9d3a004935433b','-',7,'United States','San Francisco',50.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 10:50:50',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
