(16338,'UI/UX specialist needed to help design functionality for a web app',4,'We\'re an online business marketplace seeking a skilled UI/UX expert who can bring our ideas to life while working alongside a distributed agile software development team. As part of this long-term, part-time role, you\'ll dedicate 10-20 hours a week to comprehending user requirements, analysing existing functionality, and creating designs in Figma to provide developers with everything they need to execute them. \r\n\r\nYour responsibilities will include improving current features and developing new ones. In addition, we aim to simplify complicated user flows and seek your assistance in identifying areas where users are facing difficulties.\r\n\r\n Key responsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Advise and direct us in addressing customer experience issues.\r\n- Evaluate user problems and requirements, then determine the proper functionality.\r\n- Recognise common pitfalls and obstacles when implementing features.\r\n- Develop UI prototypes and mockups in Figma to demonstrate how features or websites function and what they look like.\r\n- Establish and maintain design-style systems and ensure engineers adhere to them.\r\n- Finally, we guarantee that users are satisfied with their experience, our process, and the usability of our features.\r\n- Recognise and plan for edge cases that could result in a poorer user experience before changes are rolled out to production.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~013685540066aa45a1','-',7,'United States','Los Angeles',48.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 10:59:21',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
