(16346,'Create responsive Wordpress (Elementor) site from Figma designs (8 pages)',15,'*The indicated budget is a placeholder, please indicate in your bid what you anticipate the cost will be and I will share the Figma designs prior to hiring in case any adjustment is needed*\r\n\r\n\r\nHi,\r\n\r\nI\'m seeking a Wordpress (with Elementor) expert to build my website to match designs that have already been created in Figma. This project will include a total of 8 page layouts (6 pages + blog post layout & blog archive layout). Both desktop and mobile layouts are provided in Figma for reference.\r\n\r\nThe website doesn\'t really have any special functionality, so much of the work will be in fine tuning the layout to match the Figma designs & smoothly adjust to screens of all sizes. There is one image that may require a plugin or require some limited css animation; we can discuss the best way to implement that.\r\n\r\nI will provide the license for Elementor Pro, as well as Ultimate Addons for Elementor. These may or may not be needed, but I have them if so. I also have a license for Astra Pro, in case you prefer to use that as the base for the theme. All images needed will be provided to you for use on the site. I\'ll also provide the URL, the hosting, etc.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- The site must be built in Wordpress using Elementor.\r\n- The pages must match the Figma designs to the degree possible, with a fully responsive layout.\r\n- The site be built to all current Wordpress standards / best practices\r\n- Any plugins beyond those mentioned above must be discussed before use. The site should be as lightweight & rely on as few plugins as possible.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease include in your reply:\r\n- Links to just 3 or 4 websites that show your abilities with responsive layouts in Wordpress\r\n- Please indicate what theme you would build the site on top of (e.g. Hello theme, Astra theme, or something else)\r\n- Your availability to start and a rough timeline to develop the 8 page site\r\n- Please indicate whether you would be able to do any on-page SEO optimization during the site build (whether it\'s something you normally include, available at additional cost, etc). Not a requirement, just curious what options you might offer there (if any).\r\n- If you have any questions, please feel free to ask.\r\n\r\nI will share the Figma designs with potential candidates prior to hiring so you can take a look & confirm or adjust your bid. This project is otherwise ready to start when you are.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\n-Matt','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~012b3f26de24317081','-',7,'United States','Bethel',1200.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 11:33:24',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
