(16351,'WordPress Custom Website for Fashion House - Full Stack Developer',15,'Hello,\r\n\r\nWe are currently seeking a highly skilled WordPress / Full Stack Developer to join our team for a custom build project for a Fashion House. As a member of our team, you will be responsible for developing and implementing custom features and functionalities for the website, ensuring that it meets the specific requirements and needs of our client.\r\n\r\nThis website is a total of 12 pages with fairly complex design with e-commerce.\r\n\r\nTo be considered for this role, you must have significant experience in WordPress development, as well as a strong background in full stack development. Additionally, you must be comfortable with participating in live Zoom sessions with the team and clients.\r\n\r\nKey Requirements:\r\n\r\nStrong expertise in WordPress development, including custom theme and plugin development\r\nExperience with full stack development, including HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and PHP\r\nExperience with version control systems such as Git\r\nAbility to work with InDesign PDFs to provide direction for website design and development\r\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills\r\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team\r\nIf you meet the above requirements and are interested in joining our team, please submit your resume and portfolio for consideration.\r\n\r\nThank you for your interest. We look forward to hearing from you!\r\n\r\nDaniel','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~013b915605e2a90bc6','-',7,'United States','Townsend',3000.000,'fixed',3000.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 11:49:22',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
