(16360,'Brochure Designer',13,'We are looking for a talented and creative Brochure Designer to help design a brochure for our new product. The brochure will be used to showcase the features and benefits of our product and to provide information to potential customers.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nWork with the marketing team to understand the product and target audience\r\nDesign a brochure that effectively communicates the features and benefits of the product\r\nCreate icons and illustrations to represent the features and benefits of the product\r\nDesign the brochure in a way that is visually appealing and easy to read\r\nInclude an explanation of the user groups that the product is designed for\r\nEnsure that the brochure is consistent with our branding and messaging\r\nProvide multiple design options for the brochure and incorporate feedback from the marketing team\r\nDeliver the final brochure design in a variety of formats for both print and digital use\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience as a Brochure Designer or a similar role\r\nExcellent graphic design skills with proficiency in Adobe Creative Suite\r\nStrong attention to detail and ability to create high-quality designs\r\nAbility to understand complex information and translate it into visually appealing and easy-to-understand designs\r\nStrong communication skills and ability to work collaboratively with a team\r\nAbility to manage multiple projects and meet deadlines\r\nExperience designing brochures for print and digital use\r\nIf you are passionate about creating high-quality designs and have experience designing brochures, we would love to hear from you. Please send your portfolio and resume to us and include \"Brochure Designer\" in the subject line. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01a8b6508c35da62c2','-',7,'United States','Singapore',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 12:17:47',