(16363,'Branding and company name for new skincare brand',2,'Hi!\r\nI am launching a new skincare brand and want to understand the market and what brand identity and brand name will resonate the most with the customer. It\'s a very saturated market and I wanted to ensure I pitch it for the best success.\r\n\r\nIt will a smaller boutique company initially but with all businesses I aim to grow it. Target market will be female generally from 30 to 50 but below 30 would also be a consideration.\r\n\r\nI guess I need help to understand which brands and ethos perform well. Then to develop a brand name or possibly verify the ideas I have already, I could just move forward with my own ideas but it would be great to get some expert insight. I want the name to be interesting and cool; possibly incorporating the key USP but also open to ideas. There is always the issue of having most of the .com extensions taken but there are generally work arounds.\r\n\r\nSomeone with experience in the beauty industry would be helpful.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nSteve.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ff8186aeeccfdd5b','-',7,'United States','Bondi Junction',55.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 12:36:17',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
