(16373,'Remote medical office staff',21,'Hiring Pakistani and Indian physicians fluent in English to remotely help with US Neurosurgical practice for part-time work. We need help answering phone calls, scheduling patients for clinic and surgeries, proofreading medical records, checking faxes, faxing medical records, obtaining authorizations for tests and surgeries, billing, and calling, texting, and emailing patients. We need you to be available as close to 8 AM to 5 PM US Pacific Standard Time, but we will also have off hours and weekends to cover as well. We will be using Microsoft Teams and apps, eClinical Works, and many other electronic medical records, and you will need to be comfortable using all these applications. You need a computer, a dependable internet connection, and a quiet place to do this work. Those who excel will be given visa support to come to the US and work for our Practice in person. And for those who commit several years to us, we will also write letters of reference to help you get into US residencies.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1642554953430929409','-',7,'United States','San Diego',7.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 13:13:46',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
