(16383,'Brand Designer needed for Digital Agency',2,'Hi candidates,\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for a Brand Designer to work within our team for our client.\r\n\r\nBelow we describe the first project we\'d like to work on.\r\nThis job description is about performing Deliverable 1.\r\nHowever, if you\'re up to work on Deliverable 2 too, you\'re welcome.\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\n\r\n1. Brand refresh\r\nObjective: A modern refresh, not a complete facelift.\r\n- Logo Refresh - (x5 variations + 2 rounds of revisions)\r\n- Logo Color Variants\r\n- Logo Clear Space Guide\r\n- Logo Misuse\r\n- Brand Color Palette\r\n- Brand Color Tones\r\n- Brand Color Hierarchy\r\n- Brand Typefaces (including choice of web-safe font for email marketing purposes)\r\n- Brand Typographic System\r\n\r\n2. Email template designs\r\nx3 responsive email templates designs in Figma. \"Animated, cinematic, some dynamism, and has a fast yet effortless showcase feeling.\"\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- English speaker, at least B2 level;\r\n- Good communication skills with attention to detail and a just a nice person in general :)\r\n- Experience with Brand Design of 3 years or more (will consider less if portfolio is impressive enough);\r\n- You will be asked to explain your concepts and ideas to the client in writing when you present them.\r\n\r\nPlease remember to write about your quality, skills, send any additional information that might help. Also please start your letter from the phrase \'I understood the assignment\'. We\'d like to offer you this project at the beginning and consider you as a go-to person for the next projects of that type if everything goes well.\r\n\r\nIf you want to be considered for this role, you should\r\n1. give an estimated price for both tasks separately (in case you up to perform task 2).\r\n2. answer all the questions.\r\n\r\nWe are looking forward to hearing from you!\r\n\r\nAbout us:\r\nEfir Media (efirmedia.com), Inc (Philadelphia, USA).\r\nWe design and build websites for SMBs and larger enterprise clients, based mainly in North America and Europe, but one of our co-owners is located in Dubai and we\'d like to expand our business to UAE.\r\nWe are a team of 17, with a core team consisting of two co-founders, Art Director, Head of Marketing, Head of Sales, Head of Operations, Project Managers and a number of UX/UI Designers, Web Developers, QA Testers and Illustrators. We\'ve won more than 35 industry awards from Awwwards, Behance and Dribbble, and are striving to be one of the best agencies in the world within the next five years.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016aa1c110dd637769','-',7,'United States','Folcroft',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 13:22:59',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
