(16428,'Branding and Logo Design for Fintech Company in Hong Kong',10,'Description:\r\n\r\nWe are a fintech company based in Hong Kong and we are looking for a professional branding and logo designer to help us create a strong brand identity for our new app and debit card service for kids under 18. The name of our app is BALLOON and we want our branding and logo to reflect the fun and playful nature of our service while also conveying a sense of security and trust to parents.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Develop a comprehensive branding strategy for the BALLOON app and debit card service\r\n- Design a unique and memorable logo that captures the essence of our service\r\n- Create a consistent visual identity across all marketing materials, including social media, email marketing, and website design\r\n- Conduct market research to identify the target audience and develop messaging that resonates with parents and children\r\n- Collaborate with our team to ensure that our brand identity is aligned with our company values and mission\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience in branding and logo design, preferably for fintech companies\r\n- Strong portfolio showcasing your design skills and ability to create a cohesive visual identity\r\n- Excellent communication and collaboration skills\r\n- Familiarity with the fintech industry and trends in branding and design\r\n- Ability to work within tight deadlines and deliver high-quality work','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~017432cea177c744f9','-',7,'United States','N/A',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 15:02:53',NULL,19,3,NULL,129),
