(16431,'Brand kits for 5 websites',2,'Design Brief for Bioresonance Therapy Websites:\r\n\r\nOverview:\r\nWe are looking for a talented and experienced designer to improve the overall visual identity of our five websites that specialize in bioresonance therapy. The goal of this project is to enhance the brand identity, make the social media posts more visually appealing and professional, and create brand kits in Canva that will be used for marketing purposes.\r\n\r\nThe 5 sites for the project are:\r\n\r\nhttps://therawellness.co.uk/\r\n\r\nhttps://bioresonance.vet/\r\n\r\nhttps://bioresonancetherapy.com/\r\n\r\nhttps://bioresonancetraining.online\r\n\r\nhttps://bioresonanceshop.com/','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1642905856600510465?success','-',7,'United States','Leeds',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 15:05:20',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
(16432,'Trade show display booth graphic design',2,'Our trade show booth\r\n\r\nWe have a backlight display booth. We are the only solar company in the US that has developed AI technology to immediately assess energy needs for homeowners and provide them instant proposal by scanning a QR code from our display. Depending on the show or location of the display we may decide to post a special promotion which could be printed on a smaller piece and velcroid to the section of the display.\r\nThe booth consists of two parts wider and shorter and taller. We need both to have the same message (graphics) however both has a two sided canvas so each side needs to be designed with graphics that if we use the front of one display and back of the other one the graphics will match.\r\nWe also have two tables with tall backing which we could use with or without a monitor, graphics must be designed to allow for this.\r\n\r\nOne thing that is the most important and separates us from other solar companies, is that we have developed AI technology to instantly and only using zip code and monthly electric cost of a consumer, to provide them with a scientific solar quote with multiple financing options, this is done without greedy sales people involvement.\r\n\r\nWe also would like to create or use a brand image on our display and other digital or print material so that the consumers can relate and identify with us instantly.\r\nWe will also include a picture of our CEO who articles had been written about his innovation of AI which could be used on your design and our branding\r\nIn summary the imagery must communicate solar + AI +savings plus environment and entice the customer to scan our QR code on the display to get a solar quote instantly\r\nHere are some highlighted requirements.\r\n1. Messaging: The messaging should emphasize the unique selling proposition of SolarIt, which is the use of AI technology for instant solar quotes. This messaging should be prominent on the homepage of the website, landing pages, and ads, so that potential customers can easily identify the brand and understand its value proposition.\r\n2. Personalization: The graphics should include images that resonate with the target audience, such as homeowners over 40 years of age, and convey a sense of trust and credibility. The use of images of happy families can be effective, but they should be combined with visuals that communicate the use of AI technology for instant solar quotes.\r\n3. Branding: The design should incorporate branding elements that distinguish SolarIt from other solar companies. This can include a logo that prominently displays the use of AI technology, or a tagline that communicates the instant and scientific accuracy of SolarIt\'s solar quotes.\r\n4. Call to action: The graphics should include a clear call to action, such as \"Scan the QR code for an instant solar quote\" or \"Get started with SolarIt today.\" This call to action should be prominently displayed on the homepage, landing pages, and ads.\r\n5. Taglines: In addition to the call to action, taglines can be effective in communicating the value proposition of SolarIt. Some suggestions include \"Instant solar quotes, powered by AI\" or \"Say goodbye to pushy salespeople, and hello to SolarIt.\" These taglines should be prominently displayed on the website, landing pages, and ads.\r\n6. Visuals: The graphics should be visually appealing and include elements that convey the use of AI technology. This can include graphics that depict the process of scanning a QR code for an instant solar quote, or images that showcase the accuracy and efficiency of SolarIt\'s solar quotes.\r\n7. Color scheme: The color scheme should be consistent with the SolarIt brand, and should include colors that convey trust, credibility, by indicating we are a 5 star rated company and the sign of award of best in vegas. Also check out the landing page https://solarit.org/landing-page1 for color scheme\r\n8. Your main design will be used as our main image in our new website, landing pages, print and digital ads\r\nIn summary, the marketing and design consultant should focus on emphasizing the use of AI technology for instant solar quotes, incorporating branding elements that distinguish SolarIt from other solar companies, and using visuals that convey trust, credibility, and innovation. Additionally, they should use taglines and a clear call to action to encourage potential customers to engage with SolarIt and get their customized solar quote.\r\n\r\nNote: Solarit correct spelling below\r\nSOLARIT®','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01068a54d47dafaab1','-',7,'United States','San Francisco',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 15:05:56',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(16433,'Build a website for a commercial landscaping company with a lead form submission function.',3,'We are looking for a basic website for our landscaping company. The website will have a basic form to capture lead and contact information and 8 pages that are listed below.\r\n\r\n0. Home\r\n1. Our Story\r\n2. Services\r\n2a. Interior Plantscaping\r\n2b. Interior Plant Maintenance\r\n2c. Exterior Commerical Landscaping\r\n3. Industries Served(Multi-Family Properties, Restaurants, Office Space, Hotels, Retail Locations)\r\n4. Contact\r\n\r\nReach out if interested!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1642905820075753473','-',7,'United States','Denver',3000.000,'fixed',3000.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 15:06:05',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
(16434,'BUILD OUR WEBSITE Quickwaterfishing.com',3,'Hello\r\n\r\nThis is Kurt & Jason of Quickwater Sports Corp. We are in the process of completing all the materials needed to build an ecommerce website. It will initially not be a very big website but well spaced, designed and described.\r\n\r\nThe website will feature our manufactured product which is a unique waterproof board for holding fishing leader lines. Each QW Board include there own HD Ziplock Lure case, for securing one leader line & Bait/Lure in storage for immediate use when required. They effectively hold Baits small, up to as big as 9 inches long on all standard leader line thicknesses and line lengths with extra capacity for different rigging needs. The advantage to having leader lines tied and ready for fast immediate use is nothing new. It has not however been addressed by millions of Anglers who could improve there fishing success by adopting their use and additionally for many reasons beyond the basics of storage. It is a storage solution with many purposed fishing benefits for almost all fishing species and methods of fishing .\r\n\r\nWe like a website initially in comparison to many other e-commerce fishing brands to feature initially a maximum of ten products. We are planning to add additional products on a regular basis. We will require some work at the start of the website build which we will discuss with you later.\r\n\r\nWe have begun building a website wireframe, all product info, slider pages, details for shop pages, cart, about us etc. This product itself is not very expensive given the quality and design. It works amazingly well and its very Angler friendly.\r\n\r\nPlease include samples of ecommerce websites you have built that can be verified. Please provide information on your SEO experience.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nIf you are not part of UPWORK please do not contact us.\r\n\r\nThank you\r\nJason and Kurt\r\nwww.quickwaterfishing.com\r\nE: kurt@quickwaterfishing.com\r\nE: jason@quickwaterfishing.com','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1642906475047628801','-',7,'United States','na',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 15:07:50',NULL,18,3,NULL,156),
