(16439,'Brand kits for 5 websites',2,'Design Brief for Bioresonance Therapy Websites:\r\n\r\nOverview:\r\nWe are looking for a talented and experienced designer to improve the overall visual identity of our five websites that specialize in bioresonance therapy. The goal of this project is to enhance the brand identity, make the social media posts more visually appealing and professional, and create brand kits in Canva that will be used for marketing purposes.\r\n\r\nThe 5 sites for the project are:\r\n\r\nhttps://therawellness.co.uk/\r\n\r\nhttps://bioresonance.vet/\r\n\r\nhttps://bioresonancetherapy.com/\r\n\r\nhttps://bioresonancetraining.online\r\n\r\nhttps://bioresonanceshop.com/\r\n\r\n\r\nTarget Audience:\r\nOur target audience is people who are interested in alternative therapies and treatments, specifically bioresonance therapy. They are typically health-conscious individuals who are seeking holistic and natural approaches to improve their overall well-being.\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\n\r\nUpdated logos for each of the five websites that reflect the brand\'s values, vision, and offerings.\r\nColor palettes that can be used consistently across all five websites and social media platforms.\r\nFont selections that are easy to read and reflect the brand\'s personality.\r\nBrand kits in Canva that include templates for social media posts, cover pages, and other marketing materials.\r\nOptional: Design recommendations for the websites to make them more visually appealing, user-friendly, and in line with the updated brand identity.\r\n\r\nBrand Identity:\r\nOur brand identity should reflect our commitment to natural and holistic therapies, as well as our expertise in bioresonance therapy. The overall look and feel should be professional, calming, and welcoming. We are open to suggestions for specific visual elements that can help us stand out from our competitors.\r\n\r\nDesign Requirements:\r\n\r\nEach website should have a unique but cohesive visual identity that reflects the overall brand identity.\r\nThe design should be consistent across all marketing materials, including social media posts, cover pages, and website banners.\r\nThe color palettes and font selections should be easy to read and consistent across all platforms.\r\nThe design should be optimized for mobile and desktop viewing.\r\nOptional: Consider incorporating relevant images, icons, and illustrations to enhance the overall visual identity.\r\nTimeline and Budget:\r\nWe are looking to have this project completed within 4 weeks from the start date. Our budget for this project is $500-$1000 USD.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this job, please include your portfolio and samples of similar work you\'ve done in the past. We are looking for someone who can bring creativity, professionalism, and expertise to this project.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~018fa3eb56e78daaf2','-',7,'United States','leeds',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 15:13:42',NULL,19,3,NULL,129),
