(16448,'Expert designer needed for pitch deck',11,'I am: A startup founder building a cool new company in the streaming space.\r\n\r\nLooking for: A smart and talented designer to help turn my not-so-great pitch deck into one that\'ll attract investment.\r\n\r\nThe pitch deck: Is already compiled. Its copy doesn\'t need work (though I\'m always open to edits and suggestions), but its graphics are not very good, and the overall design is somewhat generic and PPT-based.\r\n\r\nThe hope is: To convert it from something anyone can throw together into something that looks more akin to the style of pitch decks one might see from successful startups.\r\n\r\nMy style: Is very open-minded with the hope to collaborate with the designer. I’m a big-vision thinker and not a micro-manager and I like to allow skilled individuals to apply their skills in ways they know best. While communication will be open, I will try to give clear instruction and feedback, but otherwise not be too much of a nuisance. I hope to trust the work of the designer and allow them (with my guidance) to do their thing as they do best.\r\n\r\nThe task: Is somewhat straightforward and (I hope) simple. The deck is 22-slides. The need is to improve its appearance for digestibility and the effectiveness of the branding. That might involve graphic design, color schemes, logo design, and data visualization. It may require other tasks and skills, but I will leave that to the discretion of the designer.\r\n\r\nThe expectation: Is that this deck will come before dozens (at the very least) of potential investors and stakeholders. I don\'t believe the task will be a \"heavy-lift\" since the deck is largely complete and the team is clear on vision, though it will require a skilled designer to accomplish efficiently.\r\n\r\nI’m looking for someone smart, talented, and easy to work with! I hope you find the same in me.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01f837757422f922be','-',7,'United States','Monsey',48.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 15:20:29',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
