(16472,'Packaging Designer (Pet Products)',2,'We are seeking a talented and creative Packaging Designer with a passion for pet products to join our team. As a Packaging Designer, you will be responsible for creating designs for our pet product packaging that are both functional and visually appealing. You will collaborate with our Marketing, Product Development, and our Manufacturing partners to ensure that the packaging design is aligned with our brand image and product specifications.\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n• Develop and design packaging concepts and graphics for our pet products that align with our brand image and product specifications\r\n• Collaborate with cross-functional teams to ensure that the packaging design meets regulatory requirements, is cost-effective, and can be manufactured efficiently\r\n• Research and identify packaging materials and technologies that can improve product protection, functionality, and sustainability for pet products\r\n• Create 3D mockups and prototypes of pet product packaging designs to present and for feedback and approval\r\n• Manage multiple pet product packaging design projects simultaneously, ensuring that timelines and deliverables are met','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1642920797448704001','-',7,'United States','Fort Lauderdale',70.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 16:04:31',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
(16473,'Experienced Web Designer for Engaging Career Page and Recruitment-focused Website',4,'We are Elite Auto Experts, a leading auto repair shop seeking a talented and experienced web designer to revamp our career page and optimize our website for recruitment purposes. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in designing visually appealing and user-friendly websites, with a particular focus on career pages and recruitment strategies.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n\r\n1. Design and develop a visually engaging and user-\r\nfriendly career page that showcases our company\r\nculture, values, job openings, employee testimonials,\r\nand benefits.\r\n2. Optimize our existing website for SEO and user\r\nexperience with a focus on attracting and retaining\r\ntop automotive technicians and service advisors.\r\n3. Implement clear calls-to-action, intuitive navigation,\r\nand accessible design elements to encourage\r\ncandidates to apply for open positions.\r\n4. Collaborate with our team to gather content and\r\nensure consistent branding throughout the website.\r\n5. Integrate social media and sharing options to boost\r\nour online presence and promote job openings.\r\n6. Implement tracking and analytics tools to monitor\r\nuser behavior and continuously improve the site\'s\r\nperformance.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n1. Proven experience in web design and development,\r\npreferably with a focus on career pages and\r\nrecruitment strategies.\r\n2. Strong portfolio showcasing visually appealing and\r\nuser-friendly websites.\r\n3. Proficiency in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and responsive\r\ndesign principles.\r\n4. Experience with content management systems (e.g.,\r\nWordPress) and SEO best practices.\r\n5. Excellent communication and collaboration skills.\r\n6. Ability to work within a specified timeline and budget.\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit your resume, a link to your portfolio, and a brief description of your experience in designing career pages or recruitment