(16476,'Packaging Designer (Pet Products)',2,'We are seeking a talented and creative Packaging Designer with a passion for pet products to join our team. As a Packaging Designer, you will be responsible for creating designs for our pet product packaging that are both functional and visually appealing. You will collaborate with our Marketing, Product Development, and our Manufacturing partners to ensure that the packaging design is aligned with our brand image and product specifications.\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n• Develop and design packaging concepts and graphics for our pet products that align with our brand image and product specifications\r\n• Collaborate with cross-functional teams to ensure that the packaging design meets regulatory requirements, is cost-effective, and can be manufactured efficiently\r\n• Research and identify packaging materials and technologies that can improve product protection, functionality, and sustainability for pet products\r\n• Create 3D mockups and prototypes of pet product packaging designs to present and for feedback and approval\r\n• Manage multiple pet product packaging design projects simultaneously, ensuring that timelines and deliverables are met','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1642919981702729729?success','-',7,'United States','Fort Lauderdale',70.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 16:11:08',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
