(16502,'WordPress Web Designer (Modern SaaS Style)',4,'We are currently seeking an innovative and experienced WordPress Web Designer with a strong background in modern SaaS style website design to join our team. The ideal candidate should be passionate about creating visually appealing and user-friendly WordPress websites.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDesign and create modern, visually appealing WordPress websites with a focus on SaaS style.\r\n\r\nCollaborate with the development team to ensure seamless integration of design and functionality\r\n\r\nUpdate and maintain existing websites, ensuring adherence to modern design trends\r\n\r\nTranslate business requirements into compelling visual design concepts\r\n\r\nOptimize designs for various devices and browsers to ensure a responsive experience\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience designing and creating modern SaaS style WordPress websites\r\n\r\nStrong understanding of design principles, typography, and color theory\r\n\r\nProficient in Adobe Creative Suite (Illustrator, Photoshop) and other design tools\r\n\r\nFamiliarity with WordPress and relevant page builders, such as Divi or Elementor\r\n\r\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills\r\n\r\nAttention to detail and a commitment to high-quality work\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit your resume, portfolio showcasing your experience in modern SaaS style website design, and a brief description of your experience working with WordPress. Also please include the word \'Zebra\' in your application so that we know you read this job post. We look forward to finding the best candidate to join our team!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1642935562087501825','-',7,'United States','Nettlebed',9.000,'perhour',9.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 17:03:16',NULL,18,3,NULL,156),
