(16511,'Web Designer',4,'Web Designer\r\n\r\nJob Overview:\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a talented and creative Web Designer to join our team. As a Web Designer, you will be responsible for designing and implementing website layouts, graphics, and user interfaces. You will be working closely with our development team to ensure that the website is functional, user-friendly, and visually appealing. You should have a strong portfolio of work that showcases your design skills, creativity, and attention to detail.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n• Design and develop website layouts, graphics, and user interfaces using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\r\n\r\n• Collaborate with the development team to ensure that the website is functional, user-friendly, and visually appealing.\r\n\r\n• Create and maintain design guidelines, templates, and style guides for the website.\r\n\r\n• Develop and maintain responsive design for desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.\r\n\r\n• Create and edit images, graphics, and videos for use on the website.\r\n\r\n• Conduct user research and usability testing to improve the website\'s design and functionality.\r\n\r\n• Optimize website performance and ensure that it is compatible with different browsers and devices.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n• Bachelor\'s degree in Graphic Design, Web Design, or a related field.\r\n\r\n• At least 3 years of experience in web design.\r\n\r\n• Strong skills in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\r\n\r\n• Proficient in Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign).\r\n\r\n• Familiarity with user interface design principles and practices.\r\n\r\n• Experience with responsive design and cross-browser compatibility.\r\n\r\n• Ability to work in a team environment and collaborate with developers and stakeholders.\r\n\r\n• Strong attention to detail and ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously.\r\n\r\n• Excellent communication and interpersonal skills.\r\n\r\nIf you are a creative and passionate Web Designer with a strong portfolio of work, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity to join our team.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1642941144621387779','-',7,'United States','na',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 17:25:26',NULL,18,3,NULL,156),
