(16531,'Brand Designer for eCommerce beauty brand',2,'Job Summary: We are seeking a talented and creative Brand Designer to help us create a new brand identity for our e-commerce beauty brand. The ideal candidate will be able to create a branding kit and design site elements that are congruent with our brand identity, as well as create elements for advertising. This will be an ongoing position, starting with the creation of the brand identity.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDevelop a new brand identity for our e-commerce beauty brand\r\n\r\nCreate a branding kit that includes logos, color palettes, typography, and brand guidelines\r\n\r\nDesign site elements that are congruent with our brand identity, including landing pages, product pages, and checkout pages\r\n\r\nCreate advertising elements such as banner ads, social media graphics, and email marketing templates\r\n\r\nWork collaboratively with other teams, such as marketing and product, to ensure brand consistency across all channels\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nA strong portfolio showcasing brand identity design and design skills\r\nProven experience creating branding kits and designing site elements, preferably for e-commerce brands\r\nStrong understanding of the principles behind brand identity and why it matters\r\nExcellent communication skills and the ability to work collaboratively with other teams\r\nAbility to quickly mockup ideas and iterate with guidance\r\n\r\nIf you have the relevant skills/expertise, we can conduct a first interview. If the first interview goes well, you may be offered a single small project (paid, of course) to see your work, creative skill, etc. We will then compare that paid project with other designers who have applied and make our final hiring decision.\r\n\r\nWe need a LOT of content for our business and are hoping to find someone to hire as a core designer. We expect approximately 20hrs/week of work to begin, with the opportunity for full-time.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1642961274407505921','-',7,'United States','Winterset',80.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 18:45:17',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
