(16539,'Logo and Brand Identity Design for Sustainable Solar Energy Mounts Company\"',2,'Looking for a talented graphic designer to create a logo and brand identity for \"Green Steel Mounts\", a company that specializes in manufacturing brackets and mounts for solar energy panels. The logo should be modern, professional, and visually appealing, with a focus on sustainability, eco-friendliness, and durability.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should have experience in logo design and branding, with a strong portfolio showcasing their skills. They should be able to work closely with the client to understand their vision and create a design that accurately reflects their brand values and mission.\r\n\r\nIn addition to the logo, the client also requires a brand style guide that outlines the use of colors, typography, and other visual elements that will be used in their marketing materials. The brand identity should be consistent across all channels, including their website, social media, and packaging.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re a creative designer with a passion for sustainability and renewable energy, this is the perfect opportunity to showcase your skills and help a new brand establish its visual identity.\r\n\r\nLogo Design: A unique and modern logo design that visually represents the \"Green Steel Mounts\" brand, including the logo variations and color palettes.\r\n\r\nBrand Style Guide: A comprehensive guide outlining the visual elements of the brand identity, including typography, color scheme, imagery, and graphic styles.\r\n\r\nStationery Design: Business card, letterhead, and envelope designs consistent with the brand identity.\r\n\r\nSocial Media Assets: Branded graphics and templates for social media platforms such as Facebook, Twitter, and Instagram.\r\n\r\nWebsite Assets: Design assets such as banners, icons, and graphics that are consistent with the brand identity.\r\n\r\nPackaging Design: Design for the product packaging that visually aligns with the brand identity.\r\n\r\nAll deliverables should be provided in high-resolution formats suitable for use across various platforms, including digital and print. Additionally, the designer may also be expected to provide revisions based on feedback from the client','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1642962986677665793?success','-',7,'United States','Hialeah',150.000,'perhour',150.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 18:52:17',NULL,19,3,NULL,123),
