(16567,'WordPress + WooComm Speed Optimization',15,'Our website is hosted in the USA (WPEngine), and has the WPEngine Caching and other settings already applied. We need speed optimization for USA AND Europe (VERY IMPORTANT!!!), as a large part of our customer base is in Europe. GTMetrix results are not that great when testing from the UK.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe have already compressed images (EWWW plugin) and they are hosted on EWWW CDN. We also have WPRocket enabled. As well, we are considering BunnyCDN.\r\n\r\n\r\n- Must have experience with optimizing WooCommerce\r\n\r\n- Must have knowledge on how to choose the right settings for JavaScript + CSS loading\r\n\r\n- Must have knowledge on how to optimize WordPress \"Heartbeat\"\r\n\r\n- We use Elementor Pro, so you must know how to optimize for this environment\r\n\r\n- We are open to changing caching plugins, settings, etc.. \r\n\r\n- We have access to whatever plugins are needed\r\n\r\n\r\nOpen to suggestions for improvements.\r\n\r\nMessage us for the URL of the website.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2048670','-',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 19:37:39',NULL,16,1,NULL,136),
