(16644,'Graphic Designer for Logo Redesign and Product Mockups',2,'We are seeking a skilled graphic designer to enhance our current logo by making minor adjustments to improve its aesthetics, provide the updated logo in multiple file formats, and create product mockups featuring the enhanced logo.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Review and assess the existing logo, making minor modifications to improve its appearance while maintaining brand identity.\r\n- Deliver the updated logo in various formats (vector, PNG, JPEG, etc.), appropriate for use across different platforms and applications.\r\n- Create visually appealing and realistic product mockups featuring the enhanced logo, including but not limited to: pullovers, mugs, and other promotional items.\r\n- Collaborate with the team to ensure the enhanced design aligns with our brand identity and meets our requirements.\r\n- Make revisions as needed based on feedback from the team.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Proven experience in graphic design, with a focus on logo enhancement and product mockup creation.\r\n- Proficiency in Adobe Creative Suite (Illustrator, Photoshop) or similar design software.\r\n- Strong attention to detail and ability to make subtle adjustments to existing designs.\r\n- Ability to work collaboratively and accept feedback.\r\n\r\nCover Letter: Elevator pitch - All we need is 2-3 bullets about your relevant experience along with your proposal, highlighting relevant experience in logo enhancement and product mockup creation.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643019491410776065','-',7,'United States','München',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-04-03',1,'2023-04-03',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-03 22:37:41',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
