(16649,'Google Slides presentation making assistant for software engineering conference slide deck',11,'For the next two weeks, you will be my slide deck assistant for preparing a technical conference presentation. The presentation is scheduled for April 21, 2023. I am actively working on presentation content every day and have a draft version of the slides. No template design work is needed because I will use a simple slide layout, all the work is in creating individual slides with technical content. The presentation software is Google Slides.\r\n\r\nThis work will be ongoing between project start and April 21st. I have a few tasks that need to be done immediately. After these tasks are done, I will have specific requests for up to 1 hour of small tasks almost every day. I will need a turnaround of 24-48 hours.\r\n\r\nWhat you will do:\r\n\r\n- For two key slides that illustrate technical concepts, you will propose three design ideas based on my detailed specification and links to similar images and videos that I like.\r\n- Once I have selected one design, you will create the slides, including visualizations, animations, finding any required Nounproject icons or images, ...\r\n- For a group of approximately 10 slides, I will provide sequence diagrams as PlantUML text (or simple rendered image) and you will translate them into a visually appealing layout.\r\n- As I continue working on the slide deck, I will ask you for specific detail work such as: Including code with syntax highlighting, adding graphical elements like a time line to existing slides, completing/fixing alignment and spacing.\r\n- I will ask you for feedback on layout and proof reading.\r\n\r\nYou can see slides and recordings of my previous talks at jonasneubert.com/talks/ The layout of this talk will be the same as previous talks, but completely different content.\r\n\r\nYou must have prior experience with software engineering content, including syntax highlighting, UML-style figures, sequence diagrams. Please provide at least one example of previous work.\r\n \r\n\r\nless\r\nMore/Less about','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01c88989469f9469c6','-',7,'United States','Salt lake city',75.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-04',1,'2023-04-04',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-04 07:42:34',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(16650,'Logo for stable',10,'We are a family owned company that is starting a stable where we will rent out boxes to other horse owners. We want a logo for the stable that can be used on clothing, cars, transports etc. as well as on a sign at the stable building.\r\n\r\nThe name of the company is \"L2 Stables\" and some key words to describe the intended logo are:\r\n\r\n* Elegance\r\n* Movement\r\n* Trust\r\n\r\nThe logo might be used in other areas as well so the logo should not contain actual horses or similar graphics that cannot be used elsewhere.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to working with you on this.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~019e97978460f77582','-',7,'United States','Älvkarleby',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-04-04',1,'2023-04-04',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-04 07:46:34',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
