(16655,'Website Design & Development',3,'The World Consciousness Alliance is seeking a talented and experienced web designer and graphic designer to help create a website that reflects our mission and branding.\r\n\r\nThe website should be easy to navigate, visually appealing, and mobile-friendly. It should provide a clear and concise message of who we are, what we do, and how people can get involved. The design should be in line with our existing logo and style.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\nDesign the website structure and layout, ensuring it is user-friendly and responsive across different devices.\r\n\r\nCreate all 8 main pages of the website: homepage, about us, what we do, events, awards, our community, donate, and contact us.\r\n\r\nIncorporate the existing logo and branding into the website design, ensuring it is consistent throughout all pages.\r\n\r\nEnsure that the website design reflects the mission and values of the World Consciousness Alliance, using appropriate imagery, fonts, and colors.\r\n\r\nOptimize the website for search engine optimization (SEO) and website performance, including page load times and mobile responsiveness.\r\n\r\nCollaborate with the graphic designer to ensure all visual elements of the website are cohesive and in line with the branding guidelines.\r\n\r\nImplement any necessary plugins or features to enhance the website\'s functionality and user experience.\r\n\r\nProvide regular updates to the team on the progress of the website design and incorporate feedback as needed.\r\n\r\nEnsure that the website is easy to navigate and that all pages are accessible from the main menu.\r\nIncorporate calls to action throughout the website to encourage user engagement and conversion.\r\n\r\nPrevious site: https://www.wca.earth/','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~019cc25b999113ce02','-',7,'United States','Isle of Man',750.000,'fixed',750.000,'2023-04-04',1,'2023-04-04',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-04 08:33:08',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
