(16657,'Experienced Logo Designer Needed for Trademark Logo Creation',10,'We are looking for a talented and experienced logo designer to create a unique and eye-catching trademark logo for our shop. The ideal candidate must have a strong background in creating distinctive trademark logos for businesses.\r\n\r\nProject Details:\r\n\r\n*Design a creative and memorable trademark logo for our shop\r\n*The logo can be a single name, a pure character logo, or any other innovative idea based on our products\r\n*Deliver the final logo in multiple formats (AI, EPS, PNG, JPEG, etc.) for various applications\r\n*Work collaboratively with us to ensure the logo meets our requirements and vision\r\n*Be able to complete the project within the agreed-upon deadline\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n*Proven experience in logo design, with a strong focus on creating trademark logos\r\n*A diverse portfolio showcasing your previous logo design work, including trademark logos\r\n*Excellent communication skills and the ability to receive and implement feedback\r\n*Attention to detail and a keen eye for design aesthetics\r\n\r\n\r\nTo apply:\r\nPlease submit your proposal along with a link to your online portfolio or samples of your previous logo design work, specifically highlighting trademark logos you have designed. We will review your previous work and, if we believe you are a good fit for our project, we will provide more details about our shop and the products we offer.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to working with a talented logo designer to bring our vision to life!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01cd79875c06ff997c','-',7,'United States','US',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-04-04',1,'2023-04-04',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-04 09:37:03',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
