(16678,'Rebranding Project for Mental Health and Wellness Company',2,'We are seeking a talented and experienced brand identity designer to help us rebrand our company. Our current brand is focused on stationery products, but we are expanding into mental health and wellness items. Therefore, we need to update our branding to reflect this shift in focus.\r\n\r\n\r\n- Conduct research on our target audience and competitors to determine an effective branding strategy\r\n- Develop a new brand identity that reflects our company\'s values and mission in the mental health and wellness space\r\n- Create a style guide that includes brand colours, typography, imagery, and tone of voice\r\n- Design a logo that represents our new brand identity\r\n- Develop a visual language for our brand that can be used across all marketing materials, including website, social media, and packaging\r\n- Design packaging that reflects your brand\'s new identity and aligns with your target audience\'s expectations\r\n- Develop a landing page that showcases your new brand identity and provides a clear and concise message about your company\'s values and mission\r\n- Develop an Instagram page that aligns with your brand\'s new identity and resonates with your target audience\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this project, please submit your portfolio and a proposal outlining your approach to rebranding our company, designing our packaging, developing our landing page, and creating our Instagram page. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01269b7430e091133c','-',7,'United States','London',700.000,'fixed',700.000,'2023-04-04',1,'2023-04-04',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-04 12:28:36',NULL,18,3,NULL,146),
