(16698,'Pitch deck for an innovative start up',11,'Job Overview:\r\nWe are an ambitious and innovative startup in the tech industry seeking a talented and experienced pitch deck designer to help us create a captivating and visually appealing pitch deck. Our goal is to secure funding and partnerships from investors and industry leaders, so your work will play a crucial role in our company\'s growth and success.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nCollaborate closely with our team to understand our business, value proposition, target audience, and market positioning\r\nDesign a visually stunning and persuasive pitch deck that effectively communicates our startup\'s vision, mission, product offerings, and market potential\r\nDevelop a consistent visual theme and design language throughout the pitch deck, incorporating our brand elements\r\nCreate high-quality graphics, charts, and infographics to effectively illustrate key data points and support our messaging\r\nEnsure the pitch deck is optimized for both in-person and remote presentations\r\nRevise and iterate the design based on feedback from our team and potential investors\r\nDeliver the final pitch deck in editable formats (e.g., PowerPoint, Keynote, or Google Slides) within the agreed-upon deadline\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience in designing compelling pitch decks for startups or established businesses\r\nStrong portfolio showcasing your ability to create visually engaging presentations that effectively communicate complex ideas\r\nExcellent graphic design skills, including proficiency in design software such as Adobe Creative Suite, Canva, or similar tools\r\nKeen eye for detail and strong visual storytelling abilities\r\nExcellent communication and interpersonal skills\r\nAbility to work independently and collaboratively in a fast-paced environment\r\nStrong time-management skills and ability to meet tight deadlines\r\nFamiliarity with the tech industry and startup ecosystem is a plus\r\nTo Apply:\r\nPlease submit your resume, a link to your portfolio showcasing relevant work, and a brief cover letter explaining why you are the ideal candidate for this role. Additionally, please provide an estimated timeline for completing the pitch deck, based on a 20-slide presentation.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to reviewing your application and potentially working together on this exciting project!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01d4d2618d7124bfad/apply/','-',7,'United States','Gdynia',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-04-04',1,'2023-04-04',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-04 13:24:15',NULL,19,3,NULL,120),
(16699,'SEO Content Writer for Plastic Surgery Practice',37,'Our renowned plastic surgery practice seeks an experienced and highly skilled SEO content writer to create compelling and informative content for our website and blog. As our SEO content writer, you will be responsible for creating high-quality, engaging, and optimized content that will attract and educate our target audience.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n* Conducting keyword research to identify relevant topics and keywords for our plastic surgery practice\r\n* Creating high-quality, optimized content for our website and blog that is engaging, informative, and persuasive\r\n* Collaborating with the marketing team to develop content strategies and optimize existing content for search engines\r\n* Ensuring all content is accurate, up-to-date, and consistent with our brand voice and tone\r\n* Staying up-to-date with the latest SEO trends and best practices and incorporating them into our content strategy\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n* Bachelor\'s degree in English, Communications, Marketing, or a related field\r\n* Proven experience as an SEO content writer with a portfolio of published work\r\n* Strong understanding of SEO best practices and how to optimize content for search engines\r\n* Excellent writing, editing, and proofreading skills\r\n* Familiarity with content management systems such as WordPress\r\n* Ability to work independently and meet tight deadlines\r\n* Experience in the medical or healthcare industry, particularly plastic surgery, is a plus\r\n\r\nIf you are a talented and experienced SEO content writer passionate about plastic surgery, beauty and body transformation, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity. Please submit your resume, cover letter, and writing samples for consideration.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643239318242217985','-',7,'United States','Los Angeles',5000.000,'fixed',4500.000,'2023-04-04',1,'2023-04-04',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NUL