(16792,'Virtual Assistant for Medical Office',22,'Hi,\r\n\r\nI am looking for a Virtual Assistant that can be my right hand, and a very important person in my medical business. Part time initially and then Full time.\r\n\r\nThis is a flex job initially , you will begin working 2-20 hours a week initially, supporting 8:30 AM to 5:00 PM Pacific Standard Time from Monday to Friday. Within 2 months, if you do a good job, you may get a raise.\r\n\r\nAn initial review of responsibilities and tasks are as follows-\r\nEmail / Calendar / Meeting / Call / Updating charts\r\n- You will check my emails and respond on my behalf if necessary.\r\n- You will send calendar meeting invites to people, patients and schedule appointments/meetings.\r\n- You will need to make calls for inquiry / quotes / service changes / pre-authorization etc.\r\n- You will need to attend to phone calls of patients and understand their concerns\r\n- You may be able to answer some queries of patients on the phone with some training/discussions\r\n- You should be able to update some records in the database (data entry)\r\n\r\nCoordination and Managements\r\n- You will help the Medical team, with gathering patient data and research\r\n- Keep track of email calendars and organize appointments\r\n\r\n- Help take calls from Future Patients/Insurance Companies, and assist them with their request, as possible.\r\n- Send out communications / notifications / referrals to patients/other medical teams/doctors/ PT/ OT , for coordination and follow up care\r\n- Negotiate tasks and completion of tasks\r\n\r\nPersonal Tasks\r\n- Help with making reservations (travel or personal related)\r\n\r\nIf you are interested, please send your cover letter. I will review and send you a meeting link to schedule a time for interview.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643280613077700609','-',7,'United States','-',7.000,'perhour',7.000,'2023-04-04',1,'2023-04-04',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-04 16:03:39',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
