(16794,'Collections/Accounts Receivable',23,'General Job Summary: We are looking for a detail-oriented individual with Account Receivable and Collection experience. Applicant will be responsible for tracking and resolving outstanding payment issues and generate daily/weekly aging reports in a timely manner.\r\n\r\nPrinciple Duties and Responsibilities:\r\n• Responsible for collection activities such as sending follow-up inquiries (daily collection calls), negotiating with past due accounts and rebills.\r\n• Enter notes on Clients’ files\r\n• Print clients copies of past due invoices so the office can mail them\r\n• Prepare and maintain various reports (aging, trending)\r\n• Apply Client payments\r\n• Other duties as assigned\r\n\r\nKnowledge, Skills and Abilities Required:\r\n• Strong oral and written communication skills\r\n• Very proficient in Microsoft Office Applications (Word, Excel, Outlook) & Internet\r\n• Well organized, multi-tasked and attentive to details\r\n• Must be able to work alone and with a team\r\n• Must have the ability to deal with Clients (internal and external) in a professional manner.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643268526708822017','-',7,'United States','St. Petersburg',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-04',1,'2023-04-04',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-04 16:05:24',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(16795,'Product Review Content Writer',37,'Our content team at Dentistry Brands LLC is seeking an experienced freelance SEO writer who can take on 2-8 product review articles per month. The product reviews will mostly include prescription glasses, but we also need help reviewing toothbrushes, water flossers, teeth-whitening kits, and more. Our sites include visioncenter.org and newmouth.com.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe will mail you products to test out, then you’ll be expected to write an article reviewing each product. You’ll also receive detailed instructions, content briefs, and deadlines. Experience writing product reviews and affiliate-based articles is a plus but not required.\r\n\r\n\r\nEach piece ranges from 1,500 to 2,500 words, sometimes more or less, depending on search intent needs, how many products are being reviewed, and other requirements.\r\n\r\n\r\nJob requirements:\r\n\r\n\r\n- Must have an up-to-date glasses prescription (this role requires reviews of prescription glasses)\r\n- Must be in good oral health standing to test teeth whitening products\r\n- Must live in the U.S. (we have to mail products to you, so this is required)\r\n- Capacity to write 2-8 product review articles per month, depending on needs, with quick turnaround times\r\n- Experience testing products, writing product reviews, and working in the affiliate content marketing space is a plus but not required\r\n- At least two years of experience writing long-form SEO content (preferably in the health space)\r\n- Strong self-editing and time management skills; ability to meet deadlines is essential\r\n- Ability to test products in depth, take photos of them, and provide detailed feedback on each one','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643265075773902849','-',7,'United States','-',5000.000,'fixed',5000.000,'2023-04-04',1,'2023-04-04',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-04 16:06:12',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
