(16818,'Design and Layout tri-fold marketing brochure',13,'We are in need of a graphics design freelancer to create a Tri-Fold sales brochure for SaaS product. I already have all the text copy for the brochure, so I just need someone to add the graphics elements and do the layout.\r\n\r\nHere\'s what I\'m looking for in the brochure design process:\r\n\r\nPlease use your preferred design software, such as Adobe InDesign, to create a new document with the following specifications:\r\n\r\nDocument size: 11 x 8.5 inches (landscape orientation)\r\nBleed: 0.125 inches on all sides\r\nMargins: 0.5 inches on all sides\r\nSet up the document grid to have three equal columns, with each column measuring 3.667 inches wide and 8.5 inches tall.\r\n\r\nUsing the text copy we will provide, once a freelancer is selected, please place the text onto the brochure in a logical and visually appealing way. Please make sure to keep the text within the designated columns, and to use consistent formatting throughout the brochure.\r\n\r\nNext, add in graphics elements that complement the text and help illustrate key points. Please make sure these graphics are high-quality and visually appealing, while also staying true to my brand\'s overall look and feel.\r\n\r\nPlease use my brand\'s color palette and font guidelines to ensure consistency with other marketing materials. We will provide these once a freelancer is selected.\r\n\r\nPlease export the brochure as a print-ready PDF file, making sure to include the necessary bleed and crop marks.\r\n\r\nFinally, please deliver the completed brochure to me in the requested format, along with any necessary design files.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643294559767629825?success','-',7,'United States','Boylston',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-04-04',1,'2023-04-04',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-04 16:51:42',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
