(16824,'Upgrade old wordpress site to fresh look with newest easy to use widgets',3,'We have been using the same WordPress site for over ten years. We are a consulting/advisory business built on data/research. Our front end we\'d like to look like aumni.fund. We use Tableau dashboards to present our data. We want to migrate over many of our blog posts. We have a download/reports section where people can purchase our reports. That plugs into Paypal. We\'d either like to keep this or upgrade it. Our site is www.crowdfundcapitaladvisors.com. Ideally, we want to start with a new landing page and template for all the underlying pages. Then update the navigation based on our services. The website aims to schedule calls to convert prospects into clients. Ideally, you\'ve upgraded a WordPress site before or migrated to a better product. We love how we can manually change the WordPress site now, so we don\'t want to lose this ability. We\'d like new images for the website.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643301570985013249','-',7,'United States','Denver',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-04-04',1,'2023-04-04',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-04 17:18:09',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
(16825,'Elementor Specialist - Wordpress Developer for ongoing issues and errors',3,'We recently migrated our website from a custom theme to Elementor and require some guidance.\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a highly skilled Elementor Wordpress developer who possesses extensive experience with Elementor.\r\n\r\nWe aim to minimize the use of CSS and therefore require someone knowledgeable about loops, custom post types, and advanced custom fields using Elementor.\r\n\r\nWe require assistance with the following:\r\n\r\n- Implementing Elementor Best Practices\r\n- Troubleshooting various technical issues\r\n- Editing and customizing webpages\r\n- Expertise in CSS, HTML, and PHP\r\n- Effective communication and instructional videos on navigating Elementor within our WordPress environment.\r\n\r\nAs we have specific security requirements, we are seeking developers based in the United States. We will monitor logins to our staging environment via IP address.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643303100939243521','-',7,'United States','Costa Mesa',90.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-04',1,'2023-04-04',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-04 17:24:09',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
