(16827,'Brand Identity & Guidelines Package',2,'About the Role:\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a highly-talented White-labeled Graphic Designer who is an expert in Adobe Illustrator and has intermediate illustration skills, and is able to thrive in a fast-paced, dynamic environment while creating stunning graphic design work.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will innately bring positive and creative energy to their work and is excited about delivering a transformative client journey.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is a project-based role to start, with a flat-rate compensation of $1,200.00 for the first completed project (See below for Scope of Work*). There are future work opportunities available with this position, after we establish our rapport and complete one project successfully!\r\n\r\n\r\nI. Scope of the Work\r\n\r\n*Could have more than 1 project at a time due simultaneously (work to be white-labeled)\r\n*Must be open / willing / ready to follow our internal process for brand identity development, colors / fonts, logo lock ups, social media assets, and branding guidelines\r\n*Must be willing to meet Weekly on Monday\'s for a 1 hour Zoom review, to show work & get feedback from us and possibly on Thursdays for 30 min prior to meeting with our Clients\r\n*Design feedback must be updated by Tuesday AM, so we can present to our clients\r\n\r\n\r\nThe following is what we would need for each project and the projected timeline:\r\n1. 1-3 B&W logo concepts (due in 1-2 weeks from inception of project)\r\n2. 1-3 Colored logo concepts (due 1-2 weeks after B&W concepts)\r\n3. Social Media Banners & Buttons, Color family review (8 or 12 colors), and Font Family review (5 font coordinated font families) (due for review 1 week after colored logo concepts)\r\n4. Brand Guidelines (8 pages done in Illustrator) (final due 2 weeks after social media banners & buttons, color family review)\r\n5. Final save out of all Brand Assets for Client usage (final due 2 DAYS after guidelines) per our SOP\'s.\r\n6. Basic Canva Template with 1-2 Designs for Social Media Backgrounds. Shared as needed\r\n\r\n\r\nII. How fast you need it delivered\r\n-- Final Deliverables due no more than 7 weeks after accepting project\r\n\r\n\r\nIII. Whether they’ll work with your team closely or work independently\r\n*We will work very closely together -- be on Zoom calls, share Looms on our process, be in our Slack channel, and optionally a part of our Asana work\r\n\r\n\r\nIV. If there’s potential for more work\r\n*We are very open to long-term working opportunities together for future work with the right white-labeled partner! We anticipate having new clients each month and will need help to supplement our in house designers workload regularly.\r\n\r\n\r\nV. Required experience\r\n*Must have some proven capabilities with Illustration and the ability to manipulate and design fonts into wordmarks with altered fonts, stylized wordmarks, and design abstract / monogram / symbols or other types of icons. ILLUSTRATION IS A MUST\r\n*Must have proven client-experience, positive team spirit, quick communicator in slack, willing to receive feedback openly and adjust, hit deadlines, and work in Adobe Illustrator on our G-drive.\r\n*All work must live on our LAUNCH Google drive at all times, even when not \"finished.\"\r\n*Must be willing to learn and abide by our LAUNCH Core Behaviors\r\n\r\n\r\nVI. Helpful links and references to explain the desired style\r\n*See attached Logo Examples','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643306249830600705','-',7,'United States','na',1200.000,'fixed',1200.000,'2023-04-04',1,'2023-04-04',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-04 17:36:11',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
