(16835,'Graphic Designer to design Sales Deck',11,'Graphic Designer - Contract Hire\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a skilled Graphic Designer to join our team on a contract basis to create a visually compelling sales deck that aligns with our brand identity and messaging. The successful candidate will work with our marketing team to ensure the sales deck accurately represents our products and services.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\nWork with the marketing team’s plan for the sales deck.\r\nDevelop a portfolio of reusable design templates that can be used for future sales decks.\r\nSelect and edit imagery that aligns with our brand identity and messaging.\r\nDesign and develop digital concepts for the sales deck that can be edited by team.\r\nProvide design revisions based on feedback from the marketing team.\r\nProvide project file and template PSD\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\nMust be a native english speaker (US).\r\nProven experience as a graphic designer with a strong portfolio of past work.\r\nExperience creating sales decks and other marketing collateral for businesses.\r\nProficiency in design software, such as Adobe Creative Suite.\r\nStrong communication skills and the ability to work with cross-functional teams.\r\nExperience working remotely and managing deadlines effectively.\r\n\r\nIf you are a creative and talented Graphic Designer with experience in designing sales decks and creating visually compelling content, we would love to hear from you. Please submit your resume, cover letter, and portfolio of work. This is a contract position with a flexible schedule, and the duration of the contract will be determined based on project needs.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01b8a9787376db11cc/apply/','-',7,'United States','Tampa',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-04-04',1,'2023-04-04',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-04 18:07:41',NULL,19,3,NULL,120),
