(16841,'Experienced Mental Health/Medical Virtual Assistant',22,'We are seeking 1 experienced Medical/Mental Health Virtual Assistant (Patient Care Coordinator) to help our rapidly growing outpatient Psychiatric Mental Health Practice located in California.\r\n\r\nThis position is Full-Time, Monday thru Friday, with working hours from 9:00 AM - 5 PM Pacific Standard Time (PST).\r\n\r\nOur ideal candidate is a Medical Virtual Assistant who has at least 1 year of experience working in a psychiatry, mental health, or therapy practice.\r\n\r\nTASKS:\r\nWhile our office is primarily hybrid (online and in-person), we need an experienced Registered Nurse or Medical Assistant to help to:\r\n\r\n- Communicate with prospective and current patients by text, email, fax and phone, as needed.\r\n- Assure new and follow up patients are entered into our Practice Fusion EHR system and that payment and paperwork is received for each appointment.\r\n- Make appointment reminder calls for the following day, followed by text messages and emails\r\n- Perform limited medical billing duties within the EHR and other billing platforms, for cash and insurance claims processing. Will be entering CPT codes into EHR\r\n- Will periodically verify and confirm insurance benefits eligibility electronically or by phone and collect any copays or deductibles due prior to appointment time.\r\n- Assure that patients are scheduling follow-up visits.\r\n- Complete and submit insurance Prior Authorization Forms for medication claims.\r\n- Will need experience multitasking between answering phones, data entry, completing requests from other staff members and attending to customer service tasks\r\n- Will need extensive experience with Microsoft products but especially Outlook, Excel, Word and Powerpoint\r\n- Will need to be detail oriented\r\n- This position will also be in charge of handling customer billing questions and concerns, so you will need to have great customer service skills\r\n- Will need to be on camera to greet patients and will be in charge of collecting copays\r\n\r\n#1 requirement is RELIABILITY. We are a small team and depend on each other. Attendance is very important.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643318541192335361','-',7,'United States','Long Beach',7.000,'perhour',7.000,'2023-04-04',1,'2023-04-04',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-04 18:29:51',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
