(16930,'Web Developer + Designer Needed To Create Landing Pages In Clickfunnels 2.0 & Unbounce',3,'I am looking to work with someone on an ongoing freelance basis who is very responsive and has fast turnaround times when designing and building out custom landing pages.\r\n\r\nI need someone who has extensive experience and understanding of using platforms like unbounce.com and Clickfunnels 2.0.\r\n\r\nI would need you to create multi-step quiz landing pages similar to this landing page: https://my.consumeraffairs.com/gold-iras/get-matched/\r\n\r\nWhere depending on the answers people give, they may see different offers at the end based on their answers.\r\n\r\nI would also need you to create multi-step landing pages like this: https://www.fisherinvestments.com/en-us/campaigns/fmr/ug\r\n\r\nWhere once they submit their details and take the quiz on the landing page, their answers from the quiz and their personal information could be displayed on the thank you pages to make the user feel like they are receiving a \"personalised report\" at the end\r\n\r\nI would also need you to create listicle landing pages similar to this: https://senior-perks.com/american-senior-discounts\r\n\r\nWith multiple different offers on one landing page.\r\n\r\nI would also need you to be able to replicate the design of pages quickly and add those design templates into my website funnel builders like clickfunnels / unbounce.\r\n\r\nExamples include replicating the following funnel:\r\n\r\nUpsell 1: https://easylifenutra.com/vsl1/u1\r\n\r\nDownsell 1: https://easylifenutra.com/vsl1/d1\r\n\r\nUpsell 2: https://easylifenutra.com/vsl1/u2\r\n\r\nDownsell 2: https://easylifenutra.com/vsl1/d2\r\n\r\nUpsell 3: https://easylifenutra.com/vsl1/u3\r\n\r\nDownsell 3: https://easylifenutra.com/vsl1/d3\r\n\r\nPlease write what the colour of the sky is at the top of your reply to this job post so I can see that you\'ve read this job post fully. Anyone who doesn\'t will not be selected for this role.\r\n\r\nI need someone that is very responsive and can be reached and is available to work between 9am UK time - 6pm UK time Monday - Saturday.\r\n\r\nI also need someone who can create landing pages quickly as my team needs fast turnaround times and may have a lot of work lined up for you.\r\n\r\nPlease provide examples of landing pages you\'ve created that are similar to the ones I provided above so I can see the quality of your work.\r\n\r\nThis role will be a freelance position initially but I\'ll need someone who is available for around 20-30 hours each week.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643567476132904961','-',7,'United States','Essex',40.000,'fixed',40.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 10:54:55',NULL,18,3,NULL,156),
