(16939,'Logo design for Enneagram services',2,'Design a logo for LIVING ENNEAGRAM. It should include the following elements: (1) Enneagram symbol, including the outer circle, numbers, inner triangle, and slanted hexagon (see image); (2) life, organic, plant, vine, something growing imagery; and (3) hints of ancient wisdom calling to mind things like pyramid or ancient runes, etc. Can be in one color chosen for the brand. I\'m also attaching a design with colors assigned to the numbers, but it may be better to have one overall color for the brand. I am open to suggestions on color. Please send all files for various uses, and include a transparent background.\r\n\r\nQUESTIONS: Do you know the Enneagram? Do you have a sense of spirituality and how it can be used for powerful transformation?\r\n\r\nLet\'s also keep the logo/brand playful and accessible!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643575765654589441?success','-',7,'United States','San Francisco',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 11:27:36',NULL,16,3,NULL,159),
(16940,'Modify a custom Built WordPress Website - Wordpress Developer',15,'Looking for an experienced WordPress developer for a 1–3-month project. You will work directly with the Digital Manager on redesigning parts of the website.\r\nThis contract includes multiple sub-projects.\r\nMust be experienced with WordPress, PHP, and Javascript/jquery.\r\n\r\nRequired Experience:\r\nExperience creating custom WordPress with Custom Fields is preferred\r\nUI, UX, and interactivity design experience a huge plus\r\nGraphics design experience is a plus but not required for this project\r\nExperience in making architectural recommendations (wireframes will be provided)\r\n\r\nTo be the best fit for this project you need:\r\n\r\nAbility to communicate clearly\r\nDedication to meeting project deadlines in a timely manner\r\nWrite “I am a surfer” at the top of your proposal so we know you read the description\r\nAttention to details\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this project, please reply with your prior experience.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~018dc55c25573f3e3e','-',7,'United States','Isle of Wight',48.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 11:33:56',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
