(16951,'Book cover design',2,'book cover design, front cover and back cover (maybe not spine on paperback because book will not be thick, not many pages therefore spine may not be needed)\r\n\r\nNo text yet, text, title, sub title etc will be given later\r\nstart your design based on the following:\r\n\r\nThere are three levels (or gears, one smaller, bigger and largest) and within each main level there are three levels, or smaller gears, smaller, bigger and largest,\r\n\r\nThe smaller gears or inner levels should be different colours, and the larger level should have three different colours.\r\n\r\nso three main colours, and the three inner levels three colours.\r\n\r\ncan use circles and or triangles or similar shapes and manipulated shapes.\r\n\r\njust a rough idea.\r\n\r\nmay give further ideas later to add to the above.\r\n\r\nnot sure what the design should look like, something eye catching, looks advanced, clever and easy to understand.\r\n\r\nyou must form the design and later add the text, and then do the layout on 6x9 cover for paperback and then layout for eBook, give all measurements later.\r\n\r\ndesign must be unique, no copies of anything similar.\r\n\r\nshow me work you have already done, or your artwork examples to show your style and capabilities.\r\n\r\nnot in a rush to have this job completed, want to work on it bit by bit over the next 2 months. slow progress.\r\n\r\ncopyright of design will be owned my me.\r\n\r\nmay give you credit for your work but no copyright ownership in publication and designer will not profit from publication of than job payment and credit-mention of designer\'s name in book.\r\n\r\nfinal work pdf file, sharp high res. both full covers, paperback and the ebook, which are slightly different size/layout requirements.\r\n\r\nfurther work possible','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01c248fa4eb3d54826','-',7,'United States','London',20.000,'fixed',20.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-0