(16982,'Psychiatry Private Practice Virtual Medical Assistant',22,'Pacific Northwest Psychiatry Associates is a private practice outpatient psychiatry practice out of Portland, Oregon. We are currently at 6 providers and we are looking to hire someone who is eager to join our team that has the qualifications and experience described below.\r\n\r\nPreference for applicants who have 3 years of direct VA experience for a psychiatry practice, nursing and/or pharmacy degree, experience working with the Valant EMR, and experience in medical billing.  If you have experience in these three areas please make sure you write me a note indicating so.  In your application please indicate your experience with each of these requirements.\r\n\r\nHours are Pacific Standard Time business hours (8a to 5pm)\r\n\r\nTasks\r\n\r\nManaging inbound and outbound calls to and from patients, providers, and healthcare insurance companies regarding inquiries, appointments, and data verification (maintains great phone etiquette)\r\n\r\nNavigating through EMR (Electronic Medical Records) systems such as “Valant”\r\n\r\nVerifying the healthcare insurance coverage and eligibility\r\n\r\nProviding administrative support which includes: data entry, appointment scheduling, email management, text messages with patients.\r\n\r\nObtaining and sending medical records.\r\n\r\nAssisting patients with patient portal questions and issues in the EHR\r\n\r\nIn charge of new patient intake, follow up scheduling and front-desk triage\r\n\r\nEstablishing a professional relationship with medical professionals and patients; Acts as a primary liaison between patients and providers\r\n\r\nRouting Faxes\r\n\r\nCalling No-Shows / Missed Appointments / Rescheduling Appointments\r\n\r\nStrict adherence and compliance with the HIPAA policy\r\n\r\nQualifications\r\n\r\nExcellent communication skills (both oral and written proficiency)\r\nExcellent time management, strong attention to detail, accuracy, impartiality, organization, and computer competences\r\n\r\nAt least 3 years of experience in a medical-related background\r\n\r\nIntermediate skills with G Suite and/or Microsoft Office\r\n\r\nFamiliar with Medical Terminologies\r\n\r\nA nursing degree\r\n\r\nA professional license as a Medical Technologist is preferred\r\n\r\nHIPAA Certification is a plus\r\n\r\nSystem requirements\r\n\r\nPRIMARY\r\nComputer Processor: Core i3-5th gen / AMD A8 / Ryzen 3 (2015 or later)\r\nComputer Memory/RAM: at least 8.00 GB\r\nComputer Operating System: at least Windows 10\r\nHeadset: Any USB type headset with a noise-canceling feature\r\nWebcam (at least 720P)\r\n\r\nBACK-UP\r\nComputer Processor: Core i3 – 3rd gen or later (2013 or later)\r\nComputer Memory/RAM: at least 4.00 GB\r\nInternet\r\nPrimary Connection: A stable primary wired Internet subscription with a minimum download/upload speed of 8mbps (10mbps and up preferred)\r\nBack-up Connection: A stable secondary connection with a minimum speed of 5mbps','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01f444d9d939a4667e','-',7,'United States','US',8.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 13:34:38',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
(16983,'Gluten-Free Diet Blog Articles ($10 for 1000 words)',37,'Hi, we are looking for passionate writers in the nutrition domain who have prior knowledge of the gluten-free diet.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n1. You should have a medical/nutrition background.\r\n\r\n2. Ability to research products online, that are available in the U.S. For example: Making a list of gluten-free brands/products in a certain category (such as dark chocolate), looking at their ingredients to determine what is actually gluten-free and what is not.\r\n\r\n3. You can write at least 2 articles per week (Each approx 1500-2k words). We can also do more than that.\r\n\r\nYou will get a detailed template for each article. All I ask from you is some creativity, research, and captivating writing skills!\r\n\r\nNew writers on Upwork are also welcome! But you should have the required background and writing experience.\r\n\r\nBegin your response with the word ‘Glutenemy’ so that I know that you’ve gone through the whole post.\r\n\r\nIn your response, submit relevant writing samples and also answer the screening question asked alongside.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~019b7fca846e601654','-',7,'United States','Delhi',150.000,'fixed',18.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 13:35:53',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
