(17021,'Re-Branding for a Running Event - Marathon',2,'Overview of The Brand\r\n\r\nLogicom Cyprus Marathon is the oldest and most historic Marathon in Cyprus.\r\n\r\nThe name is Cyprus Marathon and the main sponsor is Logicom.\r\nThe location is in Pafos, Palm trees, Mediterranean Sea, history and culture, hospitality. One aspect that you might want to use is that Pafos, the city of the Marathon, is where the Aphrodite, godess of Love & beauty was born.\r\n\r\nThe logo is the 13th century castle where the Marathon finishes. Along with a runner and a red ribbon.\r\n\r\nwww.LogicomCyprusMarathon.com for more information on the event\r\n\r\nObjectives\r\nWe want to give a fresh take/look on our logo and our brand. The logo should be a bit more minimalistic.\r\n\r\nAdded to the logo we would like to create branding that we can use for leaflets, social media, merchandise etc.\r\n\r\nThe ideal customer\r\n\r\nIs a European 35 - 60-year-old who likes the luxury of traveling and participating in Marathons and wants to come for enjoyment and pleasure.\r\n\r\nColours\r\n\r\nPlease use these two pantones for the branding: #EC4424 & #3C2C84\r\n\r\nOutcome\r\n\r\nWe want to have:\r\n- Logo based on our current logo (attached) but a bit more minimalistic/less details and to look more futuristic. If you have another idea we are open to see.\r\n- Leaflets, Social Media Posts, Merchandise\r\n\r\nAttached are some examples from current branding and some examples of branding we like.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643638413029036033?success','-',7,'United States','Nicosia',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 15:36:42',NULL,16,3,NULL,159),
