(17029,'Brand identity design (logo and brand assets, such as letterheads)',2,'This project entails the creation of a brand identity for a consulting company that specializes in:\r\n- Project management\r\n- Management consulting\r\n- IT development\r\n- Government relations\r\n\r\nOur website: https://chaplynsky.com/\r\n\r\nOur current logo is attached and the meaning is as follows:\r\n- Red symbolizes energy, passion, strength, power, courage, action, creativity, warmth, and security.\r\n- A triangle represents manifestation, enlightenment, revelation, perfectness, unity, importance, stability, and a higher perspective. It\'s a strong symbol, it\'s stable, as it has a good foundation.\r\n- The labyrinth/maze is about going to the center, thus identifying the optimal solution in the most effective and efficient way. We don\'t waste time, we guide our clients through the complexities of their projects.\r\n\r\nOther ideas/symbols:\r\n- The infinity symbol can be used also, as it signifies the concept of limitlessness or eternity. It is also the favourite symbol of one of the partners.\r\n- There are two partners in our company, so the brand logo and identity can show that by having two parts of something.\r\n- The logo should be simple and recognizable. The current logo is complicated due to the labyrinth. The new logo can be simple, but it should preserve our original meaning when looked at in the overall composition.\r\n\r\nI am attaching two archives (no need to adhere to anything, this is just what we looked at or tried):\r\n1. ideas.zip - ideas we visually likes\r\n2. attempts.zip - new ideas we attempted to make\r\n\r\nNothing we looked at or attempted so far really caught our eye and we\'re looking for a person who can think outside of the box. The logo itself can be simple, but when looked at in the overall composition (other elements of the brand, background in letterheads, website, etc.) it should convey our original message.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643645938933641217?success','-',7,'United States','Toronto',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 16:06:46',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
