(17038,'Modify Graphic',2,'Hi. I need to modify our current company logo, an outer space image featuring the sun and earth, to include the Statue of Liberty.\r\n\r\nAs a very crude representation of what I\'m looking for, I have linked a Dropbox folder containing a document with the current logo at top, with two very rough sketches below it that experiment with different font sizes for the company name, different placement of the company name, and different sizes of the Statue of Liberty image.\r\n\r\nThe logo was created in Photoshop. This file, as well as the non-watermarked Statue of Resolution image, are in the Dropbox folder.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking to work with a graphic design artist to work together with me to finesse and polish the logo. We\'d start by you creating some variations for me to check out, then we\'d communicate back-and-forth until it\'s just right.\r\n\r\nI\'m currently on a shoestring budget and looking for a modest rate (or a flat rate); however, our company is about to be funded, and ideally this would result in an indefinite working relationship.\r\n\r\nThank you,','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643652906518253569?success','-',7,'United States','Van Nuys',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 16:33:53',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
