(17045,'Redoing a highly customized wordpress website',3,'We are an amusement and hospitality company. We have a very large website with a store doing over 30K a month in online revenue.\r\n\r\nThe site is getting old, and we need to update it and remove a lot of custom coding put in there by the previous developers. Must be mobile first and responsive, open for future development, and easy to update.\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for a person who can duplicate the site over on our WPengine server and update the site, then help us migrate orders to the new site and turn everything back on.\r\n\r\nThere are a lot of subdomains and other URLs to point to the site, so this is not going to be an easy thing to sort out. internally we do not have someone who can assist, so you\'ll be completely on your own in figuring out the site structure, fixing broken URLS, etc.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643654289782935553','-',7,'United States','Gray',5000.000,'fixed',5000.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 16:39:46',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
