(17048,'LEARNDASH Wordpress expert to build out our elearning site',4,'Hey there, I\'m looking to build just the back end of my membership, using LearnDash, to be able to house my membership. It will consist of a basic members dashboard and access to certain courses and challenges based on the membership tier purchased.\r\n\r\nThis will be under a subdomain (ex: members.mywebsite.com) I would also like everything linked together with my main wordpress site (www.mywebsite.com) where I actually will have the sales page and be collecting payments. I hope that makes sense.\r\n\r\nPlease reach out to me and we can hop on a call. I can walk you through my process and I also have a sample education website I\'d like you to model which should make everything easier. May possibly want you to design my home page on my main website depending on what we agree on. Lets talk','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643655957064454145?success','-',7,'United States','Hurst',35.000,'Open this select menu',35.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 16:45:47',NULL,19,3,NULL,123),
(17049,'Website build',3,'We are looking to launch our initial real estate website.\r\n\r\nAs a client-centric brand we want to differentiate ourselves in design, feel and offerings.\r\n\r\nIf all goes well we will build 2 other website for different aspects of our business.\r\n\r\nHere is a link to a Figma File so you can see the style and design we need to bring to life:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.figma.com/proto/LaWYQaRJLXkhK2m1DrDdEy/Client-first-collective-(Copy)?node-id=159-375&scaling=scale-down-width&page-id=0%3A1&starting-point-node-id=1%3A66\r\n\r\nWe hope you are up for the job and that we can get a quick turnaround. Please let us know if you are intersted and what your estimate is on timeline.\r\n\r\nBeyond the initial landing page there will be 4-5 other pages that we already have designs for.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643655977658945537?success','-',7,'United States','Vancouver',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 16:46:13',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
(17050,'Build a beautiful simple website for a dental practice on Wix, domain migration',3,'Have an existing website/ sample website that is owned/hosted by someone else. Can be very similar, but cannot be identical (copyright issues). I can provide the verbiage. This is the current website: www.yenbasingdmd.com\r\nThis is a sample website someone else made (I prefer this one, if you can access it). If not, screenshots can be provided. https://yenbasingdmd.yourwebsite.life/\r\n\r\nWould like to have my own website to own and control. Would like a usable website ASAP, but can work on perfecting it over a longer period of time.\r\nWould like some help with domain migration from another host to wix, so I can control it.\r\nThe website will have some scheduling functions, access to a patient portal, access to new patient documents, etc.\r\nIf you know how to add a scheduling feature onto google maps, that would be a bonus.\r\nWould like some ongoing SEO help to make the website searchable, to decrease need for google ad marketing.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643656742645104641','-',7,'United States','na',1500.000,'Open this select menu',1500.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 16:48:49',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
(17051,'Pitch Deck for Food Product',11,'Hello,\r\nWe have a granola business. Need an experienced business pitch deck designer to put together a concise, branded, visually appealing deck for a grant we are pitching for. This will be a live presentation of 8 minutes. I have most of the slide information in plain text that we wish to convey and want to drop into the deck but it needs to be consolidated and presented based on your experience with pitch decks. So, Not strictly a design job. Needs a seasoned business professional in this area. Presentation should have a high level look at the numbers too. We are intending to include a 3 minute video in the deck that is already produced so really the presentation part is a maximum of 5 minutes. Looking to complete this within 7 days. Need a fixed fee proposal as I am self funding and no outside money yet. Once I accept job, I think a zoom call to assure understanding of the goal and handoff of the assets for the presentation. Could also do a zoom before I accept the job if you want make sure you have all the answers to your questions. Thank you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643657298996310017','-',7,'United States','Long Island City',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 16:51:34',NULL,18,3,NULL,140),
(17052,'Strong website designer needed - well versed in Figma',3,'Are you an experienced designer of beautiful web experiences? Do \"clean\" and \"fresh\" describe your style? Is attention to detail a core part of your personality? We are looking for a reliable, creative, strategic, and experienced UX/UI designer for a website project immediately.\r\n\r\nPlease only apply if you can commit to a set of hours each week — during standard business hours — to be available to our team via Slack, phone, and video. This will provide stability for both parties.\r\n\r\nYou must be familiar with brand guides, typography, color theory/strategy, responsive and adaptive design, as well as building complete website prototypes in Figma. There is no development needed for this project, Design in Figma only.\r\n\r\nExcellent communication and planning with our small team by phone, video, and Slack will ensure a smooth process for all phases of projects.\r\n\r\nWhen applying, please show your best web design projects and explain what your role was on particular projects.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643657910733524993','-',7,'United States','Austin',55.000,'Open this select menu',48.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 16:53:35',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
