(17055,'WordPress Designer & Developer with Elementor Pro Experience',4,'We are seeking a skilled and experienced WordPress Designer & Developer to join our team and assist us in creating stunning websites for our clients across various industries. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in Elementor Pro, as this is our primary plugin of choice. Additionally, they should have excellent communication skills and be comfortable using tools such as Slack, ClickUp, and video chats for collaboration.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n* Proven experience as a WordPress Designer & Developer.\r\n* Strong portfolio showcasing your work with Elementor Pro.\r\n* Expertise in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and PHP.\r\n* Proficient in responsive web design and cross-browser compatibility.\r\n* Knowledge of WordPress best practices, themes, and plugins.\r\n* Excellent problem-solving skills and attention to detail.\r\n* Strong English communication skills, both written and verbal.\r\n* Familiarity with collaboration tools such as Slack and ClickUp.\r\n* Ability to work independently and as part of a team.\r\n* Open to participating in weekly video chats (flexible timing) for project discussions.\r\n\r\nThe first task will be a simple testimonials page design and implementation for a client. If things go well, we will bring you on bigger projects in the future. Our goal is to establish a long-term relationship with a developer.\r\n\r\nPlease type I AM HUMAN in your response before submitting.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to reviewing your application!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643661822878289921','-',7,'United States','Anaheim',35.000,'Open this select menu',35.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 17:09:24',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
