(17107,'US Medical Virtual Assistant/Medical scribe',22,'We are seeking a friendly and talented medical virtual assistant/Scribe to join our growing telemedicine practice. Possible someone with experience working with Mental/Behavioral Health providers. The ideal candidate will have a medical background (medicine, nursing, pharmacy, or similar) and relevant work experience as a virtual assistant. Your responsibilities will start with coordinating the intake/scheduling of patients and data entry into the EHR but can grow into other areas as we get experience working together. Experience working with EHRs (particularly Karo EHR) and an outpatient practice environment is ideal. We are seeking individuals with excellent customer service. More details can be provided to candidates after an initial screening.\r\nSkills required.\r\nCommunications: Fluent in English\r\nMedical Transcription/Scribes support\r\nHandling intake calls\r\nSchedule appointment\r\nScreening new clients\r\nReturning client calls promptly with a high degree of professionalism.\r\nCoordinating new client intake forms\r\nGenerating superbills for clients to submit to their insurance companies.\r\nBenefits and Eligibility insurance Verification\r\nProcessing Co-Pays and Self Pays\r\nPrecertification and pre-authorization\r\nClaims submission.\r\nFollow up on insurance companies for status of claims.\r\nResearch, correct and re-submit rejected or denied claims.\r\nPrepare appeals to denied claims and authorizations.\r\nAbility to read and interpret EOBs and post payments.\r\nCreate patient payment plan/agreements.\r\nManaging emails and voicemails\r\nUpdating client electronic health records\r\nSocial Media Management\r\nProofing and editing\r\nCREDENTIALING\r\n- Set up EDI/ERA/EFT enrollments.\r\n- Credentialing and Contracting with Commercial payers and government insurances','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643707193711079425','-',7,'United States','Dacula',40.000,'Open this select menu',18.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 20:10:41',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
