(17111,'Medical Scribe & Virtual Medical Assistant (Excellent English Required)',22,'***FULL TIME POSITION SALARY POSITION W/ PTO****\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nNatural Med Doc is looking for a full-time medical scribe to help with charting, placing lab orders, and pharmaceuticals.\r\n\r\n***MOST HAVE EXCELLENT ENGLISH SKILLS & THE ABILITY TO HAVE CONVERSATIONS. PLEASE DON\'T APPLY IF THIS IS NOT YOU ***\r\n\r\n***ABOUT NATURAL MED DOC***\r\n\r\nNatural Med Doc is a quickly growing naturopathic medical practice based in the United States. It is our mission to help individuals \"LIVE THEIR BEST LIFE!\"\r\n\r\nWe provide an alternative to health clinics with long wait times and cookie-cutter, unpersonalized care that doesn’t address the root causes.\r\n\r\nOur integrative practice starts every patient off with an extensive medical history analysis and ordering comprehensive testing (when needed) to identify health issues you may or may not be aware of.\r\n\r\nMany patients reach out to us due to frustrations they have had with conventional medical doctors and pharmaceutical treatments.\r\n\r\nBy focusing on treating you as a whole rather than treating individual symptoms, we can assist you in living a pain-free life filled with energy, joy, and overall happiness.\r\n\r\n***REQUIREMENTS***\r\nUnderstand & have Experience w/ United States-based EHR systems. The EHR system our practice uses is: Charm Health (charmhealth.com)\r\nGood problem solver and can solve problems / figure out solutions.\r\nEXCELLENT English Skills\r\n\r\n***WHAT YOU WILL DO***\r\nListen to appointments the doctor has and complete charts for the doctor to review.\r\nOrder labs, prescriptions, etc. based on patient needs.\r\nRandom virtual tasks the office manager has.\r\n\r\n***AVAILABILITY***\r\nMonday - Friday 9AM - 6PM PST (Phoenix, Arizona)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643709599306813441','-',7,'United States','tempe',6.000,'Open this select menu',18.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 20:23:47',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
(17112,'Looking for a Medical biller Or Charge Master to create a revenue projection on clinics in Florida.',21,'We are starting 2 clinics.\r\n\r\nClinic 1- Our first Clinics consist of 3 services: Psychiatric, Physical Therapy and Primary Care.\r\n\r\nClinic 2- Adult Day Care program for clients with HIV.\r\n\r\nThese are based in Florida.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643710060159307777','-',7,'United States','US',100.000,'fixed',80.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 20:24:51',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
(17113,'Medical Records Specialist',21,'To organize and maintain health information both in paper files and in electronic systems.\r\nOutcomes:\r\n1) Copies, faxes, scans and files paperwork as needed.\r\n2) Plans, organizes, and completes tasks in an acceptable time frame, manage multiple tasks\r\neffectively.\r\n3) Compiles medical records and charts.\r\n4) Processes insurance payments.\r\n5) Provides backup assistance for other office functions such as reception, data entry and\r\ngeneral clerical services.\r\n6) Ensures medical records are assembled in standard order and are accurate and complete.\r\n7) Files and/or scan paperwork and reports in Electronic Medical Records (NextGen).\r\n8) Responsible for safeguarding patient records and ensuring compliance with HIPAA\r\nstandards.\r\n9) Responds to requests for patient records, both within the facility and by external sources -\r\nretrieving them and transmitting them appropriately.\r\n10) Ensures legal requests are communicated effectively to the legal department.\r\n11)Corresponds with the internal team as well as external groups via phone, in-person, and\r\nmultiple written channels.\r\n12) Input data across various platforms including but not limited to: Excel, EMR, Word.\r\n13) Daily utilization of Microsoft Excel for reporting maintenance and creation; cover sheets.\r\n14) Support all aspects of mailing correspondence from compiling envelopes to making trips\r\nto post office.\r\n15) Supporting other administrative duties as necessary.\r\n16) Follow all HIPAA regulations.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643710570379706369','-',7,'United States','Kings County',8.000,'Open this select menu',18.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 20:25:49',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
