(17128,'Professional and Creative Company Website Build',3,'Job Description:\r\nWe are a newly established company looking to create a strong online presence with a professional, clean, and digital-focused website. We need an experienced and highly skilled web developer to help us bring our vision to life. You will be responsible for creating a website consisting of approximately 6-8 pages of content based on the provided Site Map and Copy Document.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Collaborate with our team to understand the goals and requirements for the website\r\n- Develop a responsive and visually appealing website, optimized for both desktop and mobile devices\r\n- Implement a clean, modern, and professional design, with a strong focus on digital experience\r\n- Efficiently integrate the provided Site Map and Copy Document into the website\r\n- Ensure the website is SEO-friendly and optimized for search engine visibility\r\n- Test the website across multiple browsers and devices to ensure compatibility and user experience\r\n- Address any feedback from the team and make necessary revisions in a timely manner\r\n- Deliver the final, fully-functioning website within the agreed-upon deadline\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- The website must be easy for our team to edit and update as we go forward.\r\n- Proven experience in web development, with a strong portfolio showcasing previous projects\r\n- Expertise in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and other relevant web development technologies\r\n- Proficiency in responsive web design and cross-browser compatibility\r\n- Experience with content management systems (CMS) such as WordPress, Joomla, or Drupal\r\n- Strong understanding of SEO principles and best practices\r\n- Excellent communication skills, with the ability to work effectively with our team and provide updates on progress\r\n- Ability to work independently and manage time effectively to meet deadlines\r\n- Passion for creating visually appealing and user-friendly websites\r\n\r\nWhen you submit, please include:\r\n- Your resume and a brief note explaining why you are the ideal candidate for this project\r\n- A link to your portfolio showcasing relevant web development projects\r\n- A rough estimate of the time required to complete the project, or total project cost, based on the provided details\r\n\r\nWe look forward to reviewing your application and potentially working with you to create a digital experience that will set our company apart in our industry. Thank you for your interest!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643724288992153601','-',7,'United States','Santa Monica',55.000,'Open this select menu',48.000,'2023-04-05',1,'2023-04-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-05 21:17:51',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
