(17154,'Expert Logo Design Form for Psychology Expert field',10,'Who we are & what we do: We are a group of academically highly qualified experts in Positive Psychology, with the intention so start a social media channel (focus: Instagram) that shares scientifically validated information on how to lead a more meaningful, more resilient, and more fulfilled live.\r\n\r\nPositive psychology is a quite young branch of psychology focused on skills that allow individuals to build a life of meaning and purpose—to move beyond surviving to flourishing. Theorists and researchers in the field have sought to identify the elements of a good life. They have also proposed and tested practices for improving life satisfaction and well-being.\r\nIt is a scientific approach to studying human thoughts, feelings, and behavior, with a focus on strengths instead of weaknesses, building the good in life instead of repairing the bad, and taking the lives of average people up to “great” instead of focusing solely on moving those who are struggling up to “normal”.\r\n- Positive Psychology is also called “The Science of Wellbeing”\r\n- “Positive” doesn´t mean that the field ignores the negative, it means a direction of personal development. We offer to teach you the psychological skills that enable you to initiate your own upward spiral (maybe a key visual? or arrow and PPE grafical in it or other options / ieas very welcome)\r\n\r\nMain use for the logo at the moment: Social media (so small in size format, readability! / icon option (one icon eventually with subtitle or more visual components and another just icon-like) but of cause also other formats neeed rg. print / flyer etc\r\n- we need a proper round icon to use on social media (that is only a symbol and/or PPE)\r\n- a horizontal full version incl. “Positive Psychology Experts”\r\nColors: We tend to like blue, but are open to ideas, maybe a combination that includes a warm color (No Red! But orange or ocher would work in combi of blue), so: form design first/ more imporant in first round – then we´ll see about the color\r\n+ one black/white version for different reasons (prints, etc) also because of cleanness factor\r\nLook & Feel:\r\n- scientific & clean (Experts who are only offering science backed information!)\r\n- A “Typo only” Logo would basically be fine\r\n- but in best case scenario we also hope to find a simple key visual, that stands for\r\no initiating an upward spiral / growth potential\r\no developing\r\no connection (brain, dotted lines, etc9\r\no level up your life, lift up\r\no find your way into a more colorful life\r\no flourishing (but we tend not to use flowers or plants – at least not in a plain way - as inspiration for a certain form – maybe yes; definitely NO Shamrock!)\r\nImportant for us: a real design of the logo, not an icon googled which is already over-used - like hearts /trees / etc).\r\nOur initial try out included (canvas lo professional first try) Could be one option so you see our initial thought but real other design ideas we want to considerate','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0188c244d30489d69c','-',7,'United States','Zurich',130.000,'fixed',130.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 07:55:42',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
