(17204,'Accident Management Business - Brand Identity',2,'We are looking for someone to help give our current brand a bit of a refresh. We want to keep the name the same but update and improve the logo, we would also consider rethinking our brand colour pallet.\r\n\r\nWe would also like assistance applying the new brand guidelines to our website. so our current website is ccresponse.co.uk however we have just had this redesigned, the new draft website can be viewed here https://cc.leboplan.com/partnerships/ . We are not completely happy with the overall feel of the site currently and think it could benefit from some design improvements.\r\n\r\nWe are mainly direct to consumer to the site needs to have a friendly, not too corporate feel to it. although we are making a push to win more contracts directly with insurance brokers and other businesses.\r\n\r\nWe are also in the process of trying to put together a company introduction pdf document that we would send to potential new business partners. Again we would like to apply the new branding to this to keep everything cohesive and on brand.\r\n\r\nSo to summarise we need\r\n- Logo and brand identity refresh\r\n- Apply new brand identity to website and suggest other improvements\r\n- Apply brand identity to company intro doc (i can send an example of the type of thing we want)\r\n\r\nAny questions please ask.\r\n\r\nAn example of a site we like the look of which strikes a good balance between professional and friendly is https://www.ketchup-marketing.co.uk/','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~012a0cde721a77485c/apply/','-',7,'United States','Stockport',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 13:23:19',NULL,19,3,NULL,120),
