(17206,'WordPress developer and creative designer',15,'We are looking to expand our existing WordPress website by adding approximately 7 new pages to it. We need a talented WordPress developer and creative designer who can take our proposed menu structure and copy that we\'ve written and create the necessary creative elements and then build the pages on the existing WordPress instance.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n-Collaborate with our team to understand the proposed menu structure and copy.\r\n-Create the necessary creative elements (images, graphics, etc.) that align with our brand guidelines and vision.\r\n-Build new pages on our WordPress website according to our proposed menu structure.\r\n-Ensure that the new pages are mobile-friendly and responsive.\r\n-Test and optimize the website for speed and performance.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n-Proven experience as a WordPress developer and creative designer, with a strong portfolio of WordPress projects.\r\n-Excellent knowledge of WordPress, including themes, plugins, and custom post types.\r\n-Strong skills in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and PHP.\r\n-Ability to design and create creative elements that align with our brand guidelines.\r\n-Ability to work within tight timelines and deliver quality work.\r\n-Excellent communication skills and ability to collaborate with our team.\r\n\r\nIf you are a skilled WordPress developer and creative designer with a passion for creating beautiful and functional websites, we\'d love to hear from you. Please include your portfolio and relevant experience in your application.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643968899970502657?success','-',7,'United States','Kings County',75.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 13:29:27',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
