(17236,'Label and Packaging Design for a Beverage Brand',2,'ACTUAL PRICE WILL BE DETERMINED AFTER HAVING DETAILED DISCUSSION ABOUT THE DESIGN WITH THE DESIGNER.\r\n\r\nI need the following in high dpi with unlimited revisions: Product Label Design, Packaging Design, Print-Ready File, Editable Source File, and 3D Mockup Design.\r\n\r\nIF YOU CAN’T FULFILL THE FOLLOWING BELOW, PLEASE DO NOT SEND YOUR PROPOSAL TO SAVE BOTH OF OUR TIME.\r\n\r\nI want my brand to be the WEIRDEST and COOLEST, while also being an eco-friendly and healthy product anyone would ever see in a store that will leave clear images of my product in the back of their heads and have customers constantly thinking about my product.\r\nMy target audience is the youth culture, Gen Z, and early Millennials, in the 16-35 age range. I want an irreverent, unique, eye-catching, and weird design to catch people’ attention whenever they’d walk into a supermarket or a gas station.\r\n\r\nThe examples below is the type of packaging I will be using. I look forward to seeing your proposals. Thank you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643994801194422273','-',7,'United States','Los Angeles',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'Fixed Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 15:12:24',NULL,18,3,NULL,140),
(17237,'Beer Label Design',2,'We are launching a new level for our software product called \"Groundwork Lite\". We want to make a beer can design that resembles Miller Lite but use Groundwork Lite. We will use this design to create stickers, for social media and other marketing purposes.\r\n\r\nI would like for the design to look like a can. I would also like to have just the elements of the design as a SVG so I can use it for marketing materials. When you share the design, is it possible to share it as an AI file so I can adjust elements if needed for the various marketing needs.\r\n\r\nWe need this completed by Friday, April 14th.\r\n\r\nHere\'s a video that explains the project: https://www.loom.com/share/c3e148f9c9434dce800a1667b780c24d\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01051d70c9e29ba26b','-',7,'United States','Zionsville',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 15:12:29',NULL,19,3,NULL,125),
