(17268,'Interactive Design - Website Refresh',4,'We\'re looking to freshen up the website https://planbeyond.com/. The current site is just a Wordpress theme purchased years ago. While it has all of the content we want, the overall look and feel is pretty flat and not contemporary.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for someone that can develop new designs in Figma that our web developers will be able to execute. Out site is built using templated designs, so we would need new templates.\r\n\r\nOur goals and the page templates we need are listed below. Upon selecting a freelancer, we will provide a few example websites that we like to help provide some context for what we are looking for.\r\n\r\nGOALS\r\n-Bring a more contemporary look to the overall site\r\n-Freshen up font and styles (no more serifs), bring a crispness to all logos used\r\n-Play up more geometric patterns\r\n-Maintain the core colors (Midnight Blue: Hex: #022A5D, Coral Pink: Hex: #BF525F)\r\n\r\nPAGE TEMPLATES NEEDED\r\n-Homepage\r\n-Research Services Main Page\r\n-Individual Research Page (Child Page Under Research Services)\r\n-Case Studies Main Page\r\n-Individual Case Study Page (Child Pages under Case Studies','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644006522573238273?success','-',7,'United States','Seattle',45.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 15:59:17',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
(17269,'Label and Packaging Design for a Beverage Brand',2,'ACTUAL PRICE WILL BE DETERMINED AFTER HAVING DETAILED DISCUSSION ABOUT THE DESIGN WITH THE DESIGNER.\r\n\r\nI need the following in high dpi with unlimited revisions: Product Label Design, Packaging Design, Print-Ready File, Editable Source File, and 3D Mockup Design.\r\n\r\nIF YOU CAN’T FULFILL THE FOLLOWING BELOW, PLEASE DO NOT SEND YOUR PROPOSAL TO SAVE BOTH OF OUR TIME.\r\n\r\nI want my brand to be the WEIRDEST and COOLEST, while also being an eco-friendly and healthy product anyone would ever see in a store that will leave clear images of my product in the back of their heads and have customers constantly thinking about my product.\r\nMy target audience is the youth culture, Gen Z, and early Millennials, in the 16-35 age range. I want an irreverent, unique, eye-catching, and weird design to catch people’ attention whenever they’d walk into a supermarket or a gas station.\r\n\r\nThe examples below is the type of packaging I will be using. I look forward to seeing your proposals. Thank you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644007061795131393?success','-',7,'United States','Los Angeles',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 16:02:56',NULL,19,3,NULL,123),
