(17288,'Medical Billing Specialist Needed',21,'We are for Seeking Full-time Virtual Medical Billing and Coding Specialists.\r\nWe are a small US-based Orthopedic Surgery and Pain Management Medical Practice located in Washington DC and Maryland. We are currently seeking virtual full-time medical billers (you don’t have to be located inside of the United States to work for us)…. However, US medical Billing experience is REQUIRED… There will be an assessment to prove your billing qualifications… Additional training will be provided by us…\r\n\r\n\r\nYou will be required to work our Eastern Standard Time Hours 9 AM – 5 PM. The pay rate starts at $9.00 USD per hour and this is a 40-hour-per-week full-time position.\r\nMUST be able to speak and communicate effectively in ENGLISH.\r\nAgain you must speak English, please.\r\n\r\nYou will be required to have high-speed internet access.\r\nYou must have live audio and video access for virtual office interaction hence you must be logged in life via video from 9 AM – 5 PM EST. You will have a one-hour paid lunch break.\r\nThis position reports to the Director of Billing and Manager of Billing…\r\nYou will be responsible for entering and coding patient services into a computer system and generating invoices to be sent to the patient. Handles insurance claims, and performs collections duties.\r\nMust be skilled in one or more medical billing areas: Charge Entry, Working Payment Denials, Payment Posting, Collection, Credentialing, and Account Receivables.\r\nMust be well versed in the use of ICD 10 and have deep knowledge of applying CPT coding.\r\n2 YEARS OF EXPERIENCE IN MEDICAL BILLING IS REQUIRED\r\nJob Description','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644003731121319937','-',7,'United States','-',10.000,'perhour',1000.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 16:35:28',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
