(17294,'Canva Re-Design Task - Professional Event Sponsorship Sales Pack',11,'We are looking for a skilled Canva/Powerpoint designer who can re-design our new (currently Canva) designed deck, which is a proposal for sponsors to our new IRL tour event series in a few weeks.\r\n\r\nAll the text, info and images are already in a test deck, but during the creative process we have used several template designs, and random colors, which don\'t now marry up nor look cohesive, so we\'ve lost continuity in design and messaging.\r\n\r\nWe now need somebody creative who can lend their skills to provide a more professional finish to 11 slides e.g. with continuity of fonts, perfectly aligned layouts, creativity on positioning of text and images and branding colors, etc. Its just about shuffling things around to make them more uniform and on-brand for us, whilst really connecting with our potential partner brands. The ultimate aim is for us to attract sponsors from our niche with a slick, direct, and professional design.\r\n\r\nOther info:\r\n- Our current version is created entirely on Canva. We also require delivery and design from the same platform ideally, although powerpoint would also work.\r\n- Strict attention to detail, fonts, colors, alignment etc is a must\r\n\r\nPlease let me know any other questions when applying, and start your application with %% to prove your application is genuine (and not a bot or copy pasted reply). Failure to do so will result in your application being automatically ignored for this role.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01917d388290d94a39','-',7,'United States','Ashton-Under-Lyne',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 16:42:43',NULL,19,3,NULL,129),
