(17308,'English speaking healthcare/medical writers to write SEO-optimised medical articles',37,'We are currently seeking writers with a health or medical background to produce informative and engaging articles on urological procedures and conditions.\r\n\r\nThe successful candidates will be responsible for producing:\r\na) 1000-word articles on procedures such as nephrectomy and TURP, and/or\r\nb) 500-word articles on conditions such as kidney stones, prostate cancer, and benign prostatic hyperplasia.\r\n\r\nTopics will be provided by us. Overall, there are 35 Procedural articles and 21 Condition articles.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Researching and writing high-quality articles on urological procedures and conditions\r\n- Ensuring that all content is accurate, informative, and provides real value to the reader\r\n- Incorporating SEO best practices into all content\r\n- Adhering to deadlines and producing content according to specifications\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Fluent to native proficiency in English\r\n- A health or medical background\r\n- Strong writing and research skills\r\n- Ability to produce accurate and informative content\r\n- Knowledge of SEO best practices\r\n\r\nNew writers are welcomed, but should have the required background and writing experience\r\n\r\nCompensation:\r\n- $5.00 for 500 words for the first article, with the opportunity to earn $8.00 per 500 words after demonstrating quality content.\r\n- $10.00 for 1000 words for the first article, with the opportunity to earn $15.00 per 1000 words after demonstrating quality content.\r\n\r\nTo apply, please include your resume, writing samples, and a brief cover letter detailing your qualifications for this position.\r\n\r\nIn the subject line of your email, please include the word \"Copy\" to indicate that you have read and understood the job description.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644024429053218817','-',7,'United States','Malaysia',1000.000,'fixed',850.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 17:12:33',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
