(17325,'Brand Designer',2,'We are looking for a talented and creative logo designer to help us develop a brand new brand. We are a new company and need a logo that will represent our brand and help us stand out from the competition.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should have:\r\n\r\nProven experience in designing custom logos for various industries and niches\r\nA strong portfolio showcasing their previous work\r\nExcellent communication skills and the ability to understand client requirements\r\nProficiency in graphic design software such as Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, or Sketch\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDevelop a custom logo design for our brand that represents our values and mission\r\nCollaborate with our team to understand our brand\'s vision and goals\r\nProvide multiple design options and revisions as needed\r\nDeliver final logo files in various formats for use in print and digital media\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nAt least 2 years of experience in custom logo design\r\nA strong portfolio showcasing your work\r\nAvailability to work on this project for the next 2-3 weeks\r\nProficiency in graphic design software such as Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, or Sketch\r\nStrong communication and collaboration skills\r\nIf you are a talented and creative logo designer who can bring our brand to life, please apply with your portfolio and a brief description of your experience. We look forward to working with you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644029824836571137','-',7,'United States','Edmonton',60.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 17:48:20',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
(17326,'Premium Packaging Designer for Men\'s Fragrance Brand (DTC and Wholesale)',2,'We are looking for an experienced and creative packaging designer to join our team and design premium packaging for our men\'s fragrance brand. The ideal candidate will have a strong portfolio showcasing their expertise in designing high-quality and visually appealing packaging for luxury brands.\r\n\r\nIn this role, you will be responsible for designing packaging that will be used for our direct-to-consumer (DTC) business, as well as for our wholesale accounts. You will collaborate with our creative team to develop packaging concepts that align with our brand and product vision, and ensure that the packaging meets our high standards for quality and functionality.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nCollaborate with the creative team to develop packaging concepts for our men\'s fragrance brand\r\nDesign premium packaging for our DTC business and wholesale accounts\r\nCreate detailed design specifications and mockups for production purposes\r\nWork closely with suppliers and manufacturers to ensure that the packaging meets our quality standards and is delivered on time\r\nStay up-to-date with industry trends and innovations to ensure that our packaging designs are competitive and relevant','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~013804f7f8935fa4cb','-',7,'United States','Santa Monica',1200.000,'fixed',1200.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 17:58:06',NULL,19,3,NULL,129),
(17327,'Illustrator and Cover Designer for Children\'s Book on Anxiety',2,'I have written a 32-page children\'s book about a Support Dinosaur named Lickey. The book is close to my heart because it is about how to help cope with anxiety and other mental illnesses. I am on a mission to alleviate the stigma related to mental illnesses.\r\n\r\nI plan on creating a 10-book series. The first book is named \"Lickey and the Great Storm.\"\r\n\r\nI need someone who will join me on my mission. I am looking for a talented artist to illustrate the thirty-two pages of my book along with the cover. If all goes well, then I will hire the same person long term to do all of my books.\r\n\r\nCheers!!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644036615239045121','-',7,'United States','Asheboro',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'fixed job',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 17:58:28',NULL,18,3,NULL,140),
(17328,'Brand Identity & Website Designer',2,'iTelle Media, a full-service digital marketing agency, is seeking a freelancer with strong experience in Website Design + Branding.\r\n\r\nThe successful candidate will be responsible for developing innovative and visually appealing website designs from scratch, including branding, graphics, and layout design.\r\nThey will need to ensure that the final product is functional, responsive, and user-friendly. The candidate should have expertise in Adobe Creative Suite, Sketch, Figma, and other design tools, and should be proficient in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\r\n\r\nStrong communication skills, the ability to work collaboratively with a team, and excellent time management skills are required.\r\n\r\nThe candidate should have strong Branding knowledge and experience.\r\nThey should be able to provide at least 4 hours of overlap with the 9 am-5 pm EST workday (Monday - Friday)\r\n\r\nIf you are a creative individual with a passion for designing innovative and visually appealing websites, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644037484613799937','-',7,'United States','Fort Lauderdale',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 18:01:51',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
