(17384,'PowerPoint Master (Templates)',11,'We are looking for an experienced expert to create 2 or 3 PowerPoint master templates for our organization, which will be used as a basis for our future presentations. Please note that this is not for a specific presentation deck, but rather for the creation of the masters themselves.\r\nWe will provide the following:\r\n* Our corporate design standards (Brand Guidelines) which include fonts, colors, and other design standards.\r\n* Our logo in a preferred format.\r\n* Conceptual designs to assist the selected designer in creating the masters.\r\n* Typical past presentations for reference.\r\nWe expect the following deliverables:\r\nThe designs should include the following:\r\n1. Title slide\r\n2. Section slide\r\n3. Two or three types of title and full-page contents (bullets, smart art, etc.)\r\n4. Title and two-column contents\r\n5. Title and two-column contents with column headings\r\n6. Title only\r\n7. Closing slide\r\n* Additional slides where graphs can be plugged in.\r\n* Draft masters in both widescreen and standard width.\r\n* Demonstrations of how the master would work when applied to our supplied example presentations so we can confirm the master works correctly.\r\n* 2 or 3 separate designs, each with different degrees of graphic and design complexity, ranging from very simple and clean to more illustrative.\r\n* Second draft masters of the above based on our feedback.\r\n* Final sets of masters in both wide and standard width, with 2 or 3 sets based on complexity.\r\n* Custom color scheme for our company, to make it easy for users to stay cohesive.\r\n* Each slide with images should include stock images.\r\nWhen submitting your proposal, please provide the following:\r\n* Scope of work and schedule.\r\n* List of deliverables, including quantities and format.\r\n* Sample work product.\r\n* Minimum of two references of similar projects.\r\n* Billing rate and payment schedule.\r\nThank you, and we look forward to receiving','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644074767093354497?success','-',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 20:30:11',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
(17385,'Medical Billing and Scheduling',21,'We are seeking an experienced Medical Billing and Scheduling Specialist to join our healthcare team. The successful candidate will be responsible for ensuring accurate and timely billing, as well as efficient scheduling of appointments for our medical practice.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nAccurately and timely billing of medical claims, including verification of patient information, insurance coverage, and coding of medical procedures.\r\nHandling patient inquiries and disputes related to medical billing.\r\nScheduling appointments for patients, including verifying insurance coverage and ensuring necessary referrals and authorizations are obtained.\r\nMaintaining accurate and up-to-date patient records and billing information in our electronic health records system.\r\nWorking closely with physicians, nurses, and other healthcare staff to ensure efficient and effective patient care.\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nMinimum of 2 years of experience in medical billing and scheduling.\r\nKnowledge of medical terminology, coding, and insurance procedures.\r\nFamiliarity with electronic health records (EHR) systems.\r\nStrong attention to detail and accuracy in data entry.\r\nExcellent communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to handle patient inquiries and disputes professionally and effectively.\r\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team in a fast-paced environment.\r\nIf you are an experienced Medical Billing and Scheduling Specialist who is committed to providing excellent patient care, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity. Please provide your resume, cover letter, and any relevant certifications or training. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644061000731144193','-',7,'United States','-',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 20:34:08',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
