(17415,'Logo Design for an Escape Room Company',10,'Hi! We are a new escape room company looking for a new logo. If you are interested in the task, we would appreciate if you could come back explaining your usual work flow:\r\n\r\nFor example:\r\n\r\n- What\'s the exact cost and what does it include?\r\n- Do we get any logo ideas before starting to work together to decide if we can be a good fit? If not, how does it work exactly?\r\n- Any other relevant information\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\nNote: below some info about our logo ideas:\r\n\r\nThe company name Sic Mundus comes from the \"Dark\" Netflix series and it recalls time travel - But we thought of it more for its latin meaning \"Such, is the world created\" or \"This way, the world is\". We imagine giving our players real-life/movie experiences where they feel like \"this is the real world\" while they are playing it.\r\n\r\nSo while we are also open to traditional logo ideas (many escape room brands go with Doors, Locks, Mazes, People running) we also would like to explore the original concept described above in my first lines, as well as getting \"mind-blown\" from \"this world\" they are playing.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01046e68d0c303856e','-',7,'United States','Palermo',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 21:16:55',NULL,19,3,NULL,129),
