(17424,'Zoho Booking and Inventory Management Setup',39,'We are looking for a Zoho expert to help us set up and configure our Zoho booking system and inventory management process. We have already set up Zoho, but not entirely correctly as we recently switched from QuickBooks, and the data was incorrect. Therefore, we need to eliminate discrepancies in our opening balance and ensure accurate financial records.\r\n\r\nOur current inventory is in disarray, and we need it to be correctly labeled and entered as an inventory asset on the balance sheet.\r\n\r\nThe project will involve the following tasks:\r\n\r\nReviewing the current Zoho booking system and inventory management process to identify areas for improvement\r\n-Setting up opening balances and ensuring they are entered correctly in Zoho\r\n-Uploading inventory data and configuring Zoho to count it as \"stock on hand\" and as an asset on the balance sheet\r\n-Developing and implementing inventory management processes and procedures to improve efficiency and accuracy\r\n\r\nIt is important to note that this project is to set up the Zoho system and inventory management process. We will not be using data from QuickBooks as it was incorrect. Therefore, the project will include a brief training session to ensure we can continue to use Zoho correctly and accurately going forward.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should have:\r\n-Extensive experience with Zoho software and understanding of Zoho booking and inventory management processes\r\n-Knowledge of accounting principles and experience in managing financial data\r\n-Ability to set up and configure Zoho to meet our inventory management needs\r\n-Effective communication and interpersonal skills\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this project, please include your experience with Zoho software and relevant qualifications in your proposal. We look forward to hearing from you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644035460871696385','-',7,'United States','Ridgway',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-04-06',1,'2023-04-06',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-06 21:22:16',NULL,11,3,NULL,155),
