(17459,'Creating a full online brand identity for our elearning plateform (we work on Kajabi)',2,'We are looking for a great designer to craft the identity of our e-learning plateform, we are a bootstrap startup (MVP) based in France with a unique identity. We provide trainings/courses for merchants.\r\nLike a Netflix for e-commerce.\r\nWe have launched our product (go to market one month ago) but we lack brand identity and really need one.\r\nFor the moment, we work on the LMS plateform Kajabi to provide our online courses.\r\n\r\nOur acquisition is mainly online, and we generate lots of LP that must be under the same brand identity.\r\n\r\nThanks !','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644260944832385025','-',7,'United States','Paris',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 09:04:57',NULL,18,3,NULL,156),
(17460,'Boat shop logo',10,'We are looking for a talented designer to bring life to one of our businesses with a fresh looking classic logo. \"Lethbridge Marine\" is a Canadian boating company based in Lethbridge Alberta and has been in operation since 1996. Sales, Services, and Storage are the primary functions of the business.\r\n\r\nFinal deliverables for this job will include branding guides like color and type fonts, and a well designed logo in multiple file formats (jpeg, png, svg, ai). this logo must work on both black and white backgrounds.\r\n\r\nWe would like to have input in the ideation and sketching phase of logo creation before it is taken to final design. We expect several thumbnail sketches before, 1-3 iteration drafts, and then move to final design.\r\n\r\nWe want this logo to incorporate the Lethbridge train bridge. It is essential that this logo immediately coveys our company purpose to our customers.\r\n\r\nThe attached drawing is merely an insight into our vision of a potential design, however we encourage our designer to explore their creativity within our written guidelines.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~010bcff95e763c828e','-',7,'United States','Smithfield',400.000,'fixed',400.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 09:22:43',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
