(17484,'Create brand identity- Two Feet',2,'Two Feet is a social enterprise that connects people in need with the resources and support they require through an AI chat platform. Their mission is to help those who are struggling to access the help they need, whether it be financial, medical, or emotional. Two Feet is committed to making a positive social impact and is seeking a comprehensive branding guideline that reflects their values and mission.\r\n\r\n- Project Overview:\r\nTwo Feet is seeking a comprehensive branding guideline that reflects their mission of connecting people in need with the resources and support they require. The branding guidelines should represent the company\'s values of empathy, approachability, and authenticity, while also reflecting their commitment to making a positive social impact.\r\n\r\n- Design Vision:\r\nThe design vision for the branding guidelines should reflect Two Feet\'s mission of connecting people in need with the resources and support they require. The design should be warm, welcoming, and approachable, with a focus on empathy and authenticity. The colors and typography should be modern and bold, yet still communicate a sense of caring and compassion. The visual identity should be versatile enough to be used across various mediums, from digital to print, while still maintaining consistency and brand recognition.\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\n\r\n- Three unique brand guidelines that reflect different visual and conceptual directions, while still aligning with the company\'s values and mission.\r\n—Each brand guideline should include:\r\n——A comprehensive brand identity that includes a logo, color palette, font choices, and examples of how to use the brand elements consistently across different mediums.\r\n——Visual guidelines that provide clear guidance on how to use the brand elements in a way that reflects the company\'s values and mission.\r\n——A brand voice that is authentic, approachable, and empathetic, with a focus on connecting people in need with the resources and support they require.\r\n——Examples of brand application across various mediums, such as social media, print materials, and merchandise.\r\n——A style guide that includes specifications for typography, color usage, imagery, and brand messaging.\r\n\r\n- Project Objectives:\r\n\r\n—To create a brand identity that is unique, memorable, and reflective of Two Feet\'s mission and values.\r\n—To develop visual guidelines that provide clear guidance on how to use the brand elements consistently across different mediums.\r\n—To establish a brand voice that is approachable, authentic, and empathetic.\r\n—To provide examples of brand application across various mediums, such as social media, print materials, and merchandise.\r\n—To create a style guide that includes specifications for typography, color usage, imagery, and brand messaging.\r\n—To ensure that the brand guidelines are being used consistently and effectively across all communications.\r\n\r\nTimeline:\r\nThe project is expected to take approximately 6-8 weeks.\r\n\r\nBudget:\r\n\r\nPlease include an overall budget you believe the job will be.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01d18e89537d3d9a83','-',7,'United States','Australia',600.000,'fixed',600.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 10:03:30',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(17485,'Branding designer/specialist',2,'Position: Branding designer/specialist\r\nProject Type: One-time project\r\nFixed offer rate\r\nExpert\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a talented Branding Designer to lead a full rebranding process for our business. You will work closely with me to create a brand identity that aligns with our business objectives and resonates with our target audience.\r\nResponsibilities:\r\nDevelop a complete branding guideline that includes logo design, typography, color palette, and imagery.\r\nDesign marketing collateral such as flyers, brochures, email templates, social media graphics, and other marketing materials.\r\nConduct market research and analyze industry trends to ensure the brand stays relevant and competitive.\r\nEnsure all marketing materials are consistent with the brand guidelines and maintain brand consistency across all channels.\r\nRequirements:\r\nA portfolio showcasing your branding design skills and experience.\r\nProficiency in Adobe Creative Suite, specifically Illustrator, InDesign, and Photoshop.\r\nExperience in creating complete branding guidelines and executing brand revamps.\r\nExcellent communication skills and ability to work collaboratively with the team.\r\nKnowledge of the latest design trends and best practices.\r\nIf you are a creative individual who is passionate about branding design and has strong attention to detail, we encourage you to apply. Please start your proposal with the word COZY, and share the work you are most proud of so I know you read the full description. :)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644279342320680961','-',7,'United States','541Coram',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 10:03:56',NULL,18,3,NULL,156),
