(17497,'Logo Design // Construction MGMT Company',10,'This project is for logo design for a construction MGMT company.\r\n\r\nWe have a collection of logos that the client likes - we have the color palettes and a creative brief and just need a few strong mocks to get the client to lock in on.\r\n\r\nIf this project goes well, we would love to explore working with you more in the future on design work, logos, branding, brochures, etc.\r\n\r\nTime is of the essence so please call or email to setup a quick zoom.\r\n\r\nThank you.\r\nBenjamin Davidson\r\nLush Digital\r\nFounder\r\n689.500.2826\r\nbenjamin@lushdigital.agency','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644287462270926849','-',7,'United States','Saint Cloud',48.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 10:35:18',NULL,18,3,NULL,156),
(17498,'Product Logo Design & Rec Sport Jersey Design',10,'I have several projects going right now, with projects constantly sprouting up. Here is a quick run down of what we\'re looking for currently...\r\n\r\nProject 1 - A Cornhole Bag Storage Accessory that is going to be sold online.\r\nFor this I am looking for a logo design and a package design. I have a general direction we want to go with, that I can share.\r\n\r\nProject 2 - A Rec Sports League in Grand Rapids Michigan specializing in \"Adult Kickball\".\r\nFor this we need as many kickball shirt logos/designs as you can whip out (maybe 20-50), each logo doesn\'t have to be ground-breaking, they can be simply popular sayings like \"LETS F***IN GO!\" written in fun writing or it can be an elaborate image.\r\nWe have our GR Rec Sports logo that is always on the back of the jersey, so we just need something different on the front every new season. If the designs are good you\'ll get a bonus, if they are great, a bigger bonus. Our demo is 21-35 year old sporty people that like to party.\r\n(see attached file to see our design for last season.)\r\n\r\nA phone call would be best to get started, then we can text or email to stay connected throughout the project.\r\nI can pay per hour, per logo, per job, or we can come up with something else, up to you.\r\nI like being fair and flexible with my co-workers because I believe giving freedom helps unleash creativity and gets the best out of everyone.\r\n\r\nOverall, I am looking for someone fitting in my audiences demographic, you must know what cornhole is, have an understanding of sports, and what is \'cool\'.\r\n\r\nA reliable artist that communicates quickly and efficiently - If this is you, please reach out!\r\n\r\nAustin','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0182abd44d555a5345','-',7,'United States','US',800.000,'fixed',800.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 10:38:55',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
