(17512,'PowerPoint presentation',11,'I am writing to request your assistance in designing a presentation for our ministry of education. The presentation will focus on technologies skilling for higher education students and staff, and our partner on this project is Microsoft. The presentation will be viewed by a VIP audience, so it is important that the design is visually appealing and professional.\r\n\r\nHere are some key points to keep in mind when designing the presentation:\r\n\r\n1- The design should be clean, modern, and visually appealing to capture the attention of the audience.\r\n\r\n2- The company logo should be prominently displayed on each slide to reinforce brand identity and credibility.\r\n\r\n3- The content should be organized in a clear and logical manner, with emphasis on the key takeaways.\r\n\r\n4- The color scheme should be simple and consistent throughout the presentation.\r\n\r\n5- The design should be optimized for readability, with clear and legible fonts.\r\n\r\nPlease find attached the presentation and our CTS corporate logo.\r\nPlease let me know if you have any questions or concerns, and I look forward to seeing your design.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016a739d5c9e954c58','-',7,'United States','Dubai',48.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 11:50:59',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
