(17537,'Cover Art for Ice Age Novel',2,'need cover art (front, back and spine) for an historic novel titled, Ahna of the Ice Age.\r\n\r\nThis is an adventure story of a young woman about 15 or 16 years old, intended for the Young Adult market.  \r\n\r\nThe front cover shows our heroine standing about calf deep in a mountain stream.  Although the water is running swiftly, that is not the source of the danger.  There is an older man, in his late 30s, his back is to us, but part of his bearded face can be seen.  He is furious. He is menacing the young woman.\r\n\r\nShe is facing him (and the viewer) about 15 feet upstream and is hurling a fishing spear at the man.  She has a look of steely anger on her face; her expression in no way conceals that she is a beautiful young woman with blonde hair and blue eyes.  As this is the Ice Age, they are dressed in animal skins. The male character is well-muscled, not fat or over-weight.  He is pulling up his right hand and forearm to protect his face from the spear Ahna is in the act of throwing.\r\n\r\nIt is daytime. Weather is not a factor, although it is summer.  In the background you can see pine trees (fir trees) along the far, rocky bank and beyond rugged terrain (think along parts of the upper Hudson River (if you are familiar with Upstate New York).  In the distant background you can see high mountains with snow-covered peaks.  By the way, the back cover should be a continuation of this terrain only.  There should be a “quiet” area in the art on the spine and on the back cover for copy to be added.  \r\n\r\nFinal details:  I am an artist myself so we should have no trouble communicating but my style is not suitable for the look I want. I will be adding the copy to the covers. You are responsible for the art only.  Finished book size is: 5 1/8” x 7 3/4”.  I am flexible on delivery for the right artist. I will provide you with the chapter where the cover action occurs along with a rough sketch of the scene I envision. But don’t let my sketch hem in your creative ideas.  It’s just to get you started.  I look forward to hearing from so','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2051715','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 13:03:52',NULL,16,1,NULL,136),
