(17555,'Blogs writer about keto diet healthy life style and nutrition ( should use frase or surfer seo )',37,'Hello im looking for medical seo blog writers who are able to deliver an original content with exceptional depth to the topic must be expert in the keto diet and nutrition topic health in general and must be native english and a dietitian\r\n\r\nA writer know how to do deep topics and keyword research to understand the intent of the topics and ability to dig deeper to find quiestion and answer them .\r\n\r\nTo be able to deliver high quality content there are a work frame needs to be done most important thing is to read the content in the top 20 results to be able to find the gap of the compatitors comtent and be able to craft a content that more thorough with new information that is not available anywhere else in the compatitors comtent\r\n\r\nWriters who cant adhere to this will not do well from the 1st post and we will know that.\r\n\r\nSo to be able to work with us you need to know that 1st peice of comtent if it went to check list and all good will be paid otherwise if its not as good as we need will not be paid and will not be used ofcourse so there will be no future business betweent us.\r\n\r\nIm looking for creative hardworking writes who are doing this full time so each artcle of 2k words should not take more than 24 hours max otherwise we will not be able to contenue the relationship.\r\n\r\nAll the writiers im working with deliver the content seo optemized with surfer seo or frase with all the recommended number of word count and photos internal links and external links recomended by those tools.\r\n\r\nKindly read the description very well and make sure that everything mentioned are applicable to you to not waste my time nor yours\r\n\r\nI pay (0.008) cent per word the project is for long term and open ill repeat the rate for 100 words that would be (0.8 ) cent\r\n\r\nTo make sure that you have read all the post when you apply add the word ( understood ) in the subject so i know you have read and understand and your qualified for this job other wise ill ignore any message dont have this secret word\r\n\r\n\r\nKindly if you dont agree to terms you have read here dont waste your time or mine and apply\r\n\r\nI prefer to work with someone who is an subject matter expert.\r\n\r\nBest of luck','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644328766222577665','-',7,'United States','Riyadh',1000.000,'Open this select menu',850.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 13:20:28',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
(17556,'Brand Designer for Mens Mental Health App Startup',2,'I am building a mens mental health app. It is a startup. I need someone to create my branding. Brand, theme, logo, fonts. I also need you to implement the brand design into a simple landing page design on Webflow to collect emails.\r\n\r\nWe are a tech company with a male audience. The theme of the brand is masculine, tech, futuristic, clean, simple,  trustworthy and care.\r\n\r\nHere is some inspiration:\r\n\r\nLogo\r\n\r\nhttps://dribbble.com/shots/21119947-LogoLounge-Book-14-Submitted-Logos\r\n\r\nhttps://dribbble.com/shots/20567720-Vitamin-Logo-Design\r\nhttps://dribbble.com/shots/17318553-Mevita-Logo-Icon\r\nhttps://dribbble.com/shots/21065822-illusion-AI-logo-Modern-logo-Tech-logo-Software-Logo\r\n\r\n\r\nWebsite:\r\n\r\nhttps://dribbble.com/shots/19903898-Yoga-and-Meditations-Website-Design-System\r\n\r\nhttps://dribbble.com/shots/19627278-Zero-Online-Fitness-Platform-Website','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01984413c8bf37afdc','-',7,'United States','North Vancouver',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 13:23:22',NULL,18,3,NULL,146),
