(17558,'Logo design for Psychology Business',10,'My business is Incrementum Psychology.\r\nIncrementum means growth, development and increase.\r\nMy business focuses on coaching and providing psychological services for neurodivergent people (meaning people with both hidden talent and challenges such as those with an ADHD, Dyslexic and autistic brains). Some of our greatest minds now and in human history have amazing minds that are creative and think \'out of the box\'.\r\nEinstein, Da Vinci, Steve Jobs and Sir Isaac Newton - the list goes on!\r\n\r\nNeurodivergent means brain differences.\r\nI aim to help people change, discover, learn and grow through learning about their full potential in a society designed for the \'neurotypical\'.\r\n\r\nI\'d like a logo to reflect my business.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644330647425454081?success','-',7,'United States','Rostrevor',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 13:26:58',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
