(17594,'Develop low-res wireframe for my site',3,'This job post includes a number of important details, so please read to the end before responding.\r\n\r\nI am looking for a qualified individual who can help me develop a low-res wireframe for a website that I am working on.\r\n\r\nThe website I want to build will be to provide fractional / part-time Chief Marketing Officer (CMO) services to mid-sized firms in the financial services industry.\r\n\r\nBelow, I am sharing a few web pages from a site that I think does a decent job of offering fractional CMO services:\r\n\r\nhttps://rsc.llc/about/\r\nhttps://rsc.llc/fractional-cmo/\r\nhttps://rsc.llc/framework/\r\nhttps://rsc.llc/get-started/\r\n\r\nI\'d give his design a B+ and his content a B-\r\n\r\nBelow is a site that offers a very different type of service, but does a good job of selling itself:\r\n\r\nwww.saasacademy.com/\r\nwww.saasacademy.com/programs\r\nwww.saasacademy.com/programs/growth-accelerator\r\nwww.saasacademy.com/programs/saas-academy\r\nwww.saasacademy.com/programs/boardroom\r\n\r\nI like that the first site provides a framework. (I don\'t care for the actual framework, but it\'s good that he provides one.)\r\n\r\nWhat I like about the second site is that they productize their offerings (programs).\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for you to use these two sites to develop a sitemap and wireframe for each main page in the sitemap for my fractional CMO services that I would offer to financial service firms.\r\n\r\nMy preliminary view is that the sitemap can consist of: home, about, programs, framework, resources, blog, contact. I\'m open to suggestion, of course. BTW, in your response to this post, please tell me that \"unicorns are awesome\" so I know you\'ve read this far into the post.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, please provide 2 - 3 examples of low-res wireframes that you\'ve done in the past.\r\n\r\nThanks, and I look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644357798263730177','-',7,'United States','Chicago',45.000,'Open this select menu',45.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 15:15:18',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
