(17632,'Logo',10,'We are looking for a talented logo designer to create a crest logo for our company. The logo designer will be responsible for designing a unique and memorable crest logo that accurately represents our brand and its values.\r\n\r\nCreate a visual representation of the brand\'s values and mission through a crest logo.\r\nResearch the industry and competition to ensure the logo stands out.\r\nPresent multiple logo concepts and iterate on the chosen design.\r\nWork with the team to finalize the crest logo and prepare it for use across various mediums.\r\nEnsure that the logo is scalable, versatile, and meets all design specifications.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience as a logo designer with a portfolio of work showcasing strong conceptualization and design skills.\r\nExperience in creating crest logos is highly preferred.\r\nProficiency in design software such as Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, and InDesign.\r\nExcellent communication skills and the ability to collaborate with a team.\r\nAttention to detail and ability to follow design specifications.\r\nUnderstanding of branding and marketing principles.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644379125618069505?success','-',7,'United States','Little Rock',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 16:39:37',NULL,19,3,NULL,123),
(17633,'Graphic Designer for Sales Deck (Google Slides)',2,'We are looking for an experienced and creative freelance graphic designer to design an engaging and visually appealing sales deck presentation for our software solution.\r\n\r\nThe presentation should effectively communicate our value proposition, showcase our brand identity, and utilize graphics and images to emphasize key messages.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Develop a visually appealing and professional sales deck presentation based on the provided sales script and slide headings\r\n- Consistently showcase our brand\'s visual identity throughout the slides, using clean and modern design elements\r\n- Reference our website for brand colors and style guidance\r\n- Incorporate graphics and images that effectively communicate key messages and include real-life examples to build trust and credibility with potential customers\r\n- Create custom visuals, such as icons, illustrations, charts, and screenshots, to engage the audience effectively\r\n- Deliver the final sales deck presentation in a format that can be easily edited and updated (e.g., PowerPoint, Keynote, or Google Slides)\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Proven graphic design experience, with a strong portfolio showcasing previous sales deck presentations or similar projects\r\n- Strong visual design skills, including layout, typography, color theory, and branding\r\n- Excellent attention to detail and the ability to work within tight deadlines\r\n- Ability to take direction and work independently, while also being open to feedback and collaboration\r\n\r\nWe\'ll provide materials including a library of product images, logo, ideas for each slide (suggestions).','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ce55da8bfe0ddf0a','-',7,'United States','London',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 16:42:40',NULL,19,3,NULL,125),
(17634,'Logo Creation for a fun Pottery & Art Studio!',10,'4-color logo needed for the attached sketch/concept.\r\n\r\nQuick turn around time appreciated. Would like a more cartoon type style but open to suggestions. This is a Pottery & Art Studio. Logo will be used on all printed material, website/marketing and merchandise.\r\n\r\nMust express, creativity, excitement and be classy enough people would wear a T-shirt with logo on it. We want the logo to represent how fun and creative our customers can be when they walk in the door and take class at Muddy Octopus Studio.\r\n\r\nI\'m quick with feedback and edits and clear with what we\'d like to see. I worked with advertising and publishing and our art department said I was the easiest to work with! :)','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01782007450473543c','-',7,'United States','Gig Harbor',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 16:42:49',NULL,18,3,NULL,146),
(17635,'Media Kit Needed - Designed for Print',11,'Need to have a Media Kit created in a printable, booklet format.\r\n\r\nCopy will be supplied as well as a selection of images to work with. The only design direction except that it should be clean, simple and complement the look and feel of our website (https://www.eldertree.biz/)\r\n\r\nAttached are media kit samples that our sales team feels resonate successfully with our client base - the higher education market.\r\n\r\nLooking for a quick turnaround on initial draft. Hoping to have someone hired today (4/7) and a first draft no later than mid-next week but the sooner the better.\r\n\r\nSince it\'s to be booklet, I\'m guessing it will be 8 pages including front and back cover.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~013d800b00de8659a3','-',7,'United States','Norwalk',75.000,'perhour',80.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 16:44:48',NULL,19,3,NULL,129),
(17636,'Ebook writer',39,'\'m seeking a freelance writer to create an ebook on a topic related to medical coding. The ebook will need to be well-researched, informative, and engaging to a healthcare professional audience. The ideal writer will have experience in healthcare writing, a strong understanding of the healthcare industry, and a knack for distilling complex information into clear, concise language.\r\n\r\nThe ebook will be approximately 50-75 pages in length and will need to be completed within a reasonable timeframe. The project will involve collaboration with me to ensure that the content is aligned with my vision for the project.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re a reliable, detail-oriented writer with a passion for healthcare and a track record of producing high-quality content, I would love to hear from you.\r\n\r\nIn addition to research, the project will require the writer to interview our subject matter experts in the healthcare industry.\r\n\r\nPlease send me your writing samples and how you plan to approach interviewing our subject matter experts.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644378345365114881','-',7,'United States','Houston',30.000,'Open this select menu',25.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 16:46:16',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
