(17639,'Billing & Coding Technical Copywriter',37,'High degree of familiarity & proficiency in Writing long form Blog content, Case Study, Subject matter expertise in Medical Billing and Medical Coding is a must.\r\n\r\nPlease provide samples of work and your detailed resume when applying.\r\n\r\nREQUIREMENT:\r\nLooking for a content writer with experience in Medical Billing & Coding. You will be writing about coding guidelines, medical billing scenarios claims management etc.\r\n\r\n✅ Experience in Medical Billing - Claims Management - full cycle\r\n✅ Experience in Coding Guidelines, CPT/ ICD Codes, Modifiers-What combinations work, what don\'t etc.\r\n✅ Certified Coder\r\n✅ Exposure to different EMR\'s like EPIC, eCW, Athena etc.\r\n✅ Ability to structure content into easy to read blogs, summary How to documents and Guides\r\n\r\n\r\nFREELANCERS ONLY. NO AGENCIES.\r\n\r\nYou are quick to learn and immerse yourself in understanding the Target Audience persona and what will resonate with them. You are creative and can write content that tells an interesting story.\r\n\r\n\r\nContent-Type:\r\n1. Punchy Headlines and above the fold text that speaks to the Target Audience on Website pages\r\n2. Landing page storytelling with Sub Headings, section headings that aid in conversions\r\n2. Work with Content Strategist to identify specific topics for publication based on SEO goals and company positioning\r\n3. Create/ Proofread email newsletters, and promotional emails tying in to tour brand narrative and TA\r\n4. Work with the Website & SEO team to build out the content for website pages - Punchlines, Headings, sections etc.\r\n5. Build exclusive Guides, Cheat sheets etc, collaborating with our internal teams\r\n6. Proof read/ approve content published for Medical Billing, Coding related areas\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease propose a per-word price (preferred) or an alternate form of engagement.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644378967863930881','-',7,'United States','Northbrook',30.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 16:48:15',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
