(17642,'Trainee Medical coder',30,'Hiring & Employment:\r\n► Employment - Full Time\r\n► Probation Period - 4 - 6 Months\r\n► Job Nature - Medical Coding (HCC)\r\n► Work Location - Chennai\r\n► Work Shift - General / Night/ Rotational shifts\r\n► Work Timings - 09:00 AM - 06:30 PM\r\n► Work Days - Monday to Friday (Sat & Sun Holiday)\r\n\r\nPoints to Note -\r\nOur offices are operating with required number of employees and adhering to safety norm as per the Govt regulations\r\nOffered candidates are expected to report to office to start the training in their respective locations\r\nOn successful completion of training, the candidates will be moved to projects for project-based assignments\r\nBased on consistent performance long-term WFH shall be considered\r\nCandidates must adhere to all our processes and ensure to stay in line with organization expectations\r\n\r\nEligible Qualification : Medical science/ Life-Science Degree/ Diploma\r\n\r\nThe Criteria\'s:\r\n► Candidates graduated from 2017 can participate in the selection process\r\n► Candidates should have good communication (English) & interpersonal skills\r\n► At the time of interview, candidates should have completed the course & must not have arrears\r\n► Candidates who are selected and join will enter into a 21 months training agreement\r\n► Post the technical training, candidates will have to undergo a mandatory evaluation & based on the test clearance, they will be moved to production\r\n► No leaves are permitted during the training period\r\n\r\nExtensive Career Growth:\r\nProgressive and distinct career path shows potential for a trainee raise to junior coder level in less than 6 months and thereon to the level of medical coder in a year.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644379772681814017','-',7,'United States','India',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 16:52:48',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
