(17647,'Video Editor for Medical Office',28,'Video Editor for a Cardiovascular Office/Doctors\' Social Media Content\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\nWe are a team of Cardiovascular doctors who are passionate about creating educational and engaging content for our social media channels. We are seeking a skilled and experienced video editor to help us elevate the quality and appeal of our content. The goal is to create engaging content that will end up in front of other doctors.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nEdit raw video footage into high-quality, visually appealing content for social media\r\nOptimize video and photo content for specific social media channels (Instagram, Facebook, YouTube, etc.)\r\nEnsure consistent branding and messaging across all videos and photos\r\nCollaborate with our team to brainstorm and develop new video and photo content ideas\r\nUse your creativity and expertise to help us stand out from the competition\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience in video and photo editing, with a strong portfolio showcasing your skills and style\r\nFamiliarity with various video and photo editing software and tools, including Adobe Premiere Pro, Final Cut Pro, and Photoshop\r\nKnowledge of social media trends and best practices for video and photo content\r\nAbility to work independently and deliver high-quality results in a timely manner\r\nStrong communication and collaboration skills, with a positive and professional attitude\r\nExperience working with medical or healthcare-related content is a plus, but not required\r\nThis is a freelance position with the potential for ongoing work. We are looking for someone who is flexible, professional and committed to helping us take our video and photo content to the next level. If you\'re passionate about video editing and social media, and you have the skills and experience we\'re looking for, we\'d love to hear from you. Please include a link to your portfolio or samples of your work when you apply.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644390405900865537','-',7,'United States','Jersey City',30.000,'perhour',28.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 17:25:18',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
