(17658,'Design a cubby for Cigar Company',2,'El Blunto, a high-end cannabis cigar company, is seeking a talented Graphic Designer/Creative Director to design a custom cubby in stucco style with high-end gold elements. This is a one-off job with the potential for a long term working relationship for future design projects. As a Graphic Designer/Creative Director, you will be responsible for creating a visually stunning cubby design that reflects the luxurious and high-end nature of our brand. Attached are images of our blue velvet display set, as well as our humidor, that will be displayed inside the cubby.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n-Develop and execute a creative concept for the cubby design in stucco style with high-end gold elements\r\n-Collaborate with our team to ensure the design aligns with our brand\'s identity and values\r\n-Create detailed sketches and renderings of the cubby design\r\n-Select appropriate materials and colors for the design\r\nEnsure the cubby design is functional and meets our requirements\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n-Bachelor\'s degree in Graphic Design or related field\r\n-At least 5 years of experience in graphic design and creative direction\r\n-Strong portfolio demonstrating exceptional design skills and creativity\r\n-Knowledge of design software, including Adobe Creative Suite\r\n-Excellent communication and collaboration skills\r\n-Passion for the high-end industry and luxury branding\r\n-If you are a creative and driven Graphic Designer/Creative Director\r\n-looking to make a mark in the cannabis industry, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644403744475451393?success','-',7,'United States','Los Angeles',150.000,'fixed',150.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 18:18:36',NULL,19,3,NULL,123),
