(17694,'Health Professional/ Experience with Alternative Medicine',37,'ABOUT US:\r\n+E-Commerce medical supply company (link removed)\r\n+I\'m in the marketing department, and I oversee our blog, Caregiver University. This blog will be your realm as well. (link removed)\r\n+Our blog is aimed to help regular folks pick the best medical product for their specific needs. (Imagine your grandmother needs a wheelchair but she has no idea what to look for.) We are here to help!!\r\n-----\r\n\r\nWHO I AM SEARCHING FOR:\r\n+You must be some type of healthcare professional. I usually hire RNs.\r\n+You must be (at least somewhat) familiar with alternative medicine.\r\n+You must have a personal website (LinkedIn does not count). It does not have to be \'fancy\'. Here is a good example: (link removed)/\r\n-----\r\n\r\nJOB DESCRIPTION:\r\n++++You will be reviewing these articles for medical accuracy. This is NOT a writing assignment.++++\r\n+We are about to publish articles on various forms of alternative medicine. The articles are designed to educate the general public, and they are written on a high-school level. Here is an example: (link removed)\r\n+Experts tell me that each article takes ~10 minutes to review.\r\n+You will be listed as the author.\r\n+I will have a minimum of 4 articles, and possibly up to a dozen.\r\n+Each article pays $25.\r\n\r\nThank you for reading this far. To let me know that you read the entire description, tell me your favorite color. I don’t need a cover letter.\r\n\r\nMuch appreciated,\r\nOlivia H.\r\nE-Commerce Coordinator at RehabMart.com','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1644429259182510081','-',7,'United States','Watkinsville',25.000,'fixed',20.000,'2023-04-07',1,'2023-04-07',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-07 20:28:33',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
