(17778,'Realestate Brand Identity + More.',2,'Hi & thank you for your initial interest in my projects. I am based in Brisbane, Australia and I am looking to partner with someone or a team of freelancers who specialise in the design & branding space.\r\n\r\nI have 1 project to design my new business, which sells prestige property in my city of Brisbane.\r\n\r\nHowever, the second project is an ongoing project as what I am looking at doing is to create an individual property brand per listing - this is being done in reference to new land releases for communities to build new homes & also in the boutique high-rise construction projects that often are sold to buyers off the plan. Here is an example:\r\n\r\n1. https://cotepalmbeach.com.au (see how they create a name, bespoke design for the brand identity of the apartment complex itself, their great, logo, website, brochure/booklet etc. example attached\r\n\r\nSo my new business is to do this same model for individual private home sales.\r\n\r\nHere an anther example where a new community is being built and the designer has create a name, brand etc .\r\n\r\n1. https://studiobrave.com.au/work/everlea/\r\n\r\n2.\r\nhttps://www.riverfrontalbanycreek.com.au/\r\nhttps://www.theoxfordtaringa.com.au/\r\n\r\nWHAT WE NEED PER NEW PRESTIGE PROPERTY LISTING:\r\n\r\nBranding – Creation of 3 x Logo Concepts that reflect the home and location (images, video supplied). We present these to the client to gather their\r\nfeedback. A final concept is then delivered\r\n\r\nAsset Roll out– All assets are designed according to the new branding Chosen.\r\n\r\nThese assets include:\r\nSocial media branding requirements\r\n* realestate.com.au logos\r\no Email Marketing Templates (Using Mailchimp)\r\no Invitation Design for an exclusive event\r\no Organic & Paid Ad Assets\r\no Signboard & Flag\r\no A4 Brochure Design / booklet\r\no Swag Design including T-shirt, Keep cups etc\r\n\r\nWebsite Design – Squarespace or otherwise landing page, this includes wireframe\r\ndesign, copy and build of site.\r\n\r\nThanks :)','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01f2c37286dab292d8','-',7,'United States','Greenslopes',60.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-04-10',1,'2023-04-10',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-10 12:35:07',NULL,18,3,NULL,146),
