(17835,'Need custom 1, 3-page brochure',2,'We are a Landscape company in California, and we are looking for a couple of brochures made for our company.\r\n\r\nWe perform Landscaping, Masonry, and Concrete Services in the Sacramento, California, metro area.\r\n\r\nWe are a company specializing in exterior tile solutions and are seeking a skilled brochure copywriter to create a 1-page brochure showcasing our products and services. As a brochure copywriter, you will be responsible for developing persuasive and informative content that effectively communicates the benefits and features of our exterior tile products.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nWork with our marketing team to understand our target audience, product offerings, and key selling points.\r\nResearch and analyze industry trends and competitors to develop a unique and compelling value proposition for our products.\r\nWrite clear, concise, and persuasive copy for a 1-page brochure that highlights the features and benefits of our exterior tile products.\r\nCollaborate with our design team to ensure that the content is visually appealing and effectively communicates the message.\r\nEdit and proofread the content to ensure accuracy and consistency.\r\nEnsure that the brochure meets the brand guidelines and messaging of the company.\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience in copywriting, preferably in the construction or building materials industry.\r\nExceptional writing and editing skills with a keen eye for detail.\r\nStrong understanding of marketing principles and target audience analysis.\r\nAbility to work collaboratively with designers and marketing teams to develop creative content.\r\nFamiliarity with the latest trends and best practices in brochure design and copywriting.\r\nExcellent communication and time management skills to meet project deadlines.\r\nIf you are a creative and talented copywriter with a passion for crafting compelling messaging that drives sales and engages audiences, we would love to hear from you.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWe will look at making other Brochures shortly after this one.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYou can see some of our work at www.rescueconcrete.com','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645452341951668225','-',7,'United States','Sacramento',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-04-10',1,'2023-04-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-10 15:48:30',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
