(17844,'What’s the best way to attach this interchangeable ribbon to my bag design?',2,'Hi there! Here is my bag design. The ribbon on the outside is not meant to be held it’s meant to be decorative and be that pop of color that the fashionistas can easily remove and put any colored ribbon on to coordinate her outfits.\r\n\r\nOriginally I thought to finish the ends of the ribbon like a shoe string tip but then I didn’t like the way there would be holes in the front of the bag and I didn’t like the way grommets looked to see the grommet holes Hardware outside the bag.\r\n\r\nI’m wondering how magnets would work attached to the inside of the bag. But then how would the ribbon ends be attached to magnets to give it a clean luxurious professional look? They would need to be strong magnets but have a clean finished look.\r\n\r\nI’d like to see about working with you to see if you have the expertise to know how to design the tech pack just for the ribbon magnet finishing attachment for the interchangeable ribbons. I can even have lace and more delicate ribbons so the magnet solution would also need to work and be cinched in somehow to magnets even if the ribbon fabric is delicate.\r\n\r\nDo you have the solution already in your head?','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645460404770824193?success','-',7,'United States','New York',65.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-04-10',1,'2023-04-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-10 16:18:22',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
