(17858,'Self Storage Logo Design for 3 different companies (Pls. read the description)',10,'I need a logo designed for my self storage (Maxwell Self Storage). business. Pretty straight forward. I need a slight variation to the logo for 3 separate locations. Similar to 3 different tag lines for one logo design.\r\n\r\nMaxwell Self Storage is one of 3 companies\r\nIf you want, you may send us a sample. This will be red, white and blue colors (U.S. American flag colors).\r\nWe want to see what you can come up with.\r\n\r\nI will need greyscale, and background transparent. I will need high resolution files along with the design and vector files. You must be willing to do revisions, if needed.\r\n\r\nI will also need all design and copyrights to the designs.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645472460782247937','-',7,'United States','Las Vegas',200.000,'Open this select menu',200.000,'2023-04-10',1,'2023-04-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-10 17:42:29',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
(17859,'Logo Design for new soccer-specific talk show',10,'I\'m looking for an experienced designer who can help us create a logo for a new talk show that will be focused entirely on Major League Soccer and offer a ton of debate-heavy topics. The show is going to be called \"Wake Up, MLS\" and will feature a rotating stable of MLS-focused creators. This show is part of existing brand and network, known as GOLZ TV. We already have the color scheme and font. Just need some help creating the core logo design for this new show.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645471443256205313','-',7,'United States','Mill Creek',35.000,'Open this select menu',35.000,'2023-04-10',1,'2023-04-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-10 17:44:54',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
(17860,'Real Estate Website (MVP) Redesign',3,'Our real estate company is seeking an experienced web designer to lead the redesign of our new minimal viable product (MVP) website. The ideal candidate will be responsible for creating a visually appealing and user-friendly website that will allow us to gauge the market interest in this new product.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\nDesign and develop the website\'s layout, including navigation, content placement, and overall look and feel.\r\nCollaborate with the development team to ensure the website is functional and optimized for performance.\r\nCreate and edit images, graphics, and multimedia content for the website.\r\nConduct usability testing to ensure the website is user-friendly and easy to navigate.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n3+ years of experience in web design, with a focus on user experience and visual design.\r\nStrong proficiency in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\r\nKnowledge of design tools such as Adobe Creative Suite, Sketch, or Figma.\r\nExperience working with content management systems such as WordPress.\r\nFamiliarity with responsive design principles and techniques.\r\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills.\r\nStrong attention to detail and ability to meet tight deadlines.\r\n\r\nIf you are passionate about web design and have a strong portfolio of previous work, we encourage you to apply.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645470659524608001','-',7,'United States','Delray Beach',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-04-10',1,'2023-04-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-10 17:48:04',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
