(17866,'Seeking a skilled animator for a series of explainer videos',8,'The Change Companies creates evidence-based workbooks, Facilitator Guides, multimedia assets and other materials to help individuals in addiction treatment, impaired driving and justice services settings.\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a skilled and creative animator to help us adapt written explainer scripts into an engaging and fun series of brief animations (5-6 videos, up to 2 minutes each). Themes will mostly center around what happens in the brain when someone engages in substance use, and how the brain can heal through prescribed medication.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate has great creative energy and can collaborate with us on how to bring these themes to life in a friendly, nonthreatening way. Please share a comprehensive portfolio of related completed projects. Successful completion of the first project may lead to additional work.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to working with you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645500067776131073?success','-',7,'United States','Carson City',60.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-04-10',1,'2023-04-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-10 18:54:30',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
(17867,'Freelance 2D In-Between Animator - Rotoscoping',8,'We are currently seeking a talented and motivated Freelance 2D In-Between Animator to work with our creative team.\r\n\r\nAs an In-Between Animator, you will primarily focus on filling in the frames of blueprint rough animations created by our core creative team. A significant portion of your work will involve rotoscoping techniques on videos featuring a public speaker/motivational speaker, to enhance the visual appeal of these videos for social media audiences.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Work closely with the creative team to complete in-between frames for rough blueprint animations.\r\n- Utilise rotoscoping techniques to animate between key points and interesting moments in self-help public speaking videos.\r\n- Ensure consistency and quality of animation work.\r\n- Adhere to project deadlines, and meet contract compliance.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proficiency in Adobe After Effects and Adobe Animate CC.\r\n- Familiarity with the Adobe Creative Suite.\r\n- Strong attention to detail and ability to work independently.\r\n- Must have a reliable internet connection for remote work.\r\n\r\nPreferred Qualifications:\r\n\r\n- Any experience in rotoscoping.\r\n- Currently enrolled in or recently graduated from an animation program.\r\n- Passion for animation and a desire to grow within the industry.\r\n- Passion for self-help / motivational content.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645501435695087617?success','-',7,'United States','Haworth',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-04-10',1,'2023-04-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-10 19:00:57',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
