(17871,'Medical Billing Specialist',21,'Job Description:\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a qualified and dedicated individual to join our Medical Billing Team. In this position, you will be responsible for a variety of tasks, As our medical biller, your daily duties will include maintaining billing software, appealing denied claims, and recording insurance payments.\r\n\r\nTo succeed in this role, you must possess in-depth knowledge of billing software, as medical insurance policies and terminologies. The ideal candidate must also be able to demonstrate excellent written and verbal skills, as communicating with the team, clients, and various insurance agents will form a large part of the job. The candidate must also understand HIPAA regulations and patient privacy.\r\n\r\nMedical Biller Responsibilities:\r\nPrepare and submit billing data and medical claims to insurance companies\r\nEnsure the patient\'s medical information is accurate and up to date\r\nPrepare bills and invoices, and document amounts due to medical procedures and services\r\nCollect and review referrals and pre-authorizations\r\nMonitor and record late payments (if applicable)\r\nFollow-up on missed payments and resolve financial discrepancies\r\nExamine patient bills for accuracy and request any missing information from insurance companies\r\nInvestigate and appeal denied claims\r\nMaintain current collection reports\r\n\r\nMedical Biller requirements:\r\nKnowledge in healthcare administration, account, or relevant field (preferred)\r\nA minimum of 2 years experience as a medical biller or similar role (preferred)\r\nSolid understanding in electronic medical records (preferred)\r\nMust have the ability to multitask and manage time effectively (required)\r\nExcellent written and verbal communication skills (required)\r\nOutstanding problem-solving and organizational abilities (required)\r\nKnowledge and a solid understanding of HIPAA (required)\r\nSecure VPN','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645464479206285313','-',7,'United States','Elk Grove',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-04-10',1,'2023-04-10',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-10 19:13:34',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
