(17921,'Eligibility/verification for acupuncture and chiropractor office',22,'I need help with eligibility/verification checking for acupuncture/chiropractic office. Only contact me if you have done it before via phone and via insurance portals, You must have a phone to make calls,\r\n\r\nYou will be asked to do some verifcation as test.\r\n\r\nKnowledge in healthcare administration, account, or relevant field (preferred)\r\nA minimum of 2 years experience as a medical biller or similar role (preferred)\r\nSolid understanding of billing software\r\n\r\nMust have the ability to multitask and manage time effectively (required)\r\nExcellent written and verbal communication skills (required)\r\nOutstanding problem-solving and organizational abilities (required)\r\nKnowledge and a solid understanding of HIPAA (required)\r\nSecure VPN','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645464166506446849','-',7,'United States','Elk Grove',10.000,'perhour',10.000,'2023-04-10',1,'2023-04-10',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-10 21:04:55',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(17922,'Medical Billing Manager',21,'Responsibilities include:\r\n• Managing a team of billers and coders including setting expectations and creating goals\r\n• Insurance and hospital credentialing\r\n• Managing provider CAQH\r\n• Responsible for reviewing, correcting, and releasing charges.\r\n• Demonstrate strong understanding and utilization of clearinghouse claims tool and clearinghouse rejection queues.\r\n• Responsible for researching, correcting, and releasing accounts within Claim Edit Billing Work queue.\r\n• Demonstrate comprehension and implementation of claim appeal process.\r\n• Knowledge of insurance processes and Medicare rules and guidelines\r\n• Identify insurance company or proper party (patient) to be billed including identifying and billing secondary or tertiary insurances.\r\n• Review assigned accounts within the billing platform Follow Up and Catch All WQs ensuring outstanding, pending, partially paid, and denied claims are paid in a timely manner.\r\n• Communicate with health care providers, patients, insurance claim representatives and other parties to clarify billing issues and facilitate timely payment.\r\n• Accurately file confidential correspondence and documentation\r\n• Review, research, and process refund requests as needed.\r\n• Demonstrate knowledge of CPT, ICD10 and procedural modifiers\r\n• Consult with supervisor, team members and appropriate resources to solve billing and collection questions and issues.\r\n• Strictly comply with the Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act (HIPAA) in protecting patient privacy and federal and state regulations\r\n• Additional job-related duties or projects as needed.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645440396213166081','-',7,'United States','-',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-04-10',1,'2023-04-10',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-10 21:05:36',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(17923,'Looking for a part-time bookkeeper for a digital marketing agency',39,'We are a digital marketing agency looking for a seasoned bookkeeper to manage our QuickBooks files. Our chosen candidate will be responsible for the following:\r\n\r\n1. Entering receipts and transactions as they are sent over.\r\n2. Backing up the QuickBooks file at the end of the day after every use.\r\n3. Reconciling our accounts 1 per month at the designated schedule per account.\r\n4. Keeping transaction records in line with previous records.\r\n\r\nCandidate must be familiar with Quickbooks Premier Professional. We use the desktop 2019 version so the candidate must be able to use that version. Candidate must also be very detailed oriented, native English speaking, and be able to follow directions accurately.\r\n\r\nThe candidate will be sent a bank statement for each account once per month for reconciliation purposes.\r\n\r\nIf you feel you are a good candidate for this position, please feel free to apply. No applications outside of upwork will be considered.and a distribution\r\n\r\nthe P+L and balance sheet are all done\r\n\r\nJust need help with tax due and required paperwork\r\n\r\ncan you complete by due date of 4/18/23','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645457603388067841','-',7,'United States','South Plainfield',18.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-10',1,'2023-04-10',0,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-10 21:06:03',NULL,11,3,NULL,160),
(17924,'Office Manager',23,'Position: Behavioral Health Office Manager\r\n\r\nThis position provides quality assurance, administrative compliance and care coordination for all clinical operations in the agency.\r\n\r\nKey Functions\r\nThis position is responsible for:\r\n· Ensuring all initial intake documentation is present and complete in the record prior to the first date of service recipient’s services.\r\n\r\n· Data analysis and reporting for all assigned duties\r\n\r\n· New hire onboarding administrative duties and compliance\r\n\r\n· Organization of required staff trainings and credentials\r\n\r\n· Reviewing and approving all service documentation within 48 hours of submission.\r\n\r\n· Answering phones and fielding all clinical calls\r\n\r\n· Providing technical assistance to direct care staff about service documentation standards.\r\n\r\n· Maintain tracking system to ensure that individual service plans and quarterly reviews are completed in a timely manner.\r\n\r\n· Track clinical re-assessments/authorizations to ensure no lapses in services','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645431663430037505','-',7,'United States','-',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-04-10',1,'2023-04-10',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-10 21:06:16',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(17925,'Rebrand / New Brand Identity',3,'Looking to have some help rebranding our logo and stuff into something cohesive and more professional.\r\n\r\nAttached are all the logos associated with our brand. Packible Tools is the company name and the Packible logo is our main brand logo. This logo has good recognition with our customers and so I want to preserve it in the sense that it it still recognizable, but redo it in such a way that it can be integrated into a more cohesive big picture branding strategy.\r\n\r\nAll the other logos attached are branding of individual product lines. As you can tell they have a theme. A theme we have become known for.\r\n\r\nOur space is the industrial, contractors, trades people and tools sort of space. Think major brands such as DeWalt Milwaukee Tool or Craftsman.\r\n\r\nI am open to rebranding some of those products in a totally different fashion if the opinion is those names logos or branding are not the way to go moving forward. But I have had good success with my branding thus far, its unique and stands out and many if not most of our customers know the product line brands by name and our name has become synonymous with entire product categories. Think Kleenex association with tissue. Many people call the item by its brand. Our Joey and Level Lizard items are examples of that same thing in our space.\r\n\r\nI would basically like to rebrand to something more simple/minimalist that maintains an element or captures the industrial and heavy duty nature of our product.\r\n\r\nI want to go with more simple colors. Possibly all black. Greys, black and blues... I am open on this and want professional advice on how to cohesively tie this all together while communicating to our customers better the heavy duty tool nature of the brand while making sure it is still recognizable after the makeover to not loose any business.\r\n\r\nOne other reason for this rebranding is to try and find ways to make our logo more recognizable on social media when put into those tiny little circles. The nature of our long rectangular logo does not lend itself well to alot of those modern social media branding challenges.\r\n\r\nEnd result of this i would like to have a brand kit with all the fonts, logos, colors, etc... Needed for future branding activities. The main logo, Packible, being the spot lite and then finding a way to cohesively tie together my other artwork for the product lines into that image.\r\n\r\nOne thought I had to that end was to turn all logos into black and white line work type versions of their current form to tie them more together. Although I do like having some color and pop to them. But they just are not 100% the profesional look I want to have going forward as the business matures.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645533541697396737','-',7,'United States','Denmark',40.000,'Open this select menu',40.000,'2023-04-10',1,'2023-04-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-10 21:07:53',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
(17926,'Accountant / Bookkeeper',39,'Job Summary\r\n\r\nResponsible for managing the ledger, or compilation of some or all of company\'s accounts. Maintain an entire company\'s books and make numerous daily computations to update accounting records quickly and accurately. Be familiar and use proficiently with QuickBooks Online and Salesforce.\r\n\r\nThese duties and other tasks will be assigned by the Bookkeeper / Accountant.\r\n\r\nPrimary Responsibilities\r\n\r\nIn QuickBooks:\r\n• Make numerous daily computations to update and maintain accounting records.\r\n• Import, update, and reconcile Credit Card transactions\r\n• Verify and post receivables transactions\r\n• Compile data from cashiers to prepare bank deposits.\r\n• Prepare invoices for billing, including totaling numbers, adding dates, and verifying financial data.\r\n• Track and oversee overdue accounts.\r\n• Refer overdue accounts to collections.\r\n• Verify balancing receipts.\r\n• Post debits and credits.\r\n• Post details of transactions, total accounts, and compute interest charges.\r\n• Process Tour Switches in QB\r\n• Work with the Tour Coordinators and provide accounting information such as Trial Balances\r\n\r\nIn Salesforce:\r\n• Import, update, and reconcile Credit Card transactions\r\n• Post Incoming Checks in Salesforce and Send Customer Statement\r\n• Post Incoming Credit Cards Salesforce and Send Customer Statement\r\n• Manage Recurring Credit Cards - Set up, Cancel, Expired, Declines, make sure final payment is correct and doesn’t create a negative balance.\r\n• Audit and reconcile Registrations prior to Rally Date\r\n• Set Tasks for Customer Service Balance Due Call Backs\r\n\r\nOther:\r\n• Credit Card Receipt Archiving\r\n• FMCA membership processing\r\n• Reconciliation of Returned Financial WM Worksheets which includes reviewing all activities and verifying and / or posting expenses if needed\r\n• Cash Reconciliation of Returned Tours','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/164546016399680