(18001,'Graphic designer needed for a logo design',10,'I need a logo for a new Yacht Surveyors company.\r\n\r\nOur services include:\r\n\r\nPre-Purchase Surveys: Our pre-purchase surveys are designed to give potential buyers a comprehensive understanding of the condition of the vessel they are considering purchasing. Our surveyors will inspect all aspects of the vessel, including the hull, deck, machinery, and electronics, and provide a detailed report of their findings.\r\n\r\nInsurance Surveys: Insurance companies often require a survey of the vessel before they will issue a policy. Our insurance surveys meet all industry standards and provide the information insurance companies need to make an informed decision about coverage.\r\n\r\nDamage Surveys: If your vessel has been damaged, our surveyors can assess the extent of the damage and provide a report detailing the scope of repairs needed.\r\n\r\nAppraisals: Our appraisals provide a detailed analysis of the value of the vessel, taking into account factors such as age, condition, and market demand.\r\n\r\nSea Trials: Our sea trials provide an opportunity to assess the performance of the vessel in real-world conditions, including speed, handling, and fuel efficiency.\r\n\r\nConsulting: Our consulting services provide guidance and advice on all aspects of yacht ownership, from maintenance and repairs to upgrades and modifications.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01c91eef76fe8dfad7','-',7,'United States','Bucharest',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 12:29:56',NULL,18,3,NULL,146),
