(18011,'Logo design for a brand specializing in manual coffee grinders',10,'We are looking for a skilled and experienced graphic designer to create a modern and professional logo for our brand. Our brand specializes in high-quality manual coffee grinders, and the logo will be used on our website, social media, and in PR materials. The Brand name is \"Blades & Burrs\". We require a text-based logo without icons.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n-Create a unique and visually appealing text-based logo for our brand\r\n-Design the logo with the understanding that it will be used across multiple platforms including web and print materials\r\n-Ensure that the logo is professional, modern and reflective of our brand values\r\n-Deliver the final logo design in various file formats (PNG, JPEG, vector format) and sizes suitable for different purposes\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n-Proven experience in logo design\r\n-Strong understanding of typography and design principles\r\n-Proficiency in design software such as Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, or similar tools\r\n-Excellent communication skills and ability to collaborate effectively with the team\r\n-A portfolio showcasing previous logo design work is required\r\n\r\nIf you are a creative and talented graphic designer with experience in logo design and a passion for coffee, we would love to hear from you. Please include your portfolio and a brief summary of your experience in your application.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01276f4188178f8f3c','-',7,'United States','Bideford',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 12:57:09',NULL,18,3,NULL,146),
