(18013,'Brand Identity for Upcoming Fashion Startup',2,'Hello There!\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a top-level brand designer to take the lead and help us design our upcoming fashion-related platform \"Web/App\". A brand strategy/analysis background is a huge plus.\r\n\r\nAbout The Brand:\r\n\r\nLegacy is the world\'s first sneakers exchange platform in Europe that allows sneaker owner to sell their special shoes, high-valued sneakers, and limited edition fashion easier. The main purpose of the brand establishments is to make the buy/sell used goods faster and safer, we are aiming to overtake eBay in the fashion exchange section. And we need to develop a brand that delivers this message through our logo, and brand elements.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a brand designer/consultant to work with us in the next 4-6 weeks to help us build our desired brand, have a suggestion? please explain it in your cover letter. We also need the logo to be text-based with \"no icons or shoe shapes\", and most importantly we need the brand to deliver a luxurious look and feel. To make sure you read the entire post write \"Debrand\" on top of your proposal. Our ideal candidate would be someone does something similar previously and is already willing to put some effort into refining our brand strategy, mission, and vision, tagline.\r\n\r\nAttached is a rough design we made, you can take it as a reference.\r\n\r\nDeliverables Must Include:\r\n\r\n- Brand identity book,\r\n- Messaging, vision, and mission\r\n- Brand logo, 3x variation/concepts\r\n- Assets \"social media kit, printable materials, business cards\"\r\n- Brand Imagery,\r\n- Web/App elements,\r\n- Presentation \"not necessary but we might need it\"\r\n\r\nWhile writing your proposal consider explaining why you are a good fit? and what\'s your estimated time/price to complete the project from start to finish. If you have experience in fashion/tech startup we would love to work with you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645774645452521473','-',7,'United States','Istanbul',500.000,'Open this select menu',500.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 13:04:53',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
(18014,'Brand logo design including business cards, headers and social media profile.',2,'I have registered a company under the name \"Southwest Merchants LLC\" . We are based in southern California.\r\n\r\nOur company logo and design needs to be industry agnostic.\r\nWe were looking at contrasting styles 1.something eye catching and fun with vibrant colors that represents where we come from.\r\n2. Something Bold, simple , elegant and professional with a color palate similar to luxury brands or architectural companies. Something that would be seen as reliable and trustworthy.\r\n3. Something modern and upbeat, whatever you choose as a designer.\r\n\r\nWe will be dealing in multiple  industries from ATM provision to online import export and sales on major platforms like eBay and amazon. In the long term these would be done under \"trading as \" entities if it makes sense.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~012b172296759a779b','-',7,'United States','-',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 13:05:34',NULL,18,3,NULL,146),
(18015,'fast growing fintech consulting firm seeks UI/UX experience with payments experience',4,'We have a variety of projects ongoing requiring a UI/UX professional to assist with design of:\r\n- user interfaces and journeys\r\n- general graphic design and brand style development\r\n- web site development\r\n- product design and providing input to product management team\r\n\r\nImmediate hire with opportunity for long term relationships should this work out.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645776428627312641?success','-',7,'United States','Genoa City',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 13:12:11',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
(18016,'Create a custom product label',2,'Hello,\r\n\r\nI need a simple label that will act as a sticker to be affixed to a product. I will provide the brand name / logo, but need help in creating the label with some beautification / visual enhancement.\r\n\r\nLabel requirements --\r\nSee: https://www.ttb.gov/ds-labeling-home/ds-name-address\r\n\r\nAlcohol Content: The label must indicate the alcohol content of the product in a percentage format, such as \"40% ABV\" for a 80 proof spirit.\r\n\r\nProduct Name: The product name must accurately describe the contents of the bottle. For example, \"Whiskey\" should not be used to describe a product that is actually a rum.\r\n\r\nPlace of origin: The label should clearly indicate the country of origin, such as \"Product of Mexico.\"\r\n\r\nBrand Name and Trademark: The label should include the brand name and any trademarks associated with the product.\r\n\r\nNet Contents: The label should indicate the net contents of the bottle in metric units (e.g., liters or milliliters).\r\n\r\nWarning Statement: The label should include a warning statement that is compliant with US regulations, such as \"GOVERNMENT WARNING: (1) ACCORDING TO THE SURGEON GENERAL, WOMEN SHOULD NOT DRINK ALCOHOLIC BEVERAGES DURING PREGNANCY BECAUSE OF THE RISK OF BIRTH DEFECTS. (2) CONSUMPTION OF ALCOHOLIC BEVERAGES IMPAIRS YOUR ABILITY TO DRIVE A CAR OR OPERATE MACHINERY, AND MAY CAUSE HEALTH PROBLEMS.\"','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645776473553231873','-',7,'United States','Springfield',100.000,'Open this select menu',100.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 13:13:12',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
