(18019,'Design a stunning sign !',2,'I am seeking a marketing experient and graphic designer to create three variations of a sign that will be used on a print size measuring around 22 X 22\'.\r\n\r\nThe graphic itself will be used temporarily, to tell onlookers that our restaurant is being renovated and soon will open.\r\n\r\nI will need your help coming up with something that communicates the basics, while somehow achieving simplicity!\r\n\r\n\r\n• Native files for all completed work will be needed (Adobe)\r\n• Files Need to be sized appropriately and ready for the printer. Measurements are below.\r\n• The graphics will be used to build excitement and awareness of The View Restaurant Opening in Late 20XX!\r\n• About The View\r\nIt’s NYC’s only revolving restaurant. It is an elevated dining experience that is two concepts in one: A restaurant (One floor) and a separate (One Floor) Lounge.\r\n• We no longer have any sanctioned brand elements, and although not necessary for this project, it is something that might help the viewer understand the concept. We’re about revolving views 48 stories over Manhattan! See napkin, for an example\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat does this sign need to have displayed?\r\no It must have the logo\r\no It must have the slogan “NYC’s only revolving Rooftop Restaurant” or nod to that, creatively.\r\no It must nod to the Views, whether creatively or with Photographs (Can Separately fund a Shutterstock photo). Or, as noted above\r\no It needs a place holder for other prominent messaging\r\n Examples\r\n• Get Ready for the Ultimate Dining Experience: The View Restaurant Opening Soon\r\n• New York City’s only revolving restaurant is being reinvented. Opening Late 2023!\r\n• Revolving 360-degree views, Posh New Space. Reopening in late 20XX!\r\n• Dine 48 Stories Above Manhattan. The View Restaurant & Lounge, Reopening in 20XX\r\n• Colors & Fonts\r\no #13352\r\n• #FFFFF\r\n• Black is perfectly acceptable, too. (For the logo\r\n• Logo Font is Mona Lisa Solid\r\n• Sub Text is Helvetica.\r\n\r\nI will need someone who is flexibile with revisions. But with that said, my focus is to be efficient, and provide detailed feedback so that revisions are few.\r\n\r\nSince you\'ll be providing the native files, we can make last tweaks as well.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to finding a great designer to complete this project in the next few days!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645778996217847809','-',7,'United States','Chester',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 13:21:57',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
(18020,'Brand Identity, Voice, and Online Communication',2,'Brand Kit Development\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\n\r\nWe are looking for an experienced brand kit developer to help us define and develop our brand identity, brand voice, and online communication strategy. The ideal candidate should have a proven track record of creating successful brand kits for businesses in a similar industry to ours.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDevelop a comprehensive brand identity that reflects our company\'s vision, mission, and values.\r\n\r\nDefine and articulate our brand voice, including tone, language, and messaging guidelines.\r\n\r\nCreate a brand kit that includes guidelines for how to talk online, captions, and other key communication elements.\r\n\r\nCollaborate with our marketing team to ensure that the brand kit is aligned with our overall marketing strategy.\r\n\r\nProvide ongoing support and guidance to ensure that our brand identity and voice are consistently applied across all channels.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience in developing brand kits for businesses in a similar industry.\r\n\r\nStrong understanding of branding, marketing, and communication principles.\r\n\r\nExcellent communication skills and ability to collaborate with a team.\r\n\r\nAttention to detail and ability to deliver high-quality work on time.\r\n\r\nKnowledge of industry-standard design tools, such as Adobe Creative Suite, is a plus.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested in this opportunity, please submit your proposal','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645779275013234689?success','-',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 13:23:29',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
(18021,'Expert designer for logo, application icon for Android and iOS with T-shirts branding design.',2,'To create a simple and expressive design\r\n\r\n-To represent the design of time sand, the alphabet \"W\" could be rotated 180 degrees and shaped to resemble an hourglass. Or any ideas related to it is appreciated.\r\n\r\n-To emphasize the importance of time, you could use a tagline such as \"Make every moment count\" or \"Time is precious\" alongside the logo.\r\n\r\n-For the color scheme, black and yellow can work well together to create a strong and impactful design. You could use black as the primary color and yellow as the secondary color, with white used sparingly to add contrast.\r\n\r\nLastly a t-shirt design for branding with logi and text WAQT\r\n\r\nCheck the attachment for current logo','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01707ef49eeed17abd','-',7,'United States','Loveland',50.000,'fixed',50.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 13:30:24',NULL,18,3,NULL,146),
