(18035,'Animated video 30 seconds',8,'Animation of not more than 30 seconds narrated by an american sounding male voice (possible narration text to come later).\r\n\r\nAnimation is to be placed on a website. An american style work van with ABC Plumbing drives up to a gas station that has many cars getting gas or waiting to get gas. The station will have the name Discount Gas on the overhead canopy. The Plumbing van gets in line at the pump. An analog clock appears on the screen and the video fast forwards through 15 minutes as cars fuel up and leave and the clock advances to 15 minutes and our plumbing van finally pulls up to the pump. The driver fuels up for 5-10 minutes, swipes his credit card, gets back in his van and drives away.\r\nFade to another employee at a desk frantically going through paperwork and entering information on a computer.  Have the clock going through 3 hours. Show dollars counting up at $45/hour.\r\nDisplay \"How often are your employees doing this?\"','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2053849','-',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 14:51:03',NULL,16,1,NULL,136),
