(18045,'Graphic designer needed to create logo for new AI SaaS startup',2,'We are creating a new AI SaaS startup, and we would like to create an initial version of a logo and brand identity.\r\n\r\nWe have an initial concept in mind of what we want the logo and icon to look like, and we have sketched it out in Figma. We are using the logo we have sketched out, but it is pretty low-quality, since we do not have any in-house design talent (I just sketched it out quickly on my own).\r\n\r\nWe\'re definitely open to new ideas, but we also want to limit the scope of this project, so we\'ll aim for the default deliverable to be a more polished and professional version of our current concept.\r\n\r\nThe logo will consist of a simple minimalist icon on the left, with a modern sans-serif font for the company name on the right. We\'re looking for something fairly simple and quick for the initial deliverable, and depending on how we work together, we are open to expanding into a longer-term arrangement with more revisions and iterations.\r\n\r\nWe\'re not setting a budget for now, and we\'re flexible on price (ultimately depends on availability and level of expertise of the person we hire for this project). The more important variables for us are iteration speed and quality. We\'re looking to hire an expert-level graphic and brand designer for this task, and we\'ll be willing to pay the market rate for this level of quality and expertise.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645807808778985473?success','-',7,'United States','-',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 15:16:28',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
