(18062,'Front-End (Webflow) Developer',3,'We are looking for a talented Front-End (Webflow) Developer to join our team on a one-time project to build our site on Webflow. The ideal candidate should be able to work independently and possess a strong understanding of Webflow, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n1) Take our designs (XD format) and develop website on Webflow platform\r\n2) Work with our design team to ensure that the website matches up to the design files and development notes provided\r\n3) Ensure that the website is optimized for speed, performance, and responsive.\r\n4) Implement custom code and functionality using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript as needed\r\n5) Test and debug the website to ensure that it is working properly\r\n6) Provide ongoing support and maintenance as needed\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n1) Strong experience with Webflow and expertise in developing websites on the platform\r\n2) Proficiency in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript\r\nExperience with website optimization and performance\r\n3) Ability to work independently and manage multiple tasks simultaneously\r\n4) Strong communication skills and ability to work collaboratively with our design team\r\n5) Experience with responsive design and cross-browser compatibility\r\n\r\nThis is a one-time project, but there may be opportunities for ongoing work in the future. If you are a talented Webflow Developer looking for a challenging and rewarding opportunity, we encourage you to apply. Please submit your resume, portfolio, and any relevant work samples for consideration.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645821281087537153','-',7,'United States','Baton Rouge',30.000,'Open this select menu',30.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 16:10:17',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
