(18071,'Email Designer (UI)',20,'Personal Gift is a leading ecommerce brand specializing in creating beautiful personalized gifts. With over 50,000 portraits sold worldwide, we pride ourselves on delivering top-quality, unique gifts to our customers. We are currently seeking a talented In-House Email Designer with a focus on Klaviyo to join our team and help elevate our email marketing strategy.\r\n\r\n-Design and create visually engaging and responsive emails for Personal Gift, using Klaviyo, including various email flows such as abandoned cart, browse abandonment, site abandonment, thank you series, and more.\r\n- Collaborate with our marketing team to develop and execute email campaigns and automated flows that align with our brand identity, marketing goals, and customer journey.\r\n- Optimize email designs for various devices and email clients, ensuring a seamless user experience.\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Proven experience as an Email Designer, preferably within the ecommerce industry.\r\n\r\nPayment will be $100 USD per email and we have over 15 emails left to be designed and then will start needing campaign emails designed 1-2x a week.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645826754656948225','-',7,'United States','Edmonton',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'Fixed Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 16:31:49',NULL,18,3,NULL,140),
(18072,'Russian/English Virtual Assistant for Dermatology Practice',22,'We are a dermatology practice with a large number of Russian-speaking patients. We need a virtual assistant to:\r\n\r\n1) Help answer the phones during our office hours.\r\n2) Call back Russian-speaking patients with biopsy results or to answer questions\r\n3) Communicate with our in-office staff in English and Russian about patient issues\r\n4) 35+ hours per week are available. This is a STEADY employment with set weekly hours and would require dedication to the job\r\n5) Must have high speed internet to use the VOIP phone service (we provide)\r\n6) Paid training prior to starting (1 week) on both dermatology and our health record\r\n7) Join an all star group of 7 other virtual assistants fulfilling similar tasks in a collegiate environment.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested, please record yourself reading the following so we can gauge your phone voice:\r\n“ Basal cell carcinoma (BCC) is the most common form of skin cancer and the most frequently occurring form of all cancers. In the U.S. alone, an estimated 3.6 million cases are diagnosed each year. BCCs arise from abnormal, uncontrolled growth of basal cells.\r\n\r\nBecause BCCs grow slowly, most are curable and cause minimal damage when caught and treated early. Understanding BCC causes, risk factors and warning signs can help you detect them early, when they are easiest to treat and cure.”','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645771649927471105','-',7,'United States','Philadelphia',10.000,'Open this select menu',18.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 16:32:22',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
