(18101,'Accountant | Bookkeeper | CPA',39,'We are looking for an experienced and diligent Certified Public Accountant (CPA) to assist us in streamlining our company\'s financials and ensuring accurate reporting. Our primary goal is to clearly distinguish between two categories of our incoming funds, which will allow us to better understand our company\'s financial performance on a monthly basis.\r\n\r\nOur incoming funds are currently categorized into:\r\n\r\n1. Service Fees: These are the charges we impose for performing our services.\r\n\r\n2. Escrow Fees: These fees are collected from customers and subsequently passed on to various agencies on behalf of our clients.\r\n\r\nAt present, both types of fees are recorded as income, which complicates our ability to discern the company\'s true financial status. We require an experienced CPA to separate the Escrow Fees, record them on a balance sheet, and reconcile them as we utilize customer funds during transactions.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should possess expertise in managing a similar financial flow and be proficient in setting up the back end of Quickbooks. Additionally, the candidate will be responsible for maintaining and reconciling our books on a bi-weekly or monthly basis.\r\n\r\nIf you believe you are the perfect fit for this role, kindly submit your cover letter, detailing any relevant experience or similar projects you have undertaken.\r\n\r\nTo ensure your application is considered, please begin your message with the magic word: \"Unicorn\".\r\n\r\nApplications without the magic word will not be reviewed.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645822915906289665','-',7,'United States','Hollywood',800.000,'fixed',800.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 17:57:12',NULL,11,3,NULL,155),
