(18103,'Content writer - skincare//beauty',37,'I\'m looking for content writers for a website about skincare, beauty products and health. If you\'re a cosmetologist, dermatologist, medical doctor, nurse or have any other medical background/ experience in beauty niche - this job is for you (also for students)!\r\n\r\nYour job will be to write articles (usually up to 2000 words) mainly about natural ingredients and their safety, skincare routine, hair care routine).\r\n\r\nFirst task: write an article on one of two available topics:\r\n-Can I use niacinamide with hyaluronic acid (1500 words - $45)\r\n-How Long Does It Take For Niacinamide To Work (2000 words - $60)\r\n\r\nIf you want to apply:\r\n1. send some examples of your previously written content (especially on similar topics)\r\n2. let me know if you have experience in using Surfer SEO editor\r\n3. add the word \"summer\" to your proposal\r\n4. please don\'t send me any copy-paste proposal if you seriously want this job! ;)\r\n\r\nOnly native-English speakers.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645809102486306817','-',7,'United States','Poland',60.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 17:58:21',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
