(18106,'Bookkeeping assistent',39,'We are looking for someone who can help us with the bookkeeping of our Dutch company.\r\n\r\nThe job will entail:\r\n\r\n- Matching incoming transactions with invoices\r\n- Processing incoming payments of customers\r\n- contact with customers regarding payments paid or outstanding\r\n- Providing payment details to customers/creditors/debtors\r\n- Sending payment reminders to customers\r\n- Ensuring bank statements are processed correctly in Accountview (our bookkeeping software) and balances are correct.\r\n\r\nI’m certain there will be a few other tasks which are not included in this list, however the main tasks have been mentioned.\r\n\r\nWe are looking to hire someone long term for around 16 hours per week. We hope for a long term working relationship.\r\n\r\nThe salary we have in mind would be approximately 300-500 euro per month for the 16 hours of work per week.\r\n\r\nThe hours need to made within European working hours and preferably have a fixed schedule. It is important that you keep in contact with our team in the Netherlands and questions can be asked back and forth.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645825865552580609','-',7,'United States','Hoogvliet Rotterdam',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 18:02:06',NULL,11,3,NULL,155),
