(18121,'Experienced Bookkeeper with QuickBooks Online Expertise',39,'We are currently seeking a highly skilled and experienced Bookkeeper to join our team on a long-term contract basis. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in QuickBooks Online and be able to complete the following tasks with accuracy and efficiency:\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n* Perform monthly bank reconciliations, ensuring all transactions are accurately recorded in QuickBooks Online.\r\n* Reconcile employee benefits in QuickBooks Online, maintaining accurate and up-to-date records.\r\n* Add new vendors to QuickBooks Online as needed, collecting W-9 forms and setting up the 1099 status (yes/no) correctly.\r\n* Send out 1099s to applicable vendors annually, adhering to IRS deadlines and guidelines.\r\n* Collaborate with our tax preparer annually, assisting with tax compliance and ensuring that all financial records are in order.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n* Proven experience as a Bookkeeper, preferably with a strong focus on QuickBooks Online.\r\n* In-depth knowledge of bookkeeping practices, including bank reconciliation, employee benefits management, and vendor management.\r\n* Familiarity with IRS regulations related to 1099 forms and tax compliance.\r\n* Excellent attention to detail and the ability to maintain accurate financial records.\r\n* Strong communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively with our tax preparer and other team members.\r\n* A commitment to meeting deadlines and maintaining a high level of professionalism.\r\n\r\nIf you are an experienced Bookkeeper with expertise in QuickBooks Online and a passion for helping businesses maintain their financial health, we\'d love to hear from you. Apply now to join our team and contribute to our long-term success.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645862609337536513','-',7,'United States','Wilmington',50.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',N