(18136,'Medical Scribe',22,'NOTE: YOU WILL NOT BE CONSIDERED FOR THIS POSITION IF YOU DO NOT INCLUDE A BRIEF INTRODUCTION INDICATING WHY YOU FEEL YOU ARE THE BEST CANDIDATE FOR THE POSITION.\r\n\r\nAre you client-focused? Tech-savvy? Do you multitask well? We want you! Rapidly growing Podiatry clinic in West Houston is searching for a compassionate service-focused scribe/medical assistant.\r\n\r\nMEDICAL OFFICE EXPERIENCE IS NOT REQUIRED. Individuals with backgrounds in dental offices or the hospitality industry will be fully considered. DO NOT NEED TO BE BILINGUAL.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will be able to chart patient visits and perform traditional medical scribe activities.\r\n\r\nESSENTIAL RESPONSIBILITIES AND DUTIES:\r\n\r\n- Exceptional communication skills\r\n- Tech-savvy\r\n- Fully bilingual in Spanish and English - preferred but not required\r\n- 3 or more years of customer-service-oriented work required\r\n- High level of organization\r\n- HS Diploma\r\n- Some college preferred\r\n- Team player that shows up to work motivated and ready to work towards a common goal of providing excellent patient care\r\n- Professional representation of practice - Supports company mission, vision, values, and culture\r\n- Provides patient-centric focus\r\n- Carries out tasks in an efficient and timely manner\r\n- Assists management with other duties as needed\r\n\r\nIf you want to be considered for this position, answering this question is critical: We are not your typical medical office. Customer service and hard work is at our core. We are a rapidly growing and very busy company, yet have found a way to maintain exceptional google reviews by hiring friendly rock stars.\r\nWhy do you see yourself as a fit for our amazing team?','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645874390237888513','-',7,'United States','Richmond',12.000,'perhour',12.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 20:15:08',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
