(18147,'Medical date entry and client services.',22,'Are you an experienced data entry and project management professional with a medical background and perfect English? Are you interested in working for a fast-growing pharmaceutical company in Canada that is expanding into the USA market? If so, we have the perfect opportunity for you!\r\nOur company produces IV drips and other critical pharmaceutical products that are essential for patient care. As we continue to grow and expand our operations, we need someone with your expertise to help us manage our data entry and phone systems, as well as our project management processes.\r\nIn this role, you will be responsible for maintaining accurate and up-to-date records of our products, inventory, and customer data. You will also be responsible for answering phone calls and responding to customer inquiries, as well as coordinating project timelines and ensuring that all deadlines are met.\r\nAs a pharmaceutical company, we require someone with a medical background to help ensure that our data and systems are accurate and reliable. Additionally, perfect English skills are essential for effective communication with customers and colleagues.\r\nIf you are looking for a challenging and rewarding opportunity to help a growing pharmaceutical company expand its operations into the USA, then we encourage you to apply for this position today. We offer a competitive salary and benefits package, as well as opportunities for career advancement and growth.\r\nTo apply, please send your resume and a cover letter detailing your qualifications and experience to info@farsk.health. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645809407797248001','-',7,'United States','-',10.000,'perhour',10.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 20:19:53',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
