(18150,'US Tax Filings - Non-Resident/International',23,'I have invested a couple years back in property in the US. and was previously dealing with a tax firm who has filed for my ITIN number and I just received feedback from IRS that application was rejected citing lack of supporting material. The IRS agent suggested to attach enough documents showing that the investments will generate rental income, hence the need for an ITIN. Need to file a new ITIN as well as K1 forms for 2021&2022\r\n\r\nI am a Canadian citizen and not resident in Canada or the US. currently working inthe middle east. So cannot be physically present in the US.\r\n\r\nAppreciate if this is something you can help me with as I look for tax services to assist with my filings moving forward.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645803979122163713','-',7,'United States','-',100.000,'perhour',90.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 20:21:42',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(18151,'Credentialling and Onboarding Support Representative',24,'We are a medical staffing company in the US looking to hire 2-3 onboarding support reps to work with our onboarding team. Here are the duties:\r\n\r\n• Identify missing documents from clinical employee onboarding in order to notify employee of required next steps\r\n• Verify all necessary licenses, credentials, certifications, forms, etc. submitted by candidate are complete and adequately meet hiring criteria\r\n• Make calls to employees in onboarding status to encourage them to complete their remaining onboarding steps (uploading documents/credentials, signing off on documents, etc.)\r\n• Maintain records of communications with candidates/employees in applicant tracking system and update/upload documents as needed\r\n• Manage inbound phone calls and text messages from candidates including answering questions about the hiring process, etc.\r\n• Assist on compliance activities including notifying clinical employees of expiring licenses and other credentials via phone call, text, email\r\n• Collaborate with internal recruitment department to facilitate faster time to hire for clinical employees\r\n\r\nThe pay is $800 per month with 400 released every two weeks.\r\n\r\nPlease provide a voice sample of your relevant experience in customer service, recruitment support or onboarding. Recruitment experience isn\'t required.\r\nMust have great customer service skills, fast adaptability to new systems and be extremely reliable.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645805716655955969','-',7,'United States','Lake Marry',4000.000,'fixed',4000.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 20:22:31',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
