(18170,'Bookkeeper/Accounts Receivable Specialist with Strong Communication Skills',39,'We are looking for a skilled and reliable bookkeeper/accounts receivable specialist to join our team on a freelance basis. As a growing business, we need someone who can take charge of our books, manage our accounts receivables, and ensure that our clients pay their invoices on time.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will have a proven track record in bookkeeping and accounts receivable management, with excellent communication skills and a knack for following up with clients. We need someone who is not afraid to pick up the phone and call clients to follow up on outstanding invoices and ensure prompt payment.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Manage and maintain accurate records of financial transactions, including accounts payable and receivable, payroll, and general ledger entries\r\n- Prepare and process invoices, receipts, and bank deposits\r\n- Follow up with clients to ensure prompt payment and manage outstanding accounts receivables\r\n- Develop and maintain positive relationships with clients, acting as the primary point of contact for all financial queries\r\n- Track and report on financial performance, providing regular updates on accounts receivables and other key metrics\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience in bookkeeping and accounts receivable management\r\n- Strong communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to build and maintain positive relationships with clients\r\n- Ability to work independently and manage multiple tasks simultaneously\r\n- Proficiency in accounting software QuickBooks Online\r\nAttention to detail and a high degree of accuracy in financial reporting\r\n- Availability to work flexible hours, as needed\r\n\r\nIf you are a motivated self-starter with a passion for bookkeeping and accounts receivable management, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity. Please include your resume, cover letter, and any relevant work samples in your application.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1645895691323133953','-',7,'United States','Manhattan Beach',55.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-11',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-11 21:15:58',NULL,11,3,NULL,155),
