(18227,'Pitch deck creation for a tool called Fabric',11,'Hello talented freelancers!\r\n\r\nWe are in search of a skilled and creative individual to design an eye-catching and persuasive pitch deck for our new venture, Fabric. Fabric is a one-of-a-kind, customizable solution designed to build dynamic communities and deliver innovative programs. With its centralized and user-friendly platform, Fabric streamlines accelerator program management and fosters collaboration among stakeholders in business modeling, mentoring, and peer-learning.\r\n\r\nJob Responsibilities:\r\n\r\nDesign a visually appealing pitch deck that effectively communicates Fabric\'s value proposition, features, and benefits.\r\nCollaborate with our team to understand our target audience, market positioning, and key selling points.\r\nUse captivating graphics, charts, and illustrations to showcase the capabilities and advantages of Fabric\'s platform.\r\nCreate a compelling narrative that resonates with potential investors, partners, and clients.\r\nIncorporate our brand identity and design guidelines throughout the pitch deck.\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience in designing pitch decks, preferably for SaaS companies or tech startups.\r\nA strong portfolio showcasing your graphic design and storytelling skills.\r\nAbility to work independently and meet tight deadlines.\r\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills.\r\nAttention to detail and commitment to quality.\r\nHow to Apply:\r\nIf you believe you are the right fit for this project, please submit the following:','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01344a9f73f0652ec7','-',7,'United States','Dubai',50.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 11:14:59',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
