(18236,'Company Branding and Web Design',2,'I am starting a consulting services company focusing on helping corporates with people related topics (ie. leadership development, cultural change, diversity & inclusion, to name a few), and would like to work with a designer on a medium to long-term basis on brand identity and website design.\r\n\r\nA few deliverables I am looking for in the next 3 months:\r\n- By end of April - basic branding assets done including logo, email signature, and business card.\r\n\r\n- By end of May - Website completion (draft ready for review by mid-May, followed by iterations/adjustments). Main purpose of website is service introduction and need appointment booking, newsletter subscription, and potential payment/invoicing functions. Would prefer someone who\'s comfortable with SEO web design to help optimize for search engine.\r\n\r\n- By end of June - other peripheral branding assets completed including slide template, stationery/letter heads, social media template, etc.\r\n\r\nAfter the initial set up is done, may need to continue to engage at lower frequency on hourly basis for any additional asset designs or updates to website.\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~018802a57dd6bd3b57','-',7,'United States','Singapore',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 12:00:34',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
