(18239,'Logo & identity, Social Media Cover, Icons, Email and Website Assets and Brand Guide.',2,'Our project requires for the following designer to present their work and offers.\r\n\r\nOur company specializes in the sale of premium coffee products and coffee trials, as well as offering monthly subscription services and a selection of expertly curated coffee brands. We are passionate about delivering an exceptional coffee experience to our customers, and we take pride in sourcing only the finest quality coffee beans from around the world. Our subscription services allow customers to discover new and exciting coffee blends on a regular basis, while our coffee trials offer a low-risk way to sample different coffees before committing to a full bag. Whether you are a coffee aficionado or simply looking to elevate your morning routine, our products and services are designed to satisfy even the most discerning palate.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\nLogo design for a Coffee subscription company: The logo should represent the brand\'s values, mission, and services. It should be visually appealing, memorable, and reflect the essence of the coffee subscription company. The logo should be versatile enough to be used on various platforms and sizes, from website headers to social media icons. The logo should also be scalable, meaning it should look good at any size without losing quality.\r\n\r\nWebsite artwork for coffee-related: The website artwork should align with the brand\'s aesthetic and identity, emphasizing the coffee-related theme. It should be visually engaging and complement the website\'s design and content. The artwork should also be optimized for web use to ensure fast loading times.\r\n\r\nBrand guidelines: Brand guidelines should be created to establish the brand\'s visual and messaging standards. It should include rules for using the logo, color palette, typography, imagery, and tone of voice. The guidelines should be detailed enough to ensure consistency across all platforms and channels.\r\n\r\nLogo & brand guide: The logo & brand guide should provide a detailed explanation of the logo and brand\'s design elements, including color, typography, and imagery. It should also include guidelines for using the logo and brand assets, ensuring consistency across all platforms and channels.\r\n\r\nIcon or button: Icons and buttons should be designed to be intuitive and easily recognizable. They should complement the brand\'s visual identity and provide a clear visual cue for the user, highlighting the coffee-related theme.\r\n\r\nWebsite Illustration and Design Figures: Illustrations and design figures should be created to complement the website\'s content and messaging, emphasizing the coffee-related theme. They should align with the brand\'s visual identity and be optimized for web use to ensure fast loading times.\r\n\r\nSocial media page design and covers: Social media page designs and covers should align with the brand\'s visual identity and emphasize the coffee-related theme. The covers should provide a clear message and be visually engaging to attract followers.\r\n\r\nArt & illustration (Character or mascot): Characters or mascots can be used to enhance the brand\'s identity and create a memorable visual representation of the brand, emphasizing the coffee-related theme. They should be aligned with the brand\'s visual identity and messaging.\r\n\r\nEmail Signature design and presence: Email signatures should be designed to include the brand\'s logo and visual elements, emphasizing the coffee-related theme. It should also include contact information and a clear call to action. The signature should be optimized for various email clients and devices to ensure consistency across all platforms.\r\n\r\nLogo & identity\r\nLogo design\r\nWebsite artwork\r\nBrand guidelines\r\nLogo & brand guide\r\nIcon or button\r\nWebsite Illustration and Design Figures\r\nSocial media page design and covers\r\nArt & illustration (Character or mascot)\r\nEmail Signature design and presence.\r\n\r\nTo submit an offer for a project, please provide details on your experience and expertise in the relevant field, along with a proposed timeline and cost estimate. Additionally, we request that you include examples of similar projects you have completed in the past, highlighting your skills and capabilities. We look forward to reviewing your offer and considering you for this opportunity.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~010c74c7e4ba4911a3','-',7,'United States','US',50.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 12:11:45',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
