(18250,'Looking for a long-term UI/UX designer',3,'Hey!\r\n\r\nWe are Rekos Agency, looking for a full-time UI/UX designer to work with designs for websites, SaaS, apps, and e-commerce shops.\r\n\r\nWhat is Rekos? We are a branding and UI/UX design agency in Vilnius, Lithuania. We are mainly working with IT and e-commerce companies and creating new products for them. We currently have 8 members in our company, and we work with brands like Nord Security, Nexxiot, Montonio, and many more. You can take a look at our website here: https://rekos.agency/\r\n\r\nCurrently, we are looking for a UI/UX designer that could work more than 30 hours per week on our projects. The job is contract-based, and we are looking for someone who would like to join our team remotely.\r\n\r\nIn this role, you will:\r\n• Work with SaaS, website, App, and e-commerce designs.\r\n• Take responsibility and own UI/UX projects.\r\n• Analyse data before starting the project and make user-focused designs.\r\n• Collaborate with project managers and other designers.\r\n• Explain your solutions and why you think they will work for different clients.\r\n\r\nWhat we are looking for in you:\r\n• You have 3+ years of UI/UX experience as a designer.\r\n• Practical and proficient knowledge using Figma\r\n• You are detailed, sharp and observant\r\n• Good time management and planning skills\r\n• Passion for learning and trying out new things\r\n• User-focused designer.\r\n• Know how to create prototypes.\r\n• Ability to create arguments for your created designs.\r\n• Strong ability to communicate in English (must).\r\n• Live in Europe.\r\n\r\nSalary:\r\nUp to 2000 EUR per month.\r\n\r\nPlease add your portfolio as well when applying. We will talk about other details with the selected candidates.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646135245139673089','-',7,'United States','Vilnius',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 12:57:28',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
(18251,'Three 2D animation videos of 10sec each',8,'We are looking to create three 2D animation videos of 10sec each. They should be suitable for social media and should be attention grabbers.\r\n\r\nPlease share with us your best work.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646134014049116161?success','-',7,'United States','Amsterdam',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 12:58:35',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
(18252,'Web developer for Unbounce / WordPress',3,'We\'re looking for a web developer to help us create some landing pages for an existing website - https://gt.school\r\nWe generally provide designs in Figma and want to have the implementation as close as possible to the design, and we appreciate fast turn-around times.\r\n\r\nThis will be a longer-term engagement, but we want to evaluate candidates by doing an initial landing page. The pages need to be created in Unbounce (it\'s what we use to manage landing pages) and published to WordPress.\r\n\r\nInitial Landing Page design: https://www.figma.com/file/zUXSMVcQFU4y6zuqXBiC76/GT-School?node-id=2566-2702&t=KxrlCc8ub7y9btki-0\r\nLanding Page Content: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1B7AbqNnMeQprsBL6qamIZ3e0RyjbGIRLO2Vj-aaVtko/edit\r\nConstraints for initial landing page: timebox the output you what you can achieve in 5 hours.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646136958957305857','-',7,'United States','Austin',30.000,'Open this select menu',30.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 13:05:09',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
(18253,'Creative Logo and Icon Designer Needed for Unique Food App',10,'I am looking for a talented and experienced logo and icon designer to create a visually appealing and memorable logo and app icon for an innovative food app project. The ideal candidate should have a strong portfolio showcasing their ability to design unique and captivating logos and icons, as well as a keen understanding of modern design trends and principles.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Collaborate with me to understand the project\'s vision and requirements\r\n- Design a unique and visually appealing logo that reflects the app\'s purpose and target audience\r\n- Create an eye-catching app icon that stands out on both iOS and Android platforms\r\n- Provide multiple design concepts and revisions based on feedback\r\n- Deliver final designs in various file formats suitable for app stores, marketing materials, and social media\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience in logo and icon design with a strong portfolio\r\n- Expertise in design software such as Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, or similar tools\r\n- Excellent communication and interpersonal skills\r\n- Ability to work independently and meet deadlines\r\n- Strong attention to detail and a passion for creating stunning visual designs\r\n- Knowledge of current design trends and best practices','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646137836142665729?success','-',7,'United States','Kumanovo',45.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 13:08:39',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
