(18258,'Investment Deck Layout Designer - Powerpoint',11,'I have a current investment deck that I need re-worked / polished / spell-checked. It needs to be laid out cleanly and you can make creative decisions to make it look nice. I want this to lean toward minimalism so it is clean, tidy and easy to read.\r\n\r\nAs a an example of what I\'m looking for, I like Front, Stych and Morty out of these examples:\r\n\r\nhttps://pitch.com/blog/15-great-pitch-decks-from-successful-startups\r\n\r\nWhen you apply, please have examples of your past, similar work available for reference.\r\n\r\nAlso, if we work well together, I will have additional future similar work available.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01f7beeb040412a318/apply/','-',7,'United States','Burbank',150.000,'fixed',150.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 13:17:38',NULL,19,3,NULL,120),
