(18261,'Create New Email Signature',20,'I am looking to refresh my companies existing email signature.\r\n\r\nNote- The \"see your job before it happens\" blue bar is not really part of the email sig and was only added as a call to action for our customers. The thought with this blue bar is that our YouTube page sells the company better than anything and we want to drive all communication to our YouTube page.\r\nJust a thought if we should incorporate different. It is not ideal to have this above the email sig but the goal is to drive people to YouTube more than look aesthetically pleasing.\r\n\r\nAs for the sig itself, it is outdated and needs upgrades. The font is outdated as well as the layout\r\n\r\nLooking forward to thoughts.\r\n\r\n***Please share an example of what you think is an updated email sig in your response','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646142177134858241','-',7,'United States','Kings County',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 13:25:14',NULL,18,3,NULL,140),
(18262,'Graphic Designer for Beauty Industry',2,'We are seeking a talented and experienced Graphic Designer with a passion for the beauty industry to join our growing team. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in graphic design, with a focus on creating visually appealing and engaging content for various marketing channels, including social media, email, and print materials.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDesign eye-catching graphics for social media, email campaigns, website banners, and print materials that align with our brand identity\r\nCollaborate with the marketing team to develop strategies and concepts for promotional campaigns, product launches, and special events\r\nEnsure designs are optimized for various devices and platforms, including web, mobile, and print\r\nStay up-to-date on industry trends and competitor strategies, incorporating fresh ideas and innovative design techniques into your work\r\nManage multiple projects simultaneously while adhering to tight deadlines and maintaining a high level of attention to detail\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nAt least 3 years of professional graphic design experience, preferably in the beauty industry\r\nStrong portfolio showcasing your design skills across various marketing channels\r\nProficiency in Adobe Creative Suite (Illustrator, Photoshop, InDesign)\r\nKnowledge of current design trends and best practices in the beauty industry\r\nStrong attention to detail, time management, and organizational skills\r\nExcellent written and verbal communication skills\r\nTo ensure that you have read the entire job posting and to help us filter out bot applications, please include the word \"BeautyGuru\" in the subject line of your proposal. Additionally, please provide examples of your previous work in the beauty industry, as well as any relevant metrics demonstrating the success of your designs.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to reviewing your application and potentially welcoming you to our team!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646143344222420993?success','-',7,'United States','Oshawa',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 13:30:12',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
