(18275,'Logo needed for creative studio',10,'Looking to get a logo created for a clothing brand/creative studio. I’m looking for something simple yet thought provoking and rememberable.\r\n\r\nHere’s our brand message:\r\nAt T.O.S.S. , we believe in the weight of the human soul and the power of individual expression. We create clothing that not only looks good, but feels good too - clothing that embodies the essence of the soul and the spirit of the individual. Our brand is all about embracing the journey of life, the ups and downs, the joys and sorrows, and turning them into something beautiful. We believe that everyone has a story to tell and our clothing is the canvas for that story. With every piece we create, we aim to inspire, uplift, and empower individuals to express themselves authentically and confidently.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e313112a6b7c8c76','-',7,'United States','Norfolk',40.000,'perhour',37.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 14:48:41',NULL,18,3,NULL,146),
