(18292,'Pitchbook Builder for Urban Mobility Investment Fund',2,'Job Description:\r\n\r\nWe are a fast-growing urban mobility investment fund seeking a skilled Pitchbook Builder to help us create a comprehensive pitchbook that showcases our investment thesis, strategy, and track record. The ideal candidate will have experience building pitchbooks for investment firms, with a focus on the transportation or real estate sectors.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Collaborate with our investment team to gather all necessary data and insights to build a comprehensive pitchbook\r\n- Design a visually appealing and professional-looking pitchbook that effectively communicates our investment thesis, strategy, and track record\r\n- Conduct market research and analysis to provide context and insights on market trends and competitive landscape\r\n- Develop data-driven financial models and charts that showcase our investment track record and future growth potential\r\n- Ensure the pitchbook is accurate, up-to-date, and aligned with our brand and messaging\r\n- Present the pitchbook to our senior leadership team and incorporate feedback to refine the final product\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\n- Bachelor\'s degree in finance, business, economics, or a related field\r\n- 3+ years of experience in investment banking, private equity, venture capital, or a similar role\r\n- Proven track record of building pitchbooks for investment firms, with a focus on transportation or real estate sectors\r\n-Strong financial modeling skills and proficiency with - - Microsoft Excel and PowerPoint\r\n- Knowledge of market research and analysis techniques and tools\r\n- Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work with cross-functional teams\r\n- Ability to work independently and manage multiple projects simultaneously\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested in this job description, feel free to modify it to fit your specific needs and requirements.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/propo