(18302,'Logo Design',10,'Job Description:\r\n\r\nWe seek a talented and dedicated graphic designer to develop our NEW company logo. As part of the project, you will use your knowledge of typography, color, layout, and image manipulation to create a visually appealing design that communicates our core brand. The design should be attractive and appropriate to place on various marketing mediums, including but not limited to merchandise, digital print, social platforms, letterheads, business cards Etc. On your first day, you will be granted access to our Figma design files containing our current MVP prototype awaiting development. This phase will allow you to fully dive deep into our product to help you develop the right logo design for our company brand.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nCreate and design a NEW company logo with brand identity.\r\nTranslate information about the client’s business and customers into a visually enticing, easy-to-understand, and emotionally impactful logo.\r\nEstablish creative direction for the company within brand guidelines.\r\nEnsure the final product is completed promptly and with top quality.\r\nQA design for errors.\r\nImplement feedback and changes whenever possible.\r\nCreate visualizations that convey accurate messaging for the project. \r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nBachelor’s degree or higher in a creative field\r\nProficiency in Adobe Suite, Photoshop,  InDesign, QuarkXPress, Illustrator, and Figma.\r\nExcellent written and verbal communication skills\r\nMinimum of two years experience in graphic design\r\nAttention to detail\r\nPortfolio of work with a wide range of creative projects\r\nStrong analytical skills\r\nTime management and organizational skills\r\nFamiliarity with HTML and CSS preferred\r\nKnowledge of layouts, graphic fundamentals, typography, print, and web\r\nExperience with both print and digital media\r\n\r\nDeliverable includes:\r\nFull Ownership\r\nHigh Resolution\r\nWeb-ready (PNG & SVG)\r\nPrint-ready (EPS & PDF)\r\nSocial Media Kit (Profile pics & cover photos)\r\n\r\nBefore Applying - consider the following:\r\nOur leadership team has extensively created and tested many DIY logo generators, including those powered by “AI.” A few companies we’ve tested include tools from; Looka, SmashingLogo, MidJourney Bot Etc. We are now exploring the option of hiring freelance talent for this project. If your process or work includes your basic “cookie-cutter” logo designs, we have most likely tested, considered, and tossed out those designs as options. Please don\'t apply if your work is similar to others to prevent wasting your time and ours. We are looking for natural design talent that can brainstorm with leadership and examine our UI/UX designs to develop our new logo identity.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~017abc80f937d96977','-',7,'United States','Parkland',45.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 15:33:22',NULL,18,3,NULL,146),
(18303,'Moving leadpages website to replace a wordpress one without losing me SEO',15,'Please only contact me on here.\r\n\r\nI currently have a wordpress website.\r\n\r\nI need to replace that website with a website I have build using https://www.leadpages.com/\r\n\r\nI need someone to backup my original site, and replace it with the new leadpages site but the most important part here, is i MUST RETAIN MY SEO to keep my google rankings.\r\n\r\nI need this done urgently thanks','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01653ffb16fcc9f3e4','-',7,'United States','London',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 15:36:47',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(18304,'Redesign Company Logo',10,'Our company SNS owns and operates large apartment communities. We raise money from investors to do this so we operate our business under two arms. SNS Management and SNS Capital Group. We would like to start fresh with a logo design for both.\r\n\r\nLinked here is our websites and also a link to our three-year vision.\r\nsnscapitalgroup.com\r\nsns-management.com\r\nhttps://issuu.com/snsmanagement/docs/sns_vivid_vision_draft_01.19.21\r\n\r\nI\'ve also attached an example of a logo we like we found and screen shot from Google.\r\n\r\nI am looking for a graphic artist who can take our three letters (SNS) names companies and draft something visually appealing, balanced, and utilizing the golden rule of logo design.\r\n\r\nThe end result would be to have a consistent logo for both SNS Management and SNS Capital Group. This would include the text of \"SNS\" and then also if possible add a graphic that could be utilized as a separate logo without letters. Something that is symmetrical and illustrates out the mission of delivering the feeling of home. Feelings like stability belonging, and respect. I attached a basic image I liked and found on Google.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e24256c7d12b14ed','-',7,'United States','Cincinnati',50.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 15:40:08',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
