(18311,'Master UX/UI Web designer for on going work',6,'ONLY APPLY IF YOU ARE IN ANY OF THESE FOUR COUNTRIES: USA, AUSTRALIA, UK & SOUTH AFRICA.\r\nIf you are not based in any of these locations, we will not consider your application.\r\n\r\nWe\'re an online kitchen cabinetry business that works with contractors and homeowners.\r\n\r\nWe\'re seeking a highly experienced UX/UI Web Designer who will make it simple as stupid for our clients to get what they want on our site - all while getting soaked into a wonderful experience as they browse.\r\n\r\nWe need the best. This will be ongoing work.\r\n\r\nWe want you to take our web experience to the next level.\r\n\r\nIs this you?\r\n\r\nMUST SPEAK AND WRITE EXCELLENT ENGLISH!\r\n\r\n1. Has a minimum of 5 years of full-time professional web design experience\r\n2. Is a master at landing page design\r\n3. Has CRO and user flow experience\r\n4. Is going to do the work themselves and not pawn it off on someone else\r\n\r\nPlease send some designs you have done that you think would be of interest based on our brand and needs. Please send Figma examples, or Photo Shop, not websites.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to hearing from you!\r\n\r\nSean\r\nCEO - Walcraft Cabinetry\r\nwww.walcraftcabinetry.com','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646179285211893761','-',7,'United States','Ohio',100.000,'Open this select menu',48.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 15:56:30',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
