(18317,'Keynote Presentation Designer to change the look of a current 7-8 page presentation',11,'I have a travel television show pitch document (based in keynote) and I need someone that can change the look and feel of it for me to make it more compelling and professional looking. There are a lot of images from the various countries we are travelling to in it so it\'s more a layout improvement that I need. I have attached the current version which is \"Journey to South Africa\". The show is called \"Journey to (insert country)\" so this title would need to be changeable every time I use it.  I would like to be able to change the images and logos on the slides to suit the particular country we are selling to eg Fiji, USA, etc to make it more personalised. I also like that the general text is on the white background making it easy to read. Looking forward to speaking with you further about the project.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~012395373ae5f5fdbe','-',7,'United States','Woollahra',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 16:18:35',NULL,18,3,NULL,146),
