(18328,'Billing and Accounts Receivable Manager and Virtual Office Support',21,'We are currently seeking a highly organized and detail-oriented individual to fill the role of Billing and Accounts Receivable Manager. The primary responsibility of this role will be to manage weekly and monthly billing for various accounts, ensuring timely and accurate processing of invoices. Also will be responsible for taking some phone calls and inputting data into our software.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\nPrepare and distribute accurate and timely invoices to clients on a weekly and monthly basis\r\nMonitor and track payment status for all outstanding invoices\r\n\r\nFollow up with clients on past due payments and ensure timely resolution of payment discrepancies\r\n\r\nProcess credit card payments and reconcile all credit card\r\ntransactions\r\n\r\nMaintain accurate and up-to-date billing records and client information in Jobber software\r\n\r\nAssist with month-end closing activities and financial reporting\r\n\r\nCollaborate with cross-functional teams to improve billing\r\nprocesses and enhance customer experience','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646188432652099585','-',7,'United States','US',12.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 16:58:41',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
