(18331,'Bookkeeper. Quickbooks Online Expert.',39,'Fast growing medical device and supply distribution company is seeking an experienced and reliable bookkeeper with extensive Quickbooks online expertise.\r\nThe ideal candidate lives in the U.S., has a long history of success, and is highly reliable.\r\n\r\nWe will require an initial \"clean up\" of our Quickbooks account, and weekly maintenance thereafter. This would include auditing all entries on a weekly basis, including invoices, categorizing expenses and receipts, payroll for both w-2 and 1099 workers, and preparation for quarterly taxes.\r\n\r\nHours may vary depending on workload.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646199021524287489','-',7,'United States','Franklin',50.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 17:13:04',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
(18332,'Assistant Manager/Bookkeeper',39,'Our client, a leader in concrete road repair and construction located in Southfield, Michigan, is seeking a proactive, analytical, detailed-oriented entry-level bookkeeper, to join their team. The ideal candidate enjoys working in a collaborative supportive office setting. This position includes benefits such as medical insurance, dental insurance, 401(k) profit sharing, paid holidays, and paid time off during non-peak winter months. This position requires working in the office from 8:30 to 4:30 Monday through Friday.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n• Administer accounts payable including precise recordkeeping of all payments, management of vendor relationships, and exploration of opportunities for savings and discounts.\r\n• Setup and maintain customer contracts, insurance, and bonding on new and existing jobs.\r\n• Administer project job files in collaboration with the Project Manager and Assistant Project Manager.\r\n• Verify subcontractors’ sworn statements and administer MDOT reporting of subcontractor payments.\r\n• Closeout completed jobs.\r\n• Manage and administer employee MVR’s, license credentials, and documentation of physicals ensuring compliance and accuracy.\r\n• Maintain employee files including accident reports and documentation of injuries and damages.\r\n• Maintain vehicle and equipment lists.\r\n• Administer DOT vehicle reporting.\r\n• Monitor and maintain vehicle insurance and SOS reequipments.\r\n\r\nOutstanding benefits package:\r\n• 401K + Matching\r\n• Medical, Dental and Vision insurance, STD, Life Insurance\r\n• Paid Time Off\r\n• 13 Paid Time Off Holidays/Community Service Day\r\n• Competitive Compensation\r\n• Commissions\r\n• 10% Bonus based on base salary, subject to performance, paid quarterly\r\n• Exceptional training programs and numerous opportunities for advancement.\r\n\r\nSIX MOST IMPORTANT JOB FUNCTIONS\r\n\r\n1. SELF MOTIVATED\r\n\r\n2. ORGANIZED\r\n\r\n3. ABILITY TO WORK WELL WITH OTHERS\r\n\r\n4. PROBLEM SOLVER\r\n\r\n5. FOCUSED\r\n\r\n6. ABILITY TO MAKE WORK FUN\r\n\r\nSKILLS AND ABILITIES\r\n\r\n1. ACCOUNTS RECEIVABLE\r\n\r\n2. ACCOUNTS PAYABLE\r\n\r\n3. FINANCIAL PREPARATION\r\n\r\n4. BANK RECONCILIATION\r\n\r\n5. COLLECTIONS\r\n\r\nIf you are still interested in Marquette after viewing https://youtu.be/zbehu8V5TCY , text AssistantSF at 734-724-5666 to make your MARQ with Marquette. Come join Marquette\'s environment of excitement, personal fulfillment, and unique culture!\r\n\r\nWe believe in equity. We celebrate the unique backgrounds and lived experiences of our employees. We value the differences that continue to make us the most authentic versions of ourselves in our professional and personal lives. We strive to provide a safe and supportive environment where people from all walks of life can thrive, making us the best place to work, live, and invest.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646200472095547393','-',7,'United States','US',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 17:17:18',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
(18333,'Book and Workbook Editing',2,'I am writing a book on healthy marriages. I am following it up with a workbook. The book is to address the 11 reasons marriages fail, without any type of religious underpinning. The workbook is more focused on a Christian audience and presents a model named the F.O.R.E.V.E.R. W.E.D. model. I need to edit the book and then transition the book to present the model. I ran out of steam in my research and personal story integration in the book and need someone to fill in the gaps. Once the book is written, I then need to clean up the FOREVER WED workbook. So, this project will include a completed book, with Q&A from me to add gaps, and a completed WORKBOOK.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646201948516995073?success','-',7,'United States','Sachse',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 17:23:11',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
(18334,'Virtual receptionist for Physiotherapy clinic in Australia',22,'Position Title: Superstar General VA - Working with an Australian Physiotherapy/Health Business\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a superstar! Someone passionate about virtually assisting a growing, energetic, young and progressive physiotherapy/health business.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a general assistant - someone who is multi-skilled, flexible, available and willing to help grow a business. We operate in a fast-paced environment with lots of change and variability. This will be a developing role, and the tasks will vary over time.\r\n\r\nSome of the tasks undertaken will include:\r\n\r\ntaking phone calls and scheduling appointments in nookal\r\ndoing follow up calls\r\nmanaging referal communication through gmail and efax\r\nLight bookkeeping to reconcile paid invoices\r\nSocial media post creation\r\nSocial media post scheduling (Facebook and Instagram)\r\nGraphic creation for social media (primarily Canva)\r\nGoogle Sites / notion maintenance\r\nTranscription (audio into written)\r\ngo high level management\r\n\r\nAssist Director and health professionals with other support work\r\n\r\n\r\nWe need someone who has a reliable, fast internet connection and is available to communicate regularly.\r\n\r\nWe use google workspace and 3cx for communication.\r\n\r\nExceptional fluent, conversational English is a must, and medical/health knowledge is preferred but optional. Time zones have to be favourable to Australian eastern standard time.\r\n\r\nWe can negotiate, but looking at a base retainer of a set fee per week (for up to a certain number of hours per week), and then an hourly rate for any extra work. We require someone with flexibility and the ability to take on varying amounts of work (with a minimum base commitment).\r\n\r\nWe would love to hear from you if you fit this description! The following steps will involve a questionnaire and a Skype/Zoom video interview.\r\n\r\nPotential task list for Google Sheets and Tasks:\r\n\r\nUpdate Weekly KPI Dashboard\r\nUpdate Monthly KPI Dashboard\r\nUpdate Quarterly KPI Dashboard\r\nDo Weekly Feedback Sheet\r\nmanage leads in go high level\r\nIf leads do NOT have a booking, send the following SMS (change NAME for their first name)\r\nCheck and Complete Online Client Profile Forms\r\n[Weekly Task] - Nookal Diary Check\r\n[Weekly Task] - Post Positive Feedback from go high level, Into google chat','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646203865309728769','-',7,'United States','Australia',10.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 17:33:20',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
