(18337,'Creative Designer for Website Redesign and Rebranding',4,'Job Description:\r\n\r\nWe are a marketing agency specializing in Amazon and Walmart marketplaces, and we\'re looking for a talented and experienced creative designer to help us redesign our website and rebrand our logo. We need someone who can bring fresh, innovative ideas to the table and help us stand out in a crowded market.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n• Work with our team to develop a new website design and logo concept that reflects our brand identity and values.\r\n• Develop wireframes, prototypes, and visual designs for the website.\r\n• Ensure website design is user-friendly and optimized for SEO.\r\n• Work with the development team to ensure design feasibility and functionality.\r\n• Stay up to date with the latest design trends and technologies.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n• Proven experience as a creative designer, with a portfolio of recent works.\r\n• A strong portfolio showcasing your recent works and design process.\r\n• A forward-thinking approach to design with a passion for innovation.\r\n• Proficiency in design tools such as Adobe Creative Suite, Figma, Sketch, etc.\r\n• Excellent communication and collaboration skills.\r\nA strong understanding of SEO and website optimization.\r\n\r\nLocation: Remote\r\n\r\nCompensation: Competitive salary based on experience\r\n\r\nApplication Process:\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this position, please send us your portfolio showcasing your recent works and design process. We will review your application and set up an interview if we feel that you are a good fit for the role.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b0d8294125724948','Jake Schwarzbaum - Homepage Design - Crystal',155,'United States','Jericho',2500.000,'fixed',2500.000,'2023-04-11',1,'2023-04-12',1,'Fixed',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-04-12 17:42:25','2023-04-19 20:00:22',19,3,NULL,133),
