(18339,'Medical Virtual Assistant: Appointment Scheduling',22,'MUST BE COMFORTABLE BEING IN A MEETING ROOM WITH CAMERA ON THE WHOLE SHIFT.\r\n\r\nLooking for an engaging and dedicated virtual assistants to join our team and manage the care of our patients virtually. Responsibilities includes assisting providers, inbound and outbound calls, and some administrative tasks that can be added\r\nMust be very comfortable with medical terminology.\r\nWe will provide you with a phone system.\r\nWork hours are Monday to Friday from 9 am to 5 pm PST with some flexibility.\r\n\r\nGREAT COMMUNICATION SKILLS IS A MUST!\r\nUS VA Healthcare Experience is a MAJOR PLUS!\r\n\r\nTasks:\r\n-Appointment Scheduling\r\n-Answering calls, texts, and emails\r\n-Preparing Patient List\r\n-Uploading Sign In Sheets and DBQS\r\n-Updating Calendar\r\n-Updating Network Portal and DocuSign\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n-Quiet environment where phone calls can be answered in a professional manner.\r\n-Noise canceling head set\r\n-Our phone system requires 10mbps speed internet to use it. Any less and you will not be able to work\r\n-Must have very stable internet connection\r\n-Must be available throughout PST office work hours to take phone calls\r\n-Must have a stable availability with long-term goal to continue\r\n-Must have good English skills with great communication abilities\r\n-Experience working in Healthcare','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646207945773432833','-',7,'United States','Los Angeles',3.000,'Open this select menu',18.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 17:47:46',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
