(18345,'Graphic designer needed to redesign marketing creative image',2,'I have this creative design that I use on my website and marketing materials (attached).\r\n\r\nI want to redesign it according to a new brand guideline: Instead of the bluish-green gradient, our accent color is going to be purple, #4139B3. Other than that, I\'d like it to look more \"blockchain-y\", tech-y, SaaS-y. Less cheerful and childish.\r\n\r\nThe concept is supposed to be the same: Chainwire is the product, and it is the \"source\" from which our clients can \"connect\" themselves to different news sites (i.e. all of the logos surrounding Chainwire in the current design).\r\n\r\nTo see where it\'s going to end up, see the attached image \"Homepage\". Your design will replace the old one.\r\n\r\nAll the logos of the news sites are attached in a ZIP file (most are SVGs, others are hi-res PNGs).\r\n\r\nIf you have experience designing things in blockchain and you get the vibe, that\'s an advantage.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646217390446956545?success','-',7,'United States','Ramat Gan',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 18:24:20',NULL,19,3,NULL,123),
