(18348,'Looking for a Doctor / Medical Expert Writer',37,'Help us grow a national review / product comparison website to help consumers easily shop for medical-related devices, including medical alert systems. Our goal is to create the top 10 medical alert systems page, but first will create high-end company-branded pages, with FAQs about each company to help inform consumers about each company\'s products, credentials,\r\n\r\nLooking to hire medical experts (preferably a doctor) to write reviews about the top medical alert systems. We\'re looking for a doctor to add an extra level of credibility to our expert reviews and be listed as the author, also helping grow the writer\'s reputation. (content must follow E-A-T marketing standards)\r\n\r\nCompanies:\r\nBest Medical Alert Systems Home page\r\nMedical Guardian https://www.medicalguardian.com/\r\nMobilehelp Medical Alert https://www.mobilehelp.com/\r\nMedical Alert https://www.medicalalert.com/\r\nGetSafe Medical Alert https://www.getsafe.com/\r\nBay Alarm Medical Alert https://www.bayalarmmedical.com/\r\n(Philips) Lifeline https://www.lifeline.com/\r\nOneCallAlert https://onecallmedicalalert.com/\r\nLifeFone Medical Alert Systems https://www.lifefone.com/\r\nLife Alert for seniors https://www.lifealert.com/\r\nUnaliWear https://www.unaliwear.com/\r\n\r\nThe writer can have 7-10 days to complete this job.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646217171063885825','-',7,'United States','cornwall',6.000,'fixed',3000.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 18:29:54',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
