(18386,'Credentialing Specialist',24,'Hi Team, \r\n\r\nIn reference to the position posted, I wish to extend my sincerest interest to apply for it. I have attched my resume, list of qualifications and work experience along with this letter. \r\n\r\nI\'m currently working as a credentialing specialist at HealthCare Support. I am primarily doing administrative tasks and ensuring that medical staff members\' maintain current credentials and licenses to work legally in their field or specialty.\r\n\r\nI\'m also experienced with customer service which I worked for more than 2 years and I am someone who can multi- task and hard working.\r\n\r\nI appreciate your time reading this letter and I am very eager to discuss more about this. Thank you very much for the opportunity and consideration! I am very excited to be part of the team.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nJohn Benedict Dela Cruz','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646212852556152833','-',7,'United States','-',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 20:41:01',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
