(18388,'Writting',37,'Health science is the discipline of applied science which deals with human and animal health. There are two parts to health science: the study, research, and knowledge of health and the application of that knowledge to improve health, cure diseases, and understanding how humans and animals function.\r\nPublic Health is important due to aiding and prolonging life. Through the prevention of health issues, individuals can spend more of their years in good health. 4. Public Health helps detect health issues as early as possible and responds appropriately to avoid the development of disease.\r\nIt is very true that Health is Wealth. As, it is only our good health which stay with us in any bad or good circumstances. Nobody in this world can help us in bad times. So, if our health is good, we can bear any bad circumstances in our life. If one is not healthy, he/she would definitely suffer health related or other difficulties in life instead of enjoying the life. In order to maintain a good health we need to eat balanced food, daily mild exercises, fresh air, clean water, maintain good posture, enough sleep and rest, maintain cleanliness, regular medical check-ups, follow our elders, parents, and teachers etc\r\nThere is a very common and true saying that Health is Wealth. We should always keep in mind that wealth is wealth however health is the greatest wealth in this world. We should also motivate our kids and children to know something about this common saying using such as simple and easy essay on Health is Wealth. You can make your kids aware about their health using such simply worded Health is Wealth.\r\nAs we all know about the popular and common saying that “Health is Wealth”. It is as true as our life. Good health keeps us always happy and gives us feeling of complete physical, mental, social and intellectual well-being. A good health keeps us away from the diseases and health disorders. The loss of good health causes loss of all the happiness. A great freedom fighter, Mahatma Gandhi (also called Bapu) has said that “It is health which is real wealth, and not pieces of gold and silver”.\r\n\r\nA good health helps us to life a good, balanced and healthy life. Our good health needs several things to get done on daily basis. We need fresh air, clean water, proper sunlight, balanced diet, away from junk food, clean and healthy atmosphere, greenery environment, morning walk, personal hygiene, proper education, etc.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646199872177131521','-',7,'United States','-',80.000,'perhour',80.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 20:42:50',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(18389,'Healthcare Insurance Verification Specialist',22,'We are seeking a detail-oriented healthcare insurance benefit verification specialist to join our team. As a healthcare insurance benefit verification specialist, you will be responsible for calling to verify patient insurance coverage and benefits, obtaining authorization for medical services, and communicating with insurance providers and our administrative support team.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Verify patient insurance coverage and benefits prior to medical services over the phone with the insurance provider.\r\n- Obtain authorization for medical services as required by insurance providers.\r\n- Communicate with insurance providers and our staff to ensure accurate and timely explanation of insurance coverage and benefit verification information.\r\n- Resolve insurance coverage and benefit verification issues in a timely and efficient manner.\r\n- Maintain knowledge of insurance benefit policies and procedures to ensure accuracy.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Minimum of 1-2 years of experience in healthcare insurance benefit verification or related field.\r\n- Knowledge of medical terminology and insurance benefit policies and procedures.\r\n- Strong organizational and communication skills written and verbal.\r\n- Ability to work independently and as part of a team.\r\n- Proficiency in computer systems and software, including Google Sheets.\r\n- Ability to call insurance carriers for accurate benefit information.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646188263776108545','-',7,'United States','-',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 20:44:12',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(18390,'Engaging Fitness Writers For Authority Site',37,'I own an authority site in the fitness space. The brand is slowly expanding with more articles and needs great fitness writers to get bigger.\r\n\r\nYou’ll be covering a wide range of topics, including how-to posts, product review posts, question posts, and more in the fitness space.\r\n\r\nYou’re also going to need strong research/google skills. If the sentence doesn’t add value to the post, you don’t add it. You should also put a list of reference sites where you did the research so I can cite them when published.\r\n\r\nMake sure you begin your reply with the word \"Watermelon\" at the top of your proposal, that way I know you’ve read the entire posting. Those who don’t will not be contacted back.\r\n\r\nDepending on your fitness experience, the articles will be published on the website under a pseudonym or your actual name.\r\n\r\nPerks of the Job\r\n\r\nCritical feedback to improve writing skills\r\nLong term colleague/reference\r\nConsistent workload every week, with more long-term\r\nStable work as part of a high performing team\r\nBonuses with growth and improvement\r\nOpportunity in other areas of work in the brand (ie, social media, guest posting, HARO)\r\n\r\nRequirements\r\n\r\nMust have Fitness Credentials (IMPORTANT)\r\nMust be native English speaking\r\nInterested in long-term work\r\nDetail oriented as every query will require something different\r\nWorking in a timely manner, as the faster you reply to queries\r\nFollow the supplied style guide (I will send when I hire you)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646184965871575041','-',7,'United States','-',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 20:45:04',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
