(18403,'Mental Health Insurance Claims Biller',21,'We are a private practice group looking for assistance in insurance billing on a regular basis. Hours needed vary based on week-to-week need. Ideal candidate would be able to spend dedicated hours to addressing urgent needs quickly and then be able to spend 1 hour or so a day going forward on checking eligibility and details.\r\nTasks would include:\r\n~recuperating denied or unpaid behavioral health claims\r\n~credentialing on insurance panels\r\n~preauthorizations\r\n~patient insurance eligibility\r\n\r\nWe use Therapy Notes for a system and will give you access. We are located in Wisconsin. Knowledge of Wisconsin or Midwest Insurance companies is a plus.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646136261480108033','-',7,'United States','-',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 20:54:32',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(18404,'Medical billing Expert',21,'We are a fast-growing medical facility looking for experienced part time (5-8 hours per week) professionals to join our team. As a member of our team, you will be responsible for accurately coding medical procedures and diagnoses, submitting claims to insurance companies, and following up on denied or rejected claims.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nAt least 2 years of experience in medical coding and billing\r\nKnowledge of medical terminology, anatomy, and physiology\r\nProficiency in ICD-10 and CPT coding systems\r\nFamiliarity with electronic health record (EHR) systems\r\nExcellent attention to detail and organizational skills\r\n\r\nAbility to work independently and in a team environment\r\n\r\nStrong communication and problem-solving skills\r\n\r\nIf you meet the requirements and are looking for a challenging and rewarding career, please submit your resume and a cover letter for consideration. We offer competitive salary and benefits packages and opportunities for professional growth and development.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646112729436053504','-',7,'United States','-',18.000,'perhour',17.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 20:55:15',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
(18405,'Label Design',2,'Hi,\r\n\r\nWe need a label designed for a roll of Tape. There will be 2 versions but the only difference will the be the UPC.\r\n\r\nBrand Logo - Ziollo\r\n\r\nTitle - Paintable Roof Seam Tape\r\n\r\nThis is an example of a product we\'re modeling our Tape after. https://www.amazon.ca/Liquid-Rubber-Seam-Tape-Roll/dp/B01ERUDAW8?ref_=ast_sto_dp&th=1&psc=1\r\n\r\nDescription - Ziollo Peel and Stick Paintable Roof Seam Tape is used to bridge seams, joints, vents, skylights and more. Used on RV Roofs, Metal Roofs, Flat Roofs and other areas that need to be sealed and waterproofed.\r\n\r\nDirections - Apply above 50F/10C. Clean surface well (Acetone). Peel backing off from the corner and work small sections. Apply Tape and smooth from the middle out. Apply pressure to activate the adhesive. Apply your roof coating over top of the Tape.\r\n\r\nWe need a placeholder for the scannable UPC.\r\n\r\nThis is what the Ziollo branding looks like on Amazon - https://www.amazon.ca/stores/Ziollo/page/B7015324-261C-48AB-9B4A-EFD950ABC3E3?ref_=ast_bln.\r\n\r\nBrand Visuals - https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J15rsAHi-qtYF7cSeUSYNNySYIRQn5ri/view?usp=share_link\r\n\r\nZiollo Logo - https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RPzn5WTCIG67td5cX8WXqelKDmXXykUL?usp=share_link\r\n\r\nNot sure if we can use a couple icons to make a visual for RV Roofs like a motorhome and roof icon on the label so people can help better identify what the Tape is used for.\r\n\r\nThanks in advance for your time.\r\nRay','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646257236020383745?success','-',7,'United States','Oakville',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-04-12',1,'2023-04-12',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-12 21:02:50',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
