(18445,'Brand Identity & Design Required: Premium Vegan Skincare Launch',2,'We are an experienced e-commerce marketing team with a proven track record of generating over $100 million in revenue for our clients over the last few years. As we embark on our journey to launch a high-end, all-natural skincare brand, we are seeking a talented Branding Expert to join our team.\r\n\r\nOur brand will be exclusively vegan, cruelty-free, and focused on delivering premium, natural products to our customers. Our sales strategy will revolve around direct-to-consumer channels, primarily through our website, supported by Facebook ads, email marketing, and influencer campaigns.\r\n\r\nWhat we need help with:\r\n* Assistance with brand positioning\r\n* Packaging and bottle design\r\n* Logos, badges, icons\r\n* Branding Guidelines\r\n* Website design collateral\r\n\r\nWe look forward to working with someone on an ongoing basis to help us on our path! Look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nPlease only apply with a link or attachments to your previous portfolio. We anticipate a high number of applicants for this position so would prefer to let your work speak for you initially...\r\n\r\nIf we like you\'re work we\'ll hit you up for an initial call! :)','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~017b8530dd4234e6b9','-',7,'United States','Solihull',65.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-13',1,'2023-04-13',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-13 12:21:30',NULL,18,3,NULL,146),
