(18448,'Shopify 2.0 web development & design',16,'We are looking for a professional level shopify web developer / designer who can improve our website.\r\n\r\nWe are currently requiring a Shopify Expert to do 2 things.\r\n\r\n1. Product options for Shopify\r\nBuild out choices beyond just 3x and is styled like this: https://www.tesla.com/model3/design#overview (https://www.tesla.com/model3/design#overview)\r\ne.g. Tesla’s Model 3 made to order product page.\r\n\r\nGoal\r\nThe tools to turn on and off and edit these Product Options needs to be customisable using the Shopify Customise Theme Tool — which we can then use to add to page templates.\r\nThe goal is for us to be able to scale these tools by having them in our customise theme editing - which we can edit, add or delete at any time, and use for scaling our product catalogue up on our website for adding more products or templates.\r\n\r\nIt needs to be the full experience on mobile and desktop. Like Tesla does.\r\n\r\n2. Product Landing Pages\r\nWe are also needing to create product landing pages that display like this https://www.tesla.com/model3 (https://www.tesla.com/model3)\r\nIt too needs to be editable using customise theme tool.\r\n\r\nRequirements\r\nWe currently require this for our website (our website link is to be advised in direct message)\r\n\r\nThere will be ongoing opportunities to do more projects after this, including working on our other website.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this project, please send us your relevant portfolio work experience, demonstrating examples that have the solutions we require.\r\n\r\n\r\nNote: please contact us only through Upwork.\r\nPlease do not email or call us, thanks.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646492754380185601?success','-',7,'United States','Coorparoo',50.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-04-13',1,'2023-04-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-13 12:38:46',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
