(18463,'WordPress Developer and Designer',2,'Are you a WordPress Expert in Website Amalgamation?\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a web designer to amalgamate two existing WordPress websites into one for a new merger company. The project aims to combine the existing website with the latest content from both sites into a single cohesive website. We will provide the content, logo, and other necessary details. Your role will be to redesign the website and handle the technical setup.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nWork closely with our team to combine the content from both existing websites into a single new website.\r\nMaintain the website layout/navigation using the layout of one of the existing websites.\r\nEnsure that the new website design reflects the branding of the new merger company.\r\nDevelop and implement the website using the CMS platform WordPress and ensure that it is optimized for all devices.\r\nCollaborate with our team to ensure that the website is user-friendly, visually appealing, and effectively communicates our message.\r\nEnsure that the website is completed within a timeframe of one week and a half, leaving sufficient time for testing.\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nExperienced in web design and development.\r\nProficiency in WordPress, HTML/CSS, JavaScript, and other web development tools.\r\nStrong design skills and understanding of branding and visual communication.\r\nExperience with responsive design and front-end frameworks.\r\nAbility to work independently and collaboratively with a team.\r\nStrong attention to detail and ability to meet tight deadlines.\r\nWe would love to hear from you if you are a skilled web designer with experience in WordPress and amalgamating websites and can complete the project within the given timeframe. Please submit your resume and portfolio for consideration. Thank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01ef54a70dcb9e1dd7/apply/','-',7,'United States','Sydney',700.000,'fixed',700.000,'2023-04-13',1,'2023-04-13',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-13 13:27:10',NULL,19,3,NULL,120),
(18464,'Squarespace website for freelancer',18,'I am looking for a designer to convert a basic website that we currently have (set up on Mailchimp websites) to a fresh and sharp looking site using Squarespace. We already have a logo, so the job will involve any and all of the following:\r\n\r\n1. Picking a relevant/appropriate Squarespace theme\r\n2. Create a layout for homepage and 5 sub pages\r\n3. Modify our image assets to fit template\r\n4. Create additional images/graphics where needed\r\n5. Suggest stock photos where necessary\r\n\r\nSome references for sites where we think could help provide inspiration:\r\n\r\nhttps://prophet.com/ (Header, layout)\r\nhttps://fidusinfosec.com/ (Header background, trusted by)\r\nhttps://knapsackcreative.com/the-collaborative (modern style, illustrations)\r\nhttps://knapsackcreative.com/the-ready (design elements)\r\nhttps://knapsackcreative.com/simplicity-wealth-management (header IF we could find appropriate stock image)\r\nhttps://emergencehq.com/ (video background)\r\nhttps://www.sigmaofsenses.com/ (something completely different in terms of industry/style)\r\n\r\nWe would be interested to know how long this job may take and what other considerations would need to be known by you in order to proceed.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646506656303742977?success','https://trello.com/c/ol9LvIRj/2378-ed-burrows-wordpress-website-design-jg',159,'United States','Berlin',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-04-13',1,'2023-04-13',1,'NA',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-04-13 13:37:24','2023-04-27 12:04:09',17,3,NULL,119),
