(18470,'URGENT Hire: Full-Time Medical VA',22,'Job overview:\r\nWe want a multi-skilled professional maintaining a friendly attitude with patients and ability to manage the work for one doctor. Professional and healthcare experience as follows; scheduling patients, assisting on follow ups, reviewing faxes, answering HIGH VOLUME phone calls, taking detailed messages and forwarding to appropriate staff members, inputting data into the EMR system (Electronic Medical Record), requesting missing lab results, imaging results and consult notes for upcoming appointments and etc...\r\n\r\nWe want to know:\r\na. Number of years experienced in the VIRTUAL medical field?\r\nb. Number of years experienced as VIRTUAL medical assistant?\r\nc. Able to answer HIGH VOLUME calls and take detailed messages?\r\nd. Familiar with the EMR system (Electronic Medical Record)? if yes, LIST THEM.\r\ne. Familiar with the medical terminology and medications?\r\nf. Able to work Pacific Time? Los Angeles time zone, 9:00am-6:0pm - Monday to Friday\r\n\r\n1. Workstation is a MUST - well-equipped desktop, two monitors and backup internet.\r\n2. Blocking background noise is a MUST.\r\n3. Neurologist specialty experience is a plus.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646498666978562049','-',7,'United States','-',10.000,'perhour',10.000,'2023-04-13',1,'2023-04-13',1,'Regular Bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-13 14:16:58',NULL,12,3,NULL,150),
