(18475,'Landing page for existing website',3,'We are looking for a talented web designer to create an exciting landing page for our existing website, We will provide all text and info to be put on the page. We want the page to be sent to our development team to place on our URL. We want the landing page to have our text and include a submission form for visitors to the site to input their -name, email address, phone number. The landing page needs a top header bar with buttons for- HTCOC - Why Us - Membership Packages -Our Team - Contact us- In the upper left corner we want in large block letters the name of our company. The landing page needs our phone number in large block numbers in the upper right corner and the submission form below that, On the rest of the landing page we need bullet points with our call to action and a link to watch a short video production. Our attachment has all verbiage for the landing page','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646528624939679745','-',7,'United States','Baton Rouge',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-04-13',1,'2023-04-13',1,'Fixed Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-13 15:00:49',NULL,18,3,NULL,140),
