(18478,'Senior UX/UI Designer (SaaS Applications)',4,'As a company, we are looking to grow our design team and add exceptional partners / individuals to help us grow our SaaS-based platforms. This person is passionate about UX UI and can really help drive our design forward.\r\n\r\nRequired Skills\r\n\r\n– Excellent communication, presentation, and client management skills\r\n– Well-versed in iterative User Centered Design process\r\n– Experience designing transactional systems, not simply static web sites\r\n– Experience with data/information visualization\r\n- Knowledge of design frameworks and libraries such as MUI (Material Design) desirable.\r\n– You manage client expectations and your own time efficiently\r\n– Expert in Figma\r\n- Understands and has opinions about current industry best practices\r\n- UX designer who has spent the past 4+ years building out robust design systems in Figma leveraging design tokens\r\n- Will have a comfort, experience and close collaboration style working with developers\r\n- Experience and a passion for accessibility design\r\n- Comfort educating other designers about the design system, leading the design team\r\n- Deep knowledge of design process, design thinking and end to end design\r\n- Must have 8+ years of hands on UX Design skills with a portfolio outlining design thinking and process','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01f49a4660f3a8a31a','-',7,'United States','Los Alamitos',50.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-13',1,'2023-04-13',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-13 15:08:30',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
