(18482,'Ui/Ux design for phone app',4,'My name is Abdulrahman, I am currently working on developing a new rideshare app that would be based in the US. I have been working as a part-time Uber driver for the past couple of months and I have developed a new concept that could change the dynamics of the market. I currently have developed options for the brand guidelines, the wireframes, and some other business-related documents and now I need to take the next step, UI/UX designs.\r\n\r\nDirect messages are used to discuss projects that may not be posted yet.\r\nLearn more\r\n\r\nReplies within 24 hours lead to faster hiring.\r\n\r\nI currently have a rough picture of how the app would look and how it would flow, but I need the opinion of an expert. I need the person that I will work with to:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n1- Be extremely proficient in English and someone who can communicate clearly. I should be able to understand what you are saying without putting in any effort.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n2- Have at least 5 years of experience in developing UI/UX designs for mobile phone applications.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n3- Be analytical. I currently have the wire-frames done, there must be some problems with it and I need someone who can find them and make them better.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n4- Be creative. I have an end goal and a clear business model, how this app would cater to it is the developer\'s job. I am not an expert, hence I will not be giving you a detailed list of what you should do, it is your job to figure this out and then discuss the together.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n5- Not be a copycat. It is always advantageous to learn from the work of others to be able to advance, yet I don’t want the app to look like every other app that is out there, I need original work!!! The concept that is being presented in this app is new and does require a great deal of creativity.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n6- I need someone who has general knowledge and expertise in the full process of developing an app in order to cater to any future needs this app might have early in this stage.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n7- Someone who understands that the quality of the work is of utmost importance, don’t deliver something mediocre to meet the deadline, I understand that life happens and work could be delayed, so please inform me early on if anything was to happen and we can figure out that.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you believe that you are the right person please contact me so we can schedule a meeting to discuss technicalities.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ae2680c4bbd6f8cd','-',7,'United States','Fairfax',48.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-13',1,'2023-04-13',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-13 15:17:55',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
