(18505,'Writer needed for Medical OpEd',37,'I am looking for an Op-Ed to be written. It should have two versions a 1200-word version and a 750-word version. You must be familiar with the medical industry\r\n\r\nStep one is to fill in the outline more...step 2 is the write the words Please let me know 1. How long it will take to write 2. How much to write it.\r\n\r\nOutline: I. Most employers don’t realize that the CAA and TiC rules have changed what it means to be a fiduciary\r\n\r\nII. There is lots of public data out there to utilize (hospital files, RAND, Sage, etc)\r\n\r\nIII. Employers need to be sure they are getting their own data, which they have a right to. And they need to start USING it.\r\n\r\nIV. The upside is both compliance w/ ERISA duty AND big savings\r\n\r\nV. What I’ve done cut Rx by XX% and you’ve found XX% savings on the medical side.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646509999614676993','-',7,'United States','Lenni',18.000,'Open this select menu',18.000,'2023-04-13',1,'2023-04-13',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-13 16:08:22',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
