(18532,'Website designer',15,'Hello,I need to redesign my existing music/art site.\r\nRight now it\'s on WordPress, we can discuss keeping it here or moving to a different platform.\r\nI prefer to work ONLY with Europe, Latin and Central America, and all countries of the former Soviet Union.\r\nPlease, read that carefully.\r\n\r\nThe site needs optimization/Design mostly for Landing pages and restructuring of the existing pages.\r\nI will send you the site that needs redesigning, please contact me first and we will discuss everything.\r\nThis is s a very good charitable project to help Traumatised children of this world and especially in Ukraine.\r\nIf you care for the cause let\'s discuss it.\r\nhave a blessed day!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646562107417706497?success','-',7,'United States','Irvine',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-04-13',1,'2023-04-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-13 17:14:25',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
(18533,'Graphic Designer for Multiple Urban Style Packaging',2,'We are seeking a skilled packaging designer to join our team and help us create multiple packaging designs for our DankLeaf brand. The first project is to design our DankLeaf \"BustDown\" packs.\r\n\r\nThe design we envision is an urban and edgy look with a brick wall background in reddish-brown bricks. The front and back of the packaging should have graffiti-style writing throughout.\r\n\r\nThe logo and slogan \"DankLeaf Roll That Dank Shit\" should be written in graffiti drip writing and prominently displayed on the packaging without overcrowding the design. We want 5 cigars laid out in the same way as the Throwback Packaging (image provided), with \"Dankleaf\" slightly smaller and \"BustDown\" larger. The flavors should be listed as Russian Cream, Strawberry, Banana, Grape, and Original.\r\n\r\nThe design should also include a crack in the brick wall on the front of the packaging, showing the number of cigars in the pack and the flavor. For example, \"5 Banana Flavor BustDowns.\"\r\n\r\nWe want \"Made in the Dominican Republic DankLeaf Cigar BustDowns 5 PC Banana Flavor\" emphasized on the back of the packaging with all other relevant information. The surgical warning on the back should be removed, and the warning on the front updated to \"WARNING: Cigar Smoking Can Cause Lung Cancer and Heart Disease.\" Additionally, \"All Natural Tobacco\" should be added to both the front and back of the packaging.\r\n\r\nIf you are a talented packaging designer with experience in creating urban and edgy designs and interested in working with a reputable brand, please apply for this exciting opportunity to help us design our DankLeaf \"BustDown\" packs.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646563799569604609?success','-',7,'United States','Kissimmee',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-04-13',1,'2023-04-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-13 17:20:56',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
(18534,'Bookkeeper who specializes in paypal and multi currency transactions',39,'I am looking for a bookkeeper who specializes in paypal and multi currency transactions.\r\n\r\nI am a sole proprietor who files taxes in Canada. I need to do my books right away for the period of Jan 1 2022 - dec 31 2022.\r\n\r\nMy main business paypal has my income and expenses (via woo commerce).\r\nThe paypal terms (Ie GENERAL HOLD, GENERAL HOLD CONVERSION, General Currency Conversion, and other terms etc etc) in the csv’s is not adding up the $$$$$ hence I need someone who is VERY experienced in PayPal.\r\nMy PP has 3 different currencies (££GBP, cdn and us $).\r\n\r\nI get paid often in £ then it is converted to Cdn (because my pp account is Cdn) then from cdn i may make a purchase in US$ so i believe paypal takes a currency conversion fee at EVERY stage.\r\nPlus each month PP’s currency exchanges are very different (always a terrible rate for me on my end).\r\n\r\nI was told that the XERO SOFTWEAR is the best for this and that different daily currency conversions in paypal can be ‘hooked up’ in Xero. I have just signed up to xero\r\n\r\nXero wouldn’t let me import 2022 bank/paypal transactions so i just pressed import from april 1 2023 (for now).\r\n\r\nMy main business paypal is not hooked up to a bank account. I transfer money from my business paypal to my personal PP and from there I transfer it to my personal bank account. Is that OK? I’d like to keep it that way.\r\nI also need expert in Xero (if that is the best softwear) and multi currencies in xero.\r\n\r\nI also have USA bank accounts, income from the USA (going into my usa bank), Canadian income going into my Cdn bank account (I invoice a dance studio in vancouver canada and add gst (tax) onto this invoice. That is my only Cdn source of income atm.\r\n\r\nOverview: I earn aprox. just over 100,000 CDN$\r\nAprox $100,000 of that comes from my main paypal (a cdn PP but my clients mostly pay in £ as described above)\r\nAprox $15,000 US$ is earned in usa and deposited into my usa bank account (cheque or cash)\r\nAprox $10,000 CDN$ is earned in canada and deposited into my cdn account (cdn gst/tax added on in the invoice)\r\n\r\nUploaded to xero:\r\nCdn bank account x2\r\nCdn credit card\r\nUsa bank chequing account\r\nUsa bank savings account\r\nMY UK BANK HAS NOT HOOKED UP YET\r\n4 paypal accounts (only one with the main activity - the other 3 have very little)\r\n\r\nIf Xero is not the best softwear for me I can get rid of it. I have been using google sheets for the past few years and had a bookkeeper last year just do the paypal sheet for me since that was the complicated one for me. If in fact Xero is the best then I would need help getting 2022 uploaded and my books done for 2022.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAudrey K.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646565249015734273','-',7,'United States','Thunder Bay',25.000,'Open this select menu',25.000,'2023-04-13',1,'2023-04-13',1,'00',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-13 17:26:30',NULL,11,3,NULL,160),
