(18542,'QuickBooks Online Accountant Bookkeeper',39,'Job Description:\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a skilled QuickBooks Online Accountant Bookkeeper to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for uploading .csv files to QuickBooks and categorizing them correctly. Additionally, the candidate will be responsible for moving sales data from Etsy and Shopify to QuickBooks Online, performing bank reconciliations that may be overdue, and producing P&L reports.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nUpload and categorize .csv files into QuickBooks Online\r\nTransfer sales data from Etsy and Shopify to QuickBooks Online\r\nPerform bank reconciliations to ensure accuracy and completeness of financial records\r\nGenerate monthly P&L reports for management review\r\nAdvise on how to keep QuickBooks bookkeeping up to date\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nBachelor\'s degree in accounting or a related field\r\nAt least 2 years of relevant experience with QuickBooks Online and accounting/bookkeeping practices\r\nStrong knowledge of GAAP and accounting principles\r\nExperience with bank reconciliations, P&L reporting, and categorizing transactions\r\nExcellent organizational and time management skills\r\nAbility to work independently and within a team environment\r\nStrong written and verbal communication skills\r\nIf you meet the qualifications above and have a passion for bookkeeping and accounting practices, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity to work with our team.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646562980724822017','-',7,'United States','Palm Coast',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-13',1,'2023-04-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-13 17:42:38',NULL,11,3,NULL,155),
