(18550,'2022 Clean Up & Long-Term Quarterly Shopify Ecommerce Bookkeeper (Canada Corporation)',39,'We are a CANADA based corporation looking for a long-term bookkeeper for our e-commerce company to do quarterly reconciliations using QBO.\r\n\r\nThis job will start by cleaning up 2022 books which have all transaction imported. The tasks required are:\r\n1. Account structuring and rules reviews\r\n2. Shopify total sales reconciliation with bank deposits\r\n3. COGs & wire transfer reconciliation\r\n4. Cash & investment holdings reconciliation\r\n\r\nInfo:\r\n- 3-5 Shopify stores\r\n- 1 currency\r\n- ~ 1500 transaction with banks and CC (most are repeat and can be categorized by rules)\r\n- No loans, rent or mortgage\r\n- No inventory\r\n- No complex payroll or hours billable\r\n- No invoicing\r\n\r\nGiven the job is performed correctly we will move forward with full time quarterly bookkeeping:\r\n- Reconcile all financial transactions, including sales, expenses for our Shopify stores,\r\n- Ensure accurate and timely recording of financial transactions\r\n- Prepare financial statements and reports for management review, including profit and loss statements, balance sheets, and cash flow statements.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n1. At least 2 years of experience in bookkeeping, with a focus on e-commerce and online businesses.\r\nProficiency in accounting software such as QuickBooks, as well as Shopify\r\n2. Basic knowledge of Canadian tax regulations and accounting principles. (GST/HST)\r\n3. Proficiency in Google sheets & excel\r\n4. Previous work experience and degree in accounting\r\n\r\nPreferred:\r\n- Basic Chinese\r\n- Experience with Koinly\r\n- Experience with Canadian corporations\r\n\r\nPlease feel free to ask for additional information','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646227440443138049','-',7,'United States','Burnaby',800.000,'fixed',800.000,'2023-04-13',1,'2023-04-13',1,'00',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-13 18:18:05',NULL,11,3,NULL,160),
