(18564,'Build a new logo and image for a company spinoff.',2,'V.I.C. Pet Dental Spa is our new company that came out of V.I.C. Pet Care. We are looking for a new logo and image for the new company (V.I.C. Pet Dental Spa). However, we are unsure whether we want to keep similar imagery/color schemes/likeness to V.I.C. Pet Care logo. We want clients to recognize that we are part of the same group, but we are also open to the idea of seeing something completely new or redone.\r\nV.I.C. Pet Dental Spa provides non-anesthesia pet dental cleanings for dogs and cats (mainly dogs) in and around the Tampa Bay area in Florida. Anesthesia-free dental cleaning for pets is a preventative care procedure that helps ensure the health and well being of the pets mouth when scheduled once or twice a year. With calming and soothing techniques, we are able to relax the pet to ensure they are comfortable and pain free without using any medication. THIS IS NOT A MEDICAL PROCEDURE. It is more similar to grooming services.\r\nFor additional information, please visit our Non-anesthesia dental page at: https://vicpetcare.com/pet-care-services/non-anesthesia-dentals/\r\nAttached will be the V.I.C. Pet Care logo so that you can take the color scheme and imagery and create a rebranded design for V.I.C. Pet Dental Spa logo. But as mentioned above, if you feel you can create a much better logo than the V.I.C. Pet Care, please be inspired to do so.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646595336496041985','-',7,'United States','Tampa',300.000,'Open this select menu',300.000,'2023-04-13',1,'2023-04-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-13 19:26:18',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
