(18566,'Refresh our company logo!',10,'14 year old company is looking to refresh a boring logo! Our name evokes the standard STOP sign, but we\'re very interested in looking at new imaginings of our logo.\r\n\r\nPlease see attached \"working logos\" .jpg file. We are locked in on our Certified Backflow Testing (CBT) new logo - love the colors and tree image.\r\n\r\nOpen to incorporating that tree on 2B, using 2 trees instead of 3 per side. Also open to moving \"Seattle Tacoma Olympia\" up and outside of the hexagon, and \"Plumbing\" outside the hex at the base, leaving the words STOP INC. stacked and above the mountain.\r\n\r\nOpen to changing the colors to reflect the same blue and greens from CBT logo - it doesn\'t have to be red, but we\'d like to see the logo in red if changing colors.\r\n\r\nWe are also open to incorporating other imagery other than mountain and trees - perhaps pipe wrenches, pipes. See attached files Logoelements1, 2, 3, 4\r\n\r\nCurrent logo .jpg is attached, but we don\'t have the original files so you\'re starting from scratch.\r\n\r\nNew logo will be used on website, email signatures, and on uniforms.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646599184517029889','-',7,'United States','Tacoma',800.000,'Open this select menu',800.000,'2023-04-13',1,'2023-04-13',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-13 19:41:32',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
