(18587,'Experienced MEDICAL VIRTUAL ASSISTANT wanted. WOMEN\'S health',22,'We are a Women\'s Health Clinic looking for a dynamic and experienced healthcare virtual assistant to answer our busy phone lines.\r\nMust have EXPERIENCE with US doctor\'s office.\r\n_______________________________________________\r\n\r\nTHIS IS MANDATORY.\r\n\r\nMinimum 3 years experience required.\r\nWe need your expertise!\r\nJob description includes:\r\nAnswer busy telephone lines\r\nIntake of new patients and referrals.\r\nAppointment setting — scheduling, managing cancelations, and sending reminders.\r\nOrganizing files in your database.\r\nFollow ups and checking on patients after appointments.\r\nPrescription refills.\r\nEmail management — responding to messages and cleaning your inbox.\r\nProcedure scheduling.\r\n\r\nHours are Monday to Friday, 8am to 5pm\r\n\r\nOur ideal candidate would be someone who pays attention to detail and can multi-task when required. If you feel you have what it takes to do this job, we are eager to meet you. Please send your resume with a cover letter. In your response, you must include the phrase \"ready for work\" in your first sentence. We look forward to meeting you as soon as possible.\r\n\r\nTake care,\r\nMandy.\r\nOffice Manager','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646609831624790017','-',7,'United States','Columbia',5.000,'Open this select menu',18.000,'2023-04-13',1,'2023-04-13',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-13 20:40:26',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
