(18632,'Branding Designer (Clean, Modern, and Minimalist Design)',2,'Hi there,\r\n\r\nI\'m seeking a talented Branding Designer to create a style guide and templates that will help establish a clean, modern, and minimalist brand identity for my digital products brand.\r\n\r\nYou will be responsible for creating a style guide that defines a visual identity, including logo, color palette, typography, imagery, and graphic elements. You will also design templates for marketing materials, invitations, planners, social media kits, and other digital products. Your focus will be on creating clean, modern, and minimalist designs that are aesthetically pleasing.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Develop a style guide that defines our visual identity, including our logo, color palette, typography, imagery, and graphic elements.\r\n- Design templates for our marketing materials, invitations, planners, social media kits, and other digital products.\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\n- Experience in branding and design.\r\n- Strong portfolio that showcases your branding and design skills, with an emphasis on clean, modern and minimalist designs.\r\n- Excellent skills in Adobe Creative Suite, including Illustrator, Photoshop, and InDesign.\r\n- Experience with Canva is preferred but not mandatory.\r\n- Strong understanding of typography, color theory, and layout design.\r\n\r\nIf you are a talented and experienced Designer with a passion for creating clean, modern, and minimalist designs, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity.\r\n\r\n\r\nHOW TO APPLY?\r\n\r\nTo be considered please include examples of your work.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01754be750d0de1121','-',7,'United States','West Palm Beach',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-04-14',1,'2023-04-14',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-14 10:29:57',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
