(18635,'Graphic Designer - Image Enhancement',2,'This is a fully Remote Role and the candidate can be located anywhere in the world. \r\n\r\nExpected Availability: Monday to Friday, 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM Eastern Time (US & Canada)\r\n\r\nThe expected workload will be between 20-25 hours per week.\r\n\r\nNOTE: There may be some work on some weekends also.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a highly skilled Graphic Designer with specialization in Image Enhancement and Image Re-engineering to support various Email Marketing Campaigns.\r\n\r\n\r\nNOTE: You will not be designing the creatives from scratch. Rather, you will be provided with the creative in PDF or JPEG or PNG, and you may need to make minor changes to the image layout, text layout (inside the images), column widths etc. You will also need to enhance the quality of the image to make it look more crisp and clear.\r\n\r\n\r\nSkills\r\n\r\nProficient in graphic design software such as:\r\n\r\n    Adobe Illustrator\r\n    Adobe Photoshop\r\n    Adobe InDesign\r\n\r\n\r\nThe candidate must have proven experience in image enhancement and re-engineering, which includes the following activities.\r\n\r\n    Convert high-resolution PDF creatives to PNG or JPEG image formats without loss of quality.\r\n    Enhance the quality of existing images (JPEG, PNG and other formats)\r\n\r\n\r\nNote that the master width of the email is 650px in all email campaigns. Therefore, the output images will need to be small enough to fit inside the 650px master width and yet have very good clarity, quality and should not be fuzzy or hazy.\r\n\r\n\r\nTurnaround Time: This is VERY IMPORTANT, as our email campaigns must go out within short notice of 6 hours from the time the creative is received. So the Graphic Designer will need to provide a turnaround time of 2 hours per image.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a long-term person, so candidates that provide good quality outputs in the first few months can expect to receive continued work.\r\n\r\n\r\nQuotes: Please provide your best hourly rate.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2033007','https://trello.com/c/pYoHQh17/2353-image-enhancementvikramtaslim-rabia',162,'United States','abc',700.000,'fixed',700.000,'2023-04-14',1,'2023-04-14',1,'NA',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-04-14 10:43:17','2023-04-27 13:02:45',17,1,NULL,152),
