(18679,'Design Branded Slide Template for Smart Habit',11,'Job-to-be-done: design a branded slide template for my company.\r\n\r\nCompatible with PPT and Google Slides.\r\n\r\nHow slide template will be used:\r\n- internal presentations and board\r\n- sales presentations\r\n- training workshops\r\n\r\nHow we work together:\r\nCollaboratively. You provide design expertise. I will provide specific feedback to make it right for our company.\r\n\r\n# of versions: multiple to get started, then we\'d narrow it down.\r\n\r\nCriteria:\r\n- Use existing logo and brand color palette\r\n- Refer to sample docs\r\n- Use circles and high-resolution pictures of people working\r\n\r\nDesign preferences:\r\n- modern, lots of white space\r\n- relatively simple and clean\r\n\r\nSee the attached examples:\r\n- Own Your Workday ebook - lots of whitespace, strategic use of circles which represent moments of opportunity\r\n- Participant Guide - white space, brand colors, strategic use of high-resolution photos of people\r\n\r\nFonts: Comforttaa OR Montserrat; I\'m open to input\r\n\r\nTimeline: complete by Fri, April 21st\r\n\r\nIf we work together well, there will be more work.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01c0632aa12a86840b','-',7,'United States','Palm Beach Gardens',75.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-14',1,'2023-04-14',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-14 15:51:31',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
