(18684,'Graphic design of bread box packaging',2,'Currently I need custom designed packaging for the bread box. I guess it should be carton box with natural carton color but nice print on it, but feel free to suggest your ideas\r\n\r\nMy idea is that this box should have the following:\r\n\r\n- some kind of graphics to understand what is inside the box and what is the purpose (Perhaps just the name is enough)\r\n\r\n- Font and graphics color (dark brown or dark gray)\r\n\r\n- I would like to add somewhere (not necessarily in the middle) a colored sticker (as on the reference with boxes showing flowers) of green color (as on the reference with an egg stand). You can also offer other colors.\r\n\r\n- The text or graphics on a colored sticker is probably better to make white\r\n\r\n- it is mandatory to have sign in box saying Made in China\r\n\r\n- the size of the box 44cm x 33cm x 19,5cm\r\n\r\n- My logo\r\n\r\nReference of bread box is attached for you to understand what will be the product.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0166337adf1731e46f','-',7,'United States','Dubai',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-04-14',1,'2023-04-14',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-14 16:13:21',NULL,18,3,NULL,146),
