(18730,'Bookkeeper for Digital Marketing Agency',39,'Digital Delane, a fast-growing digital marketing agency, is seeking a skilled and detail-oriented bookkeeper to join our team. The successful candidate will be responsible for maintaining accurate financial records, managing accounts payable and receivable, reconciling bank statements, and preparing financial reports. This is a remote position, and the candidate must be able to work independently, meet deadlines, and communicate effectively with team members.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Manage all bookkeeping duties, including recording daily transactions, reconciling bank statements, and preparing financial reports\r\n- Manage accounts payable and receivable, ensuring timely and accurate payments and collections\r\n- Manage employee payroll and related taxes\r\n- Provide financial analysis and recommendations to the management team\r\n- Ensure compliance with financial regulations and internal policies\r\nWork collaboratively with team members to manage cash flow and financial forecasting\r\n- Maintain accurate and up-to-date records of all financial transactions\r\n- Respond to inquiries from clients, vendors, and team members regarding financial matters\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience as a bookkeeper or in a similar role\r\n- Knowledge of generally accepted accounting principles and procedures\r\n- Proficient in QuickBooks and Microsoft Excel\r\n- Strong attention to detail and accuracy\r\n- Excellent organizational and time management skills\r\n- Strong communication and interpersonal skills\r\n- Ability to work independently and meet deadlines\r\n- Bachelor\'s degree in Accounting or Finance preferred\r\n\r\nThis is a part-time position, with the potential to become full-time based on performance and company growth. If you are a highly motivated individual with a passion for finance and bookkeeping, and are looking for an exciting opportunity to grow with a fast-paced digital marketing agency, we encourage you to apply for this position.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646942941603028993','-',7,'United States','Los Angeles',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-14',1,'2023-04-14',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-14 19:12:10',NULL,11,3,NULL,155),
