(18795,'Urgent Logo Designer Needed for Charles Walter Equipment',10,'Charles Walter Equipment is seeking an experienced and talented logo designer to create a logo for our lawn care tools manufacturing and sales company. We are looking for someone who can deliver high-quality work within a tight deadline, as we need the logo completed within the next couple of days.\r\n\r\nAbout Our Company:\r\n\r\nCharles Walter Equipment specializes in manufacturing and selling lawn care tools in the United States. Our products are known for their quality, durability, and performance, which we want to reflect in our logo. The logo will be a simple yet powerful design featuring the letters \"CW\" as the primary element.\r\n\r\nJob Requirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience in logo design, preferably with a strong portfolio\r\nshowcasing previous work\r\n- Excellent graphic design skills, including proficiency in Adobe\r\nIllustrator or other vector design software\r\n- Strong communication skills, with the ability to understand our vision\r\nand requirements\r\n- Ability to work under tight deadlines and deliver the final logo within\r\nthe next couple of days\r\n- Experience in designing logos for similar industries or products is a\r\nplus\r\n\r\nJob Responsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Collaborate with our team to understand the company\'s vision,\r\nproducts, and target audience\r\n- Create a unique and memorable logo design featuring the letters\r\n\"CW\" as the primary element\r\n- Provide multiple design concepts for review and discussion\r\n- Revise and refine the chosen design based on our feedback\r\n- Deliver the final logo in a variety of file formats, including vector and\r\nhigh-resolution raster images\r\n\r\nWe look forward to reviewing your application and collaborating with you on this exciting project. Thank you for your interest in working with Charles Walter Equipment!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1647941998719344641','-',7,'United States','Leicester',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-04-17',1,'2023-04-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-17 12:39:18',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
(18796,'Need Thumbnail Designer For Youtube Channels',2,'We are seeking a talented and creative YouTube Thumbnail Designer to join our team. As a YouTube Thumbnail Designer, you will be responsible for designing eye-catching and engaging thumbnails for our YouTube videos.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDesign visually compelling thumbnails that effectively communicate the video\'s content and attract viewers to click on our videos.\r\nResearch the types of thumbnails used on the most popular videos in our niche and model them for our designs.\r\nCollaborate with our video content creators to ensure that the thumbnail accurately reflects the video\'s content and message.\r\nStay up-to-date with the latest trends and best practices for YouTube thumbnails and incorporate them into our designs.\r\nManage and organize a large number of thumbnails for various videos and ensure that they are consistently high-quality and visually appealing.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nAt least 1 year of experience in graphic design or a related field.\r\nStrong proficiency in Adobe Creative Suite (specifically Photoshop and Illustrator).\r\nExcellent eye for detail and design, with a strong understanding of composition, color, and typography.\r\nFamiliarity with YouTube and its community and an understanding of what types of thumbnails are most effective at driving views and engagement.\r\nAbility to work collaboratively with other team members and communicate effectively.\r\n\r\nIf you are a creative and detail-oriented individual with a passion for YouTube and design, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity.\r\n\r\nTo Assess your level of expertise, please design a youtube Thumbnail for the topic \"How King Salman Travels in Luxury\". You can place a water mark on the design, we just want to know your graphic design skills and creative. This is the only way we can assess how creative you are.\r\n\r\nOur Budget for this is $15 per thumbnail for 30 thumbnails.\r\n\r\nP.S: 