erstood ) in the subject so i know you have read and understand and your qualified for this job other wise ill ignore any message dont have this secret word\r\n\r\n\r\nKindly if you dont agree to terms you have read here dont waste your time or mine and apply\r\n\r\nI prefer to work with someone who is an subject matter expert.\r\n\r\nBest of luck','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1646856088861032449','-',7,'United States','Riyadh',1000.000,'fixed',850.000,'2023-04-17',1,'2023-04-17',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-17 13:34:31',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
