(18827,'Book cover Design for self improvement book',2,'Title: Book Cover Design for Self-Improvement Book\r\nDescription:\r\nI am looking for a talented graphic designer to create a professional book cover for my upcoming self-improvement book titled \"You Versus You: Solutions for Winning the War Versus Yourself\". The book is about overcoming self-sabotage, conquering self-doubt, and achieving success.\r\nThe cover should be eye-catching and visually appealing, with a modern and sleek design that appeals to a wide audience. I am open to different design styles and ideas, but I prefer a clean and minimalist look with bold typography and vibrant colors.\r\nHere are some key requirements for the book cover:\r\n• Title: \"You Versus You: Solutions for Winning the War Versus Yourself\"\r\n• Author name: William Toth\r\n• Dimensions: Traditional\r\n• Format: Print and eBook (PDF)\r\n• Colors: Vibrant and eye-catching, with a clean and minimalist design\r\n• Images: If you decide to use an image, please ensure it\'s copyright-free and relevant to the theme of the book\r\nTo apply for this job, please provide:\r\n• A portfolio of your previous book cover designs\r\n• Your creative vision for the book cover\r\n• Your estimated timeline and budget for this project\r\nI am looking for a designer who is creative, professional, and has a keen eye for detail. If you have any questions, please feel free to ask.\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1647979385708150785?success','-',7,'United States','Sarasota',150.000,'perhour',150.000,'2023-04-17',1,'2023-04-17',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-17 15:06:29',NULL,19,3,NULL,123),
