(18857,'LOGO DESIGN SOCIALNICITY',10,'OTJMedia., LLC is seeking a contractor to design a unique logo for a new African American social media website and mobile app named SOCIALNICITY. It’s important to consider the cultural significance and symbolism associated with African American history and identity: Here are some of the guides to follow when submitting a design:\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n    Research: It is important to do research on African American history and culture to understand better the symbolism and significance of various images and colors.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n    Cultural Sensitivity: Ensure that the design is culturally sensitive and respectful. Avoid using stereotypical or offensive imagery.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n    Colors: Use colors that are culturally relevant and meaningful to the African American community. For example, red, black, and green are often used in African American flags and symbolize the struggle for freedom and unity.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n    Symbolism: Incorporate symbols representing African American culture and history, such as the African continent, the Black Panther, the fist of solidarity, and the civil rights movement.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n    Typography: Choose typography that is clear and legible. It should also be culturally relevant and meaningful, such as using Afrocentric fonts or designs.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n    Purpose: Keep the purpose of the logo in mind. The logo should be unique and memorable and effectively communicate the message or identity of the organization or business it represents.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThe contractor must submit at least 5 different and unique logo designs. The final LOGO should have source code including all formats, including jpeg, gifs, ai. etc etc\r\n\r\n\r\n*Preference will be given to African Americans and people of color designers.\r\nAttachments','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2055726','-',7,'United States','-',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-04-17',1,'2023-04-17',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-17 16:55:50',NULL,16,1,NULL,136),
