(18866,'Logo Animation and Design',8,'I would like to take the Existing Logo(s) and create a new version with some subtle differences.\r\n\r\nversion os the Current Logo are attached.\r\nBackground: Kitchen Supper Club is a high end dining experience. We are open two days a week (Friday and Saturday) and serve guests in our small restaurant in Beacon NY. This is a Tasting Menu Restaurant and all seats are communal. You can get a feel for he vibe at our website: kitchensinkny.com\r\n\r\nAssignment:\r\nWe are going to open the backyard patio for the summer and would like to \"rebrand\" this portion of our restaurant from Kitchen Sink Supper Club to the Kitchen Sink Summer Club.\r\n\r\nI would like to take our additional logo and have the following animations added...\r\nI would like to \"drop\" the PP in Supper Club and replace this with MM to create a new logo... Kitchen Sink Summer Club.\r\n\r\nThe Supper Club is a very formal, higher end dining experience that happens on Friday and Saturday evenings.\r\n\r\nThe Summer Club is an informal - sort of grilling and chilling type of vibe that is only open on Sundays.\r\n\r\nPerhaps we keep the gold in the logo and drop the formal dark blue as we look to have the \"summer club\" feel less formal and lighter and more fun.\r\n\r\nOne idea I have is that the circle around the original idea starts to rotate, first slowly, then it picks up speed. as this happens the letters somehow change...','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648009199770316801','-',7,'United States','Beacon',50.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-17',1,'2023-04-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-17 17:07:21',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
