(18893,'Create a PPT and letterhead template for MS office & 365',3,'Job Title: PowerPoint and Letterhead Template Designer\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\nWe are seeking a skilled PowerPoint and Letterhead Template Designer to create a set of professional templates for our company. The successful candidate will be responsible for designing and formatting templates using the color scheme and logo provided by us.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nCreate a set of PowerPoint and letterhead templates based on the color scheme and logo provided.\r\nDesign visually appealing templates that are professional, modern and on-brand.\r\nEnsure that all templates are easily editable and user-friendly.\r\nOrganize and label templates in a clear and concise manner for easy navigation.\r\nIncorporate necessary font styles and sizes for consistency.\r\nEnsure that all templates are compatible with Microsoft Office software.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience in designing and formatting PowerPoint and letterhead templates.\r\nStrong design skills with a portfolio of past work to demonstrate.\r\nFamiliarity with Microsoft Office software and its capabilities.\r\nExcellent attention to detail and organizational skills.\r\nAbility to work independently and manage deadlines effectively.\r\nStrong communication and collaboration skills.\r\nKnowledge of graphic design principles and color theory.\r\nAbility to incorporate branding elements into design work.\r\n\r\nIf you meet the above requirements and are confident in your ability to create high-quality templates, we would love to hear from you. Please submit your resume, portfolio, and any relevant experience for our consideration.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648050824918253569','-',7,'United States','Hollywood',45.000,'Open this select menu',45.000,'2023-04-17',1,'2023-04-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-17 19:49:43',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
