(18976,'Bookkeeper for Cleaning Business',39,'We are looking for a long term bookkeeper for our busy cleaning service. We have an established QBO file recently maintained by our accountant. They have changed their offerings and now only offer minimal annual bookkeeping, and we prefer monthly books with a bit more detail so we can accurately understand our business and budget.\r\n\r\nWe need someone who thinks outside the box and is very technically inclined. All of our sales run through Jobber, and Jobber does not sync well with QBO so we have 2 methods to work around that.\r\n\r\nWe need our bookkeeper to be the expert, rather than us being the trainer and finding the solutions.\r\n\r\nWe will go through everything and explain our banking system, provide a list of common purchases and categories, explain payroll (we do this), and explain how to carry sales from Jobber to QBO based on the past methods and hope our new bookkeeper can be innovative and accurate.\r\n\r\nIf you have experience with Jobber please note that.\r\n\r\nLooking to start soon, our books are only a couple months out of date (Feb is done). But, a recently hired bookkeeper may have done a bit of March that is likely inconsistent with everything else.\r\n\r\nLooking for a long term working relationship and willing to settle on an eventual flat monthly rate.\r\n\r\nWe prefer to communicate via WhatsApp and email:)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648337274392285185?success','-',7,'United States','Spruce Grove 0',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-04-18',1,'2023-04-18',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-18 14:49:40',NULL,19,3,NULL,123),
