(18983,'Creative UX/UI App Developer required for Innovative Children’s Learning App',6,'We are seeking a talented UX/UI app developer to join our team at Tandem. We aim to develop an interactive app designed for parents and children to play, learn and create together using generative AI. The vision for the app is to transform passive screen time into an active, development-focused and joyful interaction. The content is tailored to be developmentally appropriate and designed for interactive play. Our goal is to solve the problem of toddlers spending more time looking at screens than interacting with their parents.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n* Design & Implement user-friendly interfaces for our app\r\n* Work closely with our product team to understand the functional requirements of the app\r\n* Translate functional requirements into intuitive and engaging user experiences\r\n* Design different modes of use: solo play by child, parent/child together, and parent alone\r\n* Create a navigation UI that shows differences between kid mode, parent mode, and tandem mode\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n* Experience in UX/UI design for mobile apps\r\n* Strong understanding of user-centered design principles\r\n* Ability to work collaboratively with cross-functional teams\r\n* Passion for creating engaging user experiences\r\n* Desire to make a positive impact on children’s development\r\n\r\nWe have screen mock-ups in miro that we would share as a starting point for the discussion. We want to rapidly prototype in Figma and then build out an MVP of the app with which to test the market.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648348329705861121','-',7,'United States','Pietermaritzburg',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-04-18',1,'2023-04-18',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-18 15:31:56',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
