(19038,'PowerPoint Visual Designer for Investment Firm',11,'We are an investment firm seeking a PowerPoint visual designer to upgrade the design of our existing slides. We have a set of slides that we use for investor presentations and internal meetings that we would like to improve by making them more visually appealing while still maintaining a professional and sleek look.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should have experience in visual design and a good understanding of how to use company colors to create a cohesive look and feel. The candidate should also have experience working with PowerPoint and be able to provide examples of previous work that demonstrate their design skills.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n-Upgrade the visual design of existing PowerPoint slides based on company colors and branding guidelines.\r\n-Create a consistent look and feel across all slides.\r\n-Use visual elements such as icons and images to enhance the overall design of the slides.\r\n-Ensure that the design is professional, sleek, and not too overwhelming.\r\n-Work closely with the investment team to understand the message and content of each slide.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n-Strong visual design skills and experience working with PowerPoint.\r\n-Experience working with investment firms or financial companies is a plus.\r\n-Familiarity with brand guidelines and how to use company colors to create a cohesive look and feel.\r\n-Attention to detail and ability to work efficiently and meet deadlines.\r\n-Excellent communication skills and ability to work collaboratively with the investment team.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this position, please provide examples of your previous work and let us know why you would be a good fit for this project. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648372173999616001','-',7,'United States','New York',50.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-18',1,'2023-04-18',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-18 17:06:28',