(19039,'Kick-ass Landing Page Designer Needed - Using Zipify',2,'Please read the job post in its entirety.\r\n\r\nNO APPLICANTS FROM INDIA/PAKISTAN PLEASE! THIS IS NOT DEVELOPER WORK! :)\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a talented and experienced landing page designer to join our team and help us create high converting landing pages for our Shopify store using Zipify. The ideal candidate will have a proven track record of designing and building landing pages that drive conversions and sales for expensive products.\r\n\r\nAs our landing page designer, you will work closely with our marketing and product teams to develop landing pages that are visually stunning, on-brand, and optimized for conversion. You will be responsible for creating a seamless user experience that guides potential customers through the sales funnel, ultimately leading to a purchase.\r\n\r\nKey responsibilities:\r\n- Design and build high converting landing pages for our Shopify store using Zipify.\r\n- Work closely with our marketing and product teams to ensure landing pages are on-brand and optimized for conversion.\r\n- Create a seamless user experience that guides potential customers through the sales funnel.\r\n- Continuously optimize landing pages based on performance metrics and customer feedback.\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n- 3+ years of experience in landing page design and development.\r\n- Expertise in Zipify and Shopify.\r\n- Strong understanding of UX/UI best practices and principles.\r\n- Proven track record of creating landing pages that drive conversions and sales.\r\n- Excellent communication skills and ability to work collaboratively with cross-functional teams.\r\n\r\nBONUS:\r\n- If you build a landing page that beats our current conversion rate, we will give you a bonus of $1,000! Please type the word bonus in all caps at the beginning of your application. This is so we know you\'ve read thoroughly and details matter to you.\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit your resume and a portfolio of your past work that showcases your expertise in landing page design and development. Only applicants with a strong portfolio will be considered for this role.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re passionate about creating high converting landing pages and have a track record of success in this area, we would love to hear from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648374742597103617?success','-',7,'United States','Shelbyville',50.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-04-18',1,'2023-04-18',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-18 17:23:48',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
