(19043,'Contracted Healthcare Writer',37,'About Us\r\n\r\nWe are a leading provider of advanced analytics, technology solutions, and research services to the healthcare industry.\r\nFormed through the combination of world-class data scientists and nationally recognized healthcare leaders, Cogitativo applies Precision Health Data Science—leveraging analytical rigor, operating expertise, and proven machine learning techniques to the ever-expanding scope of human health science.\r\nWe empower our clients to reimagine and develop new actionable approaches to clinical delivery, operational process improvement, the pace of innovation, and accelerate improvements in healthcare outcomes.\r\nSince our inception, Cogitativo has successfully applied machine learning solutions to over 200 unique client challenges.\r\n--\r\n\r\nThis is a remote role. We\'re looking for a contract Content Writer (10 hours per week/mid-April until the end of September) to join our Content Team.\r\n\r\nThe Cogitativo Content team is focused on empowering client members with guidance, insights, and connections to make the most out of their data to enhance the patient experience.\r\nYou will play a vital role in creating health-specific editorial content.\r\nYou\'ll also work cross-functionally with marketing, data science, product team members, and internal and external expert sources as needed.\r\n\r\nWhat you\'ll do:\r\n\r\nWork closely with the SVP of Marketing to manage day-to-day content creation, including writing pieces and approving content. Collaboratively source stories and conduct interviews to create case studies. Update and refresh older content as needed. Work closely with external agencies to produce high-quality, SEO-optimized content.\r\n\r\nRequirements\r\n\r\nFive to Seven years of writing and editing experience in the health and wellness space\r\nEagerness to learn and understand the ins and outs of data science and healthcare.\r\n\r\nHigh level of empathy for the target user/member/reader.\r\n\r\nExcellent communication skills, both written and verbal.\r\n\r\nAn appreciation for the big-picture content strategy with a sharp eye for strategic storytelling.\r\n-----','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648386009673302017','-',7,'United States','Berkeley',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-04-18',1,'2023-04-18',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-18 18:10:14',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
