(19140,'Need 5 Logos Designed',10,'Hi, I have five different groups/entities for which I need logos designed.  I\'d like at least three options for each entity.\r\n\r\n1) The Austin Exchange- this is a social club for leaders in Austin\'s finance and investment community.  Logo should probably invoke money, a stock exchange and/or trading.\r\n\r\n2) The Economic Club of Texas- this is a club for business leaders in Texas to discuss economic/social issues with peers.  Logo can be pretty basic.\r\n\r\n3) Austin Merchant Bank (AMB)- this is a business that provides financial/investment advice and other services to extremely wealthy individuals and corporations.  Logo should be understated and give a sense of prestige and discretion.\r\n\r\n4) The Contrarian Convention- this is an event/retreat that celebrates contrarian thinking and promotes unconventional analysis and solutions to the world\'s problems.  Open to ideas on the logo.\r\n\r\n5) Cosmic Viking- this is a yet-to-be-launched consumer brand.  The logo needs to combine an upside-down trident and the letters CM (see attachment for first draft).','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01c8bb2ad9dac30311','-',7,'United States','Rollingwood',45.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-04-19',1,'2023-04-19',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-19 11:40:38',NULL,18,3,NULL,146),
