(19142,'Trademark Logo Design',10,'The words should say \"Silver Cougar Esthetician\"  I envision a female cougar with the words \"Silver Cougar Esthetician\" as if the cougar was lying on it\'s side (see picture).  The tail of the cougar would be an Esthetician brush (see picture).  I like how the example of the Silver Fox Squad incorporated the fox in the word silver (see picture).  It doesn\'t necessarily have to be a cougar, but I want the words \"Silver Cougar Esthetician\" to depict a cougar.  I want the cougar to look feminine or the words to look feminine, perhaps with eyelashes, whiskers, cougar eyes and the tail that lifts up over the words with the grace of a feline with the esthetician brush on the end as if the brush painted Sliver Cougar Esthetician.  I plan to use this design on social media as the profile pic, t-shirts, cups, mugs and pens. I would like to trademark this as well.\r\n\r\nI\'m good with checking email and providing feedback in a timely manner.  I\'m very professional and I\'m taking this project very seriously.  This is the next phase of my life and career and I\'m very excited!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01765d03d419368f7b','-',7,'United States','-',50.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-04-19',1,'2023-04-19',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-19 12:04:01',NULL,18,3,NULL,146),
