(19145,'Update an existing logo to a more modern hand-drawn design',10,'Hi,\r\n\r\nI would like to update my existing logos (a full one and a short one), into a more modern, hand-drawn-looking style. The logo shouldn\'t change overall drastically, it just needs to update so it wouldn\'t create confusion.\r\nIn a sense, viewers should recognize that it\'s the old logo updated looking much more professional.\r\n\r\nHere is the link to the logos https://www.dropbox.com/sh/edv7wh78coqhosp/AAAcyGNQ4c35XjwW8t_pGFYAa?dl=0\r\n\r\nAnd here is the link to the styles of illustrations I really like (so would love for the logo to have a similar feel to it)\r\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/sh/kavz54qqyfhc4by/AAAWdIR0nU6vB2R9p6g8lNW4a?dl=0\r\n\r\nAlso, you should add a tagline beneath (or wherever you think it would work best) the logo \"Explainer Videos Done Right!\"\r\nAll items must be in separate layers so I can animate them if needed.\r\n\r\nPrice is a placeholder, I\'m willing to pay more for a professional design.\r\n\r\nSend me your portfolio with similar items,\r\nand please don\'t send me already done logos, as I will pay only for the one I hire, so don\'t waste your time.\r\n\r\nTo know that you read this and are not a bot\r\nwrite: \"Live long and prosper!\" at the beginning of your proposal\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\nAny questions, just shoot.\r\n- Edvard','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648661494476120065','-',7,'United States','Subotica',200.000,'perhour',200.000,'2023-04-19',1,'2023-04-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-19 12:16:19',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
