(19148,'Wireframing an innovative law firm website',3,'I am a lawyer and the founder of a law firm specialised in conflict resolution and dispute avoidance.\r\n\r\nOne of our USPs should be an innovative and user-friendly approach towards delivering legal services. Our goal is to make law easy to access. To that end, we want to use design to make the law transparent, user friendly and easy to understand. I would like to demonstrate our innovative and user-friendly approach through the website\'s design, layout, and user experience. This should include using easy-to-understand language, intuitive navigation, and engaging visual elements.\r\n\r\nI already have an idea for the copy and a rough structure of the website, but I am not a UX/web-design expert myself. Therefore, in a next step, I would like to get professional feedback on my ideas and turn them into a wireframe. I may also need help with the full web design later on, but for now the task is limited to the basic structural/navigational/UX elements, including a full wireframe, that may serve as the basis for the design stage.\r\n\r\nIf you want to help transforming the legal industry with good design, I look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nIf you have an additional expertise in branding, that’s a plus, but not a necessary requirement. I have already some groundwork on branding (brand archetypes, logo etc).\r\n\r\nIf your hourly rate is higher than the indicated range, feel free to make me an offer nonetheless, I will consider all offers.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648667327882457089','-',7,'United States','Vienna',50.000,'Open this select menu',48.000,'2023-04-19',1,'2023-04-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-19 12:39:57',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
