(19182,'Creative Pitch Deck Designer Needed for High-Impact Sales Presentation',11,'We are looking for a highly creative and talented pitch deck designer to create an engaging and visually stunning sales presentation for our rapidly growing digital marketing agency, DF Digitals. Our agency specializes in helping roofing contractors generate more sales by implementing our proven lead-generation strategies.\r\n\r\nAs a Pitch Deck Designer, you will be responsible for creating a compelling and visually appealing presentation that clearly communicates our unique value proposition and the benefits of partnering with our agency. The presentation will be used during sales calls with potential clients, so it should be persuasive, professional, and easy to understand.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nCollaborate with our team to understand our unique value proposition and the key benefits we offer to our clients\r\nDesign a visually stunning pitch deck that effectively communicates our services and differentiators in a persuasive manner\r\nEnsure the pitch deck is engaging, easy to follow, and supports our sales team in closing deals with potential clients\r\nIncorporate our branding elements, including colors, fonts, and logos, into the pitch deck design\r\nRevise and iterate the design based on feedback from our team\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience in creating high-impact pitch decks, preferably for digital marketing agencies or B2B service providers\r\nStrong graphic design skills with a keen eye for aesthetics and visually appealing content\r\nExcellent communication skills and the ability to understand and convey complex ideas visually\r\nProficiency in PowerPoint, Keynote, or other presentation design software\r\nAbility to work independently and meet deadlines\r\nTo apply, please submit your resume, a link to your portfolio showcasing your pitch deck designs, and a brief description of your experience creating pitch decks for sales presentations.\r\n\r\nWe are excited to find the right candidate to help us elevate our sales presentation and close more deals with potential clients. If you believe you have the creativity, skills, and experience to make a significant impact, we\'d love to hear from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648701654712315905','-',7,'United States','Swansea',50.000,'perhour',48.000,'2023-04-19',1,'2023-04-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-19 14:55:38',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
