(19189,'PC045 | Consultative approach needed for PPT deck design + cleanup',11,'Scope of Work\r\nAn enterprise client in the food and beverage industry is seeking a freelancer skilled in strategic PowerPoint deck story-telling, design and cleanup to help them with a large deck. The deck will be about 60-75 slides in length and is mostly storyboarded and mapped out. It will be presented to a senior leadership team and will be presenting data, market research, and visual concepts around a marketing + packaging concept. The freelancer should be strategic and consultative in their approach so they can provide insight where needed. Most of the project will be building out slides from multiple data points, cleanup, design work, and edits. However, the client also needs someone who can understand basic marketing and P&L concepts (i.e. gross margin), who can point out gaps in the research if there are any, and who can think through strategic visual storytelling when creating their designs.\r\n\r\nThe client will provide the current working deck, all of the branding and brand guidelines the freelancer should use, and all of the content needed. The freelancer should be able to overlap at least partially with EST for edits, reviews, and “in the moment” feedback. The freelancer should be able to deliver the final edited deck of about 60-75 slides on or before May 12, 2023. The client has future needs similar to this, and if all goes well would like to re-engage the freelancer for similar projects in the pipeline.\r\n\r\nNote that the budget you see listed is a placeholder only. Please provide a bid based on the description above. The bid or hourly rate you provide with your proposal should include any and all fees and costs of doing business.\r\n\r\nAs you go through the proposal process with this client, please keep in mind the confidentiality agreement in section 15 of the Upwork User Agreement. Note that any and all information received from or about this client is subject to the confidentiality agreement and may not be disclosed to anyone.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648709860413583361','-',7,'United States','Santa Clara',4000.000,'fixed',4000.000,'2023-04-19',1,'2023-04-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-19 15:28:03',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
