(19216,'Bookkeepers With 3 Years Desktop Quickbooks Experience',39,'Hello\r\n\r\nWe need typists/data entry experts and bookkeepers a minimum of 5 hours a day, Mon-Fri, from 10 am EST - 5 pm EST. The time is FIRM and not negotiable. Please note that we DO NOT work with agencies or companies! All consultant agreements will be in an individual name only. The bulk of the task will involve the following:\r\n\r\n1. Being able to look at data in one Excel spreadsheet to fill in data into a different spreadsheet.\r\n2. Look up the proper spelling of businesses\' names on Google, etc.\r\n3. Look up data in Desktop Quickbooks to key the results on the spreadsheet.\r\n4. Reconciling Desktop Quickbooks Transactions Manually With Financial Statements\r\n\r\nWe take our licenses seriously so you will NEVER handle any CPA or Attorney level work!\r\n\r\nPlease only reply if you have extensive experience with U.S. CPA Firms, Bank Statements, and Desktop Quickbooks! This includes reading them and being able to reconcile them manually. This project works directly with seasoned US CPAs and Lawyers, so they will know instantly if you do not have experience. Since this environment is very fast-paced and handles a lot of data, we are trying to avoid wasting anyone\'s time.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, this is why many of our reviews are negative. We have had many people in the past apply. Past hires have stated they could do the work but then realized they don\'t have the required experience after one day. So out of respect, we no longer work with freelancers who are NOT able to provide a US CPA as a reference. Please apply if you have worked with US Bank Statements, Credit Card Statements, and Merchant Statements and worked with every part of Desktop Quickbooks for at least 3 years. We will not allow Online Quickbooks to substitute this requirement.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, this project is only for individuals who are not with an AGENCY! Individuals should be able to confirm before they apply that they can type 50WPM or above and have native or advanced English speaking and writing skills. These two items will be tested for you to be considered. In an effort for you to test yourself for free to ensure that when you apply, you qualify, please test yourself!\r\n\r\nAgain, we thank you in advance for your consideration and look forward to speaking to you further should you feel your skills and education qualify you to apply.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648764613738438657?success','-',7,'United States','Atlanta',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-19',1,'2023-04-19',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-19 19:06:15',NULL,19,3,NULL,123),
