(19219,'Accountant/ Bookkeeper',39,'For two companies with different owners, one manager the same:\r\nWe need:\r\n1. Company One -- Bookkeeping for a medical group with $10 million in gross receipts, 5-6 owners, 10 providers, and 30-34 employees, to include:\r\na. Accounts payable through Bill.com. There are approximately 30 regular vendors, at the most.\r\nb. Posting of all receipts/collections/revenue and posting of all expenses in QBO in existing accounts. There may be some account setup at times, and some vendor entries at times.\r\nc. Payroll Journal Entries: will grant access to Paylocity, from which all reports can be downloaded.\r\nd. Monthly payroll journal entries: 26 pay periods.\r\ne. Posting 401(k) retirement entries.\r\nf. Cash basis with some modifications.\r\ng. Other minor bookkeeping/accounting projects as requested.\r\n\r\n2. Company Two – Light bookkeeping for small manufacturing company with 8 employees. Owners will process payroll through ADP and do some of the bookkeeping functions. The contracted bookkeeper/accountant will do accounting oversight, considering relevant taxes and compliance issues, plus some help with accounting setup as needed. Desktop QuickBooks (2023) with remote access.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648764759670857729','-',7,'United States','US',70.000,'Open this select menu',50.000,'2023-04-19',1,'2023-04-19',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-19 19:11:43',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
