(19224,'Bookkeeper and for newer e-commerce (shopify)',39,'We are an emerging E-comm, looking to prepare for an organized future related to our finances. We operate on the shopify platform. We need help with inventory management, PO set up (as we are constantly launching new products). I am someone that would like a good handle on the business and understand where all dollars are going. We currently have a bookkeeper that would help transition to you. She has been great, but we are not good fits for one another as she does not have a ton of e-comm experience (has been working in brick and mortar and B2B setting for her career).\r\n\r\nAs I mentioned, we sell through shopify and amazon. We will start on Chewy in the near future, and launch wholesale. Business size is about 500K/year revenue, but expect to hit 200-300k/month by end of December as a result of product launches and growth.\r\n\r\nI need to have the book keeping transitioned by the end of the month. I would be interested in having someone that could pay and send invoices through quickbooks as well as monthly inventory and organizing the expenses. The paying invoices is not a must if that is a deal breaker.  In addition to being comfortable with you, I would like someone that would be interested in helping me learn quickbooks. I hold an MBA, so at one point I passed a few accounting tests.... but need a refresher and help understanding practical accounting (I do like to know how to do everything though, even if someone else will be doing it).\r\n\r\nThanks. If you are interested, please give me a little info on your past ecomm experience as well as inventory management experience.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648738042225950721','-',7,'United States','Bethesda',80.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-19',1,'2023-04-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-19 19:25:09',NULL,11,3,NULL,155),
(19225,'QuickBooks Online Receipt Organizer',39,'We are looking for an individual who can go into our QuickBooks online account and attach receipts to transactions.\r\n\r\nWe are not looking for a bookkeeper as we have a bookkeeper, but you must have experience with quickbooks online and the ability to learn how to use ShoeBoxed to attach receipts to transactions.\r\n\r\nWe do not want anyone who will classify or attempt to classify the transactions, only attach receipts. This is why it\'s very important that you know quickbooks so you know how to attach receipts without having to classify transactions.\r\n\r\nFor the first month or two, you will have full time hours until you catch up. After you catch up, we will want to keep you on to continue to work at least an hour a day to continue attaching receipts to transactions in quickbooks.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648735202362540033','-',7,'United States','Saint George',40.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-19',1,'2023-04-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-19 19:26:31',NULL,11,3,NULL,155),
