(19228,'Branding Designer',2,'We are looking for a skilled Branding Designer to join our team. As a Branding Designer, you will be responsible for creating visual concepts, graphics, and layouts for various branding materials. You will work closely with our clients to understand their branding needs and develop creative solutions that align with their brand identity. The ideal candidate should have a strong portfolio showcasing their design skills, attention to detail, and ability to work collaboratively with other team members.\r\n\r\n## Responsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Collaborate with clients to understand their branding needs and develop creative solutions\r\n- Develop and execute visual concepts, graphics, and layouts for various branding materials, such as logos, business cards, brochures, and websites\r\n- Create brand guidelines to ensure consistency across all branding materials\r\n- Work collaboratively with other team members to ensure design quality and timely project delivery\r\n- Keep up to date with the latest design trends and technologies\r\n\r\n## Requirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience as a Branding Designer or similar role\r\n- Strong portfolio showcasing design skills and attention to detail\r\n- Proficiency in Adobe Creative Suite, including Photoshop, Illustrator, and InDesign\r\n- Experience in branding design, including creating logos, brand guidelines, and other branding materials\r\n- Knowledge of design best practices and design principles\r\n- Excellent communication and collaboration skills\r\n- Ability to work in a fast-paced, deadline-driven environment\r\n\r\n## Company Overview\r\n\r\nNutzBoltz is specialised in helping tech businesses find, scale, and automate new growth levers. Our team of experts has the knowledge and experience to identify the most effective strategies for your business, and we offer both 90-minutes and 90-days packages to suit your needs and budget.\r\n\r\nWith our services, you\'ll have access to your very own growth team, dedicated to helping you achieve your business goals. We believe in a hands-on approach, working closely with you to understand your unique challenges and opportunities.\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re looking to enter a new market, acquire more customers, or develop innovative products, NutzBoltz has the expertise to help you succeed.Our team is committed to delivering measurable results and long-term growth for your business. So, if you\'re ready to take your tech business to the next level, don\'t hesitate to reach out to us.\r\n\r\nFull job offer can be read here: https://nutzboltz.notion.site/Branding-Designer-c662a9bbdf4344d282caa6391404ed72. Replies can be send here on UpWork.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648770292369240065','-',7,'United States','Almere',25.000,'Open this select menu',25.000,'2023-04-19',1,'2023-04-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-19 19:28:04',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
(19229,'Real Estate business looking for cash flow reporting help',39,'I own a real estate company that focuses primarily on fixing and flipping residential houses. I am looking for help in creating a system/process for how to track inflows and outflows of cash to and from the business. My business is capital intensive and often times I am left guessing what the flows are going to be.\r\n\r\nI\'d like to create a process that\'s simple and easy to where I can hand it off to my assistant to fill in the numbers and I be able to look at summaries/reports and know real time what is coming in vs going out. Please let me know if you need anymore information and I can provide, thanks.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648770021668859905?success','-',7,'United States','Houston',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-04-19',1,'2023-04-19',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-19 19:29:05',NULL,19,3,NULL,123),
(19230,'US CPA Services',38,'We have a US Delaware entity (C-Corp) registered in 2018.\r\nWe have a Foreign Indian subsidiary that was acquired by the US entity .\r\nIndian subsidiary is profitable and paying taxes in India.\r\nWe have qualified accountants managing tax filings in India for Indian entities.\r\nFor US entity we have paid Delaware taxes until 2021.\r\nNo contractors, employees in the US.\r\nGross Revenues in the US for 2022 is in between $ .75 to $.90 Million .\r\n\r\nLooking for US CPA’s\r\n\r\nSCOPE OF WORK\r\n- Filing of Federal return for the Delaware entity for 2022 and in Upcoming years.\r\nIncluding\r\n• Filing of Form 5471(including E&P, Form 8992 and 926)\r\n• Filing of Form 5472\r\n• Filing of FinCEN Form 114\r\n• Filing of Form 1099\r\n• Filing Form 1042, 1042-S\r\n• Additional informational forms such as 5472, 1118, 5713 etc\r\n• Gross receipt-based tax filings - such as states of OH, WA, DE OR and NV based on applicability\r\n\r\n-Routine queries on Federal and state tax matters.\r\n-Response to IRS/state tax department notice on regular tax issues.\r\n- FDII deductions and returns.\r\n- File extension if needed.\r\n-Interact with our Indian accountant if required (reports, taxes, filings, transfer pricing etc) .\r\n\r\nwe are looking for proposals with cost break up for each line items.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648731923570245633','-',7,'United States','Middletown',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-19',1,'2023-04-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-19 19:29:17',NULL,11,3,NULL,155),
