(19233,'Talented and Creative Graphic Designer Needed for T-shirt Designs',2,'Hello,\r\n\r\nI need a few graphics that represent the front view of famous and iconic cars.\r\n\r\nI\'d love to think of this in a creative way that uses minimalism and basic geometry to represent the car design. The design must be recognizable (due to headlights, grill, bumper, hood lines, etc), but not necessarily full detail or overly drawn. Simple is better. Basically, I\'d want someone to see our design and know exactly what it is due to its iconic features, but not actually have it fully drawn out.\r\n\r\nexample cars I\'d like to do:\r\nRange Rover Classic\r\nhttps://www.carsized.com/resources/land-rover/range-rover/d/1985/fa_316000000_land-rover-range-rover-1985-front-view_4x.png\r\n\r\nPorsche 911\r\nhttps://images.ctfassets.net/buxxk7taiwc2/2XPM0O5ThcMagSTyj3ojl3/7248297b21f19ba081e4a783e3f9feec/997-series-brilliance-36k-mile-2011-porsche-911-carrera-s-997-2-6-speed43683245936.567570965.IM1.04.1600x1200_A.1600x1067.jpg\r\n\r\nFord Bronco\r\nhttps://www.velocityrestorations.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/1973-Velocity-Classic-Ford-Bronco-front-grill.jpg\r\n\r\nIdeally, we\'d use solid shapes and lines, and maybe some interesting color palettes based on what decade the car was made.\r\n\r\nHopefully this gives you a good idea what I\'m thinking about! Look forward to hearing your creative ideas.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nDylan','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648774799341826049?success','-',7,'United States','Virginia Beach',50.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-04-19',1,'2023-04-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-19 19:46:39',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
(19234,'Logo Designer Needed for Custom Shield Logo',10,'Job Description:\r\n\r\nWe are looking for an experienced and creative logo designer to create a custom shield logo for our client, Alexander Paselk. The successful candidate must have a strong portfolio demonstrating their skills in logo design and the ability to work with specific design guidelines.\r\n\r\nLogo Design Requirements:\r\n\r\nCreate a stylized shield shape with clean, simple lines. The shield should have a flat top, slightly rounded sides, and a pointed bottom. Fill the shield with a dark blue color (e.g., #0D3B66).\r\nTo the right of the shield, write \"ALEXANDER PASELK\" in bold, uppercase letters using a modern sans-serif font like Montserrat, Roboto, or Helvetica Neue. The text should be in white (e.g., #FFFFFF) and vertically aligned with the shield\'s top edge.\r\nBelow \"ALEXANDER PASELK,\" write \"OHS\" in slightly smaller uppercase letters, maintaining the same font and color as the main text. Align the left edge of \"OHS\" with the left edge of \"ALEXANDER PASELK.\"\r\nAlign the right edge of the shield with the left side of the text. Ensure there is some space between the shield and the text for visual balance and readability.\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nProven experience as a logo designer, with a strong portfolio showcasing your work\r\nExcellent design software skills, such as Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, or similar\r\nAbility to work with specific design guidelines and client requirements\r\nStrong attention to detail and the ability to meet tight deadlines\r\nExcellent communication skills and the ability to provide updates on project progress\r\nHow to Apply:\r\n\r\nTo apply for this position, please submit your portfolio showcasing your logo design work, along with a brief description of your experience and availability. Please also include your hourly rate and an estimated number of hours required to complete the project.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to reviewing your application and potentially working with you on this exciting logo design project!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648774994245517313','-',7,'United States','Ahmadi',150.000,'Open this select menu',150.000,'2023-04-19',1,'2023-04-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-19 19:47:41',NULL,18,3,NULL,116),
