(19236,'Website Designer & Developer for various projects',3,'Within our agency we have a variety of clients that need support with their websites but specifically for this project we are looking for a skilled and experienced designer and developer to re-build our client\'s Wix website.\r\n\r\nOur other clients have WordPress websites so the ideal candidate will need to have expertise in WooCommerce, WordPress and Wix, We also need to make sure you can develop a user-friendly, mobile-friendly and visually appealing website that meets our clients\' business needs. Creativity is a must!\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a candidate who can commit to working on this project in a timely manner and has GREAT communication skills.\r\n\r\nFor this project you will be responsible for re-designing her website and ensuring that it is optimized for both desktop and mobile users.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this position, please submit the following:\r\n*A proposal outlining your experience and skills\r\n*Links to some of your past completed projects that demonstrate your ability to build a responsive Wix site\r\n*The time it took from start to finish for each project listed\r\n*Examples of an edit vs. a complete overhaul\r\n\r\nLastly, please indicate if you have expertise in WordPress and WooCommerce as well.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you and working with you!\r\nLisa','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648779522185428993?success','-',7,'United States','Syosset',100.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-04-19',1,'2023-04-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-19 20:05:15',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
