(19241,'Graphic Designer for Pitch Decks, Annual Reports, and Corporate Marketing Collateral',2,'We are a growing digital agency seeking an experienced Graphic Designer with expertise in creating professional pitch deck designs, annual reports, corporate brochures, and marketing collateral. The ideal candidate should be highly skilled in Adobe InDesign and Figma.\r\n\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Design and create visually appealing and professional pitch decks, annual reports, corporate brochures, and marketing collateral.\r\n- Collaborate with our creative team to develop concepts and ideas for projects.\r\n- Understand and follow established brand guidelines to maintain consistency across all designs.\r\n- Translate content from Word documents into visually engaging layouts and designs.\r\n- Ensure all designs are optimized for both print and digital formats\r\n- Work efficiently to meet deadlines while maintaining a high level of quality\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Proven experience as a Graphic Designer with a strong portfolio showcasing expertise in pitch decks, annual reports, and corporate marketing collateral\r\n- Proficiency in Adobe InDesign and Figma\r\n- Strong attention to detail and a keen eye for aesthetics\r\n- Ability to work effectively both independently and as part of a team\r\n- Excellent communication and interpersonal skills\r\n- A strong understanding of design principles, typography, color theory, and layout\r\n- Ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously and meet deadlines\r\n\r\n\r\nPreferred Qualifications:\r\n- Experience working with US-based Fortune 500 companies\r\n- A track record of producing clean, high-end designs\r\n\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit your resume and a link to your portfolio showcasing relevant work. Please note that this is NOT a web-based UI/UX design position; we seek a high-quality graphic designer specializing in corporate marketing collateral design.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/164878477746