(19250,'Looking for a logo/brand identity for a SaaS startup',10,'**READ THIS CAREFULLY BEFORE APPLYING**\r\n\r\nMy client is a SaaS startup that is looking for a SaaS-style brand and brand identity. They have a wide array of customers from healthcare to Agriculture, as well as the end consumer, so this logo would need to work across all customer types. They have a preliminary logo they created, but it\'s pretty bad. They are looking for a modern clean SaaS style look and identity. I will share more details on the company if we have further conversations.\r\n\r\nThe deliverables need to be the following:\r\n\r\n- Logo designs - with all relevant files (ai, psd, jpeg, png, etc.)\r\n- Brand identity guide with logos/placements, primary and secondary color palettes, typography, business card design, social media banners and posts (LinkedIn only), general website design guidance, custom iconography, patterns/backdrops and branded powerpoint template. Need a full guide and all files for each of these things.\r\n\r\n\r\nAlso, please only apply if you have SaaS logo experience AND at least 5 years of brand identity and design experience. No novices please.\r\n\r\n**MUST HAVE SAAS DESIGN EXPERIENCE. PLEASE SUBMIT EXAMPLES OF YOUR SAAS LOGOS AND SAAS BRAND IDENTITY ONLY. DO NOT SUBMIT ANYTHING ELSE AS YOU WILL NOT BE CONSIDERED***\r\n\r\n**I AM ALSO ONLY INTERESTED IN WORKING WITH SINGLE DESIGNERS - NO AGENCIES OR GROUPS***\r\n\r\nWe need this completely done in 4-5 weeks. We cannot do a longer timeline, so please do not apply if your pro','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1648790386025607169?success','-',7,'United States','Orangevale',4500.000,'fixed',4500.000,'2023-04-19',1,'2023-04-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-19 20:48:31',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
