(19296,'Tax Consultant / Tax Accountant',38,'We are currently seeking a Tax Consultant to assist with our business tax needs. The ideal candidate will have a deep understanding of tax laws and regulations and be able to provide expert guidance to our organization.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Prepare and file all business tax returns, including federal, state, and local taxes\r\n- Stay up-to-date on changes to tax laws and regulations and ensure compliance with all relevant laws\r\n- Identify tax savings opportunities and work with our team to implement tax-saving strategies\r\n- Advise our organization on tax implications of business decisions and transactions\r\n- Assist with tax audits and other tax-related inquiries from government agencies\r\n- Provide guidance and training to other team members on tax-related matters\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\n- Bachelor\'s degree in accounting or related field\r\n- Certified Public Accountant (CPA) or Enrolled Agent (EA) preferred\r\n- 3+ years of experience in tax consulting or related field\r\n- In-depth knowledge of federal, state, and local tax laws and regulations\r\n- Strong analytical and problem-solving skills\r\n- Excellent communication and interpersonal skills\r\n- Ability to manage multiple projects and deadlines\r\n\r\nIf you\'re a detail-oriented and knowledgeable Tax Consultant with a passion for helping businesses navigate complex tax laws, we encourage you to apply.\r\n\r\nWe need assistance with 5 corporations with the incorporation state being either Delaware or California.\r\n\r\nPlease inquire if you have additional questions','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1649038629915344897?success','-',7,'United States','Santa Monica',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-04-20',1,'2023-04-20',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-20 13:15:00',NULL,19,3,NULL,123),
