(19322,'Certified Accountant needed to proofread accounting content -Only US Applicants apply',37,'We are a Fintech company that provides accounting and bookkeeping solutions based on our cloud-based accounting software. We have a blog to educate users about various aspects of accounting, bookkeeping, taxation, invoicing, and related articles for the purpose of content marketing in the US only.\r\n\r\nFor our blog, we need only US-based applicants who can proofread, quality check, and vet the blog articles. Their profiles will be featured on the blog, too, to build the domain and subject authority.\r\nhttps://www.akounto.com/blog/\r\nThis is a continued, long-time project-based work where you’ll be working in coordination with our content team. A detailed description of the work is mentioned below:\r\n·        Review and proofread blog articles related to accounts, bookkeeping, and taxation for accuracy, consistency, and adherence to industry standards and guidelines\r\n·        Ensure all financial statements, terms, and concepts used in the articles are correct and make sense\r\n·        Provide feedback and suggestions and edit the articles to improve the quality of the blogs\r\n·        Collaborate with the editorial team to ensure timely and error-free publication of articles\r\n·        Fact-check information, data, and statistics used in the articles\r\n·        Verify sources and ensure proper citation\r\n·        Ensure compliance with all applicable US laws and regulations related to accounting and taxation\r\n·        Keep up-to-date with the latest trends and developments in the accounting and finance industry\r\n·        The profile of the accountant/proofreader will be shown in the articles they will vet','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1649073058904473601?','-',7,'United States','Winter Springs',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-04-20',1,'2023-04-20',1,'00',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-20 17:07:45',NULL,11,3,NULL,160),
