(19326,'Bookkeeper for a Landscape Design Build Company',39,'We are a Landscape Design Build company based in Ohio, US. We’re looking for a part-time bookkeeper (may grow full-time) to help us with the following:\r\n\r\n1. YNAB Management (Business and Personal accounts) - weekly\r\n-Reconciliation\r\n-Bills Management (Placing bills and tracking them)\r\n\r\n2. Quickbooks - weekly\r\n-Reconciliation\r\n-Bills Management (Placing bills and tracking them)\r\n\r\n3. Monitor our Balance Sheet and Profit & Loss Report weekly\r\n\r\n4. Report reconciliation inaccuracies and make adjustments\r\n\r\n5. Track bonus payments and raises for our employees monthly\r\n\r\n6. Monitor our debt payments and report for inaccuracies weekly\r\n\r\n7. Create estimates for our clients\r\n\r\n8. Track “Work in Progress” and job expenses on spreadsheets weekly\r\n\r\n9. Pay Sales Taxes Monthly.\r\n\r\n10. Suggest bookkeeping efficiency practices where needed.\r\n\r\nWe’re using Quickbooks and YNAB for our finance management. If you are knowledgeable with these tools, please include it in your application.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nNOT FOLLOWING INSTRUCTIONS WILL BE REJECTED IMMEDIATELY.\r\n\r\n◉Please provide your availability and proposed service rate. Monthly or weekly package pricing will be considered\r\n◉ONLY apply if you have experience working with similar businesses like ours (ex. Landscape Design Build company, Home Remodelling industry, etc.)\r\n\r\n\r\nDO NOT send us an email directly or your application will be rejected right away. We will only consider applications sent here in Upwork.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1649101089246875649','-',7,'United States','Cincinnati',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-20',1,'2023-04-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-20 17:47:48',NULL,11,3,NULL,155),
