(19341,'Financial model for real estate investment',38,'Deliverable:\r\n\r\nA financial model in excel in the form of a discounted cash flow model. High quality work which would be suitable for a professional accounting firm.\r\n\r\nThis runs for fifteen years from now on a monthly basis.\r\n\r\nI need it to tell me the NPV of several scenarios. I need the model to operate from some assumptions which I can easily change, like in a normal excel model.\r\nI need the model to be very well presented.\r\n\r\nThe scenario:\r\n\r\nA holding company outside the UK is considering selling itself. It has some cash and investments and a property. The property has been valued.\r\nThe land around the area is being redeveloped and there is new transport infrastructure being built.\r\n\r\nThere are several possible scenarios to model:\r\n\r\n1: Do nothing, continue to let the property and pay expensive repairs. Possible shrinking tenancy while still paying business rates.\r\n2: Sell the property now and reinvest the cash.\r\n3: obtain planning permission and sell in 3-5 years.\r\n4: develop the property into a tower block with 40% residential 40% offices and 20% retail.\r\n\r\nAssumptions:\r\n\r\nI need the following assumptions to be easily changeable in the model: for discount rate, interest rate, tenant occupancy %, development rent, development cost, years to develop, reinvestment return %, property core value, property repair costs, inflation.\r\n\r\nSources:\r\n\r\nYou will be provided with a valuation report and the scenario details below. You may need to perform some research of your own to establish some parameters. You can ask some questions of me.\r\n\r\nSkill level:\r\n\r\nYou will be an advanced financial modeller or close to it.\r\n\r\nTiming:\r\n\r\nA 90% draft is required by saturday evening, 9pm uk time. I will return comments by Sunday morning, to be put through on Sunday morning.\r\n\r\nMilestones:\r\n\r\npayment of 66% will be paid with the 90% first draft if it meets expectations and 33% with the final cut\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nPlease share a similar model that you have created so I can check it matches my requirements. I will only review your proposition if it includes this.\r\n\r\nFollow on:\r\n\r\nI may well need good financial modellers for other business work','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1649126291322941441?success','-',7,'United States','High Wycombe',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-20',1,'2023-04-20',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-20 19:03:08',NULL,19,3,NULL,123),
