(19386,'Prior Authorization and Buy And Bill Specialist',28,'The ideal candidate is responsible for accurate, efficient ability to:\r\n· Contacting insurance to obtain covered benefits information on each patient. This position requires to call insurances to ensure the benefits are able to be described to the patient in detail.\r\n· As needed, follow up on Prior Authorization regularly, at least weekly: with company, with patient, and document accurately in Common Drive, PA Excel sheets, and in patient Chart\r\n· Enrollment/PA form completed and sent same day as patient seen\r\n· Giving patient benefits sheets to front sheets to sign and ensure updates\r\n· Determining the estimated benefits from insurance on every patient and ensuring that they are signed and approved by patients before procedures\r\n· Running patient cost responsibility prior to every visit by patients\r\n· Getting ABNs signed on patients without covered benefits (as needed)\r\n· Explain to patients on a weekly basis to keep them up-to-speed\r\n· Assists in Prior Authorization of medications and tracking expirations to prevent lapse\r\n· Adherence to and knowledge of medical regulations including OSHA, HIPAA, OIG.\r\n\r\nIn addition, this role will be involved with Inventory Management of the Buy and Bill Inventory of the biologics medications.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1649392542070149121','-',7,'United States','Scottsdale',20.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-04-21',1,'2023-04-21',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-21 14:33:43',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
(19387,'Full-Time Medical Office Biller - Long-Term Position',21,'Full-Time Medical Office Biller and Payer Coordinator (8am-5pm, M-F)\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this position, please apply with your resume and a 60-90 seconds audio/video introduction.\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a dedicated and experienced Medical Office Biller and Payer Coordinator to join our team on a full-time basis. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in medical billing, insurance coordination, and a keen eye for detail. This position requires availability during regular business hours, Monday through Friday, from 8am to 5pm.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nManage billing processes and ensure accurate and timely submission of claims to insurance providers\r\nCoordinate with insurance companies, patients, and providers to address and resolve billing-related inquiries\r\nReview and verify patient insurance eligibility, benefits, and coverage\r\nMaintain up-to-date knowledge of insurance and billing regulations, including coding and compliance requirements\r\nPerform payment posting, account adjustments, and reconciliations\r\nMonitor and follow up on outstanding claims and appeals\r\nCollaborate with the medical team to ensure accurate coding and documentation\r\nMaintain patient confidentiality and adhere to HIPAA regulations\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nAt least 2 years of experience in medical billing and insurance coordination\r\nStrong understanding of medical coding, billing procedures, and payer requirements\r\nExcellent communication and interpersonal skills\r\nProficiency in Microsoft Office and medical billing software\r\nAttention to detail and strong organizational skills\r\nAbility to work independently and in a team setting\r\n\r\nPreferred with followings:\r\nAs a USA Medical Outpatient Biller, you will be responsible for understanding Payer Fee Schedule, Benefits, and Eligibility. Your knowledge of Medicare, Medicare PPO, and Medicare HMO, Pre-Auth requirement, Practice Communication, Payer Communication will be essential in this role.\r\nYou will need to have a good understanding of Remote Patient Monitoring CPT codes (99453, 99454, 99457, 99458).\r\n\r\nIf you are a motivated and detail-oriented Medical Office Biller and Payer Coordinator looking to join a growing team, please submit your application, including your resume and 60-90 seconds video/audio introduction. We look forward to reviewing your qualifications!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1649392364046307329','-',7,'United States','Valencia',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-04-21',1,'2023-04-21',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-21 14:38:43',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
