(19468,'Long term Virtual Medical Assistant',22,'*This position is best suited for professionals with fluent English Communication skills and experience in US Healthcare setting. They need to be available between 9:30 and 5:30 PM EST time. 10 hours a week and 40 hours a month. $200 a month\r\n\r\nAdd Functional at the top of your proposal\r\n\r\nSend a video introducing yourself and you think you are a suitable candidate.\r\n\r\n1. Scheduling appointments, assisting with patient questions via phone and email, prescription refills etc.\r\n\r\n2. Check out patients; create encounters and superbills, scan and enter patient information into EMR;\r\n\r\n3. Proficiency in scheduling software, Google Drive, Power point and Microsoft Office.\r\n\r\n4. Support to physician and practice in all areas of practice needs.\r\n\r\n5. Health Care Experience and HIPA certification is preferable.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1650461083165458433','-',7,'United States','8',200.000,'Open this select menu',180.000,'2023-04-25',1,'2023-04-25',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-25 13:14:20',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
(19469,'Medical Billing Specialist',21,'Healthy Speech Solutions is an online speech therapy practice that is seeking a new medical billing specialist with administrative work opportunities as well.\r\n\r\nJob Description Includes;\r\n-Submitting speech therapy claims to North Carolina Medicaid and North Carolina commercial insurance plans\r\n-Following up on speech therapy claim statuses (e.g. calling or emailing insurance companies)\r\n-Submitting claim denials and appeals\r\n-Assisting with prior authorizations requests\r\n-Submitting claims through Healthy Speech Solutions\' electronic medical charting system (Simple Practice)\r\n-Be able to look up claims statuses as needed through individual insurance provider portal websites\r\n-Look up monthly Medicaid expiration statuses on the North Carolina Medicaid website\r\n-Faxing over speech therapy documents to doctors\' offices with follow-up communication (as needed)\r\n-More administrative duties may become available in the future','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1650460734547492865','-',7,'United States','US',20.000,'Open this select menu',18.000,'2023-04-25',1,'2023-04-25',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-25 13:15:43',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
