(19472,'Beauty Treatment Writer',37,'I’m seeking an experienced writer who can create high quality blog content for a specific niche 2-4 per month.\r\n\r\nIn this role, you will be responsible for creating informational blog articles (likely anywhere from 1000, 5000 words) from an outline you are given to follow exactly. Most of these articles usually start from 1500-3500 words.\r\n\r\nYou will have written blog posts for beauty niches (ideally within medical spa/skin care) so this will be easy work for you.\r\n\r\nHave you ghost-write before doing this niche, that\'s a bonus .\r\n\r\nYour success will be determined by it reading well (obviously) & passing Google\'s own quality guidelines via Chat GPT who will do the analysing (I expect you to understand what these guidelines are, so read up if you don\'t)\r\n\r\nThey are:\r\n\r\nEEAT (www.searchenginejournal.com/google-e-e-a-t-how-to-demonstrate-first-hand-experience/474446/)\r\nGoogle\'s helpful content update (developers.google.com/search/blog/2022/08/helpful-content-update)\r\n\r\nBy not passing at least 90% of these guidelines regardless of how great the article is, it will not be accepted.\r\n\r\nNor will it be accepted if it reads like pure junk.\r\n\r\nI will pay the same fee regardless if its 1000 words or 5000 words, regardless if you need to edit again to pass the Google updates as mentioned above. *note Google can create a new update whenever it feels like it.\r\n\r\nIf you have experience writing in this niche then the research should be pretty easy with not much time spent, so most of your time will be spend doing what you love.\r\n\r\nI know writers today are using AI tools and that\'s fine, however If your going to let them aid your writing, it must be to a good good standard so you can easily hide that fact.\r\n\r\nFor this reason you will also be a skilled editor with a passion for crafting clear, concise, and error-free content without sacrificing quality and proofreading it before submitting so all facts are on point relevant to the target.\r\n\r\nA degree in English, Communications, Journalism, or a related field would be perfect or even equivalent work experience will be considered as mentioned in sentence\r\n\r\nSample pieces of work you have written for search engines will need to be shown with your application to this role (no resume and beauty/skin care samples, with application = no video interview, not even a response.\r\n\r\nYou’re will be fluent in English & Writing.\r\n\r\nStages Before Hire:\r\n1.Submit Resume (anyone who sends me any less than 200 words when applying to tell me why you want this and what makes you best choice for me, will be automatically noted as not following directions)\r\n2.Questions.\r\n3.VIDEO Interview.\r\n\r\nWhat to do Next? Submit your resume.\r\n\r\nSKILLS:\r\n\r\nIf Using AI tools:\r\nEditing Key Responsibilities:\r\nEdit AI created content for better clarity, accuracy, readability and that human touch.\r\nMake it readable for 7-8th Grade reading level.\r\nRe-Write in a style that is engaging to the reader and so they can enjoy it.\r\nFormat elements such as subheadings, bullets, and other skimmable elements to catch people who have short attention spans.\r\n\r\nWriter Key Responsibilities:\r\nProofreading your content\r\nFact checking any stats etc and edit as necessary.\r\nPass the latest Google content updates\r\nUpload a Google Doc to Trello\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\nC1 level of English or higher\r\nYou’re fluent English Speaking & Writing\r\nStrong writing and editing skills\r\nExperience with SEO On Page best practices (those that can produce evidence of this will be boosted to top)\r\nExperience with AI Content Writers (those that can produce evidence of this will be boosted to top)\r\nExperience using Trello or similar managing system\r\nAttention to detail and strong problem-solving skills\r\n\r\nSalary Is not a Placeholder.\r\n\r\nI pay after every article you send me and is passed by Chat GPT and is not junk.\r\n\r\nDo not reply with a 2 sentence application.\r\n\r\nAt least submit no less than 200 words along with resume and niche relevant samples.\r\n\r\nSo I know you’ve read this all please include the word \"coffee\" at the very end of the first sentence.\r\n\r\nJohn','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1650464676460990465','-',7,'United States','United Kingdom',55.000,'fixed',44.000,'2023-04-25',1,'2023-04-25',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-25 13:19:30',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
