(19474,'Accounts Receivable Specialist',28,'Attach a copy of CV\r\nWhat you’ll own:\r\nLearn and use daily accounting and customer relationship systems\r\nReview and generate invoices to customers\r\nReview revenue recognition dates per invoices and accounting system to ensure accuracy\r\nCorrespond regularly with sales reps regarding questions on invoices and customer requests\r\nApply payments received to outstanding invoices\r\nMonitor and respond promptly to the constant inflow of e-mails to AR inbox and other communication channels\r\nTrack unpaid invoices and follow up regularly with customers for payment, and coordinate with sales reps as needed\r\nPrepare AR Aging reports for weekly meetings with AR team and leadership\r\nCoordinate with customers and sales reps to send invoices and receive payments through EDI (electronic data interchange) as necessary\r\nBusiness office Assistant','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1650466426243186689','-',7,'United States','US',35.000,'Open this select menu',30.000,'2023-04-25',1,'2023-04-25',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-25 13:22:11',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
(19475,'Writer with experience in health/medical industry to write series of website blogs',37,'[Long term writing cooperation] Medical&Health Advertorial Writing - Checkme BP2A Blood Pressure Monitor\r\n\r\nIntro:\r\nWe are Checkme, a brand that specialize in the field of personal healthcare and blood pressure monitors. Our BP monitors are FDA-listed, CE certified, and licensed by Health Canada. Website Link: checkmecare.com\r\n\r\nWe are looking for writers who specialized in medical and health advertorial writing. After our first cooperation, if we find out how good your articles are, we wish to have stable long term cooperation with you.\r\nWe have tons of writing tasks needed to be done such as product review, customer stories and so on. We have sufficient budget for good writers.  \r\n\r\nCurrent task:\r\nSubject:\r\nHow does a blood pressure machine work?\r\nAbout 1000 words\r\nFinish in 5 days after accepting the offer\r\n\r\nArticle-style:\r\nIt should look like a health knowledge sharing an article written by a health specialist. 80% of content should focus on giving people knowledge while the other 20% is advertising our product(Checkme BP2A Blood Pressure Monitor) \r\nExample of article style: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK279251/\r\n\r\nBrief: \r\n-talk about the principles of blood pressure measurement\r\n-who needs to do regular blood pressure test\r\n-what are the benefits of taking a bp test at home?\r\n-how to do a bp test at home? How can Checkme BP2A help people do this?\r\n\r\nPreparation:\r\n-Learn about blood pressure monitor on google. \r\n-Learn about our product Checkme BP2A on google&Youtube. Example links:   \r\nhttps://checkmecare.com/products/blood-pressure-monitor-bp2a(official website)\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n-No article spinning. Copy content from different articles to make up a different variation is not acceptable.\r\n-Find a banner image that is attractive and fits the article well. You can search and download HD image from free image websites such as https://unsplash.com/\r\n-Find 2-4 images to insert between paragraphs.\r\n-We are quite strict about content quality. Make sure you understand our product and those diseases well. Write original and valuable content.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1650465788290994177','-',7,'United States','China',30.000,'perhour',24.000,'2023-04-25',1,'2023-04-25',1,'normal bidding',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-25 13:23:42',NULL,12,3,NULL,157),
