(19479,'Concert tour t-shirt design',2,'I’m looking to have a mock up concert tour t-shirt made as gifts for 20 couples attending our pre-wedding “stag and doe” weekend in Scotland June 8-12. I will need time to produce the T-shirts so the design is urgent.\r\n\r\nWe are celebrating our marriage at least four times in their invitation to our final event on our wedding world tour refers to the following location:\r\n\r\nThe Bodhi Tree, Bodhgaya, India (March 5)\r\nDunskey Estate, Scotland (June 10)\r\nVictoria Falls, Zambia/Zimbabwe (July 2)\r\n- and -\r\nOsler Bluff Ski Club, Collingwood (Oct 1)\r\n\r\nThis T-shirt is for people joining us in Scotland. The Dunskey Estate castle (www.Dunskey.com) could be a design feature. We would also want to use a large Bodhi Tree leaf on the front or back.\r\n\r\nOur names are Sonia Verma and Evan Siddall. We are also trying to use a wedding hashtag, as one does, but haven’t thought of one yet.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1650858329368760321?success','-',7,'United States','Ottawa',50.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-04-25',1,'2023-04-25',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-25 13:48:43',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
