(19494,'Scalable, Colorful Business Logo',10,'The logo I want to have designed is for my company SmartBoost Digital Marketing. I\'m imagining a rocket of some sort in there, although no clear vision for it yet.\r\n\r\nFor colors, I\'m drawn to blues, greens, purple, hot pink. Please try to avoid red, orange, gold, black, and brown.\r\n\r\nI want the theme to be fun, approachable and energetic, yet professional and reliable.\r\n\r\nI want to be mindful of a site favicon so I want to make sure the logo can scale down in some way to fit small spaces but still be recognizable. I also plan to use the logo on promotional items (e.g. t-shirt, hoodies, hats), so want to make sure the logo will transfer well on there as well.\r\n\r\nLastly, I want to also make sure the logo I receive comes in a format that\'s easy to resize - whether I need it larger, smaller, transparent background, etc. so please share how you approach that.\r\n\r\nTo be considered, please share any relevant examples, as well as your process (including drafts and revisions), file types the logo would come in, and average turnaround time.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1650878063652966401?success','-',7,'United States','Baltimore',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-04-25',1,'2023-04-25',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-25 15:08:22',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
