(19497,'Product Packaging Designer (Packaging Refresh)',2,'We are looking for a talented and experienced Product Packaging Designer to work with us on a project basis to refresh our existing product packaging designs. As a Packaging Designer, you will be responsible for refreshing our existing packaging designs to align with our brand identity and target market.\r\n\r\nResponsabilices and Requirements:\r\n\r\n- Refresh visually appealing packaging designs for our existing products that align with our brand identity and target market.\r\n- Proven experience as a packaging designer in the consumer goods industry, with a focus on packaging refresh projects.\r\n- Strong portfolio showcasing packaging design projects that demonstrate creativity, attention to detail, and understanding of consumer behavior.\r\n- Knowledge of production processes and materials used in packaging production.\r\n\r\nThis is a project-based position and not a full-time role. If you are a creative and detail-oriented Packaging Designer with experience in refreshing existing packaging designs and can handle constructive criticism and adapt to client\'s needs, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity. Please submit your resume and portfolio detailing your relevant experience and why you are the ideal candidate for this project.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1650882801380077569?success','-',7,'United States','Rockville',45.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-04-25',1,'2023-04-25',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-25 15:31:19',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
