(19499,'Graphic designer needed to refine logo and create a certificate design',10,'1) We need to refine logo design for our Dental Choice Academy: https://dentalchoice.ca/dental-choice-academy/\r\nAttached is the current one. I’ve basically added the word “Academy” to our company logo. I’d like to have that improved to convey the educational component of it – maybe add a graduation cap on top of the tooth. We need both horizontal and vertical logo.\r\n\r\n2) We need a Certificate of Completion design for our Dental Office Administrator Program. It would include the new logo design. It should be editable. Here’s the info for the Certificate:\r\n• Dental Office Administrator Program\r\n• Date\r\n• 2 spots for signatures:\r\no Susan Fonseca – Program Trainer Lead\r\no Anastasiia Husieva – Program Coordinator\r\n• Other standard info for such document\r\n\r\nPlease provide the estimate for logo and certificate.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1650887529885446145?success','-',7,'United States','Edmonton',15.000,'perhour',15.000,'2023-04-25',1,'2023-04-25',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-25 15:41:48',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
