(19519,'Logo - Woodworking company',10,'General:\r\nWelcome to \"Oak Valley Woodworks\"\r\nI am starting a wood working company. I work in marketing and have lots of experience with branding. This will be a cornerstone of the business and branding element that I will be bringing to set myself apart. Therefore, this logo and color palette are critical. I want this to scream edgy but with class and mystery. I have attached two logos where a \"valley\" is being incorporated. One idea I had was using the \"O\" from \"Oak\" and encompassing the icon inside of that. However, I\'m not married to the idea. I want your creativity to shine through this project.\r\n\r\nLogo type:\r\nI am wanting this to be both text and icon-based. As in icon by itself and then icon with the company name.\r\n\r\nTypography:\r\nI am wanting something modern. Also something with more of a masculine look to it. I have a reference in the attachments for general types that I found more appealing. The file is called \"type\".\r\n\r\nColors:\r\nRed is sticking out to me for some reason. I\'ve attached a color palette sample, but am open to your creative ideas.\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\nDuring the first delivery, I would like to see several different, creative options to move the project forward.\r\nFinal deliverables include multiple variations of the logo. This includes:\r\n-a version in all white\r\n-a version in all black\r\n-a version with just the icon logo\r\n-a version with the icon logo and \"Oak Valley Woodworks\"\r\n-a version with the icon logo and \"oakvalleywood.com\"\r\n-a favicon of just the icon version of the logo\r\n-.jpgs, .pngs, of all the above is desired\r\n---I am wanting all of the design files post-design. in case a change is needed to be made later.\r\n\r\nCandidate:\r\nI\'m ultimately looking for someone that can bring their creative spirit to my business to make this something special. The right candidate will be someone who has exhibited creativity for creative brands in the past. Examples of blue-collar business logos is a plus. Understanding of woodworking is a plus. Communication is key. If you cannot speak fluent English, please do not propose a bid.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1650908257390497793?success','-',7,'United States','Massillon',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-04-25',1,'2023-04-25',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-25 17:04:00',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
