(19646,'Life Insurance Bookkeeper',39,'We are a married couple living in the USA with three companies. We seek a highly organized, detail-oriented, and experienced bookkeeper to manage our individual finances and the finances of 1 business. The ideal candidate will have excellent financial management skills and the ability to keep our personal finances organized, accurate, and up-to-date.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n1.\r\nMaintain accurate and up-to-date financial records for all personal transactions, including income, expenses, savings, and investments.\r\n\r\n2.\r\nWeekly updates\r\n\r\n3.\r\nYou will be using QBO\r\n\r\n2.\r\nDevelop and manage a personal budget, ensuring we adhere to the budget and providing regular reports on our financial progress (i.e. Income statements, balance sheets)\r\n\r\n3.\r\nManage and reconcile personal bank accounts, credit card accounts, and investment accounts.\r\n\r\n4.\r\nEnsure all personal financial documents are properly filed and easily accessible.\r\n\r\n5.\r\nAssist in tax preparation by providing necessary financial information and documentation.\r\n\r\n6.\r\nMonitor financial accounts for discrepancies, errors, or potential fraud and promptly address any issues.\r\n\r\n7.\r\nPrepare and analyze financial reports, including cash flow statements, balance sheets, and income statements.\r\n\r\n9.\r\nMaintain strict confidentiality of all personal financial information.\r\n\r\n10.\r\nCollaborate with our business bookkeepers and financial advisors to ensure a seamless financial management system.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1651282895965368321?success','-',7,'United States','Chicago',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-26',1,'2023-04-26',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-26 17:52:41',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
