(19648,'Create a custom WordPress plugin that allows users to create and manage a virtual marketplace',15,'Create a custom WordPress plugin that allows users to create and manage a virtual marketplace where they can buy and sell products using cryptocurrencies. The plugin should have the following features:\r\n\r\n1. User registration and login system that allows users to create and manage their own virtual storefronts.\r\n2. A shopping cart system that allows users to add products to their cart and checkout using cryptocurrencies.\r\n3. Integration with popular cryptocurrency wallets such as Coinbase, Binance, and Bitpay.\r\n4. A rating and feedback system for buyers and sellers.\r\n5. A dispute resolution system that allows buyers and sellers to resolve disputes through the platform.\r\n6. A messaging system that allows buyers and sellers to communicate with each other.\r\n7. An admin panel that allows you to manage users, products, transactions, and disputes.\r\n8. The ability to display real-time cryptocurrency prices and exchange rates.\r\n\r\nThis task requires a developer with experience in WordPress plugin development, payment gateway integration, and cryptocurrency. It also requires knowledge of e-commerce platforms and user management systems. A skilled developer should be able to complete this task within a reasonable timeframe and with high-quality code.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1651284367750836225?success','-',7,'United States','Uyo',1500.000,'fixed',1500.000,'2023-04-26',1,'2023-04-26',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-26 17:58:43',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
