(19656,'4 E-Book Covers and a Wrap',2,'general pose (from behind, facing scenery, etc.) Also need one full cover wrap, dimensions to be provided, for the final anthology cover. Typography is NOT NEEDED.\r\n\r\nMILESTONES:\r\n\r\n1) E-Book Cover for GLIMMERS IN THE NIGHT:\r\nThis novella is already written, and needs a new (non-AI) cover to be printed. I want to keep the golden pool effect and the golden globe, which is meant to be a golden door so may be lowered or made larger or more portal-like, as well as the coat. However, I am also willing to give you the novella to read for free to see if there\'s another gold-focused option available. That is the picture GlimmersV3. I like the dark black background.\r\n$150\r\n\r\n2) E-Book Cover for UNDER THE HILL:\r\nThat is cb180b, and I like the darker silhouette shape for this one as it\'s going underground. I would like a brighter gold, and for the character to look a few years older. I also would need the creepy tendrils and shadowy figures a bit more well-defined and closer in so they wouldn\'t get cropped away. I like the dark browns/fuzzy black colors of the background.\r\n$150\r\n\r\n3) E-Book Cover for DOORS OF GLASS:\r\nNo reference image for this one, I figure this one would be a slightly older (older than Under the Hill) version of Jeth. He has blond hair by now, which only matters because he won\'t be a strange shadow figure, and would be facing a golden mirror. Can be positioned so you don\'t have to see his face. Will have small set of antlers, baby version of the antlers in unknown.png. I\'d want the walls to be lighter, possibly a dark green. He\'d have a blue jacket sized up for himself, one that would be similar in cut to the 4th cover.\r\n$150\r\n\r\n4) E-Book Cover for RETURN TO RIVER TOR:\r\nThe reference image for that one is the \'unknown\' picture. He will have the blue jacket, I like the bright spring green background, and the indistinct in-a-forest- look-in-early-autumn is very good. He\'d have blond hair, not black, and the big antlers, the blue jacket with pretty gold designs.\r\n$150\r\n\r\n5) Full Wrap Cover for THE BOOK OF THE WITCH\'S SON:\r\nI want to have a wrap cover with a solid-colored spine to split it (because I am not entirely sure on the spine size and may need to expand or decrease it). I like the idea of the main character sitting on a hill with his antlers and the blue and gold coat, somewhat sideways, looking down at the town of River Tor, the river, and the woods beyond. On the back will be the rise of a hill dotted with wildflowers and shrubs over the tops of the trees. The reference for this is botwsref. It is not a good reference, I am not an artist.\r\n$300\r\n\r\nBonus for completion of all items: $100','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0146127bc0b947978f','-',7,'United States','nil',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-04-26',1,'2023-04-26',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-26 18:34:34',NULL,19,3,NULL,125),
(19657,'Character design',2,'My story is complete i now need the characters to be brought to life. Its a combination of Shaolin Monks, Kung Fu Panda, Last Airbender.\r\n\r\nThe moths will be like Shaolin monks, peaceful protectors, while the butterflies are royalty and have an arrogant/snobbish way about them, similar to the fire nation in the Last Airbender.  The friends would be like Kung Fu Panda\'s Furious 5 regarding their quirky attributes and personalities.  The centipede is a combination of all the fighting styles. The pic attached is a start of one of the characters as a child.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ee146dd437cdcf6c','-',7,'United States','Raleigh',1300.000,'fixed',1300.000,'2023-04-26',1,'2023-04-26',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-26 18:39:11',NULL,19,3,NULL,125),
