(19672,'Safe Atlanta Seniors Design Logo',10,'I am looking for a logo for my business. \"Safe Atlanta Seniors\"\r\nMy main product is a Senior Home Safety Evaluation\r\n\r\nHere is some of the background materials I send to clients...\r\nThe Need\r\nAccording to the CDC, in the United States, about one in four adults (28%) age 65 and older, report falling each year. About 37% of those who fall reported an injury that required medical treatment. The majority of these falls occur in the home.\r\n\r\nThe Good News\r\nFalls are oftentimes preventable!\r\n\r\nGoal of Our Engagement\r\nSuggest modifications, sometimes even minor, that will allow you to thrive in your home, safely and independently, for as long as possible.\r\n\r\nFOR THE DESIGN -\r\nI like calm, soothing colors. And a minimalist design. Something I can use for my website and cards, etc. I would love to see what you come up with! Here is my website www.safeatlantaseniors.com','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1651323714279149569?success','-',7,'United States','Atlanta',35.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-04-26',1,'2023-04-26',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-26 20:34:49',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
