(19713,'Gaming Company Seeks Graphic Designer For Marketing And In-Game Assets',2,'PipeFlare.io, a gaming startup, is looking for a designer to help create engaging in-game and marketing assets for a tech-savvy audience (mostly men aged 25 to 35).\r\n\r\nWe\'re searching for a talented designer to help us design several art assets using an existing brand guideline. You\'ll help with both in-game and marketing assets.\r\n\r\nIn-game assets can include sprite design, load screens, loot boxes, popups, etc...We prefer that you have experience building in-game assets, but it\'s not required.\r\n\r\nMarketing assets include marketing materials, banners, and promotional materials.\r\n\r\nWebsite assets can include designing new webpages and improvements to current webpages. Must be able to use FIGMA for website assets.\r\n\r\nDeliverables needed:\r\n- Images For Newsletter\r\n- Images For Sales Pitchbook\r\n- Images For Social Media Banners\r\n- Images For Investor Powerpoint\r\n- In-Game Assets\r\n- Website Design\r\n\r\nSpecial skills needed for this project:\r\n- Advanced knowledge of FIGMA, Photoshop, Adobe Creative Cloud or other design software\r\n\r\nIn your proposal, please provide links to work you\'ve completed in the past, specifically focusing on technology.\r\n\r\nAdjectives to describe our style: Community, Competition, Technology.\r\n\r\nIndustry: Gaming\r\nAudience: Men ages 25-35\r\n\r\nPlease visit us at PipeFlare.io to see our current brand design.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1650884587665854464','https://trello.com/c/iXB5ciCr/2381-jonathan-teplitsky-gaming-company-seeks-graphic-designer-for-mark',7,'United States','Port Washington',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-04-27',1,'2023-04-27',1,'-',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-04-27 13:36:14','2023-04-27 14:07:44',17,3,NULL,130),
