(19722,'Bookkeeping/Accounting',39,'As a virtual assistant bookkeeper, your primary responsibility would be to manage financial records and transactions for a business or an individual remotely. Your job description may include the following tasks:\r\n\r\nRecording financial transactions: You will be responsible for recording all financial transactions, including purchases, sales, receipts, and payments. You may also need to track inventory and manage accounts payable and receivable.\r\n\r\nReconciling accounts: You will need to ensure that all financial records are accurate and up-to-date by reconciling accounts regularly. This includes comparing financial statements with bank statements, credit card statements, and other financial records.\r\n\r\nCreating financial reports: You will need to generate financial reports such as income statements, balance sheets, and cash flow statements. These reports are used to help businesses make informed financial decisions.\r\n\r\nPayroll processing: You may be responsible for managing payroll for a business, which includes calculating employee hours, processing payments, and preparing tax forms.\r\n\r\nBudget preparation: You will need to prepare budgets for businesses based on their financial records and goals.\r\n\r\nMaintaining records: You will be responsible for maintaining all financial records and ensuring they are organized and easily accessible.\r\n\r\nCommunicating with clients: You may need to communicate with clients regularly to provide updates on their financial records and answer any questions they may have.\r\n\r\nTo be successful in this role, you will need to have excellent organizational and analytical skills, attention to detail, and proficiency in using accounting software. You should also have good communication skills and be able to work independently.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1651596039981174785?success','-',7,'United States','Wildwood Cres',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-04-27',1,'2023-04-2