(19742,'Accounting Assistant',39,'We are seeking an Accounting Assistant experienced in QuickBooks Online to provide general accounting support, manage QuickBooks Online, and assist with financial analysis. This remote position requires strong attention to detail, proficiency in QuickBooks Online, and a solid understanding of accounting principles.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nGeneral Accounting Support:\r\n\r\nAssist with month-end and year-end closing procedures.\r\nCollaborate with team members to ensure efficient workflow.\r\nHelp with payroll processing and recording employee information.\r\nManage QuickBooks Online:\r\n\r\nAccurately enter and reconcile financial transactions.\r\nMaintain the chart of accounts and generate financial reports.\r\nConduct audits and reconciliations to ensure data integrity.\r\nFinancial Analysis:\r\n\r\nAssist in preparing financial statements and reports.\r\nConduct basic financial analysis to identify trends and opportunities.\r\nGenerate ad hoc reports to support decision-making.\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nPrevious experience in general accounting support.\r\nProficiency in QuickBooks Online.\r\nSolid understanding of accounting principles.\r\nStrong attention to detail and accuracy.\r\nExcellent organizational and time management skills.\r\nStrong analytical and problem-solving abilities.\r\nEffective communication skills.\r\nAbility to work independently and meet deadlines.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1651626990979321857?success','-',7,'United States','Weston',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-27',1,'2023-04-27',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-27 16:39:48',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(19743,'Initial Logo Design & Apparel Graphic Artist for Costa Rica project',10,'PROJECT DELIVERIABLES: logo with native files, all logo sizes for Brilliant Directories, all logo sizes for social media (Facebook Instagram, Twitter, etc, and finally up to 3 apparel designs (t-shirts) I will page additional for an amazing Facebook header banner.\r\n\r\nPERSONAL COMMENTS: The logo must instantly ground the viewer to the country of Costa Rica and be recognizable as a tool for an online directory to locate just about anything in the country (see below). If you need more information, kindly ask me.\r\n\r\nUPDATE 2: I think I would like to try some designs with a hummingbird.\r\n\r\nTuanis is a very commonly used word and it means “cool” or “great”. Example: “Esta película está tuanis” (It is a great movie). Tuanis is thought to originate from early encounters with English speakers and Ticos repeating “Too Nice” Tuanis! Costa Rica Pura Vida!Aug 4, 2016\r\n\r\n“Que Chuzo” “Que Chiva” “Pura Vida Mae”\r\n\r\nUPDATE: I created an account today on www.printful.com and www.etsy.com made an integration between both, as well as Facebook shop plus an Instagram, TikTok and Twitter connection. Etsy will take the orders and Printful fulfill them\r\n.\r\nI will want a design similar to FB and Instagram\r\n\r\n( Find us on / follow us Tico.Social )\r\nAlso,\r\n( Tuanis! “Tico.Social” Pura Vida! )\r\n\r\n\r\nIn addition to logo request previously posted. Still open. I need a graphic apparel designer for some T-shirts I want to design and sell on Facebook to support the initial marketing of the site which will launch in about 2 months. I am thinking about also giving away a T-shirt for every business that pays and choosing to be listed in the diretory. The audience is locals/ticos in Costa Rica.\r\n\r\nInitial Logo Needed: I am looking for someone to design a logo for “Tico.Social” i.e.; www.tico.social It will be an online Brilliant Directories country bulletin board directory for Costa Rica; home improvement contractors, real-estate to rent and purchase, restaurants, medical/dental, car rental, driver services, tour operators, etc.\r\n\r\nI expect you to be familiar with the formats and sizes Brilliant Directories accepts. Check their website. In addition, I need formats for Facebook banner, Instagram, Twitter, etc. I expect the logo to evolve as we implement it in digital and printed formats (door labels and other advertising specialties, so I expect you to provide a ( one-year guarantee including the native files.)\r\n\r\nCosta Rica has many national symbols that could ground the brand. Research them in Google. If you submit rough ideas (either words or art) with your request, I will be more likely to select you. I have many other projects in the pipeline, as well.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1651627676131463169?success','-',7,'United States','Dawsonville',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-04-27',1,'2023-04-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-27 16:42:50',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
