(19751,'Enrolled Agent (EA), CPA - Expert in US Tax filing and Accounting Tax Preparation',38,'Looking for an Enrolled Agent (EA), CPA - Expert in US Tax filing and Accounting\r\n\r\nPlease note this position entails REVIEWING tax returns and also filing as needed.\r\n\r\nTax returns filing and tax planning for individuals. 1040, 1040NR, 1120, 1121S, election to file as S or C corp...etc)\r\n●Preferred not required Certifying Acceptance Agent (from the IRS)\r\n● Partnerships (1065) and C Corps (1120) S Corps (1120S)\r\n● Crypto Tax preparation and advice.\r\n●Prepare personal and business tax returns\r\n● Review personal and business tax returns\r\n●Tax Planning and Advisory\r\n\r\n\r\nAccounting :\r\n●QuickBooks Online Certified Pro Advisor\r\n●Financial Statement preparation (profit and loss statements, balance sheets, statements of cash flows, etc.)\r\n●Proficient in Quickbooks Desktop, Quickbooks Online, Excel\r\n●Balance Sheet\r\n• Bank account reconciliation\r\n• Budgeting & forecasting\r\n• Cash flow statement\r\n• Credit card reconciliation\r\n• Daily general ledger maintenance\r\nProfit and loss statement – month\r\n• Profit and loss statement','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1651667435620995073?success','-',7,'United States','Lynn',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-27',1,'2023-04-27',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-27 19:21:07',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(19752,'Quickbooks Bookkeeper / Accountant',39,'Accountant/Bookkeeper\r\n\r\nPosition focusing on performing a variety of accounting and bookkeeping duties. Expertise with Inuit QuickBooks is required (3+ years) and Full Charge Bookkeeping (5+ years). In this position, you will accurately compute, classify, and record numerical data to keep financial records complete.\r\n\r\nPay is dependent upon experience.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities include, but are not limited to, the following:\r\n\r\nMaintain financial or account records.\r\nVerify accuracy of financial or transactional data.\r\nWork closely with Account Receivable Specialist.\r\nPrepare deposits for posting.\r\nCalculate and prepare financial reports.\r\nCollection of past due payments and fees.\r\nReconcile records of sales and bank financial transactions.\r\nMonitor financial information.\r\nFile documents or records.\r\nSearch files, databases or reference materials to obtain needed information.\r\nOperate computers programmed with accounting software to record, store, and analyze information with QuickBooks Online.\r\nComply with federal, state, and company policies, procedures, and regulations.\r\nReceive, record, and bank cash, and check using both remote and manual methods.\r\nReconcile or note and report discrepancies found in records.\r\nPerform general office duties, such as filing, answering telephones, and handling routine correspondence.\r\nDisplay customer service and professional etiquette.\r\nAccess computerized financial information to answer general questions as well as those related to specific accounts.\r\nClassify, record, and summarize numerical and financial data to compile and keep financial records, using journals and ledgers or computers.\r\nDebit, credit, and total accounts on computer spreadsheets and databases, using specialized accounting software and MS Excel.\r\nTransfer details from separate specialized accounting software to QuickBooks journal.\r\nCalculate, prepare, and issue bills, invoices, account statements, and other financial statements according to established procedures.\r\nCompile financial reports pertaining to such matters as cash receipts, expenditures, accounts payable and receivable, and profits and losses.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1651670407331762177?success','-',7,'United States','Hauula',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-04-27',1,'2023-04-27',1,'Clinet may ask for call, if he shows up on chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-27 19:32:29',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
