(19755,'Financial Analyst for E-commerce Businesses',39,'We are in search of a financial analyst who is a master of creating financial projections and models for our clientele of e-commerce businesses! Should be familiar with Excel, QuickBooks Online, and Xero!\r\n\r\nYou’ll work with our team of tax professionals and accountants to collect and understand accurate financial data, using that data to model financial projections and decisions for our clients as we guide them through the stages of growing and scaling their e-commerce businesses.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities (Tasks Associated with the Role)\r\nInternal collection of client accounting, tax return, and tax planning data and figures\r\nBuild models to reflect financial strategies and projections for our clients\r\nComplete all client projects by deadline\r\nCollaborating with Tax/Accounting managers to understand client goals, entities, and unique tax situations.\r\nCollaborate with team members to develop streamlined processes\r\n\r\nResults (Expected Accomplishments)\r\nHigh degree of accuracy and attention to detail\r\nInternal and external inquiries are responded to within 24 hours (90%)\r\nDeadlines are met as much as depends on us (90%)\r\nClients receive excellent customer service and quality of work.\r\nCompany processes and communications standards are followed (including documentation).\r\nStrategic insights are communicated to departments for consideration.\r\n\r\nRequirements (Expected Proficiencies)\r\nExperience with FP&A\r\nAbility to be detail oriented as well as big-picture focused\r\nTeam player who can also self-manage\r\nGrowth mindset and ability to accept constructive criticism\r\nInterest and ability to expand financial knowledge\r\n\r\nThis job description is not all-inclusive and certain activities, duties or responsibilities may be required of the employee as needed.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1651674004937052161?success','-',7,'United States','Grants Pass',25.000,'perhour',2