(19756,'Real Estate Accrual Accountant',39,'We are seeking a skilled and experienced Accrual Accountant to join our team. As a real estate Management company, we manage multiple properties and are in need of an accountant to maintain the financial records of each property.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n*Maintain the per property books, including tracking all income and expenses, reconciling bank statements, and preparing financial statements for each property.\r\n*Ensure timely and accurate payment of property taxes, housing association fees, mortgages, and refinances.\r\n*Prepare profit and loss statements, balance sheets, and cash flow statements for each property on a regular basis.\r\n*Calculate depreciation on fixed assets and maintain accurate records of all capital expenditures.\r\n*Prepare all necessary tax forms, including 1099 forms for independent contractors.\r\n*Handle all financial matters related to acquisitions, dispositions, and refinancing of properties.\r\n*Work closely with property managers and other stakeholders to ensure accurate and timely financial reporting.\r\n*Provide financial analysis and insights to support decision-making processes.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n*Strong knowledge of accrual accounting principles and practices.\r\n*Experience with property management software, such as QuickBooks etc.\r\n*Proficient in Microsoft Excel and other accounting software.\r\n*Excellent communication and interpersonal skills.\r\n*Detail-oriented and able to work independently with minimal supervision.\r\n\r\nIf you meet the above qualifications and are interested in this opportunity, please submit your resume and cover letter for consideration.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1651675528738844673?success','-',7,'United States','United States',40.000,'Open this select menu',40.000,'2023-04-27',1,'2023-04-27',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-27 19:52:44',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
