(19771,'A basic Wordpress site with elementor.',15,'The Capital Area Progressive Democrats are a social club in Austin, Texas, looking to update its website.\r\n\r\nThe website is intended to give a brief description of the group. List its current officers, have a posted list of events, and highlight current endorsements in election campaigns.\r\n\r\nThe Capital Area Progressive Democrats Website will have a basic self-explanatory sitemap with a Navigation Bar at the top of each page. It will function on mobile devices as well.\r\n\r\nThe site will be hosted on GoDaddy.com and will use WordPress and Elementor.\r\n\r\nThe UpWork Contractor will help to set up the site temporarily behind a password-protected view until the site goes live/is approved by the board.\r\n\r\n-\r\n\r\nStep 1:\r\n\r\nSet up a home page with a basic logo that says - Website coming soon. Logo will be provided.\r\n\r\nStep 2:\r\n\r\nSet Up the skeleton of a website with copy blocks simply set up as Copy Copy Copy.\r\n\r\nStep 3:\r\n\r\nMake edits to the copy of the website\r\n\r\n-\r\n\r\nThe Website will have the same look and feel as https://www.laurieforjudge.com/ except for a different color scheme.\r\n\r\n\r\n-','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01bad6a3a3e5c8e380','-',7,'United States','Corpus Christi',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-04-28',1,'2023-04-28',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-28 10:13:46',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
