(19773,'Branding Designer',2,'We are seeking an experienced Branding Designer to join our team in developing and implementing the visual brand identity for our new software product. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in branding and graphic design, with a portfolio showcasing their work on previous software products or related projects.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDevelop and execute a comprehensive branding strategy for the new software product, ensuring a consistent and cohesive visual identity across all marketing materials, digital platforms, and product interfaces.\r\nCreate compelling and visually appealing design elements, including logos, typography, color schemes, and iconography, that effectively communicate the product\'s value proposition and brand personality.\r\nCollaborate with the marketing, product, and development teams to ensure brand alignment and design cohesion throughout the product development process.\r\nContinuously analyze and assess the effectiveness of branding efforts, making adjustments as needed to optimize brand perception and engagement.\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nBachelor\'s degree in Graphic Design, Visual Arts, or a related field.\r\nA minimum of 5 years of experience in branding design, with a strong focus on software products or technology-related projects.\r\nProficiency in Adobe Creative Suite, specifically Illustrator, Photoshop, and InDesign.\r\nDemonstrated ability to create visually appealing design elements that effectively communicate brand identity and value proposition.\r\nStrong communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively in cross-functional teams.\r\nDetail-oriented and able to manage multiple projects simultaneously, while meeting tight deadlines.\r\nA portfolio of relevant work is required for consideration.\r\nTo ensure you have read the entire job post, please include the phrase \"Creative Branding\" in the subject line of your application or within your cover letter.\r\n\r\nIf you meet the above qualifications and are passionate about creating engaging and memorable brand experiences, we encourage you to apply. We look forward to reviewing your portfolio and learning more about your unique approach to branding design.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ff6b4d16bab4f7a6','-',7,'United States','Dubai',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-04-28',1,'2023-04-28',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-28 10:24:47',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(19774,'Shopify Website Designer / Developer',16,'Job Description:\r\nLooking for a talented Shopify Website Designer. As a Shopify Website Designer, you will be responsible for designing & developing the Shopify website. Your primary role will be to create a visually appealing and user-friendly eCommerce website.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n• Design and develop Shopify website based on specifications and requirements.\r\n• Customize themes, templates, and layouts to create unique and visually appealing website.\r\n• Implement new features and functionalities using Shopify apps and plugins.\r\n• Optimize website performance and page load speed.\r\n• Ensure website security and data protection.\r\n• Collaborate to ensure consistent branding and messaging across the entire website.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n• Proven experience as a Shopify website designer, with a strong portfolio of previous work.\r\n• Strong understanding of Shopify\'s platform and ecosystem\r\n• Experience with Shopify apps and plugins\r\n• Strong communication skills\r\n• Conduct regular meetings to gather requirements and present design proposals\r\n• Create mockups to visualize website design\r\n• Develop responsive and mobile-friendly design\r\n• Optimize website content for search engine optimization (SEO)\r\n• Troubleshoot and resolve website issues and bugs\r\n• Communicate project status and updates regularly\r\n\r\nIf you are a creative and talented Shopify Website Designer (and have read this far, start your reply with the word Apple so that we know you actually read the above description in addition send at least 5 links showing your work, not a sub-contactor outside the US you hire, your work and a bonus is if you can show me a CBD specific website you have developed, not required, but for sure a bonus) with a passion for eCommerce and digital design, you encouraged you to apply for this exciting opportunity.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~013c29e8ef298f107c','-',7,'United States','Ashton',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-04-28',1,'2023-04-28',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-28 10:42:21',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
