(19806,'Squarespace Website Designer',18,'Hello Squarespace Designer!\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a talented Squarespace Website Designer to help us take our website to the next level. We have already created a rough draft of the site on Squarespace, but we need someone who is an expert in Squarespace and UI and UX design to help us make it more polished and effective.\r\n\r\nAs our website will serve as a channel for our upcoming app, it\'s important that you understand how to create a website that can support and complement an app\'s functionality. You will be responsible for ensuring that our website provides a seamless user experience and effectively communicates our brand message.\r\n\r\nThe site will likely be a single-scrolling page\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n`Extensive experience with Squarespace website design\r\n`Strong UI and UX design skills\r\n`Ability to create a website that complements an app\'s functionality\r\n`Proficient in Adobe Creative Suite or similar\r\n`Familiarity with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript\r\n`Excellent communication and collaboration skills\r\n`Ability to meet deadlines\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n~Create a user flow that optimizes sales and expresses clearly our app\'s benefits and features.\r\n\r\n~Optimize the website for performance and search engine visibility.\r\n\r\nIf you have a passion for Squarespace website design and are excited to work on a project that has the potential to make a real impact, we want to hear from you.\r\n\r\nPlease submit your resume, portfolio, and relevant work samples for consideration. Please provide samples and links from the Squarespace sites you have designed recently.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b61387eddf1c8964','Zach Fletcher - Squarespace Website Designer - Munir',190,'United States','South Lake Tahoe',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-04-26',1,'2023-04-28',1,'Fixed',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-04-28 16:28:12','2023-05-25 19:11:53',19,3,NULL,133),
