(19813,'Strong Accountant/Bookkeeper Very Proficient in Quickbooks Online',39,'Good Day; we need QBO file and books reconciled and updated for Jan 1 2022 to present. Must be very familiar and proficient with payroll accounting (accurately classifying expenses: employee contributions vs. employer contributions, taxes, etc.)\r\n\r\nExcellent and timely communication and meeting of deadlines is a must. Must be able to work and communicate during EST standard business hours.\r\n\r\nThe books/finances that need to be managed are service-based businesses.\r\n\r\nThis is a one time project that can lead to ongoing/full time work.\r\n\r\nP&L (income statement), balance sheet, statement of cash flows, A/P and A/R reports, and other reports as requested. Must provide and complete and accurate bank reconciliation monthly and be proactive in classification of transactions (versus sending a long list of \"ask my client\"/\"ask my accountant\" without first trying to Google, etc).\r\n\r\nOther requirements:\r\n\r\n- Ensures the integrity of accounting information by recording, verifying, consolidating, and entering transactions\r\n\r\n- Prepares and records asset, liability, revenue, and expenses entries by compiling and analyzing account information\r\n\r\n- Maintains general ledger by transferring subsidiary accounts, preparing a trial balance, and reconciling entries\r\n\r\n- Summarizes financial status by collecting information and preparing balance sheet, profit and loss, and other statements\r\n\r\n- Produces payroll and responsible for vendor and invoice processing for some clients by initiating computer processing (via QBO)\r\n\r\n- Helps gather information to complete an external audit by analyzing and scheduling general ledger accounts and providing information for auditors\r\n\r\n- Avoids legal challenges by complying with U.S. legal requirements\r\n\r\n- Secures financial information by completing database backups\r\n\r\n- Protects organization’s value by keeping information CONFIDENTIAL\r\n\r\nLooking to begin work immediately.\r\n\r\nPlease respond with the day of the week to confirm read solicitation in its entirety. Thank you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1652036930893750273?success','-',7,'United States','Miami',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-04-28',1,'2023-04-28',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-28 19:48:48',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(19814,'QuickBooks Bookkeeper for Real Estate Business',39,'We are seeking a QuickBooks Professional to assist with day-to-day bookkeeping and accounting tasks for our real estate development company. The ideal candidate will have experience with QuickBooks Online, and be able to work independently and efficiently in a remote environment.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Create journal entry for purchase and sales settlement statements\r\n- Create journal entry for constructions draw\r\n- Allocate monthly mortgage payments using bank feed\r\n- Allocate construction draws using bank feed\r\n- Create new classes as new properties are acquired\r\n- Review invoices to ensure they have not been paid previously or are duplicates\r\n- Attend weekly meeting on Wednesdays at 11 AM CST\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nQuickBooks Online experience required\r\nExcellent communication skills, both written and verbal\r\nAbility to work independently and manage multiple tasks\r\nStrong attention to detail and accuracy','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1652038068657430529?success','-',7,'United States','Stanwood',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-04-28',1,'2023-04-28',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-04-28 19:53:23',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
