(19847,'Quick Books Projects',39,'We are looking for an experienced and detail-oriented Quick Books Online specialist to assist us with our accounting and bookkeeping needs. The ideal candidate should possess strong knowledge of Accounting, Accounting Software, Accounts Payable, Accounts Receivable, Bank Reconciliation, Bookkeeping, Intuit QuickBooks, Microsoft Excel, Numeric Fluency, and Quick books.\r\n\r\nThe project is expected to last for more than 6 months for multiple clients, and the selected candidate will be responsible for managing our financial records, reconciling bank statements, processing invoices and payments, managing accounts payable and receivable, and generating reports using QuickBooks and Microsoft Excel.\r\n\r\nMust Be willing to sign a NDA and separate client contract.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this position, please submit a detailed proposal outlining your relevant skills and experience. Please include links to past completed projects that demonstrate your proficiency in QuickBooks and accounting software.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a candidate who is reliable, efficient, and proactive in their approach to handling financial data. If you are a team player with excellent communication skills and a strong work ethic, we look forward to reviewing your application.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653026249103147009?success','-',7,'United States','Pittsburgh',18.000,'perhour',18.000,'2023-05-01',1,'2023-05-01',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-01 13:21:50',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(19848,'Amazing Graphic Designer Needed For Book Cover and Interior Layout',2,'We partner with an independent book publishing company; our client\'s books range from 8,000 to 50,000 words. We are looking for a highly graphic designer with a solid track record of designing and producing the cover and interiors for a ready-for-print book (that looks amazing) to comply with different publication specs, including KDP, Ingram, and many others. This would be an ongoing opportunity if you are a good fit for our team.\r\n\r\nBook themes and topics will vary depending on the personality and goals of the author. You MUST already have a solid track record in this area. You must be creative and highly detail-oriented. Please only apply for this job if you have a lot of experience creating book layouts and an amazing eye for design.\r\n\r\nOur books include quotes, photos, cartoons, designs, and, of course, chapter headings. We are looking for someone who is professional and can complete projects with a quick turnaround time.\r\nPlease include samples of your manuscripts and covers you\'ve laid out (that you\'re most proud of).\r\n\r\nWe will require you to sign an NDA and independent contractor agreement. All work produced is highly confidential and can\'t be used in your portfolio or shared. In return, we offer you a steady supply of ongoing work, a large degree of creative freedom, and the opportunity to join a highly talented team.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016bc0d2ebde36ea6a','-',7,'United States','Ann Arbor',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-01',1,'2023-05-01',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-01 13:22:03',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(19849,'Bookkeeper',39,'We are looking for someone who can help us remotely with the bookkeeping for our company based in the Netherlands.\r\n\r\nThe job will entail a.o.:\r\n- Matching incoming transactions with invoices\r\n- Processing incoming payments of customers\r\n- Contact with customers regarding payments paid or outstanding\r\n- Providing payment details to customers/creditors/debtors\r\n- Sending payment reminders to customers\r\n- Ensuring bank statements are processed correctly in Accountview (our bookkeeping software) and balances are correct.\r\n\r\nI’m certain there will be a few other tasks which are not included in this list, however the main tasks have been mentioned.\r\n\r\nWe are looking to hire someone long term for around 32-40 hours per week. Approximately 16-24 hours will be spend on assisting with the bookkeeping. De hours left will be spend on assisting in our sales team with compiling offers to customers. New employees will have to get acquainted with our article database, prices etc.\r\n\r\nOur sales employees compile offers to customers and match the right articles with the requested items. Our company sells medical supplies to the shipping industry.\r\n\r\nWe hope for a long term working relationship.\r\n\r\nThe salary would be approximately 600 USD for 40 hours of work per week. If less hours are worked, the salary is calculated proportionally.\r\n\r\nThe hours need to made within Amsterdam timezone working hours and preferably have a fixed schedule. It is important that you keep in contact with our team in the Netherlands and questions can be asked back and forth.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653029144321118209?success','-',7,'United States','Hoogvliet Rotterdam',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-01',1,'2023-05-01',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-01 13:32:06',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
