(19854,'Re-designing an existing logo',10,'We are seeking an experienced logo designer to re-design our Arsenal Therapy Podcast logo. Our podcast is dedicated to all things Arsenal FC, and we want our logo to reflect the passion and enthusiasm we have for the club. The current logo has served us well, but we feel that it is time for a fresh new look that accurately represents our brand. I have attached the current logo.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Work closely with us to understand our vision and requirements for the new logo design.\r\n\r\n- Create multiple design concepts for us to choose from.\r\n\r\n- Make revisions and modifications to the chosen design until we are satisfied with the final product.\r\n\r\n- Provide us with the final design files in various formats (e.g. vector, PNG, JPG).\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience in logo design, with a portfolio of previous work to showcase.\r\n\r\n- Excellent design skills, with a keen eye for detail and the ability to create unique and memorable logos.\r\n\r\n- Strong communication skills, with the ability to understand and interpret client requirements.\r\n\r\n- Proficiency in design software such as Adobe Illustrator or Photoshop.\r\n\r\n- A passion for football and knowledge of Arsenal FC is a plus, but not required.\r\n\r\nIf you are a talented logo designer who is up for the challenge of re-designing our Arsenal Therapy Podcast logo, we want to hear from you! Please send us your portfolio and a brief cover letter explaining why you are the right person for the job.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653038241234845697?success','-',7,'United States','essex',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-01',1,'2023-05-01',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-01 14:07:59',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
