(19857,'Digital Designer required for shopify webstore',16,'We are looking for a Designer with a love for websites.\r\n\r\nThis role will focus specifically on our digital marketing, and ecommerce website but will work alongside our existing design team.\r\nRegular activity will include:\r\n• Creating static ads for use across Google Display Network, Facebook and Instagram.\r\n• Wireframing landing pages to be created using Replo (a plug-in for Shopify).\r\n• Updating webpages with CSS tweaks or new banners etc.\r\n• Designing Instagram Stories and reels.\r\n\r\nWhat skills and qualities are we looking for?\r\nOf course, you need to know Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, and InDesign. But more specifically:\r\n• Figma knowledge is essential as Replo functions similarly.\r\n• Shopify CMS experience is also very valuable.\r\n• CSS skills are beneficial, as many tweaks needed to pre-designed web elements require it.\r\n• Experience creating HMTL5 banners is beneficial.\r\n• A working knowledge of UX and CRO principles will help you construct webpages that perform.\r\n• Similarly, a working knowledge of advertising principles will help you design ads that engage their audiences.\r\nIt would also be valuable to know Replo, but we’re sure if you have the above skills then you can pick it up no problem.\r\n\r\nOther skills with shopify development are desirable.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653042378759946241?success','-',7,'United States','Glasgow',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-05-01',1,'2023-05-01',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-01 14:24:22',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
