(19860,'QuickBooks Expert Accountant',39,'Our company is currently seeking a highly skilled QuickBooks Expert Accountant to join our team. The ideal candidate will have a deep understanding of accounting principles and practices, as well as a demonstrated ability to work with QuickBooks software.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nConduct a thorough audit of all company financial records, including but not limited to balance sheets, income statements, and cash flow statements\r\nReview all transactions and financial reports to ensure accuracy and completeness\r\nIdentify and resolve any discrepancies or errors found during the audit process\r\nPrepare financial reports and statements for review by management and external stakeholders\r\nAdvise management on financial best practices and provide recommendations for process improvements\r\nWork collaboratively with the finance team to ensure all accounting practices are aligned with company goals and objectives\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nBachelor\'s degree in Accounting or a related field\r\nAt least 3 years of experience working with QuickBooks software\r\nStrong understanding of accounting principles and practices\r\nExcellent analytical and problem-solving skills\r\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team\r\nStrong communication and interpersonal skills\r\nDetail-oriented with a high level of accuracy and efficiency\r\nIf you meet the above requirements and are passionate about accounting and finance, we would love to hear from you. This is a great opportunity to work with a dynamic team and make a real impact on our company\'s financial performance.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653043676888645633?success','-',7,'United States','LONDON',10.000,'perhour',10.000,'2023-05-01',1,'2023-05-01',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-01 14:30:20',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(19861,'Corporate graphic line for an small service company in energy',10,'I just started a small company (myself alone for the moment) in the field of energy, solar photovoltaic and electrical engineering.\r\n\r\nI have a few ideas about the corporate graphic line, the message to transmit, and how I want to present the services . I just made an logo and a small wordpress site ( https://albedo.ch ), but I have no time to do it all by myself ( and not the competences that you have ;-) )\r\n\r\nFrom this starting point:\r\n\r\nThe goal of the project is create the elements to present the company and have the material to communicate:\r\n-work on the logo and make it clean, keeping the first idea of hexagone (=snowflake) and ray of light reflecting, which represent the albedo (name of the company). Have the vectorized files to reuse easily later\r\n-have a corporate graphic guideline with a coherent color set, police.\r\n-have a few icons for the various services\r\n-have clean templates for Word report and Powerpoint.\r\n\r\nThe basic ideas for the start point are in the attached file.\r\n\r\nMore could come later in function of the results, but let\'s make this first step first.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653044621605826561?success','-',7,'United States','Euseigne',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-05-01',1,'2023-05-01',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-01 14:33:21',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
