(19863,'Quick Books Online (Monthly) Auditor',39,'We are searching for a skilled and experienced professional to join our team as a QuickBooks Online Monthly Auditor for a project lasting more than six months. The successful candidate should possess expertise in accounting, accounting software, accounts receivable, balance sheet, bank reconciliation, bookkeeping, GAAP, Intuit QuickBooks, and Microsoft Excel.\r\n\r\nAs a QuickBooks Online Monthly Auditor, you will be responsible for ensuring the accuracy of financial records and compliance with accounting standards. You will be expected to audit financial statements, review transactions, and reconcile bank statements, among other responsibilities.\r\n\r\nMust Be willing to sign a NDA and separate client contract. To apply for this position, please submit a proposal that highlights your experience and skills in accounting and QuickBooks. We encourage you to include links to past completed projects that demonstrate your proficiency in this area.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to reviewing your application and working with you on this exciting project.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653046594434461697?success','-',7,'United States','Pittsburgh',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-01',1,'2023-05-01',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-01 14:41:18',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
