(19870,'Canadian Year End Bookkeeping Catch Up',39,'Hey I\'m looking to complete the my corporate bookkeeping from October 2021 to September 2022.\r\n\r\nI run a short term rental company. The majority of the funds come from Airbnb and Square (for booking.com and Expedia)\r\n\r\nI pay my employees with Rise and pay them via e-transfer. All statements can be provided.\r\n\r\nKeep in mind that as of July 1st, Airbnb collect HST, I\'ve spoken to my account and we won\'t need to reverse calculate the past past that date for Airbnb.\r\n\r\nHow many hours do you think it would take? I would say I have 100-150 transactions per month.\r\n\r\nAll work will then be sent to my accountant!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653058294520266753?success','-',7,'United States','Ottawa',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-05-01',1,'2023-05-01',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-01 15:27:51',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
