(19878,'that will look mesmerizing and attract the audience at first look and stand out.',2,'We are looking for a proficient bilingual (French and English) graphic designer to redo our product packaging. The project is expected to take less than a month. The ideal candidate should have expertise in Adobe Illustrator, Adobe Photoshop, and packaging design. The candidate will need to be able to convert English to French appropriately.\r\n\r\nYour responsibilities will include creating visually appealing packaging designs that will attract and retain the attention of our customers. You will be expected to deliver high-quality designs that meet our brand standards and effectively communicate our brand message.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this job, please submit a proposal describing how you can help with this project. Please include links to your past completed projects that demonstrate your proficiency in packaging design and bilingual design. We are looking for a candidate who can work efficiently, communicate effectively, and deliver quality work within the given timeline. We look forward to hearing from you.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ddb68a4b343b7eeb','-',7,'United States','Red Deer',30.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-01',1,'2023-05-01',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-01 16:28:06',NULL,19,3,NULL,129),
