(19880,'Bookkeeping',39,'We have a design agency based in Auckland and am looking for bookkeeping support to assist with business growth, invoicing and remittance.\r\n\r\nHere is what I am looking for in regards to bookkeeping support;\r\n- Bank reconciliation - My accountant already does this but ideally this is handled more regularly. 2 Bank accounts with anywhere from 30-50 transactions per month.\r\n- Monthly statements and follow-ups on outstanding payments\r\n- Monthly P&L reports\r\n- Processing jobs out of Streamtime into Xero and getting draft invoices ready for approval.\r\n- Processing draft invoices, for approval and then sending to clients on a fortnightly basis. - -- Currently, invoicing approve $200k per month across 20-30 invoices per month. Some of which are recurring.\r\n- Applying Verticals to invoices. These are setup that just need to be applied to job type.\r\n- Archiving Jobs in Streamtime once invoiced\r\n- Paying billables to suppliers approx 10-15 per month\r\n- Reporting on Aged Payables','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653085274749845505?success','-',7,'United States','Auckland',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-01',1,'2023-05-01',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-01 17:15:05',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(19881,'Webflow Designer for Website Design Project',4,'We are looking for an experienced Webflow designer to help us design a website for our business. The ideal candidate should have a strong portfolio of work that showcases their ability to create visually stunning websites that are also functional and user-friendly.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n* Design a website using Webflow that meets the specifications - must be able to use Webflow to create website\r\n* Collaborate to understand brand and design preferences\r\n* Create wireframes and mockups to communicate design ideas\r\n* Ensure that the website is responsive and optimized for different devices\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nStrong experience with Webflow, including proficiency in using its design tools\r\nDemonstrable experience designing websites that are both visually stunning and functional\r\nExperience with responsive design and optimization for different devices\r\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills\r\nAbility to work independently and manage deadlines effectively\r\nIf you\'re a talented Webflow designer looking for an exciting project, please submit your portfolio and resume. We\'re looking forward to working with you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653090421626585089?success','-',7,'United States','San Francisco',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-05-01',1,'2023-05-01',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-01 17:43:08',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
(19882,'Develop a brand identity for a coffee brand',2,'We are looking for a talented graphic designer to develop a complete brand identity for our coffee brand, \"Broche\". Our brand is based on the idea of interesting tiny details all around our brand, similar to the intricate details of a brooch. We want the branding to convey sophistication, attention to detail, and high-quality coffee products.\r\n\r\nThe deliverables for this project include the following:\r\n\r\nLogo design - We need a logo that embodies the essence of our brand, and reflects the idea of interesting tiny details all around. The logo should be adaptable for different mediums and should be available in various file formats.\r\nColour scheme - We need a set of colours that reflect the sophistication and elegance of our brand. The colour scheme should be used consistently throughout all branding materials, including cups, coffee bags, and packaging for our desserts.\r\nBrand book - We need a comprehensive brand book that includes guidelines for the use of our logo, colour scheme, typography, and other visual elements. The brand book should also include examples of how the branding should be applied across various mediums, such as digital platforms and print materials.\r\nCoffee cup design - We need a design for our coffee cups that incorporates our logo and brand colours. The design should be visually appealing and should reflect the high-quality of our coffee products.\r\nCoffee bag and dessert packaging design - We need designs for our coffee bags and packaging for our desserts, such as croissants and sweets. The designs should incorporate our brand colours and logo, and should be visually appealing and eye-catching.\r\nSocial media templates - We need templates for our social media platforms that incorporate our brand colours and logo. These templates should be designed for consistency and brand recognition.\r\nIf you are interested in this project, please submit a proposal that includes the following:\r\n\r\nYour portfolio of relevant work\r\nA brief summary of your understanding of the project\r\nYour estimated timeline for completion\r\nYour proposed rate for the project\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653094472256299009?success','-',7,'United States','Oxford',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-05-01',1,'2023-05-01',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-01 17:53:55',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
