(19899,'Auditing | Inventory Consulting | New Accounting Quickbooks Setup & Closing Processes',39,'Hello there!\r\n\r\nWe are hiring an experienced accounting expert with a strong accounting background to help supervise and audit our accounting books on a regular basis and ensure the complete accuracy of the financial statements.\r\n\r\nAs well as help us perform high-level accounting tasks related to our operations, such as opening and closing new companies, and the related accounting files, consolidating companies, etc...\r\n\r\nYou’re a great fit if\r\n\r\nYou have existing processes in place to quickly evaluate whether accounts have been reconciled.\r\n\r\nYou have a process of checklists you follow to be sure files and documents are correct.\r\n\r\nYou can audit quickly and efficiently, and spot trouble areas. What’s not been done, jumps out to you immediately.\r\n\r\nOrganization makes your heart swell, and numbers and spreadsheets make you happy.\r\n\r\nYou’re accurate and meticulous and have a balanced checkbook. Having documents that are off drives you crazy.\r\n\r\nYou have a process to check state, sales tax, and federal tax filings to be sure all necessary payments have been made.\r\n\r\nYou love being depended on and know your work contributes to the entire team.\r\n\r\nYou set internal deadlines and honor them. You are the type of person who submits your work ahead of the deadline and believes if you’re on time, you are already 10 minutes late.\r\n\r\nYou have inventory experience and have KPIs you follow for best practices related to an inventory business.\r\nYou are tracking trends and want to report to management.\r\n\r\nYou are very comfortable with regular meetings and making recommendations, related to inventory, high expenses, low cash flow, etc.. and can easily share and communicate these pitfalls with the owners.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653127523517558785?success','-',7,'United States','Houston',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-