(19923,'Packaging design for collagen',2,'Design the artwork for a collagen tub to complement a pouch design that I already have:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.rhythmnutrition.com/products/complete-repair\r\n\r\nI do not yet have the exact dimensions of the tub but below are examples of what a typical collagen tub looks like, and I will ask you to refine the design once we have the correct size template.\r\n\r\nExample 1:\r\n\r\nhttps://puracollagen.co.uk/shop/collagen-bundles/beauty-sleep-bundle/?gad=1&gclid=Cj0KCQjw6cKiBhD5ARIsAKXUdyaJs7ihbwFtGHZjfHKqLs3CJ71Vp6AFY5ExIEuuKvhMDJ9KoEJ4_8caAiUOEALw_wcB\r\n\r\nExample 2:\r\n\r\nhttps://wearefeel.com/products/feel-pro-collagen?variant=42466134261928&utm_source=google&utm_medium=cpc&utm_campaign=17467235416&gad=1&gclid=Cj0KCQjw6cKiBhD5ARIsAKXUdyaUHxgXvUmefAW4yjXjlWFener7fqmbqKOIzMuoGzpbTJnLITWkjA4aApyCEALw_wcB\r\n\r\nExample 3:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.skinglocollagen.com/product/skinglo-collagen-drink-rose-gold/?gclid=Cj0KCQjw6cKiBhD5ARIsAKXUdybgzY8NJTHB89l0n7-m67DYozhz9tbUKrBBIn5gid9Jhz2jfgnFM9EaAlPQEALw_wcB\r\n\r\nAttached are the front and rear labels for the REFILL packs. I want you to take the design cues from this packet and make a design that works on the tub. It doesn\'t have to the same design, the goal is for the pouch to look complementary to the tub that I want you to design.\r\n\r\nCopy: for now take all the copy from the pouch design EXCEPT the white table on the front of the pouch that has the customer name and the ingredients.\r\n\r\nThe overall goal is to communicate COLLAGEN for MOVEMENT / JOINT HEALTH. Movement can be an abstract or a literal concept in design.\r\n\r\nMust look beautiful and premium. Example 3 above is my favourite.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you have any questions.\r\n\r\nYasir','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01340438abfeb897f9','-',7,'United States','Peterborough',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-05-02',1,'2023-05-02',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-02 07:54:56',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(19924,'Logo',10,'We are seeking a skilled logo designer to create a new logo for our car dealership. The designer will be responsible for conceptualizing, designing, and delivering a high-quality logo that effectively represents our brand and appeals to our target audience. The designer should have experience creating logos for businesses and be familiar with the latest design software.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Research and analyze the market and competition to create a unique\r\nand memorable logo\r\n- Conceptualize and create logo designs that align with the brand identity\r\nand target audience\r\n- Present logo options to the marketing team and receive feedback\r\n- Refine and revise the chosen design until it meets the company\'s\r\nstandards\r\n- Deliver the final logo in various formats, including print, digital, and\r\nsocial media\r\n- Provide guidance and support for implementing the logo across all\r\nmarketing channels\r\n- Stay up-to-date with the latest design trends and techniques\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience as a logo designer, with a strong portfolio of\r\nprevious logo designs\r\n- Proficient in design software such as Adobe Illustrator and Photoshop\r\n- Attention to detail and ability to deliver high-quality work on time\r\n- Understanding of brand identity and target audience\r\n- Familiarity with the latest design trends and techniques\r\n\r\nIf you meet the requirements and have a passion for creating unique and memorable logos, please apply on this project for consideration.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0123579d14fa5842ea','-',7,'United States','Oslo',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-02',1,'2023-05-02',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-02 08:02:46',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
