(19949,'Xero Bookkeeping Expert to untangle the mess we made out of Xero',39,'We are a print marketing company using Xero for our bookkeeping. We\'re looking for an experienced Xero pro to help us straighten things out.\r\n\r\nWe had someone inhouse reconciling and I believe they didn\'t really understand the project and incorrectly matched many transactions. We need to clean things up, correctly match the bank account transactions, and make sure accounts payable and receivables are up to date.\r\n\r\nI believe this might be messed up bad enough that it could even make sense to redo everything in Quickbooks or ZohoBooks and start from scratch.\r\n\r\nWe are a young company, during the summer of 2021, so less than 2 years of transactions. We do not have a very large amount of transactions, probably less than 20 invoices per month, and maybe 12 or fewer Purchase Orders per month. While there are plenty of transactions that have already been matched I suspect many of the transactions involving account transfers were reconciled incorrectly.\r\n\r\nWe use Gusto for payroll, so that should be correct but a couple minor edits may be required for that too. We never fully integrated gusto\'s system into Xero.\r\n\r\nThe business has used a total of three banks since it\'s founding, with a total of 6 checking and savings accounts between them.\r\n\r\nFirst and foremost we need to get the books cleaned up. Afterwards there is also the opportunity to come on part-time to take care of our bookkeeping going forward.\r\n\r\nHelp us Xero Pro!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653400313472733185?success','-',7,'United States','Plymouth',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-02',1,'2023-05-02',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-02 14:07:29',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
