(19959,'Financial Coordinator (Accounts Management and Capital Raising)',39,'I am seeking a highly organized and detail-oriented Financial Coordinator with expertise in providing operational and financial support. The successful candidate will be responsible for maintaining accurate financial records, preparing invoices, weekly reports, and annual statements.\r\n\r\nBusiness planning, capital raising and grant application submissions are also required.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will have excellent communication and organizational skills, a strong attention to detail, and a proven track record of managing multiple tasks simultaneously in a fast-paced environment.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n• Manage and maintain financial records, including preparing and submitting invoices.\r\n• Prepare and deliver financial reports and annual statements for clients\r\n• Update QuickBooks to ensure accurate and up-to-date financial records\r\n• Assist with business plan development, capital raising and grant applications.\r\n• Create and maintain files and records, including client contracts, invoices, and other financial documents\r\n• Provide general operational and financial support as needed\r\n\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\n• Minimum of 5 years of accounting experience\r\n• Strong understanding of accounting principles and practices\r\n• Excellent communication skills, both verbal and written\r\n• Exceptional organizational skills and attention to detail\r\n• Ability to manage multiple tasks simultaneously and prioritize effectively\r\n• Strong problem-solving skills and ability to work independently\r\n• Proficient in Microsoft Office, particularly Excel and Word\r\n\r\nPlease note that the position requires someone living in Canada. This position requires 12 hours per week / between the hours of 9am and 5pm.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653411684854767617?success','-',7,'United States','Nassau',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-02',1,'2023-05-02',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-02 14:53:05',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(19960,'Outsourced Accounting Solution',39,'Rapidly growing start-up needs accounting support.\r\n\r\nRequired Taxes:\r\nAccrual-basis bookkeeping in Quickbooks Online (QBO), updated monthly\r\nReconcile banks and credit cards against their statements\r\nCategorize transactions and maintain chart of accounts\r\n\r\nManage revenue transactions including:\r\nAllocate revenue to the appropriate account\r\nRecognize revenue based on the invoice date\r\nReconcile invoices from Bill.com to payments received\r\nManage expense transactions including:\r\nBreakdown COGS vs. Expenses according to management’s guidance\r\nIdentify and handle accrued or prepaid expenses (e.g., annual subscriptions)\r\nExpense all inventory purchases to COGS as incurred\r\nMonitor and reconcile expense reporting integration from expense reporting software\r\nRecord payroll journal entries in QBO and reconcile against your payroll processor\'s data\r\nCapitalize and depreciate fixed assets\r\nGenerate a monthly report which includes the profit and loss statement, balance sheet, statement of cash flows, burn rate report, and flux report\r\nYou will email draft books on the 10th business day of the following month with any questions/notes from the bookkeeping work\r\n\r\nWill also need assistance with generating invoices weekly for projects.\r\n\r\n\r\nWould prefer a set monthly rate as opposed to hourly.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653413921128697857?success','-',7,'United States','Detroit',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-02',1,'2023-05-02',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-02 15:00:36',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
