(19989,'Bookkeeping Help to Close 2022 Books - USA',39,'We are a US-based company looking for a skilled bookkeeper to help close our 2022 books (we say closed, because our previous bookkeeper became unavailable from ~August forward, so that\'s the period we need help with). The ideal candidate should have experience in bank reconciliation, bookkeeping, and Quickbooks.  Please note: the chart of accounts is already set up, so this is mostly bank reconciliation.\r\n\r\nAs our bookkeeper, you will be responsible for reconciling bank accounts, preparing financial statements, and ensuring the accuracy of our financial records. You should have a solid understanding of accounting principles and the ability to work independently.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this project, please submit a proposal detailing your experience in bookkeeping and how you can help us with this project. Please include links to past completed bookkeeping projects that you have worked on.\r\n\r\nThis project is expected to take less than a month to complete. We are looking for someone who is reliable, detail-oriented, and can work efficiently to meet our deadline. If you think you are the right fit for this project, we look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653453115969814529','-',7,'United States','Clarkston',1200.000,'fixed',1200.000,'2023-05-02',1,'2023-05-02',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-02 19:09:01',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(19990,'Need web designer to redesign existing website',4,'We have an existing website located here: https://myrvmail.com. Our existing design is about 8 years old and doesn\'t feel very modern. We would like to get the entire site redesigned to something that is more modern. No existing design elements from the current site need to be retained, we\'re open to a complete re-imagination of what it should look like. A full list of the pages can be seen here:\r\n\r\nhttps://myrvmail.com (+ a login and forgot password dialog)\r\nhttps://myrvmail.com/signup\r\nhttps://myrvmail.com/company\r\nhttps://myrvmail.com/contact\r\nhttps://myrvmail.com/info\r\nhttps://myrvmail.com/physical-address-florida\r\nhttps://myrvmail.com/digital-mailbox-service\r\nhttps://myrvmail.com/address-mail-forwarding\r\nhttps://myrvmail.com/us-package-forwarding\r\nhttps://myrvmail.com/virtual-llc-address\r\nhttps://myrvmail.com/faq\r\nhttps://myrvmail.com/resources\r\nhttps://myrvmail.com/affiliates\r\nhttps://myrvmail.com/residency\r\nhttps://myrvmail.com/privacy\r\nhttps://myrvmail.com/terms\r\nhttps://myrvmail.com/hours\r\n\r\nAll but two pages are just static information, most of which is just text and looks pretty bad. We\'d like those to get a fresh design complete with elements beyond just text (icons, imagery, etc.) The other two pages do have forms that interact with our backend (registration and affiliates). It\'s not necessary to actually have knowledge to interact with those backends. Creating the pages will be enough.\r\n\r\nWe currently use React for pages with forms and an older version of Bootstrap. It\'s important that the new design be SEO friendly. There\'s no need to optimize content for SEO though as we have another team who handles that. All content can and should be copied over as is.\r\n\r\nUse of Bootstrap (newest version is ok) would be ideal since our team already knows it, but we\'re open to suggestions if better options exist. It\'s of very high importance that the site look nice and modern.\r\n\r\nOne final requirement: our main site, MyRVmail, has a blue theme. We also have cloned versions of this site called Good Sam Mail Serivce (https://goodsammailservice.com) and InstaMailbox (https://instamailbox.com). These two versions have red and teal themes respectively. It would be nice if the main site could be rethemed easily to be reused on the other sites. We DO NOT need three sites though, and the other two sites don\'t need to look terribly different.\r\n\r\nFollow-up work possible to redesign the actual platform our customers use. This won\'t happen during this contract though.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653476473657348097?success','-',7,'United States','Crestview',50.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-05-02',1,'2023-05-02',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-02 19:09:45',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
