(20041,'Experienced WordPress Web Designer for a Software Company',15,'MindMe is a state-of-the-art, all-in-one SAAS platform that combines CRM, lead capture, email & text communication, landing pages, calendar, one-to-one chat, marketing automation and more. It\'s a comprehensive, easy-to-use, affordable solution for businesses of all sizes.\r\n\r\n We are currently seeking a talented and experienced WordPress Web Designer to join our team and help us design a visually stunning, highly converting, and SEO-optimized website that effectively showcases our software platform and drives lead generation. This is an exciting opportunity for a creative and skilled web designer to make a significant impact on our online presence and contribute to our company\'s growth.\r\n\r\nRESPONSIBILITIES:\r\n\r\n1. Collaborate with the marketing and development teams to create a visually appealing, high-converting WordPress website, using our current HTML website as a reference.\r\n2. Develop and implement custom themes and templates to reflect our brand identity and ensure a consistent user experience across all devices and browsers.\r\n3. Optimize website content for SEO to drive organic traffic and improve search engine rankings.\r\n4. Incorporate best practices in lead generation and user experience design to maximize conversions and user engagement.\r\n5. Write engaging, SEO-optimized website copy.\r\n6. Test and troubleshoot website performance, functionality, and compatibility issues, ensuring a seamless user experience.\r\n\r\n REQUIREMENTS: \r\n\r\n1. Fluent in English, with exceptional verbal and written communication skills.\r\n2. Proven experience designing and developing beautiful, high-converting WordPress websites, preferably for SAAS-based software companies.\r\n3. Strong attention to detail and highly organized, with the ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously.\r\n4. Proficient in WordPress, popular plug-ins, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and responsive web design principles.\r\n5. Experience with SEO best practices, keyword research, and content optimization.\r\n6. Skilled in copywriting and content creation, with the ability to write persuasive, engaging, and SEO-optimized website content.\r\n7. A team player who is comfortable collaborating with cross-functional teams.\r\n8. Highly motivated individual capable of completing projects on budget and on time.\r\n\r\nIf you are a talented WordPress Web Designer with a passion for creating beautiful, high-converting websites and have experience with SAAS-based website projects, we would love to hear from you! Apply now to become a part of the MindMe team. Please include examples showcasing your best web design work.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1643929423706394625','-',7,'United States','Jenkintown',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-05-03',1,'2023-05-03',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-03 15:02:55',NULL,18,3,NULL,156),
