(20095,'Promotion Design Kits - Social, Banners, Email, Popup, Header',2,'I\'m are looking for someone who can design a creative brief template, design kit template instructions, and 3 example kits. The kits will include the below listed asset items.\r\n\r\nAssets List:\r\nSocial Media Posts\r\nSocial Media / Google Ad Banners (different sizes for retargeting and ad banners)\r\nEmail\r\nLanding Page Header & Promotional Graphics (not a full landing page just header and a promotional graphic)\r\nPop Ups\r\n\r\nBasically we want to create a \"kit\" with guidelines and instructions.\r\nInstructions would include required elements, sizes, margins, fonts that can be used, potential color instructions, fonts, and visual imagery guidelines.\r\n\r\nAt the end the goal is to have instructions plus 3 examples kits.\r\nThink of this like giving instructions to a graphic designer who will then use those instructions and guidelines to create kits that include the assets items previously mentioned for different holidays and promotional events.\r\n\r\nThis would also include a \"Design brief\"\r\n\r\nIncluding instructions for 24 holidays example:\r\nExample:\r\nChristmas Colors: Red, White, Green\r\nFonts: Beyond Wonderland, Frosty, Santas Big Secret BB\r\nIllustrations: Santa, Reindeer, Candy Canes, Presents, Fireplaces, Stockings, Snowmen\r\nExample Graphics:\r\n\r\nThen you would do 3 holiday example kits. NOT all 24 holiday. These kits would be used to better express the quality needed and the deliverables to a designer.\r\n\r\nIf you have experience in graphic design, and graphic design for instructions then this would be a good fit for you. At the end the instructions should be delivered with the source file, and a PDF. The sample kits would be provided as Zip file with the asset files inside and any needed instructions.\r\n\r\nWhen bidding start your bid with \"I can do template instructions and design kits\' so I know you read this and didn\'t just use a template. Show me examples of your work in both promotional asset design and instructions.\r\n\r\nAlso note that design kits will need 3 variations. They should be able to switch out some graphical element to make it industry specific. We work with 8 different industries. So for example *Same template* but have some graphic element that makes it work for Automotive, some different for Hospital, or some different for WaterPark. Just as an example.\r\n\r\nTemplates will need to use 100% free and royalty free stock, illustrations, and fonts. THAT ALLOW for them to be used in template libraries or created from scratch. You will not be able to use templates from graphic template sites.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653822397199368193?success','-',7,'United States','Seattle',1350.000,'fixed',1350.000,'2023-05-03',1,'2023-05-03',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-03 18:03:59',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
