(20097,'Podcast Art',2,'We need artwork for our podcast called Kavinaama.\r\n\r\nKavinaama is a podcast focused on Indian Poetry and Culture. Two guys reading and discussing Indian poetry with some culture mixed it. We need modern looking art (square, logo) for popular podcasting and social media platforms. It should convey the themes of our content - Indian poetry, culture and perhaps 2 friends discussing those.\r\n\r\nKavinaama means a poet’s letter in Hindi/Urdu.\r\n\r\nPlease include your portfolio in proposals.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653823759987036161?success','-',7,'United States','BREA',70.000,'perhour',70.000,'2023-05-03',1,'2023-05-03',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-03 18:09:40',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
(20098,'Business manager and accounting',39,'The purpose of this Scope of Work (SOW) is to delineate the responsibilities, tasks, and deliverables expected from an individual who will be hired to provide bookkeeping, accounting, and licensing and credentialing services for our company. This individual will be instrumental in keeping our financial records in order, maintaining our company licenses, and completing credentialing forms for hospitals.\r\n\r\nII. Responsibilities:\r\n\r\nBookkeeping and Accounting:\r\n\r\nManage all aspects of day-to-day bookkeeping and accounting processes including but not limited to: A/P, A/R, payroll, journal entries, and bank reconciliations.\r\nPrepare monthly, quarterly and annual financial reports.\r\nCoordinate with the external tax team for tax prep and audits.\r\nImplement and maintain financial controls and procedures.\r\nEnsure compliance with state and federal regulatory requirements and professional standards.\r\nLicensing and Credentialing:\r\n\r\nComplete and manage all paperwork related to licensing for the company.\r\nPrepare, compile, and submit credentialing applications for hospitals.\r\nKeep track of the status of applications and follow up as needed.\r\nMaintain all company licenses and ensure they are up-to-date.\r\nLiaise with various departments and external bodies as necessary to provide and collect necessary information.\r\nIII. Qualifications:\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate must have:\r\n\r\nA degree in Accounting, Finance, or a related field.\r\nProven experience in bookkeeping and accounting.\r\nPrevious experience with licensing and credentialing, preferably within the healthcare sector.\r\nProficiency with accounting software and Microsoft Office Suite.\r\nStrong attention to detail and the ability to maintain a high level of accuracy.\r\nExcellent organizational skills and the ability to manage multiple tasks simultaneously.\r\nStrong communication skills.\r\nIV. Deliverables:\r\n\r\nAccurate and up-to-date financial records.\r\nTimely and accurate financial reports.\r\nUpdated and valid company licenses.\r\nCompleted and submitted credentialing forms.\r\nRegular status updates and reports.\r\nV. Contract Term:\r\n\r\nThe contract term will be for a period of one year from the start date, with the potential for extension based on performance and business needs.\r\n\r\nVI. Performance Evaluation:\r\n\r\nPerformance will be evaluated based on the accuracy and timeliness of the work delivered, as well as the individual\'s adherence to the company\'s rules and procedures, and their ability to effectively communicate and work with other team members.\r\n\r\nVII. Confidentiality:\r\n\r\nGiven the nature of the work, the individual will be required to sign a confidentiality agreement, to protect sensitive company information.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653824084338778113?','-',7,'United States','Chicago',55.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-03',1,'2023-05-03',1,'00',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-03 18:12:09',NULL,11,3,NULL,160),
