(20132,'Billing',38,'Overview:\r\nWe are seeking a skilled Accountant to join our team. The Accountant will be responsible for managing financial transactions, maintaining accurate financial records, and producing financial reports for the company. The ideal candidate must be able to work efficiently and collaboratively with other team members, as well as demonstrate excellent attention to detail and strong analytical skills.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nManage all financial transactions, including accounts payable and receivable, payroll processing, and billing\r\nPrepare financial reports, such as balance sheets, income statements, and cash flow statements, and analyze financial data to identify trends, discrepancies, and opportunities for improvement\r\nEnsure accuracy and completeness of financial records by performing regular reconciliations and audits\r\nPrepare and file tax returns, ensuring compliance with tax laws and regulations\r\nMonitor budget and expenditure reports and make recommendations to management regarding cost-saving measures\r\nCollaborate with other departments, such as sales and operations, to provide financial analysis and support for decision-making\r\nStay up-to-date with industry trends and changes in financial regulations, and make recommendations to management on how to best adapt to these changes\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nBachelor\'s degree in Accounting or related field\r\n2-3 years of experience in accounting or related field\r\nStrong knowledge of financial regulations and accounting principles\r\nExcellent attention to detail and ability to maintain accurate financial records\r\nStrong analytical and problem-solving skills\r\nExcellent communication and interpersonal skills, with ability to work effectively in a team environment\r\nProficiency in accounting software and Microsoft Excel\r\nCPA certification preferred\r\nThis is a full-time position with competitive salary and benefits package. If you are a motivated and detail-oriented individual who is passionate about accounting, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653862699113607169?success','-',7,'United States','Temecula',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-03',1,'2023-05-03',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-03 20:44:53',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
