(20144,'Part-Time Accountant for Crypto-Adjacent Startup',39,'Our company is a small startup that has finances through traditional banking as well as through cryptocurrency transactions. We need someone to help us turn our bank statements & on-chain cryptocurrency transactions into traditional balance sheets that we are able to provide to our CPA to file taxes.\r\n\r\nWe use the Koinly platform to assist with cryptocurrency transactions, so we actually need the most help with our traditional finances.\r\n\r\nThe scope of this initial job is to:\r\n- Work with the COO to aggregate all company accounts, both traditional and on-chain (crypto).\r\n\r\n- Gather all account statements for the calendar year 2022, along with cryptocurrency transactions within that period. The COO will assist with this.\r\n\r\n- Use the account statements and cryptocurrency transactions to create monthly financial statements (or reports) for the company as a whole.\r\n\r\n- Aggregate all reports to create a larger financial report (balance sheet, income statement, statement of cash flows) for the Calendar Year 2022. This will be submitted to the company\'s CPA so that we can file our 2022 taxes. We\'ve already filed an extension, so no worries there.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you have any additional questions! I (the description writer) am the COO, so I should be able to answer every question you have and/or gather the resources you need.\r\n\r\nIf this goes well, then we would love to establish a longer-term working relationship where you assist us on a monthly (and future yearly) basis as well, to keep track of our finances.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking forward to working with you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1653876323630743553','-',7,'United States','0',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-05-03',1,'2023-05-03',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-03 21:46:18',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
