(20155,'Logo Design for Leadership Academy',10,'We are looking for a skilled graphic designer to create a logo for our Leadership Academy titled HighGround Leadership Academy (HGLA). The logo should work HGLA into a university shield and include our brand\'s font, look and color scheme. We need a professional-looking logo that can be used on our website, social media platforms, and print materials. Ideal candidates should have expertise in Adobe Illustrator, Adobe InDesign, and Adobe Photoshop, and have prior experience in logo design.\r\n\r\nThe project is expected to take less than a month, and we require a printable file and source file with logo transparency. The designer will be responsible for creating multiple logo options for our review and feedback. We are open to suggestions and would love to work with someone who can bring creative ideas to the table.\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit a proposal outlining your experience with logo design, your process for designing a logo, and any relevant links to past projects for our review. We look forward to working with a talented designer who can bring our vision to life.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0144a6cd89086e0d0c','-',7,'United States','US',150.000,'fixed',150.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 13:19:20',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(20156,'Convert existing website to Wordpress',15,'Hello!\r\n\r\nI am the IT director for the Lebanon, OH Chamber of Commerce.\r\n\r\nI need someone to convert https://lebanonchamber.org to a Wordpress site with all of the content intact.\r\n\r\nI do not need it to be interactive at this point at all. I do not need the forms to work on the site. This is a straight HTML copy of the site.\r\n\r\nI do not have access to the original CMS, and even if I did, the CMS is homegrown and I can not extract the data in any meaningful sense. I have taken a wget copy of the site and can get you that.\r\n\r\nI need to have an estimate regarding how many hours you think that it will take to convert this HTML site to a Wordpress site.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ba49b6585a3b612a','-',7,'United States','Lebanon',80.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 13:27:54',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
