(20158,'Illustrator-designer for map and flow chart for book',2,'I am looking for someone to make two illustrations for a book.\r\n\r\nThey are both very simple, but need to look nice and be made to certain specs in Adobe.\r\n\r\nThe first is a simple flow chart with a few circles and lines. I will provide a sketch of the desired chart.\r\n\r\nThe second is a line drawing map of some parts of southeast Asia. This would just show national borders and have a few cities labelled.\r\n\r\nI will provide specs, guidelines and examples.\r\n\r\nPlease apply with samples of similar work.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011073e838de560c00','-',7,'United States','Brooklyn',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 13:36:29',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(20159,'Professional Animator to turn Illustrator designs into Motion Masterpieces',8,'Job Description:\r\nWe are seeking a talented and creative Professional Animator to convert a series of Adobe Illustrator designs into a smooth, compelling animation as outlined in a storyboard on Figma.\r\nThe ideal candidate will have experience importing assets from Illustrator and, increasingly Figma into a professional–grade animation suite such as After Effects, Maya, or other applications and then turning them into stunning motion masterpieces.\r\n\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\nWork closely with the production team to understand the requirements of the project.\r\nAccess assets within Illustrator and Figma files and import them into Animation Suite\r\nCreate high-quality animations based on provided assets using pre-existing storyboards.\r\nEdit and composite and provide animations using various video editing software\r\nCollaborate with the client and illustrator using Figma\r\nAttend Zoom meetings with feedback\r\nWork with other designers and animators to create and adjust cohesive visual assets.\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\nBachelor\'s degree in Animation, Graphic Design, or a related field or equivalent work experience\r\nProven experience as an Animator or Motion Graphics Designer\r\nExpertise in Adobe After Effects and or other video editing software\r\nKnowledge of Figma for collaboration with clients and illustrators\r\nStrong communication and interpersonal skills\r\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team\r\nStrong attention to detail and the ability to work under pressure\r\nA strong portfolio of animations that demonstrates creative thinking and technical ability\r\n\r\nIf you are passionate about animation and have the desire to work in a dynamic and collaborative environment, we would love to hear from you! Please send a link to your portfolio along with your application.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016d1eeea3bbacb19c','-',7,'United States','Arlington',39.000,'perhour',39.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 13:43:06',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(20160,'Slide Deck Design - Quick Turnaround Requested',11,'Looking for someone to redesign a slide deck for us on a quick turnaround (ideally first round by Monday, May 8).\r\n\r\n13 slides filled with content that need an eye for design to make them easy to read and present. The content is primarily text with a couple of provided images. This will require sourcing relevant images/illustrations/icons to further illustrate the topics.\r\n\r\nWe have brand style guidelines but do not have a slide design created to follow. However, I will share inspiration slides that we like the look and feel of. We would like to do a trial (2 slides) and then complete the remaining 11.\r\n\r\nPlease share your portfolio (specifically prior slide/presentation design) and your cost (hourly, per slide, the project as a whole, etc.).\r\n\r\nPlease let me know what questions you have. Thank you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0176d3be0b8ca49c8e','-',7,'United States','Ithaca',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 13:52:07',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
