(20163,'Assistance needed with bookkeeping and bank reconciliation using Xero',39,'The Role\r\nWe are looking for an enthusiastic Finance Assistant to join our Finance Function, this role is temporary and fully remote. This role is key to the accuracy of Finance at ExperienceFirst and will report into our Finance Manager. The right person will have exposure across the entire business, partnering with different departments as needed but initially focusing on transactional finance and data surrounding it.\r\n\r\nThe role will focus on the recording and maintaining of accurate financial transactions with the opportunity to gain exposure to month end and reporting. The right person will have the opportunity to progress to a Management Accountant over time and gain more exposure to accounting. Sound like you? Read on.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities\r\nManagement of Company payroll information\r\nEnsure invoices are paid on time to freelance employees\r\nRecording transactions - you will have attention to detail when maintaining our financial transactions in terms of their accuracy.\r\nManagement of Company payroll information\r\nCredit control - you will be a business partner to other departments to confirm customer payments are received in a timely manner.\r\nSupplier invoicing - you will maintain our supplier inbox to ensure timely receipt of invoices and timely payments are made.\r\nRegular bank reconciliations, as well as reconciling between our booking engine and accounting software.\r\nAd hoc project work - you will gain exposure to other departments and the CFO on a variety of ad hoc projects.\r\nReconcile CC statements and CC portals with receipts submitted by Operations and Guides.\r\nReconcile reimbursements.\r\n\r\nSkills & Experience\r\nWhat we are looking for:\r\n- 1+ years experience in a finance role\r\n- High attention to detail - you are thorough and focused, usually picking up errors others have failed to notice\r\n- Excellent communicator - you can communicate confidently and authoritatively with a wide variety of stakeholders\r\n- Organised/flexible and able to work under pressure - you are comfortable working in a fast-paced environment, and can juggle multiple tasks at the same time\r\n- Proactive learner - you have an interest in both travel and finance\r\n\r\nThe nice-to-haves:\r\n- Experience with Quickbooks\r\n- Experience in a start-up or scale-up environment\r\n- Experience in travel or leisure\r\n\r\nThis role is part time (15 hours per week) Monday to Friday but you should be happy working some evenings and weekends if required.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654124184708542465?success','-',7,'United States','New York',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 14:04:06',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(20164,'Accountant',39,'We are looking for a Chartered Accountant who can take care of our company accounts on a regular basis and also involve in maintaining excel sheets related to certain jobs on a regular basis. We need precision in the work if we find issues in numbers and accounting flaws it\'s not going to work.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654126885081149441?success','-',7,'United States','Hounslow',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 14:13:47',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(20165,'Create a logo',10,'Please create a logo for a payroll software company who are marketing to the CIS (construction industry scheme) companies.\r\n\r\nThe company name is CIS Tool Kit\r\nand our strap line is \"Subbies Payroll with Profit Built In\"\r\n\r\nThe Construction Industry Scheme (CIS) is a UK tax scheme that applies to payments made to subcontractors for construction work. The scheme requires contractors to deduct money from the subcontractor\'s payments and submit it to HM Revenue & Customs (HMRC) as an advance payment towards the subcontractor\'s tax and National Insurance. Subcontractors must register with HMRC and may be subject to a lower rate of tax if they meet certain criteria. The scheme is designed to prevent tax evasion and ensure that subcontractors pay the correct amount of tax and National Insurance.\r\n\r\nHere are some words that could be used to describe an edgy online presence:\r\nBold\r\nRebellious\r\nUnconventional\r\nProvocative\r\nEdgy\r\nDaring\r\nRule-breaking\r\nDisruptive\r\nInnovative\r\nNonconformist\r\nAvant-garde\r\nRadical\r\nUnpredictable\r\nIrreverent\r\nControversial\r\nThese words suggest a willingness to take risks and challenge norms, and could be used to create an online presence that stands out from the crowd. However, it\'s important to use these words carefully and in a way that is consistent with the brand\'s values and target audience.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654127377536503809?success','-',7,'United States','Haydock',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 14:15:49',NULL,19,3,NULL,133),
