(20182,'Explainer animation video',8,'We are looking for a talented individual or team to create an explainer animation video for our company Intellivy. The project length will be 1-3 months and we require expertise in Advertisement, Explainer Videos and Motion Graphics. We haven\'t decided yet whether it should be a 3D Animation and/or 2D Animation, that will depend on the price.\r\n\r\nWe would like to create a 25 second video as a youtube ad, and further into the process we would like to extend this animated video into a 60 second explainer video. In the attachment we provide you with a concept storyboard to bring across our ideas.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should have experience creating engaging and informative explainer videos that can captivate our audience existing out of Amazon sellers. The video will showcase our company\'s software platform that helps our customers to get consumer information, in an easy-to-understand format.\r\n\r\nTo apply for the job, please submit begin your reaction with the sentence: \'I would like to work with intellivy\'. We would like to see links to your past completed projects to get an idea of your style and capabilities.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011096068cfb1041ea','-',7,'United States','Dordrecht',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 15:23:10',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(20183,'Logo Design',10,'Looking for a refreshed logo design for our business.  See the attached PDF document for more details about the design requirements.\r\nA qualified candidate will provide logo ideas in a PDF format.  No logo idea will be used without a contract with the freelancer.  Ideas will be used to determine the best candidate and a contract will be initiated for formal logo design.\r\n\r\nDO NOT provide any source files with your submission, they will not be considered.  Also, we do not want to see hundreds of permutations of logo designs (AI generated or otherwise).','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b3ba712190cc6640','-',7,'United States','Littleton',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 15:24:39',NULL,23,3,NULL,129),
(20184,'Logo draft, design and finalise',10,'We are going through a rebranding and renaming project. We are looking for a skilled graphic designer to help get us from a new name to a new logo.\r\n\r\nThis will be a short piece of work to tap into our brand identity, values and vibe. We will provide you with our brand guidelines etc, and any additional information required to create the logo.\r\n\r\nWe\'d like to be presented with a number of rough options and then iterate on a short-list of 3-5, to get us to a final logo. We\'d like to have copies of the final logo (transparent) in various sizes/ orientations for our website, collateral and elsewhere.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654145793192325121?success','-',7,'United States','London',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 15:29:08',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
(20185,'Shopify Web Design',16,'We are an e-commerce company specialising in selling reusable meal prep containers and kitchen utensils. Our brand message is to save time and money by preparing healthy meals in advance. Our website uses the Shopify Impulse theme and we want to improve our website by enhancing our brand message, improving the homepage, collections, and product pages, making the customer shopping experience more comfortable, increasing the conversion rate, and making the website more mobile-friendly. We are looking for a Shopify agency or freelancer that has experience in utilising all the functions available with the Impulse theme or similar theme to help us achieve these goals and take our online store to the next level.\r\n\r\n\r\nBrand Message:\r\n\r\nOur brand message is to help customers save time and money by preparing healthy meals in advance using our reusable meal prep containers and kitchen utensils. We want to emphasise the convenience and practicality of our products, encouraging customers to adopt a healthier lifestyle without sacrificing time or money. We want our brand message to be clear and consistent across all pages of our website, and to reflect the quality and durability of our products.\r\n\r\nHomepage:\r\n\r\nWe want our homepage to be clean, modern, and user-friendly. We want to showcase our brand message and our products in a way that is visually appealing and easy to navigate. We have high-quality images of our products, highlighting their features and benefits, along with clear and concise descriptions. We want to have a prominent call-to-action (CTA) that encourages customers to explore our collections and make a purchase. Our website is already integrated with reviews.io to build trust and credibility with potential customers.\r\n\r\nCollections:\r\n\r\nWe want to organise our collections in a way that is intuitive and easy to navigate. We want to categorise our products based on their use and functionality. We want to include high-quality images of each product, along with concise descriptions and specifications. We want to make it easy for customers to compare products and make an informed decision about their purchase. We also want to include customer reviews and ratings for each product to help customers make a confident choice.\r\n\r\nProduct Pages:\r\n\r\nWe want our product pages to be informative and engaging, providing customers with all the information they need to make a purchase. We want to include high-quality images of the product along with detailed descriptions of its features and benefits. We want to highlight any special offers or promotions that are currently available, along with related products that customers may be interested in. We want to make it easy for customers to add products to their cart and checkout, with clear and prominent CTAs.\r\n\r\nMobile-Friendly:\r\n\r\nWe want our website to be mobile-friendly, with a responsive design that adjusts to different screen sizes and devices. We want to optimize our website for fast load times and easy navigation, making it easy for customers to browse and purchase our products from their mobile devices. We want to ensure that our website is easy to use on both iOS and Android devices, and that our customers can access all the same features and functionality as they would on a desktop or laptop computer.\r\n\r\nMenu Bar and Navigation:\r\n\r\nCurrently, our website\'s menu bar and navigation has room for improvement. We are looking for recommendations on how to optimise our menu bar and navigation to improve the following areas:\r\n• Ease of use: Our menu bar and navigation should be easy to use, with clear labels and logical grouping of items to help customers find what they\'re looking for quickly and easily.\r\n• Mobile responsiveness: Our website should be optimized for mobile devices, with a menu bar and navigation that are easy to use on smaller screens.\r\n• Visual appeal: Our menu bar and navigation should be visually appealing and consistent with our brand\'s aesthetic\r\n\r\nInternationalisation:\r\n\r\nOur website uses Shopify Markets and Langify to sell to customers in different countries.  We need recommendations on how to further enhance the internationalisation of our website to appear more localised to the customer.  For example, the customer should see different shipping policies.\r\n\r\nWholesale:\r\n\r\nWe need our B2B wholesale landing pages redesigned to match the new website look and feel.\r\n\r\nConclusion:\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a Shopify agency or freelancer that can help us improve our website and achieve our goals of enhancing our brand message, improving the homepage, collections, and product pages, making the customer shopping experience more comfortable, increasing the conversion rate, and making the website more mobile-friendly. We believe that these improvements will help us better serve our customers and increase sales, and we are excited to work with a team or freelancer that can help us achieve these goals.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01991cc60cd2805010','-',7,'United States','Lincoln',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 15:31:27',NULL,23,3,NULL,129),
(20186,'Real Estate Investment Deck (Pitch Book)',11,'We are seeking a talented individual to help us create a Real Estate Investment Deck (Pitch Book) that will be used to pitch potential partners. The ideal candidate should have experience in Business Presentation, Fundraising, Graphic Design, Pitchbook, and Presentation Design.\r\n\r\nThe project is time sensitive and would require working this weekend, providing a draft that will be subject to change and completed output on May  9th.  As a candidate, we would like you to submit a proposal that outlines how you can help us with this project. Ability to generate pictures/drawings reflective of the potential look of some of the developments id desired.  Please include your approach to the project, critical decision criteria is investment decks (pitch books), preferably real estate, done in the past any other relevant past completed projects that demonstrate your skills.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for someone who is creative, detail-oriented, and has a strong understanding of design principles. The final product should be visually compelling and effectively communicate our investment strategy to potential investors. The final products must have a look comparable to that distributed by global investment firms. (attachments reflect the quality and \"feel\" expected, but not the format).\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this opportunity, please submit a proposal that includes your portfolio or links to past completed projects that demonstrate similar work done or your relevant skills.  Commitment to timeline is critical. We look forward to reviewing your proposal and working with you on this exciting project.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0124b25e0f1ccae9be','-',7,'United States','Kingston',200.000,'fixed',1800.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 15:32:33',NULL,23,3,NULL,129),
