(20189,'Logo/poster design for neighborhood play',10,'I need a Playbill cover graphic designed for a play the neighborhood kids are putting on. It is a Frozen parody called Frostbite: The Amazing New Musical - so will have a blue/snowflake look and a similar typeface.\r\n\r\nNo billing needed as this is the cover of the playbill (goes under the Playbill masthead, which you can see examples of online)\r\n\r\nFinal image format is JPG, GIF, or PNG, and is under 10MB.\r\nRecommended minimum dimensions: 2120 x 2811','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654147580783718401?success','-',7,'United States','Brooklyn',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 15:36:20',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
(20190,'Funding Deck Design Specialist',11,'Job Summary:\r\nWe are seeking a talented and experienced Funding Deck Design Specialist to create a visually appealing and effective pitch deck for our upcoming funding round. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in graphic design, with a focus on creating engaging and professional presentations. This is a short-term, contract role with a flexible schedule.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nCollaborate with the executive team to understand the key messaging and branding for the pitch deck.\r\nDesign and layout the pitch deck using best practices for visual storytelling and information design.\r\nCreate custom graphics and visual elements to enhance the pitch deck.\r\nEnsure that the pitch deck is consistent with the company\'s branding and messaging.\r\nWork closely with the executive team to refine the pitch deck based on feedback.\r\nDeliver the final pitch deck in a timely and professional manner.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nBachelor\'s degree in Graphic Design or a related field.\r\nAt least 3 years of experience in graphic design, with a focus on presentation design.\r\nProficient in Adobe Creative Suite, particularly Photoshop, Illustrator, and InDesign.\r\nKnowledge of best practices for visual storytelling and information design.\r\nStrong attention to detail, with a focus on creating polished and professional presentations.\r\nAbility to work independently and manage multiple projects simultaneously.\r\nExcellent communication skills, with the ability to collaborate effectively with team members.\r\n\r\nThis is an exciting opportunity to work with a dynamic and innovative fintech company and help us secure the funding we need to continue to grow and succeed. If you are a talented and experienced Funding Deck Design Specialist with a passion for graphic design and creating engaging presentations, we would love to hear from you.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e355a61ea5b5fe6f','-',7,'United States','Kent',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 15:37:21',NULL,23,3,NULL,129),
(20191,'Convert Powerpoint slides into book images',11,'We have about 150 Powerpoint slides that need to be polished in grayscale for publication in a black-and-white print book and ebook. The slides must look good in gray scale and be sharp and readable.\r\n\r\nThe slides are already done, they just need to be made into a uniform design and cleaned up in some cases.\r\n\r\nAs we find after hiring that many freelancers don\'t actually know english, we may ask for a demonstration that you comprehend the instructions so we don\'t waste your time and ours.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e850af25195c05cc','-',7,'United States','wilsonville',34.000,'Open this select menu',25.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 15:38:53',NULL,23,3,NULL,129),
(20192,'Full-Time Accountant and Bookkeeper - $750/Month',39,'We have a dessert chain in the UK and we are seeking a Full-Time Accountant and Bookkeeper to join our team. The successful candidate will be responsible for managing our financial records, ensuring accuracy, and compliance with regulations. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in working with suppliers, inventory, sales, and bookkeeping functions.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nManage and maintain financial records, including accounts payable, accounts receivable, and general ledger.\r\n\r\nProcess and monitor invoices, purchase orders, receipts, and other financial documents.\r\n\r\nMonitor inventory levels and ensure accuracy of inventory records.\r\nReconcile bank statements and perform other monthly financial reconciliations.\r\n\r\nAssist in preparing financial statements, including balance sheets, income statements, and cash flow statements.\r\n\r\nHandle day-to-day bookkeeping tasks, including recording transactions and reconciling accounts.\r\n\r\nCommunicate effectively with management and other team members to provide financial reports and analysis.\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nBachelor\'s degree in Accounting or related field.\r\nMinimum of 3 years of experience in accounting and bookkeeping.\r\nStrong knowledge of accounting principles and practices.\r\nProficiency in Quickbooks or other accounting software.\r\nExcellent communication and organizational skills.\r\nFluent in English.\r\n\r\nExperience working with suppliers, inventory, sales, and other financial functions.\r\n\r\nSchedule:\r\n\r\nFull-time position (40 hours per week).\r\nSchedule is flexible, with a preference for starting work at 7 am Central Time.\r\n\r\nSalary:\r\n\r\nMonthly salary of $750.\r\n\r\nIf you meet the qualifications and are interested in this opportunity, please submit your application and include your resume and any relevant work samples.\r\n\r\nDon\'t submit your resume if you\'re not fluent in English','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654148420030394369?success','-',7,'United States','Chicago',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 15:39:02',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
