(20197,'Financial statements/accounting/bookkeeping',39,'Company: 365-Hospitality\r\nWebsite: www.365-hospitality.com\r\n\r\nAt 365-Hospitality, we specialize in providing top-notch hospitality services to clients in the hotel and restaurant industries. We strive to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and their customers. To support our ongoing growth, we are currently seeking an experienced and detail-oriented Accounting & Bookkeeping Specialist to join our dynamic team.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nManage daily financial transactions, including invoicing, accounts payable, accounts receivable, and bank reconciliations\r\nPrepare and maintain accurate financial records and reports in compliance with regulatory requirements\r\nAnalyze financial data to identify trends and provide actionable insights for the management team\r\nAssist in the preparation of monthly, quarterly, and annual financial statements\r\nCoordinate with external auditors to ensure timely completion of audits and compliance with regulations\r\nDevelop and maintain efficient accounting processes and systems to support business operations\r\nCollaborate with team members across departments to optimize financial performance\r\nContribute to ongoing improvements in financial reporting, budgeting, and forecasting processes\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nBachelor\'s degree in Accounting, Finance, or a related field\r\nMinimum of 3 years of experience in accounting and bookkeeping\r\nStrong knowledge of accounting principles, financial reporting, and tax regulations\r\nProficient in Microsoft Office Suite, particularly Excel, and experience with accounting software (e.g., QuickBooks, Xero)\r\nExcellent attention to detail and high level of accuracy in work\r\nStrong analytical and problem-solving skills\r\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team, managing multiple tasks and meeting deadlines\r\nExcellent written and verbal communication skills\r\nWhat We Offer:\r\n\r\nCompetitive salary and benefits package, including health insurance and retirement plan\r\nA supportive and collaborative work environment with opportunities for growth and development\r\nThe chance to work with a diverse and dedicated team, making a tangible impact on our clients\' businesses','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654151095431176193?success','-',7,'United States','New York',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 15:50:10',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
