(20201,'Need a full time QuickBooks accountant for handling work of US clients.',39,'We are currently seeking a full-time QuickBooks accountant to handle the accounting work of our US clients. The ideal candidate should have experience in bookkeeping, financial accounting, accounts payable, bank reconciliation, and data entry. In addition, they should be highly skilled in Intuit QuickBooks and be able to generate accurate balance sheets.\r\n\r\nAs our QuickBooks accountant, you will be responsible for maintaining our clients\' financial records, reconciling bank statements, and generating financial reports. You will be working with multiple clients, so the ability to prioritize tasks and manage time efficiently is essential. This is a long-term position, and we are looking for someone who is committed to staying with us for more than six months.\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit a proposal outlining your experience with QuickBooks and accounting. Please include links to past completed projects that demonstrate your proficiency in these areas. We look forward to hearing from you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654155202597449729?success','-',7,'United States','Surat',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 16:06:46',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(20202,'6 powerpoint Slide Re-Design - 1 day turnaround required',11,'I’m looking to complete Presentation Design work.The work will require 1 freelancer. I anticipate the project will last a 2-4 hours with a quick turnaround (same day ideal) essential','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0116c13be0723fe7f3','-',7,'United States','Santa Clara',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 16:17:18',NULL,23,3,NULL,129),
(20203,'Product Packaging Design',2,'Hello,\r\n\r\nWe\'re Real Food Love -a Canadian wellness brand launching all-natural food and beverage products that offer guilt-free indulgence.\r\n\r\nWe are soon launching our new line of premium Dessert Teas.\r\n\r\nOur new Dessert Teas will be focused on premium and powerful dessert flavours, as a natural guilt-free indulgence to sugar cravings in the form of powerful, anti-oxidant rich, certified organic teas -focused on exceptionally rich flavours and a premium look. We want to develop a design that will speak to the bold flavour of each Dessert Tea, but that also speaks to its entirely natural composition.\r\n\r\nThey will be packaged in stand-up pouches. The teas themselves are packaged in 100% compostable corn-fibre pyramid bags.\r\n\r\nWe are launching the teas in Canada and so our packaging will need to be in English and French (equal font size for both).\r\n\r\nWe have an existing logo to use.\r\n\r\nWe will be able to supply all of the English and French content, feel free to use what you feel is best in terms of placement and design.\r\n\r\nAnd we have the dieline to supply. The packaging itself will be a stand-up pouch.\r\n\r\nWe would like to build a mood board together.\r\nHere is a starting point: https://pin.it/1VWzOSV\r\n\r\nThe goal would be to develop a package that is premium, that clearly demonstrate it is a Dessert Tea, and that showcases our logo and slogan \"Skip the cake\".\r\n\r\nWe are looking forward to connecting!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0151acfe3b5fecd5fe','-',7,'United States','Dollard-Des-Ormeaux',80.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 16:21:34',NULL,23,3,NULL,129),
(20204,'Logo design',10,'We are looking for a skilled graphic designer to create a logo for our brand. The logo should be versatile and suitable for both print and digital media. The final design must be delivered in vector file format along with a printable file. The logo should also be transparent and suitable for social media imagery. A social media kit is also required.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a designer who can provide us with a unique design that can represent our brand. We want the designer to work with us closely and provide us with their expert input throughout the process.\r\n\r\nCandidates should submit a proposal outlining their experience in graphic design and specifically logo design. Please include links to past completed logo designs as examples of your work. We look forward to seeing your proposals.\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~017eb06049e581fdc0','-',7,'United States','Tulsa',48.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 16:24:57',NULL,23,3,NULL,129),
(20205,'eCommerce Small Business Bookkeeper',39,'The Job Overview\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a bookkeeper to manage all our finances. Your responsibilities will include tracking our organization’s revenue, expenses, and taxes, as well as producing financial reports. You will also be responsible for auditing our books to ensure our records are correct.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities\r\n\r\nBelow are some of the responsibilities a bookkeeper is expected to assume in their position:  \r\n\r\nPrepare accounting records by compiling and analyzing account information\r\nReconcile company\'s financial records to help ensure accuracy of financial statements \r\nPrepare tax returns for businesses and individuals\r\nPost financial transactions to accounts and prepare financial statements\r\nStudy financial trends to determine future business needs\r\n\r\nJob Qualifications and Skill Sets\r\n\r\nBelow are the qualifications expected of a bookkeeper:\r\n\r\nStrong working knowledge of accounting principles, financial statements, and accounting systems\r\nProficient in Microsoft Office (Word, Outlook), with advanced Microsoft Excel skills\r\nStrong working knowledge of QuickBooks; experience with other tax preparation and accounting software\r\nStrong organizational, interpersonal, verbal, and written communication skills\r\nDetail-oriented and able to prioritize\r\nAble to work independently and as part of a team\r\nSelf-starter','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654162488556482561?success','-',7,'United States','Atlanta',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 16:35:13',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
