(20207,'Newsletter design for lawn care company',20,'We are seeking a talented and creative designer to create a newsletter design for our lawn care company. The project will last for 1 to 3 months and we expect the designer to have experience in Brand Identity & Guidelines, Contemporary Style, Content Writing, Creative Writing, Infographic, Newsletter, Layout Design, Social Media Imagery, and Writing.\r\n\r\nThe successful candidate should be able to create a newsletter design that is visually appealing, easy to read, and engaging for our target audience. The candidate should also be able to create content that is informative, educational, and entertaining.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this position, please submit a detailed proposal describing how you can help with the project. Please include links to past completed projects that showcase your skills in newsletter design, content creation, and social media imagery. We look forward to hearing from you and working with you on this exciting project.\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654163289276403713?success','-',7,'United States','Tulsa',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 16:38:19',NULL,19,3,NULL,133),
