(20209,'Immediate Shopify Developer Needed for Bug Fixes',16,'**URGENT - FREELANCER MUST BE ABLE TO START WORKING RIGHT AWAY**\r\n\r\nWe urgently need a skilled Shopify developer to fix some small development bugs on our website, https://mutimer.co/. If you\'re available for work and can start immediately, we\'d love to have you on board.\r\n\r\nWe have all of the bugs highlighted in a Figma.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience as a Shopify developer\r\nAbility to work under pressure and meet tight deadlines\r\nStrong communication skills\r\nImmediate availability\r\n\r\nTo apply:\r\n\r\nShare relevant experience and past Shopify projects\r\nWrite a brief intro about your skills and availability','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0113af52604b27a3ef','-',7,'United States','Zurich',60.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 16:45:22',NULL,23,3,NULL,129),
(20210,'Front and back flyer design for water damage restoration company',2,'We are a water damage restoration company, named Dry Force (https://dryforcecorp.com/), looking for a talented graphic designer to create a front and back flyer design that will help promote our business to plumbers. The flyer should be visually appealing and informative, showcasing our services and highlighting our competitive advantages. We want it to feature a step by step process of Dry Force\'s dry out process, along with some of our value propositions (free evaluations, work with all insurance companies, etc.). I\'ve included some screenshots of the type of content that we would like to incorporate from the website as examples, along with a similar pamphlet for comparison. The ideal candidate should have experience with Adobe Illustrator, Adobe InDesign, and Adobe Photoshop, as well as a strong grasp of print design and layout design.\r\n\r\nAs a candidate, we would like you to submit a proposal that outlines how you can help us with this project. Please include information about your relevant experience and skills, as well as any past projects that demonstrate your ability to create high-quality, effective marketing materials. We are looking for someone who can bring a fresh perspective to our brand and help us stand out in a competitive market. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654165116366671873?success','-',7,'United States','irving',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 16:45:45',NULL,19,3,NULL,133),
(20211,'Graphic, brand, and UI design for solar company',2,'UGE is looking for a talented and detail-oriented graphic, brand, and UI designer to work with us on a variety of projects.\r\n\r\nWhat our designer will work on:\r\n\r\n-Refreshed branding guide (colors, fonts, and design elements - logo to remain intact)\r\n-UI design updates for our website\r\n-Branded PowerPoint templates\r\n-Designs for specific decks and reports\r\n-Physical marketing collateral design\r\n-Other projects as they arise, such as assistance with data visualizations\r\n\r\nNecessary skills and experience:\r\n\r\n-Experience creating engaging, appealing, and cohesive brand visuals and design assets\r\n-Expert at creating beautiful, extremely easy-to-use PowerPoint templates\r\n-Skilled website UI designer\r\n-Interest in renewable energy and environmental protection a plus!\r\n\r\nPlease be sure to have a portfolio of work ready for us to review when you apply.\r\n\r\nAbout UGE\r\n\r\nUGE is working to make renewable energy accessible and affordable for all. As a developer, owner, and operator of community-focused solar and energy storage projects, we’re helping build a renewable energy future that is equitable and secure.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0149f171e43128a7c8','-',7,'United States','Kings County',50.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 17:17:11',NULL,23,3,NULL,129),
(20212,'Logo Design',10,'Scope of Work: Logo Design for First Bite\r\n\r\nBackground:\r\nFirst Bite is a food technology startup that provides data and tools to help grow foodservice businesses. Our core product is a comprehensive database of every commercial restaurant in the US, which we use to run predictive algorithms to estimate potential sales for our customers\' products. We are looking for a logo that captures our mission to empower food brands and restaurants to thrive in a sustainable and innovative food economy.\r\n\r\nObjectives:\r\n\r\nCreate a unique, memorable, and professional logo with and icon that represents the First Bite brand.\r\nDesign a logo/icon that captures our mission to help grow foodservice businesses.\r\nDevelop a logo/icon that can be used across various platforms, including website, social media, marketing materials, and business cards.\r\nEnsure the logo is versatile and can be used in different sizes and color variations.\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n3-5 options\r\nThe logo/icon should be simple, modern, and scalable.\r\nThe logo/icon should include the company name, \"First Bite,\" and an icon or symbol that represents the company\'s mission.\r\nThe color palette should be inspired by food and sustainability, using colors that evoke natural and fresh ingredients.\r\nWe have played with the concept of taking a bite out of a black box. The black box being a metaphor for the current lack of data problem we hope to solve.\r\nsee website: firstbite.io\r\nsee attached file with a few ideas.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01d1228d0befe1bb35','-',7,'United States','Redwood City',50.000,'fixed',50.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 17:22:28',NULL,23,3,NULL,129),
(20213,'CPA/Proforma/Cashflow Report',39,'Hello, I am seeking a reputable CPA to draft up a proforma for potential investors in our company. We have established cost factors for what the facility will require in terms of funding, payroll, monthly expenses, etc. We have also established our profits and revenues from a low, most likely, and to a high probability. We seek a professional to button up a nice proforma and cash flow sheet to share with investors in our packet. Thank you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654179725383778305?success','-',7,'United States','United States',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 17:43:39',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(20214,'Talented Graphic Designer Needed to Revamp and Modernize Company Logo',10,'We are seeking an innovative and highly skilled Graphic Designer to revamp and modernize our company logo. Our goal is to create a cutting-edge, captivating logo that stands out and can compete with top companies in our industry.\r\n\r\nProject Overview:\r\n\r\nOur current logo has served us well, but we feel it\'s time for a change. We want to embrace a modern aesthetic that reflects our company\'s values and mission while making a powerful impact on our target audience. The ideal candidate will have a strong understanding of contemporary design trends and a proven track record of creating memorable logos that make a lasting impression.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Assess our current logo and identify areas for improvement\r\n- Research and analyze current design trends and competitor logos to inform the creative process\r\n- Develop and present multiple logo concepts that demonstrate a modern and cutting-edge approach\r\n- Collaborate with our team to refine the design based on feedback and preferences\r\n- Deliver the final logo in various file formats and sizes suitable for use on digital and print platforms\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience as a Graphic Designer with an impressive portfolio showcasing logo design projects\r\n\r\n- Strong understanding of design principles, typography, color theory, and current design trends','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654185834262106113?success','-',7,'United States','Hermosa Beach',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 18:09:43',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
