(20225,'Financial advisor for a CEO of a manufacturing business',39,'Job Title: Financial Advisor for System Restructuring, Financial Modeling, Forecasting, Budgeting, Financial Analysis and Investment Advice\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\nWe are looking for a financial advisor who can help us restructure our financial system, create a financial model, forecast our financial performance, and provide advice on budgeting, financial analysis, investment opportunities, and cost-cutting measures.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Analyze our current financial system and identify areas for improvement.\r\n- Develop a financial model to forecast our financial performance.\r\n- Assist in the creation and management of budgets.\r\n- Conduct financial analysis to provide insights into our financial performance.\r\n- Provide advice on investment opportunities and strategies.\r\n- Identify cost-cutting measures to improve our financial efficiency.\r\n- Collaborate with our team to implement recommended changes.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Proven experience as a financial advisor, financial analyst, or similar role.\r\n- Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.\r\n- Knowledge of financial forecasting and modeling.\r\n- Understanding of budgeting and financial analysis principles.\r\n- Experience in identifying investment opportunities and advising on investment strategies.\r\n- Excellent communication and collaboration skills.\r\n\r\nIf you are a skilled financial advisor who can help us restructure our financial system, forecast our financial performance, and provide valuable investment advice, please apply for this job','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654200912202203137?success','-',7,'United States','Mauritania',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 19:07:55',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
