(20233,'Xero Bookkeeper with Canadian Experience for Small Businesses',39,'Description\r\n============\r\nWe are in search of a detail-oriented bookkeeper with experience in Xero software administration to support our two small, newly-established businesses. Your expertise will help us maintain accurate financial records, ensuring all transactions are coded correctly for a smooth transition to our accountant at year-end.\r\n\r\nScope of Work\r\n============\r\n- Set up and manage Xero software for two growing businesses (one e-commerce, one  consulting)\r\n- Accurately record various transactions, such as expense reimbursements, payroll (1 employee), government remittances, HST, and loan repayments, etc\r\n- Ensure accurate coding of all transactions for seamless year-end accounting\r\n\r\nRequired Skills\r\n============\r\n- Proficient in Xero software\r\n- Solid understanding of bookkeeping principles and practices\r\n- Knowledgeable in Canadian bookkeeping regulations, including remittances, taxes, and HST\r\n- Basic accounting skills to confidently debit and credit appropriate accounts\r\n\r\nExperience\r\n============\r\nMinimum 2 years of bookkeeping experience, with a preference for small business backgrounds. Familiarity with Canadian bookkeeping regulations and practices\r\n\r\nTime Commitment\r\n============\r\nInitial engagement of 2-3 hours per month on an ongoing  basis, with potential for increased responsibilities as businesses expand\r\n\r\nCompensation\r\n============\r\nHourly rate ranging from $10 to $25, based on skills and experience\r\n\r\nLocation\r\n============\r\nOntario, Canada (preferred, but not required','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654194820851646465','-',7,'United States','00',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-04',1,'2023-05-04',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-04 20:11:52',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
