(20292,'Looking to design a T-shirt / sweatshirt',2,'We are looking for a skilled designer who has experience in designing T-shirts and sweatshirts. The ideal candidate should have experience in fashion design, graphic design, logo design, T-shirt design, activewear, and clothing. The job will take 1 to 3 months to complete, and we are looking for someone who can work with us remotely.\r\n\r\nThe designer will be responsible for designing a range of T-shirts and sweatshirts that are trendy, eye-catching, and unique. The designs should reflect our brand and target market. The candidate should be able to take our ideas and turn them into designs that we can sell to our customers.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this job, please submit a proposal outlining your experience and how you can help us with this project. Please include links to past completed projects that showcase your design skills. We look forward to hearing from you and working with you on this exciting project.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01546ffaa70334c3c8','-',7,'United States','Keene',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-05-05',1,'2023-05-05',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-05 08:00:59',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(20293,'Graphic designer needed to redo previously designed logo',10,'I currently have a logo for my company that was designed some time ago. At the time, it was fine, but the work and vision has changed. The current logo is serif and I don\'t have clearly-defined brand guidelines or clean vectors.\r\n\r\nThe primary focus of this project is:\r\n- Redesign the logo and brand in a cleaner, more minimal style (preferably sans serif, but that\'s negotiable). There\'s an aspect of the logo I\'d like to keep, but I\'m flexible about everything.\r\n- Deliver a brand style guide that includes font pairings and color at the minimum. Ideally, it would include more complete typography rules that could be used to develop a website. (Note: This project doesn\'t include any web design or development. I\'m open to hearing any suggestions if you have any, but I don\'t in any way expect you to deliver web designs or code.)\r\n- Clean vectors for the logo and icon in the appropriate variations. I will also want a couple of vectors for animation purposes (drawing the logo and then filling it out on a loading screen, etc.). This would all be dependent on the final design so this is open to change.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~010aa0e2c9e95b2b5b','-',7,'United States','US',65.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-05',1,'2023-05-05',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-05 08:08:49',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(20294,'PowerPoint Presentation Slide Design and Graphic Design',11,'Moxie Institute is growing and we are hiring several project-based PowerPoint presentation slide designers to join our team and serve our clients. Moxie\'s presentation designers create engaging, on-brand visual concepts to communicate ideas that inspire, inform, and captivate an audience. Presentations include TED Talks, conferences and event keynote speaking decks, sale pitches, and general business presentations.\r\n\r\nMoxie Institute is also seeking an in-house graphic designer to work in our creative, marketing, and training departments.\r\n\r\nWe love slide decks that focus on high-impact emotional imagery that aligns with our client\'s message, captures the attention of large audiences, and moves them to action. However, we realize this style isn\'t perfect for every situation. The ability to match branding guides, create infographics and complex data visualization is a plus.\r\n\r\nRESPONSIBILITIES INCLUDE:\r\n• Meet with internal and client stakeholders to determine the scope of a project\r\n• Advise internal teams and clients on strategies to reach a particular audience\r\n• Ability to maintain Moxie or client brand colors. imagery, and style\r\n• Select colors, images, text, transitions, and layout as it relates to the presenter and audience\r\n• Strong written and verbal communication skills\r\n• Ability to present concepts, options, and designs to both clients and the internal team\r\n• Manage time effectively, multi-task, and meet deadlines\r\n• Detail-oriented individual who reviews work carefully\r\n• Self-starter with the ability to work independently\r\n\r\nIf you have a shared mission to be a positive force in people\'s lives and you have slide, visual, and graphic design skills, we want to meet you!\r\n\r\nTo learn more, check out who we are, what we do, and our why at Moxie Institute dot com.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0113b2800e1cdfc361','-',7,'United States','San Diego',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-05-05',1,'2023-05-05',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-05 08:14:35',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(20295,'Talented Graphic Designer for Luxury Ecommerce Brand (Full Time)',2,'Are you a highly skilled graphic designer with a strong background in Photoshop and Illustrator?\r\n\r\nDo you have a keen eye for design and a passion for creating exceptional visuals that capture the essence of luxury? If so, we have the perfect opportunity for you!\r\n\r\nWe are a luxury e-commerce brand seeking an experienced and talented graphic designer to join our team.\r\n\r\nOur focus is on delivering a luxury shopping experience, and we need your expertise to create stunning images for our online store.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Strong proficiency in Adobe Photoshop and Illustrator\r\n- Proven experience in graphic design and photo manipulation\r\n- Ability to create exceptional visuals in line with our luxury brand identity\r\n- A keen eye for detail and design aesthetics\r\n- Creativity and the ability to think outside the box\r\n- Excellent communication skills and a collaborative mindset\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Design and create visually appealing images for our online store\r\n- Manipulate stock images to seamlessly incorporate our product in a realistic manner\r\n- Ensure timely delivery of high-quality designs\r\n\r\nIf you believe you are the perfect candidate to elevate our luxury brand with your exceptional design skills, please submit your application along with your portfolio showcasing your best work.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to welcoming a new member to our growing team!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~017070dde144a05464','-',7,'United States','Ormskirk',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-05',1,'2023-05-05',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-05 09:57:40',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(20296,'Logo design new brand heated pillows',10,'We need a logo for our new brand. We have the following ideas about the brand:\r\n\r\n- The brand name is: \"Knuus\" or \"KNUUS\"\r\n- Maybe you can make a on/off switch idea with a U.\r\n- We want to create a minimalist brand, selling heated pillows and heated blanks. They are heated with infrared and they are wireless (so, power supply is a battery)\r\n- With our brand identity, we want to show: high quality, warmth and a slick and appealing design to prospective customers\r\n- You can get inspiration from stoov.com. They sell similar products.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01295b30585b717663','-',7,'United States','Laren',40.000,'fixed',40.000,'2023-05-05',1,'2023-05-05',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-05 10:06:21',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(20297,'Original brand name/Logo design',10,'I need an original logo design for a brand I am creating, you will have to agree that I will recieve 100% ownership/rights for the logo design made.\r\n\r\nDescription of design to be made:\r\nMust say \"Mythic Beauty\"\r\nI want an origal symbol/dragon included in the design.\r\nThe design should appear/feel elegant, expensive, and mythical/fantasy like.\r\n\r\nI have attached a sample idea of a style I like and need something similar to it...It does not have to be the same design or style as the sample. It just has to be beautiful and alluring with a signature dragon and font style that I can trademark and use together or seperately so if I print the dragon design on merchandise, people can remember it as the \"mythic beauty\" dragon logo.\r\nI will need 100% good communication, I would prefer 2-3 different design options to choose from if possible.\r\n\r\nIf I do not like the design I will not use the design, and therefor I will also not pay for it. You must agree to these these terms upon accepting the job.\r\n\r\nThe design will also have to be colored and printable in any size.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01842659a3e390d546','-',7,'United States','Sapulpa',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-05-05',1,'2023-05-05',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-05 10:22:33',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
