(20301,'Logo Design for Ecommerce Store',10,'We are looking for a talented Logo Designer to create a unique and memorable logo for our new Restaurant Equipment Ecommerce Store. The ideal candidate will have experience in Adobe Illustrator, Graphic Design, and Brand Identity & Guidelines.\r\n\r\nYour main responsibility will be to design a logo that accurately represents our brand and appeals to our target audience. You will be expected to work collaboratively with our team to understand our brand values and design requirements, and then create a logo that meets our expectations.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for someone who is creative, detail-oriented, and has a strong portfolio of previous logo designs.\r\n\r\nThe name of the store is Kitchen Pro Equipment and store is selling commercial grade-restaurant equipment products. More info will be provided later.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ed3ce6950f491784','-',7,'United States','Naples',150.000,'fixed',150.000,'2023-05-05',1,'2023-05-05',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-05 11:21:15',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
