(20303,'Grafic Designer for AI Designed Portrait For Album Artwork',2,'Me and Lotus Imane (an upcoming dj and vocalist) have created a track together called “Rewana - (Light Language Remix)” which will be released this summer.\r\n\r\nIt’s an ecstatic dance track that is already being played on dance floors in Bali, Ibiza, Amsterdam, Helsinki (while it has not been released officially yet).\r\n\r\nThe reactions for global dj’s has been above expectations, so we really feel and know we have something special to share with the world.\r\n\r\nTherefore we have decided to put some love into the artwork for this track and we had the spontaneous idea to use AI, since we were inspired by this digital native Indian.\r\n\r\nIn short:\r\n\r\n1. We will shoot a portrait of me and Lotus (2 people facing the camera) without any items or face decoration.\r\n2. We are looking for a graphic designer that can add some AI magic to the picture, with 2 native styles (Lotus: Tribal African, me = future buddhist style)\r\n3. The whole world and background and vibe has to look like paradise, heaven with the color palette of the original track (picture me sitting on the chair on the wooden floor).\r\n\r\nCould you give me an estimate of retouched picture in the Indian like quality but with 2 people in the frame?\r\n\r\nWould love to hear what is possible!\r\n\r\n(!) Please only respond with your portfolio of similiar work: AI added portraits.\r\n\r\nThank you for your attention.\r\n\r\nLorahn & Lotus','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01c124056157cb4584','-',7,'United States','Amsterdam',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-05-05',1,'2023-05-05',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-05 11:54:14',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
