(20307,'Experienced UX Designer for Ecommerce Website',4,'You will be responsible for designing new webpages from scratch including our e-commerce site and for improving the customer journey throughout the website and increasing the website usability for customers, ensuring they have an immersive experience and in turn generating revenue and an increase in sales\r\nwhat we need:\r\n- New webpages including a new homepage.\r\n- Designs for the new webpages\r\n- High-fidelity mockups for all of the webpages\r\nRequirements:\r\nTo be considered for this position, we would like to see your best Figma wireframe projects. Please select one or two projects that showcase your skills and explain in detail how you accomplished them from start to finish. We want to understand your process and be confident in the results you can provide.\r\nIf you meet this requirement, please apply with your chosen projects, and selected candidates will be interviewed. Please note that we are only interested in modern, up-to-date designs and will not consider applicants who use outdated design practices. and the proposal length does not matter we are ready to read through it all.\r\n- Proven experience as a UX Designer\r\n- Experience working on E-commerce websites\r\n- Wireframing, Mockup, and Prototyping skills\r\n- Skilled in Figma, Photoshop, and Illustrator\r\n- The ability to work collaboratively with different teams\r\nThis is a fantastic opportunity for you to join a globally recognized business and play a pivotal role in increasing the usability of their websites. Write WEB001 on top for me to know for sure whether you read through the entire post or not. And if you feel that you match the above requirements and would like to hear more, apply today!\r\nWe are also attaching some websites below for inspiration for you\r\nhttps://www.thedesignership.com\r\nhttps://remotely-talents.webflow.io\r\nhttps://www.getmoda.io\r\nhttps://www.kubo-patisserie.com\r\nhttps://www.dimiyatech.com.au','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654472426788974593?success','-',7,'United States','Brooklyn',3000.000,'fixed',3000.000,'2023-05-05',1,'2023-05-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-05 13:07:12',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
