(20311,'Creative Copy for a Landing Page',2,'PLEASE READ ENTIRE JOB DESCRIPTION BEFORE RESPONDING\r\n\r\nDear Creative Copywriters and Web Content Gurus,\r\n\r\nI am starting a new business that playfully spoofs 1950s corporations with a retro-futuristic twist. We specialize in publishing puzzles, games, and creating novelty items, all with a humorous and satirical tone. I am looking to hire a talented wordsmith/web content expert to help me create, revise and polish copy for a temporary landing page (while our online store is being built).\r\n\r\nThe primary objective of the landing page is to entice customers to provide their email addresses in exchange for a free set of puzzles. The copy should include fabricated endorsements, social proof, and exaggerated product features to create an authentic 1950s retro-futuristic atmosphere. The image portrayed should be of a thriving business developing cutting-edge puzzle technologies (but firmly rooted in satire).\r\n\r\nI have a lot of ideas and some draft copy already in place. I need your expertise to edit and optimize the copy according to web design best practices. I am seeking a skilled copywriter and web content expert who can bring life to this unique concept and add their own creative flair while maintaining the entertaining and satirical nature of the brand.\r\n\r\nIf you have a knack for writing engaging and imaginative content and know a lot about email capture pages that captivate audiences, I would love to have you on board! This will be the company\'s first web presence, so it needs to be special.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you\'re interested and if you have any questions or need more information.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to discussing further details with you.\r\n\r\nBest regards.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0148d64c5a16ae03c6','-',7,'United States','Pomona',600.000,'fixed',600.000,'2023-05-05',1,'2023-05-05',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-05 13:24:56',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
