(20313,'Graphic Design Artist for Corporation Wanted!',2,'Hello! We\'re a Chicago based, but national restoration company with locations in Chicago, Dallas and Houston. We seek an experienced graphic design specialist to assist us with our occasional graphic design needs.\r\n\r\nExamples include, brochure, business card, trade show display, miscellaneous branded marketing materials that are typically put on paper and distributed by our 11 marketing reps that drive to various stops daily.\r\n\r\nSome more specific deliverables and examples included but not limited to:\r\n- Minor adjustments to a fire guide and inside pages for each new fire department using our guides\r\n- various flyers for upcoming marketing events we have upcoming this year\r\n- flyers for an upcoming Harley Davidson giveaway contest we have upcoming\r\n- Some small promotional items like branded mousepads\r\n- pdfs for a racing experience we are marketing, which have existing templates already made\r\n\r\nSome of these can be fairly time specific with shorter deadlines, but typically nothing super urgent.\r\n\r\nIdeally for efficiency, a screen sharing option for live edits would be fantastic. Used to use Skype several years ago for this, but there may be better options now.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654479591551520769?success','-',7,'United States','Elmhurst',70.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-05',1,'2023-05-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-05 13:36:28',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
