(20330,'Futuristic Website Design for a book',3,'Looking for a talented graphic designer/web developer to create a one-pager futuristic and spiritual website design for my book. The website will showcase the key concepts of the book and provide a space for readers to connect with the author and purchase the book.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should have a strong portfolio of website designs that reflect a modern and spiritual aesthetic. The website should be visually striking, with a clean and simple layout that is easy to navigate.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nExperience in creating one-pager website designs\r\nStrong understanding of user experience and user interface design principles\r\nProficiency in Adobe Creative Suite and website design tools\r\nKnowledge of modern website design trends and technologies\r\nAbility to work collaboratively with the author and integrate feedback into the design\r\nExcellent communication skills in English\r\nThe project will involve designing and developing the website from scratch, including the layout, graphics, typography, and functionality. The website should be optimized for desktop and mobile devices and should load quickly and efficiently.\r\n\r\nIf you are passionate about creating beautiful and impactful website designs and have experience in creating one-pager designs that reflect a spiritual and futuristic aesthetic, then this project is for you! Please provide samples of your portfolio and a brief overview of your experience in your proposal.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654487667951247361?success','-',7,'United States','Givatayim',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-05-05',1,'2023-05-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-05 14:08:57',NULL,17,3,NULL,119),
