(20369,'Accounts Receivable Virtual Assistant',39,'We are seeking an experienced and detail-oriented Accounts Receivable Clerk to join our team. As an Accounts Receivable Clerk, you will be responsible for managing and maintaining all aspects of the company\'s accounts receivable function.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nProcess daily invoices and ensure accuracy of all transactions\r\nCommunicate with customers to resolve any billing inquiries or disputes\r\nMaintain accurate customer records and ensure timely payments\r\nMonitor and manage customer credit limits to minimize risk\r\nAssist in month-end closing processes and other accounting duties as assigned\r\nPrepare and analyze accounts receivable reports\r\nWork closely with the sales team to ensure timely billing of all sales transactions\r\nProcess cash receipts and reconcile accounts receivable balances\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven work experience as an Accounts Receivable Clerk or similar role\r\nExcellent organizational and time management skills\r\nStrong attention to detail and ability to work independently\r\nFamiliarity with accounting software (e.g., QuickBooks, Xero) is preferred\r\nStrong written and verbal communication skills\r\nAbility to prioritize tasks and meet deadlines\r\nExperience in customer service and resolving billing inquiries or disputes\r\nProficient in Microsoft Office, particularly Excel and Word\r\nA degree in accounting or finance is preferred but not required','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654588437771046913','-',7,'United States','00',15.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-05',1,'2023-05-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-05 21:54:57',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(20370,'Accounts Payable Virtual Assistant',39,'We are seeking a detail-oriented and experienced part-time accounts payable virtual assistant to join our team. As an accounts payable virtual assistant, you will be responsible for performing a range of accounting and administrative tasks related to the payment of invoices and other expenses.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nReview and process vendor invoices, ensuring accuracy and adherence to company policies and procedures\r\nManage the accounts payable inbox, respond to vendor inquiries, and maintain vendor files\r\nEnsure timely payment of invoices and reconcile vendor statements\r\nCommunicate with other departments and team members to resolve payment discrepancies\r\nAssist in month-end closing processes and other accounting duties as assigned\r\nMaintain accurate records of all accounts payable transactions\r\nParticipate in team meetings and provide updates on accounts payable activities\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven work experience as an accounts payable clerk or similar role\r\nExcellent organizational and time management skills\r\nStrong attention to detail and ability to work independently\r\nProficient in Microsoft Office, particularly Excel and Word\r\nFamiliarity with accounting software (e.g., QuickBooks, Xero) is preferred\r\nStrong written and verbal communication skills\r\nAbility to prioritize tasks and meet deadlines\r\nHigh-speed internet connection and a reliable computer\r\nAvailability to work part-time during business hours in the EST timezone','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654586541368328193','-',7,'United States','00',15.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-05',1,'2023-05-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-05 22:02:12',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(20371,'Accounting Expert Needed for a Marketing Agency',39,'We are a marketing agency looking for an experienced accounting expert to join our team for a project lasting more than 6 months. The ideal candidate should possess extensive knowledge in accounting, tax accounting, bookkeeping, cash flow analysis, finance and accounting, financial accounting, financial reporting, and Quickbooks.\r\n\r\nAs an accounting expert, you will be responsible for managing all of our financial records and ensuring they are accurate and up-to-date. You will be expected to analyze our cash flow and provide recommendations for improving our financial performance. You will also make recommendations on tax implications related to certain expenses on our books.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this position, please submit a proposal outlining your experience with the required skills and how you can help us with this project. We will also require links to past completed projects. We look forward to hearing from you and potentially working together to achieve our financial goals.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1654581066774417409','-',7,'United States','00',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-05',1,'2023-05-05',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-05 22:03:04',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
