(20379,'Graphic designer all rounder for print materials and digital',2,'Job is ongoing part time as need arises (busy and quiet periods).\r\n\r\nYou are required to:\r\n1. Follow company style guide\r\n2. Use the internal system to develop, track get sign off and distribute developed product.\r\n3. Use internal innovation hub system to log jobs, set up delivery plans and track them through the system.\r\nthe jobs that are most commonly done in order are:\r\n1. set up book layout of books for print functions (must have experience in preparing documents for printers and must be able to liaise directly with printers to get quotes and deliver work to printer).\r\n2. design and update product brands and change in documentation\r\n3. design brochures and books to promote products\r\n4. design infographics to promote products\r\n5. design quick images for website like maps of Australia and other small jobs.\r\n6. get materials ready for print set up\r\n7. some cross over UX/UI skill into websites/we applications etc. would be helpful.\r\n\r\nThank you','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01bd16141ebf9defa4','-',7,'United States','Cairns',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-08',1,'2023-05-08',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-08 07:30:00',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(20380,'Figma to Elementor',4,'Yoyo - before the AI content goes ham. Need someone that can be reliable, deliver on time and be part of a FUN team. We\'re everywhere, Slack is our home and we love trading different recipes from all our cultures. Agency needing some help this week, may blossom to something else.\r\n\r\nNeed someone in European timezone. Here are the details:\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a skilled developer to assist in converting our Figma designs into Elementor templates for our WordPress website. The ideal candidate should have extensive experience in CSS, HTML, JavaScript, and web design. Experience with Elementor and WordPress is also required.\r\n\r\nThe project is expected to take between 1 to 3 months to complete, depending on the complexity of the designs. The developer will be responsible for converting the designs into fully responsive and functional Elementor templates that can be easily edited and updated by our team.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this job, please submit a proposal outlining your experience and how you can help us with this project. Please include links to past completed projects that demonstrate your expertise in web design and Elementor development.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to reviewing your proposals and finding the right candidate for this project.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~019fa1abd2ac19e834','-',7,'United States','Montreal',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-05-08',1,'2023-05-08',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-08 07:45:43',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
