(20393,'Brochure about Science Bus Statistics',13,'We are looking to create a brochure about our Science Bus in order to showcase what it is and some of the statistics so far. We intend to use this brochure to seek sponsorship from companies.\r\n\r\nWe\'d like the brochure to showcase the information attached as well as photos, and to visualize the statistics as infographics.\r\n\r\nWe\'d like the style to be fun and cohesive with the existing bus branding, and we\'d like it to still remain formal/professional since major companies will be reviewing the brochure to consider sponsorship.\r\n\r\nThe brochure will be in both English and Arabic, but we will just need the English to be created and pages left for the Arabic side with placeholders. The brochure will have both languages in one.\r\n\r\nPhotos of the bus are in the below dropbox links:\r\n- https://www.dropbox.com/sh/09es4bnin8zp8s2/AACMIl5I9pSGmNi9gqKzBF-fa?dl=0\r\n\r\n- https://www.dropbox.com/sh/ozq9hy754ep1aww/AABGQaxeZNU4UcS8EgnrP_ana?dl=0\r\n\r\n- https://www.dropbox.com/sh/gxydoby5adjq31u/AAD-_hoLplRZK_KV_wdcfXbAa?dl=0\r\n\r\n- https://www.dropbox.com/sh/zzjf2e9f1xzrf7i/AADMu0Tnk59yYfTntJLL-dS0a?dl=0\r\n\r\n- https://www.dropbox.com/sh/2ah4u1twd0pi7lq/AABh7eRILvSgdjcVSqJlElVOa?dl=0\r\n\r\n- https://www.dropbox.com/sh/gxydoby5adjq31u/AAD-_hoLplRZK_KV_wdcfXbAa?dl=0','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01fd3068c7857ac5c7','-',7,'United States','Dasma',65.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-08',1,'2023-05-08',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-08 10:49:43',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(20394,'Create three (3) beautiful WordPress websites for 3 businesses using EasyWP',15,'We are looking for an experienced WordPress developer to create three (3) beautiful websites for 3 different businesses using EasyWP. The ideal candidate should have experience in landing page design, web design, and have worked with WordPress before. The project duration is expected to be between 1 to 3 months.\r\n\r\nThe successful candidate will be responsible for creating visually appealing and user-friendly websites that meet the needs of the businesses. The websites should also be optimized for search engines, load quickly, and be easy to navigate.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this job, please submit a proposal outlining your experience in WordPress development and how you can help with the project. Please provide links to at least three (3) past completed projects that showcase your skills.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for someone who is professional, communicative and has a keen eye for design. If this sounds like you, please apply and let us know how you can help us bring these three businesses to life with stunning WordPress websites!\r\n\r\nREQUIREMENTS:\r\nWe have already purchased WordPress hosting from EasyWP/Namecheap. You must use our WordPress admin, and go through us for all WordPress admin requests.\r\n\r\nDELIVERABLES:\r\n1. Professional landing page website for garzikgroup.com\r\n2. Professional landing page website for cybersparktrading.com\r\n3. Professional landing page website for rothbardlogix.com','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0168e7f055cf375f1f','-',7,'United States','Atlanta',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-05-08',1,'2023-05-08',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-08 11:15:31',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
