(20396,'Ongoing Marketing Graphic Design',2,'We are looking for a strong, talented graphic designer to work alongside our team to ideate and produce assets for all of our marketing.\r\n\r\nThis includes, but not limited to, email designs, facebook & instagram posts and ad designs, google display ad designs.\r\n\r\nYou will need to have a strong ability in the English language as the role will be highly collaborative with the internal team who produce ideas.\r\n\r\nIn your proposal, please provide detailed portfolio examples showing this type of marketing work.\r\n\r\nPlease also include the timezone that you work in - we are based in Sydney, Australia and need a generous overlap of business hours in order to discuss, collaborate on ideas and provide feedback.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01336c5d2a06467f6f','-',7,'United States','Sydney',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-08',1,'2023-05-08',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-08 11:36:59',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
