(20400,'Build Eye Catching WordPress Site for the Auto Repair Industry',15,'We are looking for a skilled WordPress developer to build an eye-catching website for the auto repair industry. The project will take 1 to 3 months to complete. The ideal candidate should have experience in ChatGPT, CSS, Graphic Design, HTML, JavaScript, Landing Page, PHP, Web Design, Web Development, and WordPress.\r\n\r\nAs the developer, you will be responsible for designing and developing a visually appealing website that is user-friendly and responsive. The website should be optimized for search engines and should include features such as a blog, contact form, and social media integration.\r\n\r\nMuch of the content is already established but would need to be optimized for SEO. We specialize in fleet maintenance and will be gearing the site toward this specialty.\r\n\r\nTo be considered for this job, please submit a proposal that outlines your relevant experience, skills, and how you can help with this project. Please include links to some of your past completed projects, particularly those in the auto repair industry or a similar niche.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a candidate who can work independently, communicate effectively, and deliver high-quality work within the given time frame. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01c7bb2c8df46f8e1f','-',7,'United States','Lewisville',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-08',1,'2023-05-08',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-08 13:27:18',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
