(20405,'Logo idea - creating vector files & change of colour',10,'Hello Fara,\r\n\r\nI am sending you this below message..\r\n\r\nattached is my logo idea for one brand of my wellness business. (I am also planning to create a similar logo with my other brand). they should somehow feel they are connected.\r\n\r\nI would like to see it in 2x versions:\r\n(wanna start with brand 1: Breathwork Tulum)\r\n\r\nI would like to have:\r\n1. 1x logo without a picture logo\r\n2. 1x logo with a picture logo (the symbol for growth or symbol for gratitude, have not decided yet)\r\n\r\n\r\nColour: BRONZE\r\n\r\nFONT: Harmonia Sans pro Light (Breathwork Tulum)\r\n\r\nFONT for slogan (Breathe. Heal. Transform.) -\r\nP22 Mayflower Smooth Regular or\r\nArtifex CF (Bold)\r\n\r\nPlease let me know how much time it would take (so I can plan for my budget) to create vector files for this logo\r\n(also need files in order to place it on my car)\r\n\r\nI should also send you the other logo idea - so you understand that both brands are connected. and should feel aligned.\r\n\r\nthank you in advance!\r\n\r\nSabine','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b7f6c1b0fae861c2','-',7,'United States','Amsterdam',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-08',1,'2023-05-08',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-08 13:46:36',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(20406,'Bookkeeping/Accounting Virtual Assistant',39,'Homerun Home Solutions is seeking a highly organized and detail-oriented Virtual Assistant to assist with bookkeeping, financial modeling, and other accounting tasks. This is a remote position, and the ideal candidate will be available to work between 5-10 hours per week at first, with the potential to transition into more hours or even a full-time position.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nManage bookkeeping using QuickBooks\r\nConduct financial modeling and forecasting\r\nPrepare financial reports and presentations\r\nManage and reconcile bank and credit card accounts\r\nAssist with budget preparation and analysis\r\nMonitor and track expenses\r\nPrepare and process invoices and payments\r\nPerform general administrative tasks as required\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\nBachelor\'s degree in Accounting, Finance or a related field\r\nAt least 2 years of experience in bookkeeping, financial modeling or related field (Real Estate Experience would be a major plus!)\r\nExpertise in QuickBooks software\r\nFluent in English, both written and spoken\r\nHighly organized and detail-oriented\r\nStrong analytical and problem-solving skills\r\nStrong communication and interpersonal skills\r\nAbility to work independently and in a team environment\r\nAbility to work remotely with reliable internet access and a home office setup\r\nIf you meet these requirements and are interested in this opportunity, please submit your resume and cover letter. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655569537473003521?success','-',7,'United States','Sicklerville',15.000,'perhour',15.000,'2023-05-08',1,'2023-05-08',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-08 13:47:03',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(20407,'Bookkeeper',39,'BOOKKEEPER\r\n\r\nABOUT US:\r\n\r\nHey there! We are a friendly online store that specializes in custom gaming equipment, such as high-quality playmats and custom card sleeves for all of your favorite TCG games. We are committed to providing the best products at reasonable costs to enhance the gaming experience for our customers.\r\n\r\nPOSITION SUMMARY:\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a detail-oriented bookkeeper to manage our financial records and ensure our financial transactions are accurate and up-to-date. The bookkeeper will be responsible for maintaining our general ledger, reconciling bank statements, and preparing financial reports. The ideal candidate will have strong organizational skills and a thorough understanding of accounting principles.\r\n\r\nPOSITION DETAILS:\r\n\r\nType: This is a permanent full-time role requiring 40 hours per week.\r\nLocation: Remote\r\n\r\nRESPONSIBILITIES AND DUTIES:\r\n\r\nMaintain the general ledger and ensure all financial transactions are properly recorded\r\n\r\n-Prepare and reconcile bank statements\r\n\r\n-Process accounts payable and receivable\r\n\r\n-Generate financial reports on a regular basis\r\n\r\n-Assist with budget preparation and tracking\r\n\r\n-Maintain accurate and up-to-date records of financial transactions\r\n\r\n-Collaborate with other team members to ensure financial data is accurate and complete\r\n\r\n-Assist with tax preparation and filings\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBASIC QUALIFICATIONS:\r\n\r\n-Bachelor\'s degree in Accounting or related field\r\n-Strong knowledge of accounting principles and practices\r\n-Excellent communication and problem-solving skills\r\n-Proficient in Microsoft Excel and other related software\r\n-Knowledge of Quickbooks or other accounting software is required.\r\n-Capable of managing multiple tasks and deadlines\r\n\r\nDetail-oriented and organized\r\nAble to work independently and as part of a team\r\nJob Type: Full-time\r\nPay: 8,980.8 - 26,942.4 (PHP) per month\r\nBenefits: Flexible schedule\r\nSchedule: Day shift (candidate’s time), Monday to Friday\r\nWork Location: Remote\r\nP.S. Do you have a passion for keeping accurate financial records? Join our team and help us maintain our financial stability and growth!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655570369234763777?success','-',7,'United States','Southfield',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-08',1,'2023-05-08',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-08 13:49:40',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
