(20454,'Bookkeeping (Ecommerce Businesses)',39,'I run a marketing agency that serves eCommerce brands and also run my own brands along with a few other online businesses.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for an experienced Bookkeeper to manage the financial transactions of our multiple businesses on a project-based, remote, part-time basis. As a bookkeeper, you will be responsible for recording, reconciling, and reporting financial data, ensuring the accuracy and integrity of financial records, and supporting the overall financial operations of our organization.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Record financial transactions for all businesses, including sales, purchases, receipts, and payments.\r\n\r\n- Reconcile bank statements and credit card statements for all businesses.\r\n\r\n- Prepare financial statements, including income statements, balance sheets, and cash flow statements.\r\n\r\n- Manage accounts payable and accounts receivable for all businesses.\r\n\r\n-Ensure compliance with tax laws and regulations, including filing of tax returns and payments.\r\n\r\n- Maintain accurate and up-to-date financial records for all businesses.\r\n\r\n- Collaborate with other members of the finance team to improve financial processes and procedures.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\nProven work experience as a Bookkeeper, preferably for multiple businesses.\r\n\r\nStrong understanding of accounting principles and practices.\r\n\r\nExcellent knowledge of accounting software, such as Quickbooks.\r\n\r\nStrong attention to detail and accuracy.\r\n\r\nExcellent organizational and time-management skills.\r\n\r\nAbility to work independently and remotely.\r\n\r\nExcellent communication and interpersonal skills.\r\n\r\nThis is a part time project with tons of benefits and room for growth. It will start off with only a few hours a month of work','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655600422937067521?success','-',7,'United States','Cypress',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-08',1,'2023-05-08',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-08 15:48:50',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
