(20488,'Digital T Shirt / Hoodie Logo Designs',10,'\'m starting a clothing brand and am looking for someone to create professional Digital Logo designs that will be used by a Manufacturer to produce our products. We want 6 designs made in a black colorway and a white colorway (Please include a transparent background on all designs and all designs will need to be done in high-quality files).  We want our Brand logo (the design with wings and SERAPH) to be touched up (Letter alignment and any other small details that need work) and done in a high-quality file so we can use it on our clothing. We want 4 different word logos below to be done in 3 different versions. The 1st version is a horizontal stack with the top word inversed (an example will be included). The second version is for the word to just be written horizontal and the third version of it to be written vertical. The final design we want made is for our purgatory logo to be redone. We want the white areas of it erased so it will give the unfinished appearance (an example of what we would like it to appear as will be provided), we then would like the black area removed and a version provided like that as well. Both versions will need to have a completely black, and a completely white finish product.  \r\n\r\n\r\nLogo Words 1st Version (All Logo should be all Caps) (Font Bakersville Old Face)\r\n\r\n    SERAPH\r\n    Rising\r\n    Fallen\r\n    Purgatory\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLogo Words 2nd & 3rd Version (All Logo should be all Caps) (Font Colonna MT)\r\n\r\n    SERAPH\r\n    Rising\r\n    Fallen\r\n    Purgatory','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2062419','-',7,'United States','-',250.000,'fixed',220.000,'2023-05-08',1,'2023-05-08',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-08 20:30:41',NULL,16,1,NULL,136),
