(20491,'Expert Accountant for an E-commerce & Logistics Company in Tunisia',39,'We are seeking a highly skilled and experienced Accountant with a deep understanding of the Tunisian business and tax environment for a project-based engagement to analyze our rapidly growing e-commerce and logistics company, Shipper, and recommend the best possible business structure.\r\n\r\nShipper is a dropshipping platform connecting suppliers to online retailers and providing logistics and financial services to businesses.\r\n\r\nWebsite for online retailers: https://shipper.market/en\r\nWebsite for suppliers: https://shipper.partners/en\r\nWebsite for logistics & financial service: https://shipper.express/en\r\n\r\nAs our Accountant, you will play a crucial role in reviewing our financial operations, ensuring compliance with local regulations, and advising us on the most efficient financial practices and structures to streamline our processes and support our company\'s growth.\r\n\r\nProject Scope:\r\n\r\nThoroughly analyze our current financial situation, business operations, and the regulatory environment in Tunisia\r\nProvide expert advice on the appropriate activities for our business, based on the Tunisian Nomenclature des Activités\r\nAssess and recommend the best possible business structure(s) for our company, considering our various services (e-commerce, logistics, and payment processing)\r\nEvaluate the pros and cons of each proposed business structure and their potential impact on our company\'s growth, scalability, and compliance\r\nDevelop a detailed report outlining your findings, recommendations, and suggested next steps for our company\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nA degree in Accounting, Finance, or a related field\r\nProfessional accounting certification (such as CPA, CA, or equivalent) in Tunisia\r\n5+ years of experience in accounting, with a strong focus on e-commerce and logistics businesses\r\nExtensive knowledge of the Tunisian tax system, business regulations, and Nomenclature des Activités\r\nStrong understanding of financial statements, budgeting, and forecasting\r\nExcellent analytical and problem-solving skills\r\nStrong communication skills, both written and verbal, in English and French\r\nHighly organized, detail-oriented, and able to manage multiple tasks and deadlines effectively\r\nIf you are a highly motivated, results-driven Accountant with a passion for e-commerce and logistics, and you have the expertise to navigate the complexities of the Tunisian business environment, we would love to hear from you. Please submit your proposal, along with your resume and a cover letter detailing your relevant experience and why you would be the perfect fit for this project.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655611417420660737','-',7,'United States','Sheridan',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-05-08',1,'2023-05-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-08 20:33:11',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
