(20501,'Escape room interactive website',3,'m looking to build a website that can be interactive for my students.  For example, they can click on the door in the picture and it will lead them to another clue and then another clue until they escape from the room.  They can collect items too (like keys, etc.).   I need the website to be where I can load an image of any room and will be able to configure it however I need.  For example, I should be able to switch out an office room image for a museum image on my own and add questions for the students to click on.  For example, I can click on the door knob and it will ask a question.  If they guess the correct answer, the door will open, etc. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAttached is an image of a kind of room I have in mind, but I should be able to add any image I want as I will have to change the room every week.  I also included a link to a website that already does something similar to this for reference, but their format is a little too complicated.  \r\n\r\n\r\nThanks in advance,\r\n\r\nShawn','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2062413','-',7,'United States','-',1000.000,'fixed',1000.000,'2023-05-08',1,'2023-05-08',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-08 21:52:28',NULL,16,1,NULL,136),
(20502,'WordPress Website Error',15,'Hi Amarpreet,  my company\'s website developed with word press Avada theme/ plugin is generating an error for a while, as such the website has been down.\r\n\r\n\r\nI have tried changing the theme to other themes and deactivating the plugin, however all the customised graphics go chaotic when attempted.\r\n\r\n\r\nWebsite: https://www.prolistic.co.uk/\r\n\r\n\r\n Word press Message: \r\n\r\nSince WordPress 5.2 there is a built-in feature that detects when a plugin or theme causes a fatal error on your site, and notifies you with this automated email.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIn this case, WordPress caught an error with your theme, Avada.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nFirst, visit your website (https://www.prolistic.co.uk/) and check for any visible issues. Next, visit the page where the error was caught (https://www.prolistic.co.uk/wp-login.php) and check for any visible issues.\r\n\r\n\r\nTimeframe: Flexible at Earliest Convenience \r\n\r\n\r\nAdditional Note:\r\n\r\n\r\nWe will like to ultimately revamp the website and modernise it, any suggestion will be welcomed and additional work compensated.\r\n\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\n\r\n\r\nEmmanuel Williams\r\nJob Q&A','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2062417','-',7,'United States','-',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-05-08',1,'2023-05-08',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-08 21:53:10',NULL,16,1,NULL,136),
