(20504,'CPA/Financial Expert for Used Car Dealership',39,'A US based car dealership  is seeking a highly skilled and experienced CPA or financial expert to review our business books with Quickbooks. Our used automobile dealership has been in operation for four years, employs four people, and generates approximately 2.1 million in revenue year-to-date in 2023. We sell rebuilt title vehicles, and our target market is anyone interested in a vehicle. We sell vehicles and aftermarket warranties, and our unique selling proposition is that we offer nice low mileage vehicles for thousands less than the market.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a financial expert to provide us with an expert opinion on how to better operate our financials and ensure we are tracking our business financial and cash flow in the best possible way. We have five separate bank accounts (Tax, Savings, Primary, Payroll, and God account) and we use Intuit Quickbooks and a custom Excel sheet to manage our floor plan line of credit. We currently deposit money, pay off the vehicles, and reconcile the books a few weeks later, but our current process is not working as well as we\'d like, especially as our business grows.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should have experience in the automotive industry and a strong background in accounting and financial management. They will be responsible for reviewing our financials, identifying pain points, and providing recommendations on how to improve our cash flow management and set financial goals. They should be able to analyze financial statements and performance metrics to help us make informed decisions about our finances.\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nA Bachelor\'s or Master\'s degree in Accounting or Finance\r\nAt least 5 years of experience as a CPA or financial expert\r\nExperience in the automotive industry is preferred\r\nProficiency in Intuit Quickbooks and Excel\r\nStrong analytical and problem-solving skills\r\nExcellent communication and interpersonal skills\r\nAbility to work independently and remotely\r\nThis is a short-term position with the potential for ongoing work if needed. The duration of the project will be determined based on the scope of work agreed upon. If you are interested in this opportunity, please apply with your resume and a cover letter detailing your relevant experience and qualifications.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655692947685294081','-',7,'United States','Ozark',200.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-08',1,'2023-05-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-08 21:59:15',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(20505,'We need an USA accountant for eCommerce( Amazon)',39,'We are looking for an experienced USA accountant to help us manage our eCommerce business on Amazon. As our accountant, you will be responsible for bookkeeping, data entry, financial accounting, tax preparation, and other related tasks. The ideal candidate should have a good understanding of Amazon FBA and Amazon Seller Central.\r\n\r\nThe project duration is more than 6 months, and we are looking for a candidate who can commit to working with us for the entire duration. We need someone who can work independently and can deliver accurate and timely work.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this position, please submit a proposal that includes your experience in accounting and eCommerce, your understanding of Amazon FBA and Seller Central, and how you can help us manage our finances. Please also provide links to your past completed projects that are relevant to this job.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you and working with you to grow our business on Amazon.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655682834657210369','-',7,'United States','00',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-05-08',1,'2023-05-08',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-08 22:00:39',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
