(20508,'UI/UX designer for visually complex and dynamic presentation site',4,'We are looking for a UI/UX designer with experience in creating visually complex designs.\r\n\r\nThe website will contain 3 presentation pages for 3 separate healthcare products.\r\n\r\nEach of the pages will contain scroll-based animations utilising 3D renders of these said products. These renders will be made available in a few weeks by a third party.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- utilise existing moodboard and design brief to create a styleguide\r\n- study site examples and propose wireframes\r\n- create interactive prototypes for every page, which should contain full 3D animations\r\n\r\nGeneral visual cues:\r\n\r\n- keywords: “classy”, “premium”, “luxury”\r\n- dark design, predominantly black background\r\n\r\nhttps://forestal.com/en/products/hydra - favourite example. Call-to-action and how the specs are laid out.\r\n\r\nhttps://mute.design/jetson/ - the build features are appreciated\r\n\r\nhttps://heleonic.com/en/- main product animation is appreciated. The boxes that items are in too towards bottom of the screen - are appreciated.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.mercurymarine.com/en/us/v12/ - the high end feeling of this but the screen flashes too much\r\n\r\nhttps://pad.dotincorp.com - this displays the product and separates it - one of the best examples as well\r\n\r\nYou will be working on a European timezone, along with a project manager.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a full-time availability, ideally (40hrs/week).\r\n\r\nPlease attach a portfolio showing your best designs and a rough estimate for such work. The most relevant candidates will be contacted in private and discuss specifics.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0140e4eb8c7e34669d','-',7,'United States','Bucharest',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-09',1,'2023-05-09',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-09 07:26:20',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
