(20522,'Need QuickBooks Online Expert',39,'I am looking for a QuickBooks online expert for a project with very specific deliverables. Here is what I need:\r\n\r\n1. Fix and improve vendor setup and tie their invoices to system\r\n2. Setup appropriate accounts/categories for for the following:\r\n\r\nThere are 2 locations and I need to clearly see salaries by location 1- production vs nonproduction and location 2 salaries nonproduction vs production\r\n\r\nSetup income to separate into product, service, and subscription\r\n\r\nI am thinking using classes is probably the best way to go with the 2 locations?\r\n\r\nPlease actually know how to do these things and do not submit a proposal if you cannot ( I have had people go in and make a complete mess of things before)\r\n\r\nSuccessful completion of this project could very easily lead to more work and for the right person a position with my company\r\n\r\nThis project is semi-urgent, so please be available and let me know your approximate timeline for completion in your proposal.\r\n\r\nThank you for reading, and have a blessed day!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655924366190346241','-',7,'United States','Leavittsburg',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-09',1,'2023-05-09',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-09 13:16:48',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(20523,'Part time ongoing book keeper wanted',39,'Hello,\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for a book keeper to reconcile my books on a weekly basis & remind customers to pay outstanding invoices.\r\n\r\nI use Wave Accounting software and all bank accounts are already integrated. It\'s just a matter of categorizing each transaction.\r\n\r\nI have multiple businesses. Experience with real estate transactions REQUIRED.\r\n\r\nMy previous bookkeeper completed the work in 3-5 hours / week.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655924744968896513?success','-',7,'United States','Laguna Beach',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-09',1,'2023-05-09',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-09 13:17:49',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(20524,'QuickBooks Certified Pro',39,'Hello!\r\n\r\nWe are a 4 year old Roofing and Reconstruction company.\r\n\r\nWe had a in house office manager/ book keeper but come to find out she didn’t know quite as much as she led us to believe.\r\n\r\nOur credit cards weren’t connecting to QuickBooks so she was manually entering the expenses in QuickBooks.\r\n\r\nNow that we finally got them to connect (hopefully) there might be double entries now.\r\n\r\nWe are needing a guru to come in clean house and help us improve our current processes to keep the books clean.\r\n\r\nSomeone who can explain the financials, create a budget and put reports together would be a plus as well\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat we are currently looking for is someone who can start pretty immediately.\r\n\r\nLet’s talk!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655925314367291393','-',7,'United States','Fort Worth',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-09',1,'2023-05-09',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-09 13:19:46',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(20525,'Experienced Bookkeeper/Accountant',39,'Looking for an experienced accountant/bookkeeper to help us with QBO.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Reconcile Bank accounts and 15 credit cards in QBO\r\n- Add transactions weekly into QBO\r\n- Generate P&L weekly and reconcile monthly\r\n- Manage and prepare bank/financial statements\r\n- Responsible for general bookkeeping\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n- Experienced with QBO, bank, and credit reconciliations.\r\n- Experience with Gusto and filing 1099\'s (preferred)\r\n\r\n\r\nMust have 5 years of experience in QBO in the service industry\r\n\r\nMust be willing to work 10-15 hours a week between 10 AM to 6 PM EST\r\n\r\nWould want to have bi-weekly meetings or sometimes as needed\r\n\r\nLooking to hire someone ASAP','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655925604646027265?success','-',7,'United States','NEW YORK',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-09',1,'2023-05-09',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-09 13:20:57',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(20526,'A bookkeeper/accountant needed as a personal assistant',39,'A long term contract.\r\nWe are seeking a highly organized and experienced bookkeeper/accountant to serve as a personal assistant for more than six months. The ideal candidate should be able to manage and maintain financial records, including accounts payable and receivable, bank statements, and general ledgers. The candidate should also be proficient in using Intuit QuickBooks and have a good understanding of accounting principles and practices.\r\n\r\nThe successful candidate will be responsible for ensuring timely and accurate financial reporting, managing budgets, and reconciling accounts. Additionally, the candidate will assist with other administrative tasks, including managing schedules and organizing files.\r\n\r\nTo be considered for this position, please submit a proposal detailing your experience and expertise in bookkeeping and accounting, as well as your ability to serve as a personal assistant. Please include links to past completed projects that demonstrate your skills and qualifications.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from qualified candidates who are committed to providing exceptional service and support.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655926818415345665','-',7,'United States','Dubai',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-09',1,'2023-05-09',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-09 13:25:39',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(20527,'We are looking for a Chief Financial Officer with HR Expertise',39,'The Chief Financial Officer (CFO) plays a crucial role in any organization. They are responsible for managing and leading the financial initiatives of a company, working closely with other C-suite executives such as the CEO and COO. The CFO is accountable for the financial successes or failures of the company and must make decisions on where to invest company funds, oversee the capital structure and financing options, provide strategic direction, and ensure accurate financial reporting.\r\n\r\nThe objectives of the role include taking responsibility for cash management, investments, insurance, budgeting, and financial reporting, as well as driving the company\'s financial strategy and hiring needs. The CFO should coordinate the development of budgets and ensure that cash flow is compatible with operations. They should also create and implement best practices and tools for fiscal management, project coordination, cross-team communications, and workflows. The CFO should comply with national and local financial requirements by studying existing and new legislation and taking appropriate action.\r\n\r\nThe CFO\'s responsibilities include efficiently developing budget proposals, researching revenue opportunities and economic trends, analyzing internal operations, and identifying areas for cost reduction and process enhancement. They should also perform risk management, evaluate and manage capital structure and fundraising initiatives, oversee HR operations, monitor business performance with tracking tools, establish corrective measures as needed, and prepare detailed reports for earnings calls, management team, and the rest of the company. The CFO should manage finance personnel and oversee financial IT systems, ensuring compliance with relevant regulatory entities.\r\n\r\nTo be a successful CFO, one must have five or more years of experience in executive leadership roles, excellent leadership skills, steadfast resolve, and personal integrity. Exceptional verbal, written, and visual communication skills are essential, as well as an understanding of advanced accounting, regulatory issues, and tax planning with GAAP Tax Code. Working knowledge of how to raise capital outside traditional lines of credit is also important. Preferred skills and qualifications include a Master\'s degree (or equivalent experience) in accounting, business accounting, or finance, international finance experience, experience in mergers and acquisitions and investor relations, executive experience with SaaS business models and their associated revenue recognition, and a professional certification (ex: Certified Public Accountant).','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655926940175351809?success','-',7,'United States','Bullhead City',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-09',1,'2023-05-09',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-09 13:26:41',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(20528,'Mid Level Web Designer',4,'We are seeking a talented and motivated mid-level web designer. The ideal candidate will have experience designing and developing websites, as well as a strong understanding of user experience and responsive design principles. In this role, you will work closely with our development team to create engaging, intuitive, and visually appealing websites that meet our clients\' needs.\r\n\r\nMain Accountabilities​:\r\nDesign and develop visually appealing and user-friendly websites, incorporating best practices for responsive design and accessibility.\r\nCollaborate with project managers, developers, and other designers to create websites that meet project goals and client requirements.\r\nConduct research and analysis to inform design decisions and identify user needs.\r\nCreate wireframes, prototypes, and design mockups to communicate design concepts and facilitate feedback from stakeholders.\r\nUp-to-date with the latest design trends, technologies, and best practices, and incorporate them into your work.\r\nManage multiple projects and priorities in a fast-paced environment, ensuring that deadlines and quality standards are met.\r\nProvide design support for other marketing materials such as email templates, landing pages, and digital advertisements as needed.\r\n\r\nOperational Excellence ​\r\n\r\n Ensuring an NPS Score of over 80% with all stakeholders for collaborative delivery of all Long term\r\ndigital products and marketing automation deployments\r\n Drive and champion craft and quality of Web Design implementation across website\r\n Compliant with all Global Standards and policies. ​\r\n\r\nSLA Compliance ​\r\n\r\n Successful delivery of Long term digital products within the expected SLAs ​\r\n Successful delivery of Marketing Automation Deployments within the expected SLAs​\r\n\r\nDigital Design Excellence ​\r\n\r\n Design and develop visually stunning and user-friendly websites that align with our clients\' brands and business objectives.\r\nEnsure digital design excellence by following best practices for user experience, accessibility, and responsive design.\r\nCollaborate with project managers, developers, and other designers to create websites that meet project goals and client requirements.\r\nConduct research and analysis to inform design decisions and identify user needs.\r\nCreate wireframes, prototypes, and design mockups to communicate design concepts and facilitate feedback from stakeholders.\r\nUp-to-date with the latest design trends, technologies, and best practices, and incorporate them into your work.\r\nManage multiple projects and priorities in a fast-paced environment, ensuring that deadlines and quality standards are met.\r\n\r\nTeamwork / Accountability ​\r\n\r\n Team player with strong communications skills that works well under pressure and delivers quality\r\nwork aligned within the project scope. ​\r\n Take accountability for all actions and lead with your design knowledge.​\r\n Fosters a spirit of teamwork and camaraderie within the assigned team to support the overarching\r\nteam KPIs\r\n Accepts mentorship from senior team members to ensure the development of excellent work ​\r\n Knowledge share from formalized training, industry events with team members ​\r\n\r\nQualifications/ Experience ​\r\n\r\n Matric​\r\n Higher Certificate/Diploma) or relevant tertiary qualifications/certifications in visual design,\r\nComputer Science or relevant field. ​\r\n Understanding of UX, SEO and familiar with coding software like HTML and CSS. ​\r\n Up-to-date knowledge of design software like Adobe creative suite. ​\r\n 5 + years’ proven work experience as a UI designer, preferably within the FMCG market ​\r\n Portfolio of design and or case studies on digital projects worked on. ​\r\n Keen understanding of user journeys and strategic display of solutions to digital products​\r\n Creative, Artistic eye for design, user interaction, functionality, and readability\r\n Strategically minded communicator to collaborate with various stakeholders​\r\n Digital Native and promotes user advocacy with rapid prototyping​\r\n Self-motivated, organised, and passionate​\r\n Natural diplomacy skills ​\r\n Team player ​\r\n Good time-management skills and strong team spirit.​\r\n Proactive, persuasive, and promotes strong business and revising skills. ​\r\n Agile-minded and can perform under pressure.​','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~019f736648555662ee','-',7,'United States','Santa Clara',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-09',1,'2023-05-09',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-09 13:29:08',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
