(20530,'Accounting and bookeeping',39,'We are currently seeking a skilled accounting and bookkeeping professional to join our team. The ideal candidate should have a strong background in accounting basics, account reconciliation, bank reconciliation, and bookkeeping.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities will include:\r\n\r\n- Maintaining accurate financial records\r\n- Reconciling accounts and bank statements\r\n- Preparing financial statements and reports\r\n- Managing accounts payable and receivable\r\n- Assisting with month-end and year-end close processes\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a candidate who is highly organized, detail-oriented, and able to work independently as well as part of a team. Excellent communication and problem-solving skills are essential.\r\n\r\nPM ME if you are interested\r\n\r\nBest Regards\r\nTom','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655928152333385729','-',7,'United States','Paris',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-09',1,'2023-05-09',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-09 13:30:55',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(20531,'QuickBooks Spring Cleaning',39,'We are looking for a skilled freelancer to help us with QuickBooks Spring Cleaning. The project will last for 1 to 3 months and requires expertise in Intuit QuickBooks. The main goal of this project is to ensure that our QuickBooks data is accurate, organized, and up-to-date.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should have extensive experience in QuickBooks and be able to assist us with the following tasks:\r\n- Reviewing and cleaning up our chart of accounts\r\n- Reconciling bank and credit card transactions\r\n- Reviewing and correcting any journal entries\r\n- Ensuring that all bills and invoices are accurately recorded\r\n- Providing guidance on best practices for using QuickBooks\r\n\r\nTo apply for this project, please submit a proposal that describes how you can help us with QuickBooks Spring Cleaning. Please also include links to some past completed projects that demonstrate your expertise in QuickBooks.\r\n\r\nWe are looking forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655928154297233409?success','-',7,'United States','Ridgecrest',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-09',1,'2023-05-09',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-09 13:31:13',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(20532,'Graphic Designer For Flexible Symbol for Wellness Logo',2,'Seeking a graphic designer to design a flexible symbol as a logo for a wellness brand. We currently have the text portion of the logo done (name, fonts and spacing) and we are looking to add symbol to the logo.\r\n\r\nThis symbol will be flexible meaning that the 4 different layers of the design should also represent the 4 different aspects of the business, to allow for variation and adaptability\r\n\r\nThe 4 different aspects of the business are (Spa & Wellness, Retreats, Products, Consulting)\r\n\r\nGoal: Create a flexible symbol for EsoLuxe Brand. This flexible design should can be easily customized and adapted to 4 different contexts of the brand while maintaining consistency and brand recognition. This will allow the brand to communicate our message effectively across different channels, whether it\'s print, digital, social media, or other platforms.\r\n\r\nInspiration: Modern clean esoteric symbol that weaves inspiration from flower of life, lotus flower, star and mandala yet elevated and high end. The different logos can be as the “peeling of layers” or lotus flower petal. Each petal would represent the 4 categories:\r\n- Spa & Wellness\r\n- Consulting\r\n- Retreats\r\n- Products\r\n\r\nBrand Audience: Four Seasons meets Gaia\r\n\r\nColors: Black, Gold, Tan, Brown, White (we will provide the colors)\r\n\r\nDeliverable: 6 versions of the design\r\n1 version of design with in white/gold (for black background)\r\n1 version of design with black/gold (for white background)\r\n1 version of design with layer 1 highlighted in gold/white/tan (Spa & Wellness)\r\n1 version of design with layer 2 highlighted in gold/white/tan (Consulting)\r\n1 version of design with layer 2 highlighted in gold/white/tan (Retreats)\r\n1 version of design with layer 2 highlighted in gold/white/tan (Products)\r\n\r\nDeliverable Format: PSD, PNG, JPG, PDF and Vector','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~017684eac86cb613d2','-',7,'United States','US',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-05-09',1,'2023-05-09',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-09 13:32:15',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
