(20539,'Bookkeeper/ cfo',39,'Job Title: Bookkeeper (Regular Work and As Needed)\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\nWe are currently seeking a reliable and experienced Bookkeeper to assist us with regular and as needed tasks. This position involves regular weekly and monthly responsibilities, as well as occasional tasks that arise. As a Bookkeeper, you will be responsible for managing our financial records, preparing reports, and ensuring accurate documentation for our business operations.\r\n\r\nRegular Tasks:\r\n\r\n1. Weekly Expense and Income Reporting: Utilize QuickBooks Online to track and report our business\'s weekly expenses and income. This task requires meticulous attention to detail and timely reporting.\r\n\r\n2. Monthly Expense Reporting: Prepare comprehensive monthly expense reports to provide an overview of our business expenditures. This will help us analyze our financial performance and make informed decisions.\r\n\r\nAs Needed Task:\r\n\r\n3. Mortgage Paperwork and Documentation: Assist with filling out mortgage paperwork applications and gathering the necessary documentation for mortgage companies. This task involves attention to detail and timely communication with the relevant parties involved. It primarily consists of accessing a Dropbox or email, retrieving files, and sending them to the insurance or mortgage company.\r\n\r\nOne-Time Task:\r\n\r\n4. Expense Categorization by Property: Organize and classify expenses according to property classes in QuickBooks. This task involves ensuring that expenses are accurately allocated to their respective properties to maintain a well-organized financial record. This task needs to be completed only once to establish a clear and organized system.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n1. Proven experience as a Bookkeeper or similar role.\r\n2. Proficient in using QuickBooks Online and other bookkeeping software.\r\n3. Strong attention to detail and accuracy in financial record-keeping.\r\n4. Excellent organizational and time management skills.\r\n5. Familiarity with mortgage paperwork and documentation is a plus.\r\n6. Ability to work independently and meet deadlines.\r\n\r\nThis position is ideal for someone who is well-versed in bookkeeping practices, has a strong eye for detail, and can manage multiple tasks effectively. The regular tasks include weekly and monthly reporting, while the as needed task involves assisting with mortgage paperwork and documentation. The expense categorization by property is a one-time task to establish an organized system.\r\n\r\nIf you are a dependable and detail-oriented professional with a passion for maintaining accurate financial records, we would love to hear from you…..\r\n\r\nSend a vocaroo audio explaining your experience and why you would be good for the job, in order to be considered\r\n\r\nNote: This is a remote position, and candidates from any location are welcome to apply.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655933813813313537?success','-',7,'United States','Pennington',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-09',1,'2023-05-09',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-09 13:53:52',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(20540,'Bookkeeper',39,'We are seeking a skilled professional to help with bookkeeping for the next 1 to 3 months. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in accounting basics, bank reconciliation, and bookkeeping.\r\n\r\nAs a bookkeeper, you will be responsible for maintaining accurate financial records and reconciling bank statements. You should have a keen attention to detail, strong organizational skills, and the ability to work independently.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for someone who is proficient in accounting software such as Quickbooks. The ideal candidate should have at least 2 years of experience in bookkeeping or a similar role.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this position, please submit a proposal outlining your experience and how you can help with this project. We would also like to see some examples of past completed projects if available.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655934641423073281','-',7,'United States','West Hempstead',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-09',1,'2023-05-09',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-09 13:57:03',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(20541,'CA for Bookkeeping and Admin',39,'We are seeking a detail-oriented and experienced bookkeeper/administrator to join our team for a 3 to 6 month project (need an Indian CA proficient in this field). The ideal candidate should have a strong background in accounting and be proficient in accounting software and bookkeeping. The role will entail handling accounts payable, bank reconciliation, and other related tasks.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Handle accounts payable and receivable\r\n- Manage bank reconciliations\r\n-GST Filing (India)\r\n- Maintain financial records accurately\r\n- Prepare and analyze financial statements\r\n- Assist with administrative tasks\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Bachelor\'s degree in accounting or related field\r\n- Strong knowledge of accounting software, particularly Quickbooks\r\n- Excellent organizational and time-management skills\r\n- Ability to work independently and meet tight deadlines\r\n- At least 3 years of experience in bookkeeping and accounting\r\n\r\nTo apply for this position, please submit a proposal detailing how you can help us with this project. Please include links to past completed projects that showcase your bookkeeping and administrative skills.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655937020457467905?success','-',7,'United States','Boston',25.000,'Open this select menu',25.000,'2023-05-09',1,'2023-05-09',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-09 14:07:44',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
