(20555,'Logo Design',10,'We are looking for a talented and experienced logo designer to create a versatile and minimalist logo design for our brand. The ideal candidate will have experience in brand identity and guidelines, graphic design, and stationery design. The project length is expected to be 1 month.\r\n\r\nThe main responsibilities of the logo designer will include creating a logo that accurately represents our brand and can be used across a variety of mediums. The candidate should be able to provide high-quality vector files and source files for the design. Additionally, the logo should be versatile enough, and or have specific versions, to be used on stationery designs, as a Favicon, and other marketing materials.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this role, please submit a proposal detailing your experience with logo design and how you can help with this project. Please also include links to past completed logo design projects that showcase your skills and expertise. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~019727735d537ff6ff','-',7,'United States','Whitefish',350.000,'fixed',350.000,'2023-05-09',1,'2023-05-09',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-09 15:01:29',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
