(20605,'Accountant',39,'ABOUT GEP:\r\n\r\n\r\nGlobal Ecom Partners is a fast-growing, dynamic e-commerce retail company headquartered in Charleston, SC. Our mission is to help brands take back control, time, and grow revenue in online marketplaces. We accomplish this by managing our client\'s presence on Amazon, eBay, Walmart, and Google through a proven Marketplace Management strategy coupled with an AI-Driven Digital Marketing approach.\r\n\r\n\r\nJoin us, and change the world for the better. If you are skilled and humble, with a commitment to lifelong learning, and you’re curious about the world and its people, you could be a good fit at Global Ecom Partners. We welcome the unique contributions you can bring to help us build a diverse, inclusive workplace because we connect, learn, and grow stronger from our differences. We want you to bring your whole, authentic self to work. We look forward to hearing from you!\r\n\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a highly-organized, analytical and detail-oriented Accountant who can be a great addition to our team. We are looking for a dedicated team member who can demonstrate strong ability to thrive in a fast-paced and dynamic environment\r\n\r\nJob Title: Accountant\r\n\r\nResponsibilities will include:\r\n\r\nReports & financial statements preparation\r\nOpen Balance Reconciliation\r\nQBO Management\r\nBank and Credit Card Reconciliation\r\nInventory reconciliation\r\nReview of accounts payable invoice\r\nRecording of US/Canada/Mexico Sales\r\nOther Reports needed\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n• Must have a bachelor\'s degree in Accounting with minimum of 3 years meaningful experience\r\n• CPA certification\r\n• Provides professional accounting advice and assistance.\r\n• Proven experience with Quickbooks and highly skilled at reconciling inventory at the SKU level\r\n• Knowledgeable in Microsoft Office/Gsuite application.\r\n• Must be well organized and detail–oriented.\r\n• Ability to multi-task and learn quickly\r\n• Excellent interpersonal skills.\r\n• Can work with minimum supervision.\r\n• Good English communication skills, both oral and written.\r\n\r\nWork Schedule & Location:\r\n9AM to 5 PM EST, Mondays through Fridays (40 hours per week)\r\nMust be willing to commit to one employer','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656048833218510849?success','-',7,'United States','Saint Petersburg',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-09',1,'2023-05-09',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-09 21:30:59',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
