(20610,'Corporate Identity for reputable Real Estate Brokerage',2,'We are BLS Immo GmbH, a licensed real estate broker in Austria, and we would like to create a corporate identity for ourselves.\r\n\r\n\r\n- Who we are and what is important to us:\r\n\r\nWe value ensuring that our customers\' real estate transactions are safe, transparent and done with excellent service. We aim to be perceived as competent, reliable and professional. We operate in eastern Austria, from the greater Vienna area to the middle Burgenland region.\r\n\r\nOur target groups are:\r\n\r\n- Sale of single-family homes (e.g. after inheritance or divorce)\r\n- Sale of property developer projects (townhouse complexes, apartment complexes)\r\n- Sale of individual apartments (e.g. after inheritance or divorce)\r\n\r\n\r\n· What we are looking for:\r\n\r\nSpecifically, we require these elements, according to our Logo and Color suggestions:\r\n\r\n- Logo\r\n- Fonts\r\n- Colors\r\n- Business cards\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~012d4b82eb4aa181db','-',7,'United States','Wien',750.000,'fixed',750.000,'2023-05-10',1,'2023-05-10',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-10 07:52:25',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
