(20633,'Experienced Bookkeeper for Small Business',39,'We are a small business seeking an experienced bookkeeper to help us manage our financial records, cashflow, budgets, and overall financial organization. Our goal is to gain clarity on our spending, streamline our financial processes, and ensure our business remains financially healthy and stable.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Maintain accurate financial records and ensure data is up-to-date and organized\r\n- Reconcile bank and credit card statements\r\n- Categorize and track income and expenses to provide a clear understanding of spending habits\r\n- Prepare and analyze cash flow statements, income statements, and balance sheets\r\n- Manage accounts payable and accounts receivable\r\n- Assist with budget creation and monitoring\r\n- Ensure compliance with local, state, and federal tax requirements\r\n- Provide financial reporting and insights to support decision-making\r\n- Recommend improvements to financial processes and systems\r\n- Liaise with external partners, such as accountants or auditors, as needed\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Proven experience as a bookkeeper or similar role (minimum 3 years)\r\n- Strong knowledge of bookkeeping principles and practices\r\n- Proficiency in accounting software (e.g., QuickBooks, Xero) and Microsoft Office suite\r\n- Excellent attention to detail and ability to maintain accuracy in a fast-paced environment\r\n- Strong organizational and time management skills\r\n- Ability to work independently and communicate effectively with team members\r\n- Familiarity with tax regulations and reporting requirements\r\n- Associate\'s or Bachelor\'s degree in accounting, finance, or a related field is preferred\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit your resume and a brief video of yourself (no longer than 3 minutes) in which you introduce yourself and explain your experience working as a bookkeeper, as well as how you believe your skills and expertise will contribute to the success of our business. We look forward to reviewing your application!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656298538133647361','-',7,'United States','Provo',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-10',1,'2023-05-10',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-10 14:03:17',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
