(20650,'Logo Re Design',10,'We are seeking a skilled and experienced graphic designer to assist us with our logo redesign project. We are looking for a candidate with expertise in brand identity and guidelines, graphic design, logo design, logo transparency, printable file, source file, and vector file format.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will have a keen eye for detail, a strong understanding of design principles, and the ability to create visually appealing logos that accurately represent our brand. The candidate should be able to work collaboratively with our team and be open to feedback and revisions.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this position, please submit a proposal outlining your experience in logo design, your approach to this project, and any relevant links to past completed projects. We look forward to reviewing your application and finding the perfect candidate to help us bring our brand to life.\r\n\r\nThe current logo is as attached. The text \"Local\" is to be replaced with \"LSPro\" We will like a logo similar to that of Urban Company https://www.urbancompany.com/ and Uber https://www.uber.com/gb/en/','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~010dd09b9cb7fe37c2','-',7,'United States','London',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-10',1,'2023-05-10',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-10 15:40:20',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
