(20654,'Financial administration, bookkeeping and automation using Moneybird and Google Suite',39,'Freelancer for Financial Administration and Automation using Moneybird and Google Suite\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a freelancer to handle the financial administration of our multiple BVs using Moneybird and Google Suite. The ideal candidate will have experience in bookkeeping, accounting, and financial management, as well as knowledge of automation tools to streamline processes.\r\n\r\n- fetch all invoices from mailboxes and archive all documents in Google Drive\r\n- connect the bank transactions with the invoices in Moneybird\r\n- categorize all the invoice lines\r\n- automate this process as much as possible\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Process and organize invoices, receipts, and bank statements for multiple BVs using Moneybird\r\n- Categorize transactions in the appropriate accounts in the general ledger\r\n- Reconcile bank and credit card accounts monthly\r\n- Set up and maintain financial dashboards\r\n- Create custom reports in Google Data Studio to support decision-making\r\n- Assist with budgeting and financial forecasting\r\nEnsure compliance with local tax and financial regulations\r\n- Identify opportunities to automate financial processes and implement automation tools\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Previous experience in bookkeeping, accounting, or financial management\r\n- Excellent organizational and time-management skills\r\n- Proficiency in spreadsheet software such as Google Sheets\r\n- Experience working with multiple entities and complex financial structures\r\n- Understanding of local (Dutch) tax and financial regulations\r\n- Knowledge of automation tools such to streamline financial processes\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a freelancer who can commit to a long-term partnership and can provide high-quality work at a competitive rate. Please include your hourly rate and availability in your proposal.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656326796183838721?success','-',7,'United States','Amsterdam',25.000,'Open this select menu',25.000,'2023-05-10',1,'2023-05-10',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-10 15:57:33',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
