(20656,'Financial Analyst',39,'OMSOL is seeking a highly motivated Staff Analyst to join our team. In this role, you will be responsible for working on existing models, building new ones, and making PowerPoint presentations to convey key insights and recommendations to investors. You will work closely with senior team members to develop financial models and analyze energy transfer data to help inform business decisions.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nWork with senior team members to analyze energy transfer data and develop financial models.\r\nBuild and update existing Excel models to reflect changes in business operations and industry trends.\r\nConduct research and analysis to identify opportunities for growth and improvement in energy transfer processes.\r\nCreate PowerPoint presentations to effectively communicate key insights and recommendations to investors and other stakeholders.\r\nCollaborate with cross-functional teams to develop and implement energy transfer strategies and initiatives.\r\nDemonstrate self-motivation and the ability to work independently without the need for constant supervision.\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nBachelor\'s degree in a related field, such as finance, economics, or engineering\r\n2+ years of experience in energy transfer analysis, financial modeling, or a related field\r\nAdvanced proficiency in Microsoft Excel and PowerPoint.\r\nStrong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to think critically about complex data.\r\nExcellent communication and presentation skills, with the ability to convey complex information in a clear and concise manner.\r\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team in a fast-paced','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656335220303380481?success','-',7,'United States','Lafayette',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-10',1,'2023-05-10',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-10 16:28:50',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(20657,'Remote Bookkeeper',39,'We are seeking a highly skilled and detail-oriented Bookkeeper with expertise in QuickBooks Online to join our team. As a Bookkeeper, you will be responsible for maintaining accurate financial records, reconciling accounts, and generating financial reports. Your proficiency in QuickBooks Online will be crucial in ensuring the integrity of our financial data and supporting our day-to-day financial operations.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nManage the company\'s day-to-day financial transactions, including accounts payable, accounts receivable, and payroll.\r\nRecord financial transactions accurately and timely in QuickBooks Online.\r\nReconcile bank and credit card statements to ensure accuracy and identify discrepancies.\r\nPrepare and maintain financial reports, including balance sheets, income statements, and cash flow statements.\r\nAssist in budgeting and forecasting processes.\r\nMonitor and track expenses to ensure compliance with company policies and budgets.\r\nCollaborate with other departments to provide financial data and analysis as needed.\r\nStay up-to-date with relevant financial regulations and accounting best practices.\r\nParticipate in the month-end and year-end closing processes.\r\nAssist with audits and provide necessary documentation and support.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656343526403723265?success','-',7,'United States','Istanbu',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-05-10',1,'2023-05-10',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-10 17:02:20',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(20658,'Xero Bookkeeper and Account',39,'We seek a highly skilled and experienced XERO Accountant to join our growing SaaS firm. The successful candidate will manage all aspects of our financial operations, including reconciling accounts, preparing financial reports, and building a great balance sheet using the XERO platform.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nManage and reconcile all financial accounts using XERO software\r\nMonitor and manage accounts receivable and payable\r\nPrepare and analyze financial reports regularly\r\nWork closely with the management team to develop and implement financial strategies\r\nPrepare and present budgets and forecasts\r\nEnsure compliance with accounting regulations and standards\r\nManage and oversee the payroll process\r\nPerform other accounting and finance-related duties as required\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nBachelor\'s degree in Accounting, Finance, or a related field\r\nCPA certification preferred\r\n\r\n3+ years of experience in accounting, preferably in a SaaS environment\r\nStrong understanding of accounting principles and practices\r\nProficiency with XERO accounting software\r\nExcellent communication and interpersonal skills\r\nDetail-oriented and able to multitask effectively\r\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team\r\nIf you have the required qualifications and experience and are excited about working in a fast-paced SaaS environment, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656353527610507265','-',7,'United States','Charlotte',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-10',1,'2023-05-10',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-10 17:41:12',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
