(20661,'Canadian OR US accountant to complete tax form to IRS',38,'Prefer an accountant that has experience with cross border filing.\r\n\r\nI am a dual citizen of USA and Canada residing in Canada.\r\nMy Canadian accountant recently retired. He has been filing my personal CRA & IRS tax forms for me the past 8-10 years so I am up to date excluding my IRS 2022 filing (2022 CRA tax return already done). I do not own any property in the USA but I do have bank accounts there. All of my income is claimed in Canada.\r\n\r\nI am seeking an Accountant that can file the proper IRS forms for me.\r\n\r\nFrom 2021\'s files, I see the following were filed by my accountant:\r\n\r\n1040 - Tax Form\r\n1116 - Foreign Tax Credit\r\n2555 - Foreign Earned Income\r\n8995 - Qualified Bus. Income Deduction Simplified Computation\r\nBSA - E-Filing Report of Foreign Bank and Financial Accts\r\n8879 - IRS e-file signature Authorization\r\n\r\nThank you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656376661306163201','-',7,'United States','Burford',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-10',1,'2023-05-10',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-10 19:13:30',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(20662,'Accounts Receivable / Collections Specialist',39,'A high growth tech company that focuses on flexible staffing is looking for an Accounts Receivable Specialist to join the Accounting team. You\'ll work closely with the Sr Mgr Accounts Receivable on following up on Accounts Receivable balances, organizing and tracking customer follow up. Strong communication skills, analytical, attention to detail, staying organized, taking initiative and providing succinct and clear status updates is important. Training to be provided!\r\n\r\nWe expect this job to take 40 hours per week. Working with exciting team and caring and interesting people! We will not accept applicants who are working on other projects.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Someone who gets great satisfaction completing tasks and bringing customers to current (9/10 experiences are positive given they are current customers!)\r\n- Experience with Basic to Intermediate in Microsoft Excel and Google Sheets for tracking and documentation purposes\r\n-Great emailer who is fast to respond and solve responses. Willing and enjoys calling customers in a thoughtful and polite manner\r\n- Ability to touch a high volume of customers a day\r\n-You are fluent in written and spoken English (enjoys phoning customers, internal and external customers, and interacting with them)\r\n-You have good Excel skills\r\n-Works on PST time to stay in tune with the team\r\n\r\nBonus Skills:\r\n-Experience with NetSuite and/or Stripe is a plus','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656377704538603521','-',7,'United States','San Francisco',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-05-10',1,'2023-05-10',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-10 19:20:28',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
