(20664,'Accountant',39,'Koolboks is a rapidly growing technology start-up that specializes in developing and manufacturing portable, solar-powered refrigeration units for use in Asia and Sub-Saharan Africa. Our mission is to improve access to refrigeration for people around the world, particularly those in areas without reliable electricity.\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a highly motivated and experienced Accountant to join our team. As an Accountant, you will be responsible for managing our company\'s financial records and ensuring compliance with accounting procedures and regulations. You will also be in charge of preparing and forwarding all the necessary information to our external accounting firm.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nMaintain financial records and ensure compliance with accounting principles and regulations\r\nPrepare financial statements and reports for management and external accounting firm\r\nCollaborate with our external accounting firm to ensure timely and accurate financial reporting\r\nManage accounts payable and accounts receivable\r\nMonitor budget and forecast future financial performance\r\nAssist with tax preparation and filing\r\nDevelop and maintain financial policies and procedures\r\nIdentify and implement process improvements to increase efficiency and accuracy.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Bachelor\'s degree in accounting or finance\r\n- CPA certification preferred\r\n- Minimum of 3 years of accounting experience\r\n- French speaker with good english skills\r\n- Proficiency in accounting software and Microsoft Office Suite\r\n- Excellent organizational and analytical skills\r\n- Strong attention to detail\r\n- Ability to work independently and remotely and as part of a team\r\n\r\nIf you have experience working with external accounting firms and possess the skills and qualifications we are looking for, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity with Koolboks.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656359595879460865','-',7,'Unit