(20726,'Build a responsive site similar to open.Spotify.com to stream YouTube videos',15,'Looking for experienced developer and webdesigner to create a site similar to www.newmusic.ai but with an interface similar to http://open.spotify.com (mobile).\r\n\r\nThe newmusic.ai site let’s users submit audio tracks as YouTube links or other embedded media. Then be able to play them and share links on social media.\r\n\r\nI want our site to have those features except have a\r\n-More organized layout\r\n- social media login.\r\n- Ability to save songs in playlists, and having those playlists featured on the front page,\r\n-connection to Spotify api to get artist information\r\n-artists pages with information pulled from Spotify api\r\n-front page with categories like Spotify (side scrolling layout and thumbnails )\r\n-autogenerated thumbnails based on the artist\r\n\r\nTo be cost effective Wordpress or existing software can be used.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e64505da3619e766','-',7,'United States','Caledon',700.000,'fixed',700.000,'2023-05-11',1,'2023-05-11',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-11 09:10:02',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(20727,'Expert Presentation Designer',11,'We are seeking a talented presentation designer to create a modern sales presentation and investment deck. The successful candidate will be responsible for developing a visually appealing and professional presentation that effectively communicates our company\'s products, services, and investment opportunities.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDesign a sales presentation and investment deck that communicates our company\'s vision, products, services, and investment opportunities.\r\nDevelop and organize the content in a clear and concise manner.\r\nCreate visually appealing graphics and animations to enhance the presentation.\r\nEnsure consistency in style and formatting throughout the presentation.\r\nWork with our team to incorporate feedback and make revisions to the presentation as needed.\r\nDeliver the final presentation in a format that can be easily shared with potential clients and investors.\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience in creating high-quality, professional presentations.\r\nExcellent skills in graphic design and animation.\r\nStrong attention to detail and ability to work efficiently under tight deadlines.\r\nProficient in presentation software such as PowerPoint, Keynote, or Google Slides.\r\nExcellent communication skills and ability to work collaboratively with a team.\r\nStrong portfolio showcasing previous work in presentation design.\r\nTo apply, please submit your resume, cover letter, and portfolio of previous presentation design work. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0142784487716f2a6d','-',7,'United States','London',400.000,'fixed',400.000,'2023-05-11',1,'2023-05-11',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-11 09:36:34',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(20728,'Graphic designs and management',2,'We are looking for a skilled Graphic Designer with experience in project management to join our team. The ideal candidate should have expertise in Adobe Illustrator, Advertising Design, Brand Identity & Guidelines, Creature Design, Graphic Design, Health & Wellness, Infographic, Informational Infographic, Logo Design, and Web Design.\r\n\r\nThe successful candidate will be responsible for creating visually appealing designs and managing projects to ensure timely delivery. The role requires a creative individual who can work independently or as part of a team to develop designs that meet our clients\' requirements.\r\n\r\nTo be considered for this role, please submit a proposal outlining your experience and how you can contribute to the project. Please include links to your past completed projects that demonstrate your skills and abilities in the areas listed above.\r\n\r\nThis is a long-term project, lasting more than 6 months, and we are looking for a candidate who can commit to delivering high-quality work consistently throughout the project. If you are passionate about graphic design and project management and can deliver results, we would love to hear from you.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01108a185ac06dd8a4','-',7,'United States','US',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-05-11',1,'2023-05-11',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-11 10:56:57',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(20729,'Website and Branding for World Famous artist Norval Morrisseau',4,'If you wish to make a name for yourself by being the lead designer for a world master artist please continue reading.\r\n\r\nPlease look at our existing website OfficialMorrisseau.com.\r\n\r\nWe think this site is marginal at best,\r\n\r\nPlease do not apply if you can not do much better.\r\n\r\nSend us at least 2 of the live working links to the actual websites that are your best work.\r\n\r\nNO WordPress or template work.\r\n\r\nNO generic replies and no only sending your portfolio.\r\n\r\nIf you can not take this offer seriously enough to send your 2 best live links works do not apply.\r\n\r\nAll generic AI replies will be ignored.\r\n\r\nLooking for an individual that would be able to do a full frontend website redesign.\r\n\r\nBut also the print branding for the company such as letterhead and purchase agreements and business cards.\r\n\r\nWe want a consistent vision across all platforms. So website and business document match thematically.\r\n\r\nThis job will be for a world-famous artist selling prints, clothing, souvenirs, etc....we use css3 html5, no Shopify or WordPress.\r\n\r\nOur website has been featured in newspapers around the world and is a highly visited site.\r\n\r\nAs mentioned the individual is a world-famous Master artist so the level of skill and quality that this Web page will have to project needs to be at the world caliber level.\r\n\r\nHis art is sold in the upper echelon of the art world, He is also one of the world\'s greatest spiritual and cultural icons.\r\n\r\nThis is the type of project to make a name for yourself and if you do not have the skills do not bother to apply.\r\n\r\nPlease do not apply for this job if you work for a large organization that will bait and switch individuals. I\'m looking for an actual person that can perform this job.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a master creative artist. The amount of work that you have performed is not crucial it is your creative ability and your skill to execute.\r\n\r\nBack-end programming is already in-house, we just need the amazing artistic, creative, elegant, high-end look.\r\n\r\nIf the person is successful in this job, that person will then get much more work.\r\n\r\nWe have hired many people off of this service and have continued to use them for years after.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016eafe269745a8c71','-',7,'United States','Surrey',100.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-11',1,'2023-05-11',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-11 11:03:58',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
