(20736,'Linkedin Carousel designer',2,'We\'re a small PR agency servicing startups and investors. This is our Linkedin page: https://www.linkedin.com/company/studiodizrupt/\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a junior graphic designer with expertise in layout design to produce carousels for LinkedIn.\r\n\r\nWe\'d love to give you the freedom to expand on the design aesthetic that we already have and develop it in new directions.\r\n\r\nWe need around 10 carousels every month:\r\n\r\n- 4 carousels are for a client\r\n- 6 carousels are for our agency\r\n\r\nAll templates we have are in Keynote.\r\nWe\'re very open to any suggestions regarding changing the design direction.\r\n\r\nYou can use whichever design software you prefer, but as a work methodology, we generally write the text in Canva, as it allows us to work collaboratively, and will deliver you the final copy either on Canva or as a pdf.\r\n\r\nIf you have experience with LinkedIn and understand the platform, that\'s a big plus. If not, no worries, we will show you lots of examples of carousels from leading users that perform super well on the platform.\r\n\r\nWe\'d love to see some relevant examples of your work.\r\n\r\nThanks!\r\nTeodora','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01a79d1e7e9db0590e','-',7,'United States','Targoviste',10.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-11',1,'2023-05-11',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-11 13:27:57',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
