(20739,'Bookkeeper Zoho Books',39,'Responsibilities:\r\n-Maintaining financial reports, records, and general ledger accounts.\r\n\r\n-Preparing and analyzing budgets and perform general bookkeeping.\r\n\r\n-Managing accounts payable and receivable.\r\n\r\n-Conducting reconciliations of all accounts on an as-needed basis.\r\n\r\n-Maintaining an organized and streamlined accounting system.\r\n\r\n-Preparing financial statements such as balance sheets, income statements, and cash flow statements.\r\n\r\n-Ensuring compliance with all internal processes.\r\n\r\n-Working closely with the team to create and analyze financial reports.\r\n\r\n-Ensuring all calculations and data entries are correct.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n-Proven bookkeeping experience with references.\r\n\r\n-Solid understanding of basic bookkeeping and accounting payable/receivable principles.\r\n\r\n-Proven ability to calculate, post and manage accounting figures and financial records.\r\n\r\n-High degree of accuracy and attention to detail.\r\n\r\n-Proficiency in using Zoho Books and Microsoft Office Suite.\r\n\r\n-Able to manage time effectively and prioritize tasks to meet deadlines.\r\n\r\n-Strong numerical skills and knowledge of generally accepted accounting principles (GAAP).\r\n\r\n-Excellent communication skills, both written and verbal.\r\n\r\n-Certified Bookkeeper or equivalent certification is preferred.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656653765669801985','-',7,'United States','Sibiu',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-11',1,'2023-05-11',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-11 13:34:39',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
