(20749,'Personal Bookkeeper for tracking & Budgeting',39,'I am looking for someone to help with personal and business bookkeeping.\r\n\r\nWe will start with a short project. You will get 18 to 24 months worth of banking data. (I will have to pull the data to see how much data we have… if we have more than 24 months then I will ask for you to do as much as we have up to 36 months).\r\n\r\nI need someone that is good at knowing personal categories and business categories.\r\n\r\nTransactions - You will need to google the codes that are on the bank statements for the vendors that names are not clear or unknown to you. Most can be figure out by copy and pasting into google and the name comes up.\r\n\r\nGoogle sheets or Excel - you should be good at organizing data in a worksheet. Creating graphs and reporting to make the data easy to understand in every way possible.\r\n\r\nI will provide categories that we need to track. I want the data inputted into google sheets by the month of the expenses and in the category of the type of expense. This way we can see month by month what was spent for each category. I also want to be able to track yearly expenses for each category.\r\n\r\nI will provide support for expenses you are unsure about. Or categories you are unsure. But there are hundreds of transactions. If I had time to do all of them I would. The reason I’m hiring someone is because I need you to be able to figure out that a (as an example) gas station name “fina” is gas and under listed as gasoline sub-category that is under “auto” category. I need an intelligent person with past verifiable success with a similar project','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656658922467409921?success','-',7,'United States','Dallas',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-05-11',1,'2023-05-11',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-11 13:55:18',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
