(20751,'Virtual Assistant: Payroll and Invoicing Coordinator',39,'We are seeking a reliable and detail-oriented individual to join our team as a Payroll and Invoicing Coordinator. This part-time position requires approximately 5-8 hours per week.\r\n\r\nAs the Payroll and Invoicing Coordinator, your primary responsibility will be to ensure accurate documentation of employee hours, timely processing of payroll, and precise client invoicing.\r\n\r\nYou Must:\r\n\r\nCollect and review employee timesheets to accurately document their hours.\r\n\r\nProcess payroll promptly and ensure compliance with all applicable regulations and policies.\r\n\r\nPrepare and send out client invoices with meticulous attention to detail.\r\n\r\nMaintain accurate records of payroll and invoicing activities.\r\n\r\nCollaborate with the finance team to resolve any discrepancies or issues.\r\n\r\nStay up-to-date with relevant regulations and best practices in payroll and invoicing procedures.\r\n\r\nHave the ability to work independently and meet deadlines.\r\n\r\nHave strong communication skills to interact with both employees and clients\r\n\r\nHave familiarity with New Zealand regulations.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656661734207815681','-',7,'United States','Christchurch',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-11',1,'2023-05-11',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-11 14:05:54',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
