(20792,'Accountant',39,'Part-Time/Full-Time Accountant/Bookkeeper/Administrative Assistant\r\n \r\nRole Summary:\r\nSeeking part-time or full-time accountant/bookkeeper to join small fast-paced accounting firm. \r\nThis position is ideal for an experienced accountant/bookkeeper who wants to work independently on a flexible, part-time or full-time schedule. Prefer candidate with strong accounting skills, QuickBooks Online & Xero software experience, ability to meet strict deadlines, knowledgeable, self-motivated and proactive.\r\n \r\nBasic Qualifications:\r\nIn-depth understanding of financial and accounting systems and processes\r\nConsiderable problem solving skills, conflict resolution and professionalism concerning confidential information/situations\r\nSkilled at multitasking in an accurate and timely manner\r\nGood communication skills - both verbal and written (accounting/technical)\r\nBachelor\'s degree in Accounting, Finance, Business Management, or other related field or equivalent experience\r\n3+ years of accountant/bookkeeper, finance or business operations experience\r\n\r\n\r\nPreferred Qualifications:\r\nPrevious experience with high stress situations, meeting deadlines and company/client goals\r\nExpert in Quickbooks, Xero and Microsoft Office suite, especially Excel \r\nPersonal management, organization, and planning expertise\r\nMarked ability to analyze and respond to site/situational problems\r\n \r\nWhat You’ll Do:\r\nData entry/record & process bank feeds (including Accounts Receivable/Payable, expenses, invoices, receipts, credit card transactions, banking statements, fix discrepancies, automate, etc.) into QuickBooks/Xero in an accurate, efficient & timely manner\r\nHandle monthly/quarterly reconciliations & financial reporting preparation from various software systems (Streamline, Vacation Rent Pro, Vacation Rent Payment, etc) into QuickBooks online or Xero\r\nFile excise & sales tax for various states (monthly, quarterly, as needed)\r\nSupport with payroll processing and pay applications, including payroll reports\r\nManage preparation of documents and paperwork\r\nMaintain an orderly accounting e-filing system\r\nParticipate in ad hoc research project & analyses\r\nIdentify opportunities for improvement within the internal reporting process\r\nAssist with other duties as required, etc.\r\n \r\nAdditional details:\r\nApproximately 15 - 30 hours/week with room to grow\r\nSalary based on experience and ability\r\nRequires a secure personal computer & connection','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656699908522409985','-',7,'United States','00',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-11',1,'2023-05-11',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-11 17:04:04',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(20793,'On-page SEO',5,'have a website that requires on-page SEO. Below is a list of what the job entails. If you are not willing or able to complete all tasks for every indexed page, do not bid. I am looking for someone who is willing to work hard and be thorough. You must be familiar with WordPress, Divi and RankMath. If not, do not bid. \r\n\r\nYou will need to prove to me you are an expert at on-page SEO and familiar with each application above. \r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Making sure each image has a title to match a keyword along with the alt text being completely filled in appropriately. \r\n\r\n- Page titles and Meta descriptions should be local SEO optimized\r\n\r\n- At least 5 keywords should be used in the content and  identified in RankMath\r\n\r\n- Proper internal links should be used, at least 5 per page. \r\n\r\n- Each slug should contain keyword and location\r\n\r\n- Mark up subheadings with header tags\r\n\r\n- Apply schema markup\r\n\r\n- Insert table of contents for each page via plugin\r\n\r\n- Optimize image sizes\r\n\r\n- Optimize for mobile\r\n\r\n- Optimize for speed\r\n\r\n- Keywords should be bold in Content\r\n\r\n\r\nYou must be willing to provide me with updates. If you have a question, please let me know.\r\n\r\nI do not accept hourly rates, so please DO NOT BID HOURLY.\r\nThere are 14 indexed pages. \r\n\r\n\r\nPlease quote a firm price and time frame for completion.','https://www.guru.com/work/detail/2062756','-',7,'United States','-',250.000,'fixed',350.000,'2023-05-11',1,'2023-05-11',1,'-',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-11 17:08:08',NULL,16,1,NULL,136),
