(20801,'Bookkeeper',39,'Job Title: Bookkeeper (QuickBooks)\r\n\r\nJob Type: Part-time\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a skilled and organized Bookkeeper to join our team. The ideal candidate will be proficient in QuickBooks and have experience in bookkeeping, reconciliation, and customer support.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nManage all aspects of bookkeeping including accounts payable, accounts receivable, payroll, and general ledger entries\r\nReconcile bank and credit card accounts\r\nMaintain accurate records of financial transactions and generate reports as needed\r\nProvide customer support and respond to inquiries regarding billing and payment processing\r\nCollaborate with other departments to ensure timely and accurate financial reporting\r\nIdentify and resolve discrepancies in financial records\r\nAssist with the preparation of financial statements and tax returns\r\nMaintain confidentiality of financial information\r\nPerform other duties as assigned\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nProficiency in QuickBooks is required\r\nStrong attention to detail and accuracy\r\nExcellent communication skills and ability to work collaboratively with others\r\nAbility to prioritize and manage multiple tasks in a fast-paced environment\r\nStrong analytical and problem-solving skills\r\nUnderstanding of basic accounting principles and financial reporting\r\nAbility to maintain confidentiality of sensitive financial information\r\nIf you are a motivated and detail-oriented individual with a passion for bookkeeping and customer support, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656734910971412481?success','-',7,'United States','United States',20.000,'Open this select menu',20.000,'2023-05-11',1,'2023-05-11',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-11 18:57:21',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
(20802,'Custom Landing Page Development (Wordpress)',3,'We are looking for an experienced freelancer to help us with a custom landing page development project. Our current website needs a new landing page, and we require someone who has a track record of delivering quality work within deadlines.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\nDevelop a custom landing page on wordpress based on the wireframe provided by us\r\nWork closely with our designer to ensure that the final design is consistent with our brand\r\nOptimize the landing page for user experience and conversion\r\nEnsure that the landing page is responsive and works across different devices and browsers\r\nProvide regular updates on the progress of the project and deliver the work within the agreed timeframe\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\nProven experience in custom landing page development\r\nProficiency in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and other relevant web technologies\r\nExcellent communication skills and ability to work collaboratively with our team\r\nStrong attention to detail and ability to deliver high-quality work\r\nAvailability to start immediately\r\n\r\nIf you meet the above requirements and are interested in this opportunity, please provide us with a quote based on time and cost for this project. We value speed and experience in our selection process and will likely choose the best fit based on these factors.\r\n\r\nTo make sure that you have read the post, start your proposal with the word --ASAP-- and I will send you the wireframe, so we can talk about how much you\'ll charge for the project. For your proposal, just send an average amount but we will finalize it later. This is a project-based contract.\r\n\r\nThanks!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656735710227451905?success','-',7,'United States','Seattle',800.000,'fixed',800.000,'2023-05-11',1,'2023-05-11',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-11 19:00:06',NULL,19,3,NULL,133),
