(20806,'Experienced Accounting/Bookkeeping',39,'Hello!\r\nWe have an opening for an ongoing position managing our personal, Investment and business financials. This position will report directly to me (owner). This will include tax prep, bank reconciliations, revenue categorization, investment reconciliation for crypto and stocks, weekly bill pay, budget setup and maintenance, and reporting. The following is a list of the tasks that would be included in the job and the core competencies required:\r\n\r\nCore Competencies\r\n- Follow up\r\n- FAST learner on new software - We use a cointracker software for our crypto investments.\r\n- Extreme attention to detail and accuracy\r\n- on-time and accurate reporting\r\n- Quickbooks expertise\r\n- Excel\r\n- Tax Prep\r\n- Cash flow watchdog. Making sure that all budgets/policies are adhered to\r\n\r\n\r\nList of tasks:\r\n- Weekly bank balancing and budget reports\r\n- Accounts receivable management\r\n- Weekly list of bills to be paid\r\n- Monthly Crypto investment tracking\r\n- Other revenue reconciliations monthly\r\n- Investor Reporting and Payouts\r\n- Investment Reconciliation','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656741293128581121?success','-',7,'United States','Scottsdale',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-05-11',1,'2023-05-11',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-11 19:22:09',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
