(20809,'Need QuickBooks Online Expert',39,'I am looking for a QuickBooks online expert for a project with very specific deliverables. The version is QuickBooks Online Advanced, so all features are available.\r\n\r\nThere are 2 locations and I need to clearly see payroll by location as well as have each location split into production and non-production.\r\n\r\nI also need income separated into sales, services, and subscriptions.\r\n\r\nIf there is a custom report needed to see these specific things, that will need to be created.\r\n\r\nIt is a straight forward project, and all transactions in QBO are marked in such a manner that you can easily tell what they are and what category they belong to.\r\n\r\nI hired someone to do this, and they made a complete mess (I believe I counted about 15 classes that they created).\r\n\r\nSuccessful completion of this project will lead to more work, possibly even steady work.\r\n\r\nThis project is semi-urgent, so please be available to start immediately, and let me know your approximate timeline for completion in your proposal.\r\n\r\nThank you for reading, and have a blessed day!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656753473270611969?success','-',7,'United States','Leavittsburg',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-05-11',1,'2023-05-11',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-11 20:10:36',NULL,21,3,NULL,123),
