(20811,'Need a lead generating website',3,'We are seeking a highly skilled and experienced form website developer. In this role, you will be responsible for developing a lead generating website from scratch that will attract and convert potential customers into leads for our business.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nDevelop a website that attracts and converts potential customers into leads for our business.\r\nCreate a clear and concise website design that is easy to navigate and use.\r\nImplement effective lead generation strategies such as calls-to-action, landing pages, and lead magnets.\r\nIntegrate the website with a CRM system to track leads and customer data.\r\nOptimize the website for search engines to increase visibility and drive traffic.\r\nConduct A/B testing and analyze website performance to identify areas for improvement.\r\nStay up-to-date with industry trends and best practices to ensure the website remains competitive.\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience in website development, preferably in lead generation or e-commerce.\r\nKnowledge of HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and other relevant web development technologies.\r\nExperience with CMS platforms such as WordPress, Drupal, or Joomla.\r\nFamiliarity with CRM systems such as Salesforce or HubSpot.\r\nUnderstanding of SEO best practices and experience optimizing websites for search engines.\r\nExcellent analytical and problem-solving skills.\r\nStrong communication skills and ability to work collaboratively with cross-functional teams.\r\nAttention to detail and ability to work in a fast-paced environment.\r\nIf you have a passion for creating effective lead generation websites and want to work with a dynamic team, we encourage you to apply for this exciting opportunity.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1655607437428162561','-',7,'United States','København',400.000,'fixed',400.000,'2023-05-11',1,'2023-05-11',1,'na',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-11 20:38:42',NULL,18,3,NULL,156),
