(20817,'Excel spreadsheet for restaurant bookkeeping',39,'I own a small mexican restaurant in New Jersey USA called\r\nLa Casa De Tortilla\r\n\r\nI need help with my accounting and every day i have several income categories and several expense categories\r\n\r\nIncome:\r\n-cash\r\n1)delivery\r\n2)takeout\r\n3)dine-in\r\n-card merchant processing\r\n1) Clover\r\n2)heartland\r\n-3rd Party card merchant processing\r\n1) chownow\r\n2) doordash\r\n3)ubereats\r\n4)grubhub\r\n5)ezcater\r\n\r\nExpenses\r\nCheck\r\nCard\r\nCash\r\nZelle\r\n\r\nExpenses detail\r\nOverhead\r\nLabor\r\nFood(CoGs)\r\n\r\nExpense banks used\r\nWellsfargo\r\nChase\r\nboA\r\n\r\nExpense location\r\nRestaurant depot\r\nBest mexican foods\r\nMayan happy tacos\r\nCostco\r\nSams club\r\nAmazon\r\nSysco\r\nLocal market\r\nIndependent contractor\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a skilled Excel expert to create a spreadsheet for bookkeeping purposes in a restaurant setting. The ideal candidate should be proficient in Excel formulas, macros, and payroll accounting. The project is expected to last less than a month.\r\n\r\nThe candidate should be able to create a user-friendly spreadsheet that will allow us to keep track of all restaurant transactions, including sales, expenses, and payroll. The spreadsheet should be able to generate reports that will help us analyze our financial performance and make informed decisions.\r\n\r\nTo be considered for the project, we require candidates to submit a proposal detailing their experience, skills, and how they can help with the project. We also require candidates to provide links to past spreadsheets\r\n\r\nI want a excel spreadsheet that for each month totals daily income, expenses, categorizes everything, and then totals them for each category and to a yearly overview. I expect to be able to enter the daily income / expenses myself every day or every week and for the spreadsheet to be neat and organized and have the right formulas total everything\r\n\r\nAttached is a basic overview and example of what i need only the person that did it , did a terrible job and its not as detailed as id like NOR does is function well at all. Id like there to be a calender linked inside.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1656768158721089537','-',7,'United States','North Burnswick',60.000,'fixed',60.000,'2023-05-11',1,'2023-05-11',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-11 21:28:41',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
