(20842,'Wordpress USA Site Setup',15,'I have a small Wordpress sales website (chillingscreams.com) with a blog that is used currently for all traffic. We use Thrive Themes and our hosting is on Cloudways.\r\n\r\nThe intention is to create some pages which are specific for the USA visitors to allow for localisation of currency, content and offers.\r\n\r\nE.g.\r\n\r\nUK visitor goes to homepage - UK homepage is displayed\r\nUSA visitor goes to homepage - USA homepage is displayed\r\n\r\nLikewise a separate navigation menu would be required for UK and USA visitors\r\n\r\nSome pages (reviews, terms, privacy, blog, articles etc) should be shared amongst all visitors.\r\n\r\nE.g.\r\n\r\nUK visitor goes to /reviews - UK /reviews is displayed\r\nUSA visitor goes to /reviews - UK /reviews is displayed (same as UK visitor)\r\n\r\nI assume a plugin will be required. I will purchase your suggestion directly, but will require you to set it up and provide training on how to set it up for future pages etc.\r\n\r\nThe website needs to be setup in the most SEO efficient way to not affect current rankings and to not interfere with future rankings for blog articles/pages etc.\r\n\r\nPlease put forward your suggestions of who you would accomplish this and the time/budget you would need.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01a0817aca4f3e1e3e','-',7,'United States','Chessington',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-12',1,'2023-05-12',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-12 10:31:16',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
