(20846,'WordPress Web Designer',15,'Job Title: WordPress Web Designer\r\nCompany: Fusion Creative Brand Strategy and Content Creators\r\nJob Summary:\r\nWe are looking for a talented and dedicated WordPress Web Designer to join our dynamic team. The ideal candidate will have experience in designing and implementing attractive and functional websites for our clients. Your main responsibilities will include making updates to existing websites and creating new ones, while working closely with our team to ensure client needs and goals are met.\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n1. Designing and building the website front-end.\r\n2. Creating the website architecture.\r\n3. Designing and managing the website back-end including database and server integration.\r\n4. Generating WordPress themes and plugins.\r\n5. Conducting website performance tests.\r\n6. Troubleshooting content issues.\r\n7. Monitoring the performance of the live website.\r\n8. Collaborating with content creators and management team to align with brand strategy.\r\n9. Providing timely updates and quick response to changes.\r\n10. Ensuring all client websites are responsive, visually appealing, and easy to navigate.\r\n11. Performing regular backups to prevent data loss.\r\nQualifications:\r\n1. Proven work experience as a WordPress Web Designer.\r\n2. Good understanding of front-end technologies, including HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, jQuery.\r\n3. Experience building user interfaces for websites and/or web applications.\r\n4. Comfortable working with debugging tools like Firebug, Chrome inspector, etc.\r\n5. Ability to understand CSS changes and their ramifications to ensure consistent style across platforms and browsers.\r\n6. Proficient understanding of code versioning tools (such as Git, SVN, and Mercurial).\r\n7. Strong understanding of PHP back-end development.\r\nKey Competencies:\r\n1. Excellent communication skills for collaborating effectively with the team and clients.\r\n2. Reliable and dedicated to meeting deadlines and achieving results.\r\n3. Ethical and responsible, with a strong sense of personal responsibility.\r\n4. Hardworking, with a commitment to continual skills development.\r\n5. Ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously and to work under pressure in a fast-paced environment.\r\n6. Strong problem-solving skills, with a creative and analytical mindset.\r\n7. Detail-oriented, with a commitment to quality and excellence.\r\nFusion Creative Brand Strategy and Content Creators is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01adb84044c28faa25','-',7,'United States','Charlotte',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-05-12',1,'2023-05-12',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-12 12:46:48',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
