(20867,'Accountant needed with good experience.',39,'We are a leading Accounting and Taxation firm and dedicated to providing our clients with professional, reliable accounting services. We utilize Xero for our business systems, enabling us to provide efficient and effective service.\r\n\r\nThe Role:\r\nWe are currently seeking a Remote Accountant based in India or the Philippines. The successful candidate will work closely with our Australian team and clients to provide high-quality accounting support.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n• Perform daily bookkeeping tasks and maintain the general ledger in Xero\r\n• Assist in payroll preparation\r\n• Support the preparation of financial reports\r\n• Assist in preparing BAS\r\n• Support audit activities\r\n• Ensure compliance with Australian accounting standards and tax laws\r\n\r\nQualifications and Skills:\r\n• Bachelor’s degree in accounting or finance\r\n• 2-3 years of accounting experience, preferably in an accounting firm\r\n• Proficiency in Xero accounting software\r\n• Knowledge of Australian accounting standards and tax laws\r\n• Excellent attention to detail and accuracy\r\n• Strong English communication skills\r\n• Ability to work independently and as part of a remote team\r\n\r\nAdditional Information:\r\nThis is a long-term contract position with a view to permanency for the right candidate. The candidate must be willing to work during Australian business hours or close to it. We offer a competitive salary, ongoing professional development opportunities, and the chance to work with a dynamic team.\r\n\r\nHow to Apply:\r\nPlease apply with your updated resume, a cover letter briefly outlining your suitability for the role and your hourly rate expectations. Applications without a cover letter will not be considered.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1657029436898570241?success','-',7,'United States','india',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-05-12',1,'2023-05-12',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for