(20911,'Logo design for new trade association',10,'We are looking for a talented graphic designer to create a logo for a new trade association in the fresh fruit and vegetable industry. The logo should reflect the contemporary style of the association and its corporate brand identity. As a designer, you should be proficient in Adobe Illustrator, Adobe InDesign, Adobe Photoshop, and have experience working with brand guidelines and brand identity. You should be able to provide a printable file of the final design, both in Black and White and in 4-color.\r\n\r\nThe project is expected to last less than a month, and we are looking for someone who can work efficiently and deliver high-quality work within the given timeline. To apply, please submit a proposal that describes how you can help with the project, including your design process, and your relevant experience and skills. Please provide links to past completed projects that showcase your design skills, particularly in logo design and brand identity. We look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nPlease see the attached fonts that we like. We are wondering if we can connect the dots in the \"i\" in both Distributors and Association with some kind of arrows to show movement. Then we need to see the PDA initials stacked with the arrows on left and right to complete a circle','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016a49322da7326e8a','-',7,'United States','Boca Raton',150.000,'fixed',150.000,'2023-05-15',1,'2023-05-15',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-15 07:56:35',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
