(20913,'Intermediate level UI/UX designer needed for ongoing work',4,'About us:\r\n\r\nOctavius is a design & development agency with about 10 employees, based all over the globe. We have a very wide profile of the customers and projects i.e. naming, branding, UI/UX, web design & development. In other words, we try to be really diverse in what we do and this makes us quite a nice place to work at. (the say : D)\r\n\r\nWho are we looking for:\r\n\r\nRight now we are looking to fill the position of UI/UX designer (would be good if you are also passionate about web design in general, as there might be some projects, that also require work on a customer\'s website/landing pages/online marketing materials etc). Please start your application with the word Junimperium to let me know you\'ve read the description.\r\n\r\nHow are we going to work together:\r\n\r\nOur main working instrument is Figma and we are SUPER pedantic about how we organize, keep and share our assets within the projects, so having experience of working with Figma and building/maintaining design systems is a must.\r\n\r\nShort summary:\r\n\r\nI think it\'s as simple as that and if you feel yourself interested - please apply and let\'s meet each other. To sum up, the right candidate is an intermediate-level UI/UX designer with a passion for everything digital, who is looking for project-based cooperation.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0133a7b92c3f1b8585','-',7,'United States','Tallinn',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-15',1,'2023-05-15',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-15 10:28:53',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
