(20924,'Job Title: Experienced Bookkeeper for Ongoing Part-Time Work',39,'Hello,\r\n\r\nAltor Digital, an innovative force in the world of decentralized agencies, is seeking an experienced, detail-oriented Bookkeeper to assist one of our esteemed clients. We are looking to establish a long-term relationship with a dedicated professional who is proficient in their field and aligns with our forward-thinking approach.\r\n\r\nOur client, a busy business owner, currently spends approximately 8 hours per month reconciling accounts and matching receipts. The ideal candidate will be able to efficiently take over these tasks, providing accurate and timely bookkeeping support.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n\r\nPerform monthly bookkeeping tasks including, but not limited to, reconciling accounts, matching receipts, preparing financial reports, and maintaining accurate records.\r\nCollaborate with the client to understand their business model, financial needs, and goals.\r\nEnsure financial records are maintained in compliance with accepted policies and procedures.\r\nRequired Skills and Experience:\r\n\r\nProven bookkeeping experience.\r\nSolid understanding of basic bookkeeping and accounting payable/receivable principles.\r\nHigh degree of accuracy and attention to detail.\r\nExcellent knowledge of MS Office and familiarity with relevant computer software (especially QuickBooks).\r\nAt Altor Digital, we value our freelancers and consider them an integral part of our team. We offer the potential for ongoing employment for the right candidate, as well as the opportunity to work with a diverse range of clients across various industries.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re an experienced Bookkeeper looking for a remote, flexible role, and you\'re excited about joining a vibrant, innovative agency, we\'d love to hear from you. Please submit your application, including any relevant work samples and references, for consideration.\r\n\r\nNote: Prior experience with QuickBooks is essential for this role.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to reviewing your applications. Thank you for considering this opportunity with Altor Digital.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658101864950734849','-',7,'United States','australia',35.000,'fixed',35.000,'2023-05-15',1,'2023-05-15',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-15 13:29:44',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
