(20935,'Quickbooks expert needed',39,'Hello! We are seeking a Quickbooks expert who can help us with our accounting software and bookkeeping needs. The ideal candidate should have extensive experience in bank reconciliation and Intuit QuickBooks. The project is expected to last less than a month and we are looking for someone who can hit the ground running.\r\n\r\nAs the Quickbooks expert, you will be responsible for ensuring that our books are accurate and up-to-date. This will involve working closely with our finance team to reconcile bank statements, manage accounts receivable and accounts payable, and track expenses. You should be comfortable working with large amounts of data and have strong attention to detail.\r\n\r\nTo be considered for this role, please submit a proposal that outlines your experience with Quickbooks and how you can help us with this project. We would also like to see links to some of your past completed projects, particularly those that demonstrate your expertise with Quickbooks and bookkeeping. We look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nThis is for a small cleaning company and we need this task completed this week.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658115439231004673','-',7,'United States','Lawrence Township',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-15',1,'2023-05-15',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-15 14:22:23',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
