(20939,'Accountant for IT Business',39,'We are looking for an experienced accountant to provide their expertise for our IT business. The job entails managing the company\'s financial records, including bookkeeping, balance sheet preparation, budget management, and tax preparation. The ideal candidate should possess a CPA certification, knowledge of financial accounting, and experience in bank reconciliation. In addition, the candidate should be familiar with chart of accounts and possess excellent organizational and communication skills.\r\n\r\nThe project duration is less than one month, and we are looking for a candidate who can start immediately. To apply, please submit a proposal outlining how you can assist with the project. Please include links to any relevant past completed projects. We look forward to working with a detail-oriented and dedicated accountant to help us manage our finances and maintain our financial records.\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658126609262084097','-',7,'United States','Melbourne',35.000,'fixed',35.000,'2023-05-15',1,'2023-05-15',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-15 15:06:46',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(20940,'Reconciliation of Quick books Accounts',39,'The Quickbooks Account Reconciliation Specialist is responsible for ensuring the accuracy and completeness of financial records by reconciling accounts in Quickbooks. This involves comparing financial transactions recorded in Quickbooks with bank statements, credit card statements, and other financial documents to identify any discrepancies or errors.\r\n\r\nThe specialist will work closely with other members of the finance team to investigate and resolve any issues that arise during the reconciliation process. They will also be responsible for maintaining detailed and accurate records of all reconciliations, and ensuring that all deadlines are met.\r\n\r\nIn addition to reconciling accounts, the Quickbooks Account Reconciliation Specialist may also be responsible for other accounting tasks, such as recording journal entries, preparing financial statements, and providing support during audits.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate for this role should have a strong understanding of accounting principles and experience using Quickbooks. They should be detail-oriented, analytical, and able to work effectively in a team environment. Strong communication skills and the ability to meet deadlines are also essential.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658130032069345281','-',7,'United States','Kissimmee',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-15',1,'2023-05-15',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-15 15:20:26',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
