(20942,'Improve Landing Page with over 4 Million Impressions',4,'We are looking for a creative, conversion focused UI/UX designer to improve our existing home page.\r\n\r\nWe are one of the UK’s fastest growing ecard companies. Over 4 Million people have used our site to let a friend or colleague know how much they value them. A landing page that looks slick and lets visitors know what we are all about is critical for converting customers.\r\n\r\nWhat will you do?\r\n- Update our header to optimise for conversions and convey what we do.\r\n- Update our existing landing page to make it look more intuitive, beautiful and creative.\r\n- Optimise the parts of the design which you think would help improve customer conversion.\r\n- Include any illustrations which you think will help to add personality to our site.\r\n- Review the copy, identifying gaps and wording that could be improved.\r\n- Ensure that designs are responsive for desktop users (who make up the majority of our visitors) as well as mobile users.\r\n- Send us a Figma file (or similar) with the design details so that your beautiful designs can be brought to life by our in-house developers\r\n\r\nWe will provide you with:\r\n- Designs we like\r\n- A list of elements that need to be included (the rest is up to your imagination).\r\n\r\nWe need a first draft delivered within 7 days.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0117337d0fb1735a33','-',7,'United States','Beaconsfield',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-05-15',1,'2023-05-15',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-15 15:33:21',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(20943,'Bookkeeper myob',39,'We are seeking a skilled Bookkeeper with expertise in managing financial records to assist our growing driving school businesses in Australia. As a Virtual Bookkeeper, you will work remotely, providing your services as a virtual assistant through Upwork.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Maintain accurate financial records for multiple driving school businesses.\r\n- Record daily transactions, including accounts payable and accounts receivable.\r\n- Reconcile bank statements and perform monthly financial closings.\r\n- Prepare financial reports, including profit and loss statements and balance sheets.\r\n- Analyse financial data to identify trends and make recommendations.\r\n- Ensure compliance with relevant accounting principles and regulations.\r\n- Collaborate with the management team to support strategic decision-making.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven work experience as a Bookkeeper or similar role.\r\n- Proficiency in accounting software (MYOB Essentials)\r\n- Strong understanding of basic accounting principles.\r\n- Excellent attention to detail and organisational skills.\r\n- Ability to work independently and meet deadlines.\r\n- Strong communication and interpersonal skills.\r\n\r\nIf you possess the necessary skills and are interested in joining our team, please submit your resume, along with a brief overview of your relevant experience through Upwork. We look forward to reviewing your application!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658133847650004993','-',7,'United States','Carseldine',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-15',1,'2023-05-15',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-15 15:35:40',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(20944,'Book keeper/ tax preparer',39,'Hi, I run a small business. My previous book keeper who was great, took up a full time job, so I am now in need of a replacement book keeper who can also keep my books tax ready. I use quick books so proficiency with it will be important. My anticipation is 1 hour monthly virtual meeting for us to jointly review my books. We can discuss further if this a fit for you and if your quote works for me.\r\n\r\nThank you\r\nOby','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658136215662960641','-',7,'United States','San Jose',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-15',1,'2023-05-15',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-15 15:44:59',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(20945,'Bookkeeper (Expense Reconciliation)',39,'A Furniture Company, that designs and manufacturers furniture\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a detail-oriented and experienced bookkeeper to join our team and assist with reconciling expenses. Our company focuses on [briefly describe your company\'s industry or nature of business].\r\n\r\nAs a bookkeeper, you will play a vital role in ensuring accurate financial records and organizing our Xero accounting system effectively.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nReconcile expenses: Process and reconcile invoices, payments, and receipts related to various business expenses, including payments made to factories, freight companies, clearance agents, and installers.\r\n\r\nReview invoices: Carefully examine invoices for accuracy, ensuring that all relevant details, such as vendor information, amounts, and dates, are correct.\r\n\r\nVerify payments: Match payments made to invoices and cross-reference them with bank statements or payment records to ensure accuracy and completeness.\r\n\r\nResolve discrepancies: Investigate and resolve any discrepancies or issues related to invoices, payments, or expenses in a timely manner. This may involve communicating with vendors or internal stakeholders to clarify any discrepancies or obtain missing information.\r\n\r\nOrganize Xero accounting system: Maintain the Xero accounting system by accurately categorizing expenses, updating vendor information, and ensuring proper documentation of transactions.\r\nGenerate reports: Prepare regular reports summarizing expenses, highlighting trends, and providing relevant financial information to support decision-making processes.\r\n\r\nCollaborate with team members: Coordinate with other departments, such as finance, procurement, and operations, to gather necessary information, clarify expenses, and ensure accurate bookkeeping.\r\n\r\nCompliance and documentation: Ensure compliance with applicable financial regulations and maintain proper documentation of all expense-related records.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience as a bookkeeper or in a similar accounting role, with a focus on expense reconciliation.\r\n\r\nStrong knowledge of bookkeeping principles and practices.\r\nProficiency in using accounting software, preferably Xero, for expense management and reconciliation.\r\n\r\nExcellent attention to detail and accuracy.\r\nStrong organizational skills and the ability to manage multiple tasks simultaneously.\r\n\r\nAnalytical mindset with problem-solving abilities.\r\nEffective communication skills, both written and verbal.\r\n\r\nAbility to work independently and meet deadlines.\r\nFamiliarity with financial regulations and compliance requirements.\r\nExperience in [your industry or related industry] is a plus.\r\n\r\nApplication Process:\r\nIf you are a meticulous and organized bookkeeper with experience in expense reconciliation, we would love to hear from you. Quote Reference: 2564 in subject, and submit your profile, highlighting relevant experience, along with a cover letter explaining your interest in the position and your qualifications for the role. Include any notable achievements or projects related to expense reconciliation.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658138165611413505','-',7,'United States','Rose Bay',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-15',1,'2023-05-15',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-15 15:52:57',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
