(20957,'Seeking a Skilled Graphic Designer for Comprehensive Coffee Branding Project',2,'We are a company specializing in selling high-quality coffee products, offering monthly subscriptions, coffee trials, and an array of carefully selected coffee brands. Our aim is to provide exceptional coffee experiences to our customers through our superior quality beans sourced globally.\r\n\r\nWe\'re seeking a designer for the following project components with a budget ranging from $4,000 to $7,000:\r\n\r\nLogo Design: Develop a versatile, memorable, and scalable logo reflecting our coffee subscription company\'s values, mission, and services.\r\n\r\nWebsite Artwork: Create engaging, coffee-themed artwork aligning with our brand identity. The artwork should be web-optimized for fast load times.\r\n\r\nBrand Guidelines: Establish comprehensive guidelines detailing our brand\'s visual and messaging standards, including logo usage, color palette, typography, imagery, and tone of voice.\r\n\r\nLogo & Brand Guide: Construct a detailed guide explaining the design elements of our logo and brand, including usage guidelines to ensure consistency across platforms and channels.\r\n\r\nIcon or Button Design: Create intuitive, coffee-themed icons and buttons that align with our brand\'s visual identity.\r\n\r\nWebsite Illustration and Design Figures: Develop coffee-themed illustrations and design figures complementing our website\'s content and messaging. They should be web-optimized.\r\n\r\nSocial Media Page Design & Covers: Design social media pages and covers aligning with our brand\'s visual identity, emphasizing the coffee-theme, and engaging followers.\r\n\r\nCharacter or Mascot Art & Illustration: Develop a character or mascot enhancing our brand identity, aligning with our visual identity and messaging.\r\n\r\nEmail Signature Design: Create an email signature featuring our brand\'s logo and visual elements, along with contact information and a clear call-to-action. It should be optimized for various email clients and devices.\r\n\r\nTo submit an offer, please provide details about your relevant experience, proposed timeline, and cost estimate. Include examples of similar projects you\'ve completed. We look forward to considering your proposal for this opportunity.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658176903782789121?success','-',7,'United States','WINCHESTER',7000.000,'Open this select menu',7000.000,'2023-05-15',1,'2023-05-15',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-15 18:27:24',NULL,8,3,NULL,119),
