(20984,'Book keeper for Investment Firm',39,'We are a growing investment firm looking for an experienced bookkeeper to manage our financial records. The ideal candidate should have a solid background in accounting basics, balance sheet preparation, bank reconciliation, bookkeeping, data entry, financial accounting, and Microsoft Excel.\r\n\r\nMUST BE FAMILIAR WITH CANADIAN TAX SYSTEM\r\n\r\nMaintain Financial Records: Accurately record financial transactions, including accounts payable and receivable, payroll, expenses, and investments, into the company\'s accounting system.\r\n\r\nReconcile Accounts: Perform regular reconciliations of bank statements, investment portfolios, and other financial records to ensure accuracy and identify any discrepancies.\r\n\r\nGeneral Ledger Management: Maintain the general ledger, including posting journal entries and ensuring that accounts are properly categorized and reconciled.\r\n\r\nFinancial Reporting: Prepare financial reports, such as income statements, balance sheets, and cash flow statements, on a regular basis to provide management with accurate and up-to-date financial information.\r\n\r\nCompliance and Regulations: Ensure compliance with applicable accounting principles, standards, and regulations, such as Generally Accepted Accounting Principles (GAAP) and tax requirements.\r\n\r\nFinancial Analysis: Assist in analyzing financial data and providing insights to support decision-making processes, including evaluating investment opportunities and assessing the financial performance of subsidiaries and affiliates.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658213365272969217','-',7,'United States','Toronto',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-15',1,'2023-05-15',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-15 20:51:48',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
