(20987,'Cutting guide needed (Brochure)',13,'We are seeking a talented and creative Brochure Designer to help us out with making a cutting guide for our brochures. We would like to offer you an opportunity to work with us on a specific task.\r\n\r\nWe are currently in the process of updating our brochure design and would like to see how well you can reproduce our old design brochure. We would like you to create a copy of our old design brochure, but with updated information, images, and design elements. This task will give us a better understanding of your design capabilities, attention to detail, and your ability to follow instructions.\r\n\r\nIf you are able to complete this task to our satisfaction, we would be happy to offer you a position with our company. As a brochure designer, you will be responsible for creating visually appealing and informative brochures that effectively communicate our company\'s products and services to potential clients.\r\n\r\nWe will send additional elements, such as our logo, to the people who are interested to make it even easier. For more information, please refer to the attachment.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658217283440771073?success','-',7,'United States','Alkmaar',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-15',1,'2023-05-15',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-15 21:07:42',NULL,8,3,NULL,119),
(20988,'Bookkeeper',39,'Job brief\r\n\r\n- We are looking for an experienced bookkeeper to maintain our financial records. You must be familiar with the accounting software Quickbooks. Confidentiality & great organizational skills are important qualifications for this position. Among your responsibilities are monitoring both payable & receivable transactions, handling our payroll, as well as calculating statistics & coordinating figures on the weekly and monthly basis. Fundamentally, you will be required to accurately record all the day-to-day financial transactions of our company on a weekly and monthly basis.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities\r\n\r\n- Keeping accurate historical records.\r\n- Recording day-to-day financial transactions\r\n- Completing the posting process\r\n- Making sure that all transactions are recorded in the respective ledger\r\n- Reporting research results\r\n- Calculating figures & making statistics\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements\r\n\r\n- 1 to 3 years of proven work experience as a bookkeeper\r\n- Knowledgeable in Quickbook Software\r\n- Data entry skills\r\n- Attention to detail\r\n- Knowledgeable of SFAS Rules\r\n- Confidentiality\r\n- English proficiency\r\n- Send monthly report via excel or google drive','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658213733688705025','-',7,'United States','Atlanta',25.000,'fixed',25.000,'2023-05-15',1,'2023-05-15',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-15 21:09:54',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(20989,'Bookkeeper/ Accountant needed',39,'Hi,\r\n\r\nI\'m looking to hire someone with a bookkeeping / Accounting background to help me daily for 1-2 hours.  \r\n\r\nI own a marketing agency which Markets to Accounting firms exclusively.  Every day I will send you a list of contacts in a Google sheet which you must sort through and tag the Financial Accounting Firms only (for my email campaigns).  \r\n\r\nYou must have have the ability to tag & segment any Forensic Accounting Firms, any Wealth Management or Private Equity providers, Management Accountants etc. based on visiting their website and so a background in Bookkeeping / Taxation / Accountancy is important and an understanding of Google Sheets / xls is a plus.  \r\n\r\nI will send you a video training and then ask you to give a paid test first.\r\nIf you pass the paid test, we can continue working together.\r\n\r\nKindly do let me know if you would be interested and please send me the term taxman in your reply so that I know you have read this full post.\r\n\r\nThanks,','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658146932397895681','-',7,'United States','Dubai',8.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-15',1,'2023-05-15',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-15 21:12:36',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(20990,'Website for Custom Home Builder - Colorado',15,'Build a website for a custom home builder. We build on scattered lots, not subdivisions.\r\n\r\nWe build both custom site built homes and modular homes.\r\n\r\nScope of work:\r\n\r\nBuild a new site, (attached is an outline of page structure).\r\nAttached is an outline of the site.\r\n\r\nPages with homes must be database driven to include an admin page where we can upload a floor plan, images, specs and a base price\r\n\r\nSEO optimized pages.\r\n\r\nWe will provide all images and logos. Looking for creative design.\r\n\r\nIdeal turnaround is 6 weeks.\r\n\r\nOur existing site is summitedgebuilders.com (hosted on squarespace).\r\n\r\nWe are open to suggestions on where to host the new site.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658221446309801985?success','-',7,'United States','Erie',5000.000,'fixed',5000.000,'2023-05-15',1,'2023-05-15',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-15 21:24:29',NULL,8,3,NULL,119),
(20991,'Logo Design',10,'I need two quick logos.\r\n- One logo is for a company called Dementia Guardian, and they have an existing logo. I just need the same logo. The logo was created in Canva and it could be of better quality. I will include the existing logo for you to reference. It would be nice to see the Dementia Guardian logo on some items like a yard sign, clothing, lapel pin, and stickers. How would the logo look in 3d?\r\n\r\n- The second logo is for a community-based corporation called New Look Solutions. Use your creativity on this one. I give you the freedom to make something great!!!!!!!!!!!!!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658223482966016001?success','-',7,'United States','Greenacress',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-05-15',1,'2023-05-15',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-15 21:32:06',NULL,8,3,NULL,119),
