(21003,'Graphic Designer',2,'Experienced graphic desinger wanted to work with digital marketing agency for ongoing work.\r\n\r\nLooking for someone to join the team full time 40-hours per week.\r\n\r\nTasks include:\r\n- Social media ad design\r\n- Landing page designing\r\n\r\nYes, two categories is all we need, BUT, the person needs to be brilliant.\r\n\r\nOver 50-clients to work on, so A LOT of work to be carried out.\r\n\r\nSocial media ads library extensive already so lots to build on.\r\n\r\nLanding pages need to have not just design, but ability to deliver high conversion rates working with marketing team.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~010ea5f3a28a1ada4c','-',7,'United States','Sydney',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-16',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-16 07:20:03',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21004,'Logo & Visual Identity Adjustment',10,'We are a party travel agency looking for help adjusting the visual identity of a sister-brand for company events, celebrations and incentive trips.\r\n\r\nWe require a logo design (we have a few sketched ideas that can be used as basis) as well as simple guidelines that will allow us to re-template our current website in new version for the separate brand.\r\n\r\nWe DO NOT require a new website design, simply logo design, colours, fonts and potentially examples of how key elements of the site can be slightly adjusted to fit the new identity (if and where needed). Ideally also a moldboard or examples of what types of images to use on the site\r\n\r\nWe will deliver the name and domain of the new brand as well as our current website for reference. We will also deliver a logo we have previously had designed, where style and colours do not match our intention but the main object has some merit\r\n\r\nThe site is mainly targeted Germany / DACH region, but may be rolled out to UK and France later','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~017ee91f134b29ac3b','-',7,'United States','Kongens Lyngby',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-16',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-16 07:43:36',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
