(21006,'Logo for a laboratory',10,'I need a logo for a laboratory. The name is Jamal Diagnostic Laboratories but it\'s known as JD Laboratories or JDL. The logo should reflect this. The logo needs to be appropriate for a lab.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01f0b0eabb4f1411fe','-',7,'United States','edgware',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-16',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-16 08:11:30',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21007,'Brand Design - Luxury Wedding Florist',2,'I\'m looking for a talented branding and design professional to help me rebrand my UK based wedding floristry business and to break into the luxury market. We absolutely need someone with luxury branding experience and can demonstrate real examples of past clients in this space.\r\n\r\nThe market as mentioned is luxury weddings and events. The style could be best described as Vogue, Chic and Elegance.\r\n\r\nThe brand name will be my personal name so I\'d like to see someone that has experience of not only a luxury brand but also can build an online persona.\r\n\r\nMy deliverables are:\r\n\r\n- Primary logo design\r\n- Secondary logo\r\n- Brand marks\r\n- Social media logos\r\n- Email signature design\r\n- Website favicon\r\n- Brand colour palette\r\n- Brand typography suite\r\n- Brand style guide\r\n- Business card / email signature\r\n- Icons set design\r\n- Social media moodboard\r\n- Packaging Elements - sticker design, business card design, note card design, printed tissue design.\r\n- Imagery selection for website\r\n- Brochure / Proposal Design - a design of a luxury brochure/proposal document to be sent to prospective customers.\r\n- Wordpress website design - design of a 6 page portfolio website with basic functionality.\r\n\r\n\r\nBased on past branding projects, my initial expectations of how this could work would be as follows (but I am open to a different approach based on the individual):\r\n\r\nDiscovery & Strategy Phase\r\nYou provide me with an in depth brand questionnaire along and I share any additional images / examples of my current brand\r\nand ideas. This helps you to understand exactly what it is I offer,\r\nhow I currently look / envision to look and how you could visually\r\nand strategically align this to my new branding to ultimately\r\nimprove the communication the passion and business value to my ideal target market.\r\n\r\nMoodboard\r\nWe collaborate on Pinterest and create a secret board, where\r\nI pin my ideas first, you then join the board and share your\r\nideas based on the styles pinned and some additional concepts you\r\nfeel will work. I then have to “like” the pins I prefer along with\r\ncomments. You will then choose a route/concept to go for based\r\non all the information and your own creative brainstorming by\r\npresenting a strategic & beautifully curated brand mood board.\r\n\r\n\r\nCreation\r\nFirst reviews of the logo to be shared usually 5 - 10 working days\r\nafter a look and feel/mood board has been approved, followed\r\nby revisions (if needed) and crafting/finalisation. After we’re in\r\nlove with a logo, the rest of the branding unfolds. I receive\r\nregular reviews of the brand development as it unfolds. You provide ideas for the UX and imagery for the website and once it\'s approved, you incorporate that into the website design. You also provide ideas for the imagery to be used in the brochure document and once approved, incorporate that into the design.\r\n\r\n\r\nCrafting & Finalisation\r\nYou work on all the fine tuning of the branding elements and website design, making sure it’s perfect and according to the brief.\r\n\r\n\r\nTo apply for this job, please submit a proposal outlining how you can help with the project. Please include links to past completed projects that showcase your branding and design skills. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0116a925d4389a0b88','-',7,'United States','Bolton',3500.000,'fixed',3500.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-16',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-16 09:07:43',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21008,'YouTube Channel Branding (Logo, Banner & Fonts) Using Reference',10,'Hello, talented designers!\r\n\r\nI\'m currently developing an AI-based YouTube channel focusing on high-quality documentaries (similar to Vox) and need an innovative graphic designer to help bring the visual identity of my channel to life. The key tasks will involve creating a distinct logo and banner with signature colors and fonts that embody the essence of the channel.\r\n\r\nThese signature colors should make my channel easily recognizable. See the following example:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@Vox\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nI need the following details:\r\n\r\nMy channel\'s name will be \'Neural Network\'. The banner can include the name, logo should stay minimalist.\r\n\r\nThe logo should be minimalistic and embody the fusion of human cognition and artificial intelligence, using a simple yet powerful design.\r\n\r\nVisualize a stylized human brain formed by lines and nodes, symbolizing the neural network of human intelligence. Intersect this with a geometric, sleek representation of an AI chip, depicted with clean lines to represent the cutting-edge technology.\r\n\r\nThe final logo should be a crisp, visually appealing representation of the channel\'s focus on the intersection of human intelligence and artificial intelligence, suitable for the modern, tech-focused content of the channel.\r\n\r\nI provided you with some AI-generated art as reference. I like the concepts, but I feel like something is missing (too dark). I would like you to use and experiment with the following vibrant colors: Electric Blue, Cyber People, Neon Green, Bright Yellow, but you can also use your own creativity to design something that says \"tech, future, AI\'!\r\n\r\nI like colors and fonts of SaaS startups.\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nFurthermore, I would also like you to design a simple transparent logo and a transparent subscribe button in my signature font I can use in the left and right corner of my videos. The corner logo should show the letters \'NN\' in my signature font.\r\n\r\nSee this video for example:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ORdWE_ffirg\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nIdeal candidates will have experience in:\r\n\r\n- Graphic design for digital platforms, specifically YouTube.\r\n- Creating unique and recognizable brand identities.\r\n- Interpreting and utilizing reference material to create original designs.\r\n\r\nI would prefer the work to be finished as soon as possible. My budget is $200 - $250, but I am open for negotiations (If I like your portfolio). I would like to clarify that I pay for all rights of the completed design.\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nI look forward to working with you!\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\n\r\nFaruk C..','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0150086ba8ff65311a','-',7,'United States','Enschede',250.000,'fixed',250.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-16',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-16 10:31:30',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21009,'Website redesign and rebranding',4,'We already have an existing website but doesn\'t fit with our current vision so we want the following services:\r\n\r\n- Redesign website with light colours\r\n- Develop a simple website\r\n- Create company branding consistent with website\r\n- SEO optimisation\r\n- Design a sales deck based on branding guide\r\n\r\nIdeal candidates please share your website design portfolios.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01cec57b038a90556f','-',7,'United States','London',1800.000,'fixed',1800.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-16',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-16 10:57:16',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21010,'Graphic Designer and Illustration',2,'Hi there,\r\n\r\nCould you help me?\r\nI am in need of some graphic design assistance. I need the following:\r\nColour Brand Guide\r\nCartoon Style Logo\r\nCGI imagery for Apartments Interior\r\nExterior Hoarding Design\r\nBrochure Design\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you could carry out these tasks and i will provide more specific information for each subject.\r\n\r\nThank you in advance for your response.\r\nRegards, David.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~010fecc9e3f422e79e','-',7,'United States','London',75.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-16',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-16 11:34:27',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21011,'Logo animation for website (SVG, CSS, Lottie, Json etc.)',8,'We are looking for experienced animator who could animate logo for the website (company that develops software) and export in a format suitable for the web. The animated logo can be embedded into website through web builder only using iframe.\r\n\r\nSince we don\'t have any specific creative approach about how the logo animation should look, we are open to suggestions. However, we do need an elegant, smooth animation that meets modern standards and looks impressive.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, we believe the animation should loop since the animated logo will be displayed on the homepage (please see the attachment for a mockup of the homepage).\r\n\r\nIn order for us to know what to expect and the technical possibilities, we will ask for a brief written or sketched concept proposal of how the overall animation will look before animation.\r\n\r\nWe will provide Adobe Illustrator .ai file of the logo.\r\n\r\nAlso, we will require to get source files of After Effects, because we will use this logo animation for tutorial videos as intro.\r\n\r\nFixed price for logo animation: 100$\r\n\r\nSo, if you have experience with website animations (svg/css/lottie/json), know how to export the animation for the website, and are ready to get started right away, send examples of your prior work and let\'s talk everything in detail.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01845d5b506a25f64f','-',7,'United States','Vilnius',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-16',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-16 12:11:06',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
