(21022,'Accounting/Bookkeeping Expert',39,'We are a US based company and seeking an experienced Accounting/Bookkeeping Expert to join our team for a long-term project of more than 6 months. The ideal candidate will have a strong understanding of accounting principles, accounts payable and receivable, bank reconciliation, and balance sheets. Proficiency with Intuit QuickBooks and Quickbooks is also required. Knowledge of US bookkeeping and accounting rules will be a plus.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities will include maintaining accurate financial records, producing financial reports, reconciling bank statements, managing accounts payable and receivable, and ensuring compliance with financial regulations. The successful candidate will have excellent attention to detail, strong communication skills, and the ability to work independently.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this position, please submit a proposal outlining your experience in accounting and bookkeeping, as well as how you can help us with this project. Please include links to past completed projects that demonstrate your skills in this area.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from qualified candidates who are eager to join our team and help us maintain accurate financial records.\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658475332233674753','-',7,'United States','Iselin',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-16',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-16 14:12:47',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21023,'Investor Pitch Deck Storyteller & Designer',11,'We are looking for a skilled storyteller and designer to create an investor pitch deck for our upcoming fundraising campaign. The ideal candidate should have expertise in GSLIDES, PPTX, and presentation design, as well as experience in data visualization, fundraising, infographics, and pitchbook creation.\r\n\r\nAs the investor pitch deck storyteller and designer, you will be responsible for crafting a compelling narrative that showcases our company\'s strengths, growth potential, and unique value proposition. You should be able to translate complex data and information into visually appealing and easy-to-understand graphics, charts, and infographics.\r\n\r\nThe project has high urgency and should be turned around within a few weeks, and we are looking for someone who can work independently while collaborating with our team.\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit a proposal outlining your experience in creating investor pitch decks, your approach to storytelling and design, and links to your past completed projects. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658475729771724801?success','-',7,'United States','St Paul',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-16',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-16 14:14:26',NULL,19,3,NULL,133),
(21024,'Logo Animation',8,'Description: \r\nWe\'re looking for help animating our logo based on the provided pre-visualization.\r\nWe’re happy with the timing and motion of it, but the hand-drawn line\r\nat the beginning should look smoother (not jagged like in pre-vis). \r\n\r\nNote that the icon proportions in the hand-drawn part are thicker\r\nthan in the logo. This might need to be adjusted closer to the icon to ensure it works at small scales. \r\n\r\nDeliverables: \r\n1. animation + colored word mark appearing (like the pre-vis) \r\n2. animation + colored icon appearing (like pre-vis without text) \r\n3. animation only (no color or text) \r\n\r\nThe three above in black & white: Neutral 500 & Neutral 100\r\n(in place of the red pre-vis animation) \r\n\r\nWe’d also like to request the final working file of the animation. \r\n\r\nFormat: Transparent .mov \r\n\r\nSize: ~ 2124x2156 \r\n\r\nFramerate: 60 fps \r\n\r\nFeedback:\r\nWe’d like to request one round of feedback for potential changes','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~017161256ce0935dba','-',7,'United States','San Carlos',32.000,'perhour',32.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-16',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-16 14:16:26',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
