(21027,'Bookkeeper',39,'We are currently seeking an experienced bookkeeper to join our team for a project that will last more than 6 months. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in accounting, balance sheet, bank reconciliation, bookkeeping, budget management, cash flow statement, data entry, and Intuit QuickBooks Online.\r\n\r\nAs a bookkeeper, you will be responsible for maintaining accurate financial records, managing budgets, preparing financial reports, and reconciling bank statements. You will work closely with our finance team to ensure that all financial transactions are properly recorded and reported.\r\n\r\nTo be considered for this position, we require candidates to submit a detailed proposal. Please describe your experience in bookkeeping and how you can help us with this project. We also encourage you to include links to past projects that showcase your bookkeeping skills.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a highly organized and detail-oriented candidate who can work independently and as part of a team. If you have a passion for bookkeeping and are looking for a challenging and rewarding opportunity, we encourage you to apply.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658483005250531329','-',7,'United States','Hollidaysburg',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-16',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-16 14:43:05',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21028,'Accounting and Bookkeeping for US Corp',39,'We are a rapidly growing medical firm looking for a Bookkeeper/Accountant for ongoing part-time work. We will also be opening 2 more companies in the next 2 months that will need bookkeeping and accounting services.\r\n\r\nExperience with US Tax codes billing/accounting required.\r\n\r\nEssential Functions:\r\nPerforms general bookkeeping duties, including, but not limited to:\r\n• Record and post day-to-day financial transactions (A/P, A/R, Deposits)\r\n• Reconcile all bank and credit card accounts on a daily and monthly basis\r\n• Develop, maintain and manage system to account for accurate financials in a timely manner\r\n• Reconcile accounts payable by matching invoices with payments and tracking credit memos.\r\n• Reviewing and processing and accounting for expense reports\r\n• Prepare month-end financial reports and P&L statements\r\n• Works closely with inventory management to ensure that assets are allocated to the appropriate location\r\n• Tracks depreciation value on existing assets.\r\n• Sources all points of revenue, including direct payments and payments via 3rd party\r\n• Assists in the preparation of quarterly tax filings.\r\n• Investigate and solve discrepancies\r\n• Ability to communicate across multi-functions throughout the company\r\n• Ad hoc projects as needed\r\n\r\nRequirements\r\n• At least 5 years experience as a bookkeeper\r\n• Proficiency in QuickBooks and Excel\r\n• Solid understanding of basic bookkeeping and accounting\r\n• Exceptional attention to detail, resourceful and proactive\r\n• Must have a sense of urgency and the ability to adhere to tight deadlines','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658485697486188545','-',7,'United States','Delray Beach',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-16',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-16 14:54:00',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
