(21030,'Accountant Needed for Bookkeeping Tasks',39,'Hello! I need someone to help me with both business and personal accounting. Depending on the rate, this could be a long-term role.\r\n\r\nMy business needs are:\r\n1. Studying my QBO for last year to get a feel for how things are structured.\r\n2. Categorize some transactions for end of year last year.\r\n3. Reconcile books for a few months last year.\r\n4. Help me sort out transactions in QBO related to the sale of my company last year.\r\n5. Get my accounts connected, and all accounting fixed for my new venture which has been operated out of the same QBO (but a different bank account)\r\n6. Setup some misc projections for the next 60 days related to a new business opportunity.\r\n\r\nPersonal needs\r\n1. I need someone to start tracking all our personal expenses, ideally in Quicken.\r\n2. I need someone to help us create a personal budget, and manage it for us.\r\n3. Other misc personal financial tasks.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n1. Must work at least 4 hours USA time in CST time zone so we have plenty of opportunity to meet.\r\n2. Must be willing to join Slack to chat.\r\n3. Must be willing to Zoom with me, video on, regularly (daily for a while)\r\n4. I need probably 40 hours a week for a couple weeks, then this will go down to lower hours I suspect...must be able to do that.\r\n5. Must be an accountant (though not a USA CPA)\r\n6. Must be awesome and fun!\r\n\r\nPlease let me know why you are the best candidate for the role! - Brad','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658488444519088129','-',7,'United States','Ardmore',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-16',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-16 15:05:25',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
