(21071,'Accounts Payable/Receivable Help Needed',39,'Job Title: Part-Time Accounts Payable Clerk\r\nLocation: Remote\r\nWork Hours: 4-8 hours per week\r\n\r\nAbout Us:\r\nWe are a growing Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) business dedicated to providing cutting-edge solutions to our more than 200 clients clients. We pride ourselves on our commitment to innovation, efficiency, and customer satisfaction. As a small but rapidly expanding team, we\'re looking for a part-time Accounts Payable Clerk to join us and help streamline our invoicing and payment processes.\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\nWe are seeking a detail-oriented, reliable, and self-motivated individual to join our team as a part-time Accounts Payable Clerk. In this role, you will be responsible for ensuring the accurate and timely issuance of invoices to our clients and following up on payments.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Use Quickbooks to generate and send out invoices to clients in a timely manner.\r\n- Monitor account balances and track incoming payments.\r\n- Follow up with clients on unpaid invoices and facilitate payment procedures.\r\n- Update and maintain accounting journals, ledgers, and other records detailing financial business transactions.\r\n- Complete any information requests and participate in vendor onboarding to get set up in AP systems from clients as a vendor\r\n- May be required to both call and email clients to finalize payment inquiries','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658591291496235009','-',7,'United States','Seattle',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-16',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-16 21:55:26',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(21072,'QuickBooks Integration Project',39,'We need an hour or so of consulting to validate an approach for integrating Advanced Deposits and Accounts Receivables from a management system to the QuickBooks (the web-based version: QuickBooks Online Edition) product for hotel operations.   The approach is a bit ‘un-orthodox’ and we want to gain expert opinions. If the consultant is qualified to help us test and deploy the solution via the QuickBooks API method we intend to use, we\'d be appreciative. But this step is a simple consultation to validate how the G/L will be affected by the Advanced Deposits and Accounts Receivables approach we are considering.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658589913136316417','-',7,'United States','Stateline',75.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-16',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-16 21:57:15',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(21073,'Need an amazing bookkeeper',39,'Our books need to be updated. QUICK!\r\n\r\nI need someone who is wrangling a messy infrastructure, so I can spend time focusing on growing the business.\r\n\r\nWe are searching for an exceptional bookkeeper to join our team for a long-term commitment of more than 6 months. As our bookkeeper, you will handle our day-to-day accounting tasks, including bank reconciliation, bookkeeping, and managing our accounting software. We require someone with a strong understanding of accounting basics and experience working with Quickbooks.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should have excellent attention to detail and be able to work independently.\r\n\r\nTo apply, please provide a detailed proposal outlining how you can help us with our bookkeeping needs. Please include links to past completed projects that demonstrate your experience and expertise in accounting and bookkeeping. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658594797812744193','-',7,'United States','San Francisco',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-16',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-16 22:07:30',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
