(21078,'Need a packaging designer for a beauty brand',2,'We are a beauty brand seeking a skilled packaging designer to help us create a unique and eye-catching packaging design for our products. The ideal candidate should have experience in brand identity design, graphic design and packaging design. The project is expected to last for 1 to 3 months.\r\n\r\nAs a packaging designer, you will be responsible for creating packaging designs that stand out on the shelves and grab the attention of our target audience. You will work closely with our team to understand our brand identity and create designs that align with our vision.\r\n\r\nTo be considered for this position, please submit a proposal detailing your experience in packaging design and how you can help us with this project. Please include links to your portfolio showcasing your past completed projects in packaging design.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a candidate who is creative, detail-oriented, and passionate about design. If you are up for the challenge, we look forward to hearing from you!\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01d6b84bbea3a5ae1a','-',7,'United States','Lystrup',30.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 09:10:36',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
