(21083,'Wix website design - fix, polish, and improve',17,'Seeking a talented and detail-oriented Wix designer to fix and polish my website at https://ignition.pw and the mobile version so it can hang with major players.\r\n\r\nI\'m fine with the content, colors, and images, but there are lots of issues with it.\r\n\r\nIn particular, I\'d like:\r\n\r\n・Resize the text and elements so they fit and look better\r\n・Fix responsiveness so it works with different sized monitors\r\n・Set up the mobile version so it looks good and works properly\r\n・Animate some elements to make it more engaging (e.g. numbers counters, on scroll movement, etc.)\r\n・Overall polish and balancing so it looks good\r\n・Other ideas and suggestions improve the layout and design\r\n\r\nI\'d like to have this done for Friday if at all possible. (I\'m highly responsive and won\'t be a bottleneck in the process.)\r\n\r\nPlease include live versions of sites that you have designed and created in your proposal.\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~010f7a767313dc15ac','-',7,'United States','Atlanta',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 10:04:49',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
