(21087,'Updating WordPress website layout',15,'I am in need of an expert WordPress developer who can make several modifications to an existing school website. Specifically, I require assistance in updating the layout to a more modern design. I am seeking a professional who possesses extensive knowledge and expertise in WordPress development.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0113b7b65af43c3f7f','-',7,'United States','US',55.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 10:27:27',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21088,'Wordpress developer (woo-commerce experience needed) - ongoing position',15,'Hi all,\r\n\r\nIm self employed and work in IT and Web and I need a right hand man (or woman) to work alongside me with ongoing creation and editing of Wordpress sites, including woo commerce, for current and future clients websites I get involved with.\r\n\r\nSometimes we need to move a site from their current server to my servers. this has proved problematic for the devs that have tired before, so good knowledge of mysql and servers would be of use if you can mention that. If you are proficient level at AWS EC2 mention that too as I have another job you can assist me with.\r\n\r\nI design the sites (or find a template on theme forest) and you code it to my or the clients requirements (I usually create mockups in photoshop for you to follow)\r\n\r\nThe job could be simple page edits one day, improving old code updates, to rolling out full new sites that takes months.\r\n\r\nYou need to have at least 3 years experience with wordpress, in return Ive got a plenty of work for you (between 5-10 hours a week on average), for at least a year.\r\n\r\n\r\nRegards hourly rate, please quote me enough so you are happy, but bare in mind this will be regular ongoing work, and im a one man band, so dont price yourself out either.\r\n\r\n\r\nGood luck!, looking forward to working with you.\r\n\r\nJohn','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01cbc69f65cd291b7a','-',7,'United States','Lichfield',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 10:38:36',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21089,'Create 2 pages in Elementor by copying mockup',4,'Posted May 17, 2023\r\nNOTE: Mockups are included below.\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a skilled Elementor website designer to recreate the mockups for two pages of our website. We require both desktop and mobile versions of each page to ensure a seamless user experience across devices. The attached mockups will serve as a reference for the design, layout, and content placement.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should possess a strong understanding of web design principles, an eye for detail, and expertise in working with Elementor. They should be able to transform the provided mockups into fully functional, visually appealing web pages.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nRecreate the provided mockups accurately and efficiently using Elementor.\r\nEnsure that the design and layout are responsive and adapt seamlessly to different screen sizes.\r\nImplement the necessary features, elements, and functionalities as depicted in the mockups.\r\nOptimize the pages for fast loading speed and performance.\r\nCollaborate with our team to discuss any design modifications or improvements.\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience in designing websites using Elementor.\r\nProficiency in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\r\nFamiliarity with responsive design principles and mobile-first development.\r\nStrong attention to detail and a keen eye for aesthetics.\r\nGood communication skills and the ability to work collaboratively.\r\nPlease note that we are looking for someone who is available to start working on this project immediately. If you have other ongoing commitments or cannot commit to the required timeframe, kindly refrain from applying.\r\n\r\nMOCKUPS:\r\n\r\nHomepage:\r\n- Desktop: https://drive.google.com/file/d/13Hz94y7DnScj__7Yhvaza-KqKcMb_k3F/view?usp=share_link\r\n- Mobile: https://drive.google.com/file/d/13J-0zc_0sq_HEuCKf-8SPhid_HhCS4KT/view?usp=share_link\r\n\r\nPricing::\r\n- Desktop: https://drive.google.com/file/d/13hPoJoKKTwP