(21090,'Experienced Presentation Designer and Document Specialist',11,'Job Description:\r\nWe are looking for an experienced and skillful Presentation Designer and Document Specialist who can create high-quality slides and documents quickly and efficiently. The ideal candidate should have extensive experience in PowerPoint, PDF editing, and other similar software.\r\nThis role involves working closely with our team to create and update pitch decks and presentation material for new clients. Work is variable, requiring several hours up front, then an hour or two per week for updates. However, flexibility is necessary as the hours may vary depending on the project’s needs.\r\n\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Designing and producing visually compelling presentation decks\r\n- Editing PDFs and other documents as necessary\r\n- Collaborating with our team to understand needs and translate them into presentations\r\n- Updating materials weekly or as required\r\n- Ensuring all deliverables are of high quality and completed within set deadlines\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Proven experience as a Presentation Designer or similar role\r\n- Proficiency in PowerPoint and other presentation design software\r\n- Strong skills in PDF editing\r\n- Experience creating pitch decks and presentation materials\r\n- Excellent attention to detail\r\n- Strong communication and collaboration skills\r\n- Able to work on a flexible schedule\r\n\r\n\r\nNice-to-Have:\r\nPlease let us know if you have experience with WordPress, website development, and other related fields. We’re always looking for talented individuals who can contribute to different areas of our business, and there may be an opportunity for a more significant role in building our websites and other digital properties.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you believe you’re an excellent fit for this role, please apply with your resume and a portfolio showcasing your previous work. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01a0cc808c9441ffcc','-',7,'United States','Austin',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 11:00:27',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21091,'Design work - banner ads, social media posts, email design',2,'Brainstem Digital Health is a startup that aims to empower individuals to collect, use, and share their health data to improve health outcomes and receive social and economic rewards. They focus on heart rate variability (HRV) as a proxy for Autonomic Nervous System health and offer wearable hardware and a digital health assistant to monitor and improve health and wellbeing. They also provide a health data sharing and collaboration network and a decentralized digital health and wellbeing product.\r\n\r\nWe already have digital collateral such as app designs, wearable device designs etc\r\n\r\nWe want to use what we already have for its use in\r\n\r\n- Banner ads\r\n- Social media posts\r\n- Email template design alterations','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ec5cf49fb49fd51a','-',7,'United States','London',60.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 11:21:40',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21092,'Website Rebuild',4,'We are seeking a skilled and experienced website designer to help us rebuild our website. The job is expected to take between 1 to 3 months to complete. The ideal candidate will have expertise in graphic design, mobile app design, Squarespace, Wix, and web design. Your experience working with small businesses with 1-9 employees is also valuable to us.\r\n\r\nAs the selected candidate, you will be responsible for redesigning our website to give it a fresh and modern look. You will work with our team to ensure that the site meets our business needs and represents our brand effectively. You should be able to provide creative ideas and solutions to improve the site\'s usability, functionality, and overall appeal.\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit a proposal outlining how you can help us with this project. Be sure to include links to some of your past completed projects that demonstrate your expertise and creativity in website design. We look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01151d89decddbfe67','-',7,'United States','Charlotte',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 11:34:13',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
