(21094,'Seeking Experienced Graphic Designer to Create Trade Show Graphics',2,'Seeking Experienced Graphic Designer to Create Trade Show Graphics\r\n\r\nDescription:\r\n\r\nWe are in search of an experienced graphic designer to design a series of communication panels for a trade show. The job will involve designing three different visuals to be used on various print mediums.\r\n\r\n1. 90x120cm Surface\r\n\r\nThis should include English text which we will provide.\r\nThere should be 3 to 4 illustrative photos included.\r\nWe are looking for an eye-catching design that remains professional.\r\n\r\n85x80cm Surface :\r\n\r\nThis should also include English text which we will provide.\r\nThere should be 3 to 4 illustrative photos included.\r\nThe design should be consistent with the first panel.\r\n\r\n85x40cm Surface:\r\n\r\nThis panel should display our logo and a catchphrase which we will provide.\r\n\r\nThe design should be simple and effective, highlighting the logo and catchphrase.\r\nBackground colors to be used will be based on an example we will provide to ensure brand consistency.\r\n\r\nCandidates should have excellent knowledge of graphic design, and prior proven experience creating visuals for events or trade shows would be a plus.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested, please send us your portfolio, along with a brief overview of your trade show and event design experience.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01dd68bc3f2cf0fa78','-',7,'United States','Estrablin',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 12:18:47',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
