(21099,'QuickBooks Desktop Enterprise Expert Needed for Company File Merging',39,'Greetings,\r\n\r\nWe are seeking an expert in QuickBooks Desktop Enterprise to assist us with a critical task. We have two company files that need to be accurately merged into a single file, ensuring data integrity and continuity.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nEvaluate our current company files to understand the complexities involved in the merging process.\r\nDevelop a step-by-step plan for merging the two company files while maintaining data integrity.\r\nExecute the merging process in a timely and efficient manner.\r\nVerify that the merged company file is accurate and complete.\r\nProvide training and documentation on the process to allow our internal team to understand the changes and to maintain the file properly moving forward.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience with QuickBooks Desktop Enterprise.\r\nKnowledge of best practices for merging company files.\r\nExcellent attention to detail, ensuring data accuracy and integrity.\r\nStrong communication skills to effectively explain the process to our team.\r\nAbility to work independently and solve problems as they arise.\r\n\r\nPreferred:\r\n\r\nExperience with companies in our industry.\r\nCertified QuickBooks ProAdvisor.\r\nPositive reviews and ratings from past clients.\r\nTo apply, please provide the following:\r\n\r\nA brief description of your experience with QuickBooks Desktop Enterprise, specifically with merging company files.\r\nAny relevant certifications you hold.\r\nA proposal for how you would approach this task, including estimated time and cost.\r\nReferences or reviews from previous clients.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering this opportunity. We look forward to your proposal.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658830785425784833','-',7,'United States','Kings County',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 13:44:56',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21100,'Create Wedding Venue Brochure',13,'We are looking for a talented graphic designer to create a stunning brochure for our wedding venue. The brochure should showcase our venue\'s unique features and amenities to potential clients. The ideal candidate should have experience in creating visually appealing brochures and be able to work efficiently to deliver the project within a month.\r\n\r\nWe are looking to model the brochure off of the format of the Hedsor House, which has been provided so you you can provide a fixed price bid with the knowledge of the number of pages, the format, etc.\r\n\r\nCobb Hill Estate in Harrisville, NH is the wedding venue, you can see some photos and learn more about it at www.CobbHillEstate.com\r\n\r\nA fairly extensive collection of photo content will be available for use for the creation of this brochure.\r\n\r\nPlease provide a fixed price bid for this project, thank you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016fde2b8d211097b0','-',7,'United States','Harrisville',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 13:47:54',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21101,'Seeking new Bookkeeper for Print Shop: using QBO, Shopify, and Etsy',39,'We are seeking an experienced bookkeeper to join our print shop. Our accounting software of choice is QuickBooks, while our order processing is managed through Shopify. It is essential that you have expertise in using Import Tools for QuickBooks, as we sell our products on various platforms such as Shopify, Etsy, and Faire.\r\n\r\nYour responsibilities will include entering monthly expenses into QuickBooks and reconciling credit card and bank statements. During our fiscal year-end, you will collaborate with our accountant to complete end-of-year reports for income tax filing.\r\n\r\nAs part of the initial setup, you will be responsible for configuring QuickBooks for expense tracking and other relevant functions. Additionally, you will set up QuickBooks Online to import transactions from Shopify, including refunds and modified orders. We also require assistance in setting up a sync tool to import Etsy sales and expenses into QuickBooks. If possible, we would appreciate your help in developing a more efficient workflow for adding Etsy transactions and resolving any issues that may arise.\r\n\r\nOn a monthly basis, you will reconcile bank statements and credit card statements. Furthermore, your expertise in troubleshooting errors and resolving transaction discrepancies will be crucial in ensuring accurate balances.\r\n\r\nIf you possess the necessary skills and experience to handle these tasks effectively, we would love to hear from you. Please provide details of your relevant experience and your proposed approach for handling adjustments and streamlining the bookkeeping process.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to reviewing your application and potentially working together to maintain smooth financial operations for our print shop.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658832083021807617','-',7,'United States','Los',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 13:50:03',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
