(21118,'Bookkeeper needed Real Estate Experience Quickbooks Fair prices',39,'Hey my name is Dan\r\n\r\nIm looking for a bookkeeper who\'s knowledgeable and charges fair prices. I do my books on QBO just once per year for the previous year for taxes. I need them done for 2022 (extensions have been filed already). Would like completed in the next 2-3 weeks to file taxes if possible.\r\n\r\nI\'ve got 2 businesses.\r\n\r\nDelivered Ads - ecommerce business. All inventory is expensed at time of purchase. Books were done for 2021, expenses just need to be categorized for 2022 the same way that 2021 were.\r\n\r\nEmpower Agency. This one is a bit more complex it is a Real estate business.\r\nWithin I do house flips. So you will see large transitions when purchasing the properties, then large transactions when sold. You\'ll also see expenses from lowes, amazon, etc for materials and payments to subcontractors via cash app and zelle.\r\nOn top of that we started rentals in 2022 so you\'ll see income from Airbnb, Income from rentals using our property management app (Innago). For 2022 there are a total of 3 properties. 2 of them are single family, 1 of them is a triplex. There are mortgages involved with these properties. Since this was new for 2022 the setup will need to be created for each property.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658846175043022849','-',7,'United States','Costa Mesa',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 14:46:13',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
