(21127,'Company Profile Design',2,'We are looking for a talented designer to create a professional and visually appealing company profile.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should possess excellent communication skills, be able to work efficiently under tight deadlines, and have a proven track record of producing high-quality design work.\r\n\r\nTo be considered for this project, please submit a proposal detailing how you can help us create an outstanding company profile. Please include links to your past work that showcase your design skills, particularly in brochure and company profile design.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a designer who can take our brand and translate it into a compelling narrative, using creative layouts and typography. We look forward to seeing your proposals and working with a talented designer who can bring our vision to life.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0120e0a0eea25c61ab','-',7,'United States','KSA',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 15:45:28',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21128,'Quickbook certified bookkeeper',39,'Record financial transactions: The bookkeeper would be responsible for accurately recording all financial transactions in QuickBooks Online, including sales, expenses, and payments. This may involve working closely with the gallery\'s staff to ensure that all transactions are properly documented and coded.\r\n\r\nReconcile accounts: The bookkeeper would be responsible for reconciling bank and credit card accounts in QuickBooks Online to ensure that all transactions are accounted for and that the gallery\'s financial statements are accurate.\r\n\r\nPrepare financial reports: The bookkeeper would prepare regular financial reports, including balance sheets, income statements, and cash flow statements. These reports may be used by the gallery\'s management team to make informed decisions about the gallery\'s financial performance.\r\n\r\nManage accounts payable and receivable: The bookkeeper would manage the gallery\'s accounts payable and receivable, including issuing invoices and processing payments. This may involve working closely with the gallery\'s vendors and customers to ensure that all transactions are handled accurately and efficiently.\r\n\r\nMonitor budget and cash flow: The bookkeeper would work with the gallery\'s management team to monitor the gallery\'s budget and cash flow. This may involve preparing financial forecasts and making recommendations to help the gallery manage its finances effectively.\r\n\r\nMaintain financial records: The bookkeeper would be responsible for maintaining accurate and up-to-date financial records, including receipts, invoices, and other financial documents. This may involve organizing and filing documents in a secure and organized manner.\r\n\r\nLiaise with external stakeholders: The bookkeeper may liaise with external stakeholders, such as the gallery\'s accountant or tax preparer, to ensure that all financial reporting and compliance requirements are met.\r\n\r\nIn summary, the bookkeeper for an art gallery located in Aspen, CO using QuickBooks Online would be responsible for managing the gallery\'s financial transactions, preparing financial reports, and ensuring that the gallery\'s financial records are accurate and up-to-date. They would work closely with the gallery\'s management team and external stakeholders to ensure that the gallery\'s financial operations are efficient and compliant with all applicable regulations.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658862037516189697','-',7,'United States','Aspen',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 15:49:20',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21129,'Bookkeeping with sevDesk',39,'We are looking for a bookkeeper with expertise in sevDesk software to help us manage our finances for the next six months or more.\r\n\r\nWe are a B2B consulting company with many incoming invoices and a few outgoing. Furthermore, we are using mainly sevDesk, GetMyInvoices, Wise and PayPal.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should have a good understanding of accounting basics and be able to handle all aspects of bookkeeping including accounts payable, accounts receivable, bank and credit card reconciliations, and financial reporting.\r\n\r\nWe need to rework 2022, bring 2023 up-to-date and then keep everything current.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities will include ensuring accurate and timely processing of transactions (sending invoices to our customers, sending payment reminders), maintaining up-to-date financial records, and generating reports for management. You need to have a huge automation mindset, so we can automize everything we can and keep manual work (and by this possible errors) low.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this position, please submit a proposal outlining your experience with sevDesk and bookkeeping, as well as how you can help us with this project.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658863863349518337','-',7,'United States','Tallinn',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 15:56:23',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
