(21137,'Experienced Bookkeeper for Video Production Agency',39,'We are a fast-paced video production agency specializing in corporate clients. We are looking for a detail-oriented, reliable, and experienced bookkeeper to manage our financial records and ensure compliance. This is a remote, contract position with the potential for long-term collaboration.\r\n\r\nRESPONSIBILITIES:\r\n1. Maintain up-to-date, accurate financial records.\r\n2. Receive, process, and reconcile statements.\r\n3. Prepare financial reports on a regular basis.\r\n4. Conduct monthly reconciliations of bank and credit card accounts.\r\n5. Coordinate with the team to ensure timely payment of invoices and bills.\r\n6. Monitor financial transactions and reports.\r\n7. Process accounts receivable and payable.\r\n8. Ensure legal compliance in all financial functions.\r\n9. Prepare documents for audits, when necessary.\r\n10. Assist in creating budgets and financial planning.\r\n\r\nREQUIREMENTS:\r\n1. Proven bookkeeping experience, preferably in the video production or creative industry.\r\n2. Solid understanding of basic bookkeeping and accounting principles.\r\n3. Proficiency in MS Office, particularly Excel.\r\n4. High-degree of familiarity with accounting software such as QuickBooks or Xero.\r\n5. High level of integrity, accuracy, dependability, and confidentiality.\r\n6. Excellent data entry skills.\r\n7. Good communication and organizational skills.\r\n8. Ability to handle multiple tasks simultaneously and meet deadlines.\r\n9. Bachelor’s degree in Finance, Accounting, or a related field is preferred.\r\n\r\nTO APPLY:\r\nPlease submit your resume, a cover letter outlining your relevant experience, and your hourly rate. Applicants without a cover letter will not be considered.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658880667542925312','-',7,'United States','Coral Gables',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 18:58:44',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
