(21152,'ERC Form 941, Payroll Ledger, and profit and loss',38,'We are looking for an experienced accounting professional who can assist us with completing our ERC Form 941, Payroll Ledger, and profit and loss statements. The ideal candidate should have a strong background in accounting and be proficient in using Intuit QuickBooks. Additionally, we require the candidate to have experience in tax preparation.\r\n\r\nThe job length is less than one month, and we expect the project to be completed in a timely and efficient manner. The successful candidate will be responsible for ensuring that all financial records are accurate and up-to-date.\r\n\r\nTo be considered for this role, please submit a proposal outlining your experience in completing similar projects. Please include some links to past completed projects that demonstrate your skills in accounting, tax preparation, and QuickBooks.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a candidate who is detail-oriented, organized, and able to work independently. If you are a self-starter who enjoys working in a fast-paced environment, we would love to hear from you!\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658917338868035585','-',7,'United States','Elgin',25.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 20:34:30',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(21153,'File US Tax Return for Delaware LLC',38,'We are currently seeking a qualified and experienced tax professional to file the US tax return for our Delaware LLC. The successful candidate will have proven experience in corporate tax, tax preparation, and tax return filing.\r\n\r\nAs this is a short-term project with a timeline of less than one month, we require a candidate who is efficient, detail-oriented, and able to meet strict deadlines.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities will include the preparation and filing of all necessary tax documents, ensuring compliance with all relevant tax regulations, and providing timely and accurate advice on tax-related matters.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this project, please submit a detailed proposal outlining your relevant experience and skills. Please include links to past completed projects to demonstrate your expertise and suitability for this project. We look forward to hearing from you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658931147722743809','-',7,'United States','Brockvile',120.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 20:36:44',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(21154,'Full Charge Bookkeeper for Industrial Electronics Business',39,'We are looking for an experienced bookkeeper to help us with accounting, bookkeeping, and financial tasks. Your goal will be to ensure our company’s daily accounting functions are accurate and efficient. Our systems and processes are accurate, timely, and efficient.\r\n\r\nYour responsibilities will include managing financial records, creating reports and reconciling bank statements. You will administrate accounting software programs (we use Xero, DEAR Inventory, Bill.com and Google Sheets/Docs) to manage business transactions, including accounts payable and receivable, disbursements, expense vouchers and receipts.\r\n\r\nWe expect you to be familiar with all accounting procedures and have strong data skills.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities are:\r\nEnter financial transactions data in database, on a daily basis\r\n\r\nOrganize bank deposits, general ledger postings, and statements\r\n\r\nCollaborate with the accounting department and other company personnel to help with processing financial transactions\r\n\r\nCreate and maintain accounting documents and records\r\n\r\nPerform timely and accurate accounts reconciliation\r\n\r\nPrepare reports or summaries on your activity areas and present them to company\'s executives or top managers\r\n\r\nDetect problems and discrepancies in accounting procedures or related documentation and develop measures to resolve them\r\n\r\nEnsure the compliance with established standards, procedures and applicable laws\r\n\r\nFollow all significant changes and trends related to your area of responsibility\r\n\r\nJob requirements are:\r\n\r\n3+ years\' experience of working as a Bookkeeper, Accounting Clerk, Accounts Receivable Clerk or Accounts Payable Clerk\r\n\r\nExperience with bookkeeping and basic accounting procedures\r\n\r\nGood practical experience with spreadsheets and financial reports\r\n\r\nGood knowledge of accounting software (Xero especially), MS Office, and databases\r\n\r\nKnowledge of filing and record keeping tasks\r\n\r\nAccuracy, high performance and close attention to detail\r\n\r\nStrong data entry, mathematical and word processing skills\r\n\r\nOrganized and responsible\r\n\r\nStrong communication skills','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658944285487497217','-',7,'United States','Emeryville',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 21:15:55',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21155,'Bookkeeper to prepare books for Accountant',39,'We are looking for a skilled bookkeeper to prepare our books for our accountant. The job will be less than 1 month in duration. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in accounting basics, bank reconciliation, and bookkeeping.\r\n\r\nAs the bookkeeper, your primary responsibility will be to ensure that all financial transactions are accurately recorded and categorized in preparation for our accountant. You will need to be comfortable working with various financial documents, including bank statements, invoices, receipts, and other financial records. You will also need to have a strong attention to detail and be able to work efficiently and accurately.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this job, please submit a proposal outlining your experience and how you can help with this project. We would also like for you to include links to past completed projects that demonstrate your expertise in bookkeeping and accounting. We look forward to hearing from you!\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658945769025404929','-',7,'United States','Calgry',23.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 21:34:31',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(21156,'Help with Quickbooks!',39,'Hello! I am an Interior Designer and I just started my own business in Feb. 2023.\r\nI have tried a few different programs for bookkeeping and have decided that they are not what I need. I just purchased Quickbooks and am totally lost. I would like someone to get my business up to date and sort everything in the right categories. It should be easy since I haven\'t had too many transactions. I just do not want to have a mess come tax time.\r\n\r\nMust have excellent experience with Quickbooks.\r\n\r\nKnowledge of the program Honeybook and ZenBusiness.\r\n\r\nFor now this is a short term project but definitely could turn into a long term relationship.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1658951165232480257','-',7,'United States','Colebrook',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-17',1,'2023-05-17',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-17 21:44:06',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21157,'Icon and logo whizz wanted',10,'Hi,\r\n\r\nI’m wanting someone to help with designing some icons for a range of accessories we sell.\r\n\r\nWe already have a set style and format to follow as we have existing accessories that have icons.\r\n\r\nWe have developed some new accessories though and these need icons designing.\r\n\r\nThese icons will then need to be designed to fit with the company logo and product description to go on the bags that they come in.\r\n\r\n**We will need this work completed in the next 24 hours so it’s important that you only bid for the work if you are available**\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\nJake','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0137e76fc99829fb9f','-',7,'United States','Morecambe',45.000,'perhour',45.000,'2023-05-18',1,'2023-05-18',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-18 07:57:03',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21158,'Rebrand and Logo Design for Croquet',10,'A detailed brief is provided in the PDF document attached, but the general information is below:\r\n\r\nCroquet is a very old person\'s sport and they are looking to make it a youthful brand.\r\n\r\nThey want the brand to be consistent across Australia, all their State organisations as well as their different sport disciplines.\r\n\r\nThey like the idea of the focus to be in a nice customised font, with an icon accompanying it. The icon should be recognisable when it is without the font. And the style should be able to be used across and adapted for the brand hierarchy (States and disciplines).\r\n\r\nThe brand style that they like are the following:\r\n- Badminton Australia\r\n- Croquet New Zealand\r\n- AUS Cycling','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0166f9a547d3d46be6','-',7,'United States','Chatswood',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-18',1,'2023-05-18',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-18 08:05:44',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21159,'Logo creation',10,'We are seeking a skilled graphic designer to create a logo for our financial education website. The site already exists but we are changing the name and will need a logo which fits the new name. The site is also an extension or subservice of a parent business and we would like the new logo to reflect or relate to the logo of this business if possible.\r\n\r\nAs it is a financial education site, we would want the logo to give a sense of professionalism and trustworthiness, but it should also appear friendly and approachable as the site content is targeted at a wide demographic from teenagers to retirees.\r\n\r\nA priority for us would be to initially have a range of options that we could further refine.\r\n\r\nThanks for any feedback or proposal you might like to provide.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~019941d20b45b5c1db','-',7,'United States','Melbourne',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-05-18',1,'2023-05-18',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-18 08:08:48',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21160,'Need a Logo design for AI company',10,'Before applying please follow these steps to learn what you will be doing:\r\n\r\n1. Learn about our company here and leave an up vote: https://www.producthunt.com/posts/arsturn-2\r\n\r\n2. Play around with the website and analyze our logo so you can get a good idea of what were looking for\r\n\r\n\r\nOur AI company, specializing in AI-powered chatbots for websites, is seeking a talented Logo Designer to create a unique and memorable brand identity. As our Logo Designer, you will work closely with our marketing and design teams to create a logo that reflects our brand values and resonates with our target audience.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Develop a comprehensive understanding of our brand values, target audience, and competitive landscape\r\n- Design a memorable and unique logo that aligns with our brand identity and resonates with our target audience\r\n- Collaborate with the marketing and design teams to ensure the logo is aligned with the overall brand strategy and visual identity\r\n- Develop logo guidelines and usage guidelines to ensure consistency across all marketing materials\r\n- Provide input and feedback on other design projects as needed\r\n\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n- Proven experience as a Logo Designer with a strong portfolio of previous work\r\n- Proficiency with design tools such as Adobe Illustrator, Sketch, and Photoshop\r\n- Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively with cross-functional teams\r\nStrong attention to detail and ability to work under tight deadlines\r\n- Knowledge of branding and marketing best practices\r\n- Experience in designing logos for technology or AI companies is a plus\r\n- Passion for design and staying up-to-date with the latest design trends and technologies\r\n\r\nWe offer a competitive salary, comprehensive benefits, and a dynamic work environment with opportunities for growth and development. If you are passionate about design and want to make an impact at an AI company, please apply with your resume and a link to your portfolio showcasing your previous logo design work.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01cf02fd425de95aee','-',7,'United States','Boca Raton',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-05-18',1,'2023-05-18',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-18 08:12:05',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
