(21162,'Packaging / Flyer Designer',2,'We are seeking a talented and creative individual to join our team as a Packaging and Graphic Designer. In this role, you will be responsible for designing packaging materials, creating flyers, and utilizing your skills in Illustrator and various packaging design techniques. If you have a passion for design, attention to detail, and the ability to bring ideas to life through visual concepts, we would love to hear from you.\r\n\r\nMost designs are alrady completed, but need to be customized for new sizes etc.\r\n\r\n\r\n1. Packaging Design:\r\n\r\n- Develop innovative and visually appealing packaging designs that align with our brand identity and product requirements.\r\n\r\n- Create 2D and 3D packaging mockups and prototypes.\r\n\r\n2. Graphic Design:\r\n- Design visually striking and persuasive flyers, brochures, and other marketing collateral that effectively communicate our brand message.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011526d246af72f244','-',7,'United States','Berlin',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-05-18',1,'2023-05-18',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-18 09:04:53',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21163,'New Logo',10,'We are a long established company, having operated since 1978. Our logo needs a refresh and it\'s a blank canvas - a great opportunity for someone with some creative flair.\r\n\r\nThe business offers educational tours for schools, colleges and groups and needs to reflect a sense of reassurance, but fun. By that, I mean it needs to look professional but not corporate.\r\n\r\nYou can use the words \'Inter School Travel\' or it can be abbreviated to \'IST\' or a combination of the two.\r\n\r\nTraditionally, we had colours of red and white but I have no preference for this rebrand. I have attached a letterhead showing the existing logo. As you can see it is very old fashioned. The new brand needs to get away any relationship to this previous design.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e1dc987a8f12ba9c','-',7,'United States','Mansfield',75.000,'fixed',75.000,'2023-05-18',1,'2023-05-18',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-18 09:10:32',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
