(21169,'Creating a PowerPoint Master and Word Template',11,'We are looking for a skilled freelancer who can help us create a PowerPoint master and Word template. You should possess extensive expertise in the design of Microsoft PowerPoint and Microsoft Word templates.\r\n\r\nYour primary responsibility will be to create a visually appealing PowerPoint master that will be used for various business presentations. The slide master should be well-structured and intuitive to use by business users.\r\n\r\nYou will also be responsible to create a Microsoft Word template that will be used for business letters, proposals, customer communication and other business related purposes.\r\n\r\nYou will be provided with a style guide that specifies key corporate design standards such as color scheme and typography. You will also be provided with existing templates that have been used so far but have become outdated – which is the reason why we are posting this job :)\r\n\r\nTo apply for this job, please submit a proposal detailing your experience in template design and presentation creation. Please provide examples of past projects that demonstrate your expertise in this area. We are looking for someone who has a solid track record of delivering high-quality work on time and within budget.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you and seeing how you can help us with this project.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Creating-PowerPoint-Master-and-Word-Template_~01ac282654e693ebf0/','-',7,'United States','Egling',75.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-18',1,'2023-05-18',1,'In Process.',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-18 11:49:06',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
