(21174,'Video Creative for Cannabis Brands - Facebook Ads',2,'Job Description:\r\nWe are seeking a talented and creative Video Creative to develop engaging and visually appealing video assets for cannabis brands. This role involves creating compelling video content specifically tailored for Facebook ads to enhance brand visibility, drive engagement, and generate conversions.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nCollaborate with our marketing team to understand the goals, target audience, and key messaging for each cannabis brand\'s Facebook ad campaign.\r\nConceptualize, storyboard, and script video ideas that align with the brand\'s identity and marketing objectives.\r\nCreate high-quality, eye-catching video assets including animations, motion graphics, product showcases, testimonials, and other visually appealing content.\r\nSelect appropriate visuals, music, and sound effects to enhance the overall impact of the videos.\r\nEdit and enhance raw footage, ensuring seamless transitions, and optimal video quality.\r\nOptimize videos for various Facebook ad formats and specifications, considering factors such as video duration, aspect ratio, and file size.\r\nIncorporate branding elements such as logos, colors, and typography to maintain brand consistency.\r\nStay up-to-date with industry trends, best practices, and emerging video formats to continuously improve the quality and effectiveness of video content.\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience in video production and editing, with a strong portfolio showcasing creative and visually engaging video assets.\r\nProficiency in video editing software such as Adobe Premiere Pro, Final Cut Pro, or similar tools.\r\nStrong understanding of Facebook ad specifications and best practices for video content.\r\nAbility to interpret brand guidelines and translate them into visually compelling videos.\r\nExcellent storytelling and communication skills, with the ability to bring ideas to life through video.\r\nFamiliarity with the cannabis industry and an understanding of its unique marketing requirements is a plus.\r\nReliable and responsive, with the ability to meet deadlines and work collaboratively with our team.\r\nAvailability to accommodate occasional revisions based on feedback and optimize videos accordingly.\r\n\r\nApplication Process:\r\nIf you are a talented Video Creative with a passion for creating engaging video content for brands on Facebook ads, we would love to hear from you. Please share your portfolio or samples of relevant work, along with a brief description of your experience and why you are interested in this role.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, please provide an estimate of the time required to deliver a typical video asset.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to reviewing your application and potentially working together to produce impactful video content for our cannabis brands.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0163f94d4a9f679718','-',7,'United States','Dublin',20.000,'perhour',20.000,'2023-05-18',1,'2023-05-18',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-18 12:33:34',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
