(21226,'Book keeper for USA LLC',39,'This position primarily requires an experienced data entry specialist who will work virtually and be responsible for doing various data entry jobs and operation tasks for our USA LLC company that deals with data and database management mostly.\r\n\r\nResponsibility -\r\n\r\nFinancial reporting and monitoring invoices & bookkeeping operation -\r\no Do basic financial reporting, invoicing and basic bookkeeping operation task to get daily profit analysis.\r\no Invoice management and creation\r\no Transfer invoices and customer data into our content management system\r\n\r\nData Entry –\r\no Oversee and verify data entry to cross check validity\r\no Do data entry and data extraction from different sources\r\no Data transferring from one platform to another (google sheet and CRM)\r\no Oversee and audit data entry of various data sources across sources\r\n\r\nReporting & update of various reports –\r\no Build reports using Google Sheet and do daily and weekly reporting to CEO.\r\no Build and maintain sales reporting\r\no Update performance report twice a day to keep the daily reporting updated.\r\no Compile all our past/current marketing campaigns into one central file\r\n\r\nExperience & Knowledge:\r\n- Need to be an expert at Excel, google sheet and know formulas & can work on Pivot Table\r\n- Bookkeeping & Accounting experience preferred.\r\n- Excellent grammar and a high attention to detail\r\n- Knowledge in Power BI and/or Google Data Studio will be an advantage','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1659267145127718913','-',7,'United States','Seongnam',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-18',1,'2023-05-18',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-18 18:39:56',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
