(21229,'Tax Filing Preparation TY 2013-2019',39,'We are looking for an experienced tax preparer to assist us with the tax filing preparation for tax years 2013-2019. This is a short-term project that requires an individual with a strong background in accounting principles and practices, and tax preparation software.\r\n\r\nAs a tax preparer, you will be responsible for ensuring that all tax returns are completed accurately. You will need to have excellent communication skills to work with clients and team members to gather necessary information, with experience preparing taxes for the USA.\r\n\r\nWe require that you have at least 3 years of experience with preparing taxes for the IRS in USA, and confidentiality is a must. The job much be completed within 20 days.\r\n\r\nWe have spreadsheets that need to be reviewed, data taken from them to establish Schedule C income from company endeavors. This should be compared with IRS income transcripts, which we will provide, and then taxes prepared to review with our revenue agent.\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit a proposal outlining your experience and how you can help us with this project. Please include links to past completed tax preparation projects. We are hiring immediately and look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1659298468907216897','-',7,'United States','Kirkland',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-18',1,'2023-05-18',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-18 20:43:23',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
