(21235,'Xero - Account / Book Keeping & Data Entry Training',39,'We are looking for a skilled and experienced freelancer who can set up and provide training on Xero accounting software for our team. This project consists of two main components: initial setup and subsequent training.\r\n\r\nFirst, the freelancer will be responsible for setting up Xero accounting software for our team. This includes configuring the software, customizing settings to align with our business needs, and ensuring seamless integration with our existing systems. The freelancer should have expertise in Xero setup and be able to optimize the software for efficient and accurate accounting processes.\r\n\r\nOnce the setup is complete, the freelancer will proceed to train our team members. The training program will cover a range of topics, including accounting basics, account reconciliation, accounts payable, balance sheet preparation, bank reconciliation, bookkeeping, cash flow analysis, and data entry using Xero. The training should be tailored to the specific needs of our team and delivered in a clear and concise manner.\r\n\r\nThroughout the project, the selected freelancer should work collaboratively with our team members, answering questions, providing guidance, and ensuring that they gain a solid understanding of Xero and its applications in accounting.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this project, please submit a proposal outlining your experience with Xero setup and training, as well as how you can help our team improve their skills. Please also include links to any relevant past projects you have completed. Upon completion of the setup and training, the freelancer will have successfully equipped our team with the necessary skills to effectively utilize Xero for accounting purposes.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1659259831986479105','-',7,'United States','London',25.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-18',1,'2023-05-18',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-18 20:51:54',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
