(21238,'Accounts and Bookkeeping Coordinator',39,'Are you passionate about finance and have a knack for numbers? Join our team as a Financial Operations Coordinator. Some of the role highlights are: Managing accounts payable, accounts receivable, bookkeeping, and budget coordination. Thrive in a fast-paced environment, ensure accuracy, and support financial success. Collaborate with stakeholders, and contribute to efficient financial operations. Apply today!\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a highly motivated and detail-oriented Part-Time Accounting Specialist to join our finance team. The successful candidate will be responsible for performing the following tasks:\r\n\r\n- Monthly accrual adjustments in Quickbooks Online (Canada)\r\n- Manage contractor invoices\r\n- Stripe invoicing and A/R\r\n- Collaborate with internal stakeholders to ensure timely collection of accounts receivable and resolve any payment discrepancies or issues\r\n- Maintain accurate financial records\r\n- Assist with other accounting related tasks as needed\r\n- Assist in financial forecasting and planning activities to ensure effective resource allocation and financial stability.\r\n- Communicate with clients and internal teams to address inquiries, resolve payment disputes, and maintain strong relationships.\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n- Bachelor\'s degree in Accounting, Finance, or a related field\r\n- 2+ years of relevant experience in accounting/bookkeeping\r\n- Proficient in Quickbooks Online and Google Sheets\r\n- Strong analytical and problem-solving skills\r\n- Excellent attention to detail\r\n- Ability to work independently and in a team environment\r\n- Strong communication and interpersonal skills','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1659311037471580161','-',7,'United States','Halifax',30.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-18',1,'2023-05-18',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-18 21:43:11',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(21239,'Designer for a Door Brochure',13,'I need someone to design a brochure layout with lorem ipsum content. Brochure is for a company that makes interior wood doors. I have some examples, rough layout/sections the brochure needs to contain, but no actual photos or text.\r\n\r\nYou would need to come up with a nice layout, place placeholder text, headlines, images and so on, so I can just replace those later on with actual content.\r\n\r\nBrochure needs to be roughly 10-15 pages and needs to contain the following sections among others:\r\n\r\n- Front page\r\n- Content page\r\n- Introduction\r\n- Types of doors we make\r\n- Page or two about each type (Classic, Modern, Profiled, Glass)\r\n- Design of the handle\r\n- Design of the hinge\r\n- Outro\r\n\r\nThank you','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ac27868d003bbb4d','-',7,'United States','Doha',50.000,'fixed',50.000,'2023-05-19',1,'2023-05-19',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-19 07:28:07',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
