(21241,'WordPress Website Redesign and Optimization Specialist',15,'We are seeking a highly skilled and experienced WordPress Website Redesign and Optimization Specialist for a short-term project. As part of our team, you will be responsible for redesigning and optimizing our existing WordPress website to enhance its visual appeal, functionality, and user experience. This is a one-time project that requires a dedicated professional who can deliver outstanding results within a specified timeframe.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n- Collaborate with our team to understand project requirements and objectives.\r\n- Utilize your expertise in WordPress to redesign and optimize our website.\r\n- Apply your design skills to create visually stunning and user-friendly website elements.\r\n- Communicate effectively with the team to ensure a clear understanding of guidelines and expectations.\r\n- Utilize provided video and document resources to ensure adherence to project guidelines.\r\n- Be open to revisions and implement feedback to achieve the desired outcomes.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Proven experience working with WordPress, including customizing themes, plugins, and templates.\r\n- Strong design skills and a keen eye for aesthetics, layout, and user experience.\r\n- Excellent communication skills to effectively convey ideas and collaborate with team members.\r\n- Ability to strictly follow project guidelines and deliver within given constraints.\r\n- Openness to revisions and feedback, with a willingness to make necessary adjustments.\r\n- Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail.\r\nSelf-motivated and able to work independently to meet project deadlines.\r\n- Portfolio Inspiration:\r\n- For reference, we are looking for a website style similar to the following\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\n1. Creative Milkshake - https://creativemilkshake.com/\r\n2. Drink OLIPOP - https://drinkolipop.com/\r\n3. For You Advertising - https://www.foryouadvertising.com/\r\n\r\nPlease note that the provided examples are for inspiration and should not be replicated directly. We are looking for a unique and innovative approach that aligns with our brand and project','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01541ea3018b866cc2','-',7,'United States','Dessel',400.000,'fixed',400.000,'2023-05-19',1,'2023-05-19',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-19 09:08:59',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21242,'Brand Identity design',2,'Brand Identity Description for Remote Geeks\r\nRemote Geeks is a modern, cutting-edge company that connects talented technology professionals with businesses in need of their skills.\r\n\r\nOur brand identity should reflect a sleek, professional, and trustworthy look that appeals to both tech-savvy individuals and businesses seeking top-quality talent. We want to establish ourselves as a reliable and forward-thinking brand in the remote work industry.\r\n\r\nTaking inspiration from Toptal\'s sophisticated and elegant style, we aim to create a visual identity that embodies the innovative, progressive nature of the remote work landscape. Our brand should communicate expertise, trustworthiness, and a seamless experience for both professionals and businesses using our platform.\r\n\r\nDesign Brief\r\nObjective: Develop a cohesive brand identity for Remote Geeks, including logo design, typography, color palette, and visual style that aligns with our brand values and target audience.\r\n\r\nTarget Audience: Technology professionals seeking remote work opportunities, and businesses looking to hire top-quality remote talent.\r\n\r\nInspiration: Toptal\'s clean, sophisticated, and professional visual identity should be a reference for our brand style. We want to achieve a similar level of elegance and simplicity, without directly copying their design elements.\r\n\r\nLogo Design: Create a modern, memorable, and distinctive logo that embodies the essence of Remote Geeks. It should be easily recognizable, scalable, and adaptable to various formats and applications (e.g., website, social media, print materials). The logo should be able to stand alone or be accompanied by our brand name.\r\n\r\nTypography: Choose a typeface that complements our logo and visual style. The font should be legible, professional, and versatile for use in different contexts, from website content to marketing materials. Consider using a combination of sans-serif and serif fonts to create a balance between modern and classic styles.\r\n\r\nColor Palette: Develop a color palette that reflects our brand values and appeals to our target audience. The colors should be sophisticated, professional, and convey a sense of trust and reliability. Consider incorporating shades of blue, gray, and white to evoke feelings of stability and expertise.\r\n\r\nVisual Style: Create a cohesive visual style that can be applied across various platforms and materials. This should include iconography, illustrations, and other design elements that can be used to enhance our brand identity. The style should be consistent, clean, and modern, with a focus on simplicity and elegance.\r\n\r\nDeliverables: Provide final design files for the logo, typography, color palette, and visual style guide. Include examples of how these elements can be applied to various formats, such as website design, marketing materials, and social media graphics.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e07b075bcd0a829e','-',7,'United States','Cairo',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-19',1,'2023-05-19',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-19 10:10:04',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21243,'Logo design',10,'Hello freelancer,\r\n\r\nWe are in rubber and plastic parts manufacturer. I need a logo design. I already have a draft for my logo, but in .JPG format.\r\n\r\nHere are some of my requirements.\r\n\r\n1. I need to redesign my logo with Adobe Illustrator. Only the logo, don\'t need brand design etc.\r\n2. The logo is designed in two colors, blue and green, but you need to select the exact color code.\r\n3. I\'ve attached the draft logo, when you submit the job, please add your comments or ideas.\r\n4. Please send me your quote also, otherwise I won\'t reply.\r\n5. I made a mistake that make this task an hourly task, please send me your project big.\r\n\r\nThanks.\r\nZoey','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e97c9c870f08fb81','-',7,'United States','Beijing',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-19',1,'2023-05-19',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-19 10:20:19',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21244,'Project Opportunity: Podcast Logo Designer and Intro Creator',2,'Project Opportunity: Podcast Logo Designer and Intro Creator \r\n\r\nWe are excited to announce a fantastic project opportunity for a talented podcast logo designer and intro creator! We are launching a brand new podcast called \"The Scale It Lab,\" focused on sharing invaluable business knowledge and empowering entrepreneurs to radically level up and scale their ventures using tangelo step-by-step processes.\r\n\r\nTo make our podcast visually and audibly captivating, we are seeking a creative professional who can bring their impressive design skills and experience to the table. This is a chance to showcase your talent and contribute to a dynamic and growing podcasting community.\r\n\r\nKey requirements for the project:\r\n A robust portfolio demonstrating your experience in logo design and creating captivating visuals.\r\n Experience in crafting engaging audio and video podcast intros.\r\n An understanding of business concepts and the ability to translate them into compelling visual and auditory elements.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\nDesigning an eye-catching logo that reflects the essence of \"The Scale It Lab\" podcast.\r\n Creating a visually stunning video intro that captivates the audience.\r\n Crafting a memorable and engaging music intro that sets the tone for each episode.\r\n\r\nInsights:\r\nPodcasts like the Huberman Labs and Money Mondays are huge inspirations for us.\r\n\r\nIf you are passionate about podcast branding, love to create visually striking designs, and possess the ability to captivate listeners through creative audio-visual storytelling, we would love to hear from you!\r\n\r\nTo apply:\r\nPlease send us your portfolio showcasing your previous logo design and intro creation work, along with any relevant experience you have in the field. We would also appreciate a brief description of how you envision enhancing \"The Scale It Lab\" podcast\'s identity through your designs. Add ‘pineapple’ to the subject so we know you read this brief.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to receiving your applications and partnering with a skilled and talented individual to bring \"The Scale It Lab\" podcast to life with an unforgettable brand identity!\r\n\r\n#PodcastDesignOpportunity #LogoDesigner #IntroCreator #PodcastingCommunity','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~014214caada2d6ebbd','-',7,'United States','Tamarac',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-05-19',1,'2023-05-19',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-19 10:41:31',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21245,'Custom PPT Business Case (presentation)',11,'Hi Upwork,\r\n\r\nI have a Business case that I need assistance with, as it will likely lead to a contract extension for our team, with an existing client.\r\n\r\nThe business case is very straight forward and will involve a bit of data quantification (% margin, financial comparisons, trends) essentially descriptive data mining. Then once we have all of the data (per the business case) we need to create a 3-5 slide ppt that summarizes our findings.\r\n\r\nThe instructions, and source data are all very straightforward and very easy to follow. I will share with the selected candidate and make an offer, should I find the best fit. The turn time is asap!\r\n\r\nThe case study and ppt build has been estimated at 3.5 hour project.\r\n\r\nThis will be used to present to C-Suite executives.\r\n\r\nThanks !\r\n\r\nJB','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01d98c0fe30857912f','-',7,'United States','Aurora',65.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-19',1,'2023-05-19',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-19 11:16:43',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
