(21249,'Package Design- Trash Bags',2,'We are looking for a package designer to create an eye-catching and functional redesign of our line of trash bags.\r\n\r\nHere are our current Home Select brand trash bag designs: https://photos.app.goo.gl/77NpMsLyXrMUvzB58\r\n\r\nUse these links for inspiration:\r\n\r\nWalmart: https://www.walmart.com/search?q=trash+bags\r\nTarget: https://www.target.com/s?searchTerm=trash+bags\r\n\r\nThe new design needs to make it easy for the consumer to identity these key attributes:\r\n\r\nSize- # Gallons\r\nClosure- Drawstring or twist-tie\r\nCount\r\n\r\nWe are looking for three different design options of one of our current items.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this job, please submit a proposal outlining your experience with package design and how you can help with this project. Please also include links to any past completed projects that demonstrate your skills in this area. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01cb755a4eee57f428','-',7,'United States','Scarsdale',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-05-19',1,'2023-05-19',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-19 13:05:32',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21250,'Design a trade show back drop (front/back) for medical supply company',2,'We\'re a medical supply company looking for a talented graphic designer to design a trade show back drop for us. The design will need to include both the front and back of the display, and we\'re looking for a professional, eye-catching design that will help us stand out in a crowded trade show environment. Our back drop dimensions are 20ft by 12ft and a 3d schematic is provided for better reference. The wall will be back lit so the use of color is essential.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will be experienced in using Adobe Illustrator and Adobe Photoshop, and will have a strong background in graphic design and layout design. We\'re looking for someone who can work quickly and efficiently, as the project has a tight deadline of less than one month.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested in this opportunity, please submit a proposal outlining your experience and how you can help with the project. Please also include links to some of your past completed projects that you feel are relevant to this job. We look forward to hearing from you!\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0190516885362fee02','-',7,'United States','Texarkana',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-05-19',1,'2023-05-19',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-19 13:08:42',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21251,'Design Logo and Business Card for Small Business',10,'Overview\r\nCreate eye-catching full-color business logo and business card for use on hard copy (e.g., business card, etc.) and digital (e.g., website, presentations, etc.).\r\n\r\nDeadline\r\nDeliver first drafts within 7 days of when you accept the contract. (Please do not consider this job unless you are confident you can meet this deadline.)\r\n\r\nRequirements and Qualifications\r\n• proficiency using InDesign\r\n• high-speed internet access for the duration of the project\r\n• past experience creating logos for a small business\r\n\r\nSpecific Instructions\r\n• Create the logo in full color.\r\n• Use client’s existing style guide which will be uploaded for you; no substitutions allowed\r\n• Review client’s (now finished but unpublished) website and get a feel for the target audience and products/services being offered.\r\n• Provide drafts of 5-8 concepts for the logo; revise and polish until approved\r\n• Business card should contain owner\'s name, email address, website address and the logo\r\n\r\nOther Considerations\r\n• Nothing clunky or casual; must be classy with appeal to business professionals\r\n\r\nRevisions\r\n• Be willing to provide unlimited revisions, but aim to finish within the first few rounds!\r\n\r\nDeliverables\r\nDeliver all drafts in PDF format.\r\n\r\nDeliver the approved design in both InDesign (zipped) package and PDF file\r\n• logo\r\n• business card\r\n• PDF of the approved file','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ac0bb29e25c59660','-',7,'United States','Herndon',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-05-19',1,'2023-05-19',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-19 13:10:31',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
