(21279,'CPA for small adventure tours company',39,'Looking for a CPA for ongoing help/advice for my small business. I have several entities, a CA based LLC, a CA based C corp registered in Delaware, and another LLC that I receive a K-1 from. Please also be well versed in crypto taxes. I would like to develop a relationship with a CPA who can help me moving forward with advice on tax planning/preparation, as well as input on the correct corporate structure for my business.\r\n\r\nId like to find a person/firm to take over all tax preparation/planning/filing for both taxes and other permits/forms needed to keep my companies in compliance. These include LLC statement of information, etc. I\'ve worked with a lot of freelancers on upwork, most great, some not so great, so Im going to include what is important to me/what my expectations are:\r\n\r\nYou\'ll show up on time to meetings\r\nYou\'ll set deadlines when work will be done, and you\'ll meet those deadlines without me checking on you\r\nI won\'t have to double check your work. You are the expert, I expect that your work will be correct the first time.\r\n\r\nIf these feel reasonable, please respond with a note on your experience with my form of business, as well as ballpark rates for all the items mentioned above. Id like to pay project rates that we agree on beforehand.\r\n\r\nThanks and looking forward to meeting you.\r\nIso','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1659604177373945857','-',7,'United States','san francisco',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-19',1,'2023-05-19',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-19 16:58:18',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
