(21282,'Remote Bookkeeper (QuickBooks Specialist)',39,'Job Title: Remote Bookkeeper (QuickBooks Specialist)\r\n\r\nJob Purpose:\r\nAs a Bookkeeper for our real estate brokerage, you will maintain our financial records, including managing accounts payable and receivable, reconciling bank statements, and leveraging QuickBooks for financial management and reporting. Your attention to detail and proficiency in QuickBooks will be integral to enhancing our financial processes.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n\r\nMaintain and record financial transactions in QuickBooks.\r\nPrepare and deliver monthly financial reports, including summary and detailed bank reconciliation reports, profit and loss statements, and balance sheets.\r\nReconcile bank statements and ledgers.\r\nHandle accounts payable and receivable, create invoices/estimates, and match receipts on a weekly basis.\r\nProcess payroll and contractors as needed.\r\nConduct regular audits to ensure accuracy.\r\nAssist in budget preparation and financial planning.\r\nRequired Skills and Qualifications:\r\n\r\nProven bookkeeping experience.\r\nSolid understanding of accounting principles.\r\nProficiency in QuickBooks.\r\nExceptional attention to detail.\r\nHonesty, self-sufficiency, and dependability.\r\nFamiliarity with Asana, Google Sheets, Slack, and Outlook. Experience with BrokerMint is a plus.\r\nDesired Experience:\r\n\r\nAt least two years of experience as a Bookkeeper, with a preference for experience in real estate brokerage.\r\nPrevious experience with QuickBooks.\r\nWork Environment and Schedule:\r\nThis is a fully remote role, requiring around 5 hours per week, with the potential for additional hours initially for QuickBooks setup and review. Join our driven, collaborative team and enjoy the flexibility and autonomy that remote work provides.\r\n\r\nTo apply, please include \"QB Bookkeeper\" in the subject line of your application.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1659605958165295105?success','-',7,'United States','Dallas',10.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-19',1,'2023-05-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-19 18:30:46',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
