(21288,'Consult and possibly help fix import transaction data in QB Desktop',39,'I am having very tiresome issues with QB Desktop Diamond edition. All I wanted was Assisted payroll on QB Desktop, and long story short, Assisted payroll could not be installed due to an unrecoverable error during setup. Intuit\'s Data Service Team wasn’t able to resolve the error either. We went back to Enhanced payroll but encountered more errors. We were then advised to start a new company file and import data into the new company file; however, while we were able to import a \"list,\" we could not import data transactions from the original company file.  We tried to export data on Excel, but QB does not seem to be able to read the Excel file during import.  QB support team couldn\'t figure out why we couldn\'t import the Excel data to the new company file.  I need an expert to get us through this new company file setup.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1659626425508372481','-',7,'United States','Hayward',60.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-19',1,'2023-05-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-19 18:38:36',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
