(21295,'Design a Shopify Site for an Athletic Apparel Brand',16,'We are 7Pacific, an athletic apparel company that inspires athletic confidence by providing the most lightweight and breathable training gear.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a Shopify expert to design the website that will sell training shirts for men. We have the following ready:\r\n- Logos\r\n- Final Tshirts\r\n- photoshoot complete\r\n\r\nNow we need to design the website. Here are some of the requirements:\r\n- We wish to have a product page that utilizes lifestyle imagery since our SKU count is small right now\r\n- a design that could be implemented on Desktop and mobile that can also be optimized for speed.\r\n- Help create detailed product descriptions\r\n- Info on how the product is made in the US (we will have pictures of the shirt being made in the factory)\r\n- Talk about our special material (it is 42.5% merino wool, 42.5% tencel, 10% nylon and 5% spandex. this is a very eco friendly and organic shirt)\r\n- Website should be simple but get across our message\r\n\r\nWe have ideas of where we want to use the photos, some colors, brand identity and are primarily looking for someone who can help materialize the vision.\r\n\r\nWe have attached pictures of the shirt and our logo for your reference.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to building this site with you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b55b62a939891650','-',7,'United States','Miami',70.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 09:11:50',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21296,'Create simple & minimal logo and svg animation',8,'So, i recently founded Konnekta (https://konnekta.nl) and build the website.\r\n\r\nThe name \'Konnekta\' is now on the website in text in the left corner of the website, which is fine. But for things like a favicon and logo on LinkedIn i need something of a logo. I need this logo to be in svg format since i will use it mainly on my website.\r\n\r\nI think something simple like the letter \'K\' and a refrence to a connection would be sufficient for now.\r\n\r\nIn addition i would like a simple animated svg to use on the website which explains how data flows from one service to another service through the Konnekta platform.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01903ae94ade77a116','-',7,'United States','Meppel',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 09:26:37',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21297,'Brand Identity Designer + NFT Design',2,'Budget is just a placeholder, the final rate will be determined individually with the candidate.\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for a Creative Designer/Artist to:\r\n1) reimagine current brand identity of our browser extension for security in Web3. This will include revamping the logo, brand style, all things visual, probably creating a mascot.\r\n2) modify the look of project\'s NFTs/tokens of appreciation.\r\n\r\nOur perfect candidate is creative and can provide non-trivial solutions, can research the competitors (the list of them will be provided) and understands the specifics of Web3 market (or will be able to research this) to create something in the spirit of this domain.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~019fc6cb8435c78c34','-',7,'United States','Lisbon',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 09:34:04',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21298,'Home Page only Webdesign Specialist',4,'This position specifically focuses on the design aspect of the home page. The job does not involve backend development or coding, but rather focuses on creating an engaging and visually pleasing user interface.\r\n\r\n\r\nDescription\r\nWe are seeking a skilled and creative Home Page Design Specialist to assist us in revamping the design of our main home page. As a Home Page Design Specialist, your primary responsibility will be to enhance the visual appeal and user experience of our website by focusing on redesigning the menu, footer, and content sections.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nCollaborate with the team to understand the existing website structure and design requirements.\r\nRedesign the menu layout to enhance usability and visual aesthetics.\r\nCreate a captivating and modern footer design that aligns with our brand identity.\r\nEnsure responsiveness and compatibility across different devices and screen sizes.\r\n.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience as a web designer or similar role, with a portfolio showcasing your design skills.\r\nStrong understanding of user experience (UX) principles and best practices.\r\nExcellent eye for aesthetics, attention to detail, and a keen sense of design trends.\r\nFamiliarity with responsive design principles and cross-browser compatibility.\r\nEffective communication skills and ability to collaborate with cross-functional teams.\r\nTime management skills to meet project deadlines and deliver high-quality designs.\r\n\r\n\r\nStarting date : ASAP\r\nWebsite : www.simply-jet.ch\r\nPLEASE PROVIDE A PORTFOLIO','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01d7d1e55b31407532','-',7,'United States','Swiss',30.000,'perhour',30.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 10:22:33',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21299,'Graphic designer for a new modern and visually appealing website',2,'Job Description:\r\nWe are seeking a skilled and experienced designer to help us develop a new website design for our business segment, pharmaceutical consulting company.\" As an European provider of pharmaceutical manufacturing and development services, we are looking for a designer who can create a modern, customer-focused, and premium-looking website that will help us stand out from the competition. No web development is needed.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n- Develop a new homepage design for our new pharmaceutical consulting company that is modern, elegant, and premium-looking while following our brand guidelines.\r\n- Previous experience in designing high-quality and customer-focused websites.\r\n- Strong knowledge of the latest trends and technologies in web development and software technology to ensure the website is modern and visually appealing.\r\n- Ability to use graphic design tools such as Photoshop, Figma, Sketch, or similar tools.\r\n- Excellent communication skills and ability to collaborate effectively with our team.\r\n- Create creatives such as animations, infographics, and graphical elements to enhance the website\'s appeal and help generate new leads.\r\n- Make sure the website is responsive and mobile-friendly.\r\n\r\nThis is a project-based contract for a designer who can help us develop the design (UI/UX) for the new pharmaceutical consulting company website. If you are interested and meet the above requirements, please submit your proposal, including your portfolio. Thank you for your interest in working with us!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0195167c0b5c4d8e1f','-',7,'United States','Lisbon',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 10:30:04',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
