(21305,'Provide bookkeeping services for property management and construction company',39,'Looking for a bookkeeper that knows property management inside and out. Familiarity with construction bookkeeping a plus. The core job responsibilities are:\r\n\r\nEnter transactions into Rent Manager on a daily basis and categorize them correctly.\r\nReconcile bank statements.\r\nCreate and review Owner Statements each month.\r\nRun monthly P & L and evaluate for accuracy.\r\n\r\nFamiliarity with Rent Manager a big plus. Must be familiar with property management bookkeeping software.\r\n\r\nMust have an advanced, working knowledge of accounting for the property management field.\r\n\r\nThis is a part time, average 10 hours per week, role. DO NOT APPLY IF YOU HAVE A FULL TIME JOB ELSEWHERE. Of course, you may have other clients, but you will not be able to do this job effectively if you have a full-time job for another company. I am looking for someone that can work through some messy bookkeeping when we only used our property management software for our own rentals. This means that there will be some cleanup work while keeping our books current.\r\n\r\nWould like to have someone that can grow into a full-time role as we grow. Can work with someone here in the U.S. or abroad but you must be willing to have meetings in mid-day U.S. time slots.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1660658829997334529','-',7,'United States','Irvine',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 14:49:26',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
