(21322,'Bookkeeper & Financial Analyst',39,'Seeking a highly skilled accounting and bookkeeping freelancer. You will need to be extremely fast in QBO and build complex excel models. We are looking for only the most skilled, organized individuals with great accounting knowledge. It will cover all aspects of the business from basic bookkeeping to financial management. This is a long-term assignment and highly rewarding. You will be working directly with the CEO.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities include:\r\n-Bookkeeping\r\n-Vendor/Client Email and Phone Communication\r\n-Liquidity Analyses\r\n-Ad Hoc Analyses\r\n-Collections\r\n-POS Management\r\n\r\n*Must be generally available during morning NYC hours, Monday-Friday. Available off hours if emergency or urgent situation.\r\n\r\n*Bonus if have experience in digital assets/crypto.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1660688790152908801','-',7,'United States','Greenwich',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 16:48:16',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21323,'Looking for support in bookkeeping/financial management',39,'We\'re looking for someone to help with receiving payments for our website through some specific gateways. We are already using some gateways, but for manual processing only.\r\n\r\nWe need help to receive payments using Paypal or Stripe. The freelancer should have a well established Paypal or Stripe account, which can receive up to $20000 per month without having limitation. We are also using our own Paypal account, but the payments have to be processed manually because the funds are held by Paypal for 21 days. We need well-established accounts which can receive funds without being held.\r\n\r\nWe will pay 2 - 3% of the overall monthly income that you receive. We can discuss the terms further during interview.\r\n\r\nLong term cooperation is expected.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1660691511745667073','-',7,'United States','Dong Da',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 16:58:56',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21324,'Bookkeeper/Accountant needed for new Amazon Wholesale FBA Business',39,'We are seeking a dedicated accountant to join our growing company.\r\n\r\nAs an accountant/ bookkeeper , you will create precise financial reports according to the business structure and IRS regulations\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nCreate and manage financial statements and dashboards\r\nCreate and file all necessary tax and financial forms for the company\r\nEnsure audits are completed promptly with a quality product\r\nAdvise best practices and optimizations throughout accounting processes\r\nCollaborate with finance personnel to develop approaches for creating more-accurate financial records and models for the company\r\nManage any and all audits on behalf of the company\r\nDetermine proper company filing schedule based on available information\r\nQuality-assure and audit reports and filings for errors\r\nImplement feedback and changes whenever possible\r\nCreate visualizations that convey accurate financial views of the project\r\n\r\nJob Qualifications and Skill Sets\r\n\r\nBachelor’s degree or higher in an accounting-related field\r\nProficiency in accounting software and bookkeeping programs such as QuickBooks Online and TurboTax\r\nExcellent written and verbal communication skills\r\nMinimum of two years experience in accounting, bookkeeping, or financial modeling\r\nStrong attention to detail\r\nStrong analytical skills\r\nTime management and organizational skills\r\nKnowledge of relevant tax laws\r\nBilingual: English & Spanish','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1660693675227721729','-',7,'United States','Salinas',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 17:07:31',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21325,'Nonprofit Accounting Bookkeeper Needed',39,'We are looking for a qualified bookkeeper to join our team for a 1 to 3-month project in the nonprofit sector. The ideal candidate will have experience in bank reconciliation, bookkeeping, data entry, and Quickbooks. Knowledge of nonprofit accounting practices is preferred.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities include reconciling bank statements, maintaining accurate financial records, tracking expenses, and preparing reports. The successful candidate will be detail-oriented, organized, and able to work independently.\r\n\r\nTo be considered, please submit a proposal outlining your relevant experience and how you can help with this project. Please include links to past completed projects that demonstrate your bookkeeping skills and experience in the nonprofit sector.\r\n\r\nWe offer a competitive hourly rate and the opportunity to work on a meaningful project that will make a difference in our community. If you are passionate about nonprofit accounting and want to be part of a dynamic team, we encourage you to apply.\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1660695233968168961','-',7,'United States','Upper Marlboro',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 17:13:29',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21326,'Transaction Management (Basic Book Keeping)2',39,'This is a simple task where we are looking for someone to log our unassigned transactions 1x per week. It should only take 15-20 minutes each week to log the transactions.\r\n\r\nWe will be happy to do a one on one tutorial to make sure the person is helping us is comfortable completing the task.\r\n\r\nWe will also ask that an NDA is signed since we will be providing login information.\r\n\r\nAny questions, please ask. Thank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1660689340582105089','-',7,'United States','Clymer',30.000,'fixed',30.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 17:29:07',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(21327,'Part time XERO bookkeeper for ecommerce brand',39,'About Us:\r\n\r\nWe are an online brand in the sleep niche, specializing in selling products that provide pain relief to our customers. Our mission is to provide high-quality, effective products that help people get the restful sleep they need to feel their best. We are a fast-growing company and are looking for a Part-Time Bookkeeper to join our team.\r\n\r\nAbout the Role:\r\n\r\nAs the Part-Time Bookkeeper, you will be responsible for managing the day-to-day financial operations of the business. You will work closely with the senior management team to ensure that financial records are accurate and up-to-date, and that the business is operating in a financially sound manner.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n\r\nManage the day-to-day financial operations of the business.\r\nRecord all financial transactions in a timely and accurate manner.\r\nReconcile bank accounts and credit card statements.\r\nPrepare financial reports, including profit and loss statements and balance sheets.\r\nManage accounts payable and accounts receivable.\r\nProcess payroll and ensure compliance with all relevant tax laws.\r\nEnsure that financial records are maintained in compliance with generally accepted accounting principles.\r\nAssist with budgeting and forecasting.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n3+ years of experience in bookkeeping or a related field.\r\nStrong understanding of generally accepted accounting principles.\r\nProficiency in Xero or a similar accounting software.\r\nExperience managing accounts payable and accounts receivable.\r\nStrong attention to detail and ability to maintain accurate financial records.\r\nExcellent communication and organizational skills.\r\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team.\r\nBachelor\'s degree in accounting or a related field preferred.\r\n\r\nThis is a part-time position, approximately 8 hours per week, with the potential for additional hours as the business grows. If you are a highly motivated Bookkeeper with a strong understanding of financial operations, we would love to hear from you. Please apply with your resume and cover letter to be considered for this exciting opportunity.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1660691490597986305','-',7,'United States','Kingston',15.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 17:30:13',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(21328,'Personal Bookkeeping',39,'I am looking for a skilled bookkeeper to help me manage my personal finances.\r\n\r\nThis would be a short-term project to get all my finances and financial records in order (starting Jan. 01, 2023), but I want to find someone to also work with long-term to constantly keep my records up to date (monthly, for example).\r\n\r\nI use Quicken for my own bookkeeping, but I rarely keep it up to date and this is causing me headaches with my year-end tax accounting, etc.  I would like to work with someone familiar with Quicken so I can also audit and edit all work as needed.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate will possess strong accounting skills, be proficient in bank reconciliation and have a working knowledge of Intuit Quicken and Microsoft Excel. The primary responsibility of this role will be transaction data entry, ensuring that all expenses and income are accurately recorded and reconciled on a monthly basis, providing monthly and annual statements, and taking care of year-end tax accounting.\r\n\r\nPlease submit a proposal outlining your experience with personal bookkeeping, your approach to managing clients\' personal finances, and your familiarity with the required software. I look forward to hearing from you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1660692205681696769','-',7,'United States','Delta',20.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 17:31:17',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(21329,'Book keeper',39,'We are seeking a detail-oriented and highly organized Bookkeeper to join our team. As a Bookkeeper, you will be responsible for maintaining accurate records, processing financial transactions, and providing essential support to our accounting department.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nMaintain and update financial records, including general ledgers, accounts payable and receivable, and bank reconciliations.\r\nProcess financial transactions, including invoices, payments, and expenses.\r\nReconcile discrepancies and resolve accounting issues.\r\nCollaborate with the accounting team to streamline financial processes and improve efficiency.\r\nMaintain confidentiality of financial information and protect sensitive data.\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nProven experience as a Bookkeeper or similar role, preferably with MYOB and or Xero.\r\nProficient in using accounting software and MS Office applications.\r\nIntermediate knowledge of accounting principles and practices.\r\nExcellent attention to detail and accuracy.\r\nStrong organizational and time management skills.\r\nEffective communication and interpersonal abilities.\r\nAbility to work independently and meet deadlines.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you are a dedicated and meticulous individual with a passion for numbers and financial accuracy, we invite you to apply for the position of Bookkeeper. Join our team and contribute to the financial success of our organization.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1660693673772298241','-',7,'United States','Nsw',5.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 17:32:13',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
