(21331,'Bookkeeping for Ecommerce business',39,'We are looking for an experienced bookkeeper to manage the bookkeeping for our ecommerce business for more than 6 months.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for someone who is able to catch up 7 months of books quickly and allocate enough time in the first 2 weeks of engagement to do so.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should have a strong background in accounting, accounting basics, bank reconciliation, bookkeeping, data entry, financial accounting, and Quickbooks.\r\n\r\nAs a bookkeeper, you will be responsible for recording all financial transactions, managing accounts payable and receivable, reconciling bank statements, generating financial reports, and ensuring accuracy of financial records.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for someone who is detail-oriented, organized, and able to work independently with minimal supervision.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this position, please submit a proposal outlining your experience and how you can help us with this project. Please include links to some of your past completed projects that showcase your bookkeeping skills.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you!\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1660698661422206977','-',7,'United States','Los Angeles',20.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 17:34:50',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(21332,'Bookkeeper Needed to Record Income & Expenses in Online platform',39,'We keep track of our Income and expenses in an online platform.  We are switching from one platform to another platform.\r\nWe need someone (Bookkeeper) to basically move data from old platform to new platform.  The amount of data is all of 1st quarter of 2023.\r\n\r\nWe will show you how to do it and then after you take over from there.\r\nThen after the move is complete, we may need you to input income and expenses for each and every month. we will send you all invoices and receipts via email or dropbox and your job wil be to make sure that they are properly added  in the right categories.\r\n\r\nThe whole objective is for us to keep track of our monthly income and expenses as well as VAT that needs to be paid to the German Tax authorities.  \r\n\r\nWe will forward all the info for each month to you which is in pdf files from ebay and amazon and you will need to put them into the online platform that does all the computations.\r\n\r\nWe need someone who pays attention to details and understands bookkeeping.\r\n\r\nWe would prefer someone who understands VAT  system in Europe.\r\n\r\nWhen applying for this job, please give the answer to this question at the begining of your application so that we know that you read the entire instructions.\r\nHow much data do we want you to move from old platform to new platform??  (2 word answer please)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1660704854899265537','-',7,'United States','Hamburg',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 17:57:59',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(21333,'QBO Bookkeeper',39,'We are looking for a skilled bookkeeper with expertise in Intuit QuickBooks to help manage our financial records. This project will last for more than 6 months, so we need someone who is committed and reliable.\r\n\r\nAs our QBO bookkeeper, you will be responsible for maintaining our financial records, including accounts payable and receivable, bank reconciliations, and generating financial reports. You should be highly organized and detail-oriented, with excellent communication skills.\r\n\r\nTo be considered for this position, please submit a proposal outlining your experience with bookkeeping and Intuit QuickBooks. Please include links to any past projects that demonstrate your ability to manage financial records effectively.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a candidate who can work independently and take ownership of this project. If you have experience in bookkeeping and a strong understanding of Intuit QuickBooks, we encourage you to submit a proposal and join our team.\r\n\r\nImmediate Need:\r\n- Complete 2022 opening entries\r\n- Close 2022 and add depreciation schedules and other tasks required for tax preparation\r\n\r\nOngoing:\r\n- Monthly book review and reconciliations\r\n- Answer questions as needed\r\n- Annual reconciliations, schedules, and closure\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1660707649654599681','-',7,'United States','Carmel',60.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 18:03:33',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(21334,'Bookkeeping',39,'Job Description:\r\nWe are a rental property management company seeking a detail-oriented and highly organized individual to assist with the preparation of depreciation schedules for our rental properties. This role primarily involves reviewing and categorizing receipts to identify items that can be separately depreciated. The successful candidate will play a crucial role in ensuring accurate and compliant financial reporting for our business.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nReview and analyze receipts, invoices, and expense documentation for various rental properties.\r\n\r\nIdentify and categorize items that qualify for separate depreciation according to the relevant tax laws and regulations.\r\n\r\nEnter and maintain accurate records of categorized items in our property management software or designated spreadsheet.\r\n\r\nCollaborate with the accounting team to ensure the accurate and timely completion of depreciation schedules.\r\n\r\nAssist with other property management tasks as needed.\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nProven experience in rental property management or a similar field, with a focus on financial analysis and depreciation schedules.\r\n\r\nExcellent attention to detail and organizational skills to accurately categorize and maintain records of depreciable items.\r\n\r\nProficiency in using spreadsheets to record and manage data.\r\n\r\nStrong analytical and problem-solving skills to identify and categorize depreciable items effectively.\r\n\r\nKnowledge of bookkeeping principles and practices is a plus.\r\n\r\nContract Details:\r\n\r\nThis is a remote, freelance position.\r\n\r\nThe initial contract will be for a specific project, with the possibility of extension based on performance and business needs.\r\n\r\nThe expected workload will vary depending on the volume of receipts and documentation requiring review.\r\n\r\nCompensation will be discussed individually, based on experience and agreed upon deliverables.\r\n\r\nIf you have the required skills and experience and are passionate about ensuring accurate financial reporting through proper depreciation schedules, we would love to hear from you.\r\n\r\nPlease submit your resume, along with a brief summary of your relevant experience, to be considered for this position.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1660713505232027649','-',7,'United States','Pueblo',20.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 18:27:18',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
