(21346,'Accountant with Zoho Books expertise',39,'Background:\r\n\r\nI’m a freelance consultant operating as a single member LLC. My company integrates 3rd party software applications with ERP systems. I subcontract to resources in the US and India to assist with project implementations at my clients.\r\n\r\nI use Zoho Books as my accounting system for all business related activity (purchases, sales, invoicing, etc.). My subcontractors are setup as users in my Zoho Books application and submit their timesheets and invoices related to the specific projects they are working on.\r\n\r\nRole Description and Requirements:\r\n\r\nI need general Zoho Books and Accounting assistance that would begin immediately with guidance related to specific open questions. My expectation is the candidate will perform as an advisor/consultant on a long term basis and provide ad hoc services. Candidates with the following skills / expertise will be prioritzed:\r\n\r\n1. Certified accountant (CPA, CFA, etc.) with US accounting and taxation expertise and experience with US / India subcontracting principles and accounting rules\r\n\r\n2. Zoho Books - Comprehensive hands on setup and configuration expertise related to all aspects of Zoho Books to ensure compliance with accounting principles. Expert ability to provide guidance based on thorough understanding of best practices regarding Zoho Books setup, including assessment of the current environment.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1660754281370324993','-',7,'United States','Decatur',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 21:15:09',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(21347,'Accountant / Bookkeeper',39,'We are looking for an experienced accountant/bookkeeper to assist our team with financial tasks for a 1 to 3-month project. The ideal candidate will have a strong understanding of accounting basics, balance sheets, bank reconciliations, and bookkeeping. Proficiency in Intuit QuickBooks and Quickbooks is required. Additionally, experience in data entry and attention to detail is a must.\r\n\r\nAs our accountant/bookkeeper, you will be responsible for maintaining accurate financial records, preparing financial statements, reconciling bank accounts, and assisting with other accounting tasks as needed. The successful candidate will be highly organized, self-motivated, and able to work independently.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this position, please submit a proposal with the message thanks 123 to know you have attention to detail, and outlining your experience and skills related to the job. Please include links to past completed projects that showcase your accounting and bookkeeping expertise. We look forward to hearing from you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1660761266461642753','-',7,'United States','Orlando',20.000,'perhour',25.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-22',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-22 21:45:21',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
