(21351,'Website Development and Maintenance',3,'We\'re among the top AI companies in Italy developing a full scale semantic platform for multi-modal content publishing and SEO.\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for an Web Development expert that will maintain our website by working with WordPress, Divi and WooCommerce. The candidate will join our marketing and product teams to develop modular Divi components for the website, will participate into reviewing mockups and implementing them. The candidate will also customize the WooCommerce onboarding flows to improve the general website experience.\r\n\r\nThe position is flexible with a minimum amount of monthly hours that can grow on behalf of the requirements and the candidate expertise and success.\r\n\r\nWe have workspaces in Rome and in Tel Aviv where you can join us, or work remotely. We can also help relocating to Rome if that\'s your interest. Our team is multicultural with more than 14 nationalities represented.\r\n\r\nOur product is used by some of the largest retailers in the world as well as publishing companies, public utilities and more.\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n* Minimum of 2 years of experience working with WordPress, Divi and WooCommerce\r\n* Excellent knowledge of WordPress\r\n* Strong ability to work effectively in a team environment\r\n* Produce high-quality, maintainable code\r\n* Proficient in English\r\n\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n* Collaborate with the marketing and product team to review the target KPIs, user experience design and mockups and their implementation\r\n* Participate in code reviews and provide constructive feedback to ensure high-quality code.\r\n* Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define and implement new features and enhancements.\r\n* Troubleshoot and debug issues, and propose effective solutions.\r\n* Stay up-to-date with the latest technologies and industry trends to continuously improve the development process.\r\n\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\n* Strong knowledge of WordPress, Divi and WooCommerce\r\n* Proficiency in web development technologies (HTML, CSS, JavaScript).\r\n* Experience with version control systems (Git) and collaborative development tools.\r\n* Excellent problem-solving skills and attention to detail.\r\n* Strong communication and teamwork abilities.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat We Offer:\r\n\r\n* Monthly budget for a package of hours (500 USD), budget will increase based on expertise and success\r\n* Flexible remote working. Or work at our workplaces in Rome or Tel Aviv\r\n* Freedom to make your mark on the role and influence our technical growth\r\n* Opportunity to work with a leading innovative team in AI and SEO\r\n* Yearly hackathon in Rome sponsored by the company\r\n\r\nIf you are a motivated and skilled Web Developer with a passion for working in a collaborative environment, we would love to hear from you.\r\n\r\nPlease submit your application, including your resume and portfolio, demonstrating your relevant experience and projects.\r\n\r\nNote: Only shortlisted candidates will be contacted.\r\n\r\nWe are an equal opportunity employer.\r\n\r\n\r\nAbout WordLift\r\n\r\nWordLift is a software tool that automates SEO (Search Engine Optimization) by analyzing and organizing the content published on the web. It leverages the power of artificial intelligence and semantic technologies to enhance the visibility and discoverability of online content.\r\n\r\n\r\nWordLift aims to democratize the use of semantic technologies for content promotion on the web, which has traditionally been limited to large companies. By offering its services through a Software as a Service (SaaS) model, WordLift provides accessible and user-friendly tools for individuals and businesses to optimize their online content.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe software analyzes the content of websites, identifying entities, concepts, and relationships within the text. It then generates structured data, such as RDFa and JSON-LD, which search engines can understand and use to improve the ranking and visibility of the content in search results.\r\n\r\n\r\nIn addition to SEO optimization, WordLift provides features for content enrichment, including the ability to create linked data graphs, add annotations, and generate internal and external links within the content. These features help users create richer and more interconnected content, improving the user experience and increasing engagement.\r\n\r\n\r\nOverall, WordLift empowers content creators and marketers to optimize their web presence, improve search engine rankings, and reach a wider audience by leveraging the power of semantic technologies and artificial intelligence.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0118dcaba5fcf4989d','-',7,'United States','Rome',500.000,'fixed',500.000,'2023-05-23',1,'2023-05-23',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-23 08:29:50',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
