(21359,'Brand naming',2,'Hello !\r\n\r\nWe are in search of a talented Branding Specialist & Naming Consultant to join our team. Your main task will be to create a distinctive brand name for our upcoming sports and coaching application, ensuring the brand name has an available URL and passes INPI (National Institute of Industrial Property) checks.\r\nMore detail will be provided if your offer is accepted.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n\r\nDevelop a unique, catchy, and memorable brand name that resonates with our sports and coaching app\'s mission and values.\r\nEnsure the selected brand name has an available URL for web presence.\r\nConduct thorough INPI checks to avoid potential conflicts with existing brands.\r\nParticipate in branding strategy discussions and contribute to the overall brand identity.\r\nProvide strategic insights and recommendations to effectively position the brand in the competitive market.\r\n\r\nAs we embark on this journey for the first time with new team members, we are seeking a project-based engagement rather than an hourly commitment.\r\n\r\nPlease note, due to the crowded market in sports and coaching, we believe that descriptive naming may be challenging. Thus, we welcome innovative and out-of-the-box approaches to our brand naming.\r\n\r\nThanks!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~013f3af7706096e65a','-',7,'United States','Paris',350.000,'fixed',350.000,'2023-05-23',1,'2023-05-23',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-23 10:56:24',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21360,'Website landing Page',4,'We are looking for a skilled web designer/developer to create a website landing page for our business \"Coco Homes\".\r\n\r\nNotes for Job:\r\n\r\n1. Coco Homes - A custom home company building homes with a holiday lifestyle approach \"Creating Paradise Called Home\"\r\n2. We have the logo in Adobe Illustrator files, colours etc\r\n3. We would like a Fantatsic landing page with the following only which will lead to a website later on.\r\n4. Page will have Logo in the Middle\r\n5. Photos of my jobs floating/sliding through below\r\n6. Contact details of Mark the director and stating we provide custom homes by appointment only.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe project will run for 1 to 3 months and the successful candidate will have expertise in Landing Page design, Usability Testing, Web Design, Web Development, and WordPress platform to be used.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should have a keen eye for design, be able to create a visually appealing and user-friendly website landing page, and proficient in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. We also require the candidate to have experience in conducting usability testing to ensure that the website is user-friendly and meets the needs of our target audience.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this job, please submit a proposal outlining your experience and how you can help with the project. We encourage you to include links to past completed projects that demonstrate your expertise in creating high-quality website landing pages.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you soon!\r\n\r\n\r\nI wish for this page to be a one off that is very unique. Look forward to some great candidates and open for unique ideas.\r\n\r\nSincerely, Mark Rogers','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~010e66b20bd89ebcbf','-',7,'United States','Spring Farm',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-05-23',1,'2023-05-23',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-23 11:27:29',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
