(21374,'Bookkeeper with Quickbooks experience',39,'We are looking for a Full-Time Accounting Clerk to support a Home and Commercial Restoration Services company based in Puerto Rico.\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nProven experience working focusing on Administrative Support specifically doing Data Management, Reporting, Documentation, and Overall Back-End and Operations Support\r\nQuickbooks experience\r\nA tech-savvy and someone who is comfortable managing different CRMs and Technical Tools applicable for the business such as Slack, Microsoft, Google Suite, etc.\r\nStrong Attention to Details is a Must\r\nCapacity and commitment to work 40 hours a week or more supporting clients following EST Timezone (or depending on business needs)\r\nProactive and Always Willing to Learn\r\nAbility to communicate clearly and professionally in English, both orally and in writing\r\nPassionate and displays a Strong Work Ethic\r\nEXTREMELY organized and INCREDIBLY calm under pressure\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nCreating, Managing and Updating Estimates for clients\r\nDocumentation and assistance in filling out forms as required\r\nOverall Back-End Support\r\nCollaborate with the client to ensure that the client is delighted with our services\r\nthrough timely and effective communication, delivery on deadlines, and stellar Administrative and Back-End support in relation to insurance\r\nDevelop and maintain positive working relationships with all team members to ensure100% client satisfaction','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661024002412044289','-',7,'United States','Quezon',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-23',1,'2023-05-23',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-23 15:00:00',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21375,'Label Design For Product Line',2,'We are looking for a skilled graphic designer to help us design labels and 3D mockups (template provided) for our upcoming product line. The ideal candidate should have experience in label and package design as well as proficiency in Adobe Illustrator, and should be able to make the labels in accordance to the guidelines provided.\r\n\r\nWe need to make a total of 115 labels and 115 3D mockups for 115 different products, each following a common concept.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTo be considered for this job, please submit a proposal outlining your experience in label and package design, your design process, and how you can help us achieve our goals.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011d527212d50994c7','-',7,'United States','Farmington',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-05-23',1,'2023-05-23',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-23 15:02:03',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
