(21377,'Bookkeeper',39,'We are a small company seeking a skilled and detail-oriented Bookkeeper to assist us in managing our financial records. As a Bookkeeper, you will play a crucial role in maintaining accurate and up-to-date financial information, ensuring our books are balanced, and providing us with a clear picture of our financial standing.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nPerform monthly bookkeeping tasks to ensure accurate and up-to-date financial records.\r\n\r\nReconcile bank statements and credit card transactions with our financial records.\r\n\r\nMaintain general ledger accounts and prepare journal entries as necessary.\r\n\r\nRecord and categorize financial transactions accurately and efficiently.\r\n\r\nProcess accounts payable and accounts receivable transactions.\r\n\r\nPrepare and submit monthly financial reports, including balance sheets,\r\n\r\nincome statements, and cash flow statements.\r\n\r\nAssist in the preparation of annual financial statements for tax purposes.\r\n\r\nCollaborate with our team to ensure proper recording of financial transactions and resolve any discrepancies.\r\n\r\nKeep track of expense receipts and ensure compliance with company policies and procedures.\r\n\r\nMaintain confidentiality and integrity of financial information.\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\nProven work experience as a Bookkeeper or similar role.\r\n\r\nProficiency in using QuickBooks is essential.\r\n\r\nSolid understanding of basic accounting principles and procedures.\r\n\r\nStrong attention to detail and accuracy.\r\n\r\nExcellent organizational and time management skills.\r\n\r\nEffective communication and interpersonal abilities.\r\n\r\nAbility to work independently with minimal supervision.\r\n\r\nKnowledge of small business accounting practices is preferred.\r\n\r\nAvailability to dedicate approximately 10 hours per month to our company\'s bookkeeping needs.\r\n\r\nPlease note that this is a remote position, and the selected candidate will work independently. While we do not require expertise in higher-level accounting functions such as forecasting, a strong foundation in bookkeeping principles and the ability to balance books accurately are essential for this role','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661026166224228353','-',7,'United States','Mountain View',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-23',1,'2023-05-23',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-23 15:08:36',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21378,'Design for new Combination Logo',10,'We are a new company specializing in coaching and interacting with athletes in a large sport, from beginners to elite athletes. We will be working across the world.\r\n\r\nJob process and payment\r\n-----------------------\r\nTo get the best result and get to choose between the best alternatives, we will accept 3 freelancers/agencies to \"do the work\".\r\n\r\nThese 3 will be chosen based on previous work and cover-letter (or other information we are given). No examples or tests of new logo for us will be accepted in this stage (we do not want consultans giving us \"free work\").\r\n\r\nThe three chosen will be paid $150 each for their initial work with our new logo. We will most likely want a couple of interactions and adjustment to each of the proposals. But we want to run this process fast.\r\n\r\nOf the 3, one logo will be chosen as the final result (with most likely a couple of adjustments). The designer of the chosen logo will be receiving a bonus of $300 (in addition to the initial $150). \"Offers\" to be paid less will not be accepted.\r\n\r\nTimeline\r\n-----------------------\r\nWe will be picking the 3 finalists on friday may 26th - and the final result we want to pick by the following friday, june 2nd.\r\n\r\nDeliverable\r\n-----------------------\r\n- Logo in vector and raster - must be able to open/edit in GIMP.\r\n- 3 versions; the abstract mark, the text/wordmark and the combined full logo.\r\n- placeholder in connection to the logo to enter a \"tagline\" (text has not been decided yet).\r\n\r\nIf you have very innovative ideas that you feel will be a good solution but does not adhere to all the \"rules\"; please feel free to submit anyway.\r\n\r\nGuideline for logo-creation\r\n-----------------------\r\nOverall: We need a \"fun\" and engaging logo - we want it to be used when promoting us on web, social media, print and merchandise (t-shirts etc.). It must be easily recognizable.\r\n\r\nName of company, website and other details will be given to the 3 contributors that are picked so that they can make real logo suggestions.\r\n\r\n\r\nColors/font\r\n-----------------------\r\nYou are free to choose both as you like.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01cbb5998d6734ff3f','-',7,'United States','Tanem',750.000,'fixed',750.000,'2023-05-23',1,'2023-05-23',1,'In Process.',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-23 15:14:52',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
