(21380,'Design initial logo & brand identity for a new startup',10,'We are seeking a talented and creative Graphic Designer to help us create our initial logo and brand identity. Our platform aims to help users learn to speak English fluently through engaging and interactive conversations with generative AI tutors.\r\n\r\nAs our designer, you will be responsible for creating a brand identity that reflects our company\'s values and mission. This will include designing a logo, selecting a color palette, and creating guidelines for typography and imagery.\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a long-term collaboration with the right candidate. If this initial job is completed exceptionally well, we\'d be thrilled to continue working with you for all our remaining graphic design tasks as we develop and expand. However the initial project scope is designed to be very short.\r\n\r\nWe\'re excited to find a designer who can help us establish a strong brand identity and look forward to reviewing your proposal.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0119696da09d4b9bdb','-',7,'United States','Siauliai',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-23',1,'2023-05-23',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-23 15:37:05',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
