(21405,'QuickBooks Implementation Expert',39,'We are a young real estate investment company with two rental properties in our portfolio. One of the properties is a four-plex with long-term tenants and the other is a single-family home rented on a short-term basis through Airbnb and Vrbo.   \r\n\r\nWe are looking for a Quick Books expert to help us automate and streamline our record-keeping currently based on Excel spreadsheets.   Our goal is to eliminate manual data entry by electronically importing transactions from bank accounts and credit cards every month.  We also need to be able to create invoices for tenants.  Finally, we need a full set of financial statements to help us track the business.\r\n\r\nThis position may evolve into a long-term position where you would be responsible for handling the monthly invoicing and reporting process.  To start, we are looking for someone who can help us get QuickBooks for two entities set up quickly.  \r\n\r\nAll candidates will need to provide examples of previously completed implementations and discuss any challenges faced in those projects and how those obstacles were overcome.   Please reach out if you\'re interested.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661048165010870273','-',7,'United States','Miami',800.000,'fixed',800.000,'2023-05-23',1,'2023-05-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-23 16:57:56',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
