(21414,'Find CPA to help with annual Taxes',39,'Hello - I am in need of help filing my annual taxes (married, filing jointly with wife who has a simple W-2 income).\r\n\r\nMy CPA just retired and so hoping to hand this over to someone else for future years including 2022 (filed an extension, so taxes are due Oct of 2023). I am based in Tennessee.\r\n\r\nI have a small business (sole proprietorship Ebay business) with myself as the only employee. I also have a list of 13 active investments (generating K1s), 11 of which are passive Real Estate investments, and 2 of which are standard Venture capital passive investments.\r\n\r\nMy prior accountant charged me $1,100 per year to file federal taxes (and one state return) so looking for something in that ballpark...maybe slightly more ($1200 to $1400??) due to the heft of entering all of the K1 data annually. I may need to file one or two more state returns related to the K1s.\r\n\r\nThe info for my business is pretty straightforward, so the only part that is a little more time consuming than a typical family return is the lengthy list of K1s.\r\n\r\nI have filed an extension for 2022, and so the taxes are due Oct 15, 2023. Hoping to complete everything in the next 30 days or so.\r\n\r\nHappy to send over past returns to give you an idea of what my returns look like.\r\n\r\nHope to chat at your convenience. Thanks!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661086011568721921','-',7,'United States','Franklin',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-23',1,'2023-05-23',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-23 19:07:00',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
