(21418,'Need help in LLC company formation and registration in US',38,'We are looking for a business consultant or a person with experience in corporate law who can help us in LLC company formation and registration in the US. The job length is expected to be between 1 to 3 months. We need someone who has relevant experience in Business Services, Corporate Law, Legal Consulting, Legal, Limited Liability Company, and Trademark.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should be able to guide us through the entire process of forming and registering an LLC company in the US. This includes selecting the state of incorporation with detailed pros and cons of each state, preparing the necessary legal documents, filing the paperwork, and meeting all other compliance requirements. Additionally, the candidate should be able to advise us on any trademarks or other legal matters related to our business.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a candidate who has a proven track record of successful LLC company formations and registrations in the US. Please submit your proposal, including your experience and relevant past projects. Links to completed projects will be highly appreciated.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661084113102995457','-',7,'United States','00',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-05-23',1,'2023-05-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-23 19:56:33',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(21419,'Accountant/Bookkeeper',39,'We an accounting firm who provides outsourced accounting services to our clients. We are not industry specific as our team comes from all backgrounds. We are looking for a bookkeeper/accountant who can join our team on a consulting basis to continue to help us fulfil on client work. This position will report directly to the Accounting Supervisor, but will also have the opportunity to work with our team of rock-star Controllers and CFOs.\r\n\r\nSome of the tasks will include, but not limited to:\r\n\r\nFull cycle accounts payable\r\nDaily/weekly/monthly reconciliation of bank and credit card accounts\r\nAccounts Receivable including the creation of invoices and proper recording of payments\r\nManagement of AP and AR aging\r\nCommunication with executives, team members, and external parties via Zoom meetings, Slack, Email, etc.\r\nMonth end close execution\r\nResponsible for the accuracy of the GL and sub-ledges\r\nEmail management and responses on behalf of the client accounting team\r\nUpdate weekly cash flow reporting\r\nCreate monthly financial packages\r\n\r\n\r\nOur expectations:\r\n\r\nArrive timely and dress appropriately for all scheduled and unscheduled meetings\r\nHighest level of attention to detail\r\nAbide by all internal and external deadlines\r\nDaily communication of open and completed tasks\r\nTeam player\r\nWillingness to go above and beyond what is asked of you\r\nDetailed records of how your time was spent by client and by task\r\nCreative problem solving abilities\r\nMake suggestions for efficiencies in processes\r\n\r\nJob Requirement:\r\n\r\nFluent in written and spoken US English\r\nWorking hours in US timezone\r\nReliable internet\r\nWebcam for video calls\r\n\r\n\r\nSoftware Requirements:\r\n\r\nQuickBooks Online and/or QuickBooks Desktop\r\nTrello\r\nSlack\r\nZoom/Google Meets/Microsoft Teams\r\nG-Suite (Gmail, Calendar, Sheets, Docs, etc)\r\nMicrosoft Excel','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661098682576756737','-',7,'United States','San Diego',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-23',1,'2023-05-23',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-23 19:56:46',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
