(21421,'Accounting system and bookkeeping for business and personal finances',39,'I have two real estate holding entities that I am looking for bookkeeping and accounting system expertise for help with. I also am looking to create a personal accounting system in quickbooks to track and manage expenses and set budgets for my personal life.\r\n\r\nThe first business is for The Little Daisy Jerome Estate (www.thelittledaisyjerome.com). This is a historic mansion we have turned into a venue space with overnight accommodations. I currently have a small staff, and new exclusive partnership with a venue management co that is beginning to market, sell, and design unique events from Weddings, Brand events, and vacation rentals in the 3 properties that make up the estate. This has been an evolving project and our flow of accounting and bookkeeping needs has shifted as the project has evolved. It may continue to shift more as we move deeper into this exclusive partnership and learn the nuances of how we best work together. I am also looking for assistance with Payroll taxes and nuances related to having in house employees.\r\n\r\nThe second business (NAZ Investements LLC) is now very simple and does not have that many transactions. This company holds two \"airbnb\" condo units in the same duplex and has a property manager/host. There are monthly revenue statements and payouts that come in from the property manager. The property manager is responsible for marketing the property, managing maintenance, and hosting the guests. They are Airbnb hosts and not a traditional property management company.  This same entity/company also currently holds 4 Limited partner interests in other commercial real estate and one business. It receives quarterly distributions from these limited partner interests and they are passive as we have no involvement in operations. In the future I will look to add additional propertys and/or investments in other real estate projects into this holding entity. This entity has also evolved drastically overtime but is now simply an investment entity that holds its own real estate and other Limited Partner interests.\r\n\r\nThirdly, I want to use quickbooks to track my personal finance and get it organized.\r\n\r\nSo far I am familiar with and use Bill.com and Quickbooks for all accounting and business needs. I have been slowly refining a system to capture receipts, invoices, complete payroll, bookkeeping, and pay bills.\r\n\r\nI need someone to look at what is in place and help come up with solutions to optimize and systematize all further as needed. It should be a simple system. I am looking for guidance on creating/managing the overall system to accurately and efficiently.\r\n\r\nThere will be ongoing bookkeeping work as we work together. I am looking to create a relationship with someone to assist and work on all 3.\r\n\r\nI have been working with a fractional CFO but a lot of this work does not make sense for the CFO to work on. We can use him as resource and help with questionable uncategorized transactions that we are not sure how best to categorize.\r\n\r\nThe CFO currently sends our business accounting things as needed to my CPA that prepares my taxes.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661094996898488321','-',7,'United States','Phoenix',50.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-23',1,'2023-05-23',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-23 19:58:30',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
