(21443,'Stellar Book keeper needed for multiple businesses',39,'You will be managing several US business and personal bank accounts, and credit cards, manage deposits and expenses, payroll, and tax planning.\r\nRecording Financial Transactions: Enter and categorize financial transactions, such as sales, purchases, expenses, and payments, into the accounting system.\r\n\r\nAccounts Payable: Process invoices, verify accuracy, and schedule payments to vendors and suppliers.\r\n\r\nAccounts Receivable: Generate customer invoices, track payments, follow up on overdue accounts, and reconcile customer accounts.\r\n\r\nBank Reconciliation: Compare bank statements with accounting records to ensure accuracy and identify any discrepancies.\r\n\r\nPayroll Processing: Calculate employee wages, deduct taxes and benefits, prepare and distribute paychecks, and handle payroll tax filings.\r\n\r\nFinancial Reporting: Generate and analyze financial reports, such as balance sheets, income statements, and cash flow statements, to provide insights into the organization\'s financial health.\r\n\r\nGeneral Ledger Maintenance: Maintain the general ledger by posting journal entries, reconciling accounts, and ensuring accuracy of financial data.\r\n\r\nExpense Tracking: Monitor and track expenses, review receipts, and categorize expenses for accurate record-keeping and budgeting.\r\n\r\nTax Preparation: Assist in gathering financial data and documentation for tax filings, working collaboratively with accountants or tax professionals.\r\n\r\nRecord Retention: Ensure proper storage and maintenance of financial records and documents in compliance with legal and regulatory requirements.\r\n\r\nFinancial Analysis: Analyze financial data to identify trends, variances, and areas for improvement, and provide recommendations to management.\r\n\r\nCommunication: Collaborate with team members, communicate financial information to stakeholders, and work with external parties, such as auditors or tax authorities, as needed.\r\n\r\nExcel, Quickbooks, ADP knowledge is required.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661376031800004609','-',7,'United States','-',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-24',1,'2023-05-24',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-24 14:18:59',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21444,'Senior Bookkeeper',39,'We are looking for a skilled bookkeeper to join our team for a long-term project lasting more than 6 months. The ideal candidate should have experience in accounts payable, accounts receivable, bank reconciliation, balance sheet, bookkeeping, Microsoft Excel, and Intuit QuickBooks.\r\n\r\nAs a bookkeeper, you will be responsible for maintaining accurate financial records, preparing monthly financial statements, reconciling accounts, and managing accounts payable and receivable. You should be detail-oriented, organized, and able to work independently.\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit a proposal outlining your experience and how you can help us with this project. Please include links to any relevant past projects you have completed. We are looking for someone who can start immediately and commit to working with us for the duration of the project.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you and potentially working together to ensure the success of our financial operations.\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661377731520729089','-',7,'United States','Newport Beach',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-24',1,'2023-05-24',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-24 14:25:42',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
