(21454,'Looking for book keeping person who can log expenses',39,'We are looking for an experienced bookkeeping professional who can help us with logging expenses for our business. The ideal candidate should have a strong understanding of bookkeeping principles and be able to accurately maintain financial records. This project is expected to last for more than 6 months and we require someone who can commit to working with us for the duration of the project.\r\n\r\nAs the bookkeeping person, you will be responsible for maintaining accurate and up-to-date records of all financial transactions. This will include logging expenses, tracking income and managing accounts payable and receivable. We require someone who is detail-oriented, organized and able to work independently.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this position, please submit a proposal outlining your experience in bookkeeping and how you can help us with this project. Please include links to past completed projects that showcase your bookkeeping skills. We look forward to hearing from you!\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661395332049244161','-',7,'United States','iselin',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-24',1,'2023-05-24',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-24 15:35:30',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
