(21456,'Web Graphic Designer',4,'Integrated Digital Strategies is a premier U.S.-based digital marketing firm with over 10 years of experience in delivering nationwide campaigns for franchise and multi-location brands. We work with franchisors and their franchisees to provide customized digital marketing services that are proven to drive franchisee sales through a robust local and national digital strategy.\r\n\r\nIDS is seeking a client-facing Web Site Designer to oversee the entire life cycle of web design projects from the inception stage to delivery. This individual will work closely with the web project manager, developers, content creators, account managers, and external stakeholders.\r\n\r\nExpected to be available between the working hours of 8:30 am - 5:00 pm ET to meet with the Web Project Manager, Account Managers, and clients.\r\n\r\n+++ Please provide a link to your online design portfolio +++\r\n\r\nPlease note: All of our websites are lead-generation WordPress websites. We do NOT develop any e-commerce websites.\r\n\r\nSo we are looking for someone that has experience with CRO to help push the site visitor further down the conversion funnel with their design elements and layouts.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities\r\n+ Oversee design project from conception to delivery\r\n+ Estimate and plan creative work to ensure project profitability\r\n+ Perform project research and discovery sessions to develop creative briefs\r\n+ Prioritize and manage multiple projects within design specifications and budget restrictions\r\n+ Designing the overall layout and aesthetic for websites\r\n+ Communicate design ideas using user flows, process flows, site maps, and wireframes\r\n+ Designing visual imagery for websites, display ads, infographics, landing pages, print collateral and ensuring that they are in line with branding for clients\r\n+ Meeting with clients to review website mockups or refine their designs\r\n+ Stay up-to-date with industry developments and tools\r\n+ Working with Account Managers to manage client expectations\r\n+ Performs other duties as assigned by management\r\n\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n+ Minimum of 5 years of professional design experience, preferably at a digital agency or in-house Web team\r\n+ Ability to convey concepts and give design direction through layouts and effective written and verbal communication\r\n+ Hands-on experience with image editing software, like + Photoshop and Adobe Illustrator\r\n+ Proficient in design software (e.g. Figma, InDesign, Balsamiq)\r\n+ Strong aesthetic skills with the ability to combine v various colors, fonts, and layouts\r\n+ Attention to visual details\r\n+ Excellent visual design skills\r\n+ Ability to meet deadlines and collaborate with a team\r\n+ Demonstrated experience managing and leading multiple concurrent projects\r\n+ Well-developed communication skills with a focus on clear, intentional, friendly written and verbal communication\r\n+ Hands-on experience with project management software such as Teamwork, Monday, Asana, or similar\r\n+ Communicates effectively and is comfortable leading internal and external meetings\r\n+ Demonstrates excellent time-management, organization, and problem-solving skills\r\n+ High attention to detail and accuracy\r\n+ Ability to work in a fast-paced environment\r\n+ You exude positivity','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~012749fe43108f5fa7','-',7,'United States','Amesbury',40.000,'perhour',40.000,'2023-05-24',1,'2023-05-24',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-24 15:43:56',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
