(21461,'Need A Homepage Banner Made For My Website',14,'I represent Dankleafs.com, and we are currently seeking a talented graphic designer to assist us in revamping our homepage banner. Our current design no longer aligns with our desired style, and we are eager to create a new banner that prominently showcases our best-selling products. We envision a sleek, urban-style homepage that authentically reflects the essence of our brand.\r\n\r\nAs a graphic designer, you will play a vital role in capturing the unique identity and aesthetic of our brand. We value creativity, attention to detail, and the ability to translate our vision into visually compelling artwork. Your expertise will help us create an engaging and visually captivating homepage that resonates with our target audience.\r\n\r\nIf you are passionate about graphic design, possess a keen eye for aesthetics, and are excited to collaborate with a dynamic team, we would love to hear from you. Join us in shaping the visual narrative of Dankleafs.com and making a lasting impact on our online presence.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ac002c7f6a8fa604','-',7,'United States','Kissimmee',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-24',1,'2023-05-24',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-24 16:15:42',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
