(21466,'Quickbooks Online Accounting Audit',39,'Online production company looking for professionally trained accountant/CPA to audit our 2021 Quickbooks Online account to present. We are looking for an expert who know US tax law and accounting standards. The audit will include our balance sheet (looking specifically at cleaning up accounts for US tax compliance) as well as reconciling our bank checking account from 12/21 to present. We DO NOT need monthly reconciliation but need to get put on the right track and then reviewed periodically as needed. We are looking for an honest long-term advisor that can work as a team with our US-based tax accountant. We have had a disappointing experience with a previous outsource firm and will only consider professionally trained individuals. Please see the attached screenshot to see scope of work. We are open to hourly or flat fee. Proposals without a specific price will be deleted. No agencies.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661414517030621185','-',7,'United States','Bothell',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-24',1,'2023-05-24',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-24 16:51:44',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
