(21469,'Bookkeeper / Quickbooks Online / Inventory Forecasting',39,'We\'re an ecommerce company that helps people solve health challenges. We sell digital courses and physical goods. Our team is 100% remote and located all around the world.\r\n\r\nWe\'re hiring a bookkeeper to close & reconcile our monthly books, track & forecast inventory needs, prepare info for the tax accountant, and other financial & operational tasks that arise.\r\n\r\nOur outgoing bookkeeper worked with us for ~4 years. You will take over all processes (and keep improving on them). We run everything on QBO. The role is around 5 hours per month.\r\n\r\nWe will review applications on May 30. Then the next step will be a short interview with the final candidates.\r\n\r\n================\r\nYour deliverables\r\n================\r\n\r\n- On QBO, reconcile the books each month\r\n\r\n- track & forecast inventory needs each month. This is done via Google Sheets.\r\n\r\n- in October each year, prepare info for the tax accountant to do the annual tax prep\r\n\r\n- other finance, operations, or spreadsheet needs that arise\r\n\r\n- if/when we need to meet, you must be able to meet between 10a - 2p USA central time.\r\n\r\n================\r\nWhat to include in your application\r\n================\r\n\r\nPlease answer the following questions:\r\n\r\n1. How many USA clients have you worked for in the past 30 days?\r\n\r\n2. How many USA business accountants have you worked with?\r\n\r\n3. What is your hourly rate so we know how much it will cost to work with you?\r\n\r\n4. Describe 1 or 2 inventory tasks/processes that you have handled for clients.\r\n\r\n5. Describe 2 projects you\'ve done with Google Sheets. Help us understand your expertise.\r\n\r\n6. Add \"IAMAWESOME\" as the very first word of your application, so we know you read this.\r\n\r\n7. What else should we know about you? What makes you a great candidate for an ecommerce company?','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661412098290933761','-',7,'United States','Claymont',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-24',1,'2023-05-24',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-24 17:12:25',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
