(21471,'Bookkeeper needed to setup and update records',39,'We are seeking a highly skilled and detail-oriented individual to join our team as a QuickBooks Specialist and Monthly Accountant. In this role, you will be responsible for setting up QuickBooks software for our organization and providing ongoing accounting support on a monthly basis. Your expertise in QuickBooks and proficiency in accounting principles will be instrumental in maintaining accurate financial records and ensuring compliance with regulatory standards.\r\n\r\nMain objective: Get quickbooks set up so that all business accounting is being properly tracked in quickbooks to simplify filing business taxes next year.\r\n\r\nSecondary Objective: Monthly balance the books to keep quickbooks uptodate.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661417204799537153','-',7,'United States','00',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-24',1,'2023-05-24',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-24 17:17:08',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(21472,'Bookkeeper',39,'Company Description\r\nVroom Media Mission: “To revolutionize life insurance marketing agencies and how people work.”\r\nWe not only consistently deliver the best results for our clients, but we also prioritize building a one-of-a-kind working experience for our team. We are 100% remote, and we encourage employees to work from anywhere in the world.\r\n\r\nWe believe that our company is most productive when our employees are fulfilled, challenged and working to achieve both their personal and professional goals, instead of putting one on hold for the sake of the other.”\r\n\r\nJob Description\r\n\r\nAs an Bookkeeper you will be assisting our CEO and Founder in handling the bookkeeping for the company. Typical duties include managing bank and general ledger reconciliations as well as payroll processing. Other functions include performing month end closing, tracking fixed assets and preparing the trial balance. Bookkeepers will have experience with Wave Accounting software, additionally it will require some excel skills.\r\n\r\nQualifications / Skills Needed\r\n\r\n- Most important is a positive attitude -- you see client dissatisfaction as an opportunity, not a burden\r\n- Strong interpersonal, verbal, and written communication skills in English. This is a must.\r\n- Self-starter -- you are comfortable working 100% remotely, managing projects and meetings deadlines without direct supervision\r\n- Driven, competitive, and confident with coaching others and setting expectations\r\n- Strong attention-to-detail, time-management, and organizational skills\r\n- At least a basic knowledge of digital advertising fundamentals, with a keen interest in learning more\r\n- Ability to multitask and prioritize under ever-changing needs and schedule\r\n- Coachable -- you are willing to participate in ongoing training and constantly push yourself to get better and better\r\n- Team player -- you are able to collaborate with a small team, ask for help when needed, and delegate tasks\r\n- Proactive -- you strive to get ahead of a problem, instead of waiting for it to become a full-blown fire','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661421758056267777','-',7,'United States','Thornhill',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-24',1,'2023-05-24',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-24 17:20:57',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
