(21484,'Creative Logo Designer for Veteran Owned Small Business',10,'Title: Creative Logo Designer Wanted for Veteran-Owned Business\r\nDescription: We are a small veteran-owned business (VOSB) specializing in energy conservation systems, and we\'re looking for a talented logo designer to create a unique and captivating logo for our brand, the Powerhouse. The logo should strike the perfect balance between a patriotic theme and a strong emphasis on energy conservation.\r\nKey Requirements:\r\n• A creative and experienced logo designer with a portfolio showcasing their skills and previous logo designs.\r\n• Ability to incorporate a patriotic theme, representing a strong connection to the U.S. government and military.\r\n• Strong understanding of energy conservation concepts, translating them into a visually appealing logo.\r\n• Attention to detail and a keen eye for design aesthetics.\r\n• Open to revisions and collaboration throughout the design process.\r\nAbout Our Business: At our veteran-owned business, we pride ourselves on providing top-notch energy conservation systems that contribute to a stronger government and military. Our flagship product, the Powerhouse, combines cutting-edge technology with our commitment to reducing energy consumption, ultimately saving the U.S. government money and resources.\r\nLogo Design Guidelines:\r\n• The logo should exude a strong, masculine \"warrior\" feel while symbolizing energy conservation.\r\n• Incorporate patriotic elements such as the American flag, stars, or other national symbols.\r\n• Colors should reflect a sense of strength, patriotism, and energy efficiency.\r\n• Strive for a clean, modern design that conveys professionalism and reliability.\r\nHow to Apply: If you are a talented logo designer who can capture the essence of our brand, we would love to hear from you. Please submit your proposal through Upwork, including a link to your portfolio, relevant experience, and an estimated timeframe to complete the logo design.\r\nWe look forward to working with a passionate designer who shares our vision of combining patriotism and energy conservation to strengthen the U.S. government and military.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~012932babf4bbea9af','-',7,'United States','Niceville',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-24',1,'2023-05-24',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-24 19:27:15',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
