(21486,'Bookkeeper for 4 Entities',39,'Hi, I own 4 business entities, and a few months ago I lost my in-house bookkeeper. I hired a new one, and they need some additional help.\r\n\r\nWhat I need right now is someone who is excellent at bookkeeping and can come in and update my books, cash flow, inventory spreadsheets to be up-to-date for the end of the year.\r\n\r\nI need someone who can learn the whole process and help develop training videos. I\'m going to be using 2 part time bookkeepers alternating between 2 sets of books.\r\n\r\nI would like someone who I could work with long-term to provide bookkeeping, auditing, additional support, spreadsheet updating, and tax filing as needed for my personal returns, state returns, and business federal returns.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for someone who is a really good bookkeeper. I need someone who can file taxes, catch-up on my books for the year, just the way I like them.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for:\r\n1. A reasonable hourly rate from someone who doesn\'t ahve to be a CPA.\r\n2. A single person who can learn the ins-and-outs of my business\'s books.\r\n3. Someone who can file state, federal, and other taxes or audit that they were filed.\r\n4. A bookkeeper who can use Quickbooks online.\r\n5. A bookkeeper who is willing to break out businesses by channels using the class feature in QBO.\r\n6. A bookkeeper who is willing to support learning and implementing our cash flow forecasting spreadsheets to help us plan for cash availability across multiple bank accounts.\r\n\r\nMain Tasks\r\n- Monthly Bookkeeping alternating between businesses with our current bookkeeper.\r\n- Transaction Auditing and Support\r\n- Updating Cash Flow spreadsheet, inventory spreadsheets monthly and other financial spreadsheets as needed.\r\n- Video recording for creating training videos and documenting company processes.\r\n- Consolidate One Entity Books into another so we can reduce the number of Quick Books accounts we use. We\'ll need to bring over a full year\'s of books.\r\n\r\nExpectations\r\n- 24 hr response to inquiries (Monday-Friday)\r\n- Deadlines will be set for work products and agreed upon deadlines will be kept.\r\n- 24 hr Response for small changes (Monday-Friday)\r\nNotification in advance of any times you will not be available to respond within 24 hours (holidays) or meet a deadline. Also, notification in advance if you are sick and will not be able to hit a deadline. When a deadline is missed we\'ll re-negotiate any deadlines and try to resolve difficulties that prevented hitting the deadline.\r\n- Weekly updates on the project with drafts submitted to show progress.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661423654961713153','-',7,'United States','Fort Worth',15.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-24',1,'2023-05-24',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-24 19:33:44',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
