(21491,'Suicide Loss Nonprofit Seeking Logo Animation Freelancer to animate our logo',8,'We are a nonprofit organization focused on supporting individuals who have experienced the loss of a loved one to suicide. We\'re seeking a skilled freelancer to create an animated logo for us, based on already-existing artwork and detailed directions from our graphic designed.\r\n\r\nWe need this project completed ASAP -- no later than June 3, and sooner if possible -- as we plan to use the animation for our annual fundraising campaign. The logo will also be used across various digital platforms, including our website, social media channels, and email communications.\r\n\r\nOur graphic designer has laid out the (ATTACHED) Logo Animation Storyboard and Deliverables. I am also attaching the story behind the logo to give you a sense of how meaningful this project is. This is our 15th Anniversary year.\r\n\r\nI have not worked with a logo animator before, so am not 100% sure of the skills needed. I would think the ideal candidate has experience in animation and graphic design, specifically 2D animation -- and anything else needed to bring our logo to life as requested. Our designer can also walk you through the project to make sure everything is clear and you have what you need.\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for someone skilled, detail-oriented, passionate, and able to work independently to meet deadlines. A plus if you are touched by our mission. If you\'re interested in this project, please submit a proposal. We\'d love to see examples of similar projects you\'ve completed in the past, so please include links to your portfolio or relevant work samples.\r\n\r\nThis project has a duration of less than a week, so we\'re looking for someone who can start right away and deliver high-quality work on time.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~011d1fd4189f7cea31','-',7,'United States','Evanston',42.000,'perhour',42.000,'2023-05-24',1,'2023-05-24',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-0