(21492,'Bookkeeping',39,'We are seeking a skilled bookkeeper to assist with our financial record-keeping and reporting. The ideal candidate will have experience with accounting basics, accounts payable, accounts receivable, balance sheets, bank reconciliation, data entry, Microsoft Excel, and Quickbooks. This is a long-term project spanning more than 6 months, and we require someone who can commit to regular updates and communication.\r\n\r\nAs the bookkeeper, you will be responsible for accurately recording and categorizing all financial transactions, reconciling bank and credit card statements, and preparing financial reports as needed. We are looking for a detail-oriented individual with a strong work ethic and the ability to work independently.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this position, please submit a proposal outlining your experience with bookkeeping and how you can help with this project. Please include links to any past completed projects that demonstrate your expertise in this area. We look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661470006290919425','-',7,'United States','-',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-24',1,'2023-05-24',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-24 20:32:19',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21493,'Project logo design',10,'Hi!\r\n\r\nI am Bálint, the lead developer of a project related to Explosive ordnance disposal training and combat support.\r\nWe started off as a team working together in free time to create something new that can help in EOD training and live missions. Soon the project will reach the point where it can no longer be just a free time project. As such we are planning to create a company based on the technology, but first we are currently working on establishing the project\'s base, and advertising it.\r\n\r\nSo in short, we need a catchy logo for a project, that is related to VR/AR technology, explosive ordnance disposal and military. We already have kind of a color palette and a name \"Project Shadow\". I marked this job as intermediate, because I want to have a professional logo in the end, but to achieve that some specific knowledge is required. (Related to military, especially EOD and virtual technology. Also existing portfolio is required.)\r\n\r\nIf you feel yourself confident, and think you have the required knowledge and skills, feel free to apply with your prices. (the current one is just a place holder.)\r\n\r\nNote: NDA contract can be required, which will be signed upon reaching an agreement.\r\n\r\nFurther details in personal contact.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1651541715744567297','Bálint | Project Logo Design | Alex',175,'United States','Orbottyan',50.000,'fixed',50.000,'2023-05-22',1,'2023-05-24',1,'na',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-05-24 21:01:31','2023-05-25 13:35:27',18,3,NULL,156),
