(21503,'Creative Logo Designer Needed for E-Commerce Company',10,'We are looking for an experienced and talented logo designer to create a unique and eye-catching logo for our company. The ideal candidate should have a strong portfolio of logo designs and a deep understanding of branding and visual identity concepts.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n* Work closely with our team to understand the company\'s vision and values, as well as our target audience.\r\n* Develop an original and memorable logo concept that accurately represents our roofing business and appeals to our clientele.\r\n* Present multiple logo design options for review and iteration.\r\n* Provide final logo files in various formats (vector, JPEG, PNG) and color variations (full color, grayscale, black and white).\r\n* Ensure the logo design is scalable and adaptable for different use cases, such as print materials, digital platforms, and signage.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n* Proven experience as a logo designer with a strong portfolio showcasing diverse logo designs.\r\n* Excellent understanding of branding and visual identity principles.\r\n* Proficiency in design software, such as Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, or similar tools.\r\n* Strong communication skills and ability to receive and incorporate feedback.\r\n* Detail-oriented, creative, and able to meet deadlines.\r\n* Knowledge of the roofing industry or experience in designing logos for construction/home improvement businesses is a plus.\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit:\r\n\r\n* Your updated portfolio showcasing your logo design work.\r\n* A brief description of your design process and how you would approach this project.\r\n* An estimated timeline for completion of the logo design.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to reviewing your application and potentially collaborating with you to create a standout logo for our company!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1652975919480926209','Thomas | Logo | Alex',176,'United States','Florence',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-16',1,'2023-05-25',1,'na',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-05-25 13:38:47','2023-05-25 14:01:37',18,3,NULL,156),
(21504,'Bookkeeper needed to manage small business accounting',39,'Join the growing team at Resi, the multifamily marketing platform!\r\n\r\nWe are seeking a detail-oriented Bookkeeper to manage our company\'s financial processes. This role involves managing accounts receivable, including maintaining consistent communication with clients about payments, tracking and reconciling client account balances, and issuing necessary documentation like W9s.\r\n\r\nThe Bookkeeper is also responsible for sending invoices to clients as requested by account managers, managing communication, setting up accounts, and ensuring invoices are properly inputted into the client systems.\r\n\r\nPayment receipt is a crucial part of the role, involving recording payments from diverse sources such as checks, ACH/Wire Transfers, and Stripe, ensuring all payments are deposited into the appropriate bank accounts, and reconciling these deposits and payments in Xero.\r\n\r\nMoreover, the Bookkeeper is responsible for paying all contractors, which involves reviewing and entering invoices each pay period. This role demands a high level of accuracy, excellent organizational skills, and a strong understanding of accounting and bookkeeping principles.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities and Duties:\r\n\r\n- Maintain accurate financial records by recording all day-to-day financial transactions.\r\n- Verify, allocate, and post transactions to appropriate ledgers or accounting software.\r\n- Reconcile all business transactions, ledgers, and accounts to ensure their accuracy.\r\n- Carry out bank reconciliation, prepare and submit weekly/monthly reports.\r\n- Manage accounts payable and receivable, promptly addressing any irregularities.\r\n- Assist in the preparation of financial statements like balance sheets and income statements.\r\n- Assist in budget preparation and expense management activities for future needs.\r\n- Enter invoices in necessary systems for prompt payment.\r\n\r\nQualifications:\r\n\r\n- Proven bookkeeping experience with a solid understanding of accounting and bookkeeping principles.\r\n- Proficiency in Google Business Suite, and experience with accounting software such as Xero or QuickBooks.\r\n- Data entry skills along with a knack for numbers.\r\n- High degree of accuracy and attention to detail.\r\n- Ability to manage multiple tasks and meet deadlines.\r\n- Good verbal and written communication skills.\r\n- Knowledge of local, state, and federal tax requirements and regulations.\r\n\r\nThis position will communicate directly with the founder, as well as respond to invoicing requests and questions from account managers.\r\n\r\nEqual Opportunity:\r\nWe are an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.\r\n\r\nNote: This job description is not designed to cover or contain a comprehensive listing of activities, duties or responsibilities that are required of the employee for this job. Duties, responsibilities and activities may change at any time with or without notice.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661729223106924545','-',7,'United States','Boca Raton',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-25',1,'2023-05-25',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-25 13:42:45',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
