(21506,'Branding for a crypto casino',2,'We are seeking a skilled branding and graphic designer to help us create a unique brand identity for our upcoming crypto casino. The ideal candidate will have experience in branding, graphic design, and logo design.\r\n\r\nAs the chosen candidate, you will be responsible for developing a brand identity that resonates with our target audience. This will include designing a logo, creating brand guidelines, and developing a visual language that can be used across all marketing materials.\r\n\r\nTo be considered for this role, we require that you have a portfolio of completed branding projects that showcase your skills and experience. Please submit a proposal that outlines your vision for our project, your previous experience with casino branding, and a timeline for completion.\r\n\r\nWe encourage you to include links to your past completed branding projects, so we can get a sense of your design aesthetic and style. We are excited to see what you can bring to the table and look forward to hearing from you!\r\n\r\nOnce we choose a candidate we will explain everything about our casino and what makes it unique so you can get a sense of what we\'re looking for.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01054e3989587667d5','-',7,'United States','US',2000.000,'fixed',2000.000,'2023-05-25',1,'2023-05-25',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-25 13:56:12',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21507,'Branding + Website Design For Video Marketing Company',2,'I\'m looking for someone who can design a brand identity for my video production / marketing company. I\'d like a consistent look across my website and socials. I\'m looking for the following deliverables.\r\n\r\n- Brand Guidelines\r\n- Mockup of Website Design\r\n- Social Banners\r\n\r\nI\'m after a bold, professional look but simple in terms of the website. We can talk more details later.\r\n\r\nPlease attach branding examples you\'ve designed to be considered. Thank you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ffc8a551e6288807','-',7,'United States','Grandville',2500.000,'fixed',2500.000,'2023-05-25',1,'2023-05-25',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-25 13:59:59',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21508,'Bookkeeper',39,'I hope this email finds you well. I am reaching out because I am currently seeking a bookkeeper for my digital marketing agency, and I came across your profile as a highly recommended professional in the field. After reviewing your qualifications and experience, I believe you may be a great fit for our business.\r\n\r\nSugar Honey is a dynamic digital marketing agency based in Australia, specialising in Paid Advertising, Social Media Management and Influencer Marketing. We have 2 employees which are also the acting directors and have several contractors carrying out a variety of tasks.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a skilled bookkeeper to take on the directors work load and help maintain accurate financial records and ensure the smooth operation of our financial processes.\r\n\r\nIdeally, we are seeking someone who has experience working with small to medium-sized businesses in the digital marketing industry. Proficiency with accounting software, particularly QuickBooks, is essential.\r\n\r\nWe value attention to detail, reliability, and confidentiality. We expect our bookkeeper to maintain the highest standards of professionalism and integrity.\r\nIf you are interested in discussing this opportunity further, I would appreciate it if you could provide me with the following information:\r\n\r\n1. Your availability and estimated number of hours you can commit to our agency per month.\r\n2. Your rates or fee structure.\r\n3. Any relevant experience or certifications you possess.\r\n4. 2 or more clients or employers who you’re currently working with.\r\n\r\nI would be happy to schedule a call or meeting to discuss the details and get to know each other better. Please let me know your availability so that we can find a suitable time to connect.\r\n\r\nI appreciate your time and look forward to your response.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\n\r\nRobert.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661733948252520449','-',7,'United States','GLENROY',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-25',1,'2023-05-25',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-25 14:01:11',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
