(21529,'Logo Design',10,'Please use our current logo as a reference. The current logo is for our site that sells rapid testing supplies for at home / office use. The new logo is to be tailored to our new brand / service that will offering lab based testing. Tests will be booked online through our new portal. We were looking for a logo similar to what we have now with the beaker, but with an updated / more modern look. Please be creative, we are open to anything. I was personally thinking keeping it simple and using only the blue / white, but open to suggestions.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~015ba4da250e248cf8','-',7,'United States','Orlando',100.000,'fixed',100.000,'2023-05-25',1,'2023-05-25',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-25 15:25:28',NULL,23,3,NULL,129),
(21530,'Creative and artistic graphic designer/ illustrator needed for logo design',2,'SudoTouch Logo\r\n\r\nCreate four distinct logo concepts for a software development company – SudoTouch.\r\n\r\nOur goal is to have logos that are visually appealing, relevant to the software/technology industry, and suitable for various applications, including digital and print media. We want designs that will be memorable and will help us establish our brand identity in the market.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n1.Create logo concepts that represent the suggested ideas and inspiration 2.described below.\r\n3.Please use this only as a guideline and incorporate any additional creativity as you see fit!\r\n4.If there is a logo concept you identify more with, please let us know as we do not necessarily need all 4 concepts represented as a deliverable\r\n5. Develop designs that are visually appealing and relevant to the software/technology industry.\r\n6. Focus on creating a logo that can be used in a variety of formats, square, dark vs light etc.\r\n7. Ensure that the final designs are suitable for various applications, including digital and print media.\r\n8. When someone sees our logo/emblem they might say “wow that’s cool what is it” or “idk what that is but it’s cool”\r\n9.We would like to stay away from space themed designs\r\n10.We are open to the idea of ‘characters’ or a ‘mascot’\r\n11. We will be sourcing concepts from multiple designers so you need to stand out.\r\n\r\nConcept 1:\r\nPixel Logo – 8-bit type logo design (more saturated color palate, think original video games). This could have just the icon/ symbol in an 8bit style, or could also incorporate it to the font as long as its legible.\r\n\r\nConcept 2:\r\nEmblem Logo- Using military/ platoon emblems and insignias as inspiration, looking for a more modern and clean take on a typically traditional and detailed design\r\n\r\nConcept 3:\r\n8bit Emblem Logo –Essentially a mix of concept 1 & 2, an 8-bit type graphic design put into an emblem (think like military/platoon emblems and insignias)\r\n\r\nConcept 4:\r\nCome up with something out of the box, using YOUR creativity.\r\n\r\nInspirations:\r\n8-bit graphics\r\nNostalgia/retro/80’s\r\nMilitary nature & lifestyle\r\nRoblox/minecraft-esque\r\nEDM music covers\r\nProlific historical\r\nRunic alphabet- similar Bluetooth logo history\r\n(https://electronicsinnovation.com/bluetooth-history-how-bluetooth-got-its-name/) \"smartCard-inline\")\r\nUnix based commands\r\nOld tech meets new/future tech\r\nAlso for reference: https://www.pinterest.com/chewieeldertree/\r\n\r\nAbout SudoTouch: (The company designing for)\r\nMission:\r\nTo solve the most challenging problems through secure, customizable, user-centric software solutions\r\n\r\nAbout Us:\r\nLet’s face it, as technology advances, the problems we face seem to get more and more complex. That’s why at SudoTouch, we take the time to understand each client’s unique needs to develop secure, customizable software solutions with the end-user in mind.\r\n\r\nWe value agility and security, and our team are no strangers to mission-critical operations. We bring deep knowledge and expertise in DevSecOps, AI/ML solutions, cloud-native architectures, and open-source software solutions. Utilizing agile methodologies and tools, we create business process automation and mission applications that minimize human error and optimize the efficiency and effectiveness of your existing workflows.\r\n\r\nWhile our team embraces a business casual dress code, our approach to problem-solving is anything but casual. With an experienced team of engineers, UX/UI experts, and veterans, we tackle each problem with meticulous attention and dedication. We’re not afraid to go above and beyond to provide you with a tailor-made user-centric experience.\r\n\r\nWe enjoy a challenge and have yet to find a problem that we couldn’t solve.','https://www.upwork.com/nx/wm/workroom/33655793/overview','Holli Kranz - Creative and artistic graphic designer/ illustrator needed for logo design - TM',185,'United States','N/a',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-18',1,'2023-05-25',1,'Hourly',1,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-05-25 15:28:41','2023-05-25 16:54:25',19,3,NULL,132),
(21531,'Branding',2,'We are looking for a talented branding expert to help us establish a strong brand identity for our company. The project length will be 1 to 3 weeks, and we require a candidate with expertise in brand positioning, corporate brand identity, logo design, and digital marketing materials.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should be able to create a minimalist, retro and vintage style that reflects our brand\'s values and attracts our target audience. We need a complete branding package, including a business card, social media kit, and source files. Website design and hosting skills or consultation a plus.\r\n\r\nIn your proposal, please describe your experience in branding and how you can help us achieve our goals. Please include links to past completed projects that showcase your branding skills.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to reviewing your proposal and working with a talented branding expert to elevate our company\'s image and attract more customers.\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~014944d00c3d6c903c','-',7,'United States','Gardendale',300.000,'fixed',300.000,'2023-05-25',1,'2023-05-25',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-25 15:28:51',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
