(21534,'Xero or Quickbooks expert for bookkeeping and Tax Preparation',39,'We are looking for an experienced bookkeeper with expertise in Xero or QuickBooks to handle our bookkeeping and tax preparation needs for a period of more than 6 months. As a bookkeeper, you will be responsible for maintaining our financial records, including bank reconciliations, balance sheets, and financial accounting. You should have a solid understanding of accounting basics and be proficient in using accounting software.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, we require a candidate with experience in tax preparation. You will be responsible for preparing and filing our tax returns and ensuring that our financial records are compliant with tax regulations.\r\n\r\nTo be considered for this position, please submit a proposal outlining how you can help with this project, including any relevant experience and links to past completed projects. We are looking for a detail-oriented and reliable individual who can work independently and meet deadlines.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661761227873619969','-',7,'United States','Oud-beijerland',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-25',1,'2023-05-25',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-25 15:49:30',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21535,'Brand Designer (Logos, Brand Guides, & Vehicle Wraps)',2,'Hello!  My name is Brad Dery, and I oversee marketing for Advantage Services Group, the parent company of eight different residential home service businesses.  \r\n\r\nI am looking for a long-term partner who can take come of one or all of these needs:\r\n1. Logo Design\r\n2. Brand Guide\r\n3. Vehicle Wraps\r\n\r\nWe are buying 2-3 companies per year, every year, and need someone we can rely on to help us manage the brand identity for our new companies.  We also have several existing companies that we may want to rebrand, as well.  \r\n\r\nBasic notes to keep in mind are as follows:\r\n1. Must be willing to be in Slack/Teams for chatting during projects.\r\n2. Must be willing to Zoom with me to chat and review progress.\r\n3. Must use only unique, original, 100% new work - never using any templates/clipart/stock images/etc.\r\n4. Must be willing to sign a legal document assuring us all work will be our own, and that it is fully unique and original.\r\n5. Must be great at visioning brands, as well as visioning logos and colors pallets that can be used in a wide array of applications (print, uniforms, truck wraps, billboards, banners, much more).\r\n6. Must work fast.  We are an incredibly fast-paced company and need partners who go faster than us.\r\n7. Lastly, while we are not looking for a cheap designer, we expect a fair, flat price for each item individually.  We also expect pricing to be based on our having a long-term relationship with many repeat projects.  \r\n\r\nIf this is you, please answer these questions and provide the specific samples requested.  We cannot process your application if you do not answer the questions or supply the samples as we ask.\r\n1. On a scale of 1 to 10, 10 being best, how would you rate your creative logo design skills?\r\n2. On a scale of 1 to 10, 10 being best, how would you rate your brand identity guide creation skills?\r\n3. 1. On a scale of 1 to 10, 10 being best, how would you rate your creative vehicle wrap skills?\r\n4. How long have you been a designer?\r\n5. What are your available meeting hours in the CST time zone?\r\n6. What is your estimated price, provided separately, for a logo, brand guide, and vehicle wrap - including reasonable revisions?\r\n7. Lastly, please provide three samples of logos, three samples of brand guides, and three samples of vehicle wraps (if you have them).\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\nBrad','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01f2eb93570b8896f4','-',7,'United States','Annapolis',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-25',1,'2023-05-25',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-25 15:50:25',NULL,23,3,NULL,129),
(21536,'New Logo Design',10,'We are renaming our e-commerce site (VOIPLINK.com) to RENEWED-IT.US and need to create a new brand mark.\r\n\r\nWe\'re seeking a talented logo designer to create a captivating and memorable logo for our ecommerce site specializing in remanufactured telecommunications equipment an emphasis on environmental sustainability.\r\n\r\nOur Requirements:\r\n\r\nDesign a fresh, modern, and versatile logo that embodies our remanufactured telecommunications equipment website\'s personality that reflects the fact that renewed equipment is also good for the environment.\r\n\r\nCraft a visually striking logo that stands out amidst the competition in the telecommunications industry.\r\n\r\nEnsure the logo remains impactful and legible across various platforms and mediums.\r\n\r\nProvide logo variations suitable for different applications, maintaining consistency and sustainability messaging.\r\n\r\nThe attached \"about VOIPLINK\" should give you some additional background. And you can visit VOIPLINK.com to get a sense of colors, etc.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01d3d2a95c37481959','-',7,'United States','St. Louis',50.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-25',1,'2023-05-25',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-25 15:54:51',NULL,23,3,NULL,129),
