(21544,'Logo Designer for Hotel',10,'We are looking for a talented and experienced logo designer to help us create a new logo for our hotel. This is a short-term project that should take less than one month to complete.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should be proficient in Adobe Illustrator, Adobe InDesign, and Adobe Photoshop. They should have experience in creating brand identity and guidelines, corporate brand identity, graphic design, illustration, and minimalist design.\r\n\r\nAs a logo designer, you will be responsible for creating a unique and eye-catching logo that represents our brand and values. You should have a strong understanding of design principles, color theory, and typography.\r\n\r\nTo apply for this job, please submit a proposal detailing how you can help us with this project. Please include links to your past completed projects that demonstrate your design skills and experience.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you and seeing your portfolio.\r\n\r\nNote: Some of the content in this job post may have been auto-generated using advanced AI.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~014ee66fce9ad5d284','-',7,'United States','New York',150.000,'fixed',150.000,'2023-05-25',1,'2023-05-25',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-25 16:21:13',NULL,23,3,NULL,129),
(21545,'Bookkeeper for Environmental Startup',39,'I\'m looking for a bookkeeper who has experience, immediate availability, a positive attitude, and is willing to learn, teach, and work collaboratively.\r\n\r\nFor about two years now, my husband and I have been running a new LLC we created doing environmental retrofits. We have a few full-time contractors working on our building projects, and another few part-time ones helping with admin and project planning. We\'re to the point now where we need professional bookkeeping.\r\n\r\nThis job includes setting up a quickbooks profile for this new company, and getting all expenses from the last year and a half in order.\r\n\r\nI expect to sit down with you for many hours and go through transactions manually together to setup quickbooks rules, transaction categories, etc.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for someone who has immediate availability for 10-30 hours per week to knock out my backlog. If we work well together, I would like to keep you on going forward. Though, I expect the work in the future will be much less volume once we clear up the backlog.\r\n\r\nI\'m a retired software engineer and project manager, and have a goal to learn enough Quickbooks skills to follow along and do some of the basic work myself. I\'m hoping to find someone who is willing to walk me though things in Quickbooks and teach me as we work together.\r\n\r\nOur company is https://www.everlasting.earth/\r\n\r\nI am willing to pay for the qualities I\'m looking for: experience, immediate availability, a positive and friendly attitude, ability to work collaboratively. If you fit these characteristics, please reach out!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661769560011411457','-',7,'United States','Fairplay',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-25',1,'2023-05-25',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-25 16:23:00',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21546,'Part-Time Bookkeeper - U.S. ONLY',39,'D&Tea is a small business based in Washington, USA, specializing in selling products online and through pop-up events across the United States. We are currently seeking a dedicated and detail-oriented Part-Time Bookkeeper to join our team. APPLICANT MUST HAVE EXPERT KNOWLEDGE OF U.S. TAX SYSTEM.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Maintain accurate and up-to-date financial records for the business, including sales transactions, expenses, and other financial activities.\r\n\r\n-Process and reconcile daily sales transactions from online platforms and pop-up events.\r\n\r\n-Record and categorize all business expenses, ensuring proper documentation and adherence to company policies.\r\n\r\n-Prepare and submit monthly financial reports to management, summarizing revenue, expenses, and overall financial performance.\r\n\r\n-Prepare books to pass to accountants for filing state and federal taxes\r\n\r\nHours will start at around 10-15 per week.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661771477022248961','-',7,'United States','Nelson',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-25',1,'2023-05-25',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-25 16:30:18',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
