(21565,'Experienced Bookkeeper for E-commerce Platforms (QuickBooks, Xero, Stripe, Wave)',39,'We are seeking an experienced and detail-oriented Bookkeeper to join our team. As a Bookkeeper, you will be responsible for managing bookkeeping tasks for various e-commerce platforms. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in QuickBooks, Xero, Stripe, and Wave, and possess a solid understanding of accounting principles and e-commerce transactions.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n1. Handle bookkeeping tasks for e-commerce platforms such as Amazon, PayPal, Stripe, and Shopify.\r\n2. Utilize QuickBooks, Xero, Stripe, Wave, and other accounting software to maintain accurate and up-to-date financial records.\r\n3. Perform bank and credit card statement reconciliations.\r\n4. Manage accounts payable and accounts receivable processes.\r\n5. Prepare monthly, quarterly, and yearly financial reports.\r\n6. Assess and mitigate financial risks.\r\n7. Communicate effectively with clients and stakeholders to address any financial issues or inquiries.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n1. Proven experience and certification as a Bookkeeper in QuickBooks.\r\n2. Strong understanding of accounting principles, GAAP, and financial reporting standards.\r\n3. Proficiency in using accounting software such as Xero, Stripe, Wave, or similar platforms.\r\n4. Excellent organizational and analytical skills.\r\n5. Attention to detail and accuracy in record keeping.\r\n6. Strong communication and interpersonal skills.\r\n7. Bachelor\'s degree in Accounting, Finance, or a related field is preferred.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661830667780788225','-',7,'United States','Dubai',7.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-25',1,'2023-05-25',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-25 21:40:56',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(21566,'Virtual Bookkeeper for Small Business',39,'We are seeking a skilled and reliable Virtual Bookkeeper to join our team. As a Virtual Bookkeeper, you will be responsible for managing bookkeeping tasks for small businesses, ensuring accurate and up-to-date financial records. The ideal candidate should have experience in bookkeeping, strong attention to detail, and excellent organizational skills.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n1. Perform daily bookkeeping tasks, including recording financial transactions, invoicing, and reconciling accounts.\r\n2. Manage accounts payable and accounts receivable, ensuring timely payment and collection.\r\n3. Maintain accurate and up-to-date financial records using accounting software such as QuickBooks or Xero.\r\n4. Prepare and process payroll, including calculating employee wages, deductions, and tax withholdings.\r\n5. Generate financial reports, including income statements, balance sheets, and cash flow statements.\r\n6. Assist in the preparation of tax returns and ensure compliance with tax regulations.\r\n7. Collaborate with clients and stakeholders to address any financial inquiries or issues.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n1. Proven experience as a Bookkeeper or in a similar role.\r\n2. Strong knowledge of bookkeeping principles and practices.\r\n3. Proficiency in using accounting software such as QuickBooks, Xero, or similar platforms.\r\n4. Excellent attention to detail and accuracy in record keeping.\r\n5. Strong organizational and time management skills.\r\n6. Ability to work independently and meet deadlines.\r\n7. Effective communication and interpersonal skills.\r\n8. Familiarity with small business accounting needs and processes.\r\n9. Bachelor\'s degree in Accounting, Finance, or a related field is preferred.\r\nThis is a remote position with flexible working hours. We offer competitive compensation based on experience and the opportunity to work with diverse and interesting small businesses. If you are a skilled and reliable Bookkeeper with a passion for supporting small businesses, we would love to hear from you.\r\n\r\nPlease include your relevant experience and proficiency with accounting software in your application.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661839807154520065','-',7,'United States','Dubai',6.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-25',1,'2023-05-25',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-25 21:42:27',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
(21567,'Bookkeeping for Ecom',39,'Hi,\r\n\r\nI have a small e-commerce business that generated around 200k in revenue for 2022. I did not do any bookkeeping and now need to look over my income and expenses to prepare my taxes for the year 2022.\r\n\r\nThe Task\r\nI will provide you with bank statements and/or CSV files from my business and business credit card accounts. You will assign categories for different expenses, such as software costs, payment processing fees, etc. It will be helpful if you\'ve done this for others in ecom since we all generally have the same expenses.\r\n\r\n80% or more of the expenses will be recurring. There are one-off purchases, but for the most part, you\'ll see the same thing every month. It usually takes me anywhere from half a day to a full day.\r\n\r\nI\'ll give you the document I put together from the previous year so you can refer to it if necessary. To demonstrate your attention to detail begin your proposal with the word ECOM. I\'ll also be available if you need anything or have questions.\r\n\r\nDEADLINE\r\nMust be fully ready no later than Tuesday, May 30th, California time.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1661842267525095425','-',7,'United States','Irvine',200.000,'fixed',200.000,'2023-05-25',1,'2023-05-25',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-25 21:43:25',NULL,21,3,NULL,155),
