(21592,'Professional Bookkeeping/Accounting - Australia company',39,'This is a full time role with our company so only independent apply no agency require\r\n\r\nThe Company\r\n\r\nAliya homes is a Melbourne, Australia base construction company that delivers exciting projects within the resedential space.\r\nWe are currently looking for a professional and experience accountant to fulfill financial duties within many sectors such as payroll, month end duties, accounts payable and receivable, GST and tax.\r\n\r\nBenefits\r\nWork for a family orientated business that delivers interesting projects in the buildings space\r\nHave access to the decision makers in order to provide financial support effectively\r\nBe apart of a great culture with social events\r\nBe apart of a company that can provide flexibility in order to promote work-life balance\r\nBe an integral part of the business to assist with their growth\r\nWork from home\r\n\r\n\r\nResponsibilities\r\n\r\nThe finance accountant will need to be providing assistance in multiple areas by completing the below responsibilities:\r\nMonth end processing, journals, and accruals\r\nBank reconciliations\r\nAccounts payable and receivable processing\r\nReporting into the general manager to handle any financial assistance needed\r\nPayroll on a fortnightly schedule\r\nProcessing reimbursements\r\nLiasing with the external accountants\r\nManage intercompany purchases/payments\r\nCredit card processing and reconciliations\r\nRequired person\r\nProven track record of successfully completing the responsibilities above\r\nOver 5 years of experience within finance and accounts\r\nHigh level administration would also be considered if some finance was involved\r\nPrevious experience in construction is desirable\r\nXERO software preferred\r\nAustralian experience preferred','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1662106543686950913','-',7,'United States','VICTORIA',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-26',1,'2023-05-26',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-26 14:41:55',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21593,'Create a Logo for my Fruit Import Business',10,'My Business is called Levantine Romania, it\'s a premium fruit import company that specializes in Citrus and Avocados. I want a logo that works for the website, and social media and being put on the product.\r\n\r\nWe want it to be written either in typography or hand drawn with elements of green and nature plus being premium. Also, incorporating elements like the letter E being a slice of citrus and the dot of the I being an Avocado etc. We are open to suggestions.\r\n\r\nLooking forward!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01619083aa7bd71426','-',7,'United States','Eugene',50.000,'fixed',50.000,'2023-05-26',1,'2023-05-26',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-26 14:45:30',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
(21594,'LOGO & BRANDING: tattoo and piercing studio',10,'Innovative Logo and Brand Designer for 9th Gate Gallery Tattoo and Piercing Studio\r\n\r\nDescription:\r\n\r\nWe are embarking on an exciting journey to establish a cutting-edge Tattoo and Piercing Studio called 9th Gate Gallery, and we are in need of a talented logo and brand designer to create a captivating visual identity for our unique establishment. As we strive to redefine the artistry and experience of tattooing and piercing, we are seeking a skilled designer who can craft a logo that embodies our studio\'s vision, artistic expression, and dedication to exceptional service.\r\n\r\nKey Details:\r\n\r\nProject Type: Logo and Brand Design\r\nClient: 9th Gate Gallery Tattoo and Piercing Studio\r\nConcept: Emphasizing artistic expression, creativity, and exceptional service\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- Develop an innovative and visually striking logo that reflects the unique identity of 9th Gate Gallery.\r\n- Create a brand identity that aligns with our studio\'s vision and attracts a diverse clientele.\r\n- Incorporate elements of tattooing, piercing, and artistry into the logo design.\r\n- Design a versatile logo that can be effectively used across various platforms, including digital media, signage, stationery, and merchandise.\r\n- Collaborate closely with our team to understand our studio\'s aesthetic preferences and target audience.\r\n- Present multiple logo concepts and provide revisions based on feedback and input.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n- Proven experience in logo and brand design, with a portfolio showcasing your creative expertise.\r\n- Proficiency in industry-standard design software and tools.\r\n- Ability to interpret and translate our studio\'s values and vision into a visually appealing brand identity.\r\n- Strong understanding of color theory, typography, and composition.\r\n- Excellent communication skills to effectively collaborate with our team and incorporate feedback.\r\n\r\nTimeline and Compensation:\r\n\r\nStart Date: ASAP\r\nCompletion Date: June 2, 2023\r\n\r\nIf you are a talented logo and brand designer with a passion for artistic expression and a keen eye for detail, we invite you to join us in establishing 9th Gate Gallery as a premier tattoo and piercing studio. Share your portfolio and proposal, demonstrating your ability to create captivating visual identities, and let\'s embark on this creative endeavor together. Together, we will set new standards of artistry and create a brand that leaves an indelible mark on the tattoo and piercing industry.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e64603c171d219ac','-',7,'United States','Sydney',350.000,'fixed',350.000,'2023-05-26',1,'2023-05-26',1,'N/A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-26 15:08:49',NULL,23,3,NULL,129),
(21595,'Quickbooks desktop and online bookkeeping',39,'Hi!\r\n\r\nWe have an older Quickbooks desktop version that needs to be imported into the online version and outdated categories that need to be refigured in the online version.\r\n\r\nWe are a dual retail business (art gallery & bookstore). Please be familiar with consignment-based inventory, sales tax, and multiple revenue streams. Can convert an older desktop version of QB to the new online updated one.\r\n\r\nWe are seeking someone to become a permanent bookkeeper for this small New York business and guide us through this transition.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1662119938886393857','-',7,'United States','New York',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-26',1,'2023-05-26',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-26 15:34:49',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
