(21599,'Parish Fair Logo',10,'Logo for our parish\'s annual fair, Fair Ascension, that ties in with our Gala and 100th Anniversary Logos and includes the window from our parish logo. We are thinking something with a tent or ferris wheel possibly.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0124945ae8a88df939','-',7,'United States','Chesterfield',175.000,'fixed',175.000,'2023-05-26',1,'2023-05-26',1,'In Process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-26 15:43:09',NULL,18,3,NULL,126),
