(21601,'Tax Preparation',38,'We are looking for a skilled and tax preparer to assist us with our upcoming tax preparation project. The project will last for 1 to 3 months, and we need someone who has expertise in accounting, tax law, and tax preparation. There will be thousands of line item transactions to review for deductions.\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate must have experience in preparing tax returns for businesses, with a thorough understanding of tax laws and regulations. They must have excellent attention to detail, strong analytical skills, and the ability to work independently.\r\n\r\nTo apply, please submit a proposal outlining your experience in tax preparation, your relevant skills and qualifications, and how you can help us with this project. Please include links to some of your past completed projects.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a candidate who can start immediately and work with us for the duration of the project. If you meet the requirements and are interested in working with us, please submit your proposal as soon as possible.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1662123282933669889','-',7,'United States','Santa Monica',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-26',1,'2023-05-26',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-26 15:48:04',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21602,'Bookkeeper to setup and update property management records',39,'Looking for a skilled bookkeeper to help us set up and update my property management records. The ideal candidate will have experience in accounting basics, bank reconciliation, bookkeeping, data entry, and Microsoft Excel.\r\n\r\nYour main responsibilities will be to set up our property management books, input and maintain accurate records of all financial transactions, reconcile bank accounts, and generate monthly financial reports. You will be working closely with our property management team to ensure that all records are accurate and up-to-date.\r\n\r\nTo be considered for this position, please submit a proposal outlining your relevant experience and how you can help with this project. Please include links to past completed projects that demonstrate your skills and experience.\r\n\r\nLooking for someone who is reliable, detail-oriented, and able to meet deadlines. This is a short-term project. If you are passionate about bookkeeping and have the necessary skills and experience, we would love to hear from you.\r\n\r\nI need a bookkeeper to help me understand payments that are going to and from my property.\r\n\r\nNeed to reconcile with bank statements and to collate the information in an excell spreadsheet so that I have a complete understanding of transactions and ensure what the current situation is.\r\n\r\nI have tenants in an apartment with a property management company that is managing it including rent, management fees.\r\n\r\nExperience in:\r\n\r\nBookkeeping\r\nReconciliation\r\nAccounting\r\nAbility to clearly showcase what is going on\r\nAbility to show what is owing from the management company\r\n\r\nYou will be given access to statements showing income coming in and expenses going out. You will be given invoices to show external expenses.\r\n\r\nPlease type \'understand\' so I know you\'ve read this.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1662124626381824001','-',7,'United States','London',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-26',1,'2023-05-26',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-26 15:53:27',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21603,'Bookkeeper needed for a SaaS company',39,'We\'re a SaaS company with about a year\'s worth of activity. We need a bookkeeper to sort the books. We use Quickbooks online.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1662127956314251265','-',7,'United States','Brooklyn',35.000,'perhour',35.000,'2023-05-26',1,'2023-05-26',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-26 16:06:33',NULL,11,3,NULL,140),
(21604,'10 Page Presentation',11,'I have a 10 page presentation to start. It was created by sales people. Need a template created and the 10 pages done in the style to start. May lead to more work once these pages are done.\r\n\r\nI have a style guide for colors and logos, but the general design/look is fairly open. Need it to look modern and fresh when the content is a little stale.\r\n\r\nSlides vary from just bullet points to slightly complex charts and images. In general it is somewhat dense and not really meant to be speaker support, more of a sales leave-behind tool.\r\n\r\nWould like to see maybe 2 or 3 pages to establish style before completing all 10 pages.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1662126463027613697?success','-',7,'United States','Dallas',50.000,'perhour',50.000,'2023-05-26',1,'2023-05-26',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2023-05-26 16:07:08',NULL,19,3,NULL,133),
