(6,5,7,'Group',13,'In-Network','2023-08-03','07/11/2023: Called, Rep said, practice is non par and provider Rohit is par but not linked with Tax ID. Rep suggested to apply via online portal using Link: www.aetna.com and note the application number for future reference. Rep Name: Paul B Call Ref # 654478483 $ \r\n08/07/2023: Called to request Fee Schedule. Rep said, we can sent request on Fax # 859 455 8650 along with Email Address and Contact Information. TAT 7 to 10 BD. Asked about the CPT\'s allowed amount, Provider Services Rep said, allowed amounts may varies from Plan to Plan and it depend on the Member\'s Plan. Rep suggested to contact with Member\'s Information or request the fee schedule as instructed from Credentialing Department. Rep Name: Joy V, Richard A, Shermi T Call Ref # 6158322514, AVA-154350321432, 61583242311 $\r\n07/18/2023: Successfully credentialed effective 08/03/2023 $ \r\n08/28/2023: Called to request Fee Schedule. Rep said, we can sent request on Fax # 859 455 8650 along with W9 and LOI having Email address and Contact Person Information. Told request that was already sent on 08/07/2023, Rep was unable to find any request and suggested to resent the request. Asked to speak with the Supervisor, Rep apologies that supervisor is not available ATM but confirm that he is forwarding Our concern to his supervisor to escalate it further to the Network Management Dept and suggest to resent the request on Fax for the reference, so he can attach it and forward it further to the concern dept to fulfill the request to copy of contract ASAP. Rep Name: LJ M Call Ref # 62160929475 $ \r\n08/29/2023: Fax Sent to Aetna for Fee Schedule Request at Fax # 859 455 8650 along with W9 and LOI. $ \r\n09/11/2023: Called to check status for Aetna (Better Health) Plans. Rep said,  practice is Par Effective Dt 08/03/2023 with Commercial, PPO, EPO, HMO & Manage Choice and for Medicare HMO, PPO, EPO and Provider Rohit is also Par Effective Dt 08/03/2023 with Same Plans as Group & linked with Tax ID. Rep suggested, to get contracted with Aetna Better Health Plan we can contact provider relations phone number for Aetna Better Health of NJ 855 232 3596 for further inquiry. Rep Name: Ranz B Call Ref # 6162691104 $ \r\n12/19/2023: Called to get status on the request for the Fee Schedule. Asked about the request sent on 08/29/2023 via Fax # 859 455 8650, Rep said, they received the request on 08/29/2023 with Ticket # NAF650784t, it got completed on 08/30/2023 and the copy of Contact was sent to hina@precisionhub.com. Rep suggested to check our Junk Folder or resent the request via Fax # 859 455 8650 with LOI & W9 . Rep Name: Lizz E Call Ref # 6174511050 $\r\n12/19/2023: Email sent to Aetna_ProviderCommunications@provider.aetna.com to follow up on request to sent allowable rates. $ \r\n12/19/2023: Called to get status on the request for the Fee Schedule. on 08/08/2023 via Email at Aetna_ProviderCommunications@provider.aetna.comRep said, the request needs to be sent via email via Fax # 859 455 8650 with LOI & W9 Form. Rep Name: Ally Call Ref # 6174535200  $\r\n12/19/2023: LOI & W9 Form sent to request Fee Schedule via Fax # 859 455 8650.','2024-01-26','2023-07-19 15:28:19','2024-01-28 01:19:53'),
(7,5,7,'Group',22,'In-process','0001-01-01','07/21/2023: Called to confirm Provider ID. Rep Confirms, Provider Medicaid ID # 0682314 is Correct and connected to HNJH (Horizon NJ Health) and UHCCP (United Healthcare Community Plan). Asked about effective date, Rep said that, my name is not listed as Authorized person so he can not share any further Details, Rep Suggested that. for any information further authorized person can call them. Rep Name: Lin E, Lexus J, Angelo D Call Ref # I-182332182, RITM11232951. $\r\n07/25/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep said, the practice is Non Par but Provider Rohit is Par as a non billing Provider Effective Dt: 12/20/2018 and Not linked with Practice Tax ID. Rep confirms that, Provider\'s Medicaid ID # 0682314 is showing Active but provider license got expired on 10/31/2019. Rep suggested that we can apply for to update Provider Enrollment status to become billable provider and also submit the copy of updated provider license via Fax: 609 584 1192 OR Email NJMMISproviderenrollment@gainwelltechnologies.com. Rep confirms that, if we have more then two providers onboard then only we can apply for Group Credentialing. Rep Name: Natalie, Lucy R Call Ref # LucyR07252023. $ \r\n08/24/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep said, practice is Non Par and Provider Rohit is Par as a non billing Provider Effective Dt: 12/20/2018 and Not linked with Practice Tax ID. Rep confirms that, Provider\'s Medicaid ID # 0682314 is showing Active but provider license got expired on 10/31/2019. Rep Suggested that, we need to submit the copy of updated provider license via Fax: 609 584 1192 OR Email NJMMISproviderenrollment@gainwelltechnologies.com. Asked about the application status, rep confirms that, the application is \"In Process\" and suggest to allow more time. TAT is 90 Business Days. Rep Name: George F Call Ref # GeorgeF08242023 . $\r\n08/31/2023: Emailed the license at NJMMIS Provider Enrollment <njmmisproviderenrollment@gainwellte