(9,5,7,'Group',57,'In-Network','2023-10-09','07/11/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep said, the practice is Non Par and Provider Rohit is Par Effective Dt: 06/27/2019 but linked with different Tax ID. Rep Suggested that, we can link our provider with Group by sending the request via Email autosubmission_@HorizonBlue.com, Requesting Practitioner Template Form. After Form is received within 24 to 48 hours, we can fill out the Form, attached the required documents and sent it back following the instructions. As per Rep, they do not credential group/practices, they credential only Individual Providers. Rep Name: Britney, Zel S, John M Call Ref # LVP-6385660, LVP-6386071 $\r\n08/23/2023: Called to check request status. Rep said, the practice is still non par and Provider Rohit is still not linked to practice tax id. Asked about the Application Status, rep asked for Service Request Number. Told rep that, we sent practitioner template form on 07/18/23 but not received any response in return or Service Request Number. Rep suggested to contact Network Service Dept for further details and provided number. Called NS dept, told all the details to Rep, Rep said, our request can not be completed because first group needs to be added in their system. Rep suggested to add practice Tax ID in there Network we need to sent LOI with W9 form and IRS and Copy of State License to email at: enterprisePDM@HorizonBlue.com. Once they receive an application they will reply with in 24 to 48 hours with Service Request Number for future reference. We can follow up after 14 days with service request number. It usually takes 30 to 60 Calendar Days to complete the request. \r\nRep Name: Kathy, eGee F, Reina G Call Ref # LVP-6752302, LVP-6753005 $ \r\n08/24/2023: Follow up Email sent with all the documents to enterprisePDM@HorizonBlue.com. $ \r\n09/07/2023: Called to check request status. Rep said, no active application found on there system and said it takes 14 business days for the reques