ed to follow up on escalation. Rep apologies and said that Kathleen is not available and supervisor Geen is still waiting for the response from concern dept. Rep said, we can follow up again via email at enterprisePDM@HorizonBlue.com and assure that she is escalating our concern on priority to Kathleen again and promised a call back with in 24 to 48 business hours. Rep Name: Gee F Call Ref # LVP-760369 $\r\n10/12/2023: Received Call from Kathleen Hollinghurst from # 973-466-4000, she was asking about the escalation, so explained her the issue that we are facing in detail. She asked to sent her the email that we sent to her email address earlier and she will look into it and get back to us with best possible solution. Email Sent to kathy_hollinghurst@horizonblue.com with attached email thread for previous correspondence. Rep Name: Kathleen H Call Ref # LVP-760369 $\r\n10/24/2023: Called Kathleen to follow up on Email, Call was routed to the Provider Services, Asked about the email sent to Kathleen on 10/12/2023, Rep said, Kathleen is not available ATM and suggested to contact her via Email, Rep also escalated our concern on priority to Kathleen again and promised a call back with in 2 to 3 business days. Rep Name: Lisa T Call Ref # LVP-7257366 $\r\n11/03/2023: Called Kathleen to follow up on Email, Call was routed to the Provider Services, Asked about the email sent to Kathleen on 10/12/2023, Rep said, Kathleen is not available ATM and suggested to contact her via Email, told rep that we didn\'t receive any response from Kathleen. Rep apologies and said she has a response from her stating that, she didn\'t received our email and suggested to resent the email. Told rep that i have resend email now, rep said that she is sending our concern to Kathleen again and promised a call back with in 2 to 3 business hours. Rep Name: Liya D Call Ref # LVP-7347281 $\r\n11/03/2023: Send Email with documents attached to kathy_hollinghurst@horizonblue.com & enterprisePDM@HorizonBlue.c