ests. $\r\n11/20/2023: Email Received from Horizon BCBS NJ > EnterprisePDM@horizonblue.com, Stating status: Thank you for submitting your request to the Physician Data Management Department regarding your Provider Maintenance, Add Location. Interaction Number NLP-4463192 was completed on 11/17/2023. $\r\n11/20/2023: Called to follow up with Kathleen, got voice mail left brief massage. Called Horizon BCBS of NJ asked about the email that we received today from EnterprisePDM@horizonblue.com, Rep Said, practice is Par Effective 10/09/2023 and Provider Rohit is also Par Effective 10/09/2023 and linked with Practice Tax ID. Asked about the contract copy rep said that we can contact with Kathleen Hollinghurst for further assistance. Rep Name: Marko A Call Ref # LVP-7455818 $\r\n11/21/2023: Called to follow up with Kathleen to request copy of contract, got voice mail left brief massage. Rep Name: IVR Call Ref # IVR11212023 $\r\n11/21/2023: Email sent to Kathleen Kathy_Hollinghurst@horizonblue.com & EnterprisePDM@horizonblue.com to request copy of contract. Got response with Service request # NLP-4585522. $\r\n11/22/2023: Email received from Kathleen Hollinghurst <Kathy_Hollinghurst@horizonblue.com>, Stating that \"I will be out of the office as of 2pm on November 10th 2023. I will not be back in the office until Monday November 27th 2023. I will not acess to email during this time. I will respond to your email when I return to the office. $ \r\n11/22/2023: Called Horizon BCBS of NJ to ask about the registration number for provider and Group. Rep said, that there is no Provider ID affiliated with provider yet but we can use Group & Provider NPI for the Commercial Plans. Rep suggested to contact NJ Health Plan Dept for provider ID on 800 682 9091. Called NJ Health Plan for Provider ID #, Rep said, there is no provider id affiliated with provider yet and suggested to contact with credentialing dept via email. Rep Name: Chris B, Martha F Call Ref # LVP-7480683, 112223004860 $ 