(22,7,24,'Group',8,'panel-closed','0000-00-00','07/21/2023: Form for certification has been sent at (608) 221-7535 09/05/2023: Called to check Application Status. Asked about the Certification Form sent on 07/21/2023 via Fax # (608) 221-7535, As per rep, there is no active application found on there system and apologize for the inconvenience. Rep recommended to resubmit using the correct option by going online using link: https://infocenter.humana-military.com/hgbprovider/providercertification/home/index?ProviderType=MD. 09/05/2023: Online Provider\'s Certification Request Submitted.\r\n11/01/2023: Called Tricare East to check Application Status. Asked about the Online Certification request submitted on 09/05/2023, As per Rep, Provider Dr. Sindhu M Thomas MD is showing \"Out of Network\" but got Certified Effective 09/20/2023 and linked with Practice Tax ID and Practice \"Kidney Care Center of Houston\" is showing \"Non Contracted\" Not Certified as Group and  As per rep, we can apply for Group Certification using online portal Link: https://www.humanamilitary.com/provider/resources/tricarecertapps > Select > Clinic or group practice certification application.  Download the application and fill up the form and return it back following the instructions provided on the form. Once Group and Provider both will become Credentialed we need to contact Tricare Liaison Community Representative : Yvonne Wyatt: 502 318 5409, Email: ywyatt@humana.com, Fax 502 322 8018 to guide us further with Contracting process. Credentialing Department usually take 30 to 90 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Shatavia L, Adreanna G Call Ref # ShataviaL11012023, AdreannaG11012023\r\n11/02/2023: LOI & W9 Form with filled Clinic or group practice certification application sent via Fax # (608) 221 7535.\r\n01/12/2024: Called Tricare East to check Group Application Status. Asked about the request submitted on 11/02/2023 via Fax (608) 221 7535. Rep, confirmed that provider Sindhu is Non Par but got Certified Effective 09/20/2023 and linked with Practice Tax ID but practice is still Non Par and Not Certified yet. Rep confirms that they received the group application on 11/07/2023 and it is in process, rep suggested to allow more time. It usually takes 45 to 90 days. Rep also suggested to contact Liaison Community Representative Yvonne Wyatt to get an advise for contracting. Called Yvonne Wyatt got VM left brief massage for call back as suggested. Name: Liz M, Marla P Call Ref #  MarlaP01122024\r\n01/12/2024: Sent contracting request with LOI & W9 for the provider Sindhu via email at ywyatt@humana.com.\r\n01/12/2024: Received Email from Yvonne Wyatt <ywyatt@humana.com>, Stating \"I am happy to assist, however these requests need to be submitted via secure messaging found in the provider portal.\"\r\n01/12/2024: Called Tricare East to get activating code. Rep provided the code and helped login to the portal. Name: Princess C Call Ref # PrincessC01122024\r\n01/12/2024: Created the online account and sent contracting request via secure account with attached LOI & W9 for provider Sindhu and Group as per instructions received via email.\r\n01/16/2024: Received Email Humana Military <HumanaMilitary@humana.com> in response of Request for Group & Provider Contracting - sent via secure email, Stating \"Thank you for using our secure messaging system! Someone will respond to your request as soon as possible.\"\r\n01/16/2024: Received Email from Yvonne Wyatt <ywyatt@humana.com> in response of Request for Group & Provider Contracting - sent via secure email, Stating \"At this time, we are not currently expanding our network based on your specialty and location within the East Region.\" $\r\n01/23/2024: Received Secure email from Yvonne Wyatt <ywyatt@humana.com>, Stating \"Humana Military thanks you for your interest in joining the TRICARE East Region network to provide care for our beneficiaries.  At this time, we are not currently expanding our network based on your specialty and location within the East Region.  We will continue to evaluate our network needs for your community, and will reach out to you should those needs change in the future. As a TRICARE certified non-network provider, you are authorized to provide care to TRICARE beneficiaries with the following TRICARE plans Tricare Select, Tricare for Life, Tricare Reserve Select, Tricare Retired Reserve, Tricare Young Adult: The reimbursement should be 100% of CMAC https://www.health.mil. Providers must seek applicable copayments, cost-shares and deductibles from the beneficiary.\" $','2024-01-23','2023-10-02 15:37:05','2024-01-23 20:20:48'),
(23,7,24,'Group',9,'In-Network','2023-08-02','Email sent for forms but so far no response 03/06/2023 Submitted online application 04/05/2023 An email has been sent on networkhelp@uhc.com for enrollment application status 05/23/2023: Contract is pending at provider;s end, we are in process of comparing rates 05/26/2023: Follow up email snet to provider 06/02/203: Follow up made again 06/06/2023: Emailed Sindhu to accept the contract if only one code requires negotiation 06/16/2023: Received response but i am sure that it has passed due date/ Asked provider to have a look and mail it out  07/10/2023: as per email by Sindhu, she has mailed out the agrement to UHC 08/28/2023: Called to check enrollment status. Rep confirms \"Kidney Care Center of Houston\" is \"In Network\" Effective Dt: 08/02/2023 and Provider Sindhu Thomas is also Showing \"In Network\" Effective Dt: 08/02/2023 with UHC and Linked to the Practice Tax ID. 09/01/2023: Called to request the Copy of Contract. As per Rep, we can sent our request via Email: networkhelp@uhc.com or centralPRteam@uhc.com and TAT for NMRT to respond is 30 Calendar Days. 09/01/2023: Successfully credentialed effective 08/02/2023\r\n01/11/2024: Called UHC to follow up on the request for copy of contract sent on 09/01/2023 at networkhelp@uhc.com centralPRteam@uhc.com, rep said that the these emails are not operational any more and suggested to contact live chat support. Contacted to UHC Live Chat Support asked rep about the request status, rep shared the provider\'s plan list for reference and for fee schedule, rep asked to share LOI and W9 over chat, shared the required documents and provided required information. Rep said that she had submitted request sent directly to Network Account Manager. You can use our reference number 04310493. TAT is 30 to 45 Day. Rep Name: Summer K, Ann, Monica Ref # 52440629, Ann01112024, 04310493','2024-01-11','2023-10-02 15:41:51','2024-01-11 23:11:14'),
