(35,10,29,'Group',9,'In-Network','2024-01-14','03/09/2023 As per Rep provider and group is non par Ref# d2409 03/09/2023 Online application has been submitted 04/19/2023 An email has been sent on networkhelp@uhc.com for enrollment application status 05/08/2023: Called UHC to confirm if provider or facility shows as in network but no update as of yet 06/08/2023: Theres no update as of yet 06/27/2023: Follow up email sent agian at NMRT 08/01/2023: Follow up email sent again 08/18/2023: Ticket escalated as no respnse is being received by UHC 08/31/2023: Follow up, as per supervisor provider can not be linked to Non Existing Group as Group needs to be credentialed and asked to resent the updated request via email to NMRT and cc it to her Email: bernieceo@uhc.com or Fax # 601 718 6584. 08/31/2023: Email sent with LOI and W9 to NMRT and Fax # 601 718 6584. 09/07/2023: a follow up over the call is made and ticket has been raised. Rep Dany C, GM B Call Ref # 2387, 42313932 09/07/2023: follow up email sent with LOI & W9 at networkhelp@uhc.com, centralPRteam@uhc.com and bernieceo@uhc.com. 09/21/2023: Follow up via email sent with LOI & W9 at NMRT@uhc.com and bernieceo@uhc.com. 09/21/2023: Called for follow up on Escalation. Rep apologies for no response and connect with supervisor, as per Supervisor Karen, she tried to reach Berniece but no response so Karen gave her official email id karen.pitogo@uhc.com and asked to sent her the same email that was sent to Berniece earlier and assured that she will escalate the same to NMRT to get update on request status & ask their back office team to contact us with in 72 hours with the update. Rep Name: Mary T, Karen P Call Ref # D8540 (Anil) 09/21/2023: Sent Email thread with LOI & W9 at karen.pitogo@uhc.com\r\n09/27/2023: Sent Email thread with LOI & W9 at karen.pitogo@uhc.com.\r\n10/11/2023: Called UHC to follow up on Escalation. Asked Rep about the escalation that was made by Supervisor Berniece O on 08/31/2023 and Supervisor Karen Pitogo on 09/21/2023 who assured that we will receive Call Back but no Response as off yet. Rep apologies and said that they have limited access and asked to contact UHC Help Desk, told her that, we already discussed it with them but they provided no assistance and asked to speak with supervisor, Rep transferred the call to Supervisor Stella P, she discussed every thing in detail and also consult with there help desk dept, as per help desk there is no blocking at there end and suggested to discuss this with our IT dept to check if there is any blocking from our firewall. Supervisor Stella, also escalated it to there support email and said that they will also look into this and contact us with in 72 hours with the update. Rep Name: Kim, Mary, Alora, Stella P Call Ref # D2927 (Anil)\r\n10/26/2023: Called to follow up on Escalation. Rep apologies and conifirmed that there NMRT Email Networkhelp@uhc.com is no more working and told that for credentialing related queries we can contact directly to there chat support. Rep suggested to login to www.uhcprovider.com and start chatting to be better assisted. Contacted Chat Support and rep said that he is able to find provider linkage request received on 10/16/2023 but there is no group application found. Rep suggested that we can apply for group from onboarding pro by login to www.uhcprovider.com. Rep Name: Jin T Call Ref # 46007416 (Anil)\r\n10/27/2023: Online Application Submitted Reference Number: CR-100000578253.\r\n11/14/2023: Submitted Complaint using link https://www.mid.ms.gov/consumers/file-company-complaint.aspx to Mississippi Insurance Department Consumer Portal\r\nreceived confirmation email with Complaint ID # 25939.\r\n12/06/2023: Contacted UHC Live Chat Support, Asked about the Online Application Submitted on 10/27/2023 Reference Number: CR-100000578253. As per Rep, \r\nThe requested provider VANESSA HAYWOOD credentialing is completed but contract still not loaded. As per their system PR-7801335 is in-progress under this TIN 922534657. It will takes 30-45 days to complete. Rep Name: Poongodi Chat Ref # 04246986\r\n11/14/2023: Submitted Complaint using link https://www.mid.ms.gov/consumers/file-company-complaint.aspx to Mississippi Insurance Department Consumer Portal.\r\nreceived confirmation email with Complaint ID # 25939. \r\n12/06/2023: Contacted UHC Live Chat Support, Asked about the Online Application Submitted on 10/27/2023 Reference Number: CR-100000578253. As per Rep, \r\nThe requested provider VANESSA HAYWOOD credentialing is completed but contract still not loaded. As per their system PR-7801335 is in-progress under this TIN 922534657. It will takes 30-45 days to complete. Rep Name: Poongodi Chat Ref # 04246986\r\n01/03/2024: Contacted Chat Support to check application status, as per rep contract loading is still in process under reference number PR-7801335. The contract is still pending and suggested to allow more. It will take 30-45 business days from the request was submitted. Asked the reason for delay, Rep said, the request is holding because clarification of correct supervising specialty to load this provider. Confirmed the required information, Rep said that, she have added notes on PR- 7801335. So, the request will complete as soon as possible. Rep Name: Anandhi Chat Ref # 04291823\r\n01/09/2024: Received email from Deborah Ivory <Deborah.Ivory@mid.ms.gov> on behalf of Mississippi Insurance Department against Complaint ID # 25939, Stating that \"As per Letter received from Ryan Miller, Vice President of Network Contracting reached out to Ms. Zareen on December 15, 2023, via e-mail. Ms. Zareen responded asking what Information is needed in order to have Ms. Haywood linked to tax identification number 922534657. Mr. Miller responded back on December 15, 2023, providing a copy of the agreement that needs to be executed. Mr. Miller stated as of today he has not received any response from Ms. Zareen.\"\\Follow up Email sent to Ryan Miller.\r\n01/10/2024: Received email from Ryan Miller <ryan_s_miller@uhc.com> in response to Hina\'s email stating that \"I received your email earlier today, but for some reason, I’m not able to reply directly to that message, but did attach it as reference.  I sent a detailed response and provided instructions to you on 12/15.  I have re-sent that email under separate cover so let me know if you don’t get it.\"\\Replied to Ryan.\r\n01/16/2024: Received Email from Miller, Ryan S <ryan_s_miller@uhc.com>, Stating \"Hina - I’ve sent it on 12/15, 1/9 and again today.  Can you check with your tech team to see if there’s a firewall or something preventing these messages from getting to you?\"\\Replied.\r\n01/16/2024: Received Email from Miller, Ryan S <ryan_s_miller@uhc.com>, Stating \"Instead of using a zip file, I’m trying to send this another way (see attached).  We will need an authorized signature on page 7 and 76 of the attached agreement to move forward.  Send them back to me and I’ll pass it off to our loading team for next steps.\"\r\n01/16/2024: Filled up information needed in contract and signed with authorized signature and sent to hina for review.\r\n01/17/2024: Received Email from Miller, Ryan S <ryan_s_miller@uhc.com>, with effective date 01/14/2024.\r\n01/17/2024: Called UHC to check Enrollment Status. Rep said, the practice QFM is Non Par and Provider Vanessa also Showing \"Out of Network\" as Individual Provider and Not linked with Practice Tax ID. Asked about the application status, rep suggested to contact credentialing department via live chat, Contacted chat support to check status, rep said as per roster report provider is showing par effective 01/14/2024 and shared roster plan list. Asked why the same is not loaded in the benefit team system yet, rep said it might take 30 business days from contract received date to uploaded contract in their system and suggest to allow time. Rep Name: Devin M, Laura, Sache Call Ref # 52912575, 04317924, 52928310.\r\n01/17/2024: Sent provi