com.\r\n10/05/2023: Called Oxford to follow up on the Metro & Liberty Plan addition request, rep said that, they don\'t have access to check provider application status and suggested to contact Credentialing Department via Email at networkhelp@uhc.com or NMRT@uhc.com. Told her that we have already sent follow up emails multiple time but not received any response and we were promised call back but didn\'t received any call. Rep apologies and said that as per recent request we were requested to allow 24 to 48 hours and we are still in that time frame so rep suggested to allow more time. Rep Name: Charlene H Call Ref # 39016421\r\n11/08/2023:  Called Oxford to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, the Astoria Speech and Language P.C. is Showing \"Non Contracted\" as a Group but Provider Leah Blakeley is Showing \"In Network\" and Linked with Practice Tax ID. Rep confirms that provider is \"In Network\" with Oxford Health Freedom Network and Choice Plus Effective 02/01/2023 but not with Metro & Liberty Network. Asked about the patient plan, rep confirmed that provider is considered Out of Network because Member has a HMO Plan with Oxford \"Liberty\" Network and there are no Out of Network coverage in HMO Plans. Asked about Metro & Liberty Plan addition request, rep said that, they don\'t have access to check provider application status and suggested that there NMRT Email Networkhelp@uhc.com is not operational currently and told that for credentialing related queries we can contact to live representative on there chat support. Rep suggested to login to www.uhcprovider.com and get started with live agent via chat support to be better assisted. Contacted Chat Support, rep said that he is unable to find any request for provider and suggested that he is applying on our behalf. Rep applied on our behalf and said that he has forwarded it to Network Manager and assured that they will contact us for further details in 5 to 7 business days. Rep Name: Gwen C Call Ref # 41206926 (Anil)\r\n12/18/2023: Called Oxford to check Metro & Liberty Plan Adding Request Status. Rep said, Practice Astoria Speech and Language P.C. is Showing \"Non Contracted\" as a Group but Provider Leah Blakeley is Showing \"In Network\" and Linked with Practice Tax ID. Rep confirms that provider is \"In Network\" with Oxford Health Freedom Network and Choice Plus Effective 02/01/2023 but Metro & Liberty Plans have not been added yet. Asked about Metro & Liberty Plan addition request, rep said that, they don\'t have access to check provider application status and suggested to contact live representative via chat support. Contacted Chat Support, rep said that Previously the request was submitted to Network Manager but not got submitted properly sometimes it happens because the system gets under maintenance and skip the upload process. Rep said that, he is submitting a escalation request to get the request loaded and forwarded it to Network Manager and assured that we will be contacted asap. Rep Name: Hannah C, Stella M, Jeevanantham Call Ref # 43790171, 04195243 $ \r\n01/31/2024: Called Oxford to check status, as per IVR provider need to recredentialed and asked to contact chat support for more information, Contacted Chat Support for status of Plan adding request. Rep said, Practice and Provider Leah are both Non Par. Rep confirms currently the contract has termed from 12/31/2023 showing in there system for the provider. Asked about Metro & Liberty Plan addition request, rep said that, we can submit the request for re credentialing with plan addition to hpdemo@uhc.com, if any additional information or documents is needed, they will reach out accordingly. Rep Name: IVR, Arun Call Ref # IVR01312024, 04343769','2024-01-31','2023-10-04 22:50:44','2024-01-31 22:39:33'),
