(80,15,42,'Group',22,'In-process',NULL,'08/18/2023: Application created under ATN 955357 09/05/2023: Submitted under tracking id 957779 09/07/2023: In process 09/22/2023: Called to check Enrollment Application Status. Asked about the Application Status ATN 957779, Rep confirms that, the application is in process with current status \"APPLICATION DEFICIENT\" Dt: 09/13/2023, there is a requirement for documents which need to be uploaded to further proceed with the application. List of the required documents are mentioned on Web Portal and we can check it using link : https://portal.flmmis.com/FLPublic/Provider_ProviderServices/Provider_Enrollment/Provider_Enrollment_EnrollmentStatus/tabId/57/Default.aspx. To check status Enter ATN 957779 and Practice Name as it is mentioned in the application. Rep Name: Cay, Andrea M Call Ref # 210394725 09/28/2023: Called to get help for submitting the required documents for Provider Dr. Ndidi Nwamu application. Rep guided about the steps to upload the require documents and submit the application to proceed with corrections made. As per Rep, Provider Background Screen is still needed to be performed by The Care Provider Background Screening Clearinghouse to complete the requirements for application. Rep Name: Ronald G Call Ref # 211452815 09/28/2023: Called Medicaid FL to get help for submitting the required documents for Provider Dr. Ndidi Nwamu application. Rep guided about the steps to upload the require documents and submit the application to proceed with corrections made. As per Rep, Provider Background Screen is still needed to be performed by The Care Provider Background Screening Clearinghouse to complete the requirements for application. Rep Name: Ronald G Call Ref # 211452815 10/02/2023: Called Medicaid FL to get update about the Application Status ATN 957779, Rep confirms that, the application is \"In Process\" and also confirms that the updates that we made are under review. Asked about the Back Ground Screening process, rep suggested that we can wait for the status to get updated and if there will ask again for it then we can contact the AHCA Clearing House: 850 412 4503 for details. Rep Name: Dominic Call Ref # 210613636','2023-10-05','2023-10-05 19:12:26',NULL),
