(82,16,45,'Group',83,'In-process','0000-00-00','08/02/2023: Called Superior Health to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, the practice \"Juniper Health & Wellness\" is showing \"Non Contracted\" as Group and Provider Dr. Sonya Ashley is also showing \"Out of Network\" and Not linked with Practice Tax ID. Rep suggested that, for Provider & Group Credentialing first we need to fill and submit the Initial Network Participation Form using Link: https://www.superiorhealthplan.com/providers/become-a-provider/contract-request-form.html\r\nand allow up to 30 days for evaluation and response of our inquiry. Someone from the credentialing department will contact us to guide further with Credentialing Process. Rep Name: Leonard G Call Ref # I-109859169 (Anil)\r\n08/03/2023: An applicaiton is submitted online and W9 has been emailed at SHP.NetworkDevelopment@SuperiorHealthPlan.com\r\n08/24/2023: Called Superior Health to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, the practice \"Juniper Health & Wellness\" is showing \"Non Contracted\" as Group and Provider Dr. Sonya Ashley is also showing \"Out of Network\" and Not linked with Practice Tax ID. Asked about the application Status, Rep suggested to contact Credentialing Dept, Rep also confirms that we can sent our inquiries via Email at: Credentialing@SuperiorHealthPlan.com or we can contact Austin Regional Office Account Manager at email:\r\nAM.Austin@@SuperiorHealthPlan.com. Rep suggests to allow more time since applied on 08/03/2023 and confirm that TAT for Credentialing application is 30 to 90 Business Days to complete. Rep Name: Patricia M Call Ref # I-111594437 (Anil)\r\n08/24/2023: Follow up email sent to Credentialing@SuperiorHealthPlan.com; am.austin@SuperiorHealthplan.com\r\n08/29/2023: Sonya got a docuemnt to be signed but didnt forward it to me, asked her to either sign it or send it back to me\r\n08/31/2023: Document is filled and sent to superior health\r\n09/29/2023: Follow up emal sent\r\n10/02/2023: Email received that the it is in process\r\n11/01/2023: Called Superior Health to check Enrollment. As per regional manager Reyna, confirmed that our practice \"Juniper Health & Wellness\" is showing \"Non Contracted\" as Group and Provider Dr. Sonya Ashley is also showing \"Out of Network\" and Not linked with Practice Tax ID. Asked about the application status, reyna said that, the contract has already been sent out at email address at hello@juniperhw.com and suggested to ask provider to check her email and junk folder. Asked reyna if she sent out the contract to different email address, she said that we have to sent request for changing our email address and resent the contract via email at AM.BH@SuperiorHealthPlan.com. Rep Name: Reyna V Call Ref # ReynaV11012023\r\n01/08/2024: Called Superior Health to check enrollment request status. Called Credentialing Dept went to voice mail left brief message. Called Superior Health Account Manager line also got voice mail suggesting to contact provider relations. Called provider relations, as per rep, she have a limited access and suggested to contact regional manager and provided her direct number Reyna Venegas : 512 642 7880 or we can sent our inquiries via Email at: Credentialing@SuperiorHealthPlan.com or AM.Austin@@SuperiorHealthPlan.com. Tried calling reyna got voice mail left brief message. Rep Name: Nora C Call Ref # I-122083141','2024-01-08','2023-10-07 00:34:12','2024-01-08 22:11:16'),
(83,16,45,'Group',8,'In-Network','2022-08-11','08/15/2023: Called Tricare East to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, the practice \"Juniper Health & Wellness LLC\" is showing \"In Network\" using the same Tax ID and Provider Dr. Sonya Ashley is Certified Effective Dt: 08/11/2022 showing \"In Network & Contracted\" Effective Dt: 01/01/2018, Contract # 000030954244  with no expiration date and linked with Practice Tax ID as well. Rep suggested that, they do not Credential Group they only do Individual provider and keep practice name for a record purpose and our provider is Good to go. Rep Name: Alma R, Toniya B Call Ref # ToniyaB08152023','2023-10-06','2023-10-07 00:39:50',NULL),
