(111,17,50,'Individual',15,'In-process','0000-00-00','10/17/2022 As per rep provider is non par and group is also non par, online application has been submitted via call application number is 13111242 Ref# Marie A 10172022  10/17/2022 Contract copy received from DocuSign System <dse_na2@docusign.net> signed the contract copy online...10/27/2022 Called Cigna As per rep application is currently under process TAT is 90-120 biz days Ref# Dalia V 10272022...11/10/2022 Called Cigna As per Rep application is under credentialing process suggested to call back within 3 weeks Ref# Lily M 11102022 03/28/2023 As per Rep application is at final stage Ref# Jeo M 03282023 04/03/2023: Agreement signed and sent 04/05/2023: Updated CV has been sent to everett via fax 04/19/2023 As per Rep application is under process 04/27/2023 As Per Rep application is still under process Ref# Dennis M 04272023 05/03/2023: An email is sent this time on provider@cigna.com to get an update 05/05/2023: As per rep it is in final steps Rep Name: LIN T Call Ref # LINT05052023 05/10/2023: In network, only effective date is remaining 06/02/2023: Email received that application has been moved to credentialing process 06/13/2023: The TAT to this applicaiton has already passed, the escalation in this regards ticket number 1256478 and said they will contact us with in 7 to 10 business days. 06/16/2023: Called again, and was told to call on 26th 06/27/2023: In process Rep Name: Angel M Call Ref # AngelM06272023. Applicaiton no 13332277 / Escalation Ticket # 1256478 08/30/2023: Called to asked about the Escalation, As per Rep, new application for Veena Reddy Dt: 08/16/2023 Application # 13420560 got closed 08/24/2023 from Medical Onboarding Team for Provider Veena Reddy reason being \"Provider does not meet the Criteria\". Rep said, we can sent email to inquire reason at intake_pdm@cigna.com and rep also escalated it further.  09/05/2023: Called to asked about the Escalation. Rep disused with supervisor Ram and confirmed that the escalation ticket # 1300507 Dt: 08/30/2023 is still under review, and suggested to allow more time. Rep also confirmed that her supervisor is sending follow up email to the concern dept and we can follow up after 30 business days. Rep Name: Bambie B Call Ref #  BambieB09052023 (Anil) 09/26/2023: Called to get update on Escalation for Veena Reddy. Asked about the Escalation ticket # 1300507 Dt: 08/30/2023, Rep said that the Ticket is still under review, since it is a group request and there is no fixed TAT for it but rep assured that there Medical Onboarding Team is working on it and suggested to allow more time. Rep Name: Rey L Call Ref # ReyL09262023 (Anil) 10/03/2023: Called to get update on Escalation for Veena Reddy. Rep said that the Ticket is still under review, since it is a group request and there is no fixed TAT for it but rep assured that there Medical Onboarding Team is working on it and suggested to allow more time. Talked to Supervisor Ram and he said that he need time to get update from concern dept and committed a Call Back with update with in 24 hours. Rep Name: Michelle H, Ram G Call Ref # RamG10032023\r\n10/18/2023: Called Cigna to get update on Email received for Doc sign for Veena Reddy. Told her that, we are unable to open the Doc and email is stating that \"Envelope has expired\" but we received the contract today only, also told her that we sent signed contract  on 05/26/2023 but since then we are following up on the application. As per Rep, it was sent from their Network Onboarding Team and apologies for the inconveyance about the Doc sign email, rep stated that she has contacted to the concern dept to sent the contract again since we are unable to open it and confirms that we will receive it on email credentialing@precisionhub.com with in 24 hours. We can sent back the Signed Contract and follow up after couple of days. Rep Name: Anna G Call Ref # AnnaG10182023 (Anil)\r\n10/19/2023: Called Cigna to get update on Email received Email with error for Doc signing for Veena Reddy. Told rep that, we received the promised email on 10/19/2023 and did signed the contact received via Docsign and again we received email from Cigna stating that \"BID: 13111242 has been voided for the following reason: \"Sent in error\". As per rep, the contract is voided and the application is denied due to reason that the panel is closed for the specialty for the location region which we have applied. Rep suggested that, we can sent our request for the consideration in detail via email to PSSCentral@Cigna.com. Rep Name: Rain, Sandy B Call Ref # SandyB10192023\r\n10/19/2023: Sent LOI & W9 via secure Email to 9PSSCENT@cigna.com for credentialing consideration request.\r\n10/26/2023: Called Texas Department of Insurance. Rep said that, we can file online complaint against the insurance using link: https://gov.sircon.com/consumerPortalLogin.do?method=initProcess&request.authorization.token=aakyidoreJqYQVz5rKYYvDrHLiqm6u2v. we need to register first and file a complain. Once complain will be filled they will sent notice to the insurance and insurance have 15 days time to respond to them. Once they get a response they are going to communicate with us. TAT is 90 Days for the complain. Rep Name: Britney Call Ref #  Britney10262023 (Anil)\r\n10/27/2023: Submitted online complaint againist Cigna with Texas State Department of Insurance Consumer portal Complaint ID: 376580.\r\n10/31/2023: Received Email from TDI department of insurance to confirm complaint number: 376580 against Cigna Health for provider Veena Reddy.\r\n10/31/2023: Received Email from TDI department of insurance to confirm complaint number: 376580 againt Cigna Health for provider Veena Reddy.\r\n11/07/2023: Received call from Cigna Yvonne Hall (860) 787-6359 inquiring about the FMA provider Veena Reddy, discussed and gave her required information. She said that she will update this to her supervisor and further contact with us in need : Rep Name: Yvonne Hall Ref # YvonneHall11072023.\r\n12/01/2023: Email Received via secure email from 9PSSCENT@Cigna.com, stating \"The normal credentialing process will be followed, you can either email your request or call the Provider Support Unit for credentialing to initiate the credentialing process over the phone. However, please take note that provider may only reapply 1 year after 08/24/2023. Currently we are not able to accept your application to re-join the network.\" Replied for Clarification.\r\n12/04/2023: Called Cigna to get update on the Email received for Veena Reddy. Rep said the last application was closed with reason \"Denied from Onboarding Committee\" with no further details provided. Rep and said that, he discussed the case with his Supervisor Ram and Ram asked rep to create provider new application on call and sent it to Ram so he can follow up on it as he have better access now to contact medical onboarding team. Rep created new application # 13535386 and said that he is forwarding it to Supervisor and committed a Call Back with update with in 24 hours from Supervisor. Rep Name: Josh S Call Ref # JoshS12042023 (Anil)\r\n12/05/2023: Email Received from secure email from 9PSSCENT@Cigna.com, stating that \"Upon reviewing your past applications, those are closed due to the reason of “Process stopped by Cigna”. It usually happens when a provider is terminated in any Cigna owned network based on a certain guideline that Cigna followed. Also, it happens when the individual provider has a denied status in one of our system. However, there is an open application as we look in our data base. The reference number are 13535386 and it was started last 12/04/2023 and 13528941 that was initiated last 11/23/2023. Please confirm if you initiated these applications and if yes, we are not guaranteeing you that this will be approved. Again, credentialing usually take 60 business days to complete but because of higher email volume it can take up to 90-120 business days. The Medical Onboarding Team is the one who is handling the credentialing right now.\" Replied with Confirmation.\r\n12/06/2023: Email Received via secure email from 9PSSCENT@Cigna.com, stating that \"Your application is currently in process and was received on 12/04/2023. Your application reference number is 13535386. The credentialing process can take 90-120 days. We will do our best to process your application as soon as possible. You will receive an email notification once you have been approved and credentialed as a network-participating provider with your effective date.\" Replied. $ \r\n01/31/2024: Received Email from Cigna Provider Onboarding Status <DiscoverCigna@information.cigna.com>, Stating \"CREDENTIALING STATUS UPDATE, Status: Application complete. Credentialing process to begin. Reference number 13535386. We have confirmed that your application is complete, and have forwarded it for credentialing review. During this stage of the application process, Credentialing will perform primary source verification, and your application will be reviewed by the Credentialing committee. We will contact you if we need any additional information, and will let you know when this step is complete.\" $','2024-01-31','2023-10-12 01:01:07','2024-01-31 19:34:30'),
