(119,17,50,'Individual',84,'In-Network','2023-01-01','01/05/2023: Called Oscar, to check enrollment status. As per Rep, Practice FMA is Showing as \"Not Contracted\" and Provider Veena Reddy is also showing \"Out of Network\". Rep transffered to Network Assistance Dept for Credentialing related questions, Rep Suggested that to get credentialed we need to sent our request to Ascension Austin for credentialing via Email: SHPProviderServices@seton.org or SHPnetworkdevolpment@seton.org. Name: Rain N, Briee S, Mikee D, Ref # Service-9841290, Service-9841771\r\n03/10/2023: Called Oscar, to inquire about the Contract Plan List and Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice FMA is Showing as \"Non Contracted\" as Group and Provider Murray Snook is Showing \"In Network\" Effective 01/21/2022 under the same Tax ID. Plan Name Commercial Cigna + Oscar for the state of Taxes. Rep Confirms that, they have Dr Reddy is Showing \"In Network\" Effective 01/16/2023 with commercial plan only, to get Cigna + Oscar we need to call Credentialing Dept 800 882 4462 Rep Name: Clowie L Call Ref # service-10384553\r\n03/24/2023: Called Oscar, to verify the Phone Number for Practice. As per Rep, we are Not Credentialed with Oscar. Lisa M Ref #  Service-10485293\r\n06/22/2023: Called Oscar, Health to Confirm Change Address Procedure. As per Rep, Practice FMA is Showing \"Not Contracted\" as a Group but Group Tax ID is linked with several individual providers who are showing \"In Network\" with same practice address with Oscar Commercial Plans. Rep suggested to change address we can submit request on call by providing complete new address or we can sent our request via Email at: rosters@hioscar.com including providers names and NPI numbers and concern in email body. Oscar’s credentialing team will reply within 1-3 business days and guide with further process and documentation required. We can also confirm with them if we need to submit separate requests for each individual provider for change of address. Rep Name: Dominic P Call Ref # Service-11041506 (Anil)\r\n08/10/2023: Called Oscar. Health to Confirm if the Address. As per Rep, the Practice FMA is showing \"In Network\" with Oscar Commercial Plans. As per Rep, for Practice FMA the Primary Address is updated as \"1106 Clayton Lane Suite 102W Austin, TX 78723\" and Secondary Address is updated as 2701 S Hwy 183, Suite B Leander, TX 78641 for all the providers under the Roster. Rep Name: Gerald T Call Ref # Service-113241778','2023-12-07','2023-10-12 01:22:24','2023-12-08 06:09:26'),
