(121,17,50,'Individual',85,'In-Network','2022-12-08','Sana Benefits - 11/23/2022 Called Sana Benefits as per rep we can submit claims if we are not in network with Sana benefits, rep also suggested to get enrolled with health smart in order to get the claims paid, we can send our claims on sanabenefits po box 855arnold mayryland 21012 Ref#271015   11/23/2022 An email has been sent on hello@sanabenefits.com for enrollment process  11/28/2022 An online gorup application has been submitted on health smart website  11/28/2022 An individual application has also been submitted on the health smart website  12/13/2022 Online application has been filled  12/20/2022 Sent an email on hello@sanabenefits.com for current status on our submitted application.  12/27/2022 Received an email provider is in network as effective 12/08/2022\r\n03/27/2023: Called Sana Benefits to verify the Phone Number for the Practice. As per the Rep, they don\'t have Credentialing requirement and there is no data available in their records for the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. Rep Name: Judy R Ref # JudyR03272023 (Anil)\r\n\r\n03/10/2023: Called Sana Benefits to inquire about the Contract Plan List and Enrollment Status. As per the Rep, Sana Benefits does not have requirement for provider\'s Credentialing.  As per the Rep, Sana is a Open Access Network so Providers do not need to get then self Credentialed to file Claims to Sana Benefits. Rep said that providers can directly sent Claims to Sana Benefits. Rep also confirms that they have a fixed fee schedule for provider they will pay 120% of Medicare Fee Schedule and 140% for Facility. To get enrolled in Sana Community Provider List we can fill online form link: https://secure.sanabenefits.com/public/join-the-sana-community, or email at: contracting@sanabenefits.com, It usually take 30 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Jermine  Call Ref # JermineB03102023 (Anil)\r\n\r\n01/06/2023: Called Sana Benefits to check enrollment status. As per the Rep, Sana Benefit does not have any Credentiling requirement. As per Rep, Sana is a Open Acess Network so Providers does not need to get then self Credentialed to bill Sana Benefits. Rep said that providers can directly bill them. also confirms that they Pay 120% to provider and 140% to Facility following Medicare fee schedule.To get enrolled in Sana Community Provider List we can fill online form link: https://secure.sanabenefits.com/public/join-the-sana-community, or email at: contracting@sanabenefits.com, it usually take 30 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Amah H Ref # 292462 (Anil)\r\n\r\n06/22/2023: Called Sana Benefit to Confirm Change Address Procedure. As per the Rep, Sana Benefit does not have any Credentialing requirement. As per Rep, Sana is a Open Access Network so Providers does not need to get then self Credentialed to bill Sana Benefits and there is no need to update the address. Rep Name: Rayan S Ref # 407332 (Anil)','2023-10-11','2023-10-12 01:25:01','2023-11-03 14:25:33'),
(122,17,50,'Individual',86,'In-Network','2023-01-24','Scott & White - 11/28/2022 An online application has been submitted for provider  12/14/2022 Received applications submitted for the provider  12/20/2022 Sent the filled forms 01/09/2023: Application is in process 01/10/2023 application is in process future effective date is 01/24/2023\r\n03/27/2023: Called Scott & White to verify the Phone Number for the Practice. As per the Rep, Phone Number (510) 402-7701 is updated for Provider Murray Snook since he is showing In Network with the same Facility Address but the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A is Out of Network. Rep Suggests that we can update the Providers Phone Number by filling up to online form via website Link: https://www.bswhealthplan.com/Pages/Demographic-Update-Form.aspx. Need to fill this online form and Upload W9 Form with it to get the request completed. Rep Name: Jennifer S Ref # JenniferS03/27/2023 (Anil)\r\n\r\n03/10/2023: Called Scott & White to inquire about the Contract Plan List and Enrollment Status. As per Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Not Contracted\" Practicing Facility and provider Murray Snook is showing \"In Network\" Effective 01/26/2023 under the same Tax ID. Rep also confirms that all other providers are showing \"In Network\" under the same Tax ID. Asked Rep to provide the Plan List that we are In Network with, rep suggested that we can check it via portal using Link: https://pam.bswhealthplan.com/. We can login and check Plans List and also raise request to add any specific plan in our contract from protal, We can also contact Tiffany Brown Provider Relations: 512 553 9089 for any further assistance. Rep Name: Orlanda B Call Ref # OrlandaB03102023 (Anil)\r\n\r\n01/09/2023: Called Scott & White to check enrollment status. As per Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Not Contracted\" Practicing Facility and for provider Veena Reddy is showing \"Out of Network\", Rep suggested that for Scott & White Credentialing we can visit online using Link: https://www.bswhp.org/Providers/Pages/default.aspx#join and apply online. First we need to Register using Link: https://pam.bswhealthplan.com/ and Create Login, After Login we can follow the prompting instructions and complete the Application. Credentialing Department usually takes 30 to 45 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Richard M  Ref # CAS-3520785-Y5H2K9 (Anil)\r\n\r\n06/23/2023: Called Scott & White to Confirm Change of Address Procedure & Enrollment status. As per Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing \"Not Contracted\" as Group and provider Veena Reddy is also showing \"Out of Network\". Rep suggested that, to get Credentialed we can visit online portal using Link: https://www.bswhp.org/Providers/Pages/default.aspx#join > Select New Individual & Group Contract Form. First we need to Register and Create Login User ID & Password, After Login is created we can follow the prompting instructions to complete the Application Form using new address. Credentialing Department usually takes 30 to 45 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Gerald M  Ref # CAS-3520829-Y5H2K8 (Anil)','2023-11-03','2023-10-12 01:27:27','2023-11-03 14:30:40'),
(123,17,50,'Individual',67,'In-Network','2023-01-01','Linked with Aetna, provider has been credentialed successfully\r\n01/05/2023: Called Meritain Health to check enrollment status. Meritain Health Rep transferred the call to Aetna Credentialing Dept. As per the Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" Practicing Facility with Aetna Effective 09/15/2014 and Provider Veena Reddy is Showing \"In Network\" for the state of Taxes Effective 01/01/2023. Rep confirmed that once we get Credentialed with Aetna Commercial Plan, we Automatically get enrolled with Meritain Health Plans and there is no separate credentialing required for Meritain Health. Rep Name: Tasheika O, Rachel Q Ref # 6127210392 (Anil)\r\n\r\n03/24/2023: Called Meritain Health to verify the Phone Number for the Practice. Meritain Health Rep transferred the call to Aetna Credentialing Dept. As per the Rep, Phone Number (512) 872-6868 is updated for the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. We can also request for the Demograpic update with LOI with W9 Form, mention the practice details in the matter of letter and mention the reason of request via Fax at # 859 455 8650. Rep Name: Jay W Ref # 6139657999 (Anil)\r\n\r\n06/21/2023: Called Meritain Health to Confirm Change Address Procedure. Meritain Health Rep transferred the call to Aetna Credentialing Dept. As per the Rep, the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" as a Group Effective 01/20/2022. Rep Suggested that, to change address we can go sent the Request via Fax with LOI and W9 Form Fax # 859 455 8650. Attn : Network Management. It will take 30 business days to complete the request. Rep Name: Rhea D Call Ref # 9825 (Anil)\r\n\r\n08/09/2023: Called Meritain Health to Confirm if the Address is updated. As per Rep, for Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. the Address was updated last time in Year 2018 and Primary Address is updated as \"6633 E HIGHWAY 290 STE 300 AUSTIN, TX 78723-1158\". Rep confirms that the Fax Number it was sent to and apologies because they have updated Fax Number. Rep Suggested that, to resent the request via Fax with LOI and W9 Form to the Fax # 763 852 5044. Attn: Network Management. It will take 30 business days to complete the request. Rep Name: Ackevia W Call Ref # AckeviaW08092023 (Anil)','2023-10-11','2023-10-12 01:29:04','2023-11-03 14:15:17'),
(124,17,50,'Individual',77,'In-Network','2022-09-23','11/23/2022 Called Geha as per rep group is par and in order to link provider under the group need to contact uhc  11/23/2022 an email has been sent on NMRT <networkhelp@uhc.com> for enrollment process  11/28/2022 Online provider nomination form has been completed  11/28/2022 An LOI and W-9 has been sent on csgehainbox@geha.com for enrollment/email failed need to be unblocked  12/14/2022 Sent the applications via email csgehainbox@geha.com  12/27/2022 Received applications filled and sent it back via fax 01/16/2023 Received an email from csgehainbox@geha.com information has been forwarded to provider data management department for review and update 02/02/2023 An email has been sent on CSGEHA Inbox <CSGEHAInbox@GEHA.com> for current status on the application 02/07/2023: Linked with UHC so provider is credentialed with UHC\r\n03/27/2023: Called Geha to verify the Phone Number for the Practice. As per the Rep, Phone Number (512) 872-6868 is updated for the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. We can also request for the Demograpic update via Email: centralPRteam@uhc.com. Rep Name: Jay P Ref # JayP03272023 (Anil)\r\n\r\n01/06/2023: Called GEHA to check enrollment status. Tried couple of time but unable to reach the Rep with out Passcode. Called UHC to inquire about GEHA Credentialing. As per the Rep GEHA in not credentialing by them self and UHC credentialing department is not open for calls, we can sent our credentiling related queries at Email: networkhelp@uhc.com. Rep suggested that we can also apply online using Link: https://www.uhcprovider.com/en/resource-library/Join-Our-Network.html. Credentialing Department usually take 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Leo C Ref # LeoC0106/2023 (Anil)\r\n\r\n06/23/2023: Called GEHA to Confirm Change of Address Procedure. Tried couple of time but unable to reach the Rep with out Passcode. Called UHC to inquire about GEHA Credentialing. As per Rep, the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" as a Group with GEHA Effective 11/13/2021. Rep suggested that GEHA does not have any separate Credentialing Department, If we have already applied for Change of Address with UHC Commercial, then we don\'t have to apply separately for GEHA. Once Change of Address will be completed for UHC Commercial, then it will be Automatically update for GEHA. Rep suggested that, since UHC Credentialing Department is not open for calls, we can sent our Network related queries to Email: networkhelp@uhc.com Or centralPRteam@uhc.com. Rep Name: Sahnia S Call Ref # 6733  (Anil)','2023-10-11','2023-10-12 01:32:19','2023-11-03 14:27:48'),
