(126,17,50,'Individual',8,'In-Network','2023-02-27','03/15/2023 Provider is certified as effective of 02/07/2023 for Enrollment it follows Humana : 06/14/2023: Called Tricare East to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, provider Veena Reddy showing \"Certified and Credentialed\" Effective 02/27/2023 and Linked with Tax ID for Group FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. with same address. Rep confirm that, Clinic and Groups does not require to get Certified or Credentialed with Tricare East only Individual Providers need to do that. Since she is already linked with practice Tax ID she can use the same for claims submission. Rep Name: Wolf P, Rochelle S, Kayla M, Joanna M Ref # WolfP06142023, RochelleS06142023, KaylaM06142023, JoannaM06142023\r\n01/05/2023: Called Tricare East to check enrollment status. As per Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" Practicing Facility Effective 04/12/2014 and for provider Veena Reddy showing \"Out of Network\". Rep suggested that, provider need to get Certified with them first using online portal: https://www.humanamilitary.com/provider/access/become-a-tricare-provider/get-certified and after getting Certified we need to apply using online portal for joining the Tricare Network Link:https://www.humanamilitary.com/provider/access/become-a-tricare-provider/join-the-network\r\nCredentialing Department usually take 30 to 90 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Natasha, Tonie B Ref # 17934504, 17934637 (Anil)\r\n\r\n03/24/2023: Called Tricare East to verify the Phone Number for the Practice. As per the Rep, Phone Number (512) 872-6868 is updated for the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. We can also request for the Demographic update by Downloading the Form and sent it back using the info at the end of the Form, we can download form via Link: https://docushare-web.apps.external.pioneer.humana.com/Marketing/docushare-app?file=4071535. Rep Name: Owen S, Silvia W Ref # Silvia W03242023 (Anil)\r\n\r\n06/22/2023: Called Tricare East to Confirm Change Address Procedure. As per Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" as a Group Effective 04/12/2014. Rep Confirms that for Address Change request we can sent it to Fax # 608 221 7535 with update W9 form Attn: Provider Service Certification. It will take 90 Business Days to complete the request.  Rep Name: Alicia P, Ketevia H Call Ref # KeteviaH06222023 (Anil)\r\n\r\n08/11/2023: Called Tricare East to Confirm if the Address is updated. As per Rep, for Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, Primary Address is updated as \"1106 Clayton Lane Suite 102W Austin, TX 78723\" and Secondary Address is updated as 2701 S Hwy 183, Suite B Leander, TX 78641 and also confirm the updated Phone # is (512) 872-6868. Also asked rep to sent confirmation Email, rep suggest to sent request via Fax to Fax # 608 221 7535. Rep Name: Lora G, Lashonda M Call Ref #  LoraG08112023, LashondaM08112023','2023-10-11','2023-10-12 01:37:20','2023-11-03 14:13:39'),
(127,17,50,'Individual',10,'In-Network','2023-09-01','03/21/2023 Group application has been submitted 04/24/2023 An email has been sent on pif@multiplan.com for enrollment of group 04/26/2023: Recieved an email along with rates, email sent to process 05/31/2023: Emailed again for follow up to pif@multiplan.com  06/20/2023: Email sent again 06/20/2023: This applicaiton SEID: 230322233444 is in process. Rep Name: Tammika F Ref # 887034 06/28/2023: Applicaiton is in process. Rep Name: Kurt G Ref # KurtG06282023 07/06/2023: Successfully credentailed effective 09/01/2023/ Contract and fee schedule is mailed to everyone. 09/26/2023: Email sent with W9 and COI at appmissinginfo@multiplan.com\r\n09/01/2023, Rep confirmed that Group is Credentialed Effective 09/01/2023. Asked about provider \"Veena Reddy\", rep confirmed that provider is still showing \"Out of Network\" and the application is on Hold due to missing information. Asked Rep about the names of providers linked with this contract, Rep said that, providers Murray Snook, Shiram Herrera, Jessica Hezekiah, Stephanie Rae Moench, Sarah Bradshaw are linked with the Practice Tax ID and provider Odessa Sue Hernandez, Veena Reddy, ROSALIA LOPEZ DE ALDA, Michelle D. Caneda and April Murrieta are not linked with Prctice Tax ID. Rep said that we need to submit W9 & Professional Laibility of Insurance (MalPractice) for Providers Veena Reddy & ROSALIA LOPEZ DE ALDA send it via Fax # 781 487 8257 Or email at appmissinginfo@multiplan.com. Provider Michelle D. Caneda need to update CAQH and resubmit the request. Provider April Murrieta request is \"In Process\" and need to allow more time. As per Rep, usually it takes 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Karissa W, Anna P Call Ref # 9159421, 9159488 (Anil)\r\n09/26/2023: Email sent with W9 and COI at appmissinginfo@multiplan.com','2023-10-11','2023-10-12 01:38:18','2023-11-03 14:02:40'),
(128,17,50,'Individual',66,'panel-closed','0000-00-00','11/28/2022 An online application has been submitted for Carefirst community health plan 11/28/2022 An email has been sent on ProviderMD@CareFirst.com for provider enrollment process 12/7/2022: Online application has been submitted 12/20/2022 An email has been sent on ProviderMD@CareFirst.com for the current status on the application 01/17/2023: Sent an email to check the status. 02/02/2023 An email has been sent on ProviderMD@CareFirst.com for status 02/02/2023 Called Carefirst but they dont have any direct line for credentialing 02/14/2023 Email has been sent on ProviderMD@CareFirst.com for the status 02/15/2023 Called Carefirst As per Rep they dont cover texas state.\r\n01/09/2023: Called BCBS CARE FIRST to check enrollment status. As per the IVR Care First lines are closed for Calls and asked to leave message, as per the IVR we need to visit website to get credentialed and we can apply online by visiting Link: https://provider.carefirst.com/providers/join-our-networks/professional-credentialing-how-to-apply OR Email pda@carefirst.com Rep Name: IVR Ref # IVR01092023 (Anil)\r\n\r\n02/15/2023 Called Carefirst As per Rep they dont cover texas state\r\n\r\n03/27/2023: Called BCBS CARE FIRST to verify the Phone Number for the Practice. As per the IVR, Care First lines are closed for Calls and only Voice Mail Option is available to leave message, as per the IVR we need to visit website to get update on credentialing and we update our demographic information by visiting Link: https://provider.carefirst.com/providers/resources/update-practice-info.page OR sent\r\nour inquries via Email: pda@carefirst.com Rep Name: IVR Ref # IVR03272023 (Anil)\r\n\r\n06/23/2023: Called BCBS CARE FIRST to Confirm Change of Address Procedure. As per Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Not Contracted\" as a Group. As per Rep, Care First is not operating in the State of Texas. Providers Located in the State of Texas can Contact Local BCBS of Texas for Credentialing or updating Demographics. Rep Name: Mary W Call Ref # MaryW06232023 (Anil)','2023-10-11','2023-10-12 01:39:35','2023-11-03 14:34:08'),
(129,18,52,'Group',15,'In-Network','2023-10-16','10/16/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep said, Practice is Non Par and Provider Kristina is Par but under different Tax ID. Rep suggested that, we can apply for Group by sending request via Email at: PSScentral@cigna.com, In Subject Line mention \"Group Name, State, Tax ID with LOI and W9 Form in Email body \"Group Name, Full Service Address, Tax ID #, Specialty & Contact Person Details. Rep also suggested to sent request for provider linkage via email at intake_PDM@cigna.com. Credentialing Department usually take 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Andrea L Call Ref # AndreaL10162023  $\r\n10/16/2023: Credentialing Request with LOI & W9 form via Email at PSScentral@cigna.com & intake_PDM@cigna.com. $ \r\n10/27/2023: Received Email from PDM COGZ <PDMCOGZ@Cigna.com> via secure email, inquiring about the Practice Premier Vitality IV & Wellness & provider Kristina Lynch request with Cigna reference ID W202310163470652, replied via secure email providing the required information. $ \r\n11/02/2023: Received Email from Cigna PDMCOGZ@Cigna.com via secure email, with Notification # W202310163470652, This request has been completed. CPF Provider ID 4660710, Effective Dt 10/16/2023. $ \r\n11/02/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep said, Practice is Par Effective 10/16/2023 and Provider Kristina is also Par Effective 10/16/2023 and linked with Practice Tax ID. Asked about the copy of contract, rep suggested that, we can request via Email at: PSScentral@cigna.com. Rep Name: Joe F Call Ref # JoeF11022023 $ \r\n01/11/2024: Request for Copy of Contract sent with LOI with W9 at PSScentral@cigna.com.\\Received response to allow 30 days. $ \r\n01/12/2024: Received Email from Cigna PSScentral@cigna.com stating \"We are unable to release the participating provider agreement to third party. please ask provider to contact us directly.\"\\Communicated same to Susan to share with provider. $','2024-01-25','2023-10-17 15:22:35','2024-01-25 17:11:26'),
