e the tax id and services rendered does not meet the criteria for group and rep suggested to reapply via online application under \"facility\" using Link: www.aetna.com. Rep Name: Ally Call Ref # 6174535200 $ \r\n12/19/2023: Called to get to guidance with filling Online Application. Rep, the application for Provider Kristina Lynch got closed because provider does not meet the criteria for provider agreement under wait loss program, red light therapy and the tax id and services rendered does not match, rep suggested to apply online under facility and guided to select the correct options. Rep Name: Ann R Call Ref # 6174552523 $\r\n12/19/2023: Online Facility Application Submitted Screen Shot Saved. $ \r\n01/05/2024: Called to check online facility application status. Rep confirmed that they received the application on 12/21/2023, the ticket was generated against NAF-675012 it got closed on 12/22/2023 with notes that the request has been forwarded to back office for review. Rep said that she is creating a new ticket and escalating it to concern dept for follow up on status Ticket # NAF-6788017. TAT is 30 days but we can follow up in a week. Rep Name: Rhea S  Call Ref # 6176626215 $\r\n01/26/2024: Called Aetna to check application status for Practice Premier Vitality. Rep confirmed that NAF-675012 was closed on 12/22/2023 with notes that the request has been forwarded to back office for review, the new ticket was created to escalate further for follow up on 01/05/2024 Ticket # NAF-6788017, Rep confirms that the Ticket # NAF-6788017 got closed on 01/09/2023 and the application got closed on 01/16/2024 with the notes that \" Panel is Closed\" for the practice location and specialty and rep said that we can not apply before one year. Rep confirm that same was communicated via email at hina@precisionhub.com, told rep that we didn\'t receive any email and ask rep to escalate it. Rep said that, he is creating a new ticket to escalate it to concern dept to sent the Panel Status in written via email, we can follow up after two weeks for status with Ticket # NAF-683543. Rep Name: Ian A Call Ref # 6179242950 $','2024-01-26','2023-10-17 15:23:30','2024-01-26 20:21:05'),
(131,18,52,'Group',9,'In-process','0000-00-00','10/16/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep said, Practice is Non Par and Provider Kristina Par but under different Tax ID. Rep suggested that we can visit online portal and apply using Link: https://www.uhcprovider.com/en/resource-library/Join-Our-Network.html or sent request via Email at networkhelp@uhc.com along with LOI with W9 Form. Credentialing Department usually take 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Zin T Call Ref # D7542 $ \r\n10/16/2023: Credentialing Request with LOI & W9 form via Email at networkhelp@uhc.com $ \r\n10/17/2023: Online Application submitted Reference Number: CR-100000564635. $ \r\n10/23/2023: Received an Call from UHC for Premier Vitality IV & Wellness Center for provider Kristina Lynch MD requesting to sent W9 Form via Email at krista.malinao@uhc.com. Rep Name: Krista M Call Ref # PR7779126 $ \r\n10/23/2023: Sent W9 from to Email krista.malinao@uhc.com. $ \r\n11/30/2023: Contacted to UHC Chat Support for Provider Kristina Lynch, asked about the application Ref #: CR-100000564635, rep said the application got closed because the group needs to be credentialed first and because provider is Par already with Different Tax ID and they can not link the provider with non existing group. Rep suggested that we can sent the request with W9 and LOI via email at hpdemo@uhc.com. Rep Name: Stephani, Nai Ref # Stephani11302023, Nai11302023 $ \r\n11/30/2023: Sent W9 from and LOI to Email hpdemo@uhc.com. $ \r\n12/01/2023: Received Email today with Error, \"hpdemo@uhc.com (hpdemo@uhc.com) Your message couldn\'t be delivered. Despite repeated attempts to contact the recipient\'s email system it didn\'t respond.\" Tried to apply online but the previous application # CR-100000564635 is still showing in process, so unable to apply for the new application. $ \r\n12/07/2023: Contacted to UHC Chat Support for Provider Kristina Lynch, asked rep that we have tried to reapply from onboarding pro but it says that the application # CR 100000564635 is already In Process and also sent W9 and LOI via email at hpdemo@uhc.com but it also bounce back with error. Rep said that the application got closed because the group needs to be loaded in their system. Rep suggested that we can sent the documents to him and he will forward it to concern dept for review sent W9 and LOI via chat and rep said that he is forwarding it further for review and someone will get back to us. Rep Name: Andrelle, Jean Ref # 04249047 $ \r\n12/11/2023: Contacted to UHC Chat Support for Provider Kristina Lynch, asked rep about the request status, as per rep there is incomplete request Rep asked provider information and contact person details to complete request and asked to sent LOI and W9 over chat, provided needed information rep said that she had submitted request and provided request reference number PR-7903522 and asked to allow time to process. TAT is 30 to 45 Day. Rep Name: Nai Ref # 04255300 $ \r\n01/05/2024: Contacted Chat Support to check application status. rep said, they have received request on 12/11/2023 and is still under review with reference number PR-7903522, rep suggested to allow more time. TAT is 30 to 45 Day. Rep also suggested to sent request via email at hpdemo@uhc.com. Rep Name: Carol Chat Ref # 04298482. $ \r\n01/08/2024: LOI with W9 for linkage request sent to hpdemo@uhc.com as suggested by rep.\\Received Error. $ \r\n01/08/2024: Contacted UHC Chat Support to ask about the application status. Rep said, they have received request on 12/11/2023 under PR-7903522 got closed with remarks that \"Currently the market is closed for the Group and Pr-7903522 was closed because the group is not currently loaded in the system\". Rep suggested to email at HPdemo, told rep that we tried already but received error and online application is already closed with remarks that provider does not required credentialing as already showing \"In Network\". Rep suggested that, in this case we need to contact the Care Coordination department @ 800-635-6882. As rep if she can help, rep suggested that she is sending request to HPdemo on our behalf and they will get back to us via email. Rep Name: Ashley, Robin Chat Ref # 04299642, 04299942 $ \r\n01/08/2024: Called UHC Care Coordination Department, told rep about the email issue at HP demo and online application. Rep said that, she is escalating it further to her supervisor and he will escalate it further to the credentialing dept and some one from the dept will get back to us with in 72 hours. Rep suggested to contact IT Dept 866 842 3278 for email white listing issue. Called IT Support, Rep said that, it is out of there domain and asked to contact chat support for same issue asked to speak with supervisor, call transferred to supervisor and he suggested, the NMRT, Hpdemo and other email for network related issues are not being operational any more and to get this checked we can contact chat support. Rep Name: Trisha R, Sanshi B, Paulo B Call Ref # 51791709, 63727 $ \r\n01/09/2024: Received Email from UnitedHealthcare_Request_AddlInfo <unitedhealthcare_request_addlinfo@uhc.com> under Reference: PR-7961628, Stating that \"Required to submit the information listed below before Jan 17th 2024.\"\\Replied with required information. $ \r\n01/10/2024: Received Email from UHC Provider Contracting <adobesign@adobesign.com>, Stating that \"UHC Provider Contracting Has Sent You UnitedHealthcare (UHC) Contract - PREMIER VITALITY IV & WELLNESS CENTER - SMGA (GD-42148445) to Sign\". Forwarded to hina to share with provider to sign the online contract and submit. $ \r\n01/10/2024: Contacted UHC Live Chat Support, asked rep to resent the contract for signing, rep asked few information and said that, she has requested the pending agreement for Premier Vitality IV & Wellness Center to be re-emailed to Kristina Lynch attention via AdobeSign under reference number GD-42148445. We should receive an updated copy of the agreement for review and signature within the next 24-48 hours if not sooner. Rep suggested that we can also sent email to the same email address who were already in communication with us regarding the case. Rep Name: Myriam Call Ref # 04305935 $ \r\n01/10/2024: Email sent requesting to resent the contract to <unitedhealthcare_request_addlinfo@uhc.com>. $ \r\n01/19/2024: Received email from UHC Provider Contracting <adobesign@adobesign.com>, got Contract - PREMIER VITALITY IV & WELLNESS CENTER - SMGA (GD-42148445) to Sign, upon checking it is the still showing cancelled and contract is not opening for signing.\\Sent email to activate the agreement and resent it for signing. $ \r\n01/25/2024: Received email from UHC Provider Contracting <adobesign@adobesign.com>, got Contract - PREMIER VITALITY IV & WELLNESS CENTER - SMGA (GD-42148445) to Sign, Filled up Form signed and Submitted, Downloaded the copy for record and snap shot saved.\\Emailed contract copy and snap shot to Hina. $ \r\n01/26/2024: Contacted UHC Live Chat Support, asked rep about the request status ref # GD-42148445, rep said that GD-42148445 and PR-7961628 are both in progress and allow more time for this information to be fully uploaded/updated in our system. Rep said that please know that TAT for contract process is 30 days for the demographical part and an additional 30-45 days for the contracting part. Rep Name: Myriam Call Ref # 04336545 $','2024-01-26','2023-10-17 15:24:15','2024-01-26 21:24:55'),
(132,18,52,'Group',22,'In-Network','2023-11-29','10/17/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. As per IVR, Practice is Non Par and Provider Kristina is Par but under different Tax ID. As per IVR, we can visit online portal and apply using Link: https://eprep.health.maryland.gov/sso/login.do. Credentialing Department usually take 30 to 90 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: IVR Call Ref # IVR10172023 $ \r\n10/17/2023: Onilne Application Filled for Group # 2310H8TS and Provider Affrication # 2310BINF. $ \r\n10/18/2023: Called EPrep Portal Help Desk to get help for completing the provider affiliation. As per Rep, in order to complete the application we need to request for admin access and rep guided how to apply. Request created and rep suggested that we will get the response with in 24 to 48 hours. Rep Name: Kelly A Call Ref # KellyA10182023 $ \r\n10/19/2023: Received Email from ePREP-MDH@dharbor.com an ePREP Portal Administration, stating that your Request for Admin access has been approved. $ \r\n10/19/2023: Online application for the Provider and Group have been completed and submitted. Group Application # 2310H8TS and Provider Affiliation Application # 2310BINF. $ \r\n10/19/2023: Called EPrep Portal Help Desk to get the application status. Rep confirms that, the Group Application # 2310H8TS and Provider Affiliation Application # 2310BINF both have been submitted and completed successfully. Rep suggested that it might take two week to review the application and guided how to track the application status from portal. Rep suggested that we need to allow time for review and usually it might take 30 to 60 days to complete the process. Rep Name: Tanay Call Ref # Tanay10192023 $ \r\n10/25/2023: Received email from ePREP for the application deficiency, Worked on Online application for Premier Vitality IV & Wellness Center for Kristina Lynch and resubmitted the application, received response Your application (Application ID: 2310H8TS; NPI: 1528761145) in ePREP has been Resubmitted. $ \r\n10/26/2023: Received email from ePREP for the application deficiency, Worked on Online application for Premier Vitality IV & Wellness Center for Kristina Lynch and resubmitted the application, received response Your application (Application ID: 2310H8TS; NPI: 1528761145) in ePREP has been Resubmitted. $ \r\n10/27/2023: Called EPrep Portal Help Desk to get help for deficiency that we received via email for application. As per Rep, in order to fulfill the deficiency we need to download PT 38 Addendum V3, fill up the form and upload it to the application along with supporting documents required. Rep guide how to download the required form and following the instructions download and filled the form and resubmitted the application. Rep Name: Tanay Call Ref # Tanay10272023 $ \r\n11/07/2023: Received email from ePREP for the application deficiency, Worked on Online application for Premier Vitality IV & Wellness Center for Kristina Lynch and resubmitted the application, received response Your application (Application ID: 2310H8TS; NPI: 1528761145) in ePREP has been Resubmitted. $ \r\n11/27/2023: Received email from ePREP for the application deficiency, stating application is return to provider and suggesting to Login EPrep Portal to make corrections, Checked application status for Premier Vitality IV & Wellness Center and provider Kristina Lynch, made corrections and resubmitted the application, received response Your application in ePREP has been Resubmitted. $ \r\n11/30/2023: Received email from ePREP stating that, Your application (Application ID: 2310BINF; NPI: 1538381389) in ePREP has been Approved. Checked status on portal, as per portal Provider Application ID: 2310BINF approved on 11/30/2023 and Group Application ID: 2310H8TS approved on 11/29/2023. $ \r\n01/31/2024: Received Email via secure email from ePREP-MDH@dharbor.com, Sub: 1538381389 Revalidation, Stating, \"Dear LYNCH, KRISTINA MD, This is to inform you that account 800048586 requires to be revalidated between 01/13/2024 and 02/27/2024. Please see attachment for details.\" Attached letter is Downloaded and forwarded to Hina for review. $','2024-01-31','2023-10-18 01:17:31','2024-01-31 20:31:22'),
