(186,17,58,'Individual',8,'In-process',NULL,'05/03/2023: Called Tricare East to confirm that why we are not able to apply online. As per Rep, Panel is Close for medical surgical network and Humana Military is currently not accepting requests to join the Network. Rep Confirms that, we can sent claims to Tricare East the Certified provider will be considered as Out of Network Provider. As per Rep, we can try after three Months to check Panel Status. Rep Name: Angela R Ref # AngelaRC05032023 (Anil)  05/03/2023: Called Tricare East to check enrollment status. As per Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" Practicing Facility Effective 04/12/2014 and provider Rosalia Lopez is showing \"Out of Network\". Rep suggested that, provider need to get Certified with Humana Military first using online portal: https://www.humanamilitary.com/provider/access/become-a-tricare-provider/get-certified and after getting Certified we need to apply for credentialing using online portal for joining the Tricare Network using Link: https://www.humanamilitary.com/provider/access/become-a-tricare-provider/join-the-network. Credentialing Department usually take 30 to 90 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Jacob Y, Auderi, Lorrie C Ref # JacobY05032023, LorrieC05032023 (Anil)','2023-10-23','2023-10-24 02:31:16',NULL),
