(188,17,58,'Individual',17,'In-process',NULL,'03/31/2023 Sent application on Provider Relations Austin <networkrelationsaustintx@humana.com> for enrollment 03/31/2023 Received an email pending for auth letter 04/27/2023 Auth letter has been sent also sent email for application status 06/02/2023: No further changes can be made untill the Issue with Humana is resolved 06/27/2023: Called Humana to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Not Contracted\" Practicing Facility and for provider Rosalia Lopez de Alda is also showing \"Out of Network\". Rep suggested that, Asked rep how to get provider credentialed and linked with our Tax ID, Rep suggested that he is sending a Roaster update request to add provider via Email at hina@precisionhub.com, we can fill up and sent it back following the instructions. Rep also suggested that we can sent out queries via email to networkrelationsaustintx@humana.com and for application status email to: acampbell8@humana.com after 30 days. Credentialing department usually take 60 to 90 Business Days to complete the process.  Rep Name: Ash R, John M Call Ref 2000322081284, 2000322088632 (Anil)','2023-10-23','2023-10-24 02:32:47',NULL),
