(196,17,58,'Individual',85,'In-process',NULL,'03/31/2023 An email has been sent on hello@sanabenefits.com for enrollment application status 03/31/2023 An online application has been submitted 04/27/2023 An email has been sent for enrollment application status 05/03/2023: Roster sent to add lopez 06/19/2023: Follow up email sent again to find out the updates 06/27/2023: Called Sana Benefits to inquire about the Enrollment Status. As per the Rep, Sana Benefits does not have requirement for provider\'s Credentialing. As per Rep, Sana is a Open Access Network and there is no Credentialing requirement for Providers to file Claims to Sana Benefits. Rep confirms that, providers can directly sent Claims to Sana Benefits. Rep also suggested that, they have a fixed fee schedule for provider they will Pay 120% of Medicare Fee Schedule and 140% for Facility. To get enrolled in Sana Community Provider List we can fill online form using link: https://secure.sanabenefits.com/public/join-the-sana-community, or email at: contracting@sanabenefits.com, It usually take 30 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Jermaine B Call Ref # JermaineB06272023 (Anil)','2023-10-23','2023-10-24 02:47:29',NULL),
