(198,17,60,'Individual',10,'In-process',NULL,'06/20/2023: Called Multiplan to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Not Contracted\" Practicing Facility and for provider Michelle D. Caneda also showing \"Out of Network\". Rep suggested that, we can apply for Individual or Group using online portal Link: https://www.multiplan.com/nominate/nominate.cfm?type=join. Rep also guided that we can go for the Group Credentialed first and once it is done we can add as many providers as we can to the same Group by going to the same link and selecting second option > \"To add an individual to an existing group\". Rep Name: Maurita W Ref # 8870292 (Anil) 06/20/2023: Called Multiplan to check Application Status. As per Rep, the Application # SEID: 230322233444, As per Rep, It is Group Application with nomination of Nine Providers under the group. as per rep they received the signed contract from us on 05/20/2023, Current Status: \"In Process\" with credentialing team waiting for contract approval. As per Rep, usually it takes 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process so we need to allow more time. Rep Name: Tammika F Ref # 8870348 (Anil) 07/25/2023: Name sent in nomination 09/01/2023: Called Multiplan to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Not Contracted\" Practicing Facility and for provider Michelle D. Caneda also showing \"Out of Network\". Asked about the Application # SEID: 230322233444, As per Rep, It is Group Application with nomination of Nine Providers under the group, received the signed contract on 05/20/2023, received the Nomination on 07/24/2023 Nomination Tracking # 032123P8Y, Current Status is \"In Process\" with Contract Administration Dept as per last update on 08/30/2023. As per Rep, the application is in final stage and it will not take longer. Rep Name: Tamika F Ref # TamikaF09012023 (Anil) 09/22/2023: Called Multiplan to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing \"Contracted\" as Group Effective Dt 09/01/2023 Contract ID: 10725194 and provider Michelle D. Caneda is showing \"Out of Network\" and not linked with the Tax ID. Asked about Nomination Request, As per Rep, the request status is \"In Complete\", as per rep the request was received before the Group got credentialed and also confirmed that provider CAQH needs to be updated. Rep suggested that, once CAQH is updated, we can resent our  request which must be on Practice Letter Head with Contract ID , TAX ID, Provider NPI and mention the reason of request and sent it via Fax # 781 487 8257 Or Email appmissinginfo@multiplan.com.  It usually takes 45 to 60 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Murrieta W Call Ref # 9154405 (Anil) 09/25/2023: Received Email to update CAQH. Checked CAQH and emailed to get the required document.','2023-10-23','2023-10-24 03:53:09',NULL),
(199,17,60,'Individual',15,'In-process',NULL,'06/20/2023: Called Cigna to check Enrollment Status. As per the Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Non Contracted\" Practicing Facility. Provider Michelle D. Caneda, is also Showing \"Out of Network\" for the state of Taxes. Rep suggested that, we can apply for Group by sending request via Email at: PSScentral@cigna.com, In Subject Line mention \"Group Name, State, Tax ID with LOI and in Email body \"Group Name, Full Service Address, Tax ID #, Specialty and Services Renders. Rep also suggested that we can submit request on call for Individual Provider Credentialing by calling Cigna but unfortunately our provider\'s CAQH Profile needs to be updated as it got Expired earlier. Once CAQH ProView is updated then we can call Cigna and submit request on call, Rep suggests to call with Provider ID #, CAQH Number, Provider Name, Tax ID # and Contact Person Information to apply. Credentialing Department usually take 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Kevin C Ref # KevinC06202023 (Anil) 08/30/2023: Called Cigna to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Non Contracted\" Practicing Facility. Provider Michelle D. Caneda, is also Showing \"Out of Network\" for the state of Taxes. Asked about the Application Status, As per Rep, the application was received 08/01/2023 and \"In Process\" and we need to allow more time. Credentialing Department usually take 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Leo A Ref # LeoA08302023 (Anil) 09/22/2023: Called Cigna to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Non Contracted\" Practicing Facility. Provider Michelle D. Caneda, is also Showing \"Out of Network\" for the state of Taxes. Asked about the Request Status, Rep confirmed that, the request was received on 08/01/2023 and is \"In Process\" and suggests that we need to allow more time. Credentialing Department usually take 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Del M Call Ref # DelM09222023 (Anil)','2023-10-23','2023-10-24 03:53:56',NULL),
(200,17,60,'Individual',87,'In-process',NULL,'06/20/2023: Called Golden Rule to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" Practicing Facility Effective 11/13/2021 and for provider Michelle D. Caneda, is \"Out of Network\" for the State of Taxes, Rep suggested that Golden Rule in not credentialing them self, to get credentialed we can contact to UHC. Called transferred to UHC providers relations, Rep suggested that their Credentialing Department is not open for calls, we can sent our credentialing related quiries on Email: networkhelp@uhc.com or centralprteam@uhc.com, we can also visit online using  Link: https://www.uhcprovider.com/en/resource-library/Join-Our-Network.html and apply online. Credentialing Department usually take 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Mercilla C, Rex M, Aleena S Call Ref # MercillaC06202023, 37161311, AleenaS06202023 (Anil)','2023-10-23','2023-10-24 03:54:39',NULL),
(201,17,60,'Individual',9,'In-process',NULL,'06/20/2023: Called UHC to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" Practicing Facility Effective 11/13/2021 and for provider Michelle D. Caneda, is \"Out of Network\" for the State of Taxes, Rep suggested that, for credentialing we need to contact Credentialing Department, As per Rep, their Credentialing Department is not open for calls but we can sent our credentialing related queries via Email: networkhelp@uhc.com or centralprteam@uhc.com, we can also visit online Portal using Link: https://www.uhcprovider.com/en/resource-library/Join-Our-Network.html and apply online. Credentialing Department usually take 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Rex M Ref # 37161311 (Anil) 08/30/2023: Called UHC to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" Practicing as a Group Effective 11/13/2021 and for provider Michelle D. Caneda, is \"Out of Network\" for the State of Taxes. Asked about the application status, as per rep they don\'t have access to check the application status and suggested to contact Credentialing Department. As per Rep, their Credentialing Department is not open for calls but we can sent our credentialing related queries via Email: networkhelp@uhc.com or centralprteam@uhc.com. Credentialing Department usually take 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Steven M Ref # 41850382 (Anil)','2023-10-23','2023-10-24 03:55:16',NULL),
(202,17,60,'Individual',17,'In-process',NULL,'06/20/2023: Called Humana to check Enrollment Status. As per the Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted Group\" effective 11/22/2016 but the Practice Name is Showing as Lamia Kadir MDPA in their record and Provider Michelle D. Caneda, is Showing \"Out of Network\" with Humana. Asked rep how to get provider credentialed and linked with our Tax ID, Rep suggested that he is sending a Roaster update request to add provider via Email at hina@precisionhub.com, we can fill up and sent it back following the instructions. Asked also from Rep how to update Group Name, Rep said he is sending the request form via email and we can fill it up and sent it back following the instructions. Rep also suggested that we can sent out queries via email to networkrelationsaustintx@humana.com and for application status email to: acampbell8@humana.com after 30 days. Credentialing department usually take 60 to 90 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Hazel T, Jess C Call Ref HazelT06202023, JessC06202023 (Anil) 08/17/2023: The issue is already under discussion for Contract conflict.','2023-10-23','2023-10-24 03:55:56',NULL),
(203,17,60,'Individual',13,'In-process',NULL,'06/20/2023: Called Aetna to check enrollment status. As per the Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" as a Group Effective 01/20/2022 and Provider Michelle D. Caneda, is Showing \"Out of Network\" with Aetna. Rep suggested that we can visit online portal and apply using Link: www.aetna.com > Explore Aetna Site > Providers > scroll down and select Join our network > First Option select Aetna > Second Option select Medical or Behavioral Health > Third Option select \"As an individual provider joining an existing group practice\" and press continue, now fill the online application following the prompt and note the application number for future reference. Rep Suggested to Follow up after one week to get Tracking ID for the application. Rep Name: Abbey R Call Ref # 6151604954. 6/20/2023: Applicaiton submitted online. Applicaiton no 05061881 08/30/2023: Called Aetna to check enrollment application status. As per Rep, the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" as a Group Effective 01/20/2022 and Provider Michelle D. Caneda, is Showing \"Out of Network\" with Aetna. Asked about the application status, Rep suggested that the Application # 05061881 is on Hold due to Provider CAQH is Expired and needs to be updated. Checked CAQH Proview and rep was correct it was showing expired and also stating that \"Your Professional Liability Insurance - 0313-6578 is Missing\". Rep said once CAQH will be updated the application will proceed further. Rep Name: Jen M Call Ref # 6161250425. 09/22/2023: Called Aetna to check enrollment application status. As per Rep, Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing \"Contracted\" as a Group Effective 01/20/2022 and Provider Michelle D. Caneda, is Showing \"Out of Network\" with Aetna. Asked about the application status, Rep suggested that the Application # 05061881 is on Hold due to Provider CAQH is Expired and needs to be updated. Checked CAQH Proview Status is still showing expired and need to complete nine different information whivh are Missing. Rep said once CAQH will be updated the application will proceed further. Rep Name: Mark L Call Ref # 6274217274 09/27/2023: Called Aetna to check enrollment application status. As per Rep, Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing \"Contracted\" as a Group Effective 01/20/2022 and Provider Michelle D. Caneda, is Showing \"Out of Network\" with Aetna. Asked about the application status and also confirm that CAQH is updated for Provider, Rep suggested that the Application # 05061881 is \"In Process\" and suggested to allow more time. Credentialing Department usually take 90 to 120 Calendar Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Jen M Call Ref # 6164901258 (Anil)','2023-10-23','2023-10-24 03:56:47',NULL),
