(206,17,60,'Individual',85,'In-Network','2023-06-26','06/20/2023: Called Sana Benefits to check enrollment status. As per the Rep, Sana Benefit does not have any Credentialing requirement. As per Rep, Sana is a Open Access Network so Providers does not need to get then self Credentialed to bill Sana Benefits. Rep said that providers can directly bill them. also confirms that they Pay 120% to provider and 140% to Facility following Medicare fee schedule .To get enrolled in Sana Community Provider List we can fill online form link: https://secure.sanabenefits.com/public/join-the-sana-community, or email at: contracting@sanabenefits.com, it usually take 30 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Amah H Ref # 292462 (Anil) 06/23/2023: Email sent to hello@sanabenefits.com 06/26/2023: Provider linked to the contract effective  6/26/2023.','2023-10-23','2023-10-24 04:02:57',NULL),
(207,17,60,'Individual',86,'In-process','0000-00-00','06/20/2023: Called Scott & White to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Not Contracted\" Practicing Facility and for provider Michelle D. Caneda is also showing \"Out of Network\". Rep suggested that, to get Credentialed we can visit online portal using Link: https://www.bswhp.org/Providers/Pages/default.aspx#join and apply online. First we need to Register using Link: https://pam.bswhealthplan.com/ and Create Login User ID & Password, After Login created we can follow the prompting instructions and complete the Application Form. Credentialing Department usually takes 30 to 45 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Richard M  Ref # CAS-3520785-Y5H2K8 (Anil) 09/29/2023: Online Application is Submitted, submission identifier is: d4bd926d-6c7e-4017-aa21-bd6514d7a8e3.\r\n10/25/2023: Received Email with link to add provider into the existing Group using Link: https://www.bswhealthplan.com/Pages/Add-Provider-Contract-Request.aspx, Online application submitted for Provider Michelle D. Caneda, submission identifier is: 5aa0cf45-b772-4015-9c9c-1c8c7128f931.\r\n11/01/2023: Called Scott & White to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" as a Group with several plans and provider Michelle D. Caneda is showing \"Out of Network\". Asked about the email that we received from them stating request is closed. Rep suggested that, she do not have access to check and said we can reply to the same and inquire with them or we can contact Provider Relation Rep Tiffany Brown: 512 553 9089. Tried calling Tiffany couple of time but got voice mail. Called Web Support line 254 724 2501, asked about the online application status Rep said that in order to inquire we can reply to the same email which we received or need to contact the Provider Relations.  Rep Name: Debbie E, Ashley, Kim P Call Ref # DebbieE11012023, IMS-0393017 (Anil)\r\n11/01/2023: Received Email from Scott & White, stating request has been closed, Repied to conform the provider name.\r\n11/02/2023: Received email with documents to fill up and sent it back to provided email. filled up the forms and sent it back to provided email HP EXPEDITES <HPEXPEDITES@BSWHealth.org> with attached documents.\r\n11/03/2023: Received Email from Scott & White for FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. for Michelle D. Caneda, Email stated, your Tax ID number is contracted and to proceed further you would have to go to the add a provider link. If you have already gone to add a provider link \r\nthen your request is in process with or Provider Services Specialists./Replied,\"we have already submitted the required documents on 11/03/2023 to hpexpedites@bswhealth.org and attached the email correspondance.\r\n11/03/2023: Received Email from Baylor Scott & White stating that, Michelle Caneda to be added to Family Medicine Center of Austin PA (GNPI 1780009522) has been received and is in process. He/she has an effective date of 11/17/2023. Please allow 3-4 weeks to ensure his/her provider configuration has been completed in our system.','2023-10-23','2023-10-24 04:03:36','2023-11-08 15:52:21'),
