(211,17,60,'Individual',8,'In-process',NULL,'06/21/2023: Called Tricare East to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" as Group Effective 04/12/2014 and provider Michelle D Caneda is showing \"Out of Network\". Rep suggested that, provider need to get Certified with them first using online portal: https://www.humanamilitary.com/provider/access/become-a-tricare-provider/get-certified and after getting Certified we can apply for credentialing using online portal Link: https://www.humanamilitary.com/provider/access/become-a-tricare-provider/join-the-network. Credentialing Department usually take 30 to 90 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Jacky, Bariana Ref # Jacky06212023, Bariana06212023 (Anil) 08/30/2023: Called Tricare East to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" as Group Effective 04/12/2014 and provider Michelle D Caneda is showing \"Out of Network\" and become Certified effective Dt: 08/04/2023. Rep suggested that, we can apply for credentialing using online portal Link: https://www.humanamilitary.com/provider/access/become-a-tricare-provider/join-the-network. Crdentialing Representative Celeste Santiago 502 318 5068 email csantiago20@humana.com. Credentialing Department usually take 30 to 90 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Morgan L Ref # MorganL08302023 (Anil) 10/02/2023: LOI with W9 Form sent Via Email csantiago20@humana.com. 10/02/2023: Email confrmation received stating that \"Thank you for your email. I will reply to your email in the order it was received.\" Celeste Santiago  10/09/2023: Email Received from csantiago20@humana.com requesting for some provider information.  10/11/2023: Sent information requested to Celeste Santiago via Email csantiago20@humana.com 10/12/2023: Email Received from csantiago20@humana.com requesting for some provider information via secure email/ Information Send via secure email with LOI & W9 with Roaster Template. 10/16/2023: Received Secure Email from CSantiago20@humana.com for FMA Michelle Caneda stating \"The providers credentialing is in Process once that is approved you can review your provider roster for the location that the provider should be affiliated to and see that she will indicate \"Complete\" when it is approved.\" Acknowledged via Secure Email. (Anil)','0000-00-00','2023-10-24 04:10:46',NULL),
(212,17,62,'Individual',10,'In-process','0000-00-00','08/14/2023: Called Multiplan to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Not Contracted\" Practicing Facility and for provider April Murrieta also showing \"Out of Network\" and not linked with the Tax ID. Asked about Group Application Status # SEID: 230322233444, As per Rep, the Application is \"In Process\" received the signed contract from provider on Dt: 07/24/2023, Need to allow more time. Rep suggested that, we can apply for Individual or Group using online portal Link: https://www.multiplan.com/nominate/nominate.cfm?type=join. Rep also guided that, once Goup Credentialed is done, We can add as many providers as we can to the same Group by going to Online Portal using the link: https://provider.multiplan.com/webcenter/portal/provider and   follow the instructions and apply for provider. As per Rep, usually it takes 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process so we need to allow more time. Rep Name: Pershan F Ref # PershanF08142023 (Anil) 09/01/2023: LOI sent via Email @ pif@multiplan.com. 09/22/2023: Called Multiplan to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing \"Contracted\" as Group Effective Dt 09/01/2023 Contract ID: 10725194 and provider April Murrieta is still showing \"Out of Network\" and not linked with the Tax ID. Asked about Nomination Request, As per Rep, the request status is \"In Complete\", as per rep the request was received before the Group got credentialed and they are not clear, if the request is for provider linkage or individual credentialing. Rep suggested that, we can sent the request which must be on Practice Letter Head with Contract ID, TAX ID, Provider NPI and mention the reason of request and sent it via Fax # 781 487 8257 Or Email appmissinginfo@multiplan.com. It usually takes 45 to 60 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Murrieta W Call Ref # 9154405\r\n12/07/2023: Called Multiplan to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, practice is Showing \"Contracted\" as Group Effective Dt 09/01/2023 Contract ID: 10725194 and provider April Murrieta is still showing \"Out of Network\" and not linked with the Tax ID. Asked about Nomination Request, As per Rep, the request status is \"Closed\" and suggested that, we can resent the provider linkage request via Fax # 781 487 8257 Or Email appmissinginfo@multiplan.com. It usually takes 45 to 60 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Sharica L Call Ref # 9463188\r\n12/07/2023: LOI with W9 sent to appmissinginfo@multiplan.com.\r\n01/16/2024: Received Email from Emily.Anderson@multiplan.com on 01/02/2024, with the attached file for missing information stating \"Hospital Privileges or Admitting Arrangements are required for all Nurse Practitioners. If the provider does not have any Affiliations or Arrangements we can accept the option \'Patients are sent the Emergency Room\' checked off as an Arrangement. Please note we do require the attached document to be filled out and signed by the provider and updated copy of PLI.\" Sent to Hina to communicate the same with provider.\r\n01/16/2024: Received Email from Emily.Anderson@multiplan.com, Case # 9463188 Stating \" Unfortunately, MultiPlan is unable to complete credentialing for April Murrieta due to missing information including the provider\'s signature on the missing hospital information form and a current copy of the provider\'s PLI face sheet.  We have made several attempts to obtain the missing information required to complete credentialing.  The credentialing process cannot be resumed until this information is received.  The case is being closed at this time.  The credentialing materials can be submitted through the Provider Portal, faxing to 781-487-8273 Attention: Registrar, or via e-mail to registrar@multiplan.com.\"\\Sent to Hina for Review.\"','2024-01-16','2023-10-26 04:23:12','2024-01-16 17:12:37'),
