(221,17,62,'Individual',86,'In-process',NULL,'08/15/2023: Called Scott & White to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is showing \"Not Contracted\" as Group and provider April Murrieta is also showing \"Out of Network\" for the State of Texas. Rep suggested that, to get Credentialed we can visit online portal using Link: https://www.bswhp.org/Providers/Pages/default.aspx#join and apply online. First we need to Register using Link: https://pam.bswhealthplan.com/ and Create Login User ID & Password, After Login created we can follow the prompting instructions and complete the Application Form. Credentialing Department usually takes 30 to 45 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Joy P  Call Ref # CAS-3631876-Y5H2K8 (Anil)','2023-10-25','2023-10-26 04:30:19',NULL),
(222,17,62,'Individual',67,'In-process',NULL,'08/15/2023: Called Meritain Health to check Enrollment Status. Meritain Health Rep transferred the call to Aetna Credentialing Dept. As per Rep, the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" as a Group Effective 01/20/2022 and Provider April Murrieta is  Showing \"In Network\" Effective Dt 10/02/2021 but under Different Tax ID. Rep confirmed that once we get Credentialed with Aetna Commercial Plan, we will be Automatically Enrolled with Meritain Health Plans and there is no separate credentialing required for Meritain Health. Rep suggested  that, to link Provider with Practice Tax ID we can send the request to Fax # 859 455 8650, with LOI and W9 Form and Attn: Demographic, we can contact to Follow up after one week to get Tracking ID # for application. Rep Name: Mark L, Mary M, Lynn R Ref # MarkL08152023, MaryM08152023, 6159417657 (Anil)','2023-10-25','2023-10-26 04:31:06',NULL),
(223,17,62,'Individual',77,'In-process',NULL,'08/15/2023: Called GEHA to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" as Group Effective 11/13/2021 and for provider April Murrieta is showing \"Out of Network\" for the State of Taxes, Rep suggested that, GEHA in not credentialing them self, to get credentialed we can contact to UHC. Called transferred to UHC providers relations, UHC Rep suggested that their Credentialing Department is not open for calls, we can sent our credentialing related queries on Email: networkhelp@uhc.com or centralprteam@uhc.com or we can also visit online portal using Link: https://www.uhcprovider.com/en/resource-library/Join-Our-Network.html and apply online. Rep confirmed that once we get Credentialed with UHC Network, we will be Automatically Enrolled with GEHA Plans and there is no separate credentialing required for GEHA. Rep Name: Briana G Call Ref # 230815013469 (Anil)','2023-10-25','2023-10-26 04:31:45',NULL),
(224,17,62,'Individual',57,'In-process',NULL,'08/15/2023: Called BCBS TX to check Enrollment Status. As per the IVR BCBS TX Credentialing Dept is not open for calls, Checked status through BCBS TX Website, Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Non Contracted\" Practicing Facility and  April Murrieta Status Dt: 2021-12-03 \"Your application has been approved. COMPLETION OF THE CREDENTIALING PROCESS DOES NOT MEAN THAT YOU ARE A CONTRACTED PROVIDER. Please await notification via letter or email.\" As per IVR, if provider have a profile with CAQH, make the required updates or contact CAQH with questions. we can sent our credentialing related queries via  Email: provider_relations_central_texas@bcbstx.com, PPNAustin@bcbstx.com or Fax 512-349-4853. We can also use Availity Essentials Portal using Link: https://www.availity.com/essentials and apply for Provider & Facility. Rep Name: IVR/Website Ref # IVR08152023 (Anil) 08/29/2023: LOI with W9 Form sent to BCBS TX via Fax # 512-349-4853. 09/01/2023: Called BCBS TX to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Non Contracted\" as a Group and provider April Murrieta is also showing \"Out of Network\" for the state of texas. Asked about the LOI with W9 Form sent via Fax # 512-349-4853 on 08/29/2023, rep suggested that, they do not have access to check application status and asked to contact credentialing dept. Rep confirms that credentialing dept is not open for calls but we can sent our credentialing related inquires via Email: provider_relations_central_texas@bcbstx.com, PPNAustin@bcbstx.com or Fax 512-349-4853. As per Rep, provider need to clear the initial CAQH screening and confirm that CAQH profile for April Murrieta needs to updated. Checked provider CAQH Profile Provider Status: Re-Attestation required indicating that Professional Liability Insurance-has Expired. Rep suggested to complete the provider CAHQ and resubmit the credentialing request. Rep Name: Gray C Ref # GrayC09012023 (Anil)','2023-10-25','2023-10-26 04:32:28',NULL),
(225,17,62,'Individual',8,'In-process',NULL,'08/15/2023: Called Tricare East to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" as Group Effective 04/12/2014 and provider April Murrieta is showing \"Out of Network\" and Not Certified. Rep suggested that, first provider need to get Certified with them using online portal: https://www.humanamilitary.com/provider/access/become-a-tricare-provider/get-certified and once Certification is done we can apply for provider contracting using online portal Link: https://www.humanamilitary.com/provider/access/become-a-tricare-provider/join-the-network. Credentialing Department usually take 30 to 90 Business Days to complete the process. Name: Alma R, Toniya B Call Ref # ToniyaB08152023 (Anil)','2023-10-25','2023-10-26 04:33:08',NULL),
(226,17,50,'Individual',68,'In-process',NULL,'03/24/2023: Called UMR to verify the Phone Number for the Practice. As per the Rep, Phone Number (510) 402-7701 is updated for the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. Rep Suggests that we can update the Phone Number by Calling Member Line 866 596 8447. Rep Name: June N, Ben S, Francis C Ref # 6619, 6710 (Anil)  01/06/2023: Called UMR to check enrollment status. Tried couple of time but unable to reach the UME Rep with out Passcode. Called UHC to inquire about UMR Credentialing. As per the Rep UHC and UMR credentialing Department are not open for calls, we can sent our request or quiries on Email: networkhelp@uhc.com or visit online provider assistance portal Link: https://www.uhcprovider.com/en/resource-library/Join-Our-Network.html. for UMR credentialing guide lines please visit Link: https://www.umr.com/oss/export/sites/default/UMR/UAS/provider_referral.pdf. As per Rep the Member have to do provider referral using insturctions in Link above. Rep Name: Nathan, Susan, Harold D Ref # 0904, 4905 (Anil)  06/22/2023: Called UMR to Confirm Change Address Procedure. As per the Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" as a Group with UMR Effective 11/13/2021. Rep suggested that UMR does not have any separate Credentialing Department, If we have already applied for Change Address with UHC Commercial, then we don\'t have to submit separately for UMR. Once Change Address will be completed for UHC Commercial, then it will be Automatically update for UMR. Rep suggested that, since UHC Credentialing Department is not open for calls, we can sent our Network related queries to Email: networkhelp@uhc.com. Rep Name: Jack H Call Ref # JackH06222023 (Anil)','2023-11-03','2023-11-03 14:21:24',NULL),
