(229,17,50,'Individual',70,'In-process',NULL,'03/27/2023: Called Group Administrators to verify the Phone Number for the Practice. As per the Rep, they are TPA and don\'t have Credentialing requirement and there is no data available in their records for the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. Rep Name: Brain W Ref # BrainW03272023 (Anil)  03/16/2023: Called Group Administrators to check enrollment status. As per the Rep they do not check the provider\'s individual status, they can only check when we provider Member\'s ID. Rep confirms that they do not provide Credentialing for providers because they are TPA (Third Party Administrator) for different PPO insurance plans like BCBS, Cigna etc. Rep said that, Network Participation depend upon the Insured Member\'s Plan, if provider is contracted with the Primary Insurance Company, then provider will be considered \"In Network\". They do not provide Individual or Group Credentialing, providers needs to contact the Primary Insurance to get them self Credentialed for Any Specific Plan, if the provider is already contracted with the respective insurance company then we can call Group Administrators with member ID to check Network Participation and verify Plan Benefits. Rep suggested that we can login to Provider Portal to check if the provider is In Network with Member\'s Plan using Member ID via Online Portal Link: https://www.groupadministrators.com/providers/. Rep Name: Laura, Angela R Ref # Laura03162023, AngelaR03162023 (Anil)  01/06/2023: Called Group Administrators to check enrollment status. As per the Rep they do not check the provider\'s individual status, they can only check if we provider member\'s ID. Rep also confirms that they do not Credential providers and they operate as a third party administrator for different PPO insurance plans and it depend upon what insurance is provided by employer to insured member. They do not do Credentialing by them self, the provider needs to contact the main insurance company to get credentialed, if provider is already contracted with the respective main insurance company and member have Group Administrators plan then we can call Group Administrators with member ID to check if we are in Network or Not and also can verify the plan benefits. Rep Name: James Ref # James01062023 (Anil)  06/23/2023: Called Group Administrators to Confirm Change of Address Procedure. As per the Rep, they do not check the provider\'s individual status, they can only verify the Plan Benefits and confirm the Provider\'s Network participation with Member\'s Plan using Member\'s Plan ID #. Rep also confirms that, they do not provide Credentialing for Providers because they operate as a third party administrator for different PPO Insurance Plans. Rep suggests to contact Primary Insurance to get Credentialing status which depend upon the Primary Insurance for the Insured Member Plan. They do not do Credentialing by them self, the provider needs to contact the Primary Insurance Company to get Credentialed. Rep Name: Alma C Ref # AlmaC06232023 (Anil)','2023-11-03','2023-11-03 14:26:53',NULL),
