(238,17,50,'Individual',80,'In-process',NULL,'04/26/2023: Called Continental Life/Aetna to Confirm Enrollment Status & Process. As per the Rep the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"In Network\" Facility with Aetna Effective 09/15/2014, Rep Confirms that, we are In Network with Aetna PPO Plan, Manage Choice, EPO, HMO, Medicare HMO & Medicare PPO, Rep Confirms that Continental Life is part of the Medicare Plan. Asked about the Provider\'s Status, Rep confirms that All the Providers and Nurse Practitioners are showing \"In Network\" with Medicare HMO and PPO Plans except for Dr. Hernandez. As per Rep, we can apply via online portal Link: www.aetna.com > Explore Aetna Site > Providers > scroll down and select Join our network > First Option select Aetna > Second Option select Medical or Behavioral Health > Third Option select As an individual provider joining an existing group practice and press continue, now fill the online application to get Provider Credentialed. Rep Name: Allyssa M, Lora S Ref # 6144209135,  (Anil)   06/23/2023: Called Continental Life/Aetna to Confirm Change of Address Procedure. Rep transferred the call to Aetna Credentialing Dept. As per Rep, the Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing \"Contracted\" as a Group Effective 01/20/2022. Rep Suggested that, to change address we can sent the request via Fax with LOI and W9 Form to the Fax # 859 455 8650. Attn : Network Management. It will take 30 business days to complete the request. Rep Name: Chassidy K, Lorra S Call Ref # 68903130, LorraS06232023  (Anil)','2023-11-03','2023-11-03 14:45:31',NULL),
