y basis and we will be contacted regarding this with in 7 to 10 Business Days. Rep Name: Reah, Maria G Call Ref # 6173415439 $ \r\n01/16/2024: Called to check status application ticket # NAF653042, Rep said, the application was received on dt: 09/09/2023 and is still \"In Process\" for review. Asked about the escalation made by last rep on 12/08/23, rep said that the contracting department closed the escalation with remarks that they are already working on the contract, rep said that she is also escalating it further to get the request completed on priority basis and said that we will be contacted with in 5 Business Days. Rep Name: Ann E Call Ref # 6177919091 $ \r\n01/17/2024: Received email from Tardy, Brittany M <Brittany.Tardy@AETNA.com>, Stating \"I will be sending you a location form to sign, please attach a W-9 . This form will be via adobe sign. We look forward to contracting with you. Thank you, Brittany M. Tardy, Sr. Analyst,Project Management, P: 706-814-8385.\" $ \r\n01/17/2024: Received Email from Brittany Moore <adobesign@echosign.com>, Subject: Brittany  Moore Has Sent You Service Location Form-Americare Medical Supplies & Services INC to Sign.\\Fillup the online Docu Sign Location Form, Signed & Submitted and Snap Shot Saved and Downloaded the Copy and sent it to Hina. $ \r\n01/18/2024: Received Email from Brittany Moore <adobesign@echosign.com>, Subject: Completed: \"Service Location Form-Americare Medical Supplies & Services INC\". Stating \"Attached is the final agreement between Aetna, Lawrence Iwuamadi & Brittany Tardy.\\Replied to confirm the effective date. Downloaded the Agreement and emailed it to Hina. $ \r\n01/18/2024: Received Email from Tardy, Brittany M <Brittany.Tardy@AETNA.com>, Stating \"Hi At this time I can’t provide a practice effective date but I will be in touch soon.\"\\Forwarded to Hina. $ \r\n01/31/2024: Received email from Brittany Moore <adobesign@echosign.com>, Stating \"Brittany  Moore Has Sent You Americare Medical Suppli