w more time and wait for contracting team to respond. Rep Name: Peggy L, Tiffany M, Courtney C Call Ref # CourtneyC12132023\r\n01/16/2024: Called to follow up on Ticket Number # T5728910 & T5819528, rep said that they do not have access to check the application status and suggested to contact credentialing department via email at credentialing@evicore.com or clientservices@evicore.com. Tried to contact with Zoraida Pinero Credentialing Lead Representative via call at 800.918.8924 Ext 27220 but got voice mail so left a brief massage for call back. Rep Name: Katlian R, Nicole W Call Ref # KatlainR01162024, NicoleW01162024\r\n01/16/2024: Follow up email sent to zpinero2@eviCore.com, cherwell@evicore.com, credentialing@evicore.com & clientservices@evicore.com.','2024-01-16','2023-11-03 16:31:03','2024-01-16 22:10:47'),
(241,8,64,'Group',9,'panel-closed',NULL,'09/11/2023: Called UHC to check Enrollment Status, As per Rep, Practice Americare Medicals Supplies & Services Inc is Showing \"Out of Network\" as Group. Rep suggested that, for credentialing we need to contact Credentialing Department, As per Rep, their Credentialing Department is not open for calls but we can sent our credentialing related queries via Email: networkhelp@uhc.com, we can also visit online Portal using Link: https://www.uhcprovider.com/en/resource-library/Join-Our-Network.html  and apply online. Credentialing Department usually take 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Sam S Call Ref # D6791 (Anil) 09/29/2023: Called UHC to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice Americare Medicals Supplies & Services Inc is Showing \"Out of Network\" as Group. Rep suggested to contact Credentialing Department to Join the Network and confirm that their Credentialing Department is not open for calls but we can sent our credentialing related queries via Email: networkhelp@uhc.com or via online Portal using Link: https://www.uhcprovider.com/en/resource-library/Join-Our-Network.html and fill up the online application form. Told rep that we are unbale to sent email to UHC and complain is already forwarded by there supervisor, Rep said that, she is escalating our credentialing concern to her supervisor and he will call back today. Rep Name: Jessa P Call Ref # 43931774 (Anil) 09/29/2023: As per UHC Website update is availble for DME providers \"Please Note: currently the DMEPOS Network is closed for all market contracting.\"','2023-11-03','2023-11-03 16:32:37',NULL),
(242,8,64,'Group',90,'In-process','0000-00-00','09/11/2023: Called Optima Health to check Enrollment Status, As per Rep, Practice Americare Medicals Supplies & Services Inc is Showing \"Out of Network\" as Group. Rep suggested that, initially Provider must notify Optima Health of their DMAS approval/approval date and request participation with Optima Health Medicaid by submitting a Provider Update form using link: https://sentara-223793.workflowcloud.com/forms/f4fd33b2-cb53-4230-91f3-1f6426136986. Once Provider Update form is  received by Optima Health, the Provider will be updated to PAR for Optima Health Medicaid effective as the DMAS approval/Enrollment date. Second Step is to Download the Request for Participation from using Link: https://shc-p-001.sitecorecontenthub.cloud/api/public/content/c0d60cadbd324c6fa18c76d14428e630?v=5126c9d3 we can fill up the form and submit it to Email provided in Form. Rep Name: Brian G Call Ref # BrianG09112023 $ \r\n09/29/2023: LOI with W9 & Filled Optima- request-for-participation Form via Email PrvRecruit@sentara.com. $ \r\n10/03/2023: Received an email that form has been received and in review. $ \r\n11/06/2023: Sent follow up email to networkmgmt@sentara.com. $ \r\n11/07/2023: Received Email from networkmgmt@sentara.com for Optima Health, providing email to contact further PrvRecruit@sentara.com./Email Sent for follow up. $ \r\n11/07/2023: Called Linda Winebrenner on 757-687-6333, got voice mail left message. Called Optima Health to check Enrollment Status, As per Rep, Practice Americare Medicals Supplies & Services Inc is Showing \"Out of Network\" as Group. Asked about the application sent on 09/29/2023 with LOI, W9 & filled Optima request for participation Form via Email at PrvRecruit@sentara.com, Rep suggested that they do not have access to check credentialing status but we can sent our credentialing related queries via Email: PrvRecruit@sentara.com since there credentialing dept is not open for calls. Credentialing Department usually take 60 to 90 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Crystal, Falisha J Call Ref # FalishaJ11072023 $ \r\n11/08/2023: Received Email from Linda Winebrenner PrvRecruit@sentara.com, Stating that \"We are in receipt of your original submission of the RFP.  I have added the contract manager, Ashley Shell, who was assigned to your group.  She will be the one to reach out to you. We are experiencing a high level of requests and it is taking some time for our department to touch base with all providers.  We appreciate your patience.\" $\r\n11/09/2023: Received Email from ANBATES@sentara.com, Ashley N. Shell, BHS Office: 804-660-8644,   Mobile: 757-642-0855, confirming that she has receive our request and will get in touch soon./ Replied with Acknowledgement. $\r\n12/14/2023: Called Ashley N. Shell on 757-642-0855 & 804-660-8644, got voice mail left brief message. Called Optima Health to check Enrollment Status, As per Rep, Practice Americare Medicals Supplies & Services Inc is Showing \"Out of Network\" as Group. Asked about the application status, Rep suggested that, they have a Limited access and can not check credentialing application status but we can inquire about credentialing related queries via Email: PrvRecruit@sentara.com or optima-credapps@sentara.com and since Ashley is the one who is handling our case we can also reach out to her via email anbates@sentara.com. Rep suggested that, we need to allow more time as Credentialing usually take 90 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Norma, Jamillah H Call Ref # 189197254312142023 $ \r\n12/14/2023: Followup Email Sent to  anbates@sentara.com, PrvRecruit@sentara.com & optima-credapps@sentara.com. $\r\n12/18/2023: Email received from Ashley N Shell ANBATES@sentara.com, stating that \"I have received the request. Due to the merger coming to a final stage, all new agreements are currently on hold. I will be working on new agreements over the upcoming weeks to allow for the two plans to become one, therefore your agreement will include both VPHP and OHP. Keep in mind, effective 01/01/2024, the plans will be one, better known as Sentara Health Plans. I will be in touch in a couple of weeks.\"/Replied. $\r\n12/20/2023: Received Email from  Ashley N Shell ANBATES@sentara.com, stating \"review the attached documents and fill them up and return to sent for internal approval, once approval receive she will sent us copy of agreement for Signing.\" $\r\n12/20/2023: Documents filled and reviewed, sent email to onshore to get the medicare PTAN #. $\r\n12/21/2023: Received email from onshore, Completed the documents following instructions and sent it back to Ashley N Shell via email ANBATES@sentara.com. $\r\n12/22/2023: Received Email from Ashley N Shell via email ANBATES@sentara.com, Stating \"I notice on the draft provider agreement, for Medicare you mention it is in process. If you are not currently a Medicare provider, I cannot include that in the agreement. We have two options: 1- We can move forward with the agreement and exclude Medicare, amend the agreement once you are approved or 2- we can put everything on hold until you are approved for Medicare. Please let me know how you would like to proceed. In addition, I am missing all required documentation needed with the application. Please review the application to determine documents needed and send at your earliest convenience.\" Emailed hina to get advise on it from provider. $\r\n12/22/2023: Email Sent to Ashley N Shell via email ANBATES@sentara.com, to get the list of documents required.\\Received auto response that she is on vacations and will return on 26th Dec 2023. $\r\n01/04/2024: Sent Email to Ashley N Shell at ANBATES@sentara.com, confirming to proceed with agreement with option 1 as suggested by provider. $\r\n01/09/2024: Email Received from Ashley N Shell at ANBATES@sentara.com, with the draft copy of contract excluding Medicare to read and confirm all the information is correct, checked the agreement and replied to confirm to proceed with it. $\r\n01/09/2023: Email Received from Ashley N Shell at ANBATES@sentara.com, Stating that \" Thank you for verifying. I have sent for language approval. Once the contract is approved, I will send you a copy for signature.\" $\r\n01/16/2024: Received Email from Ashley N Shell <ANBATES@sentara.com>, RE: Request for Credentialing -  Americare Medicals Supplies & Services Inc - Tax ID # 39-2065877, Stating \"Please see the attached provider agreement ready for your signature.\" \\Replied with attached Filled up and signed agreement. $\r\n01/17/2024: Email Received from Ashley N Shell at ANBATES@sentara.com, Stating \"Agreement require a wet signature, Please print, sign and return with required documentation.\"\\Forwarded to Hina for Wet Signature. $\r\n01/18/2024: Received wet signed agreement from offshore, compile agreement along with other documents required and sent it via email to Ashley N Shell at ANBATES@sentara.com. $ \r\n01/24/2024: Received Email from Ashley N Shell <ANBATES@sentara.com>, Acknowledging the receipt Stating \"Received, thank you! I will be submitting your application to credentialing tomorrow.\" $','2024-01-24','2023-11-03 16:37:04','2024-01-24 21:55:48'),
