(244,8,64,'Group',91,'In-process','0000-00-00','09/12/2023: Called Virginia Premier Health Plan to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice Americare Medicals Supplies & Services Inc is Showing \"Out of Network\" as Group. Rep suggested that, Virginia Premier is now Optima Health Effective May 1st, 2023, for credentialing we need to contact Credentialing Department. Told rep that, tried to reach the credentialing dept but got voice mail, as per Rep, their Credentialing Department is not open for calls but we can sent our credentialing related queries via Email: vpcred@virginiapremier.com or we can sent our credentialing request via email at networkmgmt@sentara.com, we can also visit Website using Link: https://www.virginiapremier.com/providers/join-our-network/ and follow the instructions. Credentialing Department usually take 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Shelly B Call Ref # ShellyB09122023  $ \r\n11/06/2023: Sent follow up email to networkmgmt@sentara.com.\r\n11/07/2023: Received Email from networkmgmt@sentara.com for Optima Health, providing email to contact further PrvRecruit@sentara.com./Email Sent for follow up. $ \r\n11/07/2023: Called Linda Winebrenner on 757-687-6333, got voice mail left message. Called Optima Health to check Enrollment Status, As per Rep, Practice Americare Medicals Supplies & Services Inc is Showing \"Out of Network\" as Group. Asked about the application sent on 09/29/2023 with LOI, W9 & filled Optima request for participation Form via Email at PrvRecruit@sentara.com, Rep suggested that they do not have access to check credentialing status but we can sent our credentialing related queries via Email: PrvRecruit@sentara.com since there credentialing dept is not open for calls. Credentialing Department usually take 60 to 90 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Crystal, Falisha J Call Ref # FalishaJ11072023 $ \r\n11/08/2023: Received Email from Linda Winebrenner PrvRecruit@sentara.com, Stating that \"We are in receipt of your original submission of the RFP.  I have added the contract manager, Ashley Shell, who was assigned to your group.  She will be the one to reach out to you. We are experiencing a high level of requests and it is taking some time for our department to touch base with all providers.  We appreciate your patience.\" $ \r\n11/09/2023: Received Email from ANBATES@sentara.com, Ashley N. Shell, BHS Office: 804-660-8644,   Mobile: 757-642-0855, confirming that she has receive our request and will get in touch soon./ Replied with Acknowledgement. $ \r\n12/14/2023: Called Virginia Premier Health Plan to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice Americare Medicals Supplies & Services Inc is Showing \"Out of Network\" as Group. Asked about the application status, rep suggested that, they have a limited access and can not check the application status but we can contact their Credentialing Department. Told rep that, tried to reach credentialing dept but got voice mail, as per Rep, their Credentialing Department is not open for calls but we can sent our credentialing related queries via Email: ohpcreddept@sentara.com. Credentialing Department usually take 90 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Takeisha R Call Ref # 03514949 $ \r\n12/14/2023: Follow up email Sent to ohpcreddept@sentara.com. $\r\n12/18/2023: Email received from Ashley N Shell ANBATES@sentara.com, stating that \"I have received the request. Due to the merger coming to a final stage, all new agreements are currently on hold. I will be working on new agreements over the upcoming weeks to allow for the two plans to become one, therefore your agreement will include both VPHP and OHP. Keep in mind, effective 01/01/2024, the plans will be one, better known as Sentara Health Plans. I will be in touch in a couple of weeks.\"/Replied. $\r\n12/20/2023: Received Email from  Ashley N Shell ANBATES@sentara.com, stating \"review the attached documents and fill them up and return to sent for internal approval, once approval receive she will sent us copy of agreement for Signing.\"\r\n12/20/2023: Documents filled and reviewed, sent email to onshore to get the medicare PTAN #. $\r\n12/21/2023: Received email from onshore, Completed the documents following instructions and sent it back to Ashley N Shell via email ANBATES@sentara.com. $\r\n12/22/2023: Received Email from Ashley N Shell via email ANBATES@sentara.com, Stating \"I notice on the draft provider agreement, for Medicare you mention it is in process. If you are not currently a Medicare provider, I cannot include that in the agreement. We have two options: 1- We can move forward with the agreement and exclude Medicare, amend the agreement once you are approved or 2- we can put everything on hold until you are approved for Medicare. Please let me know how you would like to proceed. In addition, I am missing all required documentation needed with the application. Please review the application to determine documents needed and send at your earliest convenience.\" Emailed hina to get advise on it from provider. $\r\n12/22/2023: Email Sent to Ashley N Shell via email ANBATES@sentara.com, to get the list of documents required.\\Received auto response that she is on vacations and will return on 26th Dec 2023. $\r\n01/04/2024: Sent Email to Ashley N Shell at ANBATES@sentara.com, confirming to proceed with agreement with option 1 as suggested by provider. $\r\n01/09/2024: Email Received from Ashley N Shell at ANBATES@sentara.com, with the draft copy of contract excluding Medicare to read and confirm all the information is correct, checked the agreement and replied to confirm to proceed with it. $ \r\n01/09/2023: Email Received from Ashley N Shell at ANBATES@sentara.com, Stating that \" Thank you for verifying. I have sent for language approval. Once the contract is approved, I will send you a copy for signature.\" $ \r\n01/16/2024: Received Email from Ashley N Shell <ANBATES@sentara.com>, RE: Request for Credentialing -  Americare Medicals Supplies & Services Inc - Tax ID # 39-2065877, Stating \"Please see the attached provider agreement ready for your signature.\" \\Replied with attached Filled up and signed agreement. $\r\n01/17/2024: Email Received from Ashley N Shell at ANBATES@sentara.com, Stating \"Agreement require a wet signature, Please print, sign and return with required documentation.\"\\Forwarded to Hina for Wet Signature. $\r\n01/18/2024: Received wet signed agreement from offshore, compile agreement along with other documents required and sent it via email to Ashley N Shell at ANBATES@sentara.com. $ \r\n01/24/2024: Received Email from Ashley N Shell <ANBATES@sentara.com>, Acknowledging the receipt Stating \"Received, thank you! I will be submitting your application to credentialing tomorrow.\" $','2024-01-24','2023-11-03 16:41:40','2024-01-24 22:00:26'),
(245,8,64,'Group',92,'panel-closed','0000-00-00','09/12/2023: Called Piedmont Community Health Plan to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice Americare Medicals Supplies & Services Inc is Showing \"Out of Network\" as Group. Rep suggested that, we can sent our credentialing related queries via Email: PCHPCredentialing@PCHP.net. Rep also suggested that, for Group Credentialing we can visit Website using Link: https://pchp.net/index.php/group-coverage-providers/provider-forms.html > and download form by selecting  \"Network Participation Request Form (Organization)\", we can fill up the form and sent it back follow the instructions. Credentialing Department usually take 60 to 90 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Beth B, Tameka S Call Ref # TamekaS09122023 \r\n09/29/2023: LOI & W9 Form With Network Participation Request Form sent via  email PCHPCredentialing@PCHP.net.\r\n11/06/2023: Sent follow up email to PCHPCredentialing@PCHP.net.\r\n11/07/2023: Called Piedmont Community Health Plan to check Enrollment Application Status. As per Rep, Practice Americare Medicals Supplies & Services Inc is Showing \"Out of Network\" as Group. Asked about the LOI & W9 Form with Network Participation Request Form sent via email PCHPCredentialing@PCHP.net on 09/29/2023, Rep suggested that they do not have access to check credentialing status but we can sent our credentialing related queries via Email: PCHPCredentialing@PCHP.net since there credentialing dept is not open for calls. Credentialing Department usually take 60 to 90 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Morgan H \r\nCall Ref # MorganH11072023 (Anil)\r\n12/01/2023: Email Received from Diane Johnson-Wood PCHPProviderRecruitment@PCHP.net, Stating that \"Piedmont has elected to pull out of the Exchange program for 2024, and therefore, our projected membership growth in the Virginia Beach area has been adversely impacted.  As a result, we have paused our network development activities in this region as we evaluate the continuation of our other lines of business.\" Replied for Clarity.\r\n12/04/2023: Called Piedmont to inquire about the email received on 12/01/2023 from Diane Johnson-Wood PCHPProviderRecruitment@PCHP.net Stating that \"Piedmont has elected to pull out of the Exchange program for 2024, therefore, in the Virginia Beach area we have paused our network development activities in this region as we evaluate the continuation of our other lines of business\". Rep confirmed that, the Panel has been Closed for the Exchange Program but we can inquire about other line of business like commercial plans via Email: PCHPCredentialing@PCHP.net, tried calling Kenneth Barrett Credentialing \r\nSpecialist on 434.455.1226, got Voice Mail suggesting to leave brief message and they will respond with in 48 hours, left brief voice message since there credentialing dept is not taking calls. Rep Name: Shenda S Call Ref # ShendaS12042023 (Anil)\r\n12/04/2023: Sent Email to request for Commercial Plans with LOI and W9 to PCHPCredentialing@PCHP.net.\r\n12/05/2023: Email Received from Chayvon Mccray <chayvon.mccray@pchp.net> in response of the voice mail, Stating that \"Good day, Piedmont Community Health Plan has received your voicemail regarding applying for other lines of business with PCHP being that the Exchange program is no longer accepting applications for the Virginia Beach area. Please see the below email as they will be better to assist you with your request. PCHPProviderRecruitment@PCHP.net.\"\r\n12/05/2023: LOI with W9 form sent to PCHPProviderRecruitment@PCHP.net, requesting them to consider us for the commercial plans and other.\r\n01/16/2024: Sent Follow up email at PCHPProviderRecruitment@PCHP.net.\r\n01/17/2024: Called Piedmont to follow up on inquiry email sent to PCHPProviderRecruitment@PCHP.net on 12/05/2023 & follow up on 01/16/2024 but still didn\'t received any response. Rep said that, we we can inquire about the same via email and get assistance with commercial plans and other line of business by sending email at PCHPCredentialing@PCHP.net, tried calling Kenneth Barrett Credentialing Specialist on 434 455 1226, got voice mail, so left a brief message for call back. Rep Name: Morgan H Call Ref # MorganH01172024\r\n01/17/2024: Sent Follow up email with previous email threads attached at PCHPCredentialing@PCHP.net, Diane.Johnson-Wood@PCHP.net, PCHPProviderRecruitment@PCHP.net, chayvon.mccray@pchp.net.\r\n01/18/2024: Email received from Diane Johnson-Wood PCHP Provider Recruitment <PCHPProviderRecruitment@PCHP.net>, Stating \"Piedmont has no commercial business in the VB area.  We could go the path of contracting but it is not likely you would ever receive a referral from us as we are not in your market.\"','2024-01-18','2023-11-03 16:45:52','2024-01-18 20:21:33'),
(246,8,64,'Group',93,'In-process','0000-00-00','09/12/2023: Called Innovation Health to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Innovation Health is Catered by Aetna and transferred the Call. As per Rep, Practice Americare Medicals Supplies & Services Inc is Showing \"Out of Network\" as Group. Rep suggested that we can apply for group credentialing using online application form Link: https://www.aetna.com/health-care-professionals/forms/facility-request-to-join-network-form.html and fill the online application following the prompts and note the ticket # for future reference. Upon checking further rep confirms that there is already an Active Application which is \"In Process\" received Dt: 09/09/2023 having Ticket # NAF653042. Rep suggested to allow time because the application is under review, once we receive the purposed contract we can check if Innovation Health is included in contract or not which totally depends on availability of network according to practice geographic location. We can not Negotiate on the initial contract, only after two years we can Negotiate. Credentialing Department usually take 60 to 90 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Louise G, Allen D Call Ref # LouiseG09122023, 6162881545 11/06/2023: Called Aetna to check Enrollment Status, As per Rep, Practice Americare Medicals Supplies & Services Inc is Showing \"Out of Network\" as Group. Asked about the Application Ticket # NAF653042, as per rep the application is still \"In Process\" and already been reviewed and suggested to allow more time. As per Rep it will usually take 60 Business Days to complete the process. Rep confirm that 60 Business days will be over at 12/06/2023. Rep Name: Juls L Call Ref # 6169711557 \r\n12/14/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status, Rep said, practice is Non Par. Asked about the Application Ticket # NAF653042, as per rep the application was received Dt: 09/09/2023 and is still \"In Process\" for review and last updated status 12/10/2023 stating that 5contracting team is working on the contract and suggested to allow more time for contract review. Rep Name: Ali F Call Ref # 6174072262\r\n01/17/2024: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep said, practice is Non Par. Asked about the application status, rep confirmed that the application was received Dt: 09/09/2023 and is still \"In Process\" it was assigned to contracting team on 12/10/2023 and ticket # NAF653042 was closed. The contracting team is still working on the contract rep suggested to allow more time for contract review. Rep confirmed that once credentialing will get completed Innovation Health will be included in Contract. Rep Name: Dannis R Call Ref # 6177980943.','2024-01-17','2023-11-03 16:49:43','2024-01-17 15:24:23'),
(247,8,64,'Group',66,'other',NULL,'09/12/2023: Called Carefirst BCBS to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice Americare Medicals Supplies & Services Inc is Showing \"Out of Network\" as Group. Rep suggested that, we can apply for Credentialing by download the application form website using link below and follow the instructions available. Link: https://provider.carefirst.com/providers/join-our-networks/professional-credentialing-how-to-apply.page and select Credentialing Application (PDF). We can fill up the application and return it back to Fax # 410 872 4107. Rep also confirms that care first is only providing services in northeast Virginia, since our practice is located in southeast Virginia it is out of coverage area for Carefirst. Rep Name: Julie M, Kathrine B Call Ref # JulieM09122023, KathrineB09122023 (Anil)','2023-11-03','2023-11-03 16:50:56',NULL),
(248,8,64,'Group',22,'In-process',NULL,'10/06/2023: Called Medicaid to check Enrollment Status, As per Rep, Practice Americare Medicals Supplies & Services Inc is Showing \"Out of Network\" as Group.  Asked about the credentialing process, Rep suggested that we can go to online portal using link: https://virginia.hppcloud.com/ProviderEnrollment/EnrollmentCreate. rep confirms that we have to registered first and then start the application. Rep Name: Ariana B, Samantha G Call 10/06/2023: Online Application filled ATN # 3197773297. 10/18/2023: Received email from provider to inquire about the application, checked via online portal and confirmed status to hina via email with snap shot attached. 10/18/2023: Called Medicaid VC to check Enrollment Application Status, As per Rep, Application # 3197773297 is \"In Process\" pending for review, Rep confirms that, they are experiencing a high volume of enrollment applications and requests are catered in the order it was received. Rep also confirm that review time is 30 Business Day and suggests to allow more time. In case of any requirement they will contact us. Rep Name: Perla R Call Ref # VA-148049','2023-11-03','2023-11-03 16:55:31',NULL),
(249,19,66,'Group',57,'panel-closed','0000-00-00','12/01/2022 Pending for Availity Account , Reminder email has been sent for Availity logins\r\n01/09/2023: Codes received\r\n01/11/2023: Request for facility registration made $ \r\n01/24/2023: ID verification form sent to Jim for notarization and mail to Availity. $\r\n01/26/2023: The form has been mailed out by James. $ \r\n01/30/2023: Dr Jeffery has received an email that form was not notirized/ waiting for updates. $ \r\n02/07/2023: New form has been mailed out by Jim.  $ \r\n02/13/2023: No updates on Availity as of now. $ \r\n02/23/2023 An application has been sent on BSCProviderInfo@blueshieldca.com for enrollment. $ \r\n04/03/2023 An email has been sent on \'BSCProviderInfo@blueshieldca.com\' for enrollment process. $ \r\n05/09/2023: Email received by Anthem that fictitious name permit is required/ email sent to James. $ \r\n05/15/2023: Follow up email sent to James. $ \r\n05/25/2023: Follow up email sent to James, meanwhile emailed insurance that the Fictitious permit is in process. $ \r\n06/26/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep said, Practice is Non Par and Provider Jeffrey is also Non Par but Certified as Individual Provider Effective 01/20/2023 but Not Linked with Practice Tax ID. Rep Suggested that, to get Provider Credentialed, we need to Download and Fill Provider IPMA Agreement Form and submit the Form following the instruction, we can Download Form online portal. TAT is 45 business days. To add Group information we need to submit RA-02 Provider Group/Facility Record Application Form, we can download the Form via portal and submit following instructions. After Group is Added we can apply to Link the Provider with Group Tax ID by filling up ICF-02 Form and Submit Form. TAT is 45 business days. Rep Name: Emily H Ref # 231510037216 $ \r\n09/15/2023: Called to check Demographic Update. Rep said, Practice is still Non Par and Provider Jeffrey is also Non Par.  Asked about the reference number 48116891 received via email, rep confirms that this email is to inform that our request is completed and got provider demographic updated and provider got linked with practice Tax ID # Effective Dt: 09/11/2023. Rep also suggested that, Blue Shield of CA is observing Temporary Network Closure and not accepting new application so the Panel is Closed for maximum specialty types including our provider’s specialty and only open for few specialty listed on Website. Panel Status can be checked via Website Link: https://www.blueshieldca.com/bsca/bsc/wcm/connect/provider/provider_content_en/guidelines_resources/prospective_providers/generic_providers Rep suggests that, we can still try to apply for provider Credentialing, we need to Download and Fill Provider Credentialing Form and submit it following the instruction, we can Download Form using Link: https://www.blueshieldca.com/bsca/bsc/wcm/connect/provider/provider_content_en/guidelines_resources/prospective_providers/generic_providers TAT is 45 business days. Rep Name: Ann F Ref # 232580006927 $ \r\n11/01/2023: Called to check Panel Status. As per Rep, Blue Shield of CA is observing Temporary Network Closure and not accepting new application so the Panel is still Closed. Rep suggested to check panel status online or we can follow up after a month. Rep Name: Yam G Call Ref # 233050032381 $','2024-01-24','2023-11-03 17:13:35','2024-01-24 18:13:01'),
(250,19,66,'Group',9,'In-Network','2023-12-23','10/21/2022 Application submitted online… 10/28/2022 Email sent on Networkhelp@uhc.com for application status 11/11/022 Sent an email to get the current status on the application 12/01/2022 Sent an email on NMRT <networkhelp@uhc.com> for current status on the application 12/23/2022 Sent an email on networkhelp@uhc.com for currrent status on the application $\r\n12/23/2022 Received an email from UHC It appears that there was an issue with the CAQH application and the credentialing application could not process as a result. $\r\n12/23/2022 Received an email application was rejected so submitted an application again. $ \r\n01/16/2022 Received an email no application on file again asked for process to enroll. $\r\n01/31/2023 Sent an email on NMRT <networkhelp@uhc.com> to reprocess the application as we already updated the caqh for provider. $ \r\n02/01/2023 Received an email from insurance resubmit the application An online application has been again submitted. $ \r\n02/09/2023: An email has been received that the application is in process now and it will take 30 days . $ \r\n02/21/2023: Email received for documents/ sent to provider. $ \r\n02/22/2023 Sent an email on Networkhelp@uhc.com for provider enrollment status. $ \r\n02/21/2023: Email received, UHC requires documents/ Email sent to Jim. $ \r\n02/27/2023: Follow up email sent for documents by dr Jaffery 03/3/2023 Sent an email to check enrollment status. $ \r\n03/08/2023 Received an email application is under process. $ \r\n04/04/2023: Called to check enrollment status. Rep said, Practice is Non Par and Provider Jeffrey is also Non Par. Rep suggested that UHC credentialing Department is not open for calls but we can sent our credentialing related queries at Email: westprteam@uhc.com.  Since 120 days TAT was over so told Rep to Escalate the case to expedite the process. Rep said that we will be updated within 15 Business days.  Name: Al Y, Cha C Ref # AlY04042023, 8908 $ \r\n06/26/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep said, Practice and Provider Jeffrey both are still Non Par. Rep also suggested to contact Credentialing Dept via email at: networkhelp@uhc.com. Rep Name: Summer T Call Ref # 4984. $ \r\n08/15/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep said, Practice and Provider Jeffrey both are still Non Par. Rep suggested to sent our credentialing related queries at Email: westprteam@uhc.com or networkhelp@uhc.com. Ask to speak with Supervisor, Rep Transferred the Call. According to Supervisor the reason for Delay can be that the Practice Name is not Listed in CAQH Provider Profile. Login Provider CAQH to check, According to provider profile the Name of the Practice is Listed but not checked to use as Primary Practice Location. We Need to check it to be considered as primary practice location. As per Rep, we can contact the Credentialing Representative by registering and Login to UHC Provider Portal and if need any help we can contact Portal Support : 866 842 3278. After login to portal we can select the Location and get the Rep contact information for further Credentialing related inquiries. Name: Dora N, Adam S Supervisor Call Ref # 1638 $ \r\n09/25/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep said, practice and Provider Jeffrey both are still Non Par. Asked about the application status, rep suggested to contact Credentialing Dept via Email at networkhelp@uhc.com. Told rep that, emails that we are sending to UHC are not getting delivered and returning back to us and we are unable to communicate at all since email is the only option that we have to communicate with UHC credentialing dept. Asked to speak with supervisor, Rep Transferred the Call to Supervisor Dino and he noted the concerns and assure that he is sending emails for both to concern departments and asked to allow time to investigate and confirm that he will communicate and call back with in 5 business days. Name: Shawn D, Supervisor Dino Call Ref # D4123 $ \r\n10/12/2023: Called to follow up on Escalation about the Email Issue. Asked Rep about the escalation that was made earlier by Supervisor Berniece O on 08/31/2023 and also Supervisor Karen Pitogo on 09/21/2023, who assured that we will receive Call Back with  resolution but no Response as off yet. Rep apologies and said that they have limited access and asked to contact UHC Help Desk, told her that, we already discussed it with them but they provided no solution and asked to speak with supervisor, Rep transferred the call to Supervisor Stella P, she discussed everything in detail and also consult with their help desk dept, as per help desk there is no blocking at their end and suggested to discuss this with our IT dept to check if there is any blocking from our firewall. Supervisor Stella, also escalated it to their support email and said that they will also look into this and contact us within 72 hours with the update. Rep Name: Kim, Mary, Alora, Stella P Call Ref # D2927 $ \r\n11/01/2023: Called to check Escalation Status. Rep said, practice and Provider Jeffrey both are still Non Par. Asked about the application status, rep suggested to contact Credentialing Dept via Email at networkhelp@uhc.com. Told rep that, networkhelp@uhc.com email is not working and if we sent email it return back to us. Rep suggested that we can visit online portal and apply using Link: https://www.uhcprovider.com/en/resource-library/Join-Our-Network.html. Rep said that, we can also inquire on chat support option available on provider portal for credentialing related queries. Contacted Chat Support and rep stated that the credentialing application unfortunately, was not approve because credentialing committee didn\'t receive information regarding hospital privileges or admitting arrangements at a facility in our practicing state that\'s within the UnitedHealthcare network. They ask that information last 5/7/2023 was sent to email erum@precisionhub.com. Since this is more than 30 days. The credentialing committee recommends resubmitting the process for credentialing. Rep suggested to apply using online application using Onboard Pro. Name: Red C Call Ref # D1054, Chat Support Ref # 04180077 $ \r\n11/03/2023: online application submitted for Provider Jeffrey Reference Number: CR-100000584043. $\r\n11/13/2023: Submitted the online Complaint Case # 8548920 using Link: https://cdiapps.insurance.ca.gov/CP/login/ $\r\n12/01/2023: Called Suzanne Valera from CA Dept of Insurance on 213-346-6004 got voice mail left brief message, Called CA Dept of Insurance for Gravity Systems Inc for Jeffrey Scott Kopstein regarding complaint against UHC File Number: HCB-8548920, asked about the email received on 11/20/2023, Rep apologies and stated that Unfortunately, under current insurance laws they do not have regulatory authority to address health care provider credentialing or contracting issues and as it is out of their adjudication. Rep said that provider can contact their Attorney and ask them to contact UHC regarding this matter. Rep Name: Jim Call Ref # Jim12012023 $\r\n12/04/2023: Received Email from Valera, Suzanne <Suzanne.Valera@insurance.ca.gov> from CA Dept of Insurance in return for the Voice Message Left for her, Stating that \"Thank you for your voicemail on Friday, December 1st regarding our recent correspondence dated November 20, 2023, inquiring if there is anything that you can do regarding your concerns with Unitedhealth Care Insurance Company. Please note that the Department of Insurance does not have regulatory authority to address health care provider credentialing or contract issues. You may wish to contact an attorney for legal advice.\" Replied with Acknowledgement. $\r\n12/12/2023: Received Email from UHC \"URGENT!!!!: Reminder: Waiting for you to sign UnitedHealthcare (UHC) Contract -JEFFREY SCOTT KOPSTEIN, DO GD-41808363\" Email Forwarded to Provider for Signing. Received response from provider that it has been signed. $\r\n12/13/2023: Called to confirm status on GD-41808363. Rep said, practice and Provider Jeffrey are still Non Par and for application status reference Number: CR-100000584043, rep suggested to contact Credentialing Dept via live Chat Support. Contacted Chat Support, rep confirmed the application is in still In Process\" and reaching its final stage, asked about signed contract we submitted, rep confirmed that  contracting team received it and it\'s in process as of 12/13/2023. Rep confirms that Contract Loaded Estimated Date is 12/19/2023 and suggested to allow more time as the recent request was submitted online on 11/04/2023. Name: Samuel S, Cristian Call Ref # D3672, 04259974 $\r\n01/24/2024: Called to confirm the enrollment status. Rep confirmed, practice is still Non Par but Provider Jeffrey got Par effective 12/23/2023 and linked with practice Tax ID #. Asked about the group application status, rep said that, they have a limited access and suggested to contact Credentialing Dept via Chat Support. Contacted Chat Support, asked about the application status Ref Number: CR-100000584043 under GD-41808363, rep confirmed that the application for Jeffery got completed and contract has been loaded under the TAX ID # 352746580 with Effective Date 12/23/2023 but Group is still Non Par. Rep also sent the Plans List for our reference and suggested to submit linkage request via email at hpdemo@uhc.com. We will receive a reference number for our request within 24 hours. Name: Ian S, Sathya Call Ref # 53813693, 04331115 $ \r\n01/24/2024: Downloaded UHC Plan List for provider Jaffrey sent to Hina via Email. $\r\n01/24/2024: LOI with W9 sent via email at hpdemo@uhc.com. $','2024-01-24','2023-11-03 17:14:46','2024-01-24 22:39:26'),
(251,19,66,'Group',94,'In-process','0000-00-00','Medi- Cal- 09/25/2023: New Pwd is (CRhina@2023) for erum@precisionhub.com. 09/25/2023: Called Help Desk. Rep helped to login the pave portal. Asked about the application status, rep said that as i can see on portal we had three application record out of those two are denied and closed due to missing information were needed and since they were not updated on time these two application got closed we can check the same via secure massage system on pave portal. Rep said that there is one application which is showing \"In Process\" but it is Incomplete so we can complete the required information and submit the application Application ID # 23644A2F. Rep Name: Jason T Call Ref # 135651 $ \r\n09/25/2023: Worked on Pave portal for Group Application # 23644A2F & Provider Affiliation Application ID # 23966UQC. $ 10/02/2023: Called Pave Help Desk. Asked Rep that we are trying to submit the group application but unbale to submit, rep said we need to have at least two providers to enroll as a Group. Rep suggested that we can go to new application and apply as a individual provider. Rep Name: Jay O Call Ref # 136415 $ \r\n10/02/2023: New online application for Individual Provider has been completed and Copy of Professional License needs to be uploaded and Signature need to be done. Application ID 2310B8B1. $ \r\n10/03/2023: Called Medi-Cal Help Desk. Asked that we are trying to submit the group application but unbale to submit, rep said that, there are two profiles created that is the reason it is reason application is not submitting, rep suggested that, we can create new application using correct profile and guided how to do it. Rep said after finishing up with the application we can try to submit the application and in case of any issue we can contact him. Rep Name: Jason T Call Ref # 136563 $ \r\n10/03/2023: New Application ID 2310C05S. $\r\n10/04/2023: Called Help Desk. Asked Rep that we are trying to submit the incorporated provider application but unbale to submit, rep guided and helped to submit the applications, rep suggested that, it take 180 days for the application to be completed and we can login to pave portal and track the application. Rep also confirms that if the application need any further documentation we will be informed and we can full fill the requirements with in 60 days time. Rep Name: Lilly O Call Ref #  236598 $\r\n10/04/2023: Completed new applications for Rendering Provider Application ID: 2310OQJR and Individual Billing Application ID: 2310C05S. $ 10/12/2023: Called to check Application Status. As per IVR, Medi Cal lines are closed for Holiday today, tried to call the Help Desk but got voice mail due to holiday. Tried to check the application status via PAVE portal, for Rendering Provider Application ID: 2310OQJR and Individual Billing Application ID: 2310C05S both are still showing status as \"Submitted\" and submit date is 10/04/2023, there is no further progress found. Rep Name: IVR/PAVE Call Ref #  IVR/Pave Portal10122023 $ \r\n11/01/2023: Called Pave Help Desk to check Application Status. As per Rep, both Applications ID: 2310OQJR and 2310C05S both are still in status \"Submitted\" and are under review, Rep suggested to allow more time. Rep Name: Jay O Call Ref # 139280 $ \r\n11/10/2023: Called to check Application Status. As per IVR, Medi Cal lines are closed for Holiday today, tried to call the Help Desk but got voice mail due to holiday. Tried to check the application status via PAVE portal, for Rendering Provider Application ID: 2310OQJR and Individual Billing Application ID: 2310C05S both are still showing status as \"Submitted\" and as per last update on 10/04/2023 it is still \"Under Review\", there is no further progress found. Rep Name: IVR/PAVE Call Ref # IVR/Pave11102023 $\r\n11/13/2023: Called to check Application Status. As per Rep, Practice Gravity Systems Inc for Jeffrey Scott Kopstein Provider Application ID: 2310OQJR and Individual Billing Application ID: 2310C05S both are still showing same status as \"Submitted\" and was last update on 10/04/2023 showing it is still \"Under Review\", asked rep why is there no further progress, rep said we will be contacted if case of any requirement for further documentation and asked to allow more time. Rep said, TAT for credentialing is 90 to 180 days and suggested to contact pave chat support. Contacted pave chat support and asked about the reason for the application is not processing further, rep said that the review team has 180 days to review the application and asked to allow more time. Rep Name: Louis1137, PAVEChat Call Ref # C-91868g14-Z4Y5, RochelleB11132023 $\r\n11/22/2023: Called to check Application Status. Rep said, they have a limited access and suggested to sent inquiry using link: https://www.dhcs.ca.gov/provgovpart/Pages/PED.aspx inquiry sent for application status, rep said that we will get response with in 5 business days. Tried to check the application status via PAVE portal, for Rendering Provider Application ID: 2310OQJR and Individual Billing Application ID: 2310C05S both are still showing status as \"Submitted\" and as per last update on 10/04/2023 it is still Under Review. Credentialing Department usually take 90 to 180 days for the application to be completed. Rep Name: Patrece ID # 1222 Call Ref # C-9220771-Y2C6 $ 11/22/2023: Application Status inquiry sent using Link: https://www.dhcs.ca.gov/provgovpart/Pages/PED.aspx. $ \r\n11/27/2023: Received Email from PEDCorr (PED)@DHCS <PEDCorr@dhcs.ca.gov>, Stating that \"These applications were received on 10/4/2023. Applications are processed in date order by the date received in PED. The application processing timeframe for this provider type is 180 days from the date received. Any notifications regarding these applications will be sent through PAVE.\" Checked application status from PAVE Portal for Rendering Provider Application ID: 2310OQJR and Individual Billing Application ID: 2310C05S both are still showing status as \"Submitted\" and as per last update on 10/04/2023 it is still \"Under Review\". $ \r\n12/04/2023: Called to check Application Status. Rep said, they do not have an access to check application progress and suggested to check the status sent from Pave Portal or we can inquire using link: https://www.dh/cs.ca.gov/provgovpart/Pages/PED.aspx, rep said it take 5 business days to get response. Told rep that we have already sent inquiry using same link and got response that we need to allow more time as TAT is 180 Days, Rep stated that, the requests will be catered in the order it was received and there is nothing they can do to expedite the process. Tried to check the application status via PAVE portal, for Rendering Provider Application ID: 2310OQJR and Individual Billing Application ID: 2310C05S both status are still showing \"Submitted\" and as per last updated on 10/04/2023. Rep Name: Zee D ID # 1152 Call Ref # C9246709C0G1 $\r\n12/19/2023: Checked the application status via PAVE portal, for Rendering Provider Application ID: 2310OQJR and Individual Billing Application ID: 2310C05S both status are still showing \"Submitted\" and as per last updated on 10/04/2023. $\r\n01/08/2024: Checked the application status via PAVE portal, for Rendering Provider Jeffery Application ID: 2310OQJR and Individual Billing Group Application ID: 2310C05S both status are still showing \"Submitted\" and as per last updated on 10/04/2023. $\r\n01/08/2024: Called to check Application Status. Rep said that, they do not have an access to check application progress and suggested to check the status sent from Pave Portal. Told rep that we have already sent inquiry and got response that we need to allow more time as TAT is 180 Days, Asked rep that way the application status is stuck on \"submitted\" from last three months and there is progress at all. Rep apologize and stated that, they have high volume of applications and the requests will be catered in the order it was received. Rep suggested to allow more time and said that there is nothing that can be done to expedite the process. Rep Name: Diane ID # 1343, Tony ID # 0282 Call Ref # C-9349870-V8P6 $\r\n01/24/2024: Checked the application status via PAVE portal, for Rendering Provider Jeffery Application ID: 2310OQJR and Individual Billing Group Application ID: 2310C05S both status are still showing \"Submitted\" as per last updated on 10/04/2023. $\r\n01/24/2024: Called to check Application Status, Rep said, they have limited access and suggested to check status from Pave Portal. Told rep that, we already checked from portal but there is no progress since 10/04/2023, rep said that TAT is 90 to 180 and suggested to allow more time. Told rep there is no progress in application at all. Rep apologize and said, they have high volume of applications and after calculation said that there has been 113 Days and assures that the requests are being catered in the order they are received and there is nothing that they can do to expedite the process. Called Pave Help Desk to inquire, Rep suggested to be patient and wait until 180 days, if no progress we can call to escalate further. Rep Name: Dayzie ID # 1315, Jaqueline P Call Ref # C-9409942-L2T4, 146367 $ \r\n01/24/2024: Received a Call from Medi-Cal, Asked Application Status, rep suggested to check status from Pave Portal and submit online inquiry. Told rep that, we already checked from portal but there is no progress since 10/04/2023, rep said that TAT is 90 to 180 and suggested that we need to allow more time. Rep Name:  Boni ID 3536 Call Ref # C-941330-Z4B0 $\r\n01/31/2024: Checked the application status via PAVE Portal, for Rendering Provider Jeffery Application ID: 2310OQJR and Individual Billing Group Application ID: 2310C05S both status are still showing \"Submitted\" as per last updated on 10/04/2023 and no progress further in tracking. TAT is 180 days. $','2024-01-31','2023-11-03 17:18:17','2024-01-31 18:14:24'),
(252,19,66,'Group',12,'In-process','0000-00-00','11/02/2023: Received Email from AETNA FIRST HEALTH NETWORK with instructions that Action is Required and we must complete and execute a First Health Physician Agreement and supply all corresponding information requested\" with link provided to electronically sign and execute our provider agreement and enclose all required information: Practice Information Forms, Physician Agreement & corresponding rate pages & W9. Completed and Submitted on line application with required documents/Snap Shot Saved.  $\r\n11/03/2023: Sent email to Hina to sign the requested docu signing document. $\r\n11/08/2023: Sent email again to Hina to sign the requested docu signing document.\r\n11/09/2023: Received Email from Adobe Acrobat Sign on behalf of Aetna FIRST HEALTH adobesign@adobesign.com, Subject : Completed: FHSelfNomCA22,\r\nStating, \"Please note: Completion of an application and agreement does not indicate our acceptance of your agreement and does not guarantee your \r\nparticipation in our network. We will evaluate your application according to our business and credentialing processes and standards and \r\nwill notify you of the status of your application and agreement.\" $ \r\n11/10/2023: Received Email from FirstHealthNetworks@AETNA.com, to inquiry about contracting information for group and provider.\\ Replied.','2024-01-24','2023-11-03 17:19:31','2024-01-24 19:56:19'),
(253,19,66,'Group',58,'panel-closed','0000-00-00','10/21/2022 Sent an email on provider.relations@kp.org, mscprovcontractinbox@kp.org & Professional-ContractRequest@kp.org for enrollment process. $ \r\n10/25/2022 Received a link from Professional-ContractRequest@kp.org for online application filled the application online. $ \r\n10/31/2022 Sent an email on Professional-ContractRequest@kp.org for enrollment status. $ \r\n11/11/2022 Sent an email for the status of the application. $ \r\n11/18/2022 Sent an email on Professional-ContractRequest@kp.org for the current status on the application. $ \r\n12/01/2022 An email has been sent on Professional-ContractRequest <Professional-ContractRequest@kp.org> for current status on the application. $ \r\n12/23/2022 Sent an email on Professional-ContractRequest@kp.org for the current status on the application. $ \r\n01/09/2023 An email has been sent on Professional-ContractRequest <Professional-ContractRequest@kp.org> for the current status on the application. $ \r\n01/17/2023 Received an email from Professional-ContractRequest <Professional-ContractRequest@kp.org> panel is closed for enrollment. $ \r\n02/23/2023 Called but number was on voice mail left voice mail. $ \r\n02/23/2023 Sent an email on Professional-ContractRequest@kp.org to confirm the panel status. $ \r\n02/23/2023 submitted the application again for group. $ \r\n03/03/2023 An Loi has been sent on TPMG-MSC-ProvSvcs@kp.org for enrollment. $ \r\n03/07/2023 As per email panel is closed for facility and called insurance unable to connect left voice mail. $ \r\n03/08/2023 Sent an email on TPMG-MSC-ProvSvcs <TPMG-MSC-ProvSvcs@kp.org> for enrollment process. $ \r\n04/03/2023 An email has been sent on TPMG-MSC-ProvSvcs@kp.org for enrollment status and panel status. $ \r\n04/04/2023 Received an email from TPMG Panel is Closed. $ \r\n06/02/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep said, Practice and Provider Jeffrey both are Non Par and Not Linked. Asked about the Panel Status, Rep suggested that, she does not have any tools to check if Panel is Open or Not, the only way to check is that to apply again and we will be getting response from Credentialing Dept. To Apply we can sent LOI via Email: TPMG-MSC-ProvSvcs@kp.org or Fax 510 987 4135 and we can sent our credentialing related queries to Email: provider.relations@kp.org. Rep Name: Sharon C, Kianna S Call Ref # S-397001945, KiannaS06012023 $ \r\n08/18/2023: Called to check Panel Status. Rep said, they do not have access to check Panel status but we can confirm by applying again and will be getting response from Credentialing Dept. To Apply we need to sent LOI via Email: TPMG-MSC-ProvSvcs@kp.org or professional-contactrequest@kp.org or Fax at: 510 987 4135 and also we can sent our credentialing related queries to Email: provider.relations@kp.org. Rep also gave direct email for County Manager we can also contact her for inquiry: liz.luciani@kp.org. Rep Name: Frances P, Yesenia C Call Ref # FrancesP08182023, YeseniaC08182023  $','2024-01-24','2023-11-03 17:20:49','2024-01-24 20:10:59'),
(254,19,66,'Group',17,'panel-closed','0000-00-00','10/21/2022 Tried to submit an online application but faced issue ref CTR000. $ \r\n10/28/2022 Called to ask enrollment process. Rep suggested to submit an LOI via email at desertpacificnetwork@humana.com Ref# 2000272644177. $ \r\n10/28/2022 An Loi has been sent on the mentioned email 11/11/2022 Sent an email for current status on the application. $ \r\n11/18/2022 An email has been sent for current status on the application. $ \r\n11/28/2022 Received an email from the insurance panel is closed for provider. $ \r\n12/23/2022 An email has been sent to check the panel status. $ \r\n12/23/2022 Received an email panel is still closed for specialty and location. $ \r\n01/09/2023: Again followed up but panel is still closed. $ \r\n01/31/2023 An email has been sent on Desertpacificnetwork@humana.com to check the panel status. $ 02/22/2023 Sent an email to check the panel status. $ \r\n02/23/2023 Received an email panel is still closed for enrollment but application will still be in que and they will reach out to us once they open the panel within a year. $ \r\n04/03/2023 An email has been sent to check the panel status. $ \r\n04/03/2023 received an email panel is still closed. $ \r\n06/02/2023: Called to check Panel Status. Rep said, Practice is Non Par and Provider Jeffrey is also Non Par Asked about the Panel Status, Rep confirms that, the Panel is still Closed for the Group Specialty and suggested that we can follow up after Three to Six Months. Rep also suggested that, once Group will get Credentialed only then we can apply to link Provider with Practice Tax ID.  Rep Name: Lovely B, Sherry F Call Ref # 2000317626683, 2000317631318 $ \r\n08/18/2023: Called to check Panel Status. Rep confirmed, the Panel is still closed for the County and Specialty. However, we can try applying again and sent LOI on company\'s letter head to email desertpacificnetwork@humana.com. once concern dept receive the request they will review and decide if practice will be credentialed or not. Rep suggested, once application gets rejected then we can apply again after Three to Six Months. Rep Name: Ranaldo W, Laila I Call Ref # 2000331558310 $','2024-01-24','2023-11-03 17:21:49','2024-01-24 20:20:48'),
(255,17,68,'Individual',10,'In-process',NULL,'10/11/2023: Called Multiplan to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing \"Contracted\" as Group Effective 09/01/2023 Contract ID 10725194 and provider Nella Gemma H. Stout is showing \"Out of Network\". Asked about the welcome letter for Group, rep said that she is sending request for it to concern dept and we can expect it with in 5 business days via email to hina@precisionhub.com. Rep suggested that, we can sent request for provider credentialing and linkage with group via Email at pif@multiplan.com & registrar@multiplan.com or Fax # 781 487 8273 with W9 Form & LOI. Rep confirms that, only Sarah Bradshaw is showing under the group and some provider have Individual contract with same Tax ID but they are not listed under group, rep suggested that we can sent our updated roaster to add other providers under the group, we need to mention each Providers Name with Individual NPI and CAQH # with Group Contract ID # to above email or fax. Credentialing Department usually take 60 to 90 Business Days to complete request. Rep Name: Amanda Q Call Ref # 9199425 (Anil) 10/11/2023: LOI Sent via Email pif@multiplan.com & registrar@multiplan.com and Fax # 781 487 8273. 10/16/2023: Email recieved from appmissinginfo@multiplan.com with Ref # 231012754894, asking for provider\'s hospital priviledges/responded.','2023-11-06','2023-11-07 02:16:17',NULL),
(256,17,68,'Individual',15,'In-process',NULL,'10/11/2023: Called Cigna to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Non Contracted\" Practicing Facility. Provider Nella Gemma H. Stout, is also Showing \"Out of Network\" for the state of Taxes. Rep suggested that, we can submit request on call for Individual Provider Credentialing by calling Cigna but unfortunately our provider\'s CAQH Profile needs to be updated as it got Expired earlier. Once CAQH is updated, then we can call Cigna and submit request on call, Credentialing Department usually take 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Andrade L Call Ref # AndradeL10112023 (Anil) 10/11/2023: Called Cigna to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing \"Non Contracted\" as Group and Provider Nella Gemma H. Stout, is also Showing \"Out of Network\" for the state of Taxes. Rep suggested that, we can submit request on call for Individual Provider, rep asked few questions and summited the request and provided Application # 13482503. Credentialing Department usually take 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Joy H Call Ref # JoyH10112023 (Anil)','2023-11-06','2023-11-07 02:17:02',NULL),
(257,17,68,'Individual',9,'In-process',NULL,'10/11/2023: Called UHC to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" Practicing Facility Effective 11/13/2021 and for provider Nella Gemma H. Stout, is \"Out of Network\" for the State of Taxes, Rep suggested that, for credentialing we need to contact Credentialing Department, As per Rep, their Credentialing Department is not open for calls but we can sent our credentialing related queries via Email: networkhelp@uhc.com or centralprteam@uhc.com, we can also visit online Portal using Link: https://www.uhcprovider.com/en/resource-library/Join-Our-Network.html and apply online. Credentialing Department usually take 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Ella C Call Ref # 1418 (Anil) 10/11/2023: LOI & W9 Sent via Email @ networkhelp@uhc.com or centralprteam@uhc.com','2023-11-06','2023-11-07 02:18:02',NULL),
(258,17,68,'Individual',13,'In-process',NULL,'10/11/2023: Called Aetna to check enrollment status. As per Rep, Practice FAMILY MEDICINE CENTER OF AUSTIN, P.A. is Showing as \"Contracted\" as a Group Effective 01/20/2022  and Provider Nella Gemma H. Stout, is Showing \"Out of Network\" with Aetna. Rep suggested that we can visit online portal and apply using Link: www.aetna.com > Explore Aetna Site > Providers > scroll down and select Join our network > First Option select Aetna > Second Option select Medical or Behavioral Health > Third Option select \"As an individual provider joining an existing group practice\" and press continue, now fill the online application following the prompt and note the application number for future reference. Rep Suggested that, we can also sent LOI with W9 Form and sent it via Fax # 859 455 8650 but the online application is Recommended. Credentialing  Department usually take 90 to 120 Calendar Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Aaron, Ian A  Call Ref # 6166440053. 10/11/2023: LOI & W9 Form sent via Fax # 859 455 8650.','2023-11-06','2023-11-07 02:18:48',NULL),
(259,17,68,'Individual',87,'In-process',NULL,'Linked with UHC.','2023-11-06','2023-11-07 02:19:37',NULL),
(260,20,70,'Individual',95,'In-process','0000-00-00','10/20/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep, the Practice is Non Par & Provider Hannah is also Non Par. Rep, they have limited access and it was also depends on the member plan. Rep suggested that, their credentialing department is not open for call but we can sent our credentialing related queries via email at Credentialing@Anthem.com. Rep also suggested that, we can apply using Availity. Credentialing Department usually take 30 to 90 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Mathew J, Joy P, Jazel P Ref # JoyP10202023, I-10905074 $ 10/23/2023: Request sent via Email Credentialing@Anthem.com with LOI and W9 Form/Confirmation Email Received. $\r\n12/13/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep, practice is Non Par and Provider Hannah is also Non Par. Asked about the request sent on 10/23/2023 via Email at Credentialing@Anthem.com with LOI and W9 Form, rep said,  they have limited access to check and suggested to contact credentialing dept via email at Credentialing@Anthem.com. Rep also suggested that, for provider credentialing we can apply using Availity link: https://www.availity.com, tried to register through Availity to apply online but unable to apply as it is stating that \"Profile already exist for this Organization and contact administrator to get access. Rep Name: Teresa M Ref # I-12953906 $\r\n12/13/2023: Follow up Email sent to Credentialing@Anthem.com. $\r\n12/13/2023: Online inquiry sent to follow up using link: https://www.anthem.com/provider/contact-us/email-form/. Request submitted response \"Thank you, we have received your message. A Provider Experience representative will respond within two business days.\" $\r\n12/14/2023: Email Received from Provider Experience (PE) <PE@anthem.com> with Case Number: 112519 in response of online inquiry submitted via anthem website. email stating \"Hi Hina, the provider is not linked to the tax ID. Do you have the application confirmation number?/Replied with response. $  \r\n12/14/2023: Email Received from Credentialing <Credentialing@anthem.com>, Stating \"Thank you for contacting credentialing department, I do not see the provider in our credentialing system. The Network Services department receives the application for enrollment and they submit it to the credentialing department.  Because we do not see that the application has been submitted to credentialing, to check the status of the application you will need to contact your Network Provider Relations.\"\\Replied. $\r\n12/15/2023: Email Received from Provider Experience (PE) <PE@anthem.com> with Case Number: 112519, Suggesting to Contact Availity\" Please follow the instructions below and contact the Availity helpdesk at 800-282-4548. Thank you.\" $ \r\n12/15/2023: Email sent to Onshore Office to get Availity Login Credentials for Practice.\r\n12/18/2023: Email Received from Onshore with Availity Credentials, tired login but unable to Availity is suggesting to reset pwd, Email forwarded to onshore regarding the action required. $\r\n12/20/2023: Received Email from Onshore with updated Availity Credentials, having issue login because of security key or back up code is required. Email sent to hina with screen shots to escalate further to Offshore. $ \r\n01/30/2024: Online Account issue resolve to successfully login Availity Portal. $ \r\n01/31/2024: Online Application Submitted for Group and Provider. Saved Screen Shot. Group Application ID: GR-568121, Hannah Provider Application ID: PR-540130. $','2024-01-31','2023-11-07 02:37:07','2024-01-31 17:15:14'),
(261,20,70,'Individual',13,'In-process','0000-00-00','10/20/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep, Practice King\'s Speech is Non Par and Provider Hannah   is also Non Par. Rep suggested, we can apply online portal using Link: www.aetna.com > Explore Aetna Site > Providers > Join our network > Select the option best suits your requirement and press continue, now fill the online application following the prompt and note the application number for future reference OR we can send the request via Fax # 859 455 8650 with LOI and W9 Form. Rep suggested to Rep Name: Liz E Call Ref # 6165730120. $ 10/20/2023: Request sent via Fax # 859 455 8650 with LOI and W9 Form. $\r\n12/12/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep, Practice King\'s Speech is still Non Par and Provider Hannah is also Non Par. Asked Rep about the request sent on 10/20/2023 via Fax # 859 455 8650 with LOI and W9 Form, as per rep the request can not be completed because provider and group both are non par. Rep suggested that we need to submit online application, we can apply for provider and practice by visiting online portal and apply for Group with Individual Provider information for each provider and note the application number for future reference. Rep Name: Win B Call Ref # 6173765122. $\r\n12/12/2023: Online Application Submitted, Request ID is 76172389, against NPI # 1619758653 for Hannah. $\r\n12/14/2023: Received Email From Aetna via adobesign@echosign.com with Subject \"Initial Contracting Has Sent You CT  Individual Agmt_All Products/ Hannah to Sign\" suggesting to open the link provided and sign the contract./Filled online Contact, Signed and Submitted. Snap Shot Saved. $\r\n12/18/2023: Received Email From Aetna NewEngland_InitialContracting1@AETNA.com, Stating that \"Thank you for this info. This has been sent to credentialing, once credentialed they will ask that this be countersigned, will do so then, Thank you, Roxanne.\"\\Replied. $\r\n01/23/2024: Called to check application status for Hannah Request ID # 76172389. Rep said, the Practice King\'s Speech is Non Par and Provider Hannah is still Non Par. Told rep that we filled, signed and submitted the online contract on 12/14/2024, Rep said the application is in process and being reviewed by the credentialing team, it was forwarded to credentialing on 12/26/2023 and suggested to allow more time. TAT is 45 to 60 Business Days. Rep Name: Joan B Call Ref # JoanB01232024. $ \r\n01/31/2024: Called to check application status Request ID # 76172389. Rep said, the Practice and Provider Hannah both are still Non Par. Rep said the application is in process and was forwarded to credentialing on 12/26/2023 and suggested to allow more time. The application is scheduled for committee review on Feb 9 2024 and rep suggested to call after that for follow up. The TAT is 45 to 60 Business Days which will be over on March 21 2024. Rep Name: Lynn, Mel O Call Ref # 6179765671. $','2024-01-31','2023-11-07 02:37:42','2024-01-31 17:54:30'),
(262,20,70,'Individual',15,'In-Network','2024-01-11','10/20/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep, Practice King\'s Speech is Non Par and Provider Hannah is also Non Par. Rep suggested that, we can apply for Group by sending request via Email at: PSScentral@cigna.com, In Subject Line mention \"Group Name, State, Tax ID with LOI and in Email body \"Group Name, Full Service Address, Tax ID #, Specialty and Services Renders. Rep also suggested that, we can submit request on call for Individual Provider Credentialing by calling Cigna but unfortunately  our provider\'s CAQH Profile needs to be updated. Once CAQH ProView is updated then we can call Cigna and submit request on call, Rep suggests to call with CAQH Number, Provider Name, Tax ID # and Contact Person Information to apply. Credentialing Department usually take 90 to 120 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Mark M Call Ref # MarkM10202023. $ 10/20/2023: Request Sent via Email with LOI & W9 Form to PSScentral@cigna.com. $  11/01/2023: received the email from provider that CAQH Profile is updated, login to check status is \"Submit your documents for approval. $\r\n11/07/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep, Practice King\'s Speech is Non Par and Provider Hannah is also Non Par. Asked rep that we submitted the application for Group & Provider Linkage on 10/20/2023 via Email with LOI & W9 Form to PSScentral@cigna.com, Rep said that, there is no need to apply on call and confirm that the application is \"In Process\" and we need to allow more time. Rep Name: Jason G Call Ref # JasonG11072023. $\r\n11/08/2023: Received Email from Cigna Secure Email 9PSSCENT@cigna.com, asking details about the Services Rendered. Replied with details requested. $\r\n11/13/2023: Received Email from Cigna Secure Email 9PSSCENT@cigna.com, with the attached Group Roaster for more then six providers, asking to fill up the Form and return back, Replied with Answer. $\r\n11/13/2023: Sent cigna Group Recruitment Roaster to Cigna via Secure Email 9PSSCENT@cigna.com. $\r\n11/14/2023: Received Email from Cigna Secure Email 9PSSCENT@cigna.com, stating that we received Provider Roaster Form and send to Cigna\'s contract decision team can start processing. $\r\n11/14/2023: Received Email from Cigna Secure Email 9PSSCENT@cigna.com, stating that We have received your request for participation and the application has been started as of 11/14/23.  Your reference number is Bid:13514727 and Bid:13514732. $\r\n11/22/2023: Email received from Cigna DocuSign System <dse_na2@docusign.net>, Cigna Contract for King\'s Speech & Learning Center CT 300548527 BID 13514727 13514732, Stating that, Medical Contract Storage sent you a document to review and sign. Filled the online DocuSing Contract and Submitted. $\r\n12/01/2023: Received Email from Sethupathi.Coumarane@evernorth.com, Stating that \"At this time, we are unable to move forward with the request due to the CAQH status reports as incomplete. Once it has been completed, please notify me so further processing of the application can continue.\" $\r\n12/11/2023: Email sent to Sethupathi.Coumarane@evernorth.com to confirm provider CAQH has been updated and asked to continue with the application. $\r\n12/12/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep, Practice King\'s Speech is \r\n still Non Par and Provider Hannah is also Non Par. Asked about the Contract Signed & Submitted via Online Cigna DocuSign System, rep confirmed that they have received it on 11/24/2023 and is \"In Process\" reference # 300548527, Asked about the provider\'s application status, as per rep they application Bid: 13514732 is \"In Process\" and also confirm that provider CAQH is updated at there end, since it was started on 11/14/2023 Rep suggested to allow more time. Rep Name: Aubrey B Call Ref # AubreyB12122023 $\r\n01/02/2024: Received Email from Evernorth Cigna Provider Onboarding Status <DiscoverCigna@information.cigna.com>, stating that \"you request Reference number 13514732, Application complete: Credentialing process to begin. We have confirmed that your application is complete, and have forwarded it for credentialing review.\" $\r\n01/16/2024: Received Email from Welcome Health Care Provider <DiscoverCigna@information.cigna.com>, Stating that \"Dear HANNAH BASSETT, Congratulations! Your application to participate in the Cigna network has been approved. Your effective date is 01/11/2024. Your provider identification number is 2716044.\" Forwarded to Hina to share with provider.','2024-01-22','2023-11-07 02:38:30','2024-01-22 23:01:50'),
(263,20,70,'Individual',96,'In-Network','2024-01-17','10/20/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep, Practice is Par Effective 02/17/2023 and Provider Hannah is Non Par. Rep suggested, we can download Provider Credentialing Form available online and fill up the form and return it back with W9 Form following the information available in the Form. Rep Name: David M Ref # 26042949 $\r\n10/23/2023: Sent the Filled Application Form with W9 via email CCICredentialing@Connecticare.com/received confirmation email. $\r\n12/12/2023: Called to check Enrollment Request Status. Rep, Practice is Par Effective 02/17/2023 and Provider Hannah is still Non Par. Asked about the application status sent on 10/23/2023 with Filled Application Form & W9 via email CCICredentialing@Connecticare.com, Rep stated that, request got closed due to reason \"Provider CAQH not updated\" and suggested to resubmit the request once CAQH got updated via email at CCICredentialing@Connecticare.com Or Fax # 866 561 9260.  Rep Name: Chris M Call Ref # 27161925 $\r\n12/12/2023: Sent the Filled Application Form with W9 via email CCICredentialing@Connecticare.com.\\Confirmation Email Received. $\r\n01/23/2024: Called to check Application Status sent on 12/12/2023 with the Filled Application Form & W9 via email at CCICredentialing@Connecticare.com. Rep said, Practice is Par since 02/17/2023 and Provider Hannah got Par Effective 01/17/2024 and linked with Practice Tax ID. Asked about copy of contract, rep said that we can request copy of contract via email at CCICredentialing Or Fax # 866 561 9260. Rep Name: Abi K Call Ref # 28094807 $','2024-01-23','2023-11-07 02:39:40','2024-01-23 16:58:19'),
