(269,20,72,'Individual',8,'In-Network','2024-01-01','10/20/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep, Practice is Non Par but Certified and Provider Makenna is also Non Par. Rep suggested, to contact Tricare Community Liaison 2 Representative Chuck Mcgrew via Email at JMcGrew3@humana.com. Asked for Provider Credentialing, rep suggested to apply online for provider certification first. Once provider gets certified then we need to contact Chuck Mcgrew for provider credentialing. Rep Name: Maggie G Ref # MaggieG10202023 $ \r\n10/23/2023: Credentialing Request sent via Email to Chuck Mcgrew at JMcGrew3@humana.com with LOI and W9 Form/Confirmation Email Received. $ \r\n10/23/2023: Received email inquiry from Chuck Mcgrew for  provider Credentialing/replied. $\r\n10/23/2023: Called to check Medicare ID # which was needed for provider Makenna to apply for Tricare Certification. As per Rep, they are not allowed to provide any information to unauthorized person. Rep suggested that, we can login to pecos portal and get the required information and incase need any help for portal login we can contact help desk at # 866 484 8049. Called help desk but rep refuse to help as my name is not listed as authorized person. Rep Name: Danielle Star, Sarrah Call Ref # 231023-001108 $\r\n10/24/2023: Online Application for Provider Certification Submitted provider Makenna Calabrese. $\r\n10/31/2023: Received Email from Kayla Sapp <KSapp1@humana.com> with attached required documents to fill up and sent back. Filled the required documents and sent it back via email to KSapp1@humana.com. $\r\n11/02/2023: Received Email from Chuck Mcgrew at JMcGrew3@humana.com, to inquire about provider information.\\Replied. $\r\n12/12/2023: Checked Online Status for Makenna Certification Request: Showing Completed, Completed Date: 11/08/2023. $\r\n12/12/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep said, the Practice is still showing Non Par and Provider Makenna is also still Non Par but got Certified Effective Dt: 11/08/2023. Asked about the status of Group Request that was sent with the required documents at KSapp1@humana.com on 10/31/2023, Rep suggested that they have a limited access but we can contact TCL 2 Representative Chuck Mcgrew via Email: JMcGrew3@humana.com or Phone 502 313 9524 also we can inquire with Kayla via email: KSapp1@humana.com or Phone 813-362-7931 since she is the one who is handling our case. Tried Calling Kayla on 813-362-7931 got Voice Mail left brief message. Tried Calling Chuck on 502 313 9524 got Voice Mail left brief message. Rep Name: Alma R, Britney C Call Ref # AlmaR12122023, BritneyC12122023  $ \r\n12/12/2023: Follow up Email Sent for Group Contracting Request Status at KSapp1@humana.com and JMcGrew3@humana.com. $\r\n12/12/2023: Received Email from  KSapp1@humana.com, Stating that \"The agreement was submitted for signature but was pushed back due to the signature being printed and not signed electronically. Can you please resign the agreement with a signature, asap.\" $\r\n12/12/2023: Email sent to KSapp1@humana.com, request to sent us copy of contract which we can electronically sign and return back. $\r\n12/13/2023: Received Email from Kayla KSapp1@humana.com, with attached copy of contract suggesting to convert the word file in PDF and then sign it electronically and return back. $\r\n12/13/2023: Signed Copy of East Professional Agreement doc with Copy of Non Delegated Master Template Sent via Email KSapp1@humana.com. $\r\n12/13/2023: Received Email from Kayla KSapp1@humana.com, suggesting to make correction, needed corrections made and resent the Agreement Copy.\\ Received response that it is now good to go. $\r\n12/22/2023: Received email from Chuck McGrew <JMcGrew3@humana.com>, Stating \"Welcome to the (Network) Tricare family!\" email forwarded to Hina to communicate with Provider that \"Wait your turn is now in network with Tricare effective 1/01/2024.\" with contract attached. $','2024-01-22','2023-11-07 02:48:57','2024-01-23 15:19:28'),
(270,6,18,'Group',8,'In-process','0000-00-00','10/20/2023: Called Tricare East to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, the Practice INNER TRANQUILITY COUNSELING GROUP, LLC is Showing \"Not Contracted\" but Certified as a Group and Provider DANIELLE CRAWFORD, M.A. LPC, is also Showing \"Out of Network\" but Certified for the State of VIRGINIA. Rep suggested that, for the Group & Provider Credentialing we can sent our request to Tricare Provider Representative Kanisa Johnson Baker via Email at kjohnsonbaker1@humana.com and we can also contact her via Phone 502 318 5874. Credentialing Department usually take 30 to 90 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Maria M Call Ref # MairaM10202023 (Anil) 10/31/2023: LOI with W9 Form Sent via Email kjohnsonbaker1@humana.com. 11/06/2023: Received Email from Kanisa Johnson-Baker <KJohnsonBaker1@humana.com> from Tricare East stating that, they are currently accepting requests to join our Behavioral Health network. we can apply using link: https://www.humanamilitary.com/provider/resources/tricarecertapps for TRICARE Certification to join the network. The Humana Military representative will contact you with a contract proposal. Replied to confirm that our Group and Provider are both certified already and wanted to proceed with contracting for both. 11/07/2023: Called Kanisa Johnson at 502 318 5874, she was not available and there was aa voice mail, left detailed message for her to advise further about provider & Group Contracting and left call back number.\r\n11/09/2023: Received Email from Kanisa Johnson-Baker <KJohnsonBaker1@humana.com> from Tricare East, same email received stating same which we received on 11/06/2023. Replied to confirm that our Group and Provider are both certified already and wanted to proceed with contracting for both.\r\n11/09/2023: Called Kanisa Johnson at 502 318 5874, she was not available and there was aa voice mail, left detailed message for her to advise further about provider & Group Contracting and left call back number.\r\n11/13/2023: Called Kanisa Johnson from INNER TRANQUILITY COUNSELING GROUP, LLC for DANIELLE CRAWFORD at 502 318 5874, she was not available and there was a voice mail, left detailed message for her to advise further about provider & Group Contracting via Email or Call Back.\r\n11/15/2023: Received Email from Kanisa Johnson-Baker <KJohnsonBaker1@humana.com>, Providing link to apply for Provider Contract Link: https://www.humanamilitary.com/provider/resources/tricarecertapps.\r\n11/15/2023: Online Application Submited using Link: https://infocenter.humana-military.com/hgbprovider/jointhenetwork.\r\n11/16/2023: Called Kanisa she is on leaves. Called Tricare East to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice INNER TRANQUILITY COUNSELING GROUP, LLC is showing Certified but\" Not Contracted\" as a Group and Provider DANIELLE CRAWFORD is also Showing Certified but \"Out of Network\". Asked Rep about the error that we are receiving while applying online since we are interested in Contracting for both, rep guided that, Panel are closed for Medical but open for Behavioral Health network and helped to apply online for the initial application and said that Network department will contact us for further assistance. Credentialing Department usually take 30 to 90 Business Days to complete the process. Rep Name: Micheal, Amanda Call Ref # Amanda11162023 (Anil)\r\n11/16/2023: Online Application Resubmited using Link:  https://infocenter.humanamilitary.com/hgbprovider/jointhenetwork.\r\n11/21/2023: Email Received from HBH Military Provider Network <HBHMilitaryNetwork@humana.com>, Stating that \"We need to apply for Practice Certification\"/Replied.\r\n11/21/2023: Called Tricare East to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice INNER TRANQUILITY COUNSELING GROUP, LLC is showing \"Not Contracted\" and Not Certified as a Group and Provider DANIELLE CRAWFORD is Showing Certified effective 12/20/2022 but \"Out of Network\" and Linked with the Practice Tax ID. Asked Rep about email that we received today stating that we need to apply for certification for practice, rep confirms that we need to get practice certified first and once completed, we can contact Tricare Community Liaison 2 Representative Pamela Mann: 502 318 9134 Email: pmann4@humana.com or Kanisa Johnson: 502 318 5874 Email: KJohnsonBaker1@humana.com for further assistance with Contracting. Asked Rep why we were told that our practice is Certified earlier, rep apologies and suggested to follow instructions provided and apply using Link : https://www.humanamilitary.com/provider/resources/tricarecertapps. Certification might take 30 to 90 Business Days. Rep Name: Janie P Call Ref # JanieP11212023 (Anil)\r\n11/21/2023: Filled Application Form for Group with W9 Form have been sent to Fax # (608) 221-7535.\r\n11/28/2023: Received Email from HBH Military Provider Network <HBHMilitaryNetwork@humana.com>, Stating that \"Thank you for your interest in joining Humana Military’s Behavioral Health TRICARE provider network! Unfortunately, at this time we are unable to confirm your TRICARE-Certification status.\"/Response sent confirming that Clinic or group practice certification application form has already been sent to the Fax # (608) 221-7535 on 11/21/2023 and asked for application status. Also sent email to Tricare Community Liaison 2 Representative Pamela Mann: 502 318 9134 Email: pmann4@humana.com or Kanisa Johnson: 502 318 5874 to get update on Practice Certification Request Status with applicaiton copy attached.\r\n11/28/2023: Tried calling Pamela Mann: 502 318 9134, got voice mail so left message, Tried calling Kanisa Johnson-Baker: 502 318 5874, got voice mail so left message. Called Tricare East to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, Practice INNER TRANQUILITY COUNSELING GROUP, LLC is showing \"Not Contracted\" and Not Certified as a Group and Provider DANIELLE CRAWFORD is Showing Certified effective 12/20/2022 but \"Out of Network\" and Linked with the Practice Tax ID. Asked Rep about the request sent on 11/21/2023 via Fax # (608) 221-7535, rep suggested that it might take 20 to 30 days for the fax to be processed and appear in their system and ask to allow more time. Certification might take 30 to 90 Business Days. Rep Name: Samantha S, Jasmine F Call Ref # JasmineF11282023 (Anil)\r\n12/01/2023: Received Email from KJohnsonBaker1@humana.com, Stating that \"The group certification application is not required. Please ensure that the each individual provider completes the TRICARE certification application.\" Replied. \r\n12/01/2023: Received Email from KJohnsonBaker1@humana.com, Stating that \"Please specify the tax ID that is requesting a contract.  I received the following response from our contracting team\" Replied  with Tax ID. \r\n12/05/2023: Received Email from KJohnsonBaker1@humana.com, Stating that \"I can confirm that the tax ID 871303732 is TRICARE certified with the following affiliated providers: Nyrisha A Hall, NPI 1114706322, Danielle P Crawford PC NPI 1972169217. For this tax ID and affiliated providers, please send a follow up request to our contracting team HBHMilitaryNetwork@humana.com along with the information above.\" Email sent to HBHMilitaryNetwork@humana.com as instructed with the information required.\r\n12/06/2023: Received Email from Tricare via secure email HBHMilitaryNetwork@humana.com, Stating that \"Dear Inner Tranquility Counseling Group, Thank you for your interest in joining Humana Military’s Behavioral Health provider network for the TRICARE East Region! We have attached a contract packet to this email for your review and consideration.\" Email suggest to fill up the contract and roster form attached and return it back. \r\n12/06/2023: Sent Filled contract and roster form via secure email to HBHMilitaryNetwork@humana.com12/18/2023: Received Email from Tricare via secure email HBHMilitaryNetwork@humana.com, Stating that \"Dear Inner Tranquility Counseling Group, You recently returned a contract packet to join the Humana Military TRICARE East Provider Network. At least one or more of your practitioners has been approved by our Credentialing department, and we can now proceed with processing the Contract. The anticipated effective date will be 2/1/2024. Thank you, Danielle Wilhoit, Autism & Behavioral Health Professional Contracting, Humana Military, F (855) 463-3571, HBHMilitaryNetwork@humana.com, HumanaMilitary.com./Replied.','2023-12-18','2023-11-08 02:48:33','2023-12-19 15:04:14'),
