t. Rep Name: Eral M, Emi F Call Ref # EralM01252024, EmiF01252024. $\r\n01/25/2024: LOI with W9 form Sent via email at nc_net_mgmt@optum.com. $\r\n01/26/2024: Contacted UHC Live Chat Support, asked rep about the alternate option to apply for provider credentialing, rep said that it is out of there scope and suggested that the only option they have to apply online using optum express. Rep Name: Myriam Call Ref # 04336545 $\r\n01/26/2024: Registered online with Optum Express for One Health ID to apply online. $ \r\n01/26/2024: Online application filled for provider, received deficiency that Practice Infinity is not updated in CAQH profile, NC state license and W9 form is missing in CAQH for practice. since optum express is fetching all the information and documents from CAQH ID it needs to be updated.','2024-01-26','2023-12-19 16:58:46','2024-01-28 00:09:36'),
