(316,22,83,'Group',22,'In-process','0000-00-00','12/21/2023: Application completed ATN # 997707/ waiting on documents by provider $ \r\n12/27/2023: Application submitted $ \r\n01/08/2024: Checked the application status via online portal for Dr Omo under ATN # 997707, the request is \"In Process - received documents are being reviewed $\r\n02/01/2024: Called Medicaid GA to check Application Status ATN # 997707. Rep said, we can check from portal. Asked rep to reset login authenticator for provider Omo account to login portal. Rep transferred to portal support, rep verified the info and reset the Portal QR code authenticator for provider Omo ID. Rep Name: Terrell, Brandy, Amma, Shekella Call Ref # 41293114, 41293869, 41293607, 41293935, 41294113','2024-02-01','2024-01-02 22:18:02','2024-02-01 17:25:49'),
(317,22,82,'Individual',22,'In-process','0000-00-00','12/22/2023: Samuel Fadare is showing \"Out of Network\" and not linked with any Tax ID/  Submitted online application ATN # 998149. $ \r\n01/08/2024: ATN # 998149, the request is \"In Process - received documents are being reviewed\" Status $ \r\n02/01/2024: Called Medicaid GA to check Application Status ATN # 998149. Rep said, the application got denied reason being \"the provider does not have the sufficent degree or trainging for the speciality of pshyology or addection drug pshycology. Rep suggested that we need to resumbit the new application with correct speciality. Asked rep to reset login authenticator for provider Omo account. Rep transfered to portal support, rep verified the info and reset the Portal QR vode authenticator for provider Omo ID. Rep Name: Terrell, Brandy, Amma, Shekella Call Ref # 41293114, 41293869, 41293607, 41293935, 41294113 $ \r\n02/01/2024: Submitted Online Application ATN # 1012358. Power of Attorney form for Payee needs to be attested by notary public seal and signed by provider and uploaded, forward the POA form to share with provider. it should be submitted before 03/02/2024. $','2024-02-01','2024-01-02 22:31:49','2024-02-01 22:48:45'),
(318,24,85,'Group',13,'panel-closed','0000-00-00','01/03/2024:  Adoro Healthcare S.upplies, LLC is Out of Network.Rep: Cia P Call Ref # CiaP01032024  01/03/2024: Online Application submitted for Facility, Snap Shot Saved.\r\n01/09/2024: Received Email from Aetna quickbase-notify@aetna.com <quickbase-notify@aetna.com> stating \"We are unable to consider an application from you at this time. Please know that this decision does not constitute a judgment regarding your professional competence or conduct. Please do not submit another request for at least one (1) year.  We will not respond to additional requests if we’ve already responded within the last 12 months, We appreciate your interest and will keep your name on file for one year in the event that there are opportunities for further expansion in your geographic location and area of expertise.\"','2024-01-09','2024-01-04 21:17:34','2024-01-09 22:59:51'),
(319,24,85,'Group',9,'panel-closed','0000-00-00','01/03/2024: Adoro Healthcare Supplies, LLC is Out of Network\" as Group. Unfortunately, on UHC website update is available for DME providers stating that \"The DME POS Network is closed for all market contracting.\" Rep Name: Norwin B, Roxan Call Ref # 44860867, 47539261','2024-01-04','2024-01-04 21:17:43','2024-01-09 19:43:02'),
(320,24,85,'Group',18,'In-process','0000-00-00','01/03/2024: Practice Adoro Healthcare Supplies, LLC is Out of Network\" as Group $\r\n01/03/2024: Online Application submitted for Facility, Snap Shot Saved. $\r\n01/18/2024: In process Rep Name: Sandra O, Teoshia R Call Ref # 2893962733 $ <br/> 01/22/2024: Email received that panel is closed as of now. $\r\n01/30/2024: Received Email from Darlene F. Yard <Darlene.Yard@fideliscarenj.com>, Stating \"I am the DME Coordinator for Fidelis Care NJ.  I received an email that you needed some assistance. How may I assist you?  Thank you\" $\r\n01/30/2024: Sent LOI with W9 via Email at Darlene.Yard@fideliscarenj.com. $','2024-01-30','2024-01-04 21:21:22','2024-01-30 20:32:58'),
(321,24,85,'Group',57,'In-process','0000-00-00','01/03/2024: Facility is Out of Network/  DME is handled by Care Centrix $\r\n01/04/2024: LOI & W9 Form sent via email at Contracting@CareCentrix.com $\r\n01/09/2024: Follow up email sent at Contracting@CareCentrix.com, james_senesi@horizonblue.com $\r\n01/18/2024:  Called but ins were closed, Rep Name: James/IVR Ref # James/IVR01182024 $\r\n01/23/2024: Follow up email sent at Contracting@CareCentrix.com,  james_senesi@horizonblue.com. $\r\n01/30/2024: Called Horizon NJ to check request status. Rep said, Practice is still Non Par as Group. Told Rep that we sent multiple requests to James & Care Centrix for enrollment but got no response, rep apologies and transferred to Credentialing dept, Rep guided as per website DME request needs to be sent to Ancillary_ProviderNetwork@HorizonBlue.com, Contracting@CareCentrix.com and rep suggested to keep james_senesi@horizonblue.com in CC. Told rep due to no response escalate it further for James to follow up. Rep escalated for follow up with James and said we will be contacted with in 2 to 3 days. Rep Name: Drei D, Miranda M, Danish S, Mark A Call Ref # LVP-7936092, MirandaM01302024, LVP-793730 $','2024-01-30','2024-01-04 21:24:40','2024-01-30 17:11:25'),
(322,24,85,'Group',49,'In-process','0000-00-00','01/03/2024:  practice Adoro Healthcare Supplies, LLC is Out of Network\" as Group. 01/03/2024: Online Application submitted for Facility, Snap Shot Saved.\r\n01/18/2024: Called to check application status. Rep said, practice Adoro is still Non Par and she sent email inquiry to the concern dept  and commit call back with in 5 BDs. Rep suggested that we can contact wellpoint at 833-731-2149 or email  PLM2SIT@anthem.com. Contacted wellpoint, rep suggested to contact via email PLM2SIT@anthem.com. Rep Name: Psalmai T, Nelly, Silva, Ann Corrnet, Amber M Call Ref # I-192741398, I-192747872 $\r\n01/23/2024: Follow up email sent at PLM2SIT@anthem.com. $ \r\n01/30/2024: Called Amerigroup/Wellpoint to check application status. Tried couple of time but was unable to connect with rep with out valid provider number or member id. Tried using other provider id to reach rep, rep said, practice Adoro is still showing Non Par and said that she is unable to find any profile created in her system yet. Rep said that TAT is 30 to 45 days and suggested to allow more time. Rep said for request status we can inquire via Fax at # 800 848 7347 or Email at PLM2SIT@anthem.com. Told rep that we have already emailed but no response, Rep guided that we can go to link: https://www.provider.wellpoint.com/new-jersey-provider/contact-us/email and submit inquiry request, in return we will get reference number and it will take 3 to 5 days to get answer to our query submitted. Rep Name: Yasmin M Call Ref # I-193389443 $ \r\n01/30/2024: Online inquiry submitted using link:  https://www.provider.wellpoint.com/new-jersey-provider/contact-us/email. $ \r\n01/30/2024: Received Email from Provider Experience (PE)-Amerigroup <PE@amerigroup.com>, Stating, \"Thank you for contacting the New Jersey Provider Experience team at Amerigroup Community Care. We have received your inquiry regarding Credentialing/ Provider Enrollment. Maria P. will contact you within 1 to 2 business days to work with you to resolve the issue. Your case number is 119562.\" $','2024-01-30','2024-01-04 21:26:54','2024-01-30 19:01:37'),
(323,13,76,'Individual',102,'In-process','0000-00-00','01/04/2024: Called Devoted Health Plans to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, practice HEART AND VASCULAR CLINIC is showing \"Out of Network\" as a Group and Provider Anand Balachandran is also showing \"Out of Network\" and Not linked with the Tax ID of the Facility. Asked how to apply, rep suggested that we can apply online using Link: https://www.devoted.com/providers/providers-al/ > Participation Request Form. We can follow the instructions and fill up the online application form to get our self credentialed. Rep Name: Marj L Call Ref # MarjL01042024\r\n01/04/2024: Online initial Application form is Submitted, TAT is 30 to 60 Days, Snap Shot Saved.\r\n01/05/2024: Received Email from Kathleen Hulcher <kathleen.hulcher@devoted.com>  on behalf on Devoted Health with Documents attached to fill up and return back.\r\n01/05/2024: Email sent to Kathleen Hulcher <kathleen.hulcher@devoted.com, with attached filled required forms and documents.','2024-01-05','2024-01-04 21:29:41','2024-01-05 18:30:31'),
(324,12,78,'Individual',46,'In-process',NULL,'01/04/2024: Called Devoted Health Plans to check Enrollment Status. As per Rep, practice Wellness Office PC is showing \"Out of Network\" as a Group and Provider Anand Balachandran is also showing \"Out of Network\" and Not linked with the Tax ID of the Facility. Asked how to apply, rep suggested that we can apply online using Link: https://www.devoted.com/providers/providers-al/ > Participation Request Form. We can follow the instructions and fill up the online application form to get our self credentialed. Rep Name: Marj L Call Ref # MarjL01042024','2024-01-04','2024-01-04 22:14:34',NULL),
(325,5,7,'Group',11,'panel-closed','0000-00-00','07/11/2023: Called AARP to check Enrollment Status. Call was Transferred to UHC. As per the Rep, the practice Care Health Medical LLC is showing \"Non Contracted\" as Group and Provider Dr: Rohit Gogna is also showing \"Out of Network\" and Not linked with Tax ID. Rep suggested that UHC credentialing Department is not open for calls but we can sent our inquiries via Email: networkhelp@uhc.com. Rep Name: Brenden, Mathew, Anthony, Patricia, Lexi, Max, Juan J Call Ref # 1860 (Anil) 08/01/2023: Called AARP to check Enrollment Status. Call was Transferred to UHC. As per the Rep, the practice Care Health Medical LLC is showing \"Non Contracted\" as Group and Provider Dr: Rohit Gogna is also showing \"Out of Network\" and Not linked with Tax ID. Rep suggested that for Credentialing related inquiry we have to contact their Credentialing Department. Rep also informed that, UHC Credentialing Department is not open for calls but we can sent our inquiries via Email: networkhelp@uhc.com. Rep Name: RJ, Jill, Edward R Call Ref # EdwardR08012023 (Anil) 01/08/2024: Contacted to live chat support to confirm the Aarp status for provider. As per Rep, the practice Care Health Medical LLC is showing \"Contracted\" as Group effective dt: 12/28/2023 and Provider Dr Rohit Gogna is showing \"In Network\" effective dt: 12/28/2023 and linked with practice Tax ID # with Commercial Plans. Rep shared the Plans List to see with which plans provider is \"Par\", according to list provider Rohit Gogna is showing \"Non Par\" with Aarp Plans. Rep Name: Steve C, Frances Call Ref # 51910509, 04198342.\r\n01/09/2024: As per AARP if provider is enrolled with Medicare they can accept patients with Aarp supplemental plans , For HMO and PPO the market is currently closed for Aarp plans for the providers specialty. Rep Name: Samantha, Angel, Rio U, Luis Call Ref # 51978307, 0430280','2024-01-09','2024-01-08 23:53:30','2024-01-09 20:30:40'),
(326,5,7,'Individual',51,'In-Network','2023-10-28','08/24/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep, the practice is Non Par as Group and Provider Rohit is Par under GHI network effective dt: 08/21/2019 but under different tax id # 471993001 and different address. Rep suggested that, we can check panel status via online portal link: https://www.emblemhealth.com/providers/resources/join-our-network > scroll down to > \"Before You Apply\". Rep confirmed that they are not credentialing groups and provider is already in Network with GHI we just need to sent Linkage request with LOI and W9 via Email: providermodifications@emblemhealth.com OR Fax the same at: 877 889 9061. credentialing dept take 45 Business Days for demographic update. Rep Name: Sam S, Chris A Call Ref # 24761008 11/27/2023: LOI with W9 Form Sent via Email: providermodifications@emblemhealth.com and Fax at: 877 889 9061.\r\n01/09/2024: Called to check the request status. Rep Confirmed, practice is Non Par since panel is closed for group but provider Rohit Gogna is Par under GHI Network Effective Dt: 10/28/2023 and linked with practice tax id # and address. Rep Name: Mark C Call Ref # 27741577','2024-01-09','2024-01-09 21:28:03','2024-01-09 21:30:02'),
(327,5,7,'Individual',103,'other','0001-01-01','09/11/2023: Called to check Enrollment Status with ABH Plans. Rep, practice is Non Par and Provider Rohit showing is \"In Network\" but under different Tax ID #. Rep suggested, first we need to get group contracted with Aetna Better Health Plan, we can sent request via Email at aetnabetterhealth-nj-providerservices@aetna.com along with LOI & W9. Once the group will get contracted we will be assigned with Provider Relations Representative who will be responsible to help us in provider linkage. It take 30 to 90 BDs to complete the process. Rep Name: Aschelle C Call Ref # PDXGR28488713\r\n09/11/2023: LOI sent via Email Address: aetnabetterhealth-nj-providerservices@aetna.com.\r\n09/11/2023: Email Received Case Number: 79339360.\r\n12/11/2023: Called to check request status. Rep, practice is Non Par and Provider Rohit is also showing Non Par but got linked with practice Tax ID Effective Dt: 06/29/2023. Asked about the request sent on 09/11/2023 via Email at aetnabetterhealth-nj-providerservices@aetna.com and got Case Number: 79339360. Rep suggested, there is no updated status available and said that she is Escalating it to Concern Dept for updated status and assured that we will get call back from Provider Relations Representative with update on it TAT 15 Days, provided contact information. Rep Name: Kurtus W, Nyoka T Call Ref # PDXGR-30206867\r\n01/10/2024: Called to check request status. Rep, practice is still Non Par and Provider Rohit is also showing Non Par but got linked with practice Tax ID Effective Dt: 06/29/2023. Asked about the escalation made on 12/11/2023 against Case Number: 79339360, rep said that the escalation got closed on 12/26/2023 with notes suggesting to sent inquiry via email at aetnabetterhealth-nj-providerservices@aetna.com with the case number and rep provided Provider Relations Representative Angelica Miranda Phone # 609 515 4817, Email: mirandaa2@aetna.com and suggested to keep her in cc for follow up email. Rep Name: Brandy H Call Ref # PDXGR-307285359\r\n01/10/2023: Follow up email sent with email thread and LOI & W9 for reference at aetnabetterhealth-nj-providerservices@aetna.com and mirandaa2@aetna.com.\r\n01/10/2024: Received Email from AetnaBetterHealth-NJ-ProviderServices <AetnaBetterHealth-NJ-ProviderServices@AETNA.com> stating \"Thank you for contacting Aetna\'s Medicaid Provider Operation Support (MPOS) department. We have received your email and will begin to review your request. Your request is important to us and will be tracked. A case number has been assigned and noted in the subject line of this email.\"\r\n01/10/2024: Received Email from Miranda via secure mail MirandaA2@aetna.com, Stating \"It has come to my attention that you have  been reaching out to a different email address for assistance.  Unfortunately, this email address does not belong to the correct contact for your inquiries.  You will need to reach out to our contracting team directly.  Please email Kim Lees leesk1@aetna.com and she will be able to assist you further. I have also included the account manager for Monmouth County, Acampora, Dina C <AcamporaD@aetna.com>  She will be able to answer any questions once you are contracted with ABHNJ.\"\r\n01/10/2023: Follow up email sent with email thread and LOI & W9 for reference at leesk1@aetna.com and AcamporaD@aetna.com.\r\n01/17/2024: Received Email from Offshore Providers Office, Stating \"We would like to cancel the Credentialing for Aetna better health for care health medical and the doctor. Please confirm when it is cancelled Thank you.\"\\Sent LOI with W9 to stop Credentialing at AetnaBetterHealth-NJ-ProviderServices@AETNA.com, AcamporaD@aetna.com; leesk1@aetna.com; mirandaa2@aetna.com.\r\n01/18/2024: Received Email Lees, Kimberly A <LeesK1@aetna.com>, Stating, \"For credentialing status, you need to submit an email to NJ_Credentialing@aetna.com as I am not provided credentialing updates. Once you submit the request, please allow at least 30 days for team to respond. If you do not receive a response, please let me know and I can escalate the email for you.\"\r\n01/18/2024: LOI with W9 to stop Credentialing at NJ_Credentialing@aetna.com.\r\n01/18/2024: Received secure email from Lees, Kimberly A <leesk1@aetna.com>, Stating \"I reviewed your email and request below and Dr. Gogna has been credentialed for a couple years now and participating with the ABH NJ since 2020.\"\\Replied to confirm if the request is closed having Case Number : 79339360.\r\n01/18/2024: Received secure email from Acampora, Dina C <AcamporaD@aetna.com>, Stating, \"This request Case Number: 79339360 has been sent for processing. I have request to cancel the Credentialing Request.\"\\Replied to confirm once the Case #  79339360 is Closed.','2024-01-18','2024-01-09 21:29:11','2024-01-18 16:57:45'),
(329,25,86,'Individual',22,'In-process','0000-00-00','11/14/2023Provider needed us to apply for revalidation but the id and pw is incorrect and provider has no clue about the id or pw for the portal/ Provider in network and will expire on 11/202/2023 $\r\n12/04/2023: Letter was submitted by provider with ink signature $\r\n12/20/2023: upon calling we got to know that no application submitted/ we sent inquiry to find out why they don’t have the request in process/tracking number is 211722415 $\r\n12/21/2023: Response received that provider can call and have it reset/ email forwarded to David $\r\n01/04/2024: Email Sent to David again with detailed instructions to communicate the same with provider for resending letter for PIN 1/11/2024: Precision sent the email to medicaid to sort out the issue\r\n1/12/2024: Email sent that we need to apply as a new provider and info needed $\r\n01/17/2024: Follow up sent $','2024-01-12','2024-01-12 18:00:41','2024-01-18 13:46:24'),
(330,8,64,'Group',17,'In-process','0000-00-00','01/23/2024: Called to check Enrollment Status. Rep said, Practice is Non Par. Asked about the credentialing process, Rep suggested that, Humana Commercial Choice Care PPO Network is catered by Virginia Health Network, we can contact them for credentialing at 800 989 3837 ext 4 or 804 320 3837 and for others plans like Medicare PPO, HMO and Medicare Private Fee for Service Plans, we can sent our request directly to Humana via email at virginiaproviderupdates@humana.com, with LOI and W9. Called Virginia Health Network for commercial plans at 800 989 3837 got voice mail, left brief message, Tried calling # 804 320 3837, got voice mail, so left brief message, also recording suggests to email for credentialing related inquiries at bcline@medcost.com or credentialingapps@medcost.com. Rep Name: Andria, Arnie E Call Ref # 2000363562303 $ \r\n01/23/2024: Request sent via email at virginiaproviderupdates@humana.com, with LOI and W9.\\Confirmation email received stating response will be 3 to 5 BDs. $ \r\n01/23/2024: Request sent via email at bcline@medcost.com & credentialingapps@medcost.com, with LOI and W9.\\Confirmation email received to allow 40 to 60 BDs. $\r\n01/24/2024: Received Email from Billie Cline bcline@MEDCOST.com, Stating \"Thank you for your email. We have forwarded to our contract negotiator, Amanda Coughlin,  to send the documents needed for contracting. She will be in touch.\"\\Replied. $\r\n01/25/2024: Received email from VirginiaProviderUpdates@humana.com, Stating \"Thank you for your recent inquiry about participation with Humana, Inc. Based on our current network requirements, including specialty and geographic considerations, we regret that we are unable to extend a participation agreement to you at this time. We maintain all requests on file for one year. Our office will contact you should network requirements change during this period.\"\\Forwarded to Hina. $','2024-01-25','2024-01-23 21:46:32','2024-01-25 19:53:48'),
(331,23,81,'Individual',21,'other','0000-00-00','01/02/2024: Vickie will discuss this with Haslem to get me her access $ <br/> 01/19/2024: Follow up email sent again to vickie $ <br/> 01/23/2024: Follow up email sent along with updates. $ \r\n01/30/2024: Called Medicare NC to ask about credentialing process. Rep said that, there is no alternate option to apply except online portal and suggested that if previous Office Administrator is no longer available and you are a new Office Administrator but you had to get a new NCID or You are an individual provider and you now want to become your own Office Administrator, To update the Office Administrator for your provider record, complete a Change Office Administrator Application using Link:\r\nhttps://www.nctracks.nc.gov/content/public/providers/Office-Admin.html.\r\nCreate new NCID following instructions and make your self admin of the new account. Asked about the enrollment status, rep said that they can not provide status with out NCID. Rep Name: Crystal Call Ref # I-6128539 $','2024-01-30','2024-01-23 21:55:40','2024-01-30 22:21:09');
