(5,'Logo design with brand identity',2,'Need to rebrand the online multi brand fashion store with logo.\r\nLogo must be sipmle and easy to read in one color.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01ed92daace763027f','NA',2,'United States','k',50.000,'fixed',50.000,'2022-10-19',1,'2022-10-19',1,'NA',0,'1','1',1,'2022-10-19 21:02:26','2022-11-22 18:07:30',6,3,NULL,144),
(6,'Motorcycle Parts Business with new Shopify Website Seeking Developer & Channel Feed Expert',3,'My name is Ben and I own a used motorcycle parts business located in Virginia Beach, VA. We have been very successful on eBay and so I decided to branch out and create a website. I hired a developer for about 4 months to build the site and they finished and launched it last week. I am having more and more difficulties daily with my store as I try to expand to new channels. I began testing some new channels a couple of days ago and since then I have had my Facebook account restricted and google merchant center account suspended. I can\'t find any answers or reasons and I have 0 experience with this so I am finding it very overwhelming. I also just checked my store speed and I am at a 37 for mobile with a lot of issues that I don\'t quite grasp. I really don\'t want to dig my business into a hole as this large investment into the website was meant to generate new leads and instead I feel like I have created numerous new problems for myself and the business. I work 14 hours a day right now and just don\'t have the time to learn everything I need to about backend website issues and channel feeds, so I am hoping to outsource to someone with expert experience in these areas.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0179ed477359529b7d','NA',7,'United States',NULL,1500.000,NULL,1500.000,'2022-10-19',1,'2022-10-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-19 21:22:54',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(7,'Landing Page & Ads Graphic Designer for Ecommerce (Consider Full-time)',3,'Fitness Niche/\r\n\r\nGraphic Designer needed. We usually use Photoshop for image work. We also welcome if you use other software.\r\n\r\nDesigner will help make images for our website(product page), and more importantly for advertisement (Facebook, google, instagram and etc). Relevant experience will be appreciated.\r\n\r\nWe might make this role a full-time role and hence a relatively high-availability will also be a plus.\r\n\r\nDelivery on Graphic Design\r\n- Create authentic design using stock photos and inhouse-photographed photos\r\n- creative mindset able to illustrate same idea with different styles and arrangement of images\r\n- good sense of Color usage; makes products stands out\r\n- able to make audience understand what the images present at an instant\r\n\r\nRate is placeholder for full-time. We shall discuss further.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016e28573ab6d7ec5a','NA',7,'United States',NULL,1050.000,NULL,1050.000,'2022-10-19',1,'2022-10-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-19 21:24:58',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(8,'Wordpress website development',3,'we want to develop website for college, the website will contains  the following :\r\n1- information about board (CV)\r\n2- information about the academic programs\r\n3- information about the fees\r\n4- display the academic calendar\r\n5- display the news and events\r\n6- display the e-magazine\r\n7- display about the contact information\r\n8- display the details of college department\r\n\r\n\r\nthere will be design prepared for this website\r\nthe proposal must contains cost and duration  ( any proposal without estimations will not be considers )','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~017eee1297214a6b33','NA',7,'United States',NULL,500.000,NULL,500.000,'2022-10-19',1,'2022-10-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-19 21:27:13',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(9,'Need a website coder',3,'I need a website coder, not a website designer I would rather you split the website into 2 milestones I have some websites that would hopefully set an example for what I need freecash.com and gg2u.org. my site will NOT be a e commerce site. the site will have offerwalls examples: offertory, ayetstudios. My site will take a small cut and leave the rest with the user. the site needs to have an account feature and a point feature as well (( so users can actually cash out) I would rather if we talked in chat and not calls.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Need-span-website-span-coder_~01f65567964a3f18cd/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,800.000,NULL,800.000,'2022-10-19',1,'2022-10-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-19 21:32:04',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(10,'Logo Recreate in Illustrator and Branding Package',2,'Hi I have a Logo that needs to be recreated in illustrator. Once complete i also need a basic branding package (Business Card Options, LetterHeads, Envelopes). I need in illustrator as well as PNG images of final product','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e1dc8c8b7db63bea','NA',7,'United States',NULL,250.000,NULL,250.000,'2022-10-19',1,'2022-10-19',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-19 21:35:58',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(11,'Playing Card Designer Needed',2,'I have a well-known brand already. I would like to make a deck of custom playing cards taking my designs and making adjustments to the design that would fit a deck of playing cards. We will make a back design, possibly all the faces or we might just do the Aces and all the court cards.\r\n\r\nIf I choose you and we have a good working relationship I will have many more projects in the future not just for playing cards using my brand.\r\n\r\nThe brand is minimalistic. The graphics are very simple. But we may use the standard court cards and combine those with my brand or make new court cards altogether. In any case, I will share more details once I\'ve chosen an artist.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0108f43307626ee527','NA',7,'United States',NULL,1000.000,NULL,1000.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 13:32:19',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(12,'Logo Design',2,'Need a very unique logo for my company. The logo should reflect environment and people.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01e4c2cc5a876ca7d5','NA',7,'United States',NULL,150.000,NULL,150.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 13:36:49',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(13,'Crime Tea',2,'\"Crime Tea\" is a daily talk show for the US market.  The logo should be a tea cup (or coffee mug) with handcuffs affixed on the handle.  The logo should emerge from the hot tea cup when hot water is added.  Steam should rise from the brim to give it a sense of hot crime urgency. The handcuffs are to communicate crime.  All and all, it\'s a dating show for women who love crime but do not want something too heavy in the morning.  I\'m not opposed to crime scene tape but it shouldn\'t read masculine.  We need an iconic design here. NOTE:  I am the creator of the hit TV show CSI: Crime Scene Investigation.  So please... nothing cheesy.  Think iconic. .','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Crime-Tea_~01b8c2e37dab8c91e8/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,500.000,NULL,500.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 13:38:25',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(14,'Wordpress Custom Plugin v2',3,'Custom wordpress plugin build contact for more information.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Wordpress-Custom-Plugin_~01c4b815f57fdfbd50/','NA',2,'United States',NULL,500.000,NULL,500.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 13:53:34',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(15,'Brand Identity for EV Chargers Website',2,'We are looking to create a new brand and logo for our website. The current website is this https://homechargers.com','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1583095240639823873','NA',7,'United States',NULL,50.000,NULL,50.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 14:03:13',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(16,'Branding Expert for Logo, Font, and Color Scheme',2,'We would like to redesign our logo, font, and color scheme from where it is today. Ideally, the color scheme stays black and white for most art but we are open to exploring accent colors. Our website is solacebands.com if you\'d like to look at our current branding before applying.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0142bc95d9b116fda0','NA',7,'United States',NULL,50.000,NULL,50.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 14:15:02',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(17,'Shopify Website',3,'We require an experienced Shopify team - a developer and a tester to work on an existing ecommerce website.\r\n\r\nThe tasks involve amending existing functions and user screens, and to develop new modules and features as per the specification.\r\n\r\nThe Shopify team will develop AND test the work to the agreed success criteria.\r\n\r\nThe work will likely span over 2-3 month period.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Shopify-span-Website-span_~0160c547573356d797/','NA',2,'United States',NULL,1000.000,NULL,1000.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 14:47:36',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(18,'Logo Designer [IMMEDIATE AVAILABILITY]',2,'*PLEASE CLARIFY YOU HAVE READ THE JOB DESCRIPTION AND ARE AVAILABLE TO START IMMEDIATELY. THE JOB IS SIMPLE BUT THE DEADLINE IS 5 HOURS*\r\n\r\nHi! looking for an immediately available designer able to quickly whip up a logo, it should not take you too long. It is just words, no actual design needed.\r\n\r\nThanks','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Logo-Designer-IMMEDIATE-AVAILABILITY_~016def335ce9befd0d/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,100.000,NULL,100.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 14:51:01',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(19,'Build an informational website',3,'I need an informational website built for my company.  My company is called AIIC and I will attach the logo.  Here is my competitors website that I would like to use to follow the layout and text. www.canamenterprises.com\r\n\r\nJust follow the flow of this website and update to my companies statistics and text which I will send to you.\r\n\r\nI would like. to get this going quickly.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Build-informational-website_~0144024a4b3061d200/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,1500.000,NULL,1500.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 14:58:44',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(20,'Designer Needed for Mobile App',2,'Are you good at converting wireframes into beautiful mobile app designs?  Send us samples of your work to apply.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Designer-Needed-for-Mobile-App_~01106d5d82308cb5d0/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,30.000,NULL,30.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'N.A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 15:03:46',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(21,'Logo for new company',2,'Create and new brand logo for a off-shoot of current company.  Will provide current company logo to be imbedded into new logo.  Looking for luxury, upscale, executive, exclusive feel (think Ritz-Carlton, Rolex, etc)','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Logo-for-new-company_~010e135d4e39361778/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,35.000,NULL,35.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'N.A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 15:09:04',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(22,'Rebrand User Manual',2,'I need someone to take the existing word document (remove page 3 as it is blank) and rebrand it to our new branding.  Brand Guidelines and logos as well as the document is attached. I would like someone who can finish this by Wenesday October 26th. The primary color of the design should be the green as this is a respiratory product but can use all the colors of the logo if desired. I am available to answer questions throughout the process.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Rebrand-User-Manual_~01f84f1c7293601365/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,150.000,NULL,150.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 15:18:37',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(23,'Need a flyer for an important sales',2,'I need a professional artist/graphic designer to help us for the design of a flyer.\r\nThis would be a very important annual event for our company so I really need someone with a lot of experience and with a degree in visual art.\r\n\r\nIf successful, we might have other similar tasks in the future.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Need-flyer-for-important-sales_~0182085ca10d00b6a4/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,60.000,NULL,60.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'N.A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 15:22:13',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(24,'Fun Thanksgiving Logo Design Project',2,'Need a new logo designed for a thanksgiving event called Yachtsgiving. Ive attached two screenshots of ideas we’d like to combine. I would like to replace the sailor with a Turkey with the captains hat on the turkey. I’d like to keep all the details around the sailor, just replace the man’s body with a turkey. Would like to add the word Yachtsgiving to above the image (curved arc text to match the image below) and then in the banner below the turkey add the words HAWKS CAY • 2022 (would like some fun font for both the text locations, whatever you think would look nice and fit the theme, but nothing too crazy haha) Thank you!!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1583116743607414785','NA',7,'United States',NULL,200.000,NULL,200.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 15:26:31',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(25,'Need a flyer for an important sales',2,'I need a professional artist/graphic designer to help us for the design of a flyer.\r\nThis would be a very important annual event for our company so I really need someone with a lot of experience and with a degree in visual art.\r\n\r\nIf successful, we might have other similar tasks in the future.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~0182085ca10d00b6a4/apply/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,60.000,NULL,60.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 15:30:30',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(26,'Create a Sales Deck',2,'We have an outline and (very rough) draft of a Sales Deck (created with Google Slides).\r\n\r\nWe need to turn it into a nice Sales Presentation that our team can use during sales calls.\r\n\r\nAttached is a sample of the Deck (1-2 -+ slides). Please review and let me know if you can work on this.\r\n\r\nWe already have all the design guidelines (colors, logo, fonts, icons, etc.) -- need someone to put it all together and organize all the information clearly.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you\'re interested!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Create-Sales-Deck_~01908052be5d61dd1b/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,45.000,NULL,45.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'N.A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 15:36:22',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(27,'Create a Sales Deck',2,'We have an outline and (very rough) draft of a Sales Deck (created with Google Slides).\r\n\r\nWe need to turn it into a nice Sales Presentation that our team can use during sales calls.\r\n\r\nAttached is a sample of the Deck (1-2 -+ slides). Please review and let me know if you can work on this.\r\n\r\nWe already have all the design guidelines (colors, logo, fonts, icons, etc.) -- need someone to put it all together and organize all the information clearly.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you\'re interested!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Create-Sales-Deck_~01908052be5d61dd1b/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,45.000,NULL,45.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 15:37:26',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(28,'Graphic Designer needed for business Logo',2,'I need a logo for my business Montgomery Wolf. I would like to have something simple like an overlapping Capital M and Capital W with a wolf howling in the background.\r\n\r\nIt needs to look professional for a business. As far as a color scheme, I\'d like the M and W to be gold and the wolf and background to remain neutral colors like grey, black and white.\r\n\r\nI am also open to just having the M and W with a neutral background, so if you could make a few examples I would appreciate it and choose between them. Thank you!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Graphic-Designer-needed-for-business-Logo_~0108187b7e3301e8af/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,30.000,NULL,30.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'N.A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 15:44:46',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
