(42,'Designing 2-Page Digital Health Buyer Guide',2,'Our digital health company is looking for a talented designer to help us create an engaging 2 pager buyer guide for a specific customer segment, healthcare insurers. With the copy already created by our team and a reasonably clear picture of the type of style we are looking for, we now need a designer to help us bring it to life!\r\n\r\nThe purpose of the 2 pager is to highlight our key value propositions to healthcare insurers in a succinct and visually appealing way, enticing them to learn more and either continue contact with our sales team or reach out to our sales team.\r\n\r\nWith this job, you would work collaboratively with 1-2 members of our team to understand the brief and learn more about the style, tone and imagery of both the company and the proposed document. We are hoping to have a design ready to review within 10 days of the job being accepted and can help with conceptualising the structure of the buyer guide given the content is complete.\r\n\r\nWe hope this job sounds of interest and we look forward to working with you on our journey to transform health systems globally!','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/span-Designing-span-Page-Digital-Health-Buyer-Guide_~01f2853359e40c02e6/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,50.000,NULL,50.000,'2022-10-20',1,'2022-10-20',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-20 21:15:33',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
