(57,'Update Ugly Pitch Deck Design with New, Provided Slide Formatting',2,'I design beautiful presentations from scratch for clients that have compelling products and stories but who don\'t know how to convey their amazing talents and ideas into compelling pitches. I get the amazing job of empowering the world\'s most brilliant minds by helping them tell their stories in a way that inspires others to invest in or buy their ideas.\r\n\r\nThe problem... I\'ve hit my maximum workload!! I can\'t do it all anymore and I need help from someone who is detail-oriented when putting together presentations and who knows presentation software like PowerPoint, Google Slides, and Figma pretty well. The job will mostly consist of:\r\n\r\n- Updating ugly decks to match sample slides I\'ll provide\r\n- Creative thinking to make slides match the new formatting requirements where the initial example doesn\'t perfectly address how to adapt more complex slides\r\n- Being detail oriented, like making sure all text blocks have the right padding, are the correct colors\r\n- Maximizing each software\'s quirks to enable the presentation to be easily editable (strategically decide what should be a background image and would should be an image on the page; using shapes with background images for headshots instead of PNGs with rounded corners that have to be recreated in design software, etc.)\r\n\r\nThis is not a branding project, but a deck design update project. Would love to get help long-term! Please let me know in your cover letter if you\'re comfortable with PowerPoint, Google Slides, Figma. Examples of your past deck work are a huge bonus.\r\n\r\nThank you so much for applying in advance!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1584996895506034689','NA',7,'United States',NULL,45.000,NULL,45.000,'2022-10-25',1,'2022-10-25',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-25 19:55:46',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
