(63,'Mighty Prayer Warrior Illustration',2,'The title of this project will be \"Mighty Prayer Warrior\".\r\n\r\nThis will be a picture of a female archer. Something like LIv Tyler from The Two Tower, Lord of the Rings. Just don\'t make it look like her face two much. Her pose will be from her side, where she is down on one knee praying. In one hand she is using her bow as a support. She has a bag of arrow on and the arrows look like they are made of light. Not sure sure of the backround yet, maybe she has a ray of light hitting her from an angle as if she is being highlighted by God. Please keep in mind that is a Christian character so though though she has a nice body I don\'t want to show cleavage and its ok to show her legs but not too much thigh. As you said, feminine but not sexy. Possibly white armor with gold touches.\r\nI would like the version by itself so I can use it as a png without background. One with the cool mystic background and the third with the background and title.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01af8cbf9b2323dba0','NA',7,'United States',NULL,800.000,NULL,800.000,'2022-10-25',1,'2022-10-25',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-25 21:10:05',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
