(65,'Brand identity design',2,'We need an experienced designer to help with a one-off project to develop a slight brand redesign.\r\n\r\nWe have an existing logo we want some basic adaptations made to it based on our preferences and customer feedback. Then we also need a brand identity built around this - colour schemes, typeface suitable for canva etc, company branding.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Brand-identity-span-design-span_~01fa074de7ced76cce/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,30.000,NULL,30.000,'2022-10-25',1,'2022-10-25',1,'N.A',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-25 21:24:48',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(66,'Freelance Shopify Developer',3,'The Engine is entering a busy season, and we\'re looking for a freelance Shopify developer to help us out on several projects over the next few months.\r\n\r\nWe\'d love to hear from mid-weight developers who have built multiple Shopify sites and are used to working with agencies. We\'re not hiring for a specific project right now, but we want to have good people on the books we can call on when we\'re ready to dive in. Typically, you\'ll be working with our creative team during initial concepting to provide developer feedback on the designs, helping to scope development, then building the full site in line with our development guidelines alongside our lead developer.\r\n\r\nWe provide designs and development guidance where needed. Our sites are built on Tailwind 3, Laravel Mix & Scss where possible.\r\n\r\nAvailability\r\n\r\nYou\'ll need to be available at least twice a week for meetings in the morning PST time, as well as being available daily on Slack. You\'ll be working with a team of people based in California, Minnesota & Finland.\r\n\r\nRequirements\r\n\r\nAt least 3-4 years working with Shopify\r\nKnowledge of Online Store 2.0 and using Shopify as a CMS\r\nTailwind\r\nGit, Sass & Liquid\r\nFamiliarity with WCAG 2.1 AA standards\r\nAbility to translate designs into responsive, well-written markup\r\nAbility to fit in with our development guidelines and work with other developers\r\nNotes\r\n\r\nWe do fixed cost estimates with our developers in advance and pay up to $600/day.\r\n\r\nWe\'re interested in talking to freelancers only - no agencies or recruiters, please.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585022999683919873?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,62.000,NULL,60.000,'2022-10-25',1,'2022-10-25',1,'client is looking for ongoing service for Shopify developer',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-25 21:55:47',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
