(70,'Need to create a logo for a VR game',2,'n December 2022 we plan to release a new VR Game that can be played with the virtual reality headsets on the Oculus, Steam and SideQuest platforms. The name of the game is \"Undead Quest\". This is an arcade game, according to the plot of which the hero, during his journey to the goal in different locations, encounters the undead, which he must destroy with the help of a racket, a magic ball and spells.\r\n\r\nWe need a game logo that will be used in the game, trailers, banners. The logo should be bright and attractive.\r\n\r\nWe have the main font and the color that is used in the game menu, we would like the logo to be similar in style.\r\n\r\nAttached is the font, color and gameplay screenshots from the alpha version of the game. + after choosing a contractor, I will send a link to the video of the gameplay','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01bd951a3bc4ff8082','NA',7,'United States',NULL,400.000,NULL,400.000,'2022-10-26',1,'2022-10-26',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-26 13:38:31',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
