(74,'Need Awesome Video Editor To Tweak A Template We Have TODAY! :)',2,'We have a template video that we need to tweak to add a different image... needs to be done this week, can you help?\r\n\r\nIf you are awesome, you can join our team as a video editing freelancer and we can give you loads more work :)\r\nInstructions:\r\n\r\nThe aim:\r\n-Animate the ascension green logo on to the square pong ball in the video clip.\r\n-Completely replicate the structure of the snippet in the \'riley reference video\'.\r\n\r\nPlease watch Video Tutorial here first: https://www.loom.com/share/2fa7d22e3fba45fa9a1bb28d4e05bce5\r\n\r\n1. please could you add this pong animation to the bottom of the \'snippet\' video so it fits the screen.\r\n\r\n2. Add the ascension green logo to replace the pong ball square so it tracks along over where the pong ball square is.\r\n\r\n3. Next add the captions on the video, make sure they are identical to the \'riley reference video\'.\r\n\r\nThey are using bold extra fine migra font in italics for the words in \'green\'.\r\n\r\nThe font is in the attached assets folder.\r\n\r\n4. Then add a headline to the video - replicate the style from \'riley reference\' video:\r\n\r\nText to use for headline:\r\n\r\n\'Why your business needs a Sale Leaseback\'\r\n\r\nNeue Montreal font on \'Why your business needs a\'.\r\n\r\nExtra fine migra font itallics bold: \'Sale Leaseback\'\r\n\r\nAnthony Cohen, Head of Investment Banking Coverage - in bold extra find migra font italics.\r\n\r\nHeadline background - must be green and replicate the texture in the riley reference video.\r\n\r\n5. Video MUST replicate the style of the Riley reference video.\r\n\r\n\r\nYou can find all files in \'Asset\' here: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1w4sZTw676LoNsMLppbGm9htzlovKFliW?usp=sharing','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585266319207292929?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,50.000,NULL,50.000,'2022-10-26',1,'2022-10-26',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-26 13:48:58',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
