(79,'Build presentation for our new business area, UI',2,'We need someone who can make an innovative, attractive and outstanding presentation for our new business area.\r\nWe need a 6-8 page pitchbook/sales presentation.\r\nWe have inspiration sites and others. Need to feel like 2025 and the future in design. Brilliant UI is key in this project.\r\nWe have the text, content, and idés. But, want someone that also can give recommendations.\r\nA first meeting will take place to go over the scope in more detail.\r\n\r\nWe have other design needs within the company so if this project goes well we can continue to the next project.\r\n\r\nLooking for a long-term partner/contractor.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0191b3bf9f12f0f1d0','NA',7,'United States',NULL,60.000,NULL,60.000,'2022-10-26',1,'2022-10-26',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-26 14:18:33',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(80,'Brand and Logo Designer needed',2,'I\'m creating a subscription-based company and website called Move. Feel. Heal. I need a logo design for the new company. We do live and recorded stretching classes of various durations that take the body through a full range of motion, function, and flexibility while balancing the body (posture alignment) at the same time. At the end of each class we do a short meditation to evoke some deep emotion like gratitude, self-love, forgiveness, oneness, etc.\r\nThe site also has routines to solve chronic muscle and joint pain like back, neck, knee, hip and shoulder pain. There is a section just for meditations and tools to clear emotional blockages. The overall mission of the site is to clear the physical and emotional blockages in the way of optimal health and happiness.\r\nI need something professional and elegant. Possible colors are some combination of blue, green, orange, yellow (not necessarily all of them but some combo). I envision something that encompasses motion, flow, feeling, moving. I\'d like at least one design that only uses the words themselves or MFH in a playful, creative way.\r\nWords that define the company: Stretching, meditation, feeling, posture, health, healing, balancing the body, balance of physical and emotional, balance of masculine and feminine energy, self-connection, inner healing wisdom.\r\nThe website is already being created under a different company name called Balance Inside & Out, but I\'m exploring the Move. Feel. Heal identity as a replacement. I also have a YouTube channel with exercises for posture, pain, balance and I\'m in the midst of writing a book on solving physical and emotional blockages.\r\nThank you and please reach out with any questions.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01c4172ca320d95a5e','NA',7,'United States',NULL,78.000,NULL,78.000,'2022-10-26',1,'2022-10-26',1,'Hourly BId',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-26 14:19:12',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
