(85,'Build Website Lookalike 2',3,'We are preparing to build a website for a boat dealership.\r\n\r\nWe would like to start with this website as a template:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/\r\n\r\nHowever, we can\'t just copy/paste any of the HTML, CSS, and JS. We would like a front-end designer to rebuild a lookalike that matches this website exactly (as closely as possible) without re-using any of their actual code.\r\n\r\nNot using any of their code is very important for copyright reasons. Libraries like Jquery/Bootstrap/Fontawesome can and should be used to create the look and feel.\r\n\r\nWe need the following pages re-created:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/\r\n\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/research\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/articles\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/articles/best-compact-suvs\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/sell-my-car\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/car-financing\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/service\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/help-center\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/faq/finding-a-car\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/why-carmax\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/about-carmax\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/buying-online\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/car-buying-process/maxcare-service-plans\r\nhttps://careers.carmax.com/us/en/\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/cars\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/cars/all\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/car/23210390\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/stores\r\nhttps://socialresponsibility.carmax.com/\r\nhttps://www.carmax.com/car-financing/car-payment-calculator\r\nLogin page (URL too long)\r\nRegister Page (URL too long)','//www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01690cd27e85681034/apply/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,1500.000,NULL,1500.000,'2022-10-26',1,'2022-10-26',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-26 14:53:06',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
