(97,'Software Explainer Video',2,'Hello there! We\'re looking someone to create a 1 minute software explainer video. The video should explain the features and benefits of our application. We will provide the script and voice over in-house. We also have an in-house graphic designer that can provide any graphics if needed. We\'re open to understanding your process and collaborating.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585289809715470337?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,1000.000,NULL,1000.000,'2022-10-26',1,'2022-10-26',1,'Fixed Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-26 15:26:40',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(98,'URGENT! Brand Identity Designer/Strategist: Visual + Brand Guide',2,'Hi candidates,\r\n\r\nThis project is about creating a Brand Identity for the American company which business is to sell event tickets to the re-sellers.\r\n\r\nDeliverables:\r\n1. Brand Book: Brand Guide (Written foundations, messaging, target audience, values, mission) - Described based on the information provided by the client\r\n2. Brand Book: Brand Style Guide (Color usage; Typography options; Guidelines on illustration and photographic styles; Proper use of logos, taglines and fonts; other elements);\r\n3. Logo pack (various file formats for print and screen);\r\n4. Naming and Tagline;\r\n5. Website UI Kit (a set of design elements such as UI components and styles);\r\n6. Business card design (include preparing files for printing);\r\n7. Social media mockups (profile images, post examples);\r\n8. Visual ad mockups: billboard, lightbox, magazine A4 portrait examples (don\'t include preparing files for printing);\r\n9. More elements are available on request and are out of scope.\r\n\r\nPlease remeber to write about your quality, skills, send any additional information that might help. Also please start your letter from the phrase \"I understood the assignment\". Once this project is complete, we might offer you more projects like this.\r\n\r\nThe most important part of this project is that you specialize not only in logos and visual part, but you also can translate client\'s businees and marketing goals into a comprehensive branding vision.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585292791173554177?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,3000.000,NULL,3000.000,'2022-10-26',1,'2022-10-26',1,'Fix price project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-26 15:32:12',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
