(100,'Brand Identity Design - Logos / Colour Palette / Fonts',2,'Hey Upwork Designers!\r\n\r\nI\'m a freelancer that is looking to create a marketing agency specialising in:\r\n\r\n- Copywriting\r\n- Marketing Strategy\r\n- Google / Social Ads\r\n- Social Media Content\r\n- SEO\r\n\r\nThe business is called WordBear. The initial project is for a logo (square and rectangle), colour palette and fonts. So a basic brand pack.\r\n\r\nI have some basic ideas for the logo, and some guidance on the brand that I am trying to create, but ultimately you as the designer need to come up with a design that matches the concept. So you will need to factor in some time to develop the concept.\r\n\r\nHowever, after this is completed I will be looking for additional materials for the website, email templates, presentation templates and the like.\r\n\r\nWhen you submit your proposal, please include a rough estimate of time lines and costs along with some examples of your work.\r\n\r\nThanks!\r\n\r\nSam','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~012593d0ccfd10228a','NA',7,'United States',NULL,35.000,NULL,35.000,'2022-10-26',1,'2022-10-26',0,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-26 15:37:17',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
