(105,'Web Designer With Direct Response Experience',3,'Hey there,\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking for a web designer with direct response experience that also has immediate availability.\r\n\r\nFor now this will be part time work as projects arise but has the potential to lead to full time as our organization grows.\r\n\r\nOur immediate needs are sales pages and direct response landing pages\r\n\r\nIf you have experience with direct response design please make that known and send over any and all examples you find relevant\r\n\r\nOur entire design library is currently in Sketch, we don\'t care if you use Sketch we actually prefer figma but we do expect you to have a way to access our design library and use our existing assets and guidelines when designing our pages\r\n\r\nPlease start your job application with the words \"design details\" so I know you read the entire job post.\r\n\r\nPlease also let me know your availability and when you can get started\r\n\r\nI\'ve attached our Style Guide\r\n\r\nI look forward to hearing from you\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nDevin Zande','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585295746591424513?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,45.000,NULL,45.000,'2022-10-26',1,'2022-10-26',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat, THE RATE IS PUT AS HOURLY',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-26 15:43:54',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
