(156,'Graphic design artist needed for two high quality sales collateral mockups Graphic Design',2,'We need two high quality manipulated photos for use as sales collateral. Our sales target is an automotive brand, and we need images of their cars in an outdoor live-music space.\r\n\r\nSpecifically:\r\nOne image needs to be the cars using their headlights to light a stage at night, in a nature/wilderness setting.\r\n\r\nThe other should probably be daytime, with cars on display in front of the stage. This should be a music festival vibe.\r\n\r\nThere will need to be additional branding in both images.\r\n\r\nFinding source imagery is included in this request. There are many official and unofficial photos of the vehicles available, which may be used.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585351781643395073?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,500.000,NULL,500.000,'2022-10-26',1,'2022-10-26',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-26 19:26:43',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
