(159,'Real Estate Loan Pitch Deck',2,'Centra Homes is a home builder in the Minneapolis market with 57m in revenue in 2021. For continued expansion we have outgrown our financial partners capacity to grow with us. We are looking for a long term partner to help create per project limited partner proposals or loan proposals several times per year.\r\n\r\nThis first project is to create all the necessary documents and proposal for a construction and long term loan on 22 residential units. We would be the builder of the units and plan to keep them as a long term investment. The financial projections are completed in a spread sheet. Historically we have had the luxury of not putting together complete and presentable presentations with our current lenders and partners. We need help creating first class presentations for new and potential lenders and investors.\r\n\r\nWe will be growing our Real Estate owned over the next four years by 120m and homes built for sale increase by 75m per year.\r\n\r\nWe want a partner that can help us grow and be with us on a per project bases for several years to come.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585353510864879617?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,250.000,NULL,200.000,'2022-10-26',1,'2022-10-26',1,'Hourly Project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-26 19:34:05',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(160,'\"New Age\" B2B Tech Staffing Company Needs a Website',3,'The goal here is to build the a simple website for the client.\r\n\r\nThey are ok with a template site, assuming that, it can be customized to some extent with respect to layout and design.\r\n\r\nThe overall design direction and copy has been created but, we will need some graphic design work - particularly as we want to stay away from ALL stock images and graphics. We are NOT looking for a cookie-cutter site - we offer a unique product and as such, want a unique website.\r\n\r\nThe site itself is fairly small, about 7-8 pages total and only one of those pages is a standalone page, the rest we imagine as part of a scroll.\r\n\r\nSite pages:\r\n\r\n• Landing\r\n• Who we are\r\n• What we do\r\n• Our process\r\n• Offerings\r\n• Case Studies/Client Quotes\r\n• Blog\r\n• Contact Us\r\n\r\n\r\nSite functionalities:\r\n\r\n• Email capture for newsletter\r\n• CMS to add Case Studies and make copy changes\r\n• Video integration (like we literally just need to have a video embedded on this page)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585354269823594497?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,4000.000,NULL,4000.000,'2022-10-26',1,'2022-10-26',1,'Client may ask for meeting if he opens up for chat',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-26 19:36:17',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
