(193,'Simple Graphics for Investment Returns - Quick deliverable',2,'Hello, we are a real estate investment company and need several simple graphics to go into upcoming newsletters. 1 newsletter per quarter. 1-2 graphics per newsletter. I estimate a total of 5-10 hours initially. This could be followed up by quarterly infographic creation.\r\n\r\nDesired graphics:\r\n\r\n1- a graphic to show our returns of between 8-10% are superior to other similar investment options -  8% compounding monthly over 10 years, 10% compounding monthly over 10 years, ten-year treasury rate over 10 years (around 4% currently), P2P real estate lending (7% simple), a recent 10-year period for the S&P500 or similar index,\r\n\r\n2- 8% & 10% compounding returns over 20 years compared to the S&P500 over a 20-year period (maybe 10 years would be better visually?) showing relative volatility of the stock market compared to real estate. I anticipate real estate will be much more stable over the long run.\r\n\r\n3 - a graphic showing a simple return & distribution versus a compounding return. The interest rate can be set to 10%.\r\n\r\n4 - a graphic showing our loan basis to collateral value ratio of 62%.\r\n\r\n5- pie chart or similar showing 93% of our loans are paid off by the borrower and only 7% must go through collection payoffs.\r\n\r\n6 - pie chart of collateral type (commercial buildings versus residential) approximately 80% residential and 20% commercial\r\n\r\n7 - A few other similar graphics we create in collaboration with the contractor.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~012aeeef457a6373a3/apply/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,45.000,NULL,45.000,'2022-10-26',1,'2022-10-26',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-26 21:07:00',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
