(208,'Illustrator Graphic Designer',2,'Illustrator Graphic Designer\r\nWe are looking for an artist to illustrate The Colosseum in Rome as it was in roman times. There are a lot of Internet images out there but for this project, we need to mix the current structure with what historians thought it looked like then.\r\nThe set of artwork that we are looking for will show the outside views and the inside from different angles.\r\nIf we like your work then we can award you the bigger project.\r\nThe candidate must do his/her own research to come up with the best possible look.\r\nAll artwork must be your original work and no copies\r\nThe candidate must give up all copyrights.\r\nThanks','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585384976627736577?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,100.000,NULL,80.000,'2022-10-26',1,'2022-10-26',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-26 21:38:29',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(209,'Expert Webflow Developer - Finsweet and Relume library',3,'We are looking for an Expert Webflow developer to help us complete the final pieces of a website project. The site is currently 70% done, and we currently don\'t have the available resources to finalize. The majority of styles and layout have been constructed, we need with the following:\r\n- Complete updates to the Desktop site to match the new Illustrator file.\r\n- Translate the Desktop to Mobile pages. Only one of our pages has a mobile design, and we are looking to translate the rest of the Desktop pages to mobile in Webflow. Much of mobile work has been completed, but need assistance with some of the more advanced responsive behavior.\r\n\r\nIf successful, we\'d love to find someone we can use long-term.\r\n\r\nIMPORTANT REQUIREMENTS:\r\n- Must know and use Relume Library, and be able to maintain and correct CSS classes across components. https://library.relume.io/\r\n- Must know and use Finsweet, in particular the Multi-Filter component which a page will need: https://www.finsweet.com/cms-library-howto/filter/example3\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585386083959767041?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,2000.000,NULL,2000.000,'2022-10-26',1,'2022-10-26',1,'Fix price project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-26 21:42:13',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
