(211,'Website Design for TBD',3,'Complete the Website following the simple phases mentioned\r\n\r\n1- Website Layout Design\r\n2- Content Writing\r\n3- Quality Testing and Website Responsiveness\r\n4- Revisions\r\n\r\n1- Website Layout Design:\r\nAfter the initial meeting and Project confirmation, I will send you a Questionnaire to gather a few details about the company. Based on the information, I will do a custom design of the Homepage of the website first and get your approval on the initial design. Once we have the Homepage design approved, I will start designing other pages of the website. Once all pages are designed and the layout is completely approved, we will move to the next phase. During this phase, we will mainly focus on the layout and feel of the website. We will use most of the content Dummy here.\r\n\r\n2- Content Writing\r\nDuring this phase, we will only focus on Content writing. We will replace dummy content with actual content that explains the business. Once it\'s done, I will ask for your approval again if you would like to change something or want me to add a few lines based on your suggestions.\r\n\r\n3- Quality Testing and Website Responsiveness:\r\nThis phase is crucial which many people neglect. During this phase, I will test the website if everything works fine. Hire now Form is working fine or not? The website works fine on Tablets and Mobile etc. The website will be fully checked before delivering as a final product.\r\n\r\n4- Revisions:\r\nAs on each Phase, I will be getting your inputs regularly but at the end, if you still think you need some changes on the website, I will be available for that and do it.\r\n\r\nAccess to Godaddy for Domain will be provided','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/Website-span-Design-span-for-TBD_~01bbf986c7989f41da/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,599.000,NULL,599.000,'2022-10-26',1,'2022-10-26',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-26 21:46:25',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
