(265,'Wordpress website for personal trainer',3,'Hi, I\'m looking for a Webdesigner who can design a website for my client. He\'s a personal trainer.\r\n\r\nI will need 2 to 3 pages maximum with Calendly integrated on one of those.\r\n\r\nI want a long-term partnership. I would need a site like this every month. If you are fast, available, and efficient, if you are able to make a site that loads quickly and is responsive, we will work together.\r\n\r\nSend me 5 website examples + the time you need to deliver them. You can use Divi or Elementor. When you\'ll contact me, please start your message with the first word \"Divi\" or \"Elementor\".','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~016ba87a720fb10984','NA',7,'United States',NULL,300.000,NULL,300.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Fixed budget',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 16:01:53',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(266,'Website Graphic Design',2,'Hello!\r\n\r\nWe are looking for an expert graphic designer who has experience in creating mockups for beautiful, high converting ecommerce websites. One of our clients is currently going through a partial rebrand and we are looking for a designer who has experience in laying out new websites that have high aesthetic appeal and great UI/UX. This could turn into a longer term role if the first job goes well. Experience is a must as well as sending over samples of previous RELATED work.\r\n\r\nLooking to hire someone and have this done ASAP!\r\n\r\nPlease write the word ShadyVEU at the top of your proposal so we know you read this.\r\n\r\nThank you!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~012ed3a4fd2e22eade/apply/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,50.000,NULL,50.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 16:04:11',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(267,'Shopify Website: Inventory Count',3,'I have a website where I sell hair extensions I would like for my website to display to the customer the available inventory when they select the item. Please see the example attached.\r\n\r\n\r\nAlso, I need for payment processor \"Sezzle\" to be removed from site (account is closed and app has been removed).','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~01b63280549ecf071b','NA',7,'United States',NULL,13.000,NULL,40.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'hourly',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 16:14:49',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(268,'Graphic designer for various tasks on call, ongoing',2,'Graphic designer needed for fast turn around, on call work.   \r\n-icons\r\n-logos\r\n-advertising materials\r\n-possible package design\r\n-various other items.  \r\n\r\nClear, direction with fast responses for edits.  \r\n\r\nPlease ensure that your portfolio is shown.  Please include 2 references to previous employers including work that is shown in your portfolio.  (There are a lot of fake portfolios on this site).\r\n\r\nWe would like to hire quickly and send first jobs over within a few days.\r\n\r\nI look forward to meeting you.  \r\nThank you.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~016eb3d475b07433af/apply/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,35.000,NULL,35.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 16:17:59',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(269,'2D animator for illustrations and animated videos',2,'We are looking for a talented 2D animator and designer to assist us with our marketing efforts for our new SaaS product.\r\n\r\nIdeally, we are looking for someone who can work with us on a regular basis to help with our animated marketing videos and other 2D animation graphical work as needed.\r\n\r\nWe would like to build up a repository of graphics that can be used across our brand, someone with the skills needed to create custom 2D designs to fit our product message and general marketing needs.\r\n\r\nAs an example of the types of work we are looking for:\r\n- Animated product launch video\r\n- Animated explainer videos\r\n- Illustrations that match the style used in the above videos that can be used on our website and other social media channels\r\n\r\nFor each video we will provide you with a storyboard.','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0188907e7adb136b33','NA',7,'United States',NULL,45.000,NULL,45.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'hourly project',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 16:19:21',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(270,'Build modern website to promote a mobile app product',3,'we are looking for a web design person who can help us create a website for a mobile app product. The website should be designed to display nicely on desktops, tablets and mobile devices.\r\n\r\nWe have a rough idea of what the website should look like and what info it is supposed to cointain. For example:\r\n- tell the visitors the different features of the app as a very brief story while they scroll down, and engage with them using interactive media\r\n- about\r\n- faq\r\n- contact us\r\n- links to app stores and social media\r\n- page dedicated for a crash course\r\n- page dedicated to take visitors\'s info who are interested in volunteering\r\n- donations\r\n- app privacy policy\r\n\r\nHere are examples of similar websites that we are trying to mimic:\r\nhttps://sage.gg/\r\nhttps://riochain.io/','https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~010966367bea9a8c9b','NA',7,'United States',NULL,600.000,NULL,600.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 16:19:59',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
