(274,'Urgent, 5 T-Shirt Designs Needed',2,'I have a real simple project - whatcha think?\r\n\r\n1. For Halloween my family is copying the Incredibles, So I want to use their exact same font/style for our own design. The SuperPowers instead of The Incredibles and make that \"i\" a P? Thanks!! (file attached)\r\n\r\n2. I want to drop ship my own shirt designs. These are meant to be simple, text tees, not a bunch of graphic images. I have 8 \"sayings\" for this project.\r\n\r\nFor my Gym I need some more \"Nike\" style athletic shirts (logos attached) :\r\nLogo: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1W8aVMtRr2ggz-TGChn_BAF1Ndk5-6yBT/view?usp=sharing\r\n\r\nLogo: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1p06UMrV5Q4raSCmZ6TkXhwO1CERvQqhv/view?usp=sharing\r\n\r\n\r\n1. Atlanta Performance Lab and the word Sports somewhere underneath it or to the side\r\n2. APL and a line underneath it then the word Athlete\r\n3. Skys out Thighs out (this would be a ladies tank and the APL logo)\r\n4. Gym then a line and the word everything underneath it so it\'s basically like Gym over everything\r\n5.polo tees with our logo on the front right pocket, and on the side sleeve I need COACH\r\n6. APL Coach shirts (I have no ideas for this, do what you please lol)','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585669117944471555?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,50.000,NULL,40.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 16:36:51',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(275,'Need New Brand Naming for non-medical home care agency',2,'In a nutshell we need: Craft the perfect moniker to help us rise above the fray, jump into our audience\'s head and steer clear of thorny trademark, URL, search and linguistic issues.\r\n\r\nWe are looking to launch a new brand name for our in-home care business.\r\nThis business will be streamlining to go nationwide and franchise so we need a catchy, corporate, fun name, new energy and something that has a deep meaning.\r\n\r\nOur current website is: www.goldenagecompanions.com so you can see what we do. I want to convey trust, experience, innovation in technology, efficiency, and also something that is tied to \'something bigger\' than just caring for these seniors. A culture, a community, a Movement that is on a mission to help seniors stay in their own homes as safe as possibly and in the highest caliber.\r\n\r\nThe Name must be able to have a .com (even if it needs to be bought for a reasonable fee), and also be able to get a Trademark with USPTO.\r\n\r\nLooking to do this project ASAP as I am on a timeline! Thanks so much!','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/1585671653386682369?success','NA',7,'United States',NULL,50.000,NULL,40.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'NA',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 16:38:21',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(276,'Need Website Designer for Conscious Personal Transformation Program',2,'Need wireframes for a 7 page website\r\n1 page needed this week\r\nanother by mid november\r\nand the rest needed in december\r\n\r\nPages include 2 infographics\r\nwe would like them both in static and with movement.\r\nSource info: https://www.canva.com/design/DAEWO-voB9w/P6NT5KtjMnqmdgWRG_3KKA/edit?utm_content=DAEWO-voB9w&utm_campaign=designshare&utm_medium=link2&utm_source=sharebutton\r\n\r\nWould also like stylized email templates\r\nmain header image with cohesive website branding elements\r\n3 templated layouts for news letters, sales emails, and even announcement.\r\n\r\nWe would like to include these elements\r\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1EttkfIuFZtooFEa21PDACKmAhbsADWYh/view?usp=sharing\r\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JtKBm7j61QROJ7gF9popyXIj4AAW6ql3?usp=sharing\r\n\r\n\r\nultimately we would like someone to work with in the future as there will be lots of marketing business materials needed on a regular basis once the project is launched.','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~015c8bd7d4f35bfee5/apply/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,500.000,NULL,500.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'Fixed',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 16:38:48',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
(277,'Publishing logo design',2,'I\'m looking for a logo design for a publishing company called Curveball Books. The logo will go on published books, some related to baseball, some not related to baseball. the logo can include baseball imagery, baseballs, etc.\r\n\r\nThe logo should fit in a square format, but I\'m am open to compelling ideas that don\'t. Ideally, I would like a few options for the logo. It should be rendered in black and white and be clear even in a small format (possibly on the spine of a book). I would want final format that could be both larger (like 1 inch) and smaller (like a quarter of an inch).\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for a logo/image. It doesn\'t have to include the words Curveball Books, but it can include either/both if needed.\r\n\r\nThis is a one-time project with limited scope and budget.\r\n\r\nThanks - David','https://www.upwork.com/ab/proposals/job/~01a96dca9280d8056f/apply/','NA',7,'United States',NULL,0.000,NULL,60.000,'2022-10-27',1,'2022-10-27',1,'In process',0,'Open this select menu',NULL,1,'2022-10-27 16:41:04',NULL,6,3,NULL,111),
